        {
          "id": "krea2-8352e5f54e109247d5a13189",
          "alias": "单女蓝睡裙害羞坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden floor, wearing a light blue spaghetti strap nightgown with a white lace bra underneath. Her hands gently tug at the straps of the nightdress, her expression gentle yet slightly shy, as if silently speaking something. In the foreground is a light blue nightgown in front of her, made of light and soft fabric with natural folds and light and shadow variations. The hem of the skirt spreads across the wooden floor, contrasting with the dark wooden panels. The light gently and evenly shines on her, highlighting the texture of her skin and the details of her clothing. The background is a blurred indoor environment, with faint outlines of green plants and reflections from the glass windows, creating a hazy and tranquil atmosphere. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered, and the light and shadow coming from soft natural light from the side. The light shines from the left, enhancing the three-dimensional effect and creating soft highlights on the nightdress. The overall atmosphere is warm, tranquil, and slightly ambiguous, with tones mainly light blue, white, and wood brown. The color scheme is harmonious and unified, and the images have the realism of everyday amateur equipment, as if captured casually with a regular camera, with slight noise and imperfect details, enhancing authenticity and a sense of life. The images present a style that is both artistic and authentic, as if recording private moments, allowing people to feel a gentle and intimate emotional flow",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
