        {
          "id": "krea2-cd7fe75b1feb9059ffc8e203",
          "alias": "单女灰衬衫办公室冷淡倚靠",
          "prompt": "The overall look is refined and modern, presenting a cool, high-end feel. She wears a loose gray-white shirt with fine vertical stripes, uniquely designed, featuring an asymmetrical diagonal neckline and twisted decorations. The sleeves are wide and slightly puffy, and the material is light and flowing. She pairs dark gray high-waisted wide-leg pants with smooth and fitted pants, and black mesh stockings printed with repeated subtle patterns The overall clothing style combines elegance and fashion. Her body leans slightly forward, her left hand naturally resting on the edge of the windowsill, fingers long, relaxed yet dignified, right hand naturally resting at her knee, her body forming a slightly slanted S-shaped curve, creating a dynamic beauty. The foreground features the main figure occupying most of the composition, with medium shots and close-ups presenting the figure from the waist upward. The background is a large blurred city skyline, with the outlines of towering buildings faintly visible in the pale blue sky, while distant buildings are shrouded in mist. It presents a hazy blue-gray tone, creating a strong contrast in depth of field. Light comes from the left side, creating a subtle transition between light and shadow, with delicate shadows. Meanwhile, a natural backlight shading is created on the right side of the figure, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall tone of the painting leans toward a cool tone, mainly gray, blue, and white, accented with gold accessories to enhance visual highlights. The layers of light and shadow are rich, creating a quiet yet detached atmosphere, as if you are in a high-rise urban office or private balcony. It conveys the independent temperament and calm contemplation of a modern urban woman. The composition uses a three-part method. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving space on the right side to create a sense of background extension. The visual guide line points from the character's line of sight to the upper right, enhancing the tension of the image. The overall image has a professional studio-level texture while retaining the naturalness of real-life scenes. It feels as if you are shooting indoors with a high-end full-frame camera, capturing with an 85mm prime lens. The aperture is f/1.8, shutter speed is 1/200 sec, ISO 100, making the image clear and sharp, rich in detail, and accurate color reproduction. It presents a cinematic-level realistic aesthetic while retaining the authenticity and warmth of everyday shooting, making it feel like a private moment captured in the early morning or afternoon when the sunlight is softest, full of storytelling and emotional impact",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
