        {
          "id": "krea2-6dd6a6936e8235a9f92708c0",
          "alias": "单女蓝和服门跪过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a traditional blue and white kimono printed with geometric and floral motifs, mainly dark blue and white, accented with small orange-red floral decorations. She wears a bright red obi belt with delicate patterns and metal clasps around her waist. She kneels on a Japanese tatami floor, her body slightly leaning forward, her right hand gently touching her chest, fingers long, elegant yet restrained, slightly curled and naturally draped over her shoulders, her expression calm and reserved. In the background is a typical traditional Japanese room with beige walls, with soft warm tones, on the left is a wooden lattice sliding door framed with dark wood. The glass window lets in soft natural light, and the light streams in diagonally from outside, creating a contrasting effect of light and shadow on the floor and figures. The tatami mat is light yellow, with clearly visible woven textures, edges decorated with black weave, and the floor reflects a slight sheen. The entire scene presents a tranquil and warm atmosphere. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, slightly tilted. The overall composition is balanced and layered. The foreground clearly shows the kimono details and feet, the middle ground features the main subject and part of the floor, and the background gradually blurs to highlight the subject. Light and shadow come from the sides and rear, forming a soft backlit contour that creates a warm and hazy visual effect. The overall tone leans warm, has a vintage film texture, moderate color saturation, rich details, and a strong Japanese aesthetic style. The image looks as if shot by an old-fashioned film camera, with slight bokeh and graininess, and the image quality is authentic and natural. Without any digital traces, it is full of the vitality of life and artistic beauty, like a private record of everyday moments, capturing the subtle emotional connection between traditional clothing and modern people. The overall composition is quiet and poetic, evoking a timeless Eastern charm",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
