        {
          "id": "krea2-52ca8bde3f7e95cd062bfeaa",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙樱花害羞站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beneath a blooming cherry blossom tree, wearing a light, flowing pink sleeveless dress made of semi-transparent chiffon or organza, adorned with wide bows on the shoulders, with lace patchwork details at the neckline and back. The overall design is sweet and layered, draped smoothly over her shoulders. She leans slightly to the side, head tilted slightly, her expression calm and slightly shy, her hands gently raised, fingers slender, fingertips painted with light blue nail polish, gently stroking the bow on the hem of the dress. Delicate silver studs hang on her earlobes, emitting a subtle sheen. The background is lush cherry blossom branches, with pink and white flowers blooming densely in layers, almost covering the entire sky. deep brown branches crisscross, forming a natural frame structure. In the distance, a clear blue sky and a few wisps of white clouds drift lightly by. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot to highlight the figure's graceful posture and the grandeur of the cherry blossoms. The main subject is on the right side of the composition, leaving space on the left for the cherry blossom branches to extend and form a visual guiding line. From the upper left to the lower right, the focus is drawn to the figure. Light and shadow come from directly above slightly to the left, and the soft and bright sunlight penetrates the gaps between the flowers, creating a contrast of light and shadow and creating a warm and dreamy atmosphere. The main colors are pink, white, and blue. The pink petals contrast sharply with the blue sky, harmoniously unified. The overall tone is fresh and soft, full of spring atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a high-resolution camera, featuring a slight film graininess and natural depth of field blur. The cherry blossoms in the background appear blurred and transitioning from near to far, highlighting the clarity of the subject. The entire image conveys a romantic, tranquil, and poetic beauty, like a spring portrait, allowing people to feel the beauty of youth and the gifts of nature",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
