        {
          "id": "krea2-bb87b3e267d8dc791f0ef1aa",
          "alias": "单女围巾秋叶温柔躺",
          "prompt": "A woman lies on her back on a grass covered in golden fallen leaves, wearing a fluffy, soft brown plush hat. Her expression is calm and relaxed, fingers naturally extended, palms facing upward, sunlight filtering through her fingers onto the back of her hand, creating mottled and dazzling light and shadow. On her wrist is a bracelet of colorful beads, arranged in a mix of white, blue, orange, red, and gray, giving a warm texture and rich details. On her left shoulder is a knitted scarf with a blue-gray background and orange-red geometric patterns. The material is thick and warm, with clearly visible texture. The scarf is casually draped over the chest, presenting natural folds and layers. The background is withered yellow grass and layers of autumn leaves. The leaves vary in shape, with curled edges and colors gradient from light yellow to deep brown. Some leaves, illuminated by sunlight, appear semi-transparent. Scattered green grass stems on the ground contrast with the dead leaves. The figure is positioned slightly above the center of the composition, full and layered. The center features her body and scarf, with spreading fallen leaves and grass in the background, spreading out to create an intimate and immersive atmosphere. Light comes from above, golden sunlight in the morning or evening—soft and warm, with a distinct side lighting effect. The shadow transitions are delicate, giving off a healthy glow. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, orange, and brown, accented with blue-gray and red-white. The colors are harmonious and unified, full of the unique warmth and poetry of autumn The image features a slight film graininess and natural lens halo, simulating real camera shooting and presenting a retro film photography texture. The background is slightly blurred, enhancing spatial depth. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and far-reaching, full of life and artistic beauty, like a private image capturing a lazy autumn afternoon. It combines the warmth of daily life with the refinement and style of artistic photography",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
