        {
          "id": "krea2-60500b3ae9b1cfebf3d77de1",
          "alias": "单女护士白护士服公寓蹲",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a white nurse's uniform squats on the wooden floor, leaning slightly forward, her posture naturally relaxed, displaying a blend of warmth and professionalism, adding a touch of sweetness and youthfulness. Her white short-sleeved nurse uniform features black stripes on the collar and cuffs, simple yet elegant. A black stethoscope hangs on her chest, with the earplugs placed at her neck and the tube naturally hanging down to her abdomen, forming a graceful curve. Her right hand rests gently on her knee, her left hand hangs naturally, fingers slightly bent. As if about to get up or just finish some work, wearing white flat sandals that reveal the long lines of the legs. The overall look is clean and sharp, full of professional aesthetics. The background is a red brick wall with clear textures and varying shades of color, presenting a warm reddish-brown tone. On the wall grows a cluster of green vines, lush and full of vitality, injecting a natural atmosphere into the scene. On the right side is a dark wooden door with vertical grille designs, adding layers to the space. The floor is light-colored wood with fine wood grain and slight wear on the surface, giving it a realistic and everyday feel. Light softly enters from the left side of the frame, creating a natural side lighting effect. The transitions between light and shadow are delicate, with soft shadows that create a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall composition uses medium shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, in a half-squatting posture with a stable visual center. The foreground shows the person's body and part of the ground, the middle ground shows the person's entire body and surrounding environment, and the background features brick walls, greenery, and wooden doors, with clear layering. The slightly overhead view enhances the image's affinity and immersion. The colors are mainly white, brown, and green, creating harmonious contrasts. The overall tone is fresh and bright, with a texture of everyday life. It resembles a real scene shot with a regular camera, without excessive embellishment, retaining slight noise and natural color distortions, presenting a realistic, warm, and life-close documentary style. Light and shadow are distributed naturally, with dark areas on the sides and background areas, creating a good sense of three-dimensionality. The entire scene is quiet and full of storytelling. It conveys a warm, reassuring, and professional atmosphere in daily medical care",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
