        {
          "id": "krea2-688ac0ec90f4fa74bc2b3a12",
          "alias": "单女绿毛衣困倦站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands with her back to the camera in a field of golden rapeseed flowers. She wears a bright green thick knit sweater paired with a white dress. Her right hand tightly holds a bouquet of vibrant orange-red roses, full and full of life, dotted with green leaves, creating a strong color contrast. On her left shoulder is a mustard-yellow canvas bag, with a vintage-style silver-gray film camera hanging from it. The camera has a black leather strap and a round lens, with the word \"MOOCO\" printed on the body. The overall design is full of artistic atmosphere and nostalgia. The composition uses dynamic blur photography techniques. The rapeseed fields in the background show strong horizontal motion blur, forming flowing golden light bands. The foreground figures stand out clearly and prominently, creating a striking depth of field contrast. The composition is positioned slightly to the right of the center, using blank space to create a sense of space. Visual guidance extends from the figure's back into the distance, attracting attention through bouquets and camera details. The lighting is bright and soft natural daylight, shining from the right side. The overall color scheme is mainly yellow-green, accented with orange-red and white, creating a warm, romantic, and slightly dreamy spring atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, as if taken with a professional camera, while retaining the realism of handheld camera snapshots from daily life. It features the grainy texture and color saturation unique to film photography, creating a quiet and poetic atmosphere that conveys a longing for a beautiful life and the tender sentiment of capturing moments",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
