        {
          "id": "krea2-9f3aa7d60903850c587ecf41",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔厨房害羞坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a marble kitchen countertop, her body slightly leaning forward, her right hand gently resting on the edge of the countertop, her left hand naturally hanging down, her posture relaxed yet slightly lazy. She wears a loose blue denim jacket, the jacket revealing a light-colored lace underneath, with a thin black string tied around her waist. The overall look blends casual and sexy elements. Looking directly at the camera, her expression is slightly shy and curious, as if she is about to speak or has just finished speaking. The background is a modern kitchen environment, with a stainless steel sink and faucet visible on the left. Above the sink is a window from which soft natural light streams in, illuminating the entire space. The wall is light beige with subtle textures, making it warm and comfortable. On the right is a simple white wall with a slanted white structure, possibly part of cabinetry or decorative design. The floor is covered with dark wood flooring, contrasting with the light wall. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, body diagonally tilted, creating a sense of dynamism and visual guidance. The camera is shot from a low angle, slightly tilted upward, making the figure appear taller and more prominent. The foreground is a partial close-up of the marble countertop, with a smooth surface and natural texture, showing faint pink and gray spots, adding realism and texture to the image. The middle shot is the main subject, occupying the main part of the frame. Their posture and expressions become visual focal points, while the background is moderately blurred to highlight the subject while preserving environmental information. In terms of lighting, the main light source comes from natural light from the left window, which is soft and even. Without strong shadows, it presents a natural three-dimensional effect. The wrinkles and material details of the denim jacket are clearly visible, the surface reflects a slight sheen, enhancing realism. The overall atmosphere is warm, intimate, and slightly ambiguous. The color palette mainly uses a contrast of cool and warm tones, while the beige and white backgrounds bring a sense of tranquility. The overall image exudes a casual sense of everyday life and the beauty of artistic photography, as if you were casually shooting at home with a regular camera, capturing an unintentional moment yet carefully composing and controlling lighting. It presents a realistic yet emotionally rich image, with soft tones, rich details, and a vibrant sense of life and youthful charm",
