          "id": "krea2-8eb879da047da96a9ea4b909",
          "alias": "单女透视蓝牛仔家中沉思坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a dark wooden stool, legs crossed, her posture naturally relaxed. She wears a white puff-sleeve cropped top and light blue denim shorts, paired with black sheer stockings and black pointed high heels. The black edges of the stockings show at her ankles. The overall look is simple yet full of everyday feel, with a slightly calm and thoughtful expression. Her hands are crossed over her knees, her left hand lightly resting on her right arm. Her fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed, and a thin chain necklace around her neck adds a touch of refinement. In the foreground is a close-up of her lower body and legs while seated, clearly showing the texture of the stockings and the lines of her legs. In the middle frame are the dark wooden stool she sits on, the white drum washing machine on the right, and the blue laundry detergent bottle placed above. The washing machine door is a round glass design with subtle reflections. The background features a semi-transparent glass sliding door, with faint outlines of modern architecture and indoor lighting outside. The floor is paved with light brown tiles with clear textures, and light naturally enters from the left, creating a soft transition between light and shadow. The overall light and shadow atmosphere is warm and realistic. It presents a sense of everyday beauty in home life scenarios, with a centrally symmetrical layout with the subject centered to the left. The depth of the foreground and background creates a sense of space, and details such as clothing folds, stockings reflection, and the gloss of metal appliances enhance realism. The color palette is mainly white, beige, and brown, accented with a blue cleaning bottle as a visual highlight. The overall style leans toward realistic photography with a slight film texture and low-saturation color treatment, simulating amateur camera shooting while preserving slight noise and natural exposure. Highlighting realism and atmosphere, it seems to capture a genuine moment from an ordinary afternoon, without any deliberate staged shots, making it feel more natural and approachable",
