        {
          "id": "krea2-5441039e449483b7d2816eba",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫窗边坐（2）",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window indoors, wearing an off-white short-sleeved shirt made of light, breathable fabric that shows natural pleats and drapes. The neckline is slightly open, revealing the collarbone. A black leather strap is slung across her shoulder, which contrasts sharply with the shirt, adding a touch of casual and casual charm. On her left ring finger, she wears a simple silver ring, while her right pinky finger wears a delicate gold earring. On her wrist is a black watch strap with a gold dial. The dial design is vintage and exquisite, with clear details that show a natural pink hue that radiates a healthy glow. Her body leans slightly forward, her arms resting on a tabletop made of dark leather, smooth and reflecting light and shadow. The background is a light gray wall, with a framed poster hanging on it. The poster features a promotional image for a Korean drama, featuring several characters dressed in traditional clothing. The background is a traditional setting, with a dark brown wooden frame with slight wear on the edges. Notably, the words \"P39\" and \"2E Baba Baxiang\" are clearly visible. Sunlight streams in from outside the window, casting mottled shadows on the walls and figures, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow, with warm and soft lighting. Present the warm tones of the golden moment, with an overall calm and cozy atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The poster in the background serves as a decorative element, enriching the layers of the image and hinting at cultural background. The foreground features the person's hands and tabletop, the middle ground is the upper body and poster, and the background is the wall and window blurred light and shadow. Following her line of sight to the poster, a cyclical visual path is formed. The overall image evokes the warmth of everyday life and the beauty of artistic photography, as if shot with a high-resolution amateur camera, featuring slight film graininess and natural exposure transitions, creating a realistic and warm moment of life",
