          "id": "krea2-61d516d0b33dd466950f6aee",
          "alias": "单女绿衬衫户外困倦站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors under the sunlight, appearing light and layered, her expression carrying a hint of tenderness and subtle reflection, presenting a natural pink color full of youthful energy. She wears a loose green floral shirt made of lightweight, breathable material with a semi-transparent texture. The fabric is printed with varying shades of green plants, the collar slightly open, revealing the white undergarment. The sleeves hang naturally, and the hem gently sways in the wind, creating a relaxed and comfortable feeling. Her hands hold a large cluster of plump, round green grapes. The grape grapes are densely arranged, their surfaces smooth and reflecting a soft sheen. Their color is a fresh emerald green, some of them illuminated by sunlight, giving them a semi-transparent texture. Her fingers are long and natural, her nails neatly trimmed, and her hands gracefully hold the grapes as if displaying a precious gift. The background is a blurry deep green vegetation, creating a soft bokeh effect. Light shines diagonally from the upper left of the painting, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow, with sunlight filtering through the gaps in the leaves. Dappled light and shadow appear on and around the figures. Highlights are bright and transparent, while shadow areas are deep and soft. The overall composition centers on the figure, using close-ups with background blur to highlight the subject. The left side of the frame leaves plenty of space, creating a sense of visual balance and breathing. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, full of the freshness of a summer afternoon. The color tones are mainly green and warm yellow, creating a natural, pure, and vibrant visual experience. The details are rich, and the color saturation is moderate. It combines realism with a touch of dreamy filters, with an overall style leaning toward fresh Japanese photography, with a strong sense of everyday life and artistic beauty. It feels like a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens, while preserving the authentic texture under natural light, allowing people to feel the beautiful moments of sunshine, greenery, and youth",
