        {
          "id": "krea2-4277e29e0f9f0631b32e04e1",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫公寓坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits inside a café, her fingers slender and long. Her ring finger wears a simple ring, and on her wrist is a delicate gold bracelet. Her right hand rests flat on a black tabletop, also wearing a gold ring. On her wrist is a black square smartwatch. She wears a white shirt with a slightly open collar and sleeves rolled up to her elbows, appearing casual yet elegant. Sunlight streams in diagonally through the right window, forming striped light spots that gently transition with the angle of the light. Creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere, the background is a deep green wall covered with posters and posters of various styles, including black-and-white vintage patterns as well as vibrant modern designs. Some of the text clearly displays words like \"SHARIS\" and \"WORTH with BLOG,\" and a white paper lantern hangs along the wall, adding a touch of Eastern charm. On the right side is a large window framed with black metal, from which you can see blurry city streets and green trees. Through the glass, the blue sky and the outlines of clouds are reflected. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center-left position, head slightly tilted, creating a sense of interaction with the viewer. The foreground is part of the tabletop, with a black phone and a corner of the keyboard placed to enhance the sense of life. The middle ground features the main figure and some walls, while the background is the complete indoor environment and the view outside the window. The overall composition is balanced and layered, with warm tones of light and shadow. The sunlight fills the entire scene with vitality and energy. It also preserves the rustic feel of daily life, as if captured in a real moment by chance, with slight graininess and film texture. The camera specs simulate real shooting effects, with a moderate focal length and well-controlled depth of field, highlighting the subject while preserving background details. Overall, it presents an artistic, fresh, natural, and authentic everyday aesthetic, suitable for social media sharing or personal portrait creation",
