        {
          "id": "krea2-bded957d6bef219234090610",
          "alias": "单女毛衣室内沉思坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a dimly lit indoor setting, turning sideways to the camera, her head slightly lowered, her expression calm and slightly contemplative. Her shoulders and arms are draped in a colorful knit sweater, with white as the base color, accented with blue, green, red, orange, and other multicolored geometric patterns and patterns, trimmed with tassels, and the cuffs reveal the light gray sweater sleeves underneath. Her overall style is retro and full of everyday life. Her right hand rests gently on her leg, fingers naturally extended, while her left hand seems to hold a tiny object or thread. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the left side of the frame, forming a visual focal point. The background features blurry bookshelves and stacked books, each with different colors—some have yellowed covers, others have neatly arranged spines. On top of the shelves are miscellaneous items such as white ceramic jars and brown cloth bags, creating a messy yet cozy study atmosphere. Light comes from the front right of the frame, presenting a warm amber tone that outlines clear contours and a sense of depth. The bookshelves and objects in the background show distinct layered light and shadow changes under the light, enveloping the entire image in a faint film graininess, with slight noise and subtle vignetting, enhancing the retro and nostalgic texture. The composition uses shallow depth of field, making the foreground characters stand out clearly while the background is completely blurred, guiding the viewer's attention to the emotional expression of the characters. It hints that she is immersed in her own world—perhaps listening to music, reading, or thinking. The overall atmosphere is quiet and private, as if capturing an ordinary yet poetic moment, like a lifetime essay taken late at night with an old-fashioned camera, full of warmth and storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
