        {
          "id": "krea2-e864a8e83ea18628ad79d470",
          "alias": "单女白礼服摄影棚微笑行走展示",
          "prompt": "A woman wore an elegant white gown with exquisite design, featuring wide shawl-style sleeves adorned with delicate pearl floral decorations. The waist was made of semi-transparent mesh fabric tied with a white bow, showcasing a light and romantic aura. She wore a light blue mesh hat with a unique design, featuring a wide brim and flowing ribbons. She gently rested her right hand on the brim, looking elegant and composed. On her wrist was a blue and white watch with a clearly visible dial. The design is simple yet elegant, adding softness and vitality. The background is a blurred green forest, with sunlight filtering through the leaves casting mottled light and shadow, creating a soft light spot effect and creating a fresh and natural atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle upward shot to highlight the figure's tall figure and elegant temperament. Light shines from above and sides, creating contrasts of light and shadow that enhance the sense of depth and depth. The overall color palette is mainly white and light blue, paired with a green background to present a fresh, pure, Elegant visual experience, rich in detail and delicate texture, resembling a professional studio outdoor photo, with the texture of a high-end fashion blockbuster while retaining the warmth and authenticity of everyday life. The camera captures the person's fleeting expression under natural light, revealing a gentle smile. The entire scene is full of poetry and beauty, like a modern urban woman strolling along a forest path on a spring afternoon. The interplay of light and shadow exudes both classical romance and modern fashion flair. This is a photographic work full of vitality and beauty, showcasing women's elegance, confidence, and independence, while also conveying a longing and pursuit of a better life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
