        {
          "id": "krea2-068e341a3e2ae73bd9b25d74",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫小径微笑侧头",
          "prompt": "A close-up half-length portrait of a woman appears light and full of vitality, revealing a subtle yet sweet smile. On her ring finger is a simple silver ring, her hand posture elegant and natural, as if unintentionally revealing gentleness and confidence. She wears an off-white pleated collar shirt with delicate ruffle designs at the neckline. The fabric is light and soft, with subtle textures and natural pleats. A thin colored stitching can be seen on the shoulder, adding a touch of detail. The overall composition uses shallow depth of field, with the main figure clearly prominent. The background is completely blurred into a soft white and pale yellow light spot, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. Light comes from the front left, soft natural light, possibly morning or evening sunlight, creating a natural transition between light and dark. The overall color palette is mainly warm white and beige, paired with soft pink and brown tones, creating a warm, tranquil, and slightly romantic atmosphere. The composition uses the classic three-part method, with the subject's head slightly tilted, gazing toward the camera but slightly shifting, enhancing interactivity and realism in the image, forming a smooth visual path. The overall style combines the refinement of artistic photography with the warmth of everyday life, as if captured on a quiet afternoon with an old-fashioned film camera, full of the atmosphere of life and emotional warmth. The image texture is delicate, color saturation is moderate, without signs of over-processing, giving a sense of authenticity, warmth, and healing",
