        {
          "id": "krea2-d0e1c6a36bd2a07903d41f21",
          "alias": "单女制服樱花俏皮持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a Japanese-style sailor uniform, an off-white top paired with a dark brown pleated skirt and black over-the-knee socks, wearing brown leather shoes, squatted under a cherry blossom tree, her left hand naturally resting on her knee, her posture elegant and natural, looking directly into the camera, exuding youthful and innocent energy, adding a touch of playfulness and vitality. The background was a blooming pink cherry tree, petals drifting like clouds, with thick and sturdy branches and clearly visible grain. The ground was covered with fallen cherry blossom petals, forming a romantic carpet of pink and white. The overall composition uses shallow depth of field photography, with clear and prominent figures in the foreground and soft blurred backgrounds. The composition centers on the figure, slightly shifting to the right, creating a sense of visual balance and dynamic beauty. The lighting is soft natural light from the front side, evenly casting on the subjects, outlining delicate contours. Shadows are elegant and layered, with warm tones predominantly in off-white, brown, pink, and black. The atmosphere of light and shadow is tranquil and cozy, as if you are on a spring afternoon, with a gentle breeze and the fragrance of flowers filling the air. The entire scene is filled with poetry and romance, like a tranquil campus portrait, tinged with a touch of nostalgia and beauty, presenting a touching moment captured unintentionally in daily life. The image quality combines realism and artistry, as if shot with a medium format film camera on a clear spring afternoon. The lens slightly shakes and is slightly overexposed, bringing a touch of vintage graininess and warm tones, enhancing the image's authenticity and intimacy while preserving enough detail and color saturation, perfectly blending the characters with the environment, conveying feelings of youth, gentleness, tranquility, and beauty.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
