        {
          "id": "krea2-1251fc0316b282d38cff275f",
          "alias": "单女白和服冷淡站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman wears an exquisite white kimono embroidered with colorful traditional floral patterns. Red, blue, green, and yellow intertwine into intricate and elegant patterns. The fabric has a silky smooth texture and delicate sheen, with a slightly open neckline revealing the fair neckline. Her right hand gently rests a delicate Japanese mask, with a white base decorated with red and gold petal-like patterns, its edges outlining smooth curves. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, with a slightly tilted pose and a slight tilt of the body, creating a dynamic sense of balance. The background is pure black or extremely dark tones, almost completely blurred, making the subject stand out more and creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. The composition uses close-ups and uses a shallow depth of field effect to completely blur the background, highlighting the main details. The light also subtly reflects on the kimono fabric, highlighting the texture of the fabric. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and storyful, carrying a touch of classical Eastern aesthetics of mystery and elegance. The visual style combines artistry and realism, as if shot with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens. Using a low-angle downward perspective to enhance the character's presence and visual impact, the tone mainly uses warm and cool contrasts. The dark background contrasts sharply with the main subject's bright parts, yet the overall color control is well controlled without feeling abrupt. The image presents a cinematic texture, like a carefully color-graded and post-processed film photograph, rich in narrative and emotional tension, making one imagine the story behind it—a moment of ritual or a metaphorical expression of the inner world. The entire scene is full of poetry and philosophical reflection. It combines the solemnity of traditional elements with the simplicity and purity of modern aesthetics",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
