        {
          "id": "krea2-5f099a9c58de5dd775ce3148",
          "alias": "单女背心户外微笑站立跳舞",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors in the sunlit woods, wearing a sleeveless top with red and white stripes and dark blue denim overalls, as if enjoying a moment of coolness and happiness. Her hands are squeezing an orange-red can hard, from which dense droplets of water gush out, forming crystal-clear light spots in the sunlight. The droplets splash through the air, some tracing graceful arcs. The background is blurred green leaves and trunks, creating a soft bokeh effect. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, Dappled light and shadow are created, filling the entire scene with warm and bright tones. The light is soft and penetrating, creating a fresh, free, and vibrant summer atmosphere. The composition uses a central shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center, body slightly tilted, arms stretched forward, movements natural and smooth. The dynamic trajectory of water droplets enhances the image's sense of movement and layering. The foreground shows clear figures and splashing droplets, the middle is the body and part of the background, and the background is completely blurred to highlight the subject. The overall image has a slight film texture and retro filter effect, with moderate color saturation and a slight warm yellow tone. The edges have slight vignetting and graininess, as if shot with an old-fashioned film camera. The lens focal length is about 85mm, aperture f/1.8, shutter speed 1/500 sec, exposure compensation +0.3 stops, capturing soft natural light in the early morning or afternoon. The light shines from the upper left, creating subtle shadows and highlights, making the contours of the subjects sharp. The water droplets appear semi-transparent under the light. The entire scene conveys a carefree, simple, and pure youthful atmosphere, as if time has stood still at this moment, leaving only laughter and cool splashes dancing in the air",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
