        {
          "id": "krea2-e01488a199717530b15d509c",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙咖啡厅俏皮站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman stands inside a modern-style coffee shop, positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, her body slightly turned to the camera, her left hand naturally lowered, and her right hand steadily holding a dark coffee cup with a white lid. Her overall posture is elegant and relaxed, gracefully draped over her shoulders, adding a playful touch. She wears an off-shoulder, long-sleeve tight dress made of off-shoulder material, which hugs her body and outlines smooth curves. The neckline is simple and elegant, and the chest features a blurred English letter pattern. She wears a delicate gold necklace around her neck, with a small and delicate pendant that adds a highlight to the overall look. She has long legs and wears a pair of off-white knee-high boots in the same color family. The boots have smooth surfaces and moderate heel height, presenting clean and sharp lines. The boot shaft fits the contours of the legs, with the background set the interior space of a coffee shop. On the left is a wide glass door and window, through which you can see the street outside. The window frame is made of dark metal, with bold lines. The glass reflects the arched window lattices and decorative patterns of the building opposite, faintly showing the \"Luckin Coffee\" brand logo, indicating this is a Luckin Coffee store. Outside the glass doors are several black metal framed high chairs paired with black cushions. The floor is paved with gray marble-patterned tiles, smooth and slightly reflective. On the right is the coffee shop's cashier area, with a black countertop edged with metal edges. On the countertop are some items, including a stack of banknotes and a black device. A long strip-shaped air conditioning vent is installed above, and green emergency exit indicator lights hang from the ceiling, emitting soft light. The entire scene is bright and evenly lit, with the main light sources coming from embedded ceiling lighting and natural light streaming in from outside the windows, creating a clean, modern, and cozy atmosphere. The composition adopts a standard portrait photography perspective, with people occupying the main part of the frame, background elements clear but not cluttered, and through the floor texture in the foreground, The main figures in the middle and the architectural details in the background create a good sense of spatial layering. The visual guide naturally leads from the figure's posture and gaze direction toward the frame. Meanwhile, symmetrical structures on both sides and glass reflections enhance the sense of balance in the image. The lighting and shadow effects are delicate, shadow transitions are natural, without obvious overexposure or missing dark areas. The overall color scheme is mainly off-white and gray-black, accented by warm yellow lighting, creating a realistic and comfortable atmosphere in daily life. It feels like street photos taken during the day with an ordinary phone, full of life and warmth. The image is delicate in texture, color fidelity is high, and details are rich. From the expressions of the people and the folds of clothing to every small object in the environment, everything is clearly distinguishable, giving a warm, friendly, and slightly fashionable feeling. It's as if you can hear the faint sound of a coffee machine and the footsteps of pedestrians in the distance. The whole scene is filled with the rhythm and warmth of urban life",
          "description": "",
