        {
          "id": "krea2-a571d0a3859096bd8f7e2443",
          "alias": "单女黑衬衫城市冷淡坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an orange cushioned chair, wearing a black-and-white short-sleeved shirt with vertical stripes and a black short skirt, her legs crossed and folded—right leg on top, left leg below. Her feet are clad in black stockings, toes hanging naturally, her posture elegant and relaxed. Her right hand gently rests on her right knee, fingers naturally extended, and she wears delicate silver earrings. The overall look is simple and fashionable, full of youthful energy. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, with a medium perspective where the figure occupies most of the space. The background features pure white walls and a white bookshelf. The bookshelf holds several books and decorations. The bookshelf is arched with clean and smooth lines, and the floor is covered with white tiles reflecting soft light. The overall environment is clean and bright. Visual guidance is formed through the characters' postures and gaze directions, then extends along body lines to the legs, finally landing on the background bookshelf. Light and shadow come from the left, soft and even, illuminating the front and sides of the characters. The slight shadows highlight the three-dimensional effect, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. It carries the relaxed feel of daily life and the refined beauty of artistic photography. The scenes are shot indoors, using professional photography equipment while preserving a natural, authentic texture. The color scheme is harmonious, with white, black, and orange as the main tones. The orange seats become the visual focal point, contrasting with the cool-toned background to enhance the sense of layering in the image. The image details are rich, the clothing wrinkles naturally, and the stockings are moderately transparent, showcasing the true material. Overall, it presents the elegance and confidence of a modern urban woman, with strong visual appeal and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
