        {
          "id": "krea2-00ef53e6dec616ea0c460349",
          "alias": "单女全裸白外套街道沉思站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a city street, wearing a white inner layer and a lightweight white jacket. The jacket has slight wrinkles and a reflective texture, giving her a casual and elegant look. She naturally folds her hands and holds a phone, her fingers long, and her nails painted with a subtle nude nail polish. Her overall posture is relaxed and natural, her body slightly turned and her head slightly tilted, showing an effortless elegance and approachability. In the foreground, the main figure occupies the center to the right, and the composition uses a low-angle downward angle. This makes the figure appear tall and imposing. The background is a quiet city alley, flanked on both sides by gray-white architectural walls, wooden door panels, and stone foundations. In the distance, the outlines of modern high-rise residential buildings can be seen: lush green trees and lush branches and leaves. Sunlight filters through the leaves casting dappled shadows. The ground is a dark gray asphalt pavement, with yellow markings along the roadside. On the right, faint red lantern decorations add a touch of cultural atmosphere. The sky appears a clear blue, with soft and warm light, like afternoon or early morning sunlight slanting down, shining down from the upper left The transition of light and shadow is natural, creating a fresh and transparent visual effect. The overall color scheme mainly features a contrast of warm and cool colors. The characters' white clothing vividly echoes the gray-blue tones of the surrounding environment, while also incorporating warm sunlight tones. The composition uses the perspective lines of the street to guide the gaze deeper. The figures stand out as visual focal points, with clear layers and a clear foreground, natural transitions in the middle scene, and moderately blurred backgrounds to enhance the sense of space and depth. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is quiet and warm, evoking a fleeting beauty captured by chance in daily life. It feels like a real scene shot with a regular camera or mobile phone, featuring a realistic style that blends the atmosphere of everyday life with artistic flair. The details are rich, colors harmonious, presenting an overall urban daily image that is youthful, pure, gentle, and slightly artistic, like a beautiful memory frozen in time.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
