        {
          "id": "krea2-7aa477d0a987a469462a96e2",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫摄影棚严肃坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in front of a simple white background, wearing a white shirt and black tie, paired with a black short skirt and black over-the-knee stockings, draped over a loose black coat. Her overall look presents a sharp and elegant professional style. Her makeup is exquisite but not exaggerated, showcasing a blend of youthful energy and mature temperament. She sits in a high chair with a metal frame, her body slightly leaning, her left leg resting on her right, knee slightly bent, her posture relaxed yet dignified. Her right hand rests gently on her thigh, while her left hand naturally rests on the armrest of the chair. The coat is casually draped over the shoulders, with the hem naturally draped to create smooth lines. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure occupying the left central position, the head slightly tilted, creating a strong visual direction. The foreground shows the legs and parts of the body, the middle ground shows the upper body, shirt collar, and tie details, as well as the coat's folds and material layers. The background is a pure light gray wall with no distractions, creating a minimalist sense of space. Light comes from the left side of the front, with subtle shadows transitioning naturally to highlight three-dimensional contours, enhancing layering, the overall light and shadow atmosphere is calm and restrained, with a professional studio texture. The color tones are mainly black, white, and gray, with a clean and sophisticated color scheme. The images are highly realistic, as if shot with a high-end DSLR. The background is moderately blurred to emphasize the subject. The composition is vertical, suitable for displaying on mobile wallpapers or social media. The details are exquisite, from the subtle folds of the shirt to the flatness of the tie, the translucent texture of the stockings, and the drape of the coat fabric, all clearly distinguishable. Overall, it presents an image of modern urban women with independent confidence, combining professional seriousness with personal charm. The composition is serene and full of tension, like a carefully arranged fashion portrait",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
