        {
          "id": "krea2-272c36f6ff8e356f67aacc7f",
          "alias": "单女女仆红女仆装森林俏皮站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a rock by the stream, dressed in a red and black maid outfit. Her red skirt is paired with black lace trim and long gloves. The deep V design on her chest and thin straps outline her elegant curves. Her posture is natural and slightly playful, wearing black high heels, her legs long and straight. In the background, a hazy waterfall cascades down from above, mist envelops the air, surrounded by dense green trees. The light is soft and has a natural diffuse effect. The overall color palette is mainly red, black, green, and white, creating a strong visual contrast. In the foreground, moist gray rocks and flowing streams ripple on the water's surface. The middle ground is the main subject, occupying the center-right position of the composition. The composition uses a third-level method, with the figure's body forming an S-shaped curve. The waterfall in the background serves as a vertical line element, enhancing the depth and movement of the image. The light and shadow come from naturally scattered light, with the light source located at the front left, highlighting the three-dimensional contours. The overall atmosphere blends fairy-tale fantasy with the natural vibe of reality, as if stepping out of an anime world into a real forest. The image texture is delicate, color saturation is moderate, and it has the graininess of film photography and the realism of everyday amateur cameras, presenting a refined yet everyday aesthetic. The lens uses an 85mm prime portrait lens, with a shallow depth of field effect that blurs the background and highlights the subject, while preserving environmental details to create an intimate and immersive visual experience. The entire scene is filled with poetry and romance, like a carefully composed outdoor portrait",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
