        {
          "id": "krea2-86177aff99bc6f9cc2f58965",
          "alias": "单女透视棕毛衣城市害羞坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a high chair by the window in a café, wearing a brown V-neck knit sweater with a loose wrap design. The sleeves are slightly long and naturally drape, and the material features a delicate ribbed texture. The dark threads glow softly under the light. Her expression is naturally relaxed, appearing both friendly and slightly shy. She wears black shorts, simple and fitted with small pleats at the waist. The fabric looks soft and fits her figure. Her legs are dressed in black sheer stockings, which are smooth and subtly reveal her leg lines. The overall look is simple yet fashionable. Her left hand rests gently on her knee, fingers naturally bent, while her right hand rests at the waist of her sweater, seemingly adjusting the wrinkles of her clothes. Her posture is elegant and composed. The background is a city street at night, and through the glass window, you can see the blurry streets, streetlights, and the light tracks of passing vehicles. The lights form long bands of light on the damp road. In the distance, neon lights flicker in a blue-purple hue. The indoor environment is warm and bright. Several round chandeliers on the ceiling emit a soft, warm yellow glow, illuminating the entire space. The café's interior is simple and modern, with tables and chairs in light wood. Next to it is a black backpack, and the floor is paved with gray tiles, reflecting a faint light. The composition centers on the figure, shot in a medium shot. The figure occupies the main subject, with the head slightly tilted and the body slightly angled to the side. The gaze meets the camera, creating a strong visual direction. The foreground features the upper body and some legs, the middle includes her entire body and surrounding chairs and tables, while the background is the night scene outside the window. The blur effect enhances depth of field, making the subject stand out more. The lighting and shadow blend the warmth of the interior with the coolness of the outdoors. Light shines from above and in front, creating a soft transition of light and shadow, with natural shadows. The city lights in the background create a contrast of cool tones, creating a sense of tranquility and loneliness at an urban night. The overall tone of the painting is warm, but with the addition of cool light outside the window, This creates contrast and adds layering, then extends down along the body lines to the legs, then extends to the background night scene. The composition is balanced, with the figure centered slightly to the left, leaving space on the right side to show the view outside the window, enhancing the depth of the image. The image texture is delicate and rich, as if shot with a professional camera in low-light conditions, conveying realism and a sense of life, while retaining artistic beauty to showcase an elegant moment in everyday life. The overall atmosphere is quiet, steady, slightly melancholic, yet full of gentleness and hope",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
