        {
          "id": "krea2-ccc733a2fdfe7244c3739517",
          "alias": "单女绿毛衣桌边跪交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman kneels on a white floor, her body slightly leaning forward, arms crossed over the edge of a wooden tabletop. Her head is angled sideways, presenting a healthy and natural texture. She wears an olive green ribbed knit cropped crop top with long-sleeved sleeves rolled up above the elbows, revealing slender arm lines. She pairs high-waisted black skinny shorts with pleats at the waist and thighs, and a black leather strap visible on the outer right thigh with metal buckle details. The overall clothing style is both casual and fashionable. The figures' postures are relaxed yet expressive, with a medium-angle perspective. The figures are positioned slightly to the right of the frame, leaving space on the left side to display a corner of the wooden table. The tabletop is made of light brown natural wood, with clear wood grain and slight wear on the surface. The table legs are framed with black metal frames with clean and sharp lines. The background is a pure white brick wall made of regularly arranged white bricks, with clear and slightly rough joints. The overall background is clean and simple, highlighting the main figure. Light comes from the front slightly left, with shadows naturally transitioning between the right side of the subject and the ground. The layering of light and shadow is distinct, creating a bright and fresh atmosphere. The image tones are mainly white, green, and black, with sharp contrast yet harmonious unity. The overall image feels as realistic as everyday amateur photography, as if shooting indoors with a regular camera, retaining slight noise and natural exposure control, presenting a lifelike, casual yet refined aesthetic. The composition is stable, the subject is prominent, the background is clean, the light and shadow are natural, and the atmosphere is relaxed and pleasant. Ideal for personal portraits or social media sharing, it showcases youthful energy and personal charm. The details are rich, and even the brick wall texture in the background is clearly distinguishable, enhancing realism and immersion",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
