        {
          "id": "krea2-fdbf892b4a762ae20dad1ae1",
          "alias": "单女白T恤街道微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor bench, her smile sweet and warm, showing off her white, neat teeth. She wears a white short-sleeved T-shirt paired with light blue denim overalls. The legs of the overalls have irregular holes, giving off a casual yet fashionable look. On her feet are white canvas shoes with silver reflective material on the uppers, adding a touch of modernity. She sits sideways, legs bent and tucked together, gently holding a book with an orange-white cover on top of her head. The pages gently flip open, creating a playful and cute atmosphere. Her posture is relaxed and natural, her body slightly leaning forward, her head slightly tilted, showing youthful energy and a relaxed, joyful state. In the foreground is the clear texture and details of the wooden bench, with tiny gaps between the wooden boards. The surface looks slightly aged but feels authentic, the bench's edges show slight wear marks, and the background is a blurred city streetscape, where you can see distant building silhouettes, greenery, and street facilities. The blurred effect makes the main subject stand out. The overall composition adopts a center-to-right visual layout, with the figure positioned on the right side of the frame. Leaving space on the left creates a sense of balance. The camera shoots from a low angle, slightly tilted upward, enhancing the person's affinity and three-dimensionality. The lighting is soft and even, like natural light on a cloudy day or early morning, without strong shadows, creating a fresh and bright atmosphere. The colors are mainly light blue, white, and beige, accented with orange book covers as visual focal points. The warm and harmonious tones present an overall sense of tranquil everyday beauty, as if photographed with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens, with a strong sense of depth and layering At the same time, it retains the authentic texture of amateur equipment shooting, such as slight noise and natural depth transitions, allowing viewers to feel a genuine warmth close to everyday life. The images contain no unnecessary decorative elements; every detail serves the emotional expression of the characters and the creation of the scene atmosphere. The composition is simple yet rich, with delicate and expressive light and shadow. The overall style combines artistic flair with youthful vitality, conveying a relaxed and hopeful attitude toward life",
          "description": "",
