        {
          "id": "krea2-6a8904900712bbbca22c3bc1",
          "alias": "单女上衣小径忧伤站立持花",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors in a lush green environment. The petals are soft and full, their color gradient from deep pink to light pink, edges slightly curled, as if telling a silent emotion. Her right hand gently holds a bouquet of roses of the same color, with flowers arranged in a well-arranged lower left corner of the frame. The stems and leaves are lush green, with clearly visible veins. The background is a blurry deep green leaf and branch, sunlight filtering through the gaps in the leaves, casting mottled light and shadow, creating a light and shadow effect that blends light and shadow, with soft and warm light. It presents a lazy afternoon atmosphere. The figure wears a loose white top with light, breathable fabric, naturally hanging cuffs. The patterns on the clothing are faintly visible but not clear. Several slender branches in the foreground stretch across the upper part of the frame, partially blocking the sky and adding depth and layering to the image. The middle shot features the main figure and the rose in his hand. The background is completely blurred into a hazy green tone, creating a strong depth of field effect and forming a smooth visual path. In terms of light and shadow, the main light source comes from the upper angle, while the other side is in shadow, creating a natural three-dimensional effect and dynamic texture changes. The overall color tone mainly uses warm and cool contrasts, with a green background complementing pink flowers and white clothing. The color saturation is moderate, with a slight film texture. The edges of the frame are slightly darkened to enhance the retro nostalgia atmosphere, with rich and realistic details. It feels like shooting with an old-fashioned film camera, with the natural texture of everyday amateur equipment. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, full of youth and a subtle melancholy, like a silent poem recording a forgotten moment. The air is filled with a faint floral scent and the scent of sunlight, and time seems to freeze in that moment.",
