        {
          "id": "krea2-7a5056d69cc6d67098d9923e",
          "alias": "单女透视黑束身衣椅上媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits gracefully and expressively on a modern high chair, dressed in a refined black bunny girl-themed outfit, including a glossy black satin corset, paired with a white lapel shirt and black bow tie. The long-sleeved jacket naturally drapes down her arms, revealing a pristine white lining at the cuffs. The overall look retains classic uniform elements while incorporating a sense of fashionable design. She wears fine-rimmed glasses that reflect soft light, adding a touch of softness and authenticity. Her legs are crossed and stretched forward, wearing black sheer stockings. Her legs are smooth and graceful, her right knee slightly bent, her left leg naturally extended, and she wears high-heeled patent leather shoes with slender, shiny heels, creating a strong visual focus. She leans forward slightly, her right hand resting gently on the edge of the chair, her left hand naturally resting on her thigh, her expression confident yet slightly seductive. The overall pose is full of tension and beauty. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, and the background in pure white without any distractions, creating a clean and simple sense of space. The metal chair bracket and transparent cushion in the foreground are clearly visible, with geometric lines contrasting with the figure's curves, enhancing the image's three-dimensional and modern feel. The middle frame focuses on the subject, with complete details from head to feet. The light and shadow treatment is delicate and soft, with the main light source coming from the front slightly above, highlighting the texture of the material. For example, the sheen of satin, the translucency of stockings, and the reflection of leather shoes, along with the pure white background of the subject, further enhance the visual impact of the subject, making the character stand out more. The overall atmosphere is fashionable, sexy, and artistic, resembling a carefully planned commercial photography or role-play portrait. The color tones are mainly black, white, and gray, with rich but not chaotic color layers. The composition is balanced and dynamic, and the visual guide is formed by the subject's gaze, posture, and prop direction, creating an immersive viewing experience, with rich image details, showcasing a high level of production quality and aesthetic pursuit",
