        {
          "id": "krea2-17fb59be7541060200f360c4",
          "alias": "单女橙T恤城市冷淡坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the edge of a white platform on a city rooftop, wearing an orange short-sleeved T-shirt and light blue loose jeans, wearing white platform flip-flops. Her posture is relaxed and natural, exuding a relaxed, lazy youthful vibe. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, occupying the foreground, with a slightly forward-leaning body and crossed legs, forming a stable visual center. The background is a dense cluster of city buildings, with houses stacked in layers, varying in height. In the distance, the silhouettes of several high-rise buildings can be seen. The sky displays a soft gray-white tone, with a slight twilight warm tone. The overall lighting is uniform and soft, without strong shadows, creating a peaceful and tranquil atmosphere. A metal railing stretches behind the figures, forming a clean line that divides the space and enhances spatial layering. The composition uses a composite perspective combining close-ups with medium and long shots, with background blur treatment to focus on the figure, while retaining enough environmental information to explain the scene. The color palette mainly consists of warm orange, fresh blue, and neutral gray. This creates a harmonious contrast of warm and cool tones, extending along the line of sight to distant cityscapes, forming a natural visual path. The light and shadows are soft and even, like scattered light on cloudy or dusk days, without obvious directional light sources. The overall atmosphere is quiet, comfortable, and full of the poetry of daily life, as if capturing a moment of afternoon rest. It has a strong sense of documentary realism and life atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and richly detailed; although the background buildings are blurred, their outlines are distinct, conveying the authentic urban environment. Overall, it presents a tranquil moment in the city, combining the hustle and bustle of the modern city with personal tranquility and comfort. It is suitable for everyday portraits or life documentary photography, with a slight film texture and retro filter effect. The tone is slightly warm to enhance the cozyness. Camera specs simulate Canon 5D Mark IV, 24-70mm f/2.8 lens, ISO 100, shutter speed 1/125 sec, f/4 aperture, 70mm focal length, well-controlled depth of field, moderate background blur, The foreground figures are clear and sharp, the overall composition is clean and tidy, with no unnecessary distractions. The composition is balanced, the visuals are smooth, and the story is rich and moving. Like a casual street snapshot, it captures beautiful moments in ordinary life, full of humanistic care and emotional warmth",
