        {
          "id": "krea2-c21feaa8ecb8d99ec5024e30",
          "alias": "单女白T恤街道自信站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at a sunny street corner, wearing a white T-shirt and a blue-and-white plaid skirt, with a white shirt casually draped over her shoulders. A light blue denim strap drapes over her shoulder, holding a cup of coffee in her left hand, gently lifting her right hand to touch an orange flowerpot hanging on the wall. Her expression is naturally relaxed, as if deep in thought. Her posture is relaxed and casual, leaning against a gray brick wall. In the background is a wall plastered with a red billboard that reads \"Bulletin Board in Light Energy\" and a phone number, with a bell hanging beside it The white button installation with the characters on the left is lush green vines, blooming with bright orange-red bougainvillea. The flowers are layered and the branches and leaves are lush, with some branches hanging down, forming a natural frame composition with the figures. In the distance, there are blurred pedestrian shadows on the street, giving the overall scene a sense of tranquility in everyday life. Light pours down from the upper left, creating soft shadows and a warm and bright afternoon atmosphere. The color saturation is moderate, the tones are warm, with a slight film texture, and the edges of the frame are slightly overexposed. It presents the grainy and faded effects of vintage film photography. The composition uses a center-right main subject, with blooming flowers and pots in the foreground, people and walls in the middle, streets and pedestrians in the background. The visual guide is composed of the lines of the characters' arms and flowerpots, with strong but not excessive light and shadow contrasts. Highlights are delicate, shadows are richly layered, presenting a realistic and lifelike scene, as if casually captured with an old-fashioned film camera, carrying a strong documentary style and nostalgic mood. The details in the painting are rich, from the folds of clothing to the textures of plants, all clearly visible. The color scheme is harmonious, mainly white, blue, orange, and green, creating a fresh and natural visual experience. The entire scene is filled with the leisure and comfort of a summer afternoon, allowing people to feel those overlooked beautiful moments in city life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
