        {
          "id": "krea2-d31e54bb90e0f4b40874721d",
          "alias": "单女灰西装街道忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a dark gray collegiate blazer over a white shirt and a burgundy plaid scarf. On her left chest was a school emblem featuring a golden crown and shield pattern. Her expression was calm and slightly distant, gently holding one end of an off-white plush scarf. The scarf was soft and fluffy, hanging from her shoulders and covering her arms. Her right hand was slightly raised, fingers naturally bent, while her left hand held a dark brown leather handbag. The body is delicately textured, the belt is wide and thick, presenting a vintage leather texture. The overall composition centers on the figure, using medium shots that occupy most of the space. The background is blurred, presenting a warm pale yellow tone. The light is soft and even, coming from the front and sides, creating a natural transition of light and dark, creating a quiet, artistic, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The color tone is warm, with moderate color saturation, rich details, and a realistic sense of clothing and materiality. The scarf is soft and fluffy, and the surface of the bag reflects natural light. The overall visual effect resembles everyday street shots taken with a high-resolution camera, with a strong film texture and a sense of life. It feels like the afternoon sunlight streaming onto a campus path is frozen in time. The image is filled with youthful sadness and poetry. The composition is stable, the subject stands out, the foreground is clear, the middle shot transitions naturally, the background is hazy, and then it falls back to the scarf and hand movements, forming a circular visual flow. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and full of storytelling, with evenly distributed light and shadows, soft shadows, and no obvious hard edges. It delivers shooting effects similar to the Canon 5D Mark IV or Sony A7R series cameras at ISO 200 and f/1.8 aperture. The lens is an 85mm prime portrait lens, delivering extreme background blur and three-dimensional character effects. The image details are rich, noise is well controlled, color reproduction is true, and it has a sense of sophistication and artistry. It retains the naturalness and spontaneity of daily life, as if captured by accident, yet captures the most moving moments. The overall image presents a gentle, tranquil, A faint sadness tinges like a silent poem, making people pause and gaze, feeling the loneliness and beauty that belong to youth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
