        {
          "id": "krea2-6ac9e48b52bf20109a76bb6f",
          "alias": "单女毛衣桌边坐持杯",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the wooden bar in a café, wearing a deep burgundy short-sleeved knit top with clear twisted cord patterns. The cuffs are decorated with white and red fine stripes, and she pairs the lower half with a light beige apron. The overall look is simple yet textured, appearing both fresh and slightly lazy. She is holding a pure white ceramic coffee cup in both hands, exuding a calm and contented expression. In front of her sits a white porcelain plate with fine green edges, holding a piece of golden pastry pastry. The surface has a slight caramel hue, appearing soft and delicious. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the foreground, with the figure occupying about one-third of the frame. The composition uses the classic three-part method to create a friendly and natural atmosphere. The middle section is the café's workspace, with a silver-gray professional espresso machine occupying the left side of the background. Its metal surface reflects soft light, and above the machine are neatly arranged multiple coffee bean jars and storage bottles. The black countertop below is clean and tidy, and below sits a bright orange plastic bucket. The barrel is stamped with a blurred English logo, adding a splash of color to the image. On the right side is a large window framed with black metal. The glass lets in bright outdoor light, creating the effect of natural light slanting in from the right rear, filling the entire space with warm morning or afternoon sunlight, enhancing the sense of depth and realism. The background blur is well handled, focusing on the people and drinks while preserving the true details of the environment. The overall color palette is mainly warm brown, off-white, and burgundy, accented with orange. It creates a comfortable and pleasant atmosphere for daily life, presenting a quiet and beautiful moment in daily life, as if taken with a professional camera. At the same time, it retains the warmth and warmth of everyday life, evoking a leisurely afternoon in a café. The color saturation is moderate, the contrast is soft, highlighting the subject while maintaining the layering of the background. The entire image exudes a quiet, warm, and healing atmosphere. Like a carefully arranged commercial portrait, yet also like a moments of life casually captured, full of a balance of artistry and authenticity",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
