        {
          "id": "krea2-11a8003fb5bb6de8e47f6fb2",
          "alias": "单女蓝旗袍小巷站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the middle of a narrow blue-brick alley, wearing a blue-and-white blue-and-white porcelain qipao with a high collar and sleeveless design that perfectly outlines her slender and elegant figure. The qipao is tightly tailored to fit the curves, with the skirt slit down to mid-thigh, highlighting her long leg lines. Her right hand gently touches her waist, while her left hand carries an off-white small handbag. On her feet are a pair of light-colored pointed high heels with deep red heels, creating a subtle contrast with the overall look. A blue flower decoration is pinned to her bun. Her earlobes are adorned with exquisite silver earrings, her makeup flawless, and the background is flanked by towering blue brick walls on both sides. The brick surfaces are covered in green moss, showing traces of age. The walls are mottled, with tiny plants growing in some cracks. The alley floor is paved with irregular stone slabs, with gaps and moss between them, giving a rustic and moist appearance. Sunlight streams in from the end of the alley, creating a soft backlight effect. The light creates a natural transition of light and shadow on the figures, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical style. The figure is positioned at the center of the composition, with walls extending into the distance on both sides, creating a strong sense of perspective that guides the gaze to the figure. Visual guidance is formed through the figure's posture, the lines of the qipao, and the depth of the alley. The layers of light and shadow are rich, with shadows distributed along the sides of the body and the floor. The overall color scheme is mainly teal-green, blue-white, accented with a touch of red, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The composition blends a strong classical Eastern charm with modern fashion, with a realistic style rich in artistic beauty. It feels like a high-quality portrait shot with professional photography equipment in the early morning or evening, with exquisite detail processing, authentic texture, and a sense of story and life. It is like a private photo record from a Jiangnan water town, with slight film graininess and natural depth blur, highlighting the subject while preserving the true texture of the environment. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, elegant, and nostalgic, yet retains the confidence and charm of modern women",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
