        {
          "id": "krea2-67deabc14aaaa6a3ce7dd2e7",
          "alias": "单女米和服广场沉思脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a light beige kimono printed with pink and brown floral patterns. The fabric was delicate and soft, presenting a light, flowing drape. The collar was slightly open to reveal the collarbone, and the wide cuffs naturally drooped. The overall cut was elegant and hugged the figure, showcasing the delicacy and understated beauty of traditional Japanese attire. She stood beside the dark brown, thick cotton-linen curtain, gently pulling aside the heavy curtain with both hands. Her fingers were long, fair, and her movements gentle yet restrained, as if performing a quiet ritual. The edges of the fabric were slightly worn down, It bears the marks of time, showing a texture of long-term use and natural weathering. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, her body slightly turned and head turned to the right, carrying a hint of thoughtful tranquility and anticipation. The background is a typical traditional Japanese architectural interior, with clearly visible wooden structures. The door frame and window lattices are dark brown, with the window frames designed in a traditional square grid. Soft natural light streams in outside, creating a contrasting effect of light and shadow, with light streaming in from the upper right. Creates a warm and hazy atmosphere. The distant background is slightly blurred, highlighting the main figure. The composition combines close-ups with middle shots. The foreground is a heavy curtain covering most of the left space, forming a strong visual guide that draws the viewer's gaze toward the figures. The middle ground is the interaction area between the figures and the curtain, while the background is a blurred interior space and windows, with clear layering. The colors are mainly warm brown, off-white, and pale pink, creating a harmonious and unified overall tone with a retro nostalgia vibe, and clever use of light and shadow. By using natural light and shadow contrasts to enhance the image's three-dimensionality, it creates a tranquil, elegant, and story-rich atmosphere. The overall image presents a fleeting beauty captured in everyday life, as if shot on film with an old camera, with slight graininess and low color saturation, emphasizing realism and a sense of life. While retaining artistic composition and emotional expression, the characters' postures are natural and relaxed, without any signs of deliberate staging. The entire scene is filled with the restraint and poetry of Eastern aesthetics. It evokes a sense of tranquility and beauty that transcends time and space",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
