        {
          "id": "krea2-e66b633940e9d27159b314ac",
          "alias": "单女上衣霓虹夜景困倦坐注视",
          "prompt": "On the city streets as night falls, neon lights and billboards shimmer with colorful lights in the darkness, creating a bustling yet dreamy atmosphere. The main figure is a woman sitting on a concrete railing at the edge of a tall building, her body slightly leaning forward, legs naturally hanging down, toes lightly touching the railing. Her sleeveless black top outlines her slender shoulders and arms, dark trousers hug her figure, presenting a simple yet casual sense of fashion. Her expression is calm yet slightly stubborn, as if gazing into this noisy world. It also seems like she is pondering something. The foreground features a clear edge of the railing and the outline of the woman's body, occupying the visual focus at the lower right of the frame. The composition uses a high-angle overhead view, placing the figure on the right side of the frame to create a strong visual guide. The view extends from the figure to the distant cityscape, with the middle scene at a street intersection, a dense flow of cars, alternating traffic lights, pedestrians weaving through the zebra crossing, blurred silhouettes intertwining with flowing light, presenting the dynamic rhythm of urban life. The background features towering skyscrapers. The glass curtain wall reflects the surrounding lights, and the huge electronic screen plays advertisements in vivid colors. One screen displays the words \"1st,\" while another features red and green patterns. The buildings are arranged in a harmonious and distinct pattern, with distant sky dyed dark purple by city lights, contrasting with the brightness of the ground. The light mainly comes from artificial sources, including streetlights, car lights, neon lights, and lighting on buildings, creating rich light and shadow effects at night. The figures are covered by soft side light, casting soft shadows on the railings and the ground, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color tone is cool, mainly blue-gray, dotted with warm yellow, red, and white glows, creating a sense of alienation and loneliness in a modern city. The painting has a distinct shallow depth of field, with the focus on the figures. The cityscape in the background gradually blurs, forming beautiful bokeh light spots that enhance the artistic and depth of the composition. The composition uses diagonal railing lines and street perspective lines. Guiding the viewer's gaze from the foreground figures to the distant street scene, creating a strong visual impact. The entire scene feels like a real moment captured with amateur equipment, with slight noise and graininess, simulating the texture of low-light photography. Camera settings are set to ISO 800, shutter speed 1/60 sec, aperture f/2.8, focal length 50mm. Handheld shooting, with slight shaking, enhances the image's sense of presence and realism. The overall atmosphere blends urban noise with individual tranquility. It conveys an emotion of independence, freedom, and a touch of melancholy, as if it were a brief yet profound pause in city nightlife, allowing people to feel the loneliness and reflection behind the bustling modern life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
