        {
          "id": "krea2-876022374e0c856c8f5fd485",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣雪地忧伤站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands quietly in the snowy winter, appearing naturally lively, wearing a gentle yet slightly melancholic smile. She wears an off-white coarse knit sweater, with a collar revealing a white turtleneck underneath. The sweater cuffs feature pink ribbed details, and a pink bow is tied around the chest. Her right hand gently holds a blooming pink hydrangea. The flowers are delicate, with layers of petals set against the green leaves, and the branches are slender. She holds flowers in both hands, her posture elegant. In the foreground, she holds a hydrangea and some close-ups of her hands, clearly visible. The background is blurred, presenting a hazy snowy scene. In the distance, faint outlines of buildings or silhouettes of trees can be faintly seen. The sky is grayish, snow is falling, and snowflakes drift down in the air, some forming crystal-clear spots under the light. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the center, forming a visual focal point. The lighting is soft and even, diffused from cloudy days, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The color tones are mainly cool white, pinkish white, and pale pink, with rich but not awkward color layers. The light and shadow are delicate, shadows are soft, and there is no strong contrast. Highlights the gentle temperament of the subject, with a film texture and slight graininess, slightly cool tone, and slight overexposure, simulating real camera shooting. It feels as if using a Canon 5D Mark IV or Sony A7R series full-frame camera paired with an 85mm f/1.8 prime lens. Shooting outdoors in natural light, shutter speed is about 1/200 second, ISO 200, aperture f/1.8, depth of field is extremely shallow, background is completely blurred, highlighting the subject, and slight vignetting at the edges enhances center focus. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, beautiful, and romantic, full of poetry and winter warmth. Like a classic scene from the film \"Love Letter,\" or like the sentiments depicted by Japanese cinematographer Araki Nobuyoshi, it conveys a pure, fragile, yet resilient emotion, allowing people to feel the gentleness and hope of winter",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
