        {
          "id": "krea2-4483a8ad6f978079024d07dd",
          "alias": "单女金和服山野微笑坐展示",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a traditional Japanese room, wearing a bright yellow kimono adorned with delicate red floral patterns and white fine stripes. The neckline is off-shoulder, showcasing an elegant collarbone line. Around her waist is a wide pink obi tied in a full bow, adding softness and playfulness, appearing fresh and natural. She sits slightly sideways, legs bent together, right hand gently resting on her left shoulder, fingers lightly touching the kimono fabric, posture relaxed and relaxed. With a hint of subtle smile, the overall expression is calm yet slightly shy. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, with the figure occupying most of the space. The composition uses medium to near near shots, with a blurred Japanese wooden structure in the background. You can see the wooden window frames and soft light streaming in from outside. Outside, you can faintly see a calm water surface and distant mountain silhouettes, creating a serene and far-reaching atmosphere. Light streams in diagonally from the right window, creating a warm backlight effect that enhances the sense of depth and layering. Light and shadow create delicate transitions between light and shadow in the kimono's folds, highlighting the texture of the fabric. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow, paired with soft orange and pink, creating a cozy and comfortable visual experience. Turning to the natural background creates a smooth visual flow, the overall atmosphere blends traditional Japanese aesthetics with modern photography style, combining classical charm with fashionable flair, presenting a fleeting beauty captured in everyday life, as if a real scene was shot with a regular camera under natural light. It features a slight grainy film texture and realistic light and shadow changes, giving the images a more lifelike feel and artistic appeal",
