        {
          "id": "krea2-058d0cb8f83058ca1b14f423",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫窗边坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits inside the red Ferris wheel's cabin, wearing a white long-sleeved shirt and a dark blue short skirt. Her legs are crossed, her posture natural and relaxed. Her right hand gently grips the silver metal armrest, fingers bent naturally, her expression gentle and serene. Her overall makeup is light and natural, highlighting a pure temperament. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the center, occupying the main visual space. In the foreground is the internal structure of the Ferris wheel. The red metal frame and transparent glass windows form a semicircular border, with faint water droplets or mist on the glass, creating a hazy texture. Through the glass, you can see the distant outline of the city and the colors of the sky. In the middle frame, the woman's sitting posture and body details are visible. The collar of a white shirt is slightly open, revealing the collarbone line, and the sleeves are naturally rolled up. Paired with a deep blue short skirt, the hem hangs naturally, legs are smooth, and light streams in diagonally through the window. The background is the city skyline at dusk, the sky gradient from pink-orange to pale purple, thin clouds, and the richly layered colors of the evening glow. In the distance, the outlines of buildings are blurred, with tall buildings and low-rise residential areas faintly visible. The overall composition uses a central composition, with the figure centered and the Ferris wheel frame forming a natural frame, enhancing visual focus. At the same time, diagonal elements are used, with armrests and leg lines guiding the gaze to create dynamic balance. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and romantic. The sunset's afterglow shines on the figures, creating a soft backlighting effect. The edge halos outline the outline, emphasizing three-dimensionality. Indoor light blends with outdoor natural light to create a contrast of light and shadow, creating a tranquil and serene atmosphere. The main color palette is warm tones, including pink, orange, Warm tones such as yellow dominate, accented with deep blue and white, forming a harmonious color scheme. The overall style combines everyday documentary feel with artistic beauty, resembling a real moment captured with a regular camera, with cinematic light and shadow texture. The image is delicate and authentic, rich in detail, and offers strong immersion and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
