        {
          "id": "krea2-82c5e2b2ed82ed1445bacd2e",
          "alias": "单女透视蓝牛仔沙发脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman sat in a brown leather armchair, wearing a light blue denim dress with long sleeves and a well-fitting cut. The hem reached mid-thigh, showing off her long leg lines. Her legs were crossed and layered, wearing black sheer stockings and black pointed high heels, her posture elegant and natural. Her right hand rested lightly on the armrest, while her left hand hung naturally at her side, slightly raised, fingers lightly touching the edge of the skirt, with a faint rosy sheen. The overall vibe was fresh and slightly sexy. The background is a simple white wall with a sheer curtain hanging on it, letting in soft light and creating a bright and tranquil atmosphere. On the left wall, several neatly arranged books are stacked, with spines of various colors, adding a touch of life to the scene. On the right is a corner of dark wooden furniture, possibly a side cabinet or small table, contrasting with the overall color scheme. The armchair is covered with a thick white plush cushion, fluffy and soft, with a delicate texture that contrasts sharply with brown leather. The composition uses a medium perspective. The subject is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, with the body slightly angled to the camera and the head slightly turned toward the viewer, forming a visual focal point. The light and shadow come from the front slightly left, with soft and even lighting without strong shadows, highlighting the silhouette and details of the clothing. The overall color palette is mainly white, light blue, brown, and black, with harmonious and unified color combinations, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere, as if shooting in a quiet indoor space. It has a realistic feel of daily life while maintaining artistic beauty. The camera angle is slightly low, shooting from below. It enhances the height proportions and aura of the characters, resulting in clean and tidy images with rich details, full of a sense of life and fashion, making it suitable for fashion photography or daily life recording scenes",
