        {
          "id": "krea2-2136c0dddbd738e44c72059c",
          "alias": "单女白长裤椅上自信坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden bench outside a Japanese café, wearing a yellow floral short-sleeved top and off-white high-waisted wide-leg pants, carrying a small black bag over her shoulder. Her right hand holds a transparent plastic cup filled with ice and dark drinks, gently sipping with a red straw. Her left hand rests naturally on her knee, her posture relaxed and elegant. Her presence is the central focal point of the entire composition, forming the main subject. In the foreground, a wooden sign with an orange vintage pattern and the Japanese word \"coffee\" leans against a bench. The edges of the sign are slightly worn, printed with coffee beans, coffee pots, and other elements. Next to it sits a wooden sign inscribed with Japanese. These objects form a layered relationship with the figures, enhancing the depth and sense of everyday life in the scene; The middle view is the café's facade, composed of dark wooden frames and glass windows. Inside, you can see coffee utensils, bottles, and paper bags. A handwritten sign reading \"Takeout Coffee\" hangs on the wall, with an old-fashioned light bulb and a few pieces of white cloth hanging above, creating a nostalgic and cozy atmosphere. Through the glass, you can see the ambiguous interior furnishings, hinting at the continuity of the space. The background is a corner of the street, with faint outlines of other shops and pedestrians visible in the distance, but these are blurred to highlight the main subject and the foreground, while preserving the authentic urban environment; The composition uses a center-right position of the character, with diagonal signs and benches guiding the view, creating a stable visual balance. The characters occupy about one-third of the frame, leaving enough space to showcase the surrounding environment and enhance the narrative feel. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting mottled shadows on the ground, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, off-white, and brown, accented with orange signage. The colors are harmonious and unified, presenting a retro film photography texture reminiscent of vintage film photography, as if shot with an old camera. It has slight graininess and low contrast, with slightly faded tones that enhance the sense of nostalgia and everyday realism. The images are full of life and cultural warmth. It allows people to experience a moment of leisure and beauty in a corner of the city",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
