        {
          "id": "krea2-a083b5804de3320a3adb29f9",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫森林愤怒坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the edge of a lush forest, wearing a wide-brimmed straw hat with naturally loosened straw fibers at the brim, giving it a handwoven texture. The hat glows with a warm golden hue in the sunlight. She slightly tilts her head up to the sky, appearing delicate and full of vitality, adding a touch of natural and casual beauty. She wears a loose white cotton shirt with sleeves rolled up to the elbows, the front open revealing the red fine stripes underneath the straps of a camisole swimsuit. The fabric of the shirt wrinkles naturally as the breeze gently brushes it. Light and shadow create a contrast of light and shadow on its surface. One hand gently rests on the edge of the straw hat, fingers slender, posture elegant and relaxed, while the other hand rests naturally on the knee, body slightly turned to the side, revealing graceful curves. In the foreground are several lush broadleaf plants, with clear veins and natural serrated edges. Some leaves, illuminated by sunlight, appear semi-transparent. In the middle are the stone steps and rocks where she stands, the stone surface covered with moss, rough yet realistic, with colors gradient from gray-brown to deep green. This shows the effects of long-term humidity. Low ferns grow between the crevices of the stone steps, while the background is dense woods. The intertwined branches and leaves form layers of green barriers. Sunlight streams through the gaps, creating mottled light spots and soft halos. The entire scene is dominated by warm tones, with golden sunlight penetrating the forest, creating a warm, tranquil, and vibrant atmosphere. The composition uses a center-right main figure, who occupies about two-thirds of the frame. Leaving space on the left and above allows light and vegetation to extend, creating a visual balance. The slightly overhead view makes the figure appear more intimate and realistic. The curved lines of the straw hat also serve as guidance, highlighting the light and shadow effect. The main light source comes from the upper left, simulating the angle of afternoon sunlight. The light is soft but not glaring, while the shadowed areas display a cool gray tone, contrasting with the warm yellow of the illuminated surface, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and spatial layering. The overall atmosphere is warm, romantic, and slightly pastoral. It feels as if capturing a tranquil moment on a summer afternoon. The image details are rich, color saturation is moderate, and the tones are warm and harmonious, giving it a strong everyday photography feel. It feels like a real scene shot with a portable camera or phone. The image is free of deliberate posing but is filled with the breath of life and the beauty of nature, presenting an overall fresh, gentle, and healing visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
