        {
          "id": "krea2-317e68fd09b07411d154de13",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤车内冷淡坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits inside a moving sightseeing bus or cable car, wearing a black-and-white thin-striped short-sleeved T-shirt with a white camisole underneath, light gray shorts, and dark gray platform sandals with black straps and orange decorative details. She wears blue sunglasses with white frames, sitting sideways, legs crossed and slightly bent, knees close to the camera, body slightly leaning forward, expression calm with a hint of laziness and gentleness. The background is bright blue sky and white clouds. Through the large curved glass windows, the sky is clearly visible, showing a clear blue sky dotted with fluffy, pure white clouds. Outside the window, the sunlight is strong, and light penetrates the glass, creating a soft light and shadow effect inside the carriage. The interior structure is simple and modern, with a light gray grid-like ceiling topped with metal frames and a gold decorative pendant along the edges. The floor is made of blue textured material, possibly anti-slip rubber or plastic. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward view to highlight the leg lines of the figures and the sense of spatial depth. The figure is positioned slightly in the center on the left side of the frame, with ample space on the right side to display the scenery outside the window, creating a layered effect from near to far. Light and shadow mainly come from the upper right, with sunlight slanting in through the window, creating a warm and bright summer atmosphere. The colors are mainly cool tones, such as blue, white, and gray, enhancing visual impact. The image texture is delicate and lifelike, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains the natural feel of real everyday scenes. It has a strong cinematic feel and storytelling, making it suitable for travel, vacations, youth, and themes like freedom",
