        {
          "id": "krea2-f582e6563d6f6e2db981c24c",
          "alias": "单女绿毛衣广场俏皮坐持食物",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a warm café, wearing an olive-green coarse knit sweater. The sweater's texture is clearly visible, with diamond-shaped cutouts and rolled-up cuffs that showcase a delicate handmade feel. The fabric of the sweater has a delicate knit texture under soft light, exuding a casual touch of everyday life. She is holding a small silver spoon in her right hand, the spoon slightly tilted, with a bit of red jam on the tip. She is about to put food into her mouth, appearing natural yet refined. Her left hand rests on the table. On her ring finger is a simple silver ring, her hand naturally relaxed, showing a relaxed and cheerful state. On a white porcelain plate in front of her sits a square cheesecake, covered with bright red strawberry jam. The glossy jam contrasts sharply with the pale yellow cake body. The edge of the plate has a slight shadow indicating the direction of the light. The tabletop is made of dark brown wood, with clear wood grain and a slight reflective surface, presenting a warm and smooth texture. The background is a blurred café interior. You can see wooden shelves and displayed items, with lighting in warm yellow tones that create a cozy and comfortable atmosphere. The composition uses a shallow depth of field, with the main figure clearly prominent. The cake and tabletop in the foreground are rich in detail, the middle shots are well-rounded, and the background is blurred to create a distinct sense of space. The light mainly comes from the upper left, with delicate and soft shadows. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with warm yellow and green tones accented by a touch of red, creating a visually harmonious and unified look. The visuals possess a lifelike artistic aesthetic, resembling a high-quality portrait shot by a professional camera, yet preserving unintentional moments from daily life, conveying a relaxed and enjoyable mood. The composition is center-right, with the figures occupying most of the space, forming a smooth visual flow. The entire scene is full of story and emotional warmth, as if one can feel the satisfying aroma of a hot drink and dessert in a café",
