        {
          "id": "krea2-40e774ffaabbfa9e594dc226",
          "alias": "单女灰T恤高塔站立注视",
          "prompt": "She smiles, showing her neat, white teeth with a healthy rosy glow. Her body is slightly turned to the camera, her left hand gently resting on the stone railing, while her right hand hangs naturally as she carries an off-white diamond-patterned handbag. The bag is small and delicate, with metal fasteners shining with a soft sheen. She wears a loose gray short-sleeved T-shirt with a black \"MIU MIU\" printed on the chest With the brand logo, the hem is tied up to form natural pleats, revealing a slender waistline. She pairs it with light gray sports shorts with a white drawstring at the waistband and white trim at the cuff. The overall look is casual yet stylish. She wears a pair of off-white platform sneakers with delicate textures and brand logos. The laces are tied neatly, presenting comfort and casualness for everyday wear. She stands on a balcony paved with reddish-brown tiles, where the floor is clearly visible. Sunlight pours in from above, providing soft and even light. Illuminating the entire scene, the background features a building with Mediterranean flair. The walls are made of beige paint and gray stone, the circular tower is partially built with gray bricks, the roof covered with red ceramic tiles, and decorative arched window frames under the eaves. The window glass reflects a faint yellow light, surrounded by dense greenery. Tall trees flourish with branches and leaves, their leaves gently swaying in the breeze. In the distance, low shrubs and vines climb the walls. The composition centers on the figure, using a medium perspective. The figures occupy about two-thirds of the height of the frame, with railings extending in an arc to both sides of the frame, forming natural guiding lines that draw the gaze toward the main subject. The buildings and greenery in the background are clearly layered, creating a sense of depth. The lighting and shadow effects are natural and realistic. Sunlight shines from the upper left, casting soft shadows on the figures. The walls and railings also create a contrast of light and shadow, creating a relaxed and pleasant overall atmosphere full of the life of a summer afternoon. The colors are mainly gray, white, beige, and green, with warm and harmonious tones. The image feels delicate and detailed, It feels like a real-life moment captured with a professional camera, with a strong sense of everyday life and artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
