        {
          "id": "krea2-085c4c599ffb216ef31a06b3",
          "alias": "单女和服街道坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a light-colored kimono with black leaf-patterned patterns sits on rustic stone steps, leaning back slightly, holding a transparent glass bottle in her right hand to drink water. Her head tilts back, her expression relaxed and content. One foot dangling gently in the air, the other firmly planted on the ground, her posture casual and natural, as if enjoying a moment of tranquility and coolness. The wooden walls behind her have clear textures, displaying a warm brown tone shaped by the passage of time. The rough wood panel patchwork marks and natural wood grain add a sense of history and authenticity. Sunlight pours in from the upper left, casting soft shadows on the walls and figures, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The warm and bright light creates an afternoon sunshine atmosphere. On the left side of the painting is a narrow street paved with gray stone slabs, extending into the distance. On both sides are traditional Japanese machiya buildings with dark gray tiles and walls made of wood and plaster. Some buildings have green plants climbing in front of them, lush branches and leaves, dotted with pink flowers. A vintage-style black streetlamp stands by the roadside, with a square shade and a clearly visible metal frame. In the background, you can faintly see the silhouettes of other pedestrians, but due to the distance, they are blurred, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The entire composition is shot at a low angle, with the tall wooden wall on the right serving as a vertical line guiding the view. Meanwhile, the stone road on the left extends diagonally with distant buildings, creating a strong perspective effect. The main figure is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, occupying the visual center. Its dynamic poses contrast with static environments, adding vividness to the image. Light pours in from the upper left, creating a distinct backlighting effect that creates a soft halo around the outline edges of the figures, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow, off-white, and brown, accented by green plants and pale pink flowers. The tones are harmonious and unified, full of traditional Japanese aesthetic charm. The image has a slight film graininess and soft bokeh effect, simulating the texture of real camera shooting. The background blur is finely processed to highlight the subject. It creates a nostalgic, tranquil, and slightly poetic moment of life, as if freezing an ordinary yet touching daily moment on a summer afternoon on the streets of Kyoto. The overall atmosphere is warm, serene, and healing, like a true portrait from life—both artistic beauty and the breath of everyday life, allowing people to feel the slow flow of time and inner peace",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
