        {
          "id": "krea2-7852b201b2636e53b62fa54b",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤船上冷淡站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on the deck of a ship, wearing a light blue tie-dye camisole dress. The skirt is light and flowing, with natural pleats and gradient colors on the fabric that create soft layers in the sunlight. A small white flower is pinned to her chest, adding a touch of freshness and romance. She leans slightly to the side, arms raised above her head, fingers gently gripping the ship's metal railing. The background is the vast water, shimmering with waves. The water color gradually transitions from light blue to pale blue from near to far, creating a soft depth blur effect. The distant skyline is blurred and tranquil, and the sky appears in a faint gray-white tone. The overall color scheme is mainly cool blue, creating a cool and refreshing summer atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle downward view, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right of the frame, and the body extending diagonally, enhancing visual tension and dynamism. In the foreground, a metal railing runs diagonally from the lower left corner of the frame, forming a guiding line that draws the viewer's attention to the subject. At the same time, it increases spatial depth. Light comes from directly above slightly to the left, representing bright natural daylight. Sunlight penetrates the clouds, forming a soft diffused light, while the shadowed areas are very soft, with almost no hard edges. The transition between light and shadow is natural, presenting a film-like texture with slight graininess and color shifts. The tone is slightly cool but retains a warm humanistic atmosphere. There is a slight vismal effect at the edges, reinforcing the central focus. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, healing, and poetic. It feels as if capturing a moment from an afternoon boat trip—both real and dreamlike, with a strong sense of everyday documentary and artistic beauty. It's like a frame of life shot with a vintage film camera on a sunny seaside, rich in detail and sincere emotion, evoking a sense of freedom, youth, and harmony with nature",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
