        {
          "id": "krea2-1f30cb8b019ac8d36a541965",
          "alias": "单女毛衣烟火微笑站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman smiling outdoors at night, gazing up at the sky, creating a natural and lively beauty. She wears a light-colored loose cardigan with a vintage patterned camisole underneath. The material is light and breathable, presenting a casual and comfortable everyday feel. Her right hand holds a burning firework stick, sparks flying, forming bright spots and dynamic trajectories. These points of light stand out brilliantly against a dark background, forming the visual focal point of the scene. In the foreground is the brilliant glow bursting from the firework stick. Some light spots appear as blurry circular spots due to shallow depth of field, enhancing the layering and dreamlike atmosphere of the image. The middle ground depicts the woman's upper body, clearly visible from neck to shoulders. Her posture is relaxed, her head slightly tilted back, and the transition of light and shadow is natural. The background is pure black or extremely dark night sky with almost no detail. This minimalist background treatment makes the subject stand out more and also enhances the visual impact of the light source. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, placing the figure slightly to the left of the frame. A large area on the right is reserved for displaying the fireworks' diffusion trajectory and lighting effects, creating an asymmetrical yet balanced visual structure. The overall composition presents a romantic, warm, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The colors are mainly warm tones, with orange-yellow, golden yellow, deep blue, and ink black forming a strong contrast of warm and cool tones. The light mainly comes from the firework stick and any ambient light sources, with the light shining from the front right, adding a sense of depth. Meanwhile, smoke or dust appears faintly under the light, enhancing the sense of air and realism. The overall image has the grainy texture and slight noise of film photography, as if shot at high ISO with a professional camera at night. The lens focal length is moderate, depth of field is well controlled, background blur is natural, and nearby sparks and distant light spots present varying levels of clarity. The visual guide begins with the glow of fireworks and finally pauses at the unknown distant edge of the night sky. The whole image conveys a sense of joy in tranquility and poetic moments in ordinary life, full of emotional tension and storytelling. Like a private photo recording youthful memories, it combines artistic beauty with genuine warmth",
