        {
          "id": "krea2-25482f2d0383de17f518bcff",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫门忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands with a side profile, appearing light and layered. She wears a white short-sleeved shirt with a delicate texture, presenting a slight semi-transparent texture. The cuffs hang naturally, the neckline is slightly open, revealing the neck line. She wears a dark plaid skirt with subtle pleats at the hem. The overall style is simple yet youthful. Her hands are folded in front of her, fingers gently resting on her waist, her posture naturally relaxed, her body slightly turned and her head turned to the left side of the frame, her expression gentle and reserved. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the composition, leaving plenty of negative space to create a tranquil atmosphere. The foreground shows the upper body and some arms, while the background is a blurred indoor environment. The walls are dark gray, with faint vertical lines of door or window frames. Light streams diagonally from the right, creating a strong backlighting effect. Sunlight passes through the fine dust in the air, producing obvious beams and lens glare. The halo spreads throughout the image, illuminating the outline and some clothing, while casting soft shadows in the background. The contrast between light and shadow is strong but the transitions are natural. Highlights are bright and warm, while shadows are deep and serene. The overall tone is mainly warm yellow and gray-blue, creating a contrast of cool and warm tones that create a serene, nostalgic, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The composition uses the rule of thirds, with the characters near the golden ratio point. The viewer's gaze guides the viewer to look beyond the frame, enhancing narrative feel. The shallow depth of field blurs the background and highlights the subject. The lighting angle is close to a low-angle sunset, simulating the realistic shooting effect under natural light, resulting in a delicate image texture. The details are rich, as if captured with a professional camera and a large-aperture lens, featuring the graininess and color gradation of film photography, presenting a fleeting beauty from everyday life, like intimate images taken with amateur equipment, full of the spirit of life and emotional warmth",
