        {
          "id": "krea2-8a79ec2d2b5c52eb221864ec",
          "alias": "单女紫毛衣屋顶困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a city rooftop or high ground at dusk, wearing a light purple knit cardigan paired with a white shirt, appearing lively and full of life, as if whispering softly or just ending a conversation. Light slants from behind her, forming a warm backlit silhouette. The overall composition presents a gentle and tranquil atmosphere. The foreground is the main figure, occupying the center slightly to the right. The composition uses the classic rule of third, with the figure's head on the right one-third line, guiding the viewer to look toward the upper left. The background is a blurry city of buildings, with clean and modern lines. The walls are grayish-white, windows are neatly arranged, and distant green trees dot the scene, creating a blurred depth of field. The sky shows a sunset gradient, transitioning from pale yellow to light orange, then blending with soft pink-purple, creating a dreamy dusk atmosphere. Light comes from the upper left of the frame, a typical backlit shot. Sunlight passes through tiny particles in the air, creating a distinct beam and bokeh effect. On the left side of the frame, a green circular light spot can be seen. This is a natural expression of lens flare, adding realism and artistic flair to the photo. The overall light and shadow layers are rich, transitioning naturally from bright light sources to shadowed areas, enhancing three-dimensionality. The composition uses shallow depth of field technology to make the subject clear and prominent, with the background completely blurred, creating a strong visual focal point. The subject's posture is naturally relaxed, the body slightly tilted, and the arm hangs naturally, giving a momentary beauty captured unintentionally. The main color palette is warm yellow, orange, and purple, with a harmonious contrast of warm and cool tones. It creates a warm and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The overall style leans toward snapshots of daily life, with a slight film texture, as if captured with a regular camera. The details are exquisitely handled, while retaining a certain graininess and noise to simulate the texture of real photography. The entire scene is full of poetry and storytelling, evoking the complex emotions woven from youth, growth, loneliness, and hope. The visuals are cinematic, like a quiet fragment in an art film, where time seems to freeze at that moment.",
