        {
          "id": "krea2-14e8f01ad95bf77b24595e22",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫高塔困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands with her back to the camera in the center of a tree-lined path paved with bricks and stones, wearing a white turtleneck knit top and a black polka-dot long skirt with white soles, black pointed ankle boots, and carrying a small black backpack in her right hand. Her body leans slightly forward, walking along the road with a relaxed and natural posture, as if enjoying the tranquility of autumn. Her figure forms a visual focal point in the frame, located near the golden ratio point of the composition, guiding the viewer's gaze into the distance. In the foreground is a delicate brick pavement, scattered with a few withered yellow fallen leaves. Sunlight slanted through the treetops, casting dappled shadows on the ground and forming interplay of light and shadow geometric patterns. Neatly arranged dawn redwoods tower into the clouds on both sides, their leaves showing a rich golden hue. Layers of branches and leaves intertwine to form a natural arched tunnel, with sunlight filtering through the gaps casting soft beams of light that create a warm and dreamy atmosphere. The middle ground is a straight path stretching into the distance, with smooth surfaces and low shrubs dotted with green and yellow leaves on both sides, adding depth to the scene. In the distance, the silhouette of a small bridge or building can be faintly seen, serving as the visual endpoint. The background is a clear pale blue sky, with a few thin clouds drifting lightly. The overall composition uses central perspective, with the lines of roads and trees converging into the distance, creating a strong sense of depth and space. Light comes from the sides and rear, representing the warm sun of morning or evening. The golden glow softly envelops the entire scene, giving the color saturation a warm tone. The shadowed areas show a deep orange-brown, with sharp but not abrupt light and shadow contrasts, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. Full of poetry and romance, it carries a slight film texture and graininess, simulating amateur camera shooting effects. The color tone leans toward vintage, and slightly overexposed highlights enhance the clarity of the image. The details are rich and layered, showcasing the unique tranquility and beauty of an autumn afternoon. It feels as if time has frozen at this moment, evoking a sense of purity and comfort far from the noise",
