        {
          "id": "krea2-b3683fb2950b39505e6949bb",
          "alias": "单女蓝西装庭院困倦坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a deep blue sailor suit sits on a woven chair in the outdoor courtyard, her left hand gently resting on her right knee, her right hand naturally resting at her leg, her posture elegant and relaxed. The collar of the sailor suit is decorated with white stripes, and the cuffs and skirt edges are also trimmed with white. Paired with pure white tights, her legs are crossed, right leg on top, ankles naturally bent, toes slightly raised, displaying the sweetness and serenity of youth. In the foreground is the gray woven chair she sits on. The chair backrest and seat are composed of interlaced geometric patterns, supported by a metal frame. The chair rests on a dark gray wooden floor with clear texture and fine gaps between the wooden boards. In the middle is a lush wall of flowers in the background, with flowers of various colors blooming densely—pink, purple, yellow, blue, and white, including hydrangeas, roses, tulips, and more. Petals overlap and green leaves intersperse throughout, forming a vibrant sea of flowers. Behind the flower clusters, faint green plants and trees can be seen. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting mottled light and shadows, illuminating parts of the area with a warm golden hue. On the left side is a beige umbrella edge, made of soft umbrella material that casts gentle shadows. The overall composition adopts a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, body slightly tilted, gazing directly at the viewer. The background wall extends from the right to the top, forming an arc-shaped visual frame that enhances the depth and layering of the image. Light comes from the upper left, natural daylight, soft and bright. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating dappled light and shadow effects on the ground and figures, creating a warm and dreamy atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly green and blue, accented with colorful flowers. The contrast of light and shadow is striking, featuring both bright highlights and soft shadow transitions. The image presents a fresh, natural, and vibrant summer afternoon atmosphere, like a high-quality portrait photographed with professional photography, with cinematic texture and artistic beauty. At the same time, it preserves real and warm moments from daily life, as if recording an ordinary yet beautiful day. The background blur is well handled, highlighting the main characters, with rich and delicate details and natural light and shadow changes. The overall composition is full of youthful energy and serene poetry, evoking a sense of simple and pure beauty",
