        {
          "id": "krea2-2d35001751b05d13b3035515",
          "alias": "单女白外套雪地冷淡站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands amidst the snowy winter landscape, appearing especially real and vivid. Looking directly at the camera, she seems to silently say something. She wears a fluffy, soft white plush jacket, thick and warm, with a light blue scarf revealing at the collar. The scarf is light and soft, creating a soft color contrast with the white jacket. One corner of the scarf casually drapes over her chest, adding a touch of casualness and laziness. Her posture leans slightly forward, her hands gently folded in front of her. It seems to be resisting the cold, yet also embracing the silent snowy night. The foreground features a clear main figure, while the background is blurred snow and wooden houses. The distant architectural outlines are blurred, and the wooden roofs and walls are covered in thick snow, presenting a peaceful and rustic rural atmosphere. The sky is grayish, snowflakes continuously fall from the sky, some tracing fine trajectories in the air, creating a dynamic visual effect. The entire composition uses shallow depth of field, with the background completely blurred, highlighting the subject's delicate expressions and emotional expressions. The composition is centered slightly lower, with the figure occupying the main part of the frame, forming a strong visual center. The lighting is soft and even, diffused from cloudy days, with no obvious shadows. The overall color palette is mainly cool white, light blue, and off-white, creating a cool, pure, and tranquil winter atmosphere. The layers of light and shadow are rich but not abrupt, highlights are natural, shadow transitions are smooth, and the faint light reflected off the snow adds a sense of transparency to the image. The overall style combines artistic and everyday feel, as if shot with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens to create a real scene. It also has the grainy texture of film photography and slight overexposure, with slightly darkened edges to enhance nostalgia and immersion. In terms of details, the fiber texture of the plush jacket is clearly visible, with each strand distinct and distinct. The scarf's pleats are naturally smooth, and snowflakes swirl in the air in various shapes—some large and small, some clearly distinguishable, some blurred into dots—enhancing the sense of spatial depth and reflecting the cool tones of the surrounding environment. The overall composition is full of poetry and storytelling, giving a sense of quietness, loneliness, and warmth. It is as if time has frozen in this moment, with only snowflakes falling silently. The entire scene resembles a meticulously composed film photograph, combining surreal beauty with the true details of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
