        {
          "id": "krea2-161462e557afe2927547db15",
          "alias": "单女黑外套城市忧伤倚靠指向",
          "prompt": "Her body leans slightly forward, her head resting on a dark marble pillar, her expression showing a hint of fatigue and detachment. She wears a black leather jacket with a smooth surface and a slight reflective surface. The cuffs and shoulders feature pleats and patchwork details. She wears a black turtleneck underneath, black trousers and platform black leather boots with a metal brand logo. Her left hand hangs naturally at her feet, fingers slightly bent, her posture relaxed and casual. The overall look presents a cold yet fashionable urban style, with gray concrete steps and the floor in the foreground. The surface is rough with slight wear marks, with a few withered yellow fallen leaves scattered among them. In the middle ground, the main figure and nearby dark marble columns have clear textures, featuring natural stone spots and stripes. The background is a blurry city streetscape, with distant reflections of glass curtain walls and some greenery and trees. The leaves glow with a warm yellow glow in the sunset, creating a soft bokeh effect. The sky is obscured, but light streams from the upper right, creating a warm and soft backlit atmosphere. The composition is shot from a low angle. The figure is positioned slightly in the center on the left side of the painting, using columns as visual support points to form a stable triangular structure, while leaving space on the right side to guide the gaze into the background. The figure's head is slightly tilted to create dynamic balance, enhancing interactivity and emotional tension. In terms of lighting and shadow, the main light source comes from the right rear, creating a subtle dramatic effect. Shadows are concentrated in the left front, with distinct shadow areas on the ground and at the base of the columns. The color tones are mainly black, gray, and brown, dotted with warm yellow light spots in the background, resulting in low overall color saturation. It presents a film texture and slight graininess, with images that resemble amateur camera realism, simulating the natural noise and color transitions of 35mm film photography. The lens is a mid-length prime lens with an aperture of about f/2.8 to achieve a shallow depth of field, making the background blur highlight the subject. The overall image conveys a lonely, contemplative moment of modern urban life, combining fashion and everyday vibes, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
