        {
          "id": "krea2-d37d51e6b3b6bc595559a0d7",
          "alias": "单女红围巾森林忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the autumn maple forest, her head slightly lowered, her expression calm and reserved. Her right hand gently strokes the deep red knitted scarf wrapped around her neck. The scarf is soft and thick, with clearly visible patterns. Her left hand hangs naturally, fingers long, and she wears a black turtleneck sweater. The texture of the garment is delicate, contrasting with the surrounding warm tones. In the foreground is a large patch of blurred red maple leaves, their edges jagged, with colors gradient from deep red to orange-red. Some leaves, illuminated by sunlight, appear semi-transparent. The dappled light and shadow create a dreamlike blur effect. The middle ground features a female subject, positioned slightly to the right of the center of the composition, her body slightly turned and head slightly tilted, her gaze straight ahead, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The background features layers upon layers of maple trees, dense and vividly colored, mainly deep red and orange-red, mixed with a hint of yellow and brown. The distant tree trunks are blurred, creating a natural transition of depth of field. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered and surrounded on both sides by maple leaves, creating a visual sense of envelopment. The background blurred maple leaves form a front and back layer with the clear trees in the background, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The visual guide line converges from the red leaves in the foreground to the central figures, then extends into the depths of the background forest. The atmosphere of light and shadow is warm and tranquil. The afterglow of the setting sun penetrates the gaps between the leaves, creating a soft backlight effect. The light is a warm yellow tone, with slight halos and scattering, enveloping the entire scene in a hazy poetic atmosphere. The color saturation is high, with reds dominating, but the richness of color is maintained through light and shadow changes The overall tone leans warm, creating a tranquil and slightly melancholic atmosphere of an autumn evening. The image has the texture of film photography, with slight graininess and a slight fading tendency, as if captured with an old-fashioned camera. The details are exquisite, the characters' expressions subtle, emotional expression subtle, the background naturally blurred, the focus clear, and the composition balanced. Overall, it presents an artistic, nostalgic, gentle, and story-rich visual style, like a still shot in a film, capturing the eternal moment of the changing seasons",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
