        {
          "id": "krea2-d5c40ec38eca446ae1ff0c1f",
          "alias": "单女紫毛衣广场站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A girl stands outdoors by a white metal railing. From a low-angle downward view, she appears tall and full of vitality. She wears a light purple knit sweater decorated with white cloud patterns, with delicate ribbed details on the cuffs and collar. The sweater is soft and fluffy, presenting a warm and comfortable texture. She wears a white lace-trimmed dress underneath, with a light and flowing hem revealing layered pleats and sheer tulle material. Her left hand hangs naturally, wearing a gold ring on her finger, and a smartwatch with a white strap on her wrist. The dial is a black square design. She slightly tilts her head toward the camera, radiating youthful vitality and innocence. The background is a vast, boundless blue sky, with not a single cloud in sight. The sky shows a gradient effect from light blue to deep blue, with light coming from the upper and lower sides, creating a strong backlighting effect. The edges of the figure's silhouette are surrounded by a golden halo with a natural reddish glow. The overall color palette is pale purple, White and blue are the main colors, with fresh and bright tones. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly above the center of the frame. The foreground features a clear white metal railing with slightly worn surfaces with slight rust and scratches. The middle ground shows the girl's full-body posture, naturally relaxed. The background is a pure blue sky, occupying most of the painting space and creating a sense of openness. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is bright and transparent, with strong but not harsh sunlight It presents a warm and pleasant summer afternoon feeling. The overall style combines everyday photography with artistic beauty, like natural moments captured with a regular phone. The images are authentic and moving, rich in details and distinct layers, combining the sweetness of youth with a serene and serene poetic charm",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
