        {
          "id": "krea2-4bc937cfdf2b2276b433dc5c",
          "alias": "单女白外套街道忧伤行走注视",
          "prompt": "A woman is walking on a city street crosswalk, wearing a fluffy, soft white plush jacket paired with a dark brown high-waisted knit skirt, black ankle boots, holding a cup of coffee in her right hand and her left hand naturally hanging at her side. Her posture is elegant and composed, showcasing a fleeting beauty found in urban life. Her figure is positioned at the lower right of the frame, forming a visual focal point. In the foreground is a clear white zebra crossing and a damp, reflective asphalt pavement, with obvious car tracks and blurred traffic markings. Beige and gray-brown stone walls, adorned with exquisite carved decorations and neatly arranged windows. Scattered views of cars and distant pedestrians can be seen sporadically. The background is a gradually blurred city skyline, with towering buildings shrouded in mist, and the sky showing a faint gray-blue hue. The overall composition uses low-angle shots, using the street's perspective lines to guide the gaze toward the distance. This creates a strong sense of depth and spatial layering. The figures are positioned near the golden ratio of the composition, highlighting the main subject while maintaining balance. The visual guide naturally extends from the foreground crosswalks and road lines to the figures, then transitions to the background buildings, creating a flowing visual path. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft and slightly cool, with scattered light evenly spreading over the streets in the morning or evening without strong shadows, but the building sides and ground show subtle contrasts of light and shadow. The overall tone is cool, mainly blue-gray. Warm white and brown accents adorn the figures' clothing, creating a tranquil, detached, and slightly melancholic urban poetry. The image texture is delicate, with slight film graininess and slightly overexposed highlight areas, as if captured with an old camera, presenting the authenticity and artistic atmosphere of everyday photography. The details are rich, from the texture of the clothing folds to the tiny cracks on the road, making the entire image full of storytelling, conveying the loneliness and composure of city dwellers walking alone between noise and tranquility",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
