        {
          "id": "krea2-83027ca40952dce055a399b5",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙城市坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a white floor indoors, leaning against white walls, wearing a black tight dress paired with a gray knit cardigan. The collar of the cardigan is tied in a bow, hands folded over the knees, fingers long, and her posture elegant and relaxed. She wears black stockings and black pointed high heels, with gold high-heeled sandals at her feet. The upper has black decorative straps. On the left side of the painting is a wooden frame with French decorative painting reading \"VOYAGE PLUS NUIT ET LE JOUR,\" next to the frame are white sockets and electrical wires On the right side is a white storage cabinet with stickers on the door. The overall environment is simple and bright, with white as the main color scheme, accented by gray accented with black clothing and gold shoes to create contrast. The composition uses medium shots, with the person positioned slightly to the right, body slightly tilted, and the light soft and evenly from the front left, creating a clean and fresh indoor atmosphere. The light and shadows are delicate and the shadows are soft, highlighting the character's outline and clothing texture. The background blur treatment makes the subject stand out even more, and the overall style combines everyday vibes with artistic flair. It feels like a photo taken with a professional camera under natural indoor light, offering strong visual guidance. The color layers are rich but not chaotic, details are clearly visible, presenting a quiet, private, and story-rich moment. The images are full of modern urban fashion and feminine charm, while retaining everyday scene elements such as wall sockets, electrical wires, and casually placed shoes to enhance realism, balance composition, natural postures, and smooth transitions of light and shadow, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. It evokes a serene beauty; the entire scene resembles a carefully crafted photographic work, combining artistic beauty with a genuine sense of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
