        {
          "id": "krea2-67356a7efd268480f4e0d933",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤沙发沉思坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the edge of a brown leather sofa, her body slightly leaned back, her expression somewhat lazy and contemplative. She wears a black spaghetti-strap tank top and a black short skirt, layered with a loose blue-gray camouflage shirt. The sleeves are casually rolled up to the elbows, presenting a casual yet refined mix-and-match style. Her legs are crossed, wearing black stockings, with her right leg naturally hanging down, left leg bent and raised, toes lightly touching the ground. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, her makeup exquisite, and her overall temperament is gentle and charming. In the foreground is the left armrest and part of the cushion of the sofa. The leather surface is smooth and reflects a faint sheen, showing the true texture of the material. The middle ground is the main subject, occupying the main position. Details such as the pleats of the shirt, the lines of the spaghetti straps, and the transparency of the stockings are clearly visible. The background is a simple white wall, with a potted green plant in the corner with broad, deep green leaves that add a touch of vitality to the scene. Next to it is a white plastic bucket, possibly for growing plants or daily storage. The floor is covered with a colorful Persian-style carpet. The patterns are complex, mainly red, blue, and beige, with traditional patterns and tassel decorations, enhancing the vintage atmosphere of the space. The floor is a light-colored wooden structure with clear texture, extending from the lower left corner into the depths of the frame. The composition adopts a slightly tilted perspective, with the figure positioned on the right side of the frame, creating an asymmetrical yet balanced visual effect. At the same time, the sofa's lines and leg postures form diagonal visual guides, enhancing the dynamic feel of the image. Light and shadow come from the left side of the image, with soft natural light filtering through windows or light sources. The shadowed areas are soft and not stiff, with slight projections on the background walls and floor, creating a warm and tranquil indoor atmosphere. The overall color palette leans warm, mainly brown, black, off-white, and green, accented with the carpet's vibrant colors, giving the image both layering and harmony. The atmosphere is relaxed and private, as if capturing a quiet moment of quiet afternoon solitude. The image presents a lifelike artistic beauty, as if shot with a professional camera paired with soft light. Or using a high-definition phone to casually capture real scenes under natural light, which have a strong sense of everyday life and warmth, while preserving enough detail and texture to provide a serene aesthetic experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
