        {
          "id": "krea2-bde4ca7e8a398fb074c04732",
          "alias": "单女白T恤俏皮出神",
          "prompt": "She wears a white lace hollow-out camisole top with light blue ruffle decorations on the shoulder straps. The material is light and breathable, exuding a refreshing summer vibe. Her hands gently hold a hand-carved wooden bowl, with clear grain patterns showing varying shades of brown wood grain. The bowl holds fresh and plump fruits, including a red and yellow apple with smooth and delicate skin and a natural sheen on the surface Next to it is a cluster of emerald green grapes, each round and plump, and another orange citrus fruit with bright and enticing colors. The overall composition centers on the figure, using close-up shots that occupy the main part of the frame, revealing neat, white, and neat teeth, as if gazing into the distance or immersed in beautiful thoughts. The background features a blurred blue roof and light gray walls, creating a soft blur effect that highlights the foreground subject. Light comes from above, with sunlight filtering through the leaves and falling on the figure, creating mottled light and shadow. Shadows transition smoothly, with an overall warm and bright color palette dominated by white, blue, green, and orange-red. The harmonious and fresh color combinations create a relaxed, lively, and lively atmosphere. The image has a film-like texture, with slight graininess and vintage tones. The edges are slightly overexposed to enhance transparency under summer sunlight. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered and the fruit bowl above serving as the visual focal point, guiding the gaze upward and forming a smooth visual flow. The overall image conveys a sense of innocence and naturalness The hopeful aesthetics of life seem to capture the most beautiful moments of a summer afternoon, allowing people to feel the vitality of youth and the sweetness of life.",
