        {
          "id": "krea2-e62eb356519dc958b485e25e",
          "alias": "单女粉外套摄影棚俏皮站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a half-sided position, her body slightly leaning back, her head turned toward the camera, giving off a slight airy touch and adding a touch of casual charm. She wears a fluffy, soft light pink long-plush jacket with a thick and layered texture. The fur is fine and curly, presenting a natural three-dimensional texture. The jacket covers the shoulders and back, with slightly flared edges forming soft silhouettes. Underneath, she wears a matching pale pink high-waisted knit jumpsuit. The fine material fits the figure and showcases smooth curves. Her right leg is slightly bent and raised, with her knee facing the camera. Her leg lines are long and balanced, with soft lighting outlining the curve of her legs. The overall composition uses medium shots, with the figure occupying most of the frame, positioned slightly to the left center. The background is a pure light gray wall with even tones and no cluttered details, creating a clean and simple visual environment. On the left side of the frame is vertical Japanese text, with fine and clear font that harmonizes with the overall style. The photography uses professional studio lighting, with the main light source coming from the front right, providing soft and even lighting Shadow transitions are natural, while subtle shadows are formed on the sides and behind the body, enhancing the sense of depth. The direction of light and shadow is consistent, avoiding harsh contrasts. The atmosphere is quiet and private, with a touch of lazy and playful everyday life. The overall color scheme is mainly soft pink-gray, harmoniously unified to create a warm and comfortable visual feel. The images have a strong sense of fashion and artistic flair, as if high-quality portraits were shot with a high-end camera in a studio, yet retain the sense of capturing everyday moments. The composition is balanced and full of tension, with rich details; from the plush texture to the skin's sheen, the gloss is clearly visible, presenting an overall refined and authentic aesthetic effect",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
