        {
          "id": "krea2-f858edc75cc1e0a30df49592",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道忧伤站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a gray cement wall at a city street corner. She wears a loose white vertical striped shirt-style dress with white camisoles underneath, a textured, plush white long dress, simple white sneakers, and a light beige woven straw hat. Her right hand gently supports an orange-black warning post, while her left hand hangs naturally, her posture relaxed and elegant, her expression tinged with contemplation and detachment. The overall design is fresh, artistic, and carries a touch of Japanese street style. In the foreground are herself and the orange-black striped warning post beside her, the red circular no-entry sign on the right, and a white traffic sign below with the words \"excluding decorative characterを\" (excluding decorative characterを」). The warning post is marked with Japanese signs such as \"Caution.\" The background is dense dark green ivy covering the entire wall, with layers of leaves and dappled light and shadow, forming a dense green barrier. The wall surface is rough, bearing signs of age and slight stains, while the ground is a gray asphalt pavement. The edges are covered with concrete curbstones, and the sidewalk features drainage gutter grilles and a circular manhole cover. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait with the figure centered slightly to the left, maintaining a stable visual focus. Warning posts and traffic signs form a symmetrical frame structure that guides the focus on the subject, while color contrast enhances visual impact. The orange and black warning posts, red no-road signs and green vines, and white clothing and gray walls create strong color contrasts, creating a fusion of natural vitality and cultural atmosphere in the city. The lighting is soft natural light from above, with natural shadow transitions without obvious hard shadows. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of life, presenting a realistic feel of everyday street photography. It feels like a casual moment captured by a regular camera in the afternoon sunlight. The tone is slightly cool, retaining the graininess of film texture and slight dark noise. The background blur is finely handled, making the main subject stand out. The layers of vines and walls are distinct, and distant streets are blurred, enhancing spatial depth. The overall image is filled with tranquil urban poetry It combines the order of a modern city with the wild beauty of natural growth, conveying a quiet, gentle, and slightly melancholic youthful mood",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
