        {
          "id": "krea2-a27a6763fc637ff3ac68eb11",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙户外俏皮站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by a white railing outdoors, exuding a natural and relaxed aura. She wears a pink strap dress with white abstract patterns. The dress features a V-neck, with a row of buttons at the chest. The waist is strained and tied with a thin belt. The skirt is A-shaped, with ruffled pleats at the hem, appearing light and elegant. Her right hand rests naturally on the white railing, while her left hand gently rests near the hem, her posture relaxed and her arms smooth. She wears a pair of simple gold round earrings. Adding a touch of fashion, the foreground features the main subject occupying the center slightly left, with a medium-shot portrait shot. The figure is fully presented from above the waist to below the knees. The background features rolling hills covered with dense green vegetation. In the distance, low shrubs and trees can be seen, with clear layers. The sky is partially obscured, and the overall color scheme is natural green and earthy yellow. The light is soft and warm, like afternoon sunlight, creating a peaceful and cozy atmosphere. The overall color scheme is harmonious and unified. The pink tones complement natural greenery for a playful look, and the background blur makes the subject stand out while preserving the realism of the environment. The image has the texture of everyday amateur equipment, as if captured with a smartphone or portable camera. Details are realistic, noise is minimal, colors are naturally reproduced, and overall it presents a lifestyle, authentic, and artistically beautiful. It is suitable for fashion outfit displays or travel photo shoots. The composition is balanced, with a slightly top-down perspective enhancing spatial depth. The white architectural structure in the background has clear edges. The contrast with the figure enhances the subject's presence. The direction of light and shadow comes from the upper right, making the right side of the figure brighter and the left side slightly shadowed, giving a strong sense of three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is warm and comfortable, full of summer vibes, and the image conveys a relaxed and comfortable attitude toward enjoying the present moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
