        {
          "id": "krea2-9641b04be5223395f446954e",
          "alias": "单女白短裙城市冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands before a gray concrete wall of a modern urban building. She wears a loose white short top and a white ruffled mini skirt, paired with a black thin-strap bra and a black sports hat. Her posture is confident and relaxed, with her right hand gently raised to her chest, her left hand naturally lowered, her body slightly turned to the side, showcasing a smooth waistline and long legs. The overall look blends street fashion with sexy elements, creating a strong visual contrast. The foreground is the main subject, occupying the left central position of the composition, with a low-angle downward shot. Highlighting the tall figures and aura of the figures, the center features a rough-textured gray concrete wall with fine textures and mottled marks. Above is a glass curtain wall divided by a metal frame, reflecting blurred images of the surrounding environment and creating geometric cuts and spatial layering. The background is a dark gray-toned building facade, simple yet industrial-rich. The cold and hard texture of glass and concrete contrasts sharply with the figures' soft clothing, enhancing the tension of the composition. Light comes from a slanting top, soft and natural, creating a uniform shadow transition The clothing features rich fold details and clear light and shadow direction. Projected from the upper right, it creates delicate contrasts of light and shadow on the wall and the figure. The atmosphere is calm and cool, with black, white, and gray as the main color scheme, accented with black accents. Overall, it presents a cool, restrained yet distinctive urban aesthetic. The lens uses an 85mm portrait focal length, simulating professional camera shooting effects. The image quality is delicate, colors are realistic, and the slight graininess adds a retro film feel. The composition emphasizes the golden ratio and use of blank space, with the subject's gaze slightly lowered. The overall visuals have a strong sense of artistry and fashion, while retaining the realism of everyday shooting, as if captured by chance on the street, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
