        {
          "id": "krea2-2903156a8e772bd951e0486e",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙户外冷淡站立交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors at dusk or dawn, slightly turning to look back at the camera, arms crossed over her chest. Her posture reveals a complex mix of vulnerability and self-protection, appearing especially cool under cool-toned lighting. She wears a black leather strapless dress with glossy texture and detailed textures. The shoulders and waist are designed to fit the figure, with a tie decoration on the back. The overall look is modern and dark in style, with the foreground as the main figure, occupying the main position in the frame. The composition uses a medium perspective. The figure appears above the waist, with the body slightly tilted and the head turned backward, forming a dynamic visual guiding line. The background is a gradient blue-purple sky, with thin clouds presenting a soft transition characteristic of dusk or dawn. In the distance, blurred mountain outlines and some vegetation silhouettes can be faintly seen. On the right edge, some trees and leaves appear in the frame, adding depth and realism to the composition. Light comes from the side and rear, either backlighting or side backlighting, outlining the figure's outline in a faint halo. The contrast between light and shadow is strong but not excessive, creating a mysterious, calm, and artistic atmosphere. The overall color tone is dominated by cool blue, with moderate color saturation and a slight film texture and graininess, as if shot with a professional camera in low-light conditions. It simulates noise and delicate light transitions at high ISO, with a strong cinematic and fashionable photography style. The composition uses asymmetrical balance, with the subject positioned slightly on the left side of the frame, leaving space on the right for background elements to enhance visual tension. The background is moderately blurred to highlight the subject. The overall composition conveys a sense of loneliness, contemplation, and introspection, combining modern aesthetics with emotional depth, like a carefully crafted artistic portrait full of narrative and psychological suggestion",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
