        {
          "id": "krea2-d053a8b7b3a787df2d4748a0",
          "alias": "单女桌边愤怒坐阅读",
          "prompt": "In the dim warm light, a woman sits quietly in a narrow space piled high with books. She wears a loose white asymmetrical top, soft and naturally wrinkled, with slightly rolled cuffs revealing slender wrists. Her fingers gently grasp an English book with a deep red cover. The title \"lovemarks\" is clearly visible, the handwriting elegant and modern, the edges slightly yellowed, revealing traces of being flipped through. Gazing at the pages, her expression focused and calm, as if immersed in a world constructed by words. It presents a reserved and thoughtful state, creating a warm and intimate atmosphere. Around it are towering wooden bookshelves, piled with all kinds of books—some neatly arranged, some stacked carelessly. Most of the text on the spines is in Chinese. Some book covers are blurry but can still be recognized with words like \"The Soul of the Scholar and the Business Talent\" and \"Classics of Chinese Studies.\" The book colors are mainly off-white, light yellow, and dark brown, with rich layers. The edges of the pages are slightly curled due to age, and some spines are worn, showing signs of long-term use and reading. Light passes through the bookshelves, forming golden beams that illuminate the dust floating in the air, creating a dreamlike visual effect. The bookshelf in the background gradually blurs, creating a blurred depth of field that makes the main figure stand out more. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame. The slightly tilted posture adds a sense of dynamism, with the gaze directed toward the lower left, guiding viewers to focus on the book in her hands. The vertical lines of the bookshelf and the horizontal arrangement of the books form an interlaced geometric structure. It enhances the sense of order and rhythm in the composition. The light source comes from the upper left side of the image, simulating the warm yellow glow of an old desk lamp or wall lamp. The light is soft and directional, shining from the upper left, while the right side and background cast deep shadows, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and spatial depth. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and nostalgic, carrying a sense of quiet solitude and a sense of profound knowledge. The tones are mainly amber, golden, and dark brown, complemented by the highlights of white clothing for contrast. The color saturation is moderate and not glaring. It creates a grainy texture reminiscent of film photography and a retro filter effect, with rich details that enhance realism and immersion. The overall style blends artistic, retro, and everyday life elements, like a private moment captured by an amateur camera, with strong narrative and emotional resonance, conveying a love for reading, reverence for knowledge, and a desire to find inner peace in a noisy world.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
