        {
          "id": "krea2-3a74ed531139f4ea7b800053",
          "alias": "单女T恤广场俏皮站立侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a colorful short-sleeved T-shirt on top. Blue, yellow, red, and purple stripes intertwine into a wavy pattern, full of vitality and modernity. She pairs it with black high-waisted shorts, showing long leg lines. On her feet are thick black plush sandals, with a unique transparent square heel design. The upper is covered with dense black feathers, giving it a stylish yet playful look. In her left hand, she carries a glossy black handbag, with metal fasteners and chain details. The overall look blends street trends with personalized fashion elements, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame. The body forms an S-shaped curve, with the head slightly tilted, creating a sense of dynamic balance. The background is a pure white gradient, transitioning from light gray to pure white from bottom to top, creating a clean and bright visual space. The foreground shows the lower body and feet, clearly showing details of shoes and legs. The middle ground is the main subject, while the background is completely blurred into a single tone to highlight the subject. The composition uses a vertical format, with the characters occupying most of the space. Low-angle shooting enhances visual impact, making the characters appear more upright and commanding. The light comes from the upper front, with light and natural shadows without strong contrast. The overall atmosphere is clean and fresh, with a modern urban fashion vibe, while retaining a sense of casualness and authenticity in daily life. The lighting is delicate, the color saturation is moderate, presenting a carefully lit studio shot effect yet retaining the sense of everyday life. It feels like a fashionable portrait shot in a minimalist studio with professional equipment. The overall image conveys youthfulness, confidence, independence, and expressive individuality, with rich details and clear layering. It has strong visual appeal and artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
