        {
          "id": "krea2-c46ffb517286523984781abb",
          "alias": "单女白T恤室内忧伤注视",
          "prompt": "The lines of her arms are smooth and soft, showing natural physiological curves and subtle muscle texture. Her overall expression is complex and restrained, wearing a simple white short-sleeved T-shirt. The fabric is thin and hugged to the body, with natural pleats at the shoulders and cuffs, and a blurred, light-colored background background. The gaps between the floor tiles are clearly visible, forming regular geometric lines that guide the gaze toward the center of the frame. The foreground features the upper body and arms of the character, while the background is an extended floor. The composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space. Light and shadow come from the upper side, soft natural light shines from the upper left, while subtle shadow transitions appear on the other side, creating a sense of depth and dimension. The light is warm and yellowish, with the unique warm tones of film photography, simulating sunset or indoor soft lighting, creating a quiet overall atmosphere Lonely, calm, and full of emotional tension, the tones are mainly off-white, light gray, and warm yellow. The color saturation is low, presenting a vintage film texture. The edges of the frame have slight graininess and vignetting, enhancing the texture of the authentic shot. It feels like capturing moments with an old-fashioned camera in natural light, offering strong narrative and emotional resonance. The composition is compact, with minimal blank space, emphasizing the characters' inner worlds. Visual guidance is formed by arm lines and the direction of the gaze, making the entire frame full of storytelling, like a still frame in a movie capturing moments of youth, confusion, and self-reflection, presenting an aesthetic that is both everyday and surreal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
