        {
          "id": "krea2-6ff89c87bf7a54d8574587dc",
          "alias": "单女透视棕外套舞台神秘倚靠持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a heavy, fluffy brown-yellow faux fur coat with a delicate and distinct plush texture, rich layers, and naturally draped edges, creating soft folds and shadows. Underneath, she wears a leopard print tight dress that perfectly echoes the same leopard-print sheer stockings and pointed high heels. The overall look is full of luxury and wildness, with a medium close-up shot, with the figure taking center stage. The head is slightly tilted to the left, body weight leans backward, right leg bent forward, left leg supports the ground, forming a stable triangular structure that creates smooth visual flow. Light and shadow come from the upper left side, soft natural light evenly illuminates the subject, while the right side forms a slight shadow to enhance three-dimensionality. The background is pure and unobtrusive, highlighting the character's silhouette and clothing details. The main colors are warm brown, off-white, and leopard print black-brown, creating a warm and sophisticated atmosphere. The overall style combines the sophistication of a fashion shoot with the natural spontaneity of everyday shooting. It's as if a professional camera paired with a softbox is capturing moments in the studio, presenting an elegant, sexy, and slightly mysterious aura. The image texture is delicate, details are clear, and the tone is slightly warm. It carries the graininess of film photography and a retro filter effect, as if time has frozen in this frame, revealing the complexity and tension of the characters' inner worlds. The composition is simple yet layered, the foreground highlights the main subject, the middle shots showcase clothing and posture, the background is clean and crisp, the sense of space is distinct, and the overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of storytelling. Like a freeze-frame shot in a movie, it inevitably makes people wonder about her current state of mind and past.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
