        {
          "id": "krea2-1b2d35d028f4bacd6f42f904",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙厨房媚态坐持花",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a black high stool in the kitchen, presenting a natural wavy texture. Her body slightly turns to the side, her right hand lightly resting on the edge of the kitchen counter. Her fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed, her posture relaxed yet elegant. She wears a light pink long-sleeve satin dress with a V-neck design and a very low neckline that highlights her full bust. The waist is tied with a matching satin ribbon, tied into a delicate bow, with the hem reaching the middle of her thigh. As she sat up, her black stockings were revealed. The silk was smooth and clingy to her skin, outlining the graceful lines of her legs. From knee to ankle, there was a noticeable shadow transition, adding dimension. Her legs were crossed and stacked, with her right leg pressing over her left, creating a posture that was both open and subtle. In the foreground was the kitchen counter and some appliances. On the counter sat a green wine bottle with a white label and a pink cap. Beside it were two silver candlesticks, each holding two lit white candles. The flames flicker, emitting a warm orange-yellow glow that illuminates the surrounding area and creates a soft reflection, creating a cozy and romantic atmosphere. Next to the candlestick is a small bouquet of pink roses, the flowers vibrant and delicate, with layers of petals layered in layers. Next to it is a black flowerpot filled with greenery. The background is a light beige wall, decorated with several pink rose pattern stickers. The flowers are lifelike in shape, with branches and leaves spreading out, echoing the roses in real life. On the left, you can see some black cabinets and a built-in oven, with a black oven panel. With a digital display and knob, the overall tone is calm and contrasts with the pink theme. On the right side are windows or glass doors, which let in blurred external light but are blocked by curtains, creating a soft light and shadow effect. The entire scene is centered on the character, shot from a slightly overhead angle to highlight her figure and clothing details. The light mainly comes from the warm light of candles and ambient light, with the light source concentrated on the front and left side of the figure, creating a contrast of light and shadow and making the character's outline clear. The overall atmosphere blends privacy, romance, and sensuality. It feels like a carefully arranged night date scene, with a strong sense of artistry and a sense of everyday life. The image style is realistic and delicate, with moderate color saturation, emphasizing texture and layering of light and shadow. It's like shooting with a professional camera in low-light environments, using a large-aperture lens to capture depth of field. The image is highly clear and detailed, showcasing a subtle elegance and allure in everyday life. The sense of realism is strong, as if you can sense the faint aroma of wine and flowers in the air, along with a subtle sense of ambiguity.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
