        {
          "id": "krea2-740215c9a346941717bf60b1",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙酒廊困倦躺侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a bright red strapless long dress, elegantly reclining on the dark gray striped cushion of an outdoor lounge sofa. Her body was naturally relaxed in an S-shaped curve, her head slightly tilted back, her left hand naturally resting at her side, wearing a gold bracelet and a thin chain bracelet on her wrist, her fingers painted with light-colored nail polish. Her posture was lazy yet full of tension, her expression slightly dreamy and contemplative, as if enjoying a peaceful moment under the sunlight. Beside her sat a tall, transparent glass cup filled with clear liquid, with its rim reflecting soft light. The overall composition uses a low-angle shot, extending from the lower left to the upper right. The figure occupies two-thirds of the left side of the frame, forming the visual focal point. The background is a modern-style outdoor terrace, composed of gray concrete steps, wooden grille railings, and metal structures. In the distance, orange decorative walls and dark vertical blinds can be seen, creating a strong light and shadow effect. Sunlight slants from the upper right, casting clear shadows on the ground and surfaces, creating a contrast of light and shadow. Warm yellow light shines on the figures, highlighting the texture and luster of the red long dress. It creates a warm and intimate atmosphere. The lens uses an 85mm prime portrait lens with precise depth control, clear foreground highlighting character details, and a moderately blurred background to enhance spatial layering. The main colors are red, gray, and brown. The red long dress becomes the visual focal point, forming a strong contrast with the cool background. The overall image is full of sophistication and fashion, presenting a tranquil moment in urban life, like a slow-motion close-up in a microfilm, capturing fleeting beauty and emotion, with strong visual guidance. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, the details rich, and the overall image presents a realistic and refined everyday photographic feel, as if captured casually with a professional camera under the afternoon sun. This not only preserves the aesthetic pursuit of artistic creation but also retains the authenticity and intimacy of life",
