        {
          "id": "krea2-bcd5beb981dd75791f7bf7e4",
          "alias": "单女白连帽衫桥忧伤倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A girl wearing a white hoodie and plaid skirt stood on the sidewalk under the bridge, her expression slightly melancholic and contemplative. In her left hand, she held a beige teddy bear plushie, its head slightly tilted to one side, looking somewhat clumsy yet cute. The girl carried a black backpack, white long socks, and black leather shoes, presenting a typical Japanese student style. She stood on a concrete path made of stone slabs, with some wear and mottled marks on the surface. Sunlight slanted down from the gap in the bridge above, casting long strip-like shadows on the ground, creating a contrasting effect of light and shadow. In the foreground is a girl and the teddy bear she holds in her arms, centered to the left, forming a visual focal point. The middle is a narrow path extending into the distance, with metal railings by the roadside. The railings are dark brown with a slightly rusted surface, showing signs of time. On both sides of the path are low concrete retaining walls, rough surfaces, with some areas covered in green vines and moss, adding a touch of natural wildness. In the background is a distant Japanese-style residential area, with several white two-story buildings arranged in an orderly fashion. The roofs are covered with gray tiles, windows of varying sizes, some open, some closed. Surrounding the area are some trees and shrubs. One tree has a bare trunk with branches stretching upward, giving it a unique shape. The sky appears a faint blue, the clouds are thin, and the light is soft and warm. The overall color scheme mainly features a contrast of warm and cool tones. The shadowed area under the bridge is cooler, showing a gray-blue hue, while the sunlit area is warm and bright, with a golden sheen. The direction of light and shadow is clear, coming from the upper right. The strong side backlight makes the character outlines clear, while the ground and walls cast a distinct projection. The composition uses a third-division method: the subject is positioned at the left one-third, while the right side leaves space to guide the gaze into the distance, creating a lonely, tranquil, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, with graininess and slight color shifts typical of film photography, simulating the effect of everyday amateur camera shooting. The lens focal length is about 35mm, with a shallow depth of field and a slightly blurred background. Highlighting the main characters, the overall atmosphere is quiet, restrained, and full of storytelling, as if capturing an ordinary yet moving moment. Like a movie shot, it feels realistic and emotionally rich. The color tone leans toward retro, saturation is moderate, contrast is gentle, details are rich, and layers are distinct. It combines the coldness of a modern city with the warmth of everyday life, creating a hazy beauty between reality and memory",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
