          "id": "krea2-af869b06cf4eb8f2e1f59414",
          "alias": "单女白T恤沉思站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways with her back to the camera, slightly lowered and gazing downward. Her right shoulder and back are exposed, wearing an off-white lace camisole with fine lace patterns clearly visible. The straps are slender, with several small tattoos on her back, and handwritten text tattoos on her arms. Her overall posture is lazy and relaxed, as if quietly contemplating or waiting for something. The main figure is positioned slightly to the left of the middle frame, her body slightly tilted, head slightly tilted back, forming a soft curve. The background is a dim, blurred indoor environment. The walls are mottled and rough, bearing traces of time. Above is a wooden ceiling structure with interlaced beams. In the corner, a warm yellow fluorescent tube hangs down, with light slanting down from the upper right, creating a warm orange-yellow tone. The entire space is enveloped in vintage film-like light and shadow. The light source comes from the fluorescent lamp on the right, soft yet clearly oriented, forming delicate outline light. The shadows fall on the left body and the background wall, enhancing the sense of depth. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the main position. The viewing angle is slightly lower than that of head-on, creating an intimate and intimate atmosphere. The contrast in light and shadow of light highlights body lines and clothing details. The main colors are warm yellow, brown, and off-white, with cool tones like deep gray and black as accents, creating a strong temperature contrast. Overall, it presents a nostalgic film photography style, with slight graininess and fading effects, as if frozen in a moment with an old-fashioned camera. The images are full of storytelling and emotional tension, like a tranquil portrait recording youthful confusion and inner monologue. There are no signs of deliberate staging; instead, it feels like a real moment captured unintentionally in daily life. The light and shadow transitions are natural, the layers rich, and the atmosphere is strong. It combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life, like a slow-motion clip in a movie, allowing viewers to feel the pause of time and the fluctuations of inner emotions",
