        {
          "id": "krea2-ed43ebefa1c150ac1002fb10",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣森林忧伤持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a thick gray sweater wrapped in a fluffy, soft white lambswool scarf over it. The edges of the scarf curl slightly, giving a warm and delicate texture with a hint of melancholy and contemplation, presenting a natural pink hue with a slight blush, as if just returning from cold air. The background is a blurry snowy landscape, the dark outline of a forest faintly visible, the sky gray and hazy, and snowflakes drifting slowly down from the air. It creates a tranquil and romantic winter atmosphere. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the image, heads slightly tilted, creating direct visual contact with the viewer. The background blur is handled very softly, highlighting the clarity and three-dimensionality of the subject. Light comes from the front slightly above, creating natural shadow transitions that enhance the realism of the materials. The overall color palette is mainly cool white and gray-blue, which then diffuses into the surrounding falling snowflakes and blurred background, creating an immersive sense of tranquility. The lighting atmosphere is both realistic and poetic, as if capturing an eternal moment, with a slight film graininess and natural underexposure effect, simulating the texture of everyday amateur camera shooting. The overall style combines artistic beauty with a sense of life, like a precious winter memory photo",
