        {
          "id": "krea2-089418652c95892ef7f45a3d",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣椅上害羞坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a warm wooden floor, wearing a light blue loose knit sweater and white lace-trimmed shorts, white hollow-out knee-high socks, hands naturally resting on her knees. Her posture is relaxed yet slightly shy, revealing an expression of innocence and a hint of contemplation. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the composition, presenting a close-up effect. In the foreground, several everyday items are scattered, including a book with the cover printed with \"Candles.\" A white notebook with the characters, a red bottle of a drink with cartoon designs, a few colorful candies, and a small green toy—these items are placed casually, enhancing the realism and everyday atmosphere of the scene. The center is the area where women sit, while the background is a cozy indoor environment. Behind is a rattan sofa covered with white embroidered cushions and gray plaid blankets, and beside it is a rattan chair. The entire space is mainly in warm yellow tones, creating a soft and comfortable home atmosphere. Light streams in from the left side of the frame. Natural side lighting is created, while soft shadows are cast on the floor and furniture. The transitions are delicate and the contrast between light and dark is moderate. The overall visual guide gradually leads from small objects in the foreground to the main subject, then extends to the home environment in the background, forming a distinctly layered spatial structure. The composition uses low-angle shots to bring the subject closer and enhances intimacy and immersion. The main color palette is light blue, white, and wood, accented with a touch of red and green. The colors are harmonious and unified, full of youthful energy, and the overall atmosphere is quiet Warm and healing, as if capturing a peaceful moment when afternoon sunlight fills the room, like everyday moments taken with a regular home camera or phone—authentic and natural, without excessive embellishment, yet full of the warmth and pure charm of life, with strong visual appeal and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
