        {
          "id": "krea2-f2b0a6521931e17e478367aa",
          "alias": "单女T恤公寓自信倚靠拥抱",
          "prompt": "Her overall makeup is clean and sharp yet sexy. She wears a black sleeveless, fitted sports tank top, with fabric that hugs her body and outlines a graceful upper body curve. The back is designed with cross-strap styles, and the waist is naturally cinched. She pairs it with high-waisted black denim shorts. The fit flatters the hips, with metal buttons and stitching details in the back pocket. A black leather belt is tied around the waist, with the pant legs just the length covering the upper thighs, revealing long legs. At the ankles, black over-the-knee socks are worn. Her sock cuffs are neat, her leg lines smooth and graceful, her body slightly leaning forward. Her right hand gently strokes the elbow of her left arm, while her left hand hangs naturally at her side. Her posture is relaxed and confident. Her body silhouette shows a soft transition of light and shadow under the light, with rich layers of light and shadow. The background is a minimalist, modern interior space. The lower half of the wall is paved with horizontal tiles alternating beige and light gray, with fine and even textures. The upper half is pure white, with a smooth and flat surface. Sunlight streams in diagonally from the window on the right side, casting clear geometric shadows on the wall, creating a visual effect of alternating light and shadow. The composition uses a mid-angle portrait shot, with the person positioned slightly to the right of the frame, occupying most of the main subject's space. The angle is slightly lower than that of the head-on, highlighting the figure's proportions and dynamic beauty. The camera focuses on the entire person's body, with moderate background blur to create a sense of depth. The foreground is unobstructed by obvious objects, extending into the light and shadow structure in the background. The overall atmosphere is bright and fresh with a touch of privacy. The light comes from the natural light source on the right, soft and directional, creating a warm golden tone. Shadow edges are clear but not stiff, with colors dominated by black, white, and beige, creating harmonious and unified tones with a realistic texture, as if shooting with a professional camera during the day. Using a large-aperture lens to capture delicate details, the image presents a casual fashion moment from daily life, possessing strong visual appeal and artistic appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
