        {
          "id": "krea2-3f61e50e2089cb5058738166",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤庭院害羞站立",
          "prompt": "A woman is presented in a medium shot, standing outdoors under natural light, her body slightly leaning forward, hands clasped in front of her, her posture relaxed and natural, showing a subtle cuteness and warmth in daily life. Under the soft sunlight, it glows warmly, appearing light and layered. She wears a loose black crew-neck T-shirt printed with three cat patterns and some English text. The design is simple yet playful, adding a touch of playfulness to the overall look. She pairs it with light blue washed jeans. The pants are straight and slightly loose, with legs hanging naturally, presenting a realistic feel for everyday wear. With a hint of a shy smile, it seems to be silently communicating with the viewer, creating a warm and intimate atmosphere. In the background is her body and some hand movements, in the background a green lawn and neatly trimmed bushes. In the distance, there is a white wall with a smooth and clean surface with fine textures and seams. In the corner, a small patch of exposed soil and withered grass roots is visible, adding realism to the scene. The overall composition adopts a slightly top-down angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving space on the right side to balance the visual effect, creating an asymmetrical yet harmonious layout. Light comes from the upper right, which belongs to natural daylight, with moderate brightness and no strong shadows. The transition between light and shadow is soft, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The lawn and shrubs in the background appear rich in green layers under the light, gradient from fresh green to deep green, with rich details and a relaxed, natural, and warm overall atmosphere. It feels like a snapshot of life taken on a sunny afternoon in a courtyard or park. The image has the texture of everyday amateur equipment, with slight graininess and low color saturation, simulating real camera effects. The tones are mainly black, white, blue, and green, with harmonious and unified color combinations, presenting a simple yet authentic aesthetic. The composition is compact but not crowded, the background is moderately blurred, highlighting the subject while preserving environmental information, making the image both focused and cohesive. The overall style leans toward a blend of everyday life, documentary, and youthful energy, conveying a simple yet beautiful everyday mood",
