        {
          "id": "krea2-7c660b54d51734b2d5e9c6fe",
          "alias": "单女白T恤室内困倦注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a simple pure white sleeveless tank top, tailored to accentuate her slender shoulders and collarbones. She pairs it with light khaki high-waisted shorts, loose and comfortable, giving the overall look a fresh and natural vibe full of youthful energy. Her left hand holds a white circular palette, dotted with a variety of vibrant pigments—bright red, warm yellow, fresh green, elegant pink and orange. The pigments are mottled and distributed, showing traces of the creative process. The edges of the palette are slightly rounded, the surface smooth, reflecting soft light. In the background, you can see a wooden easel with a simple structure, A-shaped, made of light-colored wood The surface retains the natural wood grain texture. Behind the easel is a bright window framed in white, letting in soft natural light and creating a large overexposure halo, creating a dreamy light and shadow effect. The light outside contrasts with the warm indoor tones, making the entire space appear transparent and bright. The composition uses close-up shots, with the figure occupying the main subject, appearing above the waist, with the body slightly tilted and the head turned to one side, forming an elegant S-shaped curve that draws the viewer's gaze beyond the frame. The foreground highlights figures and the palette, the middle features easels and parts of walls, while the background mainly features blurred windows and lighting, blending solid and void with clear layers. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft. The main light source comes from the window on the left, creating side lighting. The pigments on the palette display rich texture and saturation under the light. The overall color palette mainly features warm white, beige, and light khaki, paired with vibrant pigments in some areas, creating a warm and tranquil artistic atmosphere. The images have the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting. With slight noise and a soft depth of field effect, it simulates the imaging characteristics of camera lenses, offering rich details and realistic texture, presenting a lifelike, artistic, and poetic visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
