        {
          "id": "krea2-030c701fa0351f34852d4679",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙街道媚态交叠",
          "prompt": "She wore a black long-sleeved dress with a white Peter Pan collar, crossing her legs, with her right leg draped over her left, and black high heels made of gold metal. Her right hand gently stroked her right ankle, her posture elegant yet slightly provocative, her expression confident yet a bit mysterious. Her makeup was exquisite, blending vintage and modern elements. The main subject was positioned slightly to the right of the foreground, with a medium perspective where the figure occupied about two-thirds of the frame. The background was a luxurious indoor space, with a light brick textured wall on the right and a delicate texture, and a white fireplace on the left Above the fireplace hangs a circular Roman numeral clock, with a warm flame inside. On the fireplace countertop are glass decorative bottles and golden spherical ornaments. On both sides of the fireplace are crystal wall lamps that glow softly. A crystal chandelier hangs from the ceiling, emitting a bright warm glow. The floor is paved with beige marble tiles with clear and natural textures. The overall color scheme is mainly black, white, and gray, accented with gold and red, creating a luxurious and elegant atmosphere. Light and shadow from the right chandelier and fireplace flame create contrasts of light and shadow, highlighting the character's outline The background is slightly blurred, focusing on the subject. The composition is stable, giving it a cinematic and stylish cinematic feel, presenting an overall interior photography style that feels premium, refined, and alluring. It feels as if you were shooting in a high-end hotel lobby or private club, with slight film graininess and details like real camera images, simulating the shooting effects of professional equipment like the Canon EOS R5 or Sony A7R IV. It uses an 85mm prime lens with an f/1.8 aperture to create a shallow depth of field. The image has moderate color saturation, preserving realistic light and shadow layers to enhance three-dimensionality and atmosphere. It also adds slight noise and dynamic range control to mimic real camera performance in low-light environments, making the images both artistic and lifelike, presenting a private and elegant atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
