        {
          "id": "krea2-8da5417a95d6dd3dfc81ee5c",
          "alias": "单女蓝礼服城市愤怒坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a dark wooden bench, wearing a vibrant royal blue high-neck gown. The fabric features delicate subtle patterns, giving it a silky sheen. The wide sleeves drape naturally, the hem elegantly drapes over her legs, and a brown leather belt is tied around her waist, accentuating her slender waistline. The slight curl drapes over her shoulders, her makeup delicate and natural. Looking directly at the camera, her expression is calm and confident. Her left hand rests lightly on a black crocodile leather handbag, with a noticeable embossed texture on the surface. The edges are decorated with gold metal fasteners. Her body is slightly turned to the side, her head facing the camera, her posture relaxed and composed. The background is a dark gray horizontal wooden wall with fine gaps between the boards, creating a sense of regular lines. Light shines from the upper left side of the frame, creating a soft transition of light and shadow, while the left side creates natural shadows, highlighting contours and three-dimensionality. The overall light and shadow layers are rich, with tones dominated by cool blue and dark gray, creating a calm, sophisticated, and modern atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait. The figure occupies the center right of the frame, leaving space on the left to create visual balance. The horizontal lines of the background guide the viewer to focus on the subject. The handbag and hand details in the foreground enhance realism and the sense of life. The middle scene features the person's full body and part of their sitting posture, while the background is backed by a simple wall to highlight the character's image. The overall composition has a strong visual impact and a sense of fashion, while preserving the authentic texture of everyday life, as if shot under indoor lighting with a professional camera and a large-aperture lens. It presents clear details and natural depth of field, with moderate color saturation, strong but not glaring contrast, clean and crisp images, full of artistic flair and the elegant charm of urban women",
