        {
          "id": "krea2-12db31ca0684210123e00819",
          "alias": "单女毛衣屋顶忧伤坐手持物",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a low concrete wall at the edge of the roof, wearing a tawny wavy knit spaghetti strap long dress with a natural hem and a high slit design, revealing her long legs. Barefoot suspended in the air, right leg bent, left leg naturally hanging down, toes lightly tapping on the dark brown soft cushion below, body slightly leaned back, hands naturally resting on the wall, posture relaxed and elegant, slightly messy yet full of casual beauty, carrying a faint sense of detachment and contemplation, as if she was about to whisper or have just finished speaking, The overall temperament is both lazy and intellectual. The foreground features rough-textured concrete walls and dark soft cushions, with clear textures that show warm tones bathed in sunlight. The middle ground features the main figure, positioned slightly to the left of the center of the painting, forming a visual focal point. The background features rows of neatly arranged modern-style buildings, with gray metal panels on the facade featuring geometric cross-sections extending into the distance. In the distance, the undulating outlines of mountains appear as pale purple silhouettes in the dusk light, with the sky occupying most of the scene. From the light blue gradient above to the pink-orange clouds near the horizon, the clouds are fluffy and soft, dyed a warm golden pink by the sunset. Light comes from the upper right, with soft backlighting outlining the figure's outline and creating a subtle halo effect. The shadowed areas appear deep and layered. The overall composition uses a low-angle upward shot to enhance the figure's uprightness and spatial depth. The horizontal line divides the composition into upper and lower parts: the upper half is a vast sky and clouds, while the lower half is buildings and figures, creating an open and tranquil atmosphere. Returning to the changing colors in the sky, the lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm yet slightly melancholic. The unique soft light at dusk fills the scene with poetry and emotional tension. The visuals have a strong cinematic feel and storytelling, as if capturing a tranquil moment on the edge of a city. The overall color palette is dominated by warm yellow, ochre, and gray-blue, with harmonious and unified colors, rich details, and a realistic texture, as if shot with professional photography equipment, yet retaining the naturalness and spontaneity of daily life. It presents a unique aesthetic style that lies between artistic photography and life documentation",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
