        {
          "id": "krea2-aaf6da0e268b84dc89b5257e",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔商店微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a shop on a Japanese street, looking natural and lively. She leans slightly to the side, wears a sweet smile, her expression gentle and slightly playful, wearing a loose white off-shoulder ruffled top with thin straps and a large lapel collar. The sleeves are fluffy ruffled flared sleeves with rich layering, the hem has an irregular cut, paired with light blue denim shorts, revealing long legs. The overall look is fresh and sweet, full of summer vibes. Her posture is relaxed and natural, her body slightly tilted, and one hand hanging naturally. It feels as if you're enjoying the sunshine and breeze. In the foreground is the shop entrance sign and decorations. On the left stands a white sign with the Japanese word 'もつdecorative character' standing upright. Below is a menu board and price information. Next to it is a black metal heater or display cabinet with a grid texture, and a woven rattan ball decoration hanging nearby. The floor is covered with green mats, and on the right is the view extending the street. The road surface is gray asphalt, and in the distance, a row of low buildings can be seen, mostly wooden structures. The exterior walls are in soft colors, including orange, Off-white tones and other tones, with various Japanese-style signs and billboards hanging between buildings. Utility poles and wires crisscross, forming a typical Japanese street scene. The sky is pale blue, the sunlight is bright but not harsh, and light shines from the upper right, casting soft shadows on the figures. The contrast of light and shadow is natural. The overall composition uses a three-part method, with the figures positioned slightly to the left, leaving enough space to show the depth of the street. The gaze is guided from the foreground to the middle ground of the street and the surrounding buildings, creating a strong perspective effect. The visual guide line is formed by the postures of the characters, the direction of the street, and the arrangement of signs, creating a relaxed and pleasant atmosphere full of the everyday life atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly white, light blue, and gray-green, accented with warm-toned buildings and signs. The colors are harmonious and unified, presenting a realistic and natural street style like a handheld camera casually captured. The image has slight noise and a film texture, enhancing the documentary feel. The architectural details in the background are clearly visible, including windows, door curtains, clothes for drying clothes, and other everyday elements. This makes the scene more realistic and believable. Sunlight filters through gaps between buildings onto the streets, creating mottled light and shadow, adding layers and dynamic beauty to the image. The entire image conveys a youthful, free, and comfortable attitude toward life, as if capturing an ordinary yet beautiful afternoon",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
