        {
          "id": "krea2-e88376b2fc336f8250ffee1d",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙婚礼沉思站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways against a deep, dark background, wearing a light, flowing white spaghetti strap dress with delicate pleats and ruffled decorations at the hem. The material has a soft cotton-linen texture, shimmering with a warm luster in the dim light, adding a touch of laziness and gentleness. She lowers her head slightly, and inside the sphere radiates a soft and bright blue-white glow, like a miniature star or liquid crystal. Light shines through the sphere, creating a strong backlight effect, and her fingers are slender and slender. Her fingertips gently support the sphere, her posture elegant and full of ceremony, her expression calm and slightly contemplative, as if having a silent dialogue with this glowing planet. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right, her body forming an S-curve, her head slightly tilted, creating a dynamic sense of balance. In the foreground, she holds the glowing sphere with both hands, with clear details visible. Light overflows from the edge of the sphere, forming a bright halo. The middle is her upper body and shoulders. The wrinkles of the clothing and the texture of the fabric are clearly visible under the light, while the background is completely hidden in pure black, with no unnecessary elements. Only a blurry circular light spot can be seen on the right side, resembling a floating bubble or bokeh point in the distance, adding a touch of dreaminess to the composition. The composition uses an asymmetrical layout, using light and shadow contrast to enhance the subject's presence. The visual guide lines radiate from the strong light emitted from the sphere in all directions, while the curved movements of the hands form a soft, flowing line, enhancing the rhythm of the composition. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by cool blue tones, supplemented by warm white light in highlights, creating a contrast of warm and cool tones, creating a mysterious, tranquil, and slightly sci-fi atmosphere. Light shines from behind and above, producing distinct contour light and backlight effects, separating the subject from the background and highlighting three-dimensionality. The overall image has a film-like grainy texture and slight vignetting, simulating the realism of professional cameras shooting in low-light environments. Lenses chosen are wide-angle or standard prime lenses, with shallow depth of field and obvious background blur. The image is also scattered with tiny specks of dust, like particles floating in the air illuminated by light, enhancing the realism and spatial layers of the scene. The entire image presents an aesthetic style that blends surrealism with everyday poetry, combining a futuristic imagery with a sense of technology while retaining human warmth and everyday warmth. It feels like a moment accidentally captured late at night with amateur equipment, authentic and full of storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
