        {
          "id": "krea2-e6c3d089c763fdc43d1dd6ae",
          "alias": "单女蓝西装街道忧伤",
          "prompt": "She wears a deep blue or black blazer, with delicate fabric, smooth shoulder lines, slight pleats at the cuffs, and a soft glow reflecting on the surface. The overall look is simple yet elegant, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame, body slightly tilted, creating a dynamic sense of balance. The foreground area has a distinct halo effect. Orange-yellow circular light spots and striped beams extend from the upper left to the lower right, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow and visual impact. The halo edges are blurred and soft, presenting the unique bokeh texture of film photography. The background is a blurred green vegetation and trees, with rich leaf layers, colors transitioning naturally from dark green to light green. Some areas are filtered by sunlight, creating mottled light and shadow. The distant sky appears pale white or light gray, contrasting with the dark tones of the ground. The composition uses the classic three-part method. The main figure occupies the right third of the frame, leaving ample space on the left to accommodate light and background elements. The viewing angle is slightly lower than the head-on, capturing the figure's posture from the side to enhance the depth of the image. The focus is on the character's calm expression and immersion. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is mainly warm tones, with soft light from sunset or early morning shining from behind, creating a strong backlighting effect. The character's outline is clear and prominent, creating a warm, tranquil, and slightly melancholic poetic atmosphere. The overall image has the graininess and slight noise of film photography. The color saturation is moderate, with low contrast, presenting a retro and authentic texture. The image style blends features of Japanese gravure, art films, and street documentary photography, possessing strong emotional appeal and storytelling, as if freezing a moment of contemplation and release, full of vitality and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
