        {
          "id": "krea2-2d2899dad597873bd0ee7859",
          "alias": "单女黑网袜城市冷淡倚靠过肩",
          "prompt": "A female model wore a black high-slit fishnet patchwork long dress, elegantly leaning against a white SUV that naturally cascaded over her shoulders. Her makeup was exquisite, with her left hand lightly resting on the car door and her right hand naturally hanging down. She wore pink pointed high heels decorated with metal studs on the upper. The overall look was fashionable and modern. Her posture was relaxed and composed, her body slightly turned to the side, revealing graceful curves. In the foreground, the white car body was smooth as a mirror, reflecting the light and shadow of the surrounding environment, with the window edges clearly visible. The door handles and rearview mirrors are well-detailed, the wheels are covered by scattered colored paper scraps on the ground, and the background is a blurry exhibition site. The purple geometric booth structure and blue lighting installations can be faintly seen, creating an atmosphere that blends technology and futurism. In the distance, there are other vehicle silhouettes and crowd shadows, but the focus is on the figure and the main car. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the right in the center of the image, and the car extending from left to right, forming a strong visual guiding line. The shallow depth of field effect highlights the main subject. The background blur enhances spatial layering, with light coming from above and in front, creating bright reflections on the car body and natural shadow transitions. Colorful confetti scattered on the ground adds a festive atmosphere to the scene. The colors are mainly black and white, accented with pink, purple, and blue, creating a warm and cool contrast. The overall atmosphere is both professional and refreshingly lived, as if captured with a professional camera at a car show. The image texture is delicate and detailed, offering strong visual impact and artistic expression. presenting a unique style that blends urban fashion with technological aesthetics",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
