        {
          "id": "krea2-2bafd4029f5e71409c0384b7",
          "alias": "单女黑毛衣厨房坐舔咬",
          "prompt": "A woman sits cross-legged on a wooden kitchen counter, leaning slightly forward, holding an orange ice cream cone, gently licking melted ice cream with her head down, showing a sense of enjoyment and satisfaction. She wears a loose black-and-white striped knit sweater with white cutout sleeves, pink horizontal stripes on the shoulders, a black top underneath, black stockings on the bottom, and fine ankle ribbons. The overall look is casual yet stylish, adding a touch of softness and casualness. The background is a simple white vertical tiled wall, with a metal towel rack and a wooden shelf hanging on it. On the shelf is a glass jar. On the left side are a white sink and silver faucet, with several seasoning bottles and a green vintage alarm clock placed nearby. On the right counter is a yellow woven basket containing items. On the wall are several hand-drawn recipes or sticky notes. The lighting throughout the scene is soft and bright, with natural light from the left front evenly illuminating the figures and environment, creating a warm and peaceful home atmosphere. The composition uses a medium shot perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the center, forming the visual focal point. The foreground features a clear countertop and the character's legs. The middle shot shows the main subject holding an ice cream in motion, while the background includes kitchen details with distinct layers. The colors are mainly white, wood, black, and pink, with fresh and natural tones, delicate light and shadow transitions, and soft shadows. This highlights the subject while preserving the true texture of the environment. The image conveys the warmth and authenticity of daily life, as if captured by accident, a private moment. It features a slight film texture and low-contrast color grading, presenting a rustic yet lifelike artistic style. The lens simulates the effects of home cameras or mobile phones, with slight noise and natural depth blur, making the images more realistic and immersive. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and comfortable, full of healing everyday beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
