        {
          "id": "krea2-187b301104292f29ca2bf05f",
          "alias": "单女绿T恤桌边专注坐书写",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden swing, her body slightly leaning forward, her head focused on writing in her notebook. She wears a loose olive green V-neck short-sleeve T-shirt and dark gray shorts, sitting cross-legged barefoot, holding a purple pen in her right hand and gently pressing the edge of the notebook with her left, her posture naturally relaxed, showing a state of deep reflection and record-keeping, exuding a reserved and serene temperament. In the foreground is the wooden swing she sits, suspended by a thick black iron chain, with the wooden board surface marked by the weather, and fine scratches The edges are slightly worn, showing a warm reddish-brown tone. Below the swing is a wooden railing decorated with carved patterns, and next to it is an old-fashioned wooden table. The tabletop is smooth but shows signs of use, with legs clearly visible. In the background is a traditional-style wooden house with walls made of dark brown wood. The window frames are simple, and the glass reflects outdoor light. Under the eaves, there are finely carved decorative lines. In the distance, lush tropical vegetation and rich layers of green leaves shine through the gaps in the leaves. Dappled light and shadow are created on the ground and figures. The overall composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame, occupying the visual center. The left side leaves space to display environmental details and creates a sense of balance. The camera angle slightly looks down to enhance the sense of observation of the character's state. The iron chain on the right side of the painting hangs down from the top, forming a vertical guiding line that draws the gaze toward the person and extends to the background columns, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The outlines of trees and buildings in the background are blurred to create a soft gradient of green and brown. This makes the subject stand out more. Light comes from the upper left, which is naturally scattered light. Sunlight passes through the leaves to create a soft backlight, producing a slight contour light. The shadows transition delicately. The overall tone is mainly warm brown, olive green, and natural gray, with low color saturation, presenting a retro texture reminiscent of film photography. The image has slight graininess and motion blur, simulating the realism of everyday camera shooting. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is quiet and warm, full of life and artistic flair, as if capturing a private moment of quiet afternoon solitude It conveys a quiet, focused, and peaceful mood. The entire scene resembles a tranquil realistic portrait, containing both real life details and poetic aesthetic expression. The composition is stable, the visual guidance smooth, the layers of light and shadow rich, and the tones harmoniously unified, presenting a unique beauty that lies between documentary and art",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
