        {
          "id": "krea2-35334f9f959fad1688b9ca21",
          "alias": "单女白手套窗边专注举手",
          "prompt": "Her left hand is covered with a long white glove, her fingers slender, gently supporting a black smartphone with the screen facing herself. She is focused on the screen, her right hand raised, the sole slightly bent, toes lightly touching the air, creating a lazy and casual posture. In the foreground, her body occupies the left center of the frame, shot from a low angle. This makes the figures appear more intimate and real. The background is an off-white wall adorned with an arched window lattice, inside which are delicate floral patterns exuding a classical atmosphere. Below the window is a dark wooden bookshelf with neatly arranged figurine models, each with a unique shape, rich colors, and clear details. On the left side of the bookshelf is a row of white power outlets, adding a touch of life to the scene. The entire space is lighted naturally from the interior, soft and even, streaming in from the right side, creating a delicate transition of light and shadow Shadows extend across the floor, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality in the space. The overall color palette is mainly warm brown, black, and white, accented with colorful figurines on the bookshelf. The visual layers are distinct, the atmosphere is cozy and private, as if capturing a quiet and authentic moment in daily life. The visuals present a unique blend of ACG cultural elements and modern home living, blending elements of anime-style culture with the warmth of real life. The composition is compact, with the focus on the interaction between the characters and their phones. Extending to the figurine collection in the background, a natural visual flow is formed. The overall style combines artistic flair with everyday life, like images casually taken with amateur equipment, authentic and full of storytelling, with a slight film texture and subtle noise that enhances the image's authenticity and intimacy",
