        {
          "id": "krea2-76c259908e97674fc071192a",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣小巷忧伤站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the middle of a narrow Japanese city alley. She wears a loose sky-blue knit cardigan over a white top underneath, dark loose pants, hands tucked into her cardigan pockets, head slightly lowered. Her figure is divided by sunlight and shadow, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. On both sides of the alley are typical Japanese-style residential buildings, while on the left stands a two-story building with beige exterior walls. A balcony with metal railings and a closed beige gate are stacked with blue fabric by the door, and a white traffic pole stands in front of the door. Above hang a red no-entry sign and a blue-background white arrow sign. Below are Japanese signs reading \"Except for Bicycles\" and \"Port House Main Store.\" To the right is a towering concrete retaining wall covered in green vines, while above are dense branches and leaves, casting mottled shadows. In the distance, the silhouettes of modern high-rise buildings can be seen. The alley is paved with asphalt, with obvious car tracks and a circular decorative manhole cover. Sunlight slants down from the upper left of the image, casting long shadows on the ground and walls, with intertwined light and shadow. It creates a quiet yet slightly lonely atmosphere. The entire scene is shot at a level level, with a centered symmetrical composition. The figures are positioned slightly below the center of the frame, guiding the viewer from the manhole cover in the foreground to the buildings and sky in the background. The colors are mainly cool tones, with the blue cardigan contrasting with the gray streets. The lighting is soft but the contrast is strong, presenting the graininess and slight overexposure characteristic of film photography, as if captured casually with an old-fashioned camera, capturing casual moments of urban life, creating an overall peaceful atmosphere, authentic and full of life, carrying a touch of nostalgia and detachment, like a still scene in an art film, recording the subtle emotions of ordinary moments",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
