        {
          "id": "krea2-52d78eb95fbfd7ee933363b4",
          "alias": "单女白背心车厢忧伤站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at the edge of a city subway platform, turning sideways to look at the camera. She wears an off-white sleeveless top and loose pink pants, with a black shoulder bag over her shoulder, her left hand tucked into her pocket. Her posture is relaxed yet slightly contemplative, and her calm expression reveals a faint sense of melancholy and detachment, as if gazing at some distant memory or future. In the dusk light, it glows softly. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right in the foreground, her body slightly tilted, forming a natural visual guideline. The background is a typical New York City subway elevated platform. The tracks stretch into the distance, creating a strong perspective. Multiple tracks are interwoven and parallel, with metallic sleepers and rails reflecting a faint metallic sheen in the sunset. Above the platforms is a dark awning structure, edged with yellow warning lights and a \"Exit Broadway & Halsey St\" sign. On the right, a blurry pedestrian can be seen sitting on the steps. In the distance is a cluster of low urban buildings, with red brick walls mixed with concrete structures, rooftops arranged in a staggered manner, and the sky showing a warm orange-yellow gradient. The transition from the horizon upward to a pale blue, with a few thin clouds gently drifting. Sunlight casts long shadows on the ground and the figures, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow, creating a unique atmosphere of tranquility and solitude at dusk. The composition uses a three-part method: the main subject is at the right golden ratio, while the left side leaves ample space to showcase the depth of the tracks. The tracks serve as guiding lines to draw the viewer into the distance, enhancing spatial layers in the image. The overall color tone leans toward warmth, mainly orange, yellow, and brown. The pink and white tones of the figures' clothing and the dark tones of the black backpack create color balance and contrast. The image texture is close to real photography, with slight film graininess and natural noise, simulating amateur camera shooting. The exposure is slightly overexposed, with rich but not overly sharp details, presenting a sense of realism that feels very lifelike. The depth of field is shallow, the foreground is clear, the background gradually blurs, highlighting the subject while preserving environmental information. Light comes from the right rear, combining backlight and side backlighting, softly outlining the character's outline. Adding mystery and drama, the overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of storytelling, as if capturing a brief pause in the daily life of a city dweller. It carries the hustle and bustle of a modern city while permeating the tranquility and contemplation of an individual's inner world. The images convey a poetic emotion between reality and imagination, evoking youth, growth, loneliness, and the alienation of the city",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
