        {
          "id": "krea2-17a9290491f49f707cede75e",
          "alias": "单女米T恤健身房俏皮坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in front of a gym mirror, looking fresh and sharp, with a natural soft pink hue. She wears a beige fitted sports tank top with a square-neck, halter style. The lines are clean and smooth, hugging the body and highlighting the graceful shoulders, neck, and bust curves. She pairs her pants with high-waisted brown tight sports shorts, made of material with good elasticity and support, perfectly outlining the full contours of her hips and thighs, showcasing a toned body proportion. She holds a silver-framed smartphone in her right hand. The back of the phone features three cameras and a circular flash module. The fingers are long and the nails are neatly trimmed. On the wrist is a black thin strap wristband, and the left hand naturally stretches out to one side of the body, looking relaxed and confident. The background is a bright and spacious gym environment, with gray granular non-slip flooring. In the distance, multiple fitness equipment can be seen, including strength racks and resistance machines. The metal frame structure is clearly visible, and some equipment surfaces reflect soft light. The windows let in abundant natural light, making the entire space appear transparent and bright. Outside, you can faintly see the blurred outlines of urban buildings, creating a blend of urban life and a healthy lifestyle. The composition uses close-up shots: the person is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, with the body slightly turned and the head slightly turned toward the camera, creating a dynamic visual balance. The foreground shows the main subject and her phone, the middle is her torso and arms, and the background shows the gym's facilities and the view outside the window. The layers are distinct, and then extended to the background environment. The lighting atmosphere is dominated by natural light, with light slanting into the room from the left side, creating a soft contrast between light and dark. The left side is in slight shadows, enhancing the sense of depth and realism. The overall color tone is warm and harmonious, dominated by beige, brown, gray, and metallic silver, creating a daily, authentic, and lively scene. It feels like a routine self-recording after a workout, casually shot with a regular camera or phone, with slight noise and authentic detail texture, without excessive embellishment. It retains the original authenticity and intimacy, conveying a positive and healthy attitude toward life and a focus on and appreciation for self-image",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
