        {
          "id": "krea2-08b99484809e4ddc445f105b",
          "alias": "单女金礼服舞台冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A tall woman stands on the red carpet, wearing a gold sequin tight gown with a deep V-neck design, delicate straps, knee-length hem, and a cinched waist that outlines elegant curves. The chest and waist are adorned with dense silver and gold crystals, sparkling under the lights. The dress is covered with fine metallic threads woven with texture, presenting a delicate sheen. The hem edges are slightly accented with a soft off-white base, adding layers. She wears a pair of transparent stiletto sandals adorned with sparkling rhinestones. The ankles are wrapped with slender metal chains, creating a luxurious and refined overall look with slight curls. The ends are slightly voluminous, and the expression is calm and confident, exuding a touch of cool elegance. Hands naturally hang at the sides, fingers are long, nails neatly trimmed, arms are smooth, and the background is an indoor event site. The ground is gray cement, with a bright red carpet extending deep into the frame. On the right stands a metal isolation column, smooth and reflective, topped with a golden ring decoration. A red velvet rope connects it, extending from the column to the left, forming a visual guiding line. Behind it is a large glass curtain wall, with large black-and-white promotional posters pasted on it. The content is blurry, but images of tableware and food are visible, and below it is printed \"www.\" The words suggest that this is a commercial event or premiere venue. The light mainly comes from the spotlights above, focusing the light on the figure to create bright highlight areas. At the same time, many reflective points are created on the dress surface, creating a dazzling visual effect. The background and surrounding environment are in dark shadows, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow that enhances the subject's prominence. The overall composition centers on the character, using a medium angle with a slightly upward angle to make the figure appear more upright. The red carpet and isolation ropes extend from the foreground to the middle ground, guiding the gaze to focus on the characters. The posters and architectural structures in the background provide spatial depth, and the lighting and shadow atmosphere is full of celebration. It combines the grandeur of celebrities walking the red carpet with the documentary texture of on-site shooting, as if a professional camera is capturing the moment with flash. The colors are mainly gold, red, and gray. The golden gown and the red carpet create a warm and lively visual response, while the gray floor and background balance the image, avoiding an overly flashy image. The overall color scheme is harmonious and unified, with rich details, possessing a strong sense of fashion and stage presence. At the same time, subtle traces of real scenes are preserved, giving the images a lifelike, authentic texture, as if they came from a real media interview or public event recording. The entire scene not only showcases the elegant charm of the characters but also conveys the lively atmosphere and ritual of the scene. The composition is full but not crowded, elements are reasonably arranged, visual focal points are clear, and light and shadow transitions are natural, creating a dual style that combines artistic beauty with realistic documentation",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
