        {
          "id": "krea2-764c214ca34637a88b174311",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫雪地忧伤站立跳舞",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a snowy winter street, appearing especially cool and real, with a hint of red, like the natural color of blood in cold weather. She tilts her head slightly and gazes at the camera, exuding an unadorned natural beauty. She wears a thick black turtleneck sweater or jacket, with the neckline raised high and wrapping around her neck, creating a strong visual contrast. In the foreground, dense snowflakes dance in the air, each piece clearly visible of varying sizes, some appearing crystal clear under the light. Some are drawn into thin lines due to blurred movement, creating a dynamic snowy atmosphere. The middle is a blurred city street, where you can see blurry vehicle silhouettes. The red taillights of a car flicker faintly in the mist, emitting a warm halo that subtly contrasts with the overall cool tones. The background features the silhouettes of high-rise buildings, with clean and modern lines shrouded in heavy snow, presenting a grayish-white tone. The architectural details are obscured by the mist, appearing hazy and distant. The composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space. The direction of the gaze creates a sense of communication with the audience, using shallow depth of field to clarify the subject and blur the background, highlighting the characters' emotions and ambient atmosphere. Then, falling snowflakes spread outward, enhancing the sense of movement and immersion in the image. Light and shadow mainly use soft, diffused light without strong shadows. The light creates a faint reflection on the snowflakes, adding layers to the image. The overall atmosphere is quiet, lonely, and tinged with a touch of poetry. The color palette is mainly cool white, gray-blue, and black, accented with warm lighting, creating a unique winter feeling where chill and warmth intertwine. The image texture is similar to film photography, with slight graininess and color shift, simulating the effects of vintage cameras. The lens is a prime prime lens with a focal length of about 85mm and an aperture of f/1.8, simulating professional portrait photography while retaining the natural and casual feel of everyday handheld device shooting. The edges of the frame have slight overexposure and noise to enhance realism. The composition is compact with minimal blank space, emphasizing the integration of people and environment, conveying a sense of loneliness, gentleness, and tranquility in the city. The overall style combines artistry with a sense of everyday life, as if captured by chance, capturing a quiet and moving moment in winter",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
