        {
          "id": "krea2-9a1379b1bfc34d8de75849c8",
          "alias": "单女T恤街道冷淡倚靠持书",
          "prompt": "A woman leans against a metal mesh fence in a high-tension low-angle pose, wearing a black sleeveless high-collar zip-up sports tank top. White stripes run along the shoulder line and sides. The cropped design highlights a slender waist and long legs. She pairs the bottom with light khaki camouflage work shorts. The loose cut features practical pockets and drawstring details, blending street style and functional fashion sense. Her makeup is refined and cool, her expression calm and distant, and on her left wrist is a simple silver metal watch with a strap, his right hand gently resting on the railing, while the other hand holds an open newspaper. The English headline and images on the newspaper are blurred, creating a sense of realism and narrative in urban life. The figures are in a tilted posture, with the left leg bent and raised, the right leg straight, forming a strong visual guide that extends from the feet upward to the head, forming a dynamic diagonal composition. The foreground features the main subject and the newspaper, the middle ground features a metal fence and the silhouette of the figure, and the background is a deep blue sky. The clouds are thick and layered, presenting a cool tone of light and shadow at dusk or dawn. In the distance, silhouettes of city buildings and a towering tower-like structure can be faintly seen, possibly a landmark building. The entire scene is set on the rooftop or rooftop platform of a high-rise building, with dark concrete floors and light coming from the sides toward the rear, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. The shadowed areas are deep and layered, and the overall atmosphere is filled with modern urban detachment, fashion, and artistic flair, with a predominantly cool blue tone. The black accents on the characters' clothing contrast sharply with the warm camouflage tones. The image has a cinematic texture and the graininess of film photography, resembling a carefully planned street or fashion blockbuster shoot. Using professional cameras and large aperture lenses to capture the scene, it presents a natural depth of field effect and rich color details. The light and shadow processing is delicate, emphasizing three-dimensionality and spatial sense. The composition is bold and avant-garde, using low-angle downward shots to enhance the visual impact of the subject, making the subject dominate the frame. At the same time, by combining newspapers as everyday objects with urban landscapes, the images are endowed with unique narrative depth and a sense of life. The overall style combines fashion, art, and documentary quality, presenting an aesthetic realm that lies between reality and fiction",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
