        {
          "id": "krea2-6a2528ac769d56aa8b280201",
          "alias": "单女粉T恤室内自信坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the indoor floor, leaning slightly forward, supporting herself with both hands on the floor, head slightly tilted. She wears a pink knitted camisole top with a V-neck design, delicate lace trim at the neckline, and a small pink rose-shaped button on the chest as an accent. The texture is clearly visible, presenting a dense vertical ribbed knit texture that fits the figure. Highlighting soft curves, she wears underwear with floral patterns on the lower body, composed of light purple, green, yellow, and white flowers. The fabric is thin and breathable, subtly revealing the texture of the skin. The overall look is simple yet full of feminine charm. The background is heavy gray curtains made of cotton-linen blend, with rich pleats and distinct layers. Behind the curtains is a blurry indoor environment with a dark tone, creating a quiet and private atmosphere. The floor is covered with a dark gray carpet with subtle woven textures, harmonizing the colors with the background. The composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying the main position. The head is positioned at the top third of the frame, with the body forming an S-shaped curve. The extended hands and legs enhance the sense of depth in the image, with evenly distributed light and shadow. The main light source comes from the front left, creating a contrast of light and shadow that highlights the three-dimensionality of the characters and harmonious color coordination. The atmosphere is tranquil and warm, carrying a sense of everyday intimacy, as if captured with a regular camera or mobile phone. Without excessive embellishment, it preserves natural details and textures. The images present an artistic style that is authentic, simple, yet aesthetically pleasing, capturing an ordinary yet moving moment",
