        {
          "id": "krea2-4b5653fea7a8488374088173",
          "alias": "单女全裸白毛衣广场坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sat on the indoor floor, naturally draped over her shoulders. The roots were slightly darker, with the ends tinged with a hint of reddish-brown, adding some layering. The strap was made of gray fabric with a square dial, giving off a strong sense of technology. She wore a white plush knit cardigan. The cuffs and neckline edges are decorated with black plush stripes, creating a striking contrast. She wears a black topcoat underneath and a high-waisted black short skirt with a light hem and subtle pleats, presenting an elegant silhouette. She sits cross-legged, knees slightly bent, ankles naturally bent, wearing a pair of semi-transparent nude stockings. Her leg lines are smooth and graceful, with her right leg folded over her left, toes pointing forward, with a clear instep and natural foot shape. She sits on a gray short velvet carpet, which is soft and has fine fibers. The surface has a slight textured texture, contrasting with the wooden flooring. The floor is made of light-colored natural wood, with clear and natural wood grain that presents a warm beige tone. Light enters from the right side, reflecting a soft sheen on the floor. The background is a rough concrete wall with a grayish-brown surface featuring irregular holes and mottled marks, giving a rugged and primitive texture. There are also several small round holes on the wall, which may be architectural structures or decorative elements. The overall space is simple and modern, with no unnecessary decoration. It creates an atmosphere where industrial style blends with the touch of everyday life. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly toward the center on the left side of the frame, body slightly tilted, head slightly turned to the side, forming a visual focal point. The foreground features the lower body and feet, rich in detail. The middle ground is the torso and upper body, while the background is the walls and floor, with clear layering. Light and shadow come from the right, creating a soft side lighting effect. At the same time, light shadows are cast on the floor and walls, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall lighting is uniform and soft, with tones of warm white, Mainly gray-brown, black, and pink, the color combinations are harmonious and unified, creating a quiet, private, and everyday scene. It feels like a real photo casually taken in a corner of the home, with a strong sense of documentary authenticity and approachability. The atmosphere is tranquil and warm, with a touch of laziness and casualness. You can almost feel the temperature of the air and the rhythm of your breathing. Overall, it presents an aesthetic style that lies between artistic photography and daily documentation, featuring exquisite details while retaining the authentic texture of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
