        {
          "id": "krea2-e56b744be37f801847e84df4",
          "alias": "单女泳装泳池害羞坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits beside a wooden pavilion at a tropical resort, wearing a brightly colored bikini swimsuit. Both the top and bottom are printed with yellow lemon and green leaf patterns. The design is full of summer energy. The spaghetti straps outline the graceful lines of the shoulders and neck, while the waist ties tie on the sides, showcasing natural curves. The wind gently sways, with a slightly shy and lazy expression. The body leans back slightly, one hand gently touching the knee, the other hanging naturally, a relaxed yet expressive posture occupying the main position. The composition uses medium shots and close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame. The left blank space is filled with thick palm tree trunks and wooden structures, creating visual balance. The background features blurred tropical plants and a faintly visible blue pool surface. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting dappled shadows, creating a warm and bright atmosphere. Light shines from the upper left, with natural shadow transitions. The overall color palette is mainly yellow, green, and blue, full of summer vibes. The image has a strong Japanese photo style, with delicate texture and rich details. It looks like a high-resolution photo taken with a professional camera, featuring a slight film graininess and natural depth of field. The background blur highlights the subject, and the composition uses slanting wooden pillars and tree trunks to guide the viewer's gaze, enhancing the sense of depth in the image. The light and shadow layers are distinct, with moderate contrast between light and shadow, creating a relaxed and pleasant vacation atmosphere. The overall image conveys a fresh, natural, warm, and radiant summer atmosphere, like capturing a moment of authentic and beautiful life on a sunny tropical beach",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
