        {
          "id": "krea2-a4698ac014bb28ec56c31a8f",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫困倦倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a black turtleneck dress paired with a transparent polka-dot mesh long sleeve. The mesh is evenly dotted with fine black dots, subtly outlining the arm lines and creating a hazy yet sexy visual effect that glows softly in the sunlight. The overall design blends Japanese sweetness with light maturity elements, full of youthful energy. In the foreground are blooming pink flowers, dense and delicate, with petals layered and colors grading from light pink to deep pink. Some flowers have slightly withered, showing traces of a natural life cycle. These flowers are distributed below and on both sides of the composition, forming a semi-enclosed flower cluster structure that frames the natural figure. The middle ground features dense green shrubs and trees with lush branches and leaves, broad and well-defined edges. Different layers of green tones are presented, with deep green, emerald green, yellow-green, and other interwoven tones. Some leaves are illuminated by sunlight, producing bright highlights, while others are in shadow, creating rich contrasts of light and dark. The background is a blurred outline of a forest, with thick trunks and interlaced branches forming a natural frame structure. In the distance, a few rays of light can be faintly seen piercing through the canopy, creating a mottled light and shadow effect. The entire background is handled very naturally, highlighting the main figure. The composition uses a centered composition. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the composition, with a slightly tilted body and head tilted backward. The gaze meets the viewer's, forming a strong emotional connection. Surrounded by flower beds and vegetation, a natural frame enhances the depth and envelopment of the image, attracting viewers' attention. The flowers in the foreground also serve as a guide, extending upward from the bottom to gradually guide the subject. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by warm afternoon sunlight, with light shining diagonally from the upper right, creating a soft backlighting effect. This creates a golden halo around the edges of the figure's contours, creating a sense of transparency and enhancing three-dimensionality. Dotted light spots shine through the gaps in the leaves in the background, creating the classic \"Tyndall effect\" and adding a dreamy feel. The overall tone leans toward warmth, mainly pink, green, and black, complemented by golden sunlight, creating a peaceful, romantic, and slightly melancholic atmosphere, as if frozen on a spring afternoon, time stands still and emotions are gentle. The image has a strong everyday photographic texture, like shooting with a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens. The background is blurred naturally, the focus is precise, colors are faithfully restored, and details are rich, presenting an overall visual style that is both lifelike and highly artistic, making it suitable for portraits, emotional expression, or literary-themed creation",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
