        {
          "id": "krea2-60a847b2783fc17fd2fc5ceb",
          "alias": "单女泳装霓虹夜景俏皮站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a retro yellow 1950s-style motel. She wears a colorful striped bikini, paired with a blue baseball cap and white sneakers, lively on one foot on a blue-and-white plastic bench, arms spread and body slightly tilted, exuding a relaxed and joyful summer atmosphere. Her expression is confident and slightly playful. The towering palm trees in the background stand out against the clear blue sky, and in the distance, the colorful striped building walls are visible. The overall scene is full of tropical charm and nostalgia. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center. In the center is a huge yellow motel body, with green neon signs on the windows reading \"50'S DRIVE-INN OPEN.\" a blurry license plate hangs on the car, with towering palm trees and blue skies and white clouds in the background, along with distant colorful striped walls. It creates a strong sense of depth. In terms of lighting, sunlight shines from the upper right, creating bright highlights and soft shadows. The right side of the body is illuminated, while the left side is in a slight shadow, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The yellow body reflects warm light, creating a sharp contrast with the sky's deep blue. The overall color scheme is dominated by yellow, blue, and green, complemented by rainbow-colored stripes on the bikini, creating rich color layers. The image presents a texture reminiscent of everyday amateur photography, as if shot with an old-fashioned film camera. There is a slight graininess and natural overexposure, with edges slightly overexposed. Details retain authentic shooting traces, such as seat wear and paint peeling. The electrical wires and architectural details in the background appear authentic and unforced. The entire scene is filled with summer energy and nostalgic romance, as if frozen on a sunny afternoon, evoking a sense of freedom, youth, and beautiful times.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
