        {
          "id": "krea2-3a833bf02a3929a5bf7029e6",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙酒吧俏皮坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden bench in the dining room, wearing a white lace short-sleeved dress with ruffled hems, a Peter Pan collar and a small button decoration. The overall style is sweet and cute, with a slightly voluminous skirt that presents a typical Lolita or Japanese style. On her feet are a pair of pink plush lace-strap high-heeled sandals, with fine knots wrapped around the upper and soft plush accented at the edges. Add a touch of playfulness and tenderness. Next to her is a heart-shaped handbag, mainly in light gray or off-white, decorated with a light purple bow and pearl chain shoulder strap. The bag is rounded and full, with soft lines, looking very refined. The background is the bar counter area of a modern Japanese restaurant, made of dark wooden boards, smooth and textured. Above it are several sets of bamboo skewers and wooden signs with Japanese menus. The sign is rectangular, light yellow-brown, and has dish names written in black letters. Some wooden signs are decorated with small bamboo tubes or strips, creating a strong traditional Japanese atmosphere. Behind the bar counter is a transparent glass partition through which you can see inside the kitchen. A chef dressed in white work clothes and wearing a mask is working with his head down, holding yellow fabric or napkins, moving with focused and skillful movements. The kitchen is brightly lit, and the equipment is clearly visible, including stainless steel utensils and electronic displays. On the left side of the screen is a blue LED light strip that emits a cool-toned glow, contrasting with the surrounding warm light. To enhance spatial layering, the floor is paved with dark gray tiles, with a smooth and reflective surface that reflects the reflections of people and furniture. The walls are built with black bricks, with regular joints and a rough texture, creating a striking visual contrast. Under indoor lighting, the entire scene presents a warm and soft light and shadow effect. The light source comes from recessed ceiling fixtures, evenly distributed, while slight reflections appear on the floor and metal surfaces, creating a realistic sense of space. The composition centers on the figures, using medium shots. The figures occupy about two-thirds of the frame's height, with their bodies slightly turned to the right, legs crossed, and a naturally relaxed posture. The foreground highlights the details of a heart-shaped bag and shoes, the middle shot focuses on the main figure and the bar counter environment, while the background uses blur to show the kitchen and distant furnishings, guiding the viewer from near to far. The color scheme mainly consists of white, off-white, light pink, brown, and black, creating a harmonious and unified overall tone, combining innocence with the vibe of modern urban life. The light and shadow transitions are delicate, with moderate contrast between light and shadow. The atmosphere is warm and tranquil, as if capturing a fleeting moment in daily life. The images have a strong sense of everyday documentary quality, as if taken with a regular camera or mobile phone, preserving real noise and slight motion blur, enhancing authenticity and intimacy. The overall image conveys a quiet, sweet, and slightly artistic everyday aesthetic, allowing people to feel youthful, gentle, and the small joys of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
