        {
          "id": "krea2-9afb8b3d5da6308acafb0b1c",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙门俏皮坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the driver's seat of a convertible, displaying delicate luster and layering. Looking directly at the camera seems to be silently communicating with the viewer. She wears a white sleeveless spaghetti strap dress, made of lightweight, soft material with natural pleats, hugging the body yet maintaining a relaxed and comfortable feel. The hem lifts gently in the breeze, appearing lively and elegant. Her right hand rests gently on her lap, while her left hand holds a carefully packaged bouquet of blue roses. The flowers are mainly light blue and cyan, accented with a few small white flowers, complemented by green leaves. The bouquet is wrapped in light blue transparent wrapping paper, with delicate lace trim along the edges. The overall design is fresh and elegant, full of romantic charm. In the front are clearly visible bouquet details, with delicate petals and crystal-clear dewdrops, reflecting a soft sheen under the light. The background is a wide outdoor highway scene, with a gray asphalt road winding forward into the distance. On both sides of the road are barren hillsides, sparse vegetation, exposed rocks showing a yellow-brown hue. In the distance, the sky is deep blue, white clouds scatter, and their shapes are as soft as cotton. Sunlight pours in from the upper right, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. The shadows in the folds of the clothes are deep and three-dimensional. On the left side of the image, you can faintly see the car's black seats and some door structures. The metal parts reflect delicately, and the composition uses close-ups combined with medium shots. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, with the head slightly tilted and the body in a three-quarters side-profile posture, with the gaze facing the camera, creating a natural visual direction. The background blur is well handled, highlighting the subject while preserving environmental information, creating a bright and warm overall atmosphere. Full of youthful energy and romantic ambiance, the lighting is soft yet clearly oriented, creating a realistic and infectious everyday shooting feel. It's as if you're capturing a moment on a sunny afternoon with a professional camera. The color saturation is moderate, the tones are cool yet warm, and the blue and white main colors contrast harmoniously with earth tones. The images are rich in layers, details are full, and there is strong visual appeal and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
