        {
          "id": "krea2-ad1bc0ebdfec5be446483196",
          "alias": "单女红T恤海滩俏皮注视",
          "prompt": "Under the sunlight, she glows with a healthy sheen, carrying a hint of shyness and gentleness. Looking directly into the camera, it seems she is silently communicating with the viewer. She wears a blue semi-transparent long-sleeved short top embroidered with \"Forever 16,\" with red lace trim along the neckline. The fabric is lightweight and breathable, faintly revealing the red camisole underneath. A small white starfish brooch is pinned to her chest. Adding a touch of oceanic flair to the overall look, she pairs the bottom with bright red high-waisted shorts. The pants are loose and comfortable, with a drawstring design at the waist and pleated details on the sides. The sides of the pant legs have slits to reveal a slender leg line, and a small white label hangs at the waist. The overall style is fresh, sweet, and energetic. Her left hand hangs naturally, and she wears a delicate silver bracelet on her wrist, looking elegant and natural. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, with the body slightly tilted, presenting a graceful S-shaped curve. The composition uses medium shots, with the figure fully visible from head to knee. The background is a blurred outdoor environment, with green shrubs and some blurred architectural outlines visible in the distance. Above is a blue-and-white striped sunshade, slightly tilted, casting mottled light and shadow, creating the atmosphere of a summer beach or park leisure area. Light comes from the front right, creating a soft backlight effect, outlining the figure's outline with a golden halo. The shadow transitions naturally and the overall light and shadow layers are rich, mainly blue, red, and green. The color scheme is bright and fresh, full of summer atmosphere. The image has a strong visual guiding effect, then follows her gaze and body posture into clothing details and background elements. The composition is balanced and dynamic, with a clear foreground and natural transitions in the middle shot. The background is well handled with blur, enhancing spatial depth. Overall, it presents a youthful, warm, and healing everyday photo style, as if it were a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera, yet retaining a natural, everyday feel. Like a beautiful moment captured by chance on a street bathed in afternoon sunlight, the image is delicately textured, with moderate color saturation and rich details. The characters' expressions are authentic and natural, without signs of excessive embellishment, giving a sense of warmth, warmth, and vitality. The entire scene is filled with a relaxed and joyful atmosphere, evoking carefree youth and beautiful hopes for the future.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
