        {
          "id": "krea2-0823e97552e9ce0d587c9f4c",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣公园沉思行走注视",
          "prompt": "A woman holding a Canon EOS DSLR camera presents a relaxed, lazy beauty. She gazes down at the screen, her expression focused and slightly contemplative, as if composing or reviewing the moment of shooting. She wears a white plush knit jacket layered with a plaid shirt and a white bow tie, blending collegiate style with modern fashion. Her right hand is a white plush glove. Gently holding the camera body, holding the lens with the left hand, the movements are natural and smooth, showing a passion and dedication to photography. The foreground subject is clear and prominent, and the camera details are fully presented, including the \"Canon\" logo and \"EOS\" logo on the black body, as well as the focus and zoom rings on the lens. The lens cap is removed, and glass reflections can be seen at the front of the lens. The background blur is well handled, and the middle ground is a blurry outdoor park scene, with several bare tree branches interlaced with no leaves. It shows the characteristics of early spring or late autumn, with gray cement bricks paved on the ground and a yellow metal railing nearby. In the distance, faint other pedestrians can be seen—one wearing a black down jacket with his back to the camera, another in a light-colored jacket walking sideways. Their figures are blurred, creating a strong contrast with the foreground and enhancing the spatial layering of the image. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space. The slightly tilted angle creates a sense of dynamism and realism, extending further toward the shot. This forms a coherent observation path, with light and shadow coming from above, sunlight filtering through sparse branches, creating a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The colors mainly feature warm and cool contrasts, with warm clothing tones and a gray-brown background, accented by yellow railings and purple headphones. The overall tone is harmonious and unified, with a texture close to the realism of everyday amateur equipment, with slight noise and film graininess, as if capturing a snapshot of everyday life, capturing the photographer's ordinary moments on the street to record the world. Filled with youthful energy and artistic sentiment, the entire scene is quiet yet full of storytelling, as if the next moment is about to press the shutter and capture a precious moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
