        {
          "id": "krea2-c6513cee9fd09dc05fefeb28",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙窗边忧伤倚靠喝",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman, naturally draped over her shoulder, appearing lazy and authentic, with faint freckles adding a touch of naturalness and youthful quality, tinged with a hint of contemplation and melancholy, presenting a natural pink tone. She wears a white lace slip dress with delicate pleats at the neckline, sleeveless sleeves revealing slender shoulders and arms. Her right hand holds a transparent glass containing a green drink, possibly mint water or lime tea, with tiny droplets on the glass's walls. A few fresh mint leaves and ice cubes float in the cup. Her fingers are long, her nails painted pale pink and adorned with delicate floral patterns. Her hands are naturally in pose, as if about to take a sip of a drink. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the center, with close-ups and blurred backgrounds, presenting a blurred indoor environment. The walls are light green or gray-green, with faint decorations or frames visible, but the details are unclear, creating a hazy and intimate sense of space. The middle shot features the upper part of the person's body and the cup, forming a progressive layer with the foreground, while the background becomes more blurred, focusing the visual focus on the subject. The composition leans toward a central symmetry but is slightly tilted. The figure's head slightly tilts, and the gaze is slightly off-camera, adding an unintentional sense of candid shots. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft. The main light source comes from the left side of the frame, simulating natural light streaming through a window, while creating soft shadows on the other side. It enhances the sense of three-dimensionality, with an overall warm yellow tone with a vintage film feel. The color saturation is moderate, with a slightly dark tone, creating a nostalgic, tranquil, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. There is a slight vignetting effect at the edges of the frame, reinforcing the central focus. The overall style is similar to Japanese film photography, with a touch of everyday beauty. It feels like a snapshot casually taken with an old camera in a room bathed in slanting afternoon sunlight. The details are rich, the texture delicate, and full of storytelling and emotional tension",
