        {
          "id": "krea2-d130d0481264c193cf73ad7a",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤室内沉思倚靠",
          "prompt": "A female volleyball player is doing stretching training on the red sports floor of an indoor gymnasium. She wears a black short-sleeved T-shirt and black sports shorts. The T-shirt features a gold Nike logo and the word \"VOLLEYBALL\" on the chest. A round badge is pinned to her left chest, and she wears delicate silver earrings on her earlobe. Her hands rest on the ground, her body leaning forward in a low posture, her right leg extended forward, her left leg bent back, knee close to the ground, and her arm muscles clearly defined. Her nails are painted light blue. Her expression is calm and resolute, as if focused on preparing for a match or thinking through tactics. The foreground shows her bent posture and clear hand details; the middle is her entire body silhouette and the brand logo on her sportswear; the background is a blurred gym environment, with the orange-red floor contrasting sharply with the pale blue walls. In the distance, a faint white border and venue structure can be seen. The composition uses low-angle shots to highlight the dynamic beauty and power of the characters. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft and even, creating a professional and authentic training scene. The overall image presents a style that combines artistry and everyday life, as if captured with amateur equipment, capturing the athletes' focus and resilience during high-intensity training. The tones are warm and layered, combining the vitality of sports with a quiet tension. The image details are rich, from the texture of clothing materials to ground reflections, all clearly visible, presenting a sports photography style that is both authentic and aesthetically valuable",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
