        {
          "id": "krea2-c925bb018aade02ee0fc4030",
          "alias": "单女白T恤户外沉思站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the water, exuding a thoughtful calm and gentleness. She wears a white tight camisole that accentuates her slender waist, layered with a light gray loose knit cardigan. The cardigan is casually draped over her shoulders, sleeves naturally hanging down, revealing her arms. She wears light blue jeans with a loose waistband, loose pant legs, and one hand tucked into her pocket. The other hand gently supports the gray metal pillar beside him, leaning slightly against the pillar with a relaxed and natural posture. In the foreground is a thick gray metal pillar occupying the left edge of the composition. The column's surface is smooth, reflecting soft light. The background is an open body of water, calm with a faint blue-green hue. In the distance, a blurred bridge structure with faint piers and decks is visible. Further away are hazy mountains and city buildings. The sky is bright, sunlight is abundant, and the overall tone is mainly cool tones. It presents a cool, clean, and tranquil atmosphere. The composition features the figure positioned slightly to the center, occupying the main position in the composition. Metal columns serve as visual guides, directing the gaze toward the figures and creating a sense of spatial layering. Light and shadow come from the upper left, with soft lighting and elegant shadows. The wrinkles and knit textures of clothing are clearly visible, and there are slight reflections and ripples on the water surface, creating a realistic and delicate texture. The entire image presents a tranquil beauty of everyday life, as if capturing a moment under an afternoon sun. The image has the texture of film photography, with moderate color saturation and rich details, slight graininess, and soft blur outside focus. The overall style is fresh and natural, full of youthful energy and artistic atmosphere, like a real outdoor scene shot with a regular camera. No excessive retouching is needed, preserving the original light and color and giving a warm and authentic feeling of life",
