        {
          "id": "krea2-bbd548689260dadca358d9b6",
          "alias": "单女摄影棚困倦持相机",
          "prompt": "Her expression is slightly contemplative and gentle, adding realism and approachability. Coiled high above her head and hanging outside her left shoulder, she wears a black silk or satin top with puff sleeves. The shoulder features pleated details, and a thin cord-like strap decoration is visible on the back. The garment is simple yet elegant, highlighting the figure's slender figure and temperament. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the main subject occupying most of the space. The head is slightly tilted, and the body forms an S-shaped curve, enhancing the dynamic beauty. The background features pure, light gray-white walls with no distractions, creating a minimalist and clean visual environment. Light comes from the left side of the front, providing soft, evenly diffused light that simulates indoor natural light or studio soft lighting, adding volume. The overall color scheme is mainly black, white, and gray, creating a harmonious contrast. The atmosphere is tranquil, gentle, and slightly dreamy, as if capturing a real moment on a quiet afternoon, with a strong artistic and photographic quality. Like a professional photographer using a full-frame camera paired with a large-aperture lens in a bright indoor space, the image presents a slight film graininess and delicate color transitions.",
