        {
          "id": "krea2-81f2adb2d61c25f63ec7010e",
          "alias": "单女黑外套水边冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the riverbank at dusk, turning sideways to the left side of the painting. She wears a thick black down jacket and a bright blue knitted scarf around her neck. The edges of the scarf feature natural tassel details, making the colors stand out in a cool-toned setting. Her right hand firmly holds a burning newspaper, flames leaping from the edges of the pages, creating a warm and intense contrast of light and shadow. The text on the newspaper is blurry but recognizable as Chinese typesetting, with the paper curling and deforming from the heat. Some edges have already charred and blackened. Staring at the flames, his calm expression reveals a hint of contemplation and resolve. The background is a wide river, its surface calm as a mirror, reflecting the deep blue sky and the distant outline of the city. The city's buildings appear faintly in the mist. An arched bridge spans the river, clearly structured but somewhat hazy. The overall color scheme is mainly cool blue, creating a tranquil yet slightly oppressive atmosphere. The light comes from the afterglow of daylight and partial illumination from the flames, forming a dual light source. The firelight becomes the only warm focal point in the painting. Drawing viewers' attention, the composition uses a third-division method: the person is positioned on the right one-third of the frame, leaving a wide left space to showcase the environment and depth. The lens uses an 85mm prime portrait lens, with a shallow depth effect that sharpens the foreground and blurs the background, highlighting the subject and the burning newspaper. The camera is set to high ISO to capture details in low-light environments while maintaining dynamic range. The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if shot with professional photography equipment, with cinematic narrative and emotional tension. The entire scene presents a poetic sense of loneliness and symbolism, as if expressing some kind of farewell or release emotion. The atmosphere is quiet and profound, like a moment accidentally captured in daily life, yet full of artistic condensation and philosophical reflection",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
