        {
          "id": "krea2-067d7ee4bd9f9e3eba8e8141",
          "alias": "单女白T恤城市忧伤坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in front of an open refrigerator, wearing a white striped short-sleeved T-shirt and black shorts, white long socks, and sitting cross-legged on the floor. Her right hand holds a bottle of green glass bottle of Korean soju, while her left hand rests naturally on her right knee, head slightly lowered. Her expression reveals a deep loneliness and exhaustion, as if bearing some invisible pressure. The refrigerator door is open, and cold light shines through, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. Inside the fridge are several bottles of green soju, a transparent water bottle, and a bottle labeled \" \"ARSON VODKA\" vodka and some other beverage cans, with a medicine bottle placed on top. The refrigerator's metal frame and transparent partitions reflect cold light, rich in detail. On the left side of the refrigerator is a freezer door with an ice maker and storage compartment. The edge of the fridge door has metal handles and sealing strips. The floor is dark tiles or flooring with fine lines and textures. The background is a dark indoor environment, almost completely hidden in shadows, illuminated only by the refrigerator's internal light source. The composition adopts a central composition. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, with the refrigerator occupying most of the left and middle areas. The light mainly comes from inside the fridge, creating a strong side backlight effect. The cool blue tones dominate the entire image, creating a cool, lonely, and oppressive atmosphere. The contrast between light and shadow is intense, while the surrounding environment falls into darkness. The visual guide is drawn by the fridge's brightness, gradually focusing on the character and highlighting their emotional state. The overall style is realistic and cinematic, with the texture of everyday life, as if shot with a professional camera. However, it also carries a slight film graininess and natural noise, simulating the realism of amateur equipment shooting. The shot is medium shot, slightly from a top angle, capturing the interaction between the person and the refrigerator. The details are rich, including the wrinkles of clothing, the texture of socks, labels on bottles, the layers of items placed inside the refrigerator, and the delicate transitions between floor reflections and shadows. Overall, it presents a quiet yet heavy moment of urban life, full of storytelling and evoking late-night solitude, low moods, and seeking comfort, creating a strong atmosphere, full of emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
