        {
          "id": "krea2-b0b01bdfa0eb5fe04f574e03",
          "alias": "单女绿毛衣户外愤怒站立展示",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an outdoor stone steps, wearing a light green high-collar sleeveless knit dress. The dress is designed to be form-fitting and fitted, with side slit details at the waist, showcasing smooth curves and elegant silhouette. Her expression is calm yet tinged with gentleness and contemplation. Sunlight pours in from the upper right of the frame, creating a soft backlight effect. The background is a blurred green tree and shrub thicket, presenting a warm green tone. In the distance, you can faintly see blue skies and light spots filtering through the gaps between branches and leaves, creating a peaceful and natural atmosphere. The ground is paved with gray stone slabs. Light and shadow intertwine, forming mottled tree shadow patterns, enhancing the sense of layering and realism in the space. The overall composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, body slightly tilted, head facing the lens, forming a visual focal point. The light is bright but not glaring, the tones are fresh and natural, and the color saturation is moderate, presenting a beautiful moment casually captured in daily life, as if captured casually with a regular camera on a sunny afternoon, without excessive embellishment. It preserves the original sense of realism and intimacy, with the entire composition brimming with youthful energy and natural beauty, giving a relaxed, enjoyable, and life-close artistic feeling",
