        {
          "id": "krea2-45981225e58afa4fd167f11a",
          "alias": "单女制服微笑过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman is wearing a Japanese-style schoolgirl uniform: a white long-sleeved shirt paired with a deep blue bow tie and collar trim. The tie is decorated with fine white stripes, the cuffs are decorated with black lace lace, and she wears a dark blue plaid pleated skirt with the skirt naturally draped down. Her posture is elegant and slightly playful, smoothly draped over her shoulders, looking directly at the camera with a gentle and sweet smile. The background is an indoor setting. The walls are light beige with clean white decorative lines. The surface is smooth and clean, and on the left side, a corner of a black backpack and wooden furniture can be faintly seen. The overall space is simple and bright, with a medium close-up composition. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, with a slightly turned body and a slight tilt of the head, forming a natural visual guideline. Light comes from the front slightly left, with delicate and natural shadows, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The transition between light and shadow is smooth, with white, dark blue, and black as the main tones, creating a harmonious and unified overall tone. presenting a fresh, natural, and slightly academic everyday aesthetic. The images have a slight film graininess and soft depth of field, as if shot with a professional camera in natural light, emphasizing both realism and artistry, while retaining a certain amateur photography style, such as slight exposure control and natural noise effects. This makes the entire image both refined and lifelike, with a compact and layered composition, a clear foreground highlighting the subject, and a middle ground showing some environmental details. Background blur treatment enhances visual focus. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and warm, full of youthful energy and pure charm",
