        {
          "id": "krea2-9216c672260bfa69ba036d5f",
          "alias": "忧伤注视",
          "prompt": "Underwater close-up shots present a naturally moist texture, creating a realistic and delicate underwater effect, forming soft light and shadow interplay between light and shadow. These light spots change with the ripples of the water, like flowing silk, giving the image a dynamic sense of life. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space, heads slightly tilted, gazing outward, creating an open visual guidance. The background is a deep blue body of water, gradually transitioning into a blurry dark blue tone in the distance. Tiny suspended particles float in the water, adding realism and depth to the image. Light streams diagonally from the water's surface, creating a strong yet gentle contrast of light and shadow, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly cool blue, complemented by warm yellow spots, creating a striking contrast that enhances visual impact. The visuals have a strong cinematic and artistic feel, as if clipped from a sci-fi or fantasy movie. At the same time, it carries the rustic feel of everyday amateur equipment. For example, when shooting underwater with a handheld camera, the lens has slight shake and noise, making the images more realistic and lively. The rich details in the underwater environment are meticulously presented, and the entire scene is filled with a tranquil, lonely, yet poetic atmosphere. It feels as if time has frozen in this moment, merging the characters with the water, presenting a transcendent beauty",
