        {
          "id": "krea2-ff4d7475d2847ad2b567219c",
          "alias": "单女黑外套城市冷淡坐交叠（2）",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the center of a dark green velvet sofa, wearing a black leather jacket and printed T-shirt, a black short skirt, legs crossed, right hand resting on the neck of a red electric guitar, left hand lightly touching the strings, relaxed and focused, her expression slightly cold and detached, overall temperament combining rock coolness with urban fashion. She holds a bright red double-angled electric guitar, with smooth body lines, metal frets and pickup details clearly visible, neck made of light wood grain, and the headstock bearing the brand logo. The guitar's bright red contrasts sharply with the surrounding dark tones, becoming a visual focal point. In the foreground, the edge of a round glass coffee table is faintly visible, on which are white candles, colorful small bowls, and some blurred decorations. On the right, large green leaves extend into the frame, with broad leaves and distinct textures, adding a touch of vitality and wildness. In the middle of the scene, the sofa backrest behind the woman features a classic diamond stitching design, and the deep green velvet material glows softly under the light. Behind the sofa is a colorful floral wallpaper with a blue background covered with blooming roses, peonies, and other flowers. The colors are rich, including pink, white, orange, and purple, with dense and layered patterns. On the left side of the background is a vintage-style black vintage TV. The screen is off, with knobs and buttons on the device. Next to it is a bouquet of blue hydrangeas and pink roses. The TV cabinet is made of reddish-brown wooden furniture, with carved patterns on the surface, and on top are white mannequin head sculptures, glass cups, The lighting throughout the scene is dim, with the main light source coming from the left front, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow, while the rest is cast in shadow, creating a dramatic light and shadow effect. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figures centered and bodies slightly tilted, creating dynamic balance that then turns toward the audience to emphasize presence. The overall atmosphere blends retro, decadent, romantic, and modern rock elements, presenting an artistic life fragment in a private space, full of storytelling and emotional tension. It feels like a moment frozen in a late-night studio or private living room, with a strong cinematic texture and the graininess of film photography. The tones are somewhat cool, but red guitars and warm lighting create localized warmth, creating a contrast between cool and warm. The visuals are rich in layers and full of detail, combining the casual feel of daily life with carefully arranged artistic beauty. Like high-quality portraits shot with a professional camera paired with soft light, they are realistic and deeply moving",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
