        {
          "id": "krea2-229c530d19ed22bed0b2a213",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣椅上忧伤坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a retro-style café, slightly tilting her head to gaze at the right side of the frame. Her hands are folded on a wooden tabletop, her fingers slender and long, her nails neatly trimmed. She wears a white knit sweater with a slightly open neckline and a light-colored shirt underneath. The shoulder lines are soft, and the overall look is simple yet artistic, presenting a quiet and reserved temperament. In the foreground is a rustic dark brown solid wood table, with natural wood grain and slight wear marks, giving it a warm and authentic feel. On the table sits a small chocolate cake, covered with pure white cream, topped with a small pink strawberry, and beside it is a golden fork. These details enrich the layering of the scene. The middle scene is a blurred café interior, where you can see the outline of a dark wooden chair carved with simple patterns. The background is a mottled white stone wall with cracks and faded marks left by time, giving off a nostalgic feel. In the upper right, a dark-framed decorative painting can be faintly seen, but the content is blurry, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The composition combines close-up shots with medium and long shots blurring. The figure is positioned near the center on the left side of the image, with the gaze turning to the right, creating a visual extension. The foreground tabletop and cake serve as visual guiding elements, while the shallow depth of field effect highlights the subject. The background blur creates a soft atmosphere. In terms of lighting, the light comes from the front left of the painting, presenting a warm yellow-green tone, like natural light streaming through the window in the afternoon, casting a faint shadow on the tabletop to add depth. The overall light distribution is even, without strong contrast between light and dark, creating a peaceful, warm, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The color palette is mainly warm yellow, off-white, and dark brown, accented with a touch of pink and green. The color combinations are harmonious and unified, with slight film graininess and color shifts, simulating vintage camera shooting and enhancing nostalgia and artistic feel. The overall style leans toward Japanese artistic style. Filled with the breath of life and emotional warmth, it seems to capture an ordinary yet touching moment, like a frozen memory that draws people in, feeling the slow flow of time and inner peace",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
