        {
          "id": "krea2-4814693ee1c3fee0fa72ddbc",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫废墟忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "A woman squatted in a dim, narrow indoor space, slightly open, her expression both fragile and full of storytelling. She wore a white shirt with sleeves slightly rolled up, a white bow tied around the collar. The fabric was wrinkled from the dampness or movement, and the overall look showed traces of a retro collegiate style. Her body leaned slightly forward, knees bent, arms naturally hanging down, her posture relaxed yet exuding a sense of oppression. The background was a blurry dark space, with mottled walls and some indistinct objects in the corners. For example, old furniture or clutter in an abandoned room has peeling paint and stains on the walls, with a cool tone showing a mix of gray-green and deep brown. Light enters diagonally from the upper left of the frame, creating a strong contrast between light and dark. The light source comes from an old fluorescent lamp or flashlight, while the rest is immersed in deep shadow, creating a dramatic light and shadow effect, along with obvious halos and light spots. The background blur makes the subject stand out more, the composition uses a very low overhead angle, and the camera is slightly tilted. This enhances the image's sense of instability and oppression, forming a strong emotional connection. The overall image is filled with a lonely, oppressive, mysterious, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The tones are mainly deep blacks and grays, accented with cool greens and faint warm light. The graininess is strong, as if shot with an old film camera, featuring obvious noise and slight fading marks. Natural vignetting and slight scratches at the edges simulate the texture of real film photography. The use of light and shadow intensifies psychological tension, filling the entire scene with untold stories and underlying fear",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
