        {
          "id": "krea2-a7ba6e2eb813d0620b1dd33f",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙沙发温柔坐",
          "prompt": "A close-up of a woman sitting on an indoor sofa, her overall vibe is fresh and sweet, with a touch of maturity. She wears a pure white spaghetti strap dress made of lightweight, soft chiffon material. The V-neck design highlights the graceful lines of her neck and bust. The thin straps create natural pleats at the collarbone, and the cinched waist outlines a slender waist. The hem spreads out in an A-shape, with clear layers. The hem is decorated with lace trim, and the inner layer is semi-transparent mesh, subtly revealing the contours of her legs. Her left hand rests gently on her knee, fingers long, her posture elegant and natural. Her right hand hangs naturally at one side of her body. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the composition, shot in a medium shot, with the figure fully presented above the thigh. The background is a cozy indoor environment. On the left is a beige fabric sofa topped with a matching cushion, soft and comfortable. Behind the sofa is a blurred outline of wooden furniture, possibly a dining table or a bookshelf. In the right background, you can see a round wooden table and several chairs, but all are blurred. The entire scene is gently and warmly lit, with natural light streaming through the windows from the front side, creating evenly diffused light. The transition of light and shadow is natural, without harsh shadows, creating a peaceful and comfortable home atmosphere. The color palette is mainly warm yellow and off-white, harmoniously unified overall. The composition uses a shallow depth of field, with a clear foreground and a gradually blurred background. The visual guidance focuses on the figures, giving the visuals a strong artistic and cinematic feel, as if captured from an art film, shot with professional photography equipment The lens is an 85mm prime portrait lens with an aperture of f/1.8, shutter speed of 1/125 second, ISO 100. The image details are rich, textures are clearly visible, and the overall atmosphere is warm, soft, intimate, and emotional, giving a sense of tranquility and beauty, as if time has stood still at this moment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
