        {
          "id": "krea2-d41a0437c1061b4fde125e3a",
          "alias": "单女上衣",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman looking up at the sky, radiating a warm glow. She wears a pleated white top with small blue floral patterns, with delicate ruffled designs on the collar and cuffs, adding a touch of sweetness and vintage charm. The foreground is the edge of a thatched roof, where golden hay hangs down, forming geometric light spots. These light and shadow alternate between light and shadow depending on the angle, adding layers and a dreamlike atmosphere, as if searching for something. It reveals a longing and longing for beautiful things. The background is a blurred patch of green plants, with leaves showing rich green tones in the sunlight, gradient from deep green to light green, creating a vibrant natural environment. The composition uses a low-angle upward shot, placing the figure slightly to the right of the frame, leaving a large space on the left for the grass and sky above, creating an asymmetrical yet balanced visual structure. At the same time, the light spots formed by the grass also serve as a guiding light, enhancing spatial depth. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by soft natural light. Sunlight pours in from above, filtering through the gaps in the thatch, creating a warm and bright light. The tones blend warm yellow and light green, creating a peaceful, healing, and summer-like pastoral style. The image feels delicate and authentic, as if taken with professional photography, yet still retains the beautiful moments captured unintentionally in daily life. It has a strong sense of artistry and life, moderate color saturation, rich details, and clear layering, creating a fresh, refined, gentle, and healing visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
