        {
          "id": "krea2-9b2f8225ac54034c508833bd",
          "alias": "单女蓝高领衫家中困倦站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under soft purple lighting, adding a touch of softness and laziness. She wears a blue turtleneck tight knit top with delicate and clear textures, and vertical ribbed lines that fit closely to her body curves, showcasing elegant lines. The fabric is soft and elastic, with a slight reflective texture that highlights the fabric's true texture and details. Around her neck is a thin chain necklace, the gold chain is delicate and exquisite. The pendant is a teardrop-shaped purple gemstone, rich and translucent, reflecting a soft glow under the light that echoes the purple background tone. Her right hand rests gently near her abdomen, fingers long, and her nails are painted deep blue or purple, harmonizing with the overall tone. Her left hand hangs naturally or partially visible, her posture relaxed and natural, as if she inadvertently captures a private and peaceful moment. The background is a light-colored wall. It may be white or off-white, with vertical lines or pleated decorations on the wall, evenly illuminated by purple lighting, creating a soft transition of light and shadow. The light is projected from both sides or behind, creating a warm and dreamy atmosphere. The light sources come from the sides and back, creating a gradient halo effect that gently envelops the subject, highlighting the sense of depth. The composition uses medium to close-up portraits, with the subject positioned slightly to the left center, head slightly tilted, and gaze slightly angled toward the camera. This creates a friendly and striking visual direction. The foreground is the upper body of the subject, occupying the main space, while the middle extends to her waist and hand movements. The background is dominated by blurred walls and light and shadow, with clear layering. The colors are dominated by blue-purple tones, with a harmonious contrast of warm and cool tones, creating a quiet, romantic, and slightly mysterious atmosphere. The overall style combines everyday and artistic elements, as if photographed at home with a professional camera or a high-end phone, with a slight film texture and low-saturation filter effects. The edges of the frame have slight halos and bokeh, enhancing realism and immersion. The lighting is soft and not harsh, shadow transitions are natural, without rigid boundaries, presenting an image of a private, comfortable, and slightly sexy modern woman, full of life and personal charm",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
