          "id": "krea2-ae00e69c9ebd0a28af0fb392",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤健身房俏皮站立注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a black sports tank top and black sports shorts, with a well-proportioned and fit figure. Her abdominal line is clearly visible, showing a healthy and energetic posture. She smiles, naturally holding a blue fitness ball with her left hand. The surface of the ball has a distinct striped texture, giving it a slight reflective texture. Around her neck is a thin black collar with a small silver pendant hanging from it, adding a touch of refinement. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, body slightly turned to the camera, right arm naturally hanging down, left arm bent to hold the ball. forming a graceful posture. In the foreground, the main figure and a blue fitness ball are visible; in the middle is a calm sea, shimmering with waves. The golden glow of the sunset reflects on the water, forming sparkling bands of light. The distant horizon meets the sky, while the background is a blurred city skyline. The silhouettes of several tall buildings are faintly visible, with one towering tower standing out. The sky shows a gradient of colors at sunset, gradually transitioning from warm orange near the horizon to pale yellow and light blue above, with thin clouds. Bathed in sunlight, the edges are soft golden, and the composition uses a central composition. The figures serve as the visual focal points, occupying the main position. The blue fitness ball on the right creates visual balance, guiding the gaze to the right. The atmosphere of light and shadow is warm and tranquil. The backlight of the setting sun outlines the figures' contours, creating a soft halo. The reflected light spots from the sea add dynamism and depth to the image. The overall color scheme is mainly warm tones, creating a relaxed, pleasant, and vibrant atmosphere, as if it's an outdoor fitness time at dusk. It combines the positive energy of exercise with the tranquility brought by natural beauty. The visuals have a strong artistic sense and a sense of everyday life, like high-quality portraits taken with professional photography equipment, yet without losing authenticity and the warmth of everyday life. The details are rich, the light and shadow are delicate, and the colors harmonious, conveying the concepts of a healthy, beautiful, and free lifestyle. The entire scene is both visually striking and emotionally warm, offering moments of physical and mental joy",
