        {
          "id": "krea2-ab303f14a161cdce426cf944",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣车内沉思倚靠拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sat on a purple cushioned seat inside the carriage, leaning slightly forward, her right elbow resting on the backrest, and her left hand naturally hanging at her side. She wore an off-white short-sleeved ribbed knit top with clear patterns, hugging her figure and outlining soft curves. She paired light-colored shorts below, revealing her long legs. Her posture was relaxed yet slightly lazy, her expression calm yet tinged with a thoughtful tenderness and detachment. Her makeup was light and natural, with the interior of the carriage in the background, and pink curtains partially blocking the bright window behind, soft light streams in from outside the window, creating a warm backlight effect. The window frame edges are white, the curtain material is thin and gently swaying in the wind. The seats are made of deep purple fabric with fine textures and stitching details. Next to the seat is a yellow and blue backpack, with clearly visible shoulder straps. The body has black webbing and metal fasteners. On the right side of the foreground, there is a blurry orange-yellow object, possibly part of a drink bottle or a handheld item. The composition uses a close-up perspective, with the figure occupying the main subject. The head is slightly tilted, creating an overall composition that is private, quiet, and full of storytelling. The use of light and shadow is clever: backlighting shines from the upper right, enveloping the figure's outline in a soft halo, creating a distinct contour light. The shadow transitions naturally, creating a warm and hazy visual texture. The colors are mainly warm tones, interwoven with off-white, purple, pink, yellow, and other colors to form a harmonious and unified palette. The overall image has a grainy texture reminiscent of film photography and slight color shifts, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera. It features a retro filter effect, with slight vignetting at the edges to enhance the visual focus of the central subject. The background is moderately blurred, highlighting the main subject, while retaining some environmental information to enhance the sense of realism in the space. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, gentle, and nostalgic, full of poetic moments from everyday life—like an ordinary yet touching moment captured during an afternoon train journey. The details are rich, from clothing textures to light and shadow changes, all feel very realistic, presenting a style that combines artistry with everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
