        {
          "id": "krea2-67465cea52c823d58cfad9b1",
          "alias": "单女白T恤户外愤怒坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor stone steps, wearing a loose white T-shirt printed with colorful cartoon patterns, including a red heart and several expressive cartoon characters. Her fingers are slightly bent, she wears a small bracelet on her wrist, her right hand resting naturally on her knee, legs crossed, and light-colored sneakers. Her expression is slightly contemplative and gentle. There is a small tattoo on her neck, and the background is a stone wall made of irregular stones, rough on the surface, with some stones covered in green moss Scattered beneath the wall are stones and dead leaves of various sizes. On the right side is a transparent mesh tote bag containing items, with vague bottles and paper visible. Sunlight streams diagonally from the upper left of the frame, creating soft shadows on the figures. The light is bright but not glaring, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The middle frame features stone steps, stone walls, and a tote bag, with a background of distant stone walls and vegetation. The layers are distinct and visually distinct, with warm yellow tones as the main tone. The white T-shirt under sunlight shows a natural sheen, while the shadowed areas appear deep and authentic. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and natural, as if capturing a quiet and beautiful moment in daily life. The image texture is delicate and rich, with a strong sense of presence and life, as if casually shot with a regular camera, without excessive embellishment. It preserves the original light and shadow changes and environmental textures, giving a sense of warmth, authenticity, and simplicity",
