        {
          "id": "krea2-4d9f3158c306cfc4711ce805",
          "alias": "单女围巾窗边站立侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a pale yellow round-neck short-sleeved top with soft texture and soft colors, perfectly complementing the overall warm tone. She holds an off-white knitted yarn piece in both hands, possibly an earmuff or a small scarf. The knit texture is clearly visible, the stitches are even and delicate, and the edges have a natural curled edge. The yarn is fluffy and soft, giving a warm handmade touch. Her fingers are slender, Her nails are neatly trimmed, painted with light pink nail polish. Standing indoors, the background is a blurred home scene, with a faint beige wall with subtle textures. Behind her is a wooden shelf displaying items, including a green-packaged box and a container covered with plaid fabric. The background is blurred, creating a shallow depth effect that highlights the main figure. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, head slightly tilted, body slightly angled to the frame, creating a friendly and natural posture and a strong sense of interaction. Light and shadow come from the left side of the frame, soft natural light streams through the window, creating a warm backlight effect. The shadows transition smoothly, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere full of life. The main color tone of the painting is warm yellow, creating a comfortable and pleasant home feel, rich in details, and authentic texture. It feels like a real moment casually taken at home with a regular camera, capturing a quiet and beautiful everyday moment with a strong sense of immersion and emotional resonance",
