        {
          "id": "krea2-679a8c290df6d8197325df06",
          "alias": "单女白礼服镜前神秘站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman lounges lazily on the floor covered with transparent plastic film. She wears a light, flowing white lace spaghetti strap gown, the hem and semi-transparent sleeves creating a hazy texture in the light. Her left hand stretches naturally, fingers slightly bent near a circular mirror fragment, while her right hand is slightly curled at one side of her body, creating a relaxed and expressive overall posture creating a tranquil yet dynamic atmosphere. The foreground is scattered with geometric lenses and broken glass of various sizes, including triangles, circles, and irregular polygons. These lenses reflect light from the surroundings, creating a fragmented and mysterious visual effect. Interwoven with transparent plastic film, they produce rich refraction and reflection, enhancing the spatial layering and contrast between solid and void. The middle section shows the woman's body and clothing, their outlines faintly visible in soft blue-violet tones. The wrinkles and sheer relationships of the fabric are clearly visible, highlighting the softness and drape of the fabric. On the left side of the background is a classical-style white ceramic vase or decorative vessel, elegantly shaped with curled patterns and embossed details. The surface is smooth and delicate, with a faint sheen under cool-toned lighting. It quietly stands on the plastic film, forming a strong stylistic clash with the modern lenses. The entire scene is enveloped in a misty blue filter, with a cool blue-purple tone complemented by pale blue and gray-white. It creates a surreal dreamlike feeling. Light is projected from the upper left, forming a soft, diffused light. The shadow edges are blurred, the direction of the light source is clear but moderately intense, and highlights and reflective streaks are created on the lens and plastic surfaces. The interplay of light and shadow enhances the image's sense of depth and realism. The composition uses a top-down perspective, with the subject positioned slightly to the right center, head facing the camera, body extending diagonally, forming a smooth visual flow. The area around the frame is filled with negative space, making the subject stand out even more. At the same time, the folds and ripples of the plastic film add dynamic texture to the image, creating a balanced yet varied composition that evokes emotional resonance. The reflections and scattering of the lenses guide the gaze to roam throughout the frame, enhancing the desire to explore. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, ethereal, and slightly detached, as if immersed in a dimension frozen by time. It resembles a carefully planned artistic photography project or a private moment accidentally captured in daily life, offering strong visual impact and poetic beauty. The images resemble those shot in professional studios using softboxes and color filters, while retaining the slight noise and undersaturated color texture that amateur equipment may cause. The overall style blends Japanese photo, Art Nouveau, and futuristic elements, presenting a unique aesthetic experience that lies between reality and fantasy",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
