        {
          "id": "krea2-dfa0753a5f9ab0a4ecbcd824",
          "alias": "单女紫连衣裙泳池冷淡站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by a shallow pool in the city square, wearing an elegant purple gradient spaghetti strap long dress. The material is light and translucent, with subtle luster and pleats, presenting a gentle transition from deep purple to light purple to off-white. The dress fits the figure perfectly, outlining smooth curves. The straps are thin and naturally drape. Her right hand rests gently on the strap, while her left hand hangs naturally, her posture calm and confident. On her feet is a pair of black flats, which contrast with the overall look, making her look both fashionable and comfortable, naturally draped over her shoulders. Her makeup is delicate but not heavy, highlighting natural beauty. She slung an off-white canvas bag across her left shoulder. The simple shape adds a touch of casual vibe. The background is a modern urban building, with glass curtain walls reflecting the sky and surrounding scenery, presenting a cool geometric line. Several green trees dot the scene, lush and vibrant, with a few white umbrellas and some blurred figures in the distance, creating a daily atmosphere in the public space. In the foreground, a calm water surface reflects people, trees, and buildings. A mirror effect is formed, with slight ripples on the water surface creating gentle ripples that enhance the layering and realism of the composition. The middle ground features the female subject and the gray stone slab floor beneath her feet. The ground is flat and clean, with clear edges. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, guiding the line of sight naturally. The background is blurred to make the subject stand out more. Light and shadow come from natural daylight, soft and even, without strong shadows, presenting a warm tone reminiscent of morning or evening. The overall atmosphere is calm and elegant. It carries a poetic urban lifestyle, with delicate texture, harmonious colors, and rich details. It looks like a high-quality street photo taken with a professional camera, with cinematic visual texture while preserving the intimacy and authenticity of daily life. The overall style blends fashion, art, and lifestyle aesthetics, conveying a calm, confident, and elegant modern feminine temperament. The color palette is mainly purple, green, and gray, complemented by white and black, creating a contrasting and harmonious color scheme. The image is full of narrative quality. It evokes fleeting tranquility and self-expression in the city, with balanced composition, clear visual guidance, natural light and shadow transitions, and a serene yet emotionally rich atmosphere",
