        {
          "id": "krea2-8492b5e454aef1eb20b130ff",
          "alias": "单女灰短裤公园严肃倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "Her fingers are slender, and she wears a multi-layered bracelet on her wrist—wooden bead strings, metal chains, and a small pendant—adding an artistic touch. She wears a white short-sleeved top with vertical stripes, with ruffled designs at the collar and cuffs. The sleeves are puff-sleeved, with the hem slightly exposing the waist, paired with gray high-waisted shorts. The overall look is fresh and sweet with a touch of Japanese Lolita style. A pink small bag is slung across her shoulder, with a white pearl chain strap. The bag is soft and puffy, presenting a gentle pleated texture. Her body leans slightly forward, her left arm bent over the railing, her posture elegant and relaxed. The background is a blurred green lotus pond, with broad and dense lotus leaves varying shades of green. A few pink lotus flowers can be faintly seen dotted throughout. In the distance, gray-white building walls and stone steps are structured, with clean lines and calm tones. The composition uses a medium perspective. The figure is positioned slightly to the center on the left side of the frame, occupying about two-thirds of the space. The right side is left blank to guide the gaze into the distance. Using shallow depth of field, the foreground is sharp and clear, while the background gradually blurs, creating a strong sense of layering between front and back. Light comes from the upper left, creating soft natural light and delicate shadow transitions, creating a warm and peaceful afternoon atmosphere. It forms a circular circulation with evenly distributed light and shadow, without strong contrasts, emphasizing soft textures and realistic details. The images have the realism of everyday amateur equipment, such as slight camera shakes, slight noise, and natural color reproduction, as if casually captured in a park or courtyard, capturing the tranquility and beauty of youth. The images are full of life atmosphere and poetic beauty, conveying a leisurely, gentle, and restrained mood, as if time stands still at this moment, leaving only tranquil moments flowing.",
