        {
          "id": "krea2-ab512d569b350c63ad63933b",
          "alias": "单女紫礼服街道自信坐持书",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden bench on a city street, wearing an elegant deep purple silk spaghetti strap gown. The hem of the skirt naturally drapes down the edge of the bench, and the silky fabric glows with a delicate sheen under soft light, presenting a sophisticated texture and flow. Her posture is relaxed and composed, her body slightly leaned back, her head lightly resting on the bench's backrest. Her makeup is delicate and natural, adding a touch of laziness and vitality. Her hands are folded on her lap, and her right hand holds an open magazine or art book. The cover pattern is blurry but faintly reveals artistic images, creating an atmosphere where art and life blend together. The benches are made of brown wood panels and dark cast iron frames, giving a retro style. The metal parts feature carved details, giving an elegant and solid look. The floor is paved with gray square tiles, neatly joined and reflecting subtle light and shadow. The background is a blurred urban street environment, including blurred building facades, display windows, and greenery. The buildings display light beige and gray-white tones, with clean lines reminiscent of modern urban life. A few green shrubs dot the sidewalk, injecting a touch of vitality into the scene. The overall composition uses a mid-field perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, forming the visual focal point. The shallow depth of field effect makes the foreground clear, the mid-field moderate, and the background completely blurred, highlighting the subject while maintaining spatial layering. The camera angle slightly looks down to enhance realism and immersion. Light comes from the front side, representing the soft glow of evening. The sunlight is warm and gentle, casting long shadows. The shadow transitions are natural, and the folds and changes in light and shadow are rich. The overall color palette is mainly warm brown, purple-gray, and off-white, harmoniously unified to create a quiet, gentle, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The images are full of storytelling and emotional tension, as if capturing a fleeting, tranquil moment in daily life. It resembles a real scene shot with a high-resolution camera in natural light, featuring a grainy texture and color reproduction reminiscent of film photography, rich in detail, and delicate light and shadow. Overall, it presents a realistic style that combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life, suitable for expressing emotions, Themes of fashion or urban life",
