        {
          "id": "krea2-76d733c07e5b9bc787f39e78",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫商店坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bench in a city night, wearing a white turtleneck top, pink knit cardigan, and a light pink pleated long skirt. She pairs deep red Mary Jane shoes with white stockings, sitting gracefully sideways. Her overall look is sweet and vintage, with a blurry city night scene in the background. Lights flicker along the streets, creating a beautiful light spot. In the distance, you can see the silhouettes of pedestrians and buildings. The ground is paved with gray bricks, and a red curved line winds through the frame. In the foreground is a corner of a wooden bench and a metal base. The middle shot features the main figure and benches, while the background features blurred street scenes and lighting. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned on the right side, leaving space on the left to show the environment. Light and shadow come from surrounding streetlights and shop lights, creating a soft warm yellow tone. Light shines from the upper left, creating delicate transitions of light and shadow on the figure, creating a warm and tranquil urban night atmosphere. The overall image has a slight film texture and graininess, simulating everyday amateur camera shooting. The color saturation is moderate and contrast is low. It retains rich detail layers, with a high degree of background blur highlighting the main figure. The edges of the frame have slight vignetting to enhance the sense of focus. The color palette is mainly pink, white, brown, and yellow, forming a harmonious and unified visual style. The composition is stable and storyful, as if capturing a quiet night moment. The characters' expressions are natural and friendly, full of life atmosphere, presenting a gentle and serene urban nightwalker image, as if waiting for someone or lost in memories. The image is rich in detail and textures are clear. The knit textures of the characters' clothing, the pleats of their skirts, and the shine of their shoes are all clearly visible. The lighting in the background creates a circular bokeh, enhancing the artistic beauty of the scene. The overall atmosphere is warm yet tinged with a touch of loneliness, like a silent nocturne telling ordinary yet moving stories of the city",
