        {
          "id": "krea2-94967047cf72bf136db651d1",
          "alias": "单女米外套城市忧伤站立注视（2）",
          "prompt": "She wears a beige wide-sleeved cape-style jacket, paired with a black short skirt and black stockings, paired with high-heeled patent leather pointed shoes. In her right hand, she carries a small black clutch, elegantly turning sideways to look back at the camera. The overall look is simple yet stylish, with the main subject positioned slightly to the right of the composition's center, occupying the main visual space and forming a strong visual focal point. In the foreground is a wooden walkway covered with golden fallen leaves, layer upon layer of leaves, with colors ranging from light yellow to deep orange, delicate texture, and some leaf edges curled. In stark contrast to the dark wooden panels, the middle is a full-body female figure, her body slightly twisted, presenting graceful curves. The hem of her cloak flutters gently in the wind, forming soft pleats. The black short skirt and stockings outline the lines of her long legs. The metal fasteners of her high heels reflect faint light in the light. The background is a dense autumn forest, with leaves mainly bright golden yellow mixed with a few green leaves. The branches crisscross, creating rich layering. The sky is faintly visible through gaps in the canopy, with a grayish-white tone, hinting at cloudy or misty weather. The composition uses a vertical frame, presenting the figure intact from feet to head. The extended lines of the walkway guide the gaze deeper into the distance, creating a quiet yet slightly detached atmosphere. The light and shadow are soft diffused light without obvious shadows, evenly diffused on the characters and environment, highlighting color saturation and texture. The overall atmosphere is warm and melancholic, with a strong autumn vibe. The color palette is dominated by warm yellow, supplemented by beige, black, and woody brown, creating a harmonious color scheme. It has the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting, as if captured with a mobile phone or regular camera. The details are rich, the texture clear, the veins of fallen leaves, the sheen of stockings, and the fabric texture of cloaks all clearly visible. Overall, it presents a scene of urban women expressing their personal style in a natural environment, blending the sense of life with artistic beauty. The composition is stable, the viewpoint is slightly low, enhancing the character's uprightness. The background is moderately blurred to highlight the main subject, and the visuals are full of storytelling, as if telling a story about autumn, Moments of loneliness and beauty, natural transitions of light and shadow, rich yet authentic colors, presenting an overall autumn aesthetic that is tranquil, elegant, and slightly melancholic",
