        {
          "id": "krea2-5ef3c2f8fcd1590f9f37c72f",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙家中微笑坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the stone steps by the rice fields, wearing a white floral sleeveless dress with a light and flowing hem, the straps naturally hanging down, presenting a casual yet elegant summer vibe. She wears a brown cloth headscarf with red floral patterns, the edges slightly curled and gracefully draped over her shoulders. She turns sideways to look back at the camera, wearing a gentle and serene smile, revealing a subtle sense of happiness and closeness to nature. Her legs are together, wearing bright yellow rain boots, forming a striking contrast with the surrounding green rice fields. She appears lively yet playful. She sits on a stretched white lace fabric, with delicate tassel decorations along the edges, giving it a soft and delicate texture. Next to it is a bouquet of fresh flowers wrapped in kraft paper, featuring pink roses, white daisies, and some green leaves for decoration. The colors are soft and fresh. The overall composition uses a three-part layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the center on the right side of the painting, with the gaze facing upward to the left, creating a sense of extension and spatial layering. In the foreground is a clear female subject and bouquet, while in the center is a vast green rice field. In the distant background is a blurred cluster of village buildings, with simple house outlines and mainly gray-white colors. Further away are rolling mountains, and the sky displays a soft pale yellow hue. Near dusk, warm light fills the entire scene, with light slanting down from the upper right, creating a warm backlighting effect. The figures are surrounded by golden halos, with soft shadows. The overall light and shadow transition is natural, creating a peaceful and peaceful atmosphere full of pastoral poetry and romance. The main colors of the painting are green, white, and yellow. Complemented by the reddish-brown headscarf and the pink-white flowers, the color coordination is harmonious and unified, forming a smooth visual flow. The image has a strong realistic style, with rich details and clear textures—such as the grain of rice leaves, the woven texture of fabrics, and the folds of petals—all clearly visible. It also has a slight film texture, simulating the natural graininess and slight noise of amateur camera shooting, presenting an overall beautiful moment casually captured in daily life, like a casual snapshot from a country trip—authentic and warm. The composition is full but not crowded, with just the right amount of blank space, giving a breathing space. The depth of field is clearly distinguished, the foreground is clear, the middle is slightly blurred, and the background is further blurred, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is warm and healing, allowing people to feel the harmony between humans and nature, as well as the beauty and tranquility found in simple life",
