        {
          "id": "krea2-a86b47df19ce2b93fe4c36ff",
          "alias": "单女白内衣城市忧伤坐躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window, dressed in white lace lingerie and a gray knit cardigan, wearing a gray knit hat. Her expression is slightly melancholic and contemplative. Her body leans slightly back against the window frame, legs crossed, wearing white ankle socks, with a purple cushion peeking out at her feet. The overall atmosphere is private, quiet, and slightly fragile. On the left side of the painting is a semi-transparent white curtain that softly blocks some light, creating a hazy effect of light and shadow. The background is a simple interior space, with walls in light gray and white, and the right wall in a deep gray-green, creating a visual contrast of warm and cool tones. Soft natural light streams in from the upper left, creating a delicate transition between light and shadow. The overall composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, body tilted diagonally, enhancing the image's dynamic and visual direction. The background uses simple walls and blurred greenery outside the windows to provide spatial depth and environmental information. The colors are mainly gray-white, light gray, and off-white, accented with purple cushions and light blue nail polish, creating a calm atmosphere dominated by cool tones. The lighting is soft and directional, emphasizing three-dimensionality and realism. The overall style combines everyday and artistic elements, resembling real moments captured with a regular camera, with slight film grain and natural noise, simulating the texture of amateur equipment shooting. The images are full of emotional tension and storytelling. It presents the inner world of urban youth in solitary moments, combining gentle beauty with a hint of subtle loneliness and contemplation. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, as if time has frozen in this moment, with the characters and environment merging into one, forming a portrait full of the breath of life and emotional depth",
