        {
          "id": "krea2-7938a838fcc3f49c5246da99",
          "alias": "单女绿毛衣室内忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a dimly lit indoor setting, wearing a soft green knit sweater that gives off a light, flowing feeling. Her hands are folded on the table, and on her right ring finger is a simple silver ring. Her posture is relaxed yet slightly contemplative, her expression showing a faint melancholy and thoughtful mood, as if immersed in her own world. Her overall expression is calm and full of storytelling. In the foreground is a rough wooden tabletop with obvious grain and traces of time, and three glass cups are placed on the tabletop. Two of them are transparent carved wine glasses with diamond-shaped checkered patterns on the body; the other is a deep green glass with thick walls and a heavy texture. The glass contains clear liquid, possibly ice water or beverages. Tiny droplets condense on the rim, reflecting a soft glow. In the center sits a pure white flower with layered petals, a pale yellow center resembling a daisy or similar wildflower, resting quietly on the table, forming a striking contrast with the surrounding cool tones and adding a touch of purity and vitality. The background is a blurry kitchen environment, where you can see the white tiled walls and the outlines of some kitchen utensils, such as electric kettles and cabinets, but all are blurred to create a shallow depth of field effect, making the main figure stand out more. The composition uses close-ups, with the characters positioned slightly to the right of the frame, guiding the viewer's gaze to the left, creating a sense of visual extension. At the same time, strong contrast of light and shadow is used to outline the figure's outline clearly and three-dimensionally, with the light source coming from the upper right of the frame. Simulating sunset or warm light slanting in from outside creates a strong backlight effect, forming a bright halo overhead to enhance the sense of depth. The overall color scheme is mainly cool green and warm yellow, with cool tones coming from the background and shadowed areas of the table, creating a warm and cool contrast that creates a tranquil yet slightly melancholic atmosphere. The overall image has the texture of film photography, with slight graininess and color shifts, simulating the effects of vintage camera shooting. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, details rich, composition is compact, and visual guidance is clear. It evokes a moment captured unintentionally in daily life, full of authenticity and artistic atmosphere, as if a frozen moment of time records an ordinary yet emotionally charged moment",
          "description": "",
