        {
          "id": "krea2-e211ad8f7d6517d54521c50b",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫广场沉思倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a pair of transparent, square-framed glasses, the lenses reflecting slightly, revealing a quiet and slightly lazy contemplative expression. Her makeup is delicate but not heavy, giving her an overall gentle and intellectual aura. She wears a white turtleneck knit sweater with clearly visible fabric textures, sleeves naturally folded over her arms, forming soft pleats. Her arms are crossed and resting on magazines, elbows supporting her body, slightly leaning in a relaxed and casual pose. In the foreground is an open fashion magazine, the paper glowing with an off-white sheen. The pages feature blurry English text and layout, some of which can be recognized as words like \"Saorise Ronan.\" The edges of the magazine are slightly curled, showing signs of use. Below the magazine, a dark green book or box can be vaguely seen, along with scattered envelopes, cards, and small red items. The background is a light beige wall with subtle textures. Light softly streams in from the left side of the image, creating a warm backlighting effect that envelops the figures' outlines in a hazy halo. Creates a sense of three-dimensionality, with close-ups in the composition. The figure occupies the main position, with the head in the upper left and the gaze directed to the lower right, creating visual flow. The background is blurred to highlight the subject, creating a warm and tranquil lighting atmosphere. The tones are mainly warm white, beige, and light gray, creating a comfortable, private, and artistic spatial feel. The overall image looks like it was shot with a medium format film camera, featuring slight graininess and natural color shift, simulating the texture of real photography. Emphasizing authentic details and emotional expression, it carries the spontaneity and intimacy of everyday amateur equipment shooting, as if capturing the most authentic moment under the afternoon sun",
