          "id": "krea2-5e69583c0ec7a326055d8c66",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫公寓愤怒躲藏",
          "prompt": "She wears an off-white turtleneck knit sweater with a tight cut that perfectly outlines her curves. The fabric is delicate and soft, with clearly visible texture, presenting a warm and fitted texture. The cuffs feature delicate ribbed designs, and a row of small buttons faintly peeking out at the wrists. She pairs a pink tweed mini skirt made of finely woven yarn, presenting a soft pink-and-white color scheme. The texture is thick and layered, with a retro elegance style. The overall clothing is simple yet detailed, showcasing a temperament that combines intellect and gentleness. The figure's posture is natural and relaxed, with the body slightly turned to the camera and the head slightly turned, revealing a healthy and natural glow. The background is a pure white wall with a smooth and flat surface free of any cluttered elements. The light is evenly and soft, illuminating from the front slightly left, creating a natural shadow transition. This enhances the three-dimensional effect of the figures, with soft light and shadow variations on the neck, shoulders, and arms, highlighting the texture of the clothing and the lines of the body. The composition uses a medium-shot portrait, with the subject occupying most of the space, positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, leaving a suitable left blank space to create a sense of breathing and visual balance. The perspective is level and the camera focuses on the upper body, creating an overall atmosphere that is peaceful, pure, and elegant, with a unique minimalist beauty characteristic of Japanese photography. The color palette is mainly light off-white and pastel, harmoniously unified. The light is soft and not glaring, presenting a warm and realistic texture, as if shot with a professional camera under indoor lighting. It offers a high degree of realism and artistic expression, while preserving unintentional natural moments from daily life. It is like a carefully arranged yet unpretentious personal portrait, with rich image details that showcase photographic-level precision and precise control of light and shadow",
