        {
          "id": "krea2-700336b4ad657c6d1a0a84c2",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔桌边沉思站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing an olive green V-neck lace short-sleeve top and light blue high-waisted flared jeans stands in a modern, minimalist indoor space, gracefully leaning sideways against the edge of a dark wooden dining table. Her left hand gently touches a red drink decorated with lemon slices on the table, while her right hand hangs naturally and she wears white pointed high heels. The overall look is fashionable and full of everyday life. The main figure is positioned slightly in the center of the left side of the frame, leaning slightly forward and lowering her head to gaze at the table, creating a tranquil and contemplative atmosphere. The foreground shows the figure and the dining table, including a red drink in a transparent glass, yellow lemon slices floating on the rim, an open book on the table, and a metallic plate. These elements enrich the layers of the composition and guide the viewer closer to the figure. The middle ground consists of the entire figure, some furniture, and the background wall. The dark brown leather dining chair has a black metal frame, with smooth backrest lines and neatly arranged chairs creating a symmetrical beauty. The background is a light gray wall separated by dark wood. The clean geometric structure enhances the modern feel of the space, while faintly visible distant blurred door frames or passage outlines increase the depth of the image. The composition uses a third-section layout, with figures occupying the left half of the frame and the right side emphasizing space. The camera angle is slightly overlooked, presenting a realistic everyday shoot. Visual guidance starts with drinks and books in the foreground, creating a warm and soft lighting atmosphere. Natural light from the left and indoor warm light sources work together to create a delicate transition between light and shadow, while the right side is in slight shadow. The texture of the clothing and the wrinkles on the denim fabric are clearly visible, the tabletop reflects a soft sheen, and the floor is made of dark wood grain, contrasting with the light-colored walls. The overall color scheme is mainly earthy tones, blending olive green, light blue, brown, and gray-white, creating a peaceful and comfortable living scene. The image texture is close to real camera shooting, with slight noise and lens distortion, as if you were casually capturing indoor photos with a regular consumer-grade camera. Details are authentic and natural, without excessive embellishment, emphasizing the beauty of everyday moments. It offers a strong sense of immersion and artistic appeal",
