        {
          "id": "krea2-e792ce392a172094584136be",
          "alias": "单女透视灰毛衣城市沉思坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a light-colored wooden floor, leaning slightly forward, legs naturally crossed and extended, her posture relaxed and elegant. She wears a loose gray knit sweater with clear and delicate texture, featuring diamond and spiral knit patterns. The cuffs and hem feature ribbed trim, giving the overall texture a warm and solid feel. The sweater is slightly loose, revealing part of the waist and the edge of the white inner layer. She wears black sheer stockings, with smooth and slightly reflective surfaces, natural leg lines, and feet slightly curled. One foot is slightly raised, with the toes lightly touching the ground, forming a gentle arc. The expression is calm yet tinged with a touch of gentleness and calm. The background is a simple, light gray-white wall with subtle textures, creating a clean and crisp sense of space. Light comes from the front left of the painting, softly and evenly casting on the figure, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. The shadows are light to highlight the main contour, while a faint shadow is cast on the floor to enhance the sense of spatial depth. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly above the center of the frame, and the head, The torso and legs form a stable visual triangle structure, emphasizing expression and emotion. The foreground features a clear wood-grain floor with delicate texture and warm colors. The middle ground shows the full-body portrait of the person, rich in detail—from sweater textures to stockings—all clearly visible. The background remains minimalist to avoid distraction. The overall color scheme is mainly gray, white, and black, paired with warm yellow tones of wood to create a warm and cool contrast, creating a quiet, comfortable, and slightly intimate atmosphere. The light and shadow layers are rich but not abrupt. It presents a realistic texture similar to everyday home camera or mobile phone shooting, as if on a quiet afternoon with sunlight slanting through the window into the room, capturing the natural and authentic moment. The image has a strong sense of everyday life and life, while preserving the aesthetic tension of photography. The color saturation is moderate, details are highly faithful, and the overall atmosphere is both warm and slightly artistic and distant, making it suitable for portraying the daily lives of modern urban youth. The image style lies between realistic photography and artistic portraiture. Combining documentary quality with aesthetic appeal, it presents a natural beauty unadorned with no artificial embellishment",
