        {
          "id": "krea2-7e257918c56045e15e41d87b",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫摄影棚媚态站立持书",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a pure white background, wearing a loose light blue vertical striped shirt. The shirt sleeves are casually rolled up above the elbows, with the neckline slightly open, revealing the neck line and collarbone. She pairs black shorts and black stockings, paired with black high heels. The overall look blends preppy style with sexy elements. Her right hand holds a red and black plaid tie, one end of the tie hanging over her chest, the other pulled near her shoulder, her left hand tucked at her waist, body slightly tilted. presenting a confident yet slightly provocative posture, naturally draped over shoulders and chest, with a cold and focused expression with a slight sense of detachment. The composition centers on the figure, using medium shots that occupy most of the image, fully visible from head to ankle. The background is a simple pure white wall, and the floor is dark gray or black, creating a strong contrast between light and dark. Light comes from the left side of the front, softly illuminating the subject, with subtle shadows concentrated on the right side and the ground, highlighting three-dimensionality and contours. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is clean and crisp, with the texture of a professional studio. The color palette is mainly blue and white, accented with a red tie as a visual focal point. The color contrast is sharp yet harmonious, and the visual style combines the refinement of a fashion magazine feature with the realism of everyday capture. It feels like a high-end camera shot in a minimalist studio, while maintaining a casual, effortless natural state. The lens focuses on the upper body and posture details, with very little background blur. Emphasizing the clear relationship between subject and environment, the composition is stable and symmetrical, with the figure's center of gravity centered, creating a visual effect that is both calm and full of tension. The overall atmosphere combines the sharpness of modern urban energy with a hint of youthful rebellion, like a silent declaration of identity and expression. The image details are rich, from the wrinkles of the shirt to the glossy reflections on the surface of the stockings, all clearly visible, showcasing extremely high image quality and expressiveness, as if captured by a professional-grade full-frame camera paired with a large-aperture prime lens. The transitions between light and shadow are smooth, colors are faithfully restored, without signs of excessive embellishment, presenting a unique beauty that lies between artistic creation and life documentation",
