        {
          "id": "krea2-b6a234917c12824a3cf0b3db",
          "alias": "单女外套车厢忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of the glass screen doors of the subway platform, slightly tilting her head to look at the camera as if silently speaking something. She wears a loose dark coat paired with a white crew-neck T-shirt underneath, carrying a black backpack. The overall look is simple yet casual. In the foreground is a transparent glass screen door, on which fine water vapor condenses and blurred reflections create a hazy visual effect. Some water droplets and mist still remain on the glass, enhancing the dampness and realism of the image. The middle shot is inside the subway platform. Several blurry pedestrian figures walk or wait in the background, dressed in dark clothes and moving naturally—some looking down at their phones, others staring ahead, creating a sense of everyday life's flow. The neatly arranged fluorescent lights on the platform emit a cool white glow, illuminating the entire space, but the lighting is uneven—some areas appear bright, others in shadow, creating a strong contrast of light and dark. The background is the extension of the subway tunnel, with distant lights gradually diminishing, creating a perspective effect that guides the gaze deeper into the distance The entire scene presents a tranquil urban nighttime atmosphere. The composition uses low-angle downward shots to highlight the main subject, making her appear taller and more noticeable. At the same time, the glass's reflection and refraction effects add layers and complexity to the image. The visual guide starts from the foreground glass and finally extends deep into the background tunnel, forming a clear visual path. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by cool tones, with blue and gray dominating, creating a cool, lonely, and slightly melancholic mood. The light mainly comes from the fluorescent lamps above, creating a top-down illumination effect that enhances the sense of depth. The overall image has slight graininess and noise, simulating the effect of shooting with a high-sensitivity camera. It feels like capturing real moments casually with amateur equipment in a dim environment. The rich details enhance the authenticity and sense of everyday life. The overall style combines artistic and everyday elements, resembling a carefully composed photographic work or a moment accidentally captured in an ordinary moment. Full of storytelling and emotional tension, it seems to evoke the overlooked loneliness and contemplation of urban life.",
