        {
          "id": "krea2-eb2257cd216c0d4e1ea766b5",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣躺阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman lies sideways on a wooden floor, her head resting on a neatly stacked stack of old books. Her body is slightly curled, wearing a thick gray coarse knit sweater with loosely folded cuffs at her wrists, revealing her slender wrists. She gently flips the pages with her right hand while supporting the book with her left, her movements natural and relaxed, as if immersed in a world of reading. In the foreground is the book in her hand and part of her arm. The pages are yellowed and slightly curled at the edges, the texture of the paper clearly visible, and a few withered yellow fallen leaves scattered among the pages. The middle shot is a close-up of her head and shoulders. Sunlight streams in diagonally from the upper left of the frame, creating rich layers of light and shadow. The background is a blurred wooden floor texture with a warm brown tone. Other books and a few sheets of paper are scattered on the floor, with some blurry outlines of objects faintly visible in the distance. The composition uses a low-angle overhead view, with the subject positioned slightly to the lower right of the frame, forming the visual center. Light shines from the upper left, creating a strong contrast of light and dark and warm yellow tones, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall image is full of artistic atmosphere and a sense of life, with warm yellow and brown tones as the main colors, unified and harmonious tones, soft light and shadow, rich details, and a cinematic style. The lens is a large-aperture prime lens, with well-controlled depth of field, natural background blur, and a highlight of the subject. The image texture is delicate, with slight graininess and film texture, simulating the effects of everyday amateur equipment. The overall atmosphere is quiet, warm, and healing, as if capturing a lazy reading moment on an afternoon, full of poetry and nostalgia",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
