        {
          "id": "krea2-e8e74289b914ed792a95b7a4",
          "alias": "单女绿外套车厢忧伤站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands inside a subway carriage, wearing a loose army green jacket with a light beige knit sweater underneath. She carries a dark backpack over her shoulder, and a brown leather handbag in her right hand. Her expression is calm with a hint of melancholy. The background is the inside of the subway carriage, with a Japanese electronic display above showing the words \"Shiba Park,\" orange indicator lights and the words \"てら\" below. The doors are made of metal with black rubber sealing strips along the edges. A white notice is affixed to the door glass with Japanese characters and patterns. A red warning sign is posted on the right side of the door. The interior lighting is warm yellow, gently illuminating the figures and creating a natural transition of light and shadow. The overall tone is cool with a slight teal-green filter, creating a tranquil urban nighttime atmosphere. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical style, with the figure positioned at the center occupying the main visual space. The doors and display in the background form vertical lines to enhance depth, while the foreground features clear details of the figures. The middle features the doors and part of the cabin structure. The background is a blurry interior of the carriage, with shallow depth of field highlighting the subject and attracting viewers' attention. Light and shadow shine from the front slightly above, with soft shadows creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall image has a cinematic texture, resembling a street documentary shot with a professional camera, while preserving the authenticity of everyday life. It's like a moment captured by amateur photographers using a phone or portable camera, full of storytelling and emotional tension. The edges of the frame are slightly darkened to enhance the effect of focus. The color layers are rich but not oversaturated, presenting a restrained yet elegant aesthetic. The text in the background is clear and legible but not overpowering, harmonizing with the overall atmosphere. The figures' postures are naturally relaxed, their bodies slightly leaned forward, and their hands hanging naturally, presenting a state of waiting or contemplation. The entire scene is filled with the loneliness and alienation of modern cities, yet it also contains a certain inner strength and resilience. The details are exquisite, from buttons and zippers on clothes to the stitching on backpacks, all clearly visible. It demonstrates extremely high image quality and artistic expressiveness",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
