        {
          "id": "krea2-92c96ebc3493adaac6b7133c",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙门俏皮站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a warm wooden indoor space, wearing an elegant white strapless long dress that fits her body perfectly, showing off smooth curves. The high slit design extends from mid-thigh to ankle, revealing a slender leg line. The skirt hangs naturally with slight pleats and a sheen, and the material appears to be silky satin or a high-end fabric. The left hand rests gently at the waist, while the right hand hangs naturally. On her wrist, she wears a simple thin bracelet, her overall posture dignified and full of charm. She is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the painting, her body slightly turned to form a graceful S-shaped curve. In the foreground is a clear female subject, and in the background is a lively wooden room. The walls and ceiling are made of dark wood panels, presenting a natural wood grain texture and warm texture. On the left is a half-open wooden door, behind which another room is faintly visible, with several blue-and-white chairs arranged there. On the right is a row of embedded bookshelves. Various books are neatly arranged above, with spines in rich colors such as purple, blue, and yellow. Above and around the bookshelves are wooden grille decorations, adding depth to the space. In the distance, you can see a staircase handrail leading to the second floor, made of black metal railings and wooden footboards. The floor is covered with smooth, dark wood flooring that reflects soft light. The entire scene is illuminated from the sides and above, creating a warm and soft light and shadow effect. The light source may be natural light passing through windows or indoor lighting. This bathes both the characters and the environment in a uniform warm yellow tone. The shadows are delicate, edges are soft, and there is no harsh contrast. The composition combines central symmetry and the rule of thirds, with the main subject centered to the right, background elements evenly distributed to create a sense of visual equilibrium. The foreground figures stand out clearly, the bookshelves and furniture in the center are richly detailed, and the background stairs and porches provide depth and spatial depth. The visual guide extends from the characters' line of sight into the depths of the background, enhancing the sense of depth in the painting. The overall atmosphere is warm and inviting. Tranquil and artistic, it seems to capture a static image capturing an elegant moment from everyday life. It has a strong realistic style and photographic texture, reminiscent of a professional camera while retaining the warmth of everyday life. The color palette is mainly warm brown, off-white, and light gray, accented by the book's colorful covers. The color combinations are harmonious, the transitions of light and shadow are natural, the images are delicate and richly detailed, creating a realistic and warm visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
