        {
          "id": "krea2-5f52f9489b3022a0fbafb36a",
          "alias": "单女黑西装办公室戏谑坐持手机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at a dark wooden office desk, wearing a black blazer and a short skirt set, with a white shirt underneath. The collar is slightly open, revealing her collarbone and part of her chest. A red lanyard badge hangs on her chest, and the transparent card holder bears her Japanese name \"Remu Suzumori.\" She lightly holds the badge in front of her, her posture dignified yet slightly teasing. She sits cross-legged on the desk, right leg on top, left leg below, black high heels, one foot lightly tapping the table, the other foot naturally hanging down. It exudes the calmness and tenderness of a professional woman. The background is a typical Japanese office environment: on the left side is an old-fashioned CRT monitor and keyboard, on the right a white landline phone and calculator, and behind it is a large green palm plant with spreading leaves, adding vitality to the cool-toned space. The wall is light beige, with a faint glimpse of a blue folder or poster corner. The overall composition uses a medium close-up, with the figure centered slightly to the left, body slightly tilted, head facing the camera, forming a stable and dynamic visual center. The foreground features smooth wood grain and edge contours of the tabletop, while the background uses shallow depth of field blur to highlight the subject while preserving environmental information. Light comes from the upper left of the frame, soft and even, simulating a mix of indoor ceiling lights and window light. Shadows transition naturally, clothing texture is clear, fabric folds and shoe reflections are realistic and believable, with black, white, and red as the main tones, complemented by lush greenery and dark brown on the wooden table, creating a professional yet intimate atmosphere. The overall style leans toward the authentic texture of everyday shooting, reminiscent of using the Canon 5D Mark III or Sony A7 series full-frame cameras paired with 50mm f/1.8 prime lenses capture photos under standard indoor lighting, with slight noise and film graininess. The image is slightly tilted, presenting a casual and everyday feeling of handheld shooting. The light and shadow layers are rich, the contrast is moderate, without strong shadows or overexposure, emphasizing the fusion of human emotions and scene details. The overall atmosphere strikes a balance between workplace rigor and personal charm, combining the restraint and elegance of professional women. It also contains a subtle sense of privacy and allure, while the work badge and hand movements become secondary visual focal points, enhancing the narrative and presenting an overall quiet and tension-filled moment, as if capturing a brief private moment away from work—authentic yet artistic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
