        {
          "id": "krea2-649cc5410836b0efe2902f50",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣办公室冷淡坐吸烟",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at a computer desk, her right hand resting on a black mechanical keyboard, fingers naturally resting on the mouse, her posture relaxed and natural. She wears a gray knit dress with a white turtleneck sweater underneath. The hem reaches mid-thigh, revealing her long legs. She sits barefoot on the floor, sitting in a black office chair, her body slightly tilted to the camera, creating a relaxed homely atmosphere. The overall vibe is fresh and sweet. The computer monitor is positioned on the left side of the screen, displaying an ancient-style game interface. The character stands by the lake dressed in red Hanfu The background features a nighttime landscape of mountains and waters, with a game UI element below the screen. The monitor is branded Dyson, with a black frame, a black stand, and a black mechanical keyboard with blue backlighting. The key layout is standard, with a black mouse pad placed next to it. The mouse is also black, and the desktop has a wood texture with a brownish-yellow color and a smooth surface. Small items are scattered on it, including a pack of snacks in red packaging and a metal ashtray that seems to contain cigarette butt residues. There is also a blue glowing USB device, possibly headphones or chargers. The edge of the desk has slight wear marks. The background is an indoor environment, the walls are light beige with a slightly rough texture. On the right rear is a dark gray curtain or curtain hanging along the wall, creating soft shadows. The room's light comes from the warm yellow light from the ceiling, with the light source located at the upper right of the figure, creating a natural transition of light and dark. The shadows are soft, the wrinkles of clothing are clearly visible, and the screen in the background emits a cool-toned blue light, contrasting with the warm indoor light. It creates a warm yet slightly technological atmosphere. The foreground features the desktop, keyboard, mouse, and other objects; the middle ground is the main subject; the background is the monitor and wall, creating clear layers and a strong sense of depth. The overall color palette is warm yellow and gray-black, accented with cool blue tones on the screen. The color coordination is harmonious, the light and shadow effects are delicate, evoking a casual everyday feel. There is also a slight studio-style lighting texture, creating a relaxed and cozy atmosphere full of modern home life. It feels like a quiet night, just finished a game, preparing to rest or chat with friends. The entire scene is authentic and natural, rich in detail, and highly immersive and story-driven",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
