        {
          "id": "krea2-78f195abe2f03219cb177f18",
          "alias": "单女灰短裤卧室沉思坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bed in her bedroom, her expression calm and slightly lazy, presenting an unadorned sense of realism. She wears a black long-sleeved top with the hem pulled up below her chest, revealing her waist and abdomen. She wears loose gray sports shorts with drawstrings at the waist. The overall outfit is casual and casual, full of the vibe of everyday life. Her hands are raised above her head, fingers interlaced to grasp the collar, and her body leans back slightly. Leaning against the white sheets and pillow, the posture is relaxed and full of tension, creating a private and comfortable atmosphere. The bed is neat, with natural wrinkles in the white sheets. The headboard is a wooden bed board in light brown with clear grain. The background wall is off-white, simple and clean, without excessive decoration. On the right front, there is a black backpack made of smooth leather or synthetic leather, with a slight reflective surface. The zipper and metal fasteners are clearly visible, and part of the backpack blocks the lower right corner of the image. This adds spatial layering. The composition uses a mid-field perspective, with the figure occupying the center-left position, body extending diagonally, spreading from the lower left corner to the upper right to form a visual guide. It then moves down along the arms and torso to the abdomen and legs, then turns to the right backpack, creating a smooth visual path. Light comes from the left side of the image, soft and warm, like natural light in the early morning or evening. The shadows are soft and not abrupt, and the overall light and shadow distribution is even, creating a quiet and comfortable indoor atmosphere. The color palette mainly consists of black, white, and gray. The colors are harmonious and unified, with a texture leaning toward film photography style, featuring slight graininess and low saturation, simulating real camera shooting effects. The lens is a medium-focus prime lens, such as 50mm, which brings natural perspective and shallow depth of field. The background is slightly blurred, highlighting the subject while retaining some environmental details to enhance the sense of space. The entire scene conveys a daily, private, authentic, and slightly artistic life moment, as if captured by a photographer with amateur equipment for an ordinary yet touching moment. The images present a unique aesthetic that lies between a fashion blockbuster and a record of life, combining the beauty of meticulously composed images with a casual, authentic warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
