        {
          "id": "krea2-9844674894c6563fa3a3926d",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤走廊沉思蹲",
          "prompt": "A woman squats on the steps beside an indoor doorframe, her expression slightly lazy and contemplative, as if thinking or waiting. She wears a light blue striped tank top and white shorts, white long socks and blue-and-white slippers, leans slightly forward, knees bent, hands naturally supporting the floor and knees, posture relaxed and casual, presenting a sense of improvisation from daily life. It occupies about one-third of the left side of the frame, with a corridor space with dark tiled walls in the background, with several blurred photos and papers pasted on it. To the right of the door frame is a pure white wall, creating a strong contrast between light and shadow. The middle shot is the space between the person and the door frame, with the door handle and key clearly visible. Light enters from the right, creating a soft side glow on the subject. The overall tone is cool, with a distinct teal tone, reminiscent of a film camera's texture. The image has slight graininess and noise, with slightly defocused edges, creating a retro nostalgic atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the person on the left side of the frame, leaving a blank space on the right to highlight the subject. This creates direct emotional communication, with uneven light and shadow distribution creating certain shadow layers. The overall atmosphere is quiet, intimate, and full of everyday life, like a real moment accidentally captured in a corner of the home. Shot with an old film camera with a 50mm prime lens, slow shutter speed, high sensitivity, natural noise and color shift, simulating the image texture of real shooting environments. The image features a slight vignetting effect to enhance center focus. The color palette mainly uses cool blue and gray-green, accented with a small amount of warm yellow lighting This creates a subtle contrast of warmth and coldness, presenting an artistic, decadent, yet authentic sense of youthful daily life, as if time has frozen in this moment, recording the most ordinary yet touching moments",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
