        {
          "id": "krea2-24128e2a44ac14692bdc5177",
          "alias": "单女黑外套城市冷淡站立出神",
          "prompt": "As night falls, the city shimmers with a warm and enchanting halo in the deep darkness. A woman stands on the sidewalk by the bridge, dressed in a black jacket, her shoulders slightly tilted, as if gazing into the distance or reminiscing about the past. There is a subtle transition of light and shadow, a hint of cool redness, and the overall makeup is delicate yet understated, highlighting the independence and calmness of an urban woman. In the foreground, she occupies the main position of the frame, her body slightly tilted, head slightly turned toward the camera, creating a dynamic visual balance. The background is a blurry city nightscape. Under long exposure, the lights of high-rise buildings transform into soft circular light spots, presenting a classic bokeh effect. Distant headlights trail flowing light trails, creating a strong sense of movement and the passage of time. The middle ground features the bridge deck's railings and ground, with lines extending into the distance, guiding the viewer deeper into the frame. The metallic texture of the railings is faintly visible in the dim light, and the ground reflects faint streetlights, enhancing the sense of depth in the space. The composition uses a center-offset three-part method. The figure is positioned on the left side of the frame, leaving space on the right side to extend the background light spots and traffic flow, creating a sense of breath and tension visually. At the same time, shallow depth of field is used to highlight the subject, making the figure stand out from the background. Following her line of sight, the natural direction extends to distant city lights, forming a cyclical viewing path. The lighting atmosphere is mainly warm yellow, with light from streetlights and buildings casting soft side light onto the figure, outlining contours while retaining delicate details in the shadows. Avoid overexposure or darkness, creating a private, tranquil, and story-filled nighttime atmosphere. The overall tone is warm but retains a certain cool contrast, enhancing the image's layers and emotional tension. The texture is close to what would be shot with a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens, featuring film-like graininess and natural color transitions. It feels like a randomly captured street moment, yet full of carefully crafted beauty. The entire scene conveys a sense of loneliness and self-reflection in a modern city. It carries the realistic atmosphere of everyday life while also containing poetry and philosophical reflection, making one imagine her current state of mind and the story behind it",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
