        {
          "id": "krea2-9b7f14d141be9c06adf73572",
          "alias": "单女黑制服持书",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a black school uniform jacket with a white shirt and a red bow tie tied over it. The player's shell was made of transparent material, revealing the tape structure inside. It was placed on an open book, the pages slightly curled, showing signs of use. The woman's right hand gently rests on the edge of the book, fingers slightly bent, her posture relaxed and natural. Her left hand is casually placed at her side, close to her body. In the foreground, dense green grass leaves are slender and sharply edged, with some leaves covering the shoulders and arms, creating natural shading and layering. The middle ground features the main figure and surrounding objects, such as books and a player, while the background is a distant blurry grass. It creates a sense of depth, with light slanting down from above, creating a soft shadow effect. Sunlight filters through the leaves, creating contrasts of light and shadow and enhancing the image's three-dimensionality. The overall color scheme is mainly green, paired with classic black, white, and red school uniform colors, creating a fresh, natural, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. Turning to the surrounding environment, it forms a complete narrative loop. The light and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, like a long summer afternoon memory. The image texture is delicate and authentic, as if shot with an old film camera. It features a slight graininess and soft color transitions, a moderate lens focal length, and a slightly blurred background, presenting a natural realism reminiscent of everyday amateur photography. The overall image is full of youthful energy and poetic beauty, evoking a simple and pure sense of beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
