        {
          "id": "krea2-842668c4e3677aa32e6dae90",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫城市忧伤站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways by the window, wearing a white shirt and dark jacket. She lowers her head slightly, her expression slightly melancholic and contemplative, revealing a quiet and reserved mood. The glass surface has slight water stains or stains, adding a sense of realism and the marks of time in the scene. The window frame is made of dark wood or metal, with slightly worn edges. Above the frame are faded blue graffiti or text, adding a touch of urban life. The background is a blurry outdoor scene, possibly a cloudy or dusk city streetscape. Light streams in diagonally through the window, creating a warm golden halo that creates a peaceful yet slightly melancholic atmosphere. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the right side of the frame and leaving space on the left for glass and reflections, creating visual balance and tension. The background is blurred to highlight the subject's emotional expression. The camera angle is slightly tilted to simulate everyday handheld shooting, enhancing realism and immersion. Shot with a medium format film camera, it features a slight graininess and warm color tones, similar to the Kodak Portra 400 film effect. The light is soft and directional, emphasizing three-dimensionality. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and taupe, creating a nostalgic, gentle, and slightly lonely atmosphere. The image is rich in detail, and all elements together create a moment full of storytelling, as if capturing an ordinary yet deeply emotional moment, like a fragment of life taken with an old camera. Carrying traces of warmth and memory",
