        {
          "id": "krea2-13afdff156ac4305bf9a1c66",
          "alias": "单女西装媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a deep burgundy haute couture professional suit. The jacket features a single-breasted design, tailored to the right length, with a matching silk bow tie tied at the collar. Underneath, she wears a black lace-patterned bra, showcasing both elegance and sensuality in professional charm. She holds a silver metal tray in her right hand and gently points her index finger at the overhead compartment above the cabin with her left hand, her posture professional and confident, her body slightly turning to the side. Presented with a graceful S-shaped curve, the foreground is a clear half-body close-up, occupying the main position. The background is a blurred cabin interior. Blue leather seats are neatly arranged, with passengers seated—some talking, others looking at their phones. In the distance, soft natural light streams through the portholes. The curved ceiling above the cabin is evenly distributed with LED light strips, creating bright and cozy light. The composition uses a centered composition, with figures centered, and shallow depth of field effects highlighting the subject. The blurred background enhances spatial layering, and the slightly upward viewing angle makes the figure appear more upright and noble. Light and shadow slant from the porthole into the cabin, creating a soft transition of light and shadow. The shadows are delicate, the texture of clothing is richly expressed, and the silky sheen and lace texture details are clearly visible. The overall atmosphere blends the professionalism and fashion of modern aviation services, creating a scene that is both realistic and slightly artistic, as if a real photo was taken with a high-resolution full-frame camera paired with a large-aperture lens, giving it a cinematic texture. The color palette is mainly warm, with burgundy and blue-gray forming a harmonious contrast. The image is clean and crisp, with rich details, full of everyday life while maintaining a sense of sophistication, presenting a daily yet highly attractive aerial service moment that lets people feel the comfort and beauty of the flight journey",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
