        {
          "id": "krea2-507a6e7be016c87379c0b5f5",
          "alias": "单女短裙户外俏皮站立",
          "prompt": "Low-angle downward view: Next, a woman stands outdoors in a sunny scene. The overall look is fresh and simple, exuding a youthful vibe. She stands slightly sideways, her body slightly tilted, her right hand lightly resting on the wall behind her, and her left hand hanging naturally. Her posture is relaxed and confident, presenting an expression that is both playful and gentle. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the composition, occupying the main visual space. The foreground is where the lower body touches the ground, showing the long lines of the legs. Light streaming down from above creates soft shadows along the edges of the legs and skirts. The background is a clear, cloudless blue sky, occupying most of the composition. The sky is pure and rich, presenting a strong cool tone. The middle is a metal mesh fence extending diagonally, extending from the lower left corner upward to the center of the painting. The fence is woven from fine metal wires, reflecting sunlight and showing a silvery-gray sheen. Behind the fence, the white roof edges and wall structures of the building can be faintly seen. The architectural style is simple and modern, with smooth walls and light gray or off-white colors. The details are clear but not flashy. On the distant right side, there are several utility poles and interlaced wires, slender and diagonally distributed, enhancing the spatial and realistic feel of the composition. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward shooting technique to emphasize the figure's upright posture and presence, while using the vast sky background to create an open and free atmosphere, extending down along the body's curve to the legs. Then, the diagonal lines of the fence guide the viewer deeper into the frame. The lighting effect mainly uses natural daylight, with light coming from the upper right side. The neck and shoulders have soft shadows, and the folds of the clothes have distinct layers of light and shadow. The lower hem of the skirt creates partial shadows due to obstruction, enhancing the sense of depth. The strong light from the sky makes the scene brighter but not overexposed, preserving rich details. The color scheme is mainly blue, white, and pink. The blue sky represents tranquility and freedom, the white T-shirt symbolizes purity and freshness, and the pink short skirt adds sweetness and vitality. The combination of these three elements creates a fresh, sunny, and vibrant visual experience. The overall atmosphere of the image is relaxed and pleasant, combining the warmth of everyday life with a certain artistic beauty. It feels like a real moment taken with an amateur camera, capturing a beautiful moment on a summer afternoon. The image texture is delicate, color saturation is moderate, details are rich, and there is no excessive embellishment, presenting a natural and authentic visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
