        {
          "id": "krea2-92acbfdba0a774cffc64fc41",
          "alias": "单女毛衣室内温柔坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a corner of the room, adding a touch of laziness and gentleness. She wears a vertically striped knit cardigan in pink and off-white, with a soft and elastic texture. The stripes are evenly distributed and clearly visible. The cardigan features a V-neck design, with a few small buttons on the front front as a decoration. Underneath, she wears a matching striped slip dress. The overall look is simple yet elegant. She sits cross-legged in a relaxed posture, her right hand gently resting on her knee, fingers long and slender, and her nails neatly trimmed. The left hand rests naturally at the ankle, the body leans slightly back, leaning against the light gray wall. The wall surface feels rough, with subtle graininess and slight texture. Light softly streams in from the left, creating a warm and evenly diffused light. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, with rich layers in the shadows and clear contours. The background is simple and clean, with no unnecessary decorations or distractions. The floor is covered with a light brown woven carpet, with clear texture and thick material. The overall composition uses medium to close shots. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, with the head slightly tilted and gazing directly at the lens, creating an intimate and tranquil atmosphere. The colors are mainly soft and warm tones, creating a harmonious and unified visual impression. The lighting and shadow are warm and tranquil, like an afternoon sunlight streaming into the room, capturing the most authentic and natural state of the subject. The image is rich in detail and lifelike, as if shot with a professional camera. It offers high-resolution image quality and delicate texture expression, while preserving the subtle realism of everyday life. It evokes a quiet, comfortable, and slightly artistic aesthetic of living. The overall image conveys a gentle, restrained, and story-rich beauty, like a precious image from a private album, capturing an ordinary yet touching moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
