        {
          "id": "krea2-09f8e2a317b0981ba3b252e4",
          "alias": "单女红泳装海滩害羞站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the shallow waters of a tropical beach, turning her back to the camera and slightly turning to look back, adding a touch of laziness and authenticity. She wears a red and black polka dot bikini, with thin-strap straps crossing over the shoulders and tied into a bow. The waistline flows smoothly to fit the body's curves, and the low-rise pants perfectly outline the contours of the hips. The overall look is simple yet sexy, with a hint of sheen, as if she has just stepped out of the sea. Crystal-clear droplets still hang on her body, shimmering with the slight movement of her body. She stands in the crystal-clear shallow sea. The sea water has reached her calves, causing gentle ripples at her ankles. The water reflects the blue sky and the outline of her legs, creating a soft interplay of light and shadow. The background is the vast, boundless blue ocean, calm as a mirror, merging with the pale blue sky in the distance. The skyline is distinct and distinct, with a few sparse white clouds drifting in the sky, light and graceful, like cotton blown by the wind, creating a fresh and bright summer atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-ground perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving space on the right to showcase the vast sea and sky. This creates a visual sense of balance and extension. The figure's posture is naturally relaxed, with one hand lightly touching the water surface and the other hand naturally hanging down. The body leans slightly forward, the head lowered, and the gaze looks downward, presenting a calm, reserved, and slightly shy emotional state. The light comes from directly above to the right, representing high-angle natural daylight. The sunlight penetrates the clouds and evenly falls on the figure's back and the sea surface, creating a soft shadow transition that enhances the sense of depth and texture. The light refraction in the seawater creates a semi-transparent green hue in the underwater part. Forms a gradient layer with the blue above, giving the overall image moderate color saturation, sharp contrast without glaring, and a strong summer vibe and vacation vibe. The photography style leans toward the realism of everyday shooting, simulating the effect of shooting outdoors under natural light with a professional camera or high-end phone. The lens focal length is moderate, depth of field is well controlled, and the background is moderately blurred, highlighting the subject while preserving environmental details. There is slight lens distortion and noise at the edges, mimicking the texture of real equipment shooting. The overall atmosphere is calm and warm. Full of vitality, it feels as if you can hear the gentle sound of waves lapping on the shore, feel the coolness of the sea breeze, and convey a pure, free, and nature-inspired aesthetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
