        {
          "id": "krea2-f791ab03a5621397224de1cd",
          "alias": "单女黑围裙桌边俏皮站立持杯",
          "prompt": "A female barista stands at the bar in a modern-style café. She wears a black sleeveless apron with a simple yet textured design. The straps are slim and hug the shoulder line, and the chest pocket features gold metal zipper details. She holds a white ceramic coffee cup in both hands, filled with freshly made lattes. The surface features clear and smooth latte art, presenting exquisite heart-shaped or leaf-vein-like artistic designs. The cup body is white and smooth. The edges are rounded. She lightly grips the handle with her right hand and supports the bottom with her left, her movements natural and poised. The bar is made of light wood, with clear grain and a warm texture. Professional coffee equipment is displayed on the counter. On the left is a silver-gray espresso machine with smooth lines, a black handle and control panel, and a stainless steel milk bottle and metal measuring cup beside it, reflecting a soft sheen. The bar edge is also covered with a black anti-slip mat. The background is a simple and bright indoor space, and the walls are off-white or light gray-white, clean and tidy Circular recessed downlights are installed on the ceiling, providing even, soft lighting and creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. In the distance, a black trash can and some furniture outlines can be faintly seen, but both are blurred. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned on the right side of the frame, body slightly angled to the camera, head slightly turned toward the viewer, creating a natural visual guide. The coffee cup and hand details are highlighted in the foreground, the middle shot focuses on the main figure and bar elements, background blur enhances spatial depth, and light and shadow come from above and foreground. The lighting is soft and even, without strong shadows. The overall color scheme is mainly black, white, and gray, accented with warm wood tones and metallic sheen, creating a modern, minimalist, clean, and lively scene. The visuals are highly realistic, with rich details, harmonious colors, and a warm and welcoming atmosphere, as if shot in a daily café, showcasing the professionalism and charm of professional women while blending in a touch of relaxed and pleasant lifestyle aesthetics",
