        {
          "id": "krea2-c48ebb6272f7c44883bfb688",
          "alias": "单女白T恤公寓沉思坐持手机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a gray fabric single sofa, her expression slightly lazy and contemplative. Her left hand gently strokes the back of her head, while her right hand holds a black smartphone. Her fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed, wearing a white tight tank top and white shorts, paired with a black zip-up jacket casually open, revealing her collarbones and shoulder lines. Her legs are long and well-proportioned, wearing pure white mid-calf socks, with slightly curled ankles, her posture relaxed and elegant. Her legs are crossed and overlapped, knees bent, feet flat on the edge of the sofa, body slightly leaning to the side. presenting a casual yet aesthetically pleasing seating posture. In the foreground is a gray suede sofa, with metal rivets decorating the armrest edges for a delicate texture. The sofa backrest is tall, providing good support. The center features the main figure, with a wooden bar counter neatly arranged on the bar, featuring multiple whiskey bottles from malt and bourbon brands and styles, ranging from transparent to amber. The label is clearly visible, and next to it sits a brown leather briefcase, a classic design. It features a double-layer flip and metal fasteners, giving it a solid texture. Below the bar is a wooden structure with high stools. On the right, a black TV screen can be faintly seen. The composition uses a figure positioned slightly to the center, with the figure occupying the main position to form a visual focal point. The left side leaves space to display environmental details, using the perspective of near and far to create spatial layering. The body curve extends to the phone in hand, then upstream to the bar counter to the wine bottle and leather bag, forming a natural visual path. Light and shadow come from the left front. A clear contrast of light and shadow is created, with shadows falling on the right side of the sofa and the floor, enhancing the sense of depth. The wine bottle in the background reflects a faint glow under the light, creating a warm and intimate atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly gray, brown, and black, harmoniously unified. The image feels like a real indoor scene shot with a professional camera. The lighting is authentic and natural, without signs of over-processing. The details are rich and texture prominent, presenting a relaxed moment in urban life that is both artistic and authentic. It was as if they had captured a quiet and story-rich moment",
