          "id": "krea2-396041d4c3f694c5c175e29a",
          "alias": "单女白T恤城市媚态坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a dark gray fabric sofa in a modern urban apartment. She wears a white tank top and white shorts, paired with a black zip-up cardigan, and white long socks. Her legs are elegantly crossed, her right hand naturally resting on the armrest of the sofa, her left hand gently resting near her knee, her body slightly leaning forward, head slightly tilted, her expression calm yet tinged with laziness and detachment, exuding a restrained sensuality and confidence. Her makeup is exquisite but not overly heavy, and her overall posture is relaxed and full of tension. The foreground features the thick backrest and soft cushion of a sofa, made of delicate material and decorated with regular buttons, creating a visual texture layer. The middle is the female subject, occupying the left central position of the composition. The composition uses a low-angle shot to emphasize the figure's lines and spatial proportion. The background is the indoor environment, with large floor-to-ceiling windows on the left. Outside the window is the city skyline at night, with tall buildings standing tall and flickering lights presenting a cool blue glow. The curtains are half-drawn, letting in warm indoor light. The right side is the bar area. Several bottles of alcoholic beverages are displayed, with glass bottles reflecting light. Next to them are transparent glass cups. The bar counter surface is smooth and details are clearly visible. The ceiling is fitted with recessed downlights that emit a soft warm yellow light that illuminates the entire space. The floor is made of light gray wood or tiles, with a smooth texture and subtle reflections cast on the floor. The overall atmosphere is quiet and private, full of the romance and solitude of urban nightlife. The color palette is mainly dark gray, white, and warm yellow, complemented by the cool blue tones outside the window for contrast. It creates a space atmosphere where warmth and calm intertwine. Light mainly comes from ceiling downlights and city lights outside the window, creating contrasts of light and shadow. Soft shadows highlight a sense of depth. The wine bottles and glasses in the background create highlights and refraction effects under the light, enhancing realism. The composition uses the horizontal lines of the sofa and the diagonal posture of the figures to guide the view, extending from the foreground to the background to create a sense of depth. The visual focus is on the woman, and color contrast, light and shadow changes, and spatial layout reinforce the subject's presence. The overall style combines everyday realism with artistic beauty, as if shooting indoors at night with a professional camera, using a large-aperture lens to capture delicate light and shadow. The image has a film-like texture and slight noise, presenting a realistic and storytelling visual atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
