        {
          "id": "krea2-0e4b33bb3a380778b78a6d24",
          "alias": "单女橙连衣裙摄影棚专注站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands against a light gray background, presenting a soft sheen. The overall makeup is clean and translucent, highlighting natural beauty. She wears a light orange spaghetti strap dress made of lightweight and transparent material, featuring pleats and ruffles. The neckline and cuffs are decorated with fine ruffles, and a row of round buttons on the chest is similar in color to the dress. This creates a subtle contrast: the waist is cinched, accentuating her curves. Around her waist is a gold chain belt with a striking black metallic letter \"Chloe\" design. The chain is fine and high-end, and she wears a thin chain necklace, with a small gold geometric pendant and simple gold earrings. The overall style is elegant and retro yet modern. The composition uses medium and near shots, with the figure centered slightly to the right, body slightly angled to the camera, head slightly tilted. It creates a warm and focused atmosphere. The foreground features a clear upper body of the character, rich in detail. The middle ground features the lower body and belt, while the background is a solid-colored light gray wall, simple and free of distractions. Light comes from the left side of the front, soft and even, serving as a studio lighting effect. Shadow transitions are natural, with slight backlighting enhancing three-dimensionality. The direction of light and shadow is consistent, highlighting the transparent texture of the clothing and the delicate glow of the skin. The overall color tone is warm and soft, mainly warm orange, off-white, and light gray, with harmonious and unified colors. The atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, with a sense of sophistication and fashion. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains the authentic and natural moments of daily life. The background blur is well handled, highlighting the subject and forming a strong emotional connection. The entire image conveys a gentle, confident, and elegant temperament, making it suitable for fashion portraits or personal image display, while also possessing the aesthetic value of artistic photography",
