        {
          "id": "krea2-05e8ca30d8ea0a18af0606bf",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤花园冷淡侧头",
          "prompt": "Slightly open, it seems as if she is about to speak softly or be lost in thought. On her ring finger is a simple silver ring, her hand posture elegant and natural. On her wrist is a delicate silver chain bracelet, adding a touch of refinement. She wears a light blue sequin camisole gown with slender shoulder straps, Her chest is adorned with fine sequins, sparkling faintly under the light. The fabric of the garment is soft and fits her figure, showcasing the beauty of feminine curves. She wears a pair of intricately designed star-shaped earrings, made of several small diamonds, sparkling brilliantly and complementing her overall look. She holds a green flower in her hands, with petals layered and slightly wavy edges. The color gradually shifts from tender green at the center to pale yellow at the edges, with a slightly yellowish center, giving it a vibrant look. This adds freshness and a natural feel to the composition. The foreground features the figure's head and upper body, with clear focus and rich details. The background is blurred, presenting soft green plants and blurred wooden structures, possibly wooden chairs or railings in a garden, creating an outdoor natural atmosphere. The middle ground is the transitional area between the lower half of the figure and the surrounding environment, with soft light and shadow and harmonious colors. The background is a hazy green and warm light, further enhancing the depth and spatial layers of the painting. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, head slightly tilted, forming a beautiful diagonal line composition. This flows toward the blurred background area, creating a natural visual flow path. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, with the light source coming from the left front, simulating natural light effects and natural shadow transitions, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall color scheme is mainly soft warm yellow and fresh green, paired with a cool-toned blue gown to create a warm and cool contrast, creating a visual effect that is both cozy and artistic. The image texture is delicate. It features a high-end photography style, as if a professional photographer is shooting with a full-frame camera and a large aperture lens, capturing a moment full of poetry and beauty. The image presents a dreamlike atmosphere, combining fashion with natural beauty, like a carefully composed artistic portrait",
