        {
          "id": "krea2-43298f6eb9c728f263815441",
          "alias": "单女武士和服摄影棚冷淡站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a traditional Japanese kimono looks directly at the camera, her expression tinged with detachment and authority. She wears a light green kimono outer robe, with delicate texture and slight pleats and natural drape. The kimono lining is pink with elegant floral patterns, mainly pink and pale yellow, with petals layered and soft lines. The kimono collar reveals the edge of the orange lining, creating a subtle color contrast. Around her waist is a wide brown leather obi with intricate textures and metal buckle decorations. The center of the belt is wrapped with black cloth strips and tied in knots, with a tassel tassel hanging at the end, gently swaying with movement. Below the belt, the hem of the kimono skirt slits down to mid-thighs, revealing long, fair legs. Under soft light, her skin appears smooth and delicate. Her right hand tightly grips the hilt of a samurai sword, wrapped in black cord, with the scabbard exposed. The blade is sharp and reflecting a faint sheen. The left hand holds the sword at her side, her posture steady and powerful. The overall look blends classical and modern elements. It presents a cold yet dangerous aesthetic. The background is a solid white or very light beige monochrome wall, with a slight graininess and uneven light and shadow transitions, creating a clean and simple visual space. The figure stands slightly centered to the left, with the body slightly turned and head facing the camera. The composition uses a mid-angle portrait, with the figure occupying about two-thirds of the frame's height, fully presented from the ankle to the top of the head. Light comes from the upper front, softly illuminating the subject with natural shadow transitions without strong contrast between light and dark, and the overall tone is warm. Mainly off-white, light green, brown, and pink tones, the colors are harmonious and unified, creating a quiet yet tense atmosphere, as if freezing a moment of decisiveness and strength. The lens uses a large-aperture prime lens, with well-controlled depth of field, natural background blur, and emphasis on the subject. The image has the texture of film photography, with slight graininess, moderate color saturation, and rich details, presenting an artistic style that intertwines vintage and reality, like a fashionable blockbuster in a professional studio or a scene frozen in a movie scene, with stable composition. Extending further down to the katana in his hand, it creates a strong narrative tension. The entire scene is filled with a unique temperament that blends Eastern aesthetics with modern aesthetics. It combines the solemnity of traditional samurai culture with the boldness of contemporary female power. The delicate handling of light and shadow and the well-crafted atmosphere make it unforgettable",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
