        {
          "id": "krea2-d7349838174d02a2f1f990b4",
          "alias": "单女毛衣公寓沉思站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands indoors, adding a touch of softness and casualness. She wears a bright red short-sleeved top with slight pleats and reflective texture, presenting a soft knit or cotton texture. The neckline features a deep V design that hugs the figure, highlighting the graceful lines of her neck and chest. The sleeves are short and slightly puffy, her arms hang naturally, and her left hand is adorned with a gold bracelet. The bracelet consists of fine chains and decorative elements, reflecting a faint metallic sheen under the light. The right hand is partially visible, seemingly holding shooting equipment or stretching out naturally. She wears low-rise jeans on the lower half, with slight fading and distressed marks on the surface, giving a retro washed effect. The pants fit the hip curve, showing natural body proportions. The background is a simple indoor space, with walls in light beige or gray-white, flat without obvious decoration, and a white ceiling at the top. At the edge, a dark brown beam or door frame structure can be seen at the upper left of the image, forming a slight geometric segmentation. The overall environment is clean and tidy, with no unnecessary clutter or decorations. The composition centers on the figure, using a medium-near perspective. The figure occupies the main position of the composition, with the head positioned at the top third of the frame. The body is fully presented from the chest to waist, with a stable and balanced composition. Light and shadow come from the left side of the front, with a soft and even light source, possibly an indoor ceiling light or front fill light, with slight shadows. The overall lighting layers are rich but not abrupt, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The color scheme is mainly red, enhancing visual impact while preserving natural color transitions. The overall style leans toward everyday authentic shooting, conveying a sense of life and intimacy. It feels like a casual selfie or video call between friends. The camera angle is slightly tilted, simulating the realism of handheld shooting, bringing a friendly, casual, and unforced artistic atmosphere. The overall image conveys youthful vitality, confidence, and composure. At the same time, it retains delicacy and beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
