          "id": "krea2-06426db9476895566d187079",
          "alias": "单女灰T恤城市忧伤坐持杯",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the floor by the indoor window, her body slightly leaning forward, legs bent and gathered, barefoot on the light gray wooden floor. Her right hand gently holds a glass of transparent water, while her left hand rests naturally behind her head, fingers slightly bent. She wears a simple silver ring, a delicate silver bracelet on her wrist, a loose light gray short-sleeved T-shirt, and black shorts. The hem of the T-shirt is casually tucked into her waistband, her expression slightly melancholic and contemplative. Light streams in from outside, creating a soft transition of light and shadow. The background is a blurry cluster of city skyscrapers. Through the glass windows with slight water stains and reflective light, you can see the outlines of distant buildings and the arrangement of windows. The sky appears grayish-white, with an overall cool tone, mainly blue-gray, creating a quiet, lonely, and slightly detached atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned on the right side of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The upper left leaves a large blank space to highlight the main subject. The window runs across the middle of the frame, separating the foreground from the background, creating a sense of layering and making the figure's posture naturally relaxed. However, it clearly expresses emotion and attracts attention. At the same time, the water cup and hand movements also serve as auxiliary guidance. The light and shadows come from natural light outside the window, with moderate intensity and soft shadows, without strong contrasts. Overall, it presents a realistic and storytelling moment from daily life, as if capturing the tranquility and reflection of an afternoon alone. It has a film-like texture, with delicate graininess, low color saturation, cool tones, and slightly darkened edges to enhance the central focus effect. The overall style leans toward a blend of documentary photography and emotional portraits, combining the feel of everyday life with artistic beauty. Using a 35mm prime lens, the focal length is clear, depth of field is well controlled, the foreground figures are sharp and sharp, the background is naturally blurred, and the details are rich. From the texture of clothing to water stains on the glass, everything is clearly visible. The composition is balanced, elements are well-distributed, conveying the inner peace and confusion of urban youth, as well as a brief escape from real life and self-dialogue. The entire scene is filled with a poetic sense of loneliness. It evokes the image of individuals in the city seeking moments of tranquility beyond the hustle and bustle",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
