        {
          "id": "krea2-19017a101815a7d66c586294",
          "alias": "单女金礼服困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A female model wore a highly designed bright yellow strapless gown, with an asymmetrical cut. One shoulder and sleeve were made of large, three-dimensional pleated fabric, presenting a flowing sculptural effect, while the other side was patched with black lace, creating a strong visual contrast. The skirt was wide and flowing, with a delicate texture and sheen that reflected a soft metallic texture under the light. On the wrist is a thin chain bracelet. The overall look is fashionable and avant-garde, full of artistic flair. The foreground features the main figure occupying the left center of the frame, creating a full composition. The middle includes a ladder, a camera lamp stand, and some equipment. The ladder extends diagonally, guiding the gaze to the figures. The background is a dark studio environment, with multiple round soft lights emitting warm yellow-white light, creating a dramatic light and shadow effect. Smoke slowly rises from the left, adding a hazy atmosphere. Light mainly comes from above and in front, creating contrasts of light and shadow, highlighting the contours of the figures and clothing details. Shadows transition smoothly, and the overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow, creating a strong contrast with the black background. The composition uses the figures' postures, ladder lines, and light source distribution to create dynamic balance, which then spreads throughout the body. The layers of light and shadow are rich, the atmosphere is luxurious, professional, and modern, resembling a high-end fashion show or a brand-style photo shoot. It offers strong visual impact and fashion expression, while preserving the texture of authentic photography scenes. Like shooting with a professional camera in a studio, the images are clear and sharp, with rich details, high color saturation but not exaggeration, presenting an aesthetic style that is both dreamy and authentic",
