        {
          "id": "krea2-dac55bd62e23243017021f12",
          "alias": "单女紫连衣裙摄影棚神秘站立",
          "prompt": "A female character in a purple tight dress is presented with a side-facing glance, her expression revealing a sense of calm and detachment. She wears a pair of gold round earrings that reflect a soft metallic sheen in the light, adding a touch of elegance. She wears a boldly designed purple spaghetti strap dress with lace trim at the neckline. The chest and back are adorned with fine black lace patchwork, and a black woven belt is tied around the waist, adorned with black rose ornaments and silver beads. Thin strings hang from both ends of the belt with dark tassels, creating an overall look that combines sexiness with classical beauty. Her arms are crossed over her chest, her posture elegant yet slightly guarded, her body slightly turned to the side, showing graceful curves. The background is pure black with no unnecessary elements, making the main figure stand out. The composition uses medium shots and close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space, from head to knee, fully presented. The slightly lower angle enhances the visual height and presence, with lighting mainly coming from the right front. A soft transition of light and shadow is created, with shadows naturally distributed in the hollows and behind the body, creating a strong sense of depth and texture. The contrast between light and shadow is strong but not abrupt, making the skin appear smooth and delicate. The clothing materials display a silky sheen and pleated details, creating a mysterious and elegant atmosphere with a strong sense of artistry and cinematicism, as if shooting in a professional studio with multiple lights, while retaining the refinement and perfection of digital rendering. The images have extremely high resolution and detail expression. It presents a surreal beauty that lies between reality and fantasy, complemented by gold and silver accents. The harmonious tones draw viewers' attention to the left side of the frame, enhancing narrative and immersion. The overall style blends modern fashion, Eastern aesthetics, and digital art, resembling a carefully curated commercial portrait or a high-quality 3D game or animated character design, full of power and feminine charm, while maintaining a high aesthetic and artistic standard",
