        {
          "id": "krea2-ad55714f44e8db5a2e171369",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙雪地困倦站立手持物",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a red Christmas-themed dress, with fluffy white fur adorning the hem and straps. The dress is designed with a fitted design and tie decorations, showcasing elegant curves and a festive atmosphere. She slightly turns to look back, hands gently raised to her chest, fingers interlaced, her posture gentle yet reserved, carrying a touch of playfulness and tranquility. The overall look is filled with fairy-tale romance, with the main subject positioned slightly to the right of the center shot. On the left is a beautifully decorated Christmas tree, adorned with red and silver spherical ornaments. Its branches and leaves are covered with a thin layer of artificial snow, creating a crystal-clear texture. The background is a deep black night sky, with fine snowflakes drifting down, creating a tranquil and dreamy winter night atmosphere. In the upper left, a strong light source shines in from outside the frame, creating a distinct backlight effect. Light passes through the snowflakes, creating delicate light spots and scattering effects. The strong contrast between light and shadow highlights the main contour, and the composition uses a center-offset layout. The figures occupy the main visual focal point of the composition. The Christmas tree, as an important foreground element, not only enriches the layers of the image but also provides balance. The background blur treatment makes the main subject stand out, and visual guidance starts from the light source in the upper left corner and extends along the body lines to the skirt, creating a smooth visual flow. The overall color tone is dominated by red and white, paired with a cool black background. The contrasting colors are striking, creating a strong sense of festivity and artistic beauty. The image has the texture of film photography, with rich details, mild graininess, and natural transitions between light and shadow. It feels like shooting from a professional studio or outdoor night scenes, with the realism and warmth of everyday amateur equipment. The overall atmosphere is cozy, romantic, and dreamy, combining the joy of holiday celebrations with the tranquility of winter nights. It is suitable for holiday promotion, photo shooting, or emotional expression image generation",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
