        {
          "id": "krea2-cad512a5c61896e28aeea6f3",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤广场温柔持手机",
          "prompt": "A close-up of a woman's half-body adds a touch of laziness and casualness. She wears off-white square sunglasses, the frames lightly resting above her head. One hand gently supports the edge of the frame. Her fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed, and her posture is elegant but not pretentious. She wears a black camisole with thin straps, lace-patterned bra with a faint edge visible underneath. Around her neck is a slender gold chain necklace, simple yet delicate. The background is an outdoor scene on a city street corner. The floor is paved with black-and-white geometric tiles, with wooden chairs and glass windows reflecting the building's silhouette in the distance. The lighting is bright and soft, presenting the warm natural light of a summer afternoon. Light and shadow shine from the upper right, creating a sense of depth and realism. The main color palette is warm yellow, contrasted with black clothing and a dark background, highlighting the subject and creating a relaxed and comfortable atmosphere. Full of the atmosphere of everyday life, it feels like a casual shot taken with a regular phone, preserving authentic details and texture without excessive embellishment, presenting a natural, authentic, and intimate beauty. The entire scene conveys the confidence, independence, and composure of urban women—both fashionable and lifelike, making it a portrait work with a strong personal style and emotional expression",
