        {
          "id": "krea2-612a868f5b93935a2cbf7c17",
          "alias": "单女黑内衣城市温柔坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a pure white bed, her expression neutral and full of storytelling. Behind her are pristine white pillows and sheets, naturally pleated and soft. The background is a plain white wall, with a semi-transparent white sheer curtain on the left. Several small tassel decorations sway gently in the wind, sunlight streaming in from the right side, casting soft light and shadow on the walls and bed, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The light is warm and bright, with the overall color scheme mainly white, accented by dark black underwear, creating a pure, tranquil, and intimate atmosphere. The composition is centered slightly to the right, with the figure occupying the main position. The foreground shows her body and bed details, the middle is the pillow and part of the bed, and the background is the wall and sheer curtains. Light and shadow shine from the upper right. Soft shadow transitions are formed, presenting a sense of quiet beauty in everyday life, as if shot with a regular camera. There is a slight film graininess and natural color distortion, without excessive retouching, preserving the sense of life and authentic texture. The image atmosphere is tranquil and gentle, full of the independence and composure of modern urban women. Details are rich but not chaotic, and every light and fabric fold feels authentic and believable, conveying an emotional state that is both intimate and open. It evokes a sense of protected vulnerability and inner strength. The overall style leans toward a blend of minimalism and lifestyle aesthetics, combining the refinement of artistic photography with the authenticity of everyday life. It's like a fleeting moment captured in the morning bedroom where time seems to stand still, with only breath and heartbeat silently telling something",
