        {
          "id": "krea2-97634de593198ec542573635",
          "alias": "单女衣帽间温柔倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a black fitted short-sleeve top with a low neckline that highlights the neck and chest contours. The fabric has a subtle texture that fits the body's curves. Her right hand gently rests on her chest, fingers naturally bent, moving gracefully and naturally. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the frame, the head slightly tilted, creating dynamic balance. The background is an ordinary bedroom at home. On the left is a white open storage rack neatly stacked with multiple pieces of clothing in red, blue, and gray colors, with distinct layers. On the right is a dark brown wooden wardrobe with a curved carved door and silver handles. The top is stacked with storage boxes and clothes, with several light-colored garments hanging beside the cabinet. The floor is covered with a beige patterned carpet, and the bed is covered with pink floral patterned sheets. The overall tone is warm, with light coming from inside the room, located slightly to the left in front of the figure, creating a soft and even frontal light. Subtle shadows create a warm and intimate atmosphere, full of life energy. Details are rich but not cluttered, composition is compact, naturally extending to hand movements and clothing details. Light and shadow transitions are natural, color saturation is moderate, and everyday scenes are realistically reproduced, presenting an unedited sense of realism and intimacy. It feels like a snapshot casually captured with a phone or camera, with slight noise and slight lens distortion to enhance realism. The overall style leans toward life-oriented, everyday, and naturalistic elements. Capture an ordinary yet emotionally charged private moment",
