        {
          "id": "krea2-9a809293cc59d1cbcb58959c",
          "alias": "单女粉泳装海滩沉思站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the rocky shore, appearing natural and dynamic, her expression slightly contemplative and gentle, presenting a serene and reserved beauty. Her body lines are smooth and graceful, wearing a pink semi-transparent bikini. The triangular top is simple yet sexy, with slender straps and a metal buckle decoration on the chest. The bottom is low-rise with chain-style connectors. The overall look is modern and fashionable. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, slightly turned to the side, with the head facing the camera but gazing off. This creates a subtle sense of distance and narrative quality. In the foreground, the main figure occupies most of the frame, clearly visible from above the waist. The background features blurred rocky landforms, mainly grayish-brown with rough textures and uneven surfaces, with some areas covered by shadows, creating a strong sense of depth and spatial layering. In the middle ground, the rock outlines gradually blur, forming a soft transition. In the background, a cave entrance or rock wall depression can be seen, appearing deep black, enhancing the mysterious atmosphere of the composition. The composition adopts a center-shifted golden ratio layout. The figure's posture is naturally relaxed, with the right arm hanging down naturally and the left hand slightly raised close to the side. The overall proportions are harmonious, with light and shadow coming from the upper right of the frame. Soft natural light evenly illuminates the figure, highlighting skin texture and clothing reflections. Areas such as the abdomen, collarbones, and shoulders have obvious highlights, while delicate shadows are formed on the left and back sides of the body, enhancing the sense of depth and realism. The colors are mainly warm tones, with the gray-brown background providing cool contrast, making the subject stand out more and creating a quiet and intimate atmosphere. It carries the lazy vibe of a summer seaside, like a life-oriented portrait taken at dusk. The overall image presents a refined yet natural aesthetic style, full of artistic flair and emotional tension, as if capturing a fleeting inner monologue.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
