        {
          "id": "krea2-34e4b621169d273ed68c8abe",
          "alias": "单女白外套户外忧伤站立出神",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors under soft light, wearing a fluffy, soft white plush coat. The collar and cuffs of the coat feature a natural curly flickered texture, as if lightly wrapped around her body like clouds. She stands slightly sideways, hands gently folded in front of her abdomen, her posture elegant yet reserved, adding a touch of laziness and gentleness. Gazing into the distance, her expression reveals a faint contemplation and tranquility, as if she is about to whisper a secret, with a subtle sheen, as if shrouded in dawn or mist. In the foreground, the plush details of the coat are clearly visible, each fiber rich in layers, showing subtle transitions of light and shadow as the light changes. In the middle ground, the background is blurred, with faintly visible green plants and the outlines of some city buildings. Trees and leaves intertwine, light and shadow mottle, creating a hazy yet poetic atmosphere. The sky shows a gradient of light blue and gray-white, suggesting that at dawn or dusk, the light is soft and diffuse, without strong shadows. The overall color palette is mainly cool white, light gray, and light green, creating a tranquil and pure scene. The composition uses a left-centered third-section layout, with the figure positioned on the left side of the painting, leaving space on the right to enhance visual extension. At the same time, a translucent block above the head forms a natural frame structure that presses down diagonally from above, adding depth and layering to the scene. This obstruction may be part of the umbrella or sunshade, with curved edges and a lightweight material that reveals a faint blue-gray tone. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere leans toward a cool tone but still feels warm. The light source comes from the left front of the subject, simulating natural daylight to create delicate highlights and shadows, emphasizing the texture and three-dimensionality of the plush material. The entire image has a strong sense of realism and artistic beauty, as if shot with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens, capturing the moment's true emotions and environmental details. At the same time, sufficient depth control is maintained, making the subject stand out and the background naturally blends. The image presents a high-end fashion photography style, combining the intimacy of daily life with cinematic narrative. The color saturation is moderate, contrast is soft, details are rich, textures are realistic, and the overall atmosphere is peaceful, elegant, and slightly melancholic—like a poetic portrait of a modern city, evoking a tranquil beauty that transcends time",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
