        {
          "id": "krea2-157f0f076a5d7a6f0f0811e2",
          "alias": "单女透视白连衣裙公寓温柔坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a modern-style white bench, wearing a simple and elegant white sleeveless dress. The dress is tailored to the right length, the neckline is exquisitely designed, and the hem drapes naturally, revealing her long legs. She pairs her with light pink sheer stockings and a pair of platform white sandals. The overall look is fresh yet fashionable, adding a touch of gentleness and laziness. It feels as if there is a silent communication with the viewer. The background is the interior space, and the walls are decorated with dark vertical striped wood panels. The wood strips alternate in dark brown and gold, neatly arranged to create a strong visual rhythm. On the right wall hangs a flat-screen TV displaying a blue screen, with faintly visible blurred images injecting a sense of technology into the scene. The floor is paved with smooth white tiles that reflect soft light, making the entire space clean and bright. The composition centers on the figure, using medium shots. The figure occupies the main position in the composition, with clear background elements that do not overshadow the main focus. The foreground features the legs and shoes, the middle ground features the main body and benches, and the background features the wall and TV, forming a distinctly layered spatial structure. Following her line of sight, she extends to the TV screen in the background, then returns to the figure's body, forming a circular visual path. Light and shadow come from the ceiling lighting, soft and even, without strong shadows, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly white, off-white, and light pink, accented with deep brown and gold. Colors are harmonious and unified, image texture is delicate, and it feels as realistic as shooting with everyday amateur equipment. The camera simulates using Canon EOS R5 or Sony A7R IV, ISO 400, aperture f/2.8, shutter speed 1/125 sec. For handheld shooting, slight hand shake brings natural shaking, slightly overexposed highlights retain detail, noise is minimal, presenting a realistic film-like graininess, low contrast, moderate color saturation, slight warm-tone shift, natural background blur, soft out-of-focus imaging, While highlighting the main subject, the environmental information remains intact, creating a quiet and intimate atmosphere, as if capturing a tranquil afternoon leisure moment. It combines the sophistication of a modern city with the warmth of everyday life. The scene is full of storytelling, making one imagine she is waiting for someone to arrive or having just finished a conversation, quietly enjoying a moment of solitude",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
