        {
          "id": "krea2-09667139a12772b503e29470",
          "alias": "单女白旗袍庭院沉思站立注视",
          "prompt": "An Eastern woman dressed in a white Chinese-style qipao stands sideways. The qipao is embroidered with a light blue ink-style lotus pattern, with delicate black embroidery on the cuffs and collar. She wears a translucent white sheer shawl, with traditional patterns along the edges. The overall outfit looks light and flowing under the sunlight. Her expression is calm and slightly contemplative, her posture elegant and natural, hands folded in front of her, fingers long, and nails neatly trimmed. Light and shadow fall from the upper left, with a blurred Jiangnan water town courtyard in the background. In the distance, you can see traditional buildings with blue tiles and white walls. The eaves are simple and smooth, and up close are vast stretches of lush green lotus leaves and blooming lotus flowers. The leaves are layered and slightly curled at the edges, with several pink and white lotus flowers scattered throughout. On the left side of the painting, dense green branches and leaves hang down, forming a natural frame. The gaps between the leaves reveal mottled light and shadow, creating a richly layered depth effect. The sky appears a bright pale blue, the clouds are thin, and the light is soft and even. The entire scene is bathed in warm natural light in the early morning or afternoon, with white, light blue, and light green as the main tones, complemented by a touch of gray and pink. The tone is fresh and elegant. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned slightly to the right, guiding the viewer's gaze toward the distant outside. The leaves in the foreground contrast with the buildings in the background, creating a contrast of solid and void to enhance spatial depth. A large blank area is left slightly to the left of the center to highlight the main subject, while maintaining visual balance. The transition of light and shadow is natural, with moderate contrast between light and shadow, and no strong shadows. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and harmonious, full of poetry and classical charm, like a perfect fusion of traditional Chinese ink painting and modern photographic art. The lens uses a wide aperture to shoot, presenting a soft bokeh effect in the background. The details are clear yet hazy, and the overall composition has a strong artistic appeal, showcasing the subtle subtlety of Eastern aesthetics while exuding a transcendent tranquil temperament. It feels like being in a secluded paradise far from the hustle and bustle, where time seems to freeze, evoking a sense of timelessness and a sense of transcendence across time and space",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
