        {
          "id": "krea2-6db4357d2586871583193295",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙广场冷淡站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman in a white slim-fit dress stands sideways, elegantly glancing back at the camera. Her figure is smooth and full of tension, with the hem hugging the body to outline a graceful waist and hips. The dress is sleeveless, with a clean and neat neckline. The dress features delicate textures, presenting a sophisticated knit or lace texture. The skirt reaches her knees, perfectly highlighting her leg lines. She wears pure white high heels, with slender and upright heels that harmonize with the overall look. Her right hand gently grips a small deep blue handbag. The bag body features delicate metal clasps and woven textures, adding a touch of fashion. The main subject is positioned slightly in the center on the right side, forming a visual focal point. The foreground features a clean and tidy gray tiled floor, arranged in a square pattern, with smooth surfaces reflecting soft light. The middle is the exterior wall of a modern building, made of light gray stone or metal panels divided by horizontal lines. On the left is a large glass curtain wall that reflects the pale blue tones of the sky. The building's edges have sharp lines and orderly structure. On the right side, a black glass door is visible. The door frame is clearly defined, and faint indoor lighting shines through behind it. The background is a blurred urban environment, with a blurred architectural outline and a few greenery scattered in the distance. In the lower right corner, there is a small cluster of green plants with dense leaves, adding a touch of vitality. The composition uses a third-part layout, with the figure occupying the right third of the frame, leaving space on the left to create a sense of breathing and natural visual flow. The viewing angle is slightly lower, enhancing the character's uprightness and presence. Light and shadow come from the front left, with soft and even sunlight casting a natural transition of light and shadow on the figure. Shadows are concentrated on the right side of the body and the ground, creating a strong sense of depth. The overall color scheme is mainly white, gray, and blue, with sharp contrasts of warm and cool tones, creating a fresh, sophisticated, and modern urban atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and authentic, as if shot with a professional camera. The details are rich, the layers are distinct, and it exudes a strong sense of fashion and artistic flair, like a high-end magazine cover or advertising campaign, yet still retains the warmth of everyday life. The entire scene is tranquil and elegant, full of the charm and independent temperament of modern women",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
