        {
          "id": "krea2-9b2f1ec56cb5590071ce8507",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫乡村俏皮坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors on a rock, wearing a white lace-sleeved shirt paired with a beige suspender dress, a checkered canvas bag slung across her shoulder, holding an orange-yellow orange in both hands, gently touching the peel with her fingers. She wears delicate silver earrings on her earlobes. The overall look is fresh and sweet, full of countryside charm. In the foreground, the orange is clearly visible, her hands holding the fruit, and parts of her sleeves and skirt. In the middle is the complete silhouette of her body and scattered gray rocks of varying sizes, with a lush citrus grove in the background. Golden and plump oranges hang from the branches, shining enticingly under the sunlight. In the distance, faint green shrubs and trees create a richly layered vegetation. The sky is pale blue with slightly white clouds. Light falls from the upper left of the frame, creating a soft backlighting effect. The edges of the figures are enveloped in a golden halo, with natural transitions of light and shadow, creating a warm and bright afternoon atmosphere. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, head slightly tilted, interacting with the viewer. The overall color palette is mainly warm tones, with white, beige, orange-yellow, and green harmoniously combined, spreading into the background plant communities, presenting a tranquil and vibrant pastoral poetry. The image has a slight film texture and soft out-of-focus blur, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera with a retro filter style. The overall image presents a beautiful moment casually captured in daily life, full of youthful energy and a natural freshness. The details are rich and authentic, as if you can smell the fresh scent of citrus. Feel the comfort of a gentle breeze, with clear light and shadow layers, moderate color saturation—neither too flashy nor too dull—creating a comfortable and pleasant visual experience. The whole scene seems frozen on a sunny autumn afternoon, evoking leisurely rural life and simple, pure joyful times",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
