        {
          "id": "krea2-cab9934cf109d01295436d9c",
          "alias": "单女橙T恤床倚靠交叠",
          "prompt": "Her body leans slightly forward, her right hand resting on the bed behind her, her left hand naturally resting on her thigh, legs crossed and slightly apart, presenting a relaxed yet full of tension. She wears a bright orange knitted camisole top, made of fine ribbed knit. The fitted design highlights her slender waistline and smooth abdominal curve. The sides of the top have cutouts and adjustable orange tie-in straps. She wears black low-rise underwear, which contrasts sharply with the orange top. On her feet are classic high-top sneakers, with a predominantly white upper accented by striking orange and black accents. The tongue features the Nike logo, the side features a black Swoosh logo, and the laces are black. Gray socks are visible at the ankle, with a black Nike hook logo at the cuff. The background is a pale gray-white wall, flat and simple, with a black flat-screen TV hanging above. The screen is off, painted in deep black. The overall environment is clean and tidy, with soft and even lighting. Illuminated from the left side of the frame, it creates a warm atmosphere. Light and shadow create a natural transition of light and shadow on the figure's body, highlighting muscle lines and clothing textures. The composition uses a medium shot angle, with the figure occupying the main position, slightly on the left center, body in an oblique pose with a slightly tilted head, and the gaze meeting the viewer's direct view, creating a strong visual direction. The foreground shows the figure's body and part of the bed, the middle ground features the figure's legs and shoes, and the background features the wall and TV, creating a clear layering pattern. The colors are mainly orange, white, and black. Orange serves as the visual focal point to attract attention, while white sheets and walls provide a clean base, while black elements add contrast. The overall atmosphere blends the casual feel of daily life with the refinement of fashionable photography, presenting a scene where authenticity and art coexist in a private space. It feels like high-quality photos taken with a professional camera, with a slight film texture. The tone is slightly warm, the graininess is delicate, details are rich, and the subject's expressions are natural and the movements are smooth. The overall composition conveys a youthful vitality, confidence, independence, and a touch of sexiness. The composition is stable and dynamic, with delicate light and shadow handling and harmonious color coordination, creating a visual experience that is both modern and full of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
