        {
          "id": "krea2-082df1b4fe7a41ac480068c4",
          "alias": "单女外套霓虹夜景冷淡倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "Wearing a light-colored plush jacket, she leans her head slightly against the window, leans slightly and tilts her head slightly, creating a quiet and introspective atmosphere. In the foreground are blurry window glass and metal armrests, showing faint reflections and moisture traces. In the background is a blurry city nightscape, through which you can see flowing lights and architectural silhouettes, forming warm circular light spots and linear halos. The overall color scheme is mainly cool blue-green, with a faint bluish-gray tone. The light is soft and directional, mainly from the streetlights and neon lights outside the window, creating a natural transition between light and shadow. The shadows are delicate and soft, with rich layers of light and shadow. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying two-thirds of the right side, leaving space on the left to show the view outside. The angle of view is slightly upward, enhancing the character's elegance and emotional depth. Visual guidance is guided by the direction of the character's gaze and the light spots outside the window, forming a flowing path from right to left, creating an atmosphere of solitude, tranquility, and hope. The image texture is delicate and richly detailed, preserving slight film graininess and color shifts, simulating professional photography equipment while incorporating the natural feel of everyday handheld or mobile camera shooting. The lens focal length approaches 85mm, with well-controlled depth of field, clear subjects and blurred backgrounds, highlighting the emotional expression of characters. The overall style blends cinematic feel, artistic atmosphere, and poetic moments of modern urban life, conveying a profound resonance about youth, dreams, and the inner world",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
