        {
          "id": "krea2-535b8a7ef119bb49066fe11a",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙室内沉思坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the indoor floor, her body slightly leaning forward, legs crossed, posture natural and relaxed, looking directly into the camera, presenting a gentle yet slightly contemplative expression that creates a subtle transition of light and shadow. She wears a light gray, sleeveless fitted dress with a simple modern design featuring geometric line decorations. The neckline is rounded, hugging the figure and highlighting graceful curves. On the left chest is a white abstract pattern logo, adding a touch of fashion. Her right arm is bent, with her elbow resting on the knee. Her left hand is naturally placed at her side, and a black long-sleeved jacket is casually draped over her arm. The material looks soft and the pleats look natural. On her feet are a pair of classic black-and-white canvas shoes with white stripes and metal lace holes on the upper. The thick soles give off a vintage vibe. In the background is a black Marshall speaker with gold knobs and brand logos on the speaker surface. On top sits an old vinyl record player, with a black portrait photo hanging above the player, with a simple frame. The wall is a light beige with a delicate texture. On the right side, there is a black photography light stand with a clear structure and distinct details. The overall composition centers on the person, using a mid-angle perspective where the figure occupies the main part of the frame. The background elements are arranged in a well-arranged manner, creating an atmosphere where music and life blend together. Light comes from the left, creating a soft side lighting effect. Shadows naturally extend to the right of the person and in the background, with rich layers of light and shadow. The tones are mainly gray, black, and off-white, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere full of artistic and modern vibes The image has a strong visual guide, then moves downward along the body lines, and finally notices the music equipment in the background, forming a complete visual flow. The image texture is delicate and rich, as if it were a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera, while preserving the warmth of everyday life. Overall, it presents a style that combines artistic beauty with authentic life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
