        {
          "id": "krea2-7bb6411773aa7e71b322ee24",
          "alias": "单女棕外套森林站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the autumn forest, looking natural and vivid, slightly tilting her head toward the camera, wearing pale pink lipstick, her expression gentle yet tinged with curiosity. She wears a gray long-sleeved inner layer, over which she wears a brown herringbone tweed coat. The collar reveals a plaid scarf with blue and green patterns, softly wrapping around her neck and adding warmth. Her right hand is gently raised, fingers slender, pinching a small pine cone. The surface of the pine cone is rough and dark brown, and the entire scene centers on the figure. The composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space, creating an asymmetrical yet harmonious aesthetic. The background is a layered larch forest, with straight and upright trunks in a deep brown hue. The leaves have been dyed golden yellow, showing a warm orange-yellow hue under the sunlight. The ground is covered with withered yellow leaves and sparse grass, with some areas scattered with dappled light and shadow, creating a rich autumn atmosphere. Light comes from diagonally above, representing the warm sun of morning or evening. Golden beams of light pass through the treetops, creating a distinct backlighting effect. Soft contour light is produced, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall light and shadow contrast is sharp, yet the transition is natural. The tones are mainly warm yellow, brown, and green, with moderate color saturation, presenting a warm and tranquil visual experience. The image has a slight film texture, with subtle graininess and low contrast, simulating the realism of everyday amateur camera shooting. It feels like a moment captured with an old-fashioned film camera. The background blur is well handled, and the use of a large aperture lens makes the foreground figure stand out clearly. The distant woods gradually blur, creating a distinctly layered sense of space. The composition uses the rule of thirds: the figures are positioned slightly above the right of the frame, and the viewer's gaze is directed toward the upper left, creating an open visual extension. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and warm, filled with the poetry and romance unique to an autumn afternoon, as if time has frozen at this moment, recording the purest encounter between humans and nature",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
