        {
          "id": "krea2-771a02225c3a5ff2659abe0c",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道冷淡坐喝",
          "prompt": "On a city street as night falls, neon lights cast colorful reflections on the damp asphalt road. A woman sits on the rear wing of a bright blue Subaru Impreza WRX STI. She wears a white shirt and a black short skirt, paired with black over-the-knee stockings and platform leather shoes. She gazes lazily at the camera, holding a box of blue-and-white drinks and drinking through a straw. Her posture is relaxed and carefree, legs naturally crossed, one foot gently hanging down, the other firmly planted on the rear of the car. In the foreground is the iconic large rear wing and taillights of this modified sports car, which glow with a warm orange-yellow glow. The body paint reflects the neon glow of surrounding buildings, presenting a metallic cool tone. The rear features modification badges \"TR\" and \"OM,\" and the license plate displays the word \"Chiba.\" The background is a typical Japanese city nightscape, with towering skyscrapers and glass curtain walls reflecting colorful billboards and shop signs. Among them, Japanese neon lights like \"BIG CAMERA\" are clearly visible. The shops lining the street are brightly lit, with products displayed in the windows. In the distance, towering skyscrapers dot the windows like twinkling stars. The sky is deep as ink, with a crescent moon faintly visible between the buildings. The entire scene is composed with a low-angle downward shot, with the figures positioned slightly below the center of the frame, creating a strong visual direction. The lines of the car's rear wing extend to both sides, drawing the gaze toward the characters and background. The vertical lines in the background and the building's silhouette enhance the sense of spatial depth. The light and shadow atmosphere is cinematic, with a strong contrast of warm and cool tones. The blue-toned body contrasts sharply with the orange-yellow streetlights and neon lights, creating a city aesthetic that is both modern and nostalgic. The overall image has a slight film graininess and color shift, as if captured with an old-fashioned film camera, capturing the loneliness and romance of the city night. Light intertwines from multiple directions, including soft diffused light from streetlights and intense direct light from neon lights. The shadowed areas are deep and layered, with rich details, presenting an atmosphere of daily life yet full of storytelling. Like a frozen moment in a youth film, filled with poetic imaginations of speed, freedom, and urban life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
