        {
          "id": "krea2-d9b868b44ce6a7cdf12822ca",
          "alias": "单女绿毛衣摄影棚自信站立展示",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors under the sunlight, wearing a light green high-neck sleeveless knit dress. The dress is designed to fit her figure, with side slit details at the waist, showcasing elegant curves and exquisite tailoring. The fabric features a delicate ribbed texture with a natural drape, and the color is soft and fresh, with a hint of mint green tones. The color harmonizes with the surroundings, appearing smooth and glossy. Her expression is calm yet tinged with gentleness and composure. Her body gently turns to form a graceful S-shaped curve. The right hand gently rests behind the body, the left hand naturally hangs at the side, the posture relaxed and confident. The foreground shows the main figure occupying the main position in the frame, fully visible from above the knees. The background features blurred green trees and shrubs, with leaves creating mottled light and shadow in the sunlight, creating a soft blur effect. In the distance, some white stone steps and walls can be seen, with gray stone slabs paved on the ground. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating interplay of light and shadow on the ground. The composition uses a medium-shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame. Using the rule of thirds in composition and highlighting the subject through background blur, the light comes from the upper right, representing bright natural daylight. The overall lighting is uniform and soft, with natural shadow transitions without obvious hard shadows. The leaves and branches in the background appear semi-transparent under backlighting, creating a warm and fresh atmosphere. The overall color tone of the painting is light green, gray-blue, and natural green, with moderate color saturation and soft contrast, exuding a strong summer atmosphere and youthful vitality, with rich layers of light and shadow. There are both bright highlights and delicate shadow transitions, creating a tranquil and beautiful outdoor scene. It feels as if capturing a leisurely afternoon moment. The image presents the texture of professional studio outdoor shooting, while retaining the natural and casual feel of daily life. It feels like a realistic work shot with a medium format camera or a high-end digital camera. The lens focuses on the subject, the background is moderately blurred, highlighting the subject while preserving enough environmental information. The overall image is clean and tidy. With no cluttered elements, the composition is balanced, and the color scheme is coordinated, conveying a fresh, natural, elegant, and vibrant visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
