        {
          "id": "krea2-f3f5f54ce26bb643e704a8d3",
          "alias": "单女全裸白高领衫城市微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a stairwell inside a modern building, wearing an off-white turtleneck knit sweater and a gray pleated mini skirt, naturally leaning against a wooden armrest. Her left hand rests lightly on the armrest, while her right hand hangs naturally. Her body turns slightly, and she looks straight at the camera with a gentle smile. Her overall look is simple, elegant, and full of youthful energy. Her legs are long and straight, and she wears nude-colored stockings, with smooth and natural leg lines. The main subject is positioned in the middle foreground, occupying the center right of the frame. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle. Highlighting the height and presence of the characters while enhancing the sense of spatial depth, the background is a spacious and bright indoor area. The white cylindrical structure stands tall, with transparent glass railings reflecting the surrounding light and shadow. Embedded circular spotlights on the ceiling emit soft warm light, creating a uniform illumination effect. In the distance, multiple floor slabs can be seen interlaced and extended, with clean and sharp lines that create a sense of spatial layering. The middle view mainly features stair landings and glass railings, with wooden handrails in warm brown color, contrasting with the cool-toned glass. The visual guide line extends from the handrail to both sides, directing the gaze to the figure, then upward to the ceiling and architectural structure, forming a stable triangular composition. Light comes from the ceiling, mixing artificial lighting with a small amount of natural light. The overall lighting is soft and even, without strong shadows. The colors are mainly off-white, gray-blue, wood brown, transparent glass, and white walls. The tones are fresh and clean, with a slight warm tone, creating a cozy and comfortable atmosphere. The images have the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting. It feels as if you casually capture moments in a public space with a portable camera or phone, rich in details without excessive embellishment, preserving slight graininess and natural exposure control, presenting a vivid and realistic imaging style. The architectural lines in the background are clear, glass reflections are slight, reflecting the minimalist aesthetic of modern design. Characters' expressions are natural and relaxed, without forced posing, enhancing the image's intimacy and immersion. The entire scene is filled with the everyday atmosphere of urban life, combining the compositional beauty of artistic photography. It still retains the authentic warmth of life records, with smooth and delicate transitions of light and shadow, harmonious tones, creating a peaceful and warm afternoon atmosphere, as if time stands still at this moment, leaving only a gentle smile frozen deep within the space",
