        {
          "id": "krea2-2120fc004de595a07d2e12d7",
          "alias": "单女米连衣裙屋顶严肃坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the edge of a rustic blue-tiled roof, wearing a beige sleeveless long dress with delicate vertical pleats, hugging her figure yet still graceful. She sits barefoot cross-legged on dark gray tiles, left leg bent, right leg naturally hanging down, hands lightly resting between knees and eaves, head slightly tilted back, expression calm and distant. Her posture seems both deep in thought and feeling the comfort of a gentle breeze. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the middle shot, using a three-part composition The figure occupies the right third of the painting, while the left side is blank to emphasize the sense of space and the extension of the architectural structure. In the foreground are layers of neatly arranged dark gray blue tiles. The surface of the tiles shows slight signs of age, with some edges showing slight wear and moss adherence, giving a realistic and substantial texture. The edge of the eaves forms a clear diagonal line, guiding the gaze from the lower left corner upward to the figure. The background is a typical cluster of traditional Jiangnan architecture, with gray-white walls mottled and old, faint water stains and weathering marks visible on the walls, and the eaves arranged in curved layers. The lines are smooth and rhythmic, with a distant section of stone steps and arches faintly visible, enhancing the depth of the space. The overall color scheme is mainly gray, brown, and beige, harmoniously unified to create a tranquil, nostalgic, and slightly poetic atmosphere. The lighting is soft naturally scattered light, diffused from cloudy days for smooth transitions without strong contrasts. Shadows fall softly on shoulders and skirts, and subtle reflections on the floor tiles suggest a damp airy feeling. The sky appears pale gray-blue tones, with thin clouds. The overall visual atmosphere is cool and gentle, resembling a quiet moment in the early morning or evening. The image has a strong film-like texture, similar to the graininess and slight vignetting effects of vintage cameras. The color saturation is low but rich in layering, details are clear, and the composition is meticulous. Using architectural lines and human postures to visually guide the audience, it directs the viewer's gaze toward the characters, creating an atmosphere of reflection, meditation, and dialogue with nature. The images present a photographic style that combines artistic beauty with the atmosphere of everyday life. Like a fleeting moment captured by a vintage rangefinder camera in the alleys of an ancient town, full of story and emotional tension, the overall composition resembles a modern ink painting, combining the subtlety and blank space of Eastern aesthetics with the delicacy and authenticity of contemporary imagery. The composition is balanced yet dynamic, the light and shadow are soft yet expressive, the atmosphere is tranquil and profound, making one seem to hear the faint rustling under the tiles and the wind rustling over the roof ridge",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
