          "id": "krea2-34abd004533487763f25996e",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣咖啡厅忧伤坐手持物",
          "prompt": "She wears a deep blue knit cardigan with soft texture and subtle textures, layered with a black low-cut top that highlights her graceful shoulders, neck, and bust curves. She wears black shorts that reveal long, straight legs, smooth and flawless leg skin, and on her feet are blue-soled, red high-heeled open-toe sandals. The upper is printed with classic LV monogram patterns, with clear details. She sits relaxed, one leg bent and raised, the other naturally extended, and her body leans slightly forward, presenting a casual yet charming posture. In the foreground is a gray stone paved walkway, with slight wear on the floor and some areas reflecting water stains. In the middle is the steps at the restaurant entrance, edged with metal trim. The floor is covered with vintage black-and-white tiles featuring circular and snowflake-shaped geometric patterns, beautifully designed and artistically appealing. The background is a weathered red brick wall, with weathering marks and irregular cracks. Next to it is a red pipe extending from the wall, with rust and peeling paint. Next to it is a black metal frame holding a blue object, possibly a trash bin or billboard. On the left side of the image, a corner inside the restaurant can be faintly seen, with a dining table covered by a white tablecloth and wooden chairs. The overall environment creates a unique atmosphere where urban streets blend with vintage interiors, with the composition from a slightly overhead angle. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, forming a smooth visual flow. Light and shadow come from natural light from the side, soft but with strong contrast, while the other side is in shadow, creating strong contrasts of light and shadow that emphasize three-dimensionality and texture. The overall color tone is cool, mainly blue, gray, and black, accented with red high heels and pipes. The color combination is harmonious and layered, creating a calm yet slightly melancholic atmosphere, as if capturing a fleeting moment of tranquility and loneliness in a city corner, with a realistic feel reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment shooting with rich details. The lighting and shadows are natural, and the visuals are full of storytelling and artistic appeal",
