        {
          "id": "krea2-024e86166eab495661b9f755",
          "alias": "单女红毛衣广场愤怒站立",
          "prompt": "Her makeup is delicate and natural, presenting a soft matte texture. She wears a bright red sleeveless knit top with straps that accentuate her collarbone, long arms, and a silver square ring and a slender metal ring on her right hand. Her fingers are long and her nails are neatly trimmed. Her left hand rests lightly on a basketball on her knee, which is standard orange with clear black patterns and brand logos, and the texture of the ball is realistic. The texture is distinct: the background is a warm orange storage cabinet, with a white round handle on the cabinet door. The wall is slightly weathered and shows signs of time. The floor is covered with an off-white carpet with red stripes, the stripes extending diagonally with the composition. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space on the right side. The left side is reserved for a golden trophy as a visual balance. The trophy stands tall and upright, covered with a shiny gold coating. At the top is a small figurine statue, and the base is engraved with the words \"fromis_9\" and the date 2018.1.24\", the material reflects a soft metallic sheen, with light softly streaming in from the upper left, creating a warm side lighting. The shadows transition naturally, enhancing the sense of depth. The background cabinet displays a gradient warm tone when illuminated, forming layers from bright to dark areas. The floor and basketball surface have slight reflections, with consistent lighting directions to create a natural indoor lighting atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly orange-red, supplemented by black, gold, and off-white. The color saturation is moderate, with sharp contrast but not glaring, giving the image a strong visual guiding effect, then moves along the path of the arm to the basketball, then turns to the trophy on the left, forming a smooth visual flow. The composition is stable and full of tension, full of youthful energy and symbolic victories. The image texture is delicate and detailed, as if shot by a professional camera in natural light, with a film-like graininess and realistic light and shadow, presenting an atmosphere that combines artistic beauty with everyday life. It resembles a carefully curated idol portrait while retaining an unintentional sense of realism. The image is quiet yet contains strength, and gentle yet reveals determination. It evokes a unique charm and inner confidence unique to women",
