        {
          "id": "krea2-58e15e6d37e6062b86a1ca8c",
          "alias": "单女粉高领衫忧伤侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a pink turtleneck knit top. The fabric is soft and the texture is clearly visible, with vertical stripes arranged tightly to create delicate pleats. The high collar is decorated with ruffles, with slightly curled edges, adding a touch of sweetness and vintage charm. The dress fits the figure perfectly, outlining soft curves and sleeve lengths of moderate length covering the arms, the overall design is simple and elegant. The background is a gray stone steps, with neatly arranged stones and rough surfaces bearing the mottled marks left by time. Fine dust and moss are mixed in the gaps, presenting a natural weathered texture. Light slanting in from the upper right creates a soft side effect. The shadows transition naturally and distinctly. On the left side of the painting is the silhouette of another woman, only her shoulders and arms visible, wearing an orange camisole that is slightly blurred and in a state of low focus, serving as foreground contrast. This enhances the sense of spatial depth in the composition. The composition uses close-ups, with the main subject occupying the center to the right, head slightly tilted, and gaze directed to the left front, creating a thoughtful atmosphere. The lens uses a 50mm prime lens with a moderate focal length, shallow depth of field, and a noticeable background blur, highlighting the subject and evoking viewer associations. The colors are mainly pink, gray, and orange, warm and soft. Pink and gray create a warm and warm contrast, while orange is interspersed within, enriching the layers of the image. The overall atmosphere is tranquil yet slightly melancholic, as if capturing a moment when the afternoon sunlight pours down, filled with youthful innocence and a subtle melancholy, like a film photo taken with a professional camera, featuring slight graininess and natural exposure bias, presenting a realistic and emotionally rich image texture",
