        {
          "id": "krea2-f6698b9e23240d981ba83fae",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙摄影棚沉思站立张开双腿",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a pure gray gradient background, her body slightly turned to the camera, legs spread in a V-shape, posture full of confidence and vitality. She wears a form-fitting off-white short dress. The material is smooth and slightly reflective, closely outlining her body curves to outline her elegant silhouette. The neckline is low-V, the sleeves are short-sleeved, and the hem reaches mid-thigh. Revealing long, fair legs, she wears a pair of black high-heeled platform shoes. The smooth, reflective uppers and thick heels are sturdy and sturdy. The overall look is fashionable and sexy, naturally draped over the shoulders and back, with a slightly playful and confident expression. Light enters from the upper left side of the frame, creating a strong backlighting effect. The light source is positioned slightly to the left behind the figure, producing bright halos and radiating beams that illuminate the character's outline and create a dramatic contrast of light and shadow. The subject is surrounded by strong light, with a bright contour light around the edges. This makes the figure stand out from the background, with a uniform gray gradient that transitions from light gray at the bottom to deep gray at the top, with no debris or textures, highlighting the main subject. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered and occupying the main space. The view is slightly upward to enhance the character's presence and visual impact. The foreground shows the person's entire body and partial ground shadows, which is light gray reflecting the character's reflection and light; the middle ground shows the body and movement details; the background is a simple gray gradient without other interference. The V-shaped gesture of both hands guides the gaze upward, pointing to both sides of the head, forming an open frame that creates a strong emotional connection. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is mainly cool tones, with light shining from behind, creating a sense of stage and artistry, while also carrying the realistic texture of everyday photography. The overall atmosphere is both professional and approachable, as if shooting in a small studio or studio with single-light setup. Equipment may include softboxes and reflectors, with soft light but clear direction, presenting a clean, modern, The expressive visual style features rich image details, natural clothing folds, and clear reflective spots on the high heel surface. The overall image has distinct layers and harmonious color coordination. The main color scheme is gray, white, and black, creating a warm and cool contrast that enhances visual appeal. The edges of the frame have slight lens distortion and noise, simulating real camera shooting without excessive sharpening, preserving a certain original texture. Overall, it presents a visual work that combines commercial advertising and personal portrait style. It combines artistic beauty with a close connection to everyday photography expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
