        {
          "id": "krea2-0451f14076da7875ee628870",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫镜前冷淡持灯",
          "prompt": "She wears a pristine white long-sleeved shirt with a neat collar and loose lantern sleeves. The cuffs are cinched to reveal slender wrists, and the hem is tucked into a black high-waisted mini skirt. The fabric is smooth and clings to the body's curves, outlining the lines of her long legs. A deep blue tie is casually tied at the chest, the tie knot loose. Naturally hanging down, adding a touch of rebellion and rebellion. She held a smartphone with a red phone case in her right hand, the screen facing herself, taking a picture in the mirror. Her fingers gently pressed on the back of the phone, and she wore a black woven wristband on her wrist. Her left hand hung down, lightly touching the outside of her thigh, her posture relaxed yet elegant. The background was light green walls and gray tiled floors. The walls were simple and unadorned, and in the distance, a closed wooden door and a tall green plant could be seen, with broad, lush leaves. Placed in a black flowerpot in the corner, at the end of the corridor, a white radiator and metal handrail can be faintly seen. The overall lighting is soft and cool, with natural or artificial lighting from above evenly diffused on the figures and environment, creating subtle shadows. The composition centers on the figure, using a symmetrical mirror layout. The figure occupies the left side of the painting, leaving space on the right to extend the corridor, creating a sense of depth. The light and shadow are distinct, and the folds of clothing have delicate shadow transitions. The overall atmosphere is quiet, private, and slightly distant. The color palette mainly uses cool white, gray-green, and black, accented by a touch of red phone case as a visual focal point. The image texture feels authentic and natural, resembling everyday moments taken with a regular phone, with slight noise and low-saturation colors, presenting a life-oriented, authentic beauty. The composition is stable and balanced, details rich, and emotional expression is subtle and profound, as if capturing an ordinary yet story-filled moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
