        {
          "id": "krea2-5ed66ac25452905e5c2cca37",
          "alias": "单女黑短裙沙发温柔持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a white long-sleeve, fitted short top with pleats at the chest, outlining a slender waistline. She pairs a black high-waisted mini skirt with a clean and sharp hem, revealing her long legs. Her legs are crossed and slightly bent, with her right leg in front and left leg behind. She wears white lace over-the-knee socks with delicate ruffled decorations at the cuff, the lace pattern is delicate and complex, revealing the glow of her skin. Her left hand gently rests on the sofa backrest, while her right hand rests at her side, her posture relaxed and elegant. The background is a light gray wall, flat and unadorned. The sofa is made of beige or light gray-brown fabric with subtle textures and stitching. The sofa backrest and seat cushion are full and thick. On the left side is a cushion with alternating brown and white patterns. The composition centers on the person, shot in a medium shot, with the figure occupying most of the space, fully visible from knees to head, with a slightly lower angle. It creates a friendly and natural visual impression. The foreground clearly shows the details of the legs and socks, the middle ground shows the torso and upper body, and the background features the sofa and walls. The layers are distinct, and the details of the legs and lace stockings are soft and even, creating a natural transition of shadows. The lighting is warm to a cozy tone, creating an overall cozy and comfortable atmosphere with a sense of everyday home. It feels like a real life scene shot with a regular camera or phone, without excessive embellishment, carrying a sense of authenticity and familiarity. A slightly intimate everyday atmosphere, with mainly off-white, light gray, black, and white tones, harmonious and unified colors, rich details, and authentic texture, presenting a quiet, gentle, and slightly lazy afternoon atmosphere. The images are tranquil and emotional, like a carefully composed personal portrait, full of life and artistic beauty",
