        {
          "id": "krea2-7c38bb26a25406a5459cda5a",
          "alias": "单女黑短裙室内沉思站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a delicate gray lace long-sleeve top and a black high-waisted pencil skirt stands in a simple pure white space. Her figure is tall and well-proportioned, her posture elegant and composed. Her hands are naturally folded in front of her, fingers slightly bent, and fingertips lightly touch the hem of the dress, revealing a reserved yet confident aura. The soft drape drapes over her shoulders, adding a touch of tenderness and laziness. She leans slightly to the side, tilting her head slightly with a thoughtful expression. Her makeup is refined and natural, perfectly complementing the overall look. She wears a pair of black pointed high heels The heels are slender and straight, paired with sheer black stockings. The leg lines are smooth and graceful, presenting a typical fashion model-like body proportion. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the composition, with the figure occupying about two-thirds of the height, forming the visual focal point. The foreground focuses on the entire character's body, fully presented from head to ankle. The background features large areas of pure white walls and floors, creating a minimalist spatial atmosphere. On the right is a simple white cube structure with a smooth and flat surface and clear edges. It forms a geometric contrast with the figures. The middle shot creates a gap between the figure and the cube, leaving enough breathing space to enhance the sense of layering in the image. The composition combines vertical symmetry with the golden ratio, with the figure's body forming a subtle diagonal relationship with the cube, breaking the stiffness caused by perfect symmetry. Then, turning to the high heels on the feet, a coherent visual pathway is formed. Light and shadow come from the upper left, soft and even, a standard studio lighting setup. The main light source is on the left side of the figure, casting a slight shadow onto the body and the ground on the right, the shadow edges transition naturally, with a delicate texture. The lace top's hollowed-out texture is clearly visible under the light, presenting delicate pattern layers. The black dress absorbs most of the light, forming deep shadows that contrast sharply with the light gray top. The overall color scheme is mainly black, white, and gray, creating a calm and restrained yet warm visual impression. The atmosphere is tranquil and sophisticated, carrying the independence and elegance of modern urban women. The image texture is close to professional studio shooting, with rich details and faithful color reproduction. It also retains a sense of everyday life, as if a photographer used a mid-to-high-end camera paired with a standard lens to capture a photo shoot in a bright indoor environment, exuding a strong sense of fashion and artistic expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
