        {
          "id": "krea2-94fc5080351869593feb8385",
          "alias": "单女白旗袍竹林沉思站立持花",
          "prompt": "A woman wears an off-white sleeveless qipao adorned with delicate black bamboo leaf patterns. The stand-up collar design is elegant and unique, with a slim cut that outlines a slender figure. The hem naturally falls to the ankles, blending traditional Eastern aesthetics with modern fashion. She gently holds a bouquet of pure white lilies in both hands, the flowers lush and green leaves scattered throughout. Her posture is gentle and dignified, her expression calm and slightly contemplative. Standing under the corridor of a traditional Chinese pavilion, the dark wooden railings feature geometric hollow patterns, exquisitely constructed with smooth lines. The columns are thick and upright, supporting the entire pavilion. Sunlight streams in from the left, casting clear light and shadow on the ground and figures, creating a contrast between light and shadow. The light is warm and soft, creating a tranquil atmosphere in the morning or afternoon. The background is a typical Jiangnan garden landscape, with lush trees and lush branches and leaves. In the distance, the silhouettes of buildings with white walls and black tiles can be faintly seen. The roof's flying eaves and upturned corners are rustic and elegant, with distinct layers. The shadows of the railings in the foreground form regular geometric patterns on the ground, intertwining with the figures' shadows to enhance the sense of depth in the painting. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of center in the frame, naturally focusing on the subject. The pavilion structure forms a natural frame, with background blur treatment highlighting the subject. The colors are mainly off-white, ink black, emerald green, and gray-brown, with harmonious and unified tones. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and distant, full of poetic and classical charm, like a flowing Chinese painting capturing the moment where tradition and modernity merge. The image texture is delicate, details rich, and light and shadow transitions are natural, delivering high-resolution photography effects. The realistic style reminiscent of professional camera shooting retains slight film graininess and realistic ambient light reflections, presenting a visual experience that is both artistic and close to life. It is suitable for cultural promotion, fashion shoots, or personal portrait creations. There are no unnecessary decorative elements in the image; all scenes serve the theme expression, emphasizing the harmonious coexistence between people and the environment, conveying a restrained and refined Eastern feminine temperament",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
