        {
          "id": "krea2-1d3b7ad1049f97f49b4d8174",
          "alias": "单女灰高领衫冷淡侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman appears in a close-up at the center of the frame, adding a touch of liveliness and spontaneity. She wears a gray turtleneck sleeveless knit top with clearly visible textures, and vertical stripes that hug her body curves, showcasing elegant lines. Her right arm is raised high, with smooth muscle lines and natural underarm skin, with details that are authentic and free from excessive embellishment. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space, the head slightly tilted, and the body slightly tilted, creating an intimate and relaxed atmosphere. The background is an indoor environment, with light gray walls. White fluorescent tubes on the ceiling emit a uniform, cool white light, soft and not harsh. In the background, some blurry signs and office equipment outlines, such as filing cabinets and desks and chairs, are faintly blurred to highlight the main subject. The middle shots have a slight depth transition, creating a sense of layering between foreground and background. Light and shadow come from the upper and foreground light sources, with soft shadows that enhance the sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is warm and everyday, carrying a sense of authentic life. It feels like a casual shot with a regular camera or phone, capturing the beauty and composure of the person in their natural state. The tones are mainly gray, white, and brown, harmonious and unified. The image texture is delicate and rich, combining the refinement of artistic photography with the warmth and authenticity of everyday life",
