        {
          "id": "krea2-608e0b7f1dfda0d2d311ab44",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙窗边严肃倚靠阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman leans sideways against the window, her body slightly leaning back, her head turned toward the camera. She wears a white lace slip dress with pink and purple floral patterns. The material is light and translucent, with a slightly puffy hem that reveals a slender waist and back line. The strap design is simple and elegant, with subtle pleats at the shoulder straps. Her left arm is bent and resting on the windowsill, with a clearly visible tattoo on the arm that reads \"FEMININITY,\" written in a simple and modern style. Her arm muscles are naturally smooth, and she wears a small silver bracelet on her wrist, reflecting a faint glow. Her posture is relaxed and confident, as if enjoying a moment of tranquility. In the background is a wide floor-to-ceiling window framed in black metal, with clean and clean lines. Outside the window is a blurred outline of city buildings, with distant tall buildings faintly visible. The sky is pale blue, the clouds are thin, and light streams in through the window, creating a soft backlight effect and a faint halo. The window glass shows slight reflections and stains. Adding realism: the interior walls are pure white, simple and clean, with no unnecessary decoration. The overall space feels spacious and bright. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned slightly toward the center on the left side of the frame, while a large blank area on the right side is left to create a sense of breathing and spatial extension. The foreground features the figure's body and part of the windowsill, the middle is her full-body posture and window frame structure, and the background is a blurred city skyline with clear layers, focusing attention on the figure. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by natural light, with light coming from the right rear. It creates soft contour transitions of light and shadow, with colors dominated by white, pink, purple, and brown. The tone is fresh and soft, presenting a natural and authentic beauty from everyday life. It feels like a moment taken with an amateur camera, full of life and emotional warmth. The image has a slight film graininess and low color saturation, enhancing the documentary and nostalgic atmosphere. The details are rich and textures clear. All elements together form an artistic yet life-close realistic image",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
