        {
          "id": "krea2-d318448beca19c3712d4d41b",
          "alias": "单女户外微笑站立",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman wearing a wide-brimmed straw hat, creating a soft and layered light effect that presents a warm golden yellow tone, creating a dreamlike visual texture. Facing the camera, slightly parted, reveals white, neat teeth and a subtle smile. Her right hand gently supports the edge of the hat, fingers long and fair, moving gracefully and naturally. Her arms are raised to her chest, the sleeves are white knitted fabric with fine textures, and the shoulder straps are slender. The overall look is fresh and sweet, with a background of blurred green plants It could be outdoor grass or woods. The blur treatment makes the subject stand out. The composition uses close-ups, with the subject occupying most of the space. The angle is slightly upward, enhancing the character's sense of depth and approachability. Light and shadow come from the side and rear, typical of backlit photography. The light source is soft and diffuse, forming a warm contour light that gives the edges a golden halo. The overall color tone is mainly warm yellow, orange, and light green, with moderate saturation and low contrast, creating a peaceful, comfortable, and summer-like atmosphere The image has a film-like texture, with slight graininess and soft out-of-focus blur, simulating real camera shooting effects. It feels like shooting with a medium format film camera or a high-end mirrorless camera on a clear afternoon. The lens is a prime portrait lens with an aperture of about f/1.8, capturing delicate skin details and rich light and shadow layers. The image shows no post-processing traces, preserving the original dynamic light and shadow and natural texture, conveying a quiet, gentle, and vibrant everyday beauty. Like a fleeting summer afternoon moment captured unintentionally, it evokes the slow flow of time and the pure beauty of youth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
