        {
          "id": "krea2-3593fdf983026ede957af9a9",
          "alias": "单女棕衬衫街道沉思站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beside a utility pole on a city street, dressed in a brown plaid shirt and beige coat, her expression slightly relaxed and contemplative. The overall look is simple yet textured, with a thick black utility pole covered with various billboards and road signs. At the top is a medical billboard with white lettering on a blue background that reads \"Internal Medicine · Surgery, Dermatology & Plastic Surgery.\" Below is a red \"Temae\" and phone number \"03-6455-0460\", followed by a green road sign with white letters such as \"Sarugakucho 12\" and small characters like \"Kokoha\" and \"Outdoor Advertising Permit\". In the middle is a green traffic sign with white kanji characters \"decorative character\" and \"つうがく\" along with a blurry pattern. The surface of the utility pole shows wear marks and tape wrapping, appearing somewhat dated. In the center is a bust of a woman, positioned slightly to the left center of the frame. Light shines from the right front, with a blurred urban building cluster in the background. In the distance, several high-rise buildings—one is a deep blue modern building, the other a light gray high-rise residential building. The sky appears a clear pale blue, with warm tones close to dusk. The sunlight slants down, enveloping the entire scene in a warm golden glow. On the ground nearby, there are some blurry yellow bushes and white road markings. The composition uses the classic rule of thirds, with the figure occupying the left third of the frame. Utility poles serve as vertical elements to guide the viewer's gaze. The architectural lines in the background contrast with the horizon of the sky, creating a sense of space and depth. The visual guide starts from the utility pole in the foreground and extends to the buildings and sky in the background. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with golden sunset afterglow casting on the figures, creating a backlighting effect that highlights the contours. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, brown, and blue, with strong contrasts of warm and cool tones, creating a tranquil urban evening atmosphere. The image has a strong sense of daily life and life. It feels like a real street scene shot with an amateur camera, with slight film graininess and natural color shifts. The exposure is slightly overexposed, enhancing the dramatic light and shadow, presenting a gentle, authentic, and story-rich urban life segment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
