        {
          "id": "krea2-496caece3b76f16fa16cbbc0",
          "alias": "单女泳装海滩微笑躺展示",
          "prompt": "On a sunny tropical beach, a woman lies on the soft, delicate golden sand. She wears a bikini with a blue-green gradient skirt, adorned with delicate lace trim along the edges. The straps are slender and sturdy, showcasing youthful energy and natural beauty, appearing both casual and full of vitality. She wears a radiant smile, showing her white, neat teeth, conveying pure joy and carefree emotions. Her hands rest on the sand, fingers slightly apart, palms touched with fine sand. As if just crawling out of a pile of sand or about to rise, the movements are natural and smooth, full of movement. The body posture is in a push-up position, with a slightly arched back, a graceful waistline, legs stretched back, one foot raised, the sole facing upward, presenting a relaxed yet dynamic posture. The muscles of the arms and shoulders are soft, showing good physical condition. The background is a vast, boundless beach with fine and even sand grains showing a warm beige tone. In the distance, scattered seaweed fragments and shell fragments add a touch of realism Although the sky is not fully visible, the bright light and strong shadows indicate it is a clear noon. Sunlight shines from a high angle, creating clear and sharp shadows. The figure's outline is sharp, while the lower body and hands cast deep shadows, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and spatial layering. The composition uses a low-angle downward view, positioning the figure slightly below the center of the frame, with the line of sight extending upward, creating a warm and captivating visual experience. The middle shot showcases the posture of the body and the beach environment. The background features blurry sand stretching into the distance, creating a sense of depth from near to far. The overall color palette is mainly warm tones, with earth tones like yellow, orange, and brown contrasting sharply with the blue swimsuit, creating a harmonious and visually striking atmosphere. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is bright and lively, full of summer energy and freedom. The image quality is close to professional studio outdoor shooting, using a large aperture lens to capture shallow depth of field. The background blurs naturally while retaining enough detailed textures, such as the grainy texture of sand grains and the texture of swimsuits. The overall style combines realism and artistry, as if shooting a high-end DSLR with a standard prime lens outdoors in natural light, evoking a strong sense of presence and everyday life, like a real beach vacation moment frozen in time, conveying a relaxed, joyful, and pure emotional tone",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
