        {
          "id": "krea2-bd1ab5f737b2220e51545043",
          "alias": "单女短裙舞台自信持相机",
          "prompt": "Her right hand gently strokes the hem of her skirt at her waist, while her left hand hangs naturally at her side. Her posture is elegant and confident, wearing a black fitted cropped top with a high neckline and cutout details. The sleeves are three-quarter sleeves that fit the arm lines and show off her long arm curves. She pairs a matching high-slit short skirt with an irregular waist design revealing part of her abdomen. The overall look is fashionable, avant-garde, and full of sexiness, set against a stage background of deep gray tones. The large screen at the back displays blurry white English letters \"TOUR,\" with purple and green gradient halos at the edges, creating a dreamlike light and shadow effect. The foreground occupies the main position, with a centrally symmetrical layout. The figure is center-left, with a slightly tilted body creating a dynamic aesthetic. Light comes from a spotlight slightly on the front right, softly illuminating the subject evenly, while subtle light spots and scattering effects appear in the background, enhancing spatial layering. The overall atmosphere is both modern and artistic. It was as if a carefully planned performance was frozen in time, with predominantly black and white tones accented by neon backgrounds, creating a strong visual contrast. The images presented professional-level studio-level clarity and delicate texture, while retaining the authenticity and spontaneous charm of live shooting, like precious moments captured backstage with a high-end DSLR camera. The details were rich, emotionally rich, full of tension and storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
