        {
          "id": "krea2-95b5a730d003fabb75f79534",
          "alias": "单女蓝高领衫更衣室媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a deep blue turtleneck tight knit top and black stockings sits gracefully and slightly provocatively on a white marble countertop. She crosses her legs, rests her right leg over her left, toes touching the ground, and wears black stiletto heels. The heels are slender and upright, accentuating her long leg lines. Her body leans back slightly, her head turning to look back at the camera, her expression tinged with laziness and confidence. The texture is soft and glossy, and the overall look exudes a cool and captivating aura. The table she was sitting on was made of smooth white marble, reflecting soft light. The edges were neat, and the lines were simple and modern. On the right side of the table sat a silver metal-shelled automatic sensor tissue machine, and next to it was a white plastic bottle of hand sanitizer, transparent in color, pale blue with a pink cap. These everyday items contrasted sharply with the figure. In the background was a glass window framed with wooden frames, and outside the window was a row of vertically arranged light gray blinds, with faint outdoor light filtering through the gaps. This makes the interior space bright and transparent. The window frames are made of warm brown wood, giving a smooth texture that visually balances the cool-toned interior. The floor is covered with large white tiles, with fine joints and smooth reflective surfaces, reflecting the reflections of the figures and the surrounding environment. The entire scene is set in a modern public restroom or changing room, with white square tiles on the walls. In the corners are black wall-mounted devices, possibly hand dryers or disinfectants. The composition is shot at a slightly tilted low angle, extending from the foreground to the middle ground, the figure is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, occupying the visual center. The left side leaves ample space to display windows and background, creating a sense of openness. At the same time, diagonal lines guide the gaze to focus on the subject. Light and shadow come from natural light outside the window, soft and even, shining in from the upper left, creating a delicate transition of light and shadow on the figure's body, countertop, and floor. The shadows are light and not abrupt, and the overall atmosphere combines the realism of daily life with artistic beauty. The color palette mainly consists of cool blue and pure white. Accented with black and warm wood palm, the color scheme is harmonious and unified, with rich details and clear layers. It combines the authentic texture of everyday scenes with strong visual appeal and emotional tension through character postures and light and shadow treatments, as if capturing a moment of privacy—both everyday and full of storytelling, with a magazine cover-like fashion vibe and cinematic storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
