        {
          "id": "krea2-b38083f8fed1dc348d3eff9d",
          "alias": "单女长裤城市俏皮自拍",
          "prompt": "A red-haired woman takes a selfie in front of an indoor mirror. She wears a bright yellow silk pajama set. The top features a long-sleeve lapel design, with white piping decorating the neckline and pocket edges. The buttons are undone to the abdomen, revealing collarbones and part of the chest line. The bottom is loose pants made of the same material. The overall look is comfortable and homely, adding a touch of laziness and spontaneity, with a touch of playfulness and confidence. She holds a black smartphone in her right hand for a selfie in front of the camera, with the phone case featuring pink handwritten text or patterns. The left hand rests lightly on the marble countertop, fingers naturally bent, posture relaxed and expressive. The background is a modern-style bathroom or dressing room, with walls in light gray or off-white. On the left side, a white shutter door with a simple door frame can be seen. On the right is an open doorway leading to another space. The interior is dimly lit, with faint outlines of dark furniture. The floor is paved with light-colored tiles with fine textures. The countertop is dark brown marble with golden spots, smooth and reflecting the light and shadow of the surrounding environment. The composition centers on the figure. It adopts a diagonal layout, with the figure's body slightly tilted and the arm extending to the upper right of the frame, forming a visual guiding line. Mirror reflections create dual images, enhancing spatial depth and realism. The viewing angle is slightly lower than head-on, making the figures appear more approachable and three-dimensional. Light comes from the ceiling of the room, softly and evenly casting on the figure, creating a natural shadow transition. The overall atmosphere is warm, intimate, yet stylish. The color palette is dominated by warm yellow, paired with a neutral gray-white background. It creates a realistic and artistic capture of everyday moments, as if casually recorded with a regular phone, yet contains strong personal expression and aesthetic pursuits. The rich details in the images enhance the authenticity and immersion of the images, presenting a modern urban woman's daily state that combines the atmosphere of life with aesthetic taste, with a strong documentary photography style and emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
