          "id": "krea2-8b55a3c4a3a367e9f765914c",
          "alias": "单女白T恤雪地坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a vintage wooden chair, with a small green plant tattoo on her right shoulder, adding a touch of nature and life. She wears a white lace camisole dress with a light and flowing hem, revealing her long legs. Her knees are hugged tightly, hands folded on them, her posture elegant yet restrained, her ankles slender, barefoot naturally hanging down, showcasing a pure beauty. In the foreground is a pot of blooming white Phalaenopsis orchids, whose flowers are as white as snow, with layered petals, upright stems, lush green leaves, broad leaves, and slightly curled edges. Nearby are some small green plants and moss, creating a vibrant atmosphere. In the center is a wooden chair for a woman to sit. The chair is elegantly designed with carved decorations, and the backrest and armrests have smooth lines. The cushion is made of light gray fabric with fine stitching. Vines and green leaves are wrapped around the chair, and the background is a rough beige stone wall. The wall is uneven and clearly textured, showing traces of time. The wall is covered with lush ivy, with layers of leaves, some of which glow softly in the sunlight On the right side, there is a large monstera with broad, palm-like splits and rounded edges, adding a tropical touch to the composition. The overall composition uses a golden ratio slightly to the left of the center, with the figure positioned on the left side of the painting as the main focal point. The body is slightly turned and the head turns toward the frame, creating a dynamic sense of balance. The flowers and plants in the foreground extend from the lower left corner to the center, guiding the gaze upward to converge on the figure, while the background plants and walls extend backward, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. Light streams in diagonally from the right side of the frame, creating a soft backlighting effect. Sunlight filters through gaps in the leaves, casting mottled shadows on the figures, while leaving faint shadows on the ground and walls. The contrast is strong but the transition is natural, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow and green, complemented by white and brown, creating a harmonious and unified color that feels fresh, natural, and full of life. The image texture is delicate and rich, as if shot with a high-resolution camera. It has a strong artistic sense and cinematic visual impact, while retaining the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting, as if recording a tranquil afternoon. The air is filled with faint floral fragrances and earthy scents, evoking a sense of tranquility and beauty away from the noise",
