        {
          "id": "krea2-bdf365c24d9476871f638c4e",
          "alias": "单女紫泳装泳池微笑倚靠过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sat by the pool, naturally draped over her shoulders. She wore a bright smile, showing her neat, white teeth, looking at the camera, fingers slightly bent in a playful pose. Her right hand naturally rested on the edge of the pool, her body leaning forward slightly, showing a healthy, well-proportioned figure and graceful curves. She wore a light purple bikini swimsuit, with a thin crossed strap on the upper half and a wide fabric wrapping around the chest. The lower half was low-rise, making the overall look simple yet sexy. Her abdomen was flat, her waist slender, and her chest full and prominent. The lines are smooth and natural, with the background being the blue pool water, shimmering and reflecting sunlight. In the distance, blurred green trees and shrubs create a soft blur effect. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, occupying the main visual space. The foreground features brown tiles and metal handrails along the pool edge, with a clear texture. The middle ground shows the main subject and part of the pool surface, while the background features gradient colors of greenery and sky. Light and shadow come from the upper left, creating a natural contrast between light and dark. Sunlight casts soft shadows on the figure, highlighting three-dimensionality and contours. The water reflects bright spots, creating a warm and radiant summer atmosphere. The overall tone is fresh and bright, accented with a light purple swimsuit. The color combination is harmonious and pleasing, extending along the body's curves to the pool and background. The composition is balanced and stable, creating strong visual appeal. The image style is realistic and natural, as if shot outdoors under natural light with a professional camera. The details are rich and layered, presenting a relaxed and pleasant atmosphere. The vibrant summer vacation scene offers the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting, with natural light transitions, minimal noise, moderate color saturation, and a warm and comfortable overall atmosphere that evokes sunshine, water ripples, and youthful energy",
