          "id": "krea2-eca00ac116089457001bc3f1",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙商店沉思站立泼洒",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a vintage Japanese shop, wearing a white polka dot sleeveless dress adorned with black polka dots, a thin black ribbon tied around her waist, black strap sandals, holding a wide-brimmed straw hat in her right hand with a red ribbon bow. Her posture is elegant and natural, her expression slightly contemplative and gentle, her head slightly tilted, and the overall look exudes nostalgia and serene beauty. In the foreground is a clear full-body image. The composition is center-right, with the figures occupying the main visual space, creating a strong sense of subjectivity. The background is a small reddish-brown grid tile wall, above which is a wooden window frame structure. Inside the window are various products, including canned drinks, paper box packaging, and bottled items, neatly arranged in glass cabinets. On the left wall is a black-and-white male portrait poster with vivid expressions. On the right is a red vintage public telephone placed on the windowsill, with the telephone line winding into the character's hand. The entire scene exudes a strong Showa-era Japanese street atmosphere. The colors are mainly warm red-brown, off-white, and light gray, accented with bright red telephones and black polka dots to form visual focal points. The light and shadows are soft and even, like afternoon sunlight pouring from above, creating a peaceful and cozy everyday atmosphere. The composition adopts a level view angle with a stable viewpoint, highlighting the interaction between the characters and their environment. The visual guide naturally leads from the red telephone line to the characters, forming a smooth visual path, with text in the background. The phrase \"Mai Do Difficult Goza Masu\" is clearly visible, adding a real sense of life to the image. The overall atmosphere blends nostalgia, everyday, gentleness, and a hint of solitude, as if capturing a moment of tranquility. The image texture is close to high-resolution film photography, with rich details and clear layers, presenting an artistic documentary style. The tone is slightly warm, with slight graininess and natural exposure, simulating the realistic feel of amateur camera photography while preserving the refinement of the image. while still maintaining the authenticity and warmth of life.",
