          "id": "krea2-bb7bee52754a2285fbdb4211",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫户外微笑站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors in a sunny natural setting, her subject at the center of the scene. She wears a loose light blue shirt with delicate pleats at the neckline and white ruffle trim. The fabric is light and breathable, gently swaying in the breeze, presenting a fresh and natural summer atmosphere. Revealing a subtle yet gentle smile, revealing a hint of shyness and calmness. The overall posture is elegant and natural, with the body slightly tilted to the camera and the head slightly tilted, creating a friendly yet distant visual effect. The foreground mainly focuses on the heads and shoulders of the figures, occupying most of the space and highlighting their role as the visual center. The background features blurred green plants, mainly pine or conifer branches and leaves, creating a blurred bokeh effect and a soft green background. This enhances the sense of depth and space in the composition. In the middle shot, you can see some faint outlines of leaves and interlacing light and shadow, further enriching the layers of the composition. The composition uses a classic central style, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the image. The rule of thirds is used to stabilize the visual center of gravity, while leaving enough negative space on the right side, allowing the gaze to naturally extend into the lush greenery in the background, creating a balanced beauty that combines movement and stillness. This extends further to the natural environment in the background, creating a sense of tranquility. A soothing and vibrant atmosphere. In terms of lighting, the light source comes from the upper right of the image, simulating the angle of natural daylight to create soft highlights. The left side shows natural shadow transitions to enhance three-dimensionality, while subtle contrasts of light and shadow are created in the folds of clothing, highlighting material details. The overall lighting is warm and soft, without harsh direct glare, creating a hazy feeling like morning or afternoon sunlight filtering through the leaves. The ambiance is fresh, warm, healing, and slightly dreamy. It feels as if capturing a quiet afternoon nap in the woods. The entire scene is full of youthful energy and natural beauty. The color scheme is based on the complementary color combination of red and green, harmoniously unified and visually appealing. It features a slight film graininess and a low-saturation retro filter effect, simulating the authentic texture of everyday amateur camera shooting. It feels like a frame of real image taken from everyday moments, preserving artistic aesthetic pursuits while retaining a life-like, authentic touch",
          "description": "",
