        {
          "id": "krea2-a4c6e8eafaa890f395dfde8c",
          "alias": "单女湿身霓虹夜景忧伤倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "Her slightly damp skin reflected a soft halo, as if she was about to say something but hesitated. She wore a dark lace off-shoulder top, its texture faintly visible in the interplay of light and shadow. The shoulder design highlighted the graceful lines of her collarbone, and the fabric of the garment seemed softer and more fitting in the humid air. The background is a blurry city street, with streetlights and car headlights creating large bokeh spots on the rain-soaked ground. Orange-yellow, blue-green, and white intertwine to create a dreamlike halo. The ground reflects from the rain, reflecting distant neon lights and building silhouettes, creating a city nightscape atmosphere where reality and illusion coexist. The camera uses shallow depth of field, completely blurring the background to create a strong visual layering. The composition centers on the right side of the frame, leaving space on the left side to naturally extend the gaze into the flow of light and shadow in the background. The light mainly comes from the front right, creating a contrast of light and shadow. At the same time, the cool-toned background light contrasts with warm light, enhancing the drama and emotional tension of the image. The overall lighting presents the grainy texture and low-saturation color tendency characteristic of film photography, with slight noise and fading effects, simulating the realism of vintage cameras or amateur equipment. The image tones are warm yet calm, with red main light colliding with blue ambient light, creating an atmosphere that is both intimate and distant. The subject's posture is slightly lazy but full of power The body leans slightly backward, the head turns around, creating a dynamic moment full of tension. The entire scene seems to freeze a quiet moment in a rainy night, capturing both the city's noise and personal inner peace. The visuals are full of storytelling and poetry, capturing a lonely yet beautiful moment in the city night like a movie lens, conveying an emotional tone of subtle melancholy and tenderness",
