        {
          "id": "krea2-b41bbe5a7e1bab767d97be6a",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫床忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a white long-sleeved shirt paired with a beige knit vest and a plaid mini skirt, sitting on a wooden bed covered with light gray sheets. Her right leg is bent and raised, knee slightly bent, wearing white stockings, while her left leg stretches out naturally, crossed to form a gentle curve. The headboard is a light wood board, with a white pillow beside it, with a faint pattern printed on the pillow. Next to the bed was a wooden nightstand, on which lay an open book. The pages were yellowed, the spine somewhat worn, and beneath the book were several pens and a metal clip. On the floor under the bed lay a carelessly discarded dark garment. The background was a plain grayish-white wall, with dim light in the corner. The curtains were made of light gray fabric, soft in texture, and soft natural light streamed in from the left. The light slanted into the room, creating rich layers of light and shadow. The overall tone was cool, mainly gray-white, beige, and brown, creating a quiet, The atmosphere is restrained and slightly artistic, with a medium shot perspective. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The bed and nightstand form a stable triangular structure, guiding the gaze to focus on the figure. The foreground features the nightstand and books, the middle ground is the person and bed, and the background is walls and curtains. The layers are distinct, and light and shadow enter from the left, creating a soft side lighting effect. The overall image presents a sense of capturing moments in everyday life, as if a real scene was shot with a regular camera in the early morning or evening. It features a strong documentary style and emotional tension, with realistic and delicate details in the visuals, clear textures, smooth transitions of light and shadow, and no signs of over-processing. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and storytelling, like a frozen image of youthful memories, full of poetry and subtle melancholy",
