          "id": "krea2-8755846f556f8a9097c3ef01",
          "alias": "单女绿西装街道忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "On the bustling city streets as night falls, a woman stands on a zebra crossing. She wears a deep green velvet blazer, her expression slightly melancholic and contemplative. Her slightly lowered posture reveals a restrained detachment. One hand is tucked into her pocket, the other hangs naturally, her posture relaxed yet tinged with a touch of effortless elegance. Simple gold earrings shimmer softly in the light and shadow. The main figure is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, with the figure occupying about one-third of the frame, her body slightly tilted. The head turns toward the camera but avoids the gaze, creating a visual tension that feels both near and distant. The background is a typical urban nightscape, with towering skyscrapers and colorful neon signs. Orange, blue, and white lights intertwine into a flowing sea of light and shadow. The text on the billboards is blurry, creating a strong sense of urban noise. Pedestrians move like shadows on the street, and due to prolonged exposure, dynamic blur creates blurred light trails. The vehicle's taillights trail red and white light trails. This further enhances the dynamic passage of time and the rhythm of the city. In the middle of the ground, you can see red traffic lights, metal poles and street signs clearly structured, bike lane signs by the roadside, facade details faintly visible, glass curtain walls reflecting surrounding halos, background depths gradually blurring, distant high-rise silhouettes faintly visible in the night sky, composition combining close-up shots and wide-angle perspectives, with figures in the focal area clearly visible, while backgrounds show obvious depth blur, using shallow depth of field to highlight the subject. At the same time, environmental information is preserved to enhance spatial layering. Visual guidance forms a diagonal movement line from lower right to upper left through the characters' gaze and body orientation. The horizontal light tracks in the background contrast with vertical architectural lines, enhancing the rhythm of the image. The lighting atmosphere is dominated by warm tones, with neon lights casting soft halos on the figures. The green coat stands out in the warm and cool contrast, with an overall tone leaning toward yellow-green, with slight film graininess and color shifts, simulating a retro photography style. Light comes from multiple directions, including streetlights, billboards, and car headlights, creating rich transitions of highlights and shadows, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall image presents a contrasting beauty of noise in tranquility and prosperity in solitude, like a street photo taken with an amateur camera, full of life and artistic tension, as if capturing a moment of tranquility and confusion in the heart of city dwellers. The camera appears to be taken by handheld devices, with slight shake and fine focus adjustments, making the image more realistic and immediate. The overall atmosphere is both romantic and distant, combining the glamour of modern cities with the delicate expression of individual emotions, making it suitable for visual creation that depicts themes of youth, independence, and urban women",
