        {
          "id": "krea2-e98721f9b835400ab901ba80",
          "alias": "单女街道忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the balcony railing, appearing casual and genuine, glowing softly in the sunlight. Looking directly at the camera, her expression calm yet tinged with a faint melancholy and contemplation. She wears a black strapless top layered over a loose cover-up with abstract geometric patterns. The cover-up is white as a base and adorned with irregular block patterns in orange, blue, green, and black. The sleeves are rolled up to reveal slender arms. The head rests on a rough wooden railing, whose surface shows obvious wear marks and mottled paint peeling, presenting a sense of age and a sense of life. The foreground is a partial close-up of the railing, occupying the left edge of the painting and forming a visual guiding line. The middle ground features a female subject, positioned slightly to the right center. The composition uses a diagonal angle, with the figure extending from the upper left to the lower right, creating dynamic balance. The background is a blurred city streetscape, with a distant outline of a yellow car. The outlines of the street and buildings are blurred. It creates a shallow depth of field effect, highlighting the subject. The overall light comes from the right side, natural daylight, bright and soft, while the left side of the body creates natural shadows to enhance the sense of depth. The contrast between light and shadow is moderate, creating a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The tones are mainly warm yellow and off-white, complemented by colorful patterns on the cover-up to add visual layers. The overall image presents a subtle beauty from everyday life, as if captured casually with an amateur camera or phone, full of life texture and emotional tension. The composition is simple yet detailed, with the focus on the characters' expressions and postures, conveying a quiet, restrained, and evocative mood. The blurred background further enhances the subject's presence, focusing the viewer's attention entirely on the character itself. The entire scene seems frozen in an ordinary yet moving moment, evoking a sense of youth's fragility and beauty",
