          "id": "krea2-1231e6426894aa0389103be2",
          "alias": "单女红T恤街道冷淡持包",
          "prompt": "A woman on a street at night wears a bright red camisole top paired with camouflage cargo pants, with a vintage-style small bag with red and green plaid patterns slung across her shoulder. Her makeup is delicate with a subtle highlight, presenting a lazy and charming demeanor. Her left hand gently holds a fresh coconut, with the top cut open and decorated with a straw and a small white flower. Her right hand wears a string of pearl bracelets, with transparent or light-colored nail polish applied on her fingers. Her overall posture is relaxed and natural, with her body slightly turned to the side. The head is slightly tilted, creating a casual yet stylish atmosphere. The background is a dim street and alley, with faint building outlines and warm yellow lighting scattered in the distance. The walls are slightly mottled, and the floor is covered in dark paving. The surroundings are quiet and full of life. The light mainly comes from the warm-toned streetlights or neon lights on the right side of the image, creating a soft backlight effect and a striking contrast between light and shadow, highlighting the main contours and details. The background is completely shrouded in darkness, enhancing the depth and mystery of the image. The composition uses the center-right position of the figure, leaving space on the left side to balance the visuals. The layered relationship between the close-up and distant light sources extends to the background night scene, presenting a vivid moment of urban nightlife, as if captured with a phone or portable camera. It has a strong sense of realism and lifestyle aesthetics, with red as the dominant color, contrasting sharply with green coconuts, camouflage pants, and plaid bags, complemented by warm yellow lighting to harmonize the cool and dark night. It creates a contrasting beauty that is both passionate and tranquil. The image texture is delicate, clothing textures are clear, background blur is well handled, and the focus is on the people and coconuts. There is slight noise and film graininess at the edges, simulating the imaging effect of real photography equipment in low-light conditions. The overall atmosphere blends youthful energy, tropical charm, and the romantic atmosphere of urban nightscapes, conveying a free and enjoyable attitude toward life",
