          "id": "krea2-74972622824622826d9f5e40",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣公寓沉思站立持相机",
          "prompt": "Her eyelids are lowered, her expression calm and slightly contemplative, and her overall demeanor appears quiet and reserved. She wears a loose dark gray knit sweater made of coarse knit, with clearly visible grain, a subtle velvet texture and irregular color transitions, presenting a warm and vintage feel. The sleeves are wide and slightly drooping, and the hem naturally folds around the waist, forming pleats. In stark contrast to the black pleated mini skirt below, which features a high-waisted design, the skirt is made of multiple layers of fine pleats, smooth and elastic, with a radiating hem with smooth lines and neat edges, presenting a clean and sharp silhouette. She stands barefoot on the light brown wooden floor, where the floor texture is fine, the wood grain flows naturally, the colors are even, and the floor surface is slightly reflective, showing a certain sheen. Her legs are long and straight, with smooth leg lines and a relaxed foot posture, feet pressed together with toes slightly apart The soles of the feet are flat against the floor. In the left background is an off-white fabric single sofa. The sofa surface is made of short velvet material, soft to the touch, full cushion, and curved backrest. The right armrest is faintly visible. The sofa frame is made of black metal, with clean lines and a stable structure. The wall beside the sofa is light beige, smooth and without obvious texture. Light streams in from the upper right of the frame, creating soft natural light. The light and shadow subtly change on the figure's body, clothing, and floor. The folds of the sweater and the shadow of the skirt hem are clearly visible. The overall composition centers on the figure, using medium shots. The figure occupies about two-thirds of the height of the frame, with the head positioned at the top third of the frame. The body leans slightly forward, arms hang naturally, and the arms become slightly blurred by movement, creating a sense of dynamism. The sofa and wall in the background are blurred, with the focus on the figure, then turns to the ground, forming a complete visual path. The atmosphere is calm and warm, carrying the breath of everyday life, with an overall warm tone. Gray, black, and off-white are the main colors, paired with the brownish-yellow tones of the wooden floor, creating a comfortable and natural home environment. The images are rich in detail and the texture is realistic, as if captured with a regular home camera, offering a strong sense of presence and immersion",
