          "id": "krea2-3d58cceae88b701515501c4a",
          "alias": "单女制服摄影棚微笑站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a Japanese-style sailor uniform stands in front of a pure white background, naturally cascading over her shoulders, adding a playful touch. She wears a bright smile, showing neat, white teeth, and looks directly at the camera, full of energy and approachability. Her right hand is raised, palm facing the camera, fingers spread wide in a relaxed, casual wave as if greeting the audience. Her left hand hangs naturally and rests gently on her knee, her posture relaxed and expressive. She wears a light beige inner top over a dark blue sleeveless sailor collar top, The neckline is wide with white stripes, and a matching bow is tied at the chest. The neckline is boldly low-cut, highlighting a healthy and full bust contour. The lower half is paired with a dark blue pleated short skirt with white stripes along the hem, creating clear layers. The skirt hugs the body and showcases youthful curves. On her feet, she wears white over-the-knee socks with red and black stripes at the cuff, creating exquisite details. The overall look is classic yet fashionable. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of center in the frame, with the body slightly tilted and the head slightly turned to the side. This creates a natural sense of movement. The composition uses medium shots, presenting the entire view from above the thighs to the top of the head. The background is a flat white fabric or curtain with slight wrinkles and delicate texture, presenting the simple environment typical of a studio. Light comes from the front slightly left, softly illuminating the subject without obvious shadows, creating a clean and bright visual effect. The light and shadow transition is natural, with subtle shadows in the clothing folds, enhancing the three-dimensional effect. The overall atmosphere is warm and lively. Full of youthful energy, it has the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment shooting, as if casually capturing moments between friends. The color palette is mainly blue and white, harmoniously unified, with clean and fresh images free of unnecessary elements. The visual focus is on the expressions and postures of the characters, guiding viewers to feel her joy and confidence. The image style combines a realistic and everyday feel, as if capturing a sunny afternoon where she is blooming brightly at home or in a simple studio with a radiant smile. The entire image conveys a relaxed and pleasant atmosphere. A warm and friendly emotional tone",
