        {
          "id": "krea2-1bd249b92d80509c5473439b",
          "alias": "单女白连帽衫机场忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A girl sits on a metal bench in the airport lounge, wearing a white hoodie and short skirt, black leather shoes paired with white long socks, and white wireless headphones. She gazes ahead with a slightly lonely expression, her left hand gently resting on her knee, her right hand naturally hanging down, her body leaning forward slightly, her posture relaxed and reserved. Beside her is an off-white guitar bag, crisp and crisp, with fine stitching on the surface. The strap hangs naturally and contrasts softly with her clothes. The blue wall behind her is made of square tiles joined together. A blue tone of varying shades is presented. On the wall, there are a few faint light spots like light shining down from above. The floor is smooth gray tiles that reflect the reflections of the figures and benches, creating a symmetrical mirror effect. Sunlight streams in from the left side of the image, casting long strips of light and shadow on the floor, creating a visual rhythm of light and shadow. The entire scene is shrouded in a thin mist, creating a strong sense of air and creating a quiet and lonely atmosphere. The composition is centered slightly to the right of the character, with the bench extending horizontally guiding the gaze to the left, the guitar bag serves as a visual focal point, forming a balanced relationship with the characters. The blue wall in the background contrasts with the warm light in the foreground, enhancing the dramatic tension of the scene. The camera uses a low-angle shooting to bring the characters closer to the ground, making the character stand out more and enhancing the sense of depth in the space. Light shines from the sides and rear, forming a backlit silhouette and creating a soft halo effect. The overall color scheme is mainly cool blue, accented with warm yellow sunlight, creating a strong visual contrast. The transitions between light and shadow are delicate, with rich layers in shadows without harsh boundaries. The frame is filled with a faint grainy texture, as if shot with an old film camera, with slight noise and color shifts, simulating the realism of everyday amateur equipment. The overall atmosphere is quiet, contemplative, and slightly melancholic, as if capturing a brief pause during a journey. It is full of storytelling and emotional tension, with rigorous composition, rich details, and exquisite light and shadow handling. It combines the aesthetic height of artistic photography with a sense of everyday warmth",
