        {
          "id": "krea2-24a29e9a745934389fd00fd3",
          "alias": "单女蓝礼服城市沉思倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a deep blue velvet one-shoulder gown, elegantly leaning on a wooden bench. She slightly turned her head toward the camera, her right hand resting lightly on the bench's edge, her left hand naturally resting beside her thigh. Her posture was relaxed yet dignified. The dress was uniquely designed, draped across the shoulders, revealing one shoulder and collarbone. The dress was richly pleated, and the chest was decorated with a three-dimensional rose motif. The material was smooth and highly reflective. Under the light, it presents a silky, flowing texture. A gold necklace adorns the neck, the pendant is round and vintage in style, small and delicate, earrings are simple metal studs, and a gold bracelet is worn on the wrist to add a highlight of the details. The background is a light gray brick wall with clear texture, the bricks arranged neatly but with slightly irregular gaps. Above, there is a deep blue eave structure, creating a layered contrast. The floor is paved with dark stone slabs, some areas reflecting faint light and shadow. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figures occupying the main subject. Slightly to the right, the body forms an S-shaped curve, creating a dynamic aesthetic. The foreground is a partial wooden bench with natural wood grain and slight wear marks on the surface, enhancing realism. The middle ground features the figure's full body and costume details, while the background is a spatial environment formed by the building's walls and eaves. Light and shadow come from the front left, creating a soft transition of light and shadow, while shadows cast delicate gradients on the right side of the body and floor. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, with a sense of urban fashion. The color palette is mainly cool blue, accented with warm gold, creating a striking but not awkward color contrast, The image texture is delicate, with a high-end cinematic feel, as if captured in an afternoon sunlight filtering through the gaps in the buildings. Shot with a professional camera, focal length 85mm, aperture f/2.8, ISO 100, shutter speed 1/125 sec, white balance set to daylight mode, images with slight graininess and natural noise, simulating film texture to enhance realistic shooting experience. The overall style blends modern fashion with artistic portrait photography, combining the refinement of commercial blockbusters. while preserving authentic details that feel like everyday life, creating a visual experience that is both luxurious and close to everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
