        {
          "id": "krea2-b5232133b1b80e44e42abe2a",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔城市冷淡站立（2）",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors in a natural setting, wearing a white off-shoulder long-sleeve top with the word \"good luck\" printed on the chest and colorful embroidery, paired with blue high-waisted denim shorts. The edges of the shorts feature irregular frayed edges and red decorative details. The overall look is fashionable and full of youthful energy. Her makeup is exquisite, her expression slightly cool and confident, wearing a gold necklace and long earrings that add elegance and personality. Her right hand rests gently on the light-colored tile railing behind her, while her left hand hangs naturally and her body slightly turns to the side. Presented with a graceful S-shaped curve, the composition uses medium shot portraits, with the figure occupying the left central position of the frame, body slightly tilted, head facing the camera to form a visual focal point. The foreground features blurred green plant leaves, with blurred effects creating a sense of layering. The middle shot clearly shows the subject, with dense green leaves and trees in the background. The light is soft and even, presenting a fresh atmosphere under natural light. The overall color palette is mainly green and white, accented with blue denim and red details, creating a harmonious and vibrant color combination. The light and shadow come from naturally scattered light, with soft shadows and no obvious hard shadows, creating a warm and comfortable visual experience. The image texture is delicate and rich, with a realistic feel comparable to everyday amateur equipment shooting, such as slight noise and natural imaging effects from cameras or mobile phones. The lens is chosen for medium focal length, with moderate depth of field, natural background blur, highlighting the main subject. The overall composition is balanced, extending along body lines to hand movements, then returning to background greenery, forming a cyclical visual flow. The atmosphere is relaxed, natural, and full of youthful charm. Suitable for fashion portraits or lifestyle-style photography, embodying the independence and confidence of modern urban youth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
