        {
          "id": "krea2-b91670f9ad289c3ad8eeb979",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙街道冷淡倚靠",
          "prompt": "On a city street as night falls, a woman leans against a metal lamp post covered in water droplets and graffiti. She wears a pair of vintage round metal-framed glasses, her right shoulder exposed, and she wears a sleeveless bodycon dress with a black-and-white patchwork. The material features subtle grid patterns, casting a cold gleam under the dim streetlights. Her body leans slightly, her left arm hangs naturally, fingers gently resting on the lamppost, as if silently having a dialogue with the city. In the foreground, the thick metal lamppost occupies nearly half the space on the right side of the painting. The surface is covered with mottled rust, water stains formed by raindrops, and blurry Chinese and English street signs. Clearly visible words like \"Saiyangcai Street\" and \"Right - Five Street\" are visible. At the base of the lamp post is a yellow guide sign for the visually impaired, printed with bilingual signs for \"Visually Impaired Persons\" and \"Aids for Visually Impaired Persons.\" These details add a strong sense of real life and urban memory to the scene; In the middle of the ground is a blurred street background, where neon lights reflect flowing light and shadow on the slippery ground after the rain. On the left, the signs for \"Outlet Shop\" and \"AROYLE CENTRE\" are faintly visible. The fonts are hazy and layered by the night and mist. Several pedestrians hurry by, their silhouettes blurred and movements blurred, creating dynamic silhouettes that enhance the depth and authentic atmosphere of the image; The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure extending diagonally from the upper left to the center-right position, forming a strong visual guiding line. The lamp pillars serve as vertical elements contrasting with the characters' diagonal postures, increasing tension and instability in the composition, creating a narrative sense of both voyeurism and privacy. The shallow depth of field treatment completely blurs the background, highlighting the subject's emotional expression. Light mainly comes from neon and street lights of surrounding buildings, presenting a complex color system interwoven with cool blue tones and warm yellow light. Cool tones dominate the overall atmosphere, giving the image a sense of loneliness, detachment, and a touch of poetry in the modern city. The damp air after rain is enhanced by mirror reflections and water droplet details. The lens simulates the effects of old film cameras, with slight graininess and vignetting. The color saturation is low but contrast is sharp, with slightly faded edges, resembling a street photo forgotten by time. The overall style blends Japanese portraits, street photography, and cinematic textures, presenting a quiet yet story-filled everyday moment. It captures a moment of urban youth deep in thought and self-reflection amid the hustle and bustle, combining artistic beauty with the warmth of real life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
