        {
          "id": "krea2-b3c68ab78d901dcf73ec91bc",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙办公室温柔坐张开双腿",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a black high-back office chair, naturally draped over her shoulders. Her overall aura is elegant with a hint of laziness. She wears an off-shoulder dress with a white base and red strawberry patterns, with lace trim at the collar and cuffs. The chest is tied into a deep red bow with a cross-tie design extending downward. The hem of the dress is A-shaped, reaching the middle of her thighs, revealing her long, well-proportioned legs. Her hands rest naturally on the armrests, her posture relaxed yet dignified, her body slightly leaning forward, legs apart. It creates an open yet restrained visual tension. The foreground features the main figure occupying a slightly lower center of the frame, with a medium perspective presenting the view from above the knees to overhead. The background is a minimalist, modern interior space, with light gray walls. The ceiling is fitted with recessed downlights and a black linear track light, providing uniform and soft lighting. On the right side, a faint door frame and a corner of green plants add a touch of life. The overall color palette is mainly white, beige, and gray. Accents include red strawberry patterns and deep red ties as visual focal points. Light and shadow come from soft lighting slightly above the front, with smooth transitions of shadows without harsh contrasts, creating a peaceful, comfortable, and slightly intimate atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens, offering a cinematic shallow depth of field effect. The background is naturally blurred, highlighting the subject. The color saturation is moderate and not exaggerated, presenting a carefully captured moment beauty in everyday life. It looks like a fashion blogger or model doing a private photo shoot at home—authentic and story-rich, with rich details, while maintaining a moderate sense of blur and haziness, enhancing artistic expression. The composition is balanced, with the figure slightly centered and slightly lower, leaving enough breathing room. The overall image is clean and tidy, free of unnecessary elements, conveying a gentle, confident, and composed feminine charm",
