        {
          "id": "krea2-243a65f328999c802f5a6737",
          "alias": "单女舞者短裙摄影棚冷淡站立",
          "prompt": "A female dancer dressed in luxurious exotic costumes stands before the rustic stone steps. Her arms are smooth and graceful, wearing a blue-green cropped top embroidered with gold patterns and butterfly patterns, and the shoulder straps are woven from metal chains and lace. A wide belt in matching colors is tied around her waist, adorned with numerous golden tassels and bells. The hem of the skirt is made of semi-transparent tulle, edged with blue butterfly embroidery, gently fluttering in the wind. When her arms are opened, two long blue tulle sleeves stretch out like butterfly wings, embroidered with delicate floral and insect patterns. The overall design is full of Eastern classical charm and fantasy colors. She stands in the center of a wide set of stone steps, which are grayish-brown with slightly mottled surfaces bearing the marks of time. The steps extend backward and gradually blur. This creates a strong sense of depth. In the background, the silhouette of an ancient building can be faintly seen. The walls are dark red, topped with exquisitely carved eaves. On the right side is a huge red draper or cloth curtain, thick in texture and richly pleated, gently swaying in the breeze, adding a touch of drama. The entire scene is bathed in the warm, gentle evening sunlight, with light slanting from the upper right of the image, creating a distinct side light effect. At the same time, long shadows are cast on the stone steps, with interwoven light and shadow creating distinct layers. The dancers in the foreground are sharp and clear, while the stone steps and buildings in the middle gradually blur, while the curtains in the background and the outlines of distant mountains blur into a hazy tone. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figures centered. The shallow depth of field treatment highlights the subject, creating a strong visual direction. The overall tone of the painting is mainly cool blue-green, paired with warm yellow sunset rays, creating a contrast of cool and warm air that enhances visual impact. The atmosphere is both mysterious and romantic, as if from a legendary story of a lost civilization, with a strong artistic film texture. The lens captures professional, studio-grade high-resolution images, rich details, moderately high color saturation, natural light and shadow transitions, and a slight film graininess, presenting an aesthetic style that blends vintage and modern, like a precious image frozen by time, full of poetry and imagination",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
