        {
          "id": "krea2-39d1d3a8f6b2e15e9ba2ee19",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫城市沉思坐回眸",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the steps of an outdoor pedestrian bridge, wearing a black turtleneck knit top and a gray pencil skirt, kneeling cross-legged on dark gray stone steps with spotted patterns. Her right hand gently grips the heel of a black high heel, while her left hand rests on a metal and glass railing. Her body turns slightly to the side, her head looking back at the camera. Her overall posture is elegant and relaxed, presenting a tranquil moment in urban life. The foreground shows the main figure, and the middle frame features an upward staircase and metal railing, made of silver stainless steel pipe and transparent glass. The glass features a black-and-white checkerboard pattern, reflecting blurred city streets and vehicle outlines. The background is a wide sky with distant green trees and city buildings. The sky is grayish-white, with soft and even lighting, creating a peaceful and realistic atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, forming a visual guiding line. The stairs extend upward from the lower left corner to the upper right, creating a strong sense of depth and spatial layering. The light and shadows come from natural daylight, softly diffusing without strong shadows. The texture of the garments is clearly visible: the knit texture of the turtleneck sweater is delicate, the pleats of the short skirt are natural, and the shoe surface is smooth and reflective. The overall color scheme is mainly black, gray, and brown, accented with a few green plants and distant architectural colors. The image texture closely resembles the realistic effect of everyday amateur photography, rich in detail and distinct layers, exuding a sense of life and artistic beauty, capturing a gentle moment in modern urban life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
