        {
          "id": "krea2-70195ccc9ef00a1446ded65e",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙摄影棚困倦坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits gracefully sideways, her head slightly tilted, fingers naturally bent, presenting a gentle and contemplative expression. She wears a white lace slip dress with delicate straps, delicate lace trim on the chest and cuffs, a voluminous hem, and a light, flowing fabric, presenting a semi-transparent texture, with the outline of the inner layer faintly visible. Her overall posture is relaxed and confident, her body slightly leaning forward, arms naturally bent, elbows resting on knees or tabletops. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure occupying the main position, positioned slightly to the right of the visual center. The background is a soft blue gradient, transitioning naturally from light blue to deep blue, creating a serene and dreamy atmosphere. The background is blurred, presenting a blurred layer of light and shadow, with faint geometric outlines—possibly indoor sets or lighting installations. Light comes from the front left, creating a natural transition between light and dark, while shadows form subtle arcs below the neck and shoulders, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall lighting effect is clean and transparent, with the texture of a professional studio shoot. The colors are mainly white and blue, with a striking contrast of warm and cool tones. White highlights purity and nobility, while blue brings calmness and tranquility. The combination of the two creates a visual sensation that is both cool and warm. The overall image presents a style of high-end fashion photography, combining artistic beauty with commercial value. Although the background is blurry, it maintains texture, hinting at a refined and modern spatial environment. The entire image exudes elegance, romance, and mystery, as if capturing the eternal beauty of a tranquil moment, suitable for fashion magazine covers, Brand promotion or personal art portrait works",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
