        {
          "id": "krea2-4bf0ebbc01c5a3aa12a661b2",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙广场忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on the stone steps of a classical building, wearing a delicate white lace mini dress with a high neck and long sleeves. The cuffs and hem are decorated with delicate ruffles, creating an elegant and vintage overall look. She wears a lightweight white sheer veil with a large bow that gently flutters in the wind. She wears sparkling earrings and holds a small bouquet of pink roses, delicate and layered with soft colors. She wears a pair of white tall boots with smooth lines, Harmonizing with the overall design, the background features a massive dark gray metal door, with regularly arranged square recesses on the door. Above the door frame is a complex geometric hollowed-out design, presenting Gothic or neoclassical styles. On both sides of the door are heavy light gray stone pillars with natural textures. The stone steps are paved with rough stone, slightly worn edges showing signs of time. The sky is gloomy, the light is soft and even, with no obvious shadows, creating a quiet and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout. The figure is positioned slightly lower in the center of the frame, with the viewer's gaze directed toward the upper right to create a visual extension. The foreground features stone steps and the figure, the middle ground features the main gate and stone pillars, and the background features architectural structures further away. The layers are distinct, with black, white, and gray as the main color tones, accented with pink flowers as visual focal points. The overall tone is calm and restrained, full of artistic flair, resembling a carefully shot wedding portrait with cinematic texture and narrative. The details are rich, the transitions of light and shadow are natural, presenting a unique beauty that is both solemn and romantic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
