        {
          "id": "krea2-73625c81445d6c42f664f386",
          "alias": "单女绿内衣室内坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the soft indoor light, exuding an effortless, lazy beauty. She wears a light green thin-strap bra with slender straps that outline graceful shoulders and collarbones. The chest is slightly open, showcasing natural curves. Layered with a sheer cover-up in the same color family, the fabric is adorned with fine white polka dot patterns. The material is light and flowing, rising and falling with the slightest movements of the body. Creates a hazy and romantic sense of layering. The composition centers on the figure, using close-ups that occupy most of the space. The head is slightly tilted, the body slightly tilted, forming a natural S-shaped curve. The gaze directly communicates with the viewer, enhancing interaction. The foreground shows the upper body and hand movements, with clear details. The middle shot extends to the chest and shoulder areas, with rich folds and light variations. The background is a simple light-colored wall with slight texture, and light streaming in from the left. Soft shadows are cast on the wall, creating contrasts of light and shadow to highlight the outlines of the figures. The light source comes from the side, simulating natural daylight effects. The light is warm and soft, with a warm yellow tone, while the other side creates subtle shadow transitions that enhance the sense of depth. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is quiet and private, carrying the gentle vibe of early morning or dusk. The colors are harmonious and unified, and the image texture is delicate and realistic, as if taken with professional photography equipment, yet retains the realistic feel of casual snapshots from everyday life. Like a moment captured up close with a high-resolution camera, the composition is balanced and full of tension, irresistibly drawing people in. The overall style combines artistry with a sense of everyday life, presenting a tranquil, gentle, and captivating atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
