        {
          "id": "krea2-7223678846364ecdb40abc01",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣窗边躺侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman lies sideways on soft white fabric, slightly tilting her head back to gaze at the camera, adding a touch of realism and vividness. She wears a loose off-white knit cardigan, with delicate lace trim along the collar edges. The cuffs are slightly rolled up, revealing slender wrists. In the foreground is a cluster of fresh red cherry tomatoes with green vines, placed on white fabric, partially blurred out of focus, creating a soft depth effect. The tomato surface is smooth and full, reflecting warm light and presenting an enticing sheen. The background is a light-toned blurred environment, possibly by an indoor window or a corner of the bed. Light enters from the side, creating a soft backlit contour and a hazy halo effect. The overall composition uses a low-angle shot to highlight the gentleness and affinity of the characters, emphasizing emotional expression. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft. Warm yellow tones dominate, with sunlight streaming through the window, creating mottled light and shadow that enhances the image's layering and three-dimensionality. The overall image presents a tranquil, comfortable, and lifelike everyday beauty, as if capturing the most authentic moment of a lazy afternoon. It has a strong film texture and retro filter effect, moderate color saturation, soft contrast, rich details, and clear textures, like real photos taken with an old camera in natural light, with slight graininess and film-specific color shifts It creates a nostalgic yet romantic artistic atmosphere; the entire scene is filled with tranquility, gentleness, and healing power, allowing people to feel the beauty of life and the poetry found in the ordinary",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
