        {
          "id": "krea2-dbae48e6852213747686cfba",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫办公室冷淡坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a brown leather swivel chair in a modern office, wearing a uniquely designed blue-purple abstract printed shirt with three-quarter sleeves and pleated details. The neckline is tied in a bow style, paired with light purple high-waisted wide-leg pants and white cross-lace high-heeled sandals. The overall look is elegant and fashionable, with a relaxed yet dignified posture. Her left hand gently holds a light purple blazer draped over her left knee, while her right hand rests naturally on her thigh, her body slightly leaning to the side, creating a warm and professional atmosphere. In the foreground, the main figure occupies the center to the right, with a simple indoor environment in the background. The dark gray walls contrast with the black screen or decorative panels. On the left, you can see part of the edges of the wooden tabletop. The floor is covered with a gray-blue textured carpet featuring intricate geometric patterns. The composition uses a mid-field portrait angle, with the person fully presented above the knee. The camera shoots from a slight top-down angle, creating an approachable visual experience. Light and shadow come from soft natural light or indoor lighting on the left side of the frame, creating a delicate transition between light and shadow. Shadows are soft and natural, with an overall color scheme combining warm and cool tones. Blue, purple, and gray-pink form the main color palette. The deep gray and wood tones in the background provide visual balance, with clear layering in the image. The foreground and background are clearly separated, creating a quiet, focused, and slightly approachable workplace atmosphere. The image quality is close to professional commercial portrait photography, yet retains the realism of everyday office scenes, as if shot with a mid-to-high-end consumer camera or phone. It has slight film graininess and natural color reproduction, along with a slight depth of field effect. This highlights the main subject while the background is moderately blurred, creating an overall atmosphere that is calm and sophisticated. It combines the professional temperament of a professional woman with gentleness and approachability, making it suitable for brand promotion, personal image display, or social media content creation",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
