        {
          "id": "krea2-faf15538b6ee0bec530f6827",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣小径沉思站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways, gently swaying in the wind, adding a touch of liveliness and naturalness. She wears a light gray knitted cardigan, with clearly visible knit textures and fine, even stitching, presenting a warm three-dimensional effect. The collar of the cardigan is slightly open, revealing the edge of the inner garment. The overall look is simple yet layered, with a faint blush and full of luster, carrying a touch of gentleness and contemplation. It seems to gaze into a distant place, exuding a serene beauty. The background is a simple off-white wall. Diagonal light and shadow are cast onto the wall, forming a striped shadow pattern of light and shadow. The lines of light and shadow are smooth and rhythmic, creating a strong visual contrast and spatial layering. The foreground features the character's head and upper body, with the composition centered on the figure, slightly leaning toward the left side of the frame, leaving space on the right side for light and shadow to extend naturally. The middle ground features the shoulders and part of the body, while the background gradually blurs out, highlighting the subject's clarity and three-dimensionality. The overall composition uses close-ups, extending along the line of sight to the background light and shadow lines. This forms a natural visual path, with a warm and soft lighting atmosphere. The light source comes from the upper left of the image, simulating natural daylight, while the other side creates a soft shadow transition to create a three-dimensional light and shadow effect. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and light gray, harmoniously unified and giving a warm, comfortable, and slightly artistic feel. The image has the realism of everyday amateur equipment, with details captured by the lens authentic and natural, without excessive embellishment or beautification, preserving a lifelike texture. The camera's angle is slightly tilted, enhancing the image's dynamic and approachable feel. The background is moderately blurred, highlighting the subject's clarity and detail. The overall image is filled with a tranquil and gentle atmosphere, as if capturing a tranquil moment under the afternoon sun, conveying a simple and pure beautiful emotion",
