        {
          "id": "krea2-8d2af409149f3d75e44aace9",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣咖啡厅温柔坐喝",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a dark leather booth in a high-end restaurant, wearing a white knit cardigan with delicate ribbed details at the collar. Her left hand rests naturally on the table, her hand slender, giving her a gentle and intellectual aura. The focus is on this woman, positioned slightly to the right of the center, her body slightly leaning forward, creating a warm and calm atmosphere. In the foreground is a round dining table covered with an off-white tablecloth. On the table are several exquisite dishes and drinks. On the left is hot chocolate or coffee served in a white porcelain bowl, with delicate milk foam on the surface. Next to it is a small silver spoon, in the center is a small cream cake decorated with chocolate, surrounded by silver forks and plates. On the right is a latte with a clear latte art. Next to it is a transparent glass cup filled with clear drinking water. The calm surface reflects a soft light, and the tabletop edges are slightly curved, creating a sense of space. In the middle is a dark brown leather booth where the woman sits. The backrest is thick and soft, with smooth lines and delicate texture. The background features a blue-gray vertical striped wall with fine textures like stone or high-end wallpaper. Two square wall lamps are symmetrically installed on the walls, with wooden grilles that emit a warm yellow glow. The light softly illuminates the entire space, creating a cozy and comfortable atmosphere. Golden metal frames on both sides of the walls add a touch of luxury, and in the distance, you can faintly see the outlines of other seats and the vague interior arrangements. However, the focus is on the foreground figures and dining table. The composition uses a central composition, with the figures centered, and the tableware in the table creates visual balance. The tableware and drinks in the foreground enrich the layers of the image and enhance realism. Light and shadow come from warm yellow lights above and the sides, with the main sources coming from wall lamps and ceiling illumination. Light shines down from the upper left, emphasizing a sense of depth. The background wall transitions between light and shadow depending on the angle of the light, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, off-white, dark brown, and blue-gray, with harmonious and unified color combinations. It creates a quiet, elegant, and slightly intimate dining atmosphere. The images have a slight film texture and vintage filter effects, slightly lowering saturation and contrast to simulate the realism of everyday amateur camera shooting. The lens uses an 85mm prime portrait lens for natural depth blur and soft background blur, highlighting the subject while preserving some environmental details. The overall atmosphere is quiet, comfortable, and slightly artistic, as if capturing an ordinary yet warm afternoon time. The image details are rich. From the texture of the clothing to the glossy surface of the food, everything is clearly distinguishable, showcasing a sense of artistic beauty that truly touches everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
