        {
          "id": "krea2-8f3f8c991666cac799efef05",
          "alias": "单女白T恤床忧伤躺（2）",
          "prompt": "A woman lies on her side on a dark bedsheet, wearing a white sleeveless tank top and pink shorts, leaning lazily against the headboard. Her right hand rests lightly on the bed, her finger wearing a simple ring, and her wrist adorned with a delicate chain bracelet. Her makeup is exquisite but understated, and her overall posture is relaxed and expressive, creating an intimate and story-filled atmosphere. In the foreground, an open vintage magazine is spread out on the bed, with blurred text and images on the pages. Next to it lies an old-fashioned red dial telephone, with a red spiral telephone line winding and extending. Beside it are a yellow vinyl record, a metal pen, and a black circular object—possibly an old camera or radio component. Together, these objects create a nostalgic everyday scene. The middle scene is the woman's bed, with a beige patterned pillow resting at the head of the bed. The background wall is covered with vintage posters and decorative paintings, recognizable as \"HARPER'S\" and some black illustrations. In the corner is a black semicircular ornament, illuminated by warm yellow lighting, creating a contrast between light and dark. The entire space is dimly lit, with only a hidden light source casting down from the upper left, creating a warm and soft lighting effect that enhances the image's sense of depth and layering. The composition uses a low-angle shot, with the main subject positioned slightly below the center of the frame, the body extending diagonally, then moving upward to the background wall decoration, creating a natural visual flow. The overall color palette is mainly dark brown, dark brown, and warm yellow, complemented by white clothing and pink shorts as visual highlights, with low color saturation. It presents a grainy texture and slight fading effect similar to film photography, with slightly dark edges that enhance the image's privacy and sense of time accumulation. The lens is chosen for a mid-focal length, simulating the effects of 35mm film cameras, with slight optical distortion and soft focus to highlight realism and the sense of life. The overall atmosphere is quiet and melancholic, as if capturing a midnight moment of solitude, filled with youthful confusion and a reflection on the past. The images have a strong cinematic and narrative quality. Like a classic shot in an independent film, it feels both like a page from a private diary and a poetic monologue about memory and loneliness",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
