        {
          "id": "krea2-1b481984a44b122d87f53a07",
          "alias": "单女制服泳池困倦坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a Japanese-style sailor uniform sits in the indoor pool, exuding a fresh and natural aura. Her left hand gently rests on the edge of the pool, her right hand naturally resting in the water, her right leg raised high with toes pointing upward, and her calf and feet submerged in the water, creating delicate ripples and splashing droplets. The droplets freeze in the air, presenting a crystal-clear texture. She wears a white short-sleeved shirt and a black pleated skirt, with a blue bow at the collar. The fabric hugs her body slightly due to moisture, showing soft contours. She sits on a transparent round inflatable floating ring, part of which is submerged in water, its edges shimmering with gentle ripples, blending seamlessly with the surrounding water. To her left is a small glass jar floating, with a candle lit inside. The flickering candlelight emits a warm golden glow, creating a tranquil and dreamy light and shadow effect. The pool floor is covered with blue and white square mosaic tiles, reflecting the light and candlelight above, creating a delicate visual layer. The water is crystal clear, presenting a deep blue-green hue. The water surface has slight ripples and reflections, with light slanting down from above, creating mottled spots and flowing shadows on the water. The background features the pool walls and distant blue steps. The walls are beige with soft warm tones, contrasting with the cool-toned pool, creating a strong sense of space. The composition uses a low angle, with the figure positioned to the right of the frame, creating an asymmetrical but balanced visual structure. The foreground highlights the people and splashes, the middle ground shows floating rings, candlelight, and parts of the pool, while the background outlines the environmental space. The gaze begins with candlelight, extends to the raised legs, and splashes of water, forming a smooth diagonal movement. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, romantic, and tinged with a hint of youthful rebellion. The light and shadow are soft, with cool blue as the main color scheme and warm yellow candlelight accents, creating a dreamy nightscape. The image has a cinematic texture, rich in detail, and distinct color layers, as if capturing a moment frozen by time—like a professional camera film photo with a slight graininess and natural exposure transitions. It also preserves the casualness and realism of daily life, like precious memories casually captured with amateur equipment. The entire scene is poetic and storyful, evoking the intimate moments of summer nights—lonely but not lonely. Vitality lies within the quiet, with images featuring delicate textures, authentic physical feedback, and natural emotional expression, possessing strong visual appeal and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
