        {
          "id": "krea2-245f406b15bb8d2887359c67",
          "alias": "单女黑外套街道忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "On the streets of Tokyo at night, a girl wearing a black Kappa sports jacket stands at a zebra crossing, her expression calm and slightly melancholic. Her jacket features white stripes and the brand logo, paired with a white turtleneck underneath, a dark short skirt, black socks, and shoes. The overall look presents a typical Japanese street style. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, with a slightly forward-leaning body and head tilted slightly, creating a natural dynamic effect. The foreground features a clear white zebra crossing. Lines extend from the bottom of the painting into the distance, creating a strong perspective effect that guides the gaze to the figures. The middle section is a busy street, where you can see other pedestrians crossing or walking. Some people appear blurred in the background, creating an authentic urban atmosphere. On the right, cyclists pass by, adding dynamism to the scene. The background features towering modern buildings, neon signs flashing blue and white, billboards displaying Japanese characters, and the lights forming a dazzling halo in the night sky. The building's glass curtain wall reflects the surrounding light, enhancing the sense of spatial layering. The entire scene is enveloped in cool blue tones, creating an atmosphere where futurism and loneliness intertwine. The sky is a deep black, sharply contrasting with the bright lights. The composition uses low-angle shots, with the camera slightly tilted upward to make the characters stand out more. At the same time, a wide-angle lens captures a broader street scene, producing slight edge distortion to enhance visual impact. In terms of lighting and shadow, The main light sources come from neon and streetlights along the streets, with light shining down from above and sides, while shadows fall on the ground and below the body, creating a sense of depth. Ambient light reflects off the damp ground, creating a faint glow that adds detail and texture. The overall color scheme is mainly cool blue, accented with white and a few warm yellow lights, creating a modern yet slightly detached urban nightscape atmosphere. The image has the texture of film photography, with slight graininess and color shift, simulating amateur camera shooting. As if captured with an old-fashioned film camera on a late-night street scene, the images present a sense of everyday yet poetic beauty, allowing one to feel the tension between the city's nighttime noise and the inner tranquility. All these elements together construct a story-filled urban portrait, brimming with the spirit of youth and reflection on modern society.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
