          "id": "krea2-f013946c578718cbc1e02859",
          "alias": "单女和服站立持伞",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in traditional kimono stands before a Japanese ancient building. She wears a kimono with a deep green base color decorated with large orange-red flowers and white petals. She wears a wide off-white obi belt adorned with exquisite embroidery, with a tassel woven from red and blue beads hanging at the end of the belt. She wears delicate pearl earrings on her earlobes. She lowers her head slightly and holds a black oil-paper umbrella with subtle patterns on the umbrella surface. The handle is made of wood. She gently places it horizontally in front of her chest, her fingers gently stroking the handle, her posture elegant yet reserved. The background is a typical traditional Japanese wooden building. The wooden walls and eaves look warm and mottled under the warm yellow sunset, with sunlight streaming in from the right, creating a contrast of light and shadow and creating a tranquil yet slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The foreground features clear kimono details and hand movements; the middle ground is the main subject and part of the umbrella; the background gradually blurs, emphasizing the subject while retaining environmental information. The overall color tone is warm, mainly orange-yellow, brown, and dark green. The lighting is soft and layered, presenting a texture reminiscent of film photography. The image has a strong Japanese aesthetic style, like a tranquil afternoon portrait, capturing moments where tradition and modernity intertwine, full of poetry and Eastern charm. Filmed with professional-grade photography equipment, it offers high resolution and rich details, colors are faithfully reproduced, depth of field is precisely controlled, background blur is natural, and there is a slight halo effect at the edges of the frame. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, beautiful, and elegant, carrying a subtle nostalgic vibe, like a classic scene from a movie, allowing people to feel the passage of time and the accumulation of culture",
