        {
          "id": "krea2-fff9d56373a4efc8e719110d",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫办公室忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways, her gaze slightly lowered toward the lower left of the frame, as if gazing at an invisible object or lost in her inner world. She wears fine-framed glasses, the lenses reflecting soft light, adding an air of intellect and calm. She wears a blue-and-white plaid shirt with a delicate texture, clear and neat patterns, a slightly open neckline, and a pure white T-shirt underneath, with distinct layers. The overall look is simple yet stylish. Her shoulders are smooth, her body leans slightly forward, and her posture is relaxed yet full of inner tension. The wrinkles and changes in light and shadow on the clothing are delicately presented, presenting a genuine sense of life. The middle frame extends to her upper body and arms. Although her hands are not fully visible, their naturally drooping posture is visible. The background is a blurred indoor environment, with a row of bright screens or projection screens faintly visible, emitting a soft cool white glow that creates the atmosphere of a modern office or study space. The background light source presents a gradient transition between light and dark, smoothly transitioning from bright to dark areas, enhancing the sense of spatial depth in the composition. The composition uses a classic three-part layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the center on the right side of the frame, leaving a large negative space on the left side, guiding the viewer's gaze to shift from the figure to the left, creating a sense of visual extension. At the same time, the shallow depth of field effect makes the subject stand out clearly. The background blur is handled well without overshadowing the main focus, and the visual guide line naturally extends along the direction of the character's gaze and body curve. This enhances the narrative and immersive feel of the image. Light and shadow come from softly scattered light sources on the left side of the image, possibly reflected from windows or screens, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall lighting leans toward a cool tone but retains a certain warm color temperature, creating a quiet, rational, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The tones are mainly blue, white, and gray, harmoniously and unified, embodying a realistic modern urban lifestyle style. The image texture is close to that of high-resolution camera photography. With slight film graininess and natural noise, it simulates the realism of everyday amateur equipment such as mirrorless cameras or mobile phone photography. The details are rich, and the lens is chosen for medium telephoto angles to compress spatial perception, making the characters appear more focused. The overall image presents a tranquil, introspective, and story-rich artistic atmosphere, like a snapshot taken in a corner of an office or library in the morning, capturing moments of contemplation and tranquility among contemporary people amid their busy schedules",
