        {
          "id": "krea2-091f7b66f5cdee7a3db4ef37",
          "alias": "单女衬衫街道站立持灯",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under the sunlight on a city street, looking both elegant and approachable. She wears a chiffon shirt with a light purple base and gold and beige floral patterns. The shirt features a V-neck design, with several small buttons on the front. The sleeves are loose lantern-style sleeves, made of light and transparent material that slightly reveals the outline of the inner layer. She pairs with high-waisted blue denim shorts, straight, slightly wide, with natural flicked edges at the legs. The overall look is fresh, sweet, and stylish. Her right hand gently holds a small white handbag Her left hand hangs naturally, wearing a simple ring on her finger and a pair of gold hoop earrings, adding a touch of refinement. She stands on a somewhat blurred city street, with gray asphalt pavement dotted with mottled light and subtle textures. In the background, a white sedan can be seen parked in the distance. The front is clearly visible, the body reflecting sunlight, surrounded by other blurred pedestrians and green plants, creating an atmosphere of everyday urban life. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The background is blurred to highlight the clarity and detail of the main subject. The foreground is the full-body portrait of the person, the middle ground is the street and vehicles, and the background is farther away from buildings and greenery, creating a natural flow of sight. Light and shadow come from the right position, bright and soft, casting even illumination on the figure. The shadows are subtle and not abrupt, and the overall atmosphere is warm and peaceful, full of life. It feels like a leisurely moment bathed in afternoon sunlight on the streets, presenting a realistic and delicate texture. The color palette is mainly pale purple, blue, and white, accented with gold and green, creating a harmonious and unified color effect with strong visual appeal. The shooting angle is a head-up view, slightly low-angled to make the figure appear more upright, with clear layers, clear foreground and background shots, rich details, and an overall style that combines everyday street photography with fashionable portraits, combining artistic beauty with real-life relatability. Suitable for showcasing outfit coordination or themes that express youthful energy",
