        {
          "id": "krea2-05f9dc7f86b2844f5a1bbea5",
          "alias": "单女白T恤街道冷淡站立过肩",
          "prompt": "Low-angle downward view: Next, a woman stands outdoors in a sunny scene. She wears a white short-sleeved T-shirt and a pink high-waisted mini skirt, with a pink thin strap bag slung over her shoulder. The background is a pure, cloudless blue sky, occupying most of the space and creating a strong visual contrast. To the left of the subject, you can see the light-colored building walls and green metal mesh fences, with utility poles and blurry electrical facilities in the distance. The composition uses an extremely low-angle upward shot to highlight the figure's tall and imposing figure, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame. Leave a large sky on the right to create a sense of openness. The foreground is the rough cement platform edge, the middle ground is the main figure and fence, and the background is the sky and architectural silhouettes. Light comes from the right above, creating bright highlights and soft shadows. The sides of the body have clear light and shadow transitions, creating a fresh and vibrant summer atmosphere. The colors are blue, white, and pink, with strong contrasts of warm and cool tones. The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if taken with a professional camera on a clear afternoon, with slight film graininess and natural overexposure. Rich in detail, the figure's posture is natural and relaxed, with legs crossed and arms lightly leaning against the wall, presenting an overall everyday street photo style that combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life. The images are full of youthful energy and urban fashion, with clear light and shadow layers, moderate color saturation with a slight retro filter texture, well-handled background blur to highlight the subject, balanced and dynamic composition, and vivid expressions extending along body lines to the background sky, forming an upward visual flow that creates a sense of freedom and openness. A positive and uplifting atmosphere",
