        {
          "id": "krea2-c150921f2818a174b19e78b0",
          "alias": "单女泳装沙发俏皮坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a deep blue fabric sofa by the window indoors, her expression tinged with playfulness and innocence. She gently supports a bright red apple on top of her head, balancing a plump red apple with a natural sheen on its surface, showing a gradient of red and yellow colors. The details are clearly visible. Her body leans slightly back, wearing a uniquely designed bikini top. The upper half features a vintage orange-red pattern, while the lower half is patched with colorful floral patterns on a white background. The thin straps lightly outline the collarbone. The overall design is both sexy and sweet. The foreground features the main figure occupying most of the space, the middle ground is the interior behind her, including wooden floors, blurred furniture outlines, and a window that lets in soft light. The background features further room structures, such as white ceiling beams, door frame edges, and faintly visible bookshelves or storage cabinets. The composition uses close-ups: the figure is centered slightly to the left, with the head slightly tilted, and the apple placed as the visual focal point at the center of the head, creating a strong visual direction. Light streams in diagonally through the left window, creating contrasts of light and shadow, while creating soft shadows on the sofa and floor. The rich layering of light and shadow creates a lazy and cozy afternoon atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow, blending apple red, clothing orange-red and floral colors, and wood and blue tones in the environment. The color combinations are harmonious and layered, with a delicate image texture as if shot with a high-resolution camera, featuring realistic lighting and shadow effects with a slight film graininess. It presents a fleeting beauty captured casually in everyday life, combining the exquisite composition of artistic photography with the natural and casual atmosphere of amateur equipment shooting, as if recording a quiet and beautiful moment of life. The entire scene is full of youthful energy and gentle energy, evoking a relaxed and joyful mood",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
