        {
          "id": "krea2-437f481bd01dbdf36f2eddd4",
          "alias": "单女黑毛衣街道持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a black knit sweater with a wide white lapel, layered over a black-and-white striped turtleneck shirt, showcasing a retro collegiate style. In her right hand, she holds a wooden baseball bat with a warm brown body. The surface features natural wood grain patterns, and the stick is printed with the words \"Professional World Win WHITE ASH.\" The handwritten style has a vintage feel, providing a stable visual support. The background is a pure teal tone, with moderate color saturation, a slight graininess and film texture, creating a nostalgic and warm atmosphere. Above is a large white Japanese word \"decorative characterきです\" (I like you), with wear and tear effects on the edges, and below is the \"OMONT.\". MARCH\" in small print, with \"OMONT.\" SPRING OMONT. \"MARCH OLD MEMORY OF NEW TIME\" and other English texts, along with a small text explanation. The overall composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figures centered. The image has a strong visual guiding effect, forming a diagonal visual flow that extends into the background text to enhance the visual conveyance. The lighting is soft and even, coming from the upper front, with natural shadow transitions without strong contrast, highlighting the texture of the skin. At the same time, the baseball bat's surface reflects a subtle sheen, adding a sense of realism. The overall color palette mainly features teal, off-white, black, and brown, paired with moderate color contrast to create a retro film photography feel. There are slight grain noise and color shifts in the image, simulating vintage camera shooting effects to enhance the nostalgic atmosphere. The composition is compact, with the foreground prominently featuring the main subject and a baseball bat. The background is simple yet informative, with delicate light and shadow processing, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere that carries a hint of youthful rebellion and innocence intertwined, presenting an unintentional moment captured in daily life. It feels like a street portrait shot with an old camera, full of story and everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
