        {
          "id": "krea2-dd436468ddba8eb7b0798743",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫海滩冷淡站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the seaside, looking both natural and relaxed. She wears a pristine white shirt with a slightly open collar, revealing her slender neck and collarbones. The fabric is light and soft, gently fluttering in the breeze, adding a touch of liveliness and spontaneity. The petals are layered and the colors are rich and fiery, forming a strong contrast with the cool-toned background. The flower stems are slender, and green leaves dot the space, injecting vitality and energy into the composition. Using shallow depth of field to make the subject stand out clearly, the background gradually blurs, presenting a blurred coastline and a gray-blue sky. The clouds are thick and distinct, with pale purple and gray tones mixed in the sky, creating a tranquil atmosphere on cloudy or dusk days. In the distance, the sea surface is calm and undisturbed, forming a soft horizontal line at the junction with the sky. In terms of composition, the figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center, forming the visual focal point. The flowers are positioned in the lower right corner, enhancing the narrative feel. Light and shadow come from the upper side, highlighting the three-dimensional contours. The light illuminates both the white shirt and the red flowers, making them stand out against the cool-toned background. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, carrying a subtle sense of loneliness and artistic flair, as if capturing a fleeting inner monologue. The image texture is delicate and authentic, like a film-style photo taken with a professional camera. The cinematic texture has rich layers and color reproduction, rich details, natural pores and tiny freckles, and the veins and dewdrops of flowers are clearly visible. The overall color scheme is mainly cool blue-gray, accented with warm reds to create a strong color contrast. The visual impact is strong, the composition balanced and full of tension, combining the intimacy of everyday life with the refinement and depth of artistic photography, like a cinematic poem recording youth and emotions",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
