        {
          "id": "krea2-fb294093786a3d2116118af5",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔纯色背景冷淡持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a light blue denim jacket with a unique design, combining different fabrics on the sleeves and body, including plaid tweed and ripped patches, presenting a retro yet avant-garde mix-and-match style. She gently tugs at the collar with her right hand, her movements natural and relaxed, while her left hand wears gold ring-shaped earrings and rings that glow softly under the light. The overall look is full of youthful energy and a sense of fashion. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left in the lower middle, forming an asymmetrical composition that creates a dynamic visual balance. The background is a pure, light gray-white wall with no clutter or decorations. The minimalist background highlights the main subject, allowing the viewer's attention to focus entirely on their expressions, postures, and clothing details. Light comes from the front above, with natural shadow transitions and no harsh contrasts between light and dark. The overall color palette is mainly cool blue and white, creating a vivid and harmonious color contrast The atmosphere of the painting is tranquil and warm, carrying a sense of ease and privacy from everyday life, as if taken indoors with a regular camera. It has a realistic texture and warmth, with ample blank space in the composition. The large blank space in the upper half enhances the breathability and extension of the image, ultimately remaining in a minimalist aesthetic. The whole image exudes a fresh, natural, slightly artistic youthful vibe, as if capturing an ordinary yet beautiful moment",
