        {
          "id": "krea2-38d4fa96b298b0f0c7e566b1",
          "alias": "单女白和服樱花困倦站立跳舞",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a white lace kimono stands beneath a blooming pink cherry tree, glowing with a faint sheen and presenting a translucent texture. Her right hand is gently raised, fingers lightly touching the cherry blossom branches above her head, as if interacting with the flowers. The collar of the kimono is adorned with a black gemstone-embellished brooch, sleeves are wide and flowing, the fabric is adorned with delicate lace patterns, and in the background, blurred pink cherry blossoms cluster together in a hazy sea of flowers. The sky reveals a pale blue through the gaps, and the composition uses close-ups. The figure occupies the left two-thirds of the frame, with the head slightly tilted, gazing straight ahead, creating a strong visual guidance. The cherry blossom branches extend diagonally from the upper right corner to the lower left, forming a diagonal composition that enhances the movement and layering of the image. The middle scene features scattered cherry blossom petals and some branches, while the background is a completely blurred pink flower cluster, creating a dreamy sense of depth. Light comes from a slightly higher front position, creating natural transitions of highlights and shadows. The light and shadows are warm and bright, creating a fresh and sweet overall atmosphere full of spring energy. The image tones are mainly pink, white, and light blue, with moderate saturation, presenting a gentle and romantic visual effect. It has a slight film texture and graininess, simulating the realism of everyday amateur camera shooting. The background blur is finely handled, and soft circular light spots appear outside focus, enhancing the softness and artistry of the image. The figures' postures are natural and relaxed, expressions serene and serene, as if immersed in the poetic moments of cherry blossoms dancing. The overall style blends Japanese aesthetics with the pure temperament of youth. It creates a tranquil, far-reaching atmosphere full of vitality",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
