        {
          "id": "krea2-1d5d3a0464b230cfc3424234",
          "alias": "单女灰连衣裙雪地困倦站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman in a light gray long dress stands sideways on the right side of the frame, slightly tilting her head up to gaze at the blooming cherry trees above. Her posture is elegant and serene, gently embracing a white traffic sign with both hands. On top hangs a striking red circular traffic sign with a speed limit of 50 km/h. The blue number \"50\" is clearly visible, forming a striking contrast with the surrounding soft sea of white flowers. In the foreground is a green grass that has been blurred, with dense and soft leaves showing natural gradient colors. In the middle of the scene, lush cherry blossom branches stretch diagonally from the upper left corner to the center of the composition. The deep brown thick branches contrast sharply with the snow-white cherry blossom petals. Layers of flowers densely cover the branches, creating a strong spring atmosphere. The background is distant rolling blue-green mountains, appearing hazy and profound under the mist. The mountain contours are soft and distinct, the sky appears elegant gray-white, and the overall lighting is soft and even, without strong shadows, creating a tranquil and peaceful atmosphere. The composition uses an asymmetrical golden ratio, placing the figure and traffic signs on the right side of the frame, leaving ample space on the left for cherry blossom trees and the sky, creating a visual balance. The camera focuses on the people and signposts, with the background gradually blurring, creating a clear depth of field effect. It guides the viewer's gaze from the foreground grass to the figures and cherry blossoms in the middle ground, and finally extends to the distant mountains. The light and shadow are soft and diffuse, resembling natural light in the early morning or evening, with tones mainly white, light gray, light blue, and green. It creates a fresh and elegant spring atmosphere, with the entire image filled with poetry and romance, as if capturing a moment of tranquil beauty. It has the texture of film photography and a filter-like soft focus effect, presenting a visual experience that is both realistic and dreamy, like everyday moments shot with an old-fashioned camera. It carries slight graininess and natural color shifts, allowing one to feel the passage of time and the fleeting beauty of life",
