        {
          "id": "krea2-8282b50be69dd94e1b17bb87",
          "alias": "单女白内衣城市沉思站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the window inside, looking thoughtful. She wears a white lace bra paired with a loose blue and white striped shirt. The shirt sleeves are deliberately rolled up and tied with drawstrings, creating a voluminous lantern sleeve effect. She wears light blue ripped denim shorts, with flicked hems and zipper details clearly visible. The overall style is both sexy and casual, with her body slightly turned and legs naturally apart. It showcases the lines of slender legs, with the main subject positioned slightly to the left center. The foreground shows the upper body and part of the torso, while the middle extends to her legs and surrounding environment. The background features a large black metal-framed lattice window, with soft natural light streaming in and creating bright highlights. On the right side is a wooden desk and a beige lampshade, with a wooden chair beside it. The floor is light-colored wood, giving the overall space a simple yet lively atmosphere. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout. The figure is centered, with background elements distributed left and right, creating a sense of balance. Following her gaze and hand movements, she extends to the body's contours and then spreads into the surrounding environment. The lighting atmosphere is dominated by natural light, with light slanting in through the left window, creating a soft transition of light and shadow on the figure. The shadows are delicate, and the overall tone leans toward coolness, mainly blue and white, complemented by warm wood tones for contrast. The image feels authentic, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains the casual feel of everyday life. It carries a strong sense of fashion and artistic flair, like a carefully composed magazine photoshoot while maintaining the authenticity of home. The details are rich, the layers are distinct, and the colors harmoniously unified, brimming with the independence and confident charm of modern urban women",
