        {
          "id": "krea2-669b914a965aef0505c4814b",
          "alias": "单女灰连帽衫公园忧伤坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the grass in a park, wearing a gray hoodie and loose white pants, paired with slim-rimmed glasses. White wired headphones hang, connected to an invisible playback device. She wears a shiny ring on her left ring finger, and her right hand gently strokes the pages. Her posture is naturally relaxed, her body slightly leaning forward, immersed in reading. In front of her is a lush green lawn, with blurred trees and shrubs in the background, the trunks painted white, creating a soft and tranquil atmosphere The entire frame uses shallow depth of field, with the focus clearly on the subject. The background blurs to create a beautiful bokeh effect. The composition is mainly centered on the middle ground, with the person positioned slightly to the right of the frame, leaving space on the left side to enhance visual balance. The light comes from natural daylight, presenting a soft, diffused light texture. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting mottled shadows. The overall tone leans toward cool gray-blue and teal, creating a quiet, artistic, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The image has the texture of film photography, with moderate color saturation but still layering. The details are rich, the clothing textures are clearly visible, the earphone cable naturally bent, the book's edges rounded, grass leaves swaying in the wind, and tree shadows swaying in the background. The entire scene seems to capture an ordinary yet poetic moment, like a casual afternoon snapshot taken with an old film camera. The lens is slightly out of focus, with slight graininess and color shifts, enhancing realism and nostalgia. The image conveys a quiet loneliness and thirst for knowledge, while also revealing the gentleness and restraint of youth. The overall style combines a sense of everyday life with artistry, like a pastoral painting in a modern city, offering moments of tranquility and inner peace",
