        {
          "id": "krea2-dbc2b85dd7fd57bb5d119790",
          "alias": "单女黑丝袜咖啡厅冷淡坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the countertop of a gray metal locker, wearing a black knitted off-shoulder top with sleeves naturally hanging over her arms. She wears black stockings and black high heels, her legs crossed and curled up in front of her, arms crossed over her knees. Her posture is elegant yet slightly lazy, her expression calm and full of storytelling. Under soft lighting, she presents a gentle texture. The overall composition centers on the figure, forming a visual focal point. On the left side of the foreground is a stack of books—the top is DESIGN magazine, and below it is THE \"LIVING THEATER,\" \"PORTALS OF THE NEW ARCHITECTURE 2,\" and \"BOOK\"—the book's edges are neat, with slight reflectivity. Next to it are a pair of black-rimmed glasses and a vintage silver film camera. The camera body has clear scale and knob details. On the right side is a portable Bluetooth speaker with a wooden shell featuring round speaker holes and brand logos. Above the speaker is a book with a green cover, and on the spine is the word \"CAFE.\" DE FLORE\" is used as a backdrop, featuring a simple white wall with horizontal line decorations, creating a modern and minimalist indoor atmosphere. The entire scene is bright and evenly lit, using natural light or softbox simulated side and front light sources, with soft shadows and natural tonal transitions, no strong contrast, a cool tone, mainly black, white, and gray, with stable composition, the main subject centered to the right. The horizontal lines of the storage cabinets and vertical lines on the wall form geometric structures, enhancing the sense of order in the composition. Following the line of sight to the camera in your hand and the book beside you, then spreading to surrounding objects, forming a complete narrative loop. The image has the realistic texture of everyday amateur equipment, as if shot by a full-frame mirrorless camera at a standard focal length. Using an F2.8 aperture, ISO100, shutter speed of 1/60 sec, it delivers a slight graininess and realistic depth of field. The lens is slightly out of focus at the edges, the background blurs naturally, highlighting the subject. The overall atmosphere is quiet, artistic, and private. Full of everyday life and personal style, it resembles a carefully arranged home selfie, combining fashion and everyday vibes, conveying a unique understanding of aesthetics and life among urban youth. The details are rich, from the texture of stockings and the folds of clothing to the folds of book pages, all clearly visible, presenting a highly realistic and artistic visual quality",
