        {
          "id": "krea2-ab31c62f500a0f212a83b373",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫城市忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at the edge of an overpass at dusk, wearing a white short-sleeved shirt and a dark pleated skirt, white ankle socks and black shoes. She leans slightly against the concrete railing, her left hand gently supporting the railing, her right hand naturally hanging down, her body slightly leaning, presenting a lazy and contemplative posture. Her outfit is simple and everyday wear, with a white shirt that looks slightly loose, the collar loose, revealing her collarbones. The overall look exudes a youthful campus vibe, with the city night view in the background, distant traffic flowing like a weaving tapestry, and headlights forming blurred light trails—red, yellow, White and other colors intertwine to form flowing light spots. The sky shows a gradient of deep blue and purple-gray, with thin clouds and soft lighting. In the foreground are rough concrete fences and metal mesh fences, with clear fences and edges showing rust and wear marks. The middle ground features a woman, positioned slightly to the left of the frame, occupying the visual center. The composition uses a low-angle upward shot, with the figure extending upward from bottom to top to enhance the sense of spatial depth. At the same time, diagonal lines are used to create a diagonal between the guardrail and fence, guiding the gaze downward to the city lights. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by cool tones, dominated by blue and purple, creating a quiet yet slightly lonely urban nighttime atmosphere. The light source comes from distant car headlights and city lights, creating a backlighting effect. The character outlines are softened, presenting natural shadows. The overall image has a distinct film texture, strong graininess, low color saturation, and a cool tone. Slight noise and shadow overflow can be seen in the details, simulating the effects of vintage camera shooting. The lens is slightly out of focus, the background is highly blurred, the subject is highlighted, and the composition and blank space are reasonable. The large city night scene on the right serves as the backdrop, while the fence on the left forms a visual balance with the characters. The visuals are full of storytelling and emotional tension, as if capturing a fleeting inner monologue, with a strong cinematic and artistic atmosphere. The overall style blends Japanese film photography with urban portrait aesthetics, conveying an emotional tone of youth, confusion, freedom, and alienation",
