        {
          "id": "krea2-398fe17f72175c5913735667",
          "alias": "单女空姐蓝西装广场冷淡站立持手机",
          "prompt": "A female flight attendant dressed in a deep blue professional suit stands in front of a modern restroom sink. She wears a tailored deep blue blazer and a matching pencil skirt, a white shirt underneath, and a blue-and-white silk scarf with delicate geometric patterns on the neckline. Her makeup is refined and natural, her fingers long and neatly trimmed, and her left hand holds a phone. It seems as if you are examining or photographing your own image. The mirror is square with a simple frame and bright LED light strips along the edges, emitting a soft, even cool white light that illuminates the entire space. Below the mirror is a white ceramic washbasin equipped with a silver metal faucet. The faucet has a modern and minimalist design, with a smooth and reflective surface, rounded edges, and a clean and tidy interior. The background wall is covered with large white tiles with fine gray joints between the tiles. In the middle of the wall is a horizontal decorative patterned tile strip. The pattern features light gray plant leaf vein textures, adding a sense of detail. The overall environment is clean and bright, with typical features of a commercial space. The composition centers on the person, positioned on the right side of the canvas to form the visual focal point. The left side mirrors the mirror to provide symmetry and balance. The foreground features a washbasin and faucet, the middle ground features the figure and mirror, and the background features walls and tiles, creating a clear spatial layer. The viewing angle is slightly lower than that of the head-on, capturing the scene from the side and rear of the person, enhancing immersion and realism. The main light comes from the LED strip in front of the mirror. Creates uniform and soft lighting without obvious shadows, yet clearly outlines the outlines of people and the folds of clothing. The overall atmosphere is calm, professional, and restrained, evoking a sense of intimate moments in daily work, like a brief break during work breaks, full of the elegance and composure of a professional woman. The image texture is delicate, color saturation is moderate, and the tone is cool, emphasizing calmness and order. It presents a carefully lit commercial photography style while preserving the subtle realism of daily life. Like high-quality photos taken indoors with a mid-to-high-end consumer-grade camera, the details are rich, creating a realistic atmosphere that is both professional and close to everyday life",
