        {
          "id": "krea2-f17bdeb9fc66be9e841cf6e5",
          "alias": "单女上衣城市神秘阅读",
          "prompt": "At the roots, you can see natural black gradients, presenting a casual yet refined beauty, revealing a mysterious yet slightly detached expression. Her neck is graceful, wearing a thin silver chain necklace. She wears a loose white top with green shoulder straps visible on her shoulders. The material is thin and breathable, with slightly rolled-up cuffs. The overall look is simple yet layered. In the foreground, the main figure occupies the main position in the frame, with the head slightly tilted, creating direct communication with the viewer. The middle frame is a blurred corridor with an off-white wall. With slight vertical textures and light and shadow changes, the ground reflects a soft green halo, faintly visible faint door frames or passageways in the distance, the background is a blurred indoor environment, with light streaming in from above and sides, creating a strong contrast of light and dark. The top features metallic pipes or lighting structures, and the walls and floor present a visual effect of intertwined warm and cool tones. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered slightly to the left, the head slightly tilted, and text elements positioned at the bottom of the frame, the English term \"LUCID DREAM\" Presented in light green sans-serif font, the Chinese phrase \"Dreaming Awake\" is highlighted in bold orange-red font. The font edges show slight wear and grainy texture, with text layered in front of the characters' bodies to create visual layering. The upper left corner features small text \"A WONG KAR WAI FILM,\" the lower right corner labels \"JANUARY 1ST 2000,\" and the lower left corner reads \"STARRING KIM MINJEONG.\" All text integrates seamlessly into the overall image, preserving visual harmony. The lighting atmosphere is dominated by high contrast, with the main light source coming from the upper right, creating a strong backlight effect that creates a bright halo at the edges of the character's contours, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall tone is cool, dominated by green and white, complemented by orange-red text as the visual focal point, creating a psychedelic, surreal, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The image has a film-like texture, with slight grainy noise and color shifts in the frame, simulating retro camera effects, with slight defocus and chromatic dispersion at the edges. It feels as if shot with an old-fashioned 35mm film camera in low-light conditions, presenting the poetic aesthetic of Wong Kar-wai's cinematic style, filled with urban loneliness and a dreamlike, hazy atmosphere. The images are rich in detail, with natural transitions in light and shadow, and distinct color layers. It is both artistically expressive and authentic, like a moment captured by chance, recording a private moment between waking and dreaming",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
