        {
          "id": "krea2-45b0e7bd8c635d60e77240e7",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道冷淡倚靠交叠",
          "prompt": "From a low-angle downward view, a woman leans against a traffic light pole at a city street corner. She wears an off-white loose shirt and light-colored plaid wide-leg pants, paired with white pointed ankle boots and round vintage sunglasses. Her posture is relaxed yet full of tension. Her left hand gently supports the yellow pedestrian signal cover, her body leaning slightly back, her legs crossed over a metal railing covered in stickers and graffiti, creating a casual yet urban-style fashion vibe. In the foreground is the yellow plastic shell and metal bracket structure of the signal light installation, with wear marks and fine scratches on its surface. The \"ONE\" logo at the top is clearly visible. The background is a clear pale blue sky, with several bare branches extending from the lower left, forming a clean silhouette. The overall composition uses strong perspective lines to guide the gaze upward toward the main figure. The vertical lines of the signal pole and tree trunk enhance the sense of depth in the image. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the image, forming the visual focal point. The light and shadow come from the high-angle sunlight slightly to the left directly above, reflecting bright highlights on the metal surface. At the same time, deep shadows are cast inside the signal light enclosure. The color is dominated by warm yellow tones, forming a striking contrast with the cool-toned blue sky, creating a cool yet slightly warm atmosphere reminiscent of late winter to early spring or early spring. The texture of the image is similar to shooting with a medium format film camera, with slight graininess and natural color saturation. The edges are slightly out of focus, enhancing realism and documentary style. The overall atmosphere blends street art and The casual blend of modern fashion and everyday life presents an urban aesthetic that is both design-oriented and lively, as if capturing a missed moment, allowing viewers to sense the subtle relationship between people and their environment in the city. The details are rich, including fingerprint marks on traffic signal glass, peeling edges of stickers, slight wear on boot heels, and textures on clothing fibers, all adding a realistic sense of life to the image. The entire scene appears bright and transparent under sunlight. Yet it retains a faint sense of detachment, like a silent dialogue about freedom, individuality, and urban space",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
