        {
          "id": "krea2-42396143d2d25fa9d7f57cce",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔室内媚态站立回眸",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a dimly lit indoor setting, wearing a white cropped backless top and light blue jeans. Her body slightly turns to the side, turning her head to gaze at the camera. Her overall posture is relaxed and approachable, exuding an unintentional sensuality and youthful vibe. In the foreground, the main figure occupies most of the space on the right side of the frame, clearly visible from waist to head. The background is a small shop or bar full of everyday life, with walls covered in various posters, advertisements, and graffiti. The colors are colorful but blurred by the dim lighting. On the left, warm yellow light shines down from above, creating soft halos and slight spots in the air, creating a warm and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. In the middle shot, you can see blurry figures and some furnishings such as tables, chairs, wine bottles, and decorations. These elements are blurred, enhancing the sense of layering and depth in the composition. The composition uses a slightly tilted perspective, with the figures positioned in the lower right of the frame, creating an asymmetrical visual balance. The light and shadow mainly come from the warm light source in the upper left, creating a clear contrast between light and dark. The backs and arms of the figures are illuminated, creating a strong sense of three-dimensionality. The shadows are soft and transitions naturally, with an overall warm tone, mainly yellow-brown and dark brown, mixed with denim blue and white, creating a retro film photography texture. The image has slight graininess and noise, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera, with slight vignetting at the edges, enhancing the photo's realism and artistry. The entire scene exudes a daily, casual yet story-rich atmosphere, as if capturing a fleeting moment in an ordinary night. It combines the hustle and bustle of urban life with the privacy of personal emotions, and as the complex elements of the background spread outward, it forms a complete visual closed loop. The atmosphere is tranquil yet slightly melancholic, as if recording a moment of solitary thought late at night, with a strong documentary style and humanistic care",
