        {
          "id": "krea2-e667570d61646640f9681cf0",
          "alias": "单女米T恤室内冷淡站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands indoors, her expression slightly calm and confident, her overall aura combining youthful energy with a touch of coolness. Her left hand holds a smartphone with a protective case, with multiple camera modules on the back of the phone facing her, taking a selfie. Her right hand hangs naturally, fingers are long, and she wears several silver rings and a thin chain bracelet. She wears a beige short-sleeved T-shirt printed with dark brown lettering in bold and powerful font, and the fabric hugs her body, presenting slight pleats and a stretchy texture On the bottom, she wears army green cargo pants with a loose fit, a waist tie design, and multiple pockets on both sides of the legs. The material is durable fabric, with natural light and shadow transitions and slight reflection. The pants drape naturally on the legs, and the waistline is slightly raised, highlighting her body proportions. Her body leans slightly forward, relaxed yet elegant. Her right shoulder is slightly lowered, her left arm bent to hold her phone, the arm muscles are smooth, and the details of the forearm and palm are clear. The background is a modern-style indoor space. Behind it is a row of black metal bookshelves, neatly arranged with various books. Some spines are brightly colored in white, yellow, blue, and more. The books are arranged in an orderly manner—some upright, some slanted. The edges of the shelves have metal support structures that reflect light from the surrounding environment. Warm yellow lights illuminate the top and bottom of the shelves, creating a warm and layered atmosphere. On the left and right sides are silver metal pipe fittings, which are cylindrical with smooth surfaces reflecting images of surrounding objects. Valves and joints are installed at the pipe connections, rich in details with an industrial feel, the floor is made of light gray tiles or cement, with a smooth surface with subtle seams and reflections. The overall scene blends modern urban minimalist aesthetics with a sense of daily life. The composition centers on the figure, using close-ups that occupy the main part of the frame, from the waist up to the head, with the phone positioned in the upper left corner forming a visual guiding line, then moving down to body and clothing details to create a natural visual flow. Background elements are moderately blurred to highlight the main subject. At the same time, it retains enough information to enhance the sense of space. The light comes from the upper front position, soft and even, without strong shadows. The shadows are delicate and three-dimensional, while the warm yellow lighting in the background adds a warm tone to the image, contrasting with cool metal elements to create a visual balance of warmth and coolness. The overall atmosphere combines the casual realism of daily life with the refined beauty of fashionable photography, as if shot with a professional camera in a natural indoor environment. The image resolution is high, details rich, color reproduction is true, and texture is delicate The images present a style that strikes a balance between documentary and art, combining the spontaneity of amateur equipment shooting with the refinement of professional post-processing. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, the layers distinct, the characters' expressions natural, movements not stiff, the overall composition stable, and the visual focus clear, conveying an independent and confident attitude toward life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
