        {
          "id": "krea2-d78df4e28181bdea0d9f305d",
          "alias": "单女白风衣广场忧伤站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the center of an indoor staircase extending downward, wearing a loose white long trench coat paired with a black dress, dark ankle boots, and carrying a black backpack. She looks sideways at the camera, her expression slightly lazy and detached, her posture naturally relaxed, as if she has just stepped down the stairs or is preparing to continue. Her figure forms a visual focal point in the middle of the staircase, occupying a position slightly above the center of the frame, becoming the central subject of the entire composition. In the background is a staircase staircase covered with square tiles, with the tiles in beige tones. The surface features fine speckled textures, with dark anti-slip strips along the edges of each step. On both sides are white walls and metal handrails. The handrails are made of silver stainless steel, smooth and reflective, extending along the curved staircase. The walls are simple but slightly aged, with some areas showing slight stains and wear marks. On the left wall, several dark rectangular windows or ventilation openings are embedded inside, with a pitch-black interior creating a strong contrast between light and dark. The middle shot is the platform area where women stand. The floor material matches the stairs but is lighter in color. The background is a more open passage space, with exposed pipes, wires, and metal structures visible at the top. The ceiling has a rugged industrial texture, with rust and signs of aging. The overall environment feels somewhat closed and oppressive, yet full of the everyday atmosphere of urban life. Light enters from above or from afar, presenting a cool white glow, partially covered by shadows, creating a high-contrast light and shadow effect. The figures have distinct backlit outlines. The front of the body is in relative shadow, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color scheme is a mix of warm yellow and gray-white, with a vintage film texture. The graininess is obvious, and the color saturation is low, creating a nostalgic, lonely, and slightly artistic atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle upward view, emphasizing the depth and spatial pressure of the stairs, while highlighting the character's small size and presence in the environment. The visual guide lines are formed by the stairway steps and handrails, creating a dynamic visual flow. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and storytelling, as if capturing fleeting moments of urban life, like real-life scenes casually captured with an old camera, delivering a strong sense of life and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
