        {
          "id": "krea2-15546a676689baed83e5d268",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫竹林严肃站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a Parisian-style balcony, dressed in a loose white shirt and gray wide-leg pants, exuding a casual yet elegant aura. Her posture slightly turns to look back at the camera, exuding confidence and composure. Her right hand gently holds a tote bag with a blue and white tie-dye pattern, printed with the words \"COMMON KAI\" on the bag. The bamboo handle feels crisp, and the overall design is simple yet stylish. In the foreground is a delicate black cast iron carved railing, whose complex geometric patterns and smooth curves create a visual layering effect. The metallic texture of the railing reflects slightly under soft light, creating contrast and resonance with the figures. In the middle ground, the female subject is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, her body forming an S-shaped curve. The use of blank space creates a sense of breathing and draws the viewer toward the cityscape in the background. The background is a typical Parisian architectural complex, with beige stone facades, sloped roofs, bay windows, and chimneys arranged in an orderly manner. The distant architectural outlines are slightly blurred in the mist, presenting a mix of light gray and pale brown, enhancing the depth and realism of the scene. The composition uses a three-part layout, with the figure occupying the left third and leaving ample space on the right to showcase the cityscape. At the same time, vertical lines formed by railings guide the gaze upward, creating a stable visual structure. Light and shadow come from diffused light from cloudy days, with uniform and soft lighting without strong shadows. The overall color tone leans toward cool tones, mainly blue, gray, and white, creating a calm, cool, and slightly artistic atmosphere. The image details are rich yet not chaotic; from the texture of the package to the rust on the railing, everything is clearly visible, giving it the texture of high-resolution photography. It feels as if shot with a professional full-frame camera paired with a prime lens, with slight film graininess and natural color deviations, presenting a realistic moment casually captured in daily life. It combines the refinement of a fashion blockbuster with the genuine warmth of everyday life. The overall image is full of urban poetry and the spirit of modern female independence, like a quiet scene from a French film. It makes you feel the pause and tenderness of time in this moment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
