        {
          "id": "krea2-6d687ef3c1fc8013c32478c5",
          "alias": "单女粉衬衫城市温柔坐持杯",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright in a dark brown leather armchair, wearing a light pink puff-sleeve shirt and a black high-waisted leather skirt, paired with black stockings and pointed high heels. Her right hand gently holds a transparent wine glass filled with red liquid, her posture elegant and relaxed. Her left hand rests naturally on her leg, her nails painted in light pink, presenting a refined yet slightly lazy urban feminine vibe. The chair is covered with thick, fluffy white faux plush cushions, creating a vivid contrast of color and texture. The background is a deep red velvet curtain. The pleats are rich and layered, creating a warm and intimate atmosphere. The floor is covered with a Persian-style carpet featuring intricate geometric and floral patterns, mainly in deep red, black, and off-white. The details are intricate but not chaotic. In the lower left corner, a pair of black high heels can be seen casually placed, hinting that the figure has just taken a seat or is about to leave. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, slightly turning their body to form a natural visual guideline, then turning to the red background curtain to form a closed-loop visual path. Light comes from the front slightly right, softly illuminating the subject evenly, while casting subtle shadows on the curtains and carpet to enhance spatial depth. The overall light and shadow transitions naturally, with moderate contrast between light and dark, creating a warm atmosphere reminiscent of a retro film. The tones are mainly red, brown, pink, and black, with strong yet harmonious contrasts. The image texture is delicate and detailed, as if shot by professional studio lighting and cameras, exuding a strong sense of artistry and a sense of life. It is as if capturing an elegant moment in a quiet afternoon café or private study, full of storytelling and emotional tension, with images presenting a visual experience that blends realism and beauty",
