        {
          "id": "krea2-de0d369e92c13907f17000b2",
          "alias": "单女银连衣裙海滩冷淡站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman in a silver-white sequin long dress stands on the seaside pier, her expression calm and elegant. The dress features a deep V-neck design, with a cinched waist outlining a slender waistline. One side of the skirt slits high to the top of the thigh, revealing long, beautiful legs. The dress is covered with fine, shimmering particles that glow in the sunlight like flowing stars. The long sleeves hang naturally, hugging the body and showcasing exquisite tailoring. She gently supports the white railing with both hands, her posture composed. Her right arm rests on a thick stone pillar, while her left arm stretches out naturally, her fingertips lightly touching the railing ring. Wearing pointed high heels in the same color, the overall look is noble and elegant. The background is a vast, boundless blue sea, with shimmering water. In the distance, a long bridge spans the horizon. The bridge's lines are simple and modern, and a white boat slowly passes by. The sky is pale blue, with a few thin clouds drifting, soft and bright—natural light in the early morning or afternoon. Sunlight streams diagonally from the left side of the painting, creating a warm golden hue that illuminates the right side of the figure and the hem of her skirt, creating delicate layers of light and shadow. The shadows fall on the ground and beneath the railing. Enhances three-dimensionality. The foreground features blue non-slip floor tiles with white markings, giving a realistic texture. The railing is made of white metal, with a circular circular design that is highly decorative. The stone column surface is rough and textured, contrasting with the smooth metal. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, with the line extending to the left at the sea-sky junction. The middle view features the sea and distant bridges, while the distant view is the skyline and boats. The layers are distinct, creating a sense of dynamic balance. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and distant, combining urban fashion with natural poetry. The image has a cinematic texture. It feels as if shot by a professional photographer holding a handheld camera. The lens has slight noise and film graininess, moderate color saturation, rich details, and natural light and shadow transitions, presenting a realistic feel reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment shooting while retaining artistic beauty. The color palette mainly uses cool blue and silvery white, accented with warm yellow sunlight to create a contrast between cool and warm tones, highlighting the subject. The edges of the frame are slightly defocused, the center is clear, simulating the depth of field effect of real photography. The overall style blends high-end fashion, seaside charm, and humanistic mood, conveying independent confidence. A calm and unhurried aura",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
