        {
          "id": "krea2-54542fe5b2dc8e6f24849614",
          "alias": "单女绿连衣裙街道沉思站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beside the platform at Kibuneguchi Station in Japan. She wears a long emerald green silk dress with delicate wave patterns and a sheen, the hem naturally draping down to her ankles. A bow decoration is tied around her waist, accentuating her slender waistline. She wears a dark brown leather jacket that is slightly loose, with slightly rolled-up cuffs, showcasing a casual yet fashionable style. Draped naturally over her shoulders, she carries a touch of mystery and confidence. Her hands hang naturally, fingers are long, and she wears black ankle boots. The boots have a slight reflective surface, giving the overall look an elegant yet hints of rebellion. In the foreground is a clear full-body image of her, occupying the left central position of the frame. The background features the Kibuneguchi Station sign, with a white base plate and a red border, written in Japanese with \"Kibune-guchi\" and the Romanized spelling \"Kibune-guchi.\" Below are signs for \"E16\" and \"Kibuneguchi.\" The sign stands on a black metal pole, next to a row of dark wooden fences, with dense green trees behind the fence. Layers of leaves form a bright emerald green. Sunlight filters through the gaps, casting dappled light and shadow, creating a soft contrast of light and shadow. Several vintage-style brass street lamps are arranged along the road, with square shades that emit warm yellow light inside, creating a cool contrast with natural light. The lamp poles are made of black metal with clean and upright lines. The ground is a gray cement pavement with light gray stone edges. Light shines diagonally down from the upper right of the image, creating a distinct side light effect. The right side of the figure's body is illuminated by sunlight. The left side is in shadow, with distinct outlines. The trees and streetlights in the background create a sense of depth under the lighting. The overall composition uses the rule of thirds: the figure is positioned at the left one-third, with the gaze guiding to the right to the bus stop and distant woods, creating a sense of depth. The depth of field is shallow, the main figure is clear and sharp, the background slightly blurred, highlighting the subject while preserving environmental details. The color scheme is mainly green, paired with brown, black, and warm yellow, creating a harmonious visual layer. The atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, as if on a summer afternoon. The sunlight is bright and the air is fresh, blending traditional Japanese style with modern life. The image texture resembles film photography, with slight graininess and natural color transitions. The light and shadow are soft, details are rich, and the composition is balanced. It has strong narrative and artistic appeal, making it suitable for travel portraits or fashion shoots",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
