        {
          "id": "krea2-a57b023679218b20a7c75246",
          "alias": "单女白T恤商店微笑阅读",
          "prompt": "The hat has slight wrinkles and wear marks, giving it a natural and casual look. The front of the hat is embroidered with a simple pattern, possibly a brand logo or decorative design. The overall style is casual and comfortable, with a hint of natural sheen. She looks back at the camera with a gentle yet reserved smile, adding a touch of soft color. She wears a loose white T-shirt with moderately sized sleeves, and the fabric is light and breathable. On the back is a small illustration pattern, vaguely but faintly revealing cartoon-style characters or objects, arranged vertically, adding a touch of playfulness to the overall look. Her body is slightly turned sideways, her right hand naturally resting at her waist, her arm lines smooth and her posture relaxed and confident, as if she has just bought a drink from a vending machine, enjoying a moment of leisure. The foreground is prominent, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right. The composition uses close-ups, and the vending machine in the background is blurred. Creating a soft bokeh effect, the machine consists of multiple shelves, each displaying colorful bottled beverages and packaged foods. Bright colors like blue, yellow, red, and green intertwine to create rich visual layers. Some product labels have blurred text that is hard to read, but the overall color scheme is bright and characteristic of Japanese convenience stores. The vending machine surface has a slight reflection, indicating it is made of smooth plastic or metal, with buttons and indicator lights on top that emit a faint green light. It adds a touch of technology and modernity to the scene. In the background, faint stickers, price tags, and advertising posters can be seen, further enhancing the realism of the scene. The composition uses shallow depth of field photography, while the background gradually transitions into blurred colored light spots, creating a strong sense of depth and spatial layering, creating a warm sense of interaction. At the same time, her posture guides the gaze to the right, making the scene more dynamic. The lighting atmosphere is dominated by natural light, soft and even, coming from the front slightly to the left. Shadows are light and smoothly transitioned, with no obvious hard edges, presenting an outdoor environment on clear days. This might be by the street or at the entrance of a mall, where light reflects off the vending machine's glass door, creating subtle highlights that enhance the sense of authenticity. The overall color scheme is mainly white and light tones, paired with rich contrasting colors in the background, creating a vivid and harmonious visual relationship. The image conveys a relaxed, everyday, and youthful vibe, as if a photo was casually taken with a regular phone or small camera. With slight noise and film texture, it preserves everyday details and warmth, without excessive embellishment or perfection, making it appear more authentic and moving. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and warm, reminiscent of a simple summer afternoon outing, a chance encounter, and an ordinary yet cherished moment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
