        {
          "id": "krea2-f01a2bd8436035a8b0770f04",
          "alias": "单女学生蓝制服图书馆愤怒坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman in a deep blue school uniform sits on the wooden floor of the library, legs naturally extended, body slightly leaning forward. Her expression reveals a quiet contemplation and a subtle sense of detachment. Her school uniform jacket is open, layered with a white shirt and brown bow tie, black stockings wrapping her long legs. The overall look is typical of a Japanese schoolgirl uniform. The main figure is positioned slightly to the right of the foreground, occupying the main visual focus. Her posture is relaxed yet dignified, as if she has just risen from a bookshelf or is about to continue reading. It creates a sense of tranquility in everyday life. In the foreground is a vintage patterned carpet laid on the wooden floor, edged with delicate geometric patterns. The texture is soft and layered, contrasting with the smooth wooden floor and enhancing the sense of realism and touch in the space. In the middle is tall wooden bookshelves surrounding the area, neatly arranged with densely packed books. The spines vary in color, including off-white, light yellow, dark brown, and light blue. Some books are slightly tilted, showing signs of frequent flipping, with gaps between the shelves. The wall behind and another row of bookshelves can be faintly seen, creating a sense of depth. The dial is engraved with exquisite patterns, and the pendulum swings slowly, symbolizing the passage of time, adding a touch of nostalgia and order to the scene. To the right of the background is a large lattice window, where sunlight streams through the glass into the room, creating a soft backlight effect. The light scatters through the air, creating a slight halo and graininess. The entire space is enveloped in a warm golden tone. The view outside the window is blurred, with only the hazy outlines of green plants visible, hinting at a tranquil outdoor world. The composition uses a low-angle shot, with the view close to the ground, making the figure appear more intimate and evoking an atmosphere of being observed. At the same time, the leg line is elongated, enhancing the visual extension of the image. The character's head slightly shifts from the centerline, with the gaze directed upward to the left, forming a hidden visual guiding line. In terms of lighting and shadow, the main light source comes from natural light from the right window. This creates side backlighting, producing bright contour light and enhancing the sense of depth. Details are clear but not glaring. The shadows on the bookshelf and floor gradually darken with the angle of the light, creating a distinct transition between light and shadow. The overall atmosphere is warm, tranquil, and full of artistic flair, as if capturing a private moment during an afternoon reading break. The image texture is delicate, color saturation moderate, and the tones are warm yellow, dark brown, and navy blue, harmoniously unified, with graininess similar to film photography and slight overexposed edges. It simulates the authentic texture of everyday amateur camera shooting, with well-handled background blur, clear foreground, and gradually blurred background, highlighting the subject while preserving environmental information. Overall, it presents an image style that is both realistic and slightly idealized, like still frames in a youth film, carrying gentle memories of knowledge, time, and growth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
