        {
          "id": "krea2-1e3f960f255acd34867a42d5",
          "alias": "单女蓝西装教室微笑坐比耶",
          "prompt": "A Japanese high school girl wearing a dark blue suit jacket and a blue-and-white plaid pleated skirt sits at the edge of the classroom podium, smiling brightly. Her right hand makes a V-sign gesture, her posture natural and approachable. Her left hand rests lightly on the podium, wearing black long socks and white flat shoes. The overall look is full of youthful energy. The details of the uniform are clearly visible, including a white shirt, blue-and-white plaid tie, a badge on the left chest, and a pocket design on the suit lapel. Her legs are elegantly crossed, showcasing a healthy female figure and confident temperament. In the foreground, the wooden surface of the podium and several stacked textbooks are stacked. The pages are yellowed, and the covers are green, showing traces of daily study and life. In the middle frame, the female student occupies the main position, slightly leaning forward, forming a visual focal point. In the background is a slightly worn green blackboard, with a wooden set square hanging on it. The edges are slightly worn, and the surface shows faint chalk marks, creating a realistic teaching atmosphere. The classroom walls are light beige, and the floor is light brown wood, with natural light streaming in through the left window. Softly and evenly illuminate the entire space, creating a warm and bright indoor light and shadow effect. The shadows transition naturally to highlight three-dimensionality. The composition uses a mid-to-close perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the center. The podium extends horizontally through the bottom of the frame to form a stable baseline. The blackboard serves as the background element to provide depth, while the set square and book form a visual guiding line, directing the gaze toward the characters and actions. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and joyful, full of campus youthful energy, as if capturing a real moment during recess. The image texture is delicate, and the color saturation is moderate. The color palette is mainly blue, green, and off-white, harmoniously unified with a slight film graininess and natural exposure, simulating amateur camera shooting style, presenting a life-oriented, documentary visual experience. The visuals are layered and richly detailed, combining the innocence and beauty of student days with the everyday warmth and realism of the scene",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
