        {
          "id": "krea2-c83a0f037d064b54055810b1",
          "alias": "单女蓝泳装海滩微笑坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the beach by the sea, sunlight filtering through the clouds casting a soft golden halo, faintly glistening with a healthy glow. She wears a light blue spaghetti strap swimsuit with slender straps revealing a graceful collarbone. Her right hand rests gently on her knee, while her left hand holds a thin white gauze garment. The edges of the garment curl slightly, fluttering in the wind. She turns sideways toward the camera, her head slightly tilted, revealing neat, white teeth. Her smile is bright and sincere, tinged with a hint of shyness and joy, as if she has just stepped out of the sea. The background is a calm sea, shimmering with waves. In the distance, a blurred green hill outline appears. The sky displays a gradient of pale blue and gold, with light slanting from the upper right, creating a soft backlight effect. The figure's outline is enveloped in a warm halo. The foreground clearly shows the main subject, the middle ground is the gently undulating sea where the beach meets the beach, and the background is a hazy distant mountain and skyline. The composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space. The slightly lower angle creates a warm and intimate visual experience. The overall color palette of the image is mainly warm and cool, with blue seawater, swimsuits, and golden sunlight forming a harmonious complementary relationship. The layers of light and shadow are rich, with soft transitions in shadows without stiff shadows, creating a peaceful, warm, and healing summer atmosphere. The entire scene feels like a tranquil moment in a Japanese movie, full of life and poetic beauty, as if you can hear the sound of waves gently lapping on the shore. This is a photo full of vitality and emotional warmth. It looks like it was shot with an old-fashioned film camera, featuring a slight graininess and slightly warm color saturation, presenting a realistic and gentle everyday imaging style",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
