        {
          "id": "krea2-abf0675c1906f80854d32546",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣小径忧伤侧头",
          "prompt": "A half-length portrait of a woman presents a dynamic and flowing feel. Looking directly into the camera, her expression reveals a quiet contemplation and a faint melancholy. She wears a light blue knit cardigan paired with a white vest, arms naturally raised, her posture elegant and relaxed. The foreground is a thin layer of transparent gauze or mist, creating a hazy texture. The gauze gently flutters in the wind, forming soft folds and light and shadow changes, creating a dreamlike effect. The background is a pure light blue sky with no clouds, and the colors are uniform and soft. It gives a sense of openness and tranquility. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space, the head slightly tilted, and the line of sight slightly off-center, creating visual tension and a sense of breathing. The overall composition is dominated by cool tones, with blue and white interweaving, bright but not glaring, presenting a natural daylight illumination. The light source comes from the front and above, creating delicate shadow transitions that make the silhouette more three-dimensional, while the gauze creates slight reflection and light transmission, enhancing the sense of layering. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is cool and ethereal, as if you are on a quiet summer afternoon. The air is filled with a gentle breeze and a faint floral fragrance. The entire scene has a strong sense of artistry and poetic beauty, as if you were shooting with a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens, capturing a moment that is both authentic and beautiful. At the same time, it carries the rustic feel of everyday amateur equipment shooting, such as film cameras or mobile phones, preserving subtle noise and natural color transitions, enhancing realism and a sense of life. There are no unnecessary decorations or distractions in the painting, focusing on the emotional expression of the figures and the fusion of the ambient atmosphere. Through minimalist composition and pure colors, it conveys a tranquil, free, and slightly melancholic youthful mood, gradually extending to the drifting gauze and sky, forming a smooth visual path that immerses viewers in this tranquility and beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
