        {
          "id": "krea2-3681a756ea538acbeea95d5c",
          "alias": "单女旗袍庭院忧伤注视",
          "prompt": "The overall look is elegant and full of classical charm. The lace cuffs and back of the qipao feature delicate hollowed-out patterns, outlining her graceful figure. As if gazing into some distant memory or future, the foreground is a half-body close-up of the figure, the middle is a blurred courtyard environment, with faint outlines of bluestone paths and greenery, and the background completely hidden in deep darkness, where only faint architectural structures and silhouettes of trees can be recognized, creating a strong sense of depth and spatial layering. The composition uses classic rule of thirds and diagonal lines, with the figure positioned on the right side of the painting and the line of sight facing left, creating a visual extension and blank space. Natural light shines from the left, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow, reflecting a crystal-clear luster, while the shadowed areas blend into the background darkness, enhancing three-dimensionality and mysterious atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly deep blue and black, accented with metallic silver. The cool tones create a tranquil, elegant, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The light comes from moonlight or faint artificial light under the night sky, giving the image a cinematic texture and dramatic tension. The camera uses a wide aperture for shooting, with a noticeable background blur effect, highlighting the subject while preserving the hazy beauty of the environment. The image quality is delicate, The details are rich, combining the sophistication of professional photography with the natural realism of everyday handheld device shooting. It feels like an impromptu snapshot in a late-night courtyard, capturing the poetry and solitude of this moment. The overall image is filled with Eastern aesthetics, combining modern fashion with traditional charm, presenting a serene and profound artistic atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
