        {
          "id": "krea2-e3ceba37f04c6ecab0dbfd2a",
          "alias": "单女白T恤户外微笑站立指向",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors in a lush green environment, wearing a simple white crew-neck T-shirt over a loose light beige shirt. The shirt sleeves are slightly rolled up, giving off a casual and comfortable look that adds a touch of softness and playfulness. She holds a black Sony Mavica series portable camera, with the lens facing the viewer. The \"SONY\" and \"M MAVICA\" logos on the camera are clearly visible. She holds the camera in front of her chest with her right hand and raises her index finger with her left hand to point toward the sky, making a relaxed yet expressive gesture, looking directly at the camera, as if interacting warmly with the audience. The makeup is light and natural, the overall vibe fresh and sweet. The background is a blurred green vegetation, presenting a soft bokeh effect, like dappled sunlight filtering through leaves, creating a peaceful and vibrant atmosphere. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure at the very center of the frame, the foreground the figure and camera, the middle ground showing her body outline and clothing details, and the background featuring blurred green plants, creating a distinct depth of field. Light comes from natural daylight, softly and evenly falling on the subjects, without strong shadows, highlighting the texture of the skin and the folds of clothing. The overall color palette is mainly fresh green and elegant off-white, creating a warm and tranquil feeling on a summer afternoon. The image has a slight film graininess and a slightly low color saturation retro texture, simulating the effects of everyday amateur photography, as if capturing a real and beautiful moment. Following her smile and gestures, the camera extends back to her entire posture, forming a complete narrative loop. The light and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, carrying a subtle nostalgic vibe. Overall, it presents a lifelike, documentary artistic beauty, like a precious image from a private diary, capturing moments of youth, freedom, and expression.",
