        {
          "id": "krea2-cc5fe82c35bc9cbbcc0241d7",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙摄影棚困倦站立手持物",
          "prompt": "A woman stands before a pure white background, presenting a gentle yet slightly lazy expression. Her overall aura is cool yet a touch of approachability. She wears a fluffy white plush dress with a light and flowing hem, the material as soft as a cloud. The shoulder design is simple, revealing slender shoulders and collarbones. Her arms hang down naturally, and she gently holds a huge red candy cane-shaped prop. The surface of the prop is smooth and glossy, showing a bright red color, with a curved top shape. The bottom has a slender shaft with a blurred brand logo. The cane feels like plastic or rubber, forming a strong contrast with the white clothing. She wears a pair of round white earrings, a simple yet modern look adding a touch of fashion. The entire scene is shrouded in a thin layer of white smoke, creating a dreamy, hazy atmosphere. The smoke slowly rises from the ground, circles around her ankles, and spreads upward around her body, making the outline edges soft and blurred, as if immersed in a sea of clouds. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame. The red cane extends diagonally upward from the lower left corner, forming a strong visual guiding line. The vertical lines of the cane echo the figure's body, enhancing the stability and layering of the image. Light comes from a soft light source slightly above the front, presenting a uniform, bright, diffused light effect without obvious shadows. At the same time, a slight reflection appears on the cane's surface, highlighting its smooth texture. The overall color scheme is mainly white, accented with vivid red. This creates a strong color contrast, creating a clean, pure, and festive visual experience. The overall image presents a surreal and dreamlike feeling, as if characters stepped out of a fairy tale. It is both sweet and cute, with the refined beauty of modern art photography. The light and shadow are soft, the atmosphere tranquil, as if time has stopped at this moment, giving a visual experience that is both real and surreal, like studio shoots taken with professional cameras paired with large-aperture lenses. Or when using high-fidelity digital devices to capture moments in low-noise environments, the image is delicate, detailed, and color reproduction accurate, presenting a high-end commercial advertising quality feel, while preserving beautiful moments casually captured in daily life, evoking a gentle, romantic, and slightly mysterious aesthetic conception",
