        {
          "id": "krea2-a4ea931c82c1e18879186815",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫广场忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands inside the window of a vintage-style vehicle. She wears an off-white turtleneck knit sweater paired with a red, blue, and white plaid scarf with fringed edges. She holds a silver vintage film camera in her right hand, the lens facing the window, her left hand gently pressed against the glass, fingers slightly apart, as if feeling the temperature of the window and the breeze outside, with a touch of contemplation and nostalgia. Her overall posture is elegant and relaxed, with the woman as the main subject, positioned slightly to the right of the frame, forming the visual focal point. In the foreground is the frame of the window glass, with the metallic black frame clearly visible. The glass surface shows slight reflections and stains, enhancing realism. Through the glass, you can see the orange lettering \"ENTRANCE\" and a square icon. The font is bold and modern, contrasting with the retro atmosphere. The middle view shows the interior of the carriage behind the woman, with faint seats and metal armrests. The tone is dark, creating a strong contrast with the bright external light. The background is a blurry cityscape outside the car, possibly a street or platform. Light streams in diagonally from the right, creating a warm backlighting effect. Sunlight penetrates the window, casting a soft halo on the figure. The layers of light and shadow are rich, with warm yellow tones dominating the entire image, creating a peaceful, nostalgic, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the main part of the frame. The window frame acts as a natural frame, guiding the gaze to the character. The glass reflection and perspective enhance spatial depth, and the visual direction is directed from the \"ENTRANCE\" sign in the upper left corner toward the character. This creates a dynamic visual flow. The overall image has the grainy texture and slight color shifts of film photography, simulating the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting. The tones are warm but not oversaturated, preserving shadow transitions and exposure details under real lighting, presenting a lifelike, documentary artistic style. Like a momentary captured by chance, full of storytelling and emotional tension, the image shows no deliberate embellishment, preserving cluttered environmental details such as glass scratches, reflective spots, and slight lens distortion. Further enhancing authenticity and immediacy, the overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, evoking travel, memories, and the passage of time",
