        {
          "id": "krea2-9de0f668a58da9355979053f",
          "alias": "单女蓝制服城市冷淡坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A Japanese high school girl dressed in a deep blue sailor uniform sits on a bench at a bus stop, wearing slim-rimmed glasses, exuding a calm and slightly detached aura. Her right hand gently holds an open book, its pages slightly curled. Her left hand rests naturally on her lap, with a black leather backpack in front of her. She wears white pantyhose, legs crossed, exposing a bit of skin at her ankles. Sunlight streams in from the right side. The bench she sits on is made of dark stone, smooth with subtle textures. In the background, you can see blurry city streets, with several tree branches casting long shadows in the sunset. Distant building outlines are blurred, showing a mix of warm yellow and cool gray. The sky shows a faint orange-yellow gradient, and the entire scene is enveloped by soft backlight. Light passes through the gaps in the sunshade, casting strip-like shadows on the ground and walls. On the left wall, a black silhouette of a bicycle is cast, adding depth and storytelling to the scene. The composition uses a third-level method, with the figure positioned to the right. The head is slightly turned sideways, creating direct communication with the viewer. The foreground is a clear close-up of the character, the middle ground is the structure and part of the bus stop, the background gradually blurs out, highlighting the main subject and extending into the cityscape in the background. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with a texture reminiscent of Japanese youth films. The overall color scheme is mainly deep blue and gray-black, accented with golden sunlight and warm yellow background light, creating an atmosphere that is both everyday and poetic, as if capturing a quiet afternoon moment after school. The images are rich in detail, with clear textures, realistic and perceptible wrinkles on clothing, page edges, and eyeglass reflections, featuring the grainy texture of film photography and slight overexposure, resembling real scenes shot with an old camera. The images are full of life and nostalgia, evoking the gentleness and loneliness of campus days, presenting an overall sense of tranquility, restrainedness, and rich storytelling beauty",
