        {
          "id": "krea2-a1dcfee456d5a6587abea25e",
          "alias": "单女灰外套车厢忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits inside a bus or subway carriage, her expression calm and slightly contemplative. She wears a gray woolen jacket with a thick and warm texture, layered over a white striped shirt with a slightly open neckline revealing her neckline. The overall outfit is simple yet layered, creating a casual yet stylish atmosphere. The foreground shows the blurred interior structure of the carriage. This includes a dark metal armrest bar and seat edge, forming a natural framing composition that guides the gaze to focus on the subject. The middle is a half-length portrait of a woman, her body slightly tilted, head slightly raised, posture relaxed and natural, as if enjoying a moment of tranquility during travel. The background features a car window and a blurry city scene outside, through which faint architectural outlines and flowing light spots can be seen. Light from outside the window streams in from the right, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow, with a distinct red halo on the left. Possibly from headlights or reflections, the cool-toned image injects a touch of warmth. The overall lighting is mainly cool blue, creating a cool and tranquil atmosphere. Backlighting and side lighting are used to outline the figures, enhancing three-dimensionality and layering. The composition uses a three-part method, with the person positioned slightly to the right of the frame, leaving plenty of negative space to highlight loneliness and room for reflection. The overall image has a film-like texture, with low color saturation and slight graininess and noise, simulating professional camera shooting effects. At the same time, it retains details and light and shadow changes from real scenes, presenting a cinematic artistic atmosphere. The camera uses a medium-length portrait lens with a shallow depth of field and a naturally blurred background. The entire scene is full of emotional tension, conveying a common sense of detachment and inner monologue in urban life, as if seeking a moment of peace amid the noise. The visuals have no unnecessary decorations; all elements serve emotional expression, creating a quiet, gentle, and slightly melancholic poetic moment",
