        {
          "id": "krea2-b757b0a06a129eccf0963502",
          "alias": "单女绿T恤高塔困倦站立泼洒",
          "prompt": "A girl stands under the sunlight on a city rooftop, wearing a loose green T-shirt printed with white letters and patterns. Her right hand holds a yellow bubble liquid bottle, while her left hand gently supports the bubble wand. Her fingers are slender and long, radiating youthful energy. Around her float several soap bubbles of varying sizes and colors, the surface of the bubbles reflecting rainbow-like halos—some clearly visible, some slightly blurred—creating a dreamy and light atmosphere. The background is the city's buildings and towering skyscrapers. In the distance, the building is clearly outlined in the sunlight; nearby, a rusty metal spiral staircase is roughly built, bearing the marks of time. The railings and steps are covered in mottled rust, showing a brownish tone, contrasting with the girl's fresh image. The sky is pale blue, the clouds thin, the light bright and soft, sunlight pouring down from above, casting faint shadows on her shoulders and arms. The overall composition adopts a central composition, with the girl positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, her gaze looking directly at the viewer. The bubbles in the foreground and the girl in the middle create a sense of layering, while the buildings and stairs in the background provide spatial depth. The direction of light and shadow is natural daylight, with the light source coming from above, filling the entire scene with a warm afternoon atmosphere. The color tone is dominated by green, accented with yellow, blue, and brown. The color saturation is moderate, lively yet realistic. The image texture resembles film photography, with a slight graininess and soft edge transitions, as if captured with an old-fashioned film camera. On the left side of the canvas is a vertical line of Japanese text: \"けっこう、うまいですよ (laugh)\". The font is simple and harmonizes with the overall style, creating a relaxed and cheerful atmosphere, full of childlike fun and the spirit of life. It seems to capture an ordinary yet beautiful everyday moment, combining innocence with urban life background, giving a sense of authenticity and dreaminess. It feels as if time stands still at this moment, with bubbles drifting slowly, reflecting the simplest yet most precious joys in life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
