        {
          "id": "krea2-9a4bfd8e0b7d14ac4df8802f",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙门严肃拥抱",
          "prompt": "She wore a spaghetti strap dress with delicate floral patterns. The dress was based on gray-blue, accented with pink and white flowers. The material was light and breathable, hugging the figure and presenting an elegant and sexy silhouette. It draped smoothly behind her shoulders, looking directly at the camera, her expression slightly relaxed and confident, presenting a natural pink tone. Her body turned slightly to the side, her back slightly bent, and her hips gently pressed against the seat, forming a soft curve. One hand rested naturally on her thigh, while the other rested on the inside of the car door. The posture is relaxed yet expressive. The doors are open, revealing black interior trim and gray leather seats with stitched decorations. The seat surfaces feature diamond-patterned patterns, giving a premium feel. The inside of the doors is fitted with metal handles and speakers, with exquisite details. Outside the window is an outdoor green landscape, with lush grass and dense trees in the background. In the distance, you can faintly see some small purple flowers scattered throughout. The sky is pale blue, the clouds are thin, and the light is soft and warm—truly the golden time of evening. Sunlight streams in diagonally from the right front, creating contrasts of light and dark, soft shadows, and rich light and shadow layers. The overall composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned on the right side occupying the main visual space, leaving some blank space on the left to enhance the sense of balance. The camera angle is slightly tilted to simulate the realism of handheld shooting. The background is moderately blurred, highlighting the subject and creating a private, tranquil, and lively atmosphere. The color tones are mainly warm yellow, gray-blue, and green, with harmonious color coordination. The overall style combines everyday feel with artistry. It feels as if a high-definition photo was taken with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens, providing strong visual guidance. Meanwhile, the greenery and light in the background enhance the depth and realism of the image. The image presents a relaxed, joyful, and free living state, as if capturing an ordinary yet touching moment, full of youthful energy and fashionable energy. The entire scene appears especially vivid under natural light, with rich details and clear textures. From fabric folds to leather sheen to leaf veins, everything is clearly distinguishable. It creates a visual experience that is both realistic and slightly idealistic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
