        {
          "id": "krea2-ccc03bb521a28c8ec663c813",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫摄影棚微笑站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands against a pure white background, dressed in a refined collegiate outfit. Her overall look is full of vintage and artistic vibes. She wears a brown corduroy beret with a slightly slanted brim and slightly pleated body, adding a touch of casualness and authenticity. She pairs her with fine-framed round glasses, which reflect soft light, as if whispering or smiling, presenting a gentle yet slightly playful expression. She wears an off-white long-sleeved shirt with a neatly raised neckline and black letter patterns on the chest. She wears a dark brown striped tie adorned with a cute white teddy bear. The tie is loosely knotted and natural, presenting casual yet refined details. She wears a beige shearling knit cardigan with black piping trim on the cuffs and hem. The material is fluffy and soft, with clearly visible texture, creating a warm and comfortable feel. Underneath, she wears a light khaki jacket draped crossbody over her right shoulder, with the collar open, revealing part of the shirt and tie. Her left arm hangs naturally, her right hand clenched into a fist and her left hand opens naturally. Her posture is relaxed and relaxed, with a thin leather belt tied around her waist that ties the plaid pleated skirt perfectly. The dress features a plaid pattern of dark gray and brown, with evenly delicate pleats. The hem sways gently with her body, creating a dynamic layering effect. She wears a pair of brown platform loafers with smooth uppers and metal buckles. The heel height is moderate, giving a stable and elegant look. She wears high-calf plaid long socks in brown and beige tones, featuring classic British plaid patterns. The cuff is finished with pure brown ribbed trim. The colors echo the shoes and hat, creating a harmonious overall color scheme and a strong retro collegiate atmosphere. A brown leather shoulder bag is slung across the shoulder, with a natural sheen and slight wear on the body. The strap is thick, thick, and sturdy, with metal fasteners at the joints, presenting a design that is both practical and aesthetically pleasing. The composition is centered and symmetrical, with the figure occupying the main subject, fully presented from head to feet. The background is pure and flawless white, with no distractions that highlight the details of the figure and costume. Light comes from the upper front, creating a soft studio setup that evenly illuminates the entire subject. The shadows are soft and positioned at the feet, creating a natural projection. The transitions between light and shadow are delicate, with minimal contrast between light and shadow, creating a clean and bright visual effect. The overall atmosphere is warm, artistic, and nostalgic, reminiscent of a daily photo shoot on a campus or café on an autumn afternoon. It has a strong sense of fashion and a sense of life. The image quality is close to professional studio shooting, while preserving the naturalness and realism of everyday shooting, with rich details and clear layering. The colors are harmonious, presenting an aesthetic style that is both refined and understated",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
