        {
          "id": "krea2-dd99dc956cb4b5d7e138ae5f",
          "alias": "单女和服户外困倦注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a traditional kimono or Japanese yukata with an orange base featuring white floral patterns. The fabric is soft, with delicate embroidery visible in the details. In the foreground, faint withered reeds or tall grass appear, with slender grass stems crisscrossing to form a natural blurred frame. Some grass leaves are outlined by the backlight, outlining golden edges, creating a hazy light and shadow effect. The background is a soft dusk sky, presenting a gradient from warm yellow to pale blue. Thin clouds float in the sky, tinted a warm orange-yellow by the sunset. In the distance, a wide field or lakeshore can be faintly seen, but it is completely integrated into bokeh. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure positioned in the lower right of the frame, the head occupying the visual center, and the blank upper left corner providing breathing space for the sky and light. The overall composition is rich in layering and depth, extending to the background sky to form a smooth S-shaped movement line. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is mainly backlit, with strong warm yellow sunlight shining from behind the figure. A soft halo forms along the edges of her contour, with soft shadows creating a dreamy soft focus effect. The image is dotted with circular bokeh spots of varying sizes, formed by sunlight reflected by plants in the foreground, adding a romantic atmosphere and artistic beauty to the image. The colors are mainly warm orange, yellow, and gold, accented with white patterns on the kimono. The subtle contrast of warm and cool tones creates a harmonious and unified overall tone, giving the image texture reminiscent of professional cameras paired with large-aperture lenses. It offers extremely high clarity and delicate depth control, while retaining the graininess and slight color shifts characteristic of film photography. It feels like an outdoor portrait shot with a Canon 5D Mark IV or Sony A7R series camera paired with an 85mm f/1.2 prime lens. The lens halo and bokeh are natural and realistic, presenting a tranquil, poetic, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere, reminiscent of the dusk scenes commonly seen in Japanese animations by Makoto Shinkai, or the moment in Miyazaki's paintings where he gazes into the distance in the wind. The entire scene exudes a healing gentle energy, allowing one to feel the slow flow of time and inner peace",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
