        {
          "id": "krea2-14a7be687d34c227e2a6dfcd",
          "alias": "单女桌边站立侧头",
          "prompt": "As if whispering softly or immersing in some thought, a soft transition of light and shadow with a natural sheen. The cuffs of white clothing are revealed at her wrist, adorned with a blurred orange pattern. Her hands are folded on a woven tabletop, sunlight streaming through blinds or lattice structures, forming regular strips of light on the table and the back of her hand. The interplay of light and shadow creates a strong contrast of light and shadow and a sense of depth. The background is a dark-toned indoor environment, blurred and hazy, presenting a warm brownish-yellow tone that sharply contrasts with the bright parts in the foreground. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the right side of the frame, the head slightly tilted, and the gaze facing to the lower left. The visual guide line is formed by the direction of the light and the posture of the characters, creating an overall atmosphere that is warm, tranquil, and poetic. The lighting effects stand out, emphasizing the passage of time and the serene beauty of moments. The image has the texture of film photography, with moderate color saturation. It features a slight graininess and warm-toned filter to simulate the realism of amateur camera shooting. The lens is a large-aperture prime lens, with a shallow depth of field that keeps the subject clear and the background blurred. The overall style leans toward Japanese photoshoots or lifestyle aesthetic photography, conveying a restrained and gentle emotional state, as if capturing a private and authentic everyday moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
