        {
          "id": "krea2-d825704e0dadb08ae8ab5af0",
          "alias": "单女窗边冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a simple white long-sleeved top made of lightweight, breathable material, with sleeves that fit the arm lines. The garment has a faint black letter print, faintly visible with the word \"TAN.\" The overall look is clean and crisp, full of youthful energy. The pure black background highlights the subject, with light coming from the right front, creating a strong side lighting effect. It creates a clear contrast between light and dark, with deep and layered shadows, and delicate and soft highlights creating a dramatic visual impact. The composition uses close-ups, with the subject occupying most of the image. The head is slightly tilted, and the gaze looks upward to the left to create dynamic visual guidance. There is slight lens distortion and noise at the edges, simulating real camera effects, with slight graininess and color shifts to enhance realism and atmosphere. The overall color tone is mainly warm red and white. Paired with a deep black background, a strong contrast of warm and cool is formed, highlighting the vivid vitality of the subjects. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, and the details are richly detailed, all carefully crafted, presenting a style of everyday candid photography that is both artistic and full of life. It feels as if she is standing by the car window on a clear afternoon, sunlight streaming through the glass and capturing a fleeting moment of nature. The entire scene is full of youthful energy and gentle charm, while preserving the authentic texture and emotional warmth of photography",
