          "id": "krea2-e26e54db6a3325ace41f4649",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫广场冷淡坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a modern-style blue plastic chair, wearing a light blue short-sleeved polo shirt with three dark buttons at the collar. She pairs it with dark blue slim-fit cropped pants, and blue square-toe open-toe sandals in the same color scheme as her top. The overall look is simple yet stylish, presenting a casual urban vibe. Her left leg is crossed over her right, and her ankle slightly turned outward, showing off her long leg lines. The chair is constructed with a metal frame, silver metal rods standing straight and straight. The blue plastic seat and backrest are smooth and flat, with rounded edges. The overall design is simple and practical. The background is a pure white studio environment with no decoration, and the lighting is evenly and bright. Projected from the front slightly above, it creates a soft transition of shadows. The layers of light and shadow are rich but not abrupt, creating a clean and crisp visual effect. This creates a strong visual guide. The foreground shows the lower body and parts of the chair, the middle view shows the upper body and the full sitting posture, and the background features a spacious white wall. The sense of space is distinct, with blue and white as the main color tones and cool tones dominating, creating a fresh, calm, and professional atmosphere. The overall image has the texture of commercial advertisements or fashion portraits, while retaining the realism of everyday life, as if a high-quality portrait work was completed with a professional camera in the studio. The details are meticulously handled, with natural transitions between light and shadow. Without overexposure or dead black shadows, it presents a balanced and harmonious visual experience. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and confident, conveying a calm and unhurried modern feminine charm. The images possess high aesthetic value and artistic expressiveness, while maintaining a sense of everyday intimacy, as if capturing a carefully prepared yet naturally expressive moment, allowing people to feel a beauty where designed, casual and genuine elegance coexist",
