        {
          "id": "krea2-8ea88320a64a2a06e0a99721",
          "alias": "单女金衬衫办公室沉思坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at her desk, as if pondering or listening to something. She wears a pair of fine-framed, transparent glasses with simple and elegant lines, reflecting the blurred reflections of the surroundings and adding a touch of intellectual charm. She wears a loose pale yellow shirt with a light green crew-neck T-shirt underneath. The fabric is thin and breathable, with natural pleats, presenting a casual yet neat everyday style. Her body is slightly turned, shoulders relaxed, and her posture is natural and comfortable. Her right hand seems to be resting on the keyboard or just raised. Her left hand is hidden beneath the desk, making the overall movement smooth and realistic, full of a sense of life. In the foreground, some computer monitors and keyboard edges are closed, with a narrow and modern edge. The keyboard is dark gray, with clearly visible keys. The desktop is light wood or gray-white, with a clean and tidy surface without unnecessary clutter. In the middle is her office chair, with a gray mesh backrest with a modern and minimalist structure. The armrest curves ergonomically, and the backrest has a slight reflective effect, showing the texture of the material. The background is a typical office environment, with two large screens hanging on the wall behind, displaying blurry text like \"SO SERIOUS?\" and \"SERIOUS?\", with bold sans-serif font in white or light gray, and a background gradient of deep blue or dark green, creating a sense of technology and a serious atmosphere. Below the screen is a neat row of filing cabinets or shelves, with multiple white or light-colored file folders displayed. The labels are blurred but neatly arranged, and on the right are several upright folders, mainly white and beige, with slightly worn edges, showing signs of long-term use. The entire space is illuminated by indirect ceiling lighting, presenting a cool white tone. The composition is uniform and soft, with no obvious shadows. Light and shadow direction comes from the upper left, while the right side is slightly darker to enhance the sense of depth. The overall composition uses a mid-shot portrait composition, with the subject centered slightly to the left, leaving space on the right to guide the gaze to the background screen, creating visual balance. At the same time, the foreground objects and background elements are used to build depth and layering. The middle and background gradually blur, highlighting the subject while preserving environmental information. The color scheme mainly uses cool tones such as blue, gray, and white, creating a warm and cool contrast that enhances harmony and creates a quiet and focused atmosphere. It carries the calmness and rationality of a modern urban workplace, while also revealing a touch of warmth and warmth. The overall visual effect resembles a professional studio shoot, but the details are authentic and natural, with the texture of everyday amateur equipment. It's like capturing a moment with a camera in a real work environment. The lens is an 85mm prime lens with an f/2.8 aperture, moderate depth of field, clear focus, slight background bokeh, delicate image, rich detail, good noise control, wide dynamic range, and high resolution with low compression image quality The style is realistic and natural, blending cinematic feel with a sense of everyday life, conveying a calm, wise, and peaceful image of a contemporary professional woman",
