          "prompt": "A woman stands by a metal railing outdoors, wearing a white vertical stripe shirt dress that reaches her knees, with a black belt tied around her waist, making her figure appear slender and elegant. She leans slightly to the side, holding an open copy of VOGUE magazine in her left hand. The cover is clearly visible, featuring photos of models in fashionable attire. She leans against the red metal railing, her body slightly leaning, her posture relaxed and natural. The background is a blurry green tree and dappled sunlight, with leaves gently swaying in the breeze. A soft light spot effect is formed, with sunlight streaming through the gaps in the leaves, casting warm shadows on her body and creating a peaceful and beautiful afternoon atmosphere. The entire composition uses shallow depth of field, with the main figure clearly and prominently, the background blur handled well, and the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, forming a visual focal point. The foreground features partial details of the metal railing, including a grid-like railing structure and red handrails, adding depth to the image. The middle ground features the female subject, whose clothing, movements, and expressions are all clearly visible. It presents a youthful and fashionable atmosphere, with dense forests and scattered sunlight in the background, presenting rich color variations and layers of light and shadow. The light comes from above, representing warm daylight within natural light, while creating soft shadows on the ground and railings. The overall color palette is mainly white, green, and brown, paired with warm golden halos, creating a fresh, natural, and slightly artistic visual experience. The image has a strong sense of everyday life and realism, as if captured with a regular camera or mobile phone. With a slight film texture and subtle noise, the photos are enhanced with a sense of warmth and everyday life. The details are rich, the clothing 