          "alias": "单女蓝和服害羞站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a light blue kimono with white floral patterns and a bright yellow wide belt tied around her waist. She stands before a cluster of blooming golden flowers, densely clustered on the branches, forming a brilliant sea of golden flowers. She stands slightly to the side, gently touching the flowers above her head with her right hand, her fingers slender. She wears a simple silver bracelet on her wrist, while her left hand hangs naturally, holding a small bouquet of golden flowers. She looks at the camera with a gentle yet slightly shy expression, her overall posture elegant and natural. The foreground features blurred golden flowers and green leaves, creating a soft bokeh effect; the middle ground features the female subject, clear and prominent; the background is dense green plants and more golden flowers, with distinct layers. The light is soft and bright, coming from natural daylight shining down from the upper right, while natural shadows are cast on the left side of the body and among the flowers. The transition between light and shadow is smooth, creating a fresh and A tranquil and vibrant atmosphere, with bright yellow and fresh blue as the main tones, creating a striking yet harmonious unity. Yellow represents the vitality and hope of spring, while blue symbolizes tranquility and purity. The overall composition presents a poetic beauty, as if frozen in a moment on a spring afternoon, full of Japanese aesthetics and romantic atmosphere. The image is delicate, with moderate color saturation and rich details, combining realistic texture with artistic treatment. It feels like a professional camera shooting, yet retains the natural feel of everyday photography The background blur is well handled, highlighting the main subject while creating a sense of depth and space. The entire scene resembles a carefully composed photographic work, combining storytelling with visual impact, allowing people to feel the beauty of spring and the innocence of youth",
