        {
          "id": "krea2-5b47f1fb91fdef3955351b98",
          "alias": "单女制服教室忧伤书写",
          "prompt": "Sunlight streams in from outside, creating a soft transition of light and shadow. As light passes through the glass, it produces slight refraction and reflection, giving the scene a hazy sense of layering. In the foreground is a blurred window frame structure, its metallic texture faintly visible in the light, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. In the middle is the girl's complete silhouette. She lowered her head slightly, resting her head on her arm, her posture naturally relaxed. The book was spread out on the desk, the edges of the pages slightly wrinkled. A red pencil lay horizontally on the page, and beside it was a black pencil case. The details were rich and realistic. In the background, another boy dressed in a similar school uniform sat in the back seat, head down, focused on writing. His figure was elongated and partially blurred by the light, creating a quiet learning atmosphere. The classroom environment looked old but full of life, with weathered walls and worn desks and chairs. Light streams in from outside the window, forming clear beams that illuminate the fine dust floating in the air. The composition adopts a slightly tilted perspective, overlaying multiple images through the reflection and transmission of glass, giving the image a strong visual layering and documentary feel. The main subject is located at the lower right of the frame, occupying the main visual focus. The gaze is guided from the foreground window frame to the middle ground, then extends to the background learning scene, forming a natural visual path. The light and shadow tones are warm yellow, creating a tranquil, The atmosphere is nostalgic and slightly melancholic, with a warm overall tone and low saturation, featuring the grainy texture and slight fading characteristic of film photography. It feels like an old photo settled by time. The image shows no obvious movement, yet it is filled with inner emotional tension, capturing a peaceful moment in ordinary daily life. It allows one to feel the lazy, tired, and authentic moments of campus life during youth. The image presents a texture similar to that shot with a 35mm film camera, with slight bokeh and out-of-focus blur The background is blurred naturally, the subject is clear, the color transitions are delicate, and the overall composition is full of storytelling, like a frame frozen in a movie, gently evoking memories of the past. The details are rich, and these elements together create a realistic and believable scene. The visual guidance flows naturally and smoothly, progressing step by step from the foreground window frame to the middle scene of sleep, then to the background of students and classrooms, creating an immersive viewing experience. The overall atmosphere is quiet, private, and full of emotion, as if you can hear the passage of time. This is a photographic work that blends everyday observation with artistic expression, capturing life casually with amateur equipment, while also featuring professional-level light and shadow control and compositional beauty, showcasing the most simple yet touching moments of campus life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
