        {
          "id": "krea2-2cd6f68b37e0fbca669614b8",
          "alias": "单女黑外套户外忧伤站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors among withered grass, her expression slightly melancholic and contemplative. She wears a thick black coat with a gray inner layer revealing a collar, a soft, fluffy gray plush scarf around her neck, and her hands folded in front of her, tightly gripping a bundle of withered plant branches. These branches are slender and have small granular inflorescences, some of which extend upward, forming natural lines. Her posture is slightly tilted, her body slightly tilted, head turned to the left side of the frame, and the overall composition centers on the figure. Occupying the center right of the composition, the foreground features clear withered branches extending from the lower left corner to the center, forming a visual guiding line. The middle ground is the main subject, with a blurred open area in the background. In the distance, calm water reflects the sky's light. Further away are the hazy outlines of hills and sparse trees. The sky appears gray-blue, with thick clouds and soft yet even light. The overall atmosphere is quiet, cold, and slightly lonely. The tones are mainly cool tones, interwoven with black, gray, light blue, and dry yellow, creating delicate light and shadow effects. There are no obvious shadows, but the contrast between light and dark highlights the contours and texture. The image has the graininess and slight noise of film photography, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera. The focal length is about 85mm, with a shallow depth of field, natural background blur, and gradually blurred surroundings. The composition uses the rule of thirds, with the figure positioned on the right one-third, leaving plenty of space in the line of sight to enhance narrative and imaginative space. Overall, it presents an artistic, tranquil, and slightly melancholic everyday aesthetic style. Like scenes in an independent film, authentic and story-rich, with rich details, clear layering, and harmonious colors, it possesses strong visual appeal and emotional resonance",
