        {
          "id": "krea2-13e7a83b0b5dc152e86474c1",
          "alias": "单女短裙窗边沉思站立注视",
          "prompt": "She stands by the window of the room, her body slightly turned to the camera, her right hand gently caressing the hem of her skirt, her left hand naturally raised, her posture elegant and full of movement. She wears a black short-sleeved dress paired with an off-white lace lace apron and bow tie. The skirt is puffy and layered, and a wide belt in the same color accentuates her slender waist. White over-the-knee stockings wrap her long legs, and she is paired with black Mary Jane high heels. The shoe upper is smooth and reflective, the heel is thick and steady, and the overall look is vintage yet modern. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the image, with a low-angle downward perspective to highlight the character's height and presence. The background is a simple and bright indoor space, with large white walls and gray metal-framed windows forming geometric lines. Soft natural light streams in from the right side, creating a contrast of light and shadow on the wall and the figure, creating a warm and fresh atmosphere. The foreground is the main subject, clear and sharp. The middle ground features window frames and some walls, slightly blurred, while the background is a blurred outdoor scene, with faint outlines of green plants to enhance spatial depth. The visual guide naturally extends from the figures' postures and gaze directions outside the window, forming a flowing visual path. The light and shadow effects are delicate and soft, with the main light source coming from the upper right, creating a natural shadow transition with gentle and sweet expressions. The overall color scheme is mainly black, white, and gray, accented with off-white and light brown, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme with a realistic and delicate texture. It feels as if a professional camera is shooting under natural light, offering the realism and lively atmosphere of everyday amateur equipment. The details are rich, the layers are distinct, the composition is balanced, and the atmosphere is warm and tranquil, showcasing an aesthetic style that combines youthful vitality with sweet temperament",
