        {
          "id": "krea2-602c37f98e674eb74a71084e",
          "alias": "单女蓝制服厂房冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits inside a metal shopping cart, wearing a dark blue sailor uniform with white stripes on the collar and cuffs, paired with pure white stockings. Her expression is gentle yet tinged with shyness. Her hands are gently folded in a heart-shaped gesture over her chest, her fingers slender and long, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with light nail polish. Her overall posture is elegant yet slightly restrained. The metal mesh structure of the shopping cart is clearly visible, extending diagonally to the lower left corner of the frame, forming a strong visual guiding line. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, with the body slightly leaning forward. The head is slightly tilted, creating an intimate and intimate atmosphere. The background features neatly stacked brown cardboard boxes, some of which bear blurred labels and barcodes. On the right side, there is a yellow plastic bag, hinting at a warehouse or storage room. The floor is light gray cement with fine wear marks on the surface. In the distance, a faint metal shelf structure is visible, giving a strong sense of depth. The composition uses a low-angle upward angle to highlight the main subject, while the shopping cart's frame structure is used for frame-style composition, enhancing the sense of layering in the image. The overall tone is mainly cool, with blue and white contrasting and warm brown tones in the background balancing the light. The lighting atmosphere is tranquil and slightly nostalgic, as if capturing a moment in ordinary daily life. The image texture is delicate and realistic, with rich details. It features a high-resolution photography style, presenting sharpness and color reproduction similar to professional cameras, while retaining slight film graininess and natural noise. This makes the composition more realistic and artistic. The overall atmosphere is quiet, restrained, and full of storytelling, evoking youth, waiting, loneliness, or some unfinished emotional state. The image shows no obvious artificial traces; all elements naturally blend to form a complete and harmonious visual narrative. The composition is compact but not crowded, with just the right amount of blank space. The shopping cart frame in the foreground forms a clear spatial relationship with the figures in the middle frame, while stacked cardboard boxes in the background add realism and a sense of everyday life to the scene. The entire scene resembles a still frame in a movie, full of emotional tension and imaginative space",
          "description": "",
