        {
          "id": "krea2-3198506b3f40ce7bbc08b894",
          "alias": "单女棕毛衣卧室站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of the bedroom mirror for a selfie. She wears a loose brown chunky knit sweater with clearly visible texture, presenting a warm texture and soft sheen. The sleeves are wide and voluminous, naturally draping down the arms. The neckline features a classic crew neck design, giving the overall cut a comfortable and casual look. She pairs it with a black high-waisted pleated mini skirt whose hem radiates outward, with clear layers and smooth lines, showcasing an elegant silhouette. She wears dark stockings, her legs are long, and she is paired with pure white mid-calf socks. Her sock cuffs neatly wrap around her calves, forming a sharp contrast with the black dress. She wears fine-framed glasses, transparent lenses reflecting indoor light. She looks directly at the camera, holding a blue phone in her right hand. Three cameras on the back are arranged in a triangle. Her fingers gently grip the edges of the phone, her nails painted red, looking delicate and distinctive. She leans slightly toward the mirror, her left hand gently tucked into her sweater pocket, her posture natural and relaxed. It feels like a moment casually captured in daily life. The background is a cozy bedroom environment. On the left is a beige sofa bed, covered with white quilts with floral patterns. The patterns are delicate and the colors soft. Next to it is a deep pink curtain, thick and naturally pleated, letting in soft natural light. Light streams through the window, forming a uniform diffused light that illuminates the entire space. The floor is a light-colored wooden floor with clear wood grain and natural texture. On the right is a beige wall with a fine grainy texture. It presents a rough yet warm visual effect. Between the walls and floor, there is a white baseboard, with clean lines. The composition uses a vertically symmetrical layout. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, occupying the main visual position. The mirror edges are framed in black, creating contrast with the surrounding environment and enhancing the sense of depth. The foreground is the main subject, clear and prominent. The background features a distant bed and curtains, slightly blurred, creating a sense of layering and a soft and realistic light and shadow atmosphere Natural light streams in from the left side of the window, creating a soft transition of light and shadow on the subject. The shadows are slight, with no strong contrast. The overall color scheme is mainly warm tones, blending brown, beige, black, and white to create a peaceful, comfortable, and everyday home atmosphere. The image has a strong sense of realism and life, as if casually taken with a regular phone, without any retouching, preserving the most original beauty. The composition is stable, and the perspective is level enough to emphasize the privacy and authenticity of selfies. The overall image presents a quiet, gentle, and slightly artistic fragment of everyday life, full of warmth and storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
