        {
          "id": "krea2-fe75fc4399008c7d1ea15022",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙博物馆困倦站立展示",
          "prompt": "A female model wearing an elegant white deep V-neck high-slit long dress stands beside a futuristic silver-gray concept car. Her left hand rests lightly on the hood of the car, while her right hand hangs naturally and slightly bent at her waist. Her posture is dignified yet sexy, showcasing the aura and presence of a professional model. Her skirt hem naturally drapes along her body lines, with a high slit that reveals her long, beautiful legs. She wears a pair of simple black stiletto heels, creating a clean yet sophisticated look. The backdrop is a modern car showroom, with a smooth and reflective floor. The display presents a light gray tone, with soft gradient light strips extending from left to right at the back, transitioning from pink to green and then blue, creating a dreamy technological atmosphere. Multiple sets of circular spotlights are installed on the ceiling of the exhibition hall, evenly illuminating the entire space. In the distance, faint glimpses of other booths and blurred figures can be seen, but the focus is entirely on the foreground figures and vehicles. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait method, with the figures positioned slightly to the left of the center and the car occupying most of the space on the right, creating visual balance. The camera uses a head-to-head angle with a slight upward view, highlighting the character's height and presence, while showcasing the car's streamlined body design. The front details are clearly visible, the headlights are slender and sharp with LED shapes, the grille is closed, the wheels are multi-spoke sporty, and the tires are wide and have low aspect ratio, giving the whole body a sense of speed and power. The light and shadow treatment is delicate, with the main light sources coming from the front and above, providing natural shadows. The paint surface reflects ambient light, presenting a metallic texture and sheen. The background lighting creates colorful reflections on the ground and body, enhancing the sense of layering in the image. The overall color scheme is mainly cool tones, with white, silver-gray, and blue-green intertwined, creating a clean, modern, and high-end visual experience. The image has a strong commercial advertising vibe, as if it came from a professional studio or auto show, capturing the perfect fusion of fashion and technology. It boasts high artistic expression and visual impact, like a carefully planned fashion shoot that showcases women's elegant charm. It also highlights the advanced design and futuristic feel of the car, with the entire scene filled with a calm, rational, and highly attractive atmosphere, allowing people to feel the harmonious unity of modern industrial aesthetics and human aesthetics",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
