        {
          "id": "krea2-b4d738a93ee07f071fc51b3f",
          "alias": "单女制服车厢困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a dark school uniform jacket with a white shirt and a striped tie underneath is standing inside a subway carriage, holding a silver-gray vintage digital camera. The lens is slightly tilted toward herself, and sunlight streams in through the window, creating a warm backlight. The light penetrates the dust in the air, creating a hazy and dreamy texture. The camera in her hand is a classic 1990s-style portable digital camera, with a metallic sheen on the body, clearly visible buttons and interface details, and a slightly protruding lens section. The camera also connects to a small accessory below. The background is a blurred subway carriage interior, where you can see light green seat backs, metal armrests, and yellow warning signs on the doors. Outside the window, you can vaguely see the tracks and the faint platform scene. The entire frame uses a high-angle overhead view, with the figure occupying the left center position. The composition creates an asymmetrical sense of balance, drawing the viewer's gaze toward the main subject. The foreground features clear and sharp figures and cameras, while the middle frame shows the interior elements gradually blurring. The background is fully integrated into bokeh, with warm yellow as the main lighting tone. Strong side backlighting creates dramatic contrasts between light and dark. Highlights are bright but not overexposed, shadows retain rich details, and the overall tone leans toward a film-like feel, with slight graininess and color shifts, simulating the texture of vintage camera shooting. The images present a nostalgic yet youthful everyday moment, as if recording an afternoon after school while riding the subway home. The cinematic language has a cinematic feel while retaining the authentic texture of amateur photography capturing real emotions and dynamic moments in life; the images show no signs of deliberate staging, instead naturally expressing a relaxed state, conveying a quiet and gentle memory of youth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
