        {
          "id": "krea2-1fbebee669f1ecb11fdc323b",
          "alias": "单女粉毛衣雪地坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A girl sits by the window at a wooden dining table, wearing a pink knit sweater and a light-colored long skirt. The sweater's texture is clearly visible, with natural curled details on the cuffs and hem. She gently holds a white plush rabbit plush in both hands. Her left hand rests on the table, fingers long and nails neatly trimmed, while her right hand gently supports the rabbit's body, moving gently. On the table sat another white little rabbit plushie, echoing the one in her arms. In the background was a large vintage-style green window-framed window with an arched design and transparent glass. Outside the window was a winter snowy scene. The distant hillside was covered in white snow, and at the foot of the hill were several houses with snow-covered roofs arranged in an orderly manner. The roof colors were dark and contrasted with the white snow. Sunlight slanted in from the right, shining through the window onto the girl and the table, creating bright spots and soft shadows, warm and glowing. It presents a golden hue, casting long shadows on the floor and tabletop. The window frame edges show slight wear marks that hint at a sense of age. The table is made of natural wood with clear wood grain, and the legs are carved with simple patterns. Next to it is a matching wooden chair with smooth curves on the backrest. The overall composition features a figure positioned slightly to the left center. The girl is on the left side of the painting, occupying the main visual space. The right side is the window and part of the tabletop, creating a left-right balance. In the foreground is the girl and the rabbit in her hand, and in the middle is the tabletop. The chair and some window frames feature snowy scenery and distant mountains in the background, with distinct layers. Returning to the rabbit in her arms, an emotional loop is formed. The light and shadow atmosphere is tranquil and warm, full of nostalgia and poetry. The overall color palette is mainly pink, off-white, brown, and green, with soft colors and moderate saturation, with a slight film texture, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera. The edges of the frame are slightly darkened, enhancing the retro atmosphere. The background is slightly blurred to highlight the main subject, and the environmental details are rich but not cluttered, such as the old radio on the desk covered with lace fabric On top are photo frames and books, with a radio knob clearly visible, and black-and-white photos inside the frame. These elements add a sense of life and storytelling, conveying a sense of tranquility, gentleness, and a touch of loneliness in everyday life. It feels like a frozen childhood memory, with strong narrative and emotional appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
