        {
          "id": "krea2-46f8a879e63c1a79c4afe9c8",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套户外困倦站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A female high school student stands outdoors in the sunlight, wearing a dark blue school jacket and a white shirt, with a black bow tie at her collar and round metallic glasses. She holds a smartphone mounted on a handheld stabilizer in her right hand, the phone's lens facing her, while her left hand holds an open book pressed above her head. The pages are written in Korean with the words \"고등학교\" (decorative character등학교). The composition uses a low-angle downward view, with the figure positioned slightly below the center of the frame, the head slightly tilted back, forming a strong visual guiding line. The background is a vast, bright pale blue sky with no clouds, presenting the unique purity of a clear summer sky. Above is a large area of pink handwritten Korean characters \"��머フィルムを ride고!\" And the English \"It's a Summer Film!\" The title forms a poster-style style, with bold and powerful fonts and slightly irregular strokes along the edges. The overall color scheme contrasts cool blue with warm pink, creating a youthful, rebellious, and energetic atmosphere. The light comes from directly above to the right, with strong yet soft sunlight creating natural shadow transitions. The stabilizer and phone details are clearly visible, including the camera module, buttons, and connectors. The book paper feels authentic, the handwriting is clear, and the composition has a strong visual impact. The foreground highlights people and equipment, while the middle ground shows their posture and expressions. The background is simple and clean, enhancing the subject's presence. The overall style blends the drama of youth movie posters with the realism of everyday photography, as if captured in a moment captured with an old film camera or amateur DV, with slight graininess and color saturation shifts. It simulates the retro texture of film development, with rich light and shadow layers and moderate contrast, creating a summer memory atmosphere that is both real and dreamy. On the right side of the frame is a short Korean text message and the date \"2022.07.20,\" with a bottom design resembling a film border. Overall, it presents a unique aesthetic that lies between artistic creation and life documentation, full of a longing for youth, freedom, and expression. It seems to capture a moment where images confront the world, with bold composition, vivid colors, and rich emotions, possessing strong narrative and a sense of the times",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
