        {
          "id": "krea2-cd07eb0b8fd5a51f6135344a",
          "alias": "单女毛衣沙发沉思坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a fluffy, soft white plush armchair, wearing a thick knit cardigan in red and white with wide stripes. The red and white interplay create a striking visual contrast, with the knit texture clearly visible, presenting a warm and textured handwoven feel. The cardigan is loosely draped over the shoulders, revealing a black camisole underneath. The lower half is paired with black shorts and black stockings. Her legs are naturally crossed, her posture elegant and relaxed, with a hint of laziness and contemplation. The overall look blends everyday casual with a sense of fashion The background is a pure light beige wall, simple and free of any distractions, creating a minimalist yet cozy spatial atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure occupying the center-left position, body slightly turned to form a natural S-shaped curve, highlighting clothing details and body lines. The lighting is soft and even, with natural light or softbox lighting from the front left, making the character's outline clear and shadow transitions delicate without strong contrast. The overall light and shadow layers are rich but not abrupt, with red, white, and black as the main color tones. Harmoniously blending with the warm beige tones of the background, the image has a strong visual focus and a sense of everyday life. It feels like a portrait of a person filled with warmth and realism taken with a professional camera on a quiet afternoon. The style lies between fashion photography and everyday portraits, combining artistic beauty with approachability. The details are exquisitely handled, from knit textures to the reflections of stockings, all clearly visible. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, comfortable, gentle, and modern, as if you can feel a subtle warmth and tranquility permeating the air. Like a carefully crafted indoor portrait piece, it combines the professional posture of a model with the casualness and authenticity of everyday life",
