        {
          "id": "krea2-00909c3b6f8d13e81204ae63",
          "alias": "单女制服冷淡举手",
          "prompt": "The neckline is clean and sharp, giving the overall look a simple yet modern feel. The background is a plain light gray wall with subtle textures, and the overall color scheme is uniform without any cluttered elements. Light streams diagonally from the upper right of the image, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow, presenting a soft golden halo, creating deep shadow layers and irregular geometric shapes, enhancing visual tension. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, details rich, and the overall atmosphere is quiet, restrained, and emotionally charged, as if capturing a private and quiet moment. It features the unique grainy texture and low-saturation color tendency of film photography, with tones blending cool gray and warm yellow, creating a nostalgic yet modern aesthetic. The edges of the frame are slightly out of focus, the central subject is clear and sharp, highlighting the subject's expression and posture. The composition is balanced without being rigid, using light and shadow to divide space and enhance depth. Visual guidance starts from the light source in the upper right, forming a natural visual flow. Overall, it presents a daily feel reminiscent of amateur camera shooting, with slight noise and color shifts. Simulating real-life snapshots, it emphasizes genuine emotions rather than deliberate posing. The images are rich in detail, with delicate light and shadow transitions and a strong atmosphere, like on a quiet afternoon when she casually raises her hand to shield her. That moment of tranquility and beauty is captured, and the entire scene is full of storytelling, like an artistic portrait and a true record of life moments, combining beauty and authenticity, conveying feelings of youth, loneliness, and self-reflection. The color tone is restrained yet layered. The interplay of light and shadow reveals the complexity and gentleness of the inner world",
          "description": "",
