        {
          "id": "krea2-ba7924e828419ba20228fab5",
          "alias": "单女米高领衫家中媚态躺侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman is reclining on a light gray fabric sofa, slightly tilting her head, her expression revealing an unintentional sensuality and calmness. She wears a beige turtleneck knit sweater with clear patterns, slightly cinched cuffs that outline her arms, and pairs her lower body with a black pencil skirt that fits the waistline, accentuating her figure. Her legs are crossed and crossed, wearing black stockings that are smooth and translucent, subtly revealing the leg contours. Her toes are slightly raised, her feet naturally relaxed, and her fingers are long. Nails are painted dark blue, hands naturally resting on knees, and the other hand gently resting on the sofa cushion, elegant and casual. The background is a simple light gray-white wall with subtle textures. The sofa is a modern L-shaped modular sofa made of fine cotton-linen fabric in a soft gray-blue color. The sofa cushion is thick and full, with neat edges presenting a comfortable texture. The foreground is a partial part of the sofa, occupying most of the lower part of the frame and forming a visual guide. The middle ground is the female subject. Located slightly to the right center of the frame, the composition uses a low-angle downward shot to make the figure stand out more, creating a sense of intimacy and visual tension. There is a moderate space between the background wall and the sofa to avoid crowding. The overall composition has clear layers, with gray-blue, beige, and black as the main colors, soft and unified. Light and shadow come from the front left, providing soft and even lighting without strong shadows. The surface of the stockings reflects a slight sheen, enhancing the texture and creating a quiet and intimate atmosphere. It carries a relaxed sense of everyday life and an artistic fashion vibe, as if a photo shoot was taken with a professional camera in an ordinary home setting. It has strong visual appeal and emotional impact, with rich details—from the knit texture of sweaters to the transparency of stockings. The composition is balanced, the subject's posture is relaxed, and expressions are natural, presenting an overall beauty that is both authentic and exquisite, like a quiet moment in an art film, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
