        {
          "id": "krea2-2ec29537ce0b058e6fe9c478",
          "alias": "单女女仆女仆装城市俏皮站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a refined maid outfit stands on a modern urban street, wearing a white lace headpiece and a blue bow. She wears a black-and-white maid uniform, with a black fitted top featuring white ruffles on the chest, a striking blue bow at the collar, short off-shoulder sleeves, and a white pleated skirt with blue-black stripes on the bottom. The skirt is slightly lifted to reveal white stockings and black high heels, and her hands are white gloves. She elegantly lifts the skirt, presenting a playful yet slightly sexy look The overall design perfectly recreates the classic image of the anime character. In the foreground, the figure occupies the left central position of the frame, with a slight tilt of the body to create a natural sense of dynamism. The background is a modern urban architectural complex, with towering glass curtain walls reflecting the light from the sky, presenting a cold sense of technology. In front of the buildings is a neat green belt and neatly trimmed bushes. Several cars are parked by the roadside, including a yellow taxi and a green sedan. In the distance, several pedestrians are walking vaguely, one of whom carries a backpack. Another person holds an object, creating a realistic urban atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot to enhance the visual impact and presence of the characters. At the same time, road markings are used as guiding lines, extending from the bottom of the frame to the characters' feet, creating a strong perspective effect that naturally draws the viewer's gaze toward the subject. The overall tone of the painting is mainly cool, with the reflection from the glass curtain wall bringing silver-gray tones, harmoniously contrasting with the black-and-white clothing of the characters. The sky shows the characteristic gray-white of cloudy days, with soft and even lighting. Without strong shadows, the entire scene appears peaceful and realistic. The light and shadow treatment is delicate, with clothing folds and textures rendered very realistically. The buildings and vehicles in the background show a moderate transition of light and shadow under diffused light, enhancing spatial layering. The atmosphere blends the fantasy colors of anime culture with the everyday feel of real cities. It combines the fun of cosplay with the realism of street photography, as if taken with a professional camera for high-quality photos, but retains slight film graininess and natural noise. This makes the images more artistic and lifelike, with the overall picture full of vitality, fashion, and youthful charm, presenting a unique aesthetic style that lies between virtual and real",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
