        {
          "id": "krea2-da969b5efbe3d5f78441f832",
          "alias": "单女上衣公寓忧伤倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "From a high-angle overhead shot, a woman is looking up at the camera, adding a touch of laziness and casualness. She wears a loose yellow top with tiny floral patterns. The fabric is soft and wrinkled, presenting a comfortable everyday home. The background is blurred, presenting a blurred indoor environment. Faintly visible dark green and warm brown fabric sofas or bedding are present, with warm and low-saturation tones. This creates a private and tranquil spatial atmosphere. The foreground is a close-up of the character's head and shoulders, occupying the main position; the middle ground features her body and clothing details; the background fully blends into bokeh, creating a strong sense of layering between front and back. The composition adopts an inclined angle, breaking the conventional flat composition, making the scene more dynamic and visually impactful. The figure shifts slightly from the center, with the gaze directed to the upper left, creating room for imagination and imagination. Light comes from the front side, creating a delicate transition of light and shadow. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere leans toward cool tones, yet warm light penetrates through, like natural light filtering through curtains at dusk, creating a quiet, contemplative yet slightly melancholic mood. The tones are mainly blue-green and yellow-brown, with subtle contrasts of warm and cool tones. The texture of the image resembles film photography, with slight graininess and color fading, resembling an old photo stained by time, while retaining the clear details of modern digital photography. The overall style combines artistic flair with a sense of everyday life. For example, capturing a moment casually at home with an amateur camera—authentic and unpretentious, full of storytelling and emotional warmth, emphasizing beauty in its natural state—no need for embellishment, no pursuit of perfection, but rather more moving. The images present a gentle, restrained, tranquil, and poetic everyday aesthetic",
