        {
          "id": "krea2-2c83271f816e2f03245b4ae9",
          "alias": "单女蓝制服教室冷淡坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a classroom or library seat, dressed in a deep blue V-neck short-sleeved uniform, neatly combed back. In the foreground is an open book, its pages yellowed and densely printed with text, some of which are illuminated by sunlight, displaying a warm beige tone. The edges of the books are slightly curled, showing signs of use. The background is blurred, and the blurred silhouettes of other students can be faintly seen. Some are wearing white shirts, some carrying backpacks, and some are looking down to read. The environment presents a typical campus learning scene, but the focus is entirely on the main subject. The composition uses close-ups, with the characters occupying most of the space, with the head positioned slightly to the upper left, creating an asymmetrical visual balance. The shallow depth of field highlights the subject, and the background layers are distinct. The middle frame features desks, chairs, and some students behind the figures, with details gradually blurring. The background is the classroom walls and windows farther away, with light slanting in from the right, creating a clear contrast of light and shadow. On the other side, deep shadows are left to enhance the sense of three-dimensionality and space. The lighting atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with the texture of sunset or afternoon sunlight. The color palette is mainly warm yellow, mixed with cool blue clothing tones, creating a contrast of cool and warm tones. The overall scene presents a tranquil, gentle, and story-rich atmosphere. It feels as if capturing an ordinary yet precious moment, combining the realism of daily life with the artistic beauty of cinematic lenses. The image texture is delicate, similar to high-resolution camera shooting, with slight film graininess and natural color transitions. The lens is a medium-focus prime lens with a large aperture and extremely shallow depth of field. The light source is natural light from the sides and rear, simulating a real shooting environment, emphasizing the flow of light and shadow and conveying the characters' emotions. The composition emphasizes blank space and breathing to avoid crowding. The painting carries strong narrative and emotional tension, evoking a quiet moment in youth, full of poetry and nostalgia",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
