        {
          "id": "krea2-ffba434be264d471232fc718",
          "alias": "单女衬衫沉思坐侧头",
          "prompt": "Her left hand rests naturally on the floor supporting her body, her posture elegant and relaxed. She wears a white high-collar, long-sleeved shirt with wide and voluminous sleeves, smooth and slightly glossy. The neckline is slightly open, revealing a dark striped tie underneath. The tie is a mix of dark green and burgundy, tied neatly. She pairs a deep green high-waisted long skirt with a wide hem and obvious pleats, draping strongly, and the skirt fabric is heavy. The overall look presents a retro collegiate aesthetic. She wears a pair of delicate tassel earrings, made of multiple layers of beads and metal decorations. As she moves, they add a touch of liveliness. She sits on yellow-spotted floor tiles, whose surface has a fine grainy texture. The background is a vertically arranged red brick wall, with the bricks gradient from deep red to reddish-brown. The joints are clearly visible, forming a strong vertical texture. Light softly streams in from the left side of the frame, creating a delicate transition between light and shadow. Creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere, the composition uses a medium shot perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, body slightly turned and head slightly tilted, the gaze directly interacting with the viewer, creating an intimate visual guide. The foreground is the ground and the lower body of the person, the middle ground is the full body and part of the wall, and the background is a complete red brick wall with clear layers. The colors are mainly warm tones, with white, deep green, red, and yellow echoing each other. The overall scene is full of the texture of everyday life, as if shot with a regular camera in natural light. Without excessive embellishment, it preserves the details and atmosphere of the real scene. The lens focal length is moderate, depth of field is well controlled, making the subject clear and prominent. The background is slightly blurry but still detailed. The entire image exudes a quiet, artistic, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere, like an afternoon sunlight shining on a campus corner, capturing a moment where youth and tenderness coexist. The characters' expressions are calm and slightly thoughtful, as if waiting for something or reminiscing about something. The surrounding environment is simple yet full of storytelling. The rough texture of the red brick walls contrasts with the smooth materials of the clothing, enhancing the visual tension of the scene. The overall color scheme is harmonious and unified, with natural light and shadow treatment, presenting a sense of both artistic and lifelike authenticity",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
