        {
          "id": "krea2-0da93300c67ee3def2a8877a",
          "alias": "单女绿毛衣街道忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at a street corner at dusk, wearing a dark green thick knit sweater with clearly visible textures, and a black backpack strap slung across her shoulder. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the composition, forming a visual focal point. The details are rich, with light and shadow projecting diagonally from the right, creating a sense of depth and layering. The middle scene is a blurry street environment, where a warm yellow streetlight emits a soft halo. In the background, there are red walls and some blurry outlines of plants, with colors contrasting cool blue and warm orange. This creates a visual effect where warm and cool blend well. The background blur is handled very naturally, and the bokeh presents circular light spots, enhancing the depth and dreamlike atmosphere of the image. The composition uses the classic three-part layout, with the characters occupying the main positions. The overall image has a strong cinematic feel and storytelling, as if capturing a quiet moment of emotional expression. Light comes from the sides and rear, creating a combination of backlight and side lighting, enhancing the characters' sense of depth and presence. The entire scene is enveloped in the low-saturation tones unique to dusk. The sky shows a faint blue-purple gradient, and the ground reflects a faint warm light, creating a quiet, contemplative, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The image texture is close to professional camera shooting, but retains slight film graininess and natural noise, as if taken by amateur equipment on a street at dusk. The tones are warm and restrained, the transitions between light and shadow are smooth, details are rich, and the atmosphere is rich in emotion and artistic expression. The overall image presents a realistic and poetic everyday beauty. It was as if I could hear the distant whispers of the city and the sound of the breeze rustling through the leaves",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
