        {
          "id": "krea2-c41a3e6c5f0c24a5d5c3144b",
          "alias": "单女制服教室冷淡跪注视",
          "prompt": "In a softly lit classroom, a woman dressed in a typical Korean school uniform wore a white long-sleeved shirt paired with a beige knit tank top and a plaid short skirt. She was kneeling sideways on an old wooden desk, legs bent, barefoot resting on the edge of the desk, her posture elegant yet slightly lazy, leaning back slightly, turning back to gaze at the camera as if she had just snapped out of a quiet thought. Her right hand gently stroked her thigh, her left hand naturally hanging down, fingers slightly bent, nails neatly trimmed, presenting a casual sense of everyday life. The overall posture feels both like waiting for the next class to begin or immersing herself in her own world on a quiet afternoon. In the foreground is the slightly worn wooden desk she sits, with fine scratches and mottled marks from the passage of time. The metal frame of the desk legs is rusted, contrasting with her slender legs. The background is a typical Korean high school classroom environment, with a row of wide windows on the left, with bright but not harsh natural light streaming in, creating a soft backlight effect that makes the figure's silhouette glow softly. The window frame is dark gray, with some dust and water stains on the glass, enhancing the sense of realism. On the right side is a podium in front of the blackboard, which is dark green with blurred Korean characters, including words like \"history.\" The chalk marks are clearly visible, with several open textbooks and a piece of chalk placed nearby. The locker door below the blackboard is half open, faintly revealing stacks of paper and stationery. The classroom walls are light gray, with slight stains and peeling. The ceiling is a standard white checkered ceiling. The embedded fluorescent tubes emit a cool white light, creating a subtle contrast with the warm yellow natural light outside the window. The composition uses a slightly low-angle head-up shot, with the subject positioned in the left two-thirds of the frame. Diagonal lines guide the view, extending from the foreground desk to the character's body, then turning toward the blackboard, creating a smooth visual flow. The figure's back and side profile form the main visual focal point, while the strong window light and indoor shadows create a strong contrast of light and shadow. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere leans toward tranquility, blending nostalgia and youthful vibes. Light streams in diagonally from the front left, creating slight reflections on the floor and tabletops to enhance the sense of depth. The entire scene is not over-embellished, preserving the outdated details and lifestyle of a real classroom. The tones are mainly off-white, gray-brown, and dark green, with low color saturation, presenting a grainy texture and slight fading effect reminiscent of film photography. It feels like a casual shot after school with an old digital camera or amateur equipment, filled with uncarefully crafted chances and everyday moments. It evokes those intimate moments about campus, growth, and youthful memories. The images capture not only external appearances but also emotional solidification—a sudden pause in a familiar environment. That hazy beauty between reality and fantasy inevitably reminds viewers of sitting in such classrooms themselves, gazing out the window, filled with nostalgia for the past and hopes for the future",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
