        {
          "id": "krea2-c09162c3853edb3c932b572c",
          "alias": "单女透视白短裙办公室坐书写",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a black mesh office chair in the office, leaning slightly forward, her right hand naturally resting at her thigh, her posture elegant and relaxed. She wears a light purple sleeveless high-neck pleated top and an off-white A-line mini skirt. The hem of the skirt is slightly lifted, revealing the edge of her light-colored undergarment. Her legs are crossed and slightly apart, wearing black sheer stockings and high-heeled sandals with transparent plastic heels, her toes clearly visible. The background is a simple white wall and a window with blinds, from which light streams in. Soft striped light and shadow are formed. On the left is a corner of a dark brown wooden office desk. The desk is smooth with neat edges, the floor is covered with a gray carpet, giving it a delicate texture. The overall composition uses low-angle shots to highlight the leg lines and elegant sitting posture. The foreground shows the desk and lower body, the middle is the full-body and chair, and the background is walls and windows. Visual guidance starts from the foreground desk and feet, forming a natural flow of sight, with a bright and soft lighting atmosphere. Natural light enters through the right window, with delicate transitions in the shadows, creating a sense of realism and privacy in everyday office scenes. The main color palettes are white, off-white, light purple, and black, with harmonious and unified color combinations, presenting an atmosphere that is both professional and slightly sexy. It feels like capturing a moment of life on an ordinary weekday afternoon, with strong realism and artistic expression. The images are rich in detail, the expressions are natural, the clothing materials are authentic, and the sheen and transparency of the stockings are well handled. The transparent material of the high heels reflects faint images of the surrounding environment. The metal brackets and mesh backrest structures of the chairs are clearly visible. The floor texture and the wood grain of the table are meticulously detailed. The entire scene seems to have been shot with a mid-range consumer camera in natural light, preserving slight noise and authentic color reproduction, giving a warm and authentic visual experience. The composition is compact but not crowded, with the figure occupying the center to the right, leaving enough space to showcase the environmental elements. At the same time, the tilted perspective enhances the dynamic and interesting quality of the images. The overall style leans toward realistic photography, combining fashion and everyday qualities, evoking the lifestyle of modern urban working women. It combines professional rigor with personal charm. The images are full of storytelling and immersion, as if you can hear keyboard typing in the office and faint conversations in the distance. The layering of light and shadow and subtle color changes together create a moment full of warmth and emotion.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
