        {
          "id": "krea2-61a2d3939615f02af1452882",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣咖啡厅忧伤坐持食物",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at a wooden table in a café, wearing a deep blue headband and a loose off-white coarse knit sweater that reveals one shoulder. She wears light blue ripped jeans, her knees slightly bent, her body slightly turned to the right side of the frame, her right hand holding a golden piece of toast into her mouth, as if pondering or savoring the taste of food. Her expression is naturally relaxed, with a hint of laziness and contemplation. Her left hand rests on her knee, her posture casual yet genuine. Overall, it presents a quiet moment of enjoying breakfast in everyday life. In the foreground is a blurred tabletop scattered with an open magazine or book in soft color. Next to it is a white ceramic cup and a small white egg-shaped container, possibly a sugar or salt jar. In the distance, a plate of food is partially blurred. The background is a gray cement-textured wall with a wooden shelf hanging on it, on which are several glass teapots, metal kettles, and small cactus pots. White flowerpots and other miscellaneous items. In the upper left corner is a blackboard with white chalk written \"SATURDAY ONLY CAFE CAC\" in handwritten style, somewhat casual. The overall lighting is soft and cool, presenting a low-saturation gray-green tone. The light source comes from the left side of the image, creating a natural side light effect. The shadow transitions are delicate, and the background objects outside focus create soft bokeh, creating a shallow depth of field visual effect. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. The head is slightly tilted, guiding the viewer to look to the right, creating a sense of visual flow. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, artistic, and slightly melancholic, like the quiet moment of afternoon sunlight streaming through a window. It carries the texture of Japanese lifestyle photography. The tones are restrained yet warm, details rich but not cluttered, and the images are full of storytelling, as if capturing an ordinary yet touching moment of daily life. The images have the graininess of film photography and slight vignetting, enhancing the retro and nostalgic mood. Overall, it presents an artistically inspired everyday street style photo, like natural moments taken with an amateur camera in a real environment. No need for deliberate posing, all elements coexist harmoniously, light and shadow interspers, color balance is distinct, layering is distinct, and the composition is full but not crowded. The visual focus is on the characters' movements and expressions. Although the background is blurry, it still retains enough information to support the realism of the scene. The entire image conveys an aesthetic of slow-paced life, allowing people to feel moments of peace and satisfaction",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
