        {
          "id": "krea2-3086f8662901b95f8bc9a0f2",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫城市愤怒倚靠吸烟",
          "prompt": "A woman leans sideways against the balcony railing, wearing a light blue loose shirt with slightly rolled-up cuffs. The fabric is delicate and slightly wrinkled, presenting a casual and comfortable everyday wear. She holds a cigarette in her mouth, the smoke swirling with a hint of laziness and contemplation, as if gazing into some unknown secret deep within the city. Her contours are soft, her overall posture relaxed yet elegant, her body leaning slightly forward, elbows resting on the rough concrete railing, fingers long and nails neatly trimmed. It presents a sense of realistic, everyday details. In the foreground is a wooden or concrete balcony railing, with a slightly aged surface showing fine scratches and weathering marks. The geometric lines of the railing are clear, forming visual guides that draw the gaze toward the main subject. The middle ground is a cluster of urban buildings, mainly modern high-rise residential buildings. The building facades are gray-white in tone, windows are neatly arranged, some buildings have balconies, and distant buildings appear slightly blurred due to distance, creating a sense of spatial layering. On the nearby right side, you can see wooden roof supports and some green plants, adding a sense of life. The background is a pale blue sky, with thin clouds, bright but not glaring. The overall tone is cool, with the grainy texture and slight overexposure characteristic of film photography. Light and shadow shine from the upper right, creating a soft backlit contour that enhances the sense of depth. The image uses low-saturation color treatment, presenting a retro film style. The warm yellow and blue-green tones intertwine to create a nostalgic, tranquil, and slightly detached atmosphere. The composition uses the rule of thirds: the figure is positioned on the right third of the frame, leaving a large space on the left to represent the cityscape, creating visual balance and a sense of breathability. The lens uses a mid-focal length prime lens to simulate a 35mm or 50mm field of view, featuring slight lens distortion and edge vignetting to enhance realism. The image contains film grain and slight chromatic aberration, simulating the effects of vintage cameras. The exposure is slightly higher to highlight the warmth under sunlight, creating an overall atmosphere reminiscent of a silent moment in an art film. It captures the loneliness and contemplation of individuals in urban life, full of poetry and narrative quality. It is suitable for expressing themes of youth, freedom, alienation, and self-exploration. The artwork is delicate in texture and full of emotion, combining the ordinary reality of daily life with profound artistic conception",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
