        {
          "id": "krea2-579ccfcd3c897e1f3e0aeaec",
          "alias": "单女白T恤家中倚靠出神",
          "prompt": "A woman leans against a pink wall, looking relaxed and relaxed. She wears a white spaghetti camisole with a simple yet elegant neckline, highlighting her graceful shoulder and neck lines and chest contours. Her right hand is raised, fingers gently resting on top of her head, elbows bent, arms gently curved, while her left hand naturally rests at one side of her body, her posture relaxed and expressive. Her head is slightly tilted to one side, as if lost in thought. On the upper left wall hangs a blue house number \"06\". The numbers are clearly visible. Below the doorplate is a pink wall with slight texture, and slight wear marks in the corners, giving a sense of everyday life. In the background, a corner of a wooden door frame can be faintly seen, with a lighter color contrasting with the pink wall. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure occupying most of the space, highlighting their central role. The angle of view is slightly tilted, giving the scene more movement and layering. Light softly shines from the left, creating a natural transition between light and dark, while the shadowed areas delicately outline the outlines. The lighting effects are realistic and warm, with an overall atmosphere that is cozy, tranquil, and slightly private. The tones are mainly pink and white, creating a soft and fresh visual experience. The image details are rich and the texture is authentic, as if shot with a professional camera, while preserving unintended moments from daily life, combining artistry with a sense of everyday life",
