        {
          "id": "krea2-980560f3deb397136bc8645d",
          "alias": "单女白短裤摄影棚微笑坐演奏",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in front of a pure white background, wearing a white short-sleeved top and white shorts. The top features a unique design, with a tie decoration at the collar and hollowed-out details, showcasing exquisite tailoring and a modern feel. The edges of the shorts are trimmed with fluffy white plush edges, giving the overall look a cute bunny costume. Looking directly at the camera, she reveals a subtle smile and sits cross-legged elegantly. The right hand gently rests on the thigh, fingers naturally bent, while the left hand rests at the side, slightly leaning the body to present a relaxed yet dignified posture. The composition centers on the figure, using medium shots that occupy most of the image, highlighting the subject's beauty and details. The background is a simple light gray wall with subtle textures, creating a clean and pure visual environment. The lighting is soft and even, with natural light from the left side of the front or softbox, with natural shadow transitions without strong contrast. The layers of light and shadow are rich but not abrupt, creating an overall atmosphere that is peaceful, pure, and full of feel. The color palette is mainly white, creating a harmonious and unified visual effect. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with professional photography equipment, offering high resolution and realism, while preserving the relaxed and natural atmosphere of daily life. For example, a private photo shoot done at home or in a minimalist studio features no unnecessary decorations or distractions, focusing on the person themselves, emphasizing the combination of appearance, clothing, and expression. It conveys a youthful vitality, gentle and cute yet slightly sexy temperament. The image style combines fashion and everyday life, suitable for model displays, role-playing, or personal artistic creation, presenting an aesthetic experience that is both professional and close to everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
