        {
          "id": "krea2-7a54147a48418585e357f7a9",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫公寓温柔坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bed covered with pure white sheets, wearing a simple white short-sleeved shirt and a black skirt, paired with smooth black stockings. On her feet are dark flat shoes, legs naturally crossed, one hand resting lightly on the knee, the other resting lightly on the edge of the bed, graceful and relaxed, naturally draped over her shoulders. The overall aura is fresh with a hint of maturity. In the background is a brown headboard decorated with diamond-patterned patterns, behind which is a white wall and a bright window. Soft natural light streams in outside the window, evenly spreading the light into the room, creating a peaceful and warm atmosphere. The composition centers on the figure, using a middle ground perspective, with the figure occupying the main part of the composition. The bedside and window in the background form a distinctly layered spatial structure. The foreground is a soft white bedsheet, the middle ground is the main subject, and the background is the bedside and window, gradually extending to the body and surroundings. The light and shadow effects are soft and delicate, with the light source coming from the window on the left, creating a natural transition between light and dark, with subtle and realistic shadows. The overall color scheme is mainly white and black, harmoniously and unified. The images present a realistic shooting feel from everyday life, as if shot with a regular camera or mobile phone. The details are rich and full of life's atmosphere. The image style leans toward realism and naturalness, while retaining a certain artistic aesthetic. The characters' expressions are natural, without excessive embellishment, giving a sense of warmth and authenticity. The entire scene is filled with a quiet, comfortable, and intimate atmosphere, as if on an ordinary afternoon with sunlight streaming through the curtains into the room. The woman sits quietly on the bed, enjoying a moment of tranquility and solitude. There are no unnecessary decorations in the composition; the simple layout highlights the character's presence. The composition is balanced and rhythmic, with smooth lines and subtle light and shadow changes, creating a tranquil and warm visual experience. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and comfortable, allowing one to feel the beauty of ordinary life",
