        {
          "id": "krea2-bc60c56cd263bc7e654b0c71",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫沉思侧头",
          "prompt": "A half-length portrait of a woman, slightly open with a slight natural sheen, wearing an off-white turtleneck knit sweater layered with a dark green cardigan. The sweater is soft and clearly textured, with natural shoulder lines. The overall look is simple yet warm. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, with the body slightly tilted to the left and the head slightly tilted, creating a subtle sense of movement. The foreground is the upper body, occupying the main part of the composition. The background is a simple interior wall with a light gray-green color. The surface is smooth with no obvious decoration. On the left side, there is a vertical light and shadow boundary line dividing the wall into light and dark zones. Light enters diagonally from the right, creating a strong contrast between light and dark. The light source comes from outside or side windows, presenting a warm golden tone, creating bright light spots and soft shadow transitions. The composition uses medium shots and close-ups, with figures occupying most of the space. The background is blurred to highlight the main subject, and light slanting from the upper right creates a quiet and cozy atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and green. Paired with off-white and gray, the colors are harmonious and unified. The image texture is delicate, with a slight graininess and film texture, as if shot with an old film camera, full of strong nostalgia. The scene is set in a quiet indoor corner, possibly in the early morning or evening, with sunlight streaming through the curtains into the room. The air is filled with a gentle tranquility and gentleness. The entire scene is full of life and artistic beauty, as if capturing an ordinary yet touching moment, with the characters' expressions calm and reserved. It gives a feeling of both intimacy and distance, as if pondering something and waiting for something. The flow of light and shadow echoes the posture of the characters, creating a poetic atmosphere. The overall composition resembles a carefully composed film photograph, rich in detail and emotionally rich, possessing strong visual appeal and emotional impact",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
