        {
          "id": "krea2-6e5768fbb39252454bbcee8d",
          "alias": "单女灰T恤山野沉思阅读",
          "prompt": "A female model appears in the center of the frame in a half-body close-up. Her overall expression exudes a calm, reserved, and slightly thoughtful aura. She wears a loose gray short-sleeved T-shirt made of cotton, with slight wrinkles and textured details on the surface. The T-shirt is printed with blurred black English letters, and the collar is naturally open. The collarbones and neck lines are exposed, with the muscles of the shoulders and arms clearly visible. Light streams in from the right side, creating a sense of depth and layering. The background is a light beige or grayish-white wall, smooth in texture but with subtle graininess. In the right back, neatly stacked white clothes—possibly sheets or towels—are stacked into a small mountain shape, with soft edges and fluffy material. Next to it is a corner of a light brown rattan basket, with a clear woven texture. The overall composition is shot in medium to close-up shots, with the people occupying most of the frame. The head is slightly tilted, with a slight angle between the line of sight and the lens. On the left side of the screen is a vertical Japanese title: \"Futari de Wearable Men's T-shirt.\" and the English \"MEN'S T-SHIRT FOR US.\" features a simple and modern font in dark blue contrasting with the background. The magazine name \"mina magazine\" is presented in bold handwritten font in dark brown at the top, while the lower part is labeled \"fashion & lifestyle 2023 july.\" The overall layout is balanced, with the visual focus focused on the figures. In the lower right corner, there is a white circular label that reads \"Enjoy your.\" weekend!” and \"7 in JAPAN 23,\" with a minimalist design. The overall color palette of the image mainly combines warm and cool tones, with light blue, gray, beige, and gray as the main colors. The lighting is warm and soft, typical of natural light or simulated natural light, with a strong Japanese magazine photography style. The atmosphere is quiet and comfortable, everyday yet refined, as if on a quiet morning with sunlight streaming through the window into the room, capturing a real and relaxing moment. The image texture is delicate, color saturation is moderate, and details are rich. It presents a realistic feel similar to amateur camera or mobile phone shooting, while retaining professional photography composition and light control. The overall atmosphere is warm, artistic, and close to life, conveying a relaxed and fashionable lifestyle. There are no obvious artificial traces in the image; all elements appear natural and harmonious, the composition with just the right amount of blank space, and the visual guidance flows smoothly, forming a complete narrative chain. The light and shadow distribution is even, the contrast of light and shadow is appropriate, highlighting the subject without compromising the simplicity of the background. Overall, it presents a sophisticated everyday aesthetic.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
