        {
          "id": "krea2-002323a3497254618ab69cae",
          "alias": "单女米T恤俏皮站立侧头",
          "prompt": "Her overall aura is fresh and natural, with a hint of lazy sexiness. She wears a beige lace camisole inner layer, with delicate lace patterns at the neckline and shoulder straps, revealing a subtle skin texture. Over it, she wears a loose brown suede jacket with wide sleeves that slightly fold over her arms, creating natural pleats. The jacket is casually draped over her shoulders, appearing casual yet stylish. She wears light blue washed denim shorts with slightly flicked hems, exuding youthful energy. Her hands are folded in front of her abdomen, fingers long, nails neatly trimmed and painted with light pink polish. On her left wrist, she wears a black work ID strap. The card holder is made of transparent material, printed with Korean text and a round logo. The strap loops around her neck and hangs naturally over her chest. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, her body slightly turned to the camera, and her head tilted slightly. It seems as if a silent interaction is taking place with the audience. The background is a dark gray wall, smooth but with subtle textures. On the wall is a golden abstract pattern shaped like animal outlines or geometric shapes, with soft halo effects along the edges, creating a modern artistic atmosphere. On the right side of the painting is a white area, possibly due to post-production cropping or light reflection, but it does not affect the integrity of the subject. The composition uses a mid-angle portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The background is appropriately blurred to highlight the main subject while retaining environmental information. The camera angle is slightly upward, enhancing the character's uprightness and approachability. Light and shadow come from the upper front, with soft and even lighting and natural shadow transitions, without strong contrast between light and dark, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly brown, beige, light blue, and dark gray, harmoniously unified and presenting a retro yet fashionable visual style. The details are rich, and even the text and patterns on the ID cards are clearly visible. It offers a high degree of realism and a sense of everyday life, like a natural portrait captured at an event site with a professional camera, combining artistic beauty with everyday documentary feel, conveying a relaxed, joyful, confident, and composed emotional state",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
