        {
          "id": "krea2-20bc02f773d4222e41e140ae",
          "alias": "单女橙背心小径沉思持相机",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman appears casual yet realistic, with a hint of blush, a sense of calm and contemplation, as if savoring or savoring something. In her left hand, she holds a green object with an uneven surface, resembling the fruit or leaves of a certain plant. Its texture is clearly visible, with slight damage at the edges, presenting a natural texture. She wears an orange-red sleeveless top, with bright but not overly saturated colors. The main subject is positioned slightly to the center, with a compact and sharp composition. The middle frame includes parts of the shoulder and arm. The background is blurred and blurred, with faint green plant leaves and interlaced shadows of light and shadow, creating the feeling of an outdoor natural environment. The overall use of shallow depth of field photography focuses on the subject, with a soft bokeh effect in the background. The composition is a vertical rectangle, extending down the line of sight to hand movements and objects, forming a natural visual path. Light and shadow come from the upper left, sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating contrast between light and shadow. Highlights are bright and transparent, while shadows transition softly. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of life, with the texture of Japanese film photography. The tones are warm, colors are reproduced authentically and naturally, with a slight retro filter effect. The edges of the frame have slight graininess and slight overexposure, simulating the texture of vintage camera shooting. The images are rich in detail and layered, combining the warmth of everyday life with artistic beauty. It seems to capture a momentary moment of unintentional authenticity, conveying a quiet, restrained, yet vibrant mood. The entire scene presents a gentle and intimate atmosphere, allowing people to feel the passage of time and the accumulation of memories",
