        {
          "id": "krea2-31c62d21a9d7142d8b51a8d5",
          "alias": "单女衬衫摄影棚微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A female rider dressed in professional cycling gear stands at the edge of a high observation deck. She wears a black carbon fiber road bike helmet, with pinkish-purple reflective lenses. She wears a natural smile, looking directly at the camera, exuding confidence and vitality. She wears a tight purple-red short-sleeved cycling top with white flame patterns and the words \"COSMIC STUDIO\" printed on the chest. The surface of the shirt has a subtle sheen, hugging body curves and highlighting a sporty aesthetic. She wears white high-waisted cycling shorts with black prints on the sides. NOE\" lettering and the \"VLORE\" brand logo. The shorts are smooth with slight pleats, outlining the leg lines. The feet wear white professional cycling shoes with breathable holes on the upper and paired with pure white long cycling socks. The cuff is decorated with a small red logo. Wearing a smartwatch on the wrist, the hand posture is naturally relaxed. The left hand rests lightly on the waist, the right hand hangs naturally, and the nails are painted with light-colored nails. The overall look is professional and stylish. The foreground features a gray cement floor and black metal railing, which looks somewhat dated. The surface shows signs of rust and wear. In the middle is a cluster of traditional Chinese buildings layered in layers. The gray-tiled roofs are arranged in a harmonious manner, the eaves are clearly arched, the walls are mainly gray-white, some buildings feature wooden doors and windows, and the background is rolling green mountains, lush vegetation and lush greenery. The mountain contours are soft, and in the distance, a winding dirt road can be seen running through it. The sky is clear, the light is abundant but not glaring, presenting a soft natural light effect. The overall composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned at the center of the painting, forming a visual focal point. Using a foreground railing and mid-view buildings to form guiding lines, the gaze is directed toward the main figure. The background layers are distinct, creating a sense of depth. Light and shadow come from the upper left and slightly darker on the right, creating natural three-dimensional shadows. Subtle highlights are created in the folds of clothing, enhancing the texture. The overall atmosphere blends modern sports aesthetics with traditional Eastern artistic conception. It combines the dynamic vitality of urban cycling culture with the rustic and tranquil charm of the landscape. The color scheme is harmonious, with purple-red and white, gray and green creating contrast and harmony, making the scene full of life and authenticity. It looks as if it was shot with a regular smartphone, retaining slight noise and natural color transitions, presenting a realistic beauty reminiscent of daily documentation. The composition is stable, with a slightly upright perspective highlighting the character's upright posture. The background is moderately blurred, making the subject stand out more, presenting an overall style that combines artistry and documentary qualities",
