        {
          "id": "krea2-13e8aa63cf7772c949833287",
          "alias": "单女白制服城市忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits inside a modern urban rail transit carriage, wearing a white short-sleeved sailor-collar school uniform top and a dark plaid pleated skirt, paired with white over-the-knee socks and black leather shoes. In the foreground is an empty blue diamond-patterned seat, with a seat back with metal armrests behind it. The seats are made of a blend of plastic and fabric, with fine textures on the surface. The edges are trimmed with silver-gray metal, and the interior structure is clearly visible, including the white ceiling lighting, air vents, and electronic displays. The word \"Road\" can be faintly seen on the screen. The transparent window glass reflects the blurred outlines of city buildings, and light streams in from the right window, creating a soft backlight effect and creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. In the background, you can see other passengers' blurred silhouettes, some standing, some sitting. In a state of focal depth, the main figure is emphasized. The composition uses the rule of thirds, placing the figure at the left golden ratio point. The seat's lines guide the gaze toward the figure, while the contrast of depth of field between front and back enhances spatial layering. The light and shadow are handled delicately, with the main light source coming from the right front, creating a transition of light and shadow. The shadowed areas naturally blend into the environment. The colors are harmonious and unified, presenting a tranquil momentary beauty in everyday life. It features a strong realistic style and youthful spirit, resembling film-like photos taken with a professional camera. The details are rich, noise is minimal, the image is clean and crisp, with no unnecessary elements distracting. The composition is compact but not crowded, the visual guidance is smooth, and the overall atmosphere is quiet, gentle, and slightly lonely, evoking the feeling of returning home after school or a brief midday break. The images present a real and storytelling scene, full of life and emotional resonance",
