        {
          "id": "krea2-5128e27dd050d3e60d4570ac",
          "alias": "单女衬衫卧室沉思坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the edge of the bed by the bedroom window, turning to look back at the camera, her fingers slightly curved, her posture elegant and natural. She wears a white high-neck, long-sleeve shirt with a delicate texture with slight pleats and light and shadow variations. The cuffs are slightly rolled up, revealing slender wrists. She wears a baroque-style printed short skirt in black, white, and gold, with intricate and luxurious patterns. The gold chain intertwines with classical patterns, and the hem edges are trimmed in black. The overall look blends modern minimalism with vintage luxury, with legs crossed and right leg bent. Her left leg stretches straight on the windowsill, her feet bare, with graceful lines. Her body leans slightly forward, head tilts slightly, presenting a contemplative tranquility. In the foreground is part of the bed, covered with an off-white knitted blanket with tassel decorations, soft and fluffy, and warm. On the bed is a light brown plush cushion, thick and adding comfort. In the middle is a woman sitting and part of the bed, with green plants nearby. A large green leafy plant is placed below the windowsill, with broad, feather-like leaves and vibrant green color, full of vitality. Next to the plant is a gray cylindrical flowerpot with a matte surface and a calm texture. In the background is a large window, with transparent glass reflecting soft natural light. Outside, you can faintly see the blurred outlines of buildings and the sky. The curtains are made of beige vertical striped fabric material, half-drawn, emitting soft, diffused light. The interior walls are light gray-white, simple and clean, without unnecessary decoration. The composition uses a three-part method, with the figure positioned slightly toward the center on the left side of the painting, and the gaze turning to the right, creating a sense of visual flow. At the same time, the vertical lines of the window frames and curtains enhance the sense of depth in the image. Light and shadow come from natural light on the left, soft and even, illuminating the front and side of the figure, creating subtle shadow transitions that highlight the texture of clothing and skin texture. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, private, and slightly artistic. The color palette mainly uses warm white, beige, and light brown, accented with black and gold, creating a cozy and sophisticated home living scene. The image feels realistic as everyday amateur equipment, with rich details and clear layers, as if captured casually with a camera, full of storytelling and emotional tension, presenting a lazy yet refined aesthetic of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
