        {
          "id": "krea2-2c2de7b0f6e97b809b542008",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫街道冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at a street corner in a modern city, wearing a black turtleneck sleeveless top and a loose black long skirt. The hem is embroidered with golden dragon patterns, the dragon's body winding and coiling, scale details clearly visible, and gold threads shimmering with a warm and luxurious sheen on the dark fabric. The overall outfit blends traditional Eastern elements with modern fashion design, showcasing a unique blend of classical and modern beauty. Her hands are gently raised, her posture elegant and natural, her head slightly turned to the side, her makeup delicate but not exaggerated, and her skin fair and delicate. It adds a touch of spontaneity and vitality. It stands on a wide pedestrian walkway in a city's commercial district, paved with gray square stone bricks with neat gaps that reflect faint light. On both sides of the street are modern buildings. On the left stands a high-rise building with glass curtain walls, reflecting images of the sky and surroundings. The ground floor features large display windows and brand signage, with the word \"DIOR\" clearly visible, with simple yet textured font. On the right side is a low-rise shop with wooden exterior walls. The facade design is minimalist, with warm-toned lighting that creates a cozy atmosphere. In the distance, you can see other pedestrians weaving across the crosswalk, some walking, some pausing, their figures blurred but their movements realistic, adding a sense of life to the scene. The background is filled with skyscrapers with sharp lines, presenting the city's bustling and orderly atmosphere. The sky is pale gray-blue, with thin clouds and soft and even light. This is natural light on cloudy days or early morning/evening. The sunlight shines from the side, creating a subtle transition of light and shadow on one side of the figure's body. The rich layers of light and shadow enhance the sense of three-dimensionality. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, leaving space on the left to display the building and street, while guiding the gaze to extend to the left to create visual balance. The foreground is the main subject, the middle ground is the street and buildings, and the background is the cityscape farther away. The layers are distinct and the sense of depth is strong. The slightly overhead perspective makes the figure appear more upright and brings the audience closer. The colors are mainly black, gold, and gray, supplemented by the building's white, wood tones, and sky's blue-gray. The overall color scheme contrasts sharply between warm and cool tones, highlighting the luxury of the clothing while highlighting the city's calmness and modernity. The images are full of storytelling, as if capturing an ordinary yet unique moment. It combines the sophistication of a fashion blockbuster with the casualness and authenticity of daily life, like street candid shots taken with a smartphone. The image quality is slightly grainy, the details rich, and the atmosphere is tranquil and profound, inviting the imagination.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
