        {
          "id": "krea2-f969dffda1254f6e61712735",
          "alias": "单女白制服森林困倦站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways in a sun-dappled forest. She wears an off-white school uniform top with a light blue collar and brown straps. The collar is embroidered with a delicate red floral pattern, paired with a white crew-neck T-shirt. The overall look is fresh and natural, full of youthful energy. She slightly tilts her head upward, carrying a quiet and longing thoughtful expression, as if immersed in the moment the sunlight streams down. In the foreground, several lush green leaves extend from the left side of the composition, with clear edges and delicate veins. Some leaves, illuminated by sunlight, appear semi-transparent, creating a natural contrast between solid and void. The middle is a female subject, positioned slightly to the right, her body slightly tilted, head slightly tilted back, her posture relaxed and natural, creating a soft transition of light and shadow. The highlights are bright and transparent, while the shadows are warm and profound. The background is layered green vegetation, with densely interwoven leaves presenting different layers of green tones. From light green to dark green, the blurring renders the background blurry but gives it depth, creating an immersive forest atmosphere. The composition uses a rule of thirds: the main figure is positioned near the right golden ratio point, leaving space on the left for the branches and leaves in the background to extend, enhancing the breathing and dynamic balance of the image. Then, following her gaze, the line extends upward to the top, forming a smooth diagonal. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by warm golden sunlight, soft and penetrating. Light spots formed by leaves scatter over the figures and the surrounding environment, creating a dreamy halo effect. The overall tone is warm, creating a peaceful, healing, and slightly nostalgic summer afternoon atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and rich, with realistic light and shadow effects as well as a slight film feel and vintage filters. It feels like shooting with an old-fashioned camera in natural light, presenting a realistic and artistic beauty of everyday amateur photography. The entire scene is full of poetry and storytelling. It brings to mind those quiet and beautiful moments from youth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
