        {
          "id": "krea2-5e0d09d232308eb9f584731f",
          "alias": "单女橙连衣裙街道俏皮坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the driver's seat of a vintage red van, wearing a loose orange-red semi-transparent long-sleeve dress with white lettered prints, paired with a matching short skirt underneath. She wears white knee-high socks decorated with red and blue stripes, paired with classic white canvas shoes. Her left hand rests naturally over her knee, holding pink sunglasses, presenting a casual and natural posture. Her posture is relaxed and effortless, her body slightly leaning, leaning on the steering wheel. It creates a relaxed and comfortable atmosphere. The foreground features the car's red door frame and parts of the body structure, with blue labels and some blurred markings on the door frames, forming a strong visual guide that draws the viewer's attention. The middle ground shows the interior of the vehicle, including the black steering wheel, instrument panel, seats, and inside doors, rich in detail and a sense of age. The wood or plastic interior exudes a retro feel, while the background shows the outdoor view through the window, with blurred architectural outlines and green plants faintly visible. Hinting at the environment of a city street or residential area, the composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center to the right. The car door frame serves as a natural frame to enhance visual layering. At the same time, the shallow depth of field effect blurs the background, highlighting the main subject. Natural light from outside the window softly and evenly falls on the figure, creating a subtle transition of light and shadow. The direction of light and shadow shines from the left front, with the overall tone dominated by warm orange-red, forming a sharp contrast with the white socks and shoes. It creates a youthful, energetic yet slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, with a slight film graininess, simulating the realism of everyday amateur camera shooting. The color saturation is moderate, not exaggerated, preserving the natural light and shadow changes of real scenes. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and pleasant, as if capturing a peaceful moment under the afternoon sun, full of life and youthful charm",
