        {
          "id": "krea2-dabc632ccc6df18fcd522b7b",
          "alias": "单女透视白衬衫公寓神秘蹲",
          "prompt": "A woman squats gracefully on a black flat panel, wearing a form-fitting white short-sleeved polo shirt with a slightly open neckline revealing her collarbones. She pairs it with a high-waisted gray pencil mini skirt, legs clad in sheer stockings with black polka dot patterns, and pointed black high heels. The overall look is both professional and sexy, with a slightly confident and mysterious expression. Her left hand gently rests on the skirt's waist, while her right hand naturally rests on the edge of the black panel, her fingers painted bright red nail polish. On the chest hangs a black lanyard badge printed with white text and a QR code. The background is a rough-textured gray cement wall with fine textures and irregular color blocks, presenting an industrial or modern minimalist style. The floor is light gray cement, smooth but with slight scratches and dust. The overall environment is simple and cold, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame. The composition uses medium shots, with the figure occupying the main part of the frame. The head is slightly tilted, and the body forms an S-shaped curve, creating a dynamic aesthetic. The foreground highlights the main figure and the black tablet in their hands, with sharp edges and clear edges. The middle frame shows the figure's posture and clothing details. The background is dominated by a large gray wall, creating a strong visual contrast. Light comes from the front left, soft and even, with natural shadows falling on the right and back, creating a sense of depth. The transition is delicate and without obvious hard shadows. The atmosphere is calm, restrained, and full of tension. The color scheme is mainly gray, white, and black, accented with red nail polish as a visual focal point. Overall, it presents the fashion and privacy of urban professional women, as if taking spontaneous photos in front of an office space or art installation. The images have a strong sense of realism, similar to shooting with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens. The outside of focus is natural, details are rich, colors are true, and the realistic feel of everyday amateur equipment shooting, including slight noise and imperfect focus, enhancing the sense of life and presence. The overall image combines the refinement of commercial photography with the freedom of personal style. It presents a subtle balance between professional norms and personal expression, with a composition that is stable yet dynamic, extending along body curves to hand movements and high heels underfoot, ultimately drawn by the vertical lines of the background wall, forming a complete visual closed loop. The color coordination is harmonious and unified, with the calm gray tones contrasting sharply with red accents, enhancing the visual impact. The overall atmosphere is calm and story-rich, as if telling a modern allegory about the workplace, identity, and self-expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
