        {
          "id": "krea2-385e9ffd2202f206cd2d085c",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙小径愤怒站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by an outdoor wooden railing, wearing an off-white lace spaghetti strap dress adorned with delicate embroidery and ruffle decorations. The straps are slender and narrow, the neckline is slightly low-cut, and the overall style is elegant and vintage, presenting a gentle and serene temperament. Under the sunlight, she glows softly. Her left hand rests lightly on the rough wooden railing, fingers long and natural, her right hand naturally hanging down, her posture relaxed yet dignified. In the foreground is the blurred edge of a wooden railing, with clear grain and some weathering marks on the surface, adding realism and a sense of time. The middle ground shows the woman's full body and partial body silhouette, with light slanting from her right rear, creating a soft backlight effect. Her silhouette is enveloped in a golden halo, with rich layers of light and shadow. The background is a blurred urban landscape, with faint outlines of high-rise buildings in the distance. The walls are grayish-white, windows are arranged in regular patterns, but the details are completely out of focus. In the background, there is also a large area of green plants, with vines climbing the walls. The leaves display different layers of green under the sunlight. Some areas produce bright highlight spots due to the light, creating a bokeh effect. The composition uses the classic rule of thirds: the figure is positioned about one-third of the way on the left side of the painting, with the gaze facing the blank space on the right, creating a sense of extension and narrative. The depth of field is relatively shallow, and both the background and foreground are blurred to varying degrees, highlighting the subject while maintaining a sense of layering. The visual guide is guided by the characters' line of sight, Body posture and the direction of light and shadow together form a flowing path from left to right. The lighting atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with sunlight filtering through the leaves, creating a mottled effect. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow, complemented by soft green and gray, creating a lazy, nostalgic, and slightly artistic summer afternoon atmosphere. The texture is similar to film photography, with slight graininess and color shifts, reminiscent of everyday moments shot with an old-fashioned camera. The light is soft and not glaring, and shadows transition naturally. Without strong contrasts of light and shadow, the overall impression is quiet, authentic, and full of life, as if capturing an ordinary yet touching everyday moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
