        {
          "id": "krea2-13c09a133c9196f491b07d73",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙书店愤怒坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the aisle floor of a bookstore, her back to the camera, her body slightly leaning forward. She wears a light blue short-sleeved dress with a white bow tied at the collar. The skirt is puffy and lightweight, and below the knees she wears off-white pantyhose. On her feet are a pair of black patent Mary Jane shoes, their shiny surfaces reflecting faint light from the surroundings. On her left wrist, she wears a delicate silver chain bracelet, and on her right ring finger, a simple ring is fastened. Her posture is natural and relaxed, as if she is completely immersed in reading. The main subject is positioned slightly below the center of the composition, forming a visual focal point. In the foreground, the comic book cover in her hands is clearly visible. The art style is Japanese-style manga, with bright colors and cute characters. The cover features several cartoon characters, with slightly worn edges showing signs of use. The pages are slightly curled, with slight shadows at the turning points, creating a sense of realism. In the middle are wooden bookshelves neatly arranged on both sides. The left shelf is stacked with various books with various cover colors, some spines marked with text, and the right shelf is darker. The interior display is blurry, but you can still make out the outlines of several books. The floor is made of gray matte tiles, with obvious seams reflecting soft lighting. The background features bookshelves and stacks in the distance, with layers gradually blurring to create a natural depth of field. The composition is symmetrical on both sides, but due to the characters' movements, perfect symmetry is broken, creating a subtle balance. The visual guide starts from the comic book cover in the foreground, with the gaze naturally moving upward to the character's head, then extends to the entire body contour, finally spreading into the background space, forming a circular reading path. Light and shadow come from the evenly distributed warm yellow ceiling lamps above, soft and not glaring, creating delicate transitions of light and shadow on the figures. The floor projection is clear, the atmosphere is tranquil and warm, carrying a touch of solitude and focus, like a tranquil moment captured by chance in daily life. The scene is realistic and full of life, with mainly warm yellow, gray, blue, and white tones. The color combinations are harmonious, details rich, and it feels like everyday amateur equipment shooting. Camera specs simulate Canon EOS R5 or Sony A7R IV, ISO 400, shutter speed 1/60 sec, aperture f/2.8, focal length 35mm, slight noise and low-light compression, minimal lens distortion, and slight dark corners at the edges, presenting an overall warm, private, and immersive reading experience, as if time has stopped at this moment, with only the sound of pages turning and thoughts flowing",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
