        {
          "id": "krea2-88e26230574848981f566e9a",
          "alias": "单女制服沉思站立",
          "prompt": "She adds a touch of laziness and spontaneity. Her fingers are long, with a tiny brown mole visible on her wrist. Elbows are propped in front of her, and she wears a long-sleeved top with orange pinstripes on a white background. The material is light and breathable, with clear and regular stripe lines. The neckline and cuffs are exquisitely detailed, making the overall look simple yet fresh. Under the light, subtle glows are reflected, and in the foreground, several fresh fruits are scattered, including two whole strawberries and two red cherries. The strawberries are covered with tiny seeds, the green stems are fresh and upright, the cherries are full in color, and the skin is smooth and reflective. They are casually placed on a white plane, visually echoing the figures. The composition uses close-ups, with the main subject occupying most of the space. The head is slightly tilted, looking directly at the lens, creating a warm and interactive feeling. The left side of the frame leaves a large negative space, making the subject stand out even more. The background is a pure light gray-white tone, with no cluttered elements. The minimalist design enhances the subject's presence, with light and shadow softly illuminated from the upper left, creating a uniform diffused light effect. The shadow transitions are delicate without harsh shadows, creating an overall atmosphere that is peaceful, warm, and healing. The color palette is mainly warm white and light orange, accented with bright red fruits. The colors are harmonious and unified, giving it a sophisticated business portrait style while retaining the affinity of everyday life. It feels like shooting with a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens, with a natural background blur. With well-controlled depth of field, the image texture is delicate and the details rich, presenting a tranquil, elegant, and vibrant moment—like a carefully planned fashion portrait without any deliberate trace, or like a beautiful moment casually taken among friends—authentic and moving",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
