        {
          "id": "krea2-7dfd07400585658e5ec918df",
          "alias": "单女黑外套广场微笑站立持杯",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of an outdoor Christmas-themed decoration, wearing a long black coat paired with a black knit dress, black stockings, and black-and-white square button high heels. She holds a cup of coffee in her right hand and her left hand naturally tucks into her coat pocket. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, with a slight smile. The overall look is simple yet fashionable, showcasing the delicacy and confidence of urban women. Her makeup is elegant, and a thin chain necklace around her neck adds a touch of detail. In the background are two Christmas trees decorated with pine branches, red berries, and small white string lights. Several large brown teddy bear plush toys hang from the tree, each with different shapes—some sitting, some lying down—adding a warm and adorable festive atmosphere to the scene. Next to one Christmas tree is a glass window inscribed with \"MERRY CHRISTMAS,\" decorated with colorful holiday patterns, including a cartoon figure wearing a red bow, further reinforcing the festive theme. The floor is a reddish-brown brick walkway, with sunlight streaming down from the upper left of the image, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow Figures and objects cast clear and slender shadows on the ground, with bright and warm lighting presenting the unique soft texture of a winter afternoon. The composition uses a central composition, with the figures positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The Christmas decorations in the background are symmetrically distributed on both sides, forming a stable visual balance. The foreground features the figures and part of the ground, the middle features a Christmas tree and teddy bear, and the background features blurred architectural walls and display windows, with clear layering, extending to the festive elements in the background. It creates a relaxed and joyful festive atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly black, brown, green, and red. The black clothing contrasts sharply with the warm-toned holiday decorations, highlighting the main character's outline while maintaining a harmonious overall color scheme. The lighting and shadow effects are delicate, shadow edges are clear, and highlights are bright but underexposed, enhancing the realism and three-dimensionality of the image. The shooting angle is horizontal, slightly tilted, making the figure appear upright and full of presence. The overall atmosphere combines the warmth of everyday life. It also carries the joy and warmth of a festive celebration, as if it were a high-quality street photo taken with a professional camera, full of artistry and storytelling, while retaining the natural and authentic texture of amateur equipment shoots, making it feel like a simple yet beautiful winter moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
