        {
          "id": "krea2-bd02032ca6a508ecca8951af",
          "alias": "单女街道忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beside a metal pillar on a city street, slightly turned as if about to say something or simply deep in thought. She leans against a mottled white metal pillar, whose surface bears peeling marks and fine scratches from old posters. Another gray metal pillar is on the left side of the frame, forming a visual framework. The background is a blurred city streetscape, with faint architectural silhouettes, traffic lights, and a car parked by the roadside visible in the distance. The sky displays a dusk tone of pale blue and orange-yellow intertwined, with light slanting from the right, creating a strong backlighting effect. Sunlight penetrates the fine dust in the air, outlining a bright golden edge on the figure's outline, while casting clear shadows on the pillar. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, with parts of the body obscured by the pillar—this is the \"voyeuristic style\" The composition creates a private and tense atmosphere. In the foreground are two vertical metal columns, forming the visual guiding line of the painting and directing the gaze to the characters. The middle ground features the main subject and nearby columns, while the background is a gradually blurred urban environment. Using shallow depth of field to highlight the subject, the contrast of light and shadow is strong. The warm sunlight and cool streets form a harmonious color balance. The overall atmosphere is tranquil yet slightly melancholic, like a film photograph capturing everyday moments, with a strong Japanese realism style. It's as if you were casually shooting with an old 35mm film camera at dusk, with slight graininess and natural color fading. There are no obvious post-processing marks in the frame, preserving the authentic texture of the shoot. The tones are mainly brown, gray-blue, and warm yellow, presenting a retro and gentle visual feel. The entire scene is filled with the alienation of urban life and the delicate expression of individual emotions, evoking those lonely moments frozen unconsciously in youth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
