        {
          "id": "krea2-27cd3e8bc4abb58b7f508e14",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙室内冷淡倚靠",
          "prompt": "A female model wore a light blue sequin mini dress, elegantly leaning beside a white concept car. Her right hand rested lightly on the door handle, while her left hand hung naturally, fingers long. She wore simple earrings and bracelets, and on her feet were white strappy high-heeled sandals. Her legs were long and straight, showing perfect proportions. She stood at the center of the booth, her body slightly leaning, presenting a graceful S-shaped curve. In the foreground were the front fender and door area of the white car. The body was smooth like a mirror, reflecting the light and shadow of the surroundings, with transparent windows You can see a corner of the car's black interior. The front design is very modern, with smooth lines. The headlights are sharply shaped, and the emblem is clearly visible. The middle ground is a combination of the model and the car, with the figure occupying the center right. The car extends from left to right, forming a visual guiding line. The background is a modern showroom space, with walls gradient in deep blue. The top features evenly distributed circular spotlights that emit cool white light, creating a sense of technology and futurism. In the distance, you can faintly see the outlines of other booths and blurred silhouettes. However, the focus is on the foreground figure and the vehicle. The composition uses a three-part method: the main body is at the right golden ratio point, while the left side is blank to showcase the car's details. The view is slightly upward, enhancing the figure's height and presence. Light comes from above and ahead, with the main light source soft and even, shadows delicate, and slight reflections on the ground and body, creating a clean and bright atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly blue and white, with cool tones throughout, giving a calm, professional, and high-end impression. The atmosphere blends fashion, technology, and elegance. It feels like a snapshot from an international auto show or brand launch site, delivering strong visual impact and commercial aesthetics. The image texture is delicate, with rich details and moderate color saturation, no excessive retouching, preserving the texture of authentic shooting. It looks like high-quality photos taken with a professional camera in indoor lighting environments. The lens focal length is about 85mm, aperture f/2.8, shutter speed 1/125 sec, ISO 200, presenting a natural depth of field effect, with soft background blur and sharp subjects. The visuals are layered, artistic yet full of everyday life, like perfect moments captured in daily life, full of storytelling and immersion",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
