        {
          "id": "krea2-eb7fe3265859b42645650404",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫桌边冷淡坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at a wooden table, wearing a loose white shirt with sleeves slightly rolled up, the fabric naturally draped to create soft pleats. The collar is slightly open, revealing a slender collarbone. The overall look is simple yet full of everyday feel, adding a touch of laziness and spontaneity. Her right hand holds a vintage silver film camera, the lens facing forward. The camera surface has a metallic sheen, details are clearly visible, and the background is a blurred indoor environment. The wall is in a light gray tone, with a wooden door frame or partition faintly visible on the right. Light softly streams in from the left, creating a natural transition of light and shadow and creating a sense of three-dimensionality. Light and shadow interplay between the folds of the clothing, presenting a realistic texture. The entire composition uses shallow depth of field photography, with the subject clearly prominent. The background is a partial table and camera area, the middle ground shows the body's body and hand movements, and the background is completely blurred, preserving only the basic structural outline. The composition uses a three-part layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving ample space in the line of sight. Viewers are guided to imagine the object of their gaze, forming a focal point of emotional exchange. The color palette is mainly cool and white, complemented by warm wood tones. The overall atmosphere is quiet, restrained, and full of artistic flair, as if capturing a tranquil moment in an afternoon café. The light and shadow layers are rich but not intense, presenting a soft, warm daylight effect. The image texture is close to medium format film photography, with slight graininess and natural color transitions. The lens uses an 85mm prime to simulate close-up portraits, creating an intimate yet distant viewing distance. The overall style combines a sense of realism from everyday life with artistic aesthetic expression, like youthful moments casually captured with an old camera. It combines documentary warmth with cinematic poetry. The composition is simple yet detailed, the light and shadow harmoniously unified, and the characters' expressions are natural and lively, as if one can hear the slow flow of time. The entire scene is filled with a gentle sense of nostalgia, immersing viewers in the quiet beauty of ordinary moments",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
