        {
          "id": "krea2-9da7160478f48031849e1f5f",
          "alias": "单女黑旗袍庭院过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a black hull qipao with gold and white floral patterns. The cut hugged her figure, showcasing elegant curves. The neckline was designed in a traditional Chinese frog style, with smooth and natural shoulder lines and a skirt length that reached her knees. The overall look blended modern fashion with classical charm. She lightly held a black smartphone in both hands, her fingers long and her nails neatly trimmed, wearing simple silver earrings and a finely chained bracelet draped over her shoulders. The overall temperament is gentle and smooth like jade. The background is a Chinese-style porch, with wooden lattice window lattices arranged in vertical strips. The dark brown wooden frame structure is clearly visible, and warm yellow indoor light faintly shines through behind the door, creating a peaceful and tranquil atmosphere. A red lantern hangs along the left edge of the door frame. The smooth surface reflects a soft halo, adding a festive touch. The floor is paved with dark gray stone slabs with natural texture, with slight wear on the edges. Light and shadow shine diagonally from the right, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The right side of the figure is illuminated by sunlight, presenting a warm golden tone, while the left side is in shadow, creating a soft transition. Light filters through the grille, casting regular strip-like shadows on the floor and walls, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The composition uses a center-right main placement of the figure, who occupies about two-thirds of the image, creating a narrative sense of waiting or gazing. The foreground is a close-up of the figure and his phone, the middle is the entire body and part of the porch structure, and the background is a blurred interior space and grille. The layers are distinct, with the overall color scheme dominated by black, gold, and white, accented by warm colors like red, brown, and gray. The colors are harmonious and unified, and the lighting atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, as if capturing a moment in an afternoon courtyard. It combines the elegance of Eastern aesthetics with a touch of modern everyday life. The image texture is delicate and detailed, resembling a real scene shot with a high-resolution camera. The lens is a 50mm prime portrait lens with an aperture of f/1.8, shutter speed of 1/200 sec, and ISO 100, simulates real camera imaging effects, with naturally soft lighting and no obvious post-processing marks, preserving the original light and shadow texture, presenting an overall documentary aesthetic style that blends sophistication with a sense of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
