        {
          "id": "krea2-7cea7fba55ff692b73e749cb",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道忧伤蹲持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman squats on outdoor concrete steps, dressed in a white short-sleeved shirt and light blue pleated skirt in her school uniform, black leather shoes paired with white socks, and a pair of round metal-framed glasses. Her overall posture exudes a sense of youthful campus tranquility with a touch of melancholy. Her body is slightly turned to the left of the frame, her head slightly turned toward the camera. The background consists of two parts: the left side is a white tiled wall. The surface is smooth but shows fine gaps and wear marks. On the wall, a blurry notice can be faintly seen. On the right is a huge rusty iron door, its door panel dark brown, covered with mottled rust and signs of aging. The door is fitted with horizontal metal shutters, and above it is a thick metal lock bar that secures the door. At the end of the lever hangs an old-style padlock, and several blurred graffiti marks remain on the door panel. The entire scene is set outdoors in a sunny setting, with light streaming down from the upper right. A strong contrast of light and shadow is created on the figures, while shadows fall clearly on the ground and the edges of the steps, creating a strong sense of depth. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, occupying the visual center. The architectural elements on both sides create a symmetrical yet asymmetrical framing effect. The white wall on the left and the rusted iron door on the right create a striking contrast in materials and colors, enhancing the layering and visual tension of the painting. The foreground features rough concrete steps with fine cracks and weathering marks on the surface. The texture is realistic. The iron gate and walls in the background gradually blur, creating a natural depth transition that guides the viewer to focus on the subject. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is bright and warm, with strong but not harsh sunlight, presenting a unique summer afternoon feeling of intertwining heat and tranquility. The overall color scheme features a warm and cool contrast, with white and light blue uniforms bringing a fresh visual experience, while the iron gate's brown tones and the gray tones of concrete add a touch of retro and nostalgic texture. The overall image has a grainy texture reminiscent of film photography and slight overexposure highlights. It feels like real street photography taken with an old-fashioned camera, carrying the rustic feel of everyday leisure equipment while retaining the delicate emotional expression of artistic portraiture. The composition is stable, the subject's posture natural, and the background details rich yet not chaotic, conveying a complex emotion woven with youth, loneliness, contemplation, and growth, full of storytelling and the atmosphere of life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
