        {
          "id": "krea2-3e6afef683a3c2991bc1f4c4",
          "alias": "单女灰高领衫室内站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a warm indoor setting, wearing a light gray turtleneck ribbed knit top. The delicate vertical stripes of the fabric are clearly visible under soft light. She pairs loose blue and white striped pants with a thin strap from the same fabric at the waist. The overall look is simple yet layered, adding a touch of softness and spontaneity. She wears a pair of gold fine-rimmed round glasses, with exquisite frames full of vintage charm. Her right hand held a stack of books, with spines of various colors—white, green, red, etc.—with slightly raised edges, showing genuine reading marks. Her left hand hung naturally, fingers long, posture relaxed yet elegant. The background was a blurred bookshelf neatly arranged with a large number of books. The spines were mainly off-white, light yellow, and gray-brown, creating a soft color transition. Several warm yellow spherical chandeliers hung above the shelves, their light filtering through the glass covers, emitting a soft glow and creating a warm and comfortable reading atmosphere. The entire shot uses shallow depth of field, with the main subject clearly prominent, the background blurred properly handled, and the composition using a slightly slanted medium and near angle. The person is positioned on the right side of the frame, with the body turning to the left and the head slightly turned toward the lens, forming a natural visual guiding line. Light and shadow come from the front slightly to the right, while subtle shadow transitions are created on the shoulders and arms, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, off-white, and light gray, creating a quiet, intellectual, and slightly artistic everyday scene. It feels as if a real moment is captured in the corner of an independent bookstore or library. The images are rich in detail, the texture authentic, combining the breath of life with artistic beauty, presenting a natural realism reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment. The lighting is soft, colors harmonious, and the expressions of the people are natural. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and warm, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
