        {
          "id": "krea2-cab11ebef7ae4777a34e61f2",
          "alias": "单女黑毛衣办公室害羞坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor industrial-style metal staircase, wearing a black sleeveless tight knit top and a gray high-waisted mini skirt, paired with black stockings and a pair of black pointed high heels. Another matching high heel is casually placed at her feet, showing a subtle tension blending workplace and privacy. Her posture is natural and relaxed, wearing glasses, her expression slightly shy yet confident. A white lanyard badge hangs around her neck, hinting at her professional identity. Beside her is a small black chain bag that adds a touch of life. The overall look is simple yet refined. Full of the independent temperament of an urban woman, the foreground features rusted metal steps covered with irregular textures and reddish-brown rust, giving a rough yet realistic texture. The edges of the steps show obvious wear marks, presenting an industrial beauty weathered by time. The center features the main figure, sitting upright in the center of the steps, legs crossed, body slightly leaning forward, forming a stable visual center. The background features red brick walls and metal mesh railings, with neatly arranged but slightly weathered bricks. The wall is dark in color with mottled light and shadow effects. The metal guardrail is composed of circular holes with a strong geometric pattern, clear lines, and well-defined perspective relationships. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with figures centered and side steps extending backward, forming strong guiding lines that draw the gaze toward the figures. At the same time, the layering of the steps enhances the depth of the painting. The brick wall in the background contrasts with the guardrail, enriching the composition. Light comes from the upper left, soft and even, reflecting scattered light on cloudy days, making the overall tone cool and shadows delicate, without strong contrast between light and dark, creating a calm atmosphere A rational yet slightly detached atmosphere, with black, gray, and brown as the main color tones, accented by a small amount of red carpet and black leather bags to create a visual focal point. The overall image texture is delicate and detailed, as if shot with a professional camera at low ISO, with slight graininess simulating the texture of real film. The lens is an 85mm prime portrait lens, with a large aperture to blur the background and highlight the subject. The focal length is precise, the background is slightly blurred, enhancing spatial layering, and the image is highly realistic and artistic. Like a carefully composed street photography work, it captures fleeting and authentic moments in urban life, conveying a quiet, restrained, powerful, and gentle mood. It seems as if time stands still at this moment, where people and environment merge into one—modern yet nostalgic, capturing both the everyday warmth of daily life and the aesthetic pursuit of photographic art",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
