        {
          "id": "krea2-ea41b11a262ca46f7ad43aac",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣户外沉思蹲过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman squats in an autumn outdoor scene, her expression calm and slightly contemplative. Her right hand gently pinches a leaf, her left hand naturally resting on her knee, wearing an off-white thick knit sweater and light-colored skinny pants, paired with a pair of white platform boots. She wears a beige tassel scarf casually draped over her shoulders, the tassels swaying gently in the wind, adding a touch of laziness and softness. Her posture is relaxed and natural, as if in a silent dialogue with autumn. In the foreground is a ground covered with golden fallen leaves, each leaf in different shapes. Some are intact and some broken, with colors ranging from tender yellow to deep orange. Some leaves have been trampled, giving a moist texture. The ground is also mixed with fine stones and soil, rich in detail. The center is the main subject, positioned slightly to the left of the center of the composition, her body slightly leaning forward and her head lowered, creating a restrained and focused visual focal point. The background is a pink building, with slightly mottled walls, neatly arranged windows, and the building's outline blurred by shallow depth of field, creating a soft bokeh effect. Several thick trunks stand in front of the building, with clearly visible bark grain and sparse leaves, hinting at late autumn. The sky shows a faint gray-blue hue, with soft and even light without strong shadows. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and warm. The composition uses a third-division method: the figure occupies the left third of the area, leaving space on the right to enhance the balance of the composition. At the same time, the fallen leaves in the foreground and the figures in the middle foreground form a progressive layer, guiding the gaze from near to far. The visual direction starts with fallen leaves on the ground and then spreads toward the buildings and trees in the background forming a complete visual pathway. Light and shadow come from diffused light on cloudy or evening days, softly casting on the figure and ground, creating subtle transitions of light and shadow. The folds of scarves and sweaters have delicate highlights and shadows, enhancing the material's sense of realism. The colors are mainly warm tones, with off-white, light brown, gold, and pink intertwined, creating a cozy and nostalgic autumn atmosphere. The overall style combines the realism of everyday photography with the aesthetic tone of artistic imagery, as if shooting with a regular camera on a clear afternoon. With a slight grainy film texture and natural color saturation, the image texture is delicate, and the emotional expression is subtle yet profound, conveying a poetic feeling about the passage of time, changing seasons, and inner peace",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
