        {
          "id": "krea2-b2604541a73bd571a62982e7",
          "alias": "单女窗边困倦侧头",
          "prompt": "She tilted her head slightly, her expression calm and slightly contemplative, holding a small white flower in her mouth. The petal edges were tinged with a pale pink hue, the stamens fine and clearly visible, with a slight sheen, as if she had just stepped out of a cluster of flowers, radiating a healthy glow. Her neck was gracefully long, her collarbones clearly visible, shoulders exposed, and she wore a light beige or pale yellow silk garment. The neckline was wide and slightly slanted, with delicate folds and light variations on the fabric. The garment faintly showed traditional style subtle patterns. It could be embroidery or prints, with overall soft and warm tones, mainly warm yellow and off-white. The background is a dark, blurred indoor environment, possibly walls or curtains, presenting large areas of dark tones that strongly contrast with the figures. Light comes from the left side of the frame, slightly behind, as soft natural light, like morning or evening sunlight streaming through the window, creating a distinct backlight effect. On the other side, a soft shadow transition is created, with rich layers of light and shadow and strong contrast, creating a warm and dreamy atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the canvas, the head slightly tilted, leaving enough blank space in the line of sight to guide viewers to imagine their inner world, highlighting their elegant contours and delicate skin texture, forming a flowing line from bottom to top and left to right, enhancing the image's dynamic and storytelling sense. The color saturation is moderate, the tone is warm, and it carries a slight vintage film feel. The image details are rich, presenting an overall poetic beauty that is tranquil, gentle, and slightly melancholic. Like a high-quality portrait shot with professional photography, or like a moment accidentally captured in daily life, full of vitality and artistic appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
