        {
          "id": "krea2-8f072f65177fb9a8ba2add0e",
          "alias": "单女白T恤室内害羞站立跳舞",
          "prompt": "A woman stands indoors, wearing a white short-sleeved tight-fitting T-shirt and a white high-waisted mini skirt. The hem features a drawstring design, highlighting a slender waistline and long legs. Her expression is slightly shy and confident, presenting a natural makeup look. Her right hand holds a black game controller and her left hand gently rests on her thigh, her posture elegant and relaxed. Her body slightly turns to form graceful curves. In the foreground is her clear figure and the controller she holds, while in the background is a large flat-screen TV. The screen displays the main menu interface of the Nintendo Switch console, featuring icons for games like Mario Kart 8 Deluxe and Just Dance 2020. The time is shown at 12:57 PM in the upper right corner. The overall composition uses medium shots, with the characters positioned slightly to the left of the center and serving as the visual focus. The TV screen extends horizontally as the background element, creating a stable sense of spatial layering. Below the TV is a green Nintendo Switch console. Next to it is a black bracket supporting the area. The floor is a light-colored wooden floor, with white tiles paving the walls, clean and simple. Light comes from the soft indoor light source in front, while slight reflection is generated at the edge of the TV screen, creating a realistic atmosphere for everyday life. The overall light and shadow distribution is even, with no strong contrast. The tones mainly include white, light gray, and screen colors, creating a fresh and bright visual experience. The image has the texture of everyday life, as if filmed with ordinary household equipment, capturing real moments of entertainment at home. The images present a relaxed, casual, and slightly fashionable modern lifestyle atmosphere. The composition is balanced, extending to the game content on the screen, emphasizing the theme of integrating technology and life. The atmosphere is warm and inviting, rich in immersion, as if you can feel the quiet and comfort inside the room. The overall style closely resembles real photography, with rich details and clear layers, combining artistic beauty with a sense of realism in life",
          "description": "",
