        {
          "id": "krea2-d8010ff1f1b9642175012419",
          "alias": "单女绿T恤浴室温柔过肩",
          "prompt": "In front of the bathroom mirror bathed in dim warm light, a woman gazes at herself in the mirror. She wears a delicate light green lace camisole lingerie, with delicate floral embroidery faintly visible in the soft light. The sheer lace texture is clearly visible, outlining an elegant and intimate silhouette. The jet-black color drapes smoothly over her shoulders, adding a touch of laziness and fragility, as if silently whispering some secret with a faint blush. Her right hand gently strokes above her head, fingers long, her movements natural and unpretentious, reflecting her reflection in the mirror In the foreground, a blurred arm and part of her body are visible, hinting that the photographer is right beside her. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the left central position of the frame, looking directly at the lens, creating a strong emotional connection. The background is a wall covered with off-white tiles, with neat grid lines, but due to light and mirror reflections, the light appears somewhat blurry. It creates a three-dimensional layering of light and shadow. The mirror reflection also includes scattered light spots and moisture traces, enhancing realism and the sense of life. The overall atmosphere is quiet and private, full of emotional tension. The tones are mainly warm orange-red and pale green, with subtle contrasts that feel intimate yet a hint of distance, as if capturing a moment of solitude in the early morning or late at night. The image has a slight graininess and film texture, simulating everyday phone or camera photography. The edges are slightly blurred, the background naturally blurred, highlighting the subject. Overall, it presents a literary vintage visual style, like an unedited private photograph—authentic and moving, with balanced composition and rich narrative qualities that evoke resonance and imagination. The transitions of light and shadow are soft, the details rich, combining the precision of modern photography with the warmth and emotion of craftsmanship.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
