        {
          "id": "krea2-d0430a5dfb64db8698225f80",
          "alias": "单女蓝制服街道忧伤坐注视（2）",
          "prompt": "A woman sat on the concrete floor of a city street, wearing a dark blue school uniform jacket and a white shirt. Her neckline was slightly open, black stockings wrapped around her long legs, and she wore black leather shoes. Her hands gently tugged at her tie, her posture relaxed yet a hint of restraint. Her body leaned forward slightly, knees bent, right leg stretched forward, and left leg curled at her side, appearing in a casual sitting posture. Behind her was a silver-gray vintage motorcycle, with the \"nineT\" logo clearly visible on the bike. The engine section is exquisitely detailed, with a strong metallic texture. The wheels and exhaust pipe structures are distinct, and the body is slightly tilted, forming a diagonal composition with the figure. On the left side of the painting is a thick concrete column, rough with weathered marks. The ground is an old asphalt pavement, covered with cracks and yellow traffic markings, scattered with withered yellow leaves and a few green leaves. In the corner is a square drainage manhole cover with worn edges. The overall lighting is soft and even, like natural light on a cloudy or evening day, with soft and delicate shadows. There is no strong contrast, creating a quiet and tranquil atmosphere. The view is shot from a slightly higher angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the lower right of the frame. The motorcycle occupies the upper middle and middle spaces. Columns and floor lines guide the gaze toward the center. The foreground is the ground and manhole covers, the middle ground is the people and motorcycles, and the background is a blurred street environment. The colors are mainly cool tones, with blue, gray, and black as the main tone, accented by yellow floor lines and warm fallen leaves. The overall composition is balanced, with rich light and shadow layers that are not abrupt. The visuals have the texture of everyday life, as if shot with a regular camera, with slight graininess and real ambient noise, presenting a youthful, lonely, yet story-filled urban street atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
