        {
          "id": "krea2-51b4252bd17c3e28780da600",
          "alias": "单女黑泳装户外温柔站立",
          "prompt": "Her body lines are smooth and graceful, with a slender waist, rounded and full hips, and long, well-proportioned legs. On her feet are light gray flip-flops, one foot slightly raised, heel suspended, presenting an unintentionally lazy vibe. The black bikini she wears is exquisitely designed, with a deep V camisole on the upper part. The back features a cross-strap design, creating a unique cut-out aesthetic. The lower half is a high-waisted triangle pants style, decorated with thin cords on the sides. The overall look is simple yet sexy. The background is a simple white wall that looks slightly rough, with fine textures and some stains, adding a touch of everyday life. On the right, a white metal railing can be seen, extending diagonally to the upper right of the frame. Behind the railing are blurred green plants and red flowers, with dense leaves and bright colors, forming a sharp contrast with the white wall. The ground is paved with irregular stone slabs, mainly pale gray and beige. The surface is slightly worn, with slight gaps and moss marks at the edges. Sunlight streams down from the upper left of the painting, soft and bright, creating a natural transition between light and dark. The left side of the figure is illuminated, with a clear outline, while the right side is in shadow, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. Light and shadow cast faint shadows on the walls, floor, and figures, creating a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The composition uses a three-part method, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the painting. The foreground features the full figures of the figures and part of the ground, the middle ground features white walls and railings, and the background features blurred plants and sky. The layers are distinct and the depth of field is shallow, making the subject stand out and blurring the background. The overall color scheme is dominated by black, white, and gray, accented with green and red natural elements. The color scheme is harmonious and unified, filling the scene with a summer vibe. It is both fashionable and retains the casualness and authenticity of everyday life, as if shooting outdoors under natural light with a regular digital camera. It preserves the original texture and details without excessive embellishment, presenting a natural, authentic, and vibrant moment capture. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and pleasant, with a touch of intimate gentleness and tranquility, like an ordinary yet beautiful afternoon frozen in the frame",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
