        {
          "id": "krea2-44acf006609af54068c4781a",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣街道忧伤倚靠",
          "prompt": "A girl dressed in a white sweater and a deep blue sailor uniform stood in the stairwell of a narrow, old residential building. She held a transparent umbrella high in her right hand, its surface slightly tilted upward, the handle pointing straight to the sky, as if feeling the gentle touch of raindrops falling from above. Her left hand gently rested on the metal railing, her body leaning back slightly, presenting a relaxed yet expectant posture. The background was dense old residential buildings, gray cement walls covered with traces of time, and tangled wiring and clothes hanging outside the balcony. In the distance, faint signs and details rich in everyday life can be faintly seen. The overall scene is enveloped in soft light on a cloudy day, with evenly diffused light and no strong shadows, creating a peaceful yet slightly melancholic atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, placing the figure on the left side of the frame to form a visual focal point. The foreground features a clear metal railing whose geometric lines contrast with the complex structure of the background. In the middle ground, the girl and her transparent umbrella become the core of the composition, while the background gradually blurs. Highlighting the emotional expression of the characters, the colors are mainly gray, white, and blue, with cool tones that enhance the cool and tranquil mood. The light and shadow are delicate and soft, with almost no obvious directional light sources, as if coming from a cloudy sky. The overall image presents a poetic moment casually captured in daily life, like a realistic image casually taken with a regular camera on a rainy street. It has a strong sense of life texture and emotional tension, with graininess reminiscent of film photography and slight exposure control. The tone is slightly cool but still realistic. Natural vigning at the edges of the frame enhances the focus of the central subject, while preserving rich layers of environmental details, creating a narrative space that is both intimate and open. Viewers seem to hear the distant sound of rain and the city's whispers, feeling the girl's inner peace and hope for the future in that moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
