        {
          "id": "krea2-80147b134a2e82d2fd31422b",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫俏皮脱衣",
          "prompt": "She wore a white long-sleeved shirt and a light blue plaid pleated skirt, paired with a dark blue tie and black over-the-knee stockings, presenting a typical Japanese schoolgirl uniform style. Her fingers slightly spread in a playful gesture, her left hand naturally resting on her knee, wrist wearing a black beaded bracelet and a fine silver chain, a black neck hoop with a small pendant hanging from her neck. Her makeup was exquisite, her body slightly leaned to the side, legs crossed, left leg pressed over her right, showing off her long leg line. The background was an indoor environment with gray brick wall textures. The wall is decorated with a black border, and a black-background white text sign hangs on it, reading \"ARE YOU HAPPY.\" Next to it is a white chicken-shaped pattern. The floor is made of gray tiles, and the overall light comes from the left front, creating a soft transition of light and shadow and creating a warm and slightly intimate atmosphere. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure occupying the center-left position, fully visible from above the waist to the thighs. The text and decorative elements in the background add a sense of life and narrative to the image. The overall color palette is dominated by white, light blue, and black, creating a harmonious color contrast. The image texture is realistic and delicate, as if shot with a professional camera in natural indoor light. It features slight film graininess and a low-saturation filter effect, presenting a sense of capturing casual moments in daily life. It combines youthful energy with elegant elegance. The background blur accentuates the subject, creating a warm, intimate, and story-rich atmosphere, like a real-life photo taken in a café or campus corner. It offers a strong sense of immersion and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
