        {
          "id": "krea2-9788542bbfdb49e731d125cc",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣海滩害羞站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the seaside, her head slightly lowered, her expression slightly shy and lazy. Her neck is graceful, wearing multiple layers of gold chain necklaces—including thin chains, thick chains, and decorative chains with small pendants. The layers are rich and exquisite. She wears an off-white loose knit cardigan layered with a light pink pleated slip dress. The material is light and flowing, revealing her collarbones and part of her chest. Her right hand holds a woven straw hat, and several rings are worn on her fingers, featuring simple metal rings, gem-encrusted designs, and vintage designs. The hand pose is naturally relaxed, with a vast, boundless blue sky in the background, clear and cloudless. In the distance, the blurred outline of the coastline and mountains can be seen. The sea appears deep blue, connecting with the sky to form a tranquil skyline. The composition uses medium to near and close shots, with the figure occupying the left center position, the head slightly tilted. The overall lighting is bright and soft, with sunlight shining from the upper right, creating natural highlights and shadows. The colors are mainly blue, beige, and gold, with fresh and warm tones that create a romantic summer seaside atmosphere. The image texture is realistic and delicate, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains slight film graininess and the natural shaking of everyday handheld shooting. The transitions between light and shadow are smooth, shadow edges are soft, the background is moderately blurred, and the main character is highlighted. The image is full of youthful energy and artistic vibe, conveying a relaxed, relaxed, and elegant lifestyle. It is suitable for fashion styling, travel photography, or social media sharing scenarios",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
