        {
          "id": "krea2-281720078b5b9dee80374944",
          "alias": "单女短裙室内媚态站立",
          "prompt": "The outfit blends cuteness and sensuality. The top features short puff sleeves, white lace trim on the collar and cuffs, a blue bow accent on the chest, and a high-waisted short skirt made of light blue denim with white ruffle edges. The waist features metal buckles and belt details, and the skirt is A-shaped. Paired with matching mesh stockings and white pointed high heels, the overall look has clear layers. Her makeup is exquisite, revealing a sweet smile. Her body is slightly tilted, her right hand gently resting on her knee, her left hand naturally letting down, her posture elegant and relaxed. The composition uses a center-shifted layout, with the figure positioned on the right side and a large negative space on the left side to create visual balance. The lighting is soft and even, and the warm-toned lighting from the upper front creates a cozy atmosphere, with delicate shadow transitions. The background is a pure pink gradient wall with no distractions, making the subject stand out. The overall color palette is mainly pink, blue, and white, harmoniously unified to present a dreamy, fairy-tale feel. The light and shadow are handled delicately, while the shadows naturally blend into the background, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The image has strong visual guidance, then follows the clothing lines and body movements throughout the body, finally returning to the simple background space, creating a tranquil and romantic atmosphere as if immersed in a fantasy indoor scene. The overall style combines the realism of everyday shooting with the refinement of artistic creation, like portraits carefully arranged in studios with professional cameras. The details are rich, textures are lifelike, and color saturation is moderate—neither exaggerated nor bland, presenting a perfectly balanced aesthetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
