        {
          "id": "krea2-e01d008ca22cf4dbf28a0976",
          "alias": "单女米连衣裙公寓困倦侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman presents in a bust-length pose, adding a touch of laziness and casualness. Her fingers are long, and she wears a simple black thin cord bracelet on her wrist, adorned with a small metal clasp. Her arm lines are smooth and natural, and she wears an off-white or light cream-colored spaghetti strap dress with slight pleats and textures, possibly silk or satin. The straps are woven in design, The chest features a waist-cinch detail, showcasing elegant curves. The overall composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered and the head slightly tilted, creating a posture that is both static and dynamic, highlighting the expression and posture. The middle frame extends to the chest and shoulders, showcasing clothing details and body contours. The background is a plain light gray or off-white wall, flat with no obvious decoration. In the upper right corner, a corner of the architectural structure can be faintly seen, such as the edge of the ceiling or the wall bends, adding a sense of realism to the space. The light comes from the front slightly left, belonging to a soft indoor light source, possibly from soft lamps or naturally diffused light. The shadow transitions naturally, creating a sense of depth. At the same time, soft shadows are formed around the neck and collarbone, enhancing the sense of layering. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and intimate, with a warm white tone and a slight low-saturation filter effect, giving the image a vintage film-like texture. The color coordination is harmonious and unified, with no strong contrast between light and dark, but instead creates a tranquil atmosphere through delicate gradients and soft transitions. The gentle yet slightly dreamy atmosphere features a compact yet uncrowded composition, with just the right amount of blank space, becoming the focal point of the entire composition. Overall, it presents a subtle beauty found in everyday life, as if casually captured in a quiet corner of the home with a phone or regular camera. It is authentic and full of storytelling, with a high degree of artistic expression while preserving the atmosphere of life and the warmth of personal emotion",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
