        {
          "id": "krea2-194beed0f101f7ad480d7813",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫微笑侧头",
          "prompt": "Her smile is sweet and natural, full of youthful energy. She wears a white shirt with a slightly open neckline paired with a light gray striped bow tie. The sleeves are loose and comfortable, and she carries a black backpack on her shoulder, with clearly visible straps. Her fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed, her posture elegant, her body slightly tilted, head tilted to the right, as if gazing at something beautiful. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the composition. Leaving the blank space on the right creates a sense of visual breathing. The background features a blurred sky and distant white tones, presenting a hazy gradient of light blue and white, creating a spacious and tranquil atmosphere. Light comes from the front slightly left, creating natural transitions between highlights and shadows. The layers of light and shadow are rich, details are clear, and the overall tone is mainly cool. The blue and white mix brings a fresh and pure feeling. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains the realism of everyday life casually. The background blur is well handled. Highlighting the main subject, the composition is simple yet aesthetically pleasing, extending beyond her line of sight beyond the frame, sparking curiosity and association in viewers. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, warm, and healing, carrying a subtle artistic vibe and youthful vitality, as if freezing a sunny afternoon capturing the purest and most radiant smile. The image is rich in detail, with clear textures and moderate color saturation, not overly flashy, maintaining a genuine and natural visual impression. The painting has strong emotional impact and tension, allowing people to feel a simple and beautiful moment of life. Like a classic shot in a youth film, the tranquility holds infinite hope.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
