        {
          "id": "krea2-f62e4043abd60a913852d289",
          "alias": "单女短裙摄影棚困倦倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "Her right hand grips a silver longsword, its tip pointing diagonally to the ground, while her left hand stretches out naturally, sleeves fluttering in the wind, skirt flowing lightly. Her overall posture is elegant and powerful, as if she is either emerging from a thrilling battle or about to embark on a journey. The clothing is richly detailed: the upper jacket is made of light purple sheer fabric, with sleeves as wide as clouds, layered upon layers. A white embroidered ribbon tied around the waist creates a slender waist. The lower skirt is a long skirt with gradient purple-white layers, light and translucent, shimmering softly in the sunlight with movement. The hem edges are decorated with tassels and lace patterns, adding a sense of vitality. The background is a vast, undulating mountain range, with clear distant outlines. The color tone gradually transitions from near to far to blue-gray, the sky is clear and cloudless, the light bright and pure. Intense sunlight shines down from the upper right, creating a soft backlight effect that outlines the figure's outline in a golden halo. The right side presents natural shadows, creating a sense of three-dimensionality and spatial depth. In the foreground are sparse wild grass and withered vegetation, with some leaves swaying in the wind, echoing the dynamic movements of the figures and enhancing the realism and atmosphere of the scene. The composition uses a central left-leaning main placement of the figures, using the lines of the figures and the direction of the sword to guide the gaze to the right, creating visual dynamics. Distant mountains overlap and stagger, forming a deep depth of field structure. The overall color scheme is mainly cool tones, interwoven with purple, white, and blue, creating an ethereal, An ethereal Eastern aesthetic mood with delicate light and shadow processing, balanced contrast between highlights and shadows, highlighting texture and layering. The atmosphere is tranquil yet full of tension, combining the chivalrous tenderness of the martial arts world with a dreamy charm beyond the mundane. The image texture is close to a professional studio shooting combined with outdoor natural lighting. The lens uses a medium telephoto lens to compress depth of field, making the main subject stand out, the background blurred naturally, and details preserved, presenting a realistic style that combines artistry and narrative. Like a classic scene from an ancient-style xianxia drama, full of poetry and storytelling, the visuals have a strong visual impact and emotional appeal, making people feel as if they are in a distant and magnificent martial arts world",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
