        {
          "id": "krea2-a1d7ce85423d0d5a33717b9b",
          "alias": "单女歌手银T恤摄影棚叛逆坐摆拍",
          "prompt": "She presents a futuristic look that is both sweet and slightly rebellious. She sits slightly sideways on a tech-inspired white and black mechanical device, her body slightly tilted, as if immersed in her own world. She wears a futuristic sci-fi style outfit, with a silver-white high-gloss camisole top that reflects strongly with iridescent effects. Under the light, it presents a flowing metallic texture. There is a zipper decoration on the chest, with the word \"TIC\" printed on the right side and a cross-shaped logo. The shoulder straps are bright pink, creating a striking contrast with the overall color scheme and serving as a visual guide. On the lower half, she wears a short silver gradient mini skirt with irregular pleated edges. The material is also highly reflective, creating subtle light and shadow changes with her movements. Underneath the dress, she pairs pink skinny pants to echo the color of the outer garment On the legs, she wears white mesh fishnet stockings with diamond-shaped mesh and clear lines, adding a sexy and fashionable touch to the overall look. On her feet are platform boots in black and white, made of hard plastic or synthetic materials, with wide white laces and metal fasteners. The design is highly functional, with a relaxed and dynamic pose. Her legs are crossed, one hand naturally resting near the knee, the other hidden from the frame, and her right arm bent behind her back, forming a graceful curve. On the right side of the image, some mechanical structures are visible, painted in white, black, and bright pink, featuring striking red spiral patterns and geometric lines, enhancing the overall technological atmosphere. The background is a seamless screen of pure white or very light gray, with no distractions, making the subject stand out completely. The composition uses a low-angle upward angle, capturing the figure from below, emphasizing her height and aura, while creating a visual impression of being gazed upon. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame. The right side is reserved to display part of the mechanical installation, forming a balanced and dynamic layout. The foreground features the figure's head, chest, and legs; the middle includes her torso and some mechanical devices; the background is a simple solid-color wall. Through depth control, the subject is sharp and clear, with a slightly blurred background to enhance the sense of spatial depth. The design then extends along the lines of the shoulder straps, arms, and legs to the installation, returning to the overall shape. The light and shadow treatment is extremely fine, with the main light source coming from the upper front. The softbox lighting simulates a professional studio, providing even and soft light that avoids harsh shadows. At the same time, bright reflective points are created in the highlight areas of the garment, highlighting the material's characteristics. The shadowed areas transition naturally, presenting delicate grayscale layers. Side lighting adds dimension, making the character outlines more distinct. The overall atmosphere blends futuristic technology, cyberpunk, and aesthetics, combining a cold mechanical feel with a gentle and sweet aura. The colors are mainly pink, silver-white, and white, accented with black for a strong contrast. At the same time, maintaining overall harmony and unity, the images present a clean, refined, and artistic visual experience, much like high-end commercial advertisements or fashion portraits, rich in detail and outstanding texture. They are suitable for digital art creation, game character design, or virtual idol image displays, conveying a unique temperament that conveys strength within tranquility and personality hidden within sweetness",
