          "id": "krea2-887cd2c21984a6d675b6ec91",
          "alias": "单女白连帽衫城市站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a white hoodie and a black short skirt stands on the stairs of a city pedestrian bridge, slightly turning to look back at the camera. She carries a black backpack, black leather shoes, and white long socks. Her overall look is simple and everyday, yet still youthful. Her posture is naturally relaxed, as if she has just stepped down a staircase or is about to move forward, creating a momentary frozen feeling where dynamic and static intertwine. In the foreground is a concrete staircase leading down, with slight wear and rust along the edge, sunlight streaming in from above. Clear and dense strip-like shadows cast on the steps create a strong contrast with the deep gray tones of the ground, enhancing the spatial depth and layering of light and shadow in the image. The white metal railings glow faintly in the sunlight, and some railings show rust marks, adding realism and a sense of life to the scene. The middle is the pedestrian bridge platform where the figure stands, with a slightly rough surface made of dark asphalt. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, with a slightly tilted body and head slightly turned toward the camera. The gaze and viewer interact subtly. In the background is a building with beige tiles, made up of neatly arranged square tiles, presenting a typical Japanese urban residential style. The building has several dark windows, one of which faintly reveals interior furnishings. Several small items are placed on the windowsill, adding details to daily life. The ground floor features black door frames and glass windows with Japanese signs such as \"student\" and \"instructor,\" suggesting it may be a school or educational institution, with electrical wires running across the top of the frame Several black cables extend parallel to the building's lines, further enhancing the sense of realism in the urban environment. The composition uses a low-angle downward view, making the characters appear tall and visually dominant. At the same time, the stairs serve as guiding lines from the bottom of the frame, naturally directing the gaze toward the main subject, creating a strong visual guiding path. The overall tone of the painting leans toward warmth, mainly beige, gray-white, and dark gray. The golden tones brought by sunlight create a warm yet slightly nostalgic atmosphere, with sharp contrasts of light and shadow. Bright light zones and deep shadow areas alternate, creating a strong sense of three-dimensionality and dramatic effect. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and story-rich, as if capturing a poetic moment in an ordinary daily life. It carries a strong Japanese realistic photography style, emphasizing realistic texture and natural light. It feels like shooting casually with a regular camera in the afternoon sunlight, preserving film-like graininess and color saturation, presenting an imaging experience that is both everyday and artistically beautiful",
          "description": "",
