          "id": "krea2-a1e1a312326067bd3d9104d9",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙广场站立持相机",
          "prompt": "Low-angle downward view: A woman stands on outdoor concrete steps, wearing a pure white spaghetti strap dress whose hem flutters in the breeze, presenting natural pleats and flow. The skirt is slightly knee-short, revealing long legs. She wears white sneakers paired with high-top white socks, each with subtle red lettering at the cuff. The overall look is simple, fresh, and carries a touch of casual everyday charm. The figure poses naturally relaxed, standing slightly sideways with a slightly tilted head. The background is a clear, cloudless blue sky, occupying most of the frame. On the left, a thick gray cement utility pole can be seen, covered with crisscrossing black wires and cables. Above the wire hangs a square distribution box marked \"Banxue.\" Behind the pole, the outline of distant city buildings can be faintly seen. On the right, a metal railing structure extends to the edge of the frame, forming a diagonal composition. Light comes from directly above to the right, with bright and intense sunlight creating sharp, clear shadows. The figures and the edges of the skirt have distinct highlights and shadows, creating a strong sense of three-dimensionality and realistic texture. The overall atmosphere is filled with the interplay of summer afternoon tranquility and vitality. The colors are mainly white, blue, and gray, clean and refreshing, with rich details. For example, rough textures on the surfaces of cement steps, wear marks on utility poles, and wrinkles on clothing are clearly visible. The transitions of light and shadow are natural and soft, giving it a documentary photography style, as if captured with a regular camera, while retaining artistic beauty and emphasizing poetic moments in daily life. The composition uses diagonal lines to guide the viewer from the lower left corner upward to the main subject, then toward the sky This creates a sense of expansive space and visual tension, conveying a youthful, free, and pure urban lifestyle atmosphere, combining elements of modern urban daily life with the delicacy and warmth of personal emotional expression",
