          "id": "krea2-0d588d5faf015281d877ac57",
          "alias": "单女灰制服害羞站立",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a dark gray Japanese sailor uniform stands slightly sideways, her left hand gently stroking the nape of her neck, her right hand naturally hanging down. Her posture is elegant yet slightly shy, with an overall fresh and sweet aura full of youthful energy. Her sailor jacket is a cropped design revealing a slender waistline, with a blue ribbon at the collar. The sleeves are loose and slightly pleated, and the skirt is a high-waisted pleated design, with smooth lines and delicate texture. Sunlight streams down from the upper left of the frame, creating a soft backlight effect while casting a soft shadow on the right side of the body, creating a three-dimensional effect The foreground features figures occupying the main position, with a low-angle downward shot to highlight their figures and presence. The background is a blurred outdoor scene, with faint green trees and shrubs. In the distance, wooden railings and blue architectural structures are visible. The blurring makes the main subject stand out. The overall tone of the painting is cool but balanced by warm light, with strong contrasts of light and shadow, natural transitions between light and shadow, and a tranquil yet poetic atmosphere, as if capturing a moment of tranquility on a summer afternoon campus. The image is rich in detail and feels authentic. It has the realism of everyday amateur camera shooting. The slight lens outfocus enhances the hazy beauty of the image, with moderate color saturation and clear but not overly sharp details. Overall, it presents an artistic style reminiscent of youthful portraits, retaining both a natural, everyday feel and the aesthetic layers of photography. The composition is balanced, and the use of lighting cleverly shapes the contours and emotions of the figures. The blurred background contrasts sharply with the clear foreground, reinforcing the subject's presence. The entire composition exudes a gentle, The pure yet slightly melancholic atmosphere resembled a memorable campus afternoon scene, leaving a lasting impression",
