        {
          "id": "krea2-1edf5c084dc041f0b65f3150",
          "alias": "单女米连衣裙椅上困倦坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a green wooden bench outdoors, wearing a beige long-sleeved dress with fine polka dot patterns. The material is light and flowing, presenting soft pleats and natural drape. The neckline and cuffs are decorated with delicate ruffles, giving the overall style vintage and elegance. Her expression reveals calmness and introspection. She hugs her knees with both hands, leans slightly forward, lifts her right leg, and places her feet on the bench. A black platform leather shoe has been removed and placed on the edge of the bench, revealing white socks, with the other shoe still on. Her posture is relaxed yet slightly tired, as if lost in thought during a brief rest. The background is dense green trees, sunlight filtering through the gaps in the leaves, casting mottled light and shadow, creating interplay of light and shadow. The bench is made of thick wooden strips, with a slightly worn surface and peeling paint, showing traces of time. On the left side of the painting is a vertical wooden railing structure, forming a framed composition that guides the gaze to the subject, with light slanting in from the upper left. A warm golden tone is formed, while clear shadows are cast on the ground and benches, creating a strong sense of three-dimensionality and spatial layering. The foreground occupies the center right of the frame, the middle is the bench and some background plants, while the background is blurred tree shadows and faint outlines of pedestrians in the distance. The contrast between solid and void enhances the sense of depth in the image. The overall composition uses the rule of thirds, with the figure positioned near the right golden ratio point, maintaining a stable visual focus. The colors are mainly warm yellow, beige, and green, with harmonious and unified tones. With the texture of film photography, slight graininess, and soft overexposure add a nostalgic atmosphere. Light and shadow transitions are natural, highlights are bright but not glaring, shadow areas retain rich details, presenting a peaceful, poetic, and slightly lonely everyday moment, as if casually captured with an old-fashioned camera—authentic and story-rich, with emotionally charged tension, combining the fragility of youth with a gentle gaze into life",
