          "id": "krea2-6149c8ee009f52f1c18bca19",
          "alias": "单女绿连衣裙小径困倦坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in front of a transparent glass box, wearing a light green strapless dress with elegant shoulder design. The hem drapes naturally, presenting soft pleats and smooth lines. The overall color tone is fresh and elegant, echoing the green tones of the background. She wears a light blue ribbon headband that drapes naturally over her shoulders, adding movement and vitality. Her makeup is fresh and natural, exuding a serene yet slightly mysterious aura. She wears delicate white floral earrings and a fine pearl necklace, highlighting nobility and refinement in the details. Her hands gently rest on the edge of the glass box, her fingers long, her posture relaxed and elegant. Inside the glass box, a lush green fern floats in the water, its leaves clearly visible. Subtle ripples appear on the surface, bubbles rise slowly, creating a tranquil and dreamlike atmosphere. The transparent texture of the glass box contrasts with the softness of the figures, enhancing the layering of the scene. The background is a soft light green wall with subtle textures and light and shadow variations, making the entire scene appear more realistic and textured. In terms of composition, the medium shot uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly toward the center on the left side of the frame, slightly tilted body, and the gaze facing the lens, forming a visual focal point. The glass box occupies the right side of the image, and its transparent structure guides the viewer's gaze from the figure to the plants and water ripples, adding depth to the image. The foreground shows the person's body and hands, the middle ground is the glass box and plants, and the background is the wall. The layers are distinct, passing through the hands, glass box, and plants, forming a closed-loop visual path. Light comes from the front left, soft and even. Natural shadow transitions are created, with faint light spots reflected on the glass surface, enhancing the sense of space and three-dimensionality. The overall light and shadow atmosphere is peaceful, cool, and dreamy, with mainly light green, light blue, and white tones. The harmonious color combination creates a surreal beauty, as if immersed in a pure dream. The image has a strong artistic and poetic atmosphere, while retaining the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting, such as slight noise, infully focused edge details, and natural exposure control. This makes the images both exquisite and full of life, presenting an overall modern fashion photography style that blends natural elements with humanistic emotion, conveying profound reflections on life, time, and beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
