        {
          "id": "krea2-325686bbb19152fe3dc95f57",
          "alias": "单女制服困倦站立",
          "prompt": "Her hands are raised above her head, presenting a semi-transparent texture. Light filters through the sheer fabric, creating soft halos and mottled light effects, creating a dreamy, hazy beauty with a faint sheen, presenting a gradient of dark and green tones, adding a mysterious cool tone to the overall composition. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly above the center of the frame. Occupying the main visual space, the background is pure white or extremely light gray-white, with no unnecessary elements interfering, making the subject stand out. The foreground is a flowing transparent sheer gauze, whose folds and flowing forms add layers and dynamic beauty to the image. The middle ground shows the body's body and hand movements, with details clearly visible. The background is completely blurred into a bright, solid color, enhancing the visual focus of the subject. The overall light and shadow atmosphere is extremely soft, with light sources coming from the front or side, forming uniform diffused light. This makes the figure's outline clear but not stiff, while subtly refraction and reflection appear on the sheer fabric, forming blue-green light spots and stripes, enhancing the overall harmony of the composition. The composition is simple yet full of tension, using the tulle's obstruction and translucency to create a strong visual contrast, emphasizing the interaction between people and objects. The overall composition presents a surreal artistic style, combining the realistic texture of photography with the poetic expression of abstract expressionism, like a film photo taken with an amateur camera. It retains a slight graininess and natural exposure transitions, with moderate color saturation and a slight retro filter effect, simulating the light and shadow changes and color reproduction in real shooting scenes, conveying a tranquil, introspective, and self-reflective emotional state. It seems to capture a private and sacred moment, full of philosophical meaning and emotional depth. The image shows no obvious commercial advertising traces and is more like an independent artwork, constructing complex emotional layers through simple elements combined. It makes one feel the stagnation of time and the release of the soul.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
