        {
          "id": "krea2-9b877380ee994ad420195962",
          "alias": "单女绿制服樱花忧伤坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits beneath a cherry blossom tree, wearing a deep green sailor uniform with clearly visible stripes on the collar and cuffs. Her skirt hangs naturally in pleats that wrap around her legs. On her feet are a pair of red and white Mary Jane shoes, white socks adorned with pink floral patterns. Her hands gently hold a thin orange toy, the thread tips drifting in the air, forming a tiny ring. She leans against a thick tree trunk, her body slightly tilted, knees bent, feet together, and the ground covered with withered yellow fallen leaves. It presents a texture of seasonal transition, with blooming cherry trees in the background. Pink-white petals densely cover the branches, forming a hazy sea of flowers. In the distance, a few tree trunks and blurred architectural outlines can be faintly seen. The entire shot uses shallow depth of field, with foreground figures clearly prominent, background blurred softly, and the composition centered on the figure, slightly left to create a peaceful yet slightly melancholic atmosphere. The lighting is soft and even, like diffused light on a cloudy or early morning. The overall tone is cool with a faint purple tint. This enhances the dreamlike feel of the image. Light and shadow shine from above and sides, with mottled shadows of leaves scattering on the ground, adding depth. There are no obvious shadows in the frame, making it appear very soft, gradually extending to the toy in her hand and the cherry blossoms in the background, forming an invisible path of visual flow. The overall style features characteristics of Japanese photoshoots, as if captured with an amateur camera, carrying a sense of everyday documentation, yet carefully composed and color-treated. It presents a beauty that is both everyday and full of artistic flair. The details are rich, from the folds of clothing to the texture of fallen leaves, all clearly visible, while maintaining enough blank space and breathing space, evoking a serene poetic atmosphere, as if time has frozen in this moment, leaving only tender moments with the cherry blossoms",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
