        {
          "id": "krea2-7085017e9ebb6abc4b6a4f68",
          "alias": "单女上衣小径严肃站立持械",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in vintage steampunk style stands on a path paved with stone, wearing a wide-brimmed black top hat with a slightly slanted brim, adding a touch of mystery and elegance, a hint of curiosity and determination, as if gazing into some unknown secret far away. She wears a thick dark green cloak, made of a slight velvet and distressed texture, with the edges naturally hanging down. Underneath the cloak is a white turtleneck shirt, with slightly exposed cuffs, and a golden gear-shaped brooch pinned to the collar. Rich in detail and rich in mechanical aesthetics, he wears brown tight tights and a pair of vintage brown leather lace-up boots. The upper is slightly worn, showing signs of long walking. In his right hand, he firmly holds a lavishly decorated long staff. The cane is made of metal, with a complex mechanical device embedded at the top, resembling a telescope or measuring instrument. Surrounded by several small gears and transparent glass tubes, a faint warm yellow glow shines inside. Several small pendants and thin cords hang from the center of the staff. The overall design is filled with fantasy and science fiction elements. The figures pose naturally and relaxed, their bodies slightly tilted to the camera, their left hand lightly resting on the edge of the cloak, and their right arm holding a staff slightly tilted, presenting a sense of balance that is both solemn and lively. The background is a dense tropical botanical garden, with layers of green leaves intertwined, interlaced branches, and dappled light and shadow. The leaves gently sway in the wind, creating a tranquil and vibrant atmosphere. The ground is a path paved with gray stone slabs, with some moss growing in the gaps. In the center is a round manhole cover. The surface is engraved with blurred geometric patterns, enhancing the scene's realism and sense of age. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, forming a visual focal point. The foreground highlights the main figure and the details of the staff, the middle features stone paths and some vegetation, while the background is dominated by blurred greenery. The shallow depth of field effect stretches spatial layers and flows down to the feet, forming a complete visual flow. Light comes from the upper left, simulating the soft natural light of early morning or evening. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves onto the figures, creating a contrasting effect of light and shadow, while the sides and shadows of the body present deep dark tones. The overall color palette is mainly deep green, brown, and orange-red, accented with metallic silver-gray and warm yellow halos, creating a warm and mysterious retro steampunk atmosphere. The image is delicate, with a film-like graininess and low-saturation tones, as if recorded with an old-fashioned camera. It is both artistic and full of everyday life, making the entire image full of narrative and immersion It makes you feel as if you are in a different world that blends nature and machinery, reality and fantasy",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
