        {
          "id": "krea2-6b5de3a7f9d8647ffc4e55f5",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套公园蹲躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman squats on a park path covered with golden ginkgo leaves. She wears a deep blue loose wool coat layered with a light gray turtleneck sweater underneath, off-white casual pants, and a pair of brown velvet ankle boots peeking out from the boots. She carries a khaki canvas backpack, holding an open olive green umbrella in her right hand. The handle is made of dark brown wood, with a semi-transparent surface and slightly curled edges. The ribs are clearly visible and naturally hang over her shoulders. The posture is elegant and relaxed, with the overall composition shot at a low angle. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaning slightly forward, forming a visual guiding line. The background is a blurred autumn forest, with interlaced branches and leaves showing yellow-green gradients. In the distance, faint stone benches and blurred architectural outlines can be seen. The lighting is soft and even, diffused from cloudy days, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The colors are mainly earthy tones, including olive green, khaki, off-white, deep blue, and gold, creating a harmonious and unified tone. It features the graininess and slight overexposure effect of film photography, simulating the texture of vintage camera shooting. The overall image presents an artistic, fresh, tranquil, and nostalgic autumn atmosphere, as if capturing a moment forgotten by time. The characters and environment merge into one, with rich layers of light and shadow. The details of fallen leaves on the ground are clear, each leaf has subtle textures and shadows, and the background is moderately blurred, highlighting the subject while preserving environmental information. The composition is balanced and full of storytelling. Guiding the viewer's gaze from the fallen leaves in the foreground to the figures in the middle ground, then transitioning to the hazy woods in the background. The overall style is close to scenes from Japanese street photography or art films, full of the poetry and loneliness of everyday life. Shot with a 35mm prime lens, f/2.8 aperture, ISO 400, and +0.3 stop exposure compensation, it presents color reproduction similar to the Fujifilm Pro 400H, with warm tones, soft contrast, and no obvious artificial traces in the frame, with all elements naturally blending together. Create authentic and trustworthy outdoor scenes",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
