        {
          "id": "krea2-3127476c47060144a68f6c5e",
          "alias": "单女棕毛衣霓虹夜景俏皮坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a high chair by the window in a café, wearing a brown V-neck knit sweater with thick fabric and clearly visible texture. The sleeves hang loosely and naturally down, and a small bow decoration is tied at the waist to add a playful touch. She pairs it with black high-waisted shorts, which are simple and neat, forming a sharp contrast with the top. Her legs are clad in black stockings, which are smooth and delicate on the surface, reflecting a soft sheen. The right hand rests gently on the thigh, fingers naturally bent; the left hand rests on the armrest of the chair, posture relaxed and elegant, expression gentle yet reserved. The background is the city street at night. Through the glass window, you can see blurry streets, streetlights, and the lights of passing vehicles. The lights cast long light strips on the damp ground, creating a flowing effect of light and shadow. The outlines of distant buildings are faintly visible, neon lights flicker, creating an atmosphere of urban nightlife. The indoor lighting is warm and soft. The round chandelier from the ceiling emits a golden glow, while the glass window creates a slight reflection, adding layers to the composition. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, body slightly tilted, creating a sense of communication with the viewer. On the left side of the foreground is part of a wooden round table and a black backpack, casually placed next to the chair, adding a sense of everyday life. The middle ground features the main figure and the high chair she sits, with a simple and modern design combining a metal frame with soft cushioning. The background is the night view outside the window, with blur treatment focusing the focus on the figure. The use of light and shadow is skillful, with indoor warm light contrasting with outdoor cool lighting, highlighting the character's outline and texture. The overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, as if capturing a brief moment of tranquility in a city night. The image presents a subtle beauty from everyday life, with a strong sense of immersion and realism, like a casual shot taken with a regular camera in a street café. The details are rich, color coordination is rich, and full of storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
