        {
          "id": "krea2-59d6480ac02ba00e5949afe6",
          "alias": "单女白T恤城市冷淡站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a vending machine, exuding an unintentional cool vibe. Her left shoulder is bare, and she wears a loose white T-shirt printed with black lettering \"QUEEN OF THE TRI-4.\" The sleeves are casually rolled up to reveal slender arms. Around her neck is a black lace collar, adding a touch of retro and personality. Her right hand holds a can of red beverage, while her left hand hangs naturally. On her wrist, she wears a black watch, with neatly arranged vending machines in the background. Inside, various common Japanese beverages are displayed, such as green tea, coffee, and mineral water. The bottle labels are clearly visible, labeled \"100 yen\" and \"COLD.\" The machine's surface reflects sunlight, presenting a cool-toned metallic texture. On the right, a hand is reaching down from above, with slender fingers, dressed in black long-sleeved clothes, taking a can from the vending machine. Under intense sunlight, the entire scene looks bright and realistic, with light streaming from the upper right creating a warm and natural lighting effect. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the left. The vending machine serves as a background element extending horizontally, creating a sense of depth. The return to her drink can forms a subtle visual loop. The overall atmosphere blends the everyday vibe of urban streets with the personality of fashionable youth, as if capturing an ordinary afternoon while buying a drink outside a convenience store. The image has a strong documentary feel and a sense of everyday life, with white, blue, and red as the main colors—striking contrast yet harmonious unity, rich in details. All display high definition and realistic texture, as if shot with a professional camera in natural light, with slight film graininess and motion blur, enhancing the tactile feel and warmth of the real world. The entire image conveys a relaxed, casual, and youthful everyday aesthetic, like a quiet shot in an independent film, making one feel the moment when time freezes.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
