        {
          "id": "krea2-edb50c593761a36672b2cec6",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙沙发俏皮坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in front of an indoor sofa, presented from a selfie perspective. She wears a white sleeveless dress with a classic Peter Pan neckline, black buttons on the chest, and thin straps decorated with black polka dots. The hem of the dress is adorned with a black polka-dot belt, blending maid outfits with collegiate elements, paired with black fishnet stockings and black lace trim. She wears a black polka dot bow headband, and on the left side of the foreground, a hand is operating the filming equipment, clearly visible. The background is a light gray fabric sofa. A gray cushion is placed on the sofa, the floor is covered with a black-and-white geometric carpet, the wall behind is off-white, and soft natural light filters in through the windows, which slanted in from the right side, creating a natural transition between light and dark. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the characters occupying most of the space. The background blur emphasizes the subject, with white, black, and gray as the main tones, creating a fresh, clean, and slightly playful atmosphere. The image texture is authentic and natural, as if you could casually shoot with a regular phone or digital camera. It carries a subtle sense of life and everyday life, with warm and soft tones, rich details, and clear layering, presenting a relaxed and enjoyable home selfie scene. It has strong visual guidance, with an overall warm and friendly atmosphere full of youthful energy and vitality",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
