        {
          "id": "krea2-a9c1ea9d82f4325644d4c0c5",
          "alias": "单女蓝短裙车厢忧伤站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a train platform at night, wearing a white short-sleeved top and a deep blue pleated skirt. Her body is slightly turned to the right side of the frame, her head turned toward the camera, creating a subtle sense of interaction. Her clothing style carries the freshness and youthfulness of Japanese campus style. The overall look is simple yet detailed. In the background, a blue and yellow train is speeding by, and the lights inside the window blur into flowing light strips. There is a noticeable motion blur effect. The outer walls of the carriages reflect a warm yellow glow in the night, contrasting with the surrounding cool-toned environment. The platform floor is made of dark cement, with a slightly rough surface, and some fine gravel and debris visible along the edges. On the left side is a metal pillar with red warning lights and winding wires hanging from it, adding a touch of industrial and realistic feel. In the distance, the platform ceiling lights emit a soft white glow, casting a faint halo in the night sky, enveloping the entire scene in a quiet nighttime atmosphere. The lighting mainly comes from platform lights, interior train lighting, and distant streetlights. The uneven distribution of light sources creates strong contrasts between light and dark, with foreground figures clearly prominent, mid-shot train dynamics blurred, and the platform structure in the background gradually blurring. The composition uses a center-to-right main figure, using the dynamic contrast between the figure and background to enhance visual impact. The slightly upward perspective makes the figure appear more upright and brings the audience closer. The color palette is dark blue, black, and warm yellow as the main tones, creating a retro film texture with a nostalgic film feel. The image has slight graininess and noise, simulating the effects of vintage camera shooting. The layers of light and shadow are rich, shadows are deep and delicate, and highlights are bright but not overexposed. Overall, it presents a realistic feeling of everyday amateur equipment shooting, as if captured by an old film camera, full of life and artistic beauty. The overall image conveys a sense of loneliness and gentleness in the city night, with youthful vitality mixed with a hint of melancholy and contemplation, like a silent poem. Capturing an ordinary yet special moment, the relationship between the characters and the environment is harmonious and unified. Every detail serves to create the overall atmosphere. From the folds of clothing to the texture of the backpack, from the light spots on car windows to reflections on the ground, everything is carefully designed, making the entire image both narrative and aesthetically rich. Returning to the posture of the characters, it forms a complete visual loop. The use of light and shadow not only enhances the sense of three-dimensionality but also gives the image a deeper emotional expression. The final result is a city nightscape portrait that combines realism with artistic quality",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
