        {
          "id": "krea2-b339c6776ad5941ae77ac9ed",
          "alias": "单女害羞侧头",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman presents a natural fluffiness, with slender fingers, neatly trimmed nails, and relaxed movements. The bow tie is loosely tied at the chest, with natural pleats, the texture of the garment is authentic, with subtle changes in light and shadow. The overall clothing style is fresh and artistic. The background is blurred, presenting a blurry warm-toned light and shadow, with faint green and orange-yellow spots creating a soft atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the character positioned slightly to the right of the frame, head slightly tilted, gazing toward the camera, creating a friendly yet slightly shy interactive feel. The left side of the frame leaves plenty of space to highlight the main subject, with light shining from the upper left creating a soft side light. The shadow transitions are natural, the overall light and shadow layers are rich, the atmosphere is warm and peaceful, and it carries a nostalgic feeling of youthful campus. The colors are mainly warm tones, with yellow, orange, brown, and blue interwoven in a harmonious and unified tone. The image texture is similar to film photography, with slight graininess and color saturation, as if taken with a professional camera in vintage photos. The lens focal length is about 85mm, aperture f/1.8, depth of field is shallow, the background is completely blurred, and the foreground is sharp and sharp. The light spots in the background appear circular bokeh with soft edges. The overall image presents a gentle, tranquil, slightly melancholic aesthetic, as if capturing a moment under the afternoon sun. It is full of storytelling and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
