          "alias": "单女白衬衫城市神秘站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the stone steps at night, wearing a white sleeveless shirt and a dark gray high-waisted striped pencil skirt, paired with black stockings and pointed high heels. She holds a silver pen-shaped object in her right hand, her left hand hangs naturally, her posture elegant and confident, her body slightly leaning to the side, right leg bent and raised, toes touching the steps, revealing her long leg lines. Her expression is calm and slightly mysterious. The background is rough stone walls and mottled cement steps, with obvious signs of aging and fine cracks on the walls. On the left, part of the wrought iron fence is visible. The overall environment appears somewhat old but rich in texture. The composition uses a medium shot perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, forming a visual focal point. The foreground features clear steps and her leg movements, the middle ground shows her upper body and the object she holds, and the background extends along the wall and shadowed areas. The light and shadow come from the warm yellow light source on the right, possibly streetlights or indoor lighting, while faint shadows are cast on the wall, creating a warm yet slightly cold contrast atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly gray, white, and black, accented with warm yellow halos. It presents a sense of privacy and detachment in an urban nightscape, with images that have a strong cinematic feel and storytelling, as if capturing a brief yet realistic moment. The details are rich and layered, combining the realism of daily life with artistic beauty. It's like shooting at night with a professional camera, using a large-aperture lens to blur the background and highlight the subject, and low-angle downward shots to enhance the character's presence. The color saturation is moderate, preserving real light and shadow changes, presenting high-quality photography with slight graininess and film texture. The overall atmosphere is quiet and full of tension, making one imagine she has just finished an important meeting or is preparing to go to a secret location",
