          "id": "krea2-c9c556df3cc562f02f219c8d",
          "alias": "单女白T恤健身房冷淡坐持械",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a black training chair in the gym, wearing an off-white sports tank top that fits her figure to accentuate her graceful shoulder lines and slender waist. She pairs her lower body with deep blue high-waisted tight sweatpants, made of smooth and elastic material that outlines her long, well-proportioned legs. Her right hand holds a black electric massage gun, gently pressing on her right shoulder deltoids, while her left hand naturally rests on the armrest of the chair. Her posture is relaxed and relaxed, her body slightly turned to the camera, presenting a relaxed state reminiscent of daily workouts. In the foreground is a clear half-body close-up of her, with a black leather training chair in the middle showing metallic details on the backrest and armrest edges. Scattered around are some fitness equipment pieces, including distant dumbbell racks, barbell plates, and strength training machines. The background is a spacious and bright gym environment, with gray non-slip rubber mats on the floor and various fitness equipment lined up along the walls. Natural light streams in through glass windows, providing soft and even lighting. The overall color scheme is mainly gray, black, blue, and white, creating a calm and professional atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait shot, with the figure positioned slightly toward the center on the left side of the frame, leaving space on the right to showcase the environment and creating visual balance. The light and shadow come from natural light from the side window, creating a soft transition between light and shadow. The shadows are delicate and not abrupt, and the overall atmosphere combines realism and artistic beauty, as if taken with a professional camera. The photos have a slight film texture and low-contrast color grading, with moderate color saturation that leans slightly cool, highlighting the freshness and focus of fitness scenes. The images are rich in detail. From clothing textures to muscle lines to the metallic reflections of equipment, everything is clearly visible, while retaining a certain sense of everyday life. Like snapshots taken casually in daily life, it is full of healthy energy and self-care emotional expression, with a strong sense of immersion and resonance",
