          "prompt": "A woman sits on the indoor floor, her body slightly turned to the right side of the frame, head lowered, expression calm and slightly lazy. She stretches her arms upward, raising them above her head, grabbing the elbow of her left arm for a stretch, while her left hand naturally rests behind her right shoulder, showing elegant curves. She wears a light gray turtleneck tight knit sweater made of fine ribbed knit, hugging her figure and outlining the natural curves of her chest and waist The hem is short, revealing a flat belly and pink lace-trimmed panties. The underwear is low-rise and edged with delicate hollowed-out lace, creating a gentle contrast with the sweater. She kneels barefoot on a light gray carpet, feet together, feet flat on the ground. Her legs are long and well-proportioned, knees slightly bent, body leaning forward but back straight, creating a dynamic yet static beauty. On the left side of the foreground is a simple white side table, flat with four black metal stands forming a right-angle structure, and a light pink tablet sits on the table The screen is closed, with rounded edges and a smooth, reflective surface that hints at modern life scenes. The middle section is a corner of a blue fabric sofa, with a thick backrest and clearly visible fabric texture, presenting a warm blue-gray tone. The sofa's edge visually echoes the female body. The background is a bright and tidy home environment, with walls in light gray-white with a delicate texture. On the left is a wooden door or cabinet in warm brown color with vertical wood grain, a simple door frame, and in the far right frame, the outline of another piece of furniture can be faintly seen. It might be a bookshelf or storage cabinet, with clear spatial layering. The composition uses a mid-shot close-up of the figure, with the main subject positioned slightly to the right of the frame, leaving space on the left side for displaying environmental details. The gaze naturally guides from the flat panel and table in the foreground to the entire figure, then extends to the background, creating a smooth visual flow. A large aperture is used to blur the background, making the foreground and middle ground clear and prominent. The background gradually blurs, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. Light comes from the front left of the frame, soft natural light. Perhaps through the window, the light is evenly illuminated without strong shadows, with delicate transitions of light and shadow. The overall atmosphere is warm, comfortable, and tranquil, carrying the privacy and realism of daily life. The main color tones are cool gray, off-white, pale pink, and blue-gray, harmoniously unified to create a quiet, gentle, and slightly sensual home moment. It seems to capture an ordinary yet poetic moment. The image texture is delicate and detailed, combining professional studio-level light control with the relaxed feel of natural shooting",
