          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a delicate gray lace long-sleeve top and a black high-waisted pencil skirt stands in a minimalist pure white space. Her makeup is refined and natural, exuding a restrained elegance and confidence. Her hands are folded in front of her lower abdomen, her posture dignified yet relaxed. On her left wrist, she wears a delicate silver bracelet. Her fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed and painted light pink, and she wears black pointed high heels paired with sheer black stockings, giving her legs a smooth and graceful line. The overall look blends the sharpness and softness of modern urban women. The main body is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, with the body slightly turned to the side, presenting a standard three-quarter side view. The head is slightly tilted, creating a sense of dynamic balance. The foreground covers the lower body and feet, clearly showcasing clothing details and accessories. The middle ground shows the upper body and above the waist, highlighting the lace top's texture and tailoring, as well as contrasting colors with the black skirt. The background is a minimalist pure white wall and floor. On the right side, there is a simple white cube geometric structure as a visual aid. Its edges are clear, the surface smooth and textureless, enhancing the sense of depth and modernity in the space. The composition combines central symmetry with the golden ratio, with the figure occupying the main visual focal point and the background left ample blank, creating a strong visual contrast that guides the viewer's gaze to the figure himself. Light comes from the front left, making it a professional studio setup. The main light source is soft and even, shadows transition naturally, and the contours are clear but not stiff. At the same time, a slight shadow is cast on the cube on the right side to enhance the sense of depth. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is clean, bright, and layered, with gray, black, and white tones dominantly in gray, black, and white, creating a cool and restrained yet warm sense of luxury. The image texture is delicate, the fabric materials are authentic, lace patterns are clearly visible, fabric folds are natural, and the high heels and stockings are precisely reflected, presenting an overall style of quiet, focused, and professional fashion portraits, as if taken with high-end commercial photography equipment. With a strong artistic atmosphere and lifestyle aesthetics, it is suitable for magazine covers, advertising, or personal image display, offering strong visual appeal and emotional appeal",
