          "alias": "单女白衬衫公寓愤怒站立注视",
          "prompt": "Her overall aura is fresh and refined. She wears a pristine white long-sleeved shirt with a neat collar and buttons tied at the top, the cuffs slightly rolled up to reveal her slender wrists. She pairs a dark gray short skirt with a clean and sharp hem and smooth lines, long, straight legs, and black stockings that are smooth and slightly reflective, with graceful leg lines and slender ankles. Her feet naturally crossed, barefoot resting on the edge of the stone bench, toes slightly bent, her posture elegant and relaxed. Her hands were gently folded over her knees, her fingers long, her nails neatly trimmed, looking clean and neat. A pair of cream-colored flat shoes were casually placed on the ground in front of the stone bench. The upper was simple and unadorned, with low and comfortable heels. The floor was an irregularly patched gray stone path, with clear gaps between the slabs. In some areas, a few withered yellow fallen leaves scattered throughout, adding a touch of autumn atmosphere. The stone bench was made of heavy gray stone. The surface is smooth but slightly rough, with sharp edges that exude a strong industrial feel and durability. In the background stands a sturdy tree with a robust trunk, its bark covered in cracks of varying depths. The roots are exposed to the ground, tangled and intertwined, forming a complex network structure. The roots extend outward and blend seamlessly with the ground. The leaves are dense, and the branches are lush, forming a dense green canopy. Sunlight filters through the gaps, casting mottled light and shadows, creating a warm and soft lighting effect. In the distance is an open lawn. The grass is lush with a hint of withered yellow, and a few winding paths can be faintly seen winding through. In the distance, faint outlines of buildings and parked vehicles can be seen, presenting the everyday atmosphere of a city park. The sky is pale blue, clouds thin, and the light is bright but not glaring. The overall lighting is natural daylight, coming from the upper right, creating a soft side light. The shadows transition naturally, with stone benches and the ground casting faint shadows, enhancing the sense of spatial layering. The composition uses a golden ratio layout slightly to the left center, with the figure positioned on the left side of the frame, facing the lens At the same time, diagonal lines from tree trunks and stone benches form visual guides, directing the gaze toward the main subject. The large trees in the background and distant scenery create a sense of depth, enhancing spatial expansiveness. The overall color scheme mainly features warm and cool contrasts. The white shirt and black stockings create a strong visual impact, gray stone elements provide a stable base, green vegetation brings vitality, light and shadow are delicately distributed, and shadows appear on the sides of the body and beneath the stone benches. The moderate contrast between light and shadow creates a realistic and textured visual experience, creating a tranquil and warm atmosphere It combines the everyday feel of urban life with the refinement and beauty of artistic photography, as if capturing a leisurely moment of sunny afternoon sunlight and a gentle breeze. The entire image is filled with the atmosphere of life and cultural warmth, presenting a natural, authentic yet slightly artistic visual style",
