        {
          "id": "krea2-4e7b1eab11232e376b640512",
          "alias": "单女短裙卧室自信坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the edge of the bedroom, facing the mirror for a selfie. She wears a black velvet off-shoulder long-sleeve top with a unique neckline that reveals one shoulder and collarbone. She pairs a plaid mini skirt with a delicate checkered pattern of beige and dark brown, an A-shaped hem with pleated waist accentuating the waistline. She wears black stockings on the bottom, her legs are long and naturally overlapping, her feet are bare, her nails neatly trimmed, and her posture is elegant and relaxed, holding a black smartphone in her left hand. The camera module on the back of the phone is clearly visible, with the screen facing the user, taking a picture in the mirror. The mirror is slightly curled and naturally falls over the shoulder, with a calm and composed expression. In the background is a full-length mirror with a complex carved border. The mirror reflects the interior of the room. On the left is a corner of the bed, with sheets printed with green leaves and yellow pineapple patterns. The headboard is decorated with orange stripes, and some miscellaneous items are piled beside the bed, including pink plastic storage racks and clothes. On the right side is a light beige wardrobe. The cabinet door has a green maple leaf-patterned wallpaper sticker. Above the cabinet hangs a piece of light blue clothing. The wooden floor is light yellow with a smooth surface with fine wood grain patterns. Light comes from ceiling lights or window light, creating a warm and soft atmosphere with a warm yellow tone. Light and shadow shine from the upper right, creating natural shadows with clear details. The mirror reflects the entire scene, with a symmetrical layout. The main body is centered, and the reflection enhances the sense of space. The foreground features the edge of the mirror frame and the lower body of the figure. The middle frame shows the person's full body and bed, with the background being the wardrobe and wall. The visuals have clear layers and harmonious color combinations, evoking the warmth and privacy of daily life, presenting a realistic and natural home selfie style. It feels as if shooting with a regular phone, with slight camera shake. The image quality retains its original texture without excessive retouching, emphasizing the sense of recording real life moments. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, comfortable, and private, full of the spirit of life and the gentle temperament of women",
