        {
          "id": "krea2-3b4a0c19f95b6724e253d750",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙城市忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman in a black long dress stands on the damp stone steps, holding a transparent umbrella with a slightly tilted surface. Rainwater drips along the edge of the umbrella, forming a fine mist around her. Her figure is bathed in soft natural light, appearing quiet and lonely. She is slowly descending a slightly mottled stone staircase, whose surface has gone dark gray from long-term dampness. Some areas are covered with moss and fallen leaves, with metal railings and wire fences at the edges. On the left are cement brick walls and wire fences. On the right side is a low concrete wall bearing the marks of time, its surface covered with weathering marks and dark stains. The top is decorated with stone decorations. In the background, a yellow train is speeding by, its body blurred by movement, creating a sense of movement. The windows reflect the outlines of surrounding buildings. Above the train is a dense residential area, with buildings mainly in warm tones such as orange, off-white, and light blue. The roof is mostly made of dark gray tiles, and utility poles and intersecting wires run through the entire scene, adding complexity to urban life. At the top of the frame are blooming cherry blossom branches, their pink and white petals gently swaying in the breeze. The branches extend diagonally from the upper left corner to the upper right, forming a natural frame that draws the viewer's gaze toward the central figure. The cherry blossoms contrast sharply with the gloomy street below, creating an atmosphere that is both romantic and melancholic. The overall composition uses a low-angle upward view, making the figures and cherry trees stand out even more. The visual guiding line extends down the stone steps and finally converges at the figure's back, enhancing the depth and narrative value of the image. The light comes from diffuse light on a cloudy day The overall tone is on the cool side, mainly gray, black, yellow, and pink. The color saturation is low, presenting a film-like texture. The light and shadow are soft and even, without strong contrasts of light and dark, but the rain-damp ground reflects the sky's gray-blue tones, enhancing the sense of realism in the environment. The entire image seems to capture an everyday moment, yet is also full of poetry and cinematic feel, like scenes from a Japanese art film, capturing both the hustle and bustle of urban life and the accumulation of personal emotions. The visuals are rich in detail and layered. From the slippery stone steps in the foreground to the figures and trains in the middle ground, and then to the architectural clusters and cherry blossoms in the background, each floor carries a different story, creating an atmosphere that is tranquil, nostalgic, and slightly melancholic that makes one wonder why this woman lingers, whether she is waiting for something, or if she has just said goodbye to someone. This kind of blank space gives the image great imagination, and the overall style combines documentary and artistic qualities, as if captured by chance on a rainy day with an old film camera. It is full of the atmosphere of life and aesthetic depth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
