        {
          "id": "krea2-3cf15fa01d85c75129ee87b5",
          "alias": "单女灰连衣裙小径困倦行走注视",
          "prompt": "From a low-angle downward view, the foreground shows a close-up of several pink cosmos flowers. The petal edges are slightly curled, presenting a natural gradient color from deep pink to light pink. The center is deep brown, with clear details. The petals have subtle textures and water droplet reflections, and the background blur creates a soft bokeh effect, creating a strong sense of depth. The middle view is a winding dirt path, rough and uneven, with tiny stones and fallen leaves. On both sides of the path grow dense cosmos and other wildflowers, vibrant in colors such as orange, yellow, and white. The flowers are staggered in height, with intertwined branches and leaves. Some flowers sway gently in the wind, casting mottled light and shadow on the ground, creating a contrast of light and shadow. In the distance, a woman in a gray long dress walks slowly along the path, her posture elegant and slender, blending into the surroundings. Her figure appears small and serene against the bright sky background; The sky occupies about one-third of the top part of the frame, appearing pale blue. The clouds are thin, and sunlight filters through the gaps, creating a soft backlighting effect that outlines the figures in a golden halo, casting long shadows on the ground, enhancing the three-dimensional and temporal sense of the image. The composition uses the classic rule of thirds: the main figure is positioned near the right golden ratio, while flowers serve as visual guides to the left and above, directing the gaze toward distant figures and creating a strong sense of perspective and spatial layering; The overall color palette is warm and soft, mainly pink, green, and blue, with harmonious color combinations full of vitality and poetry; The lighting and shadow atmosphere is tranquil and dreamy, with sunlight slanting from above, creating a soft glow for early morning or evening. The image has a slight film texture and graininess, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera, adding realism and a nostalgic feel; The lens is ultra-wide-angle, offering a wide field of view and exaggerated perspective, making the foreground flowers appear large and the background gradually shrinking, enhancing visual impact; The focal length is set around 24mm, maintaining a certain width and depth; Slightly overexposed to highlight the brightness of the sky and the clarity of light, while preserving details in the shadows; The overall atmosphere is tranquil, romantic, and full of vitality, as if capturing a poetic moment, allowing people to feel the harmonious coexistence between humans and nature. The images are filled with healing power and a longing for a better life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
