        {
          "id": "krea2-8e8386a60a8c91128d6c6451",
          "alias": "单女白长裤街道冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a light blue long-sleeved top and off-white loose pants stands with her back to the camera in front of the railway crossing, her black backpack slung diagonally behind her. She gazes at the green vintage train slowly approaching ahead. The train's body is mainly dark green, accented with yellow decorative lines. Passengers can be faintly seen in the windows. The front of the train is fitted with a square ventilation system, the side of the train displays the Japanese sign \"ちゅうい\", the crossing railing features yellow and black warning stripes, and the red signal light is on. The electronic display below also shows the word \"chuui.\" White notice boards are posted on the crossing pillars, yellow anti-collision facilities are placed beside them. The ground is a gray cement pavement with weeds growing along the edges. Sunlight pours down from the upper right, casting clear shadows on the ground. The sky appears pale blue with a slight mist. The overall composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly lower to the right of the frame, creating visual balance. The train occupies the left and middle parts of the frame, while the crossing marker protrudes from the front left, guiding the viewer toward the train. The strong contrast of light and shadow is strong, with warm yellow sunlight contrasting with the cool green carriage creating a peaceful and nostalgic atmosphere. The image has a film-like texture, with slight graininess and enhanced color saturation, presenting a realistic feel reminiscent of everyday amateur camera shooting. The background blur makes the subject stand out, and the overall color tone is warm and storyful, as if capturing an ordinary yet poetic moment. The girl's posture is serene and contemplative, as if waiting for or recalling something. The entire scene is filled with traces of time and the warmth of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
