        {
          "id": "krea2-19ccad23bbbfbaa91ff5922a",
          "alias": "单女外套小巷忧伤站立指向",
          "prompt": "A woman stands with her back to the camera in a narrow alley in a Japanese city, wearing a dark loose jacket and a black long dress with a small white floral pattern. Her right hand hangs naturally while holding a black DSLR camera, while her left hand carries a light-colored canvas bag. She gazes relaxedly and intently into the depths of the alley. Her figure forms the visual focal point of the frame, becoming the main figure of the entire scene. On the left side of the foreground is a row of stacked air conditioning units, with a somewhat worn metal casing. Next to it stands a red square sign printed with Japanese characters and \" The English words \"COFFEE HOUSE\" are slanted at the edge of the sign, showing traces of daily life. On the right side are low potted plants, lush with green leaves, forming a natural contrast with the surrounding buildings. The middle view features narrow alleys extending into the distance, flanked by towering residential buildings or small shops, with mottled walls, graffiti, and stickers scattered throughout. Balcony railings are rusted, and wires crisscross like spider webs, densely threading overhead, creating a complex and realistic urban texture. In the distance, more building outlines and blurred signage can be faintly seen, enhancing spatial depth. The composition uses a center-right position of the figure, using the perspective lines of the alley to guide the gaze deeper into the depths, creating a strong sense of depth and an atmosphere of exploration. The proportional relationship between the figures and the building highlights the city's crowding and individual insignificance, while retaining a human touch. The visual guide starts with the coffee shop sign in the foreground, follows the figure's contours, and finally points to the unknown space at the end of the alley, forming a clear visual path. In terms of lighting and shadow, the overall lighting is soft and slightly gloomy, seemingly on cloudy or afternoon days. The sky is blocked by tall buildings, with light scattered from above, casting irregular shadows on the ground and walls. The walls emit faint reflections due to dampness, and some areas show moss or water stains, enhancing the realism of the environment and making it stand out against the gray background. The colors are mainly cool tones, with white, gray, and dark brown as the main tones. The red signboard serves as the only warm element, serving as the visual focal point. The overall image presents a film-like texture, with fine grain and low color saturation but rich layers, reminiscent of street photography taken with an old camera. It features slight vignetting and vignetting effects, adding a retro feel. The overall atmosphere is quiet, nostalgic, and full of life details, conveying a daily aesthetic of seeking tranquility and poetry in the city's cracks. It seems to capture an ordinary yet moving moment, making one imagine the photographer preparing to press the shutter and capture this quiet and authentic urban corner",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
