        {
          "id": "krea2-2facf6d609ba3e1634d5d42e",
          "alias": "单女白外套桌边专注坐喝",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden bench in a café, holding a transparent plastic cup with the words \"RAW POL\" in both hands. Inside is a light brown drink, possibly an iced latte or milk tea. She is gently sipping through a straw, looking relaxed and focused. She wears an off-white tweed jacket with double breasts and gold buttons on the cuffs, giving off an elegant and vintage look. On her left ring finger, she wears a simple silver ring, and on her right wrist is a fine chain bracelet. The overall look is exquisite and layered. On the table in front of her sat a blue diamond-patterned woven handbag. The body was embossed with the brand's signature pattern, the strap was made of matching leather tones, decorated with a gold metal chain. Next to it was a piece of food wrapped in red and white checkered paper, possibly French fries or sandwiches, with golden ingredients peeking out at the edges. The table was made of smooth light gray marble, reflecting soft light. In the background was a modern-style café interior, with an open layout and a bar area at the back. Various beverage equipment and bottled beverages are displayed on the bar counter, with several warm yellow chandeliers hanging above. The light is soft and cozy, creating a cozy and comfortable atmosphere. In the distance, another customer sits on a high stool, wearing a white shirt with his back to the camera, using his phone. The entire scene presents rich light and shadow changes under the combined effects of natural light and indoor lighting. Light streams in from the left side, creating bright highlights on the table and the package. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly toward the center on the right side of the frame The left space is reserved to display the handbag and food, creating visual balance. The foreground clearly highlights the main details, the middle frame shows the interaction between the characters and the environment, and the background blurs the distant furnishings through blurring, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The color scheme naturally extends from the drinks in her hands and the items on the table to the surrounding environment. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, off-white, and dark brown, complemented by a blue handbag as a visual focal point. The color contrasts are vivid but not abrupt, creating a quiet yet everyday atmosphere. It's as if capturing an ordinary yet lifelike moment. The image texture is delicate, with slight film graininess and soft out-of-focus imaging, reminiscent of a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens. It presents a realistic yet slightly artistic filtered style of imagery. The composition is compact and storyful, the characters' postures are natural, expressions are authentic, the scene arrangement is authentic and believable, and the lighting is precise to create a warm, comfortable, and relaxing urban leisure atmosphere, suitable for expressing women's everyday aesthetics and fashion taste",
