        {
          "id": "krea2-6c74ae3b99c206dfaf2a49f3",
          "alias": "单女灰连衣裙城市冷淡坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor stone steps, wearing a dark gray sleeveless high-neck dress adorned with a bow. The skirt slits slightly slit to reveal her long legs wrapped in black stockings, and she wears black pointed stiletto heels with shiny silver metal decorations on the toes. The overall look is elegant and sharp, jet-black and glossy, with a focused and reserved expression. Her right hand gently holds a small black wallet, her left hand naturally rests on her knee, and her wrist wears a simple gold bracelet. Her fingers are painted with white nail polish, giving her a clean and sharp look. Beside him lies an open black folder revealing a newspaper or magazine. The pages are filled with clear text and images, set against a heavy gray stone wall with rough texture and distinct lines, presenting the rugged texture of urban public spaces. The stone steps are rough and bear traces of age, and the light and shadow on the steps create a layered interplay of light and shadow. The overall lighting is soft and cool, like natural light on a cloudy or evening day. Sunlight streams in from the side above, creating delicate shadow transitions on one side of the figure's body, highlighting three-dimensional contours, with a medium shot perspective in the composition. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, sitting with legs crossed, a posture relaxed yet dignified. The camera slightly looks downward, emphasizing the figure's height proportions and clothing details. The visual guide line extends from the curves of the body and legs to the ground, then guides the gaze upward through the lines of the stone steps to enhance the depth of the image. The foreground focuses on the lower body and foot details, the middle ground features the upper body and folder, and the background is a blurred stone wall structure, creating a shallow depth of field effect. This makes the main subject stand out even more, with a calm, urban, and modern atmosphere, carrying the independent temperament of a professional woman and a touch of lazy afternoon leisure. The overall color scheme is mainly gray and black, accented with a touch of metallic sheen and white details. The texture is delicate, and the lighting and shadow treatment is realistic and natural, as if shot outdoors with a professional camera. It has a strong cinematic feel and the texture of a fashion blockbuster, while preserving the beauty of casual moments in daily life, like a real scene captured in a street shot. The images are full of storytelling. It evokes moments of relaxation and self-reflection outside the workplace, with balanced yet dynamic compositions, harmonious colors, rich details, and clear layering. It combines artistic expression with a sense of everyday life, presenting a modern female image that combines elegance and strength",
