          "id": "krea2-ce74c8f99228c5eb0d2ef9f8",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣城市冷淡坐持书",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the edge of a white, modern-style round table, her expression slightly cold and aloof. She wears a beige fitted knit dress with long sleeves and horizontal cutout details on the chest, highlighting an elegant neck line and collarbone contour. The skirt is shorter to mid-thigh, outlining a long, well-proportioned leg curve. On her feet are beige stiletto sandals, with slim heels and simple laces at the ankles. Her posture is relaxed yet full of tension, with her right leg bent over her left leg and her right hand resting lightly on the table. The left hand naturally rests at one side of the body, with a simple yet fashionable overall design. The background features a large floor-to-ceiling window with white frames, and the light outside is bright and soft, creating a uniform diffused glow. The interior walls are light beige, and the floor is a smooth light gray, reflecting the light and shadow outside. On the left side is a modern chair with a black metal frame with a wooden backrest and black cushion. To the right of the table sits a pale yellow ceramic vase adorned with several green leafy plants, and beside it is an open magazine or book. The entire space is simple and bright, with mainly off-white, light gray, and pale yellow tones, creating a peaceful, pure, and slightly artistic atmosphere. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered slightly to the right, forming a clear visual flow. Light mainly comes from the window in the back, which is backlit. However, reflectors or fill lighting methods are used to evenly illuminate the front of the figure, avoiding strong shadows. At the same time, the striped light and shadows cast by the window lattice onto the floor and walls are preserved, enhancing the sense of layering and realism in the space. The overall image presents a texture similar to everyday photography with a professional camera or a high-end smartphone, with rich details, moderate color saturation, and gentle contrast, possessing a high degree of realism and a sense of life. It seems to capture a quiet afternoon alone indoors in a bright room. It resembles a carefully composed portrait piece or a casual photo taken by a friend, full of the independent temperament and gentle strength of urban women. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, carrying a subtle sense of detached beauty and the poetry of modern life The visuals are clean and crisp, with no unnecessary decoration, highlighting the harmonious unity between the main subject and the environment. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, the details are exquisitely handled, presenting a minimalist yet sophisticated aesthetic style",
