        {
          "id": "krea2-795604afa9e0b143c3a30f51",
          "alias": "单女制服床忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a Japanese-style sailor uniform sits on an indoor bed, appearing gentle and genuine. She lowers her head slightly, her expression slightly melancholic and contemplative. Her right hand gently strokes the hairline above her head, her fingers slender and long, her posture natural and relaxed. The sailor uniform features off-white long sleeves with a deep blue collar and cuff stripes, tied with a deep blue bow at the neckline. She wears a deep blue pleated short skirt that naturally hangs down, revealing fair, slender legs. She sits cross-legged, her ankles naturally bent, barefoot on the soft sheets, toes slightly curled. Realistic physiological details are presented. She sits on a bed covered with a light brown cotton-linen texture. The surface of the sheet has natural folds and fine textures, with fringed edges adding a touch of life. On the left side of the background is a potted green plant with round, gray-green leaves, slender branches, some of which are blurred to create natural depth. The rear wall is pure white, simple and clean, without any decoration. The overall sense of space is simple and tranquil, with a medium perspective. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, with a slightly tilted body. The head is lowered to create a visual focal point, creating a restrained, quiet, and story-rich atmosphere. Light comes from the front left of the image, softly and evenly casting on the figures, creating a natural transition between light and dark. Shadows are delicate, wrinkles on clothing are clearly visible, and light shadows cast on the sheets and floor to enhance the sense of depth. The overall color palette is mainly warm gray, off-white, and deep blue, harmoniously unified and evoking the warmth of daily life. The light and shadow atmosphere is cozy and tranquil, as if capturing a moment of solitude on an afternoon. The images present a realistic texture similar to amateur photography equipment, with slight noise and natural depth of field. The background is moderately blurred, emphasizing the subject while preserving environmental information. The image is not overly embellished, maintaining a natural state with rich details. The overall style is realistic and emotionally dynamic, conveying a sense of loneliness, reflection, or subtle sadness of youth, like an inadvertently recorded inner monologue—authentic and moving",
