        {
          "id": "krea2-47cbe6e12d1e132e3b7c3696",
          "alias": "单女冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "She slightly lowers her head, as if gazing at some distant moment, presenting a faint pink glow that glows healthily under the sunlight. The interplay of light and shadow reveals the texture and layers of the skin, creating a semi-transparent halo effect scattered like stardust, reflecting a soft glow and adding a subtle dampness. The highlights are bright and warm, while the shadowed areas are deep and soft, creating a sense of three-dimensionality and depth. The background is a blurred blue sky or a light-colored background, presenting a gradient of cool tones. It forms a striking contrast with the warm tones of the foreground, highlighting the main subject. The composition uses close-up shots, with the figure occupying most of the composition. The head is slightly tilted, creating a visual sense of flow. The surrounding scenery gradually blurs, emphasizing the subject's details and emotional expression. The light comes from a diagonal top, simulating natural sunset light, creating a mottled light and shadow effect that enhances the layering and atmosphere of the image. The overall atmosphere is calm and warm, carrying a poetic beauty. The image has the texture of film photography, with moderate color saturation. It has a slight graininess and dynamic range, presenting an effect similar to shooting with a 35mm film camera. The lens is a large-aperture prime lens like the 50mm f/1.8, with strong background blur and very shallow depth of field, making the subject stand out. The image quality is delicate yet retains a certain raw feel, avoiding excessive sharpness, focusing more on realism and emotional expression. The color tones are warm yellow and orange, paired with a cool blue background to create a warm contrast that enhances visual impact, filling the overall image with an artistic atmosphere. It still retains the warmth of everyday life, as if captured casually on a quiet afternoon with an old-fashioned camera, capturing the gentlest dialogue between light and shadow and people",
