        {
          "id": "krea2-6dfdb3c3bd8e5cd31be77e4f",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫冷淡注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a white shirt and a gray pencil skirt swings a black metallic baseball bat on the field. Both hands grip the bat tightly, with a defined right arm muscle. Her left hand wears a white wristband and a dynamic forward posture. Her left leg is slightly bent to support her center of gravity, her right leg pushes back to generate power, and her feet are black high heels on the dark ground. The overall pose exudes strong athletic tension and a sense of power. In the foreground, the figure occupies the center slightly to the right, with the body fully displayed from waist to feet. The background features an orange tiered seating arrangement. The seats are neat and orderly, with metal railings and blurred green tree outlines behind. The sky is pale purple, with soft and even lighting that creates a hazy atmosphere of dusk or dawn. The composition uses a low-angle downward view to highlight the characters' strength and visual impact. The characters and baseball bats form a diagonal line, guiding the gaze from the lower left to the upper right, enhancing the sense of movement. Light and shadow come from the upper and side to create natural shadows on the figures. The overall color palette is mainly cool gray, orange-red, and light purple, with striking contrast yet harmonious unity. The visuals have a strong dramatic and cinematic feel, as if frozen at a precise moment of a shot, full of youthful energy and competitive passion. The details are rich and layered, presenting a realistic style that combines everyday realism with artistic expression. It feels as if shot with a professional camera, with delicate image quality, well-controlled depth of field, clear and prominent subjects, and moderately blurred backgrounds that enhance spatial depth. The overall atmosphere combines the refinement of commercial promotion with the naturalness and everyday life of amateur photography. It seems to capture the exciting moments of a special moment",
