        {
          "id": "krea2-0d40ef451f6cd2c9fc203542",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔厨房害羞站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beside the marble countertop in the kitchen, wearing a loose blue denim jacket. The jacket is open, revealing a white lace lingerie and thin black ribbons underneath, revealing a slightly shy yet approachable expression. Her body leans slightly, one hand gently resting on the smooth marble countertop, the other naturally hanging down, her posture relaxed and elegant. The background is a modern-style kitchen environment, with white cabinets and stainless steel faucets clearly visible, and the wall behind displays a soft beige tone. Light softly streams in through the left window, creating a warm and bright atmosphere. The entire scene uses a shallow depth of field shooting technique, with the main subject clearly prominent, while the background is blurred to enhance visual focus. The composition uses a third-level method, with the person positioned slightly to the right of the frame, leaving enough space to showcase background details. The lighting effect is delicate, with the light source coming from the front left, allowing natural shadow transitions. The overall color tone mainly features a warm and cool contrast, with denim blue harmoniously balanced with the warm skin tones. The image presents a subtle beauty from everyday life, as if captured with a regular camera or phone, with a slight film texture and natural noise, making the image more realistic and lifelike. Details like kitchen utensils in the background, such as hand sanitizer bottles and sinks, are blurry but recognizable, adding authenticity and credibility to the scene. The overall atmosphere is warm and private, conveying a relaxed and carefree lifestyle. The composition is simple yet layered, and the marble countertop texture in the foreground is clearly visible. The figures in the middle of the set have natural postures, and the kitchen setting in the background provides rich narrative threads. The overall composition is full of youthful energy and gentle temperament, possessing strong artistic appeal and emotional resonance",
