        {
          "id": "krea2-4a9e2664009114c881bf0f12",
          "alias": "单女白T恤厨房冷淡站立喝",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a dim kitchen, turning sideways to the camera, adding a touch of laziness and casualness. She wears a loose white T-shirt with the hem slightly lifted, revealing her waist and black lace-up underwear. The overall look is simple yet slightly sexy. She holds a carton of milk in her right hand, drinking from a straw, her expression focused and quiet, as if immersed in her own world. In the foreground is her body silhouette, smooth lines from shoulder to waist, natural folds of the clothing, and light and shadow create a soft transition of light and shadow on the fabric. The middle frame shows the kitchen environment. On the left, you can see some cabinets and countertops, with some blurry kitchenware and containers placed on top. On the right is an old-fashioned refrigerator with several magnets and photos stuck on its surface. The fridge door is slightly open, faintly letting in a cool light inside. The background is a deeper kitchen space, where the light gradually dims. The walls and cabinets appear in dark tones, and the entire space is enveloped in a warm and dim yellow glow, creating a private, tranquil, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The composition uses a medium close-up of the figure, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame. Reserve space on the right to display the refrigerator and background details, with a slightly lower angle to enhance the subject's presence and realism. Then turn to the refrigerator and details in the background, forming a continuous line of sight. Light and shadow come from the upper right, possibly from outside the window or indoor warm sources, creating soft highlights and delicate shadows. At the same time, the background creates a distinct contrast of light and dark. The overall atmosphere blends the casual nature of daily life with the tranquility of artistic photography, featuring the grainy texture and slight noise characteristic of film photography, with colors in warm yellow, Dark gray and black are predominant, with low saturation, emphasizing subtle changes in light and shadow and emotional depth. The image presents a retro yet realistic documentary style, as if capturing an ordinary yet moving moment in an ordinary night",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
