        {
          "id": "krea2-1e94ec18de872c2e2a586175",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣公园坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits gracefully sideways on the withered grass in a park, her body slightly leaning back, her left hand naturally supporting her back, right hand gently resting on her thigh, wearing an off-white knit cardigan paired with a light gray pencil skirt. The sleeves of the cardigan are loose and soft, with delicate lace trim at the neckline. The skirt is tailored and well-tailored, highlighting her long leg lines. Her legs are crossed and overlapped, her ankles are slender, and her toes are painted with light pink nail polish, creating a natural barefoot look. The foreground of the scene is a vast area of withered grass. The grass leaves are densely interwoven, some of which are dry and curled with the changing seasons, the ground uneven and richly detailed. In the foreground, you can see a few scattered fallen leaves and tiny soil grains. In the middle ground, the woman is the main subject, positioned slightly to the left of the frame, with her body extending diagonally to create visual guidance. Her right leg stretches forward, while her left leg is bent and tucked in front. The leg curve is smooth and graceful, the calf muscles are naturally defined, and light streams in from the upper right, creating a soft highlight on the right side of her body, while the left side shows natural shadow transitions. The layers of light and shadow are distinct, with a blurred park background in the background. In the distance, you can see several tall pine trees and shrubs, their leaves interwoven with dark green and brownish-yellow. You can faintly see pedestrians walking through the woods, but due to the shallow depth, the sky appears blurred. The sky shows a faint orange hue at dusk, with thin clouds casting a warm glow. The whole scene creates a peaceful, gentle, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The color tones are mainly warm gray, off-white, and light brown, with low saturation and a slight filmy texture. It feels as if you're shooting with an old digital camera, with slight vignetting at the edges to enhance the retro feel. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward angle, making the characters appear more tall and upright, while also bringing them closer to the audience. The shallow depth of field highlights the subject, while the background blurs into soft color blocks, guiding the viewer from the grass in the foreground to the middle and then extending to the distant woods. The direction of light and shadow is consistent, the contrast between light and shadow is moderate, and there are no harsh light sources. The overall atmosphere is quiet, private, and realistic.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
