        {
          "id": "krea2-d80058bd67388477f2c53083",
          "alias": "单女霓虹夜景困倦站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the center of the foreground of the billiard hall, wearing a black V-neck pleated top that fits her figure. Around her neck is a thin silver necklace. The pendant is a pale blue, irregular teardrop-shaped jade. On her wrist are two slender gold woven bracelets. Her right hand extends forward, fingers forming a V shape, and in her palm is holding a smooth black No. 8 billiard ball. The sphere's surface reflects the colorful colors of the surrounding neon lights, and the white circular area on the sphere clearly shows the number \"8.\" The composition centers on the figure. Using a close-up view, the background is a somewhat blurred billiard hall environment. You can see the green edge of the table, with someone standing in the distance holding cues. Above and above, purple and yellow neon lights are arranged in a staggered pattern, creating a soft halo in the air. The overall lighting atmosphere presents a dreamy urban nightlife atmosphere, creating a strong visual impact. The image has the realistic texture of everyday amateur equipment, with slight noise and motion blur, as if captured instantly by a quick camera on a phone. The composition emphasizes direct interaction between subject and audience, while background blurring enhances spatial layering, presenting an artistic style that combines fashion and street vibes, full of coolness and personal expression in modern youth culture",
