          "id": "krea2-ef9193e800c3189b1000c5bb",
          "alias": "单女黑短裤城市冷淡躺注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a black fitted cropped top and high-waisted black shorts presents a deep brown texture with a subtle sheen. She is bent forward in a highly tense forward posture, her hands naturally hanging down, her right hand gently touching the ground, and her left hand resting on her waist, showcasing her flexible lines and dynamic beauty. Her legs are long and straight, wearing sheer black stockings and pointed high heels, with thin bands wrapped around her ankles. The overall look exudes the fashion sense and confident temperament of a modern urban woman. In the foreground is a black-and-white parking fee column with a smooth surface and a clear \"P\" logo printed on the top. The column bears the brand logo, and its geometric structure is simple yet industrially designed, creating a visual contrast with the figure. The center features a wide gray cement floor with white diagonal markings that create strong perspective and extend deep into the background. The floor texture is delicate and shows slight signs of wear, reflecting an authentic urban atmosphere. The background is the interior space of a modern building, with walls in a light gray-white color The curved ceiling features smooth lines and a simple structure. At the rear is a large metal rolling shutter door, with horizontal stripes reflecting soft light. A faint glow seeps through the door gaps, hinting at the presence of an outdoor space. The entire scene is illuminated by uniform, cool-toned lighting, with light from above, creating a soft transition of shadows. The area where the lower part of the figure touches the ground is slightly projected, enhancing the sense of depth. The natural distribution of light and shadow creates a calm, rational, and slightly detached urban atmosphere. The composition is shot from a low angle. Highlighting the figure's body proportions and dynamic movements, the figure is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, with more blank space on the left side to create visual balance. The parking post is used as a foreground element to enhance depth and layering in the image. The gaze starts from the lower left pillar, follows the diagonal line to the figure's body, and finally focuses on the curved back and leg lines, creating a strong visual flow. The colors are mainly black, white, and gray, paired with metallic textures and the semi-transparent reflection of the stockings, creating a style that blends minimalism with modern aesthetics. The overall atmosphere balances everyday and artistic qualities, as if captured with a professional camera in an underground city parking lot, capturing a quiet yet dynamic moment in urban life. The details are rich, and from the tiny particles on the floor to the seams on the walls, the image presents a highly realistic visual effect. At the same time, it retains a restrained aesthetic and emotional expression, conveying an independent, confident, and calm female image. The overall image presents a unique texture that lies between everyday recording and artistic creation. Like a slice of life captured under natural light with high-end amateur equipment, it is both realistic and dramatic",
