          "id": "krea2-18228b2ebf26c8642a531876",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙城市冷淡站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A curvy woman stands on a sunny outdoor lawn, wearing a form-fitting light pink long dress that perfectly outlines her graceful curves. The neckline is slightly lower, accentuating the neck line and collarbones. A white knit cardigan that naturally drapes over her shoulders drapes over her arms, with sleeves slightly rolled up, adding a touch of casualness and laziness. Her left hand gently touches her waist, while her right hand carries a brown plaid handbag, with the strap slung over her shoulder. She wears a pair of simple silver sandals that reveal her long, fair ankles. The overall posture is elegant and relaxed, full of the fashionable charm of urban women. In the foreground is a vast green lawn that is neatly trimmed, with grass leaves shining brightly under the sunlight. The interplay of light and shadow forms mottled shadows of trees, and the long shadows cast by figures are clearly visible on the ground. In the middle is a modern-style wooden structure building with a wide cantilevered roof and floor-to-ceiling glass windows, reflecting the blue sky, white clouds, and the surrounding environment. The building's lines are simple and smooth, incorporating design elements inspired by Eastern Zen. The background features towering modern skyscrapers. The glass curtain wall shimmers with a cold, blue-gray glow in the sunlight, forming a strong contrast with the blue sky and white clouds. In the distance, other urban architectural clusters can be faintly seen. The sky is a clear blue as if washed, with a few pure white clouds drifting leisurely. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame. Wide-angle shots are used to stretch the spatial sense and create a spacious layer. The visual guide gradually extends from the grassy grass in the foreground to the buildings in the center, ultimately focusing on the tall buildings in the background, creating a strong sense of depth. The light comes from the right side from directly above. It is a typical afternoon sunshine, bright and soft, with clear shadow directions that enhance three-dimensionality and realism. The overall atmosphere is fresh and lively, blending urban modernity with natural ecological atmosphere, presenting a life-like, everyday scene. It feels like real photos taken with a professional camera paired with standard lenses, featuring extremely high detail fidelity and color saturation. The image texture is delicate, color transitions are natural, and light and shadow handling is precise, presenting a photographic style that combines artistic beauty with realism. It was as if capturing a peaceful and beautiful moment, allowing people to feel the rare comfort and composure found in urban life",
