          "id": "krea2-a3225b6cbbe5dde51e703d44",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤公寓忧伤侧头",
          "prompt": "She carries a hint of contemplation and introspection, as if about to say something or drift into some thought. Her pores and fine freckles are clearly visible under high-contrast lighting, revealing a real, unedited skin condition. She wears a black spaghetti-strap camisole with slender straps that outline her collarbones, her back slightly leaned back, and her posture relaxed yet elegant. The right hand rests flat on the wooden tabletop, palm extended, the back of the hand facing upward, wrist lines smooth, nails neatly trimmed. The overall movement conveys a quiet, restrained, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The foreground is part of the tabletop, with natural grain and subtle scratches on the wooden surface, presenting a warm gray tone contrasting with the figure's cool tones. The middle frame depicts the female body and upper body. She is positioned slightly to the left of the painting, with her head slightly tilted and gaze directed toward the viewer. The composition uses the classic rule of thirds, placing the subject at the visual focal point. The background is a simple solid-colored wall in neutral gray, with no decoration or distractions, allowing the viewer to focus entirely on the figure herself. There are prominent film borders around the frame, with the left and right edges printed with \"ILFORD HPS PLUS\" and the number \"4431,\" along with some film symbols such as triangles and circular patterns. These details enhance the photo's realism and retro feel. The composition centers on the person, using a shallow depth of field effect to highlight the subject. The background is well handled with blur, creating a sense of spatial depth. The use of light and shadow is meticulous, with the main light source coming from above to create a contrast of light and shadow. The shadows transition delicately, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, serene, and artistic, with a cinematic narrative quality, as if capturing a moment of privacy, like everyday scenes shot with an old-fashioned film camera. It carries a strong sense of realism and nostalgia, with images showing graininess and slight noise, simulating the texture of real film. The tone is cool, the black-and-white layers are rich, and the transition from extreme light to dark is natural. The details are full, the composition is compact but not crowded, and the blank space is just right. The overall style is simple, restrained, and full of cultural atmosphere, like a page in an old photo album recording an ordinary yet touching moment",
