        {
          "id": "krea2-c7b9c89016fad6f7fcb67d6e",
          "alias": "单女白T恤厨房冷淡坐持杯",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a dimly lit kitchen, her expression calm and slightly lazy, holding a half-full glass of milk. The transparent glass clearly outlines her fingers and the milky liquid inside. She wears a white knitted camisole with slender straps revealing her slender neck and collarbones. The background is a messy yet cozy kitchen environment. To the right is an old-fashioned refrigerator, with several colorful sticky notes and stickers stuck to the door. On the shelves above the fridge are various bottles, jars, cups, and yellow fruits. On the left side is a wooden cabinet with a faint decorative pattern on the door. In front of the cabinet hangs a small warm yellow bulb, emitting a faint glow. The entire shot is shot from a low angle, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right. The composition is compact and layered, with the milk cup in her hand and hand details in the foreground, and kitchen furnishings and miscellaneous items in the background, forming a space that progresses from near to far, extending down the line of sight to the cup in her hand and then spreading into the surrounding environment. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is mainly warm yellow. The light mainly comes from the light bulb in the front left and the faint natural light streaming through the window, creating a hazy and intimate nighttime atmosphere. The overall tone is cool but accented with local warm light, creating a subtle contrast between warm and cool tones. The image has a slight graininess and film texture, simulating the effects of everyday amateur or film camera shooting, as if casually captured on a real night. The color saturation is low, shadows are heavy, and highlights are slightly overexposed, enhancing the retro nostalgia atmosphere. Overall, it presents a tranquil The everyday yet story-filled atmosphere is like an old photo forgotten in a drawer, carrying gentle moments of ordinary life",
