          "id": "krea2-128677f8b478dba57a72bbdf",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙窗边俏皮坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a white plush round carpet, her body slightly turned to the camera, legs naturally extended, toes pointing forward, her posture relaxed and elegant. She wears a light blue sleeveless dress paired with a transparent white long-sleeved shirt. The neckline is high, giving off a gentle yet fashionable look, with natural layering and a soft sheen, adding a touch of playfulness and liveliness. She smiles, looking directly at the camera, exuding warmth and warmth. Her movements are natural and natural, with her left hand placed at her side, fingers slightly bent. The overall posture is full of approachability, with the main subject positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, forming a visual focal point. In the foreground is a soft, fluffy white plush carpet with fine plush edges and a delicate texture. The carpet is laid on a beige carpet, with a short velvet floor material in soft colors. In the middle is a female subject, sitting on the carpet. The background is a white brick wall, neatly arranged with clear gaps. The brick surface has slightly orange-red mottled marks, presenting a retro industrial texture. The wall is clean and tidy. Above, there is a light wood-colored window frame, with blurred glass or paper inside, allowing faint light to shine through, enhancing the sense of spatial layering. The composition uses medium portrait photography, with the figure occupying the main part of the frame. The view is slightly overlooked, creating an intimate and comfortable atmosphere. The visual guide starts with the white carpet in the foreground and extends to the brick wall and window frame in the background, forming a natural flow of sight. Light and shadow come from the front left side, with soft and even lighting, simulating natural light or indoor soft lighting, with soft shadows. There is no strong contrast; the overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, full of the comfort and artistic vibe of everyday life. The main tones are light blue, white, and beige, harmoniously unified and giving a fresh and healing feeling. The image style leans toward everyday photography, with a slight film texture, moderate color saturation, rich details, and clean and crisp images, as if shot with a professional camera combined with a large aperture lens, capturing the true emotions and ambient atmosphere of the moment. At the same time, it retains a natural realism that amateurs can capture with portable devices, presenting an everyday aesthetic style that balances beauty and approachability",
