          "alias": "单女小径俏皮持相机",
          "prompt": "A girl wears a metal cookware as a headpiece, exuding an innocent yet slightly playful expression. Her hands are folded on the edge of a white cabinet in front of her, wearing a loose orange-red long-sleeved top with buttoned cuffs. The main subject is positioned slightly below the center of the foreground, with a low-angle downward angle to highlight the character's cuteness and childlike fun. The background is a warm-toned indoor environment, and on the left is a light pink cork bulletin board with several photos, notes, and hand-drawn designs. On the right is a green wall and a wooden shelf with several pieces of clothing hanging on it, along with a framed painting. In the distance, green checkered curtains emit soft light, creating a cozy homely atmosphere. Light comes from the right rear, creating a soft side light that creates a warm and natural light and shadow effect. The main tones are warm yellow, orange-red, light pink, and light green, creating a harmonious and unified overall tone. The image has a strong sense of daily life and life, as if captured with a regular camera. It has a slight film texture and soft depth blur, with blurred but recognizable details of objects in the background, enhancing spatial layering. Following her line of sight to the upper right of the frame, it forms a natural observation path. The image presents a simple yet authentic aesthetic, combining artistic conception with a sense of life authenticity, suitable for expressing themes of youth, family, and everyday beauty",
