          "id": "krea2-1bbfe8753a73f04c8e275df4",
          "alias": "单女银礼服床困倦站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sat elegantly on a bed covered with white sheets, wearing a luxurious silver sequin strapless gown. The upper half of the dress was made of dark, shiny fabric, adorned with a huge black satin bow at the chest. The skirt was wide and voluminous, woven from countless fine silver sequins and silk threads, presenting flowing wave patterns and a dreamy sheen, like a starry river scattered across the night sky. As she sat down, layered folds and shifting light and shadow formed layers. She leaned slightly to the side, her head slightly tilted, Her expression is calm and slightly thoughtful, revealing a slender neck and delicate earrings. Her makeup is clear and natural, and her overall temperament is noble, elegant, yet gentle. In the foreground, her lower body and part of her arms in the gown occupy most of the space below the frame. The composition uses a slightly upward angle to highlight the figure's upright posture and the gown's gown gown's gown details. The background is a dense wall of deep green plants, with layered leaves with natural shadows and light spots. In the background, a vintage brown wooden box can be faintly seen, adding a touch of nostalgia. The overall lighting is soft and warm, with the main light source coming from the front right of the figure, creating delicate transitions between highlights and shadows, highlighting the gown's texture and the character's contours. The ambient light leans toward warm tones, creating a cozy and romantic indoor atmosphere. The overall image presents a cinematic texture, with silver-gray, black, and white as the main tones, accented by deep green plants and warm brown in the background. The composition is balanced and stable, then returns to natural elements in the background, forming a cyclical visual path. The layers of light and shadow are rich, including bright reflective highlights. There are also deep shadow details, creating an overall atmosphere that is tranquil and poetic, like a bespoke high-end fashion show or precious moments captured in a private space. It has strong artistic appeal and storytelling. The details are clear, the materials authentic, and whether it's the shiny texture of the gown or the vein textures of plants, everything is vivid and lifelike, presenting a sense of luxury and close to life. It feels as if a professional camera was shooting in low-light conditions, with a slight film graininess and natural depth of field. The overall style blends the refinement of fashion shoots with the warmth of everyday photography, creating a beauty that transcends reality",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
