        {
          "id": "krea2-3c182a6ffcbdd6e1c5fa18c4",
          "alias": "单女黑浴袍沙发害羞躺阅读",
          "prompt": "A silver-haired woman wore a delicate black Gothic-style robe, with gold trim adorning the collar and cuffs, and a white lace skirt underneath that revealed elegant layering. She knelt before a classic carved sofa, gently stroking the collar with both hands, her posture dignified yet slightly shy, slightly tilting her head toward the camera as if gazing into a distant dream. In the background was a dark wooden carved sofa embroidered with vintage patterns. Brownish-yellow cushions were stacked on the sofa, giving a heavy yet warm texture. On the left side sat an antique gramophone. The metal speaker's surface is engraved with exquisite patterns, and beside it lies a bright red rose quietly. Its petals are full and vibrant, and in the foreground lie several heavy books. The spines vary in color, and the covers are worn to show signs of age. The pages are slightly flipped, as if they've just been read. The entire scene is shot at a low angle, with the figure as the center. The book and gramophone in the background form visual guides, with light and shadow streaming in from the upper left, creating a dramatic sense of depth. Warm yellow light streams through curtains or windows into the room. This makes the overall atmosphere feel warm and nostalgic. The air seems to be filled with a faint scent of vintage wood, leather, and paper. The tones are mainly black, gold, and brown, accented with white and red. The color combinations are harmonious and layered, presenting a unique temperament that blends classical aesthetics with modern fantasy. It resembles a meticulously painted oil painting or a real moment captured with an old film camera. The details are rich and delicate, each item carries a story, and the overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic. It was as if time had stood still at this moment, leaving only the world she lived in silently telling the secrets of that era",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
