        {
          "id": "krea2-51aad5d492a348e4c667991e",
          "alias": "单女旗袍山野困倦站立持扇",
          "prompt": "An Eastern woman dressed in a teal silk qipao stands inside a classical Chinese pavilion. The qipao is embroidered with delicate subtle leaf patterns, the collar adorned with red frog buttons, and a white sheer shawl over it. The edges of the shawl are decorated with delicate tassels, making the overall look elegant and full of traditional charm. Her right hand gently supports the dark wooden pillar of the pavilion, her fingers slender and long, while her left hand hangs naturally, holding a folding fan with a black handle. However, the pavilion is smooth in texture. The pavilion structure is constructed from dark brown solid wood, with curved railings carved with simple geometric patterns. The background is dense tropical plants, with large, broad banana leaves layered in layers, presenting different layers of emerald green tones. The leaves have natural veined patterns and faint water droplet reflections. In the distance, more greenery and blurred architectural outlines can be faintly seen. Soft natural light streams through the gaps in the leaves, creating a mottled light effect, with light streaming in from the upper left. It creates a warm and tranquil atmosphere. On the left side of the painting hangs a yellow lantern, hexagonal and emitting a warm yellow glow, creating a visual contrast with the surrounding cool green tones. The pavilion pillars and railings in the foreground form a framed composition, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The center is the main subject and nearby plants, while the background features layers of green leaves and hazy distant mountain outlines. The colors are mainly turquoise, dark brown, and off-white, accented with a small amount of red and yellow. The overall tone is harmonious and unified, with delicate light and shadow treatment and soft transitions of shadows, creating a tranquil, poetic, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. It feels as if frozen on a summer afternoon, time flows slowly, and the scene is filled with Eastern aesthetics. It combines the elegance of traditional clothing with the refinement of modern aesthetics, like a meticulously painted meticulous painting or a real scene shot with an old film camera, with slight graininess and natural color deviations. It enhances realism and a sense of era, presenting an artistic beauty that is both dreamy and close to everyday life",
