        {
          "id": "krea2-6ee57f7958bab413c2e7586b",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫沉思站立注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a loose white V-neck shirt made of lightweight, breathable fabric, with naturally falling cuffs that reveal slender arm lines. A black camisole is faintly visible underneath, creating a striking color contrast. She wears black shorts, her legs long and well-proportioned, her posture relaxed and natural, as if she is about to stand up or has just stopped, her expression tinged with contemplation and tenderness. The overall posture is full of youthful energy and casual beauty. The foreground is the main subject, occupying about one-third of the lower part of the frame. In composition, low-angle downward shots enhance the visual impact and sense of spatial depth. The middle ground shows the air and light around the figures, with light slanting down from above, creating a three-dimensional texture. The background is a vast sky, with fluffy white clouds covering the blue sky. Cloud layers vary in thickness and shape, with some cloud edges illuminated by sunlight, presenting bright silhouettes. The rest of the area has a faint gray-blue tone, harmoniously blending with the blue sky in a gradient layer. The sky occupies most of the composition, creating a sense of open space. The composition uses an asymmetrical layout: the figure leans to the left, leaving a large area of sky on the right to enhance visual extension. The vastness of the sky highlights the character's smallness and freedom. The visual guide naturally extends from the curves of the figure's body and gaze into the depths of the sky, evoking a sense of freedom and openness. For lighting and shadow, natural daylight is used, with the light source coming from the upper right. It creates a soft side backlight effect, making the contours of the figure clear. The folds of clothing create delicate light and dark changes, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is fresh and bright, full of summer vibes, giving a sense of relaxation, joy, and freedom. The main color tones are blue and white, with simple and harmonious color combinations that have strong visual appeal. The style leans toward realistic daily photography, with a slight film texture and natural noise, making it feel like a moment casually captured with a phone or portable camera. It preserves realistic light and shadow changes and detailed textures, while also possessing a certain artistic aesthetic. It is suitable for social media sharing or personal portrait creations, conveying an overall image that conveys a youthful, natural, tranquil, and slightly lazy aesthetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
