        {
          "id": "krea2-755b6792e2a8258de53ffca1",
          "alias": "单女制服窗边跪持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in traditional Japanese sailor uniform kneels in an indoor archery range covered with tatami mats. She wears a white short-sleeved shirt paired with a deep green pleated skirt, with a red bow tie at the neckline. Her right hand grips the bow tightly, while the left hand draws the bowstring fully, showing a standard archery stance. Her fingers are long and strong, and her wrist is adorned with a simple bracelet. Her overall posture is elegant and powerful. In the foreground is a wooden bow in her hand, naturally light brown with a warm texture, and the string is taut, showing tension about to be launched. In the background, several wooden target frames marked with numbers can be seen. The positions numbered 1 and 5 are clearly visible. The frame structure is simple, reflecting traditional Japanese architectural style. The floor is neatly laid with tatami mats with fine texture, edged with black trim. Light streams in diagonally from the upper left of the frame, creating a soft side light, casting clear shadows on the floor, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, highlighting the subject's status and momentum. The visual guide line points from the bow to the shot. It enhances direct interaction with viewers, with rich layers of light and shadow and sharp contrasts of light and shadow. Sunlight streams through the window, creating a tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The overall image has a strong realist style, as if shot with a high-resolution amateur camera. The image quality is authentic and natural, color fidelity is high, details are clear, and the background slightly blurred depth of field, highlighting the main subject. The entire scene is filled with youthful vitality blending traditional culture, full of ritual and focus. The images present a unique beauty that lies between artistic photography and everyday life, combining the freshness of academic style with respect and inheritance of traditional skills, as if capturing an ordinary yet extraordinary moment, allowing one to feel the spiritual core carried by archery.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
