        {
          "id": "krea2-2784425a06e8c2a3695f5d4b",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙街道困倦坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden bench outdoors, wearing a white lace dress with a light and flowing hem, delicate ruffles on the shoulders, and short puff sleeves. The overall look is fresh and sweet, with a touch of Japanese style. She leans slightly to the side, crossing her legs—right leg in front and left leg behind. She wears a pair of white ankle boots, gently holding a golden lemon in her left hand. Her fingers are long and fair, and on her wrist is a thin silver bracelet. The bracelet is simple yet exquisite, emitting a faint metallic sheen, naturally draped over her shoulder. She appears serene and contemplative, her right hand naturally resting on her knee, her posture relaxed and elegant. Her whole body exudes a lazy beauty. In the foreground, the woman's body occupies the main position of the composition, fully visible from waist to head. The composition uses a medium to near perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame, creating an asymmetrical visual balance. The background is a dense patch of green plants, with broad leaves and clear edges, presenting different layers of green tones. The transition from light green to deep green is natural, with sunlight filtering through the gaps in the leaves to cast dappled light and shadow, forming soft light spots and scattered light, creating a warm and dreamy atmosphere. In the distance, faint yellow architectural structures can be seen, possibly part of window frames or porches, adding spatial depth to the scene. Although the sky is partially obscured, you can feel the bright natural light shining down from above. The light is soft and even, without strong shadows. The overall color palette is mainly white, green, and yellow, with harmonious and unified color combinations, presenting a fresh and natural summer atmosphere with delicate light and shadow effects. It reflects a soft sheen, while the shadows are relatively light, contrasting with the green leaves in the background. Following her line of sight to the right side of the painting, the bright yellow lemon draws attention, and finally returns to the full contours of the figure, forming a complete visual loop. The composition combines slanted and curved lines; the figure's sitting posture and leg lines form smooth arcs, while the tree trunks and branches in the background naturally tilt at angles, enhancing the dynamic and breathable atmosphere of the scene. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and warm. It feels like a leisurely moment with a gentle afternoon sun and gentle breeze. The image carries a strong sense of realism and a sense of life, like a real scene shot with a professional camera. At the same time, it carries a touch of artistic filtering to make the colors more saturated and soft, with rich details and authentic texture. The entire image is full of youthful vitality and poetic beauty, evoking a sense of simple and pure beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
