        {
          "id": "krea2-0574f418a65cb5ff1a160b73",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫教室坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden desk and chair in the classroom, wearing a white long-sleeved shirt paired with a gray pleated skirt and pink striped tie in a school uniform. She curls her legs together on the chair, hands folded on her knees, black leather wristbands on her wrists, black stockings and shiny dark brown Mary Jane shoes on her feet, adorned with metal buckles on the upper. On her left hand sits a black leather backpack with gold metal fasteners and shoulder straps, set against a pure white curtain, creating a clean and simple visual environment. In the foreground, the edges of the desk and the backpack are blurred, creating a shallow depth of field effect that highlights the main subject. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, making the figure appear taller and more approachable. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, with a slightly tilted body, presenting a naturally relaxed posture. Light is soft and evenly transmitted from the front, with smooth shadow transitions without strong contrasts of light and dark. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and warm, carrying a touch of youthful campus nostalgia. The main colors are black, white, and gray. Accented with pink and dark brown, the visual layers are rich yet not cluttered. Details such as clothing folds, stocking textures, and shoe reflections are clearly visible, enhancing realism. The entire scene looks like a studio photo shot with a professional camera, preserving the simplicity and beauty of student days in daily life, full of story and emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
