        {
          "id": "krea2-2d05b378a7e9f2e2fca64a2c",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔户外俏皮站立展示",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors in a natural setting, wearing a white off-shoulder long-sleeve top with \"good luck\" printed on the chest and colorful embroidery, paired with blue high-waisted denim shorts. The edges of the shorts feature irregular frayed edges and red decorative details. The overall look is fashionable and casual, showcasing youthful energy and personal charm. Her expression is confident with a hint of coolness, her makeup is exquisite, and she wears a gold necklace and earrings around her neck, adding a touch of elegance. Her left hand gently rests on the light-colored tiled railing behind her. The body is slightly tilted, presenting graceful curves. The background is a blurred green plant with dense leaves and rich layers, creating a fresh and natural atmosphere. The light is soft and even, coming from natural light and illuminating from the front slightly above, with delicate shadows. The overall color scheme is mainly green and white, accented with blue and gold, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The composition uses a mid-field portrait, with the figure positioned slightly centered to the left, occupying the main position in the painting to highlight the subject. The background is blurred to enhance visual focus, with the foreground featuring the figure and railing. The middle ground features the figure's body and part of the background, with blurred greenery, creating a distinct sense of spatial layering. The transition between light and shadow is smooth, the contrast between light and dark is moderate, creating a peaceful, comfortable, and lively atmosphere. The overall image has the realistic texture of everyday shooting, as if captured under natural light with a professional camera or high-end phone. The details are rich, the texture is realistic, with slight film graininess and enhanced color saturation, presenting a style that combines artistic beauty with everyday authenticity, suitable for fashion portraits, Lifestyle display or social media content creation",
