        {
          "id": "krea2-2c3b6a7a5bf8b55cd33a6b2c",
          "alias": "单女白背心困倦演奏",
          "prompt": "She wears a white sleeveless top paired with a deep blue pleated short skirt, with gold decorations at the collar and cuffs, highlighting the character's uniform features. Her legs are paired with red-and-white striped over-the-knee socks and gray knee-high boots with red accents at the edges. The overall design is full of youthful energy and ACG aesthetics. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, with a slight tilt of the body, right leg raised and bent, knee raised high, forming a graceful S-shaped curve that showcases dynamic beauty. The foreground features a clear full-body close-up, with a blurred background, faintly revealing modern urban architectural structures, including metal frames, glass curtain walls, and blurry billboards. The sky appears a bright pale blue, with sunlight streaming down from the upper right, creating a natural backlighting effect and a warm and dreamy atmosphere. The composition uses a medium shot, with the subject occupying most of the space. The shallow depth of field highlights the subject, while the background elements are softened into abstract blocks of color and lines. Looking directly at the camera conveys a gentle yet slightly mysterious emotion. The layers of light and shadow are rich, highlights are bright and transparent, shadows transition delicately, and the overall color scheme is mainly blue and white, supplemented by red and white stripes as visual highlights. The color combinations are harmonious and impactful, presenting the texture of everyday life shot with a professional camera, as if on a clear afternoon. The photographer used a wide-aperture lens to capture moments, blending realism with artistry, preserving the fantasy colors of role-playing while incorporating real-world lighting, shadows, and environmental details. The entire scene is filled with youthful energy and the charm of anime culture",
