        {
          "id": "krea2-51a741f39ab663320f365b7c",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫街道沉思坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a yellow fire hydrant on a city street, wearing a white turtleneck short-sleeved top paired with a gray plaid mini skirt and black stockings, paired with black pointed high heels decorated with metal chain details. The overall look is elegant and sharp, fingers lightly touching the screen, her posture relaxed yet tinged with contemplation. On her left wrist is a black lanyard with a small device or ID hanging from it. Her right hand hangs naturally, fingertips close to the ground, where a newspaper and a black folder are scattered. The composition centers on the figures, using a medium perspective. The figures occupy the main part of the composition, with their bodies slightly leaning forward and legs crossed, forming graceful curved lines. The background is a city street, with gray asphalt roads featuring white traffic markings. In the distance, you can see the walls of buildings and a dark gate. Next to the door stands an orange-and-white traffic cone, adding a touch of life. The building walls have a light gray stone texture with delicate texture, and light and shadow cast soft shadows on the walls. The overall tone is cool, using gray, white, Black is the main color, accented with a touch of orange and yellow, creating a sense of urban calm and detachment. The light comes from natural daylight, shining from the upper right and forming natural shadows on the left to enhance the sense of depth. The shadows fall on the ground and fire hydrants, creating clear layers. The background is moderately blurred to highlight the main subject while preserving environmental information. The composition uses diagonal street lines and arrow markings on the ground to guide the viewer's gaze, focusing on the characters' movements and expressions. The visual center is on the person's head and hands, emphasizing their focused state. The overall atmosphere blends the everyday life of a modern city with an artistic tranquility, as if capturing a brief pause in an ordinary workday. It combines the independent temperament of a professional woman with a hint of loneliness and contemplation. The visuals present a realistic and slightly cinematic visual style, as if shot by a professional camera, with rich details, high color fidelity, natural clothing folds, soft reflections in stockings, and metal decorations on high heels that glow faintly under the light. The overall visuals have strong narrative and emotional tension, full of storytelling. Like a portrait of contemporary urban life, combining fashionable beauty with a realistic tone",
          "description": "",
