        {
          "id": "krea2-7f0963c6d92075ff773631a7",
          "alias": "单女白礼服霓虹夜景冷淡倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a white deep V-neck high-slit gown gracefully leans against the front of a white SUV. Her right hand gently strokes the hood, while her left hand hangs naturally, her body slightly leaning to the side, revealing her long legs and graceful curves. Wearing exquisite earrings, her makeup is fresh and natural, and her overall posture is full of fashion and sophistication. This includes a large grille, sharp LED headlights, and a bumper design with black trim. The car's paint is smooth like a mirror, reflecting the cool-toned light of the surrounding environment. The middle ground is a combination of the female subject and the vehicle. The background is a blurred auto show hall environment, where you can see other visitors and the outline of the booth. The lighting is soft with a slight blue tint, creating an atmosphere that blends technology and modernity. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center and the vehicle occupying the main space on the left side, creating visual balance. The shallow depth of field effect highlights the subject, the background blur enhances the sense of layering, and the visual guide lines are formed by the curves of the woman's body and the lines of the vehicle. Extending from the lower left to the upper right, the lighting uses professional lighting, with the main light source coming from the upper front and forming highlight areas on the body. The shadowed areas transition naturally, with scattered lights and neon strips in the background creating a soft halo effect. The overall atmosphere combines the refinement of commercial advertising with the aesthetic style of artistic photography, presenting a high-end, elegant, modern, and dynamic visual experience, as if it were a high-quality portrait shot at a large international auto show. It offers strong visual impact and fashionable expression, with delicate image texture, moderate color saturation, harmonious contrast between warm and cool tones, and rich details. It retains the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting while maintaining professional-grade image quality. Just like capturing moments in low-light environments with a full-frame camera paired with a prime lens, noise control is well controlled, dynamic range is wide, presenting light and shadow reproduction close to real scenes. The entire image exudes a calm, rational, yet warm aesthetic atmosphere",
