        {
          "id": "krea2-0460e7d9e716b87114a20a7f",
          "alias": "单女旗袍窗边忧伤坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the wooden floor of a traditional Japanese building, wearing a bright burgundy sleeveless qipao with a collar designed in traditional Chinese style and decorated with delicate frog buttons. The cut of the qipao fits the figure while retaining an elegant drape. The skirt naturally spreads across the deep brown wooden floor, presenting soft folds and light and shadow changes. Her expression reveals a restrained tranquility and a subtle melancholy. She sits barefoot on the ground, legs crossed, right leg bent in front, left leg straight, her posture naturally relaxed yet deliberately beautifully sculpted The right hand rests gently on the knee, fingers long, shining warmly in the sunlight. The background is a typical traditional Japanese interior space. On the left is a row of wood-framed lattice sliding doors. The glass window panels let in outside light, creating a mottled light effect. The door frame and floor are made of dark solid wood with clearly visible grain. In the distance to the right is a dark wooden cabinet or antique rack, on which sits a potted green plant. Its leaves are broad and lush, giving it a natural green tone. The overall environment feels rustic and full of life. The shot uses a shallow depth of field technique, with the focus on the subject. The background is blurred, emphasizing the subject's sense of depth and layering. In composition, the figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, with a slight tilt. The gaze and camera create a subtle exchange, creating a quiet, private, and story-rich atmosphere. Light streams in diagonally through the left window, creating a warm side backlight effect. At the same time, long shadows are cast on the floor, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow that enhances the dramatic and artistic feel of the image. The overall color palette features warm brown, dark red, Dark green is the main color, with harmonious and unified colors and a realistic texture. It feels as if a high-sensitivity film camera captured a moment at dusk, presenting a vintage, nostalgic, yet modern aesthetic visual style. The details are rich, layers are distinct, and it exudes a strong cinematic feel and photographic aesthetics, like a carefully composed artistic portrait photograph capturing a gentle moment in a quiet afternoon",
