        {
          "id": "krea2-1301388b3f5d71be77ab66bd",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣小巷温柔站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a city alley, her overall temperament natural and approachable. She wears a gray fitted knit vest paired with a white ribbed cardigan. The cardigan is not fully buttoned up, revealing the outline of her inner layer. She wears a black high-waisted skirt with a slim silhouette and smooth lines. She carries an orange spaghetti shoulder bag across her body, with the strap draped from her right shoulder to her left waist, adding a splash of color to her overall look. Her hands are folded in front of her, her posture elegant and unpretentious, her body slightly turned to the side. A natural side profile is presented, with blurred city streets or alleys in the background, faint outlines of buildings on both sides, walls grayish-white, evoking a sense of life. In the distance, there are slight light spots and blur effects, creating a soft sense of depth. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, the visual focus clear, the subject prominent, the background bokeh delicate and layered, light from the upper right side, sunlight filtering through the gaps between buildings, smooth transitions of light and shadow, and the overall tone is warm and bright, using off-white and gray Black is the main focus, accented with orange as the visual focal point. The atmosphere is calm and everyday, as if capturing a real moment on an afternoon street. The image texture is authentic and delicate, with rich details and no signs of excessive embellishment, presenting a realistic feel similar to amateur camera shooting. The image has a strong sense of presence and a sense of life, as if viewers can feel the breeze and warm sunlight. The composition is simple yet full of tension, with clear foreground figures and natural transitions in the middle shot. The background is well blurred, extending along the line of sight to the body's curves. Guided by the shoulder straps into the background, the overall rhythm is smooth and narrative, with well-balanced light and shadow distribution and moderate contrast, creating a warm, intimate, and authentic urban life scene. The tones are harmonious and unified, with moderate saturation, not exaggerated, giving a calm and beautiful feeling. The whole scene resembles a carefully composed street photography, combining artistic beauty with a sense of realism in life, making one imagine the girl just leaving a café, preparing to head to her next destination, or simply pausing in her tracks. Enjoy a moment of tranquility, with images full of storytelling and emotional resonance, as if you can hear distant car sounds and voices, feeling the pulse and warmth of the city",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
