        {
          "id": "krea2-dea545b426447538dea041f4",
          "alias": "单女灰外套废墟愤怒坐书写",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an abandoned railway track, wearing a long dark gray coat over a black turtleneck sweater, loose blue jeans, and brown lace-up boots. She lowers her head, focused on writing in a yellowed notebook, holding a blue pen in her hand. Her posture relaxed and calm, her expression gentle yet tinged with thought and detachment. Her left hand gently supports the notebook, her right hand writing, her body slightly leaning, presenting a casual yet elegant posture. The main focus is in the lower right, occupying about one-third of the scene The composition uses a low-angle shot, with the figure extending from the lower left corner to the upper right, forming a diagonal line. The foreground features clear tracks and gravel running across the frame, with a noticeable metallic texture and wear marks at the edges. The gravel grains are distinct and richly detailed. The middle frame shows the full-body silhouette of a woman, with a row of blurred blue-and-white buildings in the background. The walls look somewhat old, windows are neatly arranged, and the air conditioning outdoor unit is faintly visible. The overall background is blurred, creating a shallow depth of field effect that highlights the subject. Light comes from the right rear side. It is a soft backlight or side backlight, where sunlight filters through the clouds, casting a warm golden halo along the edges of the figure's contours to create a sense of layering. The contrast between light and shadow is strong but not glaring. The color tone is mainly cool blue, paired with warm yellow sunlight, creating a warm and cool contrast that enhances visual impact. The overall atmosphere of the image is peaceful, artistic, and slightly nostalgic, as if capturing a personal quiet moment in a corner of the city. It has the texture of film photography, with moderate color saturation, slight graininess, and slightly overexposed exposure. Highlight details are preserved, and the visuals have the realism of everyday amateur equipment, like moments captured with an old camera. The composition is asymmetrical yet balanced, the subjects' gaze guides viewers toward the distance, and the railway tracks extend deep into the background, enhancing spatial depth. Overall, it presents a poetic and lonely feeling in the city, suitable for imagery that expresses themes of youth, reflection, growth, or urban life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
