        {
          "id": "krea2-5f0d8f9a3927ead153fb25cd",
          "alias": "单女灰短裙窗边忧伤坐指向",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window on a beige fabric sofa. She wears a soft, fluffy white plush long-sleeve top with slightly sliding shoulders revealing her collarbones. She pairs a light gray and white plaid short skirt with a skirt that naturally falls to her thighs. Her legs are together and straight, wearing pure white over-the-knee socks, her toes pointing toward the camera. Her posture is elegant yet slightly lazy, her fingers naturally bent, her expression slightly thoughtful or slightly melancholic. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the center. The foreground features a clear outline of the sofa and the lower body of the figure, the middle ground shows the upper body and part of the sofa backrest. Through the large window, the background presents a blurred outdoor city street scene. In the distance, you can see the silhouettes of several low buildings and sparse trees. The window edges have slight reflections, and the indoor light is soft and even. The main light source comes from the natural light outside the left window, creating a warm side backlight effect. Light streams in diagonally from outside, creating soft and unobtrusive shadows, creating a quiet and peaceful afternoon atmosphere. The composition uses the classic three-part layout, with the figure occupying the left third of the painting and a large blank space on the right to enhance visual balance. At the same time, window frames are used as natural frame structures to guide the gaze toward the subject, which then flows downward along the body lines, creating a smooth viewing path. The colors are mainly white, beige, and light gray, complemented by light purple curtains and cool-toned cityscapes outside, creating a warm contrast and highlighting the characters' warm texture. The overall image presents a realistic moment captured in daily life, as if taken with a regular camera at home, with slight film graininess and natural noise. Exposure is slightly underexposed but details are well preserved, with warm tones emphasizing realism and the sense of life. The background blur is well handled, and the depth of field is relatively shallow, making the subject stand out clearly. The surrounding environment is moderately blurred, enhancing spatial layering. The overall image is filled with a sense of tranquility, privacy, and gentleness, as if you can hear the gentle breeze outside the window. This beauty in everyday scenes is carefully captured, presenting an artistic atmosphere that is both authentic and slightly dreamy",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
