        {
          "id": "krea2-deb9c559677800dd3e284730",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙温柔站立注视",
          "prompt": "She wore a simple white slip dress with slender straps outlining her graceful collarbone. Her fingers were long, nails painted with pale pink polish, and she held a white petal in her hand, her posture elegant and natural. In the foreground was a cluster of blooming white flowers, with layers of petals and slightly yellow stamens, naturally curved branches, some of the flowers slightly scorched. This creates a soft blur effect, increasing the sense of layering and depth in the image. The background is a blurred indoor environment, with faint outlines of dark furniture and light-colored walls, creating a quiet and intimate spatial atmosphere. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the main figure occupying the main position, heads slightly tilted, and gaze directly at the camera, creating strong visual guidance. The light comes from the front slightly left, with no obvious shadows, highlighting the texture of the skin and the details of the clothing folds. The background light is slightly dim, making the subject stand out even more. The colors are mainly white, off-white, and light gray, complemented by a touch of green and brown. The overall tone is fresh and elegant, full of poetry and romance. The image presents a tranquil and beautiful atmosphere, as if capturing a peaceful moment in the early morning or dusk, like shooting indoors in natural light with a high-resolution full-frame camera. The lens is an 85mm prime portrait lens with an aperture of f/1.8, shutter speed of 1/125 sec, ISO 100, obvious background blur, rich detail, and clear textures. It features a cinematic shallow depth of field effect, with an overall style leaning toward Japanese photography, featuring a slight film graininess and warm filters, giving a warm and nostalgic feel. There are no unnecessary decorations in the frame; all elements serve the main subject, creating a pure, natural, and artistically beautiful visual experience",
          "description": "",
