        {
          "id": "krea2-288e0bef8a77cb5fc8713140",
          "alias": "单女白外套窗边坐（2）",
          "prompt": "A woman sits indoors, presenting a soft sheen and delicate texture, appearing light and layered. Her fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed with a natural sheen. Her arms are dressed in an off-white loose sleeve coat with deep blue cuffs adorned with two brown stripes. The shoulders feature dark blue suspenders, the fabric is soft and puffy, with natural pleats. The overall style resembles collegiate or Japanese sailor uniforms The background is a blurry indoor environment with warm tones, faintly visible furniture outlines and soft lighting. Light shines from the front side, creating soft highlights and shadows. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with people occupying most of the space. The background is blurred, and a shallow depth of field effect is used to highlight the subject. In the foreground, some white fabric or bedsheets can be seen with slightly wrinkled edges, adding realism and a sense of life. The overall color scheme is harmonious, using off-white and deep blue Brown as the main tone, paired with warm yellow lighting, creates a cozy and cozy family atmosphere that evokes emotional resonance. The use of light and shadow is delicate, emphasizing three-dimensionality and material details. The atmosphere is tranquil and slightly artistic, as if capturing a moment of afternoon sunlight streaming through the window, like everyday photos taken casually at home with a regular camera. Authentic and natural, without excessive embellishment, preserving the chance and realism of daily life. The overall image has a strong artistic beauty and emotional tension. It lets people feel the innocence of youth and the softness of the heart.",
