        {
          "id": "krea2-4772993f009c12d79055f2f1",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙沙发神秘持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a black strap dress with blue and yellow floral patterns. The fabric is smooth and has a silky sheen, and the fitted cut highlights her graceful figure. The V-neck design reveals her collarbones and part of her chest, the straps are slim, fingers are long, and her nails are neatly trimmed. Her left hand rests naturally on her thigh. With an elegant and composed posture, she wears a pair of gold hoop earrings. The earrings are of moderate size and complement the overall look. The background is the interior of a luxurious restaurant, with deep blue wood paneling on the walls, arched windows and wall lamps adorned with golden frames. A magnificent crystal chandelier hangs from the ceiling, emitting a warm golden glow. The light softly illuminates the figure, creating a contrast of light and shadow and creating a cozy and luxurious atmosphere. Other tables and chairs can be seen in the distance, but these are blurred to highlight the main figure. The foreground features the backrest and armrests of a blue sofa, with bright colors that create a strong color contrast with the character's black dress. The middle ground shows the person's entire body and surroundings, including chairs, tables, and some background elements. The background includes the dining room walls, windows, and lighting, with clear layers and clever use of light and shadow. The main light source comes from above and in front, with natural shadow transitions, and the overall tone is deep blue. Black and gold are the main colors, creating an elegant, noble, and slightly mysterious atmosphere. The images are rich in detail and realistic, as if shot with a professional camera. They have cinematic quality and artistic feel while retaining the realism of everyday amateur equipment. The lighting is soft, color saturation is moderate, the image is clear without excessive embellishment, presenting a genuine and beautiful moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
