        {
          "id": "krea2-ef7de0cf8a217f89772f90e9",
          "alias": "单女粉毛衣室内忧伤倚靠",
          "prompt": "When slightly open, she reveals a natural sheen. She wears a light pink knit sweater with delicate texture and clearly visible knitting patterns. The cuffs have pleats that add a touch of vintage elegance. Her shoulders are slightly tilted, her body leans back slightly, and her head turns to one side to form a graceful curve. The overall posture appears both relaxed and attractive, occupying the main part of the frame. The center frame is the outline of her shoulders and arms, with a pure light beige wall background with subtle textures and no obvious decoration or distractions. The composition uses a visual layout slightly to the right center, with the figure positioned on the right side of the frame, leaving space on the left to create a balanced visual relationship. A large aperture is used to create a shallow depth of field, with a soft background blur that highlights the subject, ultimately resting on the texture details of the clothing. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft. The light source comes from the front left, creating uniform diffused light. Shadows transition naturally, without harsh boundaries. The overall color palette is mainly warm white and light pink, creating a peaceful, cozy, and comfortable atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, as if shot indoors by a professional camera, with slight film graininess and realistic exposure, presenting beautiful moments captured unintentionally in daily life. The images are rich in layers and storytelling, conveying a gentle, restrained, and slightly melancholic youthful atmosphere. The composition is simple yet detailed. The colors are harmonious and unified, possessing a strong artistic appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
