        {
          "id": "krea2-c3eb5ca2aefbca98a2c0118d",
          "alias": "单女T恤微笑坐持食物",
          "prompt": "Her smile is bright and infectious. She wears a light-colored floral camisole top, layered with a semi-transparent white mesh long-sleeved top. The sleeves are loose and flowing, the short hem reveals a slender waistline, and she wears light blue denim shorts with slightly brushed hems. The waist zipper is slightly open, faintly revealing the colorful pattern underneath. Her left hand holds a white ice cream cone, her fingers gently gripping the wooden handle. The ice cream is spiral-shaped, with the top slightly melted, exuding a cool scent. She wears a pair of white starfish-shaped earrings, uniquely designed and full of summer charm. She sits sideways, leaning slightly forward, her posture naturally relaxed, as if interacting closely with the viewer. The background is a blurry blue pool surface, presenting a soft gradient effect. The transition from deep blue to light blue is natural, the water surface sparkling, reflecting the light from the sky, creating a peaceful and cozy atmosphere. The overall composition uses medium to close-up shots. The figure occupies the center-left position, forming a visual focal point. The background blur enhances the subject's sense of depth and spatial layering. Light and shadow come from the upper front, with no obvious shadows, highlighting the texture of the skin and the transparency of the clothing. The colors are mainly blue and white, accented with warm floral patterns in pink and yellow. The contrast between warm and cool is sharp yet harmonious, creating a fresh and bright overall atmosphere, full of summer energy and youthful energy, like shooting with an old film camera on a sunny afternoon. The lens has a slight graininess and slight chromatic dispersion, with faint vignetting at the edges of the frame, creating a nostalgic and realistic photographic feel. The ripples in the pool in the background are delicate and smooth, naturally blurring as the distance increases. The fabric texture and transparency are rendered extremely realistic, presenting an overall dreamlike beauty—like a carefully crafted artwork or a snapshot of everyday life, evoking a relaxed and joyful mood and a longing for beautiful times",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
