        {
          "id": "krea2-60d5584d3101669f5a972658",
          "alias": "单女灰外套城市微笑倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman leans against the dappled trunk of a plane tree, wearing a gentle smile. She slightly tilts her head to look at the camera with a natural smile. Her overall aura is fresh and sweet, appearing healthy and energetic. She wears a light gray-white hooded jacket with a simple and modern design, featuring a black zipper and brand logo. The cuffs are decorated with black details, paired with matching shorts in the same color to reveal her long legs. Her posture is naturally relaxed, one hand gently tucked into the jacket pocket, the other naturally hanging down, her body slightly tilted. Elegant curves are presented. The main subject is on the right, occupying about two-thirds of the composition's space. The left side leaves a wide visual space, with blurred city streets in the background. Lush trees form soft light spots, sunlight filters through the leaves, casting dappled shadows, and the ground casts tiny light spots. In the distance, you can faintly see parked vehicles and building silhouettes, but all are blurred to create a tranquil urban atmosphere. The middle ground features blurred tree shadows and streets, with clear layers, and the foreground features clear bark textures. It presents a unique texture of alternating white and brown, with a rough and uneven surface and rich details. The composition uses the classic three-part method, with the figure standing to the right, while the trunk serves as vertical lines to enhance the stability of the image. Light and shadow come from the upper left, with soft backlighting outlining the figure's outline and natural shadow transitions. The overall color scheme mainly features a fresh contrast of warm and cool tones, with green, white, and gray harmoniously unified, creating a peaceful, warm, and slightly artistic afternoon atmosphere. The painting has a strong sense of everyday life. It feels like shooting casually with a regular camera, yet it captures the most authentic and moving moments. The details are rich, color saturation is moderate, out-of-focus imaging is natural, depth of field is precisely controlled, presenting a texture similar to film photography. The overall atmosphere is warm, tranquil, and full of life, like an ordinary yet beautiful street encounter scene, allowing people to feel the purity of youth and the beauty of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
