        {
          "id": "krea2-d5cdaf74555b60ccb4a0d6c2",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙街道微笑坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the driver's seat of a luxury car, wearing a simple and elegant white spaghetti strap dress with a naturally flowing hem. The fabric is light and soft with delicate pleats, presenting a sophisticated matte sheen that drapes naturally over her shoulders and chest, adding a touch of laziness and allure. She leans slightly to the side, leaning on the black leather seat, her arms naturally resting on the edge of the car door. Her posture is relaxed and full of tension, and she gazes at the camera with a gentle smile, as if light seems to shine through. The main focus is positioned slightly to the right of the middle frame. Occupying the visual center, the composition uses close-ups, with the character's head and upper body fully presented. The background is a blurred interior environment, including black leather seats, exquisitely stitched door linings, window glass, and the blurred city street scene outside, creating a strong sense of depth. On the left side of the foreground, there is a slight obstruction, possibly part of the door handle or mirror, forming a natural framed composition that guides the gaze to the figure. Light and shadow slanting in from the right window create a soft side backlight. It creates natural highlights and shadow layers, with warm and pure light tinged with golden tones reminiscent of morning or evening. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, private, and full of modern urban elegance. The tones are mainly black, white, and gray, accented with highlights from white clothing, creating a clean yet sophisticated color contrast. The details are rich, presenting a realistic and delicate photographic texture, like shooting with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens, capturing a moment of tranquility and beauty. The whole scene feels like an unintentional moment in daily life. Yet carefully frozen into an artistic portrait, conveying a gentle, independent, confident, and slightly playful temperament, as if telling a story about freedom, dreams, and self-expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
