        {
          "id": "krea2-ba1abfc221d5035a87fe42bc",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣酒廊自信坐戏水",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a gray lounge chair by a modern outdoor pool, wearing a light blue sleeveless knit tank top and an off-white mini skirt. Her right hand gently strokes her neck, her left hand resting on the edge of the lounge chair. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, her expression serene and confident. Her ankles are slightly bent, and she is barefoot on the dark wooden deck, her toes clearly visible, showcasing a natural beauty. Beside her is a coconut drink with a straw, set atop a small white dish. The background is a clear blue pool, with the water reflecting the sky and the surrounding scenery. In the distance, dense green vegetation and the faint boundary between sea and sky are visible. Above is the base structure of a large sunshade, with a gray-and-white surface and black edges. The composition is shot from a low angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame, forming a visual focal point. The foreground features a dark wood-grain floor and some lounge chair details; the middle features the figure, a swimming pool, and greenery; the background features an open sky and distant scenery. The sky is covered with fluffy white clouds, with soft and bright lighting presenting a natural daylight effect. Overall, the light and shadow are evenly distributed and shadows are delicate. It creates a tranquil and comfortable vacation atmosphere, with fresh and harmonious colors dominated by blue, green, and gray, then shifting to distant landscapes. The layers are distinct, with a strong sense of space and depth. The images present a realistic texture reminiscent of everyday photography with a high-end camera or phone, with rich details and clear textures, while retaining slight film grain and natural exposure transitions, enhancing realism and artistic atmosphere. The overall style combines fashion and lifestyle vibes, conveying a leisurely and pleasant summer afternoon",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
