        {
          "id": "krea2-5c478c241aae3f7cdf20ba6c",
          "alias": "单女粉睡裙沙发坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a pink sofa by the window, wearing a light pink spaghetti strap nightdress whose hem hangs gently below the knees. The fabric has a silky sheen and delicate folds, the straps slender and hugging the skin, outlining a graceful collarbone. She lowers her head slightly, her basket filled with grapes of green and pale yellow. The crystal-clear fruit glistens with a moist glow under the soft light. Her hands are folded over her knees, fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with transparent or pale pink nail polish. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, with legs crossed and overlapping, barefoot lightly touching the wooden floor. Her ankles are smooth, her legs are smooth and flawless, and behind the sofa is a soft pink cushion. The background wallpaper is a warm yellow base color with light brown vine patterns, giving a gentle texture. Light from outside filters through the white window frame, creating a bright and soft backlight effect that creates a warm, hazy halo. In the foreground is a fluffy coarse wool blanket, mainly off-white, interwoven with fine threads interwoven with soft colors like pink, yellow, and orange, creating rich textures. Part of the blanket is laid on the floor, while part rests on the sofa, adding layers and a sense of everyday life to the composition. The composition uses a diagonal perspective, with the figure positioned near the center on the right side of the frame, the body extending diagonally. The gaze is guided to the grape basket in the lower left corner, creating visual balance. Light and shadow mainly come from the left window, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. The shadows are soft, and the projections on the floor and blanket are clear but not abrupt. The overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, full of the privacy and romantic mood of daily life. The tones are mainly pink, yellow, and off-white. Paired with soft natural light, it presents a tranquil and sweet home scene. The style is realistic with a touch of artistic touch, as if shot by a professional-grade full-frame camera paired with a large-aperture lens. Using an 85mm prime lens to capture depth blur, aperture f/1.8, ISO 100, shutter speed 1/200 sec, simulates the texture of real photography, emphasizes detailed texture and color gradation, while retaining a certain film graininess and slight overexposure highlights overflow. It enhances the clarity and dreamlike atmosphere of the image. There are no unnecessary decorations in the image; all elements serve the harmonious unity of the main subject and the environment. The composition is compact but not crowded, the background is moderately blurred, highlighting the subject while maintaining spatial depth. Overall, it presents a daily aesthetic that is both realistic and slightly idealized, like a carefully arranged photographic work of life art",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
