        {
          "id": "krea2-f05bf3c84e6c33e2b7890ce7",
          "alias": "单女白T恤窗边沉思站立注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a white camisole with slender straps, the fabric is thin and soft, fitting her figure and outlining the graceful lines of her collarbone and neck. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space. The head is slightly tilted, with the gaze downward, creating a contemplative or quiet state. The left side of the painting is brightly lit, while the right side is slightly dimmer. The transition of light and shadow is natural, creating a soft contrast between light and dark. The background is a light beige or cream-colored interior wall, clean and simple, without obvious textures or decorations. The blurred treatment makes the subject stand out. In the middle shot, some blurred furniture outlines or curtain edges can be faintly seen, but these are completely blurred without interfering with the visual focus, with clear details. The background is a gradually blurred indoor environment, creating a strong sense of depth Extending further to the halo area in the background, the lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, like morning sunlight streaming through the window screen. The light is warm yellow with a slight backlight effect, creating a golden halo around the outline edges of the figures. The overall color palette is mainly white, beige, and warm yellow, creating a fresh, pure, gentle, and slightly lazy everyday atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a professional camera and a large aperture, capturing the moment of authenticity and beauty. At the same time, it retains the natural blur and soft focus effects found in portrait mode on a phone, combining a sense of life with artistic beauty, making it suitable for expressing themes of youth, tranquility, self-healing, or everyday aesthetics",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
