        {
          "id": "krea2-67b941b10d261b539a097b38",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙摄影棚微笑坐侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a simple white slip dress paired with a matching white zip-up cardigan. The sleeves of the cardigan hang loosely, her left hand gently raised, right hand clenched at her side, her posture elegant and relaxed. Around her neck is a delicate silver necklace with a geometric pendant. The lines are simple yet thoughtful, flickering gently on her chest. Looking directly at the camera, she carries a faint, almost imperceptible smile. The overall temperament is pure and sophisticated. She sits on a soft white sofa, leaning slightly back, legs crossed, ankles slender, and leg lines smooth and natural. The sofa surface has slight wrinkles and shadows, showing the texture of the fabric. The background is a minimalist light beige wall, flat and clean, without unnecessary decoration. Only a small patch of light and shadow casts in the upper left corner, forming a soft shadow outline that enhances the spatial three-dimensionality. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, body slightly tilted. A natural visual guide line is formed, with the head slightly tilted forward, allowing direct communication between sight and the viewer, creating an intimate and tranquil atmosphere. Light comes from the left, using soft natural light or studio soft lighting, evenly illuminating the subject, creating a delicate transition between light and shadow. The shadowed areas are soft and unobtrusive, with the overall color scheme mainly white and light beige, pure and unified with a hint of warmth, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall image presents a sense of sophistication and artistry, as if carefully shot from a professional studio. It also carries an unintentional aesthetic from daily life, rich in details, strong visual appeal and emotional appeal, delicate image texture, moderate color saturation, and soft contrast, presenting a clean, pure, and modern aesthetic style, suitable for visual expression of fashion, lifestyle, or emotional themes",
