        {
          "id": "krea2-cd5b850aff45a5fc93a42894",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙摄影棚愤怒站立",
          "prompt": "She wears a white lace slip dress with fluffy ruffles on the shoulders. The lightweight tulle fabric glimmers faintly under the light, presenting a hazy texture and romantic atmosphere. The composition centers on the figure. Using close-ups with a pure light gray background, simple and unobtrusive, creating a tranquil and ethereal atmosphere. Light and shadow come from the left side, creating a soft side lighting effect. Highlights are bright but not glaring, shadows are soft and layered. The overall color palette is mainly warm white and light brown, harmoniously unified to create a warm, tranquil, and slightly dreamy feeling. The image has extremely high clarity and detail expression, as if shot in a studio with a professional camera, using softboxes and reflectors for lighting. The lens focuses precisely and the background blur is handled well, making the subject stand out more while preserving the transparency of the environment. The visual flow extends along the line of sight to hand movements, forming a smooth visual loop. The image presents a high-end photographic texture, combining artistic beauty with realism, as if it were a carefully conceived fashionable portrait work, combining beauty with modern flair. It is suitable for magazine covers, advertisements, or personal photo books. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and emotional, evoking a sense of gentleness. The blend of innocence and inner strength fills the scene with poetry and storytelling, as if freezing a moment's inner monologue that lingers for a long time",
