        {
          "id": "krea2-dc3d86fd0a67f88ab5d409ac",
          "alias": "单女白T恤街道害羞站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on the slope of a city street, looking natural and lively, wearing a shy yet gentle smile that reveals youthful innocence and tranquility. She wears an off-white tight camisole that highlights her slender figure, layered over a light gray lightweight jacket casually draped over her shoulders, with black detail decorations at the cuffs, adding a touch of fashion. She pairs matching high-waisted shorts in the same color scheme, creating a simple and fresh look full of summer vibes. In her right hand, she holds a transparent plastic cup filled with orange-yellow drinks, with a black straw inserted in the cup. Tiny droplets of water condense on the rim, making her look cool and inviting. Her left hand rests naturally at her waist, her posture relaxed and confident. She wears a slender silver necklace, adorned with a small pendant around her neck, adding a touch of refinement. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the foreground, with the figure occupying the main part. The composition uses a slightly upward angle, making the figure appear taller and more upright, with a blurred city street in the background. The road surface is made of dark gray asphalt, with clear white markings. There is a low green belt along the roadside and a sturdy tree, whose shadows cast dappled light on the ground. The distant street extends deep into the frame, presenting a subtle perspective effect that creates a sense of spatial depth. The light comes from the upper left, representing warm afternoon sunlight. Sunlight filters through the leaves, creating soft light spots and delicate shadows on the figures and the ground. The transition of light and shadow is natural, with a moderate contrast of light and shadow, creating an overall warm and tranquil atmosphere. It carries a sense of everyday life, with the main tones of warm yellow and light gray-white, moderate color saturation, and a realistic texture, as if shot with a regular camera. The lens has slight depth blur, edges are soft, without excessive sharpening or filtering, presenting a rustic and natural sense of realism. The overall composition is balanced, extending from her gaze and body posture to the drink in her hand, then to the surrounding environment, forming a complete narrative thread. The use of light and shadow enhances the sense of three-dimensionality and layering. It creates a relaxed, joyful, and leisurely moment of life, as if capturing an ordinary yet beautiful moment of daily life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
