        {
          "id": "krea2-759af1cc288dbca97f226339",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣城市侧头",
          "prompt": "Her makeup is fresh and natural, her skin fair and delicate, presenting a smooth texture. She wears an off-white cutout knit cardigan adorned with pink stripes that are clearly visible. Underneath, she wears a white camisole with a simple and elegant neckline that reveals a graceful collarbone, and her arms hang naturally. Wearing loose light-colored pants, the posture is relaxed and elegant. The composition uses close-up shots, with the figure occupying most of the space, the head slightly tilted, creating a dynamic visual balance. The background is an indoor environment, with a blurred background showing light-colored walls, soft lighting, and some furniture outlines, such as the bedside or sofa back. Light streams in from above and sides, creating a warm yellow tone. The light and shadows are soft and layered, with the light source coming from the left wall lamp or table lamp. It creates a warm and comfortable atmosphere, with subtle shadow transitions on the right side enhancing the sense of depth. The colors are harmonious and unified, giving the image a strong Japanese sweet vibe, blending the simplicity and fashion of modern urban life. The details are rich, the clothing textures are realistic, and the transitions of light and shadow are natural, making it feel like a real-life indoor scene shot with a high-resolution phone. Yet through artistic processing, it presents an idealized aesthetic. The entire scene is filled with youthful energy and gentle aura, evoking a sense of tranquil and beautiful everyday moments",
