        {
          "id": "krea2-a8f34ae16d9247fa82beeea8",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套雪地站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors against a white wall, her posture natural and relaxed, her overall aura fresh and refined. She wears a deep blue long wool coat with a well-tailored cut, the neckline slightly open, revealing the white turtleneck knit underneath and the hem of a white lace-trimmed dress. The coat features classic horn button design, adding a retro artistic vibe. Around her neck is a light gray plush scarf made of fluffy and soft fabric, trimmed with tassels that drape over the chest, creating a striking contrast with the dark coat. A hand-knitted bag slung across the shoulder is mainly off-white with dark gray stripes, giving it a warm and rustic feel. On her feet are brown short snow boots made of suede paired with white socks, making it both warm and stylish. The background is a simple white wall with slight textures, and sunlight streams in from the right, casting mottled leaf shadows on the wall. The light and shadows intertwine to create a warm golden hue, with soft and layered lighting that creates a peaceful and cozy atmosphere. The ground is a gray cement pavement with slight wear along the edges. The composition centers on the figure, using medium shots with the main figure occupying the main position, slightly to the left, leaving space on the right side for light and shadow to extend and enhance the sense of depth. The lighting atmosphere is warm and soft, with golden sunset afterglow casting on the figures and walls, creating a contrast of light and shadow that highlights the subject while preserving background details. The overall color palette is mainly blue, gray, white, and brown, complemented by warm yellow light and shadow, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. It is filled with a lazy and pleasant winter afternoon feeling, with a delicate and realistic texture, as if you could casually capture a beautiful moment in life with an ordinary phone at dusk. Without excessive embellishment, it is full of natural beauty and poetry. The entire scene conveys a quiet, warm, and healing everyday atmosphere, allowing people to feel the warmth and beauty of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
