        {
          "id": "krea2-e161706634956e929e93be88",
          "alias": "单女白T恤床俏皮坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a light-colored rattan bed frame, wearing a white lace-trimmed camisole and matching short skirt, paired with white lace knee-high stockings. She gently holds a furry brownish-yellow teddy bear plush. The teddy bear is of moderate size, with fluffy and soft fur, its right front paw slightly raised, looking lively and cute. Behind her are cotton bedding and pillows with pink floral patterns. Next to it is a larger teddy bear half-hidden in the background. In the foreground is a curved railing of a rattan bed frame, with smooth and soft lines presenting a warm pale yellow tone. The middle ground shows the main combination of the figure and the teddy bear, positioned slightly to the left of the frame, with the body slightly tilted, creating a natural sense of movement. The background is a pale pink wall with a wooden easel hanging on it. The easel has a simple structure, topped with a small black ornament. The wall surface has fine dotted textures, adding a touch of everyday life. The entire scene is soft and bright, with natural light streaming through the window on the left side of the painting, creating a warm backlighting effect that produces subtle halos and highlights. The transitions between light and shadow are delicate, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The color tones are mainly warm white, beige, and light pink, harmoniously unified. The visual guide starts from the rattan railing in the foreground, extends to the teddy bear in your hand, and finally lands on the easel and wall in the background. The composition combines close-ups and middle shots, with the figures occupying the main part of the frame and balanced proportions. The view is slightly tilted upward, enhancing the person's affinity and visual appeal. The overall image presents a warm, tranquil, and playful home atmosphere, as if capturing a private moment of afternoon sunlight filling the room. It has a strong Japanese style, rich details without clutter, and a realistic texture. It looks like a professional camera shooting under natural light, with extremely high clarity, natural clothing folds, and realistic fabric texture. The teddy bear's fur is well-layered, with realistic light and shadow reflections. It presents a visual aesthetic that is both artistic and close to everyday life",
