        {
          "id": "krea2-0245d704447f75acf261125a",
          "alias": "单女上衣户外站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors in a natural setting, exuding a fresh and sweet aura full of youthful energy. Her hands are raised above her head, gently supporting a broad green leaf. The leaf's edges are slightly curled, with clearly visible veins, presenting a natural curve and vitality. She wears a loose short-sleeved white top with pink floral patterns on the base. The neckline is round and decorated with thin cords at the chest, layered with a lightweight cardigan in the same color. The sleeves are three-quarter sleeves with slightly irregular hems, making the material light and breathable. She appears casual and elegant. She pairs a pure white multi-layered pleated long dress with a soft and voluminous hem, with distinct layers. Thin cords and ties accent the waist and hem add a touch of refinement. Her posture is relaxed and natural, her body slightly turned to the side, left hand in front and right hand behind, arm lines smooth and effortless, presenting a relaxed and comfortable state. The foreground is the main subject, occupying the main position in the frame. The composition uses a medium perspective, presenting the figure fully from head to knee. The background is a blurred outdoor scene, with faint green vegetation. Trees and some gray stone floors or steps, with blurred architectural outlines and mottled walls in the distance, create a deep sense of space. The light is soft and bright, coming from natural light evenly onto the figures, creating a warm, diffused light effect. The light and shadow transition is natural, with overall tones dominated by white, pale pink, and green. The colors are fresh and elegant, giving a peaceful and comfortable feeling. The image has a slight film texture, with a subtle graininess and soft color shifts, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera. The background gradually blurs, creating a shallow depth effect. Visual guidance focuses on the characters' expressions and movements, creating a balanced and harmonious composition. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, leaving space on the right for the gaze to extend, creating a sense of breathing and freedom. The atmosphere is warm and tranquil, filled with the small happiness of a summer afternoon, as if capturing a leisurely and beautiful moment. The entire image presents an unintentional beauty from everyday life, combining the refinement of artistic photography with the authenticity and intimacy of everyday life",
