        {
          "id": "krea2-4b548e8f9f314549997e0418",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套街道忧伤蹲持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman squats in front of a white wall outdoors, carrying a faint sense of melancholy and contemplation. Her overall aura is cool and quiet, wearing a deep blue thick woolen coat layered with a white turtleneck sweater. Around her neck is a light blue knitted scarf made of soft and fluffy material, with natural curled edges. On the scarf is a small white label printed with blurry brand lettering. Her left hand hangs naturally, while her right hand holds a silver vintage film camera. The camera body has a strong metallic texture, making the lens clearly visible The lens cap has been removed, and the camera strap hangs down at her side. She wears a pair of brown ankle boots, with white socks showing at the ankles. Her posture is natural and relaxed, her body slightly leaning forward, legs bent, knees close to the ground. In her left hand, she carries a handwoven colorful handbag. The body is woven from thick threads in various colors, displaying striped patterns in orange, blue, white, beige, and other colors. The handle is a double-strand woven design, with clearly visible textures. The background is a pristine cement wall, on which mottled shadows of leaves are cast, intertwining light and shadow. Irregular dark gray leaf shadows are formed, the walls have slightly rough textures, the ground is a dark gray asphalt pavement, and a white traffic lane runs by the roadside. Sunlight slants down from the upper left of the image, creating a soft and warm light contrast and a clear contrast between light and dark. The left side is in shadow, creating a strong sense of three-dimensionality. The entire composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, occupying the main visual space and creating a slight top-down angle that guides the viewer's attention to the expressions and the camera in their hands. The composition is layered: the foreground features the figure and handbag, the middle is the figure's body and camera, and the background is a wall with leaf shadows, creating a strong sense of depth. The colors are mainly cool tones, with white, blue, and black forming the base color palette, accented by a warm-toned handbag and brown shoes, creating a contrast of cool and warm. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, artistic, and slightly nostalgic, like an autumn afternoon capturing moments of life on the street. The image has the texture of film photography, with slight graininess, moderate color saturation, and rich details. The light and shadow treatment is delicate, full of the atmosphere of life and artistic beauty",
