        {
          "id": "krea2-b6f00b6c08595fec5c4f6b6d",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣摄影棚微笑站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A half-length portrait of a woman wearing a white knit hat embroidered with a black cartoon panda pattern. The lines are simple yet playful, with the brim slightly curled, presenting a soft and fluffy texture. The hat top has a small spherical decoration that adds a cute touch, showing a smooth sheen and delicate texture. She wears a white hollow-out knit sweater with a loose neckline, revealing a slender collarbone and neck line. With a touch of gentleness and curiosity, slightly open, revealing a serene and sweet smile that adds a touch of playfulness and cuteness. The background is a pure light gray or white, very simple, with no clutter, making the main figure stand out even more. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, head slightly tilted, gazing at the camera, creating a warm and natural interaction. Light comes from the front slightly left, shadows are slight, transitioning naturally to create a clean and bright atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly white and light gray. Accented with black and pink, the harmonious and warm color combinations make people want to take a closer look. The delicate handling of light and shadow enhances the sense of depth and layering. The entire scene feels fresh, sweet, and warm, as if on a quiet winter afternoon, sunlight streaming through the window onto the girl. She wears a cute hat and a soft sweater, sitting quietly by the window. The breeze gently blows, and the air is filled with a faint warmth. This is a portrait full of life and highly artistic beauty. Whether it's studio photos taken with professional cameras or everyday moments captured with a phone, it's authentic and moving, rich in detail, emotionally rich, and possesses strong visual appeal and emotional impact",
