        {
          "id": "krea2-72e597c84d3ca6326cf69b52",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣公寓严肃站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands before a soft, warm yellow wall, adding a touch of laziness and casual beauty. Her overall temperament is gentle and serene. She wears an off-white loose knit sweater with clearly visible texture, using a coarse knit technique with fine grooves and natural pleats. The cuffs are decorated with light pink fine stripes, adding a gentle touch to the overall look. She gently holds a bouquet of blooming carnations with both hands. The flowers are pale pink or pale pink, with layers of petals and a full shape. The centers are slightly curled, some of the flowers are budding, the green stems are long and upright, the leaves are tender and emerald, forming a striking contrast with the pink flowers. Her hands are naturally in motion, fingers slender and long, gently holding the stems with gentle yet steady movements. The background is a single warm yellow wall with a slightly rough texture, a slight graininess, and irregular transitions of light and shadow. The wall color is uniform but not completely flat, presenting a warm and rustic indoor atmosphere. The composition uses medium portrait photography, with the subject occupying the main position, slightly tilted to the left, head slightly tilted, and gaze to the right, creating a visually guiding and blank space. The figure and bouquet form a stable triangular structure, enhancing the balance and stability of the image. The background blur is well handled to highlight the main subject while preserving the wall details, with light coming from the upper left of the image. Soft natural light shines from the side, creating a clear contrast between light and dark, while shadows gently transition on the right side of the body and the wall. The transition of light and shadow is natural, creating a warm, tranquil, and layered atmosphere. The overall color palette mainly features warm yellow, off-white, pale pink, and green, with harmonious unity full of life and artistic beauty. The image texture is delicate, with graininess reminiscent of film photography and slight exposure shift, simulating everyday amateur camera shooting and presenting a realistic, natural, and effortless aesthetic style. It seems to capture an ordinary yet touching everyday moment, with rich image details, delicate light and shadow, and a warm and romantic atmosphere, suitable for themes of youth, tenderness, hope, and beautiful emotions",
