        {
          "id": "krea2-5b89ff3af2d957c4b8cc0dd7",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣街道微笑蹲持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman squats under the shade of a city street, looking straight at the camera with a gentle and slightly playful smile. Her right hand extends forward, her index finger and thumb forming a tiny circle, as if inviting the audience into her world. Her left hand gently holds a brown leather handbag, adorned with a delicate metal zipper and heart-shaped decoration. She wears a beige knit cardigan, loose and comfortable, with naturally draped sleeves. Underneath, she wears a white polka-dot camisole top, with a black-and-white polka-dot silk scarf tied at the collar. The silk scarf was casually tied into a bow, adding a touch of retro and sweet charm. She wore dark blue denim shorts with slightly rolled cuffs, revealing her slender leg lines. On her feet were white high-top sneakers, the uppers clean and tidy, laces loosely tied. The overall look was fresh and natural, yet fashionable. Her squatting posture was elegant and relaxed, knees bent, body slightly leaning forward, forming a soft S-shaped curve. The background was a tree-lined city street, with sunlight filtering through dense leaves casting dappled shadows. Light and shadow interplay are formed, with gray stone paths on the ground. In the distance, several tall phoenix trees can be faintly seen. Their trunks are thick and upright, their branches and leaves lush, forming a natural green corridor. Further away are blurred outlines of buildings and parked vehicles, and a few pedestrians are blurred on the street. The entire scene presents a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying the center slightly to the right of the frame, and the perspective is slightly lower, highlighting their affinity and visual guidance. The foreground clearly shows the main subject and handbag, the middle ground and some tree shadows around the figure, and the background gradually blurring streets and trees, creating a strong depth effect. Light comes from the upper left, soft natural light, with sunlight filtering through leaves creating scattered light and casting mottled shadows on the ground and figures. The contrast is strong but not glaring, creating a warm and dreamy atmosphere. The colors are mainly warm tones, interwoven with beige, white, brown, and green, creating a harmonious and unified overall tone. The image texture is delicate and authentic, resembling everyday street photos taken with a professional camera, full of a strong sense of everyday life and artistic beauty",
