        {
          "id": "krea2-3fc3e90ba4bbdb5d75384d72",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙摄影棚冷淡站立",
          "prompt": "A half-length portrait of a woman adds a touch of laziness and vitality. She wears a light blue spaghetti strap dress with fine sequins. The straps are slender, the fabric is light and flowing, and as her body tilts slightly, delicate pleats and flowing patterns appear. A small pearl necklace adorns the chest, simple yet elegant. The overall look is fresh and refined, like a fairy stepping out of a dream. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the composition, with the head slightly turned to the side. A graceful S-shaped curve is formed, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and layering. The middle frame extends to the shoulders and chest, and the sequins on the clothing twinkle like stars under light and shadow, creating a dreamlike visual effect. The background is a blurry, cool-toned space dominated by blue-purple gradients, with faint soft light spots and bokeh visible, like light projected through sheer fabric or water mist. The blur treatment makes the subject stand out while preserving the ambiance. The composition uses close-ups and shallow depth of field to enhance the subject, with slight shadowing at the edges. Enhances visual focus, with light and shadow from the upper left creating a soft side illumination, creating a warm and mysterious atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly cool blue and warm white, with a striking contrast that maintains a cool temperament without losing friendliness. The rich layering of light and shadow, with interwoven light and shadow, highlights the smooth texture of skin and the glossy details of clothing. The image is full of poetry and romance, as if capturing the most captivating moment of morning sunlight, with professional studio-level lighting control and color tuning. Yet it retains the natural beauty of everyday encounters, like a film-like work taken with a medium format camera under natural indoor light. Details are clear, colors are faithfully restored, and emotional expression is subtle yet profound, immersing one in this quiet and beautiful moment",
