        {
          "id": "krea2-5a0c7066df7aaff44a053d18",
          "alias": "单女白外套室内微笑坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a warm indoor setting, wearing a soft, fluffy white plush jacket. The material has a delicate plush texture, with slightly irregular edges and natural flicker details. Underneath, she wears a white spaghetti-strap spaghetti-strap top that reveals her slender collarbones and shoulder lines. The overall style is comfortable and relaxed, full of homely feel, gentle and lively, with a subtle smile that creates a healthy and fresh temperament. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, with the body slightly tilted and the head slightly tilted. The posture is relaxed and natural. In the background is a light wood-colored tabletop, on which sits a white portable thermos cup with a blue cartoon pattern. The lid is black, and the cup is printed with cute animal images. Next to it is a white pen or straw. The background is a blurred wooden furniture structure, possibly a bookshelf or cabinet, presenting a warm natural wood tone. The wood grain is clearly visible, but due to shallow depth of field, the blurred effect creates a soft bokeh effect. The lighting throughout the scene is soft and even. Natural light pours in from the left side through the window, with natural transitions of light and shadow without harsh shadows, creating a warm atmosphere like morning or afternoon sunlight filtering through the curtains. The overall color scheme is mainly warm white and light wood, accented with a touch of blue, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The composition uses close-ups to highlight the subject's expression and mood, creating a strong sense of interaction. The image has a slight film graininess and low-contrast texture, simulating the realism of everyday phone photography while maintaining an artistic tone. The overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, full of life and youthful energy, as if capturing a quiet afternoon moment of reading or drinking coffee. There are no watermarks or text marks in the frame, only conveying a genuine and delicate emotional warmth through lighting, materials, and composition",
