        {
          "id": "krea2-23e8261280eef1ab19fa5ccc",
          "alias": "单女制服街道害羞站立",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a Japanese-style sailor uniform stands on a city street, looking especially lively. She wears a white long-sleeved top paired with a deep blue tie and shoulder stripe decorations. She wears a black pleated short skirt with a slightly flared hem, exuding youthful energy. Her posture is natural and elegant, with a slightly shy and sweet expression. A black leather shoulder bag is slung across her shoulder. The bag is simple and elegant, with clearly visible metal buckle details. The overall look is full of campus vibe, with a background of blurred urban buildings. Dark wall and window lines create a soft blur effect, creating a shallow depth of field visual effect. Sunlight pours in from the upper left of the frame, creating a warm and bright backlight effect that presents a natural sheen. The overall color tone mainly features a warm and cool contrast, with the sky showing a light blue tone. The building's shadows lean toward gray-blue, while the main figures are illuminated by golden sunlight, creating a distinct layering of light and shadow. The composition uses the figure positioned slightly to the center, leaving space on the left side to extend the view, creating a dynamic balance and creating a peaceful and beautiful atmosphere. It combines the realism of daily life with an artistic aesthetic, as if capturing a quiet afternoon moment after school. Overall, it presents a fresh, pure, and youthful visual style, like real photos taken outdoors under natural light with a professional camera. It features high-resolution detail expression and delicate color transitions. The image texture is close to studio or street photography in modern portrait photography, yet retains authentic environmental elements and the atmosphere of life. It offers an aesthetic experience that is both dreamy and close to reality",
