        {
          "id": "krea2-f50a9b93725d1ef9db0de805",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙室内俏皮站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "She wears a simple white slip dress with thin straps and lightweight material, hugging the figure and showing elegant curves. Her right hand is gently raised, fingers long, holding a small white flower, her posture gentle and reserved, as if lost in thought or immersed in some beautiful mood. In the foreground is a cluster of blooming white flowers. Petals layer upon layer, stamens pale yellow, branches naturally curved, some flowers in a state of low focus, creating a soft depth of field effect that echoes the figures, enhancing the sense of layering and depth in the composition. The middle ground is the figure and upper body, slightly tilted, with smooth body lines, arms naturally hanging, elegant hand movements, background set in a blurry indoor environment, dark tones appearing in dark gray or black, faintly revealing geometric structures, possibly the outlines of walls or furniture. The background blur is handled very thoroughly, making the subject stand out more. The composition uses close-ups, with the characters occupying most of the frame, heads slightly tilted, and gazes directly at the camera, creating an intimate and direct visual exchange. The overall image presents a symmetrical yet lively balance. The lighting atmosphere is soft and warm, with the light source coming from the front left position, creating a uniform and soft frontal light. The shadow transitions naturally without harsh contrast, enhancing texture and three-dimensionality, complemented by a touch of green and yellow accents, creating a pure, tranquil, and gentle atmosphere. The images have a slight film texture, moderate color saturation, and a slight retro filter effect, as if a portrait was taken with a professional camera in natural light. It possesses a high degree of artistic beauty and realism, while preserving the warmth and everyday life of photography",
