        {
          "id": "krea2-2be71b412680319662d0c69f",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙持花",
          "prompt": "She wears a white lace slip dress with slender straps revealing graceful collarbones and shoulder lines. Over it, she casually drapes a light blue knit cardigan, whose texture is clearly visible, presenting a warm woolen texture. Her hands gently hold a bouquet of small green flowers, small and dense, with straight stems and lush greenery. She holds the bouquet close to her chest, her posture elegant and serene, the overall composition using medium shots. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the painting, with a slightly tilted body forming a natural S-shaped curve. The background is a blurry green forest, with layers of leaves overlapping and interlacing light and shadow, creating a soft bokeh effect. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the canopy, forming dot-like light spots that create a dreamlike atmosphere. A few leaves slightly block the foreground, adding depth and realism to the scene. Light streams in from above, creating a soft backlighting effect that outlines the figure's outline with golden light, presenting a natural sheen. The shadow transitions are smooth, without awkward boundaries. The overall color palette is mainly fresh green and light blue, paired with pure white, creating a peaceful, pure, and vibrant summer atmosphere. The image has strong visual guidance, extending upward along her line of sight, then moving down to the bouquet in her hand, and finally landing on the background light and shadow changes. The composition is balanced and poetic. The camera simulation uses a professional-grade full-frame camera, high-resolution sensor, large-aperture lens, f/ 1.8. Capturing delicate details and rich layering, with shooting angles slightly below head-to-head to enhance the gentleness and nobility of the subject. The overall style combines realism and artistic beauty, resembling real photos taken with high-end photography in natural light. There is slight film graininess and enhanced color saturation without excessive processing, preserving the original natural texture. The scene is set in a forest clearing in late spring and early summer, with fresh and humid air and a faint scent of grass and trees all around. The entire scene exudes a sense of tranquility and peace. A hopeful aura, as if time had stopped at this moment, with only a gentle breeze, melodious birdsong, and a deep yearning and longing for a better life deep within",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
