          "id": "krea2-cd27f813607213aec9ff55ff",
          "alias": "单女室内沉思坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sitting indoors, adding a touch of laziness and casual beauty. She wears a pair of thick-rimmed black glasses, with clear and transparent lenses and simple, modern frame lines, highlighting an intellectual and fashionable temperament. She slightly tilts her head and gazes at the laptop screen in front of her, appearing thoughtful or focused on work. She wears a white fitted off-shoulder top with subtle vertical textures, hugging the body and showing elegant curves. The left shoulder section slides naturally, revealing a graceful shoulder and neck line. On the arms, she wears a long-sleeved inner layer in the same color. The overall look is simple yet stylish. In the foreground is a silver-gray laptop, slim and light, with a neatly arranged keyboard. The screen is open but the content is hidden. The computer is placed on the desktop slightly tilted, forming a visual guideline. In the middle shot, the female figure is the main subject, occupying the main space on the right side of the frame. Her body leans slightly forward, her head slightly lowered, and the gaze is focused on the computer. The composition uses a diagonal angle, with the figure extending from the lower right corner to the center of the frame, forming a stable visual center. The background is a light beige solid wall with a smooth and even surface, without obvious textures or decorations, creating a clean, simple, and modern spatial atmosphere. Light comes from the upper left side of the painting, which is soft natural or indoor lighting. The light source is warm and even, creating a delicate transition of light and shadow. The shadows are soft, placed to the right and behind the figure, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and highlighting the contours. The overall light and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, carrying a sense of privacy and realism from daily life. The main tones are warm white, beige, and black. The colors are harmonious and unified, creating a comfortable, relaxed yet slightly focused atmosphere. The composition is balanced, with ample blank space and clear visual focus, conveying a quiet moment immersed in work or study. The style combines everyday realism with artistic beauty, resembling high-quality portraits shot with a professional camera, while retaining the authentic texture of amateur equipment. The details are rich, the layers are distinct, and it offers a strong sense of immersion and emotional resonance",
