        {
          "id": "krea2-f475e6a6654b68ca1f36e342",
          "alias": "单女灰连体衣室内专注站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a bright indoor setting, wearing a light gray-blue sports bodysuit, including a sleeveless sports tank top and high-waisted skinny pants. The clothing fits her body perfectly, showing a healthy and well-proportioned figure. Her right hand gently rests on the beige wooden door frame on the right, fingers long, left hand hanging naturally down, resting softly on the outside of her left thigh. Her body is slightly turned to the left side of the frame, forming a graceful S-shaped curve, legs together. He wears a pair of white platform sneakers with blue stripes on the upper and neatly tied laces. The overall look is simple yet vibrant. The foreground is the main subject, occupying the center right of the frame. The composition uses a mid-angle portrait style, presenting the person from head to foot in full. The background is a modern, minimalist interior space. On the left, you can see a white kitchen counter or bar counter with faint greenery dotted on the countertop. Behind is a window with a white frame, letting in soft natural light. Several linear track lights are installed on the ceiling to provide even auxiliary lighting. The floor is made of light-colored polished tiles that reflect a subtle sheen. The overall color palette is mainly white, beige, and light gray, creating a clean, fresh, and warm atmosphere. The light mainly comes from the front and above, classified as soft illumination, with soft shadows and no strong contrasts. The transitions are natural, with visual guidance focused on the figures. At the same time, the background lines and structure also play a guiding role, resulting in balanced composition, a prominent main subject, and clear layering in the image. It offers the realism of everyday amateur equipment, as if capturing photos in natural light with a phone or regular camera, retaining slight noise and authentic details, presenting a lifestyle and strong approachable imaging style. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and comfortable, full of youthful energy, combining beauty with everyday touch, making it suitable for creating fitness, lifestyle, or personal display content",
