        {
          "id": "krea2-55fea0210176997df84582be",
          "alias": "单女白T恤困倦站立出神",
          "prompt": "It adds a touch of liveliness and spontaneity, presenting an almost flawless texture. Under soft light, it glows slightly, as if one can feel the warmth and softness of the skin. Gazing directly at the camera yet seemingly gazing into the distance, she wears a pale pink lipstick with a natural tone. She wears a thin white camisole made of lightweight material, possibly silk or satin. The slender camisole outlines a graceful shoulder and neck line, with natural folds that fit the body's curves. It presents a simple yet elegant aesthetic. The main subject is positioned in the foreground, occupying most of the composition's space. The background is a pure gradient, transitioning from light blue in the upper left corner to pale purple in the lower right. The color is soft and layered, creating a dreamy and tranquil atmosphere. The background blur is handled very cleanly, with no unnecessary elements distracting the subject, making the subject stand out more. The composition uses a center-offset third-division method, with the figure slightly tilted. The head is slightly tilted, creating an intimate and subtle interaction, while the right side leaves space for the line of sight to extend, enhancing the sense of breath and balance in the image. Light and shadow come from the upper left, soft and even, like natural light in the morning or evening, creating a contrast of light and dark and presenting bright highlights. The right side is in slight shadows, enhancing three-dimensionality and depth. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is peaceful, pure, and romantic, with a subtle melancholy and poetic charm, mainly cool tones. The blue-violet tone creates a tranquil and ethereal feeling, as if immersed in a world far from the noise. The image texture is delicate and rich, but not overly sharp, preserving the natural feel of real shooting. The overall style blends high-end fashion photography with the texture of everyday amateur equipment, combining professional-grade light and shadow control and color matching with a touch of everyday warmth and authenticity. It's as if you were capturing the most captivating beauty on a quiet afternoon captured with an entry-level camera. The entire painting exudes a gentle, restrained, and slightly philosophical aura that draws gazing long, unwilling to look away",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
