        {
          "id": "krea2-646bc3f658662df59829412f",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣窗边沉思持相机",
          "prompt": "She carries a gentle yet slightly contemplative expression, displaying a pure yet mature temperament. She wears a white plush knit cardigan, soft and voluminous, with natural pleats and faux edges at the cuffs and hem. Underneath, she wears a white spaghetti strap vest with slender straps revealing part of her collarbone and shoulder lines. Her body is slightly turned to the side, her right hand gently resting on the side of her neck, fingers long. The nails are neatly trimmed and painted with light pink polish, with an elegant and natural posture, as if unintentionally revealing a tranquil beauty. The background is a blurry outdoor scene, and through the large windows, you can see lush green trees and soft natural light, forming large bokeh light spots that present warm yellow-green tones, creating a peaceful, comfortable, and lively atmosphere. The entire shot uses a shallow depth of field technique, with very soft background blur and a composition centered on the figure, slightly tilted to one side. It creates an asymmetrical yet balanced visual structure, with light coming from the side and above, belonging to soft natural light, creating delicate transitions between light and dark. Shadows are soft without strong contrast, highlighting the texture of the skin and the texture of the clothing. The overall color palette is mainly white and light beige, complemented by pale green and warm yellow in the background, creating a pure, warm, and tranquil visual feel. The image has a strong sense of daily life and realism, as if you casually took a life photo by the window at home with a regular camera or phone. With slight noise and natural color reproduction, it avoids excessive embellishment, retaining the original layers of light and shadow and details, giving an intimate, warm, and life-close artistic atmosphere",
