        {
          "id": "krea2-e41d8c9876a0e0789b51c35a",
          "alias": "单女白T恤室内俏皮坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sat indoors, appearing casual and gentle. She wore a white short-sleeved T-shirt with subtle textures and pleats, presenting a realistic feel for everyday wear. She paired it with light blue jeans with slightly faded legs and natural pleats. The overall outfit was simple and comfortable, creating a relaxed and casual vibe. She wore a small gold earring shaped like a small animal or an abstract pattern, adding a playful touch. This forms a visual guiding line extending from the upper left corner to the lower right. The middle foreground is her sitting, with a background wall in a warm yellow tone. Several Chinese-style decorative paintings hang on the wall, framed in wood, featuring calligraphy or traditional patterns. One shows the character \"decorative character\" (music), while the other uses a black-and-white ink wash style with bold and powerful font. These elements together create a strong cultural atmosphere. deep in the background, you can faintly see spotlights from the ceiling, their light spreading like starbursts, creating a distinct halo effect from the lens. This enhances the layering of light and shadow and the dreamlike feel of the image. The composition uses a close-up perspective, with the characters occupying most of the frame. The slightly tilted angle provides a lifelike, intimate shooting experience. The camera seems to be close to the character, capturing the most authentic moments and creating a strong emotional connection. In terms of lighting and shadow, the main light source comes from the warm yellow light from above and behind, creating a soft top light with smooth shadow transitions, while the background lighting creates strong backlight and backlight effects, making the character's outline stand out even more. Halos and light spots are also created to enhance the artistic and atmospheric feel of the image. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow, complemented by the cool contrast of white clothes and the accent of blue pants. The colors are harmoniously unified and create a warm, tranquil, slightly artistic indoor scene. The image texture is close to a phone selfie style, with slight noise and realism, as if captured casually with everyday equipment. However, post-processing enhances detail and color expression, presenting an image style that is both lively and artistically beautiful",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
