        {
          "id": "krea2-78ff2744b28f1c77b56d1abf",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣微笑脱衣",
          "prompt": "A close-up of a woman's half-body view shows her wearing black thick-rimmed glasses. The lenses are transparent, and the frame lines are smooth and modern, adding a touch of lazy and casual beauty. She presents a soft sheen, revealing a faint smile. Looking to the left of the frame, she seems to be pondering or gazing at something. She wears a white fitted knit camisole top with a low neckline, showing off the graceful lines of her collarbone and neck. The texture of the garment is clearly visible, with fine vertical stripes, giving it a soft and body-hugging feel. The foreground shows some silver-gray laptop keyboards and bodies, with black keys with smooth edges and a strong metallic texture, suggesting a work or study scene. The middle is the woman's upper body, covering from shoulder to head as the main focus. The composition uses close-ups with a slightly upward angle, highlighting the character's elegant temperament and visual focal point. The background is a pure light beige wall with no cluttered elements, clean and warm, creating a calm and focused atmosphere. The overall lighting is soft and even. The soft light from the left front doesn't create harsh shadows, enhancing the sense of depth. At the same time, subtle shadows are cast around the neck and collarbone, enriching the layers. The colors are mainly white, black, and beige, warm and harmonious, with sharp contrasts yet gentle tones. The overall image presents a realistic and refined beauty from everyday life, like a portrait shot with a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens, offering strong visual guidance. The composition then follows her gaze into the outer space, creating a compact and dynamic composition. The details are handled with extreme precision, and the overall atmosphere is quiet, steady, and slightly artistic, as if capturing a moment of tranquility. It evokes an inner focus and composure, like an intellectual working alone under the afternoon sun, or a woman immersed in reading and reflection. The images present a high degree of realism and artistry, combining the refinement of commercial photography with the warmth of everyday life, as if captured from a real, everyday scene, yet transcending the ordinariness of ordinary photos. It has reached an almost idealized aesthetic realm",
