        {
          "id": "krea2-7ef8582e5a6a599cd5aeb63e",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣车厢忧伤站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the stairs of a subway station or underground passage, her expression naturally tinged with a hint of melancholy and contemplation. She wears a gray-and-black striped knit cardigan, the sweater is fluffy and soft, with a thick gray faux fur collar at the collar. The plush and textured texture is layered with a simple white crew neck top underneath. She carries a black backpack with fine vertical stripes and metal fasteners. Her hands rest naturally on silver stainless steel armrests, her fingers long, and her nails painted light pink nails. The posture is relaxed yet carries an unspoken elegance. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the composition, with the figure occupying about two-thirds of the frame, appearing from the waist upward. The background is a wall covered with white rectangular tiles, with neat and clear tile joints forming a regular grid pattern. Above it is a row of parallel long tube fluorescent tubes, emitting cool white light that illuminates the entire space and casts even shadows. The light creates a contrast between light and shadow on the wall and floor. It creates a sense of practicality and a calm atmosphere typical of modern urban public spaces. The metal surface reflects a faint gloss from the surrounding environment, enhancing realism. The middle ground shows the spatial relationship between the figure and the handrail, with the figure's body slightly tilted and head slightly turned toward the camera, creating a subtle dynamic balance. The background features an extended white brick wall and lighting equipment at the top. The patterns are simple yet repetitive, with the overall composition using a mid-shot portrait angle. The camera position is slightly below the subject's line of sight, making the character stand out even more. The composition is layered, with the front armrest, the center shot, the background wall, and lighting in sequence from near to far. The light and shadow come from the fluorescent lamp above, with the direction downward, soft but slightly cold, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall color scheme is mainly black, white, and gray, with low saturation, creating a simple, everyday, and slightly oppressive urban atmosphere. The image texture is close to everyday phone photography, with clear details but not overly sharpened, as if casually taken on an ordinary night after work. Full of life yet tinged with loneliness and tranquility, the composition is stable, using environmental elements to enhance spatial depth, conveying a quiet, reserved, and slightly detached urban youth state. The overall image presents a low-saturation, high-contrast documentary aesthetic, as if capturing a moment drowned out by the city's rhythm—both authentic and emotionally powerful",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
