        {
          "id": "krea2-7ea6ffe1ca3059b960b2e3ff",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔广场站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "Her overall aura is fresh and refined, yet approachable. She wears a white, fitted short square-neck top with fabric that hugs her figure, highlighting her graceful shoulder and neck lines and full bust contour. The sleeves are short-sleeved, simple and elegant. She pairs it with blue jeans on the bottom. The high-waisted design outlines a slender waistline, and the pants fit well but are not tight. The pant legs are slightly rolled up to reveal the ankles, with obvious stitching and metal button details on the pants. The overall look is simple and fashionable, full of youthful energy. The figure is positioned slightly lower and center, occupying the main visual focus. The body is slightly turned to the side, facing the camera directly, with a naturally relaxed posture. Arms hang naturally at the sides, hands not fully visible in the frame. The foreground is a close-up of the upper body, fully visible from head to waist. The middle shot includes the street environment behind her, with cement-paved sidewalk edges, and the road surface clean and tidy. Next to it is an asphalt road with white traffic markings. In the distance, utility poles, intersecting power lines, and street lamps are visible. The background is blue sky and white clouds, a clear blue as if washed clean. A few fluffy, pure white clouds float leisurely. In the distance, you can faintly see a cluster of modern-style residential buildings. The exterior walls are mainly light gray and off-white, the roof is sloped, windows are neatly arranged, surrounded by green trees and shrubs. The composition uses a centered composition, with the figures centered, and the camera angle slightly lower than the level view, creating a slight upward shot. This makes the figure appear more upright and elegant. Light and shadow come from directly above to the right, with plenty of sunlight and bright lighting, creating a soft transition of shadows. The overall atmosphere is warm and bright, full of the realism and life of a summer afternoon. It feels like everyday street photos taken casually with a regular phone or entry-level camera, with a slight film texture and natural noise. The tones are authentic and natural, with moderate color saturation without excessive retouching, preserving authentic light and shadow changes and environmental details, creating a friendly, authentic, A vibrant urban street vibe",
