        {
          "id": "krea2-e86e41ba4392cfd142e05dc2",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣竹林冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an indoor floor covered with bamboo mats, wearing a light gray V-neck short-sleeved cardigan paired with a beige slip dress. Her legs are crossed and slightly extended to one side, her posture elegant and relaxed, adding a touch of gentleness and laziness. Her overall makeup is delicate but not heavy, highlighting a translucent texture. On her left wrist is a pale green jade bracelet and a silver thin chain bracelet. Her fingers are long and her nails neatly trimmed, while her right hand rests gently on her left knee. This creates a subtle sense of balance. She wears a pair of sheer, flesh-colored stockings dotted with evenly distributed black polka dot patterns. Her ankles are slightly curved, with smooth lines. The skin on her legs appears smooth and delicate under the light. The foreground shows her lower body and legs, occupying the main area of the frame, extending from the lower left corner to the middle right, forming a strong visual guiding line. The center features her upper body, sitting posture, and a bed behind her, covered with gray-blue quilts. The quilt folds naturally, presenting a soft and fluffy texture Next to it is a white pillow with clearly visible edges. The background is a plain, light beige wall, flat and unadorned, with only a single vertical golden beam slanting in from the right window, casting a bright shadow on the wall, creating a soft transition between highlights and shadows that enhance the sense of depth. The entire composition is shot at a low angle, with a slightly upward perspective that makes the main subject stand out more and creates an intimate and intimate spatial atmosphere. The composition is arranged diagonally, The tilt of the figure's body aligns with the direction of the light, creating a natural visual flow. The atmosphere of light and shadow is warm and tranquil. Sunlight filters through curtains or blinds, creating strip-like light spots that fall on the floor and the figure, presenting a soft warm yellow tone. This subtly contrasts with cool-toned clothing and quilts, creating a tranquil moment as morning or afternoon sunlight pours indoors. The overall color scheme mainly features neutral tones such as gray, beige, and brown, accented with a touch of black, resulting in a unified and harmonious tone, rich details, and a realistic texture. It feels as if you're shooting with a professional camera in natural light, with a moderate focal length, well-controlled depth of field, and moderate background blur, highlighting the clarity and three-dimensionality of the subject. The image presents a daily scene that combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life—stylish yet realistic, like a carefully composed portrait full of warmth and emotional expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
