          "id": "krea2-491bb5179072b262e12414ea",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙窗边微笑坐戏水",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in front of a rustic wooden window frame, wearing a light blue sleeveless dress with delicate pleats and a slight sheen. The material is light and breathable, presenting a soft drape texture. She wears a gentle smile, as if having a quiet conversation with the viewer. Her skin is fair and radiant, with a healthy glow. Her overall makeup is fresh and natural. Her posture is relaxed and composed, her body slightly leaning forward, leaning against the heavy dark wooden window frame. The window frame surface has clear wood grain and mottled marks left by time. Some areas have a warm brown sheen, with slight wear and scratches along the edges, presenting an antique yet warm texture. The background is a blurred indoor space, and the walls are in warm beige tones. Faintly visible wooden structures and traditional architectural details, light streams in diagonally from the left, forming a soft beam of light and casting light shadows in the background. The contrast is strong but transitions naturally, creating a peaceful and cozy atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the left central position. Using window frames as natural frames enhances visual guidance, the foreground features rugged wooden windowsills and window frames, the middle ground is the main subject, and the background gradually blurs with clear layering, with warm tones predominantly in color Blue, brown, and yellow harmoniously combine to create a warm and cool contrast that echoes each other. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, full of life and poetic beauty, like an afternoon sunlight bathing an old house, capturing the most authentic and touching everyday moments. The image has the texture of film photography, with moderate color saturation, rich details, and natural noise, as if shot with an old camera. It has slight graininess and vignetting effects, enhancing the image's realism and artistic appeal",
