        {
          "id": "krea2-04180f5acd3215e5923bf618",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙沉思站立侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a dark dress with white and light blue floral patterns. The dress features a V-neck design with elegant neckline lines. The short sleeves feature puff sleeves tailored and tightened, presenting a vintage yet refined style. At the waist is a wide black leather belt with a smooth surface and a slight reflective surface. The belt is tied into a simple bow, accentuating a slender waistline. The hem of the dress spreads out in an A-shape, giving the whole look elegance and grace. She wears a pair of round pearl earrings on her earlobes, with a small diamond set in the center, reflecting sparkling light and adding a touch of understated luxury. She tilts her head slightly, her expression calm and confident, as if gazing into some distant yet familiar place. The background is an indoor space, with walls in light gray or off-white, giving a delicate texture On the wall hang two beautifully mounted frames, each framed with gold and lined with a white canvas. The content is vague, but you can faintly see minimalist geometric lines or abstract patterns. In the left background is a desk lamp, made of white fabric and emitting a warm yellow glow. The light gently illuminates the surroundings, creating a cozy and comfortable atmosphere. The lamp is placed on a wooden tabletop, with clear texture and light brown color. There may also be some small decorations placed on the table, but due to the shallow depth of field, Details are blurry, with the foreground mainly featuring the figure, occupying most of the space. The composition uses a medium shot close-up, with the figure fully presented above the waist, the body slightly tilted, forming a graceful S-shaped curve. The middle shot includes the figure's body, arms, and part of the skirt, while the background is blurred to create a soft out-of-focus bokeh effect, making the subject stand out more. The composition uses shallow depth of field and diagonal guide lines. In terms of lighting, the main light source comes from the right front of the figure, simulating natural light or soft indoor lighting. Light hits from the side, creating a natural shadow transition on the other side, creating a beautiful halo effect. The desk lamp in the background provides warm light, giving the overall tone a warm tone with moderate color saturation. The overall atmosphere is calm and elegant, full of intelligence and gentleness. The image presents a high-end photographic texture, as if shot with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens, while still maintaining the closeness of everyday life. It feels like a high-quality portrait shot with amateur equipment—authentic and natural. There are no signs of excessive embellishment; the overall color tone of the image is harmonious and unified, mainly black, white, and gray, accented with a touch of blue and warm yellow, creating a calm yet warm visual experience. The details are rich, showcasing extremely high image generation quality, with a strong sense of artistic beauty and an immersive viewing experience",
