        {
          "id": "krea2-7bc1ac410f068331b69477dd",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙公园俏皮站立招手",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by a white metal railing in an outdoor park, gently waving at the camera. Her right hand is raised in front of her in a waving gesture. Her fingers are long, and her nails are painted a pale pink nail polish. She wears an off-white polka dot chiffon short-sleeve top with a delicate ruffle neckline, a bow tie decoration on the chest, and puff-style sleeves decorated with lace trim. She wears a pink and white plaid multi-layered cake dress with distinct layers and a fluffy hem, giving the overall look a sweet, cute, and full of charm. Her body is slightly tilted to the camera, her posture naturally relaxed. Her left hand rests on the white railing, arms outstretched, presenting a relaxed and joyful state. In the foreground is a clear white metal railing arranged in vertical lines, forming a visual frame that frames the figure slightly to the left center. In the middle is a thick pink cylindrical pillar behind the figure, smooth and brightly colored, contrasting with the surrounding environment. The background is lush green trees with dense foliage and interlaced branches. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting dappled shadows. In the distance, you can see a winding walking path, with other visitors strolling along both sides. There are also several traditional-style pavilions and architectural silhouettes. The sky is a bright light blue, with soft and warm light. The overall composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned at the main subject. Through the foreground railing, central columns, and background trees, a clear sense of spatial layering is created. Visual guidance starts from the foreground railing and extends along the figure's body lines into the deep background space. Color contrast and depth of field variations enhance the image's three-dimensionality, creating a bright and fresh lighting atmosphere. Sunlight shines from above and sides, with soft shadows. Natural light and dark transitions appear in the folds of clothing. The overall color palette is mainly soft pink, white, and green, creating a warm and romantic summer afternoon atmosphere. The image has a strong sense of daily life and life, resembling a real scene shot with a regular phone, with slight lens distortion and natural noise, presenting a realistic and approachable visual effect. The overall look is full of youthful energy and sweetness, evoking a relaxed and happy mood",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
