        {
          "id": "krea2-ea62d8e9a5cc30dcd1e7be9b",
          "alias": "单女棕外套森林微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor step, wearing a natural smile, her expression calm and slightly contemplative. She wears a loose brown corduroy jacket over a white knit sweater underneath, paired with matching corduroy wide-leg pants, and a dark leather belt at her waist. The overall look is simple yet warm, with long, slender fingers and an elegant and natural posture. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space to highlight the subject. The middle ground is her lower body and surrounding environment, with a blurred autumn forest in the background. The leaves display a gradient of golden, orange-red, and brownish hues. Sunlight filters through the gaps, creating a mottled light and shadow effect. The light is soft and warm, presenting a typical backlit shooting effect. The sun is positioned at the upper right of the frame, creating distinct contour light and highlights, creating a dreamy atmosphere. The overall tone of the image is warm, mainly brown, gold, and beige, with a slight retro filter texture. Color saturation is moderate, contrast is soft, and the background is highly blurred. Using a large-aperture lens produces a shallow depth of field effect. The composition presents an asymmetrical beauty, with the figure slightly tilted and the gaze forming a subtle angle with the camera, creating intimacy. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, gentle, and romantic, filled with the lazy and pleasant mood of an autumn afternoon, as if capturing a tranquil moment. It has a cinematic and film-like feel, rich in detail, clear layering, natural light and shadow transitions, and the image is poetic and story-rich, as if shot with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture prime lens, yet retains the spontaneity and realism of everyday photography. presenting an aesthetic style that is both refined and unforced",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
