        {
          "id": "krea2-c48238ebb5a1d26175768d43",
          "alias": "单女黑礼服困倦展示",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman, with an overall elegant and noble temperament that exudes a natural sheen. She wears a magnificent gemstone necklace set with numerous deep blue and black gemstones, surrounded by sparkling crystals and metal decorations forming intricate geometric patterns. The necklace forms a wide decorative band around her neck, highlighting her graceful collarbone lines. She wears a black strapless gown with delicate fabric texture, slight pleats and sheen, showcasing a sense of haute couture craftsmanship. The composition centers on the figure, using close-ups and blurred backgrounds, presenting a soft gray-brown gradient that creates a peaceful and mysterious atmosphere, creating a contrast of light and shadow and rich light and shadow layers, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and giving the overall tone a warm tone. However, dominated by black and deep blue, creating a strong visual contrast, the image has a cinematic texture and artistic feel, as if shot with professional photography equipment, while retaining the realism of everyday amateur camera shooting. The lens captures fleeting elegance and charm, with moderate color saturation, clear details, and obvious background blur, highlighting the main character. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and story-rich, offering a visual experience that is both dreamy and authentic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
