        {
          "id": "krea2-cee6143292d15bf944b9b436",
          "alias": "单女粉外套摄影棚忧伤侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman holding a transparent umbrella on a rainy night looks natural and lively, revealing a quiet yet slightly melancholic mood with a slight sheen, as if about to speak or sigh softly. She wears a pink down jacket that is fluffy and full, showing clear quilted textures and three-dimensional pleats. The neckline is slightly open, revealing a white knit sweater underneath. A black bag is slung across her shoulder, with a thin strap that contrasts with the overall tone. Her posture is slightly turned to the side, with her head slightly tilted, creating a casual yet elegant feeling In the foreground is the edge of a transparent umbrella, whose surface reflects the surrounding light spots, creating a dreamy bokeh effect. Raindrops slide down on the umbrella, leaving fine water marks and reflective spots, enhancing the moist texture of the image. The background is a blurry night park scene, with the silhouette of a row of wooden benches, distant silhouettes of trees and scattered lights, creating soft light spots that create a hazy and tranquil atmosphere. The entire composition uses close-up shots, with the figures occupying most of the space. Highlighting the subject's delicate expressions and emotional expression, the film draws viewers' attention through gradients of light and color. Light comes from the sides and above, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. The shadows are delicate, while the background light sources intertwine warm yellows and cool blues, creating a visual contrast of warm and cool colors. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, romantic, and slightly lonely, as if capturing a moment of inner monologue on a rainy night. The images present high resolution, ultra-fine detail, and authentic texture, delivering professional studio-level image quality, while still retaining the realism of everyday handheld device shooting, like a story photo taken on a rainy night street with a phone. There are no obvious traces of artificial force, and all elements blend naturally, presenting a poetic everyday atmosphere that is both artistic and close to everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
