        {
          "id": "krea2-7eadb9b037b8d4eda3076bb5",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣车内俏皮坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the back seat of a car, wearing a fluffy, soft off-white plush animal-shaped hat, giving off a warm and playful vibe. Her hands gently support the sides of the hat, and her fingers are painted with pink nail polish, making her look especially refined. She wears a white knit sweater with obvious twisted knit patterns on the cuffs, echoing the plush texture of the hat, creating a cozy and cozy winter atmosphere that adds a touch of casualness and authenticity. She tilts her head slightly, wearing light makeup. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the left, heads slightly tilted, creating a dynamic sense of balance. The background is the car's interior, with gray seats and door linings clearly visible but blurred to highlight the main subject. Light comes from the car window, creating a natural transition between light and shadow. The shadowed areas are delicate and not abrupt, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall color palette is mainly warm white and beige-brown, paired with a light gray background, creating a peaceful and cozy visual feeling, as if on a cold winter day A quiet moment inside the car, full of life and everyday beauty, is shot in a style similar to close-up shots with a phone or portable camera, with slight lens distortion and details preserved in real scenes. All these make the images feel more authentic and approachable, with an overall warm and healing atmosphere, combining fashion with a sense of everyday life, creating a relaxed and pleasant mood",
