        {
          "id": "krea2-63875b13c21031e8f58c3999",
          "alias": "单女T恤城市站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman adds a touch of laziness and gentleness. The color is rich and textured, and the overall makeup is clean yet refined. She wears a light champagne-colored silk camisole with a low neckline that reveals the collarbone. The fabric glows softly under the light, giving it a delicate texture. The background is a single light beige wall, simple yet not monotonous, without unnecessary decoration, making the main subject stand out. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure centered with a slightly tilted head, looking directly at the camera, creating a strong visual guidance. Light and shadow shine slightly to the left from the front, with natural shadow transitions, creating a sense of depth and enhancing the layering of the image. The overall atmosphere is quiet and private, like the moment afternoon sunlight streams through the curtains into the room, filled with warmth, tranquility, and gentleness. The color scheme is harmonious and unified. It has a sense of sophistication, presenting a realistic look like everyday life taken with a phone or regular camera. The details are rich but not overly retouched, preserving the natural texture of the skin and subtle changes in light. It feels like a selfie taken casually by the window alone on a morning or dusk. It is authentic and moving, full of life yet still artistically beautiful. The overall style leans toward the elegance and restraint of modern urban women, combining fashion and approachability. The images are full of storytelling and spark the imagination.",
