        {
          "id": "krea2-9d72dccee4c8eba13b311258",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔山野忧伤持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a loose white long-sleeve sweatshirt made of soft material, with slight wrinkles and light variations on the surface. Black lines outline decorative patterns on the shoulders and sleeves, with the letter \"FA\" printed on the chest. She pairs it with blue jeans, creating a casual and comfortable look. She folds her hands in front of her, looking naturally relaxed, with her body slightly turned to the camera. The head is slightly tilted, creating a warm yet slightly detached atmosphere. The foreground focuses on the figure, occupying the right central position. The composition uses medium shots, with the figure fully presented above the knees. The background is a blurred outdoor scene, with blurred mountain outlines and green trees in the distance. The sky shows a pale blue tone of morning or evening, soft lighting, with leaf silhouettes and scattered light spots at the top, forming a beautiful circular halo (bokeh). In the background, a faint body of water can be seen. The water surface reflects faint daylight, adding a touch of tranquility. The overall color palette is mainly cool tones, with white, blue, and green intertwined, creating a fresh and cool visual sensation. Light and shadow come from above, creating a natural transition between light and dark, while shadows are gently distributed around the neck and shoulders, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall composition has a strong sense of depth, with a clear foreground and gradually blurred background. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, gentle, and slightly melancholic, as if capturing a moment in the afternoon or dusk. It carries a literary vibe with Japanese photo photography style. The image texture is delicate and detailed, as if shot with a professional camera under natural light, yet retains the casualness and authenticity of daily life, presenting an aesthetic that is both beautiful and close to life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
