        {
          "id": "krea2-12054d3deee0656e91c246a3",
          "alias": "单女黑毛衣街道冷淡坐侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a loose black knit sweater with off-shoulder designs, revealing her slender collarbones and some shoulder lines. The sweater is thick with clearly visible texture, wide sleeves that drape naturally, and a thin white camisole underneath that subtly reveals the outline of the underwear. She wears white over-the-knee socks with white elastic bands at the ankles, and the socks are thin and translucent. The leg lines are long and well-proportioned, sitting relaxed, the right hand naturally resting on the knee, fingers long, fingers neatly trimmed and painted with light nail polish. The left hand rests gently on the leg, with a faint shadow transitioning at the wrist. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, body slightly tilted to the frame, head slightly tilted. The composition uses medium shots and close-ups, occupying the main part of the frame. The background is a glass window, and outside the window is a blurry city street scene. You can see several bare trees with interlaced branches, and the sky appears in a gray-blue hue. In the distance, there are low building silhouettes, and inside the windows, the red neon light strips reflect the interior. These strips are arranged horizontally, emitting warm red light, creating distinct reflections and layered light and shadow on the glass, while also reflecting the figures' reflections, creating a visual layer that blends solid and void. The window frame structure is clear, the metallic texture is distinct, and the reflections also include some vague outlines of indoor furniture, such as tables and chairs. The overall environment appears modern with a slight urban feel, with light coming from a mix of natural outdoor light and indoor artificial light sources. The main light source shines from the left side, enhancing the sense of depth, while red neon lights shine from behind and sides, adding a touch of warm color to the scene. Light and shadow intertwine, creating a visual tension that blends warm and cool. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of storytelling, as if capturing a fleeting moment of real life in a café or bookstore at dusk. The image features a strong Japanese aesthetic style, with restrained yet sophisticated color combinations. The tones are mainly black, white, blue, and red. It has a slight everyday shooting feel, as if taken at close range with a regular camera, preserving natural depth of field changes and slight noise texture. The edges of the frame have slight vignetting to enhance the focus of the main subject, presenting an overall style that combines artistry and realism, like a carefully composed street portrait, combining the refinement of virtual beauty with the simplicity of everyday life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
