        {
          "id": "krea2-439bed096d30a385078b03c2",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫教室愤怒站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the center of the classroom, wearing a white long-sleeved shirt and a black pencil skirt. The sleeves of the shirt are rolled up to the elbows, and the neckline is slightly open, giving her a sharp yet approachable look. Her hands are crossed, hugging a bright blue folder. The surface of the folder is smooth and reflective, with metal fasteners clearly visible. Her posture is upright and natural, her body slightly turned to the camera, and her head tilted slightly, creating a professional and approachable atmosphere. The foreground features the main figure, occupying the left central position of the composition. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, presenting the figure fully from ankle to head. The background is a typical classroom environment. Behind it is a dark gray blackboard with faint chalk writing and geometric patterns. Below the blackboard is a dark wooden storage cabinet. On the right side are metal-framed bookshelves or storage cabinets. In the lower right corner, some wooden desks and chairs are visible. The tabletop is light brown with silver metal legs, and the floor is dark wood with natural wood grain patterns. The overall lighting is soft and even, with simulated daylight from the front slightly above. The light source is warm and not glaring, shadows transition naturally without strong contrast, creating a quiet and focused learning atmosphere. The color scheme is mainly black, white, and gray, accented with a bright blue folder as a visual focal point to enhance the sense of layering in the image. The lens uses a standard viewing angle with a moderate focal length, with a slight background blur that highlights the subject. The composition is stable and balanced, and the overall style is realistic and artistic, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains the authentic details of everyday teaching scenes presenting a warm scene that combines a sense of professionalism with a sense of everyday life",
          "description": "",
