        {
          "id": "krea2-2bdff1309c136efb2cc13a4d",
          "alias": "单女白挂脖椅上倚靠比耶",
          "prompt": "Her body leans slightly forward, her posture dignified, gently holding a blue-gold patchwork clutch with both hands. The handle is smooth and made of leather or premium synthetic leather, with the blue part in deep navy blue and the gold part in matte metallic texture. The bag is simple and modern with smooth lines. She wears a black ring on her right ring finger, with a simple design and unique style. She is wearing a white halter dress. The dress features a high neckline design, with two round buttons at the neckline to form a V-shaped open front. The dress is covered with delicate wavy patterns, and the fabric has a silky sheen and pleats, hugging the figure and highlighting graceful curves. She sits on a wooden chair with a curved backrest, and the seat is made of deep brown solid wood with natural wood grain. In the background is a small round table with light brown edges, and on the table sits a transparent glass vase with several withered plant branches inserted inside. The branches are slender, the leaves are gray-green in color, and the shape is natural. Next to the vase is a scroll made of white paper, wrapped in a black cloth cover on the outside, partially unfolding to reveal the inner text or patterns. The background wall is off-white, with a smooth surface. On the left side is a window with a wooden frame, a traditional Chinese style with a dark brown frame, allowing soft natural light to flow outside. On the right wall hangs a row of hanging lamps, each with white spherical lampshades paired with black metal brackets, arranged neatly, with several small lamps below. The lighting is warm and soft, creating a cozy atmosphere. The entire scene is bright, with the main light source coming from the upper left. Natural light combined with indoor lighting creates a uniform lighting effect. The light and shadow are soft, with natural transitions in shadow without strong contrast. The composition centers on the figures, using medium shots that occupy the main positions. Background elements are reasonably distributed: the foreground features the figures and clutches, the middle ground features tables, vases, and scrolls, and the background includes walls, windows, and lamps. The gaze naturally shifts down to the clutch and body. Extending to background details, the overall color scheme is mainly white, beige, and brown, accented with blue and gold, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The image is full of Eastern charm and modern fashion, combining classical beauty with contemporary design. The atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, as if capturing a tranquil afternoon. The image is high-definition, richly detailed, and authentically textured, as if shot with a professional camera, yet carries a casual sense of everyday life, like a hobbyist casually capturing beautiful moments on their phones. The light and shadow are delicate and the layers are distinct. The overall composition is balanced and full of artistic flair",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
