        {
          "id": "krea2-9cd65969cffcc49a3d3d7e36",
          "alias": "单女金毛衣街道站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at a street corner in the city, wearing a pale yellow knit cardigan over a white lace-collared shirt, a light plaid skirt below, and holding a fluffy, soft white plush jacket in her right hand. The overall look is fresh and sweet yet elegant in temperament. Her posture is natural and relaxed, her body slightly turned to the side, her left hand gently holding the coat, presenting an effortless, casual beauty. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the composition, occupying the main visual space, with a clear figure and the white jacket in her hand in the foreground. The middle frame features mottled yellow and black speed bumps, gray cement roads, and utility poles and trees along the roadside. In the background is a reddish-brown exterior building with windows and graffiti marks on the walls. Nearby, several flowering trees bloom with pure white flowers on their branches. The branches crisscross, the sky is a bright pale blue, and sunlight pours down from the upper right, casting soft shadows on the ground and the figures. The light is warm and layered, creating a peaceful and harmonious atmosphere full of spring spirit. The shot was shot with natural light. The color palette is mainly warm yellow, accented with white, green, and red. The color combination is harmonious and unified. The composition uses the rule of thirds, with the characters near the golden ratio point. The background elements are rich but not cluttered, creating a good visual direction. The background gradually extends from the foreground to the middle ground's streets and the buildings and trees in the background, creating a profound sense of space. The camera uses a standard angle to simulate everyday phone or camera shooting, with a slight film texture and realistic environmental noise. It's as if you're shooting a moment on the street with amateur equipment, capturing an ordinary yet touching moment of life. The details are rich, and even the wear marks on the ground and the outlines of leaves are clearly visible, presenting an authentic, natural, and friendly everyday aesthetic",
