        {
          "id": "krea2-7bd90d102a342b8ef80b1c9d",
          "alias": "单女金长裤站立回眸",
          "prompt": "She wears a white short-sleeved off-shoulder top that fits her body and outlines a slender waistline. She pairs it with bright yellow high-waisted wide-leg pants, creating a striking contrast and vibrant energy. Her posture is elegant and natural, her body slightly turned to the side, her head looking back at the camera, fingers slightly bent, and her left hand naturally placed near her waist, making the entire movement smooth and natural. It presents a youthful beauty. The foreground is a clear close-up of the figure, occupying the main position from the chest to the thighs. The details are rich, the folds of clothing are clearly visible, the background is a blurred outdoor scene, the sky appears a pure blue, distant green vegetation and white railing outlines are faintly visible, and the blurring makes the subject stand out more. The composition uses a center-to-right golden ratio layout, with the figure on the right side of the painting, leaving space on the left to balance the visual flow, creating a dynamic visual flow, with the viewing angle slightly lower than the level view. A slightly upward shot makes the figure appear taller and more attractive. The light and shadow come from the natural sunlight slightly above the front, with soft and even light without strong shadows, presenting a healthy sheen. The light and shadow on the clothing transition naturally, and the yellow pants look especially vivid in the sunlight. The overall atmosphere is bright and fresh, full of summer warmth and vitality. The main colors are white, yellow, and blue, with moderate saturation—neither harsh nor dull, creating a clean, comfortable, and pleasant visual experience. The images have a strong sense of everyday life, as if captured with a regular camera or mobile phone, with a slight film texture and natural depth of field. The details are rich and layered, presenting an overall style that is lifelike, authentic, and still artistically beautiful",
