        {
          "id": "krea2-7b2801e6471596a9a1e41e94",
          "alias": "单女全裸金T恤户外俏皮站立侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a pale yellow camisole with slender straps and ruffled decorations at the neckline, appearing sweet yet elegant. Over it, she wears a light pink knit cardigan. The knit texture is clearly visible, with even and fine stitches. The sleeves hang naturally, partially covering the arms. The overall outfit is fresh and soft, with harmonious and warm colors, giving a comfortable and pleasant feeling. Her right hand is gently raised, fingers naturally bent, fingertips lightly touching near her temples, her posture elegant and natural, as if making a playful salute. Her hands are slender and long, her nails neatly trimmed, painted with a light nude nail polish. The details are well handled, her body slightly tilted, and her head tilted slightly. A beautiful diagonal line composition is formed, enhancing the dynamic and layered nature of the image. The background is a blurred green grass and the distant outlines of trees. Using shallow depth of field, the main subject stands out more. The background blurs to present a soft bokeh effect, mainly green tones accented with natural light spots, creating a tranquil and fresh outdoor atmosphere. Light comes from natural daylight, softly and evenly on the subject, without obvious shadows. The overall color tone is warm and soft, mainly pink, yellow, and green. The color scheme is fresh and pleasing, with close-up shots in the composition. The characters occupy most of the image, highlighting the main features. The overall image presents a sense of capturing a relaxed and joyful moment in daily life, as if it were a high-quality life photo taken with a regular camera or phone—authentic and natural, untouched, full of a strong sense of life and artistic beauty. The light and shadow atmosphere is warm and peaceful, allowing people to feel the beauty of youth and the tranquility of life",
