        {
          "id": "krea2-f8d5d1e09d94ba20ee862784",
          "alias": "单女米衬衫冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits sideways, wearing gold-rimmed round glasses. The lenses reflect faintly, reflecting the blurred light and shadow of the surroundings. Her fingers are long and elegant, wearing a light beige loose shirt with soft fabric that fits the body tightly, sleeves slightly rolled up, giving off a casual yet stylish look. In the lower left corner of the foreground is a vintage-style silver film camera, clearly visible with a camera body rich in details and mechanical texture. The background is a dark-toned indoor environment, with blurred lighting forming warm circular light spots that create a distinct bokeh effect. Light streams diagonally from the right, creating rich layers of light and shadow and creating a cozy and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the characters occupying most of the space. The angle of view is slightly upward, enhancing the spatial sense and storytelling of the image. The colors are mainly warm yellow and brown, creating a harmonious contrast of cool and warm tones. The overall image has a delicate texture, as if shot with professional photography equipment. It features cinematic light and shadow treatment and artistic beauty, while preserving the authentic and natural capture of everyday moments, like a casual photo taken with a medium format camera in a café or study, full of artistic flair and emotional warmth",
