        {
          "id": "krea2-0d2855f3c656359139847eb9",
          "alias": "单女灰连衣裙广场俏皮坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A close-up of a woman sitting on an indoor sofa, her overall temperament gentle yet tinged with mystery. She wore a light gray off-shoulder dress with vertical stripes, loose sleeves hanging down, a uniquely designed neckline with tie decorations, revealing one shoulder and collarbone lines. Around her neck was a delicate silver necklace, adding a delicate detail. Her legs were crossed, and on her left leg was a black English tattoo reading \"LIFE ZOOL.\" Her hand posture was natural, and her right hand held a black smartphone. In his left hand, he holds a can of green soda. His fingers are long, his nails neatly trimmed. The composition centers on the figure, using a medium to close perspective. The figure occupies about two-thirds of the frame, with the body slightly tilted and the head slightly tilted, creating a natural visual direction. The background is a modern-style indoor environment. The wall behind is made of horizontally arranged wooden slats, presenting a warm brown tone. The wood grain is clearly visible, giving a sense of layering. In front of the wall is a dark tabletop with a black square box, several sheets of paper, and a pen placed on top The items are placed casually but orderly, creating a lively-like atmosphere. The foreground features a soft beige fabric sofa with a delicate texture and slight wrinkles at the edges, forming an intimate spatial relationship with the figure's sitting posture. The overall lighting is soft and even, coming from warm yellow indoor lighting. The light source is positioned slightly to the right in front of the figure, creating a natural shadow transition. There are subtle highlights around the neck and arms, and the layered clothing folds have rich light and shadow variations, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The wooden wall in the background creates gradient light and shadow layers under the lighting, highlighting the texture of the material. The overall tone of the image leans toward warmth, mainly brown, beige, and gray-white, accented with cool-toned green beverage cans. The color contrast is harmonious and unawkward, the atmosphere is quiet and comfortable, full of the relaxed and private feel of daily life, giving it the texture of authentic photography. It feels like a moment casually captured with a phone or regular camera, without excessive retouching, preserving authentic light and shadow details and slight noise. The composition is balanced with appropriate blank space, with the visual focus focused on the characters' expressions and postures, guiding viewers to feel their inner emotions. The visuals are delicate and vivid, rich in storytelling and immersion",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
