        {
          "id": "krea2-24669527d9f73b38e3fdc303",
          "alias": "单女蓝连体衣城市冷淡站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an outdoor asphalt pavement, wearing a deep blue tight-fitting long-sleeve jumpsuit with a unique design. One shoulder is exposed, showcasing graceful collarbone lines and neck curves. The garment fits the body's contours, accentuating a slender waist and long legs. Casually draped over her shoulders, adding a touch of laziness and naturalness. She leans slightly to the side, her head gently turning toward the camera to look straight ahead, presenting a soft pink tone. Her overall makeup is exquisite and natural, as if glowing with delicate light under the sunlight. Her right hand hangs naturally, while her left hand supports a silver-gray suitcase. The metal handle and wheels are clearly visible, with a wide asphalt road in the background, white road markings on the ground, and faint traffic signs or building outlines visible in the distance. The entire scene is dominated by cool tones, with blue and gray intertwined, creating a cool, tranquil, and slightly urban atmosphere. Light comes from above, like natural evening light—soft and even, casting faint shadows on the ground and the suitcase. The composition uses a medium shot perspective, with the figure occupying the left central position of the frame, body slightly tilted, creating a dynamic visual balance. The foreground highlights the main subject, while the background is blurred to focus on the character. The line of sight extends to the body lines, then to the suitcase and floor, forming a smooth visual path. The overall composition has a strong sense of fashion and modernity, as if capturing a tranquil moment during a journey, carrying a subtle beauty found in everyday life. Similar to shooting with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens, the out-of-focus blur is natural, color saturation is moderate, details are rich, and light transitions are smooth, presenting a high-quality photographic texture. At the same time, it preserves a sense of chance and spontaneity in real life, like a traveler meeting on the street, carrying stories and emotions. The visuals are full of narrative and emotional tension, making one imagine the destination she is about to visit and the story behind it. The overall atmosphere is both calm and warm, both close and intimate. It is a visual work that combines artistic beauty with realistic warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
