        {
          "id": "krea2-cc754abd1e4cc655890cf788",
          "alias": "单女窗边忧伤倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman leans against a mottled white wall, wearing a black off-shoulder top, slightly tilting her head to gaze at the camera, her expression tinged with laziness and mystery. Her right hand gently rests on the wall, fingers long, her posture elegant and relaxed. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure occupying the main subject, creating a strong visual direction. The diagonal line from the lower left corner to the upper right enhances the depth and dynamic tension of the image, while the middle scene shows the curves of her body and the folds of her clothing. The background features large areas of peeling texture on the wall, presenting a rough and retro texture. White and gray intertwine on the wall, with some gray-brown underlying layers exposed, creating traces of time and spatial layering. Light comes from the window or source on the left side of the painting, with soft natural light slanting in from the upper left corner, creating subtle shadow transitions on the right side and back. The contrast is strong but not harsh, creating an overall quiet and restrained atmosphere, with a hint of decadent aesthetics and a post-industrial era cold tone. The color palette is mainly black, white, and gray creating a visual balance and conflict. The images have the graininess and slight noise of film photography, as if captured with an old-fashioned camera. The composition is compact but not crowded, with just the right amount of blank space. The characters' postures and expressions convey an emotionally independent, confident, yet slightly fragile state. The entire scene feels like a private moment in a forgotten corner, full of narrative and artistic appeal, like a quiet scene in a movie, sparking the imagination. The images are rich in detail and the color saturation is moderate. Emphasizing authenticity and immediacy, the overall style blends fashion photography with documentary aesthetics, presenting a lonely yet beautiful poetic moment in a modern city",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
