        {
          "id": "krea2-825b81373fb903a37f30ddf5",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道困倦站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a city street at night, wearing an off-white long-sleeve collared polo shirt with black double-striped trim on the collar and cuffs. She pairs a dark gray high-waisted pleated short skirt below, presenting a fresh and elegant Japanese collegiate style. In her left hand, she carries a small off-shoulder bag with a pink strap, adding a touch of sweetness. The background is a blurry city night scene. In the distance, a huge cartoon silhouette can be seen, possibly Hello Kitty's head, surrounded by warm yellow and white circular light spots, creating a beautiful bokeh effect and a dreamy atmosphere. The composition uses a central shot, with the character centered, background blur treatment emphasizing the subject, soft and warm light and shadow, the main light source coming from the upper front position, while retaining subtle shadow transitions to make the contour clear. The overall tone of the painting leans toward warmth, mainly off-white, gray, and brown, accented with pink and golden halos. It presents an artistic feel that is both realistic and slightly surreal, as if it were a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera. It has a film texture and slight graininess, rich details, moderate color saturation, and clear layering, perfectly blending youthful vitality with tranquil beauty. The light spots in the background vary in size and are naturally distributed, enhancing spatial depth and storytelling in the image. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and warm, like an ordinary yet poetic evening moment, capturing a moment of beauty in urban life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
