        {
          "id": "krea2-dd262a9013e5cf7a10955f75",
          "alias": "单女粉高领衫摄影棚困倦站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a pure black background, her body slightly turned to the camera, head slightly tilted, expression gentle yet confident, adding a touch of laziness and allure. She wears a light pink sleeveless turtleneck short top made of lightweight and form-fitting material, showcasing smooth curves and delicate fabric texture. The top is clean and sharp, with a unique neckline design that presents elegant lines. She pairs with light blue skinny jeans that fit the body and outline her long legs, with clearly visible details at the waistband. The metal buttons and stitching are exquisitely crafted, creating an overall look that is simple and fashionable yet still sexy and charming. Her left hand is raised behind her head, fingers naturally extended, her arm lines graceful, and her right hand hangs down naturally, creating a relaxed yet expressive pose. She wears small, delicate earrings that reflect a faint glow, adding a highlight to the overall look. The composition uses medium shots and close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space, highlighting the main body's proportions and clothing details. The background is completely blurred in pure black, with no distractions. This makes the subject stand out more. Light shines from the front above, creating a natural transition between light and dark. The shadows are delicate and not abrupt, creating a warm and soft atmosphere of light and shadow. There is a blurred circular light source at the lower right of the background, possibly distant lights or reflections, which adds a sense of space and layering to the image. The overall color palette is mainly pink, blue, and black, harmoniously unified to present a fresh yet slightly sexy visual effect. The image style combines artistic beauty with the realism of everyday shooting. It feels as if the work was shot with a professional camera in the studio, yet retains natural details and texture. The visuals are filled with the independence and confidence of modern urban women. The composition is compact and full of tension, the light and shadow treatment is delicate, colors are faithfully restored, and the overall atmosphere is both dreamy and close to life, offering a tranquil and enchanting aesthetic experience",
          "description": "",
