        {
          "id": "krea2-080a37bd405479e66911540d",
          "alias": "单女上衣广场忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman appears in the frame at an angle, her head slightly tilted to the camera, appearing natural and casual, tinged with a subtle melancholy and contemplation, presenting a soft red tone that creates a three-dimensional effect. She wears a black top with a richly colored scarf draped over her shoulders. The scarf is mainly in orange-red and brown tones, accented with dark geometric patterns and metallic textures, with tassel details along the edges, adding a touch of vintage and artistic flair. The foreground is the main figure, occupying most of the composition. The composition uses low-angle downward or tilted shots, making the figures stand out more and give them a dynamic feel. The background is blurred, presenting a warm indoor environment. Above, square warm yellow lighting installations are visible, softly casting dappled shadows on walls and floors. In the background, wooden structures and blurred furniture outlines are faintly visible, suggesting this is a cozy café or a vintage-style indoor space. The overall composition has a strong visual guiding effect. Then, following her gaze and the direction of the scarf, the image extends deep into the frame. The light and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, dominated by gold and orange tones, creating a tranquil, nostalgic, and slightly romantic everyday atmosphere. It seems to capture the moment of afternoon sunlight streaming through the window into the room. The image texture is delicate and authentic, like high-quality photos taken with a professional camera, but retaining slight film graininess and natural depth blur effects, enhancing realism and artistic beauty. The entire scene presents a poetic sense of everyday life and gentle privacy, evoking a sense of tranquility and profound inner world",
