        {
          "id": "krea2-91ca34315eeb42afaf47007b",
          "alias": "单女连体衣摄影棚专注站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands against a solid-colored light gray-and-white background, her body slightly turned to the side, head slightly tilted, her expression focused and tinged with a hint of lazy allure. Her hands are raised above her head, adding a touch of casualness and softness. She wears a tight black high-neck, long-sleeved jumpsuit made of smooth, skin-hugging material, outlining a slender waistline and full curves. Under the light, the garment shows delicate pleats and a glossy finish. The cropped design reveals her long legs, paired with black stockings, creating a simple yet modern look. The composition centers on the figure, using a full-body perspective in the middle of the scene. The figure occupies most of the space, highlighting their figure and posture. The background is a pure, undisturbed light gray-white gradient wall, creating a minimalist and clean visual environment. Light and shadow are softly projected from the upper front, creating a uniform and bright lighting effect. The neck, shoulders, and arms are smooth in line, and the clothing surface reflects delicate highlights. At the same time, natural shadows are formed on the sides and legs, enhancing the sense of depth and texture. The overall atmosphere is quiet and elegant. It carries the refined feel of a professional studio, with black and white as the main color tones, strong contrast yet harmonious unity. Overall, it presents a calm, restrained yet intrinsic aesthetic style, reminiscent of model shoots in high-end fashion magazines or commercial advertisements, rich in detail and clear layers, with strong artistic expression and a modern aesthetic vibe",
