        {
          "id": "krea2-0dd4a9eb8d04ef3ebcab060d",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙窗边冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "Her makeup is exquisite but not exaggerated, and her overall aura is both cool and approachable. She wears a form-fitting white long-sleeve tight dress made of lightweight and transparent material, creating a semi-transparent effect. The dress is printed with the red Japanese characters \"dentoru,\" with blue shading and white outlines along the font edges. The style resembles retro manga or anime slogans, with a small blurred colorful graffiti pattern below the text. The garment naturally wrinkles due to the body's curves. It highlights a slender waist and slender figure. The right hand hangs naturally, fingers are long, and the left hand is slightly raised at the side, presenting an elegant yet relaxed posture. Wearing a silver earring, the design is simple and modern, reflecting specks of light on the surface, adding detail and texture. The foreground mainly features the figure occupying the center-left position, with a mid-angle perspective, fully visible from above the knee. The background is a dim indoor space, with red brick walls visible behind and clear brick joints with rough texture. It presents an industrial or vintage café feel. Above the wall are window structures with black metal frames, arranged rectangularly. The glass reflects a blurred external light and shadow, and green plants can be faintly seen outside. Several pots of greenery are placed on windowsills or shelves, with lush leaves naturally formed. Some leaves are illuminated by light, showing a warm yellow-green tone. In the right background, there are other blurred decorations and furniture outlines, such as wooden cabinets or shelves with bottles and jars on top, but details are unclear due to the blurred effect. The entire scene is illuminated from the left, creating soft side lighting. The light source may be warm yellow indoor lighting, with natural shadow transitions. Delicate light and shadow changes appear in the folds of clothing, creating a realistic sense of three-dimensionality. The background is relatively dark, creating a clear contrast of depth of field before and back, highlighting the main subject. The composition combines central symmetry with the golden ratio. The figure stands slightly tilted, body weight shifts to one side, head tilts slightly forward, and the gaze shifts slightly away from the frame, enhancing the image's dynamic and narrative quality. It then flows down to the curves of the body and legs, finally returning to the overall contour, forming a smooth Z-shaped visual path. The light and shadow atmosphere is generally warm, mainly off-white, light gray, and reddish-brown, accented with a touch of green and metallic silver, creating a private, tranquil, and slightly lazy nighttime atmosphere. It feels as if on a quiet evening, she stands alone in a corner, waiting for something, or having just finished a conversation. The surroundings are chaotic yet orderly, revealing a sense of life. The images have a strong sense of everyday life and realism, like real moments captured with a regular camera rather than deliberately staged, while retaining artistic beauty. The color saturation is moderate, not overly flashy, rich in detail, and layered.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
