        {
          "id": "krea2-8f89b2a2c8982e089b98cb8e",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫室内冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A half-length portrait of a woman appears light and layered, revealing a healthy blush. She wears a pure white turtleneck knit sweater, with clearly visible textures. The vertical ribbed structure shows delicate undulations and shadows under the light. The turtleneck fits the neck lines, forming a soft curve. The overall garment material appears soft and comfortable, offering good warmth and skin-friendly feel. The composition centers on the figure. Using medium to close shots, the figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, with their heads slightly turned and gaze directed at the viewer, creating an intimate and direct sense of communication. The details are rich, and the background is a pure light blue tone, soft and even, with no obvious textures or debris. Only a faint diagonal light and shadow coming through the window on the left side forms a blurred geometric shape on the wall, hinting at the direction of the light source in the indoor environment. The middle ground is the natural transition between the subject's body and clothing, forming a natural transition with the background. The background blur is handled very cleanly, making the subject stand out more. The overall composition is simple yet aesthetically pleasing. Light and shadow come from the upper left of the image, simulating natural window light. The light is soft and directional, creating delicate light and shadow changes on the sweater surface, highlighting the texture of the fabric. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, cool, and pure, carrying the tranquil atmosphere of a winter morning. The color tones are mainly white and light blue, creating a warm contrast and adding a touch of warmth. The texture of the image is delicate and lifelike. It feels as if a professional studio uses a large-aperture lens, or a high-end camera combines natural light and soft light fabric, presenting an imaging style that combines artistic flair with everyday realism. It is suitable for fashion portraits, personal portraits, or lifestyle aesthetic themes, presenting a quiet, elegant, gentle, and slightly detached modern feminine temperament, like a carefully composed film photograph full of delicate emotional expression and visual appeal",
