        {
          "id": "krea2-b0d473e6bb52271c06d9ce92",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣衣帽间忧伤躺注视",
          "prompt": "A woman lies on her side on soft white bedding, wearing a light blue knit sweater with a natural sliding shoulder, revealing one shoulder and collarbone, adding a touch of laziness and ease. Her makeup is exquisite but not heavy, giving her a gentle yet slightly detached aura. Her left hand rests gently on her leg, and on her ring finger is a silver ring with fine texture that reflects slightly under cool lighting. In the foreground is a small black tabletop with a white ceramic mug on top. The cup body is written in blue handwriting with \"Cute.\" Next to it is a book or magazine with a black cover, printed with white text and patterns, including letters like \"BPEO\" and \"LEOPH,\" along with a circular logo. The middle scene shows the woman's body and surroundings, including some pillows, quilts, and the edge of the bed she leans on. The background is a dim indoor space. On the left is an open wardrobe door, with warm yellow light shining through the edge of the doorframe, forming a soft band of light. Several pieces of clothing hang inside the wardrobe, with faint black-and-white patterns. On the upper shelf is a decorative item featuring anime-style character images. The entire scene is in a low-saturation cool blue tone. The light source comes from the front left of the frame, possibly a phone flash or a small fill light, creating a strong contrast between warm and cool light. Warm yellow light seeps in through the left door gap, forming a warm halo. The shadowed areas are deep but not abrupt, and the composition uses close-ups. The figure occupies the center slightly to the right of the frame, with a slight tilt and direct gaze on the camera, creating a strong visual guidance. In the lower left corner of the image, a small table panel extends diagonally, adding spatial layering. The overall atmosphere is quiet, private, and slightly melancholic, as if capturing a quiet moment of solitude late at night. The image presents a texture of everyday life, like real life clips shot with a regular phone, rich in detail, interlaced light and shadow, and cool yet emotionally expressive colors, exuding a strong modern urban youth lifestyle. The overall image is clean and crisp, free of unnecessary distractions, focusing on expressing the characters' emotions and creating the atmosphere. It presents an aesthetic balance between reality and ideals, as if recording the truest moments of the heart on an undisturbed night",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
