        {
          "id": "krea2-b39677d95478c7b45207084a",
          "alias": "单女透视黑连衣裙楼梯自信倚靠展示",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully leans against the wooden handrail of an indoor staircase. She wears a short black velvet-textured dress with three-quarter sleeves, delicate pleated decorations at the neckline and waist. The skirt is simple and neat, showcasing a mature and fashionable temperament. Her legs are dressed in sheer stockings with fine black polka dot patterns, and on her feet are a pair of bright red stiletto sandals. The heels are slender, and the upper features cross-lace laces, creating a strong color contrast that becomes a visual focal point. She stands sideways, her right leg slightly bent, her left leg straight. The background is a red brick wall, neatly arranged with clear texture, presenting a warm orange-red tone, outlined with bold black lines. The style is simple yet childlike, creating an interesting contrast with the mature temperament of the characters. The stairs are made of dark gray stone steps, Warm yellow LED light strips are embedded beneath each step, softly illuminating the edges and creating a layered effect of light and shadow. The handrails are made of light-colored wood, with smooth surfaces and smooth lines that extend diagonally upward from the left side of the frame to the upper right, guiding the viewer. The overall composition uses diagonal lines, with the stair handrails and the slanted lines of the figures creating strong visual guidance. The light mainly comes from warm lighting at the bottom of the stairs and diffused light sources from the environment, with soft shadows that emphasize three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere blends modern urban fashion with the warm tone of retro industrial style. It combines the sophistication and beauty of commercial photography with the authenticity and lifestyle of everyday shooting. It feels like a street photo taken with a professional camera in a design-rich café or art space. The image has moderate color saturation, warm tones, rich details, and delicate texture, presenting a visual experience that combines artistry and approachability",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
