          "id": "krea2-59db5e2029bb43a868771d4e",
          "alias": "单女白背心窗边倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman creates a casual yet dynamic beauty. She wears a simple white sleeveless top with black English letters printed on the chest in a slightly vintage font. The fabric is thin and breathable, fitting the body's curves, showcasing a natural everyday style. The figure looks directly into the camera with natural colors, giving the overall temperament a balance of coolness and gentleness. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout. The figure is positioned slightly lower and center, with the head slightly tilted, gazing directly at the viewer, creating a strong visual guidance. The middle is the shoulders and upper body, while the background is a dark, blurred environment. Vertical striped textures can be faintly seen, possibly curtains or walls. The tones are mainly dark brown and black, forming a strong contrast with the subject and emphasizing the figure's presence. The use of light and shadow is extremely meticulous: natural light from the sides and rear (such as sunlight by the window) passes through the fine dust in the air, creating a distinct beam effect. It produces soft highlights and delicate shadow transitions, enhancing three-dimensionality and spatial feel, creating layered light and dark variations to create a dreamlike atmosphere. The overall tone leans toward warmth, mainly golden, off-white, and dark brown, with moderate color saturation, avoiding excessive exaggeration to maintain realism. The image texture is close to professional photography, with slight film grain and natural noise, simulating the true details of camera imaging while preserving common portrait photography soft focus edges and depth of field blur, with backgrounds gradually blurring. Highlighting the main subject, the overall atmosphere is tranquil and story-rich, as if capturing a private moment at dawn or dusk, full of artistic flair and emotional tension, like classic freeze-frame scenes from a movie—surreal beauty while still capturing the authentic feel of life",
