        {
          "id": "krea2-a6fc21901f164b1cf9a06aed",
          "alias": "单女白T恤街道害羞比耶",
          "prompt": "Looking directly at the camera, she wears a gentle yet slightly shy smile, presenting a natural, soft pink hue. She wears a form-fitting white short T-shirt with a deep V-shaped neckline, highlighting her graceful collarbone lines and full chest contour. The fabric is lightweight and soft, naturally creating folds and light changes with her movements. She pairs it with high-waisted denim shorts. The pants have a metallic sheen and a silver-gray hue. The hem edges are frayed and ripped, and the pockets are decorated with chains and rivets, adding a touch of street fashion. The overall clothing style is both sexy and casual. The figures pose relaxed and natural, with slightly turned bodies and naturally cinched waists, showcasing a slender waistline and healthy physique. The foreground focuses on the upper body, fully visible from head to waist. The background is a blurred park or street environment, with green trees and shrubs forming soft blurred light spots. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting dappled light and shadows, while the ground reflects a soft glow, creating a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the center-right. The shallow depth of field effect highlights the subject, completely blurring the background and enhancing the sense of layering in the image. The light and shadow extend downward along the neck, chest, abdomen, and then to the legs, forming a smooth visual flow. Light and shadow come from the upper left, simulating natural daylight, with soft and even lighting, while the right side forms subtle shadows to enhance the sense of depth. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and green. White clothing looks especially bright under the sunlight, contrasting with the surrounding environment and creating a fresh and natural summer atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and lifelike, as if shot by a professional camera, yet retains the beauty of casual moments from daily life. It has strong artistic appeal and a sense of life, like a street photo captured by chance, full of realism and warmth. In the background, a few tree trunks and distant railings can be faintly seen, but all are blurred so as not to interfere with the subject. The entire scene is tranquil and vivid, conveying an atmosphere of youth, vitality, and freedom",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
