        {
          "id": "krea2-1d9dbed789b0de1d8033769d",
          "alias": "单女白西装街道俏皮站立交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors on a city street, with soft wavy patterns. She wears an off-white short-sleeved sailor suit with deep blue stripes at the collar and cuffs, paired with a red floral tie-up shirt with white lace trim at the collar, paired with a dark skirt. She carries a brown leather backpack on her shoulder, arms crossed over her chest, her posture both confident and playfully defensive. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The composition uses close-ups with blurred backgrounds to create a shallow depth of field. The background is a blurry city street, where you can see distant buildings, yellow and gray walls, and some green trees and shrubs. There are yellow and black curbstones along the roadside, the ground is a smooth cement surface, and in the distance, a few white streetlight poles and some blurred colorful decorations appear. Light comes from the front and above, belonging to natural illumination, gently and evenly casting on the figures. The shadows transition naturally, and the overall color palette is mainly warm tones. Off-white, red, brown, and green complement each other, creating a warm and fresh atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, with moderate color saturation, giving a realistic feel for everyday shooting, as if shooting with a regular phone or portable camera. The camera has slight shake and slight noise, edges are slightly out of focus, but the subject remains clear and the background is blurred and natural, presenting an overall youthful, energetic, sweet, and cute Japanese style. At the same time, it carries the casualness and naturalness of real-life scenes, as if silently communicating with the viewer. The entire image is full of storytelling and emotional warmth, as if capturing an ordinary yet beautiful moment",
