        {
          "id": "krea2-408cf0673d6bc046197938d5",
          "alias": "单女米外套街道微笑站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors on a sunny street, looking natural and lively, gazing at the camera with a gentle smile, presenting a serene and friendly expression. She wears a loose light beige or cream white jacket made of light, soft material with slight pleats, and a white fitted dress underneath that highlights her slender figure. Her right hand gently holds a transparent plastic cup of iced beverage, with a pale yellow liquid topped with a white milk cap and a straw inserted at an angle, her hand posture naturally relaxed. Her nails are neatly trimmed and painted with light nail polish. Her left hand hangs naturally at her side, and she carries a dark brown leather backpack over her shoulder. The strap of the backpack slips diagonally over her shoulder, clearly showing details. She wears a delicate gold necklace, with a simple cross-shaped pendant that adds a touch of elegance. The overall composition centers on the figure, using close-ups that occupy most of the composition. The background is blurred, presenting a soft bokeh effect. In the distance, a blurred street scene is visible, with faint shaded trees. The mottled light and shadows and the silhouettes of parked vehicles come from the upper left of the frame, creating a strong backlighting effect. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves and falls on the figures, producing distinct contour light and highlights, creating a warm and bright atmosphere. The overall tone of the painting leans toward a warm tone, mainly off-white, light brown, and pale yellow, accented by green trees and blue sky. The colors are harmoniously unified, emphasizing the subject through shallow depth of field. The blurred background contrasts sharply with the foreground, enhancing spatial layering. The overall style is fresh and natural. It carries the atmosphere of everyday life, as if taken with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens, capturing a fleeting moment of beauty under the afternoon sun. The image is full of youthful energy and gentle tranquility, with rich details and delicate light and shadow, presenting a realistic and artistic image texture",
