        {
          "id": "krea2-ae44d70dfcbe473e9c67b8dd",
          "alias": "单女透视粉连衣裙椅上温柔坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a brown leather chair in the modern home appliance showroom, wearing a pink pleated off-shoulder short dress paired with sheer stockings and white transparent high-heeled sandals, naturally draped over her shoulders. Her makeup is exquisite, her left hand resting lightly on her knee, her right hand hanging naturally, and a red wrist strap on her wrist. Her overall posture is elegant and relaxed. The main subject of the painting is this woman, positioned slightly to the right of the center, occupying the visual center. In the foreground is a small round white tabletop with vertical striped wooden legs. On the table is a black wavy decorative plate containing colorful small items. The table and chairs form a stable composition. The center features women and their surroundings, while the background is a bright and tidy home appliance showroom, displaying multiple white upright and wall-mounted air conditioners. The brand logo \"Hisense\" is clearly visible. The wall has display shelves with greenery and promotional materials. The floor is polished with light gray tiles reflecting soft light, making the overall space spacious and airy. The composition uses a mid-shot close-up, with the figure centered slightly to the right. Using spatial layering to create a sense of depth, visual guidance leads from the foreground tables and chairs to the central figures, then extends to the background product display, creating a natural flow of sightlines. The lighting atmosphere is bright and soft, with light and shadows from the top track spotlights and indoor lighting. The light is evenly distributed without strong shadows, highlighting character silhouettes and clothing details. The main tones are white, beige, and pink, creating a fresh and warm commercial atmosphere while preserving authentic shooting textures, simulating everyday amateur equipment shooting styles, using Canon or Sony cameras to shoot indoors, focal length 85mm, aperture f/2.8, ISO 400, shutter speed 1/125 sec, presenting slight noise and natural color reproduction, the image has a lifelike feel, like a casual snapshot taken by customers during shopping breaks. The overall image presents a blend of fashion and everyday beauty, combining the refinement of commercial display with a genuine and intimate personal experience",
