        {
          "id": "krea2-8a6e5bf084601fd4081af9f3",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫窗边微笑站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman appears lively and full of life, with a subtle pink tone reflecting warm light and a subtle sweet smile, presenting a healthy pink. She wears an off-white polka dot chiffon shirt with a wide neckline and pleated design. The small black polka dots are evenly distributed across the fabric, creating an elegant visual rhythm. The material is light and flowing, naturally draping with the body's posture and creating soft light and shadow effects. The main subject is positioned in the foreground, occupying most of the compositional space. The figure is slightly tilted, head tilted, and the view is slightly overlooked, creating a warm and intimate atmosphere. The middle ground is a blurred indoor environment, with a warm light beige or cream wall background with a slight texture. Light enters diagonally from the left, creating a soft side backlight effect. The light source comes from outside the window or indoors, passing through dust particles in the air, forming a clearly visible beam that enhances the depth and dreamlike feel of the composition. The background blur is handled very delicately, making the subject stand out more. The composition uses the classic rule of thirds, leaving enough negative space to enhance breathability. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow, complemented by soft off-white, light brown, and pale pink. The tones are unified and harmonious, without strong contrasts, creating a warm, tranquil, and healing atmosphere. The use of light and shadow is very meticulous: the main light comes from the left front, creating soft highlights, while shadows naturally transition to the left. The details are rich but not abrupt, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and producing a light spot effect similar to the Tyndall effect. This adds artistry and drama to the visuals, creating an overall atmosphere that is tranquil and romantic, as if capturing the gentle moment of afternoon sunlight. It has a cinematic style that simulates professional portrait photography, such as the Canon 5D Mark IV paired with an 85mm f/1.2 prime lens, using a large aperture to achieve an extreme shallow depth of field. The image quality is delicate and sharp, noise control is excellent, colors are reproduced true and natural, while also incorporating slight film graininess and soft color overflow. Mimicking the texture of vintage film cameras, post-processing preserves the original light and shadow layers without excessive embellishment, maintaining a balance between realism and artistry. Overall, it presents an aesthetic experience that is both everyday and poetic. It's like casually capturing moments of life by the window with a vintage camera, unexpectedly capturing the most touching moment. The image details are rich, showcasing a high level of artistry and emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
