          "id": "krea2-586b0711609f02bd4fe244de",
          "alias": "单女森林忧伤注视",
          "prompt": "A half-length portrait of a woman adds a touch of vitality and softness, radiating a healthy glow, carrying a hint of melancholy and contemplation. Slightly open, as if about to whisper softly, she wears a light blue V-neck top made of soft and fitted material, with smooth shoulder lines. The neckline reveals a slender section of collarbone and neck, and she wears a delicate gold necklace. The pendant is a simple geometric shape, emitting a warm metallic sheen. The overall look is fresh and natural, full of youthful energy. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure centered. The head is slightly tilted, and the gaze is directly at the lens, creating a strong visual direction. The background is a blurred outdoor environment, presenting soft green and brown tones, possibly a corner of a forest or park. Using a shallow depth of field effect to blur the background and highlight the main subject, light comes from the front and side, creating a warm and bright light and shadow atmosphere that enhances the sense of depth. The overall color tone mainly uses a contrast of warm and cool tones, while the green and brown background further enrich the image layers. The image texture is delicate and realistic, with clear and visible details. It delivers professional studio-level image quality while preserving the natural feel and lifestyle of outdoor shooting. It's as if a high-end portable camera is capturing a sunny afternoon moment, conveying a tranquil, gentle, and slightly artistic atmosphere, allowing people to feel the beauty and innocence of youth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
