        {
          "id": "krea2-b4d559ce080207661619cd82",
          "alias": "单女忍者忧伤持械",
          "prompt": "Her right hand covers her left shoulder, fingers long, nails painted with black nail polish, and the backs of her hands and shoulders are stained with mottled black liquid, resembling ink or blood. Her left hand holds a slender black katana, its blade slanting through the frame, forming a cross composition with her body. The background is a white wall covered in blurred calligraphy, faintly visible on the wall Chinese characters like \"decorative character\" (heart), \"decorative character\" (fortune), and \"decorative character\" (misfortune) are partially covered by black ink, creating an ancient and oppressive atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly black, white, and gray. Light streams in from the upper and lower back, creating a strong backlighting effect along the edges of the figure's contours, giving the figure a silhouette-like silhouette. The contrast of light and shadow is striking, with clear contrasts between light and shadow. The central figure is the visual focal point, with a symmetrical composition in the foreground. The foreground shows the main figure and the knife, while the middle features her body and arm movements. The background features walls with calligraphic elements, creating a dynamic tension. The overall atmosphere is gloomy, mysterious, and full of fusion of Eastern classical aesthetics with modern dark styles. It has a strong sense of artistry and storytelling, as if it comes from a fine digital painting. The image texture is delicate, details are rich, and the light and shadow treatment is exquisite, presenting a cinematic visual effect, like a high-quality portrait taken with professional photography, yet tinged with surreal fantasy tones. The characters' expressions are cold and restrained. It exudes an aura of authority without anger. The entire scene seems frozen in a suspenseful moment, reminiscent of female assassins or ninja characters in martial arts novels. The imagery is rich in layering, from the foreground characters to the actions in the middle to the text in the background, progressing step by step with a strong sense of space. The use of color is restrained yet powerful, using minimalist black-and-white tones to highlight the characters' emotions and themes. The composition is compact yet breathable, with strong visual impact, presenting an overall refined aesthetic taste and unique artistic style",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
