        {
          "id": "krea2-c56225886bcabd9324fd5089",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤卧室沉思坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bed in her bedroom, looking directly at the camera, her expression slightly lazy and contemplative, showing a natural, soft pink tone. Her makeup is exquisite but not exaggerated, with a slight sheen. She wears a blue camisole made of soft knit fabric that fits her body and highlights her graceful shoulder and neck lines and collarbone contours. She wears a white shirt casually draped over her arms, with sleeves naturally hanging down and loosely folded hems on her thighs, creating a richly layered visual effect. She wears light blue jeans below. The pants fit perfectly, with slight wear and holes at the knees, adding a touch of casual and street style. Her body leans slightly forward, legs crossed, one hand naturally resting on her leg, the other gently resting on the edge of the bed, a relaxed yet elegant posture. The background is a cozy bedroom environment, with three beautifully framed paintings hanging on the white walls—one is a portrait, the other two are art-style photos or illustrations. The frames are deep colors, contrasting with the wall. The headboard is a black wooden headboard, simple and modern. The bed is covered with white sheets and pillows, with a beige cushion beside it that feels soft. The lighting throughout the space is soft and even, with natural light streaming through the curtains on the left side into the room, creating a warm, diffused glow that creates a peaceful, comfortable, and slightly intimate atmosphere. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, body extending diagonally to create a smooth visual flow. The foreground shows clear legs and some bedding, the middle ground shows the main body and upper body, and the background features wall decorations and the headboard area The layers are distinct, blending solid and void, with a slightly blurred background that highlights the main subject. The overall color scheme is mainly cool blue and warm white, accented with a touch of brown and black. The colors are harmonious and unified, the image texture is delicate and high-end, as if shot with professional photography equipment, while still preserving the warmth of everyday life. It presents an artistic style that combines fashion and lifestyle. The image details are rich, textures are clear, light and shadow treatment is natural, shadows are soft, and there are no harsh edges, creating a realistic and emotionally rich moment capture",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
