        {
          "id": "krea2-53f7a1921a4edab1ed276290",
          "alias": "单女白T恤床微笑坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an indoor bed, radiating a warm golden glow and natural plumpness, showing a gentle and sweet smile as she gazes at the camera with a smile. She wears a white spaghetti camisole with a slightly low neckline that outlines her graceful collarbones, layered with a dark gray loose knit cardigan with sleeves casually rolled up to her elbows. She wears light gray sports shorts with drawstrings at the waistband, and off-white over-the-knee socks neatly wrapped above the knees. She sits cross-legged with her legs, Her body leans slightly forward, her left hand holding up a white pillow with pale green plant patterns, the pillow pressed above her head, her right hand naturally resting at her side, relaxed and lazy. The background is a cozy bedroom environment, behind her is a wooden bookshelf filled with daily necessities, including a box of milk drinks with Japanese characters, a bright red apple, a green fruit, as well as some books and paper boxes. Above the bookshelf is a round woven basket, and on the left side of the painting is a window. Sunlight streams in diagonally from outside the window, forming a bright beam that passes through the curtains and falls on the figures and surrounding spaces, creating a warm and soft backlighting effect that enhances the sense of depth and layering. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space, the head slightly tilted, and the gaze directly interacting with the viewer, creating an intimate visual guide. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and off-white, accented with gray and green, creating a quiet, comfortable, and lazy home atmosphere. The image feels delicate and authentic. It feels like shooting with a medium format camera, using a large-aperture lens, with well-controlled depth of field, a slight blurred background, highlighting the subject, natural lighting, rich details, and a sense of documentary and artistic beauty of daily life, presenting a warm and healing afternoon scene",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
