        {
          "id": "krea2-b38a9d83c3e242788a392cf1",
          "alias": "单女粉T恤床坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a white bed, her left hand naturally resting on an open magazine. The pages feature hand-drawn illustrations and text, with the overall color scheme dominated by soft pink and white, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. She wears a pink lace-trimmed camisole that reveals her slender collarbones and arm lines. Her lower body is dressed in white clothing, covered by a thick pink knitted blanket covering her legs. The blanket's woven texture is clearly visible, soft and fluffy, and the background is a clean and bright indoor environment. The wall is light beige or grayish-white, with soft light streaming in from the left to create a natural transition of light and shadow. The light source comes from outside or side windows, presenting the warm sunshine effect of early morning or afternoon. The entire scene is shot in medium to close-up shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, body slightly tilted, head slightly turned. The foreground features a blanket and some legs, the middle ground is the main subject and magazine, and the background is a blurred bedside and wall. The composition is balanced and layered, forming a cyclical viewing path with delicate light and shadow handling. Shadows are gently distributed along the sides of the body and the folds of the sheets, creating an overall atmosphere that is warm, healing, and romantic, full of sense and life. It feels like a professional camera portrait, yet still retains the naturalness and authenticity of daily life. The camera feels strong, details are rich, color saturation is moderate, and the tone is warm, presenting a clean, fresh, and comfortable visual experience, as if you can feel the gentleness and tranquility permeating the air",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
