        {
          "id": "krea2-2b2f799ae12e8bfffe149131",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙沙发微笑坐演奏",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a gray fabric sofa armrest, wearing a light pink pleated tight dress with a one-shoulder design that reveals her right shoulder and collarbone. The hem reaches her knees, highlighting her long legs. She wears a pair of sheer stiletto sandals with white laces, looking elegant and sexy. Her left hand rests naturally on the armrest, her posture relaxed and confident. Her makeup is exquisite and accompanied by a gentle smile. Her overall aura is elegant and charming. In the foreground, she occupies the main left side of the frame, her body slightly tilted toward the camera. A graceful S-shaped curve forms. In the center is a gray sofa behind her and a small black round coffee table. On the table is a blue packaging box, with green plants nearby. In the background is a large flat-screen TV playing images, with a fishing boat on the sea under a purple sky. Below the screen is blurred text. Above the TV is the \"Hisense\" brand logo, bright white glowing font. The entire space is a modern home appliance showroom, with a floor of light-colored polished tiles. Reflecting soft light, the ceiling features recessed downlights and linear lighting, creating a bright and even indoor lighting environment. The composition uses a third-division method: the figure is positioned on the left third of the frame, with the gaze directed to the TV screen on the right side to create visual balance. At the same time, the TV screen image serves as a background extension, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. Light and shadow come from multiple points at the top, resulting in soft and even overall illumination, delicate shadows, no strong contrasts, and a clean, modern, and commercial atmosphere. It carries a blend of technology and fashion, with mainly pink, gray, and white tones, complemented by the TV screen's purple-red tones, creating a warm yet slightly cool color contrast. The overall image presents a realistic texture reminiscent of everyday life, as if captured with a professional camera or high-end smartphone in a real scene, rich in details and distinct layers, offering strong visual appeal and advertising effects",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
