        {
          "id": "krea2-5e793780d838e5fc516f150e",
          "alias": "单女忧伤侧头（2）",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman presents a dynamic beauty. She wears a black off-shoulder top with smooth shoulder lines, highlighting her graceful collarbones and neck curve. The background is a pure light blue tone, creating a fresh and bright atmosphere. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward shot to highlight the character's elegant temperament and visual impact. The main subject is positioned in the lower left corner, with the head slightly tilted. A diagonal visual guide line is formed, with light shining down from the upper right, creating soft transitions between highlights and shadows. The contrast between light and shadow is strong but not abrupt, enhancing the sense of layering and texture in the image, and increasing its depth and realism. The middle shot is the shoulders and neck of the figures, with smooth and natural lines. The background is simple and clean, with no unnecessary distractions, highlighting the subject's presence. The overall color scheme is mainly black and white, complemented by a light blue background, creating a warm and cool contrast that creates a tranquil yet slightly melancholic artistic atmosphere. The visuals have a strong Japanese photography style, resembling professional portrait works. Using a large-aperture lens to blur the background to highlight the subject, the details are rich, and the color saturation is moderate, presenting a visual effect that is both realistic and dreamlike. It features slight film graininess and natural noise, simulating the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment. The composition is compact and full of tension, with the subject's posture naturally relaxed and full of youthful vitality. The overall image conveys a quiet, innocent, and slightly mysterious emotional tone",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
