        {
          "id": "krea2-5ef358543d861e67bc1e2e48",
          "alias": "单女咖啡厅沉思倚靠阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sat in a red leather booth in the restaurant, wearing a black baseball cap printed with white \"DARLING\" lettering and a small brand logo. She wore an off-shoulder tight off-shoulder long-sleeved cropped top that accentuated her slender collarbones and waistline. She paired it with matching loose sweatpants, with a drawstring that naturally hung down at the waist. The overall look was simple yet fashionable. In her right hand, she held a white paper cup with handwritten patterns, printed with red lettering and cartoon elements, while her left hand casually rested beside her The body leans slightly forward, with a relaxed and lazy posture, an expression that is slightly contemplative and detached. The background is a red-and-white checkered tile wall, with a striking red billboard hanging above. Large bold red letters read \"FABULOUS FRIES,\" with small print below reading \"Southern Living Magazine,\" creating a retro American fast-food atmosphere. In the foreground is a wooden dining table with clear texture. On the table sits a piece of light brown clothing or fabric, showing natural folds. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, head slightly tilted to create dynamic balance, then pointing upward toward the background billboard, enhancing the sense of layering in the image. The warm yellow indoor light softly casts on the figure, creating subtle shadow transitions. The overall color palette is mainly red, white, and off-white, with sharp contrasts that are not awkward. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and intimate, as if capturing a quiet moment in daily life. It has a strong sense of realism and everyday life, as if shot with a regular phone or portable camera. The camera slightly shakes, focusing on the main subject, with a slightly blurred background that creates a realistic and natural environment. The images are full of urban youth's casual attitude and casual aesthetics, combining fashion with genuine warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
