        {
          "id": "krea2-aa2e251f0b70595d5468e9c7",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫床温柔坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits indoors under soft lighting, exuding an unintentionally lazy vibe, with a touch of tenderness and calm. Her makeup is delicate but not heavy, highlighting a natural beauty. She wears a white short-sleeved shirt with a gray bow at the collar, layered with a light gray knit vest with fine ribbed patterns along the edges. The details are meticulously detailed. She wears gray-white plaid pants with clear and neat patterns, and the waistband is designed with elasticity. The overall style is fresh and sweet, exuding a youthful Japanese campus vibe. She sits on the bed or sofa, her body slightly leaning forward, fingers long, posture naturally relaxed, right arm hanging down, elbow supported at her side. The foreground is a corner of the bed, on which sits an open book, the pages slightly curled and the spine facing the camera, creating a lingering aftertaste after reading. The middle shot is the main subject, occupying the left central position. The composition uses close-ups, with a gaze directly at the camera, as if silently communicating with the viewer. The background is blurred, and soft light streaming through the window is faintly visible. The window frame lines are simple, Outside the window, there are blurred architectural outlines. On the right, a white gauze curtain gently flutters, swaying gently in the breeze, adding a touch of vitality and poetry. The entire scene is dominated by white, light gray, and off-white, accented with black and dark gray. The color scheme is harmonious and unified. Light and shadow come from natural light on the left, creating a delicate transition between light and shadow, while the shadowed areas are below the neck and arms, creating rich layers and a quiet and cozy atmosphere. The overall scene presents a quiet afternoon feeling, with the texture and realism of everyday life. It feels as if a real moment is captured with a regular camera under natural light, without excessive embellishment, preserving subtle traces of life. The composition emphasizes visual guidance to attract viewers' attention. At the same time, the book in the foreground and the curtain in the background create a sense of spatial depth, enhancing the three-dimensionality of the image. The overall style combines artistic flair with a sense of everyday life, combining innocence and beauty with authenticity and intimacy. It is a daily portrait full of emotional warmth, suitable for expressing themes of youth, memories, tranquility, and growth. The visuals are delicate and emotional, evoking a gentle sense of companionship and inner peace",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
