        {
          "id": "krea2-2b3dae3fc37810b073488c14",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫桌边忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman presents a natural dynamic blur effect with a slight sheen. She wears a white collared shirt with the collar slightly open, revealing the neck line, layered with a dark vest or jacket. The fabric looks soft and comfortable. Close-up shots take up most of the frame, with indoor backgrounds, and walls in light beige or gray-white, clean and simple. On the right, you can faintly see the edges of blue objects, possibly a desk or part of furniture. On the left, there is a blurred shadow area. This adds depth to the image. Light comes from the front slightly left, creating a sense of depth. The background light is weaker, making the subject stand out. The overall tone is cool, mainly black, white, and gray, enhancing visual contrast. The image has a strong sense of daily life and atmosphere, as if taken casually with a phone or regular camera. There are slight noise and imperfect details, enhancing realism and intimacy. The composition combines center symmetry and asymmetry, with the subject's head slightly tilted, breaking perfect symmetry and adding movement. The atmosphere is quiet and private, tinged with a hint of youthful laziness and subtle melancholy, as if capturing a quiet afternoon or a quiet moment of solitude late at night. The entire scene is full of storytelling, inviting one to imagine her mood and thoughts at that moment. The visual style combines artistic beauty with a sense of realism in life, combining the documentary qualities of photography with aesthetic pursuits. It is suitable for expressing themes such as youth, emotions, and inner worlds, presenting an overall visual experience that is gentle, serene, and slightly mysterious",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
