        {
          "id": "krea2-2c18070d9c5b495f77b545fd",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣室内冷淡坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits indoors, wearing a dark gray chunky knit sweater designed in an asymmetrical asymmetrical shoulder style. The wide lapel drapes down from one shoulder, revealing the collarbone and part of the shoulder line. The sweater sleeves are loose, with ribbed trims at the cuffs. The front placket is decorated with four round metal buttons. The sweater is thick with clearly visible textures. She pairs a pleated short skirt with blue, white, and gray plaid patterns, the hem forming an A-shape with distinct layers. Wearing simple silver hoop earrings, her makeup is delicate and natural, and her overall posture is elegant and composed. The background is a light gray solid wall, clean and simple. In the corner, you can see a subtle shadow line. The floor is light gray, with a smooth texture. Light comes from the front left, softly and evenly casting on the figures, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. The sweater texture and skirt plaid are clearly visible under the light, with consistent shadow directions creating a peaceful and cozy atmosphere. The composition uses a medium-shot portrait, with the figure occupying the main position. The body is slightly tilted, the head slightly tilted, and the gaze interacts subtly with the viewer, highlighting their expressions and emotional expressions. The overall color scheme is mainly cool gray, accented with warm light, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme, presenting an artistic style of everyday life. It feels as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains the sense of everyday life. The details are rich, the texture is realistic, and the visual effect combines sophistication and approachability",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
