        {
          "id": "krea2-da56af0899e1153825daae2e",
          "alias": "单女黑衬衫户外俏皮站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors in a lush greenery, wearing dark sunglasses that reflect soft light. She stands slightly sideways, carrying a touch of effortless tenderness and playfulness. Her makeup is delicate and natural, giving her a fresh and charming look. She wears a black-and-white off-shoulder shirt with vertical stripes, uniquely designed, a wide neckline with pleated details, loose sleeves, and the hem casually tucked into her waistband, revealing a slender waistline and a small section of abdominal skin. She pairs it with high-waisted denim shorts with frayed cuffs. The overall look is casual yet stylish. She gently grips the hem of her shirt with both hands, her posture natural and relaxed. She wears a simple ring on her left ring finger and a pair of silver hoop earrings, both clean and textured. The background is a blurred green vegetation, and sunlight filters through the leaves, casting dappled shadows, creating soft halos and bokeh effects. The scene presents a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere, with light shining from the side and subtle shadows on the other side of the body, enhancing the sense of depth. The composition was shot in medium shots The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, leaving space on the right side to balance the visuals. The shallow depth of field makes the subject stand out clearly, while the background blurs into a hazy green, creating a dreamlike sense of layering. In the foreground, a few blurred leaves can be faintly seen, adding depth and realism to the scene. The overall color scheme is mainly green and black-and-white, accented with warm yellow sunlight. The colors are harmonious and unified, full of the fresh atmosphere of summer. The atmosphere is relaxed and pleasant, combining the casual nature of daily life with the refined beauty of artistic photography. It is like a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera in natural light, capturing moments of youth, freedom, and beauty. The composition is balanced, the transitions of light and shadow are natural, and the details are rich—every detail reveals a pursuit and expression of beauty",
