          "id": "krea2-8fdc9cd036f5ae8af8a1abc0",
          "alias": "单女全裸蓝衬衫庭院害羞",
          "prompt": "Her fingers were slender and long, her nails painted with a light nude color. Her expression was calm and slightly shy, wearing a light blue long-sleeved shirt dress with vertical stripes. The collar featured a classic lapel design, with several white floral decorations on the chest and sleeves. The skirt was loose and flowing, and a matching belt tied around the waist. The overall look was fresh, sweet, and full of emotion. She sat on a rough stone steps, the stone surface uneven, The edges bear traces of time. On the left is a deep green metal railing, curved to the upper left corner of the frame. The smooth, reflective surface contrasts with the surrounding environment. The background is dense green plants, with layers of leaves and dappled light and shadow. Sunlight filters through the gaps, creating soft patches of light. Some leaves are illuminated by the backlight, creating a semi-transparent texture. In the distance, faint outlines of tree trunks and branches can be seen, creating a sense of depth. The entire scene is set in a quiet courtyard or park corner. The guiding line extends diagonally from the railing, drawing the visual toward the figure. At the same time, the lines of the stone steps extend from the foreground to the back, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. Light comes from the upper left of the painting, which is natural daylight, bright but not glaring, creating soft shadows. The folds of the clothing show subtle changes in light and shadow. The overall color palette is mainly fresh blue-white, paired with a rich green background, creating a harmonious and cozy atmosphere It feels like a lazy afternoon, with just the right sunshine, a gentle breeze, and a faint fragrance of flowers and plants filling the air. The images present an unintentional beauty from everyday life, with a film-like texture, rich details, clear layering, and a clear focus on the subjects. The background blurs naturally, highlighting the subject. The 