          "id": "krea2-ae54d97e18c4e81a6a7fb09d",
          "alias": "单女短裙街道困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an outdoor street, displaying a natural sheen and layering. Each strand is distinct, with slight curls and fluffiness. The skirt is slightly open, presenting a natural breathing state. She wears a white short-sleeved puff-sleeve top with three-quarter sleeves featuring pleated details. The fabric feels light and soft, fitting the arm lines and showcasing an elegant cut. She pairs a high-waisted floral mini skirt with a dark base color. Adorned with off-white and light brown floral patterns, petals of various shapes are evenly distributed and layered. The hem of the dress unfolds in an A-shape, made of lightweight and breathable material. As the body moves slightly, natural folds and light and shadow variations appear. The skirt edges feature fine stitching textures that enhance realism. On her left wrist, she wears a simple metal bracelet connected by small rings, reflecting a soft sheen. Her fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with light pink nail polish. Her right hand hangs naturally at her side, her posture relaxed and natural. The body is slightly angled to the camera, with the head turned toward the lens, creating a warm and focused atmosphere. The foreground is the main subject, occupying the main position. The background is a blurry city street, with distant outlines of buildings and green trees. However, due to shallow depth, a soft bokeh effect is presented. Light spots and colors are mainly warm yellow and light green, creating a warm and gentle visual feeling. The composition uses a three-part method, with the figure positioned near the center on the left side of the frame. The viewer's gaze guides them toward the blank area on the right. This creates a good visual balance. Light comes from the rear oblique, using backlight or side backlighting. Sunlight penetrates particles in the air, creating a distinct halo and Tyndall effect, outlining soft contour light that makes the subject stand out from the background. The overall light and shadow transition is natural, with moderate contrast between light and shadow, highlighting the subject while preserving details. The atmosphere is warm and tranquil, full of youthful energy and poetic beauty, as if capturing a moment of afternoon sunlight. The main color palette is warm yellow, complemented by white, brown, and green. The colors are harmonious and unified, possessing strong artistic appeal. The image texture is delicate and lifelike, as if shot with a professional camera, while preserving the natural atmosphere of daily life. The details are rich and layered, conveying a tranquil, beautiful, and slightly dreamy urban living scene",
