        {
          "id": "krea2-d4f5ecda2a7edf6e6603162e",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣街道自信持包",
          "prompt": "She wears a loose light gray knit sweater paired with a white collared shirt, tied at the collar with a burgundy silk bow tie, adding a sweet preppy vibe. In her right hand, she holds a bag of white bunny-shaped candies in transparent packaging, with green and yellow decorative ribbons tied to the candy. Her left hand hangs naturally, and she wears a simple silver bracelet on her wrist, with long fingers. Nails are neatly trimmed, and the background is a bright and tidy convenience store interior. On multi-layered white shelves, various bottled drinks are neatly arranged, with bottles in orange, yellow, red, green, and transparent colors. The labels are clearly visible, some printed in Chinese or Japanese, and above the shelves are labels for \"Milk Drink\" and \"Dairy Beverage.\" In the distance, you can even see the \"URBAN REVIVO\" shop sign. The overall environment is well-lit, with warm white light evenly streaming from the ceiling. illuminating the entire space, creating a warm atmosphere of everyday life. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure centered and occupying the main position. In the foreground are the candies in the figure and her hands, in the middle is the drink shelf behind the character, and in the background are the shop signs and blurred display areas farther away. At the same time, her hands and candies form a subtle diagonal guiding line, enhancing the dynamic feel of the scene. The light and shadow are soft, without strong shadows, but the wrinkles and material details of the clothing remain clearly visible. The colors are warm beige-gray, white, Red is the main tone, paired with the abundance of colorful beverage bottles on the shelves, creating a striking contrast. The overall color scheme is harmonious and layered, presenting a realistic and natural everyday shooting feel. It feels like a casual snapshot of life with an ordinary phone at a convenience store. There is slight camera noise and slight lens distortion, simulating the realism of amateur equipment. The overall atmosphere is relaxed, friendly, and full of youthful energy, evoking the ordinary yet beautiful moments of buying snacks after school. The image details are rich, composition is stable, and the perspective is level enough. It gives a sense of immersion, as if you can smell a faint sweetness and freshness in the air. The overall style combines everyday life and artistic flair, resembling a carefully composed photo shoot while preserving the authenticity and casualness of street candid shots",
          "description": "",
