        {
          "id": "krea2-cba183654d9fb074636587ea",
          "alias": "单女短裙水边哭泣坐注视",
          "prompt": "A classical Eastern beauty dressed in exquisite Hanfu sits gracefully on the stone steps by the lakeside. She wears a wide-sleeved long skirt in pale pink and pure white, with a light, transparent pink gauze shawl on top and an elegant white skirt underneath. The fabric is delicate and smooth, presenting a silky sheen and natural drape. The collar and cuffs are embroidered with exquisite silver thread patterns, and a matching ribbon is tied around the waist, accentuating her slender waist. Around her neck are layered pearl chains and jade necklaces, adding a touch of gentle elegance. Looking toward the camera, her expression is calm yet tinged with a hint of worry. Her posture is dignified and elegant, her hands gently resting on her knees, sleeves naturally hanging down, forming soft folded lines. In the foreground, willow branches naturally hang down from the top of the frame, tender green willow leaves sway gently in the breeze, some of them illuminated by sunlight, presenting a crystal-clear texture. The background is a tranquil lake, its surface shimmering, reflecting the sky and the shore. In the distance, a small boat can be seen slowly gliding, with faint figures on board. The outlines of trees can be faintly seen along the lakeshore. The entire scene is bathed in soft light of early morning or evening, with sunlight streaming in from the side and above, forming a warm golden halo on the figures. The transition of light and shadow is natural, with soft contrasts of light and shadow, creating a tranquil, poetic, and slightly dreamlike atmosphere. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, forming a visual focal point. The weeping willows form a natural frame from above, guiding the gaze to the subject. The background blur emphasizes the foreground figure and enhances spatial layering. The overall color palette is mainly pale pink, off-white, light green, and blue-gray, harmoniously unified and rich in Eastern aesthetics. The image details are rich and texture clear, as if shot with a professional camera, giving it a cinematic texture while retaining the natural realism of everyday photography, similar to using the Canon EOS R5 or Sony A7R High-end full-frame cameras like the IV paired with prime lenses capture moments in natural light, offering extremely high resolution and detail expression, presenting a sense of both artistic beauty and life-related authenticity. The entire image exudes a unique charm that blends classical charm with modern aesthetics",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
