          "id": "krea2-fb1cfb2ef30dca17a32f1899",
          "alias": "单女桌边冷淡倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in pale blue Hanfu was leaning over a rustic wooden table, kneading dough. She wore a lightweight, translucent light blue cross-collar ruqun with wide, flowing sleeves, a beige ribbon embroidered with exquisite patterns and a red waist belt tied around her waist. The fabric had a silky smoothness and delicate sheen, with fine beads of sweat seeping from her chest, sparkling with a watery glow under the cool blue light. Her hands were dusted with flour, She was focused on kneading a round, plump white dough, her fingers long and strong, her movements skillful and gentle. On the wooden table in front of her was a thin layer of white powder. On the left side sat a dark brown ceramic bowl filled with unused dough, and on the right was a similar pottery. The background was a typical Chinese traditional kitchen, with mottled gray-white walls marked by time. In the corner, a simple wooden shelf held several ceramic jars and pots. In the distance, a wooden window with traditional window lattice let in faint light. The view outside the window is blurry, and the entire space is enveloped in a rich, cool blue light. The light source comes from the upper right of the frame, creating a strong side backlight effect. A beam of ghostly blue light shoots down from above, casting faint halos and floating dust into the air, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the left central position, body slightly leaning forward, gazing directly at the camera, as if gazing at the viewer, guiding viewers to focus on her expressions and movement details, with the foreground highlighting the interaction between her hands and dough In the middle frame, the figures are shown in their full postures and costume details, while the background is blurred to emphasize the subject and enhance spatial depth. The overall light and shadow contrast is strong, with cool tones dominated by warm light accents in some areas, creating a tranquil, cool, and life-filled classical atmosphere. The visuals are delicate and color-rich, combining the simple authenticity of ancient life with a surreal poetic beauty, like a classic scene from an ancient-style TV drama, captured by professional photography equipment, with cinematic visual impact and artistic expression",
