        {
          "id": "krea2-550e0e697085262598684209",
          "alias": "单女灰长裤广场自信侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a strapless top with a white base and small floral patterns. The top is lightweight and fitted, outlining the slender shoulder and neck lines. The neckline and hem are decorated with lace trim, adding a touch of sweetness and refinement. She pairs the lower half with loose gray casual pants and an elastic waistband. The overall look is simple yet comfortable, with long fingers. On her wrist is a delicate gold bracelet, and at her neck is a slender necklace Her posture is elegant and composed, exuding a calm and confident temperament. Behind her is a rough concrete wall with granular textures in a gray-brown color, giving a realistic and layered texture. The wall reflects mottled tree shadows, interlacing light and shadows to form irregular warm yellow patches. These spots are blurred in shape, like dynamic traces left by leaves swaying in the wind. On the wall is a small square window with a dark frame, and the window sill edges are decorated with red bricks, adding a touch of industrial detail. On the right, you can see a partial view of a door. The door frame is made of concrete, and the door sign has a blue signage with white text, though the content is unclear. The floor is paved with gray stone bricks, with clear gaps between the bricks. The surface shows slight wear, and a few withered yellow leaves scatter on the floor, adding a sense of the season and a sense of life. The entire composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, body slightly angled to the camera, head slightly tilted, creating a natural visual guide. The walls and light in the background occupy most of the space, creating a strong sense of depth. The light comes from above, representing the soft natural light of evening or early morning. The light is warm and even, creating a clear contrast of light and shadow on the walls. The shadowed areas are darker, highlighting the brightness of the light spots. The overall atmosphere is calm and cozy, carrying a poetic sense of daily life, as if a random moment on an afternoon street is frozen in time. The main colors of the painting are gray, white, and brown, accented with warm yellow light spots and colorful floral patterns on clothing. The color scheme is harmonious and unified, giving a sense of authenticity, naturalness, and warmth. The shooting style is similar to everyday mobile phone photography, preserving authentic details and slight noise, enhancing the realism and livelihood of the images, presenting an overall fresh, natural, and gentle urban street photography aesthetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
