        {
          "id": "krea2-eb0550bc26237d7c4f981eb6",
          "alias": "单女白浴袍雪地冷淡站立手持物",
          "prompt": "A classical Eastern beauty dressed in elegant white Hanfu stands amid swirling snow. The jade inlaid on the crown glows gently in the snow, forming a striking contrast with her pure white robe. She wears a wide-sleeved, cross-collar Hanfu, with light and flowing fabric, delicate texture. The collar is embroidered with several pink plum blossoms, petals tender and dripping, the branches strong and powerful, as if blooming in the cold wind. The collar and front placket are decorated with gold frog buttons, simple yet luxurious. When slightly open, it seems she has a thousand words to express but hold back. Her hands are gently clasped in front of her, fingertips long, her posture dignified and elegant, her expression serene and serene, as if merging with heaven and earth. The background is a pine forest covered with thick snow, its branches thick and sturdy, the canopy heavy with snow, its silhouette faintly visible in the hazy snowy mist. In the distance, layers of trees gradually blur, creating a profound sense of space Snowflakes flutter in the air, varying in size—some clearly visible, some blurring into specks of white light that drift around the figure. The light is soft and even, and the diffused light from the sky gives the entire composition a cool, grayish-white tone. The skin is as translucent as jade, with natural three-dimensional light and shadow. The overall composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered and occupying the main subject The background is blurred to highlight the figures, creating a tranquil, ethereal, and poetic atmosphere. The painting is filled with classical aesthetics, blending the charm of traditional Hanfu culture with modern aesthetics' pursuit of refinement and perfection. Like a meticulously colored ancient lady painting, it incorporates the delicacy and dreaminess of digital art. The overall style combines realism and idealism, presenting a beautiful realm that transcends reality, as if a fairy has stepped out of ancient poetry, standing silently in the winter snowy landscape. It naturally evokes sympathy and longing",
