        {
          "id": "krea2-c04e267d2d73d33515ae85b4",
          "alias": "单女黑外套户外微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the ancient stone steps, smiling. She wears a black zip-up sports jacket over a white vest, loose black sweatpants, white sneakers, and a teal backpack. Her right hand points her index finger to the left side of the frame, while her left hand rests naturally on her knee. Her body leans forward slightly, her posture relaxed and full of youthful energy. Behind her is a winding stone path flanked by towering trees with lush branches and leaves, forming a natural green arcade. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting mottled shadows. The stone steps are rough and clear, with edges marked by age. In the distance, several tourists walk on the steps, their silhouettes blurred, creating a clear depth contrast with the foreground. Red wooden signs stand on both sides of the steps, with blurred text on them. The background is layered with trees, presenting rich green layers, transitioning naturally from light green to dark green. The overall composition uses a low-angle upward shot, placing the figures slightly to the right below the frame, with the stone steps extending into the distance. Guiding the gaze upward, it creates a sense of depth and space. The colors of the painting are mainly natural green and gray, accented with black and teal from the characters' clothing. The visual harmony and unity are evident, with soft lighting. It is a typical diffused light on cloudy days or under tree shade, without strong shadows. The atmosphere is quiet and lively, evoking the everyday feel of outdoor hiking with a touch of artistic touch, as if shot with a professional camera. The details are rich, texture is realistic, the background is natural and the subject is emphasized, and the overall image conveys a relaxed and pleasant travel moment. Full of the breath of life and the beauty of youth",
