        {
          "id": "krea2-7f681773b7f304eec716c1d8",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙庭院困倦坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor green striped sofa, wearing a light, flowing light blue gradient spaghetti strap dress. The fabric has a semi-transparent texture and delicate pleats, presenting a soft watercolor gradient effect. The hem naturally drapes over the sofa, creating an elegant layered effect. The casual comb back adds a touch of laziness and vitality. Her expression is calm and slightly thoughtful, as if immersed in her own world. Her posture is relaxed and relaxed, her body slightly leaning forward, showing graceful curves and a natural posture. On the left side of the foreground is a bouquet of colorful hydrangeas, including white, pink, and pale purple flowers, arranged in a transparent glass vase, with small bouquets of blue flowers scattered beside it. Echoing the flowers mentioned by the figures, the background is dense green plants and a mottled stone wall. Layers of green leaves and dappled light and shadow create a quiet and vibrant courtyard atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-field perspective, with the figure positioned on the right side occupying the main visual space. The flowers and vases on the left create a visual balance, guiding the gaze from the foreground bouquet to the main figure. The overall composition follows a diagonal trend, enhancing the dynamic and depth of the image. The lighting is soft natural light from the upper left, with soft shadows. The green plants in the background are illuminated by sunlight, presenting rich color layers. The interplay of light and shadow creates a warm and dreamy afternoon atmosphere. The color palette mainly features a warm and cool contrast: blue clothing harmonizes with the green sofa and background, creating a harmonious cool tone, while the pinkish-white and purplish-red flowers bring a touch of warmth, enriching the visual quality of the image. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, romantic, and poetic, resembling a film-style photo taken with an amateur camera, featuring slight graininess and realistic light and shadow details. It presents an unintentional beauty in daily life, with moderate focal length, well-controlled depth of field, and a well-balanced background blur that highlights the main subject while preserving environmental details. The image texture is realistic, color saturation is moderate, and light and shadow transitions are natural, like a private image capturing a tender moment, conveying an aesthetic where youth, purity, and nature blend together",
