        {
          "id": "krea2-1748e58ce7580a18a715cfac",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫废墟坐躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the weathered stone steps, wearing a white stand-collar short-sleeved shirt with blue trim on the collar. She pairs a flowing blue long skirt and silver flip-flops. Her overall look is fresh and natural, exuding a Japanese collegiate style. The stone steps are made of rough blue-gray stone, with heavily worn edges and surfaces marked by the erosion of time and fine cracks. A few stubborn blades of grass peek out from the gaps, with abandoned old buildings in the background. The walls are mottled and peeling, revealing a gray-brown cement base. Some areas are covered with lush green vines, lush and full of life. On the right side, you can see a tightly closed white wooden door and an old window. The window frame is worn out, and there are obvious signs of weathering around it. The ground is paved with cement, partially cracked, with scattered wildflowers and weeds on both sides. In the upper right of the painting are dense green trees, with soft daylight filtering through the branches and leaves. The overall lighting is natural light from the upper left, creating a soft, diffused glow. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, with subtle shadows but rich layering, creating a quiet, nostalgic, and slightly artistic atmosphere. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, slightly turning the body to create an interaction with the viewer, guiding viewers to focus on their expressions and movements. The foreground highlights the main subject, the middle ground shows stone steps and some architectural structures, and the background is blurred to create a sense of depth, enhancing spatial layering. This creates a smooth visual flow, with the overall color scheme dominated by blue and white, complemented by green vegetation and gray-brown walls. The colors are harmonious and unified, with a delicate and authentic texture, presenting a subtle beauty found in daily life. It's as if a lightweight camera is casually photographed in the afternoon sunlight, capturing moments where youth and time intertwine, full of vitality and poetry, with strong visual appeal and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
