        {
          "id": "krea2-1b2f0ac842f9edf2e3e4c55b",
          "alias": "单女屋顶冷淡持乐器",
          "prompt": "Her left hand gently grips the neck, while her right hand rests above the body, her posture elegant and expressive. The red guitar body is smooth and bright, with a white guard, silver pickup, and knobs, and the headstock is light wood The brand logo is clearly visible, the strings reflect a faint sheen in the light, the background is an indoor slanted ceiling space, white walls and a slanted roof structure form geometric lines, and the skylight lets in soft natural light, streaming in from the upper left, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. Below the frame, a wooden bookshelf can be faintly seen, holding several books. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward shot to highlight the main figure, making her appear tall and full of presence. The slightly tilted angle enhances the dynamic and visual tension of the image. The foreground focuses on the figure and guitar, while the middle shot presents the lower body and parts of the background environment. The background is mainly a simple indoor structure, with blur treatment highlighting the subject. The light and shadow layers are rich, warm tones dominate, and cool white and warm yellow light intertwine, creating an atmosphere that is both everyday and artistic. It feels like a quiet afternoon, immersed alone in the world of music. The lens simulates professional camera shooting effects, with clear and sharp details, moderate color saturation, and realistic texture, presenting a style reminiscent of high-end portrait photography. It also retains a slight grainy film texture and natural light and shadow transitions, maintaining a balanced overall composition. It then flows toward the skylight in the upper right corner, creating a smooth visual path. The color combinations are harmonious, with red, blue, white, and black as main tones echoing each other to create strong visual contrasts. Through gradients of light and shadow and delicate material expression, the image gains depth and three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is both youthful and artistic, as if recording a moment about music and dreams. Like real-life moments captured with a vintage film camera, full of storytelling and emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
