        {
          "id": "krea2-8e1bbea254dc958a63ca3836",
          "alias": "单女窗边沉思坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window, appearing gentle and layered, with a natural blush and a pale pink sheen. She wears a dark blue off-shoulder top made of silk or satin, with a smooth surface and a slight reflective finish. The pleats are naturally smooth, and the sleeves are loose, creating a relaxed and comfortable atmosphere. The lines are simple and modern, the hand posture is elegant, and her nails are neatly trimmed and painted with light-colored nail polish The fingertips lightly touch the edge of the headphones, as if preparing to put them on or just taken them off. The background features white blinds, with leaves arranged horizontally. Light filters through the gaps to create interplay of light and shadow, enhancing the image's sense of depth and depth. The overall composition uses close-ups: the person is positioned slightly to the right center, with their heads slightly tilted, looking directly at the camera, creating a strong visual direction. The middle ground shows the outline of the upper body and clothing, while the background is accented by a blurred blinds, using shallow depth of field to make the subject stand out more. The light comes from the left, providing soft natural light that creates a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The tones are mainly cool blue and warm white, creating a contrasting yet harmonious unity. The overall image presents a sense of tranquility, comfort, and a slightly artistic atmosphere, as if capturing a quiet moment of listening to music in daily life. It carries the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting, rich in details without excessive embellishment, preserving natural skin texture and light and shadow transitions. The image texture is delicate, color saturation is moderate, and it carries an artistic and everyday feel. The overall style is fresh and natural, full of youthful energy and gentle temperament",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
