        {
          "id": "krea2-85c76f1094965fa264623372",
          "alias": "单女忧伤比耶",
          "prompt": "A woman with an overall cool and elegant temperament, wearing a white traditional wide-sleeved top with light and soft fabric, featuring natural folds and light and shadow effects. The neckline is V-shaped, revealing the neck line. Her right hand gently strokes a small white flower on her left shoulder. The petals are pure white, with tiny yellow stamens in the center. Her fingers are slender, and her nails are painted deep red polish. Her hand posture is naturally relaxed, and the clothing is slightly layered at the wrist, creating a soft transition of light and shadow. The background is a blurred outdoor natural setting. Dark green and dark tones of blurred light spots are presented, with sunlight slanting down from the upper right of the image, creating a warm and bright backlight effect that creates a strong contrast of light and dark and a sense of three-dimensionality. The overall composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame, head slightly tilted, guiding the viewer to look outward. The background blur emphasizes the subject, with cool blue-white tones predominantly contrasting harmoniously with the warm golden sunlight. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is peaceful and beautiful, full of poetry and Zen, with a delicate texture in the image. It feels as if taken with professional photography equipment, yet retains the realism under natural light, like high-resolution photos taken with a casual camera or smartphone. It possesses strong artistic appeal and emotional expression, presenting an overall serene, elegant, and slightly melancholic Eastern aesthetic conception",
