        {
          "id": "krea2-f0c1a1416d81b3e43e731866",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣阅读",
          "prompt": "She wears a white short-sleeved knit top with slightly cinched sleeves, revealing slender arms and a light gray crew-neck T-shirt underneath. The overall look is fresh and simple. She is looking down at an open book, gently holding it in both hands. The pages are slightly curled, the spine clearly visible, and between the pages is a small portable white fan, with the fan blades restless. Adding a touch of life and modernity to the scene, gazing gently at the camera seems to be silently communicating with the viewer, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The background features tall wooden bookshelves, neatly arranged with various books. The spines come in a variety of colors—red, green, blue, yellow, etc. The wood grain on the shelves is clearly visible, showing a warm brown tone. Some books are slightly blurred, creating a natural depth of field effect that enhances the sense of space in the image. In the middle of the scene, the outline of the bookshelf gradually blurs. The girl and the book in the foreground are clearly captured. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying a slightly lower center position, head slightly tilted, gazing directly at the lens, creating strong visual guidance. The light is soft and even, with light from the upper front creating a natural shadow transition. The edges of the pages have slight reflections, and the entire scene is enveloped in a warm beige tone, creating a quiet and comfortable reading atmosphere. The image has a slight grainy film texture and retro filter effects, simulating the realistic texture of everyday amateur camera shooting The color saturation is moderate, contrast is gentle, details are rich, light and shadow layers are distinct, and the composition is compact and storytelling. Overall, it presents a warm, tranquil, and scholarly moment in daily life, as if you can hear the sound of turning pages and the breeze brushing the pages, evoking the fusion of knowledge and beauty.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
