        {
          "id": "krea2-9ae1abe5e4f671904a13f2e3",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣书店专注站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the aisle of bookstore shelves, looking delicate and glossy. She stands slightly to the side, leaning slightly forward, gently holding a book with the words \"High Efficiency\" printed on the cover. Her fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed, and on her wrist is a simple white smartwatch with a strap and a slender gold bracelet, exuding a quiet and focused aura. She wears an off-white short-sleeved knit top with a knit texture, with ribbed trim at the collar and cuffs, showcasing exquisite craftsmanship. She paired a gray pleated short skirt with a naturally draped hem and smooth lines, giving the overall look a fresh, sweet, and intellectual look. Behind her was a neatly arranged black bookshelf filled with various books. The spines came in a variety of colors—blue, orange, yellow, pink, and more. Some book covers were printed with text and patterns, and the wooden edges of the shelves had warm light wood tones, contrasting with the black shelves to create a sense of layering. On the left side of the painting was a close-up bookshelf with several books with simple cover designs. One book has a yellow cover labeled \"Da Vinci Learning Method,\" and another has a red cover labeled \"Minimalist Mathematics Learning Method.\" These details add a knowledgeable atmosphere to the scene. The bookshelf in the background gradually blurs, creating a natural depth of field effect that makes the subject stand out more. The composition uses a centered composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the image, naturally relaxed posture, and the gesture of holding a book in both hands becoming the visual focus. The overall lighting is soft and even, with warm white light shining down from above from the ceiling. At the same time, light shadows are cast on the bookshelf and floor, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The light and shadow transitions are natural, with no strong contrast between light and shadow, creating a warm and peaceful reading atmosphere. The main colors are off-white, gray, and black, accentuating the book's colorful covers and creating a harmonious visual balance. The overall image presents a realistic photographic texture from everyday life, as if taken naturally with a regular camera, with slight noise and film-like graininess. The background blur is well handled, highlighting the subject's clarity and realism. The entire scene is filled with the scent of books and youthful energy, conveying a tranquil, focused, and curious lifestyle",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
