        {
          "id": "krea2-13844b25cc1621de6baf2cbb",
          "alias": "单女透视黑连衣裙城市神秘坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits gracefully on a modern-style indoor staircase, wearing a long-sleeved black silk dress with delicate black lace trim at the collar and cuffs. The short hem fits her figure and accentuates her long legs. Her legs are crossed and slightly leaned forward, her right hand gently touching her shoulder, while her left hand rests naturally on her knee. Her posture is composed and expressive. She wears sheer stockings with black polka dot patterns, and bright red high-heeled sandals with thin straps wrapped around her ankles, the toes sharp, and the color contrast striking. This forms a visual focal point. The bun is adorned with delicate decorations, and a pair of gorgeous golden tassel earrings hang from the earlobes. The makeup is exquisite, and the expression carries a hint of mystery and allure. The background is a deep brown wooden wall with delicate texture. The staircase steps are made of dark gray stone, and warm yellow LED strips are embedded below each step, providing soft and even light along the edges, creating a warm and layered light and shadow effect. The staircase structure extends diagonally to the upper left of the frame, guiding the gaze upward. At the same time, the figure is positioned on the right side of the frame, with a slightly tilted body to create dynamic balance. The composition uses a low-angle shot to make the figure appear more upright and prominent. The overall atmosphere blends modern urban fashion with the ambiguous mood of private spaces. Light and shadow cast upward from the bottom create a strong contrast of light and shadow, highlighting the character's outline and the details of clothing folds. The ambient lighting mainly uses warm tones, creating a warm contrast with black clothing and red shoes, enhancing visual impact and presenting a highly sophisticated cinematic texture. It feels like a scene carefully arranged in a professional studio using softboxes and fill lights, yet retains the realism of everyday shoots. It feels like a moment captured in a corner of a private gathering or a high-end venue. The entire scene is full of storytelling, combining artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life. You can almost hear faint footsteps and distant muffled conversations, creating a quiet and tense atmosphere. Every detail of the character is precisely presented, from the polka dots on stockings to the reflections of high heels. All reflect extremely high image quality. The composition cleverly uses diagonal staircase lines and the posture of the figures to create a flowing visual rhythm. The foreground features a clear main subject, the middle ground features glowing staircases, and the background is a dark wooden wall. The layers are distinct and the sense of depth is strong. Light shines from bottom to top, brightening the lower body and footsteps, while the upper body is in relatively soft shadows, enhancing three-dimensionality and drama. The overall tone is dark, mainly black, brown, and red, complemented by warm yellow lighting. It creates a mature, sexy, and slightly mysterious atmosphere, like a photo piece from a fashion magazine cover, yet still capturing the authentic texture of amateur photographers casually using a phone or camera. There are no unnecessary decorations in the image; all elements serve the shaping of the character.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
