        {
          "id": "krea2-192adef2e1fdd573e2f2e7da",
          "alias": "单女短裙街道站立持手机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the street at dusk, adding a touch of liveliness and naturalness. She wears an off-shoulder knitted off-shoulder top with a delicate vertical stripe weaving technique. The neckline is designed in an asymmetrical off-shoulder style, revealing one shoulder and collarbone. The sleeves are long-sleeved, slightly loose. The fabric looks soft and comfortable, with a good drape. The lower half is paired with a high-waisted skirt in the same color family, with a light hem. The layers are distinct, and the overall look is simple yet elegant. She holds a black smartphone in her right hand, with long fingers and neatly trimmed nails. The screen is lit, seemingly checking information or operating apps. In her left hand, she carries an off-white leather handbag. The bag is square in shape, with clean lines and a smooth surface, featuring a metal zipper and handle details, giving it a premium feel. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, with the body slightly turned and the head turned to the right, forming a natural diagonal composition. The background is a city street setting. The ground is a dark gray asphalt pavement with white traffic markings. In the distance, a lush tree stands with thick trunks and clearly visible bark patterns. The leaves glow in the sunset glow glow with golden hues, and some leaves illuminated by sunlight create a mottled light effect. The sky shows a deep blue gradient to orange-red sunset hues. Light shines from the upper left of the image, creating a warm backlighting effect. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting soft halos and fine light spots on the figures, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The knitted texture on the clothing is clearly visible under the light, with strong contrasts of light and shadow but natural transitions. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and off-white, complemented by deep blue and dark green as backgrounds. The colors are harmonious and unified. The composition uses a three-part method, with the figures occupying the main visual focus. The background blur is well handled to highlight the subject. The phone and handbag in the foreground add everyday details that enhance realism. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and romantic, as if capturing an ordinary yet poetic moment. For example, high-quality portraits shot with professional cameras while preserving the subtle beauty of everyday life. The depth of field is relatively shallow, the background gradually blurs, highlighting the subject's clarity and three-dimensionality. The use of lighting skillfully not only highlights the beauty of the character's contours but also creates a warm and healing visual experience. The entire scene is filled with the elegant temperament and independent charm of modern urban women, evoking a sense of tranquil and beautiful passage of time.",
