        {
          "id": "krea2-ca3b5b301703d94824beb34d",
          "alias": "单女卧室忧伤躺侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman lies on her side on a soft white bed, her head slightly tilted back, her makeup delicate and natural, presenting a cool sheen. Her left arm is bent, elbow supported at her side, and she wears a uniquely shaped gold carved bracelet on her wrist. The bracelet's surface is engraved with intricate patterns and smooth lines, emitting a warm metallic sheen. In her right hand, she holds a black smartphone, the screen glowing a soft blue light. Her fingers are long, and her nails are painted with a light color. Her fingertips gently touch the edge of the phone, and her body leans forward slightly. The posture is lazy and relaxed, as if immersed in a world on a phone screen. The background is dark curtains, and the vertical stripe design adds depth to the space. Light streams in from the side, creating a contrasting light and shadow effect on the bed. The white pillows and bedding are soft and fluffy, with natural folds. The sheets have a slight texture, and the overall tone is cool, mainly blue and gray, creating a quiet, private, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The composition uses a high-angle overhead view. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, with the head close to the top and the body extending to the lower left, forming a diagonal line guiding the visuals. The foreground is a partial close-up of the bedsheet and arms, the middle ground is the subject and the phone, and the background is the curtain and the distant wall. The layers are distinct, the contrast of light and shadow is strong, the light source comes from the combination of the phone screen and ambient ambient light, while the shadowed areas retain rich details, enhancing the realism and three-dimensionality of the image. The overall style combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life. It's as if a regular camera is capturing a moment in a dim bedroom, with slight noise and film texture. The color saturation is moderate, details are clear, the composition is compact, and the emotional expression is subtle and profound. It reveals the inner world of a modern urban woman alone at night—quiet yet tinged with loneliness, gentle yet revealing strength. The visuals are full of story and immersion, capturing the most authentic and touching moments of life like a movie lens",
