        {
          "id": "krea2-5dffc05b8511f1a36a9ba7ff",
          "alias": "单女白礼服窗边媚态躺注视",
          "prompt": "A woman lies sideways on soft white bedding, adding a touch of laziness and sensuality, with a touch of tenderness and thoughtfulness. She wears a light pink lipstick, appearing natural yet refined. She wears a light, flowing white tulle gown with off-shoulder designs. Layers of sheer fabric naturally drape with the curves of her body, creating rich folds and light effects. Her right hand rests gently on her chest, fingers long, nails neatly trimmed and painted with light polish, her posture elegant and relaxed. Around her neck is a multi-layered pearl necklace, round and full, varying in size and arranged in a well-arranged manner. In the center is a larger oval pearl, surrounded by tiny diamonds or crystals that sparkle softly. are a pair of gorgeous pendant earrings, composed of multiple pearls and sparkling gemstones, draping with a strong sense of drape. With slight movements, they exude a noble and elegant aura, highlighting her delicate makeup and the texture of her clothing. The center frame shows parts of her body and the flowing patterns of her clothing The background is blurred, with the edge of a wooden furniture piece and soft wall contours faintly visible, creating a private and cozy indoor atmosphere. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space, heads slightly tilted, and gaze directly at the camera, creating a strong emotional connection. Light and shadow contrast enhance three-dimensionality. The light source comes from the left, with soft natural light streaming in from outside the window, creating delicate transitions between highlights and shadows, while the right side is in a darker shadow area, creating contrast between light and shadow and highlighting contours and layers The light reflects starlight on the pearls and metal jewelry, adding a sense of luxury and dynamic beauty to the image. The overall color scheme is dominated by white and warm tones, creating a pure, elegant, romantic, and slightly mysterious atmosphere, as if capturing a private moment in a quiet morning. The image is delicate in texture, featuring high-end photography light and shadow control and color expression, while retaining the soft focus and realism commonly seen in everyday shooting, presenting an artistic beauty that is both dreamy and close to life",
