        {
          "id": "krea2-a7fa70529f15da8197536c58",
          "alias": "单女绿毛衣花园微笑站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in an outdoor garden, gently swaying in the breeze, exuding an elegant sense of dynamism. Her makeup is elegant and natural, with a gentle smile. Looking directly at the camera, it seems to be silently communicating with the viewer. She wears a mint green cropped knit cardigan with a classic double-breasted design, with wavy lace trim at the neckline and cuffs, adding romantic details. Underneath, she wears an off-white slim-fit knit top made of soft and fitted material, highlighting her slender silhouette. She pairs her lower body with high-waisted white shorts, the cuffs also decorated with delicate ruffles. The overall look is layered and full of spirit. Her right hand gently strokes the front of her cardigan, while her left hand carries a small Chanel handbag with a silver chain. The handbag features the brand's signature quilted pattern and metal logo, giving it a luxurious yet understated look. She wears a pair of small floral earrings and a simple ring on her wrist. These accessory details add a lot of charm to the entire look, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame. The body is slightly turned to the side, presenting a natural standing posture. The composition uses a medium perspective to present the figure from head to knee completely. The background is a lush green courtyard, with lush green grass. Sunlight filters through the leaves casting mottled shadows. In the distance, several beige rattan chairs and a black vintage street lamp can be vaguely seen. The lamp pole stands upright, with clean and powerful lines, contrasting with the figure and enhancing the spatial depth of the scene. In the foreground is a neatly trimmed lawn with clear grass leaves, some areas illuminated by sunlight. The light and shadows appear in a bright yellow-green tone, while the shadows reveal a deep dark green. The middle ground is the area where the figure stands, with ample lighting and high color saturation. The trees and seats in the background are blurred, creating a soft bokeh effect that makes the subject stand out more. The overall light and shadow come from the upper right, with warm and soft sunlight casting on the figure, creating a natural transition of light and shadow and a three-dimensional texture. Although the sky does not appear directly in the frame, the lighting indicates a clear daytime, making the overall atmosphere fresh and natural. Full of the vitality and energy of spring, the painting mainly features fresh mint green, pure white, and warm beige, complemented by the lush green of the grass and the golden sunshine. The color combination is harmonious and unified, creating a comfortable and pleasant visual feeling. The composition uses the rule of thirds, with the figures occupying the main position while leaving enough space to display the environment, guiding the viewer from the foreground grass to the trees and furniture in the background, forming a smooth visual path. The overall style combines fashion with the warmth of everyday life. Like high-quality portraits shot with a professional camera, they exude a strong artistic atmosphere and a sense of sophistication, while also preserving natural moments from real life, as if capturing a beautiful moment under the afternoon sun. The images are rich in detail and textures are clear, presenting an overall aesthetic of refinement, elegance, and vitality",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
