        {
          "id": "krea2-7b947ee6b65bc4cbc5a8f3a4",
          "alias": "单女黑背心室内忧伤躺出神",
          "prompt": "A woman is reclining on a dark leather sofa, looking relaxed and textured. She wears a pair of fine-framed round metal glasses that reflect soft light. Her phone is a silver-gray Apple iPhone, with a triple rear camera module clearly visible. She wears a black sleeveless top, her arms naturally curved, holding the phone with both hands. Her fingers are long and her nails are neatly trimmed. On her wrist, she wears a simple metal bracelet. The main focus is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, with close-ups and subjects occupying most of the space. This creates a strong visual focal point. The background consists of light gray walls and sofa backs, simple yet blurred, highlighting the main subject. The overall color palette is mainly cool gray and deep black, creating a tranquil and contemplative atmosphere. Light and shadow come from the front side, creating a delicate transition between light and shadow, while shadows extend naturally on the other side, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The background light is relatively dark, contrasting with the main subject and highlighting the character's outline. The camera uses a low-angle downward shot, slightly tilted, giving the image a more dynamic and approachable feel, extending further to the hands and body posture. This forms a smooth visual path, with rich details in the image, presenting a real moment captured in daily life. It feels as if a professional camera is used to shoot in low-light indoor environments, using a large-aperture lens to achieve a shallow depth of field effect, while preserving rich environmental details and emotional expression. It carries a slight film graininess and natural noise, simulating the texture of real photography. The atmosphere is tranquil yet slightly melancholic, as if on a certain late night, she is alone immersed in a digital world, lost in thought. Or waiting for news, the entire scene is full of storytelling, evoking both the alienation of modern urban life and the softness and fragility of the individual's inner world. The layers of light and shadow are rich, colors restrained and restrained, and the composition is compact and full of tension, presenting a visual style that combines artistic beauty with the authenticity of life.",
