        {
          "id": "krea2-f6087c9625374404e97284a9",
          "alias": "单女白T恤寺庙站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors under natural light, carrying a touch of gentleness and calmness, presenting a natural pink hue. She wears a white lace camisole with slender straps and a neckline decorated with delicate lace lace. Underneath, she wears a beige knit cardigan casually draped over her arm. The sleeves hang naturally, the material soft and the texture is clearly visible. A black-and-white polka-dot silk scarf is tied around her neck in an elegant bow, with slightly pleated edges adding a touch of casual beauty. Her fingers are long and her nails are neatly trimmed. On her wrist is a simple white strap with a rose gold case. The dial details are clearly visible, and the design is exquisite and modern. In her right hand, she carries a brown leather handbag. The body lines are smooth, and the metal fasteners reflect a soft sheen under the light. The bag's texture feels authentic, with subtle leather textures and stitching details. The strap length is moderate, and the posture when carried by hand feels natural. On her right arm hangs a pair of tortoiseshell round glasses, with vintage and stylish frames, transparent lenses, and clear temple details. The overall design blends artistic, sweet, and urban styles. The background features blurred green plants and mottled light and shadow, with leaves gently swaying in the wind, creating a soft bokeh effect. Light pours down from the upper left of the image, creating a warm side light. The shadow transitions naturally, creating a soft contrast of light and dark. The composition uses medium to near close-ups, with the person positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, head slightly tilted, gazing directly at the camera for strong visual guidance. The foreground highlights the subject, the background is blurred, and a large-aperture lens is used. The depth of field is extremely shallow, with mainly warm tones of white, beige, brown, and green intertwined. The overall atmosphere is cozy, fresh, tranquil, and full of life's atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and detailed, as if shot with a professional camera paired with a prime lens, presenting high resolution, low noise, and excellent color reproduction. Light and shadow are soft and even, with no obvious hard shadows. The overall image feels like a cinematic scene, with a sense of narrative and artistic beauty, while preserving the naturalness and realism of everyday life",
