          "id": "krea2-60c4825f22e3fc164e5aa660",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣街道冷淡跪过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman kneels on the gray paving of a city street, naturally draped over her shoulders. The edges of the maple leaf are clear and the veins distinct, and under the light the leaf glows a warm amber hue. Her expression is gentle and serene, looking directly at the camera, revealing an unintentional sweetness and composure. She wears an off-white knit cardigan with slightly loose sleeves, layered over a white polka-dot sleeveless top. The collar is tied with a matching polka-dot silk scarf, adding a touch of retro artistic flair. The lower half is dark blue denim shorts with slightly worn cuffs, and he's wearing a pair of white platform sneakers with neat laces. The overall look is casual yet refined. The background is a modern urban street, with a dark gray asphalt pavement and clear white traffic markings. In the distance, a black sports car is parked with smooth body lines. The taillights are slim red LED strips, and the paint reflects a cool metallic sheen in the sunlight. The vehicle is in a blurred state, creating a depth effect. In the background, the outlines of buildings and the shadows of greenery can be faintly seen. The composition uses a low-angle shot, with the figure positioned to the right of the frame, occupying the visual center. The body posture is relaxed and natural, forming a stable triangular structure. Light and shadow come from the upper left, sunlight penetrates through the gaps in the leaves, casting mottled light and shadow on the ground and the figure, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. The light is soft and layered, creating a warm and tranquil autumn afternoon atmosphere. The overall color palette is warm yellow, Off-white and deep blue are the main colors, with harmonious and unified color combinations. The image texture is delicate, with the graininess and realism of film photography. It's like capturing everyday moments under natural light with an entry-level camera, full of life and authenticity. Without excessive embellishment, it preserves the true details of the environment and the natural state of the people. The entire scene is full of youthful energy and seasonal poetry, allowing people to feel a touch of gentleness and beauty on the city streets",
