        {
          "id": "krea2-b77940a5d34e9d7f450580b3",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙酒廊坐展示",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a white fabric sofa in the outdoor lounge area. She wears a black spaghetti strap long dress with a hem that drapes down her legs. The fabric features delicate vertical pleats, showcasing an elegant texture and drape. The slight curve drapes over her chest and arms, with a slender silver cross necklace around her neck. Her left ring finger is adorned with a simple ring and yellow nail art. The overall look is simple yet sophisticated. She poses relaxed, her body slightly turned to the side, and her right hand gently rests on a white cushion beside her. The composition centers on the figure, using a medium perspective where the figure occupies the main position. The background is dense green trees with lush branches and leaves, and sunlight filters through the gaps to cast mottled light and shadow, creating a visual effect of alternating light and shadow. Above, you can see the transparent glass roof structure and the edges of the white awning. On the right side is a small dark blue round wooden table with some tissues or wrappers. The overall environment presents a modern, tranquil, and slightly private outdoor atmosphere, with natural daylight, bright and soft. Projecting diagonally from the upper right, it highlights three-dimensional contours while casting soft shadows on the sofa and floor, creating a warm and comfortable summer afternoon atmosphere. The main color palette is black, white, and green, creating a striking contrast and harmonious unity. The composition uses the white sofa in the foreground and green trees in the background to create a sense of layering, extending to the natural landscape in the background. Overall, it presents a style that combines fashion and everyday life, as if shot with a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens, capturing realistic and delicate moments with rich details, High color reproduction, natural light and shadow transitions, and a strong artistic aesthetic and atmospheric appeal",
