          "alias": "单女白T恤城市站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a sun-dappled tree-lined path outdoors, exuding a fresh and sweet aura with a hint of lazy urban vibe. She wears a white lace-trimmed camisole with delicate lace trim decorations on the neckline and shoulder straps. She pairs it with dark blue high-waisted denim shorts with irregular flicker edges, giving off a casual and fashionable look. On her left wrist, she wears a simple gold watch, and in her right hand, she holds a pale yellow knit cardigan casually draped over her arm. A black-and-white polka-dot silk scarf hangs on her chest. The scarf naturally hangs down, and a pair of tortoiseshell-framed glasses is pinned to it, adding a touch of artistic flair. She carries a brown leather handbag on her shoulder, round and vintage with delicate textured textures. The bag is adorned with various cute keychains and small charms, including a plush bear, woven knots, and metal chains. The details are rich and full of everyday life. The foreground features a clear female subject, while the middle is a blurred street environment, where you can see pedestrians passing by in the distance. One person in a blue top rides a bicycle, with dense trees and mottled light in the background. Bright sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating soft light spots. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame, light coming from the front and side, representing a warm afternoon sunshine. This creates a soft and natural transition between light and shadow, enhancing the sense of depth and realism. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and cozy, as if capturing an unintentional moment in daily life. It features a slight film texture and shallow depth of field, presenting a realistic feel similar to amateur camera shooting. The color tones are mainly warm yellow, off-white, deep blue, and brown, with harmonious and unified colors. The details are rich but not overly complicated, combining artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life. The composition is balanced, layered distinctly, and background blur is handled well, highlighting the subject while preserving the ambiance of the environment. The overall style leans toward street photography that combines realism and romance, offering strong visual appeal and emotional resonance",
