          "id": "krea2-f28e2540b917a405bf4c10b1",
          "alias": "单女米T恤城市冷淡蹲",
          "prompt": "A woman squats on an outdoor ground paved with fine gravel. She wears a light beige camisole and gray shorts, wearing a pair of white low-top sneakers. Her posture relaxes as she lowers her head and ties her shoelaces, looking directly at the camera, exuding a hint of youthful shyness and tranquility. Her hands are focused on adjusting the laces on her right foot, her fingers slender and long, her movements delicate and realistic. Her body leans slightly forward, knees bent, and her calves form a natural angle with the ground. The foreground focuses on the details of her lower body and feet, clearly presenting the shoe's texture. The folds of the shoelaces and the lines of the ankles create distinct outlines of the figure, with light and shadow outlining soft highlights and shadows on the skin. The background is blurred, presenting a blurred green plant and a dark wooden fence. The green leaves under sunlight create rich layering, with natural halos at the edges, creating a warm summer afternoon atmosphere. The overall composition uses low-angle shots to highlight the subject, with the view guided from bottom to top to enhance visual tension. The light comes from a diagonal top, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating a mottled light and shadow effect on the ground and the figure. The warm yellow tones are the main focus, blended with natural cool shades, creating a peaceful and cozy atmosphere. The image has a high texture and expressive detail, as if shot with a professional camera on a sunny day, yet retains the casualness and realism of daily life. The overall style combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life, with moderate color saturation, harmonious and unified tones, and a clean and crisp image free of unnecessary distractions. It highlights the fusion of emotional expression and environmental atmosphere, conveying a fresh, gentle, and slightly lazy urban daily 