          "id": "krea2-ab9204c832f839deb6de8f6a",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫森林忧伤站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the outdoor wooden railing, appearing lively and natural, with a hint of melancholy and contemplation, presenting a soft coral color that seems to glow faintly. She wears a loose off-white shirt jacket made of light and soft material with slight pleats. The collar is naturally folded, the cuffs slightly rolled up, revealing slender wrists. Underneath, she wears a light blue spaghetti strap dress that fits the figure and outlines graceful curves. Her right hand gently grips the shoulder strap of a pink small bag, while her left hand naturally drapes the shirt The posture is relaxed and elegant. The pink small bag is minimalist in design, rounded in shape, fitted with metal fasteners, slung crossbody over the shoulder, creating a soft color tone with the overall outfit. The background features blurred green plants and mottled sunlight, with leaves creating rich layers in the sunlight. Light and shadow interplay create a beautiful bokeh effect. The composition centers on the person, shot in the middle shot, with the person occupying the main position. The body is slightly angled to the camera, and the head is slightly turned toward the viewer, creating a friendly yet slightly distant atmosphere. The foreground features clear figures, the middle features wooden railings and partially blurred backgrounds, and the background is a completely obliterate, lush green forest. Light and shadow cast diagonally from above, creating a soft backlighting effect that enhances the sense of depth and texture. The overall color palette is mainly soft off-white, light blue, and pink, paired with a lush green background, creating a fresh and elegant visual experience. The atmosphere is tranquil and warm, as if capturing a tranquil moment under the afternoon sun, like a snapshot of real life taken with a casual amateur camera. It has a strong sense of immersion and artistic beauty, rich details, natural light and shadow transitions, and harmonious color coordination, presenting an aesthetic style that combines youthful vitality with gentle temperament. The composition is balanced, visual guidance is clear, and the background blur further highlights the main subject.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
