        {
          "id": "krea2-4909fbc5e65a7cccdf509a89",
          "alias": "单女灰T恤街道微笑注视",
          "prompt": "Her posture is relaxed and full of tension, with a hint of lazy smile. She wears a tight-fitting dark gray short-sleeved T-shirt that accentuates her slim waistline and slender figure. She pairs loose army green work pants with wide legs, multiple practical pockets, and drawstrings. She wears a pair of white platform sneakers. The overall look exudes street fashion and casual vibes. On her left wrist, she wears a silver bracelet. A thick chain necklace hangs around the neck, highlighting personality in the details. The background is a mottled reddish-brown brick wall, with neatly arranged bricks but slight wear and spots on the surface, presenting a texture shaped by the passage of time. Light streams in from the left side, creating a soft transition of light and shadow on the figures, highlighting the body contours and clothing folds, while casting clear shadows on the floor and metal benches. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figures occupying the right center of the frame, and the triangular space formed by the wall corners enhances visual stability. The diagonal lines of the bench guide the gaze upward to the figure's arm, creating a dynamic balance. The foreground shows parts of the metal bench and the person's legs, the middle ground shows the person's entire body and wall, and the background features a complete brick wall texture. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and slightly retro, with earth tones dominated by brown, beige, gray-green, and white. The colors are harmonious and unified, giving the overall image a strong sense of everyday life and realism, as if you could casually capture it with a regular camera or phone on a street corner.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
