        {
          "id": "krea2-5f35bfb009b461dbd88323ed",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣室内阅读",
          "prompt": "She wears a white knitted short-sleeve sweater with clear patterns, ribbed trimming at the collar and hem, giving a simple yet warm look. She pairs a dark gray pleated skirt with natural drapes and smooth lines. Her right hand gently rests on the edge of the wooden bookshelf, fingers long, nails painted with transparent or light-colored nails, and a simple white watch strap on her wrist. On her shoulder slung a small white backpack with gold chain decorations and exquisite details. Her posture is elegant and natural, her body slightly turned to the camera and her head slightly tilted, creating a relaxed yet approachable feeling. The foreground shows a wooden bookshelf with a clear structure and a distinct wood grain texture. On the left are several books, one with the cover labeled \"Memory Method,\" and another with a red cover labeled \"English Minimalist Learning Method.\" The books are neatly arranged. Some spine text is clearly legible. In the middle ground, the female subject is positioned near the center on the right side of the frame, visually balancing with the bookshelf on the left. The background is a blurred bookstore shelf area, filled with various books. The colors are rich but the blurred treatment creates a sense of depth. The lighting in the background is soft and the tones warm. The overall environment is quiet and comfortable. The composition uses a three-part layout, with the figure occupying the right side of the painting, leaving space on the left to display bookshelf details to form visual guidance, while the bookshelf columns serve as vertical lines. Enhances image stability, with light from the warm yellow indoor source softly and evenly applied to the subject. The texture of the clothing is clearly visible under the light, creating an overall light and shadow atmosphere that is warm, tranquil, and full of life. The image presents a fleeting beauty captured in daily life, as if captured with a regular camera, without excessive embellishment, preserving authenticity and intimacy. The colors are mainly warm tones, with a white sweater contrasting with the dark gray skirt. The colors of the background books are harmonious but not cluttered, the overall composition is clean and tidy, with rich details, conveying a quiet artistic atmosphere of reading and enjoying time, with a strong sense of daily life and artistic appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
