        {
          "id": "krea2-aec5eb1ca5b92849e919e8a8",
          "alias": "单女制服摄影棚自拍",
          "prompt": "She wears a light gray pleated short-sleeved top with a light pink Peter Pan collar design. The neckline is tied with a matching butterfly bow that hangs loosely, forming a natural curve. On the left chest, there is a small pink bow embroidered with exquisite details. The overall style is fresh and cute, full of charm, with a subtle pink sheen. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space, the head slightly tilted, and the background a pure light beige wall with subtle texture. The colors are uniform and soft, without any cluttered elements, creating a clean and clean atmosphere. Light and shadow come from the front slightly left, with soft and directional light and shadow, creating a natural transition between light and shadow. At the same time, soft shadows are formed along the edges of the hairline and neck, enhancing three-dimensionality and depth. The overall color tones are mainly gray, pink, and white, harmoniously unified to create a warm, tranquil, and healing atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains the natural feel of everyday phone selfies. The lens is selected at a standard portrait focal length to simulate real camera focus, making the subject clear and prominent, with a slight background blur and excellent depth control, making the overall image artistically beautiful. It resembles a carefully arranged studio piece, yet carries a sense of everyday warmth, suitable for expressing themes of youth, sweetness, and gentleness. The composition is stable, the visual guidance is natural, and the final focus is on exquisite costume details, filling the entire picture with vitality and emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
