        {
          "id": "krea2-4c8f810af26394989ba05721",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙海滩困倦坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a rattan chair on a seaside terrace, wearing a white spaghetti strap dress with a light and flowing hem. The upper body is made of sheer tulle with lace trim, and the waist is accentuated with a thin waist belt that accentuates her slender waistline. The overall look is elegant and sexy, naturally draped over her shoulders, looking soft and charming. She wears a gorgeous silver diamond necklace set with multiple sparkling crystals and an oval white gemstone. Her neck is gracefully shaped, and on her wrist are black thin bracelets and gold tassel earrings. Her fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed, painted with light pink nail polish. She stretches out her arm forward, palm open, fingertips slightly curved, as if inviting the audience into her world. Her makeup is exquisite and natural, radiating a healthy glow. The background is a tranquil sea, with hazy mountain silhouettes in the distance. The sky displays a pinkish-purple gradient of dusk, a crescent moon hangs in the sky, the sea surface is as calm as a mirror, reflecting the colors of the sky. The distant coastline is dotted with scattered lights, creating a romantic and dreamy atmosphere. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure occupying the center-left position. The extended arm guides the gaze toward the foreground, creating a strong visual direction. Light comes from the right side, and the soft backlight outlines the figures, creating a warm yet slightly mysterious atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly white, pink, and purple, complemented by the reflection of silver jewelry to enhance the layering and texture of the image. The image features high-resolution details, blending modern fashion with romanticism, evoking a sense of intimacy in everyday life. It also carries the refined beauty of artistic photography, like high-quality portraits taken with a professional camera, but retains slight film graininess and natural depth of field blur, making the images more realistic and warm",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
