        {
          "id": "krea2-84bb412276865c388ca9a8a3",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫街道忧伤注视（2）",
          "prompt": "She adds a touch of liveliness and naturalness. She wears a white turtleneck top and a white plush jacket. The jacket is fluffy and soft, with a clearly visible fluffy texture at the cuffs and neckline. She holds a pale green drink in a transparent glass, with crystal-clear ice cubes and a crystal-clear liquid. The overall composition is dominated by cool tones, with a blue-and-white gradient that creates a cool and tranquil atmosphere. Her expression is calm and slightly contemplative, as if immersed in her own world. The background is a city streetscape, and the blurred building facade presents clean geometric lines. The white walls contrast with the dark window frames, while distant trees and leaves are sparse, blending greenery and withered yellow. Sunlight streams in from the right, creating natural transitions of light and shadow with rich layers of light and shadow. The composition uses close-up of the figure, with the subject positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving space on the right to guide the gaze and create a sense of breathing effect. The foreground highlights the details of the person and drinks, the middle shot shows the person's body and some of the environment, and the background is blurred to enhance spatial depth. The lens is an 85mm prime portrait lens with a small aperture. It creates a creamy out-of-focus blur effect. The light comes from low-angle afternoon sunlight, soft and directional. The overall atmosphere is quiet, gentle, and slightly melancholic, giving the image a cinematic texture. It's as if you're shooting a moment on a city street with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens. The image is realistic and delicate, with moderate color saturation, retaining the authentic texture of everyday photography. At the same time, it carries an artistic aesthetic tendency. The color tones are unified and harmonious, without abrupt color interference, emphasizing the fusion of light and emotion, with a balanced composition yet dynamic feel. The visual focus is on the characters' expressions and postures, presenting a poetic moment in a modern city, like a classic shot in an art film, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
