        {
          "id": "krea2-7b8c56f08583cf5342608571",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙浴室冷淡站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a modern luxury bathroom mirror for a selfie. She wears a light blue, silky off-shoulder tight dress with a short hem that fits the curves. The high slit on the left side reveals her long, beautiful legs. She wears a semi-transparent white long-sleeved top, whose sleeves are light and flowing, creating a layered look with her inner layer. Around her neck is a delicate silver metal collar featuring intricate geometric patterns and a small pendant, adding fashionable details. Her makeup is refined, and she holds a black smartphone in her right hand for a mirrored selfie. On the back of the phone, you can see a dual-camera module. The left hand hangs naturally and the body slightly tilts, presenting an elegant S-shaped curve. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered and occupying the main part of the frame. The background is a large area of white marble walls and floors, with delicate and smooth textures presenting natural gray-and-white patterns. The mirror edges are framed with gold metal, reflecting clear images. In the mirror, you can see a recessed niche on the left side displaying several simple bath items. Below is a standalone white oval bathtub with a modern design The lines are simple, and on the right wall, there are two square power switch panels. The overall space is bright and clean, with soft and even lighting. The diffused light from the top leaves no obvious shadows throughout the scene, creating a high-end, clean, and luxurious atmosphere. The light and shadow create delicate reflections on the skin, clothing folds, and marble surfaces, highlighting the texture of the material. It follows the line of sight to the body's curves, then focuses downward on the lines of the high heels and legs, finally returning to the environmental details in the mirror, forming a complete visual loop. The image style blends fashion photography with interior design aesthetics, offering a strong sense of modernity and artistry while retaining the realism of everyday shooting. It feels as if a professional camera was used to shoot in a high-end hotel bathroom, with clear and sharp images, moderate color saturation, and a cool tone accented by warm lighting, creating a calm yet elegant atmosphere. The details are rich, the layers are distinct, and the atmosphere is full of life and aesthetic taste",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
