        {
          "id": "krea2-4aca29baf90f3ea99d4aa29d",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙樱花微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beneath a blooming cherry blossom tree, wearing a pure white lace spaghetti strap dress. The hem is light and flowing, with delicate ruffled lace trim on the shoulders and neckline. The dress has rich layers, and a matching bow decoration is tied around the waist. The overall look is sweet and fresh, with a Japanese touch. She wears a gentle, sweet smile, showing off her white, neat teeth that give off a healthy glow. She holds a black smartphone in both hands. The phone screen was facing herself, seemingly taking a selfie or viewing a photo. Her fingers were long and slender, her nails neatly trimmed, and her right ring finger wore a simple silver ring. She stood slightly to the side, her body slightly tilted, her head turned toward the camera, and the composition was a medium close-up. The figure occupied the main position in the frame, slightly to the right center. In the background was a vast expanse of blooming pink cherry trees, densely and lushly with interlaced branches, forming a dreamy sea of pink flowers. Through the gaps in the flowers, a pale blue could be seen in the sky, and sunlight poured down from above. The light is soft and bright, creating a warm backlighting effect. The petals appear semi-transparent under the light, the foreground is blurred to highlight the main subject, and the background is appropriately blurred to create a shallow depth of field. The contrast of light and shadow enhances the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color palette is mainly white, pink, and light blue, harmoniously unified and harmonious, creating a warm and romantic atmosphere full of spring. The image presents a peaceful and beautiful everyday feel, as if capturing an unintentional moment, with a realistic photographic texture. Shot with a professional camera, High resolution, clear details, natural light and shadow without excessive embellishment, preserving the realism of life. Slight halos and bokeh effects at the edges of the frame enhance the dreamy atmosphere. The overall composition is balanced and proportions harmonious, conveying themes of youth, purity, and a beautiful life",
