        {
          "id": "krea2-389f7f425a81fa9ee5c30ba1",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙广场微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "She wore a white headscarf printed with black patterns and text, adding a touch of softness and vitality. She wore a gentle smile and looked directly into the camera, as if silently communicating with the viewer. She wore a white, tight-fitting short-sleeved dress with bright patterns and rich details, forming a sharp contrast with the overall minimalist outfit. The dress's cut hugged her figure, showing off graceful curves. On her left shoulder slung a small light gray square bag, compact and delicate, equipped with a metal chain shoulder strap. The bag buckle design is simple yet stylish. On her left wrist, she wears a pink smartwatch with a bright band, which creates a visual highlight with the fresh overall tone. Her right hand reaches toward the camera, simulating a selfie pose. The arm lines are smooth, and the background is an indoor setting. She sits on a beige fabric sofa, which feels soft and comfortable, with rounded backrest lines. Next to it is a large window where warm sunlight streams in, with light slanting in from the right. The curtain is dark gray, thick and thick, partially blocking the view outside. The window frame is white, simple and modern. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space. The head and upper body are clearly visible, the body slightly tilted, and the posture relaxed and natural. The gaze meets the camera, creating intimacy and interaction. In the foreground, an outstretched arm and watch guide the viewer's gaze into the frame. The middle shot features the main figure and a sofa, while the background features windows and curtains. The layers are distinct, the light and shadow effects stand out, and sunlight casts soft shadows on the figures, enhancing the sense of depth and realism. The entire scene is warm and tranquil, full of the breath of everyday life, as if capturing a real moment of a leisurely afternoon. The color palette is mainly white, beige, and gray, accented with pink and blue, creating a harmonious unity and strong visual appeal. The image is delicate and detailed, combining the fun of anime elements with the intimacy of real life, presenting a unique beauty that blends virtual and real worlds",
