          "id": "krea2-be7c3433d309128cff117d45",
          "alias": "单女白T恤街道微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under the sunlight of a city street, looking straight at the camera with a gentle smile. Her makeup is natural and translucent, and her overall vibe is fresh, sweet, yet modern. She wears an off-white tight camisole that highlights her graceful figure, layered with a light green casual jacket made of lightweight material, a slightly open neckline, and black trimmed cuffs. She pairs it with matching high-waisted shorts, which are slim and accented with metal buttons at the waist. The overall look is simple, stylish, and layered. She holds a transparent plastic cup filled with yellow beverages in her right hand, with ice cubes and lemon slices visible inside. A straw is inserted diagonally, her fingers are long, painted with light pink nail polish, and a delicate ring on her ring finger. Around her neck is a slender silver necklace, adding a touch of elegance. She stands slightly to the side, her body slightly tilted, her left hand naturally hanging at her side, her posture relaxed and confident. The composition centers on the person, shot in a medium shot, with the figure occupying the center right of the frame, and the direction of the gaze directly communicates with the viewer The background is a blurry city streetscape, shaded by green trees. The leaves illuminate the sunlight with mottled light and shadow effects. In the distance, you can faintly see parked cars and people riding electric bikes, but all are blurred, creating a strong sense of depth. The light comes from the upper left, the warm golden afternoon sunlight, casting soft beams through the leaves, creating a beautiful backlight effect and distinct contour light, creating a dreamy halo. The shadowed areas transition naturally, with the overall color scheme mainly warm yellow, off-white, and light green, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme Filled with the freshness and vitality of summer, returning to the overall design, it forms a complete viewing path. The atmosphere is relaxed and pleasant, as if capturing a leisurely and pleasant afternoon. It has the realism of everyday photos taken with a phone or portable camera. The image texture is delicate and detailed, combining the beauty of artistic photography with a sense of everyday life, presenting a natural, authentic, warm, and infectious visual experience",
