          "id": "krea2-0ef41275aea3984dbc289c02",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤阳台媚态站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an outdoor balcony at dusk, displaying a natural sheen and layering. She wears a loose light gray hooded sweatshirt, with sleeves casually rolled up and draped over her shoulders, revealing a black lace camisole underneath. The camisole is adorned with small red floral patterns, adding a touch of playfulness and sensuality. Her left hand gently strokes the collar on her chest, her posture elegant and relaxed, with a subtle natural sheen. She wears dark blue jeans with metal buttons and decorative chains at the waist, the pants fitting her body perfectly. The overall look is casual yet stylish. The foreground is a close-up of the upper body of the subject, occupying most of the frame. The composition uses a medium-to-near portrait style, with the figure slightly tilted and head tilted, forming a graceful S-shaped curve. The background is a blurred distant view, showing the outlines of distant hills and sparse trees. The sky displays a warm orange-yellow tone, with thin and transparent clouds tinted by the sunset in a soft pink-purple gradient. Light shines from the upper right, creating a backlighting effect that creates a bright halo over the figure's profile. The shadows appear delicate and natural, with moderate light and shadow contrast, creating a tranquil and warm atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly warm tones, harmoniously blending gray, blue, orange, pink, and other colors. The shallow depth of field treatment blurs the background and highlights the subject. The lens seems to use a large-aperture prime lens, simulating real camera shooting effects, with a strong cinematic feel and artistic atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and detailed, and the overall style combines the casual nature of daily life with the artistic beauty of professional photography, presenting a gentle A quiet yet vibrant dusk",
