          "id": "krea2-15c3ad4ce827cc2248c26a8e",
          "alias": "单女透视白连衣裙庭院困倦持相机",
          "prompt": "A half-length portrait of a woman creates a natural halo effect, adding a touch of laziness and mystery. She wears an off-white or cream-colored sheer dress with a light and flowing hem, a semi-transparent texture, natural pleats, and loose puff sleeves with slight curled edges. The overall look is simple and elegant, with a relaxed posture. The body is slightly turned and the head tilts slightly, creating an intimate yet distant atmosphere. The background features an old-style building wall bearing traces of time, grayish-white with mottled textures and cracks. Some areas are covered with green vines, with dense leaves and natural forms. The vines hang down from above, and the composition uses close-ups. The figure occupies most of the frame, with light coming from the upper right. Strong backlight shines from behind, creating contrasts of highlights and shadows, creating a warm and dreamy atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly cool white, off-white, and gray-green, fresh and pure with natural light and shadow transitions. The image has a cinematic texture, as if shot with professional photography equipment, yet retains the realism of a handheld camera. The lens focal length approaches 85mm portrait lenses, with a shallow depth of field, obvious background blur, and a focus on the subject. The details are rich, and the overall atmosphere is peaceful, beautiful, and slightly artistic, like a moment captured in a courtyard bathed in afternoon sunlight, full of poetry and storytelling",
