          "id": "krea2-d6c03dfcbf616e58dca7d629",
          "alias": "单女金外套乡村俏皮站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a sunlit green hillside, appearing gentle and lively. She wears a light yellow thin coat over a white top. The material is light and soft, with natural pleats at the cuffs. The shoulder lines are soft, forming a sharp contrast with the pastoral scenery in the background. She stands slightly to the side, her head slightly tilted, as if silently communicating with the viewer. The light and shadow extend from the top of her head to her chest, with clear layers of light and shadow. The center is a vast green meadow with dense and lush leaves, presenting different layers of emerald green tones. A few white sheep are leisurely grazing on the grass, and in the distance, a few farmhouses and sheds can be seen. The architectural style is simple and rustic, with mostly gray or white roofs and beige or light brown walls, surrounded by low fences and trees, creating a typical rural rural scene. The background is rolling hills and distant mountains, densely vegetated, colors gradually fading from near to far, clear skies with alternating blue and white, sparse clouds, ample light, composition using a three-part method, with figures positioned in the lower left of the painting. The space on the right and above is reserved to showcase a vast natural landscape, extending to the upper right to the distant fields and sky, creating a profound sense of space. Light and shadow come from the upper right, creating soft highlights and shadows, while casting soft shadows on the grass creates a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly green, accented with yellow, white, and blue, creating a harmonious and unified color. The image has a strong natural atmosphere and a sense of life, as if taken with a regular phone to capture everyday photos. With slight noise and realistic exposure effects, it presents a realistic and poetic pastoral life scene",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
