          "id": "krea2-81f204140ede99499767a930",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙桌边忧伤倚靠交叠",
          "prompt": "The lace patterns are intricate and elegant, adding a touch of retro romance to the overall look. Her fingers are long and slender, her nails neatly trimmed, and her posture is gentle yet slightly lazy, carrying a hint of melancholy and contemplation, presenting a natural pink tone. She wears an off-white sleeveless dress with ruffles at the neckline and shoulders, with natural pleats. The fabric is light and soft with a subtle sheen. The clothing has subtle wrinkles and textures, giving it a realistic and textured look. Her body leans slightly forward, arms crossed on the table, with graceful arm lines. The background is dark blinds, whose blades are arranged in parallel, forming strong horizontal lines. The colors are deep gray or black, creating a sharp contrast with the light-colored clothing. Light streams in diagonally from the left side of the frame, creating a soft side lighting effect. The transition between light and shadow is natural, with strong contrast between light and shadow, while shadows are distributed across her neck, collarbones, and the sides of her body. This creates a three-dimensional layered effect. In the foreground, you can see a brown ceramic teacup and coaster. The cup body is rounded, the surface smooth, and glazed reflective. The rim of the cup holder shows slight wear marks. The tabletop is made of dark stone or wood with fine textures and spots. The overall tone is dark, blending seamlessly with the background. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space. The head is positioned slightly to the upper left of the frame, with the gaze directed toward the lower right, creating a visual guide. The main figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the painting, with the blinds in the background extending vertically, enhancing the sense of depth. Light enters from the left, creating a clear contrast of light and shadow. The entire scene is tranquil and cozy, with a vintage artistic style. It feels like a quiet afternoon, with sunlight streaming through the blinds on her, creating a warm and tranquil light and shadow effect. The colors are mainly warm tones, with soft colors like off-white, light brown, and pale pink contrasting with the dark background, enhancing the visual impact. The overall image possesses a high degree of realism and artistic beauty, like a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera. The details are rich, the light and shadow are delicate, and the texture is lifelike, as if you can feel the faint fragrance in the air and the quiet passage of time",
