        {
          "id": "krea2-bad819f9f5ba3c3319668520",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣室内困倦侧头",
          "prompt": "The transition from deep brown at the roots to light gold at the ends creates warm highlights and shadow layers, creating a light and transparent texture that appears gentle and sweet, with a subtle moisture effect. She wears an off-white knit sweater with a round neckline, soft and delicate in texture. A small dark brown five-pointed star pattern is dotted on the chest. The sweater's texture is clearly visible and the pleats are natural, showcasing the comfort of daily life. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space, the head slightly tilted, as if silently communicating with the viewer. The background is blurred and blurred, presenting a warm-toned indoor environment. The red walls and wooden furniture edges are faintly visible, and light streams in diagonally from the left side of the painting, creating a soft backlighting effect that envelops the figure's outline in a golden halo. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with an overall warm tone dominated by orange-yellow, pink, and off-white, creating a cozy, healing, and slightly dreamy everyday feel. The images have a slight film graininess and soft bokeh effects, as if captured with a regular camera in the afternoon sun. The details are rich, colors harmonious, emotions sincere, and full of youthful energy and the warmth of life",
