        {
          "id": "krea2-78d883edc7b57d4b11c11dbc",
          "alias": "单女米连体衣城市冷淡站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman stands atop a city at night, showing off her white, neat teeth, full of confidence and approachability. She wears a beige strapless jumpsuit made of soft and form-fitting material, with a drawstring design at the shoulder straps. The waistline is smooth, the hem slightly cinched, paired with a white lining that faintly reveals the edges. The overall look is simple, elegant, yet sexy. Her posture is naturally relaxed, her body slightly turned to the side, revealing graceful curves. Her left hand hangs naturally, her arm is long and well-proportioned, presenting a soft sheen, with a blurred city night scene in the background. In the distance, tall buildings stand tall, and the lights of thousands of homes twinkle like stars, forming a dazzling halo. Some buildings have clear outlines, and the lighting colors are rich, interwoven with warm yellow, cool white, and pale blue, creating a bustling urban atmosphere. The sky is a deep ink blue with a hint of gray clouds, giving the entire scene more layers. The composition uses medium and near shots for close-ups, with the figures occupying the main positions and their heads slightly raised, creating strong visual guidance. The shallow depth of field effect makes the foreground figures stand out clearly, while the background is treated with blur. It enhances the sense of spatial depth, with light coming from the upper front of the subject, creating a natural shadow transition. At the same time, the city lights in the background act as ambient light, adding warm tones to the image. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is cozy and romantic, with a slight cinematic feel, as if capturing a private and beautiful moment. The image texture is delicate and lifelike, with rich details, moderate color saturation, and warm and harmonious tones, giving it the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting. It feels like a casual snapshot of life taken with a regular phone on the balcony or by the window. Yet it also carries a carefully crafted composition and artistic aesthetic lighting, blending modern urban fashion with personal charm, presenting a relaxed, joyful lifestyle with a touch of bourgeois charm",
