        {
          "id": "krea2-9cc2fc560b65dbc3db49c0c3",
          "alias": "单女粉外套街道俏皮站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a sunny street, adding a touch of gentleness and vitality, presenting a soft pink color that gives off a fresh and refined vibe. She wears a fashionable pink outfit with a light, flowing pink jacket on top, made of silk or chiffon with pleats and ruffles. The sleeves are wide and layered, and she wears a white lace camisole underneath with a simple and elegant neckline and shoulders. She pairs the lower half with a matching pink skirt and lace trim. The overall look is sweet and cute yet still sophisticated. In her left hand, she holds a small black bag adorned with a gold brand logo. On her wrist, she wears simple accessories, and on her neck is a thin chain necklace with a small pendant hanging from it. Her posture is natural and relaxed, her body slightly turned to the camera and her head tilted slightly, revealing an effortless beauty. The background is a corner of a city street, where you can see modern-style architecture. The walls are made of red bricks and light-colored stone, and the windows and door frames are simple lines. Next to it is a tree with bare branches but dotted with tender yellow flowers. Some colorful round decorations hang on the branches, resembling festive lanterns in orange, yellow, and red, adding a lively atmosphere to the scene. In the distance, there are streetlights and blurry pedestrian silhouettes. The ground is gray concrete with traces of zebra crossings. The entire scene is illuminated by warm sunlight, with light slanting down from above, creating a soft transition of light and shadow on the figures. The sky appears a pale blue, with no clouds, and the air is fresh and transparent. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The foreground features a clear main subject, the middle ground shows the surrounding streets and trees, and the background features buildings and the sky. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is bright and warm, with pink, white, and yellow as the main tones, creating a romantic and tranquil spring afternoon. The overall composition has a strong artistic and photographic feel, as if taken with a professional camera in high-resolution photos, rich in detail, and moderately saturated colors. presenting a sense of authenticity and dreamlike beauty",
