        {
          "id": "krea2-c6419e16c262e46b0abac3bc",
          "alias": "单女人鱼白礼服樱花害羞站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman in an elegant white mermaid gown stands beneath a blooming cherry blossom tree. She slightly turns to look back at the camera, arms crossed over her chest, her posture dignified yet slightly shy. The white gown features a strapless design, with fluffy ruffled cuffs on the shoulders, a cinched waist tied into a slender white ribbon forming a bow, the ribbon naturally hanging down to the ground. A graceful curve forms, the hem hugging the figure, gradually unfolding from the waistline to present a smooth fishtail shape. The fabric has a silky sheen texture that glows softly under the sunlight. The cherry blossom branches are thick and strong, dark brown with clearly visible grain. The branches stretch outward, forming a natural arched frame. The pink and white cherry blossoms bloom densely, with petals layered in layers—some budding, others fully in full bloom—forming a romantic sea of flowers, with expansive parks and green spaces as the background. In the distance, dense forests can be faintly seen, the sky is pale blue with slight clouds, and the light is soft and bright, representing the golden moment of early morning or evening. Sunlight pours in from the upper left of the frame, casting a warm golden glow over the figures and flowers, casting gentle shadows on the ground and skirts. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot to highlight the figure's slender figure and elegant temperament, while the cherry blossom tree serves as the main visual frame, guiding the gaze to focus on the subject. The foreground features green grass and scattered fallen leaves, adding depth and realism to the image. The middle ground is the main body of the figures and cherry trees, while the background features distant trees and sky, forming a distinct spatial structure. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and romantic, full of poetic and dreamlike colors. The light and shadow transition naturally, with tones dominated by white, pink, green, and light blue, creating a fresh, refined, gentle, and beautiful visual experience. The images are rich in detail and lifelike, resembling high-resolution photographic works taken with professional photography equipment, while preserving the authentic texture under natural light, allowing people to feel the beauty of spring and the rhythm of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
