        {
          "id": "krea2-0d0a65cc2e431fd275c205bc",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙室内微笑坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a modern-style indoor setting, naturally draped over her shoulders, looking directly at the camera with a gentle smile. On her left hand is a simple silver bracelet, while on her right wrist is a gentle light gray jade bracelet. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, wearing a white sleeveless pleated dress with ruffled designs at the collar and shoulders, adding softness and layering. She sits at a dark brown wooden round table, smooth with clear wood grain patterns. On the table sits a transparent glass candle holder, containing an off-white candle. The base is made of black metal, giving it a simple yet stylish look. In the background is a spacious and bright interior, with large floor-to-ceiling windows or glass curtain walls behind. Warm natural light streams in outside, filtering through vertically arranged wooden blinds to create strip-like shadows, casting mottled shadows on the walls and floor, creating a peaceful and cozy atmosphere. In the distance, you can faintly see sofas, cushions, and some vague furniture outlines. However, the focus is entirely on the figure, with the composition using close-ups. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, with a slight tilt of the head, creating direct communication with the viewer. The candlestick and table edge in the foreground serve as visual guiding elements, while the middle frame naturally extends the body and arms. The background uses blurring to highlight the subject while preserving environmental information. The overall light and shadow are soft and even, with the main light source coming from the sides and rear, creating a strong sense of three-dimensionality and creating a warm, comfortable, and slightly intimate home atmosphere. The color palette is warm white, Beige gray and light brown are the main colors, harmonious and unified, with delicate image texture, as if shot with a professional camera in low light, presenting a grainy texture and realistic details similar to film photography. It has a strong artistic and everyday vibe, suitable for fashion portraits, emotional expression, or daily recording scenes. The overall atmosphere is quiet, elegant, and full of storytelling, evoking a rare sense of tranquility and beauty in modern urban life",
