        {
          "id": "krea2-b23c694573ea9b98df2f9056",
          "alias": "单女白外套街道忧伤站立侧头（2）",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways on a city street at night, slightly tilting her head up to gaze at the sky. She wears a thick white plush coat with a soft and fluffy collar and cuffs. She wears a dark gray turtleneck sweater underneath, wrapped in a heavy dark gray knitted scarf over it. Her hands gently gather the edge of the scarf, her posture elegant and natural, appearing gentle and charming. The main focus is positioned slightly to the center on the left side of the composition, using close-up shots to capture the upper body of the person, with a blurred city night scene as the background. In the distance, streetlights emit a warm yellow glow, forming beautiful circular light spots. The blurred shadows of trees and building silhouettes are faintly visible, creating a hazy yet layered sense of space. The overall light comes from the warm light source slightly to the left in front, while a subtle shadow transition forms on the right side, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The cool-toned lighting in the background contrasts with the warm light of the foreground, highlighting the subject's presence. The composition uses a shallow depth of field effect to focus on the figure, completely blurring the background. Guiding the viewer's gaze to the expressions and postures of the characters, it evokes associations with the unknown or distant places. The lighting and shadow atmosphere presents a serene, gentle, and slightly melancholic urban nightscape beauty, as if frozen in a moment of solitary strolling on a cold winter night. The entire scene has a strong cinematic and artistic atmosphere, with gray-blue, warm yellow, and white tones complemented by delicate texture details, enhancing realism and tactile imagination. The shooting style resembles professional portrait photography but carries the realism of everyday amateur equipment. The natural noise and slight out-of-focus rendered by a handheld camera using a large-aperture lens in low-light environments create a private, immersive personal memory fragment, as if a frame is taken from a life record, full of poetry and emotional tension. The overall atmosphere is quiet and profound, allowing people to feel the beauty in solitude and inner peace",
