        {
          "id": "krea2-1baec5a4edd5ff02bcd9f015",
          "alias": "单女衬衫竹林困倦站立",
          "prompt": "An elegant Eastern classical beauty dressed in Hanfu adorned with several simple and elegant silver hairpins and tassel earrings. Her right hand gently rests on the front of her shirt, while her left hand rests on a dark brown wooden pillar. Her posture is elegant and dignified, dressed in an off-white cross-collared right-lapel Hanfu, draped over a semi-transparent sheer jacket. The fabric is light and flowing, with a delicate and soft texture. The skirt is wide and layered, with layers of folds naturally cascading down. At the waist hangs a golden brocade belt embroidered with exquisite floral patterns, rich and meticulously detailed. The overall costume design blends traditional aesthetics with modern aesthetics, presenting a gentle and serene Eastern charm. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the composition's center, with figures occupying the main space and forming a visual focal point. The background is a blurred courtyard scene, with faint glimpses of blue tiles, flying eaves, green bamboo shadows, and mottled light, creating a serene and profound atmosphere. On the right side of the foreground stands a sturdy dark wooden pillar with clear surface grain and traces of time This contrast with the figures enhances the spatial layering of the composition. The middle ground is a blurred garden behind the figure, with interwoven trees and leaves and mottled light and shadow, creating a soft bokeh effect. The background further blurs into hazy green and gray tones, emphasizing the clarity and three-dimensionality of the main figure. The composition uses a third-section layout, with the figure centered slightly left, leaving a blank space on the right side to enhance breathability. At the same time, wooden pillars serve as guiding lines to form a stable visual structure. Light streams diagonally from the left, casting soft natural light onto the figures, creating a contrast of light and shadow, while the shadows transition naturally, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly off-white, light yellow, and gray-green, paired with deep brown and black elements. The colors are harmoniously unified and full of classical poetry. The use of light and shadow is delicate, with both the mottled effects of sunlight filtering through leaves and soft diffused halos, giving the painting a dreamy, hazy beauty. The atmosphere is tranquil and peaceful, as if immersed deep in a Jiangnan garden, time frozen, only a gentle breeze brushes and robes flutter. The entire scene exudes a strong atmosphere of Eastern aesthetics, like a meticulously painted meticulous painting or a beautiful moment in a costume drama.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
