        {
          "id": "krea2-3c02dc681647919a2ca45180",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙困倦过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman is the main subject, naturally draped over her shoulders and chest, with slightly curled ends that create soft wavy lines that add a touch of laziness and elegance. She wears a dark blue strap dress with bright blue floral patterns. The dress features a V-neck design that highlights the neck line, with thin straps draped lightly over the shoulders, a cinched waist, and shiny silver metal decorative buckles. The hem of the skirt unfolds naturally in an A-shape, making the material look light and breathable, with a soft texture. The fingers are long, and the posture is elegant and natural. The foreground is a close-up of the upper body of the character, occupying the main position, with the chest above and the head fully presented. The background is a modern minimalist indoor environment, with background blur treatment. Gray-toned walls and recessed spotlights on the ceiling emit soft warm light. In the distance, there are blurred furniture outlines and reflective surfaces. The middle ground is the space behind the figure, including parts of the countertop or bar edge. The material may be marble or high-gloss lacquer, presenting a cool gray tone. The composition uses a classic center-symmetrical style, with the figure centered. The shallow depth of field effect focuses on the figure, the background blur creates a strong sense of layering, and the lighting atmosphere is dominated by soft indoor lighting. The main light source comes from the upper front, creating a soft shadow transition. Meanwhile, the dotted light source in the background creates beautiful bokeh spots after blurring, enhancing the dreamy and sophisticated feel of the image. The overall color palette is mainly dark blue, gray, and warm orange. The color scheme is harmonious and unified, creating an elegant, tranquil, and slightly fashionable atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with professional photography equipment, featuring high resolution and rich detail while preserving the intimate feel of real-life shooting. The lens uses an 85mm portrait prime lens with an f/1.8 aperture, capturing extreme sharpness and natural depth of field. Camera parameters simulate Canon R5 or Sony A7R IV, RAW format recording. Post-processing emphasizes color reproduction and detail enhancement, preserving both the original realism and artistic beauty of the image",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
