        {
          "id": "krea2-2b8ff8b8fd7caf7df8129576",
          "alias": "单女灰外套冷淡交叠",
          "prompt": "She wears a gray plush short jacket made of soft and puffy material, with black trim at the collar and cuffs. She wears a white lapel shirt with a black bow at the collar, revealing a black tight vest at the hem. She wears a black-and-white plaid skirt paired with black stockings and gray high-cut knit slouches. Her socks were pulled above her knees, creating a crease. She wore a pair of thick-soled black leather shoes with smooth uppers, laces tied into a bow, the soles thick and textured. Her left hand rested naturally on the wall, while her right hand made a \"V\" gesture, looking relaxed and natural. She wore a black bracelet on her wrist, small earrings, and a small black bag slung across her body. The bag was simple and fitted with a gold chain, with a clear blue sky against the background. The sky was deep blue without clouds, and in the upper left corner, green leaves jutted out into the frame, lush and clearly visible, the light and shadow come from directly above to the right, bright and soft, with shadows falling on the left and lower sides of the body. The stone wall surface is rough with a grainy texture. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right, the body slightly tilted, legs crossed, creating a visual sense of dynamism. The foreground shows the lower body and legs, the middle is the upper body and part of the background, the background is the sky and branches, with sharp color contrasts. The blue sky and green leaves form a cool tone. Following the line of sight downward to hand movements and leg lines, finally landing on shoes and the floor, the overall atmosphere is fresh and bright, full of youthful energy. It is both fashionable and retains the warmth of everyday life. It feels like a casual life photo taken on a sunny afternoon with a phone—authentic and natural, rich in detail, with natural light and shadow transitions, moderate color saturation, clean and tidy images without unnecessary distractions, highlighting the main subject and conveying a relaxed, joyful, confident, and composed attitude toward life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
