        {
          "id": "krea2-22e39dde1e0ddbe21431e23e",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤厨房冷淡持手机",
          "prompt": "The texture is delicate and soft, presenting a natural texture and layering. Her fingers are slender and long, her nails neatly trimmed, painted with transparent or pale pink nail polish. The fingertips are slightly curved, and the posture of holding the grapes is elegant and natural. The surface of the grapes is smooth and rounded, shimmering with a sparkling water droplet sheen. The color is bright and emerald, as if freshly picked from the vine, carrying the scent of morning dew. She wore a blue and white vertical striped camisole with a lightweight, breathable fabric. The stripes alternate between fine blue lines and a white base, edged with delicate lace trim. The neckline and shoulder straps were tied with bows, with a thin cord design and a back-cut design revealing some skin. The fabric had a cotton-linen texture with natural folds, showing subtle texture changes under light and shadow. The overall vibe is fresh and sweet. The foreground features the main subject, clear and prominent; the middle ground shows details of the figures and clothing; the background is a blurred indoor environment; the walls are pure white or light gray, clean and simple, with faint metal reflections at the kitchen sink edges and a few outlines of household items. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is on the right side of the frame, leaving space on the left to create visual balance. The viewing angle is slightly lower than the head-on, creating a sense of familiarity. Light comes from the front left, soft and even, simulating natural light, with sunlight streaming through the window. Creates a warm backlit silhouette, soft shadows, background blur treatment, shot with a large aperture lens, out-of-focus imaging presenting a creamy bokeh effect. The colors are mainly cool tones, with blue and white paired for a fresh and pleasant look, accented with green grapes for a touch of vitality. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and warm, full of the small joys of a summer afternoon. The image has the texture of film photography, with slight graininess and color shifts enhancing realism. The overall style combines realism with artistic beauty, like beautiful moments casually captured with a phone or camera in daily life, carrying a sense of life and personal emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
