        {
          "id": "krea2-ac01722db691c3dd4b9630e7",
          "alias": "单女蓝连体衣街道温柔跪注视",
          "prompt": "A woman kneels on the smooth white marble floor, her body slightly leaning forward, presenting a dynamic and flowing aura. Her makeup is exquisite but not exaggerated, highlighting a natural beauty. She wears a light blue bodysuit printed with black handwritten English letters and symbols, varying in font sizes and arranged in a well-arranged manner, creating a visual effect of fashionable street style collaged with art. The one-piece dress features black thin straps and garter straps. The straps extend from the chest to the thighs and are secured with metal buckles, adding structure and sexy elements to the garment. She wears black stockings, with long and well-proportioned leg lines and cross straps at the knees, further enhancing the layering and detail of the look. The background is a minimalist, modern interior space, with pure white walls featuring vertical groove decorative lines. The light is soft and even, and when it shines in from the left, it casts gentle shadows on the walls and floor. This enhances the sense of three-dimensionality in the space. The marble texture on the floor is alternating gray and white, flowing naturally and with a delicate texture. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center, forming an S-shaped body posture that guides the gaze from the head down to the legs, highlighting the beauty of the body's curves. The foreground features the marble texture of the floor and the figure's feet, the middle ground features the full-body and clothing details, and the background features simple walls and the edges of door frames. The contrast between solid and void is pronounced, and the visual focus is on the figure, with delicate light and shadow treatment. The main light source comes from the front side, creating soft highlights and shadow transitions. The overall atmosphere is bright and fresh with a touch of intimate sexiness. The color tones are mainly white, light blue, and black, harmoniously unified to create a clean, sophisticated, and fashionable visual impression. The images have strong visual appeal, as if high-quality portraits were shot with a professional camera in a studio, while preserving the beauty of casual moments in daily life, like a carefully planned home portrait or fashion showcase. The images are rich in detail and have clear textures, all showcasing a high sense of realism and artistry. The overall style blends modern fashion, mature charm, and the aesthetic concepts of artistic photography, presenting a unique temperament that combines strength and softness",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
