        {
          "id": "krea2-876f1e611169fd8e0fb44b38",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙害羞跪侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a pink spaghetti strap dress made of light, flowing material with pleats, ruffled on the shoulders, and fluffy puffy sleeves. The chest is adorned with a blooming rose and a wreath made of small flowers and green beads. The wreath extends along the straps and chest, adding a romantic touch. Her hands are folded on her knees, holding several colorful tulips whose flowers show a gradient of orange-red and yellow The petals curl slightly, the green leaves are fresh, she sits gracefully, her body slightly leaning forward, head slightly tilted, creating a friendly yet slightly shy posture. In the foreground are a few tulips and part of her skirt in front of her; in the middle is her full-body image; the background is a blurred green grass, sunlight filters through the leaves, casting mottled light and shadow, creating a soft bokeh effect. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned in the center of the frame, highlighting the main subject. Natural light comes from above, soft and warm, with delicate shadows and rich layers. The overall atmosphere is warm and romantic, full of spring vibes, as if you were shooting a daily portrait with an amateur camera, featuring a slight film texture and natural noise. The tones are warm, saturation is moderate, details are clear, and it exudes realism and artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
