        {
          "id": "krea2-77f5ee94038218f35ee4a8b2",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫机场站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under the clear blue sky, wearing a white short-sleeved shirt and a beige plaid pleated skirt. Her petals are delicate and full, and the green leaves highlight a fresh texture. She stands slightly to the side, her posture elegant and natural. In the background is a large passenger plane on the tarmac, its body pure white with blue striped decorations. The wings and tail are clearly visible, the sky is clear and cloudless, and the sun is shining brightly. Light shines from above to the left, creating a bright and transparent visual effect. The overall composition uses a medium-length portrait, with the figure centered slightly to the right. Occupying the main position, the airplane extends as a background element on the right, creating a sense of spatial layering. The foreground is the main subject, the middle includes her body and the flowers in her hand, and the background is the airplane and sky. The colors are pure blue and white, with natural light and shadow transitions, clear contrasts of light and shadow, a quiet and romantic atmosphere, full of youthful energy and poetic beauty. The texture is delicate and authentic, as if shot with a professional camera, featuring film-like warm tones and slight graininess, rich details, and natural shirt folds. The skirt's texture is clear, the flower shapes are lifelike, and the airplane's surface reflects a real glow, presenting a beautiful moment casually captured in daily life, like precious memories taken by chance during travel, full of story and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
