        {
          "id": "krea2-c9cc8e97f52e1e9f4ed5fdef",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣室内温柔坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits indoors, naturally draped over her shoulders. Her overall makeup is clean and fresh, appearing healthy and full of vitality. She wears a loose light blue knit cardigan with sleeves that fall naturally, revealing slender arm lines. Underneath, she wears white shorts. Her legs are long and well-proportioned, and she gracefully leans sideways against a giant pink plush doll, a classic Hello Kitty look. With its signature large bow and rounded body, the material is soft and fluffy, with a soft pink color and delicate stitching on the surface. The doll's head and body occupy most of the left side of the image, creating a visual sense of weight. The woman's arms wrap around the doll, her hand movements natural and relaxed, fingertips gently resting on the edge of the doll, creating an intimate and warm atmosphere. In the background is a bright shop window, with glass reflecting indoor lights and product displays, showing various small items on the shelves. For example, bottled skincare products, decorations, and packaging boxes are colorful but not cluttered. Cartoon patterns are pasted above the window, including Hello Kitty and a bear in blue clothes, as well as an artistic font sign with \"Lheory.\" In the upper right corner, there is a silhouette of a white cartoon animal. The entire scene is well-lit, with warm yellow indoor lighting creating a cozy and comfortable atmosphere. The light mainly shines from the front slightly left, with soft shadows cast on the right and rear sides, enhancing the three-dimensional effect. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, the doll occupying the left, creating a balanced yet asymmetrical visual structure. The camera angle is slightly upward, highlighting the character's affinity and the doll's volume. The foreground is clear and sharp, the middle ground is the main part of the figure and doll, while the background is slightly blurred. The shallow depth of field effect emphasizes the subject, and the doll's large bow also draws attention, forming an emotional connection. The overall color scheme is mainly pink, light blue, and off-white, paired with warm yellow light, creating a sweet, healing, The youthful atmosphere is delicate, the image texture is delicate, and the details are rich, as if shot with a professional camera, yet it retains the natural feel of everyday life, with strong visual appeal and storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
