        {
          "id": "krea2-3b9dad1bd311be4b03ab4cf8",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道冷淡坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor stone steps, wearing a loose white long-sleeved shirt with the hem casually hanging above her knees. She wears a short black-and-white plaid top underneath, a black short skirt and sheer black stockings, and black cross-lace high-heeled sandals. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the painting, with a slightly turned body and crossed legs forming a graceful curve. The stone steps are made of gray concrete, with slight wear marks along the edges and a noticeably rough texture. The metal handrails are black, with clean and modern lines extending diagonally to the upper right of the painting. The background is a weathered stone wall with clear texture and a grayish-brown color showing signs of aging. Light comes from the front left, creating soft natural light, with natural transitions and balanced contrast between light and shadow. It creates a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall color palette mainly features a contrast of cool and warm tones. The white shirt contrasts strongly with the black clothing, harmonizing with the neutral tones of the gray stone steps and the background wall. The composition uses the slanted lines of the stone steps to guide the viewer's gaze upward, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The figures are placed in the foreground, with the middle being the structure of stone steps and handrails, and the stone wall as the background. The layers are distinct, and the overall composition presents a subtle beauty from everyday life, as if casually taken with a regular camera in a street style Yet through careful composition and lighting, it presents a visual effect that blends realism and art. The details are rich, from the translucent texture of the stockings to the clear woven texture of the shoes. The delicate handling of light and shadow highlights the three-dimensionality of the characters and the realism of the scene. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of storytelling, like a moment frozen in a corner of a city—both ordinary and charming",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
