        {
          "id": "krea2-ae1f8f1d63668694da0ddde3",
          "alias": "单女棕泳装海滩冷淡倚靠回眸",
          "prompt": "She wears a deep brown spaghetti strap bikini top, with the straps tied in a bow at the back of her neck. Her back is smooth and graceful, her arms adorned with matching thin cords, light gray denim shorts on the bottom, and a brown cloth belt at her waist. The overall look is simple yet layered, with a slightly tilted posture, her body leaning against the tree trunk on the right side, her head gently looking back at the camera presenting a natural reddish hue. The composition uses a medium close-up, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right. The tree trunks on both sides form a natural frame structure, guiding the gaze to focus on the subject. The background is a blurry water surface and distant sky, with gentle ripples reflecting a soft blue-green hue. The sky appears as a light teal at dusk, with light slanting from the upper left of the painting, creating a warm backlight effect that outlines a soft outline, while dappled light and shadow are cast onto the tree trunk surface. It creates a tranquil yet slightly poetic atmosphere, with the overall color scheme mainly cool blue and warm brown, creating a striking contrast yet harmonious unity. The image texture is delicate, with a grainy texture reminiscent of film photography and slight vignetting, as if captured by an old camera at dusk. The lens uses a 50mm prime lens with an f/1.8 aperture and a shallow depth of field, making the foreground clear and background blurred, highlighting the subject. The composition emphasizes symmetry and balance. Using the vertical lines of the trunk to create a visual contrast with the curves of the figures, the composition enhances depth and artistic tension. The light is soft and directional, creating a quiet, private, and slightly artistic atmosphere. The overall composition presents an unintentional beauty in daily life, like a casual seaside walk frozen in time, full of story and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
