        {
          "id": "krea2-f7382f5d9acc21b687e038b0",
          "alias": "单女户外沉思侧头",
          "prompt": "A close-up of a woman's half-body shows a dynamic feeling drifting in the wind, with subtle highlights and shadow layers, showcasing a genuine texture and flow. The pendant has a natural blush and a touch of gentleness and calm. She wears a light blue V-neck top made of soft and smooth material, with slight pleats and light and shadow variations. The shoulder lines are smooth, the sleeves are short to reveal part of the arm's skin, and a slender gold necklace is worn around her neck. The pendant is a simple geometric shape with a metallic reflective surface, adding a touch of refinement The background is completely blurred, presenting soft, warm-toned blurred light spots, possibly trees or shadows in outdoor natural environments. The middle ground is an extension of the figure's body, including the contours of shoulders and chest. The background is a hazy natural scene of green and yellow tones intertwined. Light softly shines on the figure from the side, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. The light source comes from a diagonal front, simulating natural morning or evening light. The overall lighting is warm and even, creating a peaceful, soft, and cozy atmosphere. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned in the center of the frame, the head slightly tilted, and the gaze directly directed at the viewer. The bokeh effect in the background enhances the subject's prominence while preserving a sense of space and depth. The overall image presents a texture reminiscent of everyday life shot with a mobile phone or camera, featuring slight film graininess and controlled color saturation. The tone is warm, contrast is moderate, details are rich, and the transitions of light and shadow are natural, as if captured in a quiet afternoon park—authentic and emotional. The painting is filled with youthful energy and gentle temperament, conveying a sense of tranquility, tranquility, and beauty in everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
