        {
          "id": "krea2-74e26aec00663790c15ac5cc",
          "alias": "单女金毛衣街道冷淡站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the glass window of a café by the city street, wearing a soft pale yellow knit sweater with delicate and clear texture, featuring a warm diamond pattern. The cuffs are decorated with delicate white lace trim, adding a touch of sweetness and vintage charm, appearing lazy and charming. She leans slightly to the side, gently raising her left hand, her posture elegant and natural, her makeup clear and natural, and the overall temperament fresh and refined. In the foreground is her main figure on the right side of the frame, while in the background is a tree blooming with small white flowers. Branches stretch and intertwine, flowers bloom densely, forming a hazy sea of flowers. Behind the trees, you can faintly see modern urban skyscrapers. Glass curtain walls reflect the sky and surroundings. Pedestrians walk along the distant street, a white van parks by the roadside, its body reflected in the café's glass window. Inside, greenery is dotted, and stones are stacked to form a miniature landscape, creating a tranquil courtyard atmosphere. The composition combines close-ups with medium environments, with the figure positioned in the right third of the frame, forming the visual focal point. The left side leaves space to showcase streets and buildings, enhancing the depth of the image. Light comes from the upper left, with bright daylight shining on the figures, creating soft shadow transitions that highlight three-dimensional silhouettes. Meanwhile, the reflections on the glass windows intertwine with the scenery outside, adding complexity and realism. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow and white, paired with gray-blue skies and dark buildings, creating a warm and cool contrast and creating a warm and warm spring afternoon. The image is delicate and detailed, It's as if you're shooting with a professional camera on a sunny day, capturing beautiful moments from everyday life. It has a strong sense of everyday realism and artistic beauty, like a carefully composed city street photography piece, full of youthful energy and poetic romance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
