        {
          "id": "krea2-702505e8d0ed473ebe2dff89",
          "alias": "单女粉T恤摄影棚专注站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways, hands raised above her head, body slightly leaned back, showcasing elegant and expressive curves. She wears a light pink spaghetti-strap fitted cropped tank top, made of delicate knit texture and natural pleats, hugging her figure to outline a smooth bust and slender waistline. She pairs with light blue high-waisted jeans, which are slim and slightly washed with a distressed texture. The makeup is light but the contours are distinct. The overall look is simple yet stylish, with a background of pure black or dark gray tones without any distractions, creating a strong visual contrast that highlights the main subject. The composition uses a medium close-up style, with the figure occupying most of the frame, fully visible from the waist up to the top of the head. The body is slightly tilted, with the head facing the camera and arms stretched upward, creating an upward extension that guides the audience to focus on their expressions and postures. The light and shadow come from the front left position, It softly and evenly illuminates the front of the subject, creating delicate transitions between light and shadow. Shadows are softly cast at the junction between the right side of the body and the background, creating a sense of depth and three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is quiet and focused, with a sense of intimate indoor portrait photography, as if a high-quality portrait was shot with professional studio equipment. The lighting arrangement is exquisite, the tones are warm and neutral, the color saturation is moderate, and there is no excessive rendering, presenting a realistic and natural visual effect. The image texture is delicate and rich, with cinematic-level image quality. Like using a full-frame camera with a large aperture lens in low-light conditions, the emphasis is placed on the figure's form and emotional expression. The overall composition is balanced, visual guidance is clear, and the focus is precise, creating a static moment that combines beauty and power, brimming with the independent temperament and inner charm of modern urban women",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
