          "id": "krea2-19d8a5189887b2f2d5deec7c",
          "alias": "单女白T恤椅上忧伤坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a green bench outdoors, slightly apart, exuding a quiet and charming aura. She wears a simple white short-sleeved T-shirt, layered with a black zip-up jacket casually draped over her shoulders. She wears dark denim shorts with a white belt tied around her waist, and black ankle boots. Her legs are gracefully crossed, her posture relaxed and natural. The background is a gray-white stepped grandstand structure, composed of gray stone steps and metal railings, with clear layers and clean, modern lines. The overall environment appears spacious and tranquil. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, body slightly turned and head turned to the right, creating a dynamic visual balance. The foreground features clear details of a green wooden bench, with visible wood grain. The middle ground combines the main subject with the bench, while the background gradually blurs steps and railings, creating a good sense of spatial depth. Light comes from the left side of the painting, creating a subtle transition between light and shadow. The shadows are soft and without strong contrast, making the overall lighting atmosphere warm and tranquil The color palette mainly uses cool green and gray tones to enhance visual focus. The image presents an unintentional beauty from daily life, as if capturing a tranquil moment under an afternoon sun, with a realistic photographic texture. The lens simulates 85mm prime portrait shooting, presenting high-resolution details, with slight film graininess and natural depth blur effects. It features authentic camera imaging style, realistic ambient lighting and reflections, without excessive retouching, preserving minor natural imperfections and textures, with balanced composition. Following the direction of the gaze into the depths of the background, a smooth visual path is formed. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, artistic, and tinged with a touch of melancholy youth, as if time has frozen in this moment, recording the truest self-state",
