        {
          "id": "krea2-11c29432ea81f0834ff7639e",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤城市微笑坐侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a deep blue V-neck short-sleeve T-shirt made of soft and fitted material, tightly outlining the outline of her upper body. She pairs the lower half with burgundy elastic waist sports shorts, with beige drawstrings tied into a bow at the waistband, and white thread trimming the hems. The overall look is simple yet comfortable. She sits slightly sideways, hands naturally placed at her sides, legs together, relaxed posture with a faint smile. Light streams in from the left side of the frame. On the other side, natural shadow transitions are left behind. The background is the indoor bedroom environment, behind which is a light beige bed with white pillows and quilts. The headboard is light brown, and above hangs a decorative painting with geometric diamond patterns. The frame is dark gray, and the wall color is neutral gray. The entire space is warm and calm, with close-ups occupying the center of the frame, the head slightly tilted, creating direct visual contact with the viewer. The light sources resemble natural morning or evening light, soft and directional, creating a quiet, realistic, and slightly lazy atmosphere of life. The image texture is delicate and detailed, resembling everyday scenes shot with a professional camera. It has a strong sense of presence and emotional resonance, moderate color saturation, and gentle contrast, presenting a daily moment of modern urban youth life. The image contains no unnecessary decorations, maintaining a minimalist style that highlights the characters' emotional states and the realism of the environment. The background blur is well handled, making the subject stand out more while retaining enough environmental information to enhance storytelling. The color tones are warm brown, off-white, deep blue, and burgundy tones, harmoniously unified to create a cozy and comfortable home atmosphere. The composition is balanced, the figures' postures are natural, and the transitions of light and shadow are smooth. The overall image is full of life aesthetics and artistic flair, like a carefully composed private portrait, combining the realism of photography with the refinement and perfection of digital art, presenting a beauty that lies between reality and ideals. It evokes a sense of tranquility, gentleness, and vitality in everyday moments",
