        {
          "id": "krea2-9aa2d46e126338105e836e06",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫桥忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a gray cement platform on a city overpass, wearing a white short-sleeved shirt paired with a deep blue pleated suspend dress. She leans slightly to the side, her right hand resting lightly on her left knee, her left hand naturally resting beside her right leg. On her wrist is a slender silver bracelet and a pink ring. On her feet, she wears black ankle boots and white ankle socks, her posture elegant and relaxed. The main subject of the painting is this person, positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame. Occupying the main visual space, the middle features the metal railing behind her and the purple bougainvillea blooming on both sides. The flowers are dense and vividly colored, creating a soft color contrast. The background is a blurred city street, with multi-story residential buildings, tree-lined streets, vehicles in the distance, and traffic signals visible. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward view to highlight the youthful vitality and approachability of the characters. The scene presents a warm atmosphere of everyday life, with light and shadow coming from natural evening light, soft and even. With a slightly cool tone, it creates a tranquil yet slightly melancholic atmosphere at dusk. The sky shows a gradient of light purple, with distant architectural outlines clear but details blurred, enhancing the depth of the image. The overall color scheme is mainly blue-purple, accented with white clothing and pink flowers, forming a harmonious color scheme. The visual style combines realism with artistic beauty, resembling a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera, with cinematic texture and delicate light and shadow transitions, while retaining everyday scene details such as rust on railings and slight ground wear This makes the visuals more realistic and immersive",
