        {
          "id": "krea2-796942c1f4bdf8f77b0d89cb",
          "alias": "单女白T恤城市坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the driver's seat of a white car, her body slightly turned to the camera, her left hand lightly resting on the edge of the car door, her right hand naturally hanging down. She wears a simple white camisole that reveals her slender collarbones and waistline, presenting a serene beauty. Her right leg is bent and raised, knee close to the window, and her feet are wrapped in loose white pants or a shirt, creating soft pleats that create a lazy and casual feeling. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The foreground features a clear female figure and some body details, including door handles, window frames, and rearview mirrors. The middle ground is a blurred environment reflected from the side and window of the vehicle. The background is an open outdoor scene, with the sky showing a mix of pale blue and white clouds. In the distance, faint outlines of cities or hills can be seen. The composition combines close-ups with medium shots extending the shot, making the figure's posture natural relaxed. The light and shadow come from natural daylight, soft and even, and the light shines on the figure from the right, creating subtle shadow transitions. Highlighting skin texture and the details of clothing folds, the overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic. The color tones are mainly white and light blue, creating a fresh and clean feel. The image has a high-resolution texture and rich details. The clothing materials are authentic, as if shot with professional photography equipment, while preserving the casual and realistic feel of daily life. The camera uses a shallow depth of field effect to blur the background and highlight the subject. The composition is balanced and layered, with harmonious and unified colors, presenting an overall elegance and freedom of modern urban women. It was as if capturing a moment under the afternoon sun—artistic yet genuine life's warmth",
