        {
          "id": "krea2-cc722f0f2cc34afd1dfb4996",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣城市站立持手机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands before the city skyline at dusk, wearing a form-fitting beige-gray long-sleeve knit dress. The hem reaches mid-thigh, highlighting her long leg lines. The dress features a delicate knit texture and a soft matte finish. Three black buttons adorn the cuffs, adding a touch of vintage and refined charm, making her look smooth and glossy. She stands slightly sideways, her left hand naturally hanging down, while her right hand holds a smartphone framed in orange trim. The screen lights up and shows the time 17:47. The phone case is dark blue with a simple geometric pattern. The phone strap is a light brown woven cord with a round metal ring at the end. A small black leather shoulder bag is slung diagonally over the shoulder. The body is made of smooth leather with fine embossed textures. The strap is a combination of chain and leather, with the chain part gold, contrasting with the black body. On the side hangs a white teddy bear-shaped plush pendant, with purple bow decorations. The overall look is both practical and full of style. She wears a pair of brown suede knee-high boots, with the boots reaching the middle of the calves. The shaft edges are slightly soft, with slight wrinkles and wear marks on the boots, reflecting the realism of everyday wear. The background is a blurry silhouette of the city, and the silhouettes of skyscrapers appear faintly under the changing sky. The sky displays a warm orange-yellow and pale purple evening glow, with the clouds dyed by the sunset in layers of pink, gold, and light purple. Light slanting from the right side of the frame creates a soft backlighting effect. The figure's outline is surrounded by a faint halo, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The foreground is a clear main subject, the middle ground is a blurred urban complex, and the background is a vast sky and distant mountain silhouettes. The composition uses the rule of thirds: the figure is positioned on the left third of the frame, with the body slightly tilted and head turned toward the camera, providing strong visual guidance. The overall color palette is mainly warm tones, blending orange-yellow, beige-gray, and brown to form a harmonious color match. The light and shadow are handled delicately, with natural transitions between light and shadow. Highlighting the three-dimensionality and spatial layers of the characters, the camera uses a large-aperture lens with a focal length of about 85mm and an aperture of f/1.8, achieving a shallow depth of field effect. The background is completely blurred, preserving only the colors of the sky and the city's outline. The overall image presents a romantic atmosphere where urban fashion and natural beauty blend together, as if using a professional full-frame camera paired with a prime lens to capture a moment of real life at sunset. It has a strong film texture and cinematic color grading style, with rich image details. The clothes wrinkle naturally, the light and shadow shifts subtly, and the overall atmosphere is tranquil and gentle, like a poetic essay about a city dusk, recording this fleeting yet eternal moment of beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
