        {
          "id": "krea2-bee4b853f87b4d54fe09cd1c",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫忧伤跪持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman kneels on the rough concrete floor, wearing a white shirt and a black short skirt, presenting a typical Japanese school uniform style that adds a touch of laziness and authenticity. She slightly lowers her head, carrying a faint melancholy and contemplation. Her calm expression reveals subtle emotional fluctuations. Her hands are placed in front of her, fingers naturally extended, and her nails are painted light blue, making her look especially delicate under soft lighting. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the subject positioned slightly above the center of the frame, creating a strong visual focal point. The middle shot shows her upper body and some legs, while the background is a blurred gray ground and wall, creating a shallow depth of field effect that makes the subject stand out. Light comes from the upper left, creating a soft side light, while the other side leaves a slight shadow to enhance the sense of depth. The transition between light and shadow is natural, and the overall atmosphere is quiet, restrained, and slightly artistic. The tones are mainly gray-white and dark brown, accented with cool-toned blue nail polish. The colors are harmonious and unified, and the image texture is delicate, as if shot with a professional camera. Yet it retains the casual feel of daily life, with a grainy texture reminiscent of film photography and natural color layering, presenting a tranquil yet story-rich moment. It feels like capturing a moment of reflection alone in a corner after school, filled with a hazy youthful beauty and a subtle sense of loneliness. The composition is compact and full of tension, inviting one to explore her inner world. The overall composition is both artistic and realistic, as if captured from a movie scene or photo collection. It carries a strong Japanese aesthetic style, emphasizing the emotional expression of characters and the minimalist texture of the environment, creating a peaceful yet thought-provoking atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
