        {
          "id": "krea2-391eff8c1530d1c67980b924",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙室内持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman presents a sideways glance back, adding a touch of laziness and gentleness. She wears a black strapless dress made of velvet or satin, with a smooth and lustrous texture. The fitted design highlights the graceful shoulder and neck lines and back curve. The dress is simple yet sophisticated, with a slightly cinched waist outlining a slender waistline. The hem of the skirt is slightly puffy, with slight pleats that add depth to the overall look. Around her neck is a thin black collar adorned with delicate metal ornaments that echo the earrings. The earrings are designed with long tassels, made from multiple sparkling crystals or gemstones linked together. As the head turns slightly, they sway slightly, reflecting specks of light that flare up as if about to speak softly. The overall posture is elegant and relaxed, with a slightly leaned body, shoulders naturally hanging down, and arms relaxed at the sides. The wood grain is clearly visible, with a warm brown color carrying a texture shaped by time. Light softly streams in from the left side of the painting, creating a warm golden tone. At the same time, a soft shadow is cast on the wooden background board, enhancing the sense of depth in the space. The transition of light and shadow is natural, creating a tranquil and cozy atmosphere. The composition uses medium shots and close-ups, with the figures occupying the main position and the head positioned at the upper left of the frame. The body extends to the lower right, forming a diagonal visual guideline. The background is blurred to highlight the main subject while retaining certain details, giving the image both focus and environmental information. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and black, paired with brown on a wooden background, forming a harmonious and unified color system. The light and shadow are soft, the atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, like a carefully photographed indoor portrait work with cinematic texture and artistic atmosphere, as if shot with a professional camera using a large-aperture lens in low-light conditions. The captured moments are full of emotion and storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
