        {
          "id": "krea2-09ca389ee0300a928c8aef86",
          "alias": "单女制服广场微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a Japanese school uniform, a black suit jacket paired with a white shirt and a blue-gray plaid bow tie. The left breast pocket is embroidered with the words \"NO ONE ELSE.\" She wears a sweet smile, showing off her white, neat teeth, looking delicate and alluring. Her right hand makes a V-sign in front of the camera, fingers long and slender. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the composition, using a close-up perspective. The background is an indoor environment, with beige walls decorated with simple lines, and a faint black square installation can be seen on the wall. It could be an access control or switch, with the overall background blurred to create a shallow depth of field effect, making the figure stand out more. The composition presents an asymmetrical beauty, with the figure slightly tilted and the head slightly tilted, creating dynamic balance. This extends along the line of sight to her smile and gestures, finally landing on the bow tie and badge on the chest. Light and shadow come from the upper left of the frame, creating a soft warm tone that naturally highlights the silhouette and enhances the three-dimensional effect. The overall atmosphere is warm, youthful, lively, and slightly playful. It feels like everyday moments shot in a campus corridor or classroom entrance, capturing a realistic sense of life while retaining a delicate texture. It's like a professional camera capturing those moments with a large-aperture lens in low-light environments, presenting an artistic style that lies between reality and idealism. The color saturation is moderate, the contrast of warm and cool is harmonious, details are rich, and the overall image is full of youthful energy and gentle charm",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
