        {
          "id": "krea2-020ea6933a7ddbf7376f7dee",
          "alias": "单女白T恤城市忧伤倚靠",
          "prompt": "When slightly open, she reveals a touch of calm and contemplation. She wears a simple white knitted camisole with narrow straps and clearly visible fabric texture, showing a delicate vertical stripe texture. Around her neck wears a very thin gold necklace, faintly visible, her overall posture elegant and relaxed, her body slightly leaning forward. The shoulders hang naturally, with the main composition centered on the person, shot in medium to close-up shots. The person is positioned slightly in the center on the right side of the frame, leaving ample negative space on the left side to create visual balance. The background is a blurred indoor environment, and the walls are light beige or pale pink, with slight light and shadow transitions. There are no obvious decorations or distractions, creating a clean and simple sense of space. Light comes from the front left of the frame, soft and even, creating natural light or a softbox effect, while the other side creates natural shadow transitions to enhance the sense of depth. The shadows are delicate and soft, without hard edges. The overall color tone is warm and pure, highlighting the main subject. The composition has a strong sense of layering. The middle ground features the body outlines and clothing textures, while the background is completely blurred, creating a shallow depth of field. This then guides down to the shoulder and arm lines, finally returning to the overall posture, creating a smooth visual path. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, gentle, and slightly melancholic, as if capturing a private and quiet moment, like a real-life snapshot casually taken with a phone or regular camera. Blending a sense of life with artistic beauty, the lens has a focal length of about 85mm and uses a large aperture lens. The background is highly blurred, the image texture is delicate, colors are faithfully reproduced, and the transitions of light and shadow are natural. It has a warm graininess reminiscent of film photography and a slight noise texture, presenting an overall elegant temperament and subtle expression of inner emotions of a modern urban woman",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
