        {
          "id": "krea2-6c757908a4a299ebe2ac29af",
          "alias": "单女白围巾摄影棚微笑坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A half-length portrait of a woman presents delicate layers and gently curled curves. She wears bright red lipstick, slightly opening to reveal a mysterious smile. Her skin is delicate and flawless, with a healthy glow. She wears a white feather-like plush shawl, fluffy and soft, with naturally spread edges, revealing rich textured details. The bristles are fine and dense, with a realistic texture. The shawl covers the shoulders and chest adding a luxurious and warm feeling. She wears a white silk-textured dress or gown on the lower half. The fabric is smooth and delicate, with a noticeable sheen. The pleats are naturally smooth, and with her posture, soft light and shadow changes appear. She wears a pair of gold tassel earrings, made of multiple slender metal strips, with small cylindrical ornaments hanging at the ends. With subtle movements, they gently sway, reflecting a warm golden glow on the metal surface. The earrings have a unique design and smooth lines. This adds refinement and fashion to the overall look. She sits sideways with her head slightly tilted, her expression calm and confident. The background is a pure light gray or off-white, clean and simple, without unnecessary distractions, making the subject stand out. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure occupying most of the frame and a slightly higher angle. Shot from a slightly upward frontal angle, it emphasizes her noble temperament and elegant demeanor. The middle ground shows her torso and clothing, while the background is completely blurred, creating a strong depth of field effect. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft and warm. The main light source comes from the left front, creating a soft transition between light and shadow. The shadows are delicate and natural, without stiff boundaries. Paired with warm lighting, it creates a high-end, elegant, romantic, and slightly mysterious atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and detailed, as if shot in a studio with a professional camera, using high-quality lighting equipment and high-end lenses to capture every subtle expression and texture of materials, while preserving the true human structure and the interplay of light and shadow. presenting a visual effect that is both dreamy and realistic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
