        {
          "id": "krea2-af3f882d35c6770a87d63823",
          "alias": "单女金和服庭院微笑坐侧头",
          "prompt": "The slight parting reveals white, neat teeth, forming a subtle and charming smile. She wears a traditional pale yellow kimono with soft fabric and delicate textures and pleats. The collar is decorated with a pink three-dimensional flower with layered petals and soft colors that harmonize with the overall tone. Her posture is elegant, her body slightly tilted to one side, head slightly tilted. As if gazing into the distance or recalling something, the foreground features several blurry white flowers with broad petals and slightly transparent edges, resembling peonies or peonies. They partially obscure the figure's body, adding depth and hazy beauty to the composition. The middle ground is the main subject, with a deep purple gradient background that gradually darkens outward from the center, creating a soft halo effect. In the background, some blurred lines and shadows can be faintly seen, like sunlight streaming through a window or starlight in the night sky. The composition uses the classic three-part method, with the figure positioned on the right side of the painting, leaving a large negative space on the left to enhance the sense of breath and visual guidance. The use of shallow depth of field effects creates varying degrees of blurring in both the background and foreground, highlighting the subject's clarity and three-dimensionality. Light mainly comes from the upper left, creating a natural transition of light and shadow and creating a three-dimensional light and shadow effect. The overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with a touch of dreaminess and poetry. The tones are mainly warm yellow and light purple, with a striking contrast between warm and cool tones. This enhances the visual impact of the image. The image texture is delicate and rich, as if taken with a professional camera, yet still with traces of artistic processing, such as slight graininess and film texture. At the same time, the soft brushstrokes of digital painting are incorporated, making the image both realistic and imaginative. The entire scene resembles a quiet afternoon, sunlight streaming through the window lattice, shining into the courtyard. The woman sits quietly, immersed in her own world. Everything around becomes blurry and distant, only her presence remains so vivid. This compositional approach not only highlights the beauty of the characters, but also cleverly uses light and shadow to create a sense of three-dimensionality and emotional expression, creating a gentle, tranquil, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. One can feel the innocence and beauty of youth. This is a work full of emotional tension and artistic beauty, making one pause and gaze deeply, falling into deep contemplation",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
