        {
          "id": "krea2-7d93e6fb0b9addad151ff229",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫床忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a loose white shirt with a slightly open collar and naturally draped cuffs. The fabric pleats look natural and authentic, presenting a comfortable and casual home feel. Her fingers are long and slender, her posture elegant and natural, arms smooth and smooth. The background is a cozy bedroom environment, the headboard cushion is light beige, and the sheets and bedding are fluffy and soft. presenting everyday folds and textures. Next to the bed is a small wooden table with daily necessities, including a white tissue box, a black storage box, and some miscellaneous items. Although these items are not very clear, they create a realistic living atmosphere. The room walls are light-toned, with soft light streaming in from the outside of the frame, creating a warm yellow tone. The light comes from one side, creating natural shadow transitions. The background blur is well handled, making the main figure stand out more. The composition uses close-ups. The figure occupies most of the image, with the head slightly tilted and body in an oblique posture, looking directly at the camera, providing strong visual guidance. The overall color scheme is warm yellow, forming a harmonious and layered color relationship. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is tranquil and warm, full of privacy and a sense of life, as if capturing a quiet morning or evening moment. The texture is delicate and authentic, with rich details, combining artistic beauty with the warmth of everyday life, like a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera. It also feels like beautiful moments casually captured with ordinary equipment, presenting a soft filter effect without excessive embellishment, preserving a natural authenticity. The overall style is both fashionable and lifelike, conveying a gentle, tranquil, slightly melancholic youthful atmosphere that evokes a quiet and beautiful emotional fluctuation",
