        {
          "id": "krea2-6bd33c3aaf725e411e0e4707",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙摄影棚俏皮坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits indoors, with a soft brown highlighter, appearing lively and full of life, with a touch of gentleness and confidence. Her makeup is natural and translucent, highlighting her fair and smooth skin. Her overall temperament is elegant and generous, wearing a dark blue strap dress with blue floral patterns. The dress features a V-neck design, slender straps, and a pleated waist that fits the waist. The hem is A-shaped, made of silk or satin, with a delicate sheen and drape. Light shines from the left side. At the same time, a faint shadow is cast on the right side of her body to enhance the three-dimensional effect. She wears a pair of exquisite silver tassel earrings, strung together with multiple layers of small beads. With slight movements, they sway slightly, reflecting specks of light. The background is a cozy indoor space, with deep blue walls featuring subtle textures. Behind her is a wooden shelf displaying several blue-and-white ceramic vessels, including teapots and vases. These vessels are decorated with traditional patterns, mainly in blue-and-white porcelain style. The wood grain on the shelves is clearly visible, with warm tones that contrast with the background wall. In the foreground, the female body occupies the main position, with a medium shot close-up. The figure is slightly sidelined, with the head slightly tilted, facing the camera directly, creating a warm and focused atmosphere. Below the frame, some blue sofas or chairs can be seen, made of soft material, with colors echoing the background, creating a sense of visual layering. The overall light and shadow come from the natural light source on the left front, possibly sunlight filtering through the window. The light is soft and directional, creating a clear contrast between light and dark, creating a strong sense of depth and realism. The colors are mainly deep blue, black, and warm tones. The blue tones run throughout the image, creating a unified warm and cool contrast that highlights the elegant temperament of the subjects. The overall atmosphere is calm and sophisticated, carrying the beauty of artistic photography. It feels like a work shot in a professional studio, yet retains the warmth of everyday life. The details are rich, the composition balanced, the subject prominent, creating a smooth viewing path and a delicate image texture. With extremely high resolution and cinematic quality, it looks as if shot with a high-end camera, yet still full of life's atmosphere. It resembles a photographer capturing precious moments at home with amateur equipment. The entire scene is filled with tranquility and elegance, evoking a calm attitude toward life and an inner confident charm",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
