        {
          "id": "krea2-71f8052291c948c6e4d2c037",
          "alias": "单女灰T恤室内俏皮站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a bright indoor setting, wearing a light gray sports tank top and black shorts with white piping on the edges. The overall look is simple yet modern, showcasing a healthy and energetic daily sports style, presenting a casual and natural beauty. Her right hand gently strokes the top of her head, fingers slightly bent, and her left hand rests naturally on her chest. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, exuding a gentle and confident temperament. Her makeup is delicate and natural, highlighting a fresh aesthetic. The background is a minimalist indoor space dominated by light gray and white. The lines on the walls and furniture are clean and smooth, creating a clean and tidy visual effect. On the right side, a window or glass door can be faintly seen, letting in soft natural light. The light streams in from the side, creating a subtle transition of light and shadow on the figure's body. There are slight shadows on the back and arms, enhancing the sense of depth. The foreground figure occupies the center of the composition, with a mid-shot portrait that is fully visible from head to knee, with the body slightly turned to form a graceful S-shaped curve. The visual guide lines are formed by the direction of the person's gaze and body posture, while the shorts and leg lines of the lower body naturally extend out, adding movement and balance to the image. The overall atmosphere is calm and warm, with soft and even lighting and fresh, elegant tones, presenting a real and beautiful moment from daily life. It feels like a quiet morning or afternoon, with sunlight streaming through the window lattice, capturing the calmness and beauty of the moment. The image features high-resolution detail expression, delicate texture, and faithful color reproduction. Like high-quality photos taken with a professional camera, yet still full of everyday life, it gives a sense of warmth and naturalness. It's like a casual snapshot taken with a regular home camera or phone, yet still maintains a high level of artistry. The entire scene is filled with the rhythm of modern urban life, combining the vitality of sport with the gentle tranquility. The light and shadow are delicate and the contrast is balanced, highlighting the main subject while preserving the layering of the background, creating an aesthetic experience that is both fashionable and close to everyday life. The composition is stable. The viewpoint is slightly lower, bringing the viewer closer and making the character more approachable. The overall image presents a sophisticated visual texture, like a carefully planned commercial commercial photography work, yet blending with real life scenarios, creating a relaxed and comfortable atmosphere, as if you can hear the breeze brushing the curtains and the faint scent of sunlight in the air.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
