        {
          "id": "krea2-76a685909edaa7f456c95b0c",
          "alias": "单女黑短裙水边媚态坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits indoors, adding a touch of laziness and gentleness. She leans slightly to the side, tilting her head slightly with a thoughtful expression. Her contours are soft, presenting a natural soft pink hue. She wears a high-necked white fitted long-sleeve top, made of smooth material that hugs the figure, highlighting her curves. The sleeves hang loosely, and she wears a black wristwatch with a black strap. The dial design is simple and modern, with clear details. She pairs the lower half with a black high-waisted skirt that is clean and neat, with smooth lines. The overall look is elegant, capable, and yet sensual. She crosses her legs, striking a natural and relaxed pose. Above her knees, her leg skin is visible, featuring several small tattoo patterns, including a simple animal drawing and some abstract symbols, adding personality and storytelling to the overall look. The background is a light beige wall, on which vertical strips of light and shadow stream in through the window. The interplay creates geometric patterns of light and shadow, enhancing the space's layering and visual interest. The floor is a dark wooden floor, with a warm texture. Reflecting the faint glow of the surrounding environment, the composition uses a medium perspective. The figure occupies the main position of the composition, with the body slightly tilted to form a natural diagonal line guiding the image. Returning to the overall posture, a complete visual closed loop is formed. Light comes from the side, belonging to soft natural light. The source is warm with a yellowish tone, creating the atmosphere of afternoon sunlight streaming through the curtains into the room. Light and shadow create delicate transitions on the figures, while regular shadows appear on the background wall, enhancing the spatial depth of the composition. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and off-white Black clothing is accented with black clothing, the color scheme harmoniously unified, creating a quiet and intimate atmosphere, as if capturing a quiet moment at home. It carries the warmth of daily life and an artistic aesthetic. The image style combines realism and beauty, rich in detail, and authentic texture. It resembles high-quality portraits taken with a professional camera, yet retains a casual and intimate sense of everyday life. It feels like a photographer casually capturing beautiful moments. The composition is stable, the focus is clear, and the use of light and shadow is skillful, presenting an overall sense of tranquility. Elegant and emotionally charged visuals",
