        {
          "id": "krea2-2d45753ebc97bea0adfa4fce",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣俏皮站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "She wears a light blue short-sleeved tight-fitting knit top with clearly visible texture, fitting her figure and showing off graceful curves. She pairs it with high-waisted white wide-leg pants made of light material with natural pleats, giving the overall look a simple and elegant look. She wears a delicate gold necklace with a simple pendant hanging from it, delicate earrings, and her fingers painted light pink nail polish. Her right hand makes a V-shaped gesture, her posture natural and relaxed. Looking directly at the camera, her expression is gentle yet playful. Her makeup is delicate and natural, giving her a fresh and sweet overall look. The foreground is the main part of her body, fully visible from knees to head. The composition uses a mid-field portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The background is a blurred outdoor environment, with green trees and shrubs visible. The leaves glow in the sunlight with bright yellow-green tones, and in the distance, a modern-style building stands out. The exterior walls of the building are light gray and beige, windows are neatly arranged with clean lines, the sky is deep blue, and the light is abundant. The overall atmosphere is bright and warm. Sunlight streams in from the right, creating a soft light and shadow effect on the figures, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The light texture is delicate, creating a warm atmosphere in the early morning or evening. The overall color tones of the image are mainly blue, white, and green, with harmonious and unified color combinations, balanced composition, clear layering, and well-handled background blur that highlights the subject. The image has a strong sense of daily life and life. It feels like a real scene shot with a regular phone, with slight noise and natural color deviations. The lens has a moderate focal length, reasonable depth control, rich details, and natural expressions and genuine expressions. Overall, it presents a relaxed, joyful, and youthful atmosphere. The image style combines realism and art, combining realistic texture with subtle beautification, suitable for social media sharing or personal portraits. The images are filled with peaceful and beautiful everyday moments. It lets people feel the warmth and beauty under the sunshine",
