        {
          "id": "krea2-cc327197fe893158ae2a4944",
          "alias": "单女白T恤侧头",
          "prompt": "Slightly parted, revealing a subtle sweetness and shyness. She wears a white lace-trimmed camisole with slender straps and delicate pleated patterns on the chest. She wears a black-and-white polka-dot silk scarf casually tied around her neck, with one end hanging over her chest and the other naturally draped down, adding a touch of elegance and vintage charm. On her left wrist is a smartwatch with a white strap, a small and delicate dial with metal decorations on the edge. On her right wrist, she wears a slender gold bracelet. Her fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with light pink nail polish. She raises her right hand and gently strokes the back of her head, her arm lines smooth. Her posture is elegant and relaxed. She wears dark blue jeans, with the hem slightly rolled up, exposing her ankle. The overall look is simple yet stylish. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the center, with the composition using a three-part method. The figure occupies the main part of the frame, with the head slightly tilted. The body is slightly tilted, forming a natural S-shaped curve. The background is a blurry green forest and mottled light and shadow. The leaves under sunlight display a soft yellow-green hue, with light filtering through the gaps to create bokeh light spots that create a dreamlike atmosphere. The ground is a gray cement pavement, with faint interplay of light and shadow. In the distance, there are blurred outlines of buildings and trees, but the details are blurred to highlight the main figures. The composition is clearly layered, with clear close-ups of people in the foreground and a transitional area of shadowy trees in the middle ground. The background is a distant blurred environment, creating a natural flow of sight. Light comes from above, creating soft natural daylight. The shadows are soft and not abrupt, with a balanced contrast of light and shadow, natural transitions between light and shadow, and mainly warm tones. White clothing appears especially pure in the sunlight, black polka dots contrast sharply with blue jeans, and the green and yellow tones of the background complement each other, creating a tranquil and cozy summer afternoon atmosphere. The entire image presents a beautiful moment accidentally captured in daily life. It feels like shooting with a mid-to-high-end portable camera or smartphone, featuring a slight film texture and soft out-of-focus imaging. It feels very realistic, rich in detail, and expresses emotions both subtly and movingly. The overall image is both artistic and retains a sense of everyday life, like a tranquil youthful portrait that lets you feel the pure charm of sunshine, breeze, and youth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
