        {
          "id": "krea2-5130196c5d8a2cb3795609c4",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙户外忧伤站立泼洒",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors in the sunlight, wearing a white background and blue floral spaghetti strap dress with slim straps and a light hem. She stands slightly to the side, her expression slightly lazy and mysterious, presenting a natural sense of dynamism. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space. The head and upper body are clearly prominent, with the background being a blue sky and a dense canopy. The leaves are deep green with distinct edges, the sky is deep blue, and there are few clouds. In the distance, fields or haystacks can be faintly seen. The overall tone is cool, dominated by blue, creating a strong contrast of warm and cool tones. Light comes directly from above, bright and soft, with sunlight pouring down overhead, while the shadows appear deep and layered. The interplay of light and shadow creates a fresh yet slightly melancholic atmosphere. The image has a film-like texture, with slight graininess and a retro filter effect with low color saturation, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera. The background is blurred to enhance the subject's prominence, presenting an asymmetrical composition. The slightly tilted posture of the figure adds dynamism, enhancing the visual tension of the image. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, artistic, and full of storytelling, like a movie frame on a summer afternoon—highly realistic and detailed, as if you can feel the breeze and the warmth of the sunlight",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
