        {
          "id": "krea2-b2decf04e6881be8b3a93748",
          "alias": "单女摄影棚忧伤持手机",
          "prompt": "She wears an off-white or light apricot-colored V-neck top made of soft and form-fitting material, with lace sleeves that exude elegance and romance. Around her neck is a vintage-style black metal necklace set with multiple transparent teardrop-shaped crystal pendants, adorned below with small sparkling gemstones that glow with the light. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right center, with a close-up composition. The background is pure black or extremely dark tones, almost completely blending into the darkness, creating a strong contrast between light and dark. The foreground has almost no other objects, focusing solely on the person themselves. The middle ground is the area from the neck to the chest of the subject. Details of clothing and jewelry are clearly visible, the background is completely blurred or disappears into darkness, with no specific environmental elements, enhancing the sense of space and mystery. The overall composition is simple and focused, using high-contrast lighting with the light source coming from the left front, creating a side backlight effect and a distinct transition between light and shadow. The layers of light and shadow are rich, the neck and collarbone lines appear more three-dimensional under the light, and the shadow edges are soft and not stiff, creating a dramatic atmosphere of light and shadow. The overall tone is cool, mainly black, white, and gray. This makes the images both calm and warm, with a quiet, elegant, and slightly melancholic atmosphere, as if capturing a moment of solitude late at night. The cinematic style simulates the studio effects of professional portrait photography, while retaining the realism of everyday shooting. Using high-quality cameras and large-aperture lenses, the depth of field is extremely shallow, the background is completely blurred, details are sharp, and the natural skin texture is presented. The lighting is soft and even, with no obvious noise or signs of over-processing. The image texture is realistic, with the graininess and warm tones of film photography Overall, it presents an aesthetic style that combines artistry with a sense of everyday life, much like high-quality portraits taken indoors with a mobile phone or regular camera. It emphasizes the expression of light and emotion rather than complex scene settings. The composition is compact, the posture is naturally relaxed, and the head is slightly tilted, as if silently communicating with the viewer. The entire scene is full of storytelling and an immersive experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
