        {
          "id": "krea2-382a0dcbe5b4487d97e10878",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙摄影棚困倦站立",
          "prompt": "She wears a dark blue strap dress with light blue floral patterns. The dress design is simple yet elegant, with slim straps and a cinched waist, paired with a black leather belt that highlights her slender waistline. On her wrist is a watch with a gold dial, featuring a metal chain design, giving her a refined and elegant look. A black chain bag is slung across her right shoulder. The small body and shiny chain add a sense of fashion. She stands before the calm lake, whose surface is like a mirror, reflecting the pale blue tones of the sky and the outlines of distant mountains. The distant mountains in the background are layered and blurred, presenting a hazy blue-gray hue. The sky is a gradient tone at dusk, transitioning from light blue to pale purple, with soft lighting and an overall atmosphere that is tranquil and romantic. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center, body slightly turned to the side, head turned toward the camera, forming a visual focal point The foreground highlights the main figure, the middle ground features the lake and some shores, and the background features distant mountains and sky. The layers are distinct, extending along the line of sight to the distant lake and mountains, creating a profound sense of space. Light and shadow come from the side toward the back, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. The shadows are soft and enhance the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color scheme is mainly cool, with blue and black dominating, accented by gold and warm lipstick to create contrast. The image is delicate and detailed, with a sense of sophistication and artistic flair. It feels like a work shot in a professional studio, yet still feels realistic—like capturing moments with a high-end camera under natural light, presenting a beauty that is both dreamy and authentic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
