        {
          "id": "krea2-3aa0c6d6ce2a6670cb416a47",
          "alias": "单女短裤街道俏皮站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors on a city street, slightly sideways, her right hand naturally tucked into the pocket of her light-colored shorts, her posture relaxed and elegant. She wears a light green hooded jacket with a black zipper, printed with the words \"HUANGSHAN,\" paired with a white camisole underneath and off-white high-waisted shorts. The overall look is simple and fashionable, looking directly at the camera, her expression calm yet tinged with gentleness. Around her neck is a delicate gold necklace that adds a touch of refinement. The background is a blurry city streetscape, with parked silver-gray and white cars. In the distance, the outlines of trees and buildings appear. The exterior walls of buildings have a gray-brown tone, and the windows reflect the surrounding light and shadow. Light comes from the upper right, creating a warm backlight effect. Sunlight penetrates the leaves, casting mottled shadows on the ground and figures, creating a soft contrast of light and dark. The overall tone of the painting is fresh and bright, mainly light green, off-white, and gray-brown, with harmonious and unified color combinations. The composition uses a centered composition. The person is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The foreground clearly highlights the subject, the background is blurred, and the large-aperture lens is used to create a pronounced depth of field effect. The visual guide line is guided from the person's posture and gaze direction to the center of the frame, enhancing the character's presence. The lighting atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with a soft light texture reminiscent of early morning or evening, presenting an authentic and natural beauty of everyday life, as if taken outdoors with a professional camera. It has a strong sense of presence and realism, rich in image details, while retaining moderate blurred edges to enhance the image's depth and three-dimensionality. The overall style combines fashion and everyday life, conveying a relaxed and joyful urban youthful atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
