        {
          "id": "krea2-bec4df308385fe0f87c671c6",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙持相机",
          "prompt": "On her wrist is a simple silver bracelet, her posture elegant and natural, as if silently interacting with the viewer. She wore a Lolita-style dress with a combination of light blue and off-white, adorned with a striking pink satin bow on the chest. Above the bow was a white lace heart-shaped ornament. The straps were pink satin ribbons, the dress was designed with pleats, and the waist was tied with crossed pink ribbons and lace details. The skirt was puffy, lightweight, and layered. Around her neck was a pearl necklace made of several rounded white pearls, paired with a lace collar adorned with transparent crystals. The collar edges feature delicate ruffle designs, giving the overall look a sweet and cute yet refined feel. The foreground features the main subject occupying most of the image, clearly visible from the chest up to the head. The background is an indoor environment, with a light beige hue on the walls, providing soft and even lighting, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The background is used for blurring to highlight the main subject. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, creating a visual focal point. The camera slightly tilts downward, making the figure appear petite and cute, with a suitable space left on the left side of the frame. Enhances compositional balance, with light and shadow coming from the front slightly left, creating natural transitions between highlights and shadows, enhancing layering. The overall atmosphere is warm and sweet, full of vitality. The color palette mainly consists of pink, white, and light blue, paired with soft warm yellow tones, creating a dreamlike visual experience. The image texture is delicate, color saturation is moderate, details are rich, and it has a high sense of realism and artistic beauty. It feels like a high-quality portrait photographed with professional photography equipment under indoor lighting, while preserving the relaxed and natural atmosphere of daily life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
