        {
          "id": "krea2-7202c3a70ffb38cb9fdb595d",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙愤怒坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the stone steps, wearing a loose white off-shoulder long-sleeve dress. The hem hangs naturally, revealing her long legs and black stockings. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, one hand gently resting on her knee, the other naturally resting at her side, her ankles slightly bent, barefoot on the rough steps. The steps are built of heavy gray stone, with mottled marks and fine cracks left by time. On both sides rise towering stone walls, built from irregular stones, with moss and weathering visible in the gaps. The overall tone leans toward coolness, dominated by blue, creating a tranquil and slightly mysterious atmosphere. Light pours in from above, creating a soft transition of light and shadow on the stone steps and figures. The interplay of light and shadow highlights the figure's outline and the details of the clothing folds. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, body forming an S-shaped curve. The stone steps in the background extend upward, creating a strong sense of depth. The foreground clearly shows the stone steps and the figure's legs, while the middle ground shows the person's entire body and part of the stone steps. The background features gradually blurred stone walls and the ends of steps. The overall image has a cinematic texture, as if shot with professional photography equipment, yet retains the realism of everyday amateur camera shooting. There is a slight film graininess and natural color distortion, presenting an artistic style that is both refined and lifelike. The lighting is soft and layered, shadows are delicate, highlights are bright but not glaring, and the whole scene is full of storytelling, as if telling a moment about loneliness, waiting, or reminiscence. The figure's expression is calm yet tinged with thought, contrasting with the surrounding cold environment and enhancing the emotional tension of the composition. The color tone is unified, with blue-purple tones running throughout, creating a tranquil atmosphere at night or dusk. The composition is compact, the subject is prominent, the background is well rendered, and the visual focus is on the figure. At the same time, the lines of the stone steps guide the viewer's gaze, enhancing the three-dimensionality and spatial sense of the image. Overall, it presents a serene, elegant, and slightly melancholic aesthetic concept, like a carefully composed photographic work. It combines artistic flair with authenticity",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
