        {
          "id": "krea2-0d908eda9d9896a069bc062c",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔公寓冷淡站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sat on a minimalist, modern-style chair, wearing a light blue long-sleeve fitted cropped top with delicate pleats and natural drape. The fabric hugged the figure and outlined smooth curves, with sleeves slightly rolled up to reveal slender arms. She wore washed, distressed light blue jeans with a slim fit and slight curve, delicate stitching along the back pocket edge, and a black thin strap at the waist cleverly extending from the waistband, creating a subtly subtle sexy layer. The chair is beige-gray or light gray-brown, made of matte plastic or composite material, with a simple and rounded shape, and a slight curved transition between the chair back and seat. The surface has subtle textures and signs of use. The background is a pure light beige or cream wall, flat and without obvious decoration, with only soft shadow transitions in certain areas due to lighting. The overall sense of space is clean and crisp, with no unnecessary objects obstructing the view. The composition uses a medium close-up perspective, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right of the frame, the head slightly tilted, and the curves of the body and the folds of clothing guiding the gaze toward the waist and hips, creating a dynamic visual flow. Light and shadow come from the front left side. The light is soft and even, like natural indoor light streaming through a large window. The main light source is positioned in front of the figure to the left, creating a delicate transition between light and shadow. Shadows fall on the right side of the body and the background wall, with clear layers but not awkwardness. The folds of the clothing show subtle reflections and shadow changes, enhancing the material's realism. The overall atmosphere is quiet and warm, carrying a sense of privacy and relaxed casual vibes of daily life, as if taken at home or in a studio on a quiet afternoon. The images have a high level of detail expression. The colors mainly feature warm and cool contrasts, with light blue and off-white as the main tones, creating a harmonious and unified visual effect. The image texture is close to professional camera shooting, but retains slight film graininess and real photography noise, simulating the natural texture of amateur equipment shooting. The lens is a 50mm prime portrait lens with an aperture of about f/1.8 to achieve a shallow depth of field, making the subject stand out clearly. The background is moderately blurred, enhancing spatial depth. The composition ratio is about 3:4, matching the phone's vertical display habits, presenting an imaging style that combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life. It offers the refined feel of a model's portrait while maintaining the authentic warmth of everyday scenes",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
