        {
          "id": "krea2-0f32623706172bc22dcbcd7b",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫办公室自信站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands indoors, wearing a black turtleneck, short-sleeve bodycon and a gray high-waisted pencil skirt, showcasing her slender figure and elegant curves, adding softness and casualness, exuding a calm and confident temperament. Her left hand wears a multi-layered, exquisite bracelet, gently holding a pair of metal-framed glasses, her fingers painted with light gray nail polish. The details are meticulously crafted, and the overall look is simple yet stylish. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of center foreground, with her body slightly turned to the side. The posture is relaxed yet full of tension. The background is a modern-style interior space, with light gray walls. The ceiling features recessed downlights and slender white decorative lines, with soft and even light falling evenly on the figures, creating a clean and crisp spatial feel. In the middle of the frame, you can see blurred green chair backs and the outlines of black furniture, hinting that this is an office or home environment. deep in the background, a faint grid-like partition structure appears, adding depth and layering to the space. The composition uses a low-angle downward view. It highlights the character's upright figure and presence, while using slanted ceiling lines to guide the gaze upward, enhancing the dynamic and visual impact of the image. The lower body naturally hangs down, forming a stable triangular structure that strongly guides the visuals. The light and shadow are handled with delicate detail, with the main light source leaning slightly to the left from above, creating a natural transition between light and dark. The shadows are subtle and layered, presenting an overall atmosphere that evokes the calmness, rationality, and independence of urban women. The color palette is mainly black, gray, and white, creating a sophisticated yet restrained visual aesthetic. The images possess a strong sense of realism and artistry, as if they were high-quality portraits taken with a professional camera, yet also contain authentic moments casually captured in daily life. The details are rich, light and shadow harmonious, and colors are steady, presenting an overall sense of serene and powerful beauty, as if telling a story about self-expression and modern life.",
