        {
          "id": "krea2-5e5ef6c92af82fb209e56cda",
          "alias": "单女绿T恤城市困倦展示",
          "prompt": "She wears a light green knitted camisole with graceful shoulder lines, layered with an off-white plush collar coat. The coat is soft and fluffy, with plush details clearly visible at the cuffs and neckline, presenting a warm and comfortable texture. She gracefully turns sideways to look back at the camera, her right hand gently tuning a corner of the coat, her left hand naturally letting down, her body slightly tilted, showcasing graceful curves and natural dynamism. In the foreground, the main figure occupies about two-thirds of the right side of the painting. The composition uses the classic rule of third: the figure's head is positioned in the upper right third. The middle scene is a blurred city of buildings, with towering buildings and glass curtain walls reflecting the evening glow. Some building lights are lit, forming dot-like light spots. The background is a gradient twilight sky, transitioning from pale purple at the top to light blue at the bottom, creating a tranquil and dreamy atmosphere. Light comes from the side and behind, representing soft natural light. It might be the golden hour or blues after sunset, with soft shadows enhancing the sense of depth. The overall light and shadow layers are rich, with cool tones predominantly accented by warm lighting, creating a contrast of warm and cool tones, focusing attention on the figure while hinting that they are in a bustling city. The image has a strong artistic and cinematic feel, as if taken from an urban romance drama or fashion blockbuster, presenting a modern woman who is independent, elegant, gentle, and slightly mysterious. The details are handled with extreme detail. The overall style combines realism and beauty, combining the warmth of everyday life with the sophistication of professional photography. It's like shooting with a high-end camera at dusk, using telephoto lenses to compress space and blur backgrounds to highlight the subject, presenting high-quality portrait effects",
