        {
          "id": "krea2-a3a4e3d9380f83da3165be62",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙花田困倦坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a rope swing adorned with flowers and vines. She wears a flowing white strapless long dress, the hem made of layers of lightweight tulle layers, presenting soft pleats and natural drape. The shoulders are designed with sheer sheer sleeves, wide cuffs with subtle ruffles. The overall look is elegant and dreamy. The wreath naturally fits over her head, adding a touch of pastoral poetry. She wears a gentle, sweet smile. Looking directly into the camera, the right hand gently holds a light blue plush doll. The doll is adorably shaped, while the left hand holds the swing's thick hemp rope and wears a delicate silver bracelet on the wrist. The swing is suspended by two thick brownish-yellow hemp ropes, with clear texture on the rope surface, rough yet authentic. The sides and bottom of the swing are decorated with numerous blooming flowers, including white and pale yellow peonies, blue hydrangeas, and several pure white daisies, with flowers arranged in an orderly manner along the swing's edges. Some petals also have a dewdrop-like, crystal-clear sheen. The background is a tranquil lake or bay, with shimmering water reflecting the pale blue tones of the sky. In the distance, hazy mountain outlines are shrouded in mist, presenting gradients of gray-blue and pale purple. On the right shore, faint green vegetation and a few trees can be seen. The entire composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly below the center. The swing structure extends from the upper and lower ends to the edge, creating a symmetrical and dynamic visual framework. Flowers in the foreground form a close-up layer with the figure, the middle is the main focus of the figure and swing, and the background uses blur to convey a profound sense of space. Light comes from the upper left, simulating the soft natural light of morning or evening, creating warm highlight areas. At the same time, delicate shadow transitions are created on the sides of the body and at the skirt folds. The direction of light and shadow is consistent, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and romantic, as if stepping into a fairy tale world. The color palette is mainly white, light blue, light pink, and green, with harmonious and unified color combinations. With a subtle creamy texture, the image is rich in detail, from the veins of the leaves to the texture of the fabric, all clearly distinguishable, possessing a strong artistic beauty. At the same time, it retains the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting, such as slight noise, uneven exposure, and natural depth blur, making the entire scene both dreamy and close to life. The composition is balanced, and the visual guide line extends upward from the swing's rope, creating an emotional tone of gentleness, innocence, and a yearning for freedom. The images present a surreal yet realistic aesthetic, as if captured from a summer afternoon dream.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
