        {
          "id": "krea2-bfbb7ee53ede8c0a12236780",
          "alias": "单女浴袍小径严肃持伞",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a light, flowing white Hanfu, the fabric semi-transparent and with a texture like clouds and mist. The wide-sleeved robe hung naturally, creating soft pleats and a sense of movement. The collar was slightly open, revealing the neckline. The overall look was elegant and classical. Her skin was fair and delicate, as smooth as congealed fat under the moonlight. She sat among a cluster of flowers blooming with white daisies. The right hand gently holds a beige oil-paper umbrella, with a slightly tilted surface, clearly visible ribs. The handle is wooden, topped with a red cord. The left hand gently caresses the flowers beside it, with a calm posture as if whispering to nature. In the foreground, dense white flowers and green stems and leaves are blurred, creating a soft bokeh that creates a sense of depth and depth. In the middle is a woman, positioned slightly to the right center, slightly tilted and head slightly raised. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure at the visual focal point. The background is a blurry, lush green vegetation. Light and shadow fall through the gaps in the leaves, forming mottled spots of light on the ground and the figures. The light is soft and warm, with golden tones reminiscent of morning or evening. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and far-reaching, full of poetry and Zen. The tones are mainly white, green, and beige, fresh and elegant, with moderate contrast and rich details. The image is high-resolution, with clear details and realistic textures. The photography style resembles professional portrait photography. Using a large-aperture lens for precise depth control, the subject is highlighted, the background is naturally blurred, composition emphasizes blank space and balance, then leads upward to the umbrella surface, creating a smooth visual path. Overall, it presents a surreal and aesthetic atmosphere, as if immersed in a dreamlike pastoral poetic realm with the charm of Eastern aesthetics. There are no obvious artificial traces in the frame, all elements harmoniously unified, light and shadow transitions naturally, color saturation is low but layered, emphasizing the fusion of realism and artistic feel. It feels like a high-quality work shot with high-end cameras and professional lighting equipment, while retaining the rustic feel and everyday life of everyday amateur equipment. The entire scene is bathed in sunlight, with a faint floral and grassy scent in the air. Time freezes on a quiet afternoon, evoking a sense of refreshment and refreshment. The visuals are full of storytelling and emotional tension, inviting imagination of her thoughts and past. The composition is full yet not crowded, with just the right amount of blank space, highlighting the character's gentle temperament. It also showcases the vitality and energy of nature, with an overall atmosphere that is tranquil, ethereal, and pure, like a masterpiece of classical ink painting blended with modern photography techniques, offering strong visual impact and artistic appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
