        {
          "id": "krea2-60fdb994da92fe9017857472",
          "alias": "单女灰高领衫车库自信站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the center of an outdoor parking lot, adding a touch of laziness and casual beauty. Looking directly at the camera, she presents a slightly alluring expression with a healthy glow. She wears a tight-fitting light gray turtleneck short T-shirt. The fabric has a subtle texture that hugs her body curves, outlining graceful shoulder and waist lines. She pairs beige denim shorts with a slim fit, and a black leather belt tied around her waist. The belt is adorned with multiple metal buckles and chain decorations, rich in details and a street style Her right hand hangs naturally, holding a piece of pale pink fabric that falls softly, forming soft pleats. Her overall posture is relaxed and confident, her body slightly turned to the side, revealing long legs and smooth waist-to-hip proportions. The foreground is a clear close-up of the figure, with the chest to thighs occupying the main position. The background is an open asphalt ground with white parking markings. In the distance is a light beige wall with red letters such as \"Welcome.\" In the corner of the wall, there is a small piece of gray cement structure. The sky is grayish-white, with even, soft lighting, like natural light on a cloudy or evening day. The entire scene appears ordinary and realistic. The composition uses a centered approach, with the figure centered. The extension of the lower body also guides the visual flow downward. Light and shadow come from the front slightly above, softly illuminating the character's front. The shadows are subtle and transitions naturally, without strong contrasts of light and dark, creating a peaceful, everyday, and slightly intimate atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly neutral. The color saturation is low, and the texture feels realistic. It feels like everyday photos taken with a regular phone, but through fine light and shadow handling and control over human posture, it presents a scene that combines the atmosphere of everyday life with artistic beauty. The image details are rich, and although the background elements are simple, they are authentic and believable. The overall atmosphere combines the casual feel of urban life with a quiet personal expression, allowing people to feel a unique moment captured in an ordinary setting, as if it were an afternoon when the sunlight had not fully faded. She stands alone in an empty parking lot, gazing at the camera, waiting for something, or having just finished a journey, everything in the frame feels so real and moving",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
