        {
          "id": "krea2-0dde641714765cfd7d4d65c7",
          "alias": "单女车厢害羞坐交叠",
          "prompt": "She wears a white medical mask, sitting naturally, her hands gently touching the edge of the mask, her expression gentle yet slightly shy. Her overall look presents a youthful Japanese campus vibe. In the foreground, the main figure occupies the center slightly to the right, with the background showing the interior environment of the subway carriage, including metal handrails, windows, billboards, and information signs. Soft natural light filters through the windows. Creates a warm backlighting effect. The middle ground features the carriage seats and some passenger areas, with blurred effects to highlight the subject, while the background is a blurred platform or city building outline, creating a sense of spatial depth. The composition combines close-ups with medium environments. The figures are positioned near the golden ratio point, bodies slightly tilted, legs crossed, forming graceful curves. Light and shadow contrast enhances three-dimensionality. The light source comes from the right window, with sunlight slanting in, creating a warm and tranquil lighting atmosphere. It carries the soft texture unique to early mornings or afternoons, with overall tones dominated by white, pink, and light gray. The color combinations are harmonious and unified, creating a fresh and sweet everyday atmosphere. The images are rich in detail, while retaining a certain film texture and slight noise, simulating the realism of amateur camera shooting. It feels like a snapshot of life captured by chance during a commute, with strong documentary and artistic aesthetics. The images are full of youthful energy and the poetic everyday life of urban life",
