        {
          "id": "krea2-566b1069b4a0067a22cf02dc",
          "alias": "单女蓝围巾庭院神秘站立注视",
          "prompt": "Her expression is calm yet reveals a hint of detachment. She wears a white strapless Hanfu with light, flowing fabric, off-shoulder design, and a semi-transparent deep blue sheer shawl embroidered with light gold cloud patterns. The wide cuffs are trumpet-shaped, and the material is light as smoke, swaying gently in the wind. Red embroidery patterns can be seen on the collar. On her chest is a luxurious ornament made of green jade and gold metal, uniquely shaped and richly detailed. In her right hand, she holds an intricately decorated staff. The main body of the staff is white, carved with golden dragon and auspicious cloud patterns. The top is decorated with a golden lotus, and the base is tied with pink silk ribbons. The staff is wrapped with colorful knots and small bells, making the overall design elegant and noble. Her left hand hangs naturally, gently supporting the middle of the staff, her posture elegant and composed. The background is a classical garden shrouded in thick mist. In the distance, the silhouette of a multi-story pagoda can be faintly seen. The pagoda body has simple lines, with a traditional Chinese flying eaves structure at the top. The surrounding buildings are blurred, presenting a blurred depth effect. In the foreground, you can see a few green leaves and white flowers, with the leaf edges gently curled and petals light and light, forming a layered contrast with the figures. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the center, and the gaze is slightly angled to the camera, creating a tranquil and mysterious atmosphere. The light is soft and even, with diffused light from above slightly to the left, creating soft shadows without strong contrast. The overall color scheme is mainly cool, interwoven with blue-gray, white, and cyan, accented with gold, red, and green as visual focal points, creating an ethereal and ethereal Eastern atmosphere. The image is delicate in texture, rich in detail, and features surreal dreamlike light and shadow effects, as if a fairy has stepped out of an ancient scroll. The entire scene is filled with tranquility, mystery, and poetry, like a courtyard in the morning mist. Time seems to stand still, and everything silently tells ancient stories. The camera is shot in medium shots, with the background completely blurred. While highlighting the main subject, the atmosphere remains intact, and the painting possesses strong artistic appeal and narrative power, as if capturing a fleeting mythological moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
