        {
          "id": "krea2-d7547ac0add3b16856e5af1d",
          "alias": "单女毛衣沙发媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits indoors under soft lighting. She wears a loose knit sweater made of gray and white. The fabric is fluffy and soft, with clearly visible texture, featuring a design combining thick knit knit and cutout lace. The sleeves have a mesh cutout structure with naturally curled edges. Revealing a thin white camisole underneath, the strap is slender and contrasts with the sweater. Her right hand rests gently on the sweater, fingers long, nails neatly trimmed, painted with light pink or transparent nail polish, her posture natural and relaxed, body slightly leaning forward, leaning against a white sofa or bed. The background is a blurred indoor environment, with faint glANDes of bookshelves, books, magazines, and some daily necessities. One open magazine has a cover printed with \"SENSUAL AND PURE,\" with a cool background color scheme mainly in gray-blue AND off-white. It creates a quiet and intimate spatial atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space, their heads positioned slightly above the center of the frame, meeting the viewer's gaze to create strong visual guidance. The foreground features the figure's body and sweater details, while the background is blurred to highlight the subject. Light comes from the left, possibly natural window light, creating a natural transition between light and shadow. The overall light and shadow distribution is even, without strong contrast, presenting a warm and delicate texture. The color scheme is harmonious, using gray, white, Brown and other low-saturation tones are used as the main theme, creating a quiet, comfortable, and slightly lazy home atmosphere. The overall image feels intimate with everyday life, while also carrying the refined beauty of artistic photography. It feels like a private moment captured with a professional camera, yet still feels authentic—like a warm moment casually captured with ordinary equipment. The image details are rich, and the overall style leans toward a blend of realism and modern aesthetics, emphasizing emotional expression and atmosphere creation, conveying a sense of tranquility, gentleness, and healing visuals",
