        {
          "id": "krea2-662615b7e9318bf0e190fcb3",
          "alias": "单女浴袍庭院困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in exquisite and luxurious Hanfu stands outdoors under natural light. The shape resembles a flower or butterfly, with distinct layers. The tassel earrings hanging down are also mainly gold, adorned with beige pom-poms and fine strings of beads. With her subtle movements, they emit a gentle luster. Gazing directly at the camera, she carries a hint of calm and calm, as if light can shine through. She wears a wide-sleeved robe with white as a base, yellow dyed like clouds. The fabric is light and flowing, with a soft texture. The neckline and cuffs are embroidered with intricate gold patterns. The shoulders and chest are decorated with multiple layers of metal chain straps, inlaid with colored gemstones of various sizes, forming a magnificent brooch-style ornament. At her waist is a wide yellow ribbon tied in an elegant knot, adorned with intricately carved gold waist badges and multiple pendants, including jade sachets, wooden small boxes, and jade pendants. The colors are rich, the materials varied, and the details are meticulously detailed The overall costume blends traditional craftsmanship with modern aesthetics, both solemn and lively. The composition uses medium to near shots, with the figure centered slightly to the left, body slightly angled to the camera, right hand naturally hanging down, left hand gently raised to the waist, posture elegant and composed. The background is a blurred outdoor environment, with faint green trees and mottled light and shadow. Sunlight pours down from the upper right of the frame, creating a contrast of light and shadow that enhances three-dimensionality and layering. The lighting is warm and bright, presenting the natural lighting effect of afternoon or early morning, with tones mainly warm yellow and light white. It creates a tranquil, poetic, and slightly dreamy atmosphere. Through the flow of light and shadow and harmonious color matching, it highlights its classical beauty and temperament. The image texture is delicate, like a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera, featuring slight film graininess and realistic bokeh, presenting a sense of realism and life reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment shooting. While retaining artistic aesthetics, the entire scene seems to freeze in an ancient courtyard instant, time standing still, only the wind brushing past the sleeves. It awakens millennia of poetry and romance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
