        {
          "id": "krea2-e25381e9b25f4d3211f6d8c1",
          "alias": "单女蓝连体衣城市冷淡站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an outdoor asphalt pavement, wearing a deep blue long-sleeve tight jumpsuit designed in a single-shoulder, off-shoulder style. The fabric hugs her body curves, showcasing smooth lines and elegant silhouettes, adding a touch of movement and spontaneity. She stands slightly sideways, one foot raised, knee bent, presenting a dynamic posture as if preparing to step forward or just stopped, appearing gentle and spirited. Her right hand hangs naturally, while her left hand gently rests on the silver trolley suitcase beside her, whose surface is smooth. The light reflects the surrounding environment, with clear details. The background is a gray asphalt pavement with white markings, and in the distance, a blurred architectural outline can be faintly seen. The overall tone is cool, mainly blue and gray, creating a fresh, calm, and slightly urban atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure occupying the left central position, forming a visual focal point and enhancing the sense of depth. Light and shadow from above are gently and evenly cast on the figure, while light and shadow cast light on the ground and suitcase. Enhancing three-dimensionality, the overall image presents a realistic feel reminiscent of everyday life, as if captured with a regular camera or phone. It preserves natural details and a sense of life. Color saturation is moderate, contrast is clear, and there is no excessive embellishment, maintaining a balance between authenticity and aesthetics. The style blends fashion and everyday elements, combining the refinement of model portraits with the casual street style, giving a visual experience that is both professional and approachable",
