        {
          "id": "krea2-f244ce2c6a91be7d25680990",
          "alias": "单女紫毛衣客厅俏皮站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a bright indoor living room, her overall makeup refined and natural, presenting a healthy glow. She wears a light purple V-neck knit cardigan with delicate bow decorations at the collar. The sleeves are loose and comfortable, the material soft and voluminous. She pairs the lower half with off-white high-waisted pleated wide-leg pants that are loose and flowing. A matching thin string is tied at the waist, and she wears a pair of white platform casual shoes, looking both fashionable and comfortable. A small off-white square bag with a gold chain drapes over her shoulder adds a touch of elegance, making her posture naturally relaxed With arms crossed over her chest and body slightly turned to the camera, she appears relaxed and cheerful. The background is a modern, minimalist interior space. On the left is a set of black metal framed bookshelves holding several magazines and black-and-white ceramic vases. Above the shelves is a black staircase railing leading to the second floor, with clean and sharp lines. On the right side is a large floor-to-ceiling window. Outside is an autumn rainy scene. Yellow ginkgo leaves sway in the rain, the ground is moist and reflective, and in the distance, pedestrians and vehicles are blurred. The sky is gray, creating a tranquil and rainy atmosphere. By the window is a black leather sofa with dark gray cushions, smooth texture, and soft and even indoor lighting, mainly from natural light from the window. The warm indoor lighting illuminates the figures and foreground, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center and the dog at the lower left. This creates visual balance: the foreground features a figure and a dog, the middle ground is a bookshelf and sofa, and the background is the rainy scene outside the window. The layers are distinct, extending to the body and dog. Looking out through the window, the light and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with a subtle sense of nostalgia. The overall color scheme is mainly purple, off-white, and black, accented with yellow leaves and a white puppy. The colors are harmonious and unified, filling the image with a sense of life and everyday beauty. It feels as if you were shooting with a mid-range consumer-grade camera. The lens has slight noise and soft focal length, rich in detail, and strong realism. It presents an unintentional everyday moment, like a family gathering or a casual record during a weekend break. The image is tranquil and beautiful, conveying the close relationship between people and pets and their love for life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
