        {
          "id": "krea2-1c62de8d99afb21109d55822",
          "alias": "单女湿身白T恤街道忧伤站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a rain-soaked street, wearing a white cropped tank top and a light gray hooded sweatshirt, paired with light blue jeans. Her overall look is casual and youthful, appearing lively and natural. She wears silver fine-rimmed round glasses that reflect soft light. She looks directly at the camera, her expression calm yet tinged with a hint of melancholy and contemplation. Her fingers are slender, her posture elegant, and her right hand holds the black handle of a transparent umbrella. The umbrella is slightly tilted to shield from the rain, creating a small shelter under the umbrella. She carries a black guitar bag on her shoulder, the strap slung across her chest. The pouch is full, hinting that she might be a music enthusiast or on her way to a performance. The earphone cable hangs naturally, adding a touch of artistic flair. Beside her is a retro-style bicycle with handlebars wrapped in brown leather, metal parts shining with a cool sheen, and the wheels are blurred to highlight the main figure. The background is a blurred city streetscape. Faint green plants, gray roads, and distant building silhouettes can be seen, creating a hazy urban atmosphere. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The foreground is a clear close-up of the character, the middle is the bicycle handlebar and part of the body, and the background is completely blurred, creating a strong depth of field contrast. The lighting and shadow atmosphere presents the soft, scattered light unique to cloudy days after rain, with light evenly spread over the figures without obvious shadows. The color palette is mainly cool gray-blue, accented with white. Light gray and light blue, low-saturation colors create a calm, cool, and slightly melancholic mood. The overall image has a cinematic feel and storytelling, as if capturing an ordinary yet poetic moment, like everyday moments shot with an old film camera. The slight graininess and natural exposure shift enhance realism and nostalgia. The image details are rich, from the folds of clothing to the reflection of raindrops on the umbrella surface, all clearly visible, with a delicate texture and distinct layers. It presents a tranquil and gentle urban lifestyle aesthetic",
