        {
          "id": "krea2-d9073965783dce5f8dc1d3b6",
          "alias": "单女白T恤教室害羞坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at a wooden desk in the classroom, looking directly at the camera, her expression slightly shy yet gentle. Her right hand gently holds a sugar stick, her fingers slender and long, her nails painted a pale pink polish. Her left hand rests naturally on her knee, her posture elegant and relaxed. She wears a white short-sleeved T-shirt with deep blue trim at the collar and cuffs, paired with a dark blue sports mini skirt with white stripes on the skirt sides. Her legs are clad in white over-the-knee stockings, which are delicate and smooth with a slight reflective texture, presenting natural folds and light effects. The overall design is youthful and lively, full of campus atmosphere. The background is a bright indoor environment, with white vertical blinds or curtains behind, letting in soft natural light. Light streams in from behind and sides, forming a uniform diffused light that illuminates the subject, creating a fresh and bright atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure centered slightly to the left, body slightly tilted, head facing the camera to create a visual focal point. The foreground features the person's body and hand movements, with clear details. The middle shot includes her clothing, sitting posture, and part of the desk. The background consists of blurred curtains and windows, creating a shallow depth of field effect that highlights the subject and forms a natural line of sight. The light and shadows are soft and layered, with light sources coming from behind and left, forming subtle contour lighting. The overall color palette is mainly white, light gray, and deep blue, accented by pink candy as the finishing touch. The color scheme is harmonious and unified, giving the image a strong Japanese anime style while blending realistic photography texture, as if taken with a professional camera for high-resolution photos. The lens uses an 85mm prime portrait lens. With an f/1.8 aperture, the image presents an aesthetic experience that is both dreamy and real, as if the afternoon sunlight streaming through the window into the classroom is frozen into an eternal image. The entire scene is quiet and warm, filled with youthful innocence and beauty. It is as if you can hear the distant class bell and classmates' conversations. The air is filled with a faint scent of books and the sweetness of candy. The scene is serene and vivid, drawing you in and feeling the gentleness and stirring of the times",
