          "id": "krea2-a46e50cce62619f89161345a",
          "alias": "单女短裙竹林微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in exquisite Hanfu sits upright on the railing of the stone bridge. She wears a wide-sleeved long skirt in pale pink and white. The fabric is light and flowing, with a texture as smooth as silk, glowing with a warm luster in the sunlight. The neckline and cuffs are embroidered with exquisite floral patterns, with fine stitching and soft colors. The hem of the skirt is adorned with several elegant embroidered flowers, adding a touch of classical charm. The hanging pearl necklace swayed gently in the breeze, looking especially elegant and captivating. She wore a gentle smile, exuding a serene yet slightly shy temperament. Her hands were folded on her knees, posture dignified, her body slightly tilted, presenting graceful curves. In the foreground was a gray stone bridge railing, rough with clear texture and some mossy marks along the edges. On the left, a few emerald bamboo leaves poked into the frame, adding vitality and layers to the composition. The middle ground was a calm lake surface. The water's surface reflects the willow trees on the shore and the light and shadow of the sky, shimmering in the water. Several quaint small boats are moored in the distance. One is a typical Jiangnan black-awning boat, with a deep brown hull and low canopy with smooth lines. The other is lighter in color with a blurred outline, creating a contrast between solid and void. The background is a hazy willow forest, with branches hanging down and swaying gently in the wind. The leaves glow in the sunlight with a bright tender green, and some areas are outlined softly by the backlight. In the distance, a Chinese pavilion building with flying eaves and upturned corners can be faintly seen. The roof is covered with gray tiles, elegantly structuring, blending seamlessly with the entire scene. The sky appears a pale blue-gray, with thin clouds and soft lighting. The overall color palette is mainly pale pink, gray-white, and blue-green, creating a tranquil and distant atmosphere. The composition uses the classic three-part method: the figure is positioned slightly toward the center left of the painting, with the gaze facing the front right, then turning to the willow forest and buildings in the background, creating a natural visual flow. The painting uses a shallow depth effect to make the main figure stand out clearly, while the background gradually blurs, enhancing the sense of space and depth. The light and shadow come from the upper left, representing soft natural light. The light evenly spreads over the figures, with natural shadow transitions that enhance the sense of depth. At the same time, subtle reflections appear on the stone railings and the water surface, creating a realistic and delicate light and shadow texture. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and far-reaching, full of poetry, like a classical painting of a Jiangnan water town, rich in Eastern aesthetic conception. The style combines realism with artistry, preserving the texture of authentic shooting while incorporating the aesthetic taste of traditional painting. Like a frame captured by a professional camera paired with a prime lens, the details are rich, colors harmonious, and composition exquisite, delivering strong visual appeal. It makes you feel as if you are in a poetic world far from the hustle and bustle, feeling the gentleness and beauty that transcends time and space",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
