          "id": "krea2-7dba88d17a380ebc67d71fe2",
          "alias": "单女金毛衣公园害羞坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors under the sunlight, adding a touch of gentleness and laziness, revealing a gentle yet slightly shy expression. She wears a pale yellow knitted cardigan with a hollowed-out woven pattern, delicate button decorations on the cuffs and placket, and a white slip dress underneath. The skirt is light and flowing, embroidered with fine floral patterns. The overall look is fresh and natural, full of youthful energy. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, with the body slightly turned and head turned toward the camera, creating a warm and interactive atmosphere. The background is a blurred outdoor scene, possibly a park or courtyard, with stone paths paved on the ground. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting mottled light and shadow, creating soft halos and bokeh effects. In the middle ground, some blurred greenery and interlaced tree shadows enhance the spatial layering. The composition uses close-ups and shallow depth of field effects to make the subject clear while blurring the background. Light comes from above, like a warm afternoon sun, creating contrasts of light and shadow and a sense of three-dimensionality. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is cozy and tranquil, carrying a subtle sense of nostalgia and a sense of everyday life. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and white, creating a healing, comfortable, and romantic atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and authentic, as if captured with a regular camera, featuring slight film graininess and natural color transitions, presenting a life-like authentic beauty. Without excessive embellishment, it preserves the original light and shadow transitions and detailed textures, allowing people to feel a beauty and tranquility in the ordinary",
