        {
          "id": "krea2-252f936a59712f2792529476",
          "alias": "单女T恤室内微笑站立展示",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a bright indoor setting, dressed in a light gray-blue sportswear, including a form-fitting sports tank top and high-waisted tight yoga pants, presenting a healthy and well-proportioned figure. Her fingers are long, her posture elegant and relaxed. On her feet are a pair of white platform sneakers with blue stripes on the uppers, neatly tied laces, giving the overall look a simple yet energetic look. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the painting, with a slightly tilted body and a slight tilt of the head, presenting a gentle smile. The overall atmosphere is fresh and natural. The background is a modern, minimalist interior space, with white walls and a door or partition with glass windows behind. Through the glass, the blurred outlines of outdoor greenery can be faintly seen. Several recessed spotlights are installed on the ceiling, emitting warm yellow-white light. The floor is a light wood floor, smooth and reflecting soft light and shadow. The foreground occupies the main visual space, the middle is the space between the figure and the wall, and the corridor area extending into the background. The background is composed of distant architectural structures and the view outside the window, creating a clear sense of spatial layering. The composition uses vertical composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the center-right, leaving a blank area on the left to balance the image, while also highlighting the subject. The body lines extend to the feet, finally landing on the details of the ground and background. Light and shadow come from above and on the sides, combining natural light and artificial illumination. It creates a soft and even lighting effect, with subtle shadows and natural transitions, creating a bright, clean, and comfortable atmosphere. The overall color palette mainly consists of light gray-blue, beige, and white, harmoniously unified and giving a sense of tranquility, warmth, and vitality. The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains the warmth of daily life. It is like a carefully arranged fitness record, combining artistic beauty and realism, suitable for showcasing a healthy lifestyle or fashionable sportswear. The painting contains no unnecessary decorations, is simple and not monotonous, focusing on the figures themselves and conveying a positive and uplifting attitude toward life",
