          "alias": "单女短裙窗边倚靠",
          "prompt": "The clip is adorned with gold details, adding a touch of elegance. She leans sideways against the armrest, looking relaxed and relaxed, exuding a serene and sweet expression. She wears a light purple semi-transparent chiffon top with lace trim at the collar and cuffs, and a large bow tied at the chest. The layered ruffles add a romantic and beautiful touch, paired with a matching high-waisted short skirt. The hem of the dress is also adorned with lace details, giving the overall look a fresh, sweet yet sexy charm. The background is a bright indoor space, flanked by a white-framed window. Outside, lush greenery flows in, sunlight filters through the sheer curtains, creating a soft effect of light and shadow. The curtains are light and flowing, gently swaying in the breeze. The windowsill is made of wood, with a surface showing signs of age, presenting a warm reddish-brown tone. Light streams in from the left, creating a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The composition uses a medium perspective. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, with an S-shaped body and a slightly tilted head, creating a close interaction between the viewer and the viewer. The foreground shows the local texture and folds of the sofa, with a clear texture. The middle ground features the subject and details of their clothing. The background consists of windows, curtains, and outdoor greenery, creating distinct layers. Light shines from the upper left, making the figure's silhouette more three-dimensional. The shadows are soft and not abrupt, and the overall color palette is mainly warm white, pale purple, and beige, complemented by green plants outside the window, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and comfortable, as if capturing a quiet and pleasant everyday moment, with a strong cinematic feel and life atmosphere. It resembles a real scene shot by a professional camera under natural 