        {
          "id": "krea2-dbd477874b3b3df380ab9fe7",
          "alias": "单女粉旗袍花园害羞坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor stone bench, wearing a light pink modified qipao. The qipao is made of soft silk fabric, presenting a delicate sheen and natural drape. The neckline features a traditional Chinese stand collar design with delicate frog button decorations. The sleeves reach the elbows, with an overall slim and elegant cut. The sides of the skirt slit reveal the agility and grace of walking, revealing a calm yet slightly shy expression. She slightly turns her body to the camera, her right hand lightly resting on the edge of the stone bench, her left hand naturally resting on her knee, her posture dignified yet relaxed. A simple white bracelet is worn on the wrist, adding a touch of freshness. The background is lush green shrubs and lawns, with rich vegetation layers. The leaves display varying shades of green under sunlight. Some areas form bright patches due to backlighting, and in the distance, faint architectural outlines can be faintly seen, but the focus is entirely on the figures. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, forming the visual focal point. The foreground features the rough surface of the stone bench and part of the ground, with the stone texture clearly visible. There are traces of time, with fine stones and dead leaves scattered on the ground, adding realism. The middle ground features the main figure and nearby vegetation, while the background gradually blurs, creating a good depth of field. Light comes from the upper left, which is natural daylight, soft and warm, creating distinct side lighting. On the right, natural shadows are created to enhance three-dimensionality. The transition between light and shadow is smooth, forming a bright contour light. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and warm, full of poetry and Eastern aesthetic charm. The main color palette is powder green, harmonious and unified, with moderate saturation. Highlighting a fresh and natural feel, the composition is balanced and stable, with strong visual guidance. The image then extends along the body lines to the details of the clothing and the surrounding environment, presenting a beauty captured casually in daily life. It feels like a gentle moment accidentally captured in an afternoon garden, like shooting with an old film camera, with slight graininess and natural exposure. The tone is slightly warm, presenting a lifestyle documentary style. The image quality is delicate yet authentic, combining the refinement of artistic photography. It retains the warmth and spontaneity of amateur shooting, and the entire image exudes an atmosphere of youth, gentleness, tranquility, and a blend of nature",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
