        {
          "id": "krea2-4dff0a40fb5a6219de74d3ab",
          "alias": "单女灰西装车厢微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of an escalator at a subway station, wearing a gray school suit jacket with a white shirt and blue-and-white striped tie underneath. She also wears a gray-white plaid pleated short skirt. Her overall look is a typical Japanese student uniform style, with a gentle smile as she looks directly at the camera. Her left hand is in her suit pocket, while her right hand carries a black handbag. Her posture is natural and relaxed, as if she has just finished a day of study or is preparing to go somewhere. The background is the interior of a modern urban subway station. Two side by side escalators extend upward, with metal handrails and steps reflecting a cool glow under the lights. Several small photos or posters are pasted on the walls, one of which faintly shows a person's image. The floor is paved with gray non-slip tiles, featuring red safety warning signs and green arrow markings. The entire space is evenly illuminated by artificial lighting, with soft and slightly cool lighting that creates a daily commuting atmosphere. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly below the center of the frame, occupying the visual focal point. The escalator's diagonal lines extend backward from both sides, creating a strong perspective guide that draws the gaze deeper. The symmetrical structure enhances the stability and order of the image. Figures in the foreground stand out clearly, the middle features the escalator and some platform facilities, while the background features stairs and wall details farther away. The layers are distinct, the light and shadow treatment is delicate, and the main light source comes from the fluorescent lamps above. The shadows are soft and without obvious hard edge shadows. The overall color scheme is mainly gray, white, and blue, accented with red and green warning colors. The color palette is calm and harmonious, creating a quiet, authentic, and slightly detached moment of urban life. The image texture is close to the real scenes shot by high-megapixel phones, with slight noise and natural depth transitions, as if captured by a photography enthusiast during their daily commute. It carries a strong sense of documentary and youthful energy, with an overall atmosphere that is both everyday and full of storytelling, evoking the continuation of campus life and the everyday trajectory of urban light-footed people. The images are filled with complex emotions, intertwined with the innocence of youth and the rationality of the city",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
