        {
          "id": "krea2-d96520e5acd1959d07f3fb3b",
          "alias": "单女白T恤困倦倚靠持相机",
          "prompt": "Her overall temperament is sweet and gentle. She wears a white lace camisole with delicate lace trim decorations at the neckline and shoulder straps, exuding elegance and innocence. She wears a fluffy, soft off-white plush cardigan with wide sleeves and pleated details, making the material look very comfortable and warm. She wore a white pleated short skirt with distinct layers, swaying gently with every movement, adding a touch of liveliness and vitality. She wore a classic pearl necklace, with round pearls gently sparkling around her neck, adding a touch of vintage elegance to the overall look. The overall look was round and full, and when held to her chest, it looked especially warm and cozy. Her posture is slightly sideways, her body slightly leaning forward, creating a warm and direct sense of interaction, occupying the main visual focus of the scene. The center is the shelf behind her, neatly lined with a large number of Sanrio series plush toys such as My Melody and Keroppi, mainly in pink, white, and black. Some dolls wear outfits with bows or small skirts, rich yet unified in color. The shelves use black metal frames and transparent glass partitions, with a simple and modern structure. The background is other areas inside the store, where you can see more product shelves displaying beautifully packaged boxed goods in various colors—yellow, blue, red, etc.—but they appear slightly blurred due to the distance. The floor is light gray tiles with fine spots, creating a soft reflection that enhances the sense of openness. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame, creating a strong visual direction. The figure then extends downward along the doll she is holding and finally spreads to the toy shelves in the background. This creates a sense of layering from near to far. Light from above is a warm white LED lamp, evenly illuminating people and products without obvious shadows. However, subtle transitions between highlights and shadows enhance the sense of depth and texture. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is bright and warm, with a fairy-tale-like dreamy feel. The color saturation is moderate, dominated by pink tones, paired with white and beige, creating a sweet, pure, and pleasant visual experience. The image has high detail expression while retaining soft edge transitions. It simulates the effects of a professional camera under good lighting conditions, presenting an overall aesthetic that is both realistic and slightly idealized, as if captured from a sweet shopping trip, full of youthful energy and healing power",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
