        {
          "id": "krea2-448982bc1e8631c4f68ff453",
          "alias": "单女蓝旗袍自信站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a light blue Chinese qipao with a stand collar and delicate frog buttons. The dress was embroidered with elegant floral patterns, and the fabric showed a delicate silky sheen and natural pleated texture. Her skin was fair and radiant. In her right hand, she gently held a white lotus-shaped porcelain plate, inside which sat a beautifully carved green pastry. The pastry surface was engraved with landscape patterns, giving the overall look a simple and elegant look. On her left arm, she wore a warm jade bracelet. On the wrist is a jade bracelet in the same color family, gracefully poised and slightly tilted, showing graceful curves. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is on the right, leaving space on the left for visual balance. The background is a blurred outdoor courtyard, with lush green trees forming soft bokeh light spots. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting dappled light and shadows, creating a warm and hazy atmosphere. The foreground blur emphasizes the subject, the middle ground clearly presents the details of the figure and props, and the background fully blends into the natural environment. Light shines from a slanting top, creating a soft transition between light and dark, with shadows naturally falling on the neck and shoulders. The overall color palette is mainly teal and gray-blue, accented with white and emerald green, creating a harmonious and unified color with an Eastern aesthetic charm. The lens simulates 85mm prime portrait photography, using a large aperture f/1.8, with extremely shallow depth of field. The background presents a creamy, smooth out-of-focus blur, with a delicate image texture as if shot by a professional camera, with slight film graininess and realistic light and shadow noise. It enhances the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting while preserving artistic aesthetic expression. The composition is meticulous, with a slightly overhead perspective to narrow the gap between the subject and viewer, guiding the gaze to focus on the expressions and objects in their hands. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, gentle, and poetic, full of classical charm and the breath of life. Like a portrait of an Eastern beauty blending modernity and tradition, it conveys a tranquil, far-reaching and tranquil mood of tranquil years",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
