        {
          "id": "krea2-3b40537fa3de4b916937c24a",
          "alias": "单女短裙摄影棚困倦",
          "prompt": "Her skin was as fair as jade, dressed in a light white gauzy Hanfu. The fabric was semi-transparent and delicately textured, with layered sleeves and skirts gently swaying in the breeze. Her chest is embroidered with pink floral patterns with exquisite details. Her posture is elegant, her arms naturally outstretched, fingers long, and her overall look full of classical charm and poetic beauty. The background is a pure blue gradient sky, transitioning softly from deep blue to light blue, creating an ethereal and dreamy atmosphere. The main figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the composition, with a full and layered composition. The middle scene shows body posture and fluttering robes, with a background that is simple yet profound. This creates a strong sense of perspective and spatial depth. Light comes from the front and above, creating subtle contour light at the edges, making the figure's outline clear. The folds of clothing and the rich contrast of light and shadow on transparent materials create a cool and pure visual effect. The colors are mainly white and blue, accented with pink for a harmonious unity. The image has a high artistic sense and a surreal aesthetic, resembling a carefully painted ancient-style lady or a high-quality portrait shot in a studio with professional equipment. With a slight film texture and delicate graininess, the lens uses a large aperture blur to highlight the subject and blur the background, presenting an overall image style that is both realistic and dreamy, perfectly blending traditional aesthetics with modern technology",
