        {
          "id": "krea2-df7614c2d6f31d31c8be5be9",
          "alias": "单女庭院忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "A woman wore an elegant white Hanfu, with light and flowing fabric, delicate texture, and a semi-transparent sheer effect. The collar and cuffs were embroidered with delicate light blue patterns, and a pale blue ribbon was tied around her waist, tied into an elegant bow. The ribbon hung in front of her, adding a touch of liveliness and softness. With a faint melancholy and contemplation, her expression serene and serene, she stood in an antique courtyard, with a background of blurred Chinese architecture: blue tiles and white walls, flying eaves, and upturned corners. Faintly visible wooden carved window lattices and wooden railings were carved with exquisite geometric patterns. Branches slanted in from the right side of the painting, lush and green. Sunlight filtered through the leaves, casting mottled light and shadows, forming soft light spots that created a tranquil and poetic atmosphere. The overall tone of the painting was mainly cool, with white, light blue, The interplay of gray and green creates a fresh and elegant feeling. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure centered and background blurred to highlight the subject. The light and shadow are soft, and natural backlighting outlines the figure's outline, making her appear enveloped in a hazy halo. The entire scene resembles a classical ink painting, full of Eastern aesthetic charm, combining the elegance of traditional clothing with the delicate texture of modern photography. The composition is highly artistic and storyful, as if freezing a quiet afternoon where time stands still, making one unable to immerse themselves in that distant and gentle atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
