        {
          "id": "krea2-021a626f0a51636ccba7ec71",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣广场困倦躺注视",
          "prompt": "A woman lies on her side on a soft white bedding, wearing a light gray knit sweater with the straps naturally slipping to one side, revealing smooth shoulders and collarbones. She gazes into the camera, slightly dreamy, slightly open, presenting a quiet yet slightly alluring expression. On her left hand is a silver ring, her fingers gently resting on the edge of the sweater sleeve, her posture relaxed and natural. In the foreground is a white ceramic mug, with \"cut.el\" written in blue handwritten letters on the cup. The cup was securely placed on a black square tray, with subtle textures on the surface. Next to it was a book or magazine with a black cover, printed with blurred white text and circular patterns. The background was a dim bedroom environment, and on the left was a half-open door frame. Warm yellow light shone through the crack, creating a contrast between cool and warm. Behind the door, you could vaguely see a few pieces of clothing hanging inside the wardrobe, and on the upper shelves were some small items and decorations, including a black-and-white style painting or poster. The entire space is enveloped in a rich blue-purple hue. The light source comes from the front left of the frame, possibly a phone flash or a small LED light. The light shines from the side, creating a private, tranquil, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The foreground cups and trays serve as visual anchors, giving the overall image a strong sense of daily life and life, as if it were a real moment casually captured with a phone. But through careful light and shadow control and color coordination, it presents an aesthetic effect reminiscent of film reels. The tones are mainly cool blue-purple, accented with local warm yellow light sources to enhance layering and emotional expression. The image details are rich, and even the handwritten handwriting on the cup is clearly legible. The visuals are full of storytelling, evoking the tranquility of solitary moments late at night. The interplay of light and shadow reveals a blend of loneliness and tenderness. The overall atmosphere is both modern and retro, combining artistry with authenticity. presenting a unique style that lies between everyday documentation and aesthetic creation",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
