        {
          "id": "krea2-4d93ed56ab1abf19ffa4f5ed",
          "alias": "单女毛衣专注坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a rough stone wall, wearing an off-shoulder knit top with long sleeves naturally draped down. The fabric features soft pleats and delicate textures, with a unique shoulder design—one shoulder exposed, the other covered by wide sleeves, creating an asymmetrical visual effect. She pairs it with washed, distressed gray wide-leg jeans. The legs are loose, and the fabric shows natural wear marks and faded spots, giving it a casual yet textured look, adding a touch of brightness and vintage vibe to the overall look. She wears a pair of large silver round earrings, simple yet fashionable. She tilts her head slightly upward, creating a dynamic beauty. The background is a pure, cloudless deep blue sky, with high color saturation and a fresh summer sky. In the upper right corner, dense green leaves hang down, clearly visible, with slightly curled edges forming a sharp contrast with the blue sky. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure occupying the left central position of the composition, body slightly tilted, posture relaxed and natural. The stone wall surface is rough and uneven, with weathering marks and white mottled lime marks. The texture is realistic, with light and shadow coming directly from above. The sunlight is strong, and the shadows are concentrated under the body and in the recesses of the stone wall, creating a clear transition of light and shadow. The overall lighting is bright and transparent, with blue, white, and gray as the main tones, accented by orange scarves. The color contrast is vivid and harmonious, creating a fresh and natural atmosphere, full of youthful energy and summer vibes. The image has a strong visual impact and artistic feel, as if it were a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera, while preserving the casualness and realism of everyday life. The details are rich and the layers are distinct. From the textures of the characters' clothing to the colors of the sky in the background, everything is clearly distinguishable, presenting an aesthetic style that is both refined and full of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
