        {
          "id": "krea2-a906534e7f55b0c21283fcea",
          "alias": "单女半褪灰毛衣街道微笑坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a street at night, wearing a gray wool beret with a slightly slanted brim. The cap's texture is delicate, presenting a soft matte texture. The brim's edges are slightly pleated, adding a touch of casual and lazy charm. It has a natural sheen, with curly waves hanging from her shoulders, faintly visible in the night, appearing rich and vivid. She wears a loose gray knit sweater made with a coarse knit technique, with a clear surface texture. The sweater collar is designed to be off-shoulder. One side of the collarbone and shoulder line are exposed, the sleeves of the sweater on the arm are casually pulled down, creating natural pleats and layering. The right hand gently caresses the chest, fingers are long, nails painted in light pink or nude colors, fingertips slightly curved, posture elegant and relaxed. The left hand naturally rests on the knee, revealing a small slender wrist at the wrist. The overall outfit is harmonious and unified, mainly in gray tones, creating a calm and gentle atmosphere. The background is a city street at night, with the ground covered by dark gray asphalt. There are faint white markings on the road surface, faint traces and reflections of wheel runs, distant building outlines blurred, windows emitting scattered warm yellow lights, forming blurred light spots. Some walls appear dark, possibly made of concrete or stone, with rough surfaces and fine cracks. The sky is completely dark, cloudless, with only very faint ambient light. The overall scene is in a low-light environment, quiet and private. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, head slightly tilted. The expression is calm with a hint of gentle smile. The fill light source from the front right is smooth, with no harsh boundaries, enhancing the realism of the material. The foreground is the main subject, occupying the main part of the frame, while the middle is the ground and some street elements. The background is completely blurred to highlight the subject. At the same time, hand movements and the texture of clothing guide the gaze toward the middle of the body, making the overall composition stable. Using a central composition and slight tilt to enhance movement, the colors are mainly cool tones of gray, black, and brown, creating a warm and cool contrast. The lighting and shadow atmosphere are tranquil yet slightly melancholic, as if capturing fleeting gentle moments in a city night. The image has a cinematic texture, rich in detail, and clear layering, as if shot at night with a professional camera, yet still full of life. It is like capturing real moments casually on the street with a phone or portable device. The photos have slight film graininess and natural noise, enhancing realism. Precise exposure control, no highlights are overexposed, shadows retain details, and the overall look presents a refined yet effortless everyday aesthetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
