        {
          "id": "krea2-49bb018a70e02182093f3447",
          "alias": "单女白外套公寓严肃站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors under the sunlight, adding a touch of liveliness and gentleness. She wears a white hooded sports jacket with a deep blue collar and sleeve design. The shoulders and sleeves feature three classic white stripes, and on the left chest is a round school emblem. The jacket zipper is half-open, revealing a white short inner layer underneath, revealing a flat belly. She wears dark blue sports shorts on the bottom, giving the whole outfit a casual and fashionable look. The cable is light blue, naturally hanging over her chest, making her look both practical and lifelike. Her hands are in her coat pockets, her posture relaxed and natural, her body slightly turned to the camera and her head slightly tilted, creating a casual yet elegant atmosphere. The background is a blurred city street, with faint glimpses of shaded street trees and distant building silhouettes. Light streams diagonally from the left side of the frame, creating a soft backlighting effect. A warm golden halo is created, forming beautiful contour light and creating a richly layered visual texture. The entire composition uses shallow depth of field photography, with the background blurred to present bokeh effects, enhancing the subject's prominence. The composition uses a center composition, with the figure centered, the main subject in the middle background, and the blurred street scene in the background together creating a complete spatial layer. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and bright, filled with the lazy and cozy summer afternoon sunshine, complemented by warm yellow sunshine tones, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. It gives a fresh, clean, and vibrant feeling. The image texture is delicate, as if captured by a high-resolution camera on a clear day, with a slight film graininess and natural color gradients, presenting an unintentional beauty in daily life. The composition is full but not crowded, with just the right amount of blank space. The characters and environment echo each other, conveying a youthful, free-spirited attitude toward life. The overall atmosphere is warm and healing, with strong visual appeal and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
