        {
          "id": "krea2-ebb605566f8c5d1730cd46c4",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙花园站立展示",
          "prompt": "A woman, as the main subject, adds a touch of liveliness and gentleness. She wears a light blue spaghetti strap dress made of light and flowing material, with slender straps. Several three-dimensional pale pink and white flowers adorn the chest, with lifelike shapes and distinct petals and rich details. The skirt hangs naturally with pleats, showcasing an elegant texture. Her posture is slightly tilted, one hand hangs naturally, and her movements are smooth and youthful, full of vitality. The background is a blurred green plant and blue sky, presenting a soft bokeh effect. The blur treatment makes the subject stand out. The composition uses a centered technique, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, creating a visual focal point while leaving a sense of space to make the image more breathable. The perspective is a level view with a slight downward view, bringing the audience closer to the character. It enhances intimacy. In terms of lighting and shadow, light comes from the front and above, creating natural transitions between highlights and shadows. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting mottled light and shadow, creating a warm and bright atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly fresh and soft blue-white, accented with pale pink flowers and a green background. The color coordination is harmonious and unified, giving a sense of tranquility, purity, and beauty. The image texture is delicate and richly detailed, giving it the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting. It feels as if a regular camera was captured outdoors under natural light. The lens has a focal length of about 50mm and an aperture of f/2.8, accurate exposure, and true-to-life color reproduction. The image is not over-retouched, retaining natural graininess and slight noise, presenting a lifelike, documentary aesthetic. The entire scene resembles a clear afternoon, with a gentle breeze and bright sunshine. The figures stand quietly in a garden, as if time has frozen in that moment, exuding an atmosphere of youth, innocence, and beauty",
