        {
          "id": "krea2-d6755a653682dd0970e5aa46",
          "alias": "单女制服小径困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a Japanese-style school uniform stands on a sunlit stone-paved path, looking especially gentle and charming. She wears a white stand-collar shirt with a light beige bow at the collar, paired with a dark blue knit cardigan, a gray-black plaid pleated skirt, paired with black pantycoons and shiny black leather shoes. She gently holds a dark blue canvas backpack with a gray wide shoulder strap and red metal buckle details on the sides. The overall look is fresh, sweet, and full of youthful energy. Her posture is natural and relaxed, slightly lowering her head to look at the camera. It feels as if you've just returned from school or are about to head somewhere. The background is lush trees and shrubs, lush and green. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting mottled shadows, creating soft halos and bokeh effects. In the distance, you can faintly see a corner of a wooden cabin or pavilion, with warm and rustic tones. The entire composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure centered to the right, occupying the main position. In the foreground, there are a few blurred green leaves and grass to enhance the sense of spatial layering. The middle scene features a stone path and figures. The background is composed of blurred woods and buildings, creating a distinct depth effect. Light comes from the upper left, with soft daylight filtering through the canopy, creating a warm and dreamy atmosphere. Light and shadow intertwine with moderate contrast between light and shadow. Highlights are delicate and bright, shadows transition naturally. The overall color palette is mainly green and blue, supplemented by white, gray, and brown. The colors are harmonious and unified, with a slight film texture and graininess, simulating everyday amateur camera shooting. The edges of the frame are slightly darkened to add a retro filter feel. The rest gradually blurs out, highlighting the main subject, presenting an overall atmosphere of tranquil, gentle, and slightly nostalgic campus life, like a memory frame on a summer afternoon—combining the beauty of youth with a subtle poetry and tranquility",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
