        {
          "id": "krea2-4230c921a435cd33c77a25a5",
          "alias": "单女白短裙森林困倦站立持扇",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors under natural light, wearing a white silky top with a sleek asymmetrical shoulder design. The neckline hangs low to reveal one shoulder and collarbone. The sleeves are short puff sleeves with delicate pleats and a sheen, presenting a soft, flowing silhouette. The lower half is paired with an off-white high-waisted long skirt, creating a simple, elegant, and modern look. She wears a thin silver chain necklace with a fan-shaped pendant. The edges are set with tiny gemstones, shimmering with a gentle glow in the light. On the wrist are multiple red beaded bracelets layered with gold bracelets, creating a striking and harmonious color contrast. Holding a book or album with a cover painted with green forests and pink flower patterns is gently held in the hand. The pages are slightly opened, details are clearly visible, the figure's posture relaxed and natural, bodies slightly turned to the side, hands folded in front of the body, with a hint of contemplation. The makeup is exquisite but not exaggerated, with a blurred outdoor forest scene in the background. The interwoven branches and leaves create blurred green and brown tones. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting dappled light and shadows, creating numerous circular and oval bokeh spots, creating a dreamy and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses shallow depth of field, with the background completely blurred to highlight the subject. The composition centers on the figure slightly to the center, leaving space on the left side for the line of sight to extend naturally, creating a smooth visual flow. Light comes from above, a soft natural glow, like morning or evening sun, with warm yellow tones running throughout the image. The shadow transitions are natural and richly layered. The overall color palette is mainly white, off-white, and pale yellow, accented with red and green. The color combinations are fresh and elegant, and the light and shadow effects are realistic and delicate, as if taken with professional photography equipment in a natural lighting environment. It has a high sense of realism and artistic beauty. The image details are full and the texture clear, presenting a poetic beauty that is both everyday and extraordinary. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, gentle, and romantic, full of youthful energy and artistic flair. It is suitable for fashion shoots, personal portraits, or emotional-themed creations.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
