        {
          "id": "krea2-a21004e0577763b2680a9500",
          "alias": "单女黑长裤雪地俏皮站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the window of the cable car on the snow mountain. She wears a black baseball cap with a slightly lowered brim, with a white embroidered logo on the front that glows softly in the sunlight. She wears a fitted black cropped top and loose pants in matching tones, showing off her slender waistline and appearing relaxed and confident. Her left hand gently rests on the edge of the cable car window frame, her body slightly turned to the side, her head looking back at the camera, her expression tinged with laziness and playfulness. The main focus is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, occupying most of the visual space, with the rolling snow-capped forest in the background. The hillside is covered with mottled snow, pine forests are lush, some areas are exposed on brown soil, winding paths and scattered buildings can be seen in the distance. The middle ground features a wide snowfield and wooden fences, with light and shadow slanting down from the upper right, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. The shadows clearly outline the outline, and sunlight reflects bright highlights on the snow, creating a cool and transparent texture. The composition combines close-up and distant shots, with the figure on the left side of the frame and the right side reserved to showcase the magnificent mountain scenery. Using cable car window frames as natural frames enhances the sense of layering and depth in the image, forming a circular circulation path. The overall atmosphere blends winter tranquility, outdoor freedom, and youthful vitality, presenting a real, natural moment of life. It resembles travel photos casually taken with a phone, featuring slight film graininess and natural color saturation. The lighting is warm and soft, with black, white, and gray tones dominated by green vegetation and snow reflections. The image is delicate and rich, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
