        {
          "id": "krea2-37e1f21fea2e01bc3ac4e032",
          "alias": "单女粉连体衣公寓俏皮坐比耶",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a beige fabric sofa, wearing a pink ribbed long-sleeve bodysuit that fits her body perfectly, showing soft curves. The neckline is V-shaped with delicate vertical texture, making it both comfortable and fitted. She lifts both hands to gently pull the hoop, her fingers long, nails neatly trimmed, painted with light pink nail polish. She wears a fine silver chain necklace. The pendant is small and simple. She kneels on the sofa, legs bent, wearing white ankle socks printed with cute cartoon patterns. She leans back slightly, her posture relaxed and elegant. The background is a warm beige wall with a delicate texture and a slight graininess. The sofa backrest is thick and equipped with multiple pillows in the same color. The surface of the pillows is flat and full, with the overall composition centered on the figure, shot in a medium shot, with the figure occupying the main position, fully visible from knees to overhead, with the camera slightly overlooking the scene creating a friendly and natural visual experience. Light comes from the right side, creating a soft side effect, while the left side creates natural shadows, enhancing the sense of depth. The transition between light and shadow is smooth, with a warm yellowish tone that creates a cozy and cozy home atmosphere. The entire picture is unified and harmonious, mainly pink and beige, accented with a touch of white, presenting a sweet, lazy, and healing everyday feel. It feels like a life photo taken with a regular household camera in the living room—authentic and natural, without excessive embellishment. It preserves subtle traces of daily life, with a composition that is simple yet layered. The foreground is the main figure, the middle ground is the sofa and cushions, and the background is the wall. The spatial relationships are clear, and the overall composition is full of youthful energy and atmosphere, exuding a relaxed and joyful lifestyle atmosphere, as if recording a tranquil moment when afternoon sunlight pours into the room—warm and beautiful",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
