        {
          "id": "krea2-d3874bf6ef80134078569954",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣户外微笑站立举手",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the white railing outdoors, wearing a gentle smile. Her overall aura is sweet and fresh. She wears an off-white knit dress with pleats and lace trim, layered with a pink knit cardigan. The collar and cuffs feature ribbed details, buttons are neatly arranged, her left hand raised high toward the sky, her body slightly turned, elegant and full of vitality. The background is a blurry green forest and soft patches of light, with sunlight slanting in from the left side of the frame, creating rich layers of light and shadow. It presents a dreamlike atmosphere: the foreground features a clear female subject, the middle ground is a blurred white railing and distant ground, the background is blurred trees and circular light spots formed by scattered light. The composition uses the center-right position of the figure, using diagonal body movements to guide the gaze. The heads are near the golden ratio point of the frame, creating a visual focal point. The camera uses a large aperture with extremely shallow depth of field, the background completely blurred, highlighting the subject. Light comes from the low-angle sun at dawn or dusk, soft and warm. The color palette is mainly pink, white, and beige, paired with a green background to create a warm and cool contrast. The overall atmosphere is warm and romantic, carrying a youthful innocence and sense of hope, as if capturing a peaceful and beautiful moment. The image has the texture of professional photography while retaining the realism of everyday amateur equipment. The image is delicate, with natural color transitions, rich details, and exquisite light and shadow treatment, presenting a visual effect that is both artistic and close to everyday life",
