        {
          "id": "krea2-e065a0ca18227ecca6859e2a",
          "alias": "单女外套咖啡厅沉思倚靠阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sat in a red leather booth in the restaurant, wearing a black baseball cap adorned with white lettering and patterns, draped over her shoulders. She wore an off-shoulder, fitted cropped top with long-sleeve designs that naturally draped over her arms, paired with loose sweatpants in matching tones. The waist had drawstring details, giving the overall look a casual yet fashionable look. Her right hand held a white paper cup printed with patterns, while her left hand casually rested on her leg, her body slightly leaning to the side, head lowered, gazing downward. Her expression is somewhat lazy and contemplative. In the foreground is a wooden dining table with a light brown garment, possibly a coat or apron, with clearly visible texture. The center features a female subject, positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space. The background is a red-and-white checkered tile wall, with a striking red billboard above that reads \"FABULOUS FRIES\" in large red lettering, and \"Southern\" below The text of \"Living Magazine\" features a simple and powerful font, strong color contrast, and the entire scene is softly lit. The warm yellow tones from indoor lighting create a cozy and comfortable atmosphere. The shadows are soft, highlighting the contours of the figures and the texture of their clothing. The visuals have a realistic feel of everyday life, as if captured with a real phone. The camera is slightly tilted, creating a casual yet aesthetically pleasing visual effect. The overall color palette is mainly red, white, brown, and black, with harmonious and unified color combinations. It presents an urban leisure style, with rich image details and authentic texture, combining fashion with a sense of everyday life. The composition is compact, with visual guidance focused on the characters. Background text and environmental elements enhance the authenticity and storytelling of the scene, creating a relaxed and comfortable afternoon nap atmosphere",
