        {
          "id": "krea2-1f1e7facfe962c8bf6cb837b",
          "alias": "单女白T恤室内微笑倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman appears natural and lazy, with a hint of contemplation and dreaminess. Looking directly into the lens, it seems to be silently communicating with the viewer, slightly parting to reveal a faint, almost imperceptible smile. She wears an off-white camisole with loose puff sleeves designed in a light, soft material. The overall look is simple and fashionable. She leans slightly to the side, tilts her head slightly, and her posture relaxed. The arms are naturally bent, with elbows supporting the body in front of the body, forming a comfortable leaning posture. The background is a blurred warm yellow tone, presenting a soft gradient effect, like walls or curtains illuminated by indoor lighting. The blur treatment makes the subject stand out more. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space, the gaze directed toward the lower right, creating a visual guide. The background is completely blurred into a warm halo, with the lighting and shadow atmosphere dominated by warm yellow, with light softly shining from the left. Meanwhile, the background light presents slight halos and scattering effects, enhancing the dreamy and layered feel. The overall tone of the image is uniform, with moderate color saturation and a slight film texture and graininess, as if shot with a professional camera in low-light conditions. The large-aperture lens is extremely shallow, the background is completely blurred, highlighting the subject's details and expression. The image has a strong artistic sense and emotional expression. It retains the warmth and authenticity of everyday life, as if on a quiet afternoon, she wears headphones and immerses herself in her own world, capturing a tranquil and beautiful moment. The image is filled with gentleness, tranquility, and a faint melancholy that makes people want to get closer and listen to her story",
