        {
          "id": "krea2-1b8c148b43387c49828dcdbc",
          "alias": "单女紫毛衣城市忧伤坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the weathered concrete steps, adding a touch of laziness and casualness. Looking directly at the camera, she carries a faint melancholy and contemplation, slightly parted to reveal a faint, almost imperceptible smile. She wears a fluffy, soft purple plush knit sweater made of extremely delicate material, with a fine plush texture that glows slightly under the light. The sleeves are wide and layered, and the wrists are slightly tightened, outlining the lines of her slender arms. The fabric has slight wash marks and natural pleats, giving it a casual yet fashionable look. On her shoulder is a small brown crocodile leather bag. The body is small and exquisite, adorned with gold chain decorations and metal fasteners. The details are meticulously crafted, with the strap draping from her right shoulder to her left waist, adding movement and layers to the image. Behind her is a rough concrete wall with obvious cracks, peeling, and stains, showing signs of aging. Above it runs a black metal railing across the top of the frame, rusted and worn on the surface, with slightly rough edges. On the right is a black diamond-shaped wrought iron grille, possibly a vent or decorative component. The overall background tone is rather gray, forming a strong contrast with the vivid clothing of the figures. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, body slightly tilted, head facing the camera, creating a visual relationship that is both intimate and distant. The foreground features the upper body and parts of the legs, clearly prominent; the middle frame shows her sitting posture, hand movements, and bag; the background features walls and railings, with distinct layers. The movement follows her arms and clothing, finally extending to the texture and details of the background. Light and shadow come from the left side of the painting, soft natural light, while shadows fall on the neck and shoulders, creating a sense of three-dimensionality and realism. The overall atmosphere is quiet and slightly melancholic. Blending the roughness of urban streets with the refined personal fashion, it presents a quiet and contemplative moment of modern youth in a corner of the city, as if capturing an unintentional emotional freeze. The visuals have a strong cinematic feel and storytelling, with purple, blue, and brown as the main color tones, harmoniously unified and unified. The contrast of warm and cool tones enhances visual impact. The image texture is delicate and rich, featuring both the graininess and light and shadow changes of real photography, as well as subtle artistic touches. It combines a sense of everyday life with aesthetic height",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
