        {
          "id": "krea2-a38f535163c00c70bb005c84",
          "alias": "单女粉睡裙椅上困倦坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the soft indoor light, wearing a light pink floral spaghetti strap nightdress with delicate white lace trim on the hem and shoulders. As if telling some quiet secret, in the foreground is a bouquet of colorful flowers, including roses and hydrangeas in shades of pink, orange-yellow, and light blue. The flowers are full, with layers of petals and green leaves scattered throughout, adding vitality and depth to the scene. The middle scene shows the woman's whole body and part of her environment. The chair she sits on is decorated with gold carvings, and the background is a warm wooden wall. Above the wall hangs a round vintage-style mirror, framed in gold and reflecting blurred light and shadow. Green vines climb up beside it, creating an atmosphere where nature and culture blend together. On the right, a layer of sheer curtains is visible, light and soft, letting in soft light. The entire scene is bathed in warm yellow sunlight, with the light coming from the left window, forming diagonal beams that pass through the fine dust in the air, creating a dreamy Tyndall effect that highlights three-dimensionality and texture. The overall composition combines close-up and middle shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, guiding the gaze naturally and the background blurred. This makes the main subject stand out even more. The colors are soft pink, off-white, and pale yellow, accented with a touch of green and colorful flowers, creating a warm, romantic, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The overall image has a strong cinematic and artistic aesthetic, like a carefully composed film photographic work, rich in detail, clear layers, flowing light and shadow, full of poetry and emotion. It is like a quiet moment of afternoon sunlight streaming through the window lattice, capturing the purest and most beautiful side. The image quality is delicate, the resolution is high, and the details are clear. It presents a visual experience that is both real and surreal",
          "description": "",
