        {
          "id": "krea2-d92276dc02d3499b9d35984a",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙海报倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a light pink sleeveless dress with a pure white high neckline, simple and elegant. The skirt's lines are smooth and fitting to the figure, and the material has a subtle silk texture. Light and shadow create a soft transition of light and shadow on the fabric, with a light beige wall as the background. Golden decorative lines above create a luxurious and tranquil atmosphere. The overall composition is centered, with the figures occupying the main part of the composition. The head is slightly tilted, and the gaze is slightly downward, giving a calm and reserved impression. Close-up shots and background blur are used to highlight the subject. Light shines from the front left, creating a soft side lighting effect that presents a crystal-clear texture. The overall color palette is mainly soft pink, white, and beige, accented with gold, creating a warm and pure visual impression. The image is rich in detail, with almost no visible pores, yet retains the natural texture of the skin. The edges are sharp, the transitions between light and shadow are smooth, with no obvious noise or signs of excessive sharpening. The overall style leans toward a blend of sophistication and artistic sensibility in portrait photography, with a touch of refined digital painting. It feels as if shot with a professional camera, using a large-aperture lens with a focal length of about 85mm, moderate shutter speed, and low ISO to capture the most authentic light and shadow changes. The image has strong visual guidance, and the overall atmosphere is calm and gentle. The entire scene seems frozen in a crack of time, full of poetry and romance. It is like a beautiful work from a fashion magazine cover, yet it retains authenticity and a sense of everyday life. It is like a beautiful moment casually captured with a regular home camera in a cozy indoor space, yet carefully processed in post-processing, giving the image both a sense of everyday authenticity and a surreal artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
