        {
          "id": "krea2-bf41e8c145ef73fe97c652ba",
          "alias": "单女白礼服严肃站立",
          "prompt": "She wears a set of luxurious jewelry, with a necklace set with multiple dazzling diamonds and pearls. This forms an elegant collarbone chain, each gemstone meticulously cut, reflecting dazzling light. The earrings are long in design, topped with sparkling diamonds, and a rounded pearl hangs in the center. With her movements, it gently sways, radiating a captivating glow. She wears a white gown with a unique shoulder design: one shoulder is exposed, while the other is covered by pleated fabric. The fabric is smooth and soft, with a silky sheen. Light shines from the left, creating a gentle contrast of light and shadow. The background is a blurry gray tone, presenting a shallow depth of field effect that makes the subject stand out. The composition uses the classic rule of thirds: the figure is positioned on the right side of the frame, leaving space on the left side to balance the visual balance, creating a noble, elegant, tranquil, and far-reaching atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly white and gray, with delicate light and shadow treatment. The highlights are bright and transparent, while the shadows transition naturally, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and layering. The composition is full of artistic beauty, like a fine oil painting with a touch of modern photographic realism. It evokes a sense of serene and solemn ritual, as if telling a story of beauty and elegance",
