        {
          "id": "krea2-8f7b3b399f504da33ba5042d",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣户外愤怒站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under a clear blue sky, adding a touch of liveliness and naturalness, with a gentle yet slightly contemplative expression. Looking directly into the camera, it seems as if she is silently communicating with the viewer, presenting a healthy and natural sheen. The slightly flared version exudes a youthful and energetic aura. She wears a light gray sleeveless tight knit tank top, with clear fabric texture that fits the figure, showing off graceful curves and a healthy figure. She pairs it with white high-waisted shorts, which are simple and neat, with the pant legs slightly rolled up. Revealing slender calves, hands naturally tucked into pants pockets, the pose relaxed and casual. The overall look is fresh and fashionable, full of summer vibes. The background is a vast, boundless pure blue sky, with a gradient blue from top to bottom, transitioning from deep blue to light blue without a single cloud, creating an open, tranquil, and ethereal atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle upward shot, placing the figure slightly to the right center, highlighting their upright posture and slender body proportions, while using the sky as a large blank space. This creates a strong visual contrast that enhances the subject's presence. The foreground features details of the lower body and hands, while the background stretches to the horizon of a deep blue sky. Light and shadow come from intense sunlight directly above, bright and even, making the figure's outline clear and shadows soft but not glaring. There are subtle shadow transitions on the back and sides of the body, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color palette is mainly blue and white, fresh and bright, creating a strong visual impact. The visual atmosphere is both fresh and natural, full of modernity. It's as if capturing a moment of afternoon sunlight, like shooting outdoors with an old film camera. The lens shakes slightly, the focal length is slightly blurry, with slight graininess and color shift, simulating the texture of real photography. The lighting is soft, edges slightly vignetted, and the background is moderately blurred, highlighting the subject. The overall style combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life, conveying a sense of freedom, comfort, and vibrant summer daily life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
