        {
          "id": "krea2-6e26b4ab4a10082b1a8aa048",
          "alias": "单女蓝高领衫微笑倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman, as the main subject, adds a touch of liveliness and gentleness, with a faint smile. She wears a deep blue turtleneck sweater made of soft and thick fabric, featuring delicate knit textures. She wears a dark plaid skirt with tassel decorations along the hem, creating an overall look that is both vintage and youthful. Her hands gently embrace a metallic railing, her fingers naturally and long, her posture elegant and relaxed, her body slightly leaning forward, her head resting lightly on her arms, as if enjoying a moment of tranquility and comfort The background is a blurred outdoor natural environment, with green plants and dappled light and shadow intertwining to create a soft blur. In the distance, the silhouette of a wooden building can be faintly seen, creating a poetic pastoral atmosphere. In the foreground, a metal railing extends diagonally from the lower left corner to the center of the painting, forming a strong visual guiding line. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, making the figure stand out more and feel approachable, while also enhancing the sense of spatial depth. Light comes from the upper and side effects, creating a contrast of light and shadow and highlighting the three-dimensional contours. Warm yellow sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating a mottled light and shadow effect that adds a warm and dreamy atmosphere to the entire image. The overall color scheme is mainly blue-green, paired with warm golden sunlight, creating a fresh, tranquil, and slightly nostalgic visual experience. The image has a distinct shallow depth of field, with delicate background blur and a dreamlike bokeh effect. The image texture resembles professional camera shooting, with rich details, moderate color saturation, clear layering, and natural light and shadow transitions. It feels as if a vivid and moving moment captured on a sunny afternoon with high-end photography equipment. The overall style combines the warmth of everyday life with the beauty of artistic imagery, offering a serene, gentle, and story-rich visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
