        {
          "id": "krea2-7d0c97ae6af5ce4f8a5b03a3",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣街道俏皮站立戏水",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on the balcony of an open-air café on a city street. Her right hand gently rests on a white metal railing, wearing a loose light gray knit sweater. Two thin ribbons tie into a bow on her shoulders reveal her collarbones and part of her shoulders. She pairs it with black pants. The overall look is simple yet elegant. Her posture is natural and relaxed, her body slightly turned to the side, presenting a casual yet refined temperament. In the foreground is the white metal railing on the balcony, whose surface is slightly worn and shows signs of daily life. Next to it is a corner of a white table. The middle view is a wide city street, clean and tidy, with clear white traffic markings. Several cars are parked by the roadside, including a yellow taxi and a white sedan. On both sides of the street are rows of tall phoenix trees, their leaves tender green and branches upright. Their shadows cast on the road, creating mottled light and shadow. Several pedestrians are walking on the sidewalk, some wearing casual jackets, others carrying bags. The background is the classic architectural cluster of Shanghai Bund. The porch is decorated with exquisite carved decorations. In the distance to the right stands the towering Oriental Pearl Tower, with its structure clearly visible. Surrounded by other modern skyscrapers, the sky shows a gradient of light blue and yellow. Sunlight streams down from the upper right, creating a soft and warm glow that coats the entire scene with a golden glow. The composition combines close-up of characters with a layered layout of mid- to long-range urban landscapes. The figure is positioned slightly lower to the right of the painting, with the viewer's gaze facing the viewer, then extending left to the streets and buildings, creating a sense of visual depth. The lighting and shadow effects are natural and realistic, with delicate shadow transitions. The building facades are illuminated by sunlight, with rich details. Vehicles and pedestrians on the street also create contrasts of light and shadow due to the light, creating a peaceful and lively atmosphere. The overall tone of the painting is warm and harmonious, combining the bustling urban atmosphere with the warmth of daily life, as if capturing a leisurely moment of afternoon sunlight bathing the city. The image texture is delicate and lifelike, like high-quality photos taken with a professional camera, offering a strong sense of immersion and artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
