        {
          "id": "krea2-66792cd9bcbf3e6577c52af0",
          "alias": "单女粉内衣海滩冷淡坐喝",
          "prompt": "From a low-angle low-angle view, a woman sits on a seaside rock. She wears a pink lace bra and light blue denim shorts, paired with a loose off-white knit cardigan. The cardigan is casually draped over her shoulders, with sleeves naturally draped down, revealing her slender arms and collarbones. She is looking up at the sky, holding a transparent plastic mineral water bottle with a blue and white label in her right hand. Her head is slightly tilted back, presenting a layered effect of deep brown with light brown accents. She wears a slender silver necklace. The pendant is small and exquisite, adding a touch of elegance. The overall posture is relaxed and natural, full of summer leisure vibes. The background is a vast, boundless blue sky, with no clouds, pure and transparent like a filter. The light is bright and soft, and sunlight pours down from above, creating natural highlights and shadows. The transition of light and shadow is natural, creating a fresh, clean, and healing atmosphere. The foreground features rough gray-brown rocks, with textured and uneven details. The rock edges are clearly visible, contrasting with the figures, while the middle is the main subject. Occupying the main position in the composition, the composition uses a center-shifted third-division method. The character is on the left side of the frame, leaving plenty of space on the right to enhance visual extension. The action of drinking water is then returned to the action, creating a cyclical visual flow. The overall color tone mainly uses warm and cool contrasts. The blue sky contrasts gently with the pink and off-white of the characters' clothing, creating a harmonious unity. The color saturation is moderate, not overly flashy, maintaining a sense of realism. The image texture is close to professional photography style, but still carries the natural feel of everyday phone photography. The lens simulates an 85mm prime portrait lens, with a shallow depth of field and slight background blur, highlighting the subject while preserving the clarity of the sky. The lighting is natural daylight, usually in the morning or afternoon. The sunlight slants throughout, creating soft contour light. The figures are clearly contoured, and the overall atmosphere is peaceful, comfortable, and free, as if capturing the most relaxing moment on a summer afternoon. The image conveys a leisurely state of an urban girl escaping the hustle and bustle and embracing nature, with a strong sense of immersion and a sense of everyday life. The details are rich, such as the words on the water bottle, Although the label content is blurry, it is recognizable, enhancing realism. The composition is full but not crowded, with reasonable blank space and visual comfort, presenting an overall style of photography that is both artistic and close to everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
