        {
          "id": "krea2-4b71b56a0e03b055fc7ce37d",
          "alias": "单女旗袍温泉困倦坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits half-squatting on a floor paved with white pebbles, dressed in a refined Eastern fantasy-style cosplay outfit. The main piece is a modified qipao-style top with white and yellow accents, black lace trim on the collar and cuffs, a blue ribbon tied around the chest, and a wide blue-and-white patterned belt at the waist. The skirt is short and flowing, embroidered with colorful feather patterns along the edges. The overall design blends traditional clothing elements with modern fantasy aesthetics. The foreground is scattered white gravel with delicate textures clearly visible. Some areas are illuminated by blue lighting to give a cool sheen. The middle ground is the main subject, occupying the main position. The composition adopts a slightly overhead perspective, with the figure centered slightly to the left, body forming an S-shaped curve. The head is slightly tilted, forming a soft visual guiding line. The background is blurred, and you can faintly see wooden structures and stacked stones under blue light. Behind is a white round fan painted with pink flowers, and a blurred pink light spot floats in the upper right, creating a dreamy, hazy atmosphere. The overall light and shadow are mainly cool blue, projected from the left and above, creating a soft transition between light and dark. The shadows are natural and emphasize three-dimensionality, while cool reflections on the legs and floor enhance spatial layering. The painting's tones intertwine warmth and coldness. It combines the tranquility of Japanese hot springs or courtyards with a mysterious and fantastical atmosphere. The overall atmosphere combines the authentic texture of everyday photography with artistic beauty, as if capturing a carefully arranged stage performance or a private photo moment. The details are rich, emotions are full, and it is full of storytelling and visual appeal",
