        {
          "id": "krea2-0be1ecbc44aa90640a267b90",
          "alias": "单女白浴袍桌边坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a classical-style study, wearing a delicate white silk robe. The V-neck design and soft pleats glow in the warm light glow with a gentle sheen. The sleeves are slightly rolled up, revealing slender wrists, adding a touch of laziness and naturalness. Her expression is calm, as if immersed in a world of words. Her hands rest gently on the pages, her fingers slender and graceful. Her left hand gently presses the page, while her right hand hovers above it, as if about to flip or close it. On the table sits a vintage brass desk lamp. The lampshade is made of beige fabric material, emitting a warm, soft golden glow. Light pours down from the right, casting soft shadows on the pages and tabletop, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. The yellowed paper bears the marks of time, with slightly worn edges and clearly visible handwriting. Next to it sits a cup of hot tea, a white ceramic cup holding amber-colored tea liquor. Wisps of white smoke rise from the rim, drifting lightly and adding a touch of dynamism and warmth to the space. The tabletop is made of dark brown solid wood. The surface is smooth with natural wood grain, clear texture, and a heavy texture. The background is a tall wooden bookshelf with neatly arranged books densely packed and orderly. The spines vary in color, mainly brown, deep red, and dark green. Some book covers are decorated with gold or embossed decorations. The bookshelf structure is complex with carved details, giving it a rustic and elegant look. The overall environmental tones are warm brown, ochre, and gold, creating a cozy, tranquil, and scholarly atmosphere. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figures positioned slightly toward the center on the left side of the frame. The body is slightly tilted, with the gaze facing the lower right. The desk lamp serves as the main light source on the right side of the frame, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow that creates a dramatic visual effect. Light shines from the upper right, while the rest gradually blends into darkness, enhancing the depth and layering of the image. The foreground highlights the interaction between the figure and the desk, the middle features a desk lamp, teacup, and books, while the background extends the bookshelf for a rich sense of space. The composition uses shallow depth of field to make the subject clear and sharp, while the background is softly blurred to enhance the visual focus. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, gentle, nostalgic, and poetic. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, the details are exquisite, presenting a texture similar to film photography, with slight graininess and moderate color saturation, reminiscent of vintage images shot with vintage cameras. The aspect ratio is 3:4, suitable for vertical display on phones. The overall style blends romanticism and realism, combining artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life, conveying a sense of comfort and focus. Immerse yourself in a tranquil moment immersed in knowledge and time, with no unnecessary decoration in the painting; every element serves the theme, creating a pure and profound reading experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
