          "id": "krea2-c8f6b47158e6eea6069c6007",
          "alias": "单女紫T恤沙发忧伤坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sits indoors, slightly curled, presenting a lazy yet elegant texture with a hint of melancholy and contemplation. She wears a light purple sleeveless camisole nightgown, made of lightweight, soft material with a hint of transparency, hugging her body curves and showcasing a natural posture. Her right arm is raised, elbow resting on the black sofa behind her, with smooth arm lines, slightly raised shoulders, and left arm naturally hanging down. Her posture is relaxed yet elegant, her body leaning slightly forward, head slightly turned to the side. A subtle tilt angle is formed, enhancing the dynamic and intimate feel of the image. In the foreground, you can see the edge of a white tablet or laptop, placed on her lap or on the table in front. The background is the indoor environment, the walls are light gray or off-white, with slight textures on the surface, giving a clean and plain look. On the right side, there is a dark door frame or window with black edges, contrasting with the wall. deep in the background, a glass container or vase can be faintly seen, apparently filled with liquid or decorations, reflecting faint purple light spots that add depth to the space. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the composition, forming an asymmetrical yet balanced layout. Moving down to clothing and foreground objects, a continuous visual path is formed. Light mainly comes from the left or front left of the image, soft and warm, with a distinct pink-purple hue, creating a romantic, tranquil, and slightly intimate atmosphere. It enhances the sense of depth, with the overall color palette dominated by warm pink and purple, complemented by neutral gray and black. The colors are harmonious and unified, full of artistic flair and emotional expression. The images have the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment shooting, such as slight noise, imperfect focusing, and natural exposure control, simulating the original style of mobile selfies. The details are rich and layered, combining the realism of photography with the aesthetic of painting. The overall atmosphere is quiet, gentle, and slightly hazy, as if capturing a moment of solitude late at night. It conveys a restrained emotion and a personalized spatial experience",
