        {
          "id": "krea2-118df2ed71a05bfa9aacf817",
          "alias": "单女森林愤怒侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a light, flowing light blue sheer Hanfu, with the fabric adorned with tiny, star-like tiny glow particles. Under the soft natural light, it shimmered with a gentle luster. The semi-transparent sleeves and collar swayed gently in the breeze, showcasing a flowing texture and layering. Looking toward the camera, she seemed to carry a hint of shyness and anticipation. Her right hand was gently raised, fingers slightly bent, It seems to touch mist or petals in the air, with elegant and natural postures. In the foreground, a few blurred green plant leaves blur at the edges, creating a soft depth transition. In the middle ground, the woman is the main subject, occupying the center-right position. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure slightly turns to the side, with the head slightly tilted, creating a dynamic beauty. The background is a hazy gray-blue tone, with faintly visible moist rock textures and misty mist. Light streams diagonally from the upper left, creating a soft backlight effect and a bright outline light. The light and shadow are soft and not glaring, creating a tranquil and far-reaching atmosphere, filled with classical Eastern poetry and a sense of ethereal charm. The main tones of the painting are cool green and gray-blue, presenting a fresh, ethereal, and dreamy visual experience. The details are rich and the texture is authentic, as if capturing a moment after a light morning rain in the forest. There is a slight film graininess and natural noise from everyday camera shooting, enhancing realism and a sense of life. The overall composition is full but not crowded, with distinct spatial layers, and visual guidance from the foreground leaves to the central figures. Extending further into the hazy background imagery, a smooth visual path is formed. The painting possesses strong artistic appeal and immersive viewing experience, like a modern freehand ink painting, combining traditional aesthetics with contemporary aesthetics. The colors harmoniously unify, the light and shadow treatment is delicate, and the details are meticulously detailed, presenting a tranquil, pure, and transcendent Eastern aesthetic conception",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
