        {
          "id": "krea2-6af10f83b9dac9a0b7d7004d",
          "alias": "单女黑短裤门自信蹲交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman squats gracefully at the entrance of a modern building, wearing a bright red fitted long-sleeved short top whose fabric fits her body and showcases smooth curves. Black high-waisted mini shorts outline her long legs, making the overall look full of fashion and visual impact. She wears delicate gold earrings and a thin chain necklace, with a slender gold bracelet adorning her wrist, creating a look that is both simple and glamorous. She is turning sideways to look back at the camera, her left hand lightly touching a pair of red patent leather high-heeled musles. The other shoe is taken off and placed by the foot, looking natural and relaxed. The background is a beige exterior wall decorated with geometric lines for a delicate texture. On the right is a deep brown wooden carved door, with clearly visible grain patterns showing a warm wood sheen. The floor is paved with gray terrazzo tiles, neatly joined, with black metal strips trimming the edges. On the left side of the painting, a partial black metal bracket can be faintly seen, possibly part of the outdoor furniture. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right of the frame. The body forms an S-shaped curve, with legs crossed and bent to form a graceful arc, creating a complete visual flow. Light comes from above, softly and evenly casting on the figure, creating a warm golden atmosphere. Shadows transition naturally, with a strong sense of depth. The overall color palette is mainly red, black, beige, and brown. The color contrasts are vivid yet harmonious, with rich layers of light and shadow, including both light and dark variations and delicate reflections. The image presents a high-end fashion photography feel, as if shot with a professional camera for a commercial commercial campaign. At the same time, it preserves details from real everyday scenes, exuding a strong sense of artistic beauty and a sense of everyday life. The overall atmosphere is both sexy and charming, yet elegant and composed",
