        {
          "id": "krea2-863e3c1ed8c00d46e00f2e81",
          "alias": "单女橙毛衣卧室沉思坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bed in her bedroom, displaying a gentle yet slightly contemplative expression. She wears an orange knit sweater with soft texture and pleats. The sleeves are casually pushed up to the elbows, revealing slender arms and collarbones. A thin black camisole is faintly visible from the shoulders. She wears dark blue shorts, legs bent together, ankles naturally crossed, body slightly turned to the side, one hand gently resting on the knee, the other naturally hanging down, a relaxed and elegant posture creating a subtle transition of light and shadow. Creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere, the background is a white wall adorned with various paintings and photographs. One large landscape painting depicts mountains and trees with rich color layers, while the smaller pieces vary in style, including city scenes, abstract patterns, and records of everyday moments. These paintings are arranged in a staggered manner, adding a strong artistic atmosphere to the room. On the left side of the painting is a wooden bookshelf filled with books, cosmetic bottles and jars, hats, and miscellaneous items, neatly stacked with books. Some covers are clearly visible, the bottles and jars are minimalist, giving the whole place a touch of everyday life without clutter. Above the bookshelf is a small white appliance, possibly a humidifier or aroma diffuser. On the right is a corner of the bed, with the white sheets slightly wrinkled, soft and fluffy. The headboard cushion is made of green fabric with a slight texture. The entire scene is illuminated by a beam of natural light from the front left, which passes through the window or curtains into the room, creating a soft backlighting effect and outlining a golden halo along the edges of the figures. At the same time, a faint shadow is cast on the wall, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality in the space. The composition uses medium and close-up shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, head slightly tilted, and the gaze meeting the viewer directly, creating a strong visual guidance. The paintings and bookshelves in the background serve as environmental elements, enriching the layers of the image without overshadowing the main focus. The figures in the foreground occupy the main visual focus, and the warm tones of their clothing contrast with the cool tones of the background, further highlighting the main subject. The overall composition presents a sense of privacy and artistic aesthetic style from everyday life, as if captured with a regular phone or portable camera. However, through careful composition and light and shadow processing, the image has a cinematic texture and emotional impact. The color palette is mainly warm yellow, orange-red, and off-white, accented with cool colors like green, blue, and black. The color combinations are harmonious and unified, with rich details. From the woven textures of clothing to the edges of wall frames, everything is clearly visible. The light and shadow are soft and layered, creating a tranquil, The comfortable and distinctive living atmosphere makes the overall scene like a silent poem about youth, freedom, and self-expression, evoking a sense of quiet power and inner peace",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
