        {
          "id": "krea2-058ab8b7d598479b21caffd4",
          "alias": "单女黑礼服摄影棚媚态站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands before a solid-colored light gray background, wearing a black strapless gown that fits her figure. The waist features a transparent mesh patchwork design, showcasing elegant curves and delicate details. Her makeup is exquisite, creating a strong visual contrast with the overall dark tones. Her expression is calm and powerful, raising her right hand high, gently lifting a piece of black transparent tulle. The tulle floats upward from her hand, unfolding lightly like smoke, forming smooth curves and richly layered folds. The edges of the tulle gently tremble in the air. It feels as if an invisible breeze is blowing by, creating a dynamic aesthetic. In the foreground, a woman occupies the center of the composition, her body slightly turned sideways, her posture relaxed and natural. In the middle of the scene, flowing black sheer fabric traces graceful traces in the air, forming an interactive relationship with the figures and enhancing the sense of space and flow. The background is a pure light gray gradient without unnecessary interference, making the subject stand out more. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered and the sheer veil extending to both sides, creating visual balance and tension. At the same time, negative space is used to enhance the character's presence, then the flow of the sheer veil extends to the top of the frame, ultimately returning to the figure to form a complete visual closed loop. The light and shadow are handled delicately, with the main light source coming from the upper front position, creating a subtle translucent effect on the sheer fabric, giving it a semi-transparent texture. The shadow transitions naturally, avoiding awkward light and dark boundaries. The overall atmosphere is calm, mysterious, and full of artistic flair. The color palette is dominated by black, white, and gray, creating a high-end A restrained yet sensual visual experience, with image quality close to professional studio shooting. High-end photography equipment captures details while still carrying a slight graininess and realism typical of everyday amateur cameras. It feels like a creation completed on a simple set with a medium format film camera. The lens is a 50mm prime and a small aperture to control depth of field, making the subject clear while the background is moderately blurred, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall style blends the characteristics of fashion blockbusters with portrait art, combining the refinement of commercial advertising. It also contains depth of personal expression, presenting a modern woman's independent, elegant, reserved, yet powerful temperament. The images convey a sense of movement in tranquility, light in darkness, and firmness beneath gentleness. All these elements together create a visual work rich in emotional tension and aesthetic value",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
