        {
          "id": "krea2-72603923766a8157db62a44f",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙城市冷淡坐展示",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a modern industrial-style interior, looking directly at the camera. Her expression is cold yet tinged with laziness and confidence. She wears a white long-sleeve tight dress with a unique neckline, off-shoulder style, and black lettering \"Easo Le\" and a black cross pattern on the chest. The short hem fits snugly, accentuating her figure. She wears white over-the-knee socks with black crosses and text decorations on the legs, blending gothic elements with fashion trends. She presents a cool yet avant-garde aesthetic. She sits on a rectangular table with a metallic texture, legs naturally apart, hands gently resting on the edge of the table, her posture relaxed yet elegant. To her left sits a dark brown baseball cap with a slightly curled brim featuring a white bear symbol. The background is a spacious interior, with a smooth gray cement floor. The walls and columns are made of exposed concrete, showcasing a raw and rugged industrial aesthetic. The space is divided by multiple vertical concrete columns and transparent glass partitions. Behind the glass, you can see metal grid railings and staircase structures. In the distance, blurry figures are moving, and light pours evenly from long strips of fluorescent tubes above, creating a bright yet slightly cool illumination effect. Through the glass windows, you can see outdoor greenery and natural light, adding a touch of vitality and softness to the scene. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figures positioned slightly below the center of the frame, occupying the visual focal point. The foreground features a metal tabletop and some benches, the middle ground features the main subject and surrounding environment, and the background is a deep spatial extension and architectural structure, creating a strong sense of interaction. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is mainly cool tones, with evenly distributed lighting and soft shadows, presenting an overall calm, rational, and modern urban atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and detailed, giving it a high-end photographic feel, as if it were a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera, while preserving the subtle realism of everyday life. Like a photographer capturing moments in urban public spaces, it is full of storytelling and artistic tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
