        {
          "id": "krea2-92ebb33e2e0e55e16fb7693e",
          "alias": "单女舞台神秘站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways, her head slightly lowered. The butterfly's wings are semi-transparent, their edges glowing faintly, as if formed by moonlight. She wears a plain, loose long-sleeved garment, with light fabric and natural wrinkles. Her hands are elegant and her fingers are slender, gently supporting the butterfly. The focus is on the moment of interaction between person and butterfly, with her hand and butterfly in the foreground. Light shines diagonally from the lower left, creating a strong backlighting effect. The halo spreads, creating a dreamlike light spot and glow, with a background of dark gray blurred space. Faint clouds or misty textures enhance the ethereal and mysterious atmosphere of the image. The middle shot features the woman's upper body, with her head slightly tilted, highlighting three-dimensionality. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space, arranged diagonally from the lower left to the upper right, enhancing visual guidance. The light source comes from the outside of the frame, simulating natural light or stage spotlights, creating a strong contrast between light and dark. Highlights are concentrated around the hands and butterflies, forming a visual focal point. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic. Full of surreal beauty, the color palette mainly consists of black, white, and gray, accented with warm golden halos. The color layers are rich, the transitions between light and shadow are delicate, giving it an oil painting texture. The details are exquisite, the texture of butterfly wings is clearly visible, and light and shadow create soft shadows and highlights on the fabric, presenting a realistic and dreamlike visual effect. The image style blends digital painting with photographic realism, featuring a slight film graininess and natural depth blur, creating a realistic feel reminiscent of everyday amateur camera shooting. At the same time, artistic light and shadow treatment is retained, and the overall composition conveys a tenderness in loneliness, a fleeting encounter in life, and inner peace and hope. The atmosphere of light and shadow is serene and profound, as if time has frozen in this moment. The entire scene is like a tranquil dream, full of poetic tension and emotional depth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
