        {
          "id": "krea2-8932ec25521162bc36eeb904",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣城市俏皮站立持包",
          "prompt": "She wears a beige V-neck knit top with a cross-wrap design, highlighting an elegant neck line and slender waist. The knit texture is clearly visible, soft and fitting to the figure. She pairs a deep gray-green high-waisted knit midi skirt with vertical ribbed texture, and the waist is decorated with a matching thin bow string, outlining a smooth waistline and long legs. The overall style is simple yet refined. Her left hand gently rests on the black metal railing, her posture natural and relaxed. Her right hand carries a fluffy white plush handbag. The plush is rich and soft, with slightly irregular edges that bring a touch of playfulness and warmth. On her shoulder, she carries a small black matte leather bag crossbody. The shape is simple and neat, with metal fasteners reflecting a subtle sheen. Her earrings are pearl pendants paired with gold chains, and the necklace is a fine chain paired with a rounded white bead. The details highlight her taste. Her makeup is clear and natural, exuding a serene and confident temperament. On the left side of the foreground is a cluster of green agave plants, with sharp and upright leaves and edges glowing a silvery-gray sheen. On the right are several cattail-like plants with spike-like inflorescences of pale yellow that gently sway in the breeze. The background features a modern glass curtain wall structure, reflecting the pale blue sky and the surrounding greenery. The wall is made of large blocks of transparent glass and metal frames, with clean and strong lines. The glass surface exhibits subtle light and shadow changes due to light refraction, and in the distance, blurred outlines of trees and buildings can be faintly seen, creating depth and layering. The overall composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, slightly turned and facing the camera to form a visual focal point. The plants in the foreground and the buildings in the background together create a sense of spatial depth. Further upward to the glass buildings in the background, light and shadow come from the right front, which is soft natural light, possibly the slanting sunlight of evening. The shadows transition naturally, with distinct light and shadow in the folds of clothing, highlighting material details. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, full of the refinement and vibe of urban life, with tones such as beige, Gray-green and black are the main colors, accented with white plush and green plants, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The image texture approaches high-end portrait photography, shot with a professional camera, yet retains the unintentional beauty of everyday life, offering a visual experience that combines realism and artistry",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
