        {
          "id": "krea2-5f80d5d6e9ebe60fb02a0d15",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣雪地坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully reclined on a white velvet sofa, wearing a beige high-neck sleeveless knit dress. The fine, coarse knit patterns were clearly visible, perfectly shaping her figure and outlining soft curves. On her left wrist, she wore a silver geometric cut-out bracelet, her fingers long and slender. Her right hand gently stroked her thigh, showing graceful leg lines, fair and smooth skin. Her bare feet rested lightly on a soft plush blanket, toes slightly bent, appearing authentic and natural. She sat on a sofa covered with a light brown faux fur blanket. The blanket is fluffy and thick, with edges hanging naturally and realistically textured. The sofa backrest is simple and smooth, and next to it sits a plush cushion in the same color with irregular spotted texture, adding layers. In the foreground is a round white coffee table with three goblets on top—two filled with clear liquid, another filled with champagne or sparkling wine, with delicate bubbles rising. Next to it are three unlit white candles, with rounded bodies and smooth surfaces. In the middle is a woman and a sofa, with the composition centered to the right, and the figure occupying the main visual focus. On the left side of the background stands a beautifully decorated white Christmas tree, its trunk covered in a layer of artificial snow. Its branches and leaves are adorned with warm yellow LED string lights, softly flickering to create a cozy atmosphere. It is adorned with white sphere ornaments of various sizes and silver metal fittings. To the right is a classic-style fireplace stand with intricate and exquisite carvings. On the fireplace stands a beige fabric lampshade lamp, its bright and warm light emitting a soft halo. Beside it, three neatly lit white candles are arranged, the flames flickering and the light and shadows flicker, creating a space in a cream-white, Ivory white is the main color, paired with gold and warm yellow light spots, creating a luxurious and elegant holiday atmosphere. Light comes from multiple indoor light sources, including desk lamps, candles, and Christmas tree lights, creating warm backlight and side lighting. Shadow transitions are natural, overall composition is balanced and harmonious. Using medium shots with a slightly top-down perspective, it highlights the relationship between the subject and the environment. The image is richly layered, with moderate color saturation and rich details, presenting a high-end home holiday scene. Like a carefully arranged photo shoot in a professional studio, it carries the warmth of everyday life, as if capturing real moments in a living room with a high-end camera. The image texture is delicate, noise is extremely low, and it presents cinematic visual effects",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
