        {
          "id": "krea2-91006735fccaf8ee341a3823",
          "alias": "单女秋叶困倦站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by an outdoor stone wall, wearing a loose light gray hooded sweatshirt with a collar adorned with thick gray-brown faux fur, presenting a warm and lazy texture. The sweatshirt is designed off-shoulder, naturally revealing one shoulder and collarbone, appearing both casual and slightly sexy. It drapes smoothly over her shoulders and chest, her head slightly lowered, as if sniffing the scent of leaves, her expression calm and focused. The bright red maple leaf in her hand forms a striking color contrast with her gray-white clothing. This adds a visual focal point to the composition. The background is a clear, cloudless blue sky, occupying most of the area and creating a spacious and bright atmosphere. In the upper right corner, several bright red maple leaves extend from outside the painting, as if drifting down from a tree, adding a lively accent to the composition. Below is a stone wall made of irregular stone blocks, rough with a grayish-brown color showing traces of time. The texture is authentic, contrasting materially with the soft clothing of the figures. The overall composition uses a medium perspective. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the painting, with a slightly tilted body and a naturally relaxed posture. The head is slightly tilted, the gaze looks downward, and the light comes from the upper right, creating a soft highlight. At the same time, clear shadows are cast on the stone wall, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The transition between light and shadow is natural, with a moderate contrast of light and shadow, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The entire image has a fresh and bright tone, dominated by blue, gray, and red. The color combinations are harmonious and layered, creating a strong visual impact and rich details. It showcases delicate textures, and the overall style combines the natural beauty of daily life with artistic aesthetic expression. It resembles real photos taken with a professional camera on a clear autumn day, but with a slight surreal filter effect that makes colors more saturated and images more dreamy. It is suitable for fashion portraits or emotion-themed photography, conveying a quiet, gentle, and slightly melancholic autumn mood",
