        {
          "id": "krea2-b8deaab834b618ab614ae177",
          "alias": "单女灰风衣城市站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands indoors, exuding an elegant, intellectual, and modern urban vibe. She wears a dark gray mid-length trench coat with a simple yet layered design. The lapel is wide and crisp, with double-breasted details clearly visible. The waist tie is tied into a bow, highlighting a slender waist. The cuffs have strappy designs that add a fashionable touch. She wears a black fitted top underneath and black knee-high boots below. The overall look is harmonious and unified, showcasing a sophisticated fashion sense. Her hands naturally fold in front of her. In his right hand, he holds the handle of a black leather handbag. The body has a classic square structure, with a smooth and delicate texture. The golden metal fastener reflects a warm luster under the light. The other hand gently rests on the side of the bag. On the wrist, he wears a delicate gold bracelet, a ring on his finger, a simple necklace around his neck, and small earrings. The overall accessory is understated luxury. On the left side of the painting is a small black round table, on which sits a white leather handbag. The bag is square in shape and fitted with gold hardware. Next to it is a bouquet of pale pink roses decorating, with a light gray wall and dark gray vertical striped curtains in the background. The curtains are thick and naturally folded, creating a soft light and shadow effect. Light softly enters from the right, creating a uniform side glow with natural shadow transitions. The overall color scheme is mainly gray, black, and white, accented with gold. The color combination is harmonious and high-end. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the painting, occupying the main visual space. In the foreground is the main figure and the black handbag in her hand. The middle shot includes a white handbag and bouquet, with walls and curtains as the background. The spatial layers are distinct, gradually extending to clothing and handbags, and finally focusing on the background elements. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, with a slight commercial photography texture. Overall, it presents a calm posture after carefully dressing up in daily life, as if taken at home or in a studio with high-quality fashion display photos. Shot with professional cameras and standard lenses, the focal length is moderate and depth of field is well controlled, highlighting the subject while preserving environmental details. The image is clean and tidy. With no unnecessary clutter obstructing the view, it presents a realistic yet slightly idealized aesthetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
