        {
          "id": "krea2-abf3a6ecd643054220fb494e",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙竹林困倦站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an outdoor shaded path, wearing a wide-brimmed straw hat with naturally curled edges, presenting a natural texture and soft shadows. The hat's woven pattern is clearly visible, sunlight filtering through the leaves and creating dappled shadows on the brim, adding a touch of gentleness and laziness. She wears a white spaghetti strap dress with fine vertical stripes, a ruffled embellishment at the chest, a cinched waist, and an A-shaped hem that spreads out in an A-shape. The layered pleats gently sway in the breeze, making the material light and breathable. With a faint sheen, her right hand holds a small light-colored bamboo basket, the edge reinforced with white string, inside a greenish fruit as if ready to taste. She leans slightly to the side, leaning slightly forward, wearing a delicate silver necklace with a small geometric pendant. The overall look is fresh and natural, full of summer countryside vibes. In the foreground is the basket and fruit in her hands, rich in detail. The basket's woven structure, the smooth texture of the fruit's surface, and the slight reflection are all clearly visible. The middle shot is her full-body image, fully presented from head to ankle, with elegant posture and natural movements. The background is a blurry green forest with distinct layers of leaves, interlacing light and shadow to create a soft bokeh effect. In the distance, faint tree trunks and paths on the ground create a sense of depth. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, the head slightly above the horizon, and light and shadow coming from the upper left, simulating natural daylight. The light is soft and even, without strong contrast, but retains subtle shadow transitions. Emphasizing three-dimensionality, the light spots in the background scatter like pearls, enhancing the dreamy atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly white, green, and pale yellow, with fresh and bright colors, moderate saturation, and harmonious contrast between warm and cool tones. The image presents a tranquil, warm, and poetic summer afternoon atmosphere, as if capturing an ordinary yet beautiful moment. It has a strong sense of everyday documentary and artistic beauty, like high-quality portraits taken with a professional camera, while retaining everyday details and realism, suitable for showcasing youth, Themed creations on nature and a beautiful life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
