        {
          "id": "krea2-f012184b6680062a48a9b052",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫椅上愤怒坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors in a black director's chair, wearing a white short-sleeved shirt paired with a light yellow dress, with a matching ribbon tied around the neckline. The overall look is fresh and sweet, full of youthful energy. Her makeup is exquisite, hands folded on her knees, her left hand wearing a colorful beaded bracelet and a silver bracelet, while her right ring finger has a simple ring. She leans forward slightly, her posture elegant and natural. In the background is an open-air stall, with faint red Chinese characters printed on pink curtains. Behind the stall are several transparent glass wine bottles, with clearly visible labels. Next to them is a white insulated barrel and a black menu board covered with colorful text. In the distance, a person in a white polo shirt is looking down at his phone. Sunlight pours in from the upper right of the frame, casting soft shadows on the figures. The light is bright but not glaring, presenting a warm golden tone. The entire scene is bathed in natural outdoor light, with rough cement or stone slabs on the floor and a black wooden table in the foreground. The table reflects blurred images of the surrounding environment. The composition uses a medium angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. The background blur emphasizes the subject, creating a daily, realistic, and slightly artistic atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly white, yellow, and pink, accented with black and metallic tones. The image is rich in layers, details are clear, and it has a strong sense of presence and life, as if captured with a regular camera in a real environment, with a slight film texture and natural noise. It presents a subtle beauty, with natural transitions of light and shadow, soft shadows, and background elements that are blurred but still recognizable, enhancing the realism and immersion of the scene. The overall image conveys a peaceful, comfortable, and vibrant summer afternoon atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
