        {
          "id": "krea2-4bdefd6b3124e3eb7f12c7d3",
          "alias": "冷淡躺注视",
          "prompt": "The overall look blends campus and anime elements, with the main figure occupying the center of the frame slightly to the right. The middle frame features a light gray concrete railing and yellow warning strip, with a black exhaust pipe with a white cap on the left. The background is a gray, overcast sky with layers of city buildings below, and in the distance, the undulating outlines of blue-gray mountains can be seen. The entire scene presents a sense of desolation and loneliness on the edge of the city. The composition uses standard portrait proportions, with the figure fully presented from the waist up, and the visual guide follows the direction of the body and gaze to the upper left of the frame, creating an outward visual tension The light and shadow are evenly scattered natural light on cloudy days with no obvious shadows. The overall tone is cool, mainly gray, white, and black, accented with a touch of red and yellow, creating a quiet yet slightly detached sense of everyday life. It feels like real-life moments captured with a regular phone or portable camera. The image texture is authentic and delicate, with rich details, characterized by slight graininess and low color saturation, presenting an unedited documentary aesthetic. The characters' expressions are subtle, neither fully facing the camera nor completely avoiding it. It creates a contemplative immersive atmosphere, with the surrounding environment somewhat old and rough, the ground cracked and stained, and the guardrails slightly worn, enhancing the realism and storytelling of the scene. The overall atmosphere lies somewhere between everyday life and fantasy, combining traces of real life with virtual character settings, creating a unique visual contrast and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
