        {
          "id": "krea2-59ce2b0a1f1a6671eaa224c0",
          "alias": "单女米风衣广场沉思站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a beige long trench coat stands gracefully in a modern, minimalist indoor setting. She leans slightly to the side, her left hand tucked into the coat pocket, her right hand gently clutching a black handbag. Her posture is calm and confident, showcasing the intellectual charm of a city woman. The trench coat design is classic, with clearly visible details such as the lapel, belt, and double-breasted buttons. The belt is tied into a bow, outlining a slender waistline. The hem of the coat naturally falls to mid-calf, layered with a black tight dress or leggings, and on her feet are high-top black leather boots. The boot surface is smooth and reflective, with a strong texture. On the left side of the front is a small black round side table with a bouquet of pale pink roses. The flowers are delicate and layered with petals. Next to it is a white leather handbag, exquisitely shaped with gold hardware and clean and flowing lines. On the right is an off-white curved sofa with a black-and-white square throw pillow printed with the classic double C logo. The background is a light beige vertical striped wall with dark gray vertical decorative lines adding layering. The overall spatial tone is mainly neutral, creating a sophisticated and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses a center-right main placement of the figure, who occupies the main position in the frame, forming a visual focal point. Background elements are evenly distributed, with symmetrical but not stiff sides on both sides. Light and shadow come from the front left of the image, soft and even, with light shadows that are mild and three-dimensional. The light texture is delicate, presenting a lighting effect similar to a professional studio, while preserving the warmth of daily life. The color scheme is harmonious and unified, with beige, black, white, and light gray forming a classic color scheme, visually comfortable, the overall image exudes a strong sense of fashion and artistic atmosphere, like a carefully composed commercial portrait photographic piece, yet still carrying the authenticity of daily outfit sharing. The camera captures a moment full of life aesthetics, as if you can feel the faint scent of perfume in the air and the quiet afternoon sunlight. The details are rich, from the folds of the trench coat to the reflection of leather boots, from the texture of flowers to the embroidery of the pillow, all clearly visible, creating a visual experience that is both realistic and idealized. It looks like a fashion blogger showcasing her outfits at home—professional yet approachable",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
