        {
          "id": "krea2-bbe785f446e21b45eb3578ea",
          "alias": "单女女仆黑女仆装椅上困倦坐注视",
          "prompt": "She wore a black-and-white maid-style outfit. Her top was a white strapless design, with a thin camisole and two black bows on the chest. There was a white collar at the neckline, also tied with a black bow. She wore a black pleated short skirt with two white stripes along the hem, which was puffy and paired with white over-the-knee stockings. The stockings are lightweight and translucent, with graceful leg lines. The overall look is full of charm and cute vibes. She sits on a dark chair, leaning slightly forward, hands naturally resting on her knees, with an elegant and relaxed posture. The background is a light gray wall, with a blue-toned abstract painting hanging on it. The artwork displays textures resembling waves or water ripples, with rich color layers—blue and white intermingling, soft light and shadow. On the left side of the image, cool-toned blue lights shine on the figure, creating a distinct halo effect. Especially on the left arm and shoulder, bright blue reflections enhance the atmosphere and visual impact of the image. The light mainly comes from the front side, with soft shadows. The composition uses medium shot portraits, with the figure positioned slightly to the center, occupying the main position. The head is slightly tilted, and the gaze is directly on the lens, creating a strong visual direction. The foreground features the upper body and some legs, with clear details. The middle shot includes her full-body posture and some background elements, while the background is the wall and hanging paintings, making it simple yet layered. The overall color scheme is mainly black and white, accented with cool blue light, creating a tranquil, dreamy, and slightly mysterious atmosphere. The contrast between light and shadow is strong, and the blue light source brings a sense of technology and futurism, while preserving the warmth of everyday life. It feels like a photo taken casually at home with ordinary equipment, conveying authentic life and artistic beauty. The image texture is delicate, color saturation is moderate, and details are rich, showcasing youthful vitality and a gentle, sweet temperament. The composition is stable, the perspective is level enough, and the main subject is emphasized. The background blur is well handled, focusing the focus on the characters, creating an overall atmosphere that is both warm and distinctive, full of modern cultural aesthetic features",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
