        {
          "id": "krea2-662c5589fe4d40222ca73739",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙公园微笑坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors in a lush green setting under the sunlight, wearing a pure white lace spaghetti strap dress with a light and flowing hem, featuring delicate cutout patterns and ruffle decorations. The pleats on the shoulders and chest add softness and layering, making the overall look fresh and sweet, as if stepping out of a summer fairy tale; She wears a beige woven straw hat with a wide brim and slightly rough edges, presenting a natural handmade texture. Her fingers were slender and long, her posture gentle and serene, revealing a faint smile. Her expression was calm and slightly shy, as if savoring the leisurely moment; The background is a blurry green forest, with sunlight filtering through the leaves casting mottled shadows, forming large circular light spots (blurred outside focus), creating a dreamlike atmosphere. In the distance, a glimpse of blue sky can be seen, with bright and transparent tones, filling the overall environment with a natural vibe and a cool summer feeling; The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, body slightly turned and head turned toward the camera, creating direct visual communication with the viewer and creating strong visual guidance; The foreground is a clear subject, the middle ground is the local environment and lighting around the figure, and the background is a completely blurred green tree and sky, with clear layers and a strong sense of space; The light comes from the upper right, which is soft natural daylight—bright but not glaring, with delicate shadows. The wrinkles and details on the clothing are clearly visible under the light, the overall transition of light and shadow is natural, with a moderate contrast of light and shadow, creating a warm and bright atmosphere; The colors are mainly white, beige, and pale yellow, complemented by a green background and small yellow flowers, creating a harmonious and vibrant look. The tones are fresh and clean, giving a sense of tranquility, comfort, and healing; The entire scene presents a sense of realism reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment shooting, like moments casually captured in a park or courtyard with a regular camera or phone. Without excessive embellishment, it preserves the authentic details and warmth of daily life. At the same time, through careful set design and composition, it is endowed with artistic beauty and storytelling, allowing one to feel the laziness and beauty of a summer afternoon. It is as if you can hear the gentle breeze rustling the leaves and the distant chirping of birds. It is a poetic and romantic pastoral portrait.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
