        {
          "id": "krea2-13d7ace796fc19df250d455b",
          "alias": "单女白外套教室坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at a desk in the classroom, wearing a white short-sleeved sailor jacket with a deep blue bow at the collar and two dark blue stripes on the cuffs. The background is a typical Japanese or Korean school classroom, with a dark green blackboard on the left, edged with a metal frame Above the blackboard hangs a round clock decorated with white floral patterns. To the right is a large window with a white frame, where soft natural light streams in, filtering through the glass and creating bright spots on the floor and walls. The classroom is lined with multiple wooden tabletops and desks and chairs with gray metal frames. The tabletop has light brown wood grain, and the chairs have wooden backrests. There is storage space under the desks, and some desks hold open notebooks or books. The overall color scheme is mainly white, gray, and wood. Creating a fresh and tranquil atmosphere, the composition uses medium shots, with the person positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, occupying the main visual focus. The foreground features a nearby desk and her legs. The middle ground shows the person's entire body and surrounding desks and chairs. The background features a blackboard and windows. Using depth of field blur to slightly blur the background, highlighting the main subject. Light and shadow come from the right window, creating a side backlighting effect. The light is soft and even, producing slight highlights, while natural shadows are cast on the sides of the body and the desk, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, full of youthful campus vibe. The visuals are delicate and authentic, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retain the natural feel of daily life. The tones are warm and soft, saturation is moderate, details are rich, clothing wrinkles are natural, and light and shadow transitions are smooth, presenting a clean and pure aesthetic with strong narrative and emotional resonance, evoking the innocence of student days. The image style is realistic and slightly idealized, combining artistry with a sense of everyday life, like a tranquil moment in a movie. It captures the most beautiful moments of youth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
