        {
          "id": "krea2-e8f0482cff983ea9acd85aba",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙户外微笑站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an outdoor green lawn, wearing a gentle smile. Her right hand is gently raised, touching the green leaves above, while her left hand hangs naturally. She carries a beige woven bag across her shoulder, wearing a blue-and-white gradient spaghetti strap dress printed with moon, stars, and shell patterns. The hem is layered, edged with delicate lace trim. She wears a white hollow-out knit cardigan with wide, flowing sleeves, and tassel earrings made of transparent crystal and metal pieces. Sunlight streams down from the upper right of the image, passing through the leaves, creates mottled light and shadow, which appear bright yellow-green under the light. The background features blurred green trees and faintly visible white buildings in the distance. The composition uses a mid-ground portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, body slightly tilted, head facing the camera. The light is soft and warm, creating a dreamy afternoon atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly blue, green, and white, fresh and elegant, with rich layers of light and shadow. The leaves and figures in the foreground create a front-and-back contrast. Extending along her line of sight to the sunlit sky, the background blur enhances the subject's prominence, filling the image with youthful energy and romantic atmosphere, as if capturing a peaceful and beautiful moment. Shot with professional photography equipment, high resolution, clear details, natural light and shadow transitions, strong visual impact and artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
