        {
          "id": "krea2-cd921f00bd21c0ccecc81a12",
          "alias": "单女紫礼服花园困倦坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright amid a sea of purple flowers, wearing a light purple strapless gown whose skirt is as light and flowing as a cloud. The dress is adorned with silver three-dimensional embroidered vine and floral patterns, sparkling softly under the soft light, like stars scattered across the night sky. The material of the dress has a semi-transparent sheer texture, with the layered skirt creating a dreamlike layered effect. It naturally drapes over her shoulders, exuding a serene and elegant aura. Her hands are folded on her knees, her fingers long and slender, Her nails are neatly trimmed and painted with light pink nail polish. Around her neck is a simple silver necklace, and the pendant is a petite floral shape, adding a touch of refinement. In the foreground, the hem of her skirt and hands are close-up, with clear details. The middle is her full-body posture, fully visible from head to ankle. The background is made up of a large cluster of purple wisteria flowers hanging down, forming a dreamy floral curtain. Wisteria flowers cluster densely and layeredly, with several clusters of light purple hydrangeas scattered below, their petals full and rounded. Creating color echo and contrast with wisteria, the overall composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame. The shallow depth of field effect blurs the background to highlight the main subject, while preserving the outlines and colors of the background flowers to enhance the sense of space. The light is soft and even, coming from the upper front, simulating natural light or professional lighting effects to create a warm and bright atmosphere. The transitions between light and shadow are delicate, shadows are soft, without harsh shadows. The overall color scheme is mainly purple, paired with light purple, light purple, white, and silver. The colors are harmonious and unified, full of romance and poetry. The images present a tranquil, elegant, and dreamy artistic aesthetic, as if stepping into a fairytale garden party. It has strong visual appeal and emotional resonance, making it suitable for high-end fashion photography, wedding themes, or artistic portrait creation. The style combines realism and surreal fantasy elements, with rich and layered details. The overall image is clean and tidy, with no distractions, presenting a highly refined and perfect visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
