        {
          "id": "krea2-84b6df8bdebab54add987592",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣户外沉思站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors under the shade of lush greenery, wearing an off-white plush hooded knit cardigan with a white spaghetti strap gown underneath. The overall look is simple yet warm, presenting a fresh and natural style that appears especially soft. She slightly tilts her head upward, her expression gentle yet slightly thoughtful, one hand gently touching the brim of her hat, her posture elegant and natural, as if enjoying a tranquil moment bathed in sunlight. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the middle shot, composed using the classic third-division method, with the figure occupying about one-third of the left side of the frame The right side is left open to highlight the sense of extension of the environment and light and shadow. In the foreground, several lush green leaves hang down from the top of the frame, with clearly visible edges and delicate veins. Some leaves are bathed in sunlight, creating a semi-transparent halo effect. The background is a blurry green forest, lush with branches and leaves, presenting different layers of green tones. Light filters through the gaps between the leaves, creating mottled light and shadow, creating soft bokeh in the background, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The entire painting is colored in white, off-white, Light green is the main tone, paired with natural warm yellow sunlight. The warm and harmonious tones visually give a comfortable and relaxing feeling. The light comes from the upper left, which is soft natural light. The sunlight passes through the leaves, creating a distinct backlighting effect, casting a golden halo around the edges of the figure's silhouette, enhancing the three-dimensional and transparent feel of the image. The overall light and shadow distribution is even yet layered, with soft transitions in the shadowed areas without rigid boundaries. The composition uses a low-angle upward shot, making the figure appear more elongated and upright. At the same time, it brings viewers closer and enhances intimacy. Combined with the light spots in the background and the direction of leaves, a natural flow of sight is formed. The overall image presents a quiet and healing atmosphere, as if a beautiful summer afternoon, with a strong Japanese photography style. The details are rich and realistic, like high-quality portraits taken with a professional camera, while retaining the natural atmosphere of daily life. The image texture is delicate, color reproduction is accurate, exposure control is appropriate, and there is no excessive sharpening or distortion Overall, it presents a clean, pure, and vibrant aesthetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
