        {
          "id": "krea2-4295f46f0d44e55389f98491",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙椅上温柔坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sat indoors, naturally draped over her shoulders. She wore a black fitted dress paired with a tailored black blazer. The jacket was open, revealing a deep V-neck design underneath, highlighting her elegant neck line and collarbone contour. She wore a slender silver necklace with a small and delicate pendant, a pair of simple round earrings, and her left hand naturally resting on her thigh, her posture calm and relaxed. Her legs were crossed, wearing black stockings, giving her legs a smooth and graceful shape. She sits on a chair with a black frame and rattan cushion. The backrest and cushion show a natural woven texture, with a light beige wall in the background. On the wall hangs a landscape painting depicting the lakeside at sunset. After the sun slowly sinks into the distant mountains, the sky is dyed with a gradient of orange-red and pale purple. The lake surface shimmers, reflecting the glow of the sky. Distant trees and hills are clearly outlined, and the scene is filled with a peaceful and warm atmosphere. To the right is a small wooden table. The tabletop has a natural wood grain texture. On the table sits a brown glass bottle diffuser, with a white label on the bottle and several black diffuser sticks inserted. Next to it is a transparent glass bottle and a small metal jar. On the table is a round wooden tray, creating a warm and comfortable environment with a modern home style. The composition uses a medium angle angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, slightly turned to the side, head facing the camera, forming a stable visual center. The foreground features details of the main figure and the chair. The middle ground includes portraits, chairs, tables, and paintings on the walls, while the background is the wall and distant shots in the painting. Light and shadow come from soft natural light on the left or indoor lighting, creating a natural transition between light and dark. The shadows are soft and not abrupt, with overall tones dominated by black, brown, and beige, accented with warm oranges and pinks and purples from sunset paintings, creating an elegant, intellectual yet slightly intimate atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a high-resolution camera, rich in detail, distinct layers, with a slight film graininess and natural depth of field, highlighting the main subject while preserving the realism of the environment, presenting a sophisticated moment captured unintentionally in daily life, much like a professional photographer using a full-frame camera with a large-aperture lens to shoot in natural indoor light, creating a realistic and artistic image",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
