        {
          "id": "krea2-afff964e5d74805d3a2969fe",
          "alias": "单女街道沉思站立持手机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a sun-dappled street, turning sideways to the right side of the frame, adding a touch of vitality and naturalness. She wears a light green, semi-transparent long-sleeved knitted top, with clear textures. The lightweight fabric reveals the contours of her skin, appearing fresh and gentle. Around her neck is a thin chain necklace, a small and delicate pendant that glows softly in the sunlight. She holds a phone in both hands, her fingers long and her nails neatly trimmed, her expression calm and focused, revealing a reserved tenderness and contemplation. On her right shoulder, she carries a brown leather handbag. The strap hangs naturally, with a delicate texture that harmonizes with the overall color scheme. In the background is a street shaded by green trees, with tall phoenix trees lining both sides of the road. Their trunks are thick, their bark grayish-brown, and their branches and leaves lush, forming a natural green arcade. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating a dappled and flickering effect. The zebra crossings on the ground are clearly visible, and the black-and-white lines extend into the distance, enhancing the sense of depth in the space. On the left is a building with beige exterior walls. The roof is made of red tiles, with dark sunshades hanging under the eaves. The windows are bright, and the interior lighting is soft. Tables and chairs are faintly seen, creating a warm and cozy atmosphere. A black streetlamp stands beside the tree, with clean lines blending seamlessly with the surroundings. The entire composition uses a medium shot, with the figure occupying about two-thirds of the frame, highlighting the main subject while preserving rich environmental details. The slightly lower angle makes the figure appear more elegant and upright, creating a smooth flow of vision. The light comes from the upper left, representing the warm, slanting afternoon sunlight. Soft contour light is formed, casting light shadows on the ground and clothing. The layers of light and shadow are rich, creating a tranquil and poetic atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly green and warm yellow, creating a fresh, comfortable, and slightly lazy summer afternoon atmosphere. The image has the texture of film photography, with moderate color saturation and rich details, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera. It has a slight graininess and natural exposure transitions, presenting a beautiful moment casually captured in daily life, full of vitality and artistic beauty. The images show no obvious traces of artificial intervention, with a strong sense of realism, as if recording a quiet moment in an ordinary yet touching corner of the city",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
