        {
          "id": "krea2-ffc5cd06c7a92c9f8f2f254f",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道媚态蹲",
          "prompt": "A woman on a city street at night, wearing a pristine white long-sleeved shirt with delicate fabric, a slightly open neckline, and sleeves rolled up to the elbows, presenting a casual yet refined everyday feel. The hem of the shirt is gently tucked into a black short skirt, with a clear waistline outlining an elegant silhouette. Her legs are long, dressed in black stockings and black high heels with intricate laces. The laces at the ankles echo the lines of her legs, adding a touch of mystery and sensuality. She squats sideways by a metal railing, The right hand gently rests on the railing, the left hand hangs naturally, fingers long, and the posture relaxed yet full of tension, gracefully draped over the shoulders as if telling an unfinished story. The background is a dim night scene, with faint streetlights and building silhouettes in the distance. The light is a cool blue tone, creating a quiet yet slightly melancholic atmosphere. The nearby ground reflects a faint light, presenting a moist texture. The metal surface of the railing glows coldly under the blue light. The composition uses a low-angle upward shot to highlight the figure's upright posture and presence. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving space on the right to showcase environmental details. The body curve extends to the legs and feet, creating a smooth line of sight. Light and shadow mainly come from the sides and above. The cool blue main light source envelops the entire scene in a calm, distant, yet captivating atmosphere. The figures in the foreground are sharp and clear, the railings and ground in the middle gradually blur, and the background fully blends into darkness, creating a strong depth of field contrast. The overall scene resembles a classic shot from a movie. It possesses a strong sense of artistry and narrative quality, like high-quality portraits taken with professional photography equipment, while preserving the authentic sense of moments captured by chance in daily life. The colors are mainly cool white, deep black, and blue-gray, rich in layers and exquisite details, presenting a poetic scene of a modern urban woman contemplating or waiting alone at night. The overall composition is full of storytelling and emotional tension, combining beauty with imagination",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
