        {
          "id": "krea2-36f0199136c57b34085d8e84",
          "alias": "单女白连体衣庭院自信站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a tropical courtyard, exuding a serene and confident aura. She wears a white sleeveless V-neck jumpsuit. The top features a pleated design, forming an elegant knit decoration on the chest. The fabric is light and breathable, presenting a natural texture and a slight drape. The bottom is loose wide-leg pants with legs naturally draping to the floor. The overall look is simple, elegant, and stylish. Her right hand naturally holds a black smartphone, while her left hand casually drapes it over a light gray knit cardigan draped over her shoulder. The cardigan is soft and fluffy, with slightly rolled-up cuffs, giving off a casual and lazy vibe. She carries a woven rattan handbag across her shoulder, its beige hue giving it a rugged and natural texture that harmonizes with the overall style. She stands beside a square flowerbed made of white stone, planted with lush greenery, including tall palm trees and broad-leaved dragon blood trees, lush and green. The background is a white wall and a door with bamboo blinds. The bamboo curtain's texture is clear, presenting a warm brownish-yellow tone. Sunlight pours in from the upper left of the painting, creating a soft side light that creates a warm and fresh atmosphere. The floor is paved with light gray marble tiles, with natural patterns reflecting faint light. The composition uses a medium shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the right, leaving ample negative space on the left side, highlighting the main subject while also showcasing the layering of the environment. Several large leaves extend into the foreground at the edges, adding visual depth and a natural atmosphere. The middle ground features the figure and surrounding plants, while the background is the architectural structure. This creates a clear spatial depth, with visual guidance naturally directed to the right side of the frame through the characters' gaze and body posture. At the same time, details like the phone and bag add a touch of everyday fun to the image. The overall color palette is mainly white, beige, green, and brown, harmoniously unified to create a comfortable, relaxed, and vacation-style atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains the warmth of everyday life. The lighting is soft and even, without strong contrasts. It presents a warm and bright summer afternoon atmosphere, with the entire scene filled with leisure, ease, and natural beauty. It feels as if you can feel the rustling of leaves in the breeze and the soft sound of distant waves, making one yearn for this simple yet beautiful lifestyle",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
