        {
          "id": "krea2-354ee7cf72fcdd413ec8f9b9",
          "alias": "单女绿连衣裙森林站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman in a sun-dappled forest, naturally draped over her shoulders and chest, wearing a wreath made of white daisies and blue forget-me-nots, adorned with light blue fabric decorative bands that echo her light green floral spaghetti strap dress. The dress is lightweight and translucent, printed with small white and blue floral patterns, with delicate ruffles at the neckline. Her fingers are long, her nails painted pale pink. The background is a blurry deep green forest, with thick and upright trunks. Layers of leaves form a dense green shade, sunlight streaming through the gaps in the leaves, creating mottled light and soft shadows on the ground and the figure. In the foreground is a cluster of blooming blue forget-me-nots and white flowers. The flowers are fresh and natural, with lush foliage that echoes the floral elements on the figure. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of center of the frame, head slightly tilted. The gaze gently gazes at the lens, creating a strong visual direction. The overall image tones are fresh and bright, mainly green, blue, and white, creating a tranquil, romantic, and vibrant atmosphere. The lighting effects are delicate and soft, with bright highlights and natural transitions in shadows, presenting a combination of professional studio lighting and natural light, with a slight film texture and graininess, as if shot with an old-fashioned film camera, while retaining the clarity of modern high-definition digital imaging. There is a slight vignetting effect at the edges of the frame, enhancing the focus of the central subject. The color saturation is moderate, with a touch of retro filter style. The overall atmosphere is like a fairy-tale encounter on a summer afternoon, full of youthful energy and poetic beauty",
