        {
          "id": "krea2-37965136128e23f5b12531f5",
          "alias": "单女白外套户外微笑倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman in the outdoor environment at dusk or night, displaying natural dynamism and vitality. She slightly tilts her head back, wearing a radiant smile, full of youthful energy and happiness. She wears an off-white baseball jacket with colorful rainbow patterns and white lettering embroidery, paired with a white top underneath. The overall look is casual and fashionable, with close-ups of the figure, the head slightly tilted, forming a beautiful diagonal composition. The background is a blurred night sky and distant water. Scattered city lights reflect on the water's surface, forming soft light spots. On the left side, dark silhouettes of trees add depth and layering to the image. The light comes from a position slightly below the front of the figure, like a camera flash or handheld fill light, while preserving natural shadow transitions to create a warm and dreamy atmosphere. The overall tone leans cold, mainly gray-blue, creating a strong contrast between warm and cool tones and enhancing visual impact. The image features high resolution, ultra-fine detail, and cinematic lighting effects. It feels as if shot with professional photography equipment, yet still carries the intimacy and realism of everyday amateur mobile photography. It captures a fleeting natural state, rich in storytelling and emotional tension. The edges of the frame show slight film graininess and lens halo, simulating real camera imaging and enhancing artistic atmosphere and nostalgia. Overall, it presents a youthful, free-spirited, hopeful, and beautiful visual style",
