        {
          "id": "krea2-da64217f8301ef05d6ac77fc",
          "alias": "单女绿连衣裙忧伤",
          "prompt": "She wears a lightweight, translucent green spaghetti strap tulle dress made of material as translucent as cicada wings, subtly revealing the contours of her skin. The earrings are made of multiple layers of chains and small gemstones, with star-shaped decorations at the top. As her head turns slightly, they shimmer faintly, giving the overall look an elegant look full of classical Eastern charm. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the composition, using close-up shots. The background is a blurred forest environment, with interlaced trees and leaves, and mottled light and shadow, presenting a layered blend of deep green and dark green. In the distance, a few rays of sunlight shine through the canopy, forming soft beams of light that create a quiet and mysterious atmosphere. The details are rich and texture clear. The middle ground features the figure's body and part of the background, blending solid and void, while the background is a completely blurred forest scene, enhancing the spatial depth of the painting. The dangling effect of the earrings also draws attention. Light and shadow come from above and sides. The cool-toned blue and purple main lights create a tranquil atmosphere at night or dusk, creating a warm contrast that enhances three-dimensionality. The overall image has a cinematic texture, as if shot with professional photography equipment, yet still retains the delicacy and perfection of AI-generated quality. The color saturation is moderate, transitions are natural, and the details are extremely finely handled. The overall atmosphere is both ethereal and slightly melancholic, as if you are deep within a dreamlike forest, full of poetry and artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
