        {
          "id": "krea2-1bac0207b187eddf9750c8bd",
          "alias": "单女棕毛衣窗边愤怒坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window indoors, sunlight streaming in from the left, creating a warm, soft backlight effect that looks light and layered. She wears a white thin-strap inner layer and a loose dark brown knit cardigan. The cardigan is casually draped over her shoulders, revealing her collarbones and shoulder line. She wears a light-colored short skirt with small green floral patterns, the hem hanging naturally with slight pleats. The background is a cozy home environment. On the left is a window with a clearly visible frame, letting in bright natural light. At the back right is a wooden bookshelf with several books, a red apple, and some blurred decorations. One book has a colorful cover with the word \"Biscuit\" faintly visible. In front of the bookshelf is an old TV or radio, though the surface is slightly worn, adding a touch of retro charm. The entire scene is shot at a low angle, with the figure occupying the center to the right. The composition is full and layered. The foreground features the figure's body and headphones, while the background features bookshelves and window areas. Visual guidance starts from the light source in the upper left, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. Shadows gently fall on the sides of the body and the folds of clothing. The overall atmosphere is warm, tranquil, and full of life. The color palette is mainly warm yellow and off-white, accented with brown and light green, creating a comfortable feeling as if afternoon sunlight fills the room. The image is delicate and detailed, It feels as if a regular camera was used to capture the real environment, blending the documentary feel of daily life with artistic beauty. The lighting is soft and not glaring, and the color saturation is moderate, presenting a natural and authentic photographic style. At the same time, it retains a moderate amount of blur, making the subject stand out and the background is blurred, enhancing spatial depth. The overall image conveys a gentle, healing, lazy, and slightly artistic youthful atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
