        {
          "id": "krea2-761c026e16362071e9b5f845",
          "alias": "单女严肃站立注视",
          "prompt": "The earrings resemble ancient wind chimes, with intricate details. Swaying gently in the breeze, she holds a long sword with a hilt wrapped in brown woven cord. The scabbard is faintly visible, and she holds the hilt firmly. The red Hanfu she wears is made of silk, with a smooth texture. The collar is embroidered with geometric and floral patterns alternating gold and white. The neckline and cuffs are decorated with intricate brocade edges, with fine stitching and rich color layers. The design blends classical aesthetics with modern aesthetics. The background is blended with a soft gray-green tone, resembling the blurred outlines of mountains or ancient buildings. Distant scenes are hazy, creating a shallow depth effect that highlights the main figure. Light comes from the left front, simulating natural daylight and creating a contrast of light and shadow. Shadows fall on the sides of the neck and shoulders, creating a three-dimensional effect. The composition uses close-ups, with the characters occupying most of the space, heads slightly tilted, and gazes directly at the camera, creating strong visual guidance. The center of the composition is slightly right, with blank areas to enhance the sense of breath. The colors are mainly warm tones, with bright red clothing creating a striking contrast with the cool background. Silver metallic accessories and brown sword hilts add layers to the image, with natural light and shadow transitions, creating a calm and story-rich atmosphere. It carries both the classical charm of the East and the delicate texture of modern photography, resembling a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera, yet preserving the authentic moments casually captured in daily life. The images present a subtle balance between artistic creation and life documentation, combining meticulously arranged beauty with a genuine, tangible warmth. The details are rich and the texture clear—from the carving of the earrings to the subtle movements of the fingers, every detail stands up to scrutiny, and the entire scene is full of poetry and tension. It makes one imagine the story behind her—whether she is a heroine of the martial world, a character in a period drama, or perhaps someone who suddenly bursts into the camera on an ordinary afternoon. The visual language is subtle and profound, provoking the imagination.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
