        {
          "id": "krea2-a90a376bedd2c2eba68be698",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣秋叶站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors in autumn, wearing a beige knit cardigan paired with a white lace dress. Her expression reveals complete enjoyment of the present moment and inner peace. Her hands are gently open, palms facing upward, as if catching a few golden and orange-red autumn leaves drifting down from the sky. One leaf drifts slowly past her hand, another falls on her left arm, and the rest scatters across her chest and arm, creating a dynamic sense of balance Her posture is naturally relaxed, her body slightly leaning forward, her head slightly tilted, presenting an innocent, unadorned, and pure beauty. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the composition, with the figure occupying about two-thirds of the frame's height, forming the visual focal point. In the foreground, a clear female figure and the fallen leaves in her hand are in the background. In the middle ground, trees and light in the blurred background create a soft blurred effect. The green and brown intertwined leaves create mottled light and shadow under the light. In the distance, some blurry architectural outlines or road traces can be faintly seen, but all are deeply blurred to create a strong sense of depth. The composition uses classic center shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the center, and the shallow depth of field highlights the subject, allowing the background to fully blend into the atmosphere. This creates a flowing path from the upper left to the lower right, enhancing the dynamic and storytelling of the composition. Light comes from the sides and rear, typical of afternoon oblique light. The warm yellow sunlight penetrates through the gaps in the leaves, creating soft backlight and contour light, with rich layers of light and shadow. There are both bright highlights and delicate shadow transitions, creating an overall atmosphere that is warm, romantic, and poetic, carrying a tranquil beauty of everyday life. It's like capturing a real moment with an old film camera. The lens shakes slightly, color saturation is slightly low, with slight graininess and color shift, simulating the texture of real photography. The tones are mainly warm yellow, off-white, and light brown, complemented by orange-red and deep brown leaves, forming a harmonious autumn palette. The overall image presents a gentle and healing atmosphere. It lets you feel the changing seasons and the beautiful moments of life, as if time has stood still in this moment, with only the wind, leaves, and smiles silently telling the story of autumn",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
