        {
          "id": "krea2-f0a1f46d48923749def2f7c9",
          "alias": "单女全裸白T恤城市冷淡躺",
          "prompt": "A woman lies on her side on a soft white sheet, wearing a simple white crew-neck T-shirt. The fabric naturally drapes into soft pleats, with slightly rolled cuffs revealing slender arm lines. The overall look presents a lazy yet casual homely vibe, with a golden-brown texture. The rest is dyed a deep blue by cool blue light, adding a touch of rebelliousness and authenticity. Her fingers are long, and her nails are painted in a subtle off-white or light nude color, supporting her head with graceful posture and a natural pink hue, with a slight wildness and a touch of contemplation and gentleness in the expression, as if immersed in deep memories or fantasies in the quiet of night. The middle shot extends to the lower half of the body, reclining and the white bedding covering the body. The background is completely integrated into a pure black blurred space, with no distractions, making the subject stand out even more. The lighting and shadow design is highly dramatic On the left side, cool blue LED lights are projected from the side, creating a strong contrast between light and dark; on the right, warm yellow light sources simulate candlelight or desk lamp effects. These two distinctly different color temperatures intertwine and collide, creating a visual contrast of warm and cool tones that enhance the layering and artistic tension of the image. The light edges transition smoothly, without rigid boundaries, allowing colors to blend naturally. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, intimate, and emotionally moving, like a late-night self-conversation. The image texture is delicate, It features a grainy texture and slight noise similar to film photography, simulating the realism of everyday phone or portable camera shooting. The blur outside of focus is natural, the background is completely out of focus, guiding the viewer's attention to emotional expression. The overall color palette is mainly black, white, blue, and yellow, forming an extremely simple yet sophisticated color combination. The images present a poetic moment from the life of modern urban youth, combining fashion with a sense of everyday life, full of storytelling and psychological depth, as if taken from a private diary. It makes people want to explore her inner world.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
