        {
          "id": "krea2-13ff525309610be2f120033a",
          "alias": "单女黑和服站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a black kimono with bright yellow trim on the collar and cuffs, and colorful floral patterns embroidered on the shoulders and sleeves, mainly in pink, purple, and green. The lines are delicate and smooth, presenting the delicate beauty of traditional Japanese embroidery. She stands beside a vintage-style bicycle, gently holding the handlebars with both hands. The handlebars are wood-brown, with metallic bells and brake mechanisms. The orange plastic basket is located below the frame, with clearly visible woven patterns, and the rim of the frame is slightly glossy. She adds a touch of liveliness and softness. She wears a small silver earring and a thin chain necklace, with details revealing a minimalist fashion vibe. The background is a blurred green vegetation, sunlight filters through the leaves, casting dappled light and shadow, creating a soft bokeh effect. The light spots vary in size and are evenly distributed, creating a peaceful and warm atmosphere. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the main part of the frame, extending from the lower left corner to the upper right corner, forming a diagonal composition. Highlighting its expression and emotion, the light comes from a diagonal top, belonging to natural light, soft and even, with subtle shadows that enhance the sense of depth. The overall color scheme is mainly green and black, accented with yellow and orange, creating a vivid and harmonious color contrast. The image has a strong visual impact and artistic appeal, as if capturing a quiet and beautiful moment on a summer afternoon, like images taken with an old film camera, with a slight graininess and warm filter effect. The lens focal length is set to 85mm, and the aperture is set to f/. 1.8 achieves a shallow depth of field effect, completely blurring the background and making the subject clear and prominent, while preserving subtle light and shadow changes and color transitions from the real environment. The overall atmosphere is warm and healing, full of youthful energy and a sense of life, evoking a relaxed and pleasant everyday beauty",
