        {
          "id": "krea2-71df3e9cbca31b01be3f8a64",
          "alias": "单女短裙广场神秘站立演奏",
          "prompt": "A female character dressed in exquisite, fantasy style stands in the city's outdoor plaza, wearing a silver headpiece adorned with blue gemstones on her head. The headpiece is uniquely designed, resembling some mysterious totem or magical device. Round metal earrings hang, and her overall makeup is exquisite. Her outfit is mainly in white and light purple tones. Her top features a navel design, with wide white fabric decorations on the shoulders. The chest is adorned with light purple butterfly-shaped fabric, and the waist is hollowed out and secured with white cloth strips, creating a unique layered effect. The skirt hem is made of multiple layers of lightweight white tulle, edged with white petal-shaped fabric pieces that gently flutter in the breeze. On her arm are multi-layered silver metal bracelets and a wide bracelet set with blue gemstones. Her wrist is slightly bent, palm facing the camera, elegant and expressive. The background is a modern urban architectural complex, with towering skyscrapers and glass curtain walls reflecting intense sunlight, creating a contrasting effect of light and shadow. In the distance, a white van and a person wearing a yellow safety helmet, A worker wearing a reflective vest is walking. On the left side of the painting is a red cart. The ground is a plaza paved with gray stone slabs, and the overall lighting is bright. Sunlight pours in from above, creating soft highlights and shadows on the figure, creating a strong sense of depth and authenticity. The foreground highlights the subject, while the middle shot shows their full posture and surrounding environmental details. The background uses blur to weaken the building's outline, focusing the focus on the characters and creating an atmosphere of invitation or interaction. The lighting and shadow are bright and transparent, with a strong sense of daytime outdoors. Overall, it presents an artistic style that blends fantasy and reality, resembling a role-playing scene from a large comic convention or street event. The visuals are delicate and the color saturation is moderate, combining the aesthetic features of anime characters with the realism of everyday shooting, as if you could casually capture those moments with a regular camera. Yet it captures an extraordinary and extraordinary beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
