        {
          "id": "krea2-9e467f6ea911dbe4b1d9e136",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤小巷愤怒站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the glass railing on a high-rise rooftop, looking natural and lively, exuding a gentle yet slightly mysterious expression. She wears a beige tight strapless top paired with a black lace-trimmed camisole with black lace bows, adding a touch of retro and sexy charm. Over it, she casually drapes a gray denim jacket with rolled-up sleeves and loose buttons, presenting a laid-back street style. Around her neck are two silver necklaces—one is a thin chain with a small pendant. The other is a slightly thicker chain with a cross-shaped metal pendant, rich in detail and layered. Her posture is slightly turned to the side, shoulders relaxed, arms naturally hanging down, body slightly leaning forward, as if about to approach the camera, creating an intimate and interactive visual effect. The foreground shows the main figure occupying most of the frame, fully visible from above the chest to the head. The composition uses medium to close shots, with a vast city skyline in the background, towering buildings in the distance, and the complex clearly visible under the clear blue sky and white clouds. Some building outlines are slightly blurred due to distance, creating a soft depth effect. The sky is light blue, dotted with a few fluffy white clouds. The overall atmosphere is bright and open, with plenty of sunlight but not glaring. Light comes from above, and shadows transition naturally, highlighting skin texture and clothing folds, enhancing three-dimensionality. The overall tone of the painting leans toward coolness, mainly blue, gray, and beige. The meeting of gaze creates a strong emotional connection that then spreads throughout the clothing details. The composition is stable and balanced, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame. The left side space is reserved to showcase the cityscape, creating visual balance and depth. Overall, it presents an atmosphere where urban fashion and youthful vitality blend together, combining artistic beauty with the realism of everyday life. It feels like an outdoor portrait shot with a professional camera, featuring cinematic quality and delicate textures, while preserving subtle dynamic elements from the natural environment, creating an image style that is both refined and full of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
