        {
          "id": "krea2-516b187c4bf5d455ce275284",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道持包",
          "prompt": "She wears a pure white long-sleeved shirt with a slightly open collar and naturally falling cuffs. She carries a classic brown monogram handbag on her shoulder, made of cowhide with a light brown leather strap. On the bag hangs a small white plush bear charm. In her right hand, she gently holds a beige teddy bear dressed in blue denim overalls and tied with a red bow. She turns sideways and smiles back. Revealing neat white teeth, sunlight slanted down from above. On both sides of the street were old residential buildings, with mottled walls and worn-out windows. Some windows had iron railings, and the buildings were grayish-brown, giving a somewhat vintage feel. On the left was a small shop, with shelves at the entrance displaying various teddy bear plushies—some dressed in different outfits, some wearing hats. Above the shops hung deep red sunshades, and beneath the canopy was a warm yellow bulb, illuminating the goods and contrasting with the natural light outside. The shop sign has blurry Chinese characters, and the building on the right is equally old. Clothes are drying outside the balcony, power lines crisscross, and a few green leaves hang overhead, adding a touch of vitality. The floor is a gray cement pavement, with sunlight casting mottled shadows of trees and buildings. The overall composition centers on the figure, using close-up shots. The person is positioned slightly to the right, facing the camera, creating a friendly and natural interaction. The background is slightly blurred, highlighting the main subject, and the lighting effect is obvious. Sunlight shines from above and sides, creating strong contrasts of light and dark, while shadows fall on the sides of the body and the ground. The overall atmosphere is warm and bright, full of life and a sense of daily life. The colors are harmonious and layered, presenting a realistic, natural, and slightly nostalgic urban street photography style, as if casually capturing moments with a regular camera under the afternoon sun, full of story and warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
