        {
          "id": "krea2-e35a7c0c47445c4333bd1f76",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣困倦站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A close-up of a woman's half-length looks fresh and natural, presenting a delicate sheen like petals just opening in spring. She wears an off-white hollow-out knit camisole with clearly visible fabric texture, fine stitching, a V-neck design that accentuates the neckline, slender shoulder straps, and multiple brightly colored three-dimensional floral decorations on the chest, including pink, yellow, white, and purple flowers, all lifelike in shape The petals are layered and accented with green leaves. These flowers are neatly arranged on her chest and shoulders, adding a touch of pastoral poetry and romance. She wears a pair of pink round earrings, made by stacking two pink spheres of varying sizes. The small ball at the top has a slight pearl texture, while the larger sphere below has a smooth surface and uniform color. The earrings reflect a soft sheen in the light, complementing the overall look. The background is a blurred pale blue sky and faint green plant outlines. The blur effect creates a strong depth of field effect, making the main figure stand out more. In the lower right corner of the foreground, a large green leaf extends diagonally into the frame, with clear edges and visible vein patterns. The leaf is naturally curved, adding layers and spatial depth to the image. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, head slightly tilted, and gaze toward the camera, creating a warm and natural interactive feel. Light comes from the upper front, representing soft natural light, with sunlight streaming down from above. The rich layers of light and shadow enhance the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color palette is mainly soft pink, white, blue, and green, with harmonious and unified color combinations that create a warm, bright, and fresh spring atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and richly detailed, offering strong visual appeal, as if it were a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera, featuring slight film graininess and natural color saturation, presenting an artistic beauty that is both realistic and slightly dreamy. The entire image is filled with youthful energy and the beauty of life. It evokes a sense of tranquility and joyful emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
