        {
          "id": "krea2-14fefd06689c4ebc9014dec3",
          "alias": "单女绿外套茶室忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wore traditional Hanfu in light blue and white, with light and flowing fabric, presenting a silky sheen. She wore a translucent light green sheer jacket over it, with wide sleeves and delicate frog buttons and tassel decorations at the neckline. On her wrist, she wore a simple bead necklace, and her left hand rested naturally on her knee, her posture elegant and composed. Sitting on a seat by a dark wooden window, her body slightly tilted, presenting a serene and restrained classical beauty. In the center is the dark wooden windowsill where she sits, along with a tray of tea sets. On the tray is a transparent glass teapot filled with golden tea soup, beside it are black teacups, pastries, and blue-and-white porcelain jars. Through the background of the carved wooden window frame, you can see layers of gray tile rooftops, with exquisitely carved flying eaves and upturned corners under the eaves. In the distance, green trees provide shade, the sky is gloomy, and the light is soft and even. The overall composition combines close-ups and mid-shot environments. The figures are positioned slightly to the left of the frame, forming the visual focal point. The geometric lines of the window frame divide the image into multiple layers, guiding the gaze from the figures to the scene outside. The soft light and shadow create a tranquil and peaceful atmosphere. The color tones are mainly blue-gray, off-white, and ink-black, complemented by the warm yellow of the tea soup and the vibrant green of green plants. The colors are harmonious and unified, carrying a strong classical Eastern charm and poetic beauty, as if capturing a tranquil moment in a tea room on a Jiangnan water town afternoon. It has a slight film texture and the realism of everyday amateur equipment, rich in detail, well-layered, full of storytelling and artistic atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
