        {
          "id": "krea2-a759b603e9557c46fe609a95",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙露营地愤怒坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a rattan chair on an outdoor wooden platform, wearing an elegant white sleeveless V-neck dress with a naturally draped hem, a delicate slit at the waist, revealing a slender waistline. The overall look is simple yet elegant. She leans slightly to the side, her left hand naturally resting on the wooden tabletop, several silver woven bracelets on her wrist, a simple silver necklace around her neck, a delicate leaf-shaped pendant, and delicate earrings. Her makeup is fresh and natural, creating a peaceful and charming atmosphere. In the foreground is a rectangular table made from dark wooden strips, with clear texture and a naturally warm texture. The table's edges form a diagonal composition with the figures' bodies. The vegetation displays yellow-green tones, the sky is deep blue, with a few fluffy white clouds floating in the air. The sunlight is bright but not glaring, and the light softly shines on the scene, bringing a warm golden tone to the entire scene. At the back right of the painting is a row of tent-style cabins built from natural logs, with a roof covered with beige canvas and simply fenced with ropes, presenting a typical outdoor vacation camp style. Above is a huge beige sunshade supported by metal frames. The tarpaulin surface features natural folds and fine textures, providing shade for the figures. The composition combines close-up and distant shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, occupying the visual focal point. The frame structure formed by the sunshade frames the main subject. This enhances the sense of layering and depth in the image. Light and shadow shine from the upper right, highlighting the three-dimensional contours. At the same time, fine parallel shadows are cast on the wooden tabletop, enhancing the sense of realism in the space. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, off-white, and light green, creating a leisurely, comfortable, and slightly exotic summer afternoon atmosphere. The details are rich, from the folds of the characters' clothing to the grain of the wood and the undulating grasslands in the distance, all are clearly distinguishable, creating a strong sense of presence and a sense of everyday life. It feels like a real photo taken with a professional camera, or like a beautiful moment casually captured in daily life. The images are full of poetry and romance, allowing people to feel the harmonious blend of nature and humanity",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
