        {
          "id": "krea2-5b2481cd1128cfd05c3ea237",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙花园站立回眸",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a lush garden, adding a touch of gentleness and vitality. She wears a light, flowing white slip dress with an irregular hem and distinct layers. The waist features pleated details, and the skirt features delicate lace textures and hollow-out patterns. The hem edges are wavy, gently swaying in the wind, creating a romantic and beautiful atmosphere. Her right hand gently supports a blooming sunflower, its flowers golden and full. The center of the flower head is deep brown, with petals layered and a realistic texture. Her left hand hangs naturally, fingers are slender, her posture elegant, body slightly tilted, head looking back at the camera. The overall composition centers on the figure, occupying the main position and forming a visual focal point. In the foreground is a large number of blooming hydrangeas, their color gradient from pale pink to light purple. The flowers are dense and rounded, with green leaves set off among them. The leaves are broad and have clear veins, and some leaf edges glow faintly under the light. In the middle are more layered hydrangeas and several tall sunflowers, some fully in bloom, others still budding, with tall branches and thick stems. The background is a dense wall of green plants, with leaves of varying sizes and rich layers. Above, you can see a corner of a wooden pavilion built from solid wood, with clear beams and railings that display a natural brownish-yellow tone. The light and shadow effects are strong, with sunlight slanting down from the upper right, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The left side is in soft shadows, with light filtering through the leaves. Dappled light spots are cast on the ground and flowers, enhancing the sense of space and realism. The overall atmosphere is warm and bright, full of summer vitality. The color palette is mainly white, pink, and green, accented with yellow, creating a harmonious and unified color effect. The composition has a strong visual guiding effect, then spreads to the surrounding lush flower beds. The composition combines close-ups with medium and long shots, using flowers as a frame to frame the figures, creating a \"person among flowers\" mood. The shooting angle slightly tilts upward to highlight the petite and gentle beauty of the figures. At the same time, it showcases the vastness and richness of the environment, with an overall style that combines artistic beauty with the warmth of everyday life. It feels like a snapshot casually taken with a regular camera on a sunny afternoon. The image quality is delicate, details rich, color saturation moderate, and a slight film graininess, creating a warm and nostalgic atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
