        {
          "id": "krea2-203603c62627a6d2bf05d1f2",
          "alias": "单女棕毛衣屋顶沉思站立过肩",
          "prompt": "She stands slightly sideways, her posture elegant and natural. She wears a dark brown sleeveless knit top with a cutout design at the chest, accentuating her slender collarbones. She wears black skinny pants and a light green jacket casually draped over her shoulders. She carries a black cloth bag in her right hand, a brown baseball cap in her left, and a brown leather wristband on her wrist. The overall outfit is simple, stylish, and full of summer vibes. In the foreground is the vertical lines of a metal railing, with slight rust and traces of time on its surface, presenting a realistic sense of life. The railing divides the scene into upper and lower parts, forming visual guidance. The middle ground features a female subject, positioned slightly in the middle right of the frame, slightly tilted and gazing to the left, creating an atmosphere of contemplation or waiting. The background is a vast blue ocean, with the water gradient from light blue to deep blue from near to far, with waves rolling with white foam constantly crashing against the shore. The distant coastline is clearly visible, densely packed with buildings. The rooftops are mostly white or light-toned, stretching in an orderly manner up to the hills. The sky is clear and cloudless, showing a pure pale blue. The sunlight is abundant and bright, with light shining down from the upper right, casting clear shadows on the railings and the ground. The contrast of light and shadow is sharp but not too strong, creating an overall warm and tranquil atmosphere, as if on a leisurely afternoon. The composition uses the rule of thirds, with the figure occupying the right third of the painting. A large amount of space is reserved for the expansive sea view, enhancing the depth and breathing of the image. The lens is a mid-focal length portrait lens with a slight depth blur effect, making the sea and distant buildings in the background appear slightly blurred, highlighting the clarity of the main subjects while preserving the realism of the environment. The colors are mainly blue and white, complemented by brown, green, and black clothing to create a harmonious and layered color scheme. The overall image presents a beautiful moment casually captured in daily life. For example, travel snapshots taken with a regular digital camera or phone carry a natural, approachable documentary style.",
