        {
          "id": "krea2-801ac73abd861c92dffe4c0c",
          "alias": "单女绿毛衣街道冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an escalator in a modern city, her makeup delicate and layered, exuding a calm and confident aura. Her body leans slightly forward, her left hand lightly resting on the edge of the escalator, her right hand naturally resting near her knee. She wears an olive green off-shoulder knit cardigan with a white camisole underneath, paired with loose cargo pants in matching tones with slightly pleated legs. She wears platform white sneakers with complex textures and the brand logo \"Ocat™.\" The overall style blends street fashion with urban leisure. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left center of the foreground, with a relaxed yet tense posture. The composition uses a medium shot, with the characters occupying the main part of the frame. The background features towering modern skyscrapers, and the glass curtain wall reflects the light and shadows of the sky, creating rich geometric lines and mirror effects. The escalator's metal structure and black rubber pedals extend diagonally, guiding the viewer from the foreground to the middle ground and background. Transparent glass railings on both sides of the escalator frame the cityscape, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. Light comes from directly above to the right, with soft and even natural light and delicate shadows. The overall atmosphere is bright and transparent, full of urban modernity and futuristic energy. The colors are mainly cool gray-blue, creating a visual contrast. The image texture is delicate and authentic, as if shot with professional photography equipment, with a strong cinematic and artistic aesthetic. It preserves the realism of everyday snapshots, with a balanced composition and dynamic feel, harmonious coexistence between people and environment, creating a tranquil yet powerful urban aesthetic",
