        {
          "id": "krea2-a85e2f2d9219ec238ea4d6ba",
          "alias": "单女白外套高塔忧伤站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the lake, a gentle breeze blowing. She wears an off-white tweed short jacket with a classic design, gold buttons on the lapel, two flap pockets on the chest, and two black stripes on the cuffs. She wears a white knit sweater underneath and black high-waisted shorts. The overall look is fashionable and elegant. She carries a silver sequin handbag in her right hand and extends her left hand toward the right side of the frame, striking a relaxed and natural pose with a playful and confident expression. Around her neck is a thin chain necklace adorned with a small pendant. The foreground features a female subject, occupying the left central position. The composition uses a third-division method: the figure is positioned in the left one-third, leaving space on the right for the arm to extend. The background is a wide lake surface, with gray-blue water shimmering and calm. Several waterfowl swim in the distance, and across the lake are rolling mountains with soft contours shrouded in mist. At the foot of the mountains, city buildings and skyscrapers are arranged in an orderly manner, faintly revealing the modern urban landscape. The sky is covered with heavy clouds, presenting gray-blue tones and soft, even lighting, with no obvious shadows, it is diffused light on cloudy or evening days. The overall atmosphere is calm and slightly melancholic, with an artistic and lifelike vibe. The color palette is mainly cool, with off-white, gray-blue, and black forming contrasts. The visual layers are distinct, light and shadow transitions naturally, depth of field gradually blurs from near to far, highlighting the main subject. The lake and distant mountains in the background appear slightly blurred, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The camera angle is level-up and slightly upright, making the figure appear more upright and well-balanced. The characters' movements blend with the environment, conveying a leisurely and carefree lifestyle, as if capturing a moment from a trip. It feels authentic as daily documentation while maintaining artistic beauty. The overall style blends fashion and nature, making it suitable for social media sharing, creating a fresh, refined, gentle, and intellectual atmosphere. The details are rich, color saturation is moderate, and it does not appear overexposed or too dark, presenting a truly natural visual texture. The images appear as if taken outdoors under natural light with a professional camera. However, it retains the slight noise and realism common to amateur equipment, with compositions rich in storytelling and visual flow. The overall image is quiet and vivid, full of poetry and a sense of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
