        {
          "id": "krea2-62b8df2e475b47599ef45951",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙困倦坐侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a white strap dress with colorful floral patterns. The material is light and flowing, printed with pink, blue, yellow, and purple flowers and green leaves. The patterns are naturally and vividly distributed, the skirt is loose and comfortable, and one side slit reveals a slender leg line. The shoulders are decorated with ruffles, and the straps are slender. The overall look is elegant and romantic. She sits barefoot on the grass, her feet naturally crossed. Her toes were painted a pale red nail polish, her posture relaxed and composed. Her left hand gently touched the flowers beside her, her right hand naturally resting at her side, her body slightly leaning forward, head slightly tilted, her expression calm and focused. She wore a string of pearl necklaces adorned with sparkling diamonds or crystals, and delicate pearl earrings on her earlobes, adding a touch of nobility. In the foreground was a dense green mossy ground, delicate and soft, as if stepping on it made a faint rustling sound. Scattered around her were various wildflowers, including pink, white, The small yellow flowers have delicate petals, slender stems and leaves; some flowers have already bloomed, while others are still buds. The center features a female subject, positioned slightly to the left of the center of the composition. Her body forms an S-shaped curve, her legs crossed, knees bent, forming a graceful arc. The background is a colorful abstract canvas, mainly pale purple, light blue, and beige. The brushstrokes are soft, presenting a watercolor-like gradient effect, resembling a dreamy sky or clouds. The overall composition uses the centering technique, with the figure occupying the main position. The background is blurred to highlight the subject, extending along the body's curves to the skirt hem and feet, then spreading to the surrounding flowers and plants. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft and bright, with the light source coming from the upper front, evenly illuminating the figure to create natural highlights and shadows. The shadows are soft and not abrupt, with a warm and soft overall tone, dominated by warm tones, paired with fresh green and colorful flowers, creating a dreamy, romantic, and tranquil pastoral poetic atmosphere. The painting has a strong sense of artistry and beauty, resembling a meticulously painted oil painting At the same time, it carries the authentic texture of everyday photography with a professional camera, rich in detail, distinct layers, harmonious and unified colors, full of vitality and emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
