        {
          "id": "krea2-5e6b7fc7196b0f8f83d7adee",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣城市自信站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a bright indoor space, wearing a beige slim-fit knit long-sleeve top and dark gray skinny jeans, paired with light-colored pointed stiletto heels and simple silver long earrings. Her right hand gently holds a black handbag, standing gracefully sideways, slightly turning back to gaze at the camera, her expression gentle yet confident. Her overall look is refined and full of urban fashion. Her body lines are smooth and graceful, showing a healthy and well-proportioned figure. The background is a modern café or restaurant setting. The floor is paved with light-colored wood parquet flooring, creating a warm and delicate texture. Around it are several round white tabletops paired with golden metal frames. The chairs feature curved backrests, and some seats are upholstered in light gray, creating a comfortable and sophisticated dining atmosphere. On the left front, there is a small round table with a silver vase adorned with pink tulips and green leaves, along with a white shopping bag and a plate of pastries, adding a sense of life and detailed details. In the background, large floor-to-ceiling windows hang from pure white translucent sheer curtains. Soft natural light streams through the curtains into the room, creating a uniform and bright diffused light effect that makes the entire space appear open, clean, and breathable. In the distance, other empty tables and chairs are neatly arranged, faintly revealing the blurred outline of the city outside the window. The composition uses a medium shot, with a close-up of the figures. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, slightly tilted body, head slightly turned, and gaze directed toward the viewer, creating a dynamic sense of balance. Using greenery and dining table in the foreground as visual guiding elements, while the background blur enhances spatial depth, highlighting the main subjects. Light and shadow distribution is natural, with the main light source coming from the left window, creating soft side lighting. The shadow transitions are delicate, and the clothing texture is clearly visible, highlighting the texture of the materials. The overall color palette is mainly off-white, gray, and gold, accented with a touch of pink and green. The colors are harmonious and unified, creating a warm, tranquil, yet stylish atmosphere. The composition has a strong sense of everyday realism and lifestyle aesthetics. It feels like a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera in natural light, combining artistry and practicality, presenting an elegant lifestyle for modern urban women.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
