        {
          "id": "krea2-e1db474d07c1d81b4933f71a",
          "alias": "单女透视绿旗袍城市冷淡站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an outdoor stone pavement, wearing a deep green high-collar short-sleeved qipao. The fabric has a silky sheen, and the fitted tailoring perfectly outlines her slender waistline and slender figure. The neckline is adorned with black frog buttons and delicate bow decorations. The waist features pleated details and side ties. The skirt slits down to mid-thigh, revealing her legs clad in black sheer stockings. On her feet are black stiletto sandals with metal buckle decorations on the uppers. She gently holds a small black suede handbag in both hands. The bag is compact and exquisite, adorned with a gold metal chain and buckle. On her wrist is a string of light green jade bracelets, with simple silver round earrings on her earlobes. She stands slightly to the side, with a background of hazy, lush green forests and winding gray roads. In the distance, rolling hills are faintly visible. In the background, the sidewalk is paved with gray square stone bricks, with sunlight streaming from the upper left of the frame, creating a soft side light illumination, with natural transitions in the shadows. The overall composition uses medium portrait photography, with the subject positioned slightly to the right center. The shallow depth of field effect blurs the background to highlight the subject, creating rich light and shadow layers, a quiet, elegant, and slightly vintage atmosphere. The color palette is mainly cool green, accented with warm yellow sunlight, creating a beauty that is both modern and classical. It feels like a high-quality photo shot with a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens in the early morning or evening, while preserving the authenticity and everyday life of everyday photography. It showcases a unique charm that urban women radiate in a natural environment",
