        {
          "id": "krea2-c81a62ca13b00ff179073d7e",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙码头站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the lakeside, appearing serene and elegant. She wears a black strappy dress with red and white floral patterns. The dress is tailored and tailored with pleats, and the hem is light and fluffy. As she moves, it lifts slightly, creating a natural dynamic effect. Her right hand gently lifts the hem, as if feeling the breeze, her posture relaxed and natural. The overall aura is fresh and sweet. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, with her body slightly turned to the camera, forming a graceful S-shaped curve. In the background is crystal-clear emerald lake water, calm as a mirror, reflecting the buildings, trees, and sky on the shore. The lake surface shimmers with tiny ripples, presenting a crystal-clear texture. The lake's color gradually shifts from emerald green to deep blue, with distinct layers. The middle view is a small town at the foot of the Alps across the lake, with several typical Swiss-style wooden houses arranged neatly by the lakeside. The roof is covered with dark brown sloped tiles, the walls are natural wood, and windows have green shutters. Some houses have wooden balconies and terraces. Next to one of the buildings is a small dock, with a small boat moored nearby. The shore is also lined with stone embankments and steps, set against the backdrop of the towering Alps. The mountains are steep, the rocks are exposed, the summit is covered in pure white snow, and the slopes are covered with dense coniferous and broadleaf forests, presenting layers of emerald green tones. Under the sunlight, the leaves are vibrant and full of life, the sky is a washed blue, dotted with large, fluffy, pure white cumulus clouds. The clouds are thick and three-dimensional, with strong light and shadow effects. Sunlight pours down from the upper left of the painting, illuminating the entire scene and creating a contrast between the mountains and buildings. At the same time, a bright reflection is cast on the lake surface, and the figures cast soft shadows, enhancing spatial depth. The composition uses a third-section method: the main subject is located in the right third, while the left side leaves ample space to display the lake and distant scenery, creating visual balance. The distant mountains occupy the top of the painting, echoing the lake below, creating a clear sense of layering between the foreground and the buildings in the center. The visual guide extends from the lake to the distant foot of the mountain, then upward to the summit, creating a profound sense of space. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and peaceful, full of the leisurely vibe of a summer vacation. The image tones are fresh and natural, with moderate saturation, harmonious colors, bright and warm lighting, and a slight film texture, as if shot with an old film camera. The lens has slight bokeh and graininess, smooth transitions outside focus, and slightly dark corners at the edges, presenting an authentic and story-rich style of everyday travel photography. Rich in detail, delicate in light and shadow, with strong artistic appeal and immersive viewing experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
