        {
          "id": "krea2-5b3ddcda326e4e5216940459",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣咖啡厅困倦坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at a wooden table in a Japanese restaurant, gently raising a pair of pink chopsticks in her right hand with a natural relaxed posture. She wears a white knit cardigan adorned with finely sparkling pearls, paired with a white lace dress adorned with three-dimensional floral motifs. Around her neck is a simple silver necklace. The overall look is elegant and sweet, with a dark wall and a natural wood sliding door. Behind the door shines warm vertical striped light and shadow. On the left dining table are blue Doraemon plush toys, red placemats, and tableware. On the wall hangs a red calligraphy scroll inscribed with the characters \"Fu Lai.\" To the right stands a beautifully decorated Christmas tree, covered with white downy feathers that resemble snow, adorned with golden spherical ornaments and red red envelopes, creating a strong festive atmosphere. The entire scene appears warm and dreamy under soft indoor lighting, with light projecting from embedded spotlights on the ceiling. The overall color palette is mainly white, beige, and gold, accented with red. The composition features a figure centered slightly to the right, occupying the main position of the image. The Christmas tree serves as a visual extension element in the upper right, forming a diagonal line. The sliding doors and dining table lines in the background provide depth, while the hand movements and chopstick details in the foreground add a sense of everyday life. Overall, it presents a sense of warmth as captured in everyday life, as if captured with a regular camera or phone. There is slight lens distortion and natural noise, soft and layered lighting, moderate color saturation with a touch of warmth, creating a warm, comfortable, and festive home atmosphere. The painting evokes a strong sense of immersion and emotional resonance, as if one can smell the aroma of food and hear soft conversations. The Christmas tree and 'Fu' character decorations in the background hint at the approaching New Year, while the characters' costumes and expressions convey their anticipation and enjoyment of a beautiful life. The entire scene retains the ritual of traditional festivals while incorporating modern lifestyles. The composition is stable and varied, with visual guidance flowing naturally. The chopsticks extend to the Christmas tree in the background, then return to the figures, forming a complete visual loop The overall visuals are full of storytelling and warmth, like still frames from a microfilm, capturing a beautiful moment in ordinary days. The background blur is handled just right, highlighting the main subject while preserving environmental information. The overall atmosphere is warm and romantic, full of festive joy and poetic life",
