          "alias": "单女白制服街道冷淡站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a semi-open outdoor corridor. She wears an off-white Japanese sailor uniform with brown stripes on the collar and cuffs, and a large brown polka-dot bow tied at the chest. The word \"Cool\" is printed on the shirt, and the short-sleeved design reveals her slender arms. She pairs a pleated skirt in the same color below, with brown stripes along the hem. The overall look is fresh and sweet, full of charm. She gently holds a small golden orange in her right hand. Her fingers were long and fair, her nails neatly trimmed. In her left hand, she carried a black leather shoulder bag, the strap draped across her shoulder. The bag was simple and smooth, reflecting a faint sheen. She stood slightly to the side, her body slightly tilted, appearing both natural and friendly. The background was a corner of a courtyard in a city residential area, with gray stone bricks paved on the ground, and a wooden platform beside it. The edge was marked with yellow warning lines, surrounded by lush greenery and lush shrubs. Behind her, you could see the building's exterior walls and metal columns, with faint trees and sky in the distance. The lighting is soft and even, presenting the warm natural light of the afternoon. Sunlight pours down from above, casting slight shadows on the figures. The transitions are delicate, and the overall tone of the image is bright and fresh. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, the body occupying the main visual space, the head and upper body fully visible, the background blended appropriately to highlight the main contour, the foreground clear, the middle shot with distinct layers, the background slightly blurred but preserving details, creating a good sense of spatial depth. The camera angle is slightly overhead. It enhances the person's approachability, creating a relaxed and everyday atmosphere, as if it were a spontaneous street photography documentary, infused with a sense of life and youthful energy. The overall style combines realism and beauty, resembling real scenes taken with a regular phone or entry-level camera. The realism is natural and unforced, with moderate color saturation, gentle contrast, rich details, clear clothing textures, natural light and shadow transitions, and no signs of excessive embellishment, presenting a simple yet authentic sense of youthful daily life",
