          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙椅上忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor wooden chair, wearing an elegant black sleeveless long dress. The skirt has delicate textures and a subtle sheen, presenting a sophisticated velvet texture. The hem naturally drapes over the grass, creating soft folds and light and shadow effects. Her overall posture is relaxed and rhythmic, her body slightly turned to the camera. It showcases graceful shoulder and neck lines and back curves. The background is a blurred courtyard environment, with a green lawn extending into the distance. A vintage-style black wrought iron streetlamp and some blurred architectural outlines can be faintly seen, creating a tranquil yet slightly mysterious atmosphere. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, and the chair extending diagonally from the lower right corner, forming a stable visual guiding line. The focus is clearly on the figure, while the background is blurred to highlight the subject's details and emotions. Light comes from the upper side. Soft and even, like natural light on a cloudy or dusk day, with delicate shadows and smooth transitions between light and dark. The overall color palette is dominated by black, green, and brown, with subtle contrasts of warm and cool tones, creating a quiet, elegant, and slightly melancholic artistic feel. It feels like a photo shoot with professional equipment, with cinematic texture and narrative quality, while retaining the warmth of everyday life. The image is full of poetry and philosophical thought, inviting imagination of her current state of mind and story. The lens is shot with a large-aperture prime lens. Precise depth control makes the subject stand out, the background hazy, and the visual guidance natural and smooth. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, elegant, and contemplative, like a moment frozen by time, radiating the unique charm and inner strength of mature women",
