          "id": "krea2-685f44e2d83c827fe7733de1",
          "alias": "单女人鱼连衣裙小径注视",
          "prompt": "Her left hand hangs naturally, wearing simple silver earrings and a fine chain necklace. The overall look is elegant and noble. The upper half of the dress features a light yellow-green striped spaghetti strap design adorned with pink and white floral decorations. The waistline flows smoothly to fit the figure, and the hem gradually unfolds from the waist to form a graceful mermaid shape. The material is smooth like satin with a soft sheen. The skirt spreads out on the ground, forming natural folds. The background is a vibrant wall of greenery, with vines entwined around a white metal grid frame. Dense green leaves and blooming pink roses climb above, with flowers of various shapes—some budding, others fully in bloom. The branches intertwine and crisscross, creating a richly layered plant landscape. In the distance, a blurred courtyard scene can be faintly seen, including stone paths, wooden fences, and some low shrubs. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned at the center of the composition, occupying the main visual focus The vertical metal mesh frame forms a natural guiding line, directing the gaze toward the subject, while contrasting with the curved skirt to enhance the rhythm of the composition. Light comes from the upper right, presenting a warm and soft golden sunlight. The sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting dappled light and shadow, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The shadowed areas transition naturally, creating a tranquil atmosphere in the early morning or evening. The overall color palette is dominated by pink and green, complemented by golden sunlight. The color coordination is harmonious and unified, full of romantic atmosphere, and the image texture is delicate. The details are rich, combining the refinement of high-end fashion photography with the realism of everyday outdoor shooting. It's as if a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens captures the moment. The lens has a focal length of about 85mm, an aperture of f/2.8, ISO 100, and a shutter speed of 1/125 second. The background blur is well handled, highlighting the subject while preserving enough environmental information. The entire scene is as beautiful as a movie, exuding a dreamlike pastoral poetry. The air seems to be filled with a faint floral fragrance and the warmth of sunlight. It gives people a sense of peace, beauty, and hopeful living",
          "description": "",
