        {
          "id": "krea2-e8d4f131515e7905e9a24599",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套海滩愤怒站立举手",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on the beach, naturally draped over her shoulders, adding a touch of liveliness and grace, presenting a soft pink color. She wears a long light blue jacket made of light and breathable material, with a slight reflective texture. The jacket design is simple and modern, with a white lining at the neckline, wide sleeves, smooth lines, arms crossed in front, right hand raised in a thoughtful pose. Black sunglasses are worn on top of her head, with deep lenses reflecting the surrounding light and shadow. It creates a sense of fashion and a touch of mystery. The foreground features the main figure occupying the center right of the frame, with a close-up composition. The background is a blurry beach environment, with several beige umbrellas and a thatched roof. The edges of the umbrella are clearly visible, the structure is simple, and there are string lights nearby. The light is a warm yellow, scattered as dotted light spots. In the background, faint green plants and trees are faintly visible, creating natural green accents. The sandy surface is delicate with a noticeable graininess, and light shines from the upper left, creating a soft transition between light and shadow. The shadows are soft, and the overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and bright, full of the pleasant feeling of summer afternoon sunshine. The main color tones are light blue, beige, and white, with harmonious and fresh color combinations. The composition uses the contrast between the foreground and the background blur to enhance spatial depth, while maintaining balance and stability. The overall style combines the natural realism of daily life with the refined beauty of artistic photography, as if it were an outdoor portrait shot with a professional camera, yet retains the rustic and everyday atmosphere of amateur equipment. The camera presents a slight depth of field, with a natural background blur and soft, non-glaring lighting, creating a peaceful, comfortable, and slightly artistic atmosphere. The entire image conveys a youthful, innocent, and leisurely mood, as if capturing a moment when the inner world is unintentionally revealed, allowing one to feel the stillness and beauty of time.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
