        {
          "id": "krea2-284cabe21d899e1a86740ba1",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙森林俏皮站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a sun-dappled forest, wearing a pure white lace long dress with a V-neck design and exquisite lace trim. The three-quarter sleeves are also embroidered with delicate lace patterns. The skirt hem is light and flowing, the waist is cinched to outline a slender figure, and the hem is adorned with a ring of lace cutouts and tassel details. The overall look is elegant and layered, naturally draped over the shoulders, looking lively and natural. She lowers her head slightly, her left hand hanging naturally, holding a beige woven straw hat with a wide brim, The edges are decorated with natural grass spikes and a white ribbon, which hangs naturally, adding a touch of pastoral charm. It leans against a sturdy old tree, its trunk covered in rough textures, vines entwining it. The lush green leaves glow bright emerald green under sunlight, with some foliage varying in golden or deep green depending on the angle. The background is a blurred green vegetation, creating a soft bokeh effect. In the distance, the outlines of trees are faintly visible, with intertwined light and shadow, creating a tranquil and dreamlike atmosphere. The composition uses a middle shot, with the figure positioned slightly toward the center on the left side, slightly turned to the side, head slightly lowered, posture naturally relaxed, and a downward gaze guiding the viewer's attention. The foreground features clear tree trunks and vines, the middle ground features the main figure and a straw hat, and the background is a blurred green with distinct layering. The colors are mainly white and green, complemented by a warm yellow halo of sunlight. Light shines diagonally from the upper right of the frame, creating a soft backlighting effect. The figure's outline is outlined by the glow, with soft shadows, and the overall light and shadow transitions are natural. It creates a warm and tranquil summer afternoon atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a professional camera, featuring high resolution, 8K quality, ultra-fine detail, realistic light and shadow reflections, and depth of field effects. The lens focal length is set at 85mm, aperture f/1.8, composition follows the rule of thirds, with the visual focus focused on the subject. Tree trunks and vines are used as frame elements to enhance depth, resulting in an overall style that combines romance, freshness, and artistic flair. It presents a story-rich everyday aesthetic reminiscent of cinematic lenses, as if a photographer uses high-end full-frame cameras like the Canon R5 or Sony A7R IV to shoot outdoor portraits under prime lenses in natural light. The images are free of unnecessary distractions, focusing on the harmonious relationship between the subject and the environment, conveying an atmosphere of tranquility, gentleness, and natural beauty",
