        {
          "id": "krea2-4d68a747c7d98186c8ff9c17",
          "alias": "单女橙连衣裙公园害羞站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under a tree in the park, wearing an orange-yellow strappy dress with pink and red floral patterns. The fabric is light and flowing, presenting a silky sheen. The hem naturally falls to near the knees, with smooth lines that fit the figure. The thin straps outline an elegant collarbone, adding a touch of laziness and ease. The pendant is simple and round, and her right hand is gently placed near her chest, fingers long and natural. Her posture is dignified yet slightly shy, her left hand naturally hanging at her side, her body slightly turned to the side, presenting a graceful S-shaped curve. She stands beside a large tree in a dense forest, with a thick and ancient trunk covered in deep brown rough bark textures. The roots are tangled and exposed, forming a complex three-dimensional structure. The background is blurred green vegetation and mottled sunlight. Soft light filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting dot-like light spots on the ground and the figure. The overall composition uses a centered composition. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, with the head slightly raised. The foreground is a blurred green bush. The middle ground clearly shows the main subject and some tree trunks, while the background is a completely blurred forest scene, creating a strong depth of field effect. Light and shadow come from diagonally above, creating soft side lighting. Subtle highlights appear in the folds of clothing, creating an overall atmosphere that is peaceful, gentle, artistic, and poetic. The color tones are mainly warm yellow, orange-red, and green, with harmonious color combinations and rich layers. The image presents a beautiful moment captured unintentionally in daily life, as if an improvised portrait was taken with an old film camera under the afternoon sun. The lens carries slight film graininess and natural exposure, while the background blurs to produce creamy, soft out-of-focus images. The overall style combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life, like a tranquil summer portrait that lets people feel the harmony of youthful innocence and nature",
