        {
          "id": "krea2-2c9d4807da0d103a843e54f6",
          "alias": "单女雪地温柔站立持扇",
          "prompt": "Her right hand gently holds a white round paper fan, with light wood ribs and a surface as white as snow. The fan is slightly tilted, creating an elegant yet reserved posture. Her left hand gently rests on a wooden pillar beside her, her fingers long, and her nails adorned with delicate pearl decorations, appearing especially exquisite. The figure is positioned on the right side of the painting, with a slightly tilted body and head lowered, a natural and unpretentious posture forming a soft curve. The foreground features a clear wooden structure, including sturdy columns and beams. The wood grain is clearly visible, presenting a warm brownish-yellow tone, with a faint trace of time on the surface, adding realism and texture. The middle scene shows the figure herself and the lattice window lattice behind her. The window frame is dark brown, and the window paper is a semi-transparent off-white, subtly revealing the interior space. This creates a layered blend of solid and void. The background is a blurred bamboo forest, with emerald green bamboo poles standing tall and leaves swaying in the wind, forming a hazy green screen. In the distance, there are also some trees and vegetation. The overall background is blurred, highlighting the main figure. The composition uses diagonal guide lines extending from the lower left to the upper right, using wooden structures and the figures' postures to create visual flow. The figures are placed near the golden ratio point of the painting, enhancing balance and beauty, then spreading outward along the fan's curve. This creates a restrained yet open tension, with a soft and bright lighting atmosphere. Light comes from the front and above, belonging to natural light. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the roof, with shadows transitioning naturally without strong contrast. The overall color palette is mainly warm white, light brown, and tender green, creating a fresh and tranquil Japanese courtyard atmosphere. The image has a slight film texture, moderate color saturation, rich details, and gradually blurred backgrounds, presenting a realistic feel reminiscent of amateur camera shooting. The lens choice is an 85mm prime lens with an aperture f/ 1.8, close-up shots, the overall style blends Eastern aesthetics with modern portrait photography, combining classical charm with youthful energy. The image presents as a high-quality everyday photo, like a beautiful moment captured by chance during a trip, full of story and life",
