        {
          "id": "krea2-b5e5caa87387b90c4fb0bc07",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙椅上愤怒坐展示",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor rattan bench, wearing a light pink sleeveless dress with a delicate white bow tied at the neckline. The skirt is light and flowing, presenting a soft pleated texture. The overall look is elegant and fresh, appearing both dignified and playful. She gently cups a transparent tall glass with both hands, filled with clear liquid—perhaps champagne or sparkling water—glistening softly in the sunlight. Her posture is relaxed and composed, slightly tilted toward the camera, creating a peaceful and joyful atmosphere. In the foreground is a corner of a round table covered with a white tablecloth, on which the outlines of tableware can be faintly seen. Next to it is a bouquet of decorative dried flowers, including beige agave leaves and green eucalyptus leaves, gently tied with ribbons, adding a touch of pastoral charm. In the center is a wooden-framed rattan bench, with soft white cushions on the backrest and cushions. The chair structure is clearly visible, showcasing a design style that blends vintage and modern. In the background is a wide green lawn, with a row of white fences in the distance. The space is divided in an orderly way. Further away are dense trees and shrubs, forming a blurred green screen. The sky casts mottled light and shadow through the leaves, presenting the entire composition with a soft out-of-focus blur. The composition uses classic center composition: the figure is at the very center, with light coming from the upper left, belonging to soft natural daylight. It is bright but not glaring, creating a warm golden tone. The shadows delicately outline the contours of the figures and the folds of clothing, casting faint shadows on the ground and surfaces. It enhances the sense of depth, with evenly distributed light and shadow, creating a tranquil atmosphere where morning or afternoon sunlight filters through leaves. The colors are mainly soft pink-white, pale green, and natural wood tones, with unified and harmonious tones full of romance and healing. The overall image presents a high-quality photography style, as if shot with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens, offering strong visual appeal and emotional resonance",
