        {
          "id": "krea2-f4b7daacb099a44934825d6b",
          "alias": "单女粉毛衣面包店持包",
          "prompt": "Inside the basket is a white sheet of paper printed with a pattern and a colorful sandwich. The sandwich has distinct layers, showing fresh lettuce, tomato slices, chunks of meat, and sauce, making the overall look very tempting. She wears a pink gradient knit cardigan layered with a pink turtleneck underneath, and a loose dark gray long skirt that naturally drapes to the floor, forming soft pleats Her posture is elegant and relaxed, as if she has just bought a treat from a bakery and is ready to enjoy a moment of tranquility. In the background is a cozy bakery interior. On the left side are several display cases under glass covers, neatly arranged with a variety of breads and pastries, including baguettes, croissants, and small cakes. Each item has a black label below its name and price. The cabinet is made of solid wood, and the drawer-style structure is illuminated by warm yellow lighting. The light reflects a soft halo through the glass, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. On the right is a beige brick wall, with a bag of flour printed with the word \"Casan\" hanging on it. Next to it is a potted greenery for decoration, adding vitality. Above, metal shelves hold containers and bottled items such as milk, juice, jam, etc. At the top hangs a silver metal barrel. The entire space is dominated by warm tones, with light radiating from the ceiling and inside the cabinets, creating multi-layered light and shadow effects. Sunlight slants in from the upper left of the painting, casting clear shadows on the floor and cabinet surface. This creates a contrast of light and shadow, enhancing three-dimensionality and realism. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the image. The bread cabinet and displays in the background serve as visual extension elements, enriching the content while maintaining the main subject's prominence. The overall image presents a scene full of warmth and atmosphere from daily life, with a strong sense of realism and intimacy. It is like shooting with a medium-format camera or a professional mirrorless camera, with the lens focusing on the person, the background slightly blurred, and depth of field well controlled. Details are clearly visible, texture is delicate, color saturation is moderate, and the light and shadow changes and material expressions in real environments are reproduced. The entire image exudes a tranquil, healing, and slightly artistic atmosphere, allowing people to feel the beautiful moments in ordinary days",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
