        {
          "id": "krea2-4bc0e0f193a52238634d4920",
          "alias": "单女黑毛衣酒店坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at a refined dining table in the lobby of a luxury hotel, slightly tilting her head toward the camera. She gently holds a small transparent glass cup filled with light-colored liquid, striking an elegant and natural pose. She wears a black sleeveless knit top with a white lapel design, a white high-waisted skirt, and a simple black wristband and jade bracelet on her wrist. The overall look is both fashionable and intellectual. In front of her is a set of exquisite afternoon tea snacks, including a yellow flower-shaped dessert on a blue ceramic dish. A fruit platter in a transparent glass bowl, a white porcelain pot, and a glass kettle filled with pale pink drinks. Next to it are neatly stacked white napkins and silver knives and forks. In the background is a black grand piano. When the lid is opened, it reflects the light and shadows of the surroundings. Behind the piano are lavishly decorated golden screens and striped walls. The ceiling is adorned with smooth curved light strips that emit a warm orange-yellow glow. The floor is covered with a deep blue carpet with golden patterns. The entire space appears luxurious and elegant, with soft and warm lighting. The main light sources come from recessed ceiling lighting and ambient lighting, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The composition uses a central layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center. In the foreground is a rich afternoon tea utensils and food; in the middle is the main figure and part of the dining table; the background features a piano and architectural details; and further back, the piano and spatial structure in the background create a distinctly layered visual depth. The color tones are mainly warm yellow, black, white, and blue, harmoniously unified and delicate, with a delicate and realistic texture. It presents a beautiful moment from everyday life, as if taken with a professional camera in high-quality photos, with a strong sense of artistry and a sense of everyday life. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, full of the refined style of a modern city, like a leisurely afternoon spent in a high-end hotel",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
