        {
          "id": "krea2-236c418b9920418d4cb5d700",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙摄影棚困倦站立（2）",
          "prompt": "A woman stands before a soft pale pink background, showing graceful wavy curves. Her expression is calm, elegant, and full of approachability. She wears a light blue sleeveless dress with a simple and elegant design, a wide lapel neckline, and a slightly raised collar that creates a unique visual focal point. The dress is tailored to fit well, The waist is cinched to highlight the waistline, the hem spreads out in an A-shape, the fabric pleats naturally and smoothly, presenting a light and flowing texture. The hem edges have subtle curves, with exquisite details. She wears a thin chain necklace, the pendant is a simple geometric shape with a faint silver sheen, small earrings, and a slender bracelet on her wrist made of transparent or metallic material, with exquisite details. The overall outfit is harmonious and unified, with a fresh and sweet style. The composition uses a central symmetrical layout, with the figure centered. Occupying the main subject, the head is slightly tilted, the body forms an S-shaped curve, the posture is naturally relaxed, both hands hang naturally at the sides, the left hand gently rests on the edge of the skirt, the right hand hangs naturally, fingers are long, nails neatly trimmed, light and shadow shine from the upper left of the front, creating a soft and even illumination. At the same time, natural shadow transitions are created on the neck, collarbone, inner arms, and the folds of the skirt, with consistent direction and moderate intensity, not abrupt. The background is a pure light pink gradient, with colors from light to slightly dark from top to bottom. There are no chaotic textures, maintaining minimalist cleanliness. The background blur is well handled, creating a clear spatial separation from the subject. Through color contrast and light and shadow distribution, the subject's presence is reinforced. The overall atmosphere is gentle and romantic, full of breath. The tones are mainly light blue and light pink, harmoniously unified to create a dreamy, tranquil beauty. The images present a highly realistic style, rich in detail, and realistic texture, as if shot with professional studio equipment, yet retaining a sense of everyday intimacy. The camera focuses on the entire person. Using medium shot composition, the background is moderately blurred, highlighting the subject without completely disconnecting the environment. The overall composition is balanced and stable, visually comfortable, suitable for fashion photo shoots, promotional posters, or personal image display. The style combines modernity and classical beauty, with strong artistic appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
