        {
          "id": "krea2-6b345dec1b3e399e314d9c9c",
          "alias": "单女竹林躺过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman wore exquisite traditional Hanfu in light blue and light purple, with light and flowing fabric, embroidered with delicate white floral patterns and scroll patterns. The collar, cuffs, and hem edges were decorated with exquisite piping and embroidery. She carried a finely woven bamboo basket filled with freshly picked wildflowers—mainly white daisies and green branches and leaves—naturally draped over her shoulders. She gently holds the rope of the bamboo basket with both hands, her posture graceful, as if she has just returned from the forest. The background is beside a quiet stream, with mottled light reflected on the water's surface. The shore is covered with irregular stones, the ground is moist, with faint traces of water and fallen leaves. In the distance lies a dense forest, with light filtering through the gaps in the leaves, creating soft spots of light on the ground and the figures. The composition uses close-ups: the figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, body slightly tilted, head turned toward the camera, creating a warm and interactive feeling. The foreground clearly highlights the details of the figures. The middle ground shows her body and bamboo basket, while the background gradually blurs, creating a strong depth of field effect. Light and shadow come from the upper and side effects, creating a peaceful and far-reaching atmosphere, full of poetic pastoral charm. It resembles an ancient-style painting, with fresh and elegant tones, mainly green, pink, and off-white, paired with natural brown and black. The colors are harmonious and unified, with a delicate and realistic texture of everyday amateur equipment and a sense of life, capturing an ordinary yet beautiful moment. It presents a simple yet beautiful Eastern aesthetic conception",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
