        {
          "id": "krea2-4caedb82c2436633dc20f774",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙茶室冷淡坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a Japanese-style window seat, her posture elegant and natural. She wears a white lace spaghetti strap dress over a matching white knit cardigan. The cuffs and neckline have pleated designs, adding a touch of retro and soft charm. Around her neck is a simple and exquisite silver necklace, with a small floral pendant. The overall look is fresh and refined, full of artistic flair. She sits upright, leans slightly forward, and her left hand rests naturally on her leg. Her fingers are long, and her nails are neatly trimmed. On the table is a traditional Japanese tea set, including a ceramic teacup decorated with floral patterns, filled with amber-colored tea soup placed on a black porcelain plate. Next to it is a pair of neatly arranged wooden chopsticks on a small wooden tray, along with a folded paper menu or card. At the corner of the table is a blue flowerpot with several pink flowers inside, adding a splash of brightness to the scene. On the left side of the foreground is a classic-style Japanese lantern, hexagonal-shaped, with warm and soft lighting inside, emitting a golden glow. The lantern frame is made of black metal, with a simple yet elegant structure. The background is an open natural landscape. Outside the window, you can see a winding stream flowing through the pebbled riverbed, the water crystal clear to the bottom. Surrounded by dense green vegetation, trees stand at varying heights, with lush branches and leaves. Some tree trunks are bare, showing signs of seasonal transition. In the distance, the mountains rise and fall in distinct layers, the sky is bright but slightly misty. The overall lighting is natural daylight, with sunlight streaming in from the right side, while shadows are clearly visible on the left side of the body and the edge of the chair. To create a sense of depth and realism, the composition combines close-up of the figure with the natural scenery in the distance. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the image, occupying the main visual focus. The lantern forms a diagonal line in the upper left, guiding the gaze toward the figure. Meanwhile, the view outside extends to the right, creating a sense of spatial depth. The colors are mainly white, beige, green, and brown, with a fresh and natural tone. The warm yellow lighting contrasts with the cool green environment, enhancing the sense of warmth in the painting. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and harmonious, full of poetry and a sense of life It seems to capture a leisurely afternoon in a traditional Japanese teahouse, enjoying tea and appreciating the scenery. The image is delicate and richly detailed, presenting an unintentional beauty from daily life, with a strong artistic and storytelling feel. It resembles a real scene shot with an amateur camera, with a slight film graininess and natural color saturation. The transitions of light and shadow are smooth, without excessive embellishment, preserving the warmth and warmth of real life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
