        {
          "id": "krea2-d23f44305e7819bb7bf1b4e3",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣窗边忧伤倚靠",
          "prompt": "She wears a beige V-neck knit cardigan, made of a textured fabric with subtle textures that gives it a linen-like texture. The sleeves are decorated with three black stripes, with several gray-blue buttons on the collar. She pairs a black high-waisted short skirt with a clean and sharp hem, giving the overall look a simple yet layered look. Her hands hang naturally at her sides, her posture relaxed, and her body leans slightly forward. Near the green metal railing, the surface of the railing shows slight wear. The background is a typical urban residential cluster with mixed architectural styles, featuring old concrete exterior walls and mottled walls. Some areas show obvious signs of weathering and stains. Windows vary in size, some are fitted with security screens, others open, and potted plants are on the windowsill. In the distance, a modern high-rise residential building can be seen, contrasting with the surrounding low-rise buildings. The sky is gloomy and grayish-white, the clouds are heavy, and the light is soft and even, with no obvious shadows. The entire scene is quiet and The everyday atmosphere is enveloped, with lush greenery and vibrant leaves, creating a sharp contrast with the gray buildings. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly below the center of the frame, occupying the main visual focus. The background is blurred to highlight the main subject. The colors are mainly beige, black, green, and gray, with harmonious tones and natural light and shadow, creating a genuine sense of life and a subtle sense of nostalgia. The image texture is delicate and detailed, as if captured with an ordinary phone. With a slight film graininess and slightly lower color saturation, the retro filter effect presents a visual style that is both everyday and slightly artistic, conveying a quiet and beautiful moment in urban life",
