        {
          "id": "krea2-7a4071c5c795bf75b2532bd2",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙小径沉思站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a white lace slip dress, standing gracefully on her side, her head slightly tilted back, her expression calm and slightly contemplative. She wore a slender gold necklace with a simple teardrop-shaped pendant that complemented the overall look. The white dress was made of lightweight chiffon material, with layered ruffles creating soft pleats at the shoulders and waist, and the skirt was fluffy and flowing. Featuring delicate lace trim, the thin string-style shoulder straps at the cuffs are distinctive and layered. The arms are naturally bent, elbows slightly bent, and the posture is relaxed and relaxed, as if enjoying a tranquil moment. The foreground figure occupies the main position, clearly visible from the chest to the thighs. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with a blurry pale gray-white background that creates a soft blur effect, creating a dreamlike spatial feel. Light from the front left gently and evenly illuminates the figure, creating a natural transition between light and shadow. It highlights the delicate texture and three-dimensional contours of the skin, while the shadows subtly outline the neck and shoulder lines. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and hazy, with mainly white, off-white, and pale gray tones, complemented by very light warm yellow tones, creating a pure, gentle, and poetic visual experience. The images have a strong artistic and cinematic feel, as if capturing a static lyrical poem, while also carrying the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting, such as handheld cameras shooting indoors under natural light. Slight noise and soft out-of-focus imaging enhance the realistic and intimate atmosphere. The lens is a 50mm standard prime lens, with depth control around f/1.8, making the subject clear and prominent, with the background completely blurred. In composition, the figure is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, leaving a blank space on the left to create a sense of visual breath. The line of sight is guided from the character's head toward the top of the frame, creating an upward-flowing flowing path. The overall image is full of romanticism, combining surreal aesthetics with a touch of everyday warmth and realism. The attention to detail is exquisitely crafted, presenting an aesthetic style that is both refined and natural",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
