        {
          "id": "krea2-c30b5b59c86665efd5cfcdb8",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a white short-sleeved shirt in Japanese sailor uniform style, paired with a brown knit cardigan and a gray pleated skirt. Her right hand rested gently on the wall, while her left hand naturally hung down. Her overall posture appeared relaxed and elegant, with city buildings in the background. In the distance, several high-rise residential buildings and low-rise red-roofed houses could be seen, and the sky was grayish-white and overcast. The lighting is soft and even, with no obvious shadows. The composition uses a mid-field portrait shot. The person is positioned near the center on the right side of the frame, occupying about two-thirds of the space. The left side leaves some background space to create visual balance. The yellow tiles on the wall echo the beige and gray colors of the characters' clothing, while the blue circular sign \"80\" and the white text Japanese sign on a blue background add a sense of life. The overall atmosphere is quiet and daily, with a slight film texture that simulates real camera shooting. The lens focal length is about 50mm, aperture f/ 2.8, shutter speed 1/125 second, ISO 200, natural transitions of light and shadow, slightly blurred background to highlight the subject, composition stable and layered, with warm yellow, beige brown, and gray-white as the main colors, accented with blue elements for visual highlights, creating a youthful campus realism that feels like a street snap captured on an afternoon, carrying a subtle nostalgic mood and warmth of everyday life",
