        {
          "id": "krea2-2cd46d22480e1e4b4a97ffb2",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙咖啡厅坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the bar in a Japanese restaurant, slightly tilting her head to look at the camera. Her posture is elegant and natural. She wears a pink floral dress with a light and flowing skirt printed with cute cartoon patterns. The sleeves feature ruffled edges, adding a touch of sweetness. On her wrist are multiple bracelets, including gold chains, colorful bead strings, and woven bracelets, with rich details and a sense of style. On her right ring finger, she wears a simple ring, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with light nail polish, giving the overall look fresh and charming. occupying the main left side of the frame, the composition uses close-up shots to highlight the main subject. The center is the bar counter, on which sits a beautifully crafted sushi platter. The wooden tray is decorated with green seaweed and pine needles, with a rich variety of sushi, including salmon sushi, crab sticks, tempura, and more. The colors are bright, and beside it is an amber-colored drink, possibly sake or whiskey, along with a pair of chopsticks, a small plate, and a small black box. The background is the restaurant's interior. The dark walls are paired with golden metal grille screens, which are fan-shaped and grid-shaped, with soft light strips illuminating the edges to create a warm atmosphere. Above, the ceiling is fitted with embedded spotlights, evenly illuminating the space. On the right side, you can see some dining tables and chairs and another table. In the distance, a calligraphy piece hangs on the wall, inscribed with the words \"True Flavor.\" The calligraphy is neat, adding a cultural atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly black, gold, and pink, creating a striking contrast yet harmonious unity. The composition features a figure positioned slightly to the left center. Using bar counter lines to guide the gaze to the right, while the interplay between the person and the food creates visual balance. In terms of lighting and shadow, the main light sources come from the top spotlight and the screen backlight, creating a soft warm yellow tone. The shadows are natural, the background is slightly dark, but the details are clear, creating a cozy and private dining atmosphere. The overall image has the realistic texture of everyday amateur equipment, with slight noise and natural camera colors, as if you casually recorded life moments with a phone or portable camera, presenting a friendly, The realistic and artistically rich visual style features delicate images and clear layers, combining the sophistication of modern urban life with the warmth and emotion of everyday life. It feels as if you can smell the aroma of food and feel the tranquility and satisfaction of the moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
