        {
          "id": "krea2-9a73c19b16c05ad76024f1eb",
          "alias": "单女白T恤公园俏皮站立伸展",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the green lawn in an outdoor park, wearing a loose white crew-neck T-shirt with pink plaid patterns and colorful polka dot decorations on the chest reading \"COOK.\" The T-shirt is pinned with a pink flower-shaped hairpin. She gently raises both hands, lightly touching the sides of her temples in a playful and cute pose. On her left wrist, she wears a thin silver chain bracelet, on her right wrist a brown woven bracelet, and a pink canvas bag slung crossbody over her shoulder. The strap is slender, giving the overall look a sweet and fresh look. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the center foreground, with a gentle and natural expression. The background is an urban park. On the left is a tree with thick branches and dark brown bark, branches stretching outward, leaves sparse, revealing a gray-blue sky. In the distance, you can see roads, green belts, and the silhouettes of white buildings. The center features a gray asphalt pavement, with low cement curbstones along the roadside. On the right, neatly trimmed green shrubs are visible. In the distance, the hillside is densely vegetated, and traditional white-walled, black-tiled buildings can be faintly seen. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout. Figures occupy the main part of the composition, forming a visual focal point with distinct background layers. From nearby grasslands and figures to the middle ground of roads and trees, then to distant buildings and mountains, the sense of space is strong, and it extends to the surrounding environment, forming a complete observation path. The light is scattered on cloudy days, soft and even, without obvious shadows. The colors are mainly white, pink, and green, paired with gray floors and dark tree trunks. The tones are fresh and elegant, the atmosphere relaxed and comfortable, full of youthful energy and the warmth of daily life. The overall image presents a realistic and natural street candid effect, as if shot with a phone or portable camera, with slight lens distortion and noise texture, enhancing the realism of everyday life. The details are rich, the transitions between light and shadow are delicate, and the color saturation is moderate, giving it a strong sense of affinity and appeal",
