        {
          "id": "krea2-c99416ba2977162dec1c97a8",
          "alias": "单女旗袍摄影棚站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a modified qipao made of deep blue silk texture, with a stand-up collar and red piping details. The slim cut perfectly outlined elegant curves. She gently held an unfolded folding fan in both hands, its surface featuring a classical ink wash landscape painting. The gray-white gradient contrasted sharply with the black ribs, naturally draping over her shoulders. The background is a traditional Chinese bird-and-flower painting, with blooming pomegranate fruits and green leaves and branches in the frame. The colors are soft and warm, and the composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly below the center to form a visual focal point. The foreground features the main figure and a folding fan, the middle ground features the torso and some background floral patterns, and the background is a complete traditional painting wall. Light softly shines from the front left, creating a warm and bright effect with natural and delicate shadow transitions. The overall atmosphere blends Eastern classical aesthetics with modern fashion, presenting a tranquil, elegant, gentle, and captivating mood. The images have the texture of professional studio photography, captured with a large-aperture lens, with well-handled background blur to highlight the main contour. The color saturation is moderate, layered and clear, showcasing high-end visual expression. It feels as if recording a poetic moment, combining traditional charm with modern aesthetics. The composition is rigorous and artistic, forming a smooth visual path. The overall composition is harmonious and unified, full of cultural atmosphere and aesthetic value",
