        {
          "id": "krea2-5cc63adf223d490f303f4631",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔床困倦坐持花",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bed by the window, slightly tilted, gently holding a beige plush cushion in her right hand, while her left hand hangs naturally, her posture elegant and relaxed. She wears a white sleeveless lace trim cropped top with delicate black polka dot patterns, a ruffled hem, paired with light blue denim shorts. The hem is slightly rolled, revealing her slender leg lines. She wears white socks with delicate black floral embroidery on the sock legs, giving the overall look a fresh, sweet, and fashionable look. To her left is a huge brown teddy bear plushie, its fluffy texture very soft, occupying most of the left side of the painting. On the right windowsill is a bouquet of pink roses, with tender petals and green leaves scattered throughout. Next to it is a small green cup. In the background is a curtain with pink floral patterns, made of light material that lets in soft natural light. The window is a white sliding window with a simple frame, and the blurred scenery outside is faintly visible. Light streams in diagonally from the right window, creating a warm backlight effect. It creates a dreamy atmosphere of light and shadow. The entire scene is dominated by soft pink, white, and light blue, presenting a warm and romantic home ambiance. The foreground features a teddy bear and part of the bed, the middle ground is the main subject, and the background features curtains, windows, and bouquets. The layers are distinct, the transitions between light and shadow are delicate, and the contrast between light and shadow is soft. The overall composition has a strong Japanese style, full of healing and a sense of everyday life. It feels like a real-life moment captured with an ordinary home camera, with rich details, authentic texture, moderate color saturation, a slight film graininess, and natural exposure compensation, presenting a sense of everyday yet carefully arranged beauty. The shadows are soft, and the overall atmosphere is peaceful, warm, and sweet, making you feel comfortable and at ease",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
