        {
          "id": "krea2-efaff4cbfdf5572643324733",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣街道困倦坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor concrete pavement, adding a touch of laziness and gentleness. She wears a white inner layer and a blue knit cardigan. The cardigan has clearly visible textures, neatly arranged buttons, and slightly rolled cuffs. She wears dark jeans below, with the legs naturally bent on the ground, forming a relaxed sitting posture. Her body is slightly turned to the camera, her head slightly tilted, showing elegant contours. Her right hand gently rests on a flower bed beside her. Her left hand rested naturally near her knee, her posture relaxed and natural. She carried an orange canvas bag on her back, the strap slung across her shoulder. The bright colors stood out, forming a striking contrast with the blue cardigan. In the background was a quiet country road, smooth and smooth. In the distance, a white car could be faintly seen parked by the roadside, with dense green plants lining both sides. On the right was a wooden flower box filled with blooming purple flowers. The flowers were delicate and dense, with pale purple petals, a hint of yellow, and green leaves making the blossoms even more delicate. The flower box is made from rough wooden planks, with natural textures and mottled marks on the surface, appearing simple yet authentic. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the left. In the foreground are blooming purple flowers and part of the box's edges; in the middle is the figure and her seat; in the background, a long path and distant vehicles and vegetation form a distinct sense of spatial layering. At the same time, the direction of the flowers enhances the sense of movement in the image. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft and warm, with light coming from the side and above. Like the dappled light and shadows cast by afternoon sunlight filtering through leaves, the shadows are soft, and the highlights on clothing and flowers are just right. The overall tone is fresh and natural, with blue, purple, orange, green, and other colors harmoniously matched, creating a peaceful, healing, and lively pastoral atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, as if you were casually shooting everyday life with a regular camera, with slight film graininess and realistic color reproduction. The background is naturally blurred, highlighting the main subject. Overall, it presents a beauty that is both realistic and slightly dreamy",
