        {
          "id": "krea2-9a8571ea11e5119049bf2e3a",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙广场自信站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the center of an outdoor wooden terrace, wearing a sleeveless tight dress with horizontal stripes in blue, yellow, and white. The dress is tailored to fit her figure, highlighting elegant curves. The neckline is a simple round neckline, with slender straps. The overall style is fresh and fashionable, exuding a calm and confident temperament. Her hands gently hold a white square handbag, adorned with metal clasps. The lines are simple and the texture delicate. On her wrist are several delicate bracelets and a ring, adding a touch of refinement. On her feet is a pair of white high-heeled sandals decorated with white studs. The upper is made of multiple interlaced thin ribbons and metal rivets interspersed, creating a blend of vintage and modern style. She stands on a dark brown wooden floor, with clear texture and natural wood texture and the marks of time. The background is a simple white white wall, flat and clean. On the right side is a white metal frame dining table, with a natural wood color retaining natural wood grain. The table legs are sharply lined, and next to it is a white cross-backrest chair, with a simple and modern structure. On the left is a lush green potted plant with lush leaves, and clusters of small white flowers dot the branches, full of vitality and injecting a natural atmosphere into the scene. Above is a transparent glass ceiling supported by a white metal frame, with light filtering evenly through the glass to create a soft, diffused glow that creates a bright and transparent atmosphere. The entire scene is well-structured, with the figure centered to the left, the composition balanced, and the visual focus on the figure. The foreground is mainly the main subject, the middle includes a handbag, legs, and some furniture, while the background consists of walls, Plants and the ceiling create distinct layers, with light and shadow slanting down from above, casting subtle shadows on the ground and figures, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall color scheme is mainly white, blue, and yellow, paired with natural wood tones and green. The colors are harmoniously unified and full of summer freshness. The image presents an elegant moment from everyday life, as if shot with a professional camera in natural light, creating a strong sense of realism and artistic beauty while still retaining a sense of everyday life. It seems to capture a tranquil moment under the afternoon sun, with rich image details and authentic texture. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and warm, combining the sophistication of urban women with the comfort of a natural environment, conveying a relaxed and carefree attitude toward life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
