        {
          "id": "krea2-bee68160b0b3b31dd7e70f79",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫小巷害羞蹲",
          "prompt": "A woman squats on the damp alley floor, dressed in a white short-sleeved shirt and a deep blue pleated skirt in her school uniform, black stockings, and shiny leather shoes. Her expression is gentle yet slightly shy. The background is mottled beige walls and green plants crawling with vines. On the left is an old wooden ladder, topped with a plush teddy bear and a pink woven bag Next to it stands a red-and-white Coca-Cola billboard with Japanese characters like \"Open\" written on it. On the right wall leans a white sign with Chinese characters, surrounded by scattered green plants and fallen leaves. The damp ground reflects the image of people and scenery. The overall composition is shot from a low angle, with the person positioned slightly to the right center, forming a natural visual guideline. The foreground features dense round leafy plants, the middle ground shows the figure, billboard, and ladder, while the background is the wall and climbing vines. The lighting is soft and even. It presents the unique diffuse light effect of cloudy or rainy days, with blue and white as the main tones, accented with red and green, creating a tranquil yet slightly nostalgic everyday atmosphere. The image has a slight film texture and graininess, reminiscent of a real moment captured on the street with an amateur camera. The background is moderately blurred to highlight the subject, with rich light and shadow layers, fresh and natural tones, full of youthful and everyday details. The composition is balanced and storyful, giving a tranquil, warm, yet slightly melancholic afternoon feeling. It was as if I could hear the faint sounds of the city in the distance and the gentle sound of raindrops falling",
