        {
          "id": "krea2-6a1b6ba3ae42a9976aa258d1",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫森林侧头",
          "prompt": "A close-up of a woman's half-body appears soft and natural. Looking directly into the camera, it seems as if she is silently communicating with the viewer, adding a gentle touch. She wears a pure white lace blouse paired with a lightweight white tulle jacket with delicate ruffle decorations on the collar. The overall look is elegant and pure. She wears a pair of long silver tassel earrings adorned with pearls and small bells, gently swaying with her subtle movements. She makes subtle sounds, her posture dignified and relaxed, head slightly tilted, displaying a serene and reserved temperament. The details are rich: the center is her shoulders and chest, the folds of her clothing and the lace cutout patterns are layered distinctly, while the background is a blurred blue-green tone, presenting a soft bokeh effect, resembling an outdoor natural environment, possibly a forest or garden. Light streams diagonally from the left side of the frame, creating a soft backlighting effect that creates a faint halo around the edges of her silhouette, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and texture. The overall composition uses a central composition, with the figures centered and becoming the visual focal points. The color palette is mainly white and light blue, creating a fresh, tranquil, and dreamlike atmosphere. The light and shadow transition smoothly, without strong shadows, giving a warm and peaceful feel. The entire scene has a high artistic and cinematic feel, as if it were a carefully photographed portrait, yet also carries a touch of casualness and authenticity from everyday life, as if captured by a professional camera under natural light, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
