        {
          "id": "krea2-535ce3d6f22514e66e599607",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫机场自信坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bench in a modern airport lobby, wearing a light blue vertical striped shirt and a beige high-waisted knit mini skirt, white sneakers, and black-rimmed glasses. Her expression is slightly lazy and confident, her body slightly turned to the side, her left hand gently tugging at her sleeve, right hand resting on her knee, her posture relaxed yet full of tension. The overall look is simple, fashionable, and full of urban flair. In the foreground, the main figure occupies the centered left of the frame, and the composition uses a low-angle upward shot to highlight the figure's curves and sense of spatial depth. The middle ground features smooth dark gray floors and metallic railings, with a futuristic architectural structure in the background. The ceiling features a geometric glass skylight, with sunlight streaming through the skylight and casting dappled shadows, creating a visual effect of interwoven light and shadow. In the distance, blurred pedestrian silhouettes and signs can be seen, creating a realistic spatial layer. The composition uses lines to guide the gaze deeper into the interior, with figures becoming the visual focal point. Light streams in from above, creating a soft backlit contour with delicate shadow transitions. The overall atmosphere blends the coldness of a modern city with the relaxed daily life, presenting an imaging style that combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life. It feels as if a professional camera was shooting under natural light, with rich details, true colors, and delicate texture. The image has a slight film graininess that enhances realism and warmth. The color palette is mainly blue and white, accented with beige and black, creating a harmonious unity. The composition is balanced yet dynamic, and the figures' postures are natural, as if capturing an unintentional moment during a journey. The background blur is handled just right. While highlighting the main subject, it retains environmental information, presenting an overall high-end fashion photography feel while maintaining a sense of authenticity and warmth in everyday life",
