        {
          "id": "krea2-ad168f758da39825278268de",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙椅上微笑坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a rattan chair in an outdoor café, looking directly at the camera with a gentle smile. Her overall aura is elegant and confident. She wears a form-fitting leopard print strapless dress that tightly accentuates her graceful figure. The neckline perfectly accentuates her collarbones, and the hem reaches mid-thigh, revealing long, straight legs. Her right hand rests lightly on the armrest of the chair, a string of colorful bracelets on her wrist, a simple ring on her ring finger, and a slender silver necklace around her neck adding a touch of refinement. She sits at a wooden round table, her body slightly tilted toward the camera, her posture relaxed and composed. In the foreground is part of the wooden tabletop and rattan chair backrest; in the middle is a clear full-body view of herself; in the background is a blurred outdoor café environment, where you can see other customers sitting at distant tables and chairs—some chatting, some dining. Green plants and umbrellas surround the area. Above is a beige sunshade structure, with several warm yellow chandeliers hanging from the ceiling, the light soft and warm. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame, occupying the main visual focal point. The shallow depth of field effect highlights the subject, while the background is blurred to create a natural sense of layering. The lighting is then guided upward to the overhead lighting, forming a complete visual flow path. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by warm yellow tones, with sunlight filtering through the awning to cast dappled shadows, creating a leisurely and pleasant afternoon atmosphere. The overall color tone is harmonious and unified, full of life atmosphere and artistic beauty. It presents a beautiful moment captured unintentionally in daily life, as if shot with a professional camera on a clear afternoon, rich in detail, authentic, and natural, with a strong sense of immersion and emotional resonance",
