        {
          "id": "krea2-940b40b4313c533b82684ea4",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙屋顶严肃站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beside the stone railing of a classical Chinese building. She wears a delicate light-colored spaghetti strap long dress covered with sequins and embroidered floral patterns, creating a semi-transparent texture. The three-dimensional floral decorations on the chest and waist sparkle in the sunlight. The skirt is light and flowing, gently swaying in the wind, exuding an elegant and romantic temperament. Her expression is serene and full of storytelling. She turns sideways to look back at the camera, her posture natural and relaxed. Her arm gently rests on the carved stone railing, fingers slender and long, and the overall look is full of Eastern aesthetic charm. In the foreground is an antique teal stone railing, with its surface bearing the marks of time, carved with intricate cloud and meander patterns. The edges are inlaid with golden lines, with exquisite details. The mottled colors reveal a sense of historical depth. The stone railing's texture is rough yet authentic, forming a sharp contrast with the gentle beauty of the figures. The middle ground depicts the female subject and the architectural part. She is positioned slightly in the center on the right side of the composition, her body slightly tilted, forming a graceful S-shaped curve. The background features the eaves structure of traditional Chinese pavilions and towers, with upturned eaves and layered tiles. The wooden parts show visible painted decorations, interwoven in blue, green, and gold, creating intricate and luxurious patterns typical of Jiangnan gardens. Below the eaves hangs a string of copper bells, which produce crisp sounds when the breeze blows, adding a touch of vitality. In the distance, a hazy white mist slowly rises from gaps between buildings, creating an ethereal and dreamlike atmosphere. In the distance, the silhouette of another ancient building with white walls and gray tiles can be faintly seen, shrouded in mist, faintly visible and elusive, enhancing the spatial layering of the scene; The composition uses a low-angle downward shot to highlight the figure's upright posture and the grandeur of the architecture. The figure occupies the right half of the frame, with more blank space on the left side, creating visual balance. At the same time, the gaze is guided to extend upward from the foreground stone railing to the figure and the building's rooftop, using the building's lines and the curvature of the eaves to form a natural visual guideline. In terms of light and shadow, sunlight streams diagonally from the upper left of the image, creating bright highlights that create soft shadow transitions, enhancing three-dimensionality and giving the figure a more transparent feel. The building's shadows fall on the ground and walls, deepening the sense of realism in the scene. The overall lighting is natural daylight, warm and soft, with warm yellow tones accented with teal and gold, creating a tranquil, poetic, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The overall image presents a cinematic texture, as if stepping out of a quiet moment in an ancient-style art film, with strong artistic appeal and narrative power. It's like shooting with a professional camera in the early morning, capturing a stunning portrait that blends traditional aesthetics with modern aesthetics.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
