        {
          "id": "krea2-1a0aaedf780ea535a886a3fd",
          "alias": "单女礼服桌边坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a burgundy silk spaghetti strap gown sits sideways at a vintage carved wooden dining table. Her shoulders are smooth and graceful, and the thin shoulder straps on her back outline her slender collarbones and spine. The dress fits her body perfectly, the waist is cinched to highlight her curves, and the hem drapes naturally, presenting a silky sheen and delicate pleats. One of her hands rests gently on the table. The other hand hangs naturally, with a calm and elegant posture. In the foreground is a deep brown round solid wood dining table with natural wood grain and traces of time. On the table sits a transparent glass vase adorned with several pure white tulips and green leaves. Next to it is a tall glass vase filled with white daisies, yellow flowers, and blue forget-me-nots. The flowers are lush and the colors fresh and natural. Beneath the vase rests a rough wooden tray, on which is a yellowed old book and a small metal candlestick. The candlestick is adorned with red berries, and a whole lemon lies quietly at the corner of the table. The center is the complete outline of a woman's sitting posture, her body slightly leaning back, leaning against the chair. The background is a warm beige wall with a soft arched doorway structure. The texture of the wall is delicate and slightly mottled, creating a nostalgic and cozy atmosphere. The entire composition is shot from a low angle, with the main figure as the main composition. The flowers and books in the foreground create a sense of layering, guiding the gaze upward from the vase in the lower left corner to the figure. Next, transitioning to the upper right background, light comes from the window on the left side of the image. Soft warm yellow natural light pours in from the side, casting soft shadows on the table and walls. The transition of light and shadow is natural, creating a peaceful, private, and artistic indoor scene. The overall color palette is mainly warm brown, burgundy, and beige, accented with blue, white, and yellow floral accents. The colors are harmonious and unified, with a delicate texture and a cinematic feel of high-end cinematography and a hazy beauty reminiscent of an oil painting. It was as if capturing a tranquil moment of afternoon sunlight streaming through blinds into the old house, full of poetry and the spirit of everyday life, like a classic shot from an art film, combining the warmth of everyday life with an extraordinary artistic style",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
