        {
          "id": "krea2-606f60fff6926fa0e4fb19ca",
          "alias": "单女黑毛衣广场困倦过肩",
          "prompt": "Her makeup is delicate and natural, and her overall aura is fresh and sweet. She wears a black long-sleeve knit sweater paired with a white lapel shirt tied at the collar with a red, white, and blue striped ribbon, looking youthful and elegant. She wears a light gray pleated short skirt, a pair of cream-white platform sneakers, a beige spaghetti strap bag slung over her shoulder, and a black smartphone in both hands. Her posture is natural and relaxed, as if waiting for someone or having just taken photos. The background is a sunny street scene. To the right is a low wall made of irregular stones, with rough textures and mottled light and shadow. To the left is neatly trimmed green shrubs, and behind them are several lush trees with bright green leaves in the sunlight. In the distance, a vintage-style streetlight and a corner of a white building can be faintly seen. A silver car is parked by the roadside, with light brown square tiles laid on the ground. Sunlight slants down from the upper left of the frame, casting clear shadows and figures on the ground. The lighting is warm and soft, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. The overall tone of the scene is warm, filled with a lazy and pleasant summer afternoon atmosphere. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned in the center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The background blur emphasizes the subject, and the lines of the floor tiles in the foreground guide the viewer's gaze toward the figure, creating a sense of depth and realism. The overall style blends Japanese photo and campus elements, with a slight film texture and graininess, as if shot with an old-fashioned film camera. Slight vignetting and color shifts at the edges of the frame enhance the retro nostalgia atmosphere while preserving the clarity and detail of modern digital photography, presenting an overall visual effect that is both realistic and dreamy, allowing people to feel the beauty of youth and the tranquility of life",
