        {
          "id": "krea2-103a6836953bbd062c0ca6e3",
          "alias": "单女灰T恤车库俏皮站立摆拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on the asphalt road of an outdoor parking lot, wearing a gray body-tight camisole with red \"GTENL\" lettering printed on the chest, paired with white high-waisted denim shorts and platform white sneakers. She wears large silver hoop earrings, smiles, leans forward slightly, lifts her left leg, and touches the ground with her toes, presenting a relaxed, natural, and slightly playful pose. Her left hand gently rests on the pull handle of a silver-gray hard-shell suitcase beside her, whose surface features delicate brushed texture and metallic texture. On the right is the edge of a glass door or window, reflecting a blurred image of her legs. The background is a dark gray asphalt road with clear white parking markings, straight and slightly worn. The overall environment is simple and everyday, with a slightly top-down angle. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The foreground is the suitcase and part of the ground, the middle is the main subject, the background is the extended road and distant blurred traffic lines, creating a clear sense of spatial layering. Light comes from the front slightly above. Soft and even, like scattered light on cloudy or evening days, with natural shadow transitions without strong contrasts, creating a fresh, realistic, and lifelike atmosphere. The colors are mainly gray, white, and black, accented with red text and silver accents, creating a clean and crisp visual effect. The overall style leans toward modern urban street photography, with a sense of realism for everyday documentation and subtle artistic touches. It's like capturing a moment outdoors with a professional camera, emphasizing the harmony of natural light and shadow with the posture of the subjects. The details are rich but not cluttered. Highlighting the characters' youthful energy and laid-back temperament, the visuals convey a relaxed mood of preparing to travel or returning from a trip, full of storytelling and immersion",
