        {
          "id": "krea2-dc88cfb85fc08bce666bf203",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙雪地困倦坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden bench outdoors, wearing an off-white lace spaghetti strap dress with elegant shoulder designs that reveal collarbones and shoulder lines. The skirt gently drapes over her legs, showing natural pleats and delicate textures that add a touch of laziness and gentleness. She tilts her head slightly, her overall expression calm and thoughtful. She holds a bouquet of blooming white moth orchids in both hands. The flowers are full and round, petals as white as snow, with pale yellow stamens dotted in the center. The green leaves are slender, and the branches curve naturally, forming a graceful arc with the flowers. The bouquet is placed on her lap, with some branches extending to the right side of the painting, creating a visual sense of extension. In the foreground, the bouquet occupies about one-third of the lower left of the painting, becoming the visual focal point. She is positioned slightly to the left of the center, her body slightly tilted, head slightly lowered, her posture relaxed and expressive. The background is a lush forest, with tall trees standing tall, their trunks thick and their surfaces showing clear bark textures. The leaves are dense, presenting varying layers of green. Under the sunlight, a mottled light and shadow effect is created. In the distance, a Japanese-style wooden cabin can be seen. The roof is made of dark gray tiles, the eaves are slightly raised, and the walls are built from natural wood, with a simple and rustic structure. In front of the cabin is a bamboo lattice fence with a diamond-shaped woven pattern, in a light brownish-yellow color that harmonizes with the surroundings. The composition uses a three-part layout, with the main figure positioned near the left golden ratio point. The bouquet serves as a foreground element to guide the viewer's gaze, while the buildings and trees in the background create a sense of depth and spatial layering Light slanted down from the upper right of the frame, creating a soft backlighting effect. The edges of the figures are shimmered with a golden halo, creating a sense of transparency and soft shadows. Bright light spots shine through the gaps between leaves in the background, creating a bokeh effect that enhances the dreamy atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly warm white, beige, light green, and dark brown, harmoniously unified and full of idyllic charm. The image texture is delicate with a slight film graininess, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera, with slightly out-of-focus lenses and slightly blurred edges. Adding a sense of realism and nostalgia, the alternating light and shadow create a tranquil, warm, and slightly melancholic atmosphere, like a gentle afternoon encounter in the garden. Time seems to stand still, and the entire scene radiates romance, tranquility, and natural beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
