        {
          "id": "krea2-d2a2e4753b631776e6dfb95e",
          "alias": "单女短裙樱花注视",
          "prompt": "Gazing ahead, her expression is calm yet tinged with a hint of worry. Her skin is fair and delicate, and her makeup is natural and elegant. She wears a semi-transparent white wide-sleeved Hanfu, the fabric light and translucent, adorned with delicate golden specks and decorations. The outer sheer sheer fabric is embroidered with exquisite phoenix patterns. The sleeves are wide and the lines are smooth, and the skirt spreads across the floor, forming soft pleats. Gently holding a round fan painted with peony flowers and butterfly patterns, the fan surface is brightly colored, pink peonies in full bloom, green leaves set off with black butterflies fluttering gracefully. The fan ribs are clearly visible, rich in detail. The overall composition centers on the figure, using medium shots to capture the upper body and part of the skirt. The background is a blurred natural environment, with distant tree branches interlacing, white cherry blossoms or apricot blossoms blooming on the branches. Petals drift down, green grass grows thickly, light and shadows dapple through, sunlight streaming through the leaves, forming soft light spots that create a warm and bright atmosphere. The color palette of the painting is mainly white, pink, and green, fresh and elegant, with clear layers of light and shadow, soft shadows, delicate material texture, natural perspective, balanced composition, and prominent subject. The foreground features figures and a round fan, the middle is her body and skirt, the background is blurred woods and flowers, and returning to the fan in hand creates a circular line of sight. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, full of classical beauty, like an ancient-style painting, with strong artistic appeal, as if photographed with a professional camera, yet retaining the natural authenticity of daily life The lens has a slight film texture, moderate color saturation, rich details, and natural light and shadow transitions, presenting an aesthetic style that is both refined and full of life",
          "description": "",
