        {
          "id": "krea2-8100c6e5970fef4d951602e0",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙咖啡厅坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a red leather sofa chair in a high-end restaurant, wearing an off-white strapless dress with a knot at the chest, revealing one shoulder and back line. Her left hand rests naturally on the red leather armrest, her posture elegant and relaxed. She wears several exquisite rings, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with light nail polish. The overall look is simple yet feminine, with a dining table laid with a pristine white tablecloth in the foreground. On the table is a complete set of Western tableware, including black cutlery and forks, neatly folded white napkins, a tray with red edges and a white base, and amber drinks in a transparent glass. Beside it is a small bowl of deep red berries, a small plate of pastries, and a plate of breadsticks. The table is tidy and orderly, presenting a sense of ritual for high-end dining. The center frame shows the restaurant's interior, with multiple tables staggered, each covered with white tablecloths and fitted with red leather seats. In the background, you can see a tall wooden wine cabinet displaying various bottles and decorations. Above the wine cabinet, warm-toned lighting creates a cozy atmosphere. Large black-and-white art photos hang on the wall, including a portrait of a woman in a formal dress, adding an artistic touch. The dining room is spacious, with a dark gray carpet on the floor. The overall lighting is soft and dim, with main light sources from ceiling spotlights and localized lighting inside the wine cabinet, creating a warm golden glow that highlights the main contours and texture. The composition combines close-ups with medium scenes, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, occupying the visual focal point. The background blur makes the main subject stand out more while preserving enough environmental information to explain the scene. The perspective is clear, and the lines along the dining table edge extend into the distance, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. Following her gaze and hand movements, she leads to the details on the table, then extends to the wine cabinet and artistic paintings in the background, forming a natural viewing path. The overall atmosphere is luxurious and private, combining modern fashion with vintage artistic style. The colors are mainly red, white, and black, accented with gold and amber. It creates a strong contrast yet harmonious unity, with delicate image texture and professional studio-level light and shadow control and color reproduction. It feels like shooting with a high-end full-frame camera paired with a large-aperture prime lens, simulating the shallow depth of field effect of real portrait photography, while preserving rich environmental details and authentic life atmosphere, presenting a refined yet everyday urban aesthetic style",
