        {
          "id": "krea2-12e16c6bd416d8d1b7a32ec5",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣城市坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a rattan chair in an outdoor café, her expression calm yet revealing a subtle sense of detachment. Her arms are crossed over her chest, her posture naturally relaxed yet tinged with a sense of defense and independence. She wears an off-white sleeveless V-neck knit tank top, adorned with a black bow on the chest, and paired with a matching high-waisted knit skirt. The overall look is simple and elegant, with a delicate golden four-leaf clover necklace around her neck, a pearl bracelet, and a silver bracelet on her wrist. The details are exquisite and full of everyday life. In the foreground is a white dining table with a brown ceramic plate on it, filled with fresh Caesar salad. The lettuce, bacon pieces, Parmesan cheese, and croutouts are clearly visible. The plate's surface has a natural textured texture. In the background is the café entrance with red brick walls. Through the arched doorway, you can see warm lighting and blurred customer figures. On both sides of the entrance hang a black fan along the wall, decorated above with dense green vines and blooming pink bougainvillea, with lush flowers and lush green leaves. Creating a romantic and cozy atmosphere, several warm yellow wall lamps emit a soft glow that illuminates the entire scene. On the left side of the frame, another woman sits in a distant seat, looking down at her phone, adding a touch of real life to the scene. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, body slightly angled to the right, and the head turning slightly to the right, creating a natural visual guide. The foreground tray and the figure create visual layers, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The light comes from natural daylight, bright and soft. Sunlight pours in from the right, with soft shadows that are not jarring. The overall color palette is dominated by warm yellow, off-white, red brick brown, and lush greenery. The colors are harmonious and unified, presenting a lazy and leisurely afternoon atmosphere. The image texture is close to everyday amateur photography, with a slight film graininess and natural exposure control, as if captured with a smartphone or a portable camera. It captures quiet and beautiful moments in urban life. The composition is stable and balanced, with a natural and smooth visual guidance, extending from the foreground plate to the figure. Leading further into the background inside the café, a complete narrative thread is formed. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, gentle, and full of poetic life—like a carefully arranged artistic portrait and a casual snapshot of real life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
