        {
          "id": "krea2-18fc67b6d7e35979abe9a81c",
          "alias": "单女蓝制服床忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a dark blue school uniform jacket paired with a white shirt and a green-white striped tie sits on a bed covered with white sheets. Her body leans slightly, her right hand gently resting on an open fashion magazine, exuding youth and tranquility. On her wrist is a silver bracelet, with nails painted light blue. The details are exquisite and authentic. She lies on a slightly messy but clean white bed, with natural folds of the sheets, presenting a sense of everyday life. The background is a simple indoor environment, with pure white walls and a slanted skylight on the sloping ceiling that lets in soft natural light. Light pours in from the upper left, creating a warm and evenly diffused glow that illuminates the entire scene and creates a bright and fresh atmosphere. On the wall, a white power outlet and a slender electrical wire can be seen, adding a sense of realism and everyday life to the space. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right, heads slightly tilted, creating direct communication with the viewer. The magazine section in the foreground is clearly visible, with blurred portraits and text printed on it, adding narrative elements to the image. The middle ground features the figure's body and bed, while the background includes walls, skylights, and outlets, with distinct layers. The contrast of light and shadow highlights the outlines of the figures and the texture of the clothing. The color scheme is harmonious and unified, creating a fresh, artistic, and slightly nostalgic campus style. The image has a strong sense of daily life and life, as if taken with a regular camera at home, with a slight grainy film texture and soft depth of field. The background blur is well handled, making the subject stand out. The lighting is soft and shadows delicate, without excessive or exaggerated highlights. The overall atmosphere is warm, peaceful, and healing, like a quiet afternoon with sunlight streaming through the window into the room. The girl lounges lazily, immersed in her own world. The scene is full of youthful vitality and a subtle melancholy. It gives a sense of pure beauty and tranquility",
