        {
          "id": "krea2-45ae7347e97cf64909cc06b7",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙庭院站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beneath the sun-dappled grapevine trellis, slightly tilting her head up toward the camera. Her right hand holds up a bunch of plump, rounded teal-green grapes, as if about to taste. On her left arm is a small, delicate pink tattoo pattern. She wears a deep blue sleeveless dress with small white floral patterns. Her shoulders are graceful, her overall posture naturally relaxed, full of youthful energy and pastoral poetry. In the foreground are clearly visible grape vines and several broad green leaves, one of which falls just above her right shoulder. This creates a natural decorative effect. The middle ground is a half-body close-up of the woman, with a slightly tilted perspective in the composition, placing the figure on the right side of the frame, leaving space on the left for grapevines and background, creating a sense of visual balance and breathability. The background features lush green plants, with layers of leaves creating rich light and shadow under sunlight. Some areas are filtered by sunlight forming soft light spots, and in the distance, some blurred architectural outlines and trees can be faintly seen, suggesting this is an outdoor courtyard or garden environment. Light pours down from above and sides, creating a warm and bright natural lighting effect. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting delicate and dynamic shadows on and around the figures. The transitions of shadows are natural, creating a fresh, tranquil, and vibrant overall atmosphere. The color scheme is dominated by green, harmoniously unified colors. The composition uses the curves of grapevines and the extension of leaves to guide the viewer from the fruit in the foreground to the figure, then upward into the depths of the background greenery, forming a smooth visual flow. The composition has a strong summer atmosphere and a sense of life. It feels like a real moment casually captured with a daily camera, carrying an unintentional sense of beauty and intimacy. The details are rich and layered, combining artistic aesthetic pursuit with the warmth and spontaneity of real life, presenting an overall tranquil and beautiful pastoral poetic artistic conception",
