        {
          "id": "krea2-ee054af9cfd733c2fb64a2e6",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤船上忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the deck of a white yacht, wearing a light, flowing white semi-transparent long-sleeved top, paired with a light blue spaghetti-strap camisole underneath, and dark blue loose jeans. The overall look is fresh and natural, yet fashionable. She smiles brightly, looking directly at the camera, making a playful \"V\" gesture with her right hand, and her left hand naturally resting on her knee. On her wrist, she wears a slender gold bracelet. She wears exquisite double C logo earrings, and a thin gold necklace around her neck highlights her elegant temperament. She sits relaxed and confident, her body slightly tilted to the camera, showing her natural silhouette. In the foreground is the yacht's white deck and silver metal railings, whose smooth surface reflects a cold metallic texture. In the middle is the woman herself, positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, occupying the main visual focus. The composition adopts a slightly top-down perspective, enhancing the sense of space and the three-dimensionality of the figure. The background is a vast, calm sea surface, with deep blue-green tones and delicate ripples. In the distance, water and sky meet, forming a blurred horizontal line. The sky is gloomy, the light is evenly soft and even, without strong shadows. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is peaceful and slightly cool, like natural light at dusk or on cloudy days, creating a leisurely and pleasant vacation atmosphere. The colors are mainly cool tones, with white, blue, and gray intertwining, highlighting the purity of the subject and the sense of openness in the environment. The composition is simple yet layered. The visual guide naturally extends from the railing lines in the foreground to the figures, then transitions to the background sea surface, creating a smooth flow of sightlines. Overall, it presents a realistic feeling of everyday life shot with a mobile phone, as if capturing beautiful moments casually during travel. With slight camera noise and authentic color reproduction, it simulates the texture of amateur equipment shooting, capturing youthful vitality and free moments, full of life atmosphere and artistic beauty",
