        {
          "id": "krea2-488b2819542f646a532ad58b",
          "alias": "单女白T恤教室坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a desk and chair in the classroom, exuding a fresh and sweet aura. She wears a white short-sleeved T-shirt with deep blue trim at the collar and cuffs, paired with dark blue shorts, white over-the-knee socks, and black platform shoes. Her legs are crossed and stacked, her posture naturally relaxed. Her right hand rests gently on her knee, while her left hand hangs naturally. Her body leans slightly forward, presenting a posture that combines youthful energy and sensibility. In the foreground is a yellow desk surface, and the smooth surface reflects the reflection of her legs and shoes, creating a mirror-like effect. In the middle is the wooden desk and chair she sits. The tabletop is light yellow with slightly worn edges. The chair's backrest is made of yellow wooden planks, with clean and practical lines. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the composition, using a central composition. The figure occupies the main visual space. The background is a blurred classroom environment, where a white blackboard can be seen, faintly with handwritten text and patterns. The wall is light gray, and light streams in diagonally from the left window, casting clear strips of light and shadow on the figure and wall, creating a visual effect of alternating light and shadow Sunlight streams in through blinds or glass windows, producing regular parallel beams of light. The direction of light and shadow is side backlight, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly white, yellow, and blue, with fresh and bright colors, moderate contrast, rich details, and a realistic texture. The image has a strong sense of daily life and life, resembling a real scene shot with a regular camera, with slight film graininess and natural noise. The lens focal length is close to a standard lens, depth of field is well controlled, and the background blurs naturally. Highlighting the main characters, the overall style is realistic and artistically beautiful, presenting a tranquil and beautiful campus moment, full of youthful energy and gentle emotions. The visual atmosphere is warm and comfortable, with rich layers of light and shadow, and exquisite detail handling, giving a dreamlike yet tangible visual experience",
