          "id": "krea2-03b972995c33916bc8bc80c1",
          "alias": "单女灰连体衣街道冷淡站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an autumn street, gently swaying in the breeze, exuding natural dynamism and vitality. Her overall temperament is elegant and approachable. She wears a uniquely designed deep gray long-sleeve bodysuit, featuring a hollowed-out woven structure that creates a bone- or mesh texture. Cross-strapped straps on the chest and waist create a visual layering and sheer effect, accentuating her body curves while retaining a subtle sense of mystery. She pairs it with high-waisted slim-fit jeans that fit her body perfectly. It outlines smooth leg lines with a natural texture, with slight wash marks and natural folds. A dark leather handbag slung across the shoulder, with classic patterns on the body and exquisite edges. The overall look is fashionable and full of personality. Both hands make heart-shaped gestures on the chest, fingers are long, and the movements are natural, conveying feelings of love and warmth. The background is an autumn tree-lined avenue, lined with tall trees lining the road, their leaves showing golden and orange-red warm tones. Some leaves have already fallen, scattered along the roadside and surface. A thick carpet of fallen leaves forms a thick carpet, with sunlight streaming through gaps in the canopy, creating mottled shadows. The light is soft and directional, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The sky is obscured by leaves, revealing only a small patch of pale blue. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow, balanced by cool tones such as deep gray, deep blue, and brown. The composition uses a central composition, with the figures positioned slightly below the center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The road in the background extends into the distance, forming a guiding line that enhances the sense of spatial depth. The foreground features scattered dead leaves and white road markings, adding realism and a sense of life. The middle ground is the transition between the subject and the surrounding environment, while the background is blurred trees and distant streets, highlighting the subject while maintaining a sense of cohesion. In terms of lighting and shadow, sunlight slants down from the upper right, creating distinct contour light and highlights on the subject. The shadows are soft and the contrast between light and shadow is moderate, creating an overall atmosphere that is warm, romantic, and slightly poetic, like a carefully photographed street scene. It carries a strong sense of life and artistic beauty, as if capturing an ordinary yet beautiful moment, allowing people to feel the warmth of autumn and the beauty of life",
