          "id": "krea2-8297223fc3ae25808e28b5a3",
          "alias": "单女制服户外害羞站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a Japanese-style sailor uniform stands in front of the green wire fence at the outdoor sports field, her expression focused yet slightly shy. She wears a white short-sleeved sailor collar top with gray and red stripes on the collar and cuffs, a large red bow with white dots tied around the chest, and a light blue pleated skirt with red piping along the hem. On her left wrist, she wears a simple silver bracelet, on her right ring finger a small ring, and holds an open comic book in both hands. The pages are brightly colored and printed with cartoon character designs. The main subject of the painting is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, with the body slightly turned to the right and head slightly lowered. The gaze falls on the book in hand, forming a natural visual guideline. The middle ground is a sports field covered with green artificial turf, with red running track lines on the ground. In the distance, several abandoned wooden benches and black plastic chairs can be seen. The background is dense green trees and shrubs, sunlight filtering through the leaves casting dappled light and shadow, creating a soft contrast of light and dark. The overall composition uses a third-level layout, with the figure occupying the left third of the frame. The right side leaves ample space to display the background environment. The barbed wire runs diagonally across the entire frame, creating a strong geometric division and perspective effect. The camera shoots from a slightly higher angle, capturing the subject's full posture from the entire body to above the knees. The lighting is natural afternoon light, warm and soft, illuminating from the upper right to create a peaceful and tranquil atmosphere. The color scheme is mainly fresh and bright green, accented with white, red, and blue. The overall tone is harmonious and unified, and the image quality is close to the realism of everyday phone photography. With slight noise and natural depth blur, the focus is on the main subject while preserving environmental details, presenting a snapshot of youthful campus life—as if frozen on a quiet afternoon after school, with a faint scent of grass and sunlight in the air. The composition is layered, the visual guidance is natural and smooth, the lighting and shadows are delicate and authentic, and the overall atmosphere is warm, nostalgic, and full of youthful energy",
