          "id": "krea2-6db303124ebf388f3498d1ac",
          "alias": "单女米T恤冷淡站立",
          "prompt": "A low-angle upward shot of a woman standing under the dusk sky, wearing a beige pleated camisole top, paired with a black spaghetti-strap bra that is faintly visible, paired with army green cargo pants. The overall look is simple yet layered. Looking directly into the camera, it seems to be whispering or deep thought. Her right hand gently strokes her abdomen, with multiple silver rings on her fingers. Her nails are painted with white and gold gradient nails, with exquisite details. On her earlobes are tiny pearl studs, adding a touch of elegance, with a vast deep blue sky as the background. Scattered with sparse pale pink clouds, presenting the unique tranquility and gentleness of dusk. The composition centers on the figures, occupying the left side, leaving a large expanse of sky on the right as the background, creating a strong visual contrast. Light and shadow come from the upper right, creating a warm yet slightly cool atmosphere. Light shines from the side, emphasizing contours and three-dimensionality. The overall tone is cool, dominated by blue, but the warm colors of the skin and clothing create a subtle contrast, enhancing visual appeal. The painting has a strong artistic sense and emotional expression. It seems to capture a quiet yet story-filled moment, like a real-life scene shot with an amateur camera, with slight noise and natural color transitions, emphasizing realism and everyday atmosphere. The background blur makes the subject stand out, and the overall image conveys feelings of loneliness, freedom, and self-exploration. It feels both like a carefully crafted artistic portrait and an unintentionally recorded moment of life, full of poetry and modernity",
