          "id": "krea2-cf9cea281556ec2f1349350c",
          "alias": "单女紫毛衣酒廊忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits gracefully on a wooden lounge chair outdoors, wearing a light purple knit off-shoulder top adorned with a fluffy, soft purple plush collar on her shoulders. Her white high-waisted wide-leg jeans are simple and neat, paired with silver stiletto sandals with a shiny metallic texture. Her toes are painted with red nail polish, adding a touch of brightness. She sits sideways, legs naturally crossed, one foot lightly resting on an old wooden platform in front, her posture relaxed yet stylish, with a hint of calm melancholy. In the foreground is a rough wooden platform with obvious wood grain and wear marks on the surface, with irregular edges that give off a rustic industrial feel. In the middle is a light-colored wooden recliner with a white canvas cushion that stretches flat. Behind the chair are several bundles of golden haystacks, rounded and clear, scattered across the green lawn, with some withered yellow leaves showing the transition of seasons. The background is a dense deep green shrub. Layers of leaves and mottled light and shadow create a rich sense of depth. The composition is shot from a low angle, with the subject shot from the lower left looking upright, making the figure appear more upright. In composition, the figure is positioned slightly to the right, forming the visual focal point. The left blank space includes wooden boards and some grass to balance the composition. Using haystacks and trees as natural frameworks guides the gaze to focus on the figures, with light coming from the upper left, soft natural light evenly spreading over the figure, creating delicate shadow transitions. The wrinkles and plush details of the clothing are clearly visible. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting mottled light spots, creating a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly green, purple, and white, paired with golden hay and brown wood. The colors are harmonious and layered, with subtle contrasts of light and shadow, including bright highlights and deep shadows, enhancing the sense of depth. The image presents a realistic style that combines artistry with everyday life, as if shot outdoors under natural light with a professional camera. It captures a quiet and beautiful moment, with a slight film texture and soft depth-of-field blur. The plants in the background and distant shadows are moderately blurred to highlight the main subject while preserving environmental information. The entire scene exudes a relaxed, comfortable, and slightly artistic atmosphere, like a quiet monologue in a film, allowing people to feel the slow flow of time and inner peace",
