        {
          "id": "krea2-2db62709fb6b1abb93268135",
          "alias": "单女牛仔庭院愤怒站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of outdoor greenery, exuding a fresh, natural, and slightly lazy vibe. She wears a black-and-white striped cropped crop top paired with a washed, distressed, high-waisted denim skirt. The hem edges show slight wear and faded details, giving off a vintage feel. She wears a light khaki loose casual blazer with sleeves casually rolled up to reveal her forearms. Her left hand gently lifts a corner of the jacket, while her right hand holds a pink-purple gradient cold drink. The transparent body reveals the layers of the drink inside, paired with a blue straw. The hand posture is naturally relaxed, with neatly trimmed nails painted in light pink polish. The wrist wears a delicate silver bracelet, the body slightly leans to the side, and the center of gravity is slightly shifted, creating a relaxed and casual posture. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left center, with a medium shot using a medium portrait. The figure occupies about two-thirds of the height of the frame, leaving enough space to create the ambiance. The foreground is a floor paved with dark gray gravel, rough and distinct grains. The middle shot features the main figure and some outdoor furniture, including a white folding chair. There is a vague English logo on the back of the chair, and next to it is a small wooden table with a dark blue hat and a black plate. The background is a dense, lush green shrub, with layers of leaves forming a natural green barrier. Sunlight pours in from the upper right, warm and bright but not glaring, presenting the natural lighting effect of afternoon or evening. The color saturation is moderate, with a slight film texture. The image has a clear depth of field, and the background blur highlights the subject while retaining certain details, resulting in a balanced and harmonious composition. It creates a leisurely and pleasant atmosphere in daily life, as if captured in a café courtyard or garden corner. The images present the natural beauty of real-life scenes, combining fashion and approachability. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and comfortable, like street photos taken with a regular camera on sunny days, full of youthful energy and artistic flair",
