          "id": "krea2-1a4e6a6d87612ea3d9197b11",
          "alias": "单女粉毛衣森林自信展示",
          "prompt": "She wears a light pink short-sleeved knit top paired with a gray high-waisted long skirt, whose loose, flowing hem spreads across the floor. The overall look is elegant and fresh, with a dignified and composed posture, presenting a serene yet approachable temperament. In the foreground is a rough-textured gray stone slab floor edged with wooden railings stretching across the edges. In the middle is a calm pond, with the water reflecting the surrounding green trees and buildings. Several natural stones of various sizes are stacked along the pond's edge. On the left side of the background is a traditional Japanese shrine building, with a roof covered in dark gray tiles and upturned eaves. The structure is simple and elegant, with wooden walls and columns showing signs of time. On the right is a partial view of another traditional Japanese house, with off-white walls, window frames and balcony railings in natural wood. In the distance, lush mountains with bamboo groves and broadleaf trees grow intertwined, creating rich layers. Sunlight pours through the gaps in the leaves, creating mottled shadows. The light is soft and warm, presenting a golden tone for morning or evening. The overall composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly below the center of the frame. The architecture and natural scenery in the background create symmetry and balance. The visual guide extends from the stone-paved path in the foreground to the pond in the center, then leads to the shrine and forest in the background, creating a sense of depth and spatial layering. The atmosphere of light and shadow is tranquil and harmonious, full of Zen and poetry, with tones mainly green, gray, and brown. Accented with light pink and gray-white clothing in a harmonious and unified color, the overall image resembles a carefully shot Japanese-style photo shoot, featuring slight film graininess and natural depth blur effects. It feels like using a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens outdoors in natural light. The details are clear, colors are true, the atmosphere immersive, and full of artistic beauty and everyday life, showcasing a tranquil moment of harmony between humans and nature",
