        {
          "id": "krea2-e51b654b28562e530b6238be",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙泳池俏皮坐出神",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the edge of the fountain, wearing an elegant white spaghetti strap long dress with a naturally flowing hem that fits the figure smoothly. The thin straps outline the graceful contours of her collarbones, and the V-neck design adds a touch of sexiness and intellect. The overall look is simple yet sophisticated, appearing lively and natural. She leans slightly to the side, her posture relaxed yet full of tension. Her right hand rests gently on her knee, fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed, and she wears exquisite gold earrings that sparkle softly in the sunlight, looking straight into the camera. The expression is gentle yet tinged with a hint of detachment, as if lost in thought or gazing into the distance. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the foreground, occupying the visual center. The composition uses a three-part method, with the figure and the fountain forming a diagonal relationship to enhance the dynamic feel of the scene. The fountain is in the middle of the scene, with water jets shooting upward from the bottom of the pool, forming an arc-shaped curtain. The droplets sparkle in the sunlight, reflecting scattered light and splashes, creating a light and flowing atmosphere. The water surface appears emerald green, reflecting the sky and surrounding trees, with delicate ripples and interwoven light and shadow. Adding layers, the background is dense green trees and neatly trimmed shrubs. The leaves are layered and the colors are well balanced. In the distance, tall trees can be faintly seen, with thick branches and lush canopies forming a natural green barrier. The light is soft and bright, typical of afternoon natural light. Sunlight streams diagonally from the upper left, creating a clear transition of light and shadow, soft shadows, and strong three-dimensionality. At the same time, soft light spots are cast on the ground and water surface, enhancing realism. The overall color scheme is mainly white and green, accented with gray stone and gold ornaments. The colors are harmonious and unified, creating a tranquil and elegant atmosphere, full of poetry and romance. It resembles a carefully composed outdoor portrait with strong visual guidance, extending along body lines to fountains and backgrounds, forming a naturally flowing visual path. Details are rich, texture delicate, clothing wrinkles are natural, water droplets are transparent and glossy, leaf textures are clear, and stone surfaces are rough and bearing signs of age. Overall, it presents a professional-level photographic aesthetic, similar to shooting with a high-end camera and large aperture lenses. Proper out-of-focus blur processing, blurred backgrounds without loss of detail, highlighting the subject. The image has extremely high resolution and clarity, making it suitable for fashion shoots or personal portrait creation",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
