          "id": "krea2-d4c5c14ae56551b46e75924f",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣小径严肃站立出神",
          "prompt": "She wears a white hollow-out knit short-sleeve top made of lightweight and breathable fabric, with delicate textures clearly visible. The neckline is slightly open, revealing the collarbone line. The overall look is simple yet elegant. She carries a black leather shoulder bag with the strap slung across her chest, her hand naturally resting on it. On her wrist, she wears a red bracelet that adds a touch of brightness to the overall understated tone. Her posture is slightly turned to the side, The head is slightly turned toward the camera, looking straight ahead, with a calm and reserved expression, as if gazing into the distance. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the composition, creating a dynamic balance. The left side has more blank space, enhancing the sense of space and breathability. The foreground is a half-body close-up of the subject, rich in detail. The middle is a tree-lined path extending into the distance, lined with tall trees lined neatly on both sides. Their trunks are thick and upright, their bark textured and distinct, and their branches and leaves lush and green, forming a dense canopy. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting mottled light and shadow, creating interplay of light and shadow. The ground is paved with gray stone bricks, with fallen leaves and fine dust in the gaps. The light and shadow cast long tree shadows on the ground. The background is a row of white walls, flat and simple, with subtle vertical textures. The edges of the wall tops are clear, while the distant walls gradually blur, creating a strong sense of depth. The entire scene presents a tranquil and fresh summer atmosphere. The light comes from the upper left, belonging to soft natural daylight, with moderate brightness and no strong contrast. The shadow transitions are smooth and the contours soft. The leaves in the background are outlined by backlight to create bright contours, creating a subtle halo effect. The overall color scheme is mainly green and white, accented with black and gray. The color coordination is harmonious and unified, extending along the line of sight to the end of the road and back to the surrounding environment, forming a complete visual closed loop. The composition uses a third-division method, with the main subject leaning to the right, and background lines guiding the gaze deeper to enhance the spatial layering of the image. The overall style combines everyday realism with artistic beauty. It feels like shooting with a regular camera, with slight film graininess and natural exposure control, details preserved intact, without deliberate beautification, yet full of life and youthful charm",
