        {
          "id": "krea2-9cac59603d58ad347e1d6c20",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣户外微笑站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors under natural light, appearing lively and natural, with a faint smile. Her overall temperament is gentle and serene. She wears a blue Chinese-style stand-collar top adorned with two white buttons at the collar, layered with a white knit cardigan. The material is light and breathable, with clearly visible texture. She wears a pair of exquisite silver earrings, composed of cross-shaped metal ornaments and slender danglings, designed simply yet full of detail. Her right hand gently holds a bouquet of pale yellow lilies, the flowers about to bloom. The petals are pure white with a soft tender yellow, the green leaves are tall and upright, with slightly curled edges, giving the overall posture an elegant posture. The composition uses close-ups: the figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, with the head slightly tilted and the gaze slightly lowered, creating a restrained and reserved aesthetic. The foreground features a clear lily and some arm outlines, the middle is the main subject, with blurred stone walls and autumn trees in the background. The leaves display interwoven orange-red, golden, and deep green hues, with dappled light and shadow as sunlight slants in from the upper left. It creates a soft backlighting effect, with natural shadow transitions. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and warm, carrying the unique laziness and poetry of an autumn afternoon. The main color tones are blue, white, and yellow, complemented by warm tones in the background. The colors are harmonious and unified, giving it a strong Japanese photo style. It feels as if you were shooting with an entry-level full-frame camera paired with a standard prime lens. The lens is slightly out of focus, bringing a genuine humanistic texture. The image has a slight film graininess and low-contrast color grading. Simulating natural moments casually captured with a phone or portable camera in daily life, the composition emphasizes blank space and breathability. Characters occupy about two-thirds of the frame, background blur is well handled, highlighting the subject while preserving environmental information, presenting an overall tranquil, gentle, and slightly artistic everyday aesthetic, like an image capturing fragments of time, full of life and emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
