        {
          "id": "krea2-8aa6fb73d071ee1f679d7aa3",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙城市沉思坐",
          "prompt": "She wears a white lace short-sleeved dress with delicate ruffles at the collar and cuffs. Her fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed, and she looks directly at the camera, her expression gentle yet slightly thoughtful. Her overall posture appears quiet and elegant. In the background is the round dining table where she sits, an off-white table with subtle textures. On the table is a set of utensils, including silver knives and forks, spoons, and a blue plastic napkin clip. Next to it is a neatly folded white napkin. In the background, a waiter wearing a white shirt and gray apron is busily tidying up the table with natural movements. deep in the background, there are other customers, one wearing a green-and-white striped top sitting on a blue-and-white checkered chair. The scene in the picture shows the café's interior space, with multiple seating areas. The floor is covered with light wood flooring in a herringbone pattern, and the walls are light beige. Some walls are fitted with glass display cabinets displaying products. The ceiling features embedded spotlights for illumination, providing soft and even lighting. Through the large windows, you can see the cityscape outside, with blurred pedestrians and architectural silhouettes. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, and the perspective is slightly overlooked. The shallow depth of field effect makes the foreground clear and the background blurred, creating spatial layering and emotional communication points. The lighting and shadow atmosphere are warm and gentle, with indoor lighting blending with natural light outside to create subtle contrasts of light and shadow. The shadows are soft, and the colors are white, beige, light blue, Gray is the main color, with a fresh and elegant tone. The overall image has the texture of everyday life, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains the details and atmosphere of real scenes, presenting an imaging style that is both refined and full of life",
