        {
          "id": "krea2-535905b27da2fadc8fdc9202",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫家中站立持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a white ruffled V-neck shirt with flared cuffs. The fabric is light and flowing, with rich layers. Underneath, she wears a burgundy spaghetti strap dress with a bow in the same color at the waist. The lines are clean and smooth, and the overall look is both intellectual and sweet. Around his neck is a delicate gold necklace, perfectly adorned. In the foreground, the upper body is a close-up, fully presented from the chest upward, highlighting his expression and costume details. In the center is a row of wooden bookshelves behind the figures. The bookshelves are neatly structured, made of dark brown solid wood with natural wood grain. The shelves hold many books, with a wide variety of books and covers in different colors—red, blue, yellow, white, etc. Some books stand upright, some horizontally, arranged in a well-arranged manner that is orderly but not rigid. The text on the spine is blurred and visible, creating a strong cultural atmosphere. The background is a light gray wall with fine textures, the lighting is soft and even, and the overall environment is quiet and warm. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, giving a clear visual focus that gradually spreads to clothing details and background elements. The image has a good sense of spatial layering. Light and shadow come from the left, creating soft side lighting, while the right side creates natural shadows to enhance three-dimensionality, with warm lighting texture. Similar to natural light or softbox effects, it creates a comfortable and tranquil atmosphere. The overall color palette mainly consists of white, burgundy, and brown, presenting a sophisticated and fresh visual experience. The image texture is delicate and rich, as if shot with a professional camera, yet still carries a sense of everyday warmth. It is like a daily portrait taken in a private study or at home, full of life atmosphere and artistic beauty. The images are tranquil and full of storytelling, giving a gentle and intellectual impression, suitable for fashion display or personal image documentation.",
          "description": "",
