        {
          "id": "krea2-a9f2658246814825cc1f1b6b",
          "alias": "单女严肃持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a light white Hanfu, the fabric as soft and flowing as clouds. The wide sleeves hung down, the collar slightly open, revealing the collarbones and neckline. The pleats on the body naturally stretched out, and the material had a semi-transparent texture, subtly revealing the contours of her skin. At her waist was a dark brocade sash embroidered with fine subtle patterns, adding an elegant charm. Her right hand gently lifts, and her fingertips lightly touch the blooming white daisies beside her. The petals are delicate, the stems are slender, the clusters are dense, varying in height. Some flowers are blurred in the foreground, creating a sense of layering. The background is a blurred green vegetation, and sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting dappled shadows to create soft halos and spots. The light shines diagonally from the upper left, creating a contrast of light and shadow that highlights the main contour. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the main position, slightly to the right. Leaving blank space on the left side creates a sense of breath, the background gradually blurs, using a shallow depth effect to enhance depth, then extending to the flower beds and background to form a flowing visual path. The colors are mainly cool whites and tender greens, accented with pale yellow and gray-brown, creating a harmonious and unified atmosphere. The atmosphere is tranquil and far-reaching, full of poetic and classical beauty, as if immersed in spring mountains, with a gentle breeze and the fragrance of flowers. The image has slight film graininess and natural overexposure marks, simulating the texture of everyday amateur camera shooting while preserving real light and shadow details and color deviations, creating a lifelike artistic atmosphere, presenting an overall gentle, tranquil, and transcendent Eastern aesthetic conception",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
