        {
          "id": "krea2-b84c259ce57a253ade8687bc",
          "alias": "单女短裙街道站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an outdoor asphalt road, wearing an off-white one-shoulder pleated top and a colorful tie-dye skirt. Her left hand gently strokes her head, pushing her sunglasses to the hairline. She slightly tilts her head to look to the right side of the frame, her posture elegant and natural, her right hand extended to one side as if taking a selfie. In the background is a winding road, with neatly arranged yellow and black warning posts along the roadside. In the distance, green trees provide shade and lush foliage. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting dappled light and shadow, creating a pale blue gradient in the sky. The overall lighting is soft and bright, presenting a warm summer afternoon atmosphere. The composition combines close-ups with medium shots. The figures occupy the left side of the frame, leaving space on the right to express the extension of the road, forming a visual guideline. The colors are mainly light tones, complemented by green vegetation and colorful clothing to create a fresh and natural visual experience. The camera captures unintentional moments from daily life, with a subtle film texture and realistic light and shadow effects It's as if you're casually shooting with a regular camera. The details are rich, the clothes wrinkle naturally, the transition between light and shadow is soft, and the overall atmosphere is relaxed and comfortable, full of youthful energy and a sense of life. It has a strong sense of realism and approachability, allowing people to feel a peaceful and beautiful everyday moment",
