        {
          "id": "krea2-00dd1fed00b538e10223869d",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙室内自信站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands indoors, naturally draped over her shoulders, slightly gazing at the camera with a subtle sense of mystery. She wears a tight black slip dress that accentuates her slender waistline and slender silhouette. Layered with a beige, puffy plush jacket, the plush texture is soft and thick, with naturally flared edges creating a warm and luxurious visual effect. She wears black stockings on both legs, black high heels, and black garter stockings at her ankles. The overall look is both sexy and elegant, and her right hand is gently raised. Grasping the sleeve of her plush jacket, her body slightly leaned to the side, her posture calm and confident. Her left arm hangs naturally, and her left hand rests gently on a metal shelf beside her. In the background is a large round mirror, reflecting her reflection and details in the room, including a magnificent crystal chandelier. The chandelier is made of multiple glass candlesticks, its light soft and bright, emitting a warm yellow glow that illuminates the entire space. The mirror's edges are framed with gold, adding a touch of vintage luxury. On the right is a shelf combining transparent glass and metal frames, housing a classic Marshall speaker. The speaker shell is black, the front panel features a silver-gray checkered design, topped with a gold brand logo, and beside it is a lit white candle. The flame flickers softly, emitting a soft glow. The floor is covered with a black plush carpet, dense and fluffy, adding layers and comfort to the space. Soft shadows are distributed around the figure and on the ground, creating a cozy, private, and slightly atmospheric atmosphere. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center. The mirror reflection enhances spatial depth, extending along body lines to the legs and hand movements. Through reflections and background elements in the mirror, a closed loop is formed, with even light and shadow distribution. Dark areas appear on the ground and corners, with the overall color scheme mainly black, white, and beige. Accented with gold and silver, the colors are harmonious and unified, giving a strong sense of fashion and artistic beauty. The image texture is delicate and rich, as if shot with a professional camera in a carefully arranged indoor scene. It has a high-end photographic feel while retaining the warmth of everyday life, making it suitable for fashion portraits or lifestyle content creation",
