        {
          "id": "krea2-e7ef1b984dac3e9c4c497e60",
          "alias": "单女粉礼服酒店困倦倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman in a pink strapless gown leans elegantly against the wall of a modern-style hotel corridor, her makeup exquisite, hands folded over her chest, her posture composed and expressive. The upper half of the dress is designed short to fit the figure, covered with fine, sparkling silver beads and sequins, shimmering softly under soft light. The skirt is layered and made of light pink tulle fabric, edged with fluffy, soft pink feather tassels. As the body tilts and the skirt unfolds, it forms a graceful curve, trailing across the floor. Her long trailing tail unfolds like petals, creating a dreamy visual effect. She wears a pair of thin-strapped high-heeled sandals, with sparkling elements on the upper of the shoes echoing the dress. The overall look is luxurious yet lively. In the foreground, the main figure and its ornate skirt details are visible. The middle frame extends deep into the corridor, flanked by beige wooden walls and neatly arranged doors. The floor is covered with blue-and-white geometric carpets with delicate textures, allowing light to stream in from afar, giving the corridor a sense of varying depths and layers. The composition uses a classic diagonal layout, with the figure positioned slightly toward the center on the right side of the frame. The gaze naturally leads to the end of the deep corridor on the left, emphasizing the sense of spatial depth through perspective. At the same time, the low-angle downward view highlights the figure's slender figure and the three-dimensional structure of the clothing. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft and bright, with the main light sources coming from the ceiling and natural light from distant windows. The light evenly falls on the figure, forming clear contour light and soft shadows, with well-handled background blur. While highlighting the main subject, it retains the texture and details of the environment. The overall color palette is mainly pink, blue, and beige, with harmonious and sophisticated color combinations. The visuals are filled with the refined vibe of a fashion blockbuster while maintaining the everyday feel of real scenes. It feels like a high-end portrait shot with a professional camera, delivering strong visual impact and artistic appeal. Like classic moments in movies, it captures a perfect blend of elegance, confidence, and beauty, creating an atmosphere that is both dreamy and authentic, leaving a lasting impression",
          "description": "",
