        {
          "id": "krea2-89718e367b5239d9cfb976f1",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣雪地微笑坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an indoor floor covered with a white long-velvet carpet. She wears a pure white strapless knit dress, paired with a fluffy white plush scarf and matching knit gloves, and white knit socks at her ankles. The overall look is warm and layered, with a faint smile. She holds a beige teddy bear plush in both arms, with a blue-and-white striped bow tied around its neck. Her posture is natural and relaxed, with a slightly forward-leaning body, creating an intimate and healing atmosphere. On the left side of the painting is a green Christmas tree decorated with snowflakes. The branches are covered with a snow-like effect, presenting the tranquility and purity of winter. On the right is a white bed with soft white quilts. In the background, a window with blinds can be seen, and light softly filters through the blinds, creating a dynamic of light and shadow. The entire space is dominated by white, accented with pale green and beige brown, creating a minimalist yet cozy winter atmosphere. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, creating a visual focal point. The Christmas tree and books in the foreground enhance the sense of spatial depth. In the middle ground, the main figure and teddy bear are in the background, with beds and windows in the background. The layers are distinct, visually guiding the Christmas tree in the foreground to the characters, then extending to the window in the background, creating a smooth flow of vision. Light comes from the sides and rear, classified as soft scattered light. The light source simulates natural light passing through blinds, with delicate shadows and natural transitions. The overall light and shadow present a cool-toned white balance, reinforcing the chill and cleanliness of winter. The atmosphere is peaceful, warm, romantic, and slightly fairy-tale-like. It feels like a quiet afternoon, with delicate texture and rich details, offering the realism of everyday photography with a regular camera, while retaining artistic beauty. Like a warm moment casually captured at home, it features slight film graininess and low-saturation color treatment, enhancing realism and nostalgia. The overall style blends Japanese photography, holiday themes, and home aesthetics, conveying a simple and pure beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
