        {
          "id": "krea2-0ae2f9f482ce51dc133cc5de",
          "alias": "单女白T恤街道困倦站立",
          "prompt": "She wears an off-white lace camisole with black fine-trimmed trim and tie designs, adorned with several small black buttons on the chest, layered with a loose knit cardigan in the same color. The cardigan is lightweight and breathable, with sleeves naturally draped to create soft pleats. She wears high-waisted shorts with irregular flicker edges on the pant legs. The overall style is fresh and sweet, full of summer vibes. Her hands are naturally folded in front of her, her posture elegant and relaxed, her body slightly angled to the camera, showing a graceful S-shaped curve. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure occupying the left central position. The street is covered with gray asphalt, with clear zebra crossings. Sunlight pours in from the upper right of the frame, creating a bright backlight effect. The light is soft and warm, creating a hazy, dreamy halo. The shadows transition naturally, with rich layers of light and shadow. The overall color palette is mainly warm white and beige, accented with a touch of green and gray. The colors are harmonious and unified, creating a peaceful and cozy atmosphere. Full of youthful energy and romantic atmosphere, the photography style resembles everyday handheld camera shooting, featuring slight graininess and natural exposure control. The lens is either a 50mm prime or an 85mm portrait lens with an aperture of about f/1.8, achieving an extremely shallow depth of field, making the subject stand out and the background completely blurred. Using light and color to create a realistic yet slightly idealized aesthetic, the overall image resembles a carefully composed street portrait, combining the atmosphere of life with artistic flair, presenting a relaxed and pleasant atmosphere. Gentle and healing everyday moments",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
