        {
          "id": "krea2-1a422d3f4c5b5c500d00594b",
          "alias": "单女银连衣裙海滩冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman in a silver-white sequin long dress stands on the seaside pier, her expression calm and elegant, exuding a casual yet noble aura. She wears a V-neck long-sleeved high-slit gown, covered in fine silver sequins that glow softly in the sunlight. The waist is designed to cinch the waist, highlighting a slender waistline. The hem of the dress naturally drapes down with her posture, and the high slit reveals her long legs. She wears a pair of simple white pointed high heels, making the overall look both luxurious and modern. One hand rested gently on the white metal railing, the other naturally lowered, her body slightly tilted, presenting a relaxed and relaxed posture. The background was the vast, boundless blue sea, shimmering with waves. In the distance, a white cruise boat slowly passed by. In the distance, a large sea-crossing bridge could be faintly seen spanning the sky. The sky was a clear blue without a single cloud, the light bright and soft, presenting a typical daytime clear sky. The ground was covered with a blue non-slip rubber mat marked with white stripes. It forms a sharp contrast with the surrounding environment, with the composition using a medium perspective. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, occupying the visual center. The foreground railing and columns form a framing guide that draws the gaze toward the main subject. At the same time, the layering of the sea and distant mountains creates a deep space. Light and shadow come from directly above slightly to the right, evenly shining on the figure, creating delicate reflections of the sequins. Shadows fall on the ground and below the railing, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and romantic, combining the refined sensibility of urban women. It also incorporates a natural sense of openness. The color palette is mainly blue and white, with harmonious contrasts of warm and cool tones, rich details, and a realistic texture. It resembles a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera, possessing strong artistic expression and visual impact. At the same time, it preserves the beauty of casual moments in daily life, presenting an elegant, composed, and story-rich scene. The camera captures a moment that is both real and dreamlike, allowing people to feel the stillness of time and inner peace",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
