        {
          "id": "krea2-5293d41d398f454eebdb61cf",
          "alias": "单女白挂脖摄影棚站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wore an off-white high-neck halter qipao. The fabric featured delicate woven patterns and a subtle sheen, presenting a light and elegant texture. One side of the skirt slit down to mid-thigh, revealing a long leg line. The overall look blended traditional Eastern aesthetics with modern fashion design. She held an unfurled black folding fan, its surface painted with the white outline of Mount Fuji and pink cherry blossom patterns. Light and shadow cast from the side, creating a soft transition of light and shadow on the figure, creating a strong sense of three-dimensionality and layering, highlighting the outline and clothing details. The background is in a soft shadow, making the main subject stand even more prominently. The overall composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure standing in the center and the body slightly turned to the side, presenting graceful curves. Visual guidance directs the subject's gaze directly to the viewer, while the curved edges of the folding fan also serve as an auxiliary guide. The visual atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, with a poetic beauty blending classical and modern elements. The colors are mainly off-white, black, and gray, accented with a touch of pink and red, creating a harmonious and unified tone with a sense of sophistication. The photography style resembles professional portrait portraits, using a large-aperture lens for precise depth control, obvious background blur, and soft and directional lighting. It feels like a softbox or naturally diffused light from a studio, presenting a visual experience that is both artistic and realistic. It's as if a high-end full-frame camera is being shot under indoor lighting, capturing a moment full of Eastern charm. The image details are rich, from the cheongsam's folds to the texture of the folding fan, all clearly visible. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, without excessive sharpening or smudging. The overall image retains the realism of everyday photography while maintaining professional-grade image quality",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
