        {
          "id": "krea2-6e71eb17c2766d441d841a44",
          "alias": "单女粉旗袍室内严肃站立",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a light pink Chinese qipao stands in the bluestone alleys of a Jiangnan water town. On her wrist is a simple silver bracelet that reflects a soft sheen. The qipao is short-sleeved, with a high neckline and delicate frog buttons. The fabric features delicate subtle texture and texture, Under the sunlight, the palette glows faintly, with the overall tone mainly soft pink-white, creating an elegant and refined Eastern charm. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the composition, forming a visual focal point. The composition uses a medium shot, with the body slightly turned and the head facing the camera, conveying a sense of tranquility and tranquility. In the lower right corner of the foreground, a rough gray stone step edge is visible, with some green moss and leaves attached, adding layers and realism to the image. The background is a typical Jiangnan residential complex: white walls and black tiles, wooden doors and windows with simple carvings, and smooth eaves lines Some walls are slightly weathered, revealing traces of time. In the distance, there is a half-open wooden window where the interior furnishings are faintly visible, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The overall background is blurred, and the use of a large-aperture lens makes the subject stand out clearly. The background presents a soft bokeh, and the light and shadows come from natural daylight, falling from the upper left, creating a soft side light. The shadows transition naturally, while subtle light and shadow changes occur in the pleats of the qipao. The sky is light blue and cloudless, indicating clear weather and a peaceful overall atmosphere. Full of poetry and nostalgia, it seems to capture an unintentional moment in the morning or afternoon, possessing strong artistic appeal. Like a freeze-frame shot in an art film, it combines classical aesthetics with modern photography style. The colors are harmoniously unified, with low-saturation pink, gray, and blue as the main tones, creating a fresh and elegant visual experience. The details are rich yet not chaotic, the composition is balanced, the blank space is appropriate, and the narrative extends to the background, forming a complete narrative logic that presents an image of a dreamlike, gentle, and charming Eastern woman. It combines traditional beauty with modern aesthetics, as if a classical beauty stepped out of a painting, leaving a lasting impression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
