        {
          "id": "krea2-f096c5ed08853bfb1b2aada9",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣广场困倦坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors by a white wrought iron railing, slightly tilting her head to look at the camera. Her overall aura is fresh and sweet, with a touch of quiet elegance. She wears a light blue knit cardigan featuring a small black kitten embroidery pattern, with delicate ribbed trim on the cuffs and collar. She wears a white garment underneath, and on the lower half, she wears an off-white high-waisted pleated skirt. The fabric is light, soft, and naturally pleated. She folds her hands over her legs, holding a book with a deep green cover. The spine is printed with golden English words \"STUDIES ON CULTURAL HERITAGE.\" she slung a white chain bag across her shoulder, with a simple square design and a faint glow on the metal chain. The background features blurred green plants and dappled sunlight, casting warm light through the gaps in the railing, creating interplay of light and shadow on the ground. The railing is a white metal structure, with some areas showing rust and wear marks, showing signs of time. The composition was shot with a medium portrait. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, with the body slightly tilted and the head slightly turned toward the lens, forming a graceful curve. The foreground features a blurred railing and the ground, the middle ground is the main subject, and the background is bokeh greenery and sunlight. Using a wide aperture lens creates a strong depth of field effect, making the figure stand out clearly. The background is completely blurred, with light coming from the front left, creating a sense of depth. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, full of the cozy atmosphere of daily life. The color palette is mainly blue and white, accented with green and brown. The color scheme is harmonious and unified, with a delicate and realistic texture, resembling a film-style photo taken with a professional camera. It has a slight graininess and natural exposure transitions, presenting a fresh and artistic Japanese photo style. The background light spots are circular or oval, varying in size, with colors gradient from bright yellow to pale green, creating a dreamy, hazy atmosphere. The entire scene resembles a corner of a campus under the afternoon sun or a rest area in a city park, giving a quiet, comfortable, and beautiful feeling. The images are rich in detail, The characters' expressions are vivid and natural, the costumes and material elements are realistic, and the environmental elements are authentic and believable, possessing strong artistic appeal and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
