        {
          "id": "krea2-9bf7c91f5b91eb9c5b4ad1e3",
          "alias": "单女灰短裙街道困倦坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window on a beige fabric sofa, wearing a soft, puffy white plush long-sleeve top with slightly sliding shoulders to reveal her collarbones. She pairs a light gray and white plaid short skirt with a skirt that naturally drapes down to her thighs. Her legs are straight and clad in pure white over-the-knee socks, her toes pointing toward the camera, striking an elegant yet slightly lazy pose. Fingers slightly bent, head slightly tilted, expression slightly contemplative or tired, presenting a quiet and reserved emotional state. It naturally drapes over the shoulders and chest, adding a touch of dynamism. The sofa backrest is designed in a classical style, with silver-gray carved trim on the edges. The seat cushion and cushion are made of beige fabric with fine textures, and the edges are decorated with black-and-white tassel lace, giving it a rich texture. The window is on the left side of the painting, with clear and transparent glass. Outside is a blurry city street scene, with faint outlines of buildings, streetlights, and trees visible. Light streams through the glass into the interior, creating a soft, diffused glow. The overall composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, body slightly angled to the camera, head slightly tilted forward, forming a natural visual guideline. The foreground features part of the sofa and the character's legs, the middle focus on the main subject, while the background features a blurred cityscape outside the window and a red potted plant in the right corner of the wall. The plant's leaves are slender and deep green, contrasting with the overall warm tones. The light and shadow come from the left front, with soft and even lighting, no strong shadows, clear details, and natural shadow transitions, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly white, beige, and light gray, accented with pale pink and dark green, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme that gives a sense of everyday home life. The image presents a realistic shooting texture, as if shot with a regular camera in natural light, with slight graininess and authentic color reproduction. It doesn't pursue excessive beautification, preserves everyday details, and enhances realism. The composition is simple yet layered, using windows as natural frames to frame figures at the center of the composition, while the background outside the window blurs out the main subject, creating a sense of spatial depth. The visual guidance extends from outside the window into the interior, then focuses on the expressions and postures of the characters, forming a coherent viewing path that conveys a tranquil, private, and slightly melancholic everyday mood, as if capturing a moment of solitude on an afternoon, full of storytelling and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
