        {
          "id": "krea2-fa9afc30a11afde766a45bc7",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套竹林忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands inside a vintage-style yellow, vintage bus cabin. She wears a light blue fluffy down jacket with a high collar that wraps around her neck. The jacket's surface features delicate quilting textures and a soft sheen, with a small round brand logo on the left cuff. Her right hand gently grasps a white triangular ring, her arm slightly raised, and her left hand gently pulls the front of the jacket. Her posture is natural and relaxed, as if she was about to speak or had just finished speaking. She wears a light blue knitted long dress below. The skirt hem features fine vertical striped patterns, and the overall color scheme of the clothing is harmonious and unified, creating a serene and gentle visual experience. The interior of the cabin is mainly a warm yellow tone, with the roof and walls showing a nostalgic beige. The metal handrails and hanging rings are clearly visible, with some areas showing slight rust and wear marks, adding a genuine sense of history. Multiple white triangular hanging rings hang from the ceiling on metal frames, with clean and rhythmic lines. The windows are rectangular and the glass is highly transparent. The view outside the window is blurry, with faint outlines of buildings in the distance and a gray sky, hinting at cloudy or early morning weather. On the left is a row of blue striped seats with deep blue cushions and fine woven textures on the backrest. Next to the seat is a pink plush toy, adding a touch of childlike fun and a sense of life. On the right side is a similar chair, and next to the front pillar is a bamboo basket, rich in details and full of everyday warmth. The floor is made of light-colored wood, with clear wood grain. Soft light is reflected, and the entire space is compact and orderly. The figures are positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, with the composition using a medium shot. The figure occupies the main subject, with the head and upper body fully presented. Background elements such as seats, windows, and armrests are evenly distributed, creating a good visual balance. The foreground features the figure and hanging rings, the middle ground shows the interior space and seats inside the carriage, and the background is the blurred view outside the window. The layers are distinct, extending along the line of sight to the window, then returning to the figure's body, forming a complete visual loop. The light and shadows come from natural light from the window, soft and diffuse, without strong shadows. The overall illumination is even, highlighting the contours of the figures and the texture of the clothing. The atmosphere is quiet, nostalgic, and slightly lonely. The color palette mainly uses blue and yellow contrasts, blending warm and cool tones, both warm and fresh, giving a sense of tranquil everyday moments. It's like a snapshot of daily life taken with an old film camera in the morning. The image quality is slightly grainy and has slight color shifts, simulating real camera imaging quality. The lens selection is a standard 50mm lens. The focal length is moderate, depth of field is well controlled, the background is slightly blurred to highlight the main characters, the composition is stable, and the perspective is level enough to capture the most authentic cultural scenes. The overall image is filled with the atmosphere of life and emotional warmth, allowing viewers to feel a sense of beauty and tranquility in the ordinary",
