        {
          "id": "krea2-2354cdf80b2a8e6711f4d68d",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙森林困倦倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman in a white lace sheer long dress leans elegantly on a black metal-framed chair. Her posture is lazy yet full of tension. The hem of the skirt slightly unfolds with her body's tilt, revealing her long legs and silver high heels. The upper is set with sparkling rhinestones, and a thin band is decorated around her ankles. A silk belt in the same color accentuates her slender waistline. The overall look is both sexy and noble, with a small round table in the foreground. The table was covered with a pure white tablecloth, with a dark green velvet napkin covering the center. On top were two sets of tableware, including silver plates, knives, forks, and wine glasses. The tableware reflected soft light, making it crystal clear. Next to the table was a mobile phone. In the center was a vast golf course, with a lush green lawn trimmed like a carpet, showing natural undulation and wavy patterns. In the distance, a winding path crossed the grass, with a dense forest in the background, lush and layered. The sky shows a gradient of light blue and light orange at dusk, with thin clouds and soft and warm light. A magnificent golden crown-shaped crystal chandelier hangs from above, suspended in the upper right corner of the image. The chandelier is composed of multiple layers of crystal beads, sparkling with light and adding a touch of luxury and dreaminess to the scene. The composition balances the centered left main figure with the dining table on the right, occupying the main position, then rising to the chandelier, and finally extending to the distant green space and sky. This forms a complete visual flow, with light and shadow coming from the sides and rear, simulating natural evening light. This makes the contours of the figures clear, the shadows soft, and the ground reflective light, creating a peaceful and romantic atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly green and white, accented with gold and silver, creating a harmonious and unified color effect with a strong visual impact. The image style blends surrealism with fashionable photography elements, presenting a sense of sophistication that is both realistic and dreamy, as if shot with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens, resulting in delicate image quality. Outside the focus, the blur blurs nature, and the chandelier in the background and distant trees create a subtle bokeh effect, enhancing the sense of spatial depth while preserving enough detail. It feels like a carefully arranged outdoor dinner scene yet possesses a surreal drama. The entire scene exudes a tranquil, luxurious, romantic, and slightly mysterious atmosphere, like a classic shot in a film capturing a moment when time freezes.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
