        {
          "id": "krea2-d06151e991dd3e33abe15694",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙室内困倦坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a Japanese-style indoor setting, wearing a simple and elegant white spaghetti strap long dress. The skirt is made of smooth silk fabric, presenting a soft sheen and naturally draped pleats. The hem softly drapes over the light-colored tatami, the waist is well-designed to highlight a slender waistline, the straps are delicate and delicate, outlining a graceful collarbone. She folds her hands in front of her, fingers long, nails neatly trimmed, posture dignified and elegant. Her right hand gently holds her left wrist, her body slightly tilted, head slightly tilted. The background features a typical Japanese shoji door, divided by a black wooden frame into multiple squares, emitting a hazy green glow that creates a serene and far-reaching atmosphere. On the right is a black round low table, smooth and scattered with several white orchids, their petals pure and flawless. The flower stems are lush green, the leaves spread naturally, and a few leaves and flower buds are placed on the table, adding a touch of vitality. The floor is covered with a light beige tatami mat with clear texture and delicate texture. The overall composition uses a mid-shot portrait perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, forming a visual focal point. The foreground highlights the main subject, the middle shot reveals environmental details, and the background is blurred to make the subject stand out. The composition is balanced and harmonious, and the geometric lines of the shoji door guide the gaze toward the figure, with soft and even light and shadow. The main light source comes from the front left, simulating natural light effects with natural shadow transitions. There are slight highlights on the shoulders and arms, and subtle changes in light and shadow in the folds of clothing. The background light passes through the shoji doors, creating soft scattered light that creates a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly white, black, and beige, accented with pale green and white flowers. The color combination is fresh and elegant, filling the scene with an oriental aesthetic atmosphere. It combines modern fashion with traditional charm, possessing high artistic expression and emotional appeal. It feels as if capturing a beautiful moment in a quiet afternoon, with images presenting a delicate and lifelike texture, as if taken with professional photography equipment, yet with a slight film texture and soft depth of field, creating a visual experience that is both realistic and dreamy",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
