        {
          "id": "krea2-aaf1f2e8cfd958243618a955",
          "alias": "单女婚礼困倦站立侧头",
          "prompt": "The shoulder line was smooth, accentuating the graceful collarbones and shoulder lines. The bow was fluffy and full, with a soft and smooth texture adding a touch of softness and vitality. The background is a pure light gray-blue tone, with no unnecessary decoration, simple yet spacious. In the middle shot, a soft halo can be faintly seen, like natural light streaming in from the side, creating a dreamy, hazy atmosphere. In the foreground, her slightly bent body outline is clearly visible, with arms and hands clearly visible and rich in detail. The composition uses a classic central symmetrical layout, with the figure centered, head slightly tilted, gazing directly at the lens, creating a strong visual guidance. The overall composition is mainly cool tones, with soft and even lighting. Soft light from the upper front features no obvious shadows, highlighting the translucent texture of the skin and the layers of luster of the garment. The background blur is well handled, focusing on the subject, enhancing the depth and layering of the image. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is tranquil and romantic, carrying a touch of purity and sacredness, like the first ray of morning sunlight shining on the bride. The entire scene exudes gentleness, innocence, and anticipation, as if recording the most important moment in life. The image style blends the characteristics of high-end fashion photography with wedding portraits, possessing a strong sense of artistic beauty and emotional tension while preserving the texture of authentic shooting. It feels as if a professional camera is paired with a large-aperture lens inside the studio, capturing the most moving moments and presenting a visual effect that is both dreamy and realistic. The overall tone is clean and fresh, with moderate color saturation, soft contrast, rich details, and clear textures, showcasing a high level of craftsmanship and aesthetic pursuit. There are no unnecessary elements in the frame, and everything revolves around the characters. It emphasizes the perfect unity of inner temperament and external image, with rigorous composition, harmonious proportions, and a clear visual focus, providing a comfortable and pleasant viewing experience. The use of light and shadow is just right, highlighting the main features while creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere, as if time stands still at this moment, leaving only this beauty and purity.",
