        {
          "id": "krea2-068c8d386d75d6136bbb9f43",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤窗边持手机",
          "prompt": "She wore a dark blue crew-neck T-shirt and a brown plush backpack on her shoulder. The backpack was decorated with large round buttons, and the strap was made of matching leather tones. The overall composition centers on the character, using a close-up perspective to capture the subject from a slightly overhead angle. The background features the car's interior off-white diamond-patterned leather seats, with clear texture. The inside of the doors and seat belts faintly appear at the edges of the frame, with light and shadow coming from the side of the window, creating soft natural illumination and creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The color palette mainly features warm brown, off-white, and deep blue, harmoniously matching and unifying the colors to evoke a sense of everyday warmth while retaining a certain artistic aesthetic. It feels like a real moment taken with a phone or portable camera, with a slight graininess and realistic exposure, presenting a youthful yet gentle and tranquil visual style. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and natural, full of life and sentiment, like recording a beautiful moment on the next journey, evoking a sense of tranquility and companionship",
