        {
          "id": "krea2-dc12bebf1ff33cc3bfb7b7f1",
          "alias": "单女绿高领衫咖啡厅神秘坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the wooden porch steps of a restaurant called CAFE & BISTRO PHD, slightly lowering her head to gaze at the camera, exuding a quiet and reserved aura. She wears an army green turtleneck trench coat layered with a matching tight base shirt underneath, and black fishnet stockings featuring fine diamond mesh patterns and evenly distributed dark polka dot patterns. She wears black pointed stiletto heels with a crocodile leather texture on the upper. Her legs are crossed, with her right leg in front and left leg behind. The right hand gently strokes the upper of the shoe at the right ankle, the left hand naturally rests on the knee, and a watch with a black strap is worn on the wrist. Next to it sits a classic black quilted chain bag, featuring quilting craftsmanship, a gold metal chain, and a double C logo. The background features the café's wooden door frame and glass windows. The window frame is made of dark brown wood, with the glass reflecting a blurred image of the surrounding trees. Above the door hangs a yellow sign printed with \"CAFE&BISTRO\" and \"PHD.\" The walls have an off-white cement texture with a slightly mottled appearance. The floor is paved with gray stone bricks, and the steps are made of old, dark wood panels. The surface shows natural texture and wear marks. The overall composition centers on the figure, using a medium perspective. Light comes from the left, with soft natural light streaming in from outside. The shadowed areas are clear but not harsh, creating a low-saturation atmosphere typical of cloudy or evening days. The colors are mainly earthy tones, including army green, Brown, gray-black, and off-white intertwine, with a calm and restrained tone. The image has a strong sense of urban street fashion while preserving the authentic texture of everyday life. It feels as if shot with a professional camera, with moderate focal length, well-controlled depth of field, slightly blurred backgrounds that highlight the subject, presenting an overall image of a calm, elegant, and slightly mysterious modern woman, full of storytelling and artistic flair",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
