        {
          "id": "krea2-2828fdd2accf29e2bf7eaf80",
          "alias": "单女衬衫窗边俏皮站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the window, adding a touch of laziness and gentleness. She wears an off-shoulder, long-sleeve tight base shirt with off-shoulder fabric that hugs her figure, showing off smooth curves. The sleeves have natural pleats and layering, giving her a premium feel. She pairs with black sporty shorts with white stripes at the hem, and the hem peeks out from lace lining, adding a touch of sexiness and playfulness. Her legs are slightly bent, and her right hand rests gently on her knee. Her fingers are long and slender, her posture natural and relaxed. Her left hand rests gently on her thigh, her body slightly turned to the camera, creating a semi-reclining posture. The background features a light-colored window frame and glass that emits cool blue tones. Light from outside filters through blinds and sheer curtains pours in, creating a soft layering of light and shadow. On the right is a heavy brown curtain, soft in texture, noticeably draped, and richly pleated, contrasting with the cool tones on the left, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The head is slightly tilted, looking directly at the camera. The light comes from the front left, creating soft natural light. At the same time, subtle shadows appear on the sides of the body and in the folds of clothing, enhancing the sense of depth and realism. The overall light and shadow transitions are natural, without rigid light and shadow boundaries. The atmosphere is warm, quiet, and slightly artistic. The tones are mainly warm white, beige, pink, black, and brown, harmoniously unified and creating a subtle beauty in everyday life. It feels as if the moment was captured with an old film camera, with the lens slightly out of focus, the image showing slight graininess and low-saturation tones, simulating a realistic photographic texture. The overall image is full of storytelling, evoking a quiet moment when afternoon sunlight fills the room. The woman seems lost in her own thoughts, or waiting for someone important to arrive. The entire scene is both real and dreamlike, blending the atmosphere of life with artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
