        {
          "id": "krea2-b3501c7084227ca0d080474a",
          "alias": "单女粉毛衣户外媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor metal railing, looking natural and lively, displaying a soft pink hue. She wears a pink off-shoulder knit sweater made with coarse knit craftsmanship, with clear textures and a warm feel. The sleeves are loose with pleated details, and the left shoulder reveals skin, showing an effortless sensuality and casualness. She pairs a white high-waisted pleated short skirt with distinct layers, smooth lines, and a light material that slightly unfolds with her posture. On her feet are classic red canvas shoes with bright red uppers, white laces and rubber soles, paired with white mid-calf socks. The overall look is youthful, lively, and fashionable. She holds a paper coffee cup in her right hand, with a brown outer layer and a white plastic lid and straw hole. The simple cup reflects the casualness and authenticity of daily life. Her left hand rests naturally on the railing, her body slightly tilted, head slightly turned toward the camera, as if gazing into some distant place. It creates a quiet yet slightly melancholic atmosphere. The foreground features the main subject occupying most of the composition, composed from a low-angle downward angle, making the figure appear taller and more elegant. The middle scene features the gray metal railing she sits on, smooth and slightly reflective, spanning the lower part of the frame to form a stable visual support line. The background is a city street, with a dark gray asphalt pavement with white traffic markings. In the distance, faint blue roadside railings and the shadows of trees cast onto the ground. Dappled light and shadow create a strong contrast of light and shadow. Sunlight pours diagonally from the upper right of the image, creating a strong backlight effect and creating a soft halo that enhances the sense of three-dimensionality and dreaminess. The shadowed areas maintain natural layering, creating an overall warm and bright atmosphere filled with the tranquility of an autumn afternoon or early spring morning. Although the sky is not fully visible, it can be inferred to be clear weather. The tone is relatively cool, contrasting with the warm colors of the figures, further highlighting the main subject. The overall composition of the composition is balanced, conveying a sense of leisure, A relaxed yet slightly artistic lifestyle fragment, blending realistic photography with artistic treatment, combining the warmth of everyday life with carefully designed aesthetic texture. It feels like a street portrait shot with a professional camera, while retaining the soft texture and color saturation of film photography. The overall color palette is mainly pink, white, and red, accented with gray and blue. The color coordination is harmonious and unified, rich in layering, and the image details are rich. From the sweater's knit texture to the stitching on the shoe upper, everything is clearly visible. The character's expression is natural, without excessive embellishment, giving a sense of authenticity and beauty, as if capturing an ordinary yet touching moment. The entire scene is filled with a quiet, gentle, and slightly poetic atmosphere, making one imagine she has just finished a leisurely walk and is about to enjoy a moment of peace brought by a cup of hot coffee",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
