        {
          "id": "krea2-6cce506c069d31f0d9446117",
          "alias": "单女金礼服森林困倦站立展示",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the forest, her makeup exquisite, slightly turning to look back at the camera, her posture elegant and confident. She wears a golden off-shoulder gown woven from dense metal chains or beads, presenting a grid-like texture that shimmers with delicate luster under the light. The shoulder features an asymmetrical pleated shape, one side sliding down to the arm, the other wrapping around the shoulder, creating a strong visual contrast. Her right hand gently rests on her left arm, fingers long, and she wears a pair of golden round earrings with smooth surfaces. Reflecting soft light, she leans against a thick, withered tree trunk. The trunk is grayish-white, covered with rough cracks and weathering marks. The twisted branches stretch upward, natural and full of power. The background is deep within a blurry forest, where tall and upright trees stand tall, with sparse leaves showing varying shades of brown and green. The ground is covered with withered yellow leaves and low shrubs, creating an overall dark tone that creates a quiet yet slightly desolate atmosphere. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned on the left side of the frame. The withered tree trunk in the foreground extends diagonally from the lower right corner to the center of the frame, forming a strong diagonal structure that enhances the spatial and dynamic feel of the composition. The middle ground features the main subject and some tree trunks, with clear details, while the background is completely blurred. A shallow depth of field effect is used to focus the focus on the figure. Light and shadow come from naturally scattered light, soft and even, mainly illuminating from the upper left. At the same time, natural transitional shadows are created on the right side of the body and in the shadows of tree trunks. The overall light and shadow layers are rich, creating a mysterious and noble atmosphere. The image presents a surreal beauty, like a classic scene from a fashion blockbuster, yet with cinematic narrative tension. The colors are mainly earthy tones, with the golden gown sharply contrasting with the gray-brown tree trunks and forest background, highlighting the character's presence. The entire image has a strong artistic sense and visual impact, as if shot with a professional camera for high-end commercial photography. Yet it retains a touch of the authentic texture of the natural environment, like a carefully arranged outdoor shoot, showcasing the harmony and conflict between the characters and nature. The visuals are rich in detail; although the background is blurred, one can still feel the depth and tranquility of the forest. The overall composition is balanced and full of tension, with clear visual guidance and exquisite use of light and shadow, creating an atmosphere that is both dreamy and realistic, drawing viewers into this story-filled moment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
