        {
          "id": "krea2-59eda5146f38468b75de6595",
          "alias": "单女黑毛衣街道忧伤奔跑侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a loose black knit sweater with an off-shoulder design, revealing her slender collarbones and shoulder lines. The knit texture is clearly visible, the stitching is even and tight, the hem slightly short, revealing part of the thighs and white over-the-knee socks, with slight pleats at the cuff. She looks natural and authentic, layered with a thin white camisole that faintly reveals the shoulder strap outline. The overall outfit is simple yet stylish. Her right hand hangs naturally over her knee, fingers long, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with elegant off-white nail polish. Her left hand rests gently at her side, looking relaxed and elegant. The background is the glass window of a café, and outside the window is a city street scene on a winter evening. The sky is gray-blue, with several bare trees intertwining branches. The distant blurred outlines of buildings contrast with the warm yellow halo of streetlights against a cool-toned background. The glass reflects the light and shadow of the indoor red neon light strips, forming horizontal lines running through the image. The red light gently diffuses across the glass surface, creating a warm and psychedelic atmosphere. Inside the display window, the reflections of tables, chairs, and decorations can be faintly seen, but the details are blurred, enhancing the sense of depth in the space. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly center-right, head slightly tilted, and gaze directly at the camera. The overall color scheme is mainly cool tones. Blue, black, and gray form the main tone, with red neon light as accents, creating a strong visual impact. The light and shadow treatment is delicate, while preserving the transition of shadows to create a sense of depth. The red lights in the background create bright highlights on the glass, creating a warm contrast with the cool tones of the characters. Then the red light band in the background creates a flowing visual path. The overall atmosphere combines urban indifference with personal gentleness, as if capturing a quiet and lonely moment. The image quality is close to professional camera shooting, with rich details and well-controlled noise, presenting a high-resolution, low-contrast everyday imaging style with a strong cinematic feel and storytelling, as if taken from an art film, full of modern urban youth's aesthetic taste and emotional expression",
