        {
          "id": "krea2-a5104358a0bc8cd184cc92d7",
          "alias": "单女白旗袍花园困倦坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright on a wooden chair, wearing a delicate white sleeveless qipao. The fabric is light and flowing, presenting a silky sheen. The neckline and front are decorated with delicate frog buttons and three-dimensional embroidery patterns. The embroidery features intricate floral and vine motifs, rich in detail and layered. The hem hangs naturally, forming soft pleated lines. The overall look is elegant and gentle, blending traditional Eastern aesthetics with modern fashion. Her right hand rests lightly on the chair's backrest, her wrist wears a slender silver chain bracelet, her fingers long and fair, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with transparent or light nail polish. In her left hand is a black lace-trimmed folding fan, with a semi-transparent black lace surface decorated with gold hollowed-out patterns. The ribs are clearly visible, and the fan is slightly unfolded, forming an elegant curve. The background is dense tropical plants, with huge palm leaves layered in layers, broad and upright, with distinct veins showing a deep green tone. Some leaves are bathed in sunlight, creating mottled light and shadow. In the depths of the background, warm yellow lanterns can be faintly seen hanging. The lanterns are cylindrical in shape, with textured details on the surface, emitting a soft, warm glow that creates a hazy, dreamy atmosphere. In the distance, blurry blue and purple light and shadow intersect, hinting at nighttime or dusk scenes. The entire composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, body slightly turned and head facing the camera. The foreground clearly shows the main figure and a folding fan, while the middle ground features nearby palm leaves and some background elements. The background is composed of distant plants, Lanterns and blurred light and shadow are formed with clear layers and a strong sense of space. Light comes from a slanting top, simulating natural daylight or soft artificial lighting. The main light shines from the left, creating delicate shadow transitions that highlight skin texture and clothing folds. The lanterns in the background emit warm light, creating a contrast with the cool-toned greenery, enhancing visual tension. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, full of poetic and classical charm, as if you are in a Jiangnan garden or courtyard. The colors are mainly white, green, and black. Accented with warm yellow and gold, the tones are harmonious and unified, the light and shadow are delicate, the texture is realistic, and it possesses strong artistic beauty and narrative quality. It resembles a high-quality portrait photograph shot with a professional camera, featuring a slight film graininess and natural depth blur effects, presenting an overall dreamlike Eastern aesthetic conception",
          "description": "",
