        {
          "id": "krea2-8e6d219506a1308555afab29",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣窗边俏皮自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sat in the back seat of a car, wearing a fluffy, soft white plush hat. The top of the hat was designed in a cute animal shape, making her look like a little bear or kitten. The edges and lining of the hat were covered with dense white plush for a warm and cute look. She wore a white knit sweater with obvious woven patterns on the cuffs, gently resting her hand on the brim. Her fingers were long, painted with light pink nail polish, her expression gentle yet slightly playful. The background was the inside of the car. You can see the black plastic panels on the inside of the doors and the window edges. The light outside is soft, streaming through the windows into the cabin, creating a natural effect of light and shadow. The composition centers on the person, using close-ups with slightly upward shots to make the figure appear more three-dimensional. Light comes from the left, creating a soft shadow transition that creates a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly white and light beige, creating a striking contrast. The image texture is delicate, with the plush texture clearly visible, and the layers of light and shadow rich. It presents a warm and healing feeling in daily life, as if on a winter afternoon, a girl is enjoying a moment of tranquility in the car. The entire scene is full of life and youthful energy, giving a friendly, warm, and approachable impression. The photography style resembles a phone selfie, with slight natural blur and noise to enhance realism and documentary quality. The color saturation is moderate, not overly exaggerated, maintaining a natural visual effect. The overall image is harmonious and unified, with exquisite detail handling. It highlights the cuteness and fashion of the main subjects while preserving the simplicity and authenticity of everyday life",
