          "id": "krea2-d0da9ce83581f16f4f1ba1c3",
          "alias": "单女白T恤街道忧伤持相机",
          "prompt": "A close-up of a woman's half-body adds a touch of laziness and gentleness. She wears a white spaghetti-strap camisole top, made of lightweight and breathable material, subtly revealing the texture of her skin. Layered with a pale yellow sheer jacket, the fabric is soft and flowing, gently swaying in the breeze, creating a hazy and romantic atmosphere. Her posture is elegant and natural, her body slightly turned to the side, her right hand resting softly on her shoulder, fingers naturally bent, as if she is tidying clothes or unintentionally revealing a hint of shyness, carrying a subtle melancholy and contemplation, with a full, natural color forming a faint, almost imperceptible smile. The overall makeup is fresh and natural, highlighting her natural beauty. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, composed using a third-level method, with the figure occupying the main part of the frame. The background is a blurry city nightscape. The warm yellow lighting creates a beautiful bokeh effect in the frame. The circular light spots vary in size and are evenly distributed, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. Light shines from the upper right, creating a soft backlighting effect that sharpens the character's outline and enhances the sense of depth and layering. The shadow transitions naturally and details are rich. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow, paired with white and pale yellow, creating a cozy, tranquil, and slightly romantic nighttime atmosphere. Light and shadow intertwine, blending solid and void, extending along her line of sight to the background light spots, forming an invisible visual path that enhances the depth and storytelling of the composition. The composition is compact but not crowded, with just the right amount of blank space, highlighting the subject's central role. The overall style combines artistic flair with the beauty of everyday life. It feels as if a professional camera captured a moment on a street at night—authentic and emotional, with cinematic texture and delicate detail. There are no obvious watermarks or text distractions in the frame, focusing on the fusion of the characters' emotional expression and the ambient atmosphere, conveying a tranquil, gentle, and poetic urban nightlife atmosphere, allowing people to feel a sense of tranquility and beauty surrounded by warmth",
