        {
          "id": "krea2-0e59be8b05235cb7217c80e9",
          "alias": "单女金连衣裙庭院站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under the black wooden porch of a Japanese courtyard, wearing a bright yellow sleeveless ruffled dress with layers flowing like petals, with a neckline adorned with delicate sequin decorations. In her left hand, she carries a black woven handbag with white patterns, printed with the brand's signature letters and designs. On her wrist, she wears a delicate gold bracelet. The overall look exudes a fresh summer vibe, with black pillars and eave structures on the porch in the foreground. Below the eaves hangs a black square signboard with \"YAKA since 2016\" written in white letters. On the left side is a large potted green plant with broad, lush leaves, placed in a coarse ceramic pot. The background is a lush Japanese garden landscape, with layered trees and lush greenery. Dappled light and shadows shine through the leaves, and in the distance, stone steps, streams, and rocks of various shapes can be seen, creating a tranquil and far-reaching Zen atmosphere. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned at the very center of the painting. Framed by the porch frame, it forms a visual focal point. The geometric lines of the porch contrast with the organic forms of natural scenery, enhancing the depth and spatial layers of the painting. The light is soft and naturally scattered, filtering through the gaps in the leaves, creating delicate mottled light and shadow on the ground and figures. The overall color scheme is mainly yellow-green, with the yellow dress and green plants creating a vivid and harmonious color contrast. The transition of light and shadow is natural, creating a quiet and warm atmosphere. The visuals present an aesthetic moment casually captured in daily life, as if taken in front of a small street corner shop taken in the afternoon. It features a slight film texture and slight graininess, simulating the realism of amateur camera photography. The lens is a standard 50mm lens with a moderate focal length, well-controlled depth of field, clear and prominent figures, and a modest background blur. The overall style combines fashion and natural vibes, conveying a relaxed and comfortable urban leisure lifestyle. The image details are rich. From the folds of clothing to the textures of plants, everything is clearly distinguishable, delivering high-resolution imaging while preserving the original warmth and realism of photography",
