        {
          "id": "krea2-4c5e4ac517e80724af80eefe",
          "alias": "单女雪地冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "Delicate silver earrings hang, exuding an elegant and dignified aura. Her red Hanfu is embroidered with exquisite white floral patterns, with a wide ribbon of the same color tied at her waist tied into an elegant bow. Over her is a pure white fluffy cloak, with thick, soft white fur at the collar and cuffs. The delicate texture contrasts sharply with the red garment, creating a visual effect where warmth and chill intertwine. She stands in the snow, with snow covering the ground beneath her feet, presenting natural textures and layers. On the left is a plum tree covered in bright red plum blossoms, its branches strong and strong, some branches covered in snow, and the flowers bloom in the cold wind, their colors vivid and vivid. In the background to the right is a Chinese-style courtyard building, with red walls and gray tiles, deep red wooden doors, and two round red lanterns hanging above the lintel. The lanterns' surfaces are smooth, emitting a warm glow. Under the eaves, traditional carved window lattices can be faintly seen. In the distance, the sky is clear and sunlight pours in. The lighting is bright and soft, and the entire scene is covered by a thin layer of white snow. The ground, branches, and roofs are all covered with pure white snow, creating a tranquil and pure atmosphere. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, the plum tree occupying the left foreground, forming a visual guide that draws the gaze toward the main subject. The buildings and lanterns in the right rear serve as background elements, enriching the composition and enhancing spatial depth. Light and shadow come from the sunlight slightly above the front, creating natural shadows in the folds of clothing. The edges of the plush cloak emit soft highlights under the light, and the snow reflects faint diffused light, making the overall brightness even. The tones are mainly red, white, and gray. Red symbolizes celebration and enthusiasm, white represents purity and coldness, and gray highlights the rustic architectural texture. The color combinations are harmonious and contrasting, creating a tranquil and cozy atmosphere, like a ray of warm sunlight shining into the courtyard on a winter morning, conveying the joy of the festival and the beauty of life. The scene carries a strong sense of Eastern aesthetics, combining classical charm with modern aesthetics. Like a carefully shot film photo, it features slight graininess and realistic exposure control, simulating the texture of amateur camera shooting. The background is slightly blurred to highlight the subject, the composition is balanced, and the perspective is level to create a warm and authentic atmosphere of everyday life. The overall style is both artistic and retains the warmth of everyday life",
