        {
          "id": "krea2-7bb939d899644240a2d9617f",
          "alias": "单女睡裙忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands with a profile profile, her body slightly turned to the right of the frame, her head slightly raised, presenting a calm yet slightly melancholic demeanor. She wears a lightweight, transparent lace spaghetti strap nightdress with slender straps and a fully exposed back, showcasing graceful spinal lines and smooth curves. The dress is light and soft, adorned with delicate lace trim. The hem drapes naturally, with rich pleats and distinct layers, creating subtle light and shadow changes with the slight movements of the body On her back, there is a clearly visible black rose tattoo, with intricate patterns. The petals are layered, and the branches and leaves wind and stretch, resembling a flower of life blooming in the darkness. It contrasts sharply with the skin, highlighting artistic sense and personal expression. The figure is in a strongly backlit environment, with the light source coming from behind, creating a high-contrast silhouette effect. Only soft halos shine along the edges of the contours, creating a mysterious, hazy, and dramatic visual tension. The background is a pure light gray-white tone, with almost no details. It presents a texture similar to misting or diffused light, making the subject stand out. The composition adopts a center-to-right golden ratio layout, with the figure occupying the main position with ample blank space and a clear visual focus. It guides the viewer's gaze along the contour line from the feet upward to the head, forming a smooth vertical movement that enhances spatial depth. The overall composition is simple yet powerful, embodying the minimalist aesthetic style of modern photography. The lighting atmosphere is highly prominent, with backlighting treatment creating strong contrast between light and dark, and highlights concentrated at the edges of the figure's contours. A bright halo boundary is formed, while deep shadows fall inside, creating a poetic mood reminiscent of \"dialogue between light and shadow.\" The light is soft yet penetrating, like the first ray of morning sunlight or the last afterglow of dusk—warm yet slightly cool. The tones are mainly black, white, and gray, complemented by very pale warm yellow tones, making the painting both calm and full of emotional warmth. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, private, and slightly melancholic, like a moment frozen by time, conveying an emotional state of loneliness, self-reflection, and inner strength. The texture of the painting is delicate, with slight film graininess and motion blur, simulating the realistic texture of professional cameras shooting in low-light conditions. The lens has a moderate focal length and shallow depth of field, with the focus precisely on the subject's back and tattooed area. The background blurs naturally, and the foreground and mid-shot transition smoothly. Overall, it presents a cinematic portrait photography style, blending the refinement of fashion photography with the philosophical thinking of artistic photography, as if capturing a moment of authenticity and vulnerability, prompting reflection on the deeper meaning of beauty, identity, and existence",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
