        {
          "id": "krea2-d3e2a7ccefc1daac42701cfd",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫床愤怒持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a white short-sleeved shirt made of light, translucent fabric, subtly revealing the outline of her inner layer. The neckline is slightly open, appearing casual yet elegant. The sleeves are short, revealing the slender arm lines. She wears a black high-waisted short skirt with a natural hem, forming a sharp contrast with the white shirt. Her legs are crossed, with her right leg bent in front. Her left leg is stretched straight and slightly pulled back. At her ankle, you can see her looking down to tie her shoelaces or tie her clothes. Her hands are naturally placed near her knees, fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed, and her movements are relaxed and natural. In the background is a piece of fabric with a red and white checkered pattern, possibly a curtain or bed curtain. The plaid is moderately sized, the colors are bright but not glaring, with slight wrinkles and light and shadow variations, adding realism and spatial feel to the scene. In the foreground is a white bedsheet with natural folds and transitions of light and shadow, giving it a soft texture. The middle shot features a female subject, centered and slightly left-centered, with the body slightly tilted and head slightly turned, creating a direct communication with the viewer, creating an intimate and tranquil atmosphere. The red and white checkered fabric in the background extends diagonally, creating visual guidance and drawing attention to the figure, while enriching the color layers of the composition. The overall composition uses close-ups and shallow depth of field effects to blur the background, enhancing the subject's three-dimensionality and focus. Light comes from the left side of the frame, soft natural light. Like morning or evening sunlight streaming through the window into the room, the light is warm and even, creating soft transitions between highlights and shadows. The direction of light and shadow is clear, enhancing the three-dimensionality and realism of the image. The overall atmosphere is warm, tranquil, and sweet, carrying a youthful vibe and the warmth of everyday life. The tones are mainly white, black, and red, with harmonious color combinations. The visuals are clean and refreshing, with rich details and strong visual appeal and artistic beauty, as if a high-quality portrait was shot with a professional camera. At the same time, it preserves the authenticity and natural beauty found in everyday life",
