        {
          "id": "krea2-1fea8555d5b5e3cfcd9e93b7",
          "alias": "单女旗袍竹林自信侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a high-necked, sleeveless modified qipao. The qipao had an off-white base color printed with ink-wash bamboo leaves and floral patterns, presenting a subtle Eastern charm. The black piping outlined the neckline, shoulder line, and side slits, adding a touch of refinement. The fabric had a silky sheen that glowed gently under soft light. The body-hugging design highlighted her graceful curves, with the waist being perfectly clinked. The hem naturally fell to the ankles, and one side high slit revealed the lines of her long legs. She stood before a rustic wooden sliding door, gently supporting the door frame with her left hand, her right hand naturally hanging down, her body slightly turned to the camera, head slightly tilted, her posture elegant and composed. The door frame was made of dark brown old wood, with natural wood grain and traces of time. The door handle was made of vintage metal with a circular design and classical decorative details. The door was half open, Through the glass windows, you can see the store's furnishings. Various bottles, jars, and packaging boxes are displayed on the shelves. Some product labels are marked in Chinese characters, and the indoor lighting is warm and soft, creating a cozy atmosphere. On the left is a small courtyard landscape, with the ground paved with gray pebbles of various sizes arranged in a harmonious manner. Several green plants dot the area, including tall bamboo, broad-leafed monstera, and a pot of spider plants. The plants are lush and vibrant, with vibrant colors. The overall composition uses a medium perspective, with the figures positioned slightly to the center on the right side of the frame occupying the visual center, with shops and courtyards in the background forming a distinctly layered spatial structure. The foreground features door frames and some plants, the middle ground features the main figures, and the background features the shop's interior and distant greenery. The light combines natural daylight with indoor warmth, with sunlight streaming in from the upper left, creating a soft shadow transition. The right side is in a slightly shadowed area, with natural light and shadow contrasts that highlight three-dimensionality. The overall color palette is mainly off-white, gray-brown, and dark green, harmoniously unified to create a peaceful, elegant, and culturally rich atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a professional camera, featuring the graininess and dynamic range of film film, while preserving the realism of everyday life captured unintentionally. Like a beautiful moment accidentally captured on an afternoon street, the composition is balanced, the visual guide is natural, leading from the door frame lines to the people and extending into the background, forming a smooth visual flow. Overall, it presents an artistic style that blends traditional aesthetics with modern aesthetics, combining Eastern classical beauty with a fashionable modern feel. The visuals are full of storytelling and emotional impact, evoking a sense of tranquil and elegant living",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
