          "id": "krea2-b0ded377a4b1f3ebadd9b76c",
          "alias": "单女黑外套城市沉思站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a riverside promenade at dusk, exuding a natural sense of fluidity and shine. She wears a black cropped zip-up jacket made of velvet with a slight matte reflective finish. The zipper is silver metallic, with fine stitching details at the hem and cuffs. Underneath, she wears an off-white crewneck base shirt that reveals a small collarbone She wears a simple thin chain necklace around her neck, a small round metal pendant, a pair of tiny earrings, a slender bracelet on her left wrist, and a ring on her right ring finger. She wears a dark plaid pleated mini skirt with a classic dark brown and black plaid pattern. The fabric has a certain crispness, the hem spreads out in an A-shape, and the waist is decorated with two gold buttons. The dress has multiple vertical pleats, creating rich textures. She wears a pair of black platform Martin boots. The boot upper is made of smooth leather, with a rounded toe and black laces tied in a standard cross knot. The sole is thick and has obvious patterns. She carries a black diamond-patterned chain bag crossbody, made of soft leather with clear diamond-shaped embossing. The cover has a gold metal fastener, and the chain is designed in double rows, connected by fine metal rings. She rests her hands on the black metal railing, leaning slightly to the side. Her left leg is bent forward, toes touching the ground, and her right leg stands upright for support, with an elegant and natural posture. The background is a wide river. The water reflects the colors of the sky, creating ripples. In the distance, blurred outlines of city buildings can be seen. The sky displays a gradient of warm tones, transitioning from orange-red near the horizon upward to light purple and light blue. The clouds are thin, presenting a soft pink-orange hue. Light comes from the rear diagonally, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame. The railing runs across the lower part of the painting, forming a visual guiding line. The foreground features a stone slab floor and some railings. The middle frame features a portrait as the main subject, with rivers and city silhouettes in the background. The lens uses an 85mm prime portrait lens with a shallow depth of field, noticeable background blur, and a prominent emphasis on the subject. The overall color scheme is mainly warm tones, blending dusk gold, orange, and pink with the black and brown of the characters' clothing. The image texture is delicate and detailed, presenting a style of urban street photography that balances fashion and everyday atmosphere, like a real moment captured by a professional camera at dusk. The light and shadow are natural, and the colors are harmonious. Full of the atmosphere of life and artistic beauty",
