        {
          "id": "krea2-f364c7df23e0c5793a4066c3",
          "alias": "单女竹林忧伤倚靠拥抱",
          "prompt": "She wears a deep gray traditional Hanfu with a delicate texture and a slight sheen. The collar and cuffs are adorned with delicate subtle embroidery, hugging the body and outlining a slender silhouette. In her right hand, she gently holds a rustic oil-paper umbrella. The handle is made of natural bamboo, with clear surface patterns. The umbrella surface is grayish-white, with slightly worn edges showing signs of age. The top is decorated with a black woven mesh structure. forming a unique visual focal point. Her posture is elegant and composed, her head slightly tilted, carrying a faint melancholy and contemplation, as if she is about to whisper or be lost in some kind of thought. The overall composition centers on the figure, with the middle showing her half-body clothing and posture, while the background is a hazy natural landscape. The blurred green vegetation and stone walls create a soft blurred effect, creating a profound sense of space. The composition uses the classic three-part method: the figure is on the left side of the frame, leaving a large blank space on the right to guide the gaze into the distance. At the same time, the vertical lines of the umbrella handle contrast with the diagonal contours of the figures, enhancing the stability and visual tension of the image. The lighting is soft and even, shadows are delicate and not jarring, and the overall tone leans toward a cool tone, mainly gray-green, dark gray, and ink, creating a quiet, cool, and slightly poetic atmosphere. The layers of light and shadow are rich but not overly intense, presenting a cinematic-quality film-like texture, as if shot outdoors on a cloudy day with a professional camera. The lens has slight graininess and color shifts, simulating the texture of real photography. The overall composition carries a strong sense of Eastern aesthetics, blending traditional clothing, natural elements, and modern aesthetics. It resembles both a meticulous brushwork and a documentary photographic work, full of storytelling and emotional tension. It is suitable for expressing themes of loneliness, longing, nostalgia, or tranquility and far-reaching goals. There are no unnecessary decorations or distractions; every detail serves the emotional expression of the figures and the creation of the atmosphere, presenting an overall artistic beauty that is subtle and intriguing",
