          "id": "krea2-8029bed823b13e46a152e209",
          "alias": "单女白外套椅上自信坐持包",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden chair, exuding an elegant and intellectual aura. She wears a loose, oversized off-white long wool coat paired with a simple crew-neck dress in the same color family. The hem of the coat naturally drapes out smooth pleated lines, with wide cuffs featuring a slight flare design. The front placket is adorned with two gold buttons adding a touch of detail. The look is small and delicate, and her legs are crossed. She wears a pair of beige suede knee-high boots, with low-heeled heels and fine ribbons at the ankles. The overall outfit is harmonious and unified, presenting a sense of sophistication and fashion. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of center of the frame, with a slightly turned body and a slight tilt of the head, a relaxed and confident posture. The foreground occupies most of the frame, the center features a dark wooden floor and several classic-style wooden chairs, and the background features a row of light beige vertical striped curtains that softly block the space behind. In the distance, a dining table covered with a white tablecloth and a wooden chair can be vaguely seen. The composition uses the classic three-part method, with the figure as the visual focal point extending to the handbag. Light comes from the left window, creating soft natural light that illuminates the front and sides of the figure. The shadowed areas transition naturally, with rich light and shadow layers, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The overall scene uses off-white, beige, and light brown tones, paired with a dark brown wooden floor, creating a striking contrast yet harmonious unity. The image has a strong sense of texture. From the wool texture of coats to the suede material of boots to the smooth surface of leather clutches, attention to detail is well executed, creating an overall atmosphere of tranquility and elegance, as if capturing a tranquil moment in an afternoon café. It has the texture of high-end fashion photography while retaining a sense of everyday life, as if shot with a professional camera in a real environment, emphasizing authentic light and material details, highlighting the character's elegant temperament and fashion taste",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
