        {
          "id": "krea2-1a091c674820c57a191bf17e",
          "alias": "单女旗袍摄影棚站立",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a modified qipao with a white background featuring red floral patterns. The stand-up collar design paired with red trim perfectly showcases her elegant figure. The blooming peony and plum blossom patterns on the qipao are distinctly layered, with delicate petal edges and green leaves scattered throughout. The overall pattern arrangement is well-balanced, full of classical Eastern charm. Her left hand naturally folds in front of her, her posture dignified and gentle. The background features traditional Chinese wooden door frames and window lattices, with clear dark brown wood grain. Above hang two large red lanterns with vertical folds on the surface and golden tassels and copper rings on top. Warm yellow light shines through the lanterns, creating a warm and festive atmosphere. In the distance, green plants and a blurred courtyard scene are faintly visible. The composition uses a medium shot close-up, with the figure centered slightly to the left and the head slightly angled to form a visual focal point. The foreground highlights the main figure, while the middle ground displays the details of the qipao and lantern elements. The background is blended to enhance spatial depth. Light comes from the left front, with natural light and shadow transitions. The fabric folds have delicate shadows, and the overall color scheme is mainly white, red, and gold. Paired with a dark brown background, the colors are harmonious and unified, creating a warm and peaceful atmosphere with a strong traditional festive atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, as if shot in a professional studio, using an 85mm prime lens with an f/1.8 large aperture and shallow depth of field, capturing clear character outlines and the beauty of background blur. It also preserves the lighting details and texture of real photography, presenting an imaging style that combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
