        {
          "id": "krea2-7a2e0796ea112db38174c9cd",
          "alias": "单女高领衫窗边坐侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a sleeveless turtleneck knit top in a blue-gray tone, featuring vertical striped textures. The material is soft and fits the body's curves, showcasing delicate knit textures and three-dimensional pleated details. The sides of the top have slits to reveal the waistline, while the shoulders and arms are fitted with matching long knit sleeves, loosely folded over the arms to create natural pleated layers. She wears light blue denim shorts. The pants fit perfectly, with slight wear and flicked edges at the legs, presenting a casual everyday style. She sits on the wooden floor, legs slightly bent together, her posture relaxed and elegant. Her right hand is raised behind her head, fingers naturally bent, while her left hand gently grasps the strap of the right sleeve. Her expression is gentle and serene, her makeup exquisite and natural, with delicate transitions of light and shadow. The background is an indoor space full of life. On the left is a wooden bookshelf with several neatly arranged books, with blurred text marks on the spine. Next to it is a vintage clock with a green dial, below which is a white ceramic cup and a gold candle holder. To the right is a wooden bulletin board with several colorful sticky notes and hand-drawn patterns, including pink hearts and geometric shapes. Below the bulletin board is a brown vintage radio with a clearly visible round silver speaker. Next to it is a transparent glass bottle decorated with colorful dots. Next to the radio is a beige storage box with blurred text printed on the surface, and above the box is a white helmet. The overall ambient lighting is bright and soft. Natural light from outside the window pours in from the upper right, creating a warm side lighting effect while creating delicate shadows on background objects. The composition centers on the person, using a medium shot perspective. The figure occupies the main position of the image, with the head slightly tilted, creating direct communication with the viewer. Background elements are evenly distributed on both sides, creating visual balance. The foreground's arms and clothing details are clearly visible, while the middle shot focuses on the person's entire body and part of the background. The background presents a certain blur effect to highlight the subject. The color scheme is mainly blue-gray, beige, and brown, creating a warm and comfortable home atmosphere. The light and shadow layers are rich, the contrast between light and shadow is soft, and the overall image presents a realistic style that combines artistic flair with a sense of everyday life. It resembles a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera, offering strong visual appeal and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
