        {
          "id": "krea2-d167f6aa70ff3b22a29a5e90",
          "alias": "单女困倦跳舞",
          "prompt": "She wears a light blue, semi-transparent strapless top with lace trim and embroidery, and a richly decorated gold belt hanging from the belt, adorned with beads, discs, and bells. On her arms are multi-layered gold bracelets and arm rings. At her wrist, a slender chain extends from her shoulders to her abdomen, forming a graceful curve. Her hands are elegantly clasped in front of her chest, her fingers long, nails neatly trimmed, her posture dignified and expressive. The background is deep black, with faint flowing white smoke drifting in the air, creating a dreamy and mysterious atmosphere. Light streams in from the left, creating a strong backlight effect. Sunlight penetrates the smoke, outlining a bright gold outline around the figure's silhouette, filling the entire scene with a warm and soft golden tone. The layers of light and shadow are rich, with strong contrasts between highlights and shadows, highlighting the texture and three-dimensionality of the clothing. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, head slightly turned to the side, carrying a touch of gentleness and mystery. The smoke in the background spirals upward, adding dynamism and spatial depth to the image, presenting a semi-transparent texture. The overall color palette is dominated by gold, off-white, and light blue, complemented by a black background for a strong visual impact. The style blends Eastern classical aesthetics with modern photographic art. It carries a strong exotic charm and romantic atmosphere, as if capturing a moment from an ancient legend. It combines the grandeur of court nobility with the lively rhythm of folk dance, while retaining the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting, such as slight noise, imperfect exposure, and natural depth transitions, making the images both exquisite and lifelike. The color saturation is moderate, and the light and shadow treatment is delicate, creating a dreamlike visual experience, as if stepping out of a freeze-frame from an epic film. It makes you feel the beautiful moments when time freezes.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
