        {
          "id": "krea2-26355c33fc1dd9a238e1158c",
          "alias": "单女旗袍竹林持扇",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a modified qipao with a white background and pink floral patterns. The qipao featured short sleeves, with delicate lace trim on the collar and cuffs. A pink ribbon bow was tied at the chest, and a green bamboo-shaped decorative buckle adorned at the waist. The overall look was elegant and full of Eastern charm. She held an open beige folding fan in her right hand, its surface painted with elegant pink flowers and leaf patterns. The background is a lush garden, with large patches of lush green lotus leaves nearby. The leaves are broad and rounded, with slightly curled edges. Some leaves even have crystal-clear droplets that sparkle in the sunlight. In the distance, the calm pond reflects the surrounding green trees, with a few scattered lotus petals floating on the water. Further away is a sturdy willow tree, its hanging branches like silk threads, gently swaying in the wind. Sunlight streams in diagonally from the upper left of the image, creating warm golden rays that pass through the leaves and fall onto the figures, creating a soft light and shadow effect that creates a dreamlike atmosphere. The entire composition centers on the figure, shot in the middle shot, with the figure occupying about two-thirds of the frame. The background is blurred to highlight the subject, the lotus leaves in the foreground and the willow trees in the background create a sense of layering, then extend to the distant lake and trees. The contrast of light and shadow is strong but transitions naturally. The overall color palette is mainly green and pink, paired with soft warm yellow sunlight. It creates a tranquil, poetic, and classical summer afternoon atmosphere, like a masterpiece combining traditional Chinese ink painting with modern photographic art. The image texture is delicate, color saturation is moderate, and details are rich, exuding strong artistic appeal and immersion. It is like a photo taken with a high-resolution camera and professional lighting under natural light, presenting a serene and beautiful Eastern aesthetic conception",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
