        {
          "id": "krea2-3bf3299f31bd35f4b70820b3",
          "alias": "单女白T恤车内微笑坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sits inside the car, appearing moist and textured. She wears a white camisole and white skinny pants, with an overall look that is simple and fresh. Her posture is relaxed, her legs slightly bent, one arm naturally resting on her knee, the other gently resting on her leg, and wearing a deep red woven bracelet on her wrist, adding a touch of warmth and a faint smile that lifts slightly, presenting a serene and charming temperament. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, with a close-up and background blur, presenting the interior environment, where you can see some of the inside of the doors, seat edges, and the blurred light and outlines outside the windows, creating a sense of privacy and quiet. The middle ground features the bodies of the people and parts of the interior, with light and shadow streaming in from the windows and sunlight filtering through, creating a natural backlighting effect that enhances depth and layering. Although the background is blurry, the basic interior structures such as door handles, seat textures, and window frames are preserved, adding realism. The overall color palette is mainly white and light gray. The visual contrast is vivid and harmonious, with a warm and soft lighting atmosphere, evoking the tranquility and laziness of a summer afternoon. The image is full of life and a sense of daily life, like a casual car selfie shot with amateur equipment. The slight noise and natural depth of field transitions enhance realism. The camera settings are set to low ISO to reduce noise, and the shutter speed is moderate to capture sharp moments. The overall image presents a clean, pure, and approachable artistic aesthetic, combining the casual and free nature of modern urban life with the unique gentleness and innocence of youth. The details are rich, while maintaining moderate blurring and blur to avoid the stiffness caused by excessive sharpness. It creates a dreamlike atmosphere between reality and ideals, like a carefully selected yet effortless snapshot of life, capturing an ordinary yet precious moment. The use of light and shadow cleverly shapes the three-dimensional forms of the figures, with delicate transitions at the intersection of light and shadow. Highlights are bright but not glaring, shadow areas are deep but not dull, presenting an overall balanced and comfortable visual experience. The color saturation is moderate—neither overly vivid nor dull—matching the true presentation under natural light. There are no unnecessary decorations or distractions, focusing on the emotional expression of the figures themselves. The composition is compact and dynamic, conveying a quiet, confident, and slightly shy emotional state. The entire scene seems frozen by time, evoking a sense of tranquility and beauty in that moment. This atmosphere is suitable for personal portraits and possesses strong visual appeal, sparking resonance and imagination in viewers.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
