          "id": "krea2-4cbde04ad1097d8f30af2f05",
          "alias": "单女粉外套健身房愤怒坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the gray floor of an indoor tennis training court, wearing a light pink zip-up sports jacket and gray tight sweatpants, beige casual sneakers, her right hand lightly gripping the handle of a white tennis racket, and her left hand resting naturally on her knee. Her posture is relaxed yet carries a hint of post-exercise laziness. Her body leans slightly, her right leg bent and left leg straight, forming a natural sitting posture curve, presenting an overall relaxed fitness vibe. In the foreground, the white frame and mesh of the racket are clearly visible. Visually echoing her movements, the center features an orange-red shopping cart filled with yellow-green tennis balls. The spheres are plump and rounded, brightly colored, and glow faintly under the lights. The metal frame and wheels of the cart are clearly detailed, with a black tennis net beside it. The mesh is finely woven with red edges, and behind the net is a faint blue lettering of \"Tennis Fit.\" In the background is a huge blue wall printed with white tennis court lines and a green tennis ball pattern. and an envelope-shaped logo. The walls are flat and clean, with high color saturation but not glaring. The entire space is bright and evenly lit, using indoor ceiling lighting with soft light sources without strong shadows, creating a clean and tidy commercial sports environment. The composition centers on the person, shot from a slightly overhead angle, with the person positioned slightly to the left of the frame, the shopping cart and tennis ball on the right side forming a visual balance. The tennis net extends diagonally from the upper left corner to the center of the frame, guiding the gaze through the person's body to enhance the sense of spatial depth. The blue wall in the background contrasts with the gray floor to create a warm and cool contrast, highlighting the warm tones of the main subject. The light and shadow distribution is even, reflecting the texture of modern indoor lighting. The overall color tone is fresh and bright, combining the vitality of sport with a casual sense of everyday life. It feels like a daily record shot with a professional camera paired with a standard lens. It features slight film graininess and natural exposure transitions, presenting a realistic, natural, and approachable visual effect. The composition is stable yet dynamic, and the colors are harmoniously unified. The details are rich but not overly complicated, providing a relaxed and enjoyable visual experience",
