        {
          "id": "krea2-f2ee7ab8789407b2599885b1",
          "alias": "单女粉挂脖卧室站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of an indoor bookshelf wearing a tightly tailored deep rose-pink halter dress. The fabric is smooth and soft, with a subtle silky sheen. Under the light, delicate pleats and light transitions appear. Her right hand gently tugs at her waist, forming a natural pleat texture that highlights curves and dynamic beauty. Light softly shines from the front side, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The background is a dark wooden bookshelf neatly arranged with several hardcover books. The spines vary in color, including blue, beige, brown, and more. Some book titles are blurry, and the edge of the lower shelf faintly reveals a white pillow and a magazine cover. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with figures occupying most of the space. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, private, elegant, and artistic, with rich light and shadow layers and warm tones, creating a gentle, lazy afternoon atmosphere, as if taking a daily photo in a private study or bedroom corner. The image texture is delicate, with moderate color saturation, featuring professional studio-like lighting effects while retaining a casual sense of everyday life. The entire image exudes a blend of understated luxury and restrained sexiness. It is neither an overly commercial fashion photoshoot nor a rough amateur candid shot, but a refined aesthetic expression that strikes a balance between the two. The attention to detail is spot-on, as if you can feel the warmth and tranquil atmosphere in the air.",
