        {
          "id": "krea2-25d85bd148de2358b7a41338",
          "alias": "单女棕衬衫沙发温柔坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright on a modern, minimalist gray fabric sofa, wearing a delicately textured dark brown long-sleeve shirt. The fabric has a soft sheen, presenting silky smooth pleats and drape under natural light. The neckline is slightly open to reveal the collarbone, paired with a silver-gray shiny hip-bust mini skirt that hugs the figure and outlines smooth curves. Wearing black stockings below, her legs are long and well-proportioned, combining professional sophistication with intimate sexiness. His calm expression revealed a hint of laziness and confidence. The foreground focuses on her upper body and leg posture, with her right hand naturally resting on the edge of the sofa, her left hand gently stroking the hem of her skirt, her body slightly leaning forward to create a dynamic sense of balance, creating a visual tension that is both intimate and distant. The middle view shows the sofa's surface and cushion details: the left side features an olive green textured cushion, while the right side features a light gray base with white floral patterns, edged with black piping. The material contrast is rich yet does not overpower, enhancing the spatial layering. The background features a plain beige wall with no decorations or clutter, only a single vertical wall crevice line hinting at the spatial structure. The overall color scheme is unified and harmonious, using a low-saturation warm color scheme to enhance a quiet, private, and immersive atmosphere. The composition uses vertical full-body cropping, with the figure positioned slightly to the center, while maintaining the leg extension of the lower body to enhance the depth of the image. It extends down from the neck, shoulders, waist, and legs down to the ankles, forming a natural guide chain for the body's curves. In terms of lighting and atmosphere, the light source comes from the front left of the frame, creating a subtle sense of depth. The shoulders, neck, and chest areas are brightly illuminated, creating natural highlight transitions, while the sides and legs show soft shadows. The dark areas do not appear stiff, highlighting the texture of the skin and the details of the garment's folds. The overall image exudes a tranquil, elegant, restrained, and story-rich atmosphere, as if capturing a moment of tranquility in an afternoon alone. It combines the comfort of daily life with the refined aesthetics of artistic photography, making it suitable for amateur equipment such as phones or small cameras. Through precise focusing and stable composition, it achieves high-quality images, filling the image with a sense of sophistication and emotional tension, inviting visitors to pause and appreciate its emotional storytelling and visual beauty.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
