        {
          "id": "krea2-a5ed709eb4bd074ab03264c1",
          "alias": "单女旗袍摄影棚困倦持相机",
          "prompt": "She wore a light teal sleeveless qipao top, made of fabric as thin as silk, with subtle textures and a soft sheen. The frog button design at the neckline was exquisite and elegant, blending the color with the body and highlighting the simplicity and sophistication of traditional Eastern aesthetics. The composition employs compact medium and close-up shots, with shallow depth of field treatment rendering the background completely blurred into a hazy warm gray tone, creating a strong emphasis on the subject. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is extremely soft, with the main light source coming from the upper sides, like natural afternoon light filtering through window lattices or tree shade, creating warm and bright highlights that avoid harsh contrasts and present an overall dreamy, hazy soft-focus texture. The color base mainly interweaves warm and cool tones, while the warm gray background provides a stable base. The overall color tone is harmonious and unified, rich in cinematic feel and an ink-wash painting-like atmosphere. The entire composition exudes a tranquil, restrained, and artistic atmosphere full of Eastern charm. It features professional studio-level precise lighting control while still carrying the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting—slight lens defocus, slight noise, and soft color temperature shifts seem like moments casually captured at dusk with an old film camera or phone, unexpectedly creating a work full of emotional depth and aesthetic tension.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
