        {
          "id": "krea2-0cb2b0629f58be4c99fbecac",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣街道俏皮倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "She leans slightly to the camera, her skin fair and radiant, exuding a youthful yet slightly calm aura. She wore a beige knitted cardigan, with clearly visible fabric textures, fine ribbed designs on the cuffs and neckline, and three neatly arranged dark brown buttons on the chest; Underneath, she wears a white sailor-collared shirt with two deep red pinstripes along the collar edge. The bow is a dark brown satin bow in the same color family, elegantly tied at the chest. The collar is faintly decorated with several lines of red embroidery, adding a touch of interest; She paired the lower half with a light gray pleated skirt, the hem draping naturally and the lines clean and sharp. Her right hand is gently raised, fingertips slightly raised, as if about to point in a certain direction or strike a playful pose, while her left hand is naturally tucked into the skirt pocket, relaxed and expressive. She was standing on a wall paved with countless tiny yellow grid tiles, neatly arranged and glowing with a gentle glow under soft light. In the corner, part of a blue street sign was visible, printed with the white number \"0\" and blurred Chinese characters. The foreground is the natural contour lines formed by her body and arms, guiding the gaze to focus on the subject. In the middle ground, thick concrete columns stand behind her, their rough surfaces bearing traces of time, creating a textured contrast with her soft clothing. Visual passages form between the columns, with modern urban buildings in the background. Glass curtain walls reflect the gray-white sky on cloudy days, tall buildings rise in the distance, windows are neat, and scattered pedestrians are blurred on the streets, creating a daily urban atmosphere. The composition is shot from a slightly upward angle, making the figure appear more upright and approachable, while columns are used as framed elements to enhance the sense of spatial depth. Extending downward to clothing details and gestures, then transitioning to architectural lines in the background, creating a smooth visual flow. The light and shadows come from scattered light on cloudy days, soft and even, without strong shadows. The color saturation is moderate, and the overall tone leans toward a warm and cool balance, mainly beige, gray-blue, and yellow, creating a fresh, artistic, and slightly retro campus vibe. The atmosphere is tranquil yet full of storytelling, evoking a sense of urban detachment while revealing warmth through the characters' expressions and postures, as if capturing an ordinary yet precious moment—perhaps a nap after school or a casual group photo with friends. The entire scene resembles a daily portrait taken with a regular phone on a cloudy afternoon, exuding a strong sense of realism and the atmosphere of everyday life. Yet, thanks to the clever combination of character shapes and scenes, the image is endowed with a carefully crafted artistic beauty, resembling a real street art photography rather than a deliberately polished commercial blockbuster.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
