        {
          "id": "krea2-1a515477f08122d6469eca0e",
          "alias": "单女毛衣室内倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "Without heavy makeup, she appeared more genuine and pure; She wore a high-quality gray knitted long-sleeve top, with the fabric covered in delicate, complex wave patterns and geometric dark patterns. Under the light, it created rich transitions of light and shadow and three-dimensional folds, with delicate ruffled decorations on the cuffs, adding a touch of softness and elegance; Her arms are naturally bent, her elbows lightly resting on a soft object, and her palm resting lightly on her shoulder or chest, her posture relaxed and rhythmic, displaying an effortless elegance and composure; Especially the textured knit sweater occupies most of the visual space in the composition, with smooth lines extending from shoulder to arm, guiding the gaze toward the center; The middle shot features the folds of her neck, collarbones, and clothing, where light and shadow create subtle contrasts, enhancing the image's three-dimensional and realistic feel. The background is treated in soft, blurred warm white tones, with natural light filtering in from outside and the hazy outlines of city buildings faintly visible, creating a warm and tranquil indoor atmosphere while avoiding any distractions; The composition uses the classic rule of thirds combined with diagonals, with the figure's head slightly tilted, gaze facing upward to the right, and the body leaning to the left, creating dynamic balance; The overall composition is vertical, with meticulous use of light and shadow. Soft, diffused light from the upper side evenly spreads, creating warm highlights that enhance the sense of layering and realism; The overall atmosphere is peaceful, gentle, and healing, full of poetic beauty reminiscent of Japanese art films. The color palette mainly consists of low-saturation gray-white, off-white, and light brown, complemented by warm skin tones of the characters, creating a fresh, natural, and slightly nostalgic visual experience; The image style combines the delicate texture of professional photography with the hyper-realistic soft focus effect of AI-generated images. The details are extremely rich, while retaining slight softening and dreaminess. It feels like a daily portrait shot with a high-end digital camera paired with a large aperture lens, carefully graded and sharpened in post-processing, offering high artistic expression and emotional resonance.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
