        {
          "id": "krea2-6f49afe3caf482f015e47006",
          "alias": "单女自信倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "Her posture is elegant and composed, with wide, flowing sleeves. Layers of sheer fabric cast a hazy texture in the light and shadow. A matching ribbon is tied at the waist, with delicate embroidered patterns decorating the knots. The entire garment presents silky smoothness and flow; In the foreground, her half-leaning figure and clothing are displayed, with dark columns on the right serving as visual anchors, drawing the viewer's gaze toward the main figure; The folds of the garment naturally fall along the body's curves, with light filtering through the sheer fabric from the front side, outlining the skin contours and layering of the garment, creating a three-dimensional effect of interwoven light and shadow; The background is a blurred classical garden or courtyard scene, with faintly visible mottled stone walls, entwined vines, and hazy tree shadows. Using large apertures and shallow depth of field, it creates a dreamlike atmosphere; The composition uses a vertical close-up perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the center, leaving the space on the left to extend visual tension. The color saturation is low, emphasizing emotion rather than visual impact; The atmosphere is extremely strong, blending the hazy atmosphere of ink paintings with the delicate emotional expression of cinematic lenses. It feels like a tranquil moment in an ancient-style TV drama or the poet's beautiful scene of \"the moon above the willow tips.\" It carries a rich sense of Eastern aesthetics blending with modern photography techniques for a sophisticated texture. It is neither a professional commercial blockbuster nor a rough amateur shoot, but a refined visual work that combines artistic depth with the atmosphere of everyday life, allowing visitors to feel the beauty of time standing still and the eternal charm of classical culture.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
