        {
          "id": "krea2-f6a73663809bfde7095d3fb1",
          "alias": "单女全裸蓝旗袍泳池冷淡倚靠",
          "prompt": "An Eastern woman gracefully leans against a rustic stone railing, wearing a deep blue modified qipao with delicate floral patterns. The neckline features a classic Chinese frog button, and one side of the skirt reveals her long, beautiful legs. She wears a light, flowing white hollow-out knit shawl adorned with delicate tassels, wears a simple silver watch on her wrist, and pairs of nude pink pointed stiletto heels. The overall look blends classical charm with modern fashion. Her makeup is fresh and natural, she slightly turns to glance back at the camera, exuding confidence and composure. In the foreground is a rough-textured gray stone floor, dotted with patches of moss and tender green ferns in the gaps, adding natural vitality; The central frame features a heavy stone railing carved with traditional patterns, topped with lotus relief carvings. The lines are ancient and powerful, the stone surface texture clearly visible, with figures leaning against it, forming a stable visual support; In the background is a pristine white antique-style wall, on which is boldly inked with vigorous brush calligraphy characters like \"Ink Pool.\" The strokes are full and majestic, while the small characters on the right sign \"Zhu Fang\" hint at cultural origins. The wall texture is rough like rice paper or gray clay, contrasting with the smooth fabric of the figures' clothing. The composition uses a slightly upturned mid-shot portrait perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the golden ratio point, the body extending diagonally, and the stone railing running diagonally through the painting to enhance depth. The light and shadow come from soft, naturally diffused light, possibly shot on cloudy days or under tree shade. The lighting is uniform without strong shadows. The blue qipao stands out against the white wall, with high color saturation, and the white shawl reflecting soft halos creates a tranquil and gentle atmosphere. The overall color scheme mainly interweaves warm and cool tones, with blue and white as the main tones, creating a calm yet vibrant visual balance. The atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, full of Eastern aesthetic conception. It combines a sense of historical depth with youthful vitality, like a vivid picture of modern urbanites harmoniously coexisting with traditional cultural elements. The texture of the images is delicate and authentic, like precious moments captured in the afternoon glow with amateur equipment (such as a phone or ordinary camera). It combines artistic expression with a sense of everyday intimacy, conveying a self-expression of restrained confidence, cultural identity, and beauty.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
