        {
          "id": "krea2-ef8949f02fb07c105d05afc1",
          "alias": "单女黑外套广场沉思倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully leans against the hood of a futuristic silver-gray supercar, wearing a sharply tailored black cargo jacket paired with a black fitted cropped top and silky black stockings, paired with black pointed high heels adorned with dazzling square rhinestone buttons, gently fluttering in the breeze as she gazes into the camera. Her posture is composed and unhurried, her legs long and stretched, one hand lightly resting on the car body, the other naturally letting loose, showcasing a modern urban woman's charm that combines strength and softness. The vehicle is a high-performance sports car with a highly streamlined design, its body surface reflecting soft daylight. The license plate number \"556\" is clearly visible, and the overall metallic sheen contrasts sharply with the matte black components. In the foreground is a slightly mottled dark asphalt pavement, dotted with several light water or oil stains, adding a realistic texture and a sense of everyday life to the scene; The middle view is the front of the vehicle and the lower body of the figure, forming the visual focal point; On the left side of the background is a lush, well-defined evergreen conifer; on the right, in the distance, a faint white guardrail and a blurry \"Keep Clear\" warning sign can be seen; farther away, a wide, slightly grayish-blue sky with thin clouds and even, soft lighting creates a tranquil atmosphere reminiscent of dusk or dawn. The entire composition uses vertical composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, while vehicle lines and a sense of floor extension enhance spatial depth. The light and shadow treatment is delicate: the main body is affected by side backlighting, while the body appears semi-reflective, with smooth shadow transitions. The overall color palette is mainly cool gray, black, and silver, creating a sophisticated, calm, and slightly detached fashion atmosphere. The image quality leans toward a realistic photography style, with rich details but not excessive sharpening, featuring slight film graininess and natural noise, simulating professional camera shooting rather than overly rendered CG illustration styles, presenting an artistic depth that closely resonates with everyday amateur equipment capturing moments.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
