        {
          "id": "krea2-cab28106f6ac83fde852952f",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙竹林忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "An Eastern woman sits upright in a classical Chinese interior, wearing a smooth, off-white spaghetti strap long dress with a matching bow at the waist. The hem naturally falls to her calves, and the fabric glows with a delicate sheen under soft light, highlighting her slender figure and elegant posture; Her makeup is delicate and elegant, her expression calm with a hint of melancholy. On her left wrist, she wears a string of warm pearls, her right hand gently resting on the edge of a small wooden table, her fingertips lightly touching an unfolded classical ink painting. In the painting, you can faintly see rocks, trees, and figures, with a transparent glass cup and a round bamboo tray placed nearby. The wood grain on the table is clear and natural; The round stool she sits on is made of dark brown solid wood, with a smooth surface and clean lines; The background features a dark wooden lattice screen and scroll-style calligraphy hanging scrolls. The four bold characters \"Blessings and Longevity\" are inscribed on both sides, with small regular script signatures and red seals on both sides. The scroll hangs above a dark brown wooden frame, with vintage mirror frames embedded inside, faintly visible of blurred English markings; Farther away is a dark wooden partition wall, the wall made of vertical wooden planks joined together, with faint light and shadow filtering through the gaps. On the right side, a corner of a light-colored curtain can be faintly brushed by the wind; The floor is covered with a warm brown wavy texture carpet, harmoniously blending with the overall spatial tone; The composition uses a medium shot's close-up angle, with the main figure positioned slightly to the left center, maintaining a stable visual focus. The foreground table and hand movements form guiding lines, drawing the viewer's gaze from her fingers to the painting. The middle ground depicts the subject's entire body and surrounding environmental details, while the background is enhanced with blur to enhance spatial depth. Light comes from the front left of the image, soft and warm, creating a side backlighting effect, while soft shadows are cast on the background screen and furniture, creating a contrast of light and shadow; The overall atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, carrying the artistic conception of traditional Eastern aesthetics, combining the delicate texture and humanistic warmth of modern photography. The use of light and shadow is delicate and restrained, with earthy tones as the main tones—dark brown, off-white, and warm brown intertwined—creating a calm, restrained, and culturally rich poetic space. It feels as if time has frozen at this moment, and the figures resemble flowing meticulous ladies' paintings. Quietly observing the inner world in a classical setting, the entire composition exudes a strong sense of Eastern Zen and artistic beauty. Like shooting with amateur equipment, it boasts professional-level composition and control of light and shadow; the details are rich yet never overpowered, with every element serving the overall emotional expression and visual storytelling.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
