        {
          "id": "krea2-24b1d774d4578e04dee87e7d",
          "alias": "单女全裸白衬衫广场害羞坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright in a space filled with retro Japanese style, wearing an off-white sleeveless pleated shirt dress adorned with a delicate black bow at the neckline. The garment feels light and smooth, shimmering with a silky sheen under the soft warm light. The hem edges are decorated with delicate ruffles, adding a touch of sweetness and playfulness. She exudes a calm yet slightly shy expression, as if immersed in a peaceful afternoon. Her hands are gracefully moved: her left hand resting lightly on the armrest of the rattan chair behind her, while her right hand naturally rests in front of her knee. Her fingers are long and slender, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with elegant nude nails. On her wrists, she wears two minimalist metal bracelets—one uniquely shaped like a coiled vine or chain, and the other a plain circle. The overall accessory is understated yet refined, highlighting her gentle and serene temperament. In the foreground, her body occupies the main position in the composition, using medium to close-up shots. The slightly tilted angle adds dynamism and layering to the scene. The background is a typical Japanese old shop or izakaya interior, with mottled wooden walls covered in vertical signboards inscribed with calligraphy, with ink in varying shades—some strokes bold and unrestrained, others neat and elegant, creating a strong cultural atmosphere; A square paper lantern hangs overhead, emitting a warm yellow glow while casting soft light and shadow outlines on the wall; Next to it hangs a small Japanese-style flag with a red background and white borders, printed with blurred black text patterns, adding a splash of bright color; On the right, another customer's blurry silhouette can be faintly seen, suggesting that this is a real, everyday scene rather than a completely empty setting. In the middle of the frame, she leans on a dark wooden rattan chair, with clearly visible grain. Its rough and rustic texture subtly contrasts with the softness of her clothing, further highlighting the presence of the subject. The overall lighting of the painting leans toward warm tones, with the main light sources coming from overhead paper lanterns and indirect side lighting, creating a natural transition between light and shadow and a rich three-dimensional effect. The wooden structures and wall decorations in the background are positioned in slightly darker areas, further highlighting the main figures. The overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, carrying a strong sense of Japanese nostalgia, as if time has frozen at this moment, evoking a sense of peace and beauty away from the noise. The colors of the painting are mainly off-white, light brown, and wood tones, complemented by a red flag as the visual focal point, forming a harmonious and unified visual language. Then, through arm lines and armrests, you can be guided to the lower right corner, ultimately drawn in by the gentle expressions of the characters. The entire image presents a delicate, realistic style with a touch of artistic filters, like a work shot with amateur equipment but carefully adjusted in post-processing. It preserves the natural feel of daily life while imparting a cinematic narrative beauty and emotional depth, making one stop and gaze, immersing themselves in this gentle world within a small space.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
