        {
          "id": "krea2-e17cfed0cf9cd906164d632f",
          "alias": "单女衬衫街道沉思站立持包",
          "prompt": "At night, a woman stands at the edge of a sidewalk, with the brightly lit exterior walls of modern university buildings in the background. The golden English letters \"JIANG GONG SHANG UNIVERSITY\" are clearly visible on the walls. The glass curtain walls reflect warm yellow lights and tree shadows in a hazy glow, while the lush trees above cast dense and soft silhouettes in the night, while the leaves appear in bright yellow-green tones under the lights. In the foreground is a damp, reflective gray paving curb with yellow tactile stripes and white traffic markings. On the right stand two gray-and-white stone road posts, with a striking fluorescent yellow warning strip wrapped in the center, standing out in the night. The female subject is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the painting, with a tall posture and a calm expression with a hint of coolness and elegance. She wore a light purple, semi-transparent shirt with a neckline tied at the chest, sleeves slightly rolled up to reveal her slender wrists, paired with high-waisted black shorts, black transparent stockings with fine horizontal stripes on her legs, and a pair of platform white sneakers with classic black stitching on the uppers, blending collegiate style with street fashion vibes. She gently holds a black glossy handbag in her left hand; the body is smooth and rounded, the metal chain fastener glows softly under the light, and her right hand naturally rests at her thigh, exuding a calm and confident posture. The composition uses slightly upturned medium to long shots, with the figure occupying about two-thirds of the frame's height. Buildings, shrubs, and road posts create a distinct sense of spatial depth, with visual guidance extending from the ground markings to the characters' feet, enhancing the subject's focus. The lighting atmosphere is dominated by warm yellow artificial light sources, with light from the building facade evenly casting light on the figures, outlining soft, three-dimensional contours. At the same time, delicate shadow transitions are created on the ground, creating a unique tranquility and ambiguous atmosphere at night in the city; The wrinkles and stocking textures are clearly visible, with rich details. The entire image has a strong realist style but shows delicate post-processing color grading effects. The color saturation is moderate and contrast is slightly strong, presenting a visual beauty that is both realistic and slightly artistic filtered. It feels like shooting with a high-end digital camera paired with a large-aperture lens, preserving everyday noise and slight motion blur, enhancing the image's realism and immersive experience, allowing viewers to feel the unique charm and composed aura of a youthful, independent woman in the city night.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
