        {
          "id": "krea2-d0d8d1b0a201c1493f5e7ad4",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫愤怒站立注视",
          "prompt": "Her posture is full of movement and youthful energy, fluttering backward in the strong wind, creating a stark contrast with the clear, blue sky. She wore a loose white long-sleeved shirt, the hem slightly puffed by the wind, paired with black high-waisted denim shorts, revealing her long, well-proportioned calves, as if sunlight had penetrated the delicate texture of her skin; A black-and-white vertical striped shirt is casually tied around the waist, fluttering in the wind and adding a casual and fashionable vibe; She wears a pair of pure white platform sneakers paired with white knee-high socks, with loose and natural laces, giving the overall look a simple yet layered look; In the foreground is a clearly visible blue court ground with a white border, and a black tennis net stretching across the figure in front of the figure. The grid structure is finely defined, and the ropes glow slightly in the sunlight; The medium shots focus on the figure's complete body from waist to ankles, with smooth and graceful leg lines, muscle lines accentuated by sweat, and the interplay of light and shadow outlining a healthy silhouette; The background is a vast, pure blue sky without a single cloud, presenting an extremely tranquil yet dynamic visual space. In the distance, the field fence and blurred outlines of city buildings can be faintly seen, creating a sports scene atmosphere on the edge of the city; The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, placing the figure slightly to the left center of the frame, emphasizing their upright posture and dynamic beauty. The tennis racket extends diagonally to guide the gaze, with bright, glaring natural daylight coming from the upper right of the figure, creating a soft yet strong contrast of light and shadow. The shoulders, back, and legs are brightly lit, while the shadowed areas are deep and textured. Sweat beads on the legs reflect dazzling highlights, enhancing the realism and vitality of the movement. The overall atmosphere combines youthful energy, free spirit, and healthy vitality. The colors are mainly cool tones, with blue skies, nets, and sneakers forming a calm tone, creating a sports aesthetic that is both professional and full of everyday life. It has a highly realistic photographic texture, as if shot with amateur equipment but with professional-grade post-processing color grading. The details are rich and full, showcasing the photographer's mastery of light, shadow, and motion capture.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
