        {
          "id": "krea2-d73dfd7041d740c3c6e3ae39",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙车库冷淡站立持手机",
          "prompt": "In a sunlit afternoon parking lot, a woman is the absolute focal point of the scene. She wears a delicate and elegant white French puff-sleeve dress, with layers of skirt as light and flowing as clouds. The neckline is adorned with delicate lace and metal accents, outlining a classical romantic silhouette. The cinched waist accentuates her slender waist, and the overall cut retains both softness and the dignified temperament of a mature woman. Add a touch of lazy and casual vibe; She carries a small rattan basket in her left hand, with a soft cloth strap tied to the rim. In the foreground, she stands on asphalt roads, with light and shadow interwoven beneath her feet. The dark shadows cast by the wheels contrast with the reflections on the ground, enhancing the sense of spatial depth; On the left side is a row of modern white SUVs parked. The body lines are smooth, the taillights reflect a soft, cool glow in the sunlight, and the license plate is clearly visible but not overshadowed; instead, it serves as a stable anchor point in the composition. In the distance on the right, two blurry figures slowly walk along the road. Their presence not only enriches the layers of the image, but also suggests that this is a real, everyday scene full of everyday life, rather than a staged scene. The middle section consists of neatly arranged cars and extended roads, with green trees shading both sides of the road, their dappled shadows scattering on the ground, forming a natural visual guide line while enhancing the spatial sense and depth of the composition; In the background, a towering coniferous forest stands out, with dense branches and leaves creating a deep dark green hue against the blue sky. The daylight filtering through the gaps in the leaves forms spotted light spots, creating a contrast of reality and void with the bright sunlight nearby. The vertical lines of the trees intertwine with the horizontal lines of the roads, creating a solid and rhythmic visual framework. The entire shot is shot from a slightly top-down angle, with the figures positioned near the golden ratio point, creating a full, uncrowded composition that naturally focuses on the subjects; The light comes from the upper left of the frame, typical daytime natural light. The strong light penetrates through the clouds and casts a soft, delicate highlight transition on the skin and clothing, while leaving a clear and sharp shadow on the ground and vehicle surfaces, enhancing the sense of depth and authenticity. The color palette is mainly pure white, with an overall fresh, harmonious, and warm tone that creates a carefree, relaxed, and pleasant summer afternoon atmosphere; The atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, combining the convenience and order of urban life (cars, roads) with natural wildness and humanistic warmth (trees, dolls, pedestrians). The characters' expressions are naturally relaxed, their movements relaxed and free, as if capturing a fleeting beautiful moment, conveying themes of youth, freedom, and everyday happiness; The overall style leans toward the realism of amateur equipment shooting—no excessive sharpening or exaggerated filters, moderate color saturation, subtle but real noise, natural light and shadow transitions, delicate detail handling yet still rough, like snapshots casually recorded on a phone, yet through the postures of the subjects and the clever arrangement of the environment, it presents an artistic appeal that surpasses ordinary photos, making people pause and feel the poetry and beauty hidden in everyday life.",
