        {
          "id": "krea2-a3695622af9dd3b63c6d90d0",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣室内沉思坐躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman sitting on an indoor carpet, adding a touch of laziness and authenticity. Looking directly into the camera, as if lost in her own thoughts. She wore an off-white vertical striped knit sweater with clearly visible texture, natural pleats at the cuffs and neckline, and a soft and fluffy material that exuded a warm and comfortable home atmosphere. Under the sweater, a corner of the black shorts peeks out, creating a simple contrast with the sweater. She sat with her legs crossed, a printed sheet of paper on her knees, covered with blurred text and charts, suggesting she might have just finished her studies or work, or was pondering something. Her posture is relaxed yet focused, her body slightly leaning forward and her head slightly tilted, creating an intimate and natural shooting angle.",
