        {
          "id": "krea2-df6e41fb47e2663ed50b7433",
          "alias": "多人毛衣公寓忧伤演奏",
          "prompt": "The background is a light-colored wall, with a large flat-screen TV hanging on it. The screen is lit up, playing multi-screen split-screen programming—the upper left corner features close-ups of several different characters, while the upper right corner displays white artistic font \"FNSUAI.\". // //P’NTHONLL. S\", and below it, a green banner reads \"THE CAPD.\"—these elements together create a scene of modern urban life. Below the TV is a minimalist wooden TV cabinet with a smooth surface and a warm gray color. The interior is empty, with only a faint black object visible in the right corner. The floor is covered with a gray carpet with subtle textures, with the edges naturally connecting to the floor, creating a harmonious and unified overall color scheme. The entire space is lighted softly and evenly, while subtle transitions of light and shadow form in the folds of the sweater. The cool light emitted by the TV screen in the background contrasts with the warm indoor light, enhancing the spatial layering of the image. The composition uses medium and close-up shots, using shallow and deep backgrounds to blur the background. The entire photo is quiet, private, and full of everyday life. It combines the contemporary feel brought by modern technological equipment, while the posture and expressions of the subjects convey a gentle, artistic, and slightly lonely youthful mood. It seems to capture the most authentic moments of an ordinary day, evoking the fatigue and reflection after late-night study, or the quiet and pleasant moments enjoyed alone. The colors are mainly warm tones, with off-white, light gray, and dark brown as the main tones, complemented by blue light accents on the screen. The overall tone is soft and comfortable, with a strong realistic photographic texture. It's like casually capturing everyday moments at home with a regular phone, yet the expressions and compositional details of the characters radiate a unique artistic beauty and emotional resonance.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
