        {
          "id": "krea2-292cc6a186c05c55830292ae",
          "alias": "单女白旗袍窗边忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "An elegant Eastern woman is the absolute focal point of the scene, wearing a delicate off-white knitted qipao-style dress with a modern, modernized Chinese stand collar and delicate frog button decorations. The slim cut perfectly outlines her slender and slender silhouette, with the hem naturally falling to the ankles. The material is delicate with vertical ribbed texture, glowing gently under soft light. On her left shoulder, she draped a matching semi-transparent plush knit cardigan, light and flowing like cloud gauze, gently fluttering in the wind. Her right hand gently held a fluffy, pure white feather fan, with the handle faintly visible. Her left hand naturally touched the mottled blue brick wall behind her. On her wrist, she wore a simple gold bracelet and a ring. The foreground focuses on her body outline and clothing details, especially on the blue brick wall where her right arm rests. The bricks are tightly arranged but roughly textured, with colors transitioning from dark gray to light gray. The surface is covered with mottled marks and fine cracks from the passage of time, with moss or dust occasionally found between the cracks, adding a sense of history. The middle ground features the stone floor she stands on and the building wall structure behind. The floor is paved with irregular gray stone bricks, with slightly worn edges. The wall extends to the left side of the frame, featuring dark brown wooden window and door frames. The window glass reflects faint daylight, creating a cool contrast; The background features a distant blurred architectural outline and sky, with a cool blue-gray tone that creates a sense of spatial depth. The composition uses the classic rule of thirds: the figure is positioned near the golden ratio point on the right side of the painting, with the body leaning diagonally against the wall to create dynamic balance, while the left arm extends upward to break the static and create a visual flow. The lighting and shadow handling is extremely delicate, with the main light source coming from the side backlight on the left front of the figure, softly outlining her body outline and the folds of her clothing, while casting soft shadows on the walls and floor to enhance the sense of depth; The overall atmosphere leans toward a cool blue-gray tone at dusk or early morning, with a slight grainy film texture. The emotional tone is calm, restrained, and poetic, resembling a portrait of a classical beauty in a modern city. It combines the subtle grace of Eastern aesthetics with the sophistication and artistry of contemporary photography. The images are full of storytelling and blank space, like movie stills or fashion magazine covers. The overall style combines the realistic texture of everyday amateur equipment with professional-grade post-production color grading artistry. It conveys a gentle and lonely beauty shaped by the passage of time.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
