        {
          "id": "krea2-e747df1cd31ba502ee225910",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔城市冷淡自拍",
          "prompt": "The hat's texture clearly shows natural wear marks, her nails are neatly trimmed with transparent or light pink nail polish. On her left ring finger, she wears a simple silver ring. On her wrist is a slender gold chain bracelet, and around her neck hangs a rugged silver industrial-style chain necklace layered with a thin chain. She wears a light blue washed denim slip dress with an off-shoulder design, the fabric texture echoing the color of the hat. At the knees, a pair of matching jeans is casually draped over the knees, with fabric pleats that naturally fit the leg lines. The background features off-white leather seats and a black high-gloss luggage bag. The roof lining is made of light gray fabric, and the recessed reading light on top emits a soft warm glow. Outside light filters through the windows to create a diffused effect. The overall composition is a close-up shot, with the figure occupying the main visual center. The middle ground showcases the texture of clothing and seat texture, while the background blur enhances the subject's presence. The lighting and shadow atmosphere reflects the urban afternoon sunlight filtering through the window, creating a mix of light and shadow, soft transitions of shadows create a sophisticated blend of fashionable street style and private spaces, complemented by the cool gray and golden accents of metal jewelry, and guided downward by the lines of necklaces and bracelets. The overall style combines street fashion with refined elegance, like a selfie captured during a daily commute, yet full of meticulously composed artistry. It has the texture of authentic camera shots rather than overly edited digital filters, conveying a relaxed mood that blends self-expression with the independent charm of urban women.",
