        {
          "id": "krea2-b9f23e0ae3d2ab9487a25f48",
          "alias": "单女制服室内戏谑站立演奏",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a delicate navy uniform: a white short-sleeved top with blue trim and a badge on the chest, matching skinny shorts, a striking blue belt at her waist, and a sailor hat with blue and white stripes shining gold. Her right hand was raised in an open pose, while her left hand hung naturally. She wore a slender gold bracelet on her wrist, her legs long and straight, wearing over-the-knee white stockings, and a pair of shiny black high heels with slightly raised toes. The overall look combines sweet and sexy visual tension. She stands in a warm and gentle indoor setting, with a pure off-white wall behind her, unadorned to make the main figure stand out even more; On the left is a soft, fluffy cream-colored sofa topped with thick white plush cushions, with a brown teddy bear quietly curled up in a corner of the sofa, adding a touch of healing and playful charm; In the right corner of the wall sits a minimalist pink decorative frame, with faint handwritten artwork visible. Next to it is a small tray that seems to hold desserts or drinks, hinting at a private and comfortable home space. The floor is covered with a snow-white long velvet carpet, harmoniously blending with the sofa and the characters' clothing tones, enhancing the overall warmth of the composition. The composition uses a full-body perspective in the middle shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the center, body slightly turned to the side, and gaze gently directed toward the camera, creating a friendly yet slightly teasing interaction. The visual guide line naturally extends from the character's outstretched arms, legs, and the edge of the sofa. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft and even, warm indoor lighting. The light source comes from the left front of the figure, creating subtle shadow transitions between the shoulders and waist, highlighting the beauty of the curves; The surface of stockings is shimmered with a delicate sheen due to light reflection, while the sole of high heels reflects strongly and enhances the three-dimensional effect; The feature wall and sofa area have slight shadows, but overall remain bright and open, avoiding any sense of oppression. The entire image presents a carefully curated everyday photography style, as if taken at home with a regular phone or small camera. The image texture is delicate and realistic, with moderate color saturation and a slight soft-focus effect, creating a dreamy yet lifelike atmosphere. It retains the playful nature of role-playing while conveying a tranquil, sweet, and slightly shy youthful mood, like a gentle frozen afternoon sunlight streaming into the bedroom, full of storytelling and artistic appeal. The details are rich yet never overshadow the main focus. Each element serves the theme of expression, forming a modern lifestyle aesthetic image with deep narrative potential and a strong visual enjoyment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
