        {
          "id": "krea2-b9d988bcbd71dfe2e9c20989",
          "alias": "单女黑短裤厨房冷淡倚靠持相机",
          "prompt": "She paired it with black shorts and semi-transparent black stockings. Her legs were smooth and long, her posture relaxed and full of tension. She sat cross-legged on a low white geometric stool, leaning forward slightly. Her right hand gently held a plump, round red tomato, her fingertips lightly touching the fruit skin. The other tomato rested on a white porcelain plate beside her, quietly holding two bright, smooth, and glossy tomatoes. The bright orange-red of the tomatoes contrasts sharply with the black-and-white clothing of the figures, becoming the visual focal point of the scene; In the foreground is the tomato she holds and the edge of the porcelain plate. The composition adopts a slightly overhead mid-to-close perspective, placing the main figure slightly to the left center of the frame. The background is a simple space composed of light gray walls and white marble-textured tiles. In the corner, the outline of a closed white cabinet door can be seen. Light enters the room diagonally from the upper left, creating a three-dimensional and layered effect of interplay of light and shadow. The overall light and shadow are soft but have dramatic contrasts. The color palette is mainly cool gray-white, complemented by warm orange tomatoes as visual anchors, creating a tranquil atmosphere. Intimate yet slightly artistic, it seems to capture the real moment of afternoon sunlight streaming through the window lattice onto a corner of the kitchen. It combines the everyday life atmosphere with the independence and aesthetic taste of urban youth. The image texture is delicate and authentic, as if taken by a professional camera under natural light, presenting a style that combines artistic expression with the warmth of everyday life.",
