        {
          "id": "krea2-9ecba8c4884746b76463618f",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙忧伤",
          "prompt": "The sleeves were wide, and the hems swayed gently in the breeze, creating an ethereal visual beauty; In the foreground is a dark brown old-fashioned wooden railing, whose rough texture contrasts sharply with its rounded curves. The railing extends diagonally from the lower left corner of the painting, cleverly framing the main figure and the folds and flowing feel of the dress, forming the core visual area of the painting; The background is a hazy, blurred Chinese courtyard, with mottled wooden columns, gray-tiled eaves, and distant blurred outlines of trees. The air is filled with a faint damp scent and the faint scent of moss. The entire composition exudes a strong sense of Eastern aesthetics and poetic melancholy, like a meticulous painting of a lady painted in ink wash and color, yet infused with the delicate texture and realistic techniques of modern photography, presenting a visual experience that is both classical and contemporary, dreamy yet realistic.",
