        {
          "id": "krea2-bae345e2f9759c59ded284a2",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣街道困倦站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman standing outdoors under the sunlight looks natural and lively; She leans slightly to the side, her head tilted slightly, and her overall expression is calm with a hint of sweetness and shyness; She wore an off-white knit cardigan with lace-trimmed camisole underneath. The cardigan sleeves were puffy and curled, and the fabric felt delicate and soft, showing a gentle pleated texture under the light. Pair the bottom with a classic red and black plaid pleated mini skirt. The skirt is voluminous and layered, with vivid colors that visually contrast with the understated upper body; Her right hand is gently raised, her left hand naturally hangs down, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with light pink or transparent bright polish; A small white chain bag is slung crossbody over the shoulder. The simple and elegant shape harmonizes perfectly with the overall outfit; The background is a blurred city streetscape, with faint zebra crossings, gray roads, and distant buildings and greenery, creating spatial layering through shallow depth of field; The composition uses medium to close-up portraits, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, body slightly tilted to create dynamic balance. The lighting and shadowing use strong backlighting techniques, with sunlight slanting from behind the subject, creating soft contour light in front of her body, separating the subject from the background and creating a dreamy and transparent atmosphere; The overall color palette is warm and bright, with white, beige, and red as the main tones, complemented by cool gray-blue shades in the shadows, creating a visual temperature contrast; The atmosphere is full of youthful energy and academic atmosphere, while also revealing a calm, gentle, and slightly artistic mood, as if frozen in a lazy afternoon street sun; The image style leans toward the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment shooting, rich in details without overly refined embellishment, preserving the everyday realism brought by natural light and shadow changes and slight noise. It is suitable for social media sharing or personal photo collections, conveying a relaxed, joyful, and free lifestyle attitude.",
