        {
          "id": "krea2-aa15d80f2023bc171deb78ad",
          "alias": "单女T恤婚礼忧伤注视",
          "prompt": "A woman is the absolute subject of the painting, with fair and delicate skin. She wears a simple yet elegant camisole wedding dress with slender straps that are faintly visible, and a delicate silver necklace around her neck that glows faintly in the dim light; Her hands wore a pair of elbow-length white lace gloves, with intricate and delicate patterns interwoven with three-dimensional flowers and scroll motifs. The lace pattern of the gloves reflected in the light created subtle layers of light and shadow, as if silently expressing a certain restrained emotion; In the foreground is the area where her hands rest. The detailed texture of the lace gloves and the translucent texture of the veil form a visual focal point. The middle shot shows her exposed neck, collarbones, and part of her upper arm lines, which under the light present a warm, warm texture that contrasts reality and void with the background; The background is somewhat blurry but the interior space is recognizable. The left wall is a light beige painted wall with fine grain texture, while on the right is a dark wooden chair with a dark gray fabric chair featuring white star and butterfly embroidery hanging from the back. The fabric texture is clearly visible, suggesting a private and cozy indoor setting; The entire composition is a close-up shot, with the subject occupying most of the frame. It uses a slightly low angle and uses slight depth blurring to gradually blur background elements, thereby enhancing the visual impact of the subject. Meanwhile, the lace patterns on the veil and gloves create mottled light effects as light penetrates, adding depth and artistic texture to the image; The entire photo exudes a tranquil, romantic, and slightly melancholic atmosphere, as if a brief gaze or memory before an important moment. It carries both the sacred sense of a wedding ceremony and the delicate expression of personal emotions. Like a real-life moment captured indoors in low-light with a regular phone, the carefully matched expressions and costume details give it a strong cinematic feel and artistic appeal. The image is filled with a \"unfinished\" narrative tension, prompting imagination about the story behind it.",
