        {
          "id": "krea2-2ba534ff16d26f5b8220c1b6",
          "alias": "单女白挂脖窗边温柔坐持包",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright in a modern, Chinese-style indoor space. She wears a delicate white sleeveless halter qipao-style dress made of delicate and elegant wavy geometric patterns. Two small, rounded white frog buttons are fastened at the neckline. adding a touch of laziness and authenticity. Gently holding a minimalist two-tone clutch in both hands, the upper layer is made of deep blue leather, the lower layer is made of beige fabric. The edges are sharp, the fingertips are slender and slender, and on the left ring finger is a delicate and petite black ring, with detailed details. The foreground focuses on the hand movements of her bag and the hem of her skirt, with the garment's pleats naturally conforming to the figure, and light and shadow creating subtle transitions between her skin and fabric. The center view shows her complete upper body and part of the seat contour. The seat is made of dark brown wood, with gold metal trim accented on the armrests, giving it a warm and elegant feel. In the background on the left is a small round table in dark wood, on which sits a transparent glass vase. Inside the vase are several withered green plant branches, sparse and poetic, with the vase reflecting soft ambient light; In the background on the right, a light-colored tabletop is visible, casually placed with rolled paper rolls or painting scrolls, with a faint corner of green plant leaves nearby, hinting at a sense of life and artistic ambiance. Further away, the background is a simple white wall, with a set of modern-style black metal bracket decorative lamps hanging on the wall. The lamp shades are hazy spherical, emitting a soft, even warm light. In the corner of the ceiling, a window with wooden grilles lets in natural light, filling the space with a sense of openness and layering. The overall composition uses medium and close-up shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, creating an intimate and tranquil visual focal point. The lighting is soft yet directional, with the main light source coming from the upper right window combined with the ceiling chandelier, creating a soft contrast of light and shadow with a three-dimensional effect. The transition of shadows is delicate, and the texture of the clothing is clearly visible, creating a warm, tranquil, and slightly artistic atmosphere. The color palette is mainly off-white, light gray, and natural wood tones, accented with deep blue and dark green. The color combination is harmonious and unified, giving a sense of sophistication and the warmth of everyday life. The entire image presents a fusion of \"New Chinese Aesthetics\"—combining the elegant charm of traditional clothing with the simplicity and comfort of modern homes. Through delicate light and shadow treatment and everyday prop arrangements, it conveys a calm, reserved, and story-rich female image. It feels like a precious moment captured from a quiet afternoon life, combining the refinement of artistic photography with the authentic texture and emotional warmth of amateur equipment shooting, allowing people to feel a sense of escape from the noise and Returning to a beautiful state of inner peace.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
