        {
          "id": "krea2-0c752f5905355a62d66a5741",
          "alias": "单女浴袍愤怒持相机",
          "prompt": "A classical Eastern beauty dressed in flowing light beige Hanfu, her skin fair and delicate, carrying a hint of thoughtful calm and gentle temperament. The petals are edged with fine pearls and shimmering metal, which shimmer gently in the breeze and reflect a soft glow; Her right hand gently stroked the front of her robe, her slender fingers elegantly pinching the sheer fabric. Her posture was dignified yet tinged with a hint of shyness. The sleeves were wide and light, layers of sheer fabric casting a hazy texture under the light. The collar was faintly decorated with fine beads, and a matching ribbon tied around her waist outlined her graceful figure; The foreground focuses on her slender neck, collarbone lines, and shoulders half-concealed by sheer fabric. Light streams in from one side, with highlights warm and bright, shadows deep and soft, creating a sense of depth and authenticity; The middle scene features her full skirt hem and flowing sleeves, with rich layers of fabric and naturally smooth pleats. Sunlight filters through the sheer fabric, casting dappled and flowing light and shadow effects that enhance the dynamic beauty of the composition; The background is a deep, blurred forest or courtyard corner, with mainly dark green and gray-black tones, creating a tranquil and mysterious atmosphere. Faint outlines of branches and leaves and blurred stone steps or wooden railings provide classical support for the figure without overpowering the main theme; The composition uses a center-shifted portrait style, with the main figure occupying most of the space, while the clothing in the foreground and the background are blurred to create a sense of depth; then extending deep into the background, creating an immersive viewing experience; The overall lighting atmosphere presents a \"soft light diffuse\" photography style, with the light source coming from the upper side, simulating the natural afternoon sunlight filtering through the gaps in the canopy. The light is soft and not glaring, creating a dreamy, tranquil, and slightly poetic Eastern aesthetic. The overall color saturation is moderate, with the main tones contrasting warm white and deep green, emphasizing purity and tranquility. The image texture is delicate and smooth like an oil painting, with a slight film graininess, as if shot with a high-end digital camera paired with a large-aperture prime lens. The overall atmosphere is like a fairy descending to earth from an ancient book illustration, full of a sophisticated blend of classical charm and modern aesthetics, combining artistic expression with the realism of everyday photography.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
