        {
          "id": "krea2-b0fd8433b7d5c050825405cb",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫博物馆俏皮站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at the center of the coffee-themed exhibition, dressed in a sweet collegiate outfit with a pure white short-sleeved shirt and pleated mini skirt. The neckline features delicate buttons, the skirt is light and flowing, paired with white over-the-knee socks and a simple silver handbag. The strap hangs naturally, and the body is adorned with fluffy pom-pom decorations, giving the overall look a clean, fresh, and youthful vibe. Below, English poetic copywriting creates a poetic atmosphere. In front of the wall is a \"Welcome Brazil\" slogan display board, complemented by cartoon illustrations such as green teapots, coffee beans, and red star patterns. On the right side, there is a playful design of a globe and a figure sitting in a coffee cup. The floor is made of mirror-like light-colored tiles that reflect the outlines of the figures and exhibits. On the left, you can see part of the coffee machine advertisement poster. On the right, a corner of pink furniture can be faintly seen. The entire scene is decorated in bright and lively colors, mainly off-white, light green, and pink, creating a visually rich and harmonious visual layer; The composition uses a mid-shot full-body portrait approach, with the subject positioned slightly to the right of the golden ratio point, the body slightly turned to the camera to create a natural visual focal point; The foreground features the lower body and foot area, with ground reflections enhancing spatial depth; The medium set focuses on the interaction between the upper body of the figure and the background display board, enhancing the immersive feeling of the scene; The background is composed of multiple layers of coffee culture elements, progressing from walls to booths and promotional materials, creating a strong thematic atmosphere; The lighting and shadow treatment are soft and even, with the background lighting slightly warm, contrasting with the cool-toned floor. The overall atmosphere is cozy, comfortable, and artistic, as if immersed in a slow-living aesthetic experience of a coffee festival. The visuals present the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment shooting, rich in details yet concise, with strong narrative and emotional resonance. It captures an ordinary yet happy moment, allowing people to feel the pursuit and love for beautiful things in urban life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
