        {
          "id": "krea2-aa28ad1833c7e2b9b2376a57",
          "alias": "单女粉T恤樱花困倦持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman is the absolute subject of the painting, with petals showing delicate textures in the sunlight. She wore a pink floral camisole set, with a strapless top featuring pleated decorations at the neckline and cuffs. The fabric was lightweight and flowing, printed with elegant cherry blossom patterns. The waist was cinched to highlight a slender waistline, and the bottom was the same printed skirt, with a matching bow cord tied around the waist. The foreground focuses on her upper body and arms, with graceful arm lines and soft light and shadow outlining the texture of her skin. The middle frame features the details of her clothing and some of the green plant branches blurred in the background, creating a sense of spatial layering. The background is a completely blurred outdoor green environment, with blurred circular light spots (out-of-focus imaging) showing soft colors interwoven with light green, pale yellow, and light brown, hinting at sunlight filtering through the leaves, creating a fresh and natural atmosphere. The composition uses a classic medium and close-up portrait style, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving space on the right side to create a sense of visual breath. Light comes from the upper side, soft and layered, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. The shadows are soft and unobtrusive, presenting an overall warm and bright afternoon atmosphere. The color palette is mainly pink, white, and green, with fresh and elegant tones and moderate saturation, creating a dreamy summer pastoral poetry. The image texture is as delicate as professional camera shooting, with slight film graininess and soft focus effects. It's like using a Sony A7 series or Canon R5 paired with an 85mm prime lens, capturing a moment of tranquility and beauty along shaded paths, full of youthful energy and natural healing. It combines the refined beauty of artistic photography with the authentic, casual charm of everyday life, evoking a gentle, pure, and carefree youthful atmosphere.",
