        {
          "id": "krea2-3aa4a063334a7ee8564185d8",
          "alias": "单女乡村微笑躺注视",
          "prompt": "This is a close-up portrait of a woman full of natural atmosphere and the texture of life. The subject is a woman wearing a light brown straw hat with a wide brim, its brim emitting a soft warm yellow sheen under the light, gently swaying in the breeze, adding a sense of dynamism. The skin presents a delicate and moist creamy white base with a healthy glow, becoming one of the visual focal points. It was as if it was silently telling the story of a summer afternoon. Naturally full, with a faint smile that is hard to notice, it conveys a calm and serene mood. Her shoulder and neck lines are elegant, and she wears a simple light blue cotton crewneck top with a delicate and soft texture that perfectly complements the overall atmosphere. Next to it lies a plump, rounded apple with a natural red-yellow gradient on the skin, with fine dots and luster on the surface. The apple serves not only as a prop but also reinforces the imagery of \"countryside,\" \"harvest,\" and \"season,\" forming a subtle interaction with the figure. The composition uses extremely close close-ups, with medium shots extending to her neck and shoulders, as well as parts of her apple; The background is highly blurred, with only the blurred outlines of green plants recognizable, suggesting an outdoor garden or orchard environment and creating a hazy, poetic sense of space. The entire shot uses shallow depth of field, with the subject sharp and sharp, the background as soft as ink wash, creating a strong layered contrast. The position of the apple guides the viewer's gaze toward the lower right corner. In terms of lighting, the light source comes from the upper left, which is soft natural light. Possibly taken in the early morning or evening, it outlines a soft three-dimensional effect. The overall atmosphere is warm, tranquil, and healing, infused with a strong sense of life and artistic beauty. It resembles a snapshot casually captured by a phone or portable camera in natural light, yet thanks to precise composition and emotional expression, it has the texture of a professional photographic work, evoking the leisurely moments in a summer orchard. Or a beautiful moment captured unintentionally, combining the warmth of real life with a transcendent artistic tension, evoking a sense of tranquility and far-reaching inner state, as if time quietly stands still at this moment, accompanied only by breath and sunlight.",
