        {
          "id": "krea2-fa104ddcf3efab71b1d56760",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣厨房温柔坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright at a modern minimalist kitchen dining table, wearing an off-white spaghetti-strap knit tank top and matching high-waisted shorts. The clothing is delicate and fits her figure, adding a touch of lazy gentleness. Her skin is fair and radiant, her makeup is elegant and natural, harmonizing with the overall color palette. In the foreground is a corner of the tabletop, where the gray stone surface with fine speckles occupies about one-third of the lower part of the frame. Its texture is rough yet retains a sense of sophistication. The tabletop is clean and neat, with no clutter, guiding the viewer to focus on the subject. The middle is the upper part of the woman's body and the wooden dining chair she sits on. The backrest has simple lines and clearly visible wood grain, creating a material echo and transition with the furniture in the background. In the background is a cozy yet somewhat messy living space. On the left, you can see a black metal shelf displaying glass bottles, jars, and wooden cutting boards for kitchen supplies; On the right side is a set of dark brown solid wood cabinets, with doors half-open revealing internal storage, topped with pottery and photo frame decorations; Farther away, the walls are light gray-white, with round woven hanging ornaments and fabric towels, creating a space atmosphere where everyday life blends warmth with artistic flair. The entire composition uses a slightly overhead low-angle composition, making the characters appear more intimate, realistic, and approachable. At the same time, the shallow depth of field effect blurs the background, highlighting the main subject's presence. Light comes from soft natural light outside the window or from the ceiling light box inside, outlining a soft silhouette. Subtle light and shadow changes appear in the folds of the clothing. The overall color scheme is mainly off-white, light gray, and wood brown, creating a warm, tranquil, and healing visual atmosphere. Like afternoon sunlight streaming through the window lattice, it brings a sense of slow-paced lifestyle aesthetics. The entire image presents a highly realistic artistic photography style, combining the casual feel of daily life with the beauty of carefully arranged. It feels like a beautiful moment taken from an urban romance drama or lifestyle magazine, rich in detail and emotionally rich, evoking a quiet and far-reaching vitality and inner tenderness.",
