        {
          "id": "krea2-34174b2306a4b05ecc37106b",
          "alias": "单女灰短裙城市自信站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a modern, minimalist indoor space, wearing a tight-fitting black high-neck, short-sleeved top made of delicate material that hugs her figure, outlining a smooth waist and abdominal curve. She wears a dark gray high-waisted pencil skirt with a naturally draped hem, accentuating her long legs; Add a touch of lazy and casual charm; Her right hand gently holds a pair of fine-framed metal glasses, her fingers slender and elegant, wearing a delicate silver bracelet, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with a light gray-blue nail; Her expression is calm and confident, yet gentle and reserved; The composition uses a slightly upward angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of center of the frame, body slightly turned to the side, head facing the camera as a focal point. The foreground shows the glasses she holds and parts of her skirt details. The middle ground shows her full upper body outline and arm posture. The background features clean, crisp light gray-white walls and ceiling. In the corners, faint outlines of dark furniture such as sofas or bed frames can be seen. The recessed downlights above provide soft, even ceiling lighting, with overall soft and natural light and shadow without strong shadows. It creates a low-key, sophisticated, quiet, and steady atmosphere; The color palette is dominated by black, gray, and white, with minimalist and restrained color combinations that highlight the main subjects and the texture of the clothing; The entire scene exudes the intellectual charm of urban white-collar workers or independent women, with a slight sense of fashion and portraiture while retaining the natural atmosphere of daily life. It feels like a quiet afternoon at home or in a studio, capturing a private moment. The style leans toward realistic and delicate phone textures or small camera effects, rather than overly post-processed perfect filters, presenting a visual experience that combines artistic beauty with a sense of realism in life.",
