        {
          "id": "krea2-7c76a0997441b9ada335da38",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣街道微笑站立展示",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under the natural light of a city street, her shoulders naturally lowered, wearing a gentle smile and revealing a calm and confident expression. She wore a stylishly designed white off-shoulder long-sleeve tight knit top, with a cleverly angled neckline to one side, revealing a blue-and-white plaid camisole underneath. The straps were slender, and the chest was adorned with a few small buttons, adding layers of detail; She pairs the bottom with dark navy blue sports shorts, gray patchwork at the waist, and a white drawstring design. The overall look is simple yet full of youthful energy, showcasing a casual urban style. She wears a slender silver necklace around her neck, with a small, delicate geometric pendant that sparkles gently under natural light. In the foreground, the left side features lush green vine plants, with bright and full leaves, some branches naturally hanging down to the edges of the painting, forming a natural visual guide frame that organically interacts with the figure. In the middle is the gray stone-paved road where she stands, with clear textures and scattered fallen leaves. On the right side, a round manhole cover is faintly visible, enhancing the scene's realism and sense of life. The background is a somewhat blurred cluster of urban residential buildings, mainly in light off-white and pale yellow tones. The balcony railings are simple, windows are neatly arranged, and in the distance, a white SUV and a dark-colored sedan are parked. The taillights reflect a faint red in the soft light, creating a sense of everyday life. The composition uses a slightly upward-looking perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of center of the frame, body slightly tilted, head facing the camera, forming a stable and dynamic visual center. The green plants on the left side of the painting serve as the foreground frame, with light and shadow from naturally scattered light slightly to the left above, softly and evenly scattered over the figure, outlining delicate contour shadows, especially creating subtle transitions between light and shadow on the shoulders, abdomen, and legs, highlighting the figure's curves. The overall tone is fresh and elegant, with a focus on warm and cool contrasts—green plants bring vitality, white clothing brings purity, dark shorts add a sense of stability, and the background buildings present warm neutral tones. The atmosphere is tranquil and full of the lazy vibe of a summer afternoon, combining the everyday life of urban life with the freshness and freedom brought by the natural environment. The visuals convey a poetic feeling of being casually captured in beautiful moments, as if freezing an ordinary yet precious everyday moment. It has a strong artistic texture and realism, as if taken by a high-end digital camera on a clear afternoon. The image quality is delicate, color saturation is moderate, and details are rich yet evoke a hazy beauty.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
