        {
          "id": "krea2-2253961832c4f8b16ab8f33b",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣森林冷淡持手机",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman outdoors under natural light, slightly lowering her head and gently pinching a thick, soft royal blue knit scarf with her right hand. Her fingers are long and slender, her nails neatly trimmed, and she wears a black turtleneck sweater with clearly visible cuff patterns. The scarf and sweater create a warm and cool contrast, with blurry forest branches and dappled blue sky in the background. Sunlight pours in from above, creating rich layers of light and shadow that create a warm yet slightly mysterious atmosphere. The composition uses an extremely close upward angle. Highlighting the details of the characters' expressions and emotional tension, the background blur treatment reinforces the subject's presence. The overall atmosphere is quiet, restrained, and full of life, as if capturing a gentle moment revealed unintentionally on a winter afternoon. The image texture closely resembles the realism of everyday phone or camera photography, with slight noise and natural color deviations. Without excessive post-processing, it preserves the true human texture and environmental details. The light and shadow transitions are soft and natural, with moderate color saturation, presenting a cinematic film aesthetic. Combining artistic depth with the warmth of everyday life, the entire image conveys an emotional state where quiet self-protection coexists with inner strength, like a silent poem telling stories of youth, loneliness, warmth, and secrecy.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
