        {
          "id": "krea2-e8118e31c4cdffbed137675f",
          "alias": "单女全裸蓝旗袍竹林困倦坐持伞",
          "prompt": "An Eastern woman sits upright on a bluestone railing, wearing a light blue sleeveless qipao dyed with delicate ink wash. The fabric is light and reveals delicate textures and soft pleats. The neckline is delicately frog-buttoned, embodying ancient charm. The skirt hangs naturally to fit her figure, and her waist curves are subtly revealed in light and shadow. The petals are layered and slightly soft, blurred at the edges. She gently holds a classic oil-paper umbrella in both hands, with a warm yellow surface and clearly visible paper texture. The umbrella ribs are made of natural bamboo, and the wooden handle is decorated with orange string, highlighting her gentle and reserved posture. It is as if silently telling a story about the rainy alleys or deep courtyards of Jiangnan. The foreground focuses on her slender fingers and the wooden details of the oil-paper umbrella, with neatly trimmed fingernails coated with a very light nude polish that glows gently under the sunlight. The center is the visual focal point formed by her elegant sitting posture and the pleats of her qipao, with her body slightly leaning forward, her posture relaxed and composed. The background features dense, deep green trees and shrubs, with leaves turning into soft, blurred green light spots in the bokeh, creating a sense of depth and tranquility. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure occupying the main position, slightly standing to the right, and the left blank space filled in by an oil-paper umbrella, creating visual balance. Light comes from the upper left of the frame, with natural sunlight filtering through the gaps in the leaves, casting mottled, soft highlights and shadows on her shoulders, neck, arms, and cheongsam, enhancing the sense of dimension and texture. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, full of classical Eastern aesthetics, like a meticulous painting of a light-colored lady, or like a gentle woman stepping out of an old art album. The colors are mainly blue and white, complemented by warm yellow umbrellas and cool greenery tones to create a harmonious contrast. The transitions of light and shadow are delicate, the layers of light and shadow are rich, and the saturation is moderate, presenting an artistic sense that is both realistic and slightly dreamy. The visual style leans toward professional post-processing, featuring cinematic texture and film graininess, while retaining the natural realism of everyday equipment shooting. No excessive embellishment is needed, details are precise, and emotional expression is restrained yet emotionally powerful, allowing viewers to feel the unique gentleness, serenity, and poetry unique to Eastern women.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
