        {
          "id": "krea2-1c46e6da5d0339f2ffac20ea",
          "alias": "外套街道冷淡自拍",
          "prompt": "The collar was slightly open to reveal the outline of the inner layer, and the metal buttons and wear marks on the jacket added a casual street vibe. The shadows are deep but not jarring, and the overall tone of the image is warm and neutral, with moderate saturation, featuring slight film graininess and soft focus effects that simulate the real-life texture commonly seen in phone selfies. then naturally transitioning to the shoulders and clothing textures, guiding the audience to immerse themselves in the emotional expression of the characters; The composition is compact yet leaves breathing room, using window frames to form natural borders and reinforce the sense of boundary in the scene; Complemented by the cool reflective glow of metal accessories, it creates a visual experience that blends everyday fashion with artistic ambiance; The entire image exudes a leisurely artistic atmosphere of an urban afternoon, combining the independent confidence of modern youth with subtle emotional restraint, as if capturing an ordinary yet story-filled moment, evoking moments of pause on a journey, emotional expressions during solitude, or relaxed group photos with friends, possessing strong narrative and emotional resonance potential.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
