        {
          "id": "krea2-5818e78da04444076d38f08a",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣城市冷淡展示",
          "prompt": "She slightly tilted her head back and gazed into the distance, as if immersed in some gentle thought. It adds a touch of laziness and authenticity. On her head is an off-white wide knit headband with a clear vertical texture that looks soft matte under warm light, she wears two delicate silver studs—one with a simple round bead design, the other a delicate heart-shaped pendant. Understated yet unmistakable, she becomes one of the visual focal points. She wore an off-white collared shirt with a crisp and clean neckline, forming a sharp contrast with the dark blue knit vest she wore. The vest was soft with delicate ribbed texture, and the collar edges fit perfectly with the shirt, showcasing a meticulous everyday outfit aesthetic. The composition adopts a slightly tilted side view, giving the characters a greater sense of depth and dynamic beauty; The middle frame is composed of a shirt collar, vest shoulder line, and headband edge, serving as a visual transition. The background is a blurred indoor environment, with light beige walls or curtains showing vertical textures on the left, and a dark window frame or door frame structure on the right, creating a strong contrast of warm and cool tones. At the same time, blur is used to create a sense of spatial depth. The overall light comes from the upper left, using soft natural diffused light or simulated fluorescent lighting, creating warm and bright highlights. The overall atmosphere is quiet, gentle, and slightly artistic, evoking a fleeting sense of urban relaxation—like the afternoon sunlight streaming through the window onto your desk, or a brief pause amid the rushing crowd in a subway station. The colors are mainly warm white, beige, and deep blue, with moderate saturation and a retro film texture. The image features slight grainy noise and soft-focus edges, simulating the realism of ordinary phone cameras rather than overly retouched commercial blockbuster styles. It conveys a daily aesthetic concept of \"ordinary people can also shoot with a sense of sophistication,\" neither overly beautified nor distorted, full of warmth and artistic breath.",
