        {
          "id": "krea2-2f98c43dcc9280aee68fcc48",
          "alias": "单女灰外套街道冷淡倚靠持花",
          "prompt": "The door is open, her body leans slightly forward, her left hand resting lightly on the steering wheel, her right hand naturally resting at her knee, holding a bouquet of colorful, layered flowers—including pink, white, and red roses, along with delicate small flowers—wrapped in beige paper, which look especially warm and vivid against the cool-toned environment; She wore a fluffy, soft light gray plush jacket paired with a light blue striped shirt with a delicate large bow neckline. She paired a dark gray pleated short skirt with matching over-the-knee socks and black ankle boots, and a simple pearl necklace around her neck. Her makeup was delicate and soft, blending youthful energy with winter warmth; In the foreground is thick snow covering the edges of the doors and the ground, with scattered snowflakes falling. There are obvious snow piles at the door sills, the tire walls covered with wet snow, the tire tread patterns clearly visible, and the ground is trampled snow with car ruts; The mid-range is the interior of the vehicle, with black leather seats, steering wheel, and instrument panel details clearly visible. The window glass reflects the blurred outlines of the sky and distant trees, creating soft and even interior lighting that contrasts with the external environment. The background is an open winter outdoor scene, with several bare deciduous trees in the distance and the silhouette of a low, modern building. The sky is grayish-white, with heavy clouds, no direct sunlight, only fine snow drifting down slowly, creating a quiet, chilly yet romantic atmosphere; The composition uses a low-angle front-side view, focusing on the upper body and hand movements. The car door frame forms a natural frame composition, then extends from the bouquet downward to the legs and snow, creating a natural and smooth visual flow; In terms of lighting and shadow atmosphere, the overall light is scattered on cloudy days, with soft lighting without strong shadows. The fluffy texture of the plush jacket appears distinctly layered under the light, and the flowers are highly saturated, forming a striking contrast with the cool-toned background. This creates a scene that exudes warmth within the cool and artistic touch in everyday life. It feels like a street portrait shot with a regular phone or small camera in the early morning or evening. The image is full of life and authentic texture, while still preserving carefully arranged fashion aesthetics and emotional expression.",
