        {
          "id": "krea2-a652c69ef40ecdae1fa18619",
          "alias": "单女衬衫桌边忧伤坐出神",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bright white countertop indoors, leaning slightly forward, her hands naturally folded and resting gently on the edge of the table, her posture relaxed yet slightly lazy. She wore a loose white hooded sweatshirt with a prominent red large letter \"RITHAN\" and an oval \"XXL\" logo printed on the chest. The shirt was casually pulled up to one shoulder, revealing delicate collarbones and shoulder and neck lines, creating a casual yet sexy visual effect. Add softness and authenticity. As if lost in thought or gazing into a gentle moment in the distance, her expression calm with a faint melancholy or expectation. The background is a minimalist, modern indoor environment, with light-colored walls paired with white shelves displaying blurred decorative jars and small items. On the right side, you can faintly see the outlines of black appliances. The overall space is clean and tidy, mainly in cool white tones, enhancing the clarity and sophistication of the image. The foreground focuses on the details of the torso and hands, the middle ground is the upper body and legs, and the composition uses medium and close-up shots, placing the figure slightly to the right of the center to form the visual focal point; The background is moderately blurred, making the subject stand out more. Light comes from the left window direction, naturally soft and creating sidelight illumination, while subtly reflecting and shadowing on the garment surface, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, fresh, and slightly artistic, combining the warmth of everyday life with the refinement and emotional tension of artistic photography. The light and shadow are handled with delicate light like morning sunlight, with pure white and warm red tones as the main tones, creating a gentle, lazy, and slightly youthful atmosphere. The entire image presents a carefully designed yet seemingly natural shot effect, as if captured by a high-end camera under soft daylight. It combines a sense of life with aesthetic height, possessing strong visual appeal and emotional resonance, making it suitable for visual expression in fashion, beauty, or lifestyle content.",
