        {
          "id": "krea2-9308eefb6c5fa3aab9aac5bc",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙困倦站立",
          "prompt": "An Eastern woman stands before a semi-transparent sheer curtain, wearing an elegant white satin strapless long dress, with delicate orange peony and leaf patterns. The characters are lively yet blurred, evoking the artistic conception of classical literati; In the lower left corner of the foreground, a few green leaves appear faintly, adding natural vitality; In the middle shot, the main figure occupies the center-right position of the frame, with the body slightly tilted to create a sense of dynamic balance; The composition uses medium to close shots, with the area from the head to the knees fully presented. The light is soft and even, coming slightly to the left from the front, with soft light outlines faintly visible behind the sheer curtain; The overall atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, infused with the subtlety and poetry of Eastern aesthetics. It combines the refinement of modern fashion photography with the traditional ink painting mood. The layers of light and shadow are rich yet not abrupt, with tones dominated by cool gray-blue and warm orange-white, creating a visually contrasting yet harmonious unity; The visuals are highly artistic and narrative, as if telling a story about the fusion of classical charm and contemporary aesthetics. It is suitable for high-end fashion blockbusters or cultural-themed visual creations, simulating professional camera shooting effects. The image quality is high-definition and delicate, with moderate color saturation, preserving authentic texture and light and shadow transitions, avoiding excessive filtering, presenting a visual experience that is both dreamy and close to reality.",
