        {
          "id": "krea2-becd651c36a7cc43aa6ed20e",
          "alias": "单女挂脖水边俏皮站立自拍",
          "prompt": "Add a lively and natural feel. She wore a brightly colored striped halter swimsuit with a white base color interwoven with blue, purple, black, and other fine stripes. The straps were simple and stylish, and the swimsuit material was lightweight and skin-friendly, reflecting slightly in the sunlight. Layer it with loose, casual dark blue denim overalls, with metal buckle details visible at the waistband. The strap naturally drapes over the chest, creating a richly layered outfit. Her left arm is raised high, its lines long and graceful, posture relaxed and confident, as if embracing a clear sky or preparing to take a selfie. Her right arm hangs naturally, body slightly leaned forward, head slightly tilted, and the composition presents a static beauty amid dynamic balance. The background is a vast, boundless blue sky, pure as if washed clean, dotted only by a few thin white clouds along the distant horizon edge. The sky occupies about two-thirds of the image's space, creating a sense of expansive and expansive visual space. In the distance, a lush green mountain outline can be faintly seen, with dense trees forming a striking contrast of warm and cool tones against the blue sky, suggesting the figure is on vacation by the sea or lakeside. The entire composition uses vertical composition, with the figure positioned slightly lower in the center. Using low-angle downward shots to highlight the subject, while reinforcing the sense of depth and pressure of the sky, the image then extends upward along her raised arm to the sky, and from the sky falls back to the details of the figure and clothing, creating a smooth visual flow. Light comes directly from above, typical outdoor daylighting—bright and even, with no obvious shadows, highlighting the texture of the skin and the texture of the garment's folds. The light and shadow atmosphere is filled with the lazy and pleasant mood of a summer afternoon. The highly saturated blue sky and the colorful stripes on the characters' costumes create a visual impact. At the same time, the gentle expressions of the characters blend with the natural environment, conveying a fresh, free, and carefree sense of youthful vitality. The entire image presents a cinematic realistic style, with slight soft focus and skin smoothing effects, simulating the delicate texture of professional cameras shot under natural light. The edges of the frame are slightly blurred to enhance depth of field, making the subject stand out more. The overall visuals convey a pure sense of happiness and an immersive enjoyment of the beautiful summer days, combining a strong sense of daily recording with artistic aesthetic appeal, as if capturing a beautiful moment from a healing youth drama.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
