          "alias": "单女短裙户外困倦倚靠",
          "prompt": "A large, full, matching satin bow was tied at the chest, and the hem was adorned with embroidered patterns of blue flowers and green leaves. The flowers were arranged in a balanced way, injecting fresh vitality into the overall understated tone. Her right hand gently lifts one side of her skirt, while her left hand naturally hangs behind her, her posture elegant and relaxed, as if spinning softly in the breeze or about to step forward; The foreground focuses on the upper body and skirt details, with the edges of the skirt creating natural flow and layers of light and shadow through slight movements; The middle ground shows her long legs and the hem of her skirt, with a blurred light gray stone paving or concrete floor, hinting at an outdoor environment; The background features lush greenery and blooming white flowers with a blurred effect, creating a dreamlike bokeh effect. The petal outlines appear faintly in soft focus, evoking the atmosphere of a spring garden or courtyard; The composition uses a classic centrally symmetrical portrait style, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame, the line of sight interacting with the camera, and the principle of thirds to stabilize the visual center of gravity; The composition uses a vertical long proportion, emphasizing the complete body lines from ankles to heads; The light comes from soft, even natural sources, such as diffused light on cloudy days or indirect sunlight under the shade of trees. The overall tone leans toward a balanced cream white and mint green, with soft shadows that are gentle and unobtrusive, enhancing the sense of dimension without losing warmth; The atmosphere is tranquil and full of youthful romance, like a gentle encounter in an afternoon garden. It has a cinematic film texture and slight grainy noise, simulating the realism of amateur equipment (such as a phone or small camera). Color saturation is moderate, contrast is low, presenting a \"soft-focus filter\" hazy and beautiful visual experience. The entire image exudes a healing, dreamy fairy tale feel, like a carefully color-graded portrait piece, evoking the tranquil summer afternoons and carefree memories.",
