        {
          "id": "krea2-451d7a6de3f886bbc2121c4c",
          "alias": "单女白长裤海滩冷淡蹲",
          "prompt": "A woman squatting by a tranquil lakeside in a natural setting, adding a sense of vitality and softness; She wore simple pure white casual pants and a light gray short-sleeve T-shirt. The fabric was light and breathable, and the naturally draped hem formed a soft curve with her body lines. The overall outfit was clean, fresh, and full of comfort for everyday life. Her skin is fair and delicate, her makeup is elegant and natural, exuding a youthful vibe with a touch of artistic flair. The composition uses a medium to close-up perspective, with the main subject occupying the center to the right, body posture naturally relaxed, legs bent in a squat posture, and hands naturally folded in front of the knees or gently resting on them, creating an intimate and unforced posture. The background is shimmering water, with the sunset's afterglow casting tiny golden patches of light. The water's texture is delicate and realistic, ripples spreading layer upon layer, and the interplay of light and shadow reflects a warm and dreamlike atmosphere; At the distant meeting of water and sky, a hazy shoreline outline can be faintly seen, further enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The foreground portion features the leg area below the characters' knees and the moist ground details along the shore, which may be covered with moss or fine sand, transitioning naturally from the water. Then return to the body's movements, creating a smooth and cyclical visual path. Light comes from a low-angle sunset source on the side and rear, creating a contrast of light and shadow that highlights the three-dimensional silhouette, while the shadowed areas fall on the sides of the body and the ground, adding layering. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, healing, and romantic, with a cinematic dusk poetry. The colors are mainly warm gold, cool blue, and pure white, creating a harmonious contrast. The color saturation is moderate—neither overly flashy nor dull, presenting the authentic texture of a professional studio shooting in a natural environment. The image texture is delicate and realistic, featuring high-resolution clarity and rich detail expression, like a frame of life aesthetics captured at dusk with a high-end digital camera. It combines artistic depth with the intimacy of daily documentation, perfectly blending natural scenery with humanistic emotional expression, conveying a state of freedom, tranquility, and carefree living.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
