        {
          "id": "krea2-ebe80b9bfd9bbc789701c2fb",
          "alias": "单女黑挂脖城市媚态倚靠跳舞",
          "prompt": "At the edge of the city skyline as night falls, a woman gracefully leans against a metal railing. Her figure is as graceful as a willow in the night breeze, shimmering with a silky sheen in the faint light, adding a touch of laziness and sensuality. She wore a simple yet stylish black sleeveless halter top, with a cleverly pleated drape at the neckline, outlining her slender, elongated neck and full shoulder contours. She paired it with dark high-waisted denim shorts, the sharp fit that hugged her leg curves, highlighting her long, well-proportioned thighs and calf muscles. She wears a pair of sheer, thick-soled high-heeled sandals, with the heels reflecting a soft warm glow, as if she is standing on the edge of a dream where light and shadow intertwine. One foot is steady, the other gently lifted, knees slightly bent, her posture lively and graceful, as if she might dance with the wind or leap into the night at any moment. Her left hand is gently raised behind her head, fingers naturally bent, while her right hand hangs naturally at her side, fingertips curled slightly, revealing an unintentionally revealed confidence and composure. In the foreground, a sharp metal railing runs across the lower part of the frame. The cold industrial texture contrasts sharply with the gentle lines of the figures, and the railing surface reflects the city's neon lights, enhancing the spatial layering of the composition. In the middle shot, her long legs and ankles appear, her skin appears especially smooth and delicate in the night, radiating a healthy glow. Her legs are smooth and graceful, sculpted and perfect. The background is a city night scene blurred, with warm yellow and orange-red lights blending into a hazy patch of light, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. In the distance, faint outlines of buildings and blurred light sources create a typical shallow depth of field effect. The entire composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, maintaining a stable and dynamic visual focus; At the same time, railings are used as guiding lines to draw the viewer's gaze upward from the bottom, with light mainly coming from the upper front angle, creating a natural three-dimensional effect of light and shadow transitions; At the same time, the background lighting casts a warm backlit silhouette on the figure, making her seem to float in a mist of light, adding a surreal beauty. The overall color scheme is mainly deep black, warm yellow, and orange-red, creating a rich urban nighttime atmosphere. The interplay of light and shadow reveals a sense of fashion and avant-garde yet slightly retro romantic. The visuals are filled with dynamic beauty and serene poetry, hinting at the hustle and bustle of modern urban life while preserving the inner tranquility and confidence of the characters. The entire image exudes strong artistic sense and emotional tension, like a carefully composed portrait photograph, capturing a moment of nighttime full of vitality and allure, allowing people to feel the freedom, sensuality, and endless possibilities of urban nightlife.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
