        {
          "id": "krea2-fc54e8aca0b57293fa7c2433",
          "alias": "单女黑外套雪地冷淡站立",
          "prompt": "She wore a thick black coat with delicate plush patterns faintly visible at the neckline and cuffs, while a simple white shirt underneath revealed the collar, creating a classic black-and-white contrast; A wide white plush scarf wrapped around her neck, soft and fluffy, with rich layers. The end of the scarf was gently rolled up by her right hand, her fingers long and slender, her nails neatly trimmed, and the moment her fingertips touched the scarf, it revealed an unintentional gentleness and elegance. The composition uses a slightly upward-looking close-up, with the figure occupying a slightly higher center position, maintaining a stable and approachable visual center. The middle shot delicately depicts her shoulders, scarf, and hands; the wrinkles and plush texture of the clothing are clearly visible under light and shadow, enhancing the three-dimensional and realistic feel of the composition. The background is a blurry, dark-toned winter scene, with faint traces of snowflakes drifting and hazy shadows of trees or building silhouettes, creating a cold and romantic atmosphere. The blurring makes the main subjects stand out. The overall composition is vertically proportioned, reinforcing emotional connection. The use of lighting is extremely meticulous, creating a \"halo\" effect that enhances three-dimensionality and dreamlike feeling; The snow particles in the background appear semi-transparent and suspended under the light, as if time has been frozen in this tender moment. The overall atmosphere is cool yet warm, combining the purity and silence of winter, with sharp light and shadow contrasts that are not stiff. The colors are mainly black, white, and gray, creating a sense of sophistication and cinematic quality. The image details are exquisitely detailed, presenting an almost surreal delicacy, as if shot with a professional camera in a cloudy backlit environment. Post-production uses HDR and soft-focus technology to enhance the layering of light and shadow and the clarity of skin textures. The overall style combines the depth of artistic photography with the realism of everyday images, evoking a sense of tranquility, purity, and poetic winter aesthetics.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
