        {
          "id": "krea2-75ebd85d3d7878bdfcde13be",
          "alias": "单女蓝长裤摄影棚微笑站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman occupies the center of the frame, wearing a pair of exquisite, small, gold-framed round glasses. The frames are elegant and simple, and the lenses are clear and bright. She gently pinches one side of the frame with her right hand, her fingertips slender and long, her nails neatly trimmed to reveal a natural pale pink nail surface. Her left hand hangs naturally at her side or lightly grasps her sleeve, revealing a faint, almost imperceptible smile. Her skin is fair and delicate, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. Especially when her fingers touch the frames, her posture is highly expressive. Details such as the pleated texture of the loose white long-sleeve top, the soft cotton texture at the neckline, and the elastic elastic band at the cuffs are all clearly visible. The hem faintly reveals a corner of the blue-and-white striped pants, hinting at a casual everyday style. The middle shots mainly show her neck to chest area, with sunlight streaming diagonally from the right side, casting soft contrasts of light and shadow on her collarbone and shoulder blades. The rich and natural light and shadow layers enhance the sense of depth and realism. The background is extremely simple and clean, consisting of a whole wall or curtain of pure white, with no debris distracting the visual focus. Only a soft shadow on the left side of the wall hints at the direction of the light source, creating a minimalist sense of space. The composition uses close-up, vertical shots, with the figure's head slightly tilted, and the line of sight intersecting with the camera creating a strong emotional connection. The shallow depth of field effect blurs the background edges, making the subject stand out more. At the same time, light enters from the upper right, forming backlit contour light that enhances the dramatic tension and beauty of the image. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is bright and gentle, featuring soft, diffused light under natural daylight, without intense direct shadows. The color scheme is pure white, forming a fresh and elegant visual tone. The whole scene is full of youthful energy, gentle restraint and artistic vibes, combining the refined feel of professional studio shooting with the genuine natural beauty unintentionally revealed in everyday scenes. It seems to capture the most relaxed and comfortable moment of a girl during a quiet afternoon sun, conveying a sense of tranquility and healing. A slightly artistic aesthetic for living.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
