        {
          "id": "krea2-d91e02450f3b8a1a9b379dc1",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙宅邸倚靠",
          "prompt": "An Eastern woman gracefully leans against a classical carved doorframe, wearing a white high-slit long dress that blends modern design with traditional qipao elements. Her upper body is a delicately embroidered semi-transparent sheer strapless style, with a pearl bow decoration at the neckline. On the right side, a white wooden door in the same style can be faintly seen, with simple geometric relief decorations on the door panel, further enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The entire composition adopts a vertical long proportion, with the figure centered to the right, and a door frame forming a natural framed composition, which highlights the main subject while enhancing the layers of the composition; The lighting and shadow processing is extremely delicate, with the light source coming from the front left of the figure, outlining a three-dimensional silhouette. At the same time, subtle transitions of light and shadow and layering are created between the skirt and sheer fabric. The floor and walls reflect faint ambient light, giving the overall composition a warm and sophisticated creamy tone; The atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, combining the refined feel of modern fashion with the gentle charm of Eastern classical aesthetics. It feels as if you are in a private corner of a noble mansion, where time freezes at this moment. The figures resemble meticulously painted oil paintings, with every detail exuding elegance and tranquility. The entire image has a strong cinematic texture and artistic photography style, as if a professional photographer has captured the meticulously arranged indoor scene using high-end digital equipment, pursuing ultimate detail expression and emotional depth.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
