        {
          "id": "krea2-07da61d986b3c20bdf5832a2",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣广场微笑倚靠",
          "prompt": "She looked straight into the camera, a hint of shyness and calmness, revealing a calm and confident smile. Her makeup is delicate and soft, with a slender silver necklace around her neck, and a simple small bead pendant that is understated yet elegant. She wore a Japanese-style collegiate outfit: a beige knit cardigan with a delicate and soft texture, clear ribbed patterns at the hem, dark brown wood buttons, and naturally tailored cuffs; Underneath, she wears a white sailor-collar shirt with two parallel deep red stripes along the neckline. At the chest is a matching dark brown satin bow, and below the neckline, several lines of red embroidery are faintly visible, with elegant and subtle lettering; She wore a light gray pleated skirt below, with a light hem and smooth lines that harmonized with the overall look. Her left hand hangs naturally at her side, her fingers gently tapping the edge of her skirt, her posture relaxed and expressive, while her right hand is tucked into the skirt pocket, her body leaning slightly against the yellow tiled wall, creating a natural and comfortable leaning posture. The wall she leans against is paved with countless finely arranged yellow tiles, warm and bright in color, still soft and soft under cloudy light. In the left corner of the wall is a blue square sign printed with the white number \"0\" and some blurred Chinese characters, adding a touch of life and realism to the scene. In the foreground is her clear half-body outline, occupying the main visual space from waist to head. The composition uses a slightly upward angle, making the figure appear more upright and elegant. In the middle is the thick concrete column behind her, with weathered marks and vertical textures on the surface. The column is heavy and powerful, forming a sharp contrast with the figure's slender and graceful figure, enhancing the spatial layers. The background features distant cityscapes, including several modern glass curtain wall skyscrapers with clean and stern lines, creating a hazy blur effect against the gray-white sky, creating a sense of urban detachment and vastness. In the distant left side of the frame, several blurred figures of passersby can be seen, adding to the realism and lively atmosphere of the scene. The composition uses the classic three-part method, with the main subject positioned on the right side of the frame. The yellow tiled wall in the foreground serves as a visual guideline, with extremely soft and even light and shadow treatment, creating a cloudy, scattered light environment without strong shadows or highlights. The clothing textures are delicate and visible, and the overall color tone leans toward warm and neutral tones, mainly beige, light gray, and cream yellow, accented with dark brown and navy blue, creating a harmonious and cozy color scheme. The atmosphere is tranquil and slightly nostalgic, blending the pure beauty of campus youth with the everyday texture of urban life. Overall, it presents a fresh, artistic, and slightly Japanese-style visual aesthetic. It resembles a casual life photo taken with a regular phone camera on city pedestrian bridges or public building corridors, yet its expressions and precise composition give it professional-level artistic appeal, allowing people to feel a poetic and gentle power in the ordinary.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
