        {
          "id": "krea2-ef9028816ccb22d41c6fc449",
          "alias": "单女蓝短裙户外困倦坐",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in elegant and flowing Hanfu sits solitary outdoors amid dappled light and shadow. A few silver tassels hang lightly down to her chest, gently trembling in the wind. The hem is half-sheer like sheer gauze, and the pale blue and white skirt is layered with intricate patterns, glowing softly in the sunlight. In the foreground are her slightly tilted shoulders and slender arms. Under the light, the fabric creates natural folds and transitions between light and shadow. The background features a gray stone wall and checkered floor tiles that look weathered. The rough texture of the walls contrasts with the regular lines of the floor to create a warm and cool contrast. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center. The slightly tilted perspective enhances the sense of spatial depth. The shadowed areas retain delicate textures, creating an overall atmosphere that is tranquil and dreamy, with a poetic beauty reminiscent of classical poetry. The image texture is delicate and authentic, like a high-definition image taken with a professional camera under the afternoon sun, capturing the subtle expressions of the figures and every inch of clothing texture, full of the refined fusion of Eastern aesthetics and modern photography techniques.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
