        {
          "id": "krea2-1b43df1318e0ca01ce2eae70",
          "alias": "单女金毛衣公园俏皮跪",
          "prompt": "A woman kneels by the leaf-lined path in the autumn park, wearing a loose, fluffy creamy yellow plush knit top with a one-shoulder off-shoulder neckline that reveals delicate and fair shoulder and neck lines. She pairs it with pure white sneakers and matching ankle socks, creating a simple yet youthful and energetic look. Add a touch of lazy gentleness. Her knees are bent, and the sunlight glows softly around them, radiating warm vitality in the light and shadow. In the foreground is densely packed orange-red maple leaves, with clear edges and rich, rich colors, layered over the gray cement roadside stones, forming a striking warm-toned visual focal point; The middle ground is the main part of her body and the fallen leaf area extending to her feet, where faint traces of road texture and geometric curbstones can be seen among the fallen leaves, enhancing the spatial depth of the composition; The background is a gray-toned road cut by tree shadows, with mottled shadows scattered like brushes on the ground, creating a tranquil and distant atmosphere. The distant blurred scenery hints at the park's open space. The composition adopts a slightly top-down perspective, placing the figure slightly to the left center of the composition. At the same time, the diagonally extended curbs and leaf strips form dynamic visual guidelines, giving the painting layers and rhythm. The light comes from natural daylight from the upper side, moderately strong yet clearly directional, creating a soft contrast between light and dark, while the shadowed areas enhance depth and realism; The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and bright, evoking the softness and comfort unique to autumn afternoons. The overall color palette is mainly warm orange, beige, and cream white, balanced by a cool background of deep gray and dark green, creating a visual experience that is both cozy and romantic with a touch of artistic flair. Like a carefully composed outdoor portrait work, it combines the casual feel of daily life with an artistically refined beauty. It is suitable for shooting with a phone or small camera under natural light, aiming for authentic and delicate humanistic emotional expression.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
