        {
          "id": "krea2-1c8a3d7d0a3db1d4a21a949e",
          "alias": "单女白礼服城市冷淡倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully leans against the armrest of a deep green leather sofa, dressed in a delicate white strapless gown adorned with fluffy, soft white feathers adorning the hem and neckline, adorned with fine, sparkling silver beads that reflect gently under soft lighting. Behind her is a highly designed interior space, with glass partitions featuring Chinese carved metal frames in the background. Warm yellow lighting faintly shines through the wine cabinet or display rack, displaying neatly arranged transparent glass bottles and exquisite utensils. Above the ceiling, there are embedded light troughs outlined with simple lines, emitting even, soft light. The entire scene is composed from a slightly overhead angle, with the main figure occupying the center slightly to the right of the frame, body in a diagonal posture to create dynamic balance. The foreground sofa armrest and her arm form a visual guiding line, creating a warm and layered lighting atmosphere. The main light source comes from the upper front, creating a delicate three-dimensional effect. The warm yellow lighting in the background subtly contrasts with the cool metal structure of the environment. The overall color palette is mainly off-white, cream, dark green, and metallic gray. It presents a sophisticated, retro yet modern urban nightlife vibe. The image texture is delicate, as if shot by a professional camera, featuring a slight film graininess and natural depth blur effect, making the subject stand out clearly. The background elements are hazy yet full of storytelling. The overall atmosphere is quiet, private, and full of fashionable flair, conveying an elegant mood of calm confidence and enjoying solitude—like a moment captured in a high-end restaurant or private club—both everyday and full of artistic beauty.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
