        {
          "id": "krea2-1e7cfc5e9ff4d791e1eab638",
          "alias": "单女短裙窗边倚靠（2）",
          "prompt": "The hem cascades like clouds over the rough white wall, gently swaying in the breeze with gentle curves. Sunlight filters through the sheer fabric, outlining delicate layers of light and shadow between her skin and the hem. Add a touch of laziness and vitality; Her makeup is exquisite but not overly heavy, presenting a natural and fresh vibe. Her legs are long and slender, one foot elegantly resting on the edge of the window frame, the other naturally dangling. Her barefoot posture exudes a sense of unrestrained freedom and innocence, as if savoring a moment of tranquility in the afternoon. In the foreground, the semi-transparent gauze texture of her skirt and the sunlit skin details at her ankles are visible; in the middle is the wooden window frame frame she leans on, and pink rose vines winding up from beneath the windowsill. The flowers are delicate and dripping, petal edges glistening softly, and the green leaves make her look even more vibrant. The background is a deep, dark indoor space, with dim lighting inside the windows, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow, making the main figure stand out and hinting at a private and restrained atmosphere. The entire composition is shot from a slightly upward angle, placing the figure at the visual center, with window frames as natural frames cleverly guiding the viewer's attention to her posture and expression; Light comes from the upper left of the frame, providing warm, soft natural light that creates bright highlights, while shadows of varying shades are left below the body and deep in the background, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and spatial depth. The image texture is delicate, like a portrait shot with a professional camera under natural light, featuring a slight film graininess and soft focus effect, enhancing the aesthetic and nostalgic emotional expression. The entire scene exudes a gentle, serene, and healing artistic beauty, evoking images of portraits in classical oil paintings or characters stepping out of fairy tales, full of storytelling and imaginative space.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
