        {
          "id": "krea2-4c7aed13bf972b9d2cb5153c",
          "alias": "单女牛仔公寓微笑站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a modern minimalist indoor corridor, wearing a close-fitting white long-sleeve crew-neck top made of delicate and smooth fabric, which outlines her smooth silhouette under soft light. She pairs it with light gray, washed, high-waisted ripped jeans. The natural tear design at the knee reveals the fabric texture and flush details inside. The pants are slimming and accentuate the beauty of the leg lines; She carries a black leather chain handbag on her shoulder, with the strap elegantly hanging down, and the metal chain glinting faintly under the light, adding a touch of refinement; Wear a thin chain pendant necklace around your neck. The pendant is simple yet stylish, with a light accent at the collarbone; Her makeup is delicate and elegant, her expression calm and confident, with a hint of playful smile. Her left hand gently leans against the white wall on the left, her fingertips naturally curved. The wall surface is smooth and flat, with faint vertical lines and blurred text markings. The right background features a dark gray floor and blurred architectural silhouettes, creating a sense of depth and space. The composition uses a medium full-body perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, body slightly turned to the side, head slightly tilted toward the camera, creating dynamic balance and visual tension; The foreground is the part where the lower body and hands touch the wall, with the background blurred to highlight the subject; The visual guide line extends from the person's leaning hand to the wall, then directs the viewer through the direction of the gaze, while the waist and leg lines form a natural guiding path; The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, with the light source at the top left creating a natural contrast between light and dark. The background is set in a low-saturation cool-toned environment, emphasizing the subject's warm color and focal point. The overall image presents a fashionable everyday feel of urban life, with a slight cinematic soft focus and fine grain, as if a professional camera has captured an indoors under natural light, capturing an unintentional yet story-filled moment. It combines artistic aesthetics with authentic life atmosphere.",
