        {
          "id": "krea2-703b474492aeb59f8d6577b2",
          "alias": "单女金毛衣镜前愤怒站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of an indoor mirror for a selfie, wearing a soft pale yellow knit cardigan with clearly visible fabric textures. The cuffs and front are decorated with delicate woven patterns, paired with a form-fitting light gray pencil dress underneath. The fabric is delicate and elastic, hugging the figure to outline smooth curves. The waist and hips naturally conclude, with the hem draping down to mid-calf, presenting an elegant and confident posture. It was as if she was enjoying this private moment of self-expression. The composition uses a full-body perspective in the middle of the scene, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. On the left side, a simple dark door frame or wall serves as a visual guideline, while on the right side is a large warm white wall background, creating a clean, minimalist atmosphere with a sense of spatial depth. Light comes from the front right of the figure, soft and warm, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. Subtle shadows are cast on her right side, enhancing the three-dimensional silhouette while illuminating the cardigan texture and the pleated details of the dress, making the materiality of the garment more authentic and tangible. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow, accented with gray, white, and black, creating a cozy, tranquil, and slightly lazy afternoon home atmosphere. The layers of light and shadow are rich but not glaring, creating a strong atmosphere. The image style leans toward an artistic presentation of everyday life, featuring slight soft focus and natural noise effects, simulating the authentic texture of amateur equipment shooting. The image has moderate saturation, soft colors that are not gaudy, emphasizing emotional expression rather than excessive embellishment, presenting a genuine, intimate, and life-filled personal visual aesthetic that allows people to feel the protagonist's inner joy and ease, as if one can hear her softly hummed melody or the breeze drifting in outside the window.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
