        {
          "id": "krea2-9ab564b91266c11540d6d932",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔街道冷淡站立自拍",
          "prompt": "She wore a washed, distressed-style light blue denim jacket. The fabric texture was clearly visible, presenting a natural faded and faded effect. The stitching details on the shoulders, cuffs, and chest pockets were distinct, and the metal buttons reflected a delicate sheen under the light, giving the overall look a balance of casual street style and fashionable sophistication. Her fingers are long and slender, painted with matte black nail polish, forming a striking contrast with the silver multi-layered ring—each ring is set with fine, sparkling diamonds or crystals, sparkling softly under soft light and highlighting her attention to detail and taste; Wearing a simple silver chain necklace around her neck, understated yet still highlighting. The composition uses a classic central style, with the figure's head slightly tilted, creating a strong visual focus and emotional connection. In the foreground, a close-up of her fingertips and ring, in the middle is a jacket collar and hand pose, and in the background is a pure, flawless white wall. The minimalist treatment makes the subject stand out even more. The use of light and shadow is extremely meticulous, outlining a soft three-dimensional effect while avoiding harsh highlights. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, elegant, and full of the independent temperament of a modern urban woman. It combines the professional quality of a studio with the genuine warmth of everyday shooting, as if capturing a moment of her lazy afternoon selfie. The color palette is mainly cool blue-gray, harmonious and vibrant. The images are rich in detail but not overly noisy, presenting a beauty that balances artistry and everyday life. It meets the aesthetic standards of fashion blockbusters while preserving the authentic, natural, and unartificially unpolished emotional expression typical of ordinary camera shoots.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
