        {
          "id": "krea2-71fc13889521bd6adcbe69cb",
          "alias": "单女白T恤咖啡厅沉思坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a bright outdoor café or casual restaurant, with a close-up of her from her chest to the middle of her thighs. She slightly lowers her head and gazes at the table, her posture lazy yet full of youthful energy. She wears a light blue baseball cap on her head, with sunglasses featuring reflective golden lenses hanging from the brim, adding a touch of street fashion and mystery; She wore a white fitted camisole with the hem just exposing her flat stomach and navel, highlighting her healthy figure. She wore a bright yellow quilted jacket over it, with blue embroidered letters on the sides and dark patchwork designs visible at the cuffs. She paired loose white sweatpants with elastic pleated details at the waistband, giving the outfit a vibrant, rich, and energetic look. In the foreground is a gray tabletop with a transparent glass filled with red iced drinks, with a black straw in the cup, and a flipped magazine or picture booklet spread beside it, with colorful images and typography suggesting she might be reading or resting to relax; The middle shot focuses on the torso and clothing details, with soft lighting outlining skin contours and clothing textures; After the background blur treatment, elements such as green potted plants, wooden grille structures, and arched porches can be faintly seen, creating an urban leisure space atmosphere; The composition is shot at a slightly upward-angled angle, with the subject positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving space on the right to display the environment and creating visual balance; The visual guide naturally extends from the person's downward gaze to the drinks and magazines on the table, creating a light and shadow atmosphere that presents the effect of natural daylight. The light source comes from the upper right, creating soft scattered light spots on the table and background. The overall color tone is warm and bright, with the yellow jacket and red drink becoming the visual focal points, creating a relaxed, cozy, and fashionable everyday atmosphere. It feels like a real moment casually captured by a phone or regular camera under the afternoon sun, with a strong sense of documentary and everyday life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
