        {
          "id": "krea2-745ca7699cb3ac5bc6515714",
          "alias": "单女毛衣车厢忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways by the door of a high-speed train carriage, her body gently leaning against the silver metal handrail, her posture elegant and natural. She wore a pure white outfit, with a sheer knit cardigan on top. The hem draped naturally and featured a delicate three-dimensional embroidered short skirt. The skirt was light and flowing, made of soft material that hugged the figure, outlining smooth curves. She wore off-white Mary Jane flats with delicate laces and a rounded, comfortable shape. The overall look was simple and pure, exuding a fresh and gentle aura. Her left hand rests gently on her waist, while her right hand naturally hangs down or lightly grasps the hem of her skirt. Her legs are long and straight, standing upright, her right foot slightly extended forward, and her left foot firmly on the dark gray non-slip floor, with the heel slightly raised, creating a dynamic and balanced visual aesthetic. The foreground focuses on her slender leg lines and foot details, as well as the metal armrest she leans on, whose smooth surface reflects the sheer sheen, with vertical lines guiding the gaze upward toward the subject. The center shot depicts her complete silhouette, clearly captured from head to ankle, with white clothing contrasting sharply against the background, highlighting the character's presence. The background is the train's interior with a clean, modern interior, dominated by large areas of pure white and light gray. The door frames are clean and neat, with intricate mechanical structures and black rubber sealing strips visible in the door gaps. The floor is a matte dark gray material, scattered with fine dust particles in some areas, enhancing the sense of realism. Outside the round windows is a blurred green field landscape during high-speed movement. The dynamic draglines created by speed present flowing, wave-like textures, with high color saturation, mainly interwoven with bright emerald green and pale yellow, creating a strong sense of movement and spatial depth, as if time outside the window is stretched and distorted. The entire composition uses vertical composition, with the figure positioned on the left two-thirds of the frame, the right side blank to create a sense of breathing, and the round car window as the visual focal point and emotional outlet. The light and shadow are delicate and soft, creating subtle transitions between light and shadow. Natural shadows appear in the folds of the clothing, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The interior lighting uses cool white tones, creating a warm and cool contrast with the warm green outside the window, while also imparting a calm and restrained emotional tone to the scene. The overall atmosphere is tranquil yet full of tension, evoking both longing for unknown destinations during travel and cherishing moments in the present. The photography style leans toward the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment, with slight noise and color shifts. The images do not pursue perfect sharpness, preserving the warmth and breathing of everyday life. Like a casually recorded yet story-filled travel photo, it builds a rich inner world and visual layers within a simple space, conveying a poetic beauty that is youthful, free, and slightly melancholic.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
