        {
          "id": "krea2-27ff169afce0389ff48580df",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫摄影棚忧伤坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits alone atop an ancient stone pillar high above, wearing a loose, flowing off-white long-sleeved shirt dress with soft fabric that fits her figure, sleeves naturally rolled up, hem hanging below her knees, barefoot suspended in the air, toes slightly curled, posture both relaxed and full of contemplative tension. It adds a touch of unruly and gentle charm. In the foreground is a rough-textured gray stone pillar surface, with clearly visible grain, outlined by the afterglow of the setting sun, creating a warm edge glow that contrasts with the soft glow of the figure's skin. In the middle shot, her legs hang straight and long, showing a natural sheen under the light. Her ankles and calves are smooth, as if connected to the earth yet transcending the world. The background is a hazy city skyline, where distant buildings and tree silhouettes transform into blurred silhouettes of deep blue and dark green at dusk. The sky shifts from deep indigo to a patch of pink-orange evening glow on the horizon. The clouds are thick and layered, spreading like silk, creating a tranquil yet slightly melancholy atmosphere. The composition uses a vertical long perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame. The stone pillar extends diagonally from the lower right corner to the center of the image, forming a solid visual support. The light and shadow are handled with extreme finesse, creating a strong sense of three-dimensionality with strong contrast between light and shadow, while the right side is immersed in gentle shadows, enhancing the drama and depth of the painting. The overall color scheme is dominated by a mix of warm and cool blue-purple tones, complemented by the warm whites of the characters' clothing and the orange pink of the sky, creating a cinematic dusk atmosphere. The painting carries a strong sense of narrative and emotional tension, as if capturing a moment of solitary reflection on life and feeling loneliness and freedom at dusk, full of artistic and philosophical atmosphere. The image style leans toward a professional studio-level texture, but with a slight film graininess and soft focus effect, as if shooting at dusk with a high-end camera paired with a large-aperture lens. The details are rich and layered, with natural and soft transitions of light and shadow, presenting an overall image that combines artistic beauty with everyday realism, evoking a sense of tranquility and eternity as time passes.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
