        {
          "id": "krea2-1e7ba66fb17d708bbea88b57",
          "alias": "单女透视黑短裤街道媚态倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A female model gracefully leans in a half-squat pose against the concrete low wall of a city overpass or viaduct, dressed in a fashionable look full of street punk and sensual elements: a leopard-print strapless top showing off a slender waistline, paired with black mini shorts adorned with metal studs and leather floss trim, tightly wrapped black sheer stockings, and a pair of exaggeratedly designed thick-soled lace-up Martin boots adorned with metal chains, buckles, and star-shaped studs, reflecting a cool sheen in the sunlight. She turned sideways to look back at the camera, wearing a multi-layered bracelet and metal bracelet on her left wrist, while her right hand gently touched her left knee, exuding a balance of strength and graceful curves. The foreground focuses on the visual tension created by her long legs and heavy shoes; the ground is a mottled cement pavement with fine cracks and wear marks, enhancing the sense of realism. In the middle is the rough concrete low wall she leans against and the gray metal railing extending beside it. The railing surface shows slight rust and signs of use, infusing the painting with an industrial texture. The background features blurred urban architectural silhouettes and sky, with the upper structure composed of off-white steel beams and columns, creating a geometric frame effect. Distant tall buildings are blurred into soft tones, hinting at the atmosphere of dusk or early morning. The composition uses a slightly upward angle, giving the figure a dominant position in the frame. The guardrail serves as a guiding line, with light and shadow coming from natural light slightly above the side, soft and layered, outlining the three-dimensional outline of her body and casting clear but not harsh shadows on the ground and walls. The overall atmosphere blends the ruggedness of urban streets with the contrast of feminine softness, creating a visual experience that is both rebellious and refined, everyday yet surreal. The color palette is mainly black, gray, and off-white, accented with leopard print brown and metallic silver in a striking contrast. The image is delicate and detailed, presenting a high-quality photo style reminiscent of a high-end digital camera captured in golden moments. It has strong narrative and artistic expressiveness, capturing a moment full of personality and attitude rather than mere staged shots, conveying a modern youth cultural atmosphere of freedom, independence, and self-expression.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
