        {
          "id": "krea2-f90f81eb23fc5c6cd09bf933",
          "alias": "单女粉旗袍花园坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright beside a stone railing in a classical garden, wearing a soft pink sleeveless modified qipao-style top with a delicately rounded neckline, and an off-white lace knit shawl naturally hangs down the cuff, adorned with fine tassels that flutter gently in the wind; She folds her arms over her chest, her right hand lightly resting on an open plain white thread-bound book. The book rests quietly on a mottled, rustic gray-brown stone pedestal, whose surface has rough textures and clearly visible traces of time; Staring into the camera seems to have a thousand words to say, yet it is reserved and reserved; The foreground focuses on the lines of her shoulders, neck, and arms. The fabric wrinkles are delicate, and the interplay of light and shadow reveals a warm texture of skin. After the background is blurred, a faint Chinese courtyard scene is faintly visible—in the distance, dark gray brick walls and wooden window lattices, dappled sunlight filters through the window slattics; nearby, lotus leaves glisten with ink green, rippling water blurring into soft-focus color blocks, creating a hazy, poetic space; The composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, extending to the garden behind the scene; The overall composition uses shallow depth of field techniques, with sharp subjects and soft background blur, creating a strong sense of visual layering; Light comes from the upper right, the warm golden sunlight slanting in the morning or afternoon, outlining three-dimensional contours while casting warm shadows on the stone base and collar, enhancing the depth of the space; The color palette mainly consists of pink, white, gray, and green, with moderate saturation, presenting a gentle and tranquil atmosphere with a touch of artistic retro charm; The image quality is delicate and realistic, as if shot with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens in natural light. It features a film-like soft focus graininess and slight noise, rich in details yet with a hazy beauty. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, blending Eastern classical aesthetics with modern freshness, allowing listeners to feel the tranquil poetry and scholarly elegance accumulated over time.",
