        {
          "id": "krea2-6bd7ee82f69e54efbb90b204",
          "alias": "单女蓝高领衫花园困倦书写",
          "prompt": "Occupying the core of the frame, she possesses an Eastern beauty that blends classical and modern styles. Her overall makeup is clean yet full of detail. She wears a pair of gorgeous pearl and diamond earrings, with the upper half streamlined by finely set brilliant diamonds, and the end hanging from a full, rounded white pearl that reflects a gentle luster under the light. She wore a light blue turtleneck dress with a delicate white satin ribbon bow at the neckline, adorned with delicate pearl embellishments at the shoulders and neckline. The fabric was light and flowing, exuding a high-fashion feel. She wore a wide-brimmed light blue tulle hat, made of lightweight, breathable mesh or thin silk, with delicate pleats at the brim. She gently held a corner of the brim with her left hand, her posture elegant and composed. The background is a blurred outdoor natural landscape, where blurred green vegetation blends with the sky, creating a dreamy pastoral or garden atmosphere. In the distance, soft golden light spots faintly visible, hinting at sunlight filtering through the leaves. At the top is a pure light blue area printed with bold black artistic text \"BEAUTY BAZAAR 2025.11 NOV TRENDS,\" a modern minimalist yet powerful design; The bottom is also in a light blue area, printed with a small Song font: \"The white moonlight overseas heiress looks like her, right?\" The writing style is warm and gentle, carrying the unique artistic vibe of magazine covers. The overall light and shadow are soft and even, using diffused natural light. The light slopes down from the upper left, creating natural shadow transitions without harsh contrasts of light and dark, highlighting the skin's translucency and clarity. The colors are mainly cool tones, with extensive use of various layers of blue (sky blue, lake blue, light cyan) as the main color, complemented by white, pearl color, and a touch of green to create a calm, pure, noble, and slightly cool visual atmosphere. The entire image presents the texture of a high-end fashion magazine cover, combining the refined control of a professional studio with the liveliness and breathability of outdoor natural light. It possesses strong artistic expression and commercial appeal, like a carefully graded digital oil painting, while preserving the subtle graininess and sense of life that comes from everyday amateur equipment, allowing viewers to experience ultimate aesthetics without feeling overly cold or distant.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
