        {
          "id": "krea2-502dbe31874946613c722e19",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤街道严肃倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman leans against the corner where white walls meet large windows, her overall aura blending street fashion with gentle artistic vibes. She wore a black cropped fitted T-shirt with striking red artistic lettering on the chest: \"Marry?\" Me?” The lettering, set against a pure black background, creates a strong visual impact; Pair loose cargo pants with neat cuts and multiple practical pockets, and tie colorful handwoven cord chains and pearl threads at the waist, creating a strong decorative contrast. This not only preserves the tough lines of street tech style but also adds romantic and personalized details through intricate accessories. Around her neck, she wears a choker woven from ruby beads and white pearls, while her wrist is adorned with wooden bracelets and colorful woven bracelets. These accessories shimmer subtly in the light, enhancing the overall layering and storytelling of the look. The figure's posture is relaxed and natural, one hand resting lightly at the waist, the other hanging by the side, body slightly leaning against the wall, presenting a dynamic beauty inadvertently captured by sunlight. The foreground is a close-up of her body, especially the design of cargo pants at the waist and thighs, the woven chains hanging from the fabric, and the delicate transitions of light and shadow created by fabric folds; The middle shot focuses on the upper body and the textual patterns and accessory details on the figure's clothing, while the black metal lines on the window frame cut the image, creating a strong geometric structural contrast; The background is the exterior view of the city's buildings seen through the window. After blurring, warm-toned brick walls and vintage window frames are presented, faintly revealing the outlines of buildings opposite and the halo of the sky, creating an authentic urban atmosphere. The composition uses the classic rule of thirds: the figure is positioned in the left third of the painting, with the right side left blank and a window introduced as a visual guideline, while the window frame forms a natural frame effect, enhancing the depth of the image. Light comes from natural daylight in the upper left, slanting into the room, while on the left side of the body, natural transitional shadows are formed, enhancing the figure's silhouette and sense of space; The light and shadow are evenly distributed but not monotonous, presenting a warm yet slightly nostalgic atmosphere. It combines the rebellion and flamboyance of modern street culture, as well as the softness and poetry of the heart, as if frozen on a lazy afternoon, with sunlight filling the room and a girl quietly waiting for an important moment. The overall style leans toward realistic photographic quality, simulating professional camera shooting effects. The images are clear and sharp, with moderate color saturation, delivering cinematic narrative and emotional tension, as if a frame is taken from an independent short film about youth, love, and self-expression.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
