        {
          "id": "krea2-d8de75f74d9d2e455ae0f761",
          "alias": "单女粉T恤公寓困倦躲藏",
          "prompt": "She wore a pink semi-transparent lace camisole top made of light and tulle material, covered with three-dimensional floral embroidery and layered ruffled pleats. She naturally flowed with her figure, layered with a pure white base tank top and white high-waisted lace shorts, which were decorated with intricate three-dimensional floral lace patterns at the hem. The waistline was slender, with a flat belly and navel faintly visible, presenting a sweet and relaxed style that blended elegance with home-style relaxation. In the foreground, her left hand gently rests on the edge of the pillow, while her right hand naturally folds in front of her abdomen. Her fingers are long and slender, her nails neatly trimmed, and her posture relaxed and natural, as if she has just woken up from sleep or is enjoying a leisurely afternoon. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure occupying the left central position, the body slightly turned but the head turning toward the camera, creating a subtle dynamic balance; The background is blurred, making only the light-toned interior recognizable. On the right, you can faintly see the outline of a white cabinet and blurred window frame lines. In the lower left corner, a fabric with pink flowers and heart patterns peeks out—possibly a sheet or blanket—further enhancing the atmosphere of the bedroom or private space. The lighting uses soft and even natural light, with the light source coming from the front right of the figure. Light penetrates the pink top to create a hazy, semi-transparent texture and delicate transitions between light and shadow, while the shadows naturally converge to avoid harsh contrasts. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and warm, full of the \"healing\" and \"lazy feeling\" found in Japanese home aesthetics. The color scheme is mainly pink and white, creating a fresh, gentle, and slightly dreamy visual experience; The visual guidance in the image is clear, then naturally transitions to her hand movements gently stroking the cushion and the flowing fabric texture, then extending down to the lace details at the waist and shorts, finally stopping at the spatial layers of the leg lines and background; The entire image exudes a high degree of artistry and a sense of life, as if shot by a high-end digital camera paired with a large-aperture lens, presenting delicate graininess and authentic human light and shadow expression, while also carrying the casualness and realism of everyday amateur equipment. Without excessive embellishment, it captures the most natural state and ambient atmosphere of the subject, conveying an intimate, comfortable, and private emotional resonance.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
