        {
          "id": "krea2-ffeb5b00988248685f3d763c",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣车厢俏皮坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits inside a subway carriage, leaning slightly forward against a silver metal armrest, her posture naturally relaxed with a touch of playful movement. She wears a fluffy, soft off-white knit sweater, with cuffs and hem adorned with rounded, full white pom-pom decorations. The sweater's texture is delicate and clear, presenting a warm and comfortable texture. Under soft light, it glows softly, paired with a clean black short skirt with a plaid lining at the hem, adding a touch of collegiate detail. Her legs are clad in pure white over-the-knee socks. The sock cuffs hug the thigh line, forming a sharp contrast with the black high heels. The pointed toe design highlights a refined silhouette, blending sweetness, youthfulness, and a touch of fashionable coolness. The gentle expression conveys confidence and curiosity. The background is a typical subway carriage interior, with blue seats neatly arranged. The blurred outlines of city buildings outside the window are faintly visible, and the window glass reflects indoor lights and reflections, creating a dynamic and tranquil atmosphere. The foreground focuses on the upper body and leg lines. The wrinkles on sweaters and the tight skin texture of socks are both captured with great detail. In the middle shot, the metal armrests and seat edges form visual guiding lines, naturally transitioning the viewer's gaze from the waist to the feet. The background uses shallow depth blur to make the subject stand out. The composition is shot from a slightly upward angle to enhance the character's presence and approachability. The straight line structure inside the carriage is used as a framing element to enhance the depth of the image. The main light source is evenly scattered illumination from the top of the carriage, with natural shadow transitions. There is no harsh contrast between light and dark, but subtle shadow layers remain deep in sweater folds and at the joints of the legs, creating a three-dimensional and textured visual effect. The overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, blending with the everyday vibe of urban life. It is both pure and sweet, while also reflecting the realism of modern city commuting scenes. The color palette is mainly warm white, deep black, and cool blue, harmoniously and unified, neither overpowering nor overpowering, with a highly visually striking texture. The image presents a delicate texture almost cinematic. It feels like a high-quality portrait shot with a high-end digital camera under natural light, rich in detail and full of artistic beauty that feels like everyday life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
