        {
          "id": "krea2-2492ac123a5e67a4772a811d",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙浴室坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a white windowsill by the window, her body slightly turned and her head slightly raised to look back at the camera. Under the afternoon sunlight streaming in slantingly, she flows as smoothly as silk, adding a touch of casualness and authenticity; She wore a simple, pure white strapless dress made of lightweight, soft fabric, with pleats that naturally draped to fit her skin lines. A matching bow was tied around her waist, accentuating her slender waist. In the foreground is her bare slender arms and legs, evenly illuminated by sunlight, presenting a healthy and natural warm tone; knees slightly bent and crossed, posture relaxed yet full of tension; In the middle is the edge of the window sill she leans on, with the white wood grain clearly visible. Below, a vintage-style metal faucet installation is faintly visible, suggesting this is a corner of a bathroom or laundry room full of life; In the background are large bright windows, outside which is a blurred yet layered autumn courtyard scene. Branches intertwine and leaves in pale pink and orange-yellow tones. Through the sheer curtains, a soft bokeh effect is created. In the distance, faint outlines of city buildings can be seen, creating a tranquil, private, and slightly urban spatial atmosphere; The composition uses a vertical close-up perspective, with the figure occupying the center-right position. The window frame serves as a natural frame to enhance visual focus, with light projected diagonally from the left side upward and extending outside the window to blur the background, creating a sense of spatial depth from near to far, from solid to void; The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and healing, featuring cinematic soft-focus texture and film grain noise, as if shooting an old digital camera or phone under natural light. The image saturation is moderate, with colors leaning toward creamy white and warm brown gold tones, exuding a lazy, comfortable, gentle, nostalgic everyday aesthetic, like the tranquil moment captured by afternoon sunlight filling a room, full of poetry and warmth of life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
