        {
          "id": "krea2-d4027db61f8cdb65c59bab07",
          "alias": "单女金连衣裙街道沉思站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman is the absolute subject of the painting, wearing a striking yellow high-slit long dress adorned with smooth orange-white abstract prints. The fabric feels light and flowing, shimmering with a silky sheen under the sunlight. The hem of the dress naturally drapes and lifts slightly with her posture. She paired it with black knee-high leather boots, whose smooth, reflective boots contrasted strongly with the vibrant dress, highlighting a fashion-forward vibe. Add a touch of lazy sexiness. In her right hand, she holds a vintage silver portable digital camera. The camera casing has a brushed metallic texture, and the lens is pointed at her, as if she's taking a selfie or preparing to shoot a street scene. Her left hand naturally raised, palm open, fingertips slightly curved, striking a pose full of energy and playfulness, perfectly complementing the overall color scheme. Her body leaned against a thick gray metal utility pole, whose surface was covered with various city stickers and graffiti, its edges worn and mottled, giving off a strong urban street vibe. In the foreground are her long legs, knee-high boots, and the dynamic pleats of her skirt. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, making the figure appear taller and more upright, while highlighting the beauty of her leg lines. The middle ground shows the area from her waist down to her ankles, as well as the base of the utility pole she leans on. On the left is a row of multi-story buildings with beige exterior walls and black wrought iron balcony railings. The windows are neatly arranged with dark frames, and the facades bear the marks of time; In the distance to the right, a small shop or residential building with orange-red walls can be seen, with faint crowds at the entrance, adding a touch of everyday life. The sky is a pure light blue, with almost no clouds, and sunlight pours down from above, creating a bright and soft natural environment. The light mainly comes from the upper left, creating a soft transition between light and dark, with shadows concentrated on the inner side of her body and beneath the utility pole, enhancing the sense of depth. The entire scene is highly saturated, dominated by warm yellow tones, contrasting with the cool gray utility poles and buildings, creating a lively, lively, and slightly rebellious urban street art atmosphere. The layers of light and shadow are rich and delicate, featuring highlights under strong light and subtle shadow transitions, enhancing the contours and textures of objects. The composition uses a slanted diagonal structure, with utility poles extending diagonally from the lower right corner to the center of the frame, while the figures' bodies are distributed along another diagonal line, creating strong visual tension and movement. The visual guidance lines are clear and distinct, from the raised arms and the direction of the gaze, to the extension of utility poles, to the lines of the background buildings, and guiding the gaze downward to explore the details of the legs and boots. The entire image exudes a youthful, free-spirited street fashion vibe, featuring professional studio-level makeup and costume lighting effects, while retaining the rough texture of real street scenes. It's as if a regular digital camera captured a momentary full of stories in the afternoon sunlight—both everyday and artistic, combining the refinement of a commercial fashion blockbuster with the authenticity of street documentary photography.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
