        {
          "id": "krea2-44070a4176d1e1c2b7a6f4ab",
          "alias": "单女白T恤城市困倦注视",
          "prompt": "Her makeup is understated and elegant, presenting a fresh and natural \"bare-faced\" vibe, with no trace of excessive embellishment, yet extremely attractive. She wore a white cropped tight-fitting T-shirt with brightly colored cartoon patterns on her chest—several adorable little animal figures, full of childlike fun and vitality; Layered with a burgundy knit cardigan, the fabric is thick and soft, with clearly visible ribbed patterns at the cuffs and neckline. The cardigan is casually draped over the shoulders, adding a touch of casual and relaxed vibe. She paired the bottom with white vertical striped wide-leg pants. The pants were loose-fitting, with smooth lines and fine, even stripes. As she sat, they naturally draped down and formed soft pleats. The pant legs slightly folded around her calves, revealing black sheer pantyhose. The smooth surface hugged the skin, outlining the leg lines. She slung a light gray mini chain bag across her right shoulder. The body was small and delicate, with the metal chain gleaming coldly under the light, subtly contrasting with the overall warm-toned outfit and adding a touch of urban fashion. In the background is a window adorned with white sheer and dark brown curtains, with light filtering through the sheer fabric to create a mottled, soft effect of light and shadow that illuminates the sofa, figures, and parts of the floor; The wooden window frame by the window is faintly visible, adding layers and a sense of life to the space. In the foreground are the sofa armrests and part of the floor carpet. The carpet is darker in color with geometric dark patterns, creating a visual contrast with the bright sofa and enhancing the stability of the scene. The composition uses a slightly overhead angle, with the lens focusing on the subject's chest to mid-thigh, with the main body occupying the left central position, body posture relaxed and relaxed, creating a natural visual balance. It then extends to the legs and bags, guiding the viewer's gaze from top to bottom, layer by layer. The light mainly comes from the window on the right side of the painting, which is a natural backlight. It is soft and layered, with folds of clothing creating transitions of light and dark, creating a warm, tranquil, and slightly dreamy atmosphere. The entire image exudes a sense of comfort and personal charm from home life, combining the everyday warmth of daily life with carefully designed artistic beauty. It feels like a moment casually captured as afternoon sunlight fills the room. It is authentic, natural, yet full of emotional tension, like a photo taken with a high-resolution phone or professional camera under natural indoor light. The details are rich, colors are harmonious, and the light and shadow are soft, creating a strong immersive viewing experience.",
          "description": "",
