        {
          "id": "krea2-b827ca6edfad314deea14bad",
          "alias": "单女旗袍竹林坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright before a bamboo window lattice in a Chinese courtyard. She wears a light teal modified qipao, adorned with pearl buttons at the collar and cuffs. A delicate white silk flower is pinned to the collar, paired with an off-white lace knit cardigan. The cardigan is light and translucent, as light and transparent as sheer gauze, hugging the figure. The fabric has delicate and clear textures, naturally falling to the knees. The overall tone is soft and elegant, presenting a gentle and serene classical Eastern aesthetic. In the foreground, on the right hangs a scroll of plain white xuan paper, written in dense ink in a flowing brush calligraphy. The characters are vigorous and free-spirited, with some characters blurred to create a hazy poetic atmosphere; On the left, a dark wooden desk can be vaguely seen. On the table sits a brush and an inkstone, the tip slightly tilted, the inkstone pool untouched, hinting at scenes of literati and refined scholars' lives. In the middle is the bamboo window lattice where the woman leans while seated. Its structure is simple yet rich in Eastern charm, with distinct bamboo joints and a warm color like ancient bronze. The window lattice reflects mottled light and shadow, blending with the blurred greenery outside. The background features a hollowed-out courtyard greenery, lush with branches and leaves, with rich color layers, gradually transitioning from near to far into soft green tones, creating a sense of tranquil and profound space. The entire composition uses medium to near shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. The xuan paper on the right and the table on the left form a symmetrical balance, enhancing the stability of the composition. It draws the viewer's gaze deep into the frame. The light and shadow are soft and natural, with soft light from the front and side evenly casting outlines the figure's silhouette and the folds of clothing. The contrast of light and shadow is just right, with no strong shadows, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly cyan, white, and beige, accented with ink tones. The colors are harmonious and unified, with a subtle ink wash texture, exuding a rich classical Eastern artistic conception. It combines the exquisite delicacy of artistic photography with the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment. The images are full of poetry and humanistic atmosphere, like a tranquil meticulous figure painting, allowing one to feel the elegance and composure accumulated over time.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
