        {
          "id": "krea2-4ef5a4e56e354ff3a84210e4",
          "alias": "单女制服室内微笑坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A cute person sat indoors under soft warm yellow lighting, dressed in a delicate Japanese-style sailor uniform: a light blue short-sleeved top with a white bow tie and deep blue striped edging. A playful cartoon cat pattern was embroidered in the chest pocket, wearing a blue bow and a little star above its head, with a cute and silly expression. She wore a fluffy, lightweight white pleated mini skirt paired with pure white over-the-knee socks, adorned with light blue hand-painted hearts and letters, giving her a youthful and sweet look. She wears a pair of transparent, fine-framed glasses and a sweet smile, with a clean and natural makeup that highlights her pure and innocent aura. Her hands elegantly made a heart gesture on her chest, her fingertips lightly outlining a heart shape, as if conveying love and warmth to the audience. Beside her snuggled a huge gray plush doll, its body covered in simple black line patterns, adding warmth and companionship to the scene. The background is a cozy corner of a bedroom or study. On the left, you can see off-white curtains gently swaying in the breeze, while the right wall is a soft mustard yellow, with a simple wooden framed painting hanging on it, creating a peaceful and comfortable home atmosphere. The floor is covered with textured brown carpets, and the person sits with legs crossed, naturally relaxed. The entire composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure occupying the center-left position. The shallow depth effect slightly blurs the background, highlighting the main subject. The light comes from a soft light in the front left of the image, creating a gentle and delicate transition of light and shadow, enhancing the sense of depth and texture. The overall color scheme is mainly blue and white, complemented by a warm yellow background. The color combination is fresh and elegant, creating a gentle and healing artistic atmosphere full of heart and dreaminess. The visual style leans toward the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting, rich in details and full of life atmosphere. It includes carefully designed costumes and props while preserving natural, authentic light and texture, allowing viewers to experience a relaxed, pleasant, warm, and healing emotional resonance.",
