        {
          "id": "krea2-55f4d87823c0148e23868701",
          "alias": "单女白浴袍室内温柔持花",
          "prompt": "She wears a loose off-white or light cream-colored robe, with soft and voluminous fabric, vintage pleats, ruffled cuffs, and a collar loosely open, revealing collarbones and slender shoulder and neck lines. The robe naturally folds at the sides to create soft pleated layers, with light and shadow outlining delicate transitions of light and shadow on its surface. Her hands gently held a delicate bouquet of pink roses, her fingertips long, nails neatly trimmed, the flower budding about to bloom, petals layered with a tender pink sheen, stems and leaves fresh and emerald. With an almost devout posture, she pressed the flower close to her chest, as if guarding a quiet moment. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure occupying a slightly higher central position. The background features an old-fashioned window frame with wooden frames, faint traces of water or dust visible on the glass, and outside the window are blurry green plant branches and leaves, which, under soft diffused light, create dreamlike blurred light spots, creating a sense of depth and space. Light enters the room diagonally from the upper left, creating a warm backlit silhouette while casting subtle shadows between the folds of the robe, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, poetic, and tinged with a touch of nostalgia, like the afternoon sunlight streaming into the study of an old house, carrying the laziness and gentleness of spring. The color palette mainly consists of warm white, beige, and pale pink, complemented by natural green tones outside the window, creating a soft and harmonious visual balance. The image presents a cinematic soft focus and grainy film texture, as if shot with an old digital camera or a high-sensitivity film camera under natural light. The transitions of light and shadow are natural and natural, with rich but not overly sharp details. Overall, it exudes a serene artistic temperament and a sense of everyday aesthetics. It combines the meticulous arrangement of artistic photography with the authentic warmth of everyday scenes, allowing viewers to feel moments of peace and beauty in the flow of time.",
