        {
          "id": "krea2-afe622557d72c3aaaf324d69",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫城市坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window, sunlight slanting into the room from behind, presenting a lazy and casual beauty; She wears a pair of retro-style round metal glasses with fine frames, the lenses clearly reflecting the blurred light outside the window. Looking directly at the camera, her expression is calm yet tinged with a gentle detachment; She wore a loose white cotton shirt with a deep V neckline. The fabric was light and soft, creating delicate folds and transitions between light and dark under the light. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, artistic, and full of life, like the afternoon sunlight shining on a desk, carrying a subtle nostalgic mood and urban leisure. The colors are mainly warm white, light gray, and deep black, with low saturation to emphasize emotion rather than visual impact. The entire image looks like an amateur DSLR shot under natural light, with slight noise and realistic film grain texture, pursuing emotional expression rather than perfect technical presentation. It allows viewers to feel a real, tangible poetic touch of everyday life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
