        {
          "id": "krea2-dd01d14932d2690729b2d19e",
          "alias": "单女短裤摄影棚冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "A woman is the absolute subject of the painting, adding a lazy and sexy vibe; The makeup is soft and natural, revealing a confident and gentle expression; She wore a beige-toned sheer long-sleeve top paired with matching shorts. The top features fine rhinestone or pearlescent textures, which reflect gently in the light and outline her figure; At the waist hangs a decorative metal chain belt with round metal pendants of various sizes and colors, such as ancient coins or badges, adding vintage and personality elements to the overall look; She sits on a silver-gray metal outdoor chair or railing, legs naturally crossed, right hand lightly resting on the chair backrest, left hand naturally resting beside her thigh, nails neatly trimmed to a pale pink, posture relaxed yet elegant; The foreground features the chair's metal armrests and leg lines; the metal surface reflects light with a cool sheen, creating a temperature contrast with the figure's skin; The middle ground features the metal railing structure on which her lower body rests, with faintly visible dark green shrubs and low vegetation below. The plant leaves are rich in layers but remain blurred, creating a sense of spatial depth; The background is a vast, open sky, with thin and evenly distributed clouds presenting soft tones of pale blue and gray-white. In the distance, you can see the rolling outlines of indigo mountains and scattered buildings, suggesting that the shooting location may be on the edge of the city or on a high platform in the suburbs; The entire composition uses a vertical long format, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, maintaining a stable visual focus. At the same time, the large blank space in the sky enhances the character's presence; The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere leans toward a soft light diffuse effect, with the light source coming from the left front of the character to avoid harsh shadows; Metal railings and reflective points on clothing form local highlights, enhancing the texture of the image; The overall color palette is dominated by warm brown, off-white, and light blue-gray, harmoniously unified to create a tranquil, lazy, and slightly artistic afternoon atmosphere. It combines the refinement of a professional studio with the natural casualness of everyday shooting, as if capturing moments of life casually on a sunny evening, yet the person's posture and environment make it highly artistically appealing.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
