        {
          "id": "krea2-fef078c8624ba16d95299aa0",
          "alias": "单女持相机（2）",
          "prompt": "It resembles a colored silk portrait of a lady, yet it carries the authentic warmth and breath of everyday photography. The color scheme is dominated by blue and white, harmonious yet dynamic, with delicate and authentic texture, as if shot with a professional-grade camera under soft natural light. It combines artistic expression with a sense of everyday life, immersing viewers in this tranquil yet story-filled moment.",
