        {
          "id": "krea2-c1ae1ced8bae8ae6743b7622",
          "alias": "多人摄影棚困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "The fabric was light and flowing, presenting a soft texture and subtle luster under the light. The hem faintly revealed layered ruffled cuts, giving the overall look a sweet and fresh vibe, full of summer vibes. At the boundary of these two colors, a subtle geometric division is formed, creating a sense of spatial layering while avoiding visual distractions, making the subject stand out more; The composition uses a classic central style, with the figure centered slightly to the right, the gaze slightly directed to the left side of the lens, then extending into the background color area, creating a smooth visual flow; Light and shadow use soft diffuse light, with the light source slightly to the left in front to create a natural transition between light and dark. The shadows are soft and not abrupt, while subtly reflecting the folds of the clothing; The overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with a dreamy soft-focus texture, as if you are in an afternoon study or a pink-themed cabin where sunlight filters through the sheer curtains. The tones are dominated by low-saturation creamy yellow, mint blue, and cherry blossom pink, creating a gentle, healing, and slightly artistic visual experience. The visuals have a strong cinematic feel and studio-level professional texture, yet retain the warmth and authenticity of everyday life, like portraits taken with a high-end digital camera under soft natural light. Combining artistic aesthetics with everyday narrative tension, it evokes a quiet, gentle, and youthful emotional resonance.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
