        {
          "id": "krea2-37d4918c3a58c0a60b6966ce",
          "alias": "单女短裙摄影棚愤怒持相机",
          "prompt": "The overall style is fresh and vintage yet modern; Her posture is naturally relaxed, her body slightly turned to the side but her head facing the camera, creating a warm and infectious visual connection; The foreground focuses on her upper body, with clearly visible shoulder and arm lines, and the skirt edges naturally folded with slight movement; The middle ground area shows the transition from her waist up to the hem of her skirt, with rich textures and layers of light and shadow, and faint outlines of green plants in the background blurred; The background is a blurred outdoor natural environment, mainly blue-green, with a sky as clear as a washed blue. In the distance, tall grass or reeds swaying in the wind can be faintly seen, creating a soft bokeh effect that enhances spatial depth and dreamlike atmosphere; The composition uses a classic central style, with the figure positioned slightly above the center, and the diagonal lines formed by the hanging skirt are used to balance the image; Extending to the neck, shoulders, and chest floral decorations, then extending down to the hem of the skirt, finally followed by background blur; Light comes from natural daylight, softly and evenly casting on the figure, presenting a creamy, translucent texture; Enhances three-dimensionality; The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with cool blue-green tones paired with soft warm white tones, creating a fresh and healing feeling like summer afternoon sunlight filtering through leaves onto the grass; The images have a distinct \"everyday amateur equipment shooting\" feel, meaning they are not professional studio lighting but simulate the realistic capture of handheld cameras or mobile phones outdoors in natural environments, including slight noise, moderate color saturation, slight edge defocus, motion blur marks, and natural color overflow; The overall image presents a \"cinematic\" narrative atmosphere, as if taken from a youth campus drama or art short, featuring carefully designed aesthetic elements while retaining a casual, realistic feel of everyday life; The setting is set in an outdoor garden or forest clearing, with moist and fresh air and bright sunlight that is not glaring. The entire scene exudes an atmosphere of tranquility, gentleness, innocence, and freedom, evoking carefree summer days and beautiful memories of youth.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
