        {
          "id": "krea2-54bcc0a3d2241b8b19f99e76",
          "alias": "单女白T恤摄影棚俏皮坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the back seat of a car, naturally falling to her shoulders and chest. She wore a simple, pure white thin camisole that accentuated her slender collarbones and long neckline, paired with matching white skinny pants. The overall look was clean and neat, highlighting youthful energy and a fresh temperament. On her left wrist, she wears a deep red wooden Buddhist prayer bead bracelet, which adds a warm accent to her wrist. Her fingers are long and slender, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with elegant white nails. Her right hand rests gently on her knee, fingertips lightly touching the edge of her pants, her posture relaxed and natural, exuding a lazy yet slightly playful vibe. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the main figure occupying most of the space, and a slightly tilted perspective enhances visual tension. In the foreground, her bent knees and overlapping arms form a natural visual guiding line; in the background is a blurred interior of the car, with faint glimpses of the metal handles on the inside of the doors, seat edges, and part of the window outline. The light outside the distant window is blurred into a bright white spot, creating a strong sense of depth. In terms of lighting and ambiance, the main light source comes from the upper side of the window, which is a soft natural backlight, while delicate shadow transitions are left on the sides of her body and the folds of her clothes, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall color scheme is pure white, presenting a sophisticated texture that blends warm and cool tones. The atmosphere is tranquil and gentle, carrying a lazy touch of summer afternoon sunlight. It combines studio-level professionalism with the authentic texture of everyday shooting, like a portrait captured by a high-end digital camera under natural light, full of cinematic narrative and poetic beauty that resonates with everyday life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
