        {
          "id": "krea2-3df494530357c6613aaefb5e",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤舞台俏皮站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman takes center stage with a selfie perspective, wearing a light gray faux-edged newsboy hat. She wore a dark gray hooded sweatshirt, with the zipper half-open revealing a corner of her black T-shirt underneath. A faint white print was visible on the chest. The fabric was soft and fluffy, with natural pleats at the cuffs and neckline, presenting a comfortable and casual look for home. The camera tilts slightly, creating an intimate and slightly playful visual tension. The background is a modern, minimalist interior space. Beige walls paired with wooden door frames and flooring, behind the door, a faint outline of a sofa and warm-toned lighting can be seen. The built-in air vents on the ceiling have clean lines, creating an overall clean and tidy environment with minimal decorations to obstruct the view, creating a quiet and cozy home atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups combined with a slightly upward-looking angle to create a strong visual center. The lighting and shadow processing is extremely delicate, with soft transitions of shadows avoiding harsh contrasts. The background blur makes the subject stand out even more, creating an overall atmosphere that is warm, tranquil, and full of life. It's as if capturing the moment when afternoon sunlight streams through the curtains into the room, and she relaxes and smiles at the camera. It combines the fashion of urban life with the relaxed and authentic warmth of everyday life. The color saturation is moderately warm, with gray, black, and off-white forming a harmonious and unified visual tone. It creates a refined yet down-to-earth visual aesthetic, like casually taking high-quality lifestyle photos at home with a regular phone, carrying a natural sense of breath and emotional resonance, making people imagine her mood and story at that moment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
