        {
          "id": "krea2-f9acc538740f5e76502f3c78",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙森林困倦",
          "prompt": "Her fingertips are neatly trimmed and painted with elegant white nail polish, with her fingers naturally curled and resting on the branch. Her wrist is adorned with a small, delicate white fabric flower decoration, adding a playful and pastoral touch; She wears a light, flowing white sleeveless dress, layered with a sheer teal green cover-up, on which silver embroidery or prints faintly reveal, with smooth and elegant lines; The composition uses a slightly tilted perspective, with the main figure occupying the center slightly to the right, then leading upward toward the greenery overhead, creating a layered visual progression; The background is a blurred outdoor natural environment, presenting a blurred gray-green tone and bokeh light spots, creating a hazy, dreamy atmosphere; The overall lighting is soft and even, with the main light source coming from the front and sides, complemented by woody brown tones and metallic silver accents. The overall color tone is harmonious and unified, full of tranquility, freshness, and vibrant artistic beauty; The images present a realistic texture reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment, rich in detail but without forced embellishment, as if frozen in a moment of encounter on a forest path. It combines the refined composition and light control of professional photography with the natural breathing of everyday scenes, conveying the vitality of youth, innocence, and coexistence with nature.",
