        {
          "id": "krea2-67f75e0ae8c911c630aa1b9f",
          "alias": "单女城市严肃倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "She leaned sideways against a modern railing with a deep gray metallic texture, her hands gently resting on the edge. On her left wrist, she wore a simple yet exquisite gold watch, while her right hand gently held an off-white mini handbag. The bag was made of transparent material with gold metal clasps, gleaming softly in the sunlight. It exudes a quiet and confident aura. The background is a corner of a city street, with a pristine white building exterior wall on the left featuring a simple rectangular window with clean and sharp window frames. On the right, red brick walls and exposed metal pipes intersect, with a light stone paving and a few patches of lush grass along the roadside. The entire scene is evenly illuminated by soft natural light, which streams diagonally from the left front of the figure, creating a warm and layered sense of three-dimensionality. The composition uses a medium shot, leaning toward close-up. The figure occupies two-thirds of the right side of the painting, while the left side is blank with a railing that naturally focuses the viewer's gaze on the subject. The railing extends diagonally diagonally, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The foreground features a mirror-smooth railing surface that reflects the lower body and handbag, adding interest and realism to the image. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and rich in urban poetry, with soft and warm light and shadow. The color palette is mainly white, gray, and blue, accented with gold, conveying a sense of sophistication that blends understated luxury with everyday leisure. It feels as if capturing a moment of tranquility under the afternoon sunlight flooding the streets. The entire image appears to have been taken by a high-end digital camera under natural light, rich in detail, authentic in texture, full of the spirit of life and artistic beauty.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
