        {
          "id": "krea2-de65750e2c5fa42c64cd29f5",
          "alias": "单女困倦倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "On the left, you can faintly see the metal frame and colorful carriages of a giant Ferris wheel; on the right, a blue cable car hangs in the air. In the distance, there are tented buildings with colorful canopies. The sky appears in a soft gray-blue tone, with thin clouds; The entire composition uses close-ups, with the characters slightly centered and slightly above, with their gaze facing directly at the camera, creating a strong sense of interaction; The visual guide naturally extends from the girl's heart gesture with both hands to the doll, creating a soft and even lighting atmosphere, like natural light on cloudy or diffused lighting environments, without strong shadows, creating a fresh, dreamy, warm, and healing overall atmosphere; The main colors in the painting are light blue, white, and pink, paired with warm yellow and light colors in the background, creating a bright yet gentle visual effect; The image style leans toward the realism of everyday amateur equipment, but after post-processing color grading and slight skin smoothing, it presents a soft, filter-like artistic beauty. It resembles a film photo gently touched by sunlight, carrying a youthful fairy-tale atmosphere, conveying an atmosphere of innocence, joy, romance, and emotional resonance.",
