        {
          "id": "krea2-9a1517f16fd35bb2ba7456dc",
          "alias": "单女紫旗袍室内冷淡倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully leans against a modern, minimalist wooden bench inside. She wears a delicate purple lace modified qipao. The sleeveless design outlines her long shoulder and neck lines, with traditional frog buttons at the neckline accented with deep purple beads, harmonizing with the overall color scheme. The skirt hangs naturally with a slit design, revealing one side of her leg curve. Her makeup is delicate and delicate. Her left hand rests naturally on her knee, fingers are slender, her nails painted with a pale yellow gradient nail, while her right hand gently supports the mirrored edge beside her. This creates a visual layer of interplay between solid and void. The background is a large floor-to-ceiling glass window or mirrored wall, where the blurred outlines of city buildings and soft natural light can be faintly seen. On the right, a large green plant has broad and spreading leaves, presenting a rich emerald green, creating a warm and cool contrast with the purple qipao. The floor is paved with dark gray marble tiles, with several white towels stacked in the corners, hinting that this is a hotel suite or a high-end leisure space. The ceiling recessed downlights emit even, soft warm white light. The main light source comes from the left side of the figure's front, creating a three-dimensional and warm skin texture. At the same time, subtle shadow transitions are created on the sides of the body and the hem of the skirt. The overall composition adopts a medium-close close-up perspective, with the figure occupying the center-right position, creating a strong emotional connection. The mirror reflection adds depth and narrative value to the image. The main color tones are purple, gray, wood brown, and green, creating a quiet and elegant atmosphere while retaining modern urban fashion. The light and shadow treatment is delicate and soft, avoiding harsh contrasts. Overall, it presents a sophisticated lifestyle aesthetic scene, as if real photos taken with a professional-grade camera paired with a large-aperture lens in a mixed indoor environment of natural and artificial light. The details are rich but never overpowering, emphasizing the fusion of emotional expression and ambiance. The entire scene exudes a gentle, confident, and slightly mysterious Eastern charm, blending the subtle restraint of classical aesthetics with the comfort and freedom of contemporary lifestyle.",
