        {
          "id": "krea2-4082252766680f993eb78cc8",
          "alias": "单女粉毛衣车厢忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the window inside the subway carriage, wearing a pair of exquisite round pink sunglasses framed in a delicate rose gold metallic material. The lenses reflect the blurred light and shadows inside the carriage and outside the window, exuding a gentle yet slightly detached aura. She wore a light pink short knit short-sleeve top with a clear, delicate vertical ribbed texture, three silver buttons at the chest, and a black satin bow necklace at the neckline, adding a touch of vintage and playful charm; She paired the bottom with a high-waisted black pleated midi skirt with smooth lines and a clearly defined waistline, fair abdominal skin, and a naturally rounded navel. Her left hand rested gently on the edge of the car window, while her right hand naturally hung at her side, her posture relaxed yet graceful. Outside the window is the flowing scene of the city streets. Through the glass, you can see the blurred pink building facades and distant greenery and trees. Sunlight streams in diagonally through the right window, creating a contrasting effect of light and shadow on her, while leaving soft shadow transitions on the other side, enhancing the sense of depth. The interior of the cabin features a blurred background, with faint signs on the ceiling, the silhouettes of passengers behind, and details like doors and handrails, creating an authentic atmosphere of everyday life. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure occupying the main visual center, the body slightly leaning against the window, forming a natural visual focal point that extends to the skirt and the view outside. The overall color palette is mainly soft pink, black, and gray, accented by warm yellow sunlight outside the window. The contrast is sharp yet not jarring, creating a fresh, artistic, and slightly urban lonely atmosphere. The layers of light and shadow are rich and delicate, with light coming from the natural light source in the upper right, forming warm backlit edges that make the figure's outline clear and the garment's texture clearly visible. The entire frame has a slight film grain texture and soft focus effect, as if captured by a regular phone or small camera during a daily commute. It is full of life and an unintentional beauty, combining the rushed pace of modern cities with the protagonist's inner peace and self-expression.",
