        {
          "id": "krea2-590fe732d532fbb3cb10dba9",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙沙发坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright in a modern, minimalist interior space, wearing a pure white short-sleeved polo collar dress with a delicate pleated hem, paired with matching high-top over-the-knee socks, adorned with delicate cross-lace decorations, giving the overall look a clean and crisp yet sweet feel; Under soft lighting, it presents a gradient of deep brown and light chestnut tones, adding a touch of laid-back and casual charm; She sits slightly to the side, legs crossed, hands naturally resting on her knees or sofa armrests, her posture relaxed and elegant, looking directly at the camera as if engaging in a silent emotional exchange with the viewer; In the foreground is the white leather sofa she sits on, with a smooth and delicate surface and smooth edges, its soft texture subtly echoing the figure's skin; In the middle of the scene, a cylindrical beige low bench rests quietly behind the sofa, with materials and tones highly consistent with the overall space. In the background is a wall finished with light wood grain, with fine and even texture. On the right, you can faintly see coffee machines and neatly arranged paper cups, hinting that this is a corner of the space that combines lifestyle with commercial functions; The entire composition adopts a symmetrical layout with the center slightly to the right, with the figures positioned at the visual center of the composition, and the lines of the sofa guiding the gaze to focus on the subject; The light and shadow treatment is extremely delicate, creating a soft transition between light and shadow, while leaving clear and soft shadows along the sofa's edges and leg contours, enhancing the sense of depth; The atmosphere creates a peaceful, comfortable, and slightly artistic everyday scene. Warm-toned lighting combined with wooden elements creates a cozy and healing spatial tone, with figures exuding a fresh and natural aura, as if a leisurely afternoon has just ended and is preparing for the next relaxed and pleasant moment; The colors are harmonious and unified, with moderate saturation, maintaining realism while featuring a slight soft-focus effect. It simulates the delicate image quality of shooting with high-end digital cameras or professional mode on a smartphone, with rich details but not overly sharp, presenting a realistic aesthetic style that almost feels cinematic.",
