        {
          "id": "krea2-3c64faf867f98103d3dede01",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔街道俏皮站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by a metal railing at a city street corner, looking directly at the camera, exuding confidence and a relaxed urban charm. She wore an off-shoulder cropped off-shoulder top with semi-transparent tulle cuffs that outlined her slender arms. She paired loose washed light blue jeans on the bottom, and the waist cleverly revealed her flat stomach, highlighting her healthy and energetic curves. Her left hand rests naturally on the railing, while her right hand gently grips a black chain shoulder bag, with the strap hanging down at her waist, blending street style with refined details. She stood right at the junction of the street and sidewalk, with a yellow asphalt road marked beneath her feet. Behind her stood a red brick building marked by the passage of time, its walls covered in patchy peeling paint and several air conditioning units. To the right was a concrete staircase leading upward, with the wall beside the steps covered in bright graffiti and bold blue, yellow, and pink letters, full of artistic tension and rebellious spirit. On the left side is a colorful taxi, with rainbow stripes and the word \"TAXI\" painted on its body, and the taillights creating a visual contrast with the car's reflections. The entire composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. The guardrail extends diagonally, with natural daylight that is soft and even, with light light that is light and light, creating a fresh and transparent atmosphere while preserving the authentic texture of the building and graffiti colors. The overall color tone leans toward warm saturation, with red walls and blue graffiti creating a strong visual impact. The garments have a natural glossy finish, presenting a style that combines street realism with a touch of fashionable blockbuster quality. It feels as if a high-end digital camera was shooting in the afternoon sunlight, with slight noise and realistic film graininess, capturing the momentary dynamic and free-spirited aesthetic expression of urban life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
