        {
          "id": "krea2-1231d0c7d16dc19ef26eb1ca",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙雪地困倦站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands gracefully in a soft, hazy sea of white flowers, wearing a light, flowing off-white sleeveless long dress adorned with elegant blue, pink, and green floral patterns. The sheer fabric gently drapes in the breeze, giving off a warm luster; On her head, she wears a natural flower crown woven from fine, pure white flowers and tender green branches and leaves. The petals are delicate, and the touch seems to feel the moisture of morning dew; She turned slightly to look back at the camera, her skin as fair and smooth as fresh snow; Her right hand gently holds a simple basket woven from natural wood willow branches, with a small piece of pure white ribbon tied at the rim. The basket is filled with freshly picked daisies and baby's breath, with plump and delicate flowers, yellow cores and white petals sparkling in the sunlight; In the foreground, several scattered clusters of white flowers appear faintly, and the blur treatment enhances the spatial layers of the composition; The center stage features her complete silhouette and the flower basket in her hand, becoming the visual focal point; The background features vast blurred flower fields of light green and white, with blurred light spots and soft color blocks creating a dreamy pastoral atmosphere; The composition uses a vertical center-right-leaning symmetrical layout, with the main subject positioned near the golden ratio point of the composition. Light comes from soft natural daylight above, creating subtle transitions between highlights and shadows. The overall color palette is mainly fresh mint green, creamy white, and pale blue, accented by warm yellow and pink-orange from flowers. The color saturation is low but rich in layers; The atmosphere of light and shadow is tranquil and poetic, as if you are in a secret garden undisturbed on a spring afternoon. The air is filled with the scent of grass and flowers, and the entire scene exudes a healing, artistic romantic vibe. It combines the refined texture of a professional studio with the lively realism captured unintentionally by everyday amateur equipment—slight noise or soft-focus marks at the edges of the frame, making viewers feel as if they are glimpsing this beautiful moment through the lens of an old film camera. The emotional tone is warm and pure, Full of vitality and sentiment, it makes one want to reach out and touch the withering daisy, or follow in her footsteps into this boundless flower dream.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
