        {
          "id": "krea2-0c0ed07042b5ecd5f87efd9a",
          "alias": "单女全裸窗边持相机",
          "prompt": "The dual camera modules are neatly arranged, fingers are long and slender, and nails are neatly trimmed to a natural nude color, with fingertips gently tracing the edges of the phone. In the foreground, she is holding a phone and part of her sleeve, while the background is a blurred indoor environment. The tone is warm gray, with soft light and shadow patterns on walls or curtains faintly visible, creating a strong sense of depth of field. The composition uses a slightly tilted vertical perspective, with the main figure occupying the center right of the frame. Light comes from the upper left, creating bright and soft natural light, creating warm highlights and subtle shadow transitions, creating an atmosphere like afternoon sunlight filtering through a window screen; The color scheme is mainly low-saturation gray-white beige, with a harmonious and unified overall tone with a slight film texture and soft-focus effect; The image is filled with a sense of tranquility, healing, and the beauty of everyday life, as if capturing a lazy afternoon girl immersed in self-recording. It combines the sweetness and liveliness of youth with a realistic sense of everyday life, featuring a strong cinematic and artistic photography style. It's as if shot with a high-end digital camera paired with a large-aperture lens, and after careful color grading and skin smoothing in post-production, it presents a dreamlike, gentle, and healing visual experience.",
