        {
          "id": "krea2-7742d49eed9c4c1390335e90",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫泳池俏皮站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A female student stands by the outdoor pool, wearing a white polo shirt with a blue collar and cuffs. There are three white buttons on the collar, a small green school emblem embroidered on the left chest, dark blue sweatpants, and a brown canvas strap bag slung across her shoulder. The overall look is clean and neat, full of youthful campus vibe. She wears a pair of slender round metal-framed glasses, showing off her neat, white teeth, her expression full of sunshine, vitality, and pure joy. Her right hand raises a blue coffee cup printed with the \"GBE\" logo, featuring an abstract swirling water ripple pattern. The black lid is tightly closed, and the cup is held above her head, exuding vitality and a sense of ceremony, as if announcing a lighthearted and joyful everyday moment to the camera or audience. Her left hand naturally hangs at one side of her body, her posture relaxed and relaxed. The foreground focuses on the main subject, with clear close-ups from the chest above to the head. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical style, with the figure standing in the center, maintaining a stable and prominent visual focus. The background is a blurred outdoor pool environment, with a light blue hue on the water surface, faintly visible tile lines, and in the distance light off-white building walls, creating a soft, cool-toned spatial depth. The light comes from soft, even natural daylight, which may be cloudy or diffused light in the early morning or evening. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is clear and tranquil, with the overall color scheme dominated by blue, white, and brown, creating a fresh, healing, lazy, and lifelike summer afternoon atmosphere. The visual guide line naturally extends upward from the figure holding a coffee cup, drawing the viewer's attention to the brand logo on the cup's surface. The entire image presents a highly refined commercial photography texture, with rich details, harmonious colors, and positive emotions, making it suitable for campus promotions, beverage advertisements, or youth-themed visual content. It also preserves the authentic graininess and slight noise typical of everyday amateur equipment, making the images more approachable and documentary, avoiding the false perfection caused by excessive post-processing. It conveys the simple joys and beautiful moments found in ordinary life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
