        {
          "id": "krea2-f25e740b52002d584103ba1d",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣公园俏皮倚靠",
          "prompt": "The makeup is delicate and soft, full and radiant. She wore a light gray-green vertical striped knit camisole top, adorned with a cute cartoon cat head embroidery on the chest. The cat's expression was adorably innocent, creating a playful contrast with her overall temperament; Layer it with black high-waist overalls, featuring a vintage metal buckle design. The gold metal reflects a warm luster in the sunlight, creating a textured contrast with the black suede material. Her hand gestures are highly expressive: her right hand is elegantly raised above her head, wearing a black-and-white bead bracelet and a diamond-encrusted ring; Her left hand bends naturally, her fingertips lightly tapping her chest, and a slender red woven cord bracelet is tied around her wrist, with a metal ring faintly visible. The entire composition uses medium to near near shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. The tilted angle enhances the dynamic beauty. In the foreground, her exposed shoulders, neck, and arm lines are visible; in the middle shot, the center focuses on clothing details and accessories; and in the background, dense green plants and scattered yellow flowers are blurred, creating a hazy, dreamlike depth of field. Light and shadow shine diagonally from the upper right, warm and layered, illuminating the skin while outlining the wrinkles of clothing and the three-dimensional metal clasps. The overall atmosphere leans toward a fresh and healing summer afternoon, with a slight film grain texture and moderate color saturation. The green background contrasts harmoniously with the characters' clothing, while preserving the realism of everyday shooting. It feels like capturing a moment of life aesthetics in a corner of a park with a phone or small camera. It combines the delicacy of a fashion blockbuster with the natural vitality of youth. Through hand movements, it extends into clothing details and ultimately settles into the background plant textures, forming a complete narrative loop. The visuals are full of breath and emotional tension. It evokes the beautiful moments of sunshine, gentle breeze, flowers, and youth.",
