        {
          "id": "krea2-5f709474b5c2d1ae9611933f",
          "alias": "单女短裙竹林沉思坐持相机",
          "prompt": "An Eastern woman dressed in a light beige sheer Hanfu with fabric that flows lightly like mist. The skirt hem features a sparse and elegant bamboo branch pattern in an ink wash style. The sleeves are semi-transparent, subtly revealing the contours of her skin. Her makeup is exquisite but not overly heavy, her expression calm yet tinged with a thoughtful gentleness and calm. Her right hand gently holds a simple, delicate teacup, while her left hand rests naturally on the edge of the dark wooden table. Her fingertips are slender and long, wearing a simple yet exquisite ring and nail polish. Display an elegant and composed demeanor; In the foreground is a low, dark wooden table with a heavy texture. The surface is smooth and delicate, with clearly visible grain. On the table sits a lit black candlestick, its flickering warmth and softness. Next to it is an elegantly shaped small white porcelain bottle, with a rounded and full body and smooth lines, and a slightly tapered mouth. The overall composition is shot from a low angle, while the slanted edge of the table guides the visual flow toward the main figure. The background features a typical Japanese or Chinese traditional lattice sliding door, with black-and-white vertical stripes forming a clean and orderly geometric frame. Behind the door, faint silhouettes of bamboo leaves can be seen outside the window, gently swaying in the breeze, creating a spatial layering of reality and void. The lighting throughout the scene is soft and even, with the main light source coming from diffused natural light from the left window edge, complemented by candlelight as warm accents, creating a contrast of cool and warm tones that enhance the soft texture of the figures' skin and the transparency of the clothing. The color palette is mainly off-white, gray-black, and dark brown, creating an overall atmosphere that is tranquil, poetic, restrained, and rich in Eastern aesthetics, as if you are in a courtyard teahouse far from the hustle and bustle, with time frozen in this moment. Only the gentle flicker of candlelight and the curling aroma of tea convey a Zen-like, leisurely aesthetic of living. The image texture is delicate and authentic, with rich details, as if shot by a professional studio using a high-end digital camera under soft natural light, presenting a highly realistic cinematic image quality. It combines the depth and emotional expression of artistic photography with the authentic touch and life atmosphere of everyday scenes.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
