        {
          "id": "krea2-c529914731270ee3ea377b47",
          "alias": "单女白礼服婚礼困倦站立",
          "prompt": "An elegant Eastern bride stands before the marble walls inside a modern building, wearing an exquisitely designed creamy white strapless mermaid wedding dress. The shoulders and waist feature numerous layered pleats and three-dimensional lace decorations. The edge of the light brown carpet beneath her feet is faintly visible. The background is a large marble wall made of mottled patterns of dark gray and dark green. The joints are clear, giving a rugged, cold feel. On the left is a dark brown wooden door frame with a red safety sign, creating a strong visual contrast with the gentle beauty of the figure. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of center of the frame, and the hem of the skirt extending to the lower left, creating visual balance; The light and shadow come from naturally scattered light from the upper right side, evenly and softly, while subtle shadows are cast on the left wall and skirt edges to enhance the sense of depth; The atmosphere is tranquil and ceremonial, combining the solemnity and elegance of a wedding with the intimate warmth of everyday life, as if capturing the moment about to enter the halls of marriage, filled with anticipation and happiness; The overall color palette is mainly cool gray and warm white, harmoniously unified without losing layers; The image style leans toward professional studio-level post-processing, but features a slight film grain texture and realistic lighting traces, simulating the natural transitions and detail noise of amateur equipment shooting, presenting an aesthetic expression that is both dreamy and close to reality.",
