        {
          "id": "krea2-584449ce377610b5de5645ad",
          "alias": "单女白礼服婚礼冷淡持相机",
          "prompt": "An elegant Eastern woman wore a finely designed white satin gown with exaggerated ruffled off-shoulder cuts on the shoulders. The skirt was layered and voluminous like clouds, adorned with intricate pearl strings that shimmered softly under the light. Paired with delicate crystal earrings, her makeup was clear and delicate. Looking directly at the camera, it seemed as if she was silently telling an inner story; Her hands gently held a large bouquet of pure white flowers—baby's breath. The flowers were small and dense, with slender green stems naturally sandwiched between her chest and shoulders, creating a gentle shade and visual balance. On her left wrist was a simple silver bracelet, and on her right ring finger was a sparkling ring. Her fingers were long and slender, and her nails neatly trimmed; The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the composition, composed in medium to close-up shots. The background is a dark gray marble wall or column structure with natural textures, with a slightly mottled surface, faint vertical lines dividing the space, and faint reflections, creating a cold yet sophisticated spatial atmosphere; The light comes from the front right of the figure, soft and directional, while creating delicate transitions between highlights and shadows on the skin, greatly enhancing the sense of depth and texture; The overall color palette is dominated by cool gray and pure white, creating a calm, restrained yet gentle visual contrast; The atmosphere of light and shadow is tranquil yet dramatic, as if capturing a moment about to reach an important moment—the eve of a wedding, the opening of a celebration, or a brief pause at a private party; The visuals present a professional studio-level texture while retaining the authentic warmth and breathing of everyday shooting. Without deliberately pursuing perfection, it is full of emotional resonance. It combines the refined composition and color control of artistic photography with the intimacy and realism of everyday scenes, making the characters the core carriers of emotional expression rather than mere image displays. Then, through the geometric framework formed by the gown's folds and background columns, attention is focused on the subject. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, restrained, and full of narrative quality, like a freeze-frame taken from a film or literary work—both concrete and abstract, inviting imagination about the stories and moods behind it.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
