        {
          "id": "krea2-d9fcec9f15e30d41c3029135",
          "alias": "单女外套沙发倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman lounges lazily against the soft white headboard or sofa backrest, her hairpin gleaming with a gentle metallic sheen in the sunlight. It exudes a quiet, restrained yet slightly fragile beauty. She wore a fluffy, soft plush jacket with a warm cream white collar and cuffs, paired with a pink and light blue striped knit sweater underneath. The fabric was thick and textured, presenting soft pleats and layers under the light. Her hands rest lightly on the edge of the bed or sofa, her posture relaxed yet elegant. Her body leans slightly forward, her head naturally resting on a soft white pillow, her whole body enveloped in soft light, creating a homely, comfortable, and peaceful living atmosphere.",
