        {
          "id": "krea2-179404485ff3baa835724a01",
          "alias": "多人摄影棚忧伤注视",
          "prompt": "The foreground area is dominated by a large white headboard or sofa backrest occupying most of the left side of the painting. Its clean geometric lines and pure white tones create a strong visual guide, naturally directing the viewer's gaze to the main figure on the right. In the corner below the backrest, a cute green Christmas tree-shaped pillow is placed, embroidered with colorful dots in yellow, pink, purple, and blue, adding a lively festive atmosphere and lifestyle fun to the scene, while also serving as a visual balance point and enriching the composition. The middle ground is the bed or sofa area where the figure is located, with white quilts overlapping with plush jackets, with delicate and soft textures. Light and shadow flow across the surface, creating a visual rhythm of transitions between light and shadow. In the background is a bright window with a white frame, clearly visible on the pane. Light outside filters through the translucent sheer curtains, creating a soft and even backlight effect. The light from the window outlines the figures, casting hazy halos and fine light spots and shadow streaks on the floor and objects, enhancing the sense of depth and realism in the space. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward shot, making the characters appear more approachable, three-dimensional, and visually impactful. The left side of the frame has a large blank space, while the right side is center-right, creating an asymmetrical yet harmonious visual balance. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is mainly warm tones, with sunlight shining from the sides and rear, creating soft contour and volumetric light. At the same time, contrasts of light and shadow in the background and foreground create a lazy and tranquil atmosphere in the early morning or afternoon, carrying a subtle sense of nostalgia and healing. The color palette is mainly based on soft neutrals such as white, beige, and cream, accented with small areas of bright pink, blue, and green. The overall tone is warm and comfortable, full of a lively atmosphere. The image is delicate and detailed, offering studio-level lighting accuracy while preserving the realism of everyday home environments. It feels as if shot with amateur equipment, but its effective use of light and shadow makes it highly artistically appealing, conveying a tranquil, gentle, and slightly lonely youthful aesthetic, allowing people to feel the warmth and tranquility under the winter afternoon sun.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
