        {
          "id": "krea2-b52e39adb332f18e69796273",
          "alias": "单女制服城市害羞站立叉腰",
          "prompt": "A youthful figure stands under the corridor of a modern urban park, dressed in a refined Japanese-style sailor uniform. The overall color scheme is soft off-white, accented with dark brown stripes and polka dot decorations. A full, fluffy dark brown polka dot bow is tied around the chest, and the double fine stripes on the collar and cuffs outline a classic preppy silhouette. The left breast pocket faintly shows the word \"Cool\" embroidery. Her posture was confident yet slightly playful, standing upright with hands on hips, slightly tilting her head back to look at the camera, with a hint of innocent yet slightly shy smile, as if she had just basked in sunlight. The ground beside her feet was a mix of dark gray tiles and wooden pathways, with a few fallen leaves and a small black bag scattered nearby, hinting at the casual vibe of everyday campus life. The background features a modern building framed by greenery, with metal columns and wooden lattice windows forming geometric lines. In the distance, neatly trimmed trees and lush foliage create a vibrant natural atmosphere. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting dappled light and shadow, creating a soft transition of light and shadow between the ground and the figures. In the foreground, her skirt hem and arm lines are clear, the pleats are distinct, and light and shadow flow across the fabric, highlighting the texture of the fabric. The composition is shot at a slightly upward angle, making the figure appear more upright and charming, with the main body centered slightly to the right. The framed composition formed by the columns on both sides enhances the sense of depth in the image. The overall lighting is natural daylight, soft and even, without strong shadows, creating a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The color tone leans toward warm yellow tones with a slight film graininess, simulating the realistic texture of amateur equipment shooting. The edges of the frame are slightly blurred to enhance the subject's prominence. The entire scene exudes a fresh and sweet youthful atmosphere, full of the dreamy vibe and everyday warmth of Japanese campus idols. It features carefully designed clothing details and environmental arrangements while preserving the casualness and naturalness of real life. Like a beautiful moment captured unintentionally, it allows people to feel the vitality, innocence, and gentle power of youth.",
