        {
          "id": "krea2-a0a2b54bfc6c4215240bcfed",
          "alias": "单女白礼服户外困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in an elegant white gown stands on the sunny grass outdoors, wearing a delicate light blue tulle wide-brimmed hat with a light and flowing brim, tiny pearl earrings hanging, and a watch with a silver metal strap on her wrist that is clearly visible. The overall look exudes a noble aura blending vintage and modern elements; Her gown was exquisitely designed, featuring a cropped waist-revealing top, a wide ruffled shawl on the shoulders, adorned with several delicate three-dimensional floral decorations. The waist was tied with a matching satin bow, and the hem was a voluous A-line long skirt. The hem was layered and light as clouds, with a faint pale blue lining at the hem. The hem naturally fell to the ground, gently fluttering in the breeze, as if merging with the earth. She stands slightly to the side, her left hand gently caressing her skirt, her right hand naturally resting at her side, her posture composed and sculptural, as if gazing into a beautiful moment in the distance; In the foreground are sparse wild grasses and withered grass spikes; slender stems and fuzz appear in warm golden tones under the sunlight, and some grass leaves gently touch the edges of the skirt, adding realism and depth to the scene; The middle shot fully presents her slender figure and the hem of her skirt, with smooth and graceful lines from waist to ankles, light and shadow creating delicate transitions between the pleats of the skirt, highlighting the garment's three-dimensional structure and texture; The background is a dense green forest, where leaves form mottled circular light spots under strong light, creating a dreamy out-of-focus blur effect. The sky is cut into bright white areas by the gaps between leaves, creating a clear and fresh summer atmosphere; The composition adopts a vertical full-body perspective, with the figure centered slightly to the left, maintaining a stable and dynamic visual focus. The skirt hem extends downward to occupy the lower half of the frame, forming a solid visual foundation while guiding the gaze upward to focus on the figure's head and hat; Visual guidance lines naturally converge from the hem edges, arm lines, and head contours to create emotional resonance; Light comes from the upper right, a soft slanting sunlight that enhances the sense of depth and drama. The edge of the skirt shimmers softly against the backlight, as if coated with a layer of silver trim; The overall atmosphere is tranquil and dreamy, with a subtle nostalgic filter, like a perfect blend of classical oil painting and modern photographic art. The colors are mainly pure white, clear blue, and vibrant green, accented with warm golden light and shadow, creating a poetic beauty that is both noble and elegant yet close to nature. The entire scene is strongly cinematic and story-driven, as if freezing an elegant afternoon about to unfold.",
