        {
          "id": "krea2-92f6a0bc168e1320df7622ae",
          "alias": "单女礼服窗边微笑倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully leans against the stone low wall beside a classical fountain, wearing a smooth champagne-colored satin gown that naturally falls to the floor. The slightly asymmetrical pleated lines on the shoulders add a modern and relaxed vibe. She wears exquisite round gold earrings and a slender bracelet that glows gently in the sunlight. Her posture was relaxed and confident, her left hand lightly resting on the rough edge of the bricks, while her right hand naturally rested on the hem of her skirt, revealing a quiet and gentle smile. In the foreground, lush green grass and dappled stone walls illuminated by sunlight appear. The leaves display vivid green layers under the light, and some areas create contrasts of shade and depth, enhancing the three-dimensional effect of the composition; The middle scene depicts the interaction between the main figure and the fountain. The fountain is made of off-white marble, with a retro and elegant design. The top is decorated with sculptural decorations, and water slowly drips from the top, forming crystal-clear droplet trails under sunlight. The mist spreads through the air to create a refreshing sensation; The background is a courtyard building full of French style, with walls in warm yellow tones, white window frames, and a cluster of blooming purple wisteria hanging above the windowsill. The flowers are dense and lush, forming a vivid contrast with the blue awning. In the distance, teal iron tables and chairs and neatly trimmed shrubs can be seen. Further away, lush trees and a deep blue sky with sparse white clouds are present. The overall composition is shot from a slightly overhead angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the left and the fountain occupying the left visual focus. The blank area on the right is filled with plants and architecture, creating visual balance; The visual guiding lines of the painting are composed of the vertical structure of the fountain, the direction of the characters' arms, and the dynamic trajectory of the water. In terms of lighting and atmosphere, intense sunlight slants down from the upper right, casting clear and soft shadows on the characters' skin, fabrics, and environmental objects, creating a warm, bright, and textured overall tone. The interplay of highlights and shadows at the fountain enhances the texture of the materials; The overall color palette is dominated by earth tones, complemented by the green of plants, purple of flowers, and blue accents of buildings, creating a harmonious and layered color scheme. The visual style combines cinematic feel with the authentic texture of everyday photography, rich and delicate details, with slight film graininess and natural color deviations, as if captured by a high-end digital camera in the afternoon sunlight. It combines the exquisite composition of an artwork with a casual, authentic sense of everyday life.",
