        {
          "id": "krea2-2c1dd1e666a8df3e7e99aa85",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫广场困倦站立回眸",
          "prompt": "A female student stands outdoors under the dappled shade of sun-dappled trees, adding a touch of playfulness and vitality; She was slightly turning to the side, glancing back at the camera, her overall aura fresh and refined, like a youthful poem unexpectedly encountered on campus. She wore a refined Japanese collegiate outfit: underneath a crisp white shirt with a neat and defined neckline, light pleats at the cuffs, and a light gray knit sleeveless vest with clearly visible fabric texture and black fine stripes along the edges, creating a rich yet minimalist layering; A gray-blue plaid tie is tied around the neck, draped across the chest, infusing the overall look with a touch of British retro charm; Paired with a dark pleated skirt on the bottom, the tailored fit exudes youthful energy. On her left shoulder slung a heavy, thick black leather backpack. The bag has a classic square shape, with metal fasteners reflecting a cool sheen in the light, contrasting sharply with the soft clothing, hinting that she is preparing for or just finishing a campus walk. Her hands gently hold a fluffy, soft white plush pouch as if it were a pet or a decoration, adding a touch of warmth and healing to the scene. The foreground focuses on the main subject, clearly visible from the chest to the ankles; the background is a dense bokeh with blurred greenery and mottled light and shadow. The leaves on the left form dreamy circular light spots (Bokeh) under strong light, while a bright white column structure faintly visible on the right, possibly a corridor column or wall, creates a sense of spatial depth. The composition uses the classic rule of thirds, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, creating visual balance and a sense of breathing; The shooting angle is slightly upward, making the figure appear more elegant and upright. Light comes from the upper left of the painting, soft afternoon natural light filtering through the gaps in the leaves, while the background is heavily exposed to create a \"halo\" effect, enhancing the lazy and tranquil summer afternoon atmosphere. The entire photo features fresh and elegant gray, white, and green tones, complemented by a black leather bag as a visual anchor. The colors are harmoniously unified, presenting a gentle and hazy beauty with a hint of Japanese film filter texture. It features professional studio-level precise lighting and post-production color grading, while retaining the authentic graininess and everyday atmosphere of everyday amateur equipment. The images are full of narrative quality—as if capturing the moment of a girl quietly waiting to be discovered in a corner of the campus after school, combining artistic beauty with close to real life. It inevitably makes one imagine where she is headed.",
