        {
          "id": "krea2-448792649b32c91695f556bb",
          "alias": "单女紫旗袍茶室冷淡坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a luxurious purple modified qipao sits gracefully in a vintage and luxurious interior. The main color of the qipao is deep violet, embroidered with delicate golden floral patterns. The shoulders and neckline are cleverly adorned with golden beaded mesh tulle, as light as a flowing galaxy. Her makeup is fresh, and she slightly lowers her head to gaze at the white porcelain teacup in her hand. The cup is decorated with pink classical patterns, and the tray is designed in the same style. Her hands are slender and elegant, and on her left wrist is a simple pearl bracelet. Her fingertips lightly touch the rim of the cup, her posture calm and focused; In the foreground is a round table covered with a dark purple velvet cloth, with another set of identical tea sets on the table. The edges of the metal tableware gleam coldly, and the tabletop texture is clearly visible; In the middle is the carved chair she sits on, with the back covered in intricate floral embroidery patterns, vibrant and echoing the background wall; The background features a massive Eastern court-style mural set against a warm gold background, featuring large peonies, roses, and other flowers. The petals are layered, with colors gradient from pinkish-white to golden yellow, and leaves deep and deep green. The overall scene is filled with a strong sense of Eastern art and noble atmosphere; The composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, naturally drawing the gaze toward the teacup in their hand, creating a visual focal point; The camera is slightly tilted, creating an immersive narrative experience; The light and shadow are soft and layered, highlighting the texture of the skin and the details of fabric folds, while the background mural is slightly blurred to enhance the subject's striking effect; The overall atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, blending classical aesthetics with modern fashion. It feels like being in a private tea room in a luxurious castle, where time seems to freeze. The air is filled with a faint scent of tea and silky textures. The whole scene exudes a noble, restrained, and poetic Eastern charm, like a meticulously painted oil painting. Every detail is meticulously polished, presenting a sense of refinement and authenticity akin to the near-perfect everyday amateur equipment for shooting. It makes one imagine this is a private moment captured by a professional photographer, yet it carries a touch of everyday warmth and intimacy.",
