          "id": "krea2-d0fb2c52bd0c4f1e6ee2864b",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙森林愤怒站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman is the absolute subject of the painting, adding a touch of vitality and authenticity; It reveals a quiet and reserved emotional state; She wore a white high-neck, long-sleeved dress or shirt, made of light, flowing fabric, covered with delicate blue-purple daisy patterns. The petal edges were softly blended, the flower centers dotted with pale yellow, and the overall print was fresh and artistic, harmonizing well with the surrounding environment; She wears small, simple pearl earrings, which reflect a gentle glow in natural light; The foreground is the upper middle part of her body, occupying the main visual area from the chest to the head. The garments have rich folds and layers, and light and shadow create delicate transitions on the fabric; In the middle of the ground, the forest and vegetation blur behind her, with thick and upright trunks arranged in vertical lines, dense deep green leaves, softly blurred under the shallow depth of field, and scattered purple wildflowers on the ground, adding a splash of color; The background is a deeper forest space farther away, with interwoven branches and leaves creating a natural frame, with light filtering through the gaps casting mottled light spots, creating a quiet and mysterious forest atmosphere; The composition uses a center-to-right approach, with the character's head slightly tilted to the left and the gaze downward, forming a visual guide line leading downward. The rule of thirds is used to place the figure on the right third of the frame, leaving blank space on the left to enhance breathability; At the same time, background blur treatment enhances the subject's prominent effect; The lighting atmosphere presents soft, natural scattered light, with the light source coming from the upper left position, creating contrast between light and dark without glaring, and soft transitions of shadows, enhancing the sense of depth; The overall color scheme is dominated by cool green tones, paired with white and blue prints on the characters' costumes, creating a tranquil, poetic, and slightly melancholic spring afternoon atmosphere. It feels like being in a private, undisturbed garden, with the air filled with the scent of moist soil and grass. The entire scene exudes a film-like texture, as if shot with an old-fashioned digital camera under natural light, with slight noise and low color saturation, creating a realistic feel. The image presents delicate emotional tension and a lifelike aesthetic expression.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
