        {
          "id": "krea2-fc59bac8918409dbecad01ae",
          "alias": "单女绿高领衫城市冷淡持相机",
          "prompt": "She wore an elegant mint green or light teal turtleneck shirt made of lightweight, semi-transparent fabric with delicate vertical pleats, creating a silky glow under the light. The neckline was tied with a matching silk scarf that naturally flowed above her collarbone, adding an elegant layering touch. The front of the shirt has several small white buttons arranged in detail, with exquisite details. The composition uses the classic rule of thirds, with the figure's head positioned slightly toward the center on the right side of the frame, and the body extending diagonally to the lower left corner, creating a dynamic visual balance. The background features minimalist pure white walls, with faint horizontal lines or plaster lines decorating the wall, creating a sense of spatial depth without overpowering the main focus. The foreground mainly consists of the subject's neck, shoulders, and the texture of clothing; the middle ground is the area above the chest, where clothing folds and light and shadow variations are rich, serving as the visual focal point. The background is simple and clean, preserving only the wall texture and colors to enhance the prominent effect of the main subject. The overall composition emphasizes the contrast between vertical lines and soft curves, jointly creating a harmonious and unified rhythm in the painting. The use of light and shadow is extremely meticulous, with the light source coming from the front left of the character, soft and even, avoiding strong shadows and creating a transition between large smooth highlights and subtle gradient shadows. When light penetrates the fabric, it creates transparency and delicate reflections, enhancing the texture's realistic tactile feel. The atmosphere presents a serene, restrained, artistic, and slightly detached aesthetic, as if you are in a study bathed in afternoon sunlight or a quiet café corner, full of poetry and storytelling. The colors are mainly cool tones, with light teal, white, beige, and dark brown forming gentle contrasts. The overall tone is low saturation, with smooth transitions between light and dark, creating a sense of sophistication and emotional immersion. The image texture pursues realistic and delicate photographic expression, similar to professional camera shooting under soft natural light, featuring film-like graininess and soft-focus edge treatment, while retaining slight atmospheric blur to enhance spatial layers and dreamlike atmosphere. The entire image conveys the intellectual beauty, serene temperament, and inner strength of modern urban women, offering the depth of artistic portraiture while closely capturing authentic and aesthetically pleasing moments in everyday life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
