        {
          "id": "krea2-1a0c6dba5031742a3241f7d8",
          "alias": "单女绿旗袍花园冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "An Eastern woman stands in a classical Chinese garden, dressed in an elegant olive green sleeveless qipao. The fabric is delicate and smooth, featuring a texture of plant leaf veins and subtle relief patterns of varying shades, glowing with a silky luster under natural light; The neckline is adorned with delicate red frog buttons and a small golden butterfly brooch, with a tight waistline outlining a graceful figure. Sunlight casts mottled shadows on their uneven surfaces, creating a textured contrast with the figures; In the middle is where she stands, with a simple blue brick arch bridge behind it. The bridge is smooth and rounded, with tiles layered and partially hidden by lush greenery. The bridge is paved with a white cobblestone path that winds into the distance; The background is dense shade of green trees, sunlight filtering through the branches and leaves, casting countless circular light spots, creating a dreamlike blurred effect. In the distance, a pool of emerald water can be faintly seen reflecting the sky and clouds, creating an ethereal and profound sense of space; The composition uses a medium-shot portrait frame, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, body slightly turned to the side, gaze directly reaching the viewer, creating a strong emotional resonance; The visual guide lines are constructed by the diagonal movement of the rocks in the foreground, the curved contours of the bridge in the middle ground, and the vertical layers formed by the trees in the background. Light comes from the upper left, creating a three-dimensional and warm transition of light and shadow, while the shadowed areas retain delicate details without feeling heavy. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, full of Eastern classical aesthetics. It has the charm of ink wash painting with the subtle texture of modern photography, like a lady painting stepping out of a historical scroll, carrying the moist atmosphere and cultural depth of Jiangnan gardens. It is neither a staged scene nor a cold commercial promotional image, but a real moment captured during everyday amateur photography—the natural blurred edges caused by slight camera shake, the hazy feeling of clothing folds not fully focused, and the overly blurred halo edges of the background. All these infuse the image with a warm, everyday warmth, allowing one to feel the photographer's leisurely mood as he unintentionally presses the shutter in the afternoon sunlight. The entire image exudes a poetic beauty of \"time paused,\" like a silent prose poem quietly flowing through the lush green courtyard.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
