        {
          "id": "krea2-d8df93a2256c10e7c46adc32",
          "alias": "单女蓝围巾街道站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the middle of a city street, filmed from a slightly overhead angle. Her posture is naturally relaxed yet full of expressiveness. On top of her head, she wears a deep blue printed scarf with white vintage letters and patterns, adding a touch of street fashion to the overall look. She wore a simple, fitted gray body-fitting camisole that outlined her smooth shoulders and neck lines and a slim waist and abdomen. She paired it with classic washed blue denim shorts, with the waistband naturally rolled up, revealing a small section of her waistline and navel, highlighting youthful energy and a healthy physique. On the left shoulder is a boldly designed backpack, with a black and white body accented with abstract geometric patterns in red and blue. The shoulder strap is wide and comfortable, giving the whole style a distinctive and modern urban vibe. The background is a wide, smooth asphalt pavement, with clear white arrow traffic markings and solid yellow roadside lines. In the distance, blurred green belts and low shrubs can be seen, suggesting this is a clear daytime urban road environment. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered as the main visual focal point. In the foreground, the raised arm and the corner of her backpack are in the middle; in the middle is her upper body and shorts; and in the background, the road and vegetation stretch into the distance, creating a clear layering and a sense of depth. Light comes from natural daylight, softly and evenly casting on the figures. The folds and shadows of the clothing transition naturally and realistically, presenting a warm and bright atmosphere. It creates a fresh, casual, and free-spirited street photo style with a strong sense of everyday life and life. It feels like a casual outdoor snapshot with a regular smartphone, yet through precise composition and light and shadow processing, it gives the image professional-level beauty and artistic tension, conveying a positive mood of youth, independence, confidence, and exploring the world.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
