        {
          "id": "krea2-7f7ba14252630da48e3657d5",
          "alias": "单女绿毛衣城市忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands with her back to the camera at the edge of a vast, endless green rice field. She wears a soft, fluffy dark green knit sweater paired with a dark brown short skirt, paired with white sneakers paired with black-and-white striped socks, and drapes a fabric bag with orange-red floral patterns across her shoulder. The overall look is full of youthful campus vibe and a retro artistic vibe. Her right hand gently held a plump, red-and-yellow apple, while her left hand held a bouquet of blooming orange-yellow daisies or gerberas. The center of the flower was deep brown, with layers of petals gently pressed against her chest, as if offering nature a gift to the earth. The rice leaves sway gently in the wind, and the layered green extends from the foreground all the way into the distance. In the distance, the mountains stretch gently and undulatingly, with soft contours shrouded in mist and clouds, showing a blue-green gradient from near to far. At the foot of the mountains, scattered village buildings can be faintly seen, with indistinct roofline lines like silhouettes in a dream. The sky is gloomy but not oppressive, covered by large grayish-white clouds, with soft and even light without strong direct beams, making the entire scene calm and poetic. The composition uses the classic rule of thirds, with the figure positioned about one-third to the right of the painting, and the gaze facing the mountains and fields to the left, creating a spatial tension that explores the unknown and quietly contemplates; The wooden boardwalk in the foreground naturally focuses the gaze on the subject, while also enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The visual guide line consists of the characters' postures, the bouquet in their hands, and the apple, hinting at the continuity of the story and the flow of emotions. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is presented as a \"cloudy diffuse light\" effect, with soft, cool light evenly cast over figures and scenery, avoiding harsh shadows and enhancing the emotional intensity of the image—neither the joy of bright sunshine nor the oppressive pressure of an impending rainstorm, but rather a touch of melancholy, tranquility, and nostalgia, like a slow-paced lyric poem. Color use emphasizes harmony and contrast: the vast emerald green rice fields form a visual unity with the figure's sweater, while the bouquet's warm orange and apple's red-yellow accents stand out in cool backgrounds, creating visual focal points; The characters' blue headbands and white sneakers serve as a balancing point between the top and bottom of the frame, infusing the scene with lively energy. The entire image is delicate in texture and rich in detail, with a strong cinematic feel and film grain texture, as if shot with an old-fashioned digital camera in the early morning or evening. It combines the refined composition of professional photography with the casual realism of everyday life, creating a healing aesthetic atmosphere of \"urban escape from the noise and embracing nature,\" evoking the power of growth, freedom, innocence, and inner peace.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
