        {
          "id": "krea2-b64445e77b78326eb784448e",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙竹林害羞倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman, the absolute subject of the painting, exudes a playful yet slightly shy expression. Her left hand rests naturally on a wooden bench beside her, and she wears a slender gold bracelet on her wrist. Against the backdrop of a light blue spaghetti strap dress, she looks even more delicate. The dress is designed off-shoulder, with layers of ruffled pleats on the shoulders. The waist is cinched with drawstring details, and the skirt is light and flowing. The overall color is a clear mint green, with a delicate and soft texture that creates a lazy, comfortable summer afternoon atmosphere. The foreground focuses on the natural wood bench she leans on, with clearly visible grain and slight natural wear from use. At the edge of the chair, an orange-yellow drink with a straw in the mouth can be faintly seen, the cup reflecting light from outside the window; In the middle is the wooden platform where she stands and the blurred indoor space behind. The platform is made of thick solid wood boards joined together, with a simple and rugged structure. In the background, you can faintly see the outlines of wooden tables and chairs, as well as glass window frames. Outside the window is a lush tropical plant landscape, with tall green plants such as palm and bamboo scattered in scattered arrays, their leaves displaying varying layers of emerald green under the sunlight. The background is completely dominated by the natural environment outside the window, with water surfaces or courtyard areas appearing hazy and blurred, and in the distance, pink flowers can be faintly seen dotted throughout, adding a touch of gentle romance; The composition uses medium to close-up portraits, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, body slightly turned toward the camera, creating a subtle interaction between the gaze and the viewer. A bench in the foreground guides the visual flow toward the subject, while shallow depth of field treatment blurs the background, highlighting the subject while creating a sense of spatial depth; The visual guide line extends from the horizontal lines of the foreground wooden bench to the movements of the figure's arms. In terms of lighting and atmosphere, the overall light comes from naturally scattered sunlight outside the window, softly and evenly casting it on the figures, creating bright but not harsh highlights. The shadowed areas are soft and not stiff, creating a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The color palette is mainly fresh and elegant mint green, natural wood brown, and natural green, together creating a serene, healing, and life-filled artistic image. It feels like a real moment shot with everyday amateur equipment, yet through careful composition and post-production color grading, it presents a cinematic aesthetic.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
