        {
          "id": "krea2-e2ae5fd2fbc0986f14c8fcaf",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔街道俏皮站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors under the clear blue sky, wearing a bright red baseball cap embroidered with the white letter \"TB\" embroidered on the front. The slender waistline revealed her navel, highlighting a healthy and energetic figure; Paired with washed blue jeans on the bottom, a black leather belt tied at the waistband with a gold round metal buckle, giving a steady yet fashionable feel; Her left hand casually slipped into her pants pocket, her posture relaxed and natural, while her right hand hung naturally at her side; A bright red leather handbag is slung across the right shoulder, with a slender strap and a rounded, full body, creating a vivid and harmonious color contrast with the hat; The composition is shot from a low angle, with the subject occupying most of the space, fully visible from head to waist. The background is a pure, cloudless blue sky, and in the lower left corner, the outline of a light-colored bottle-shaped object can be faintly seen, suggesting it may be on the street or in a casual place; The overall light and shadow effect is strong and soft, casting naturally transitioning shadows on the sides of the body and on the folds of the clothing, enhancing the sense of depth and realistic texture; The atmosphere is filled with the lazy and pleasant atmosphere of a summer afternoon, combining youthful vitality with fashionable energy and a serene, serene poetic beauty; The use of colors is bold and harmonious, with the blue sky as the base, a red hat and bag as visual focal points, a white top providing a pure tone, and denim blue pants balancing the overall tone, creating a visual layer of warm and cool contrast that blends together; The visual guide naturally extends from the heads to the waist, then the hand movements guide the gaze downward to focus on the details of the jeans pockets. The image presents a highly realistic artistic photography style, like a professional camera capturing real moments under bright daylight. The rich and delicate details create a strong immersive visual experience, exuding a free, confident, youthful lifestyle attitude and urban leisure aesthetic.",
