        {
          "id": "krea2-55dc8ab72de7493f6a9e2ff9",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣医院困倦站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman is the absolute subject of the painting, wearing a form-fitting beige high-neck sleeveless knit dress with delicate vertical textures that create a soft texture under natural light; Add dynamism and softness; exuding a confident and composed temperament; Her left hand naturally hangs down, holding a brown hard-shelled folder with the words \"Phil Heights Hospital\" and \"Top Secret Files\" printed on the cover, creating a dramatic contrast; The right hand hangs naturally, fingertips lightly touch the edge of the folder, posture elegant and relaxed; A classic brown monogram handbag is slung across the left shoulder, with clearly visible straps and body details. A small red plush plush toy hangs at the opening, adding a playful and everyday touch to the overall look. The foreground focuses on the lower body of the figure and the folder they hold. The ground is paved with city streets, with some visible blue abstract graffiti lines winding and extending. The color contrast is strong but not jarring, enhancing visual guidance; The middle frame is the transition area between the full figures of the characters and the surrounding environment, including blurred street-side facilities, distant vehicle outlines, and faintly visible orange fire hydrants, creating a realistic urban atmosphere; The background is completely blurred, presenting circular light spots and bokeh effects formed by dense green trees. The distant outlines of buildings are faintly visible, suggesting the shooting location is located next to urban green belts or corner parks, giving the overall spatial layers rich and a sense of depth. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical portrait frame, with the figure standing centered and slightly leaning forward to create a subtle dynamic balance. The line of sight is parallel to the ground, avoiding a sense of oppression; The visuals use shallow depth of field technology, preserving only the clear and sharp subject of the subject. Both background and foreground elements are soft-focused, highlighting the subject while enhancing the artistic appeal of the image. It then extends to the blue graffiti lines on the ground, finally converging into the background blurred light spots, forming a natural and smooth visual flow. In terms of lighting, natural daylight is shone from the upper side, providing soft and even light, with the shoulder and arm contours outlined by side lighting to create a three-dimensional effect; Enhances material expressiveness; Dappled light and shadow transmitted through the gaps of background leaves create a dreamy halo in the blur, creating a warm contrast with the cool-toned ground in the foreground; The overall atmosphere combines the realism of urban daily life with surreal dramatic tension. The words \"Top Secret Files\" on the folder hint at some mysterious or suspenseful plot, forming a strong contrast with the characters' gentle and serene images, creating a narrative atmosphere that is both real and full of imagination. It feels like a key moment in an urban fantasy drama, with cinematic texture yet retaining a sense of everyday intimacy. The entire image presents a highly refined artistic photography style, as if captured by professional equipment during prime time on city streets, while still maintaining the casualness and genuine warmth of everyday life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
