        {
          "id": "krea2-602b1517b2c23660ec7c1bc3",
          "alias": "单女家中冷淡躲藏",
          "prompt": "The overall look is simple yet full of summer vibes, adding a touch of laziness and authenticity. She gently held a plump, ripe yellow mango in her right hand, as if about to taste or enjoying this sweet moment. In the foreground, a huge cylindrical beige lampshade cuts diagonally from the upper left of the frame, creating a dramatic visual effect of \"peeking\" or \"partially covered.\" At the same time, the lampshade emits a warm, even, soft light inside. In the middle of the frame, her exposed shoulders, arms, and abdominal curves are visible, with fair and smooth skin and clearly visible waist and abdominal lines. Details of the clothing, such as woven cord edges, slightly reflect under the light, enhancing the material's realism and tactile feel. In the background is a modern, minimalist interior space. On the right side is a light wood open bookshelf neatly arranged with several design and art books, such as \"Paris,\" \"The Other Book,\" and \"The Rise of David Bowie.\" The spines are vivid but not overpowering; Under the bookshelf, a dark wine bottle and a transparent wine glass can be faintly seen, hinting at a lifestyle and tasteful home environment. The entire composition adopts a tilted perspective and asymmetrical layout, with the lampshade serving as a strong visual guiding element, pressing from the upper left corner toward the center of the image, creating a dynamic balance. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is mainly warm, with diffused light from the lampshade creating a gentle feeling like afternoon sunshine. Meanwhile, the background wall and furniture display cool blue-gray tones, creating a subtle contrast of warmth and coolness that enhances the layering and emotional tension of the image. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, private, and full of lifestyle aesthetics. With professional studio-like exquisite lighting and composition, it feels like a scene captured from real life, full of breath and emotional warmth, rather than a deliberately staged commercial work. The color saturation in the painting is moderately warm and warm; the golden mangoes, the mint green of clothing, the creamy yellow of lighting, and the cool gray-blue background together form a harmonious and visually rhythmic color scheme that highlights the main subject while maintaining the storytelling of the environment. The entire image conveys a sense of \"slow living,\" \"self-pleasure,\" and \"small happiness\" urban femininity, as if stealing a moment of peace amid the busy life and rewarding one's senses and soul with a mango.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
