        {
          "id": "krea2-64d519b765d042354a317ed5",
          "alias": "单女庭院沉思坐",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a pale pink sheer Hanfu sits upright at a stone table in the outdoor courtyard. Her sleeves are light and semi-transparent, embroidered with delicate white butterfly patterns. Underneath, she wears a simple white strapless top. A blue petal-shaped hairpin is tucked into her bun. Her overall makeup is elegant and gentle, her fingertips gently stroking the petals, her posture serene and elegant, as if she were savoring the fragrance of flowers or pondering poetry. Before her lay a yellowed ancient book, its pages densely covered with small calligraphic calligraphy, and a corner of the scroll was tied with colorful ribbon tassels. The tabletop is made of a smooth dark gray material, highlighting the soft tones of figures and books. On the left side of the foreground are several clusters of plump, blooming cherry blossom branches, with layers of petals that are tender and beautiful, gently swaying in the breeze. Some petal edges have a slightly hazy, blurred effect. The background features blurred reflections of lakes or ponds, with shimmering water reflecting the blue-green tones of the sky and trees. In the distance, lush tree shadows and blurred white flower clusters can be faintly seen, creating a deep and tranquil spring garden atmosphere. The composition uses medium to near shots in close-ups. The main figure occupies the right two-thirds of the frame, creating an asymmetrical and balanced aesthetic. The camera is shot from a slightly overhead angle, highlighting the expressions and details of the book. The light and shadow are soft and delicate, naturally diffused from the upper and side areas. The folds of the clothing reveal subtle shadow layers, and the edges of cherry blossom petals are gently outlined by sunlight, creating a serene and poetic atmosphere, infused with the charm of Eastern classical aesthetics and the romantic feeling of spring. The colors are mainly pink, white, light blue, and gray-green, blending warm and cool in harmony, giving the image a delicate and authentic texture. Like shooting with a high-end professional camera during the golden hours of morning or evening, it features cinematic soft focus and depth control, presenting a dreamlike aesthetic and immersive narrative atmosphere, like a meticulous, vividly colored lady painting perfectly blending modern photographic art.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
