        {
          "id": "krea2-4955c8d13c1e812f3288e456",
          "alias": "单女蓝围巾忧伤站立持手机",
          "prompt": "The cuffs faintly showed brand embroidery, adding a touch of everyday life; A soft, fluffy light blue scarf coiled around her neck like a cloud, gently gathered by her hands, her fingertips trembling as if resisting the chill or soothing her heart. A few snowflakes scattered along the edge of the scarf, swaying gently in the chilly air; As if immersed in a silent memory or monologue; The foreground focuses on a close-up of her hand tightly clutching a scarf, with long, slender fingers, clean and unadorned nails, and a slightly curled palm, hinting at an emotional confinement or inner tension; The center frame shows her torso from chest to waist, with clearly visible pleats and button details on the black coat, fine snowflakes piled up on the collar, and the texture and light intertwining create a heavy, warm visual contrast; The background is a snowy forest rendered with blurred effects, where gray-white and dark green intertwine like misty shadows. Between the intertwined branches, faint snow covers the area, and in the distance, mist spreads. The layers are rich yet do not overshadow the main focus, intensifying the subject's sense of loneliness and immersive atmosphere; The composition uses medium to near shot close-up portraits, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center. The slightly tilted standing and lowered posture create a natural dynamic balance, which then extends to the blurred background to create a sense of spatial depth; Light and shadow use softly scattered light from the upper side to outline a soft, three-dimensional contour and enhance the material's expressiveness; The overall atmosphere is tranquil, cool, and poetic, with cinematic narrative and emotional tension. The color palette is mainly cool blue-gray, creating a \"gentleness in solitude\" theme; The image quality is delicate and realistic, similar to shooting with amateur equipment (such as a phone or entry-level camera) in natural light, retaining slight noise and uneven color transitions with graininess, simulating accidental moments captured in real environments rather than perfect post-processing; The entire scene exudes a lonely aesthetic reminiscent of artistic youth—not staged dramatic expression, but poetic slices of everyday encounters, allowing viewers to easily immerse themselves in the characters' emotional states and feel the fragile yet resilient resilience of life beneath the winter snow.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
