        {
          "id": "krea2-f9082b24673dc8dc9cc0958a",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫面包店冷淡站立持食物",
          "prompt": "A woman stands inside a modern minimalist café or boutique bakery, wearing a deep navy blue-style workwear shirt with slightly rolled cuffs, silver buttons on the chest reflecting a delicate sheen in soft light, paired with black shorts, creating an overall look that is sharp yet gentle; Nature falls on your shoulders, your expression calm and tinged with a hint of lazy satisfaction, as if you're immersed in a moment of tranquility and the temptation of delicious food; Her left hand gently holds a white square paper tray, on which sits a sliced caramel puff pastry bread. The golden, crispy crust contrasts sharply with the soft, moist filling, and a small bamboo skewer is stuck in the bread, hinting at the freshness of the oven. She slung a simple black handbag across her right shoulder, with the strap hanging naturally, creating a subtle and harmonious tone with her overall outfit; In the foreground is the light gray terrazzo floor where she stands, with clear textures reflecting the soft afterglow of the ceiling lights. To the left is the bar area, where a set of exquisite glass coffee utensils is displayed on metal stands, including a drip filter, measuring cup, and rubber air pump. Next to it is a yellow ceramic container and a cash register marked \"Cash,\" with the tabletop covered with menu text; The middle view is the space extending behind the bar counter, where several customers appear vaguely in the background—some chatting, some sitting upright—creating a real, everyday social atmosphere. On the right side is a row of clean white comfortable sofa seats with smooth lines, paired with a natural wood coffee table, faintly catching the reflection of lush greenery outside the window; The background features simple white walls and ceiling structures, while exposed industrial air ducts, embedded downlights, air conditioning vents, and surveillance cameras in corners together create authentic details of the urban space. A large-framed decorative mirror reflects warm-toned lighting and geometric lines in a corner of the interior, enhancing the sense of depth in the space. The composition uses a slightly slanted diagonal perspective, with the main figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame. The visual focus is stable and dynamic, and the bread in her hand naturally transitions into the background social scene; For lighting and shadowing, soft and even indoor ceiling lighting is used to avoid strong shadows. The layered folds of the clothes are distinct, and the surface of the bread displays a warm golden highlight, while preserving subtle contrasts of light and shadow in the environment, such as the shadows on the bar edge and the dark tones behind the sofas, creating a quiet, comfortable, and slightly artistic atmosphere; The overall composition exudes a sense of relaxation from everyday life and a blend of refined aesthetics, combining the calm rationality of urban space with the gentle privacy of personal enjoyment of food moments. The colors are mainly black, white, and gray, accented by blue clothing and the warm tones of golden-brown bread, creating a visual balance of cold and warmth, presenting a lifestyle moment that is both suitable for social media sharing and possesses the texture of artistic photography.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
