        {
          "id": "krea2-a68ddd283496bc700e570b02",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙摄影棚媚态持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a black, high-gloss patent leather bunny outfit reveals a blend of laziness and confidence when looking directly at the camera. Her outfit was a highly designed black patent leather dress, with a sleeveless halter cut on top. The chest was adorned with a delicate bow tie, the collarbone line cleverly revealed, and a metal belt at the waist to tighten the silhouette. The skirt was a voluminous short design with clear layers and pleated details, reflecting a strong texture under the light. Both hands wear elbow-length patent leather gloves, while the left hand rests elegantly against the pristine white wall behind her. Her fingers are slightly apart, casting clear and soft shadows where fingertips touch the wall. Her right hand hangs naturally at one side of her body. At her wrist, slim garter stockings and metal buckles are visible. Her legs are long and well-proportioned, with her thighs subtly bound and fixed by black leather straps, creating a striking visual contrast. The background features a pure white wall in classical style, decorated with symmetrical vertical grooves and horizontal decorative moldings, clean and simple, with no clutter or distractions. The wall material is fine and smooth, and the changes in light and shadow outline a three-dimensional structure. The entire composition uses a middle shot, with the figure occupying the center-left position. The slightly tilted body posture and head orientation create a dynamic balance. The foreground is visually guided by the contact area between the character's arm and the wall. Light comes from the upper left side of the painting, which is soft natural light or professional studio lighting, evenly casting on the figure, creating a natural transition between light and shadow in a three-dimensional effect. Especially on the patent leather material, it creates a highlight reflection, enhancing the material's sense of luxury and texture. At the same time, subtle shadows are cast between the walls and the figures' bodies, adding depth and spatial layers to the composition. The overall atmosphere combines fashion, sensuality, and artistry, blending Gothic aesthetics with modern trends. It is both alluring and retains an elegant temperament, presenting a sense of sophistication and mystery under cool tones. It feels as if you are in a high-end studio or private art space, with a texture as authentic and natural as shooting with amateur equipment, yet featuring professional-grade composition and color control. It perfectly captures the posture and emotional expression of the characters, conveying a sense of strength and confidence in tranquility.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
