        {
          "id": "krea2-9ce6a45aa5e6b270680c27df",
          "alias": "单女绿T恤户外坐持花",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor artificial turf football field, wearing a green sleeveless sports tank top with white \"BOSTON\" lettering and the number \"11\" printed on the chest, paired with black shorts and white high-top sneakers. Her posture is relaxed and natural, legs cross-legged, and her right hand gently holds a slender yellow flower stem. The flower is slightly tilted on the left side of the frame, with bright and full petals, as if a gentle poetry in her hand. The foreground focuses on details around her knees and ankles, with loose laces in her white shoes and shiny decorative nail nails adorning her nails that reflect a faint glow in sunlight, enhancing the image's sense of life and authenticity. The center frame is the complete contour of her body, clearly visible from shoulder to foot. The fabric texture is delicate, and the white stripes at the waist neck and sleeves contrast sharply against the green, enhancing the visual layer. The background is a football field surrounded by green fences, with a grid-like structure with faint trees and shrubs visible behind. Some areas are dotted with yellow wildflowers, and in the distance, a blurry goal net frame creates an open and tranquil sports atmosphere. The composition uses a slightly upward perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the center, leaving space on the left for the yellow flowers and the extended grassy lines, creating visual balance and guidance; At the same time, the white edges of the court are used as horizontal dividers, dividing the image into upper and lower zones, enhancing the sense of order. Light and shadow come from the upper side, soft and even, without strong shadows. Light filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating dappled shadows on the grass and adding a warm, lazy afternoon atmosphere to the scene. The overall color scheme is dominated by a rich green palette, complemented by white, black, and a touch of bright yellow. The color saturation is moderate, creating a fresh, natural, and vibrant summer campus or athleisure scene. The atmosphere of the painting combines youthful dynamism with quiet restraint and restraint. Through the detail of the figure holding a small flower, it cleverly conveys inner softness and a cherishing of the subtle beauty of life, possessing strong artistic appeal and emotional resonance. The image quality leans toward the style of everyday amateur equipment shooting, with slight noise and natural blur effects, preserving the graininess and breathability of real life rather than the over-retouched commercial blockbuster feel, allowing viewers to feel an unrefined innocence and freedom.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
