        {
          "id": "krea2-842cdd94d4b16de3d2b1f476",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫城市冷淡坐手持物",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in exquisite professional attire sits elegantly atop a massive white curved structure, which resembles a floating modern art installation or a minimalist architectural element, wrapping her body with gentle curves and serving as the central foreground support of the composition. She wore a tailored white long-sleeve shirt with a structured neckline, a small gold badge accented on the chest pocket, and a narrow black tie draped down her chest, creating a classic black-and-white visual focal point; Her lower body is a high-waisted black pleated short skirt, with a slim belt adorned with vintage geometric gold at the waist, outlining a clear silhouette at her slender waist; She wears a pair of black pointed high heels, with a row of dazzling rhinestones on the upper, reflecting a subtle sheen where the ankle touches the ground, adding a touch of luxury. Her hands naturally rest on both sides of the curved structure, with nails painted deep black polish, creating a cool contrast with the overall look. The composition uses medium to close shots, with figures occupying a position slightly above the center of the composition. The curved structure extends from the lower left to the upper right, while the background is a pure, flawless white drape curtain. Countless vertical folds create delicate texture layers, creating a dreamlike soft light environment and, together with the curved structure in the foreground, create a sense of spatial depth; Light comes from the upper front, evenly and gently casting on the figure, with shadows that are very light and naturally transitioning, enhancing the sense of depth without losing transparency; The atmosphere is tranquil and sophisticated, carrying the calm temperament of urban fashion and artistic photography, as if you are inside a studio full of design or futuristic exhibition space. The overall color palette is dominated by pure white and pure black, creating an extremely minimalist yet luxurious visual impact; The visuals present a carefully curated commercial fashion epic style, yet retaining the natural light and shadow transitions and realistic human proportions typical of everyday amateur equipment shoots. There are no excessive retouching marks, emphasizing authentic texture and emotional expression, as if capturing the model frozen in the moment of afternoon sunlight filtering through the curtains. It combines professional photography precision with a relaxed, casual beauty in everyday life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
