        {
          "id": "krea2-30f1a1aa0da80ccfe6041596",
          "alias": "单女毛衣城市冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "The short-sleeved cardigan features vertical stripes and metal button decorations, symmetrical pockets on the chest are richly detailed, and she pairs the lower half with a matching high-waisted skirt. At the waist, a brown leather belt is tied, and the silver metal clasp reflects gently in the soft light, outlining a slender waistline. Slightly wavy curls add softness; Her makeup is delicate and elegant, conveying a calm and confident aura. Her left hand rests lightly on the chair's backrest, her right hand naturally resting at her side, her nails neatly trimmed with deep black nail polish, and a slender gold bracelet on her wrist that flickers faintly in the light and shadow. The foreground focuses on her long leg lines and seat edges, with gray-white cushions contrasting with the warm wood grain for a textured effect; The middle shot shows her complete sitting posture and clothing details, with clear layers; The background is a minimalist interior space. The large floor-to-ceiling window on the left lets in soft, even natural light, the curtains are as thin as gauze, and the light is softened into a hazy halo. The right wall is clean and plain, with only a single light wood pillar serving as a visual guide, creating a tranquil, sophisticated, and undisturbed atmosphere. The composition uses a medium-near portrait perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, the body slightly tilted to create dynamic balance, and the chair extending diagonally to enhance depth in the image; At the same time, the waist belt, the curve of the chair backrest, and the lines of the legs create a smooth visual path. The light and shadow treatment is delicate and soft, with the main light source coming from the left window, creating a soft sidelight effect. At the same time, natural shadow transitions are created on the right shoulder and back, avoiding harsh contrasts between light and shadow; The overall color scheme is dominated by earth tones, blending camel, beige, and natural wood tones, complemented by the cool sheen of metal accessories, creating a warm, sophisticated, and reserved visual atmosphere. The visual atmosphere is tranquil yet artistic, as if frozen in a lazy afternoon or early morning, full of the independence and elegance of urban women, while preserving the authentic texture and life of everyday shooting. Without deliberately pursuing drama or excessive embellishment, it presents a true aesthetic of \"professional-grade amateur equipment shooting\"—highly controllable lighting and carefully selected environments, yet retaining the vitality and emotional warmth of naturally breathed images, evoking a low-key, luxurious, and comfortable lifestyle aesthetic.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
