        {
          "id": "krea2-aa61da8b332f8363c3c443b8",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫城市坐持手机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright on a white outdoor sofa chair in a modern urban street corner café, wearing a neatly tailored dark blue short workwear shirt dress. The cuffs and collar are adorned with silver metal buttons, highlighting a minimalist yet sophisticated fashion sense. Her legs are naturally crossed, her right hand lightly gripping a smartphone, her left hand casually resting beside her knee, and a classic black quilted chain leather bag slanted beside her. The material is delicate and glossy, perfectly complementing the overall look. In the foreground is a coffee table with clear natural wood grain, on which sits a light brown ceramic cup with coffee stains on the edge, and a QR code card attached to the bottom, hinting at the leisurely scenes of daily life; In the middle is the wide white sofa chair she sits on, with fluffy and soft fabric and smooth backrest lines. Beside it, transparent glass sliding doors reflect soft indoor lighting and blurred shadows. Inside the door frame are exposed concrete columns, creating a rugged texture that contrasts with modern design; The left side of the background extends into the city street, shaded by lush trees and lush branches. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting dappled shadows. In the distance, several cars and electric vehicles are parked, pedestrians hurry by, and along the street is an open-air seating area under a white sunshade. To the right is the café's interior space, where through the glass you can see white sofas, warm yellow wall lamps, and hazy human activity, creating a semi-open urban living atmosphere; The composition adopts a slightly top-down perspective, with the subject centered to the right. The front desk guides the viewer's focus on the figures, while the deep streets and architectural structures create a strong sense of perspective, enhancing the spatial layers of the composition; The visual guide line consists of the edge of the foreground table, sofa armrests, glass door frames, and the extending direction of the distant street. In terms of light and shadow, the main light source comes from natural daylight in the upper left, casting subtle shadows on the sofa and floor. Indoor light streams through the glass door, creating a warm contrast between the shoulders and the background. The overall atmosphere is calm and elegant yet retains urban vitality. The subtle film-like warm filter effect presents a daily yet artistic life moment, as if shot with amateur equipment but with post-processing color adjustment, rich in detail and emotionally rich, capturing poetic moments of contemporary urban women enjoying moments of leisure and self-expression on bustling street corners.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
