        {
          "id": "krea2-c0544e1a06526dcec4c05209",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤沙发俏皮坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright in the soft indoor light, adding a touch of lively vitality. She wears a blue-and-white vertical striped camisole layer, layered over a loose off-white workwear-style shirt. The cuffs are casually rolled up to reveal slender wrists, and the hem naturally drapes down and tied around the waist, creating a casual yet stylish style. The wrinkles and texture of the garments are clearly visible, especially the white piping on the edge of the spaghetti straps and the rich details of the natural folds on the shirt fabric. The middle shot extends below her waist, with the loose hem of her shirt scattered over the dark sofa or floor, the fabric soft and layered, and light and shadow creating subtle transitions of light and shadow on its surface. The background blur is handled with great skill, with faint visible white clothing or curtains, as well as warm-toned walls or furniture outlines, creating a cozy and comfortable home environment. The composition uses a classic center-biased portrait style, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, the gaze slightly turned to the right, and diagonal body postures (raised arms) to enhance the dynamic and visual tension of the image. It then extends into the background space, forming a complete and smooth visual pathway. The use of light and shadow is extremely refined, with the main light source coming from the left side or the upper front of the image, outlining a soft, three-dimensional contour and enhancing the skin's transparency and radiance; The shadows are carefully controlled to avoid harsh contrasts, giving the overall image a creamy and warm texture. The atmosphere is warm, tranquil, and healing, with a strong sense of \"everyday aesthetics\" and \"fragments of life\" narrative, as if capturing the moment when the afternoon sunlight streams through the window lattice, prompting the heroine to glance back unintentionally—full of authenticity and emotional resonance. It creates a fresh, natural, and non-overpowering visual experience, while the blue-green stripes on the camisole inner layer add a touch of vitality and visual focal points. The overall image exudes a highly realistic artistic photographic texture, with rich and delicate details and natural, soft transitions of light and shadow, as if shooting with a professional-grade camera in a natural light environment, yet preserving the subtle beauty and genuine warmth of everyday life, presenting a sophisticated imaging style that combines commercial aesthetics with personal emotional expression.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
