        {
          "id": "krea2-7f554a7bd475b625130fa312",
          "alias": "单女白浴袍手持物",
          "prompt": "She wears an elaborately crafted golden phoenix crown inlaid with turquoise, orange-red agate, and pearls. She wears a chest-length ruqun in warm orange tones, embroidered with gold-threaded peonies and entwined branch patterns, draped over a thin off-white gauze robe as thin as cicada wings. The cuffs and belt are adorned with pale blue silk ribbons, creating rich layers and a graceful flow. Her right hand gently lifted a corner of her gauze dress, her fingers slender and slender, and a jeweled bracelet adorned her wrist, her posture elegant and natural, as if immersed in the tranquility of a gentle breeze. In the distance, mountains overlap, the sky is clear and blue, and sunlight pours in from the side and above, creating a warm and bright backlight effect that outlines the figures while casting soft shadows on the ground and clothing. The entire composition uses the golden ratio, with the figure positioned slightly to the left, naturally directed to the right. The use of light and shadow is highly layered, while the shadows transition smoothly. The overall color palette is mainly warm orange, off-white, pale blue, and gold, creating an elegant, noble, and slightly ethereal atmosphere. Like a classical lady painting with meticulous brushwork, it combines realism and surrealism with artistic beauty, presenting a dreamlike, breathtaking visual feast, as if a peerless beauty stepped out of an ancient palace painting. As time passes, eternal beautiful moments are frozen in place. Every detail is meticulously crafted, filled with the rhythm and poetry of Eastern aesthetics. It carries a sense of historical weight while retaining the softness and vitality of modern aesthetics. The entire image exudes a strong classical romantic atmosphere, like a silent poem slowly flowing through the visuals, captivating the heart.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
