        {
          "id": "krea2-e4fc302be53156dc789ed2cd",
          "alias": "单女忧伤倚靠泼洒",
          "prompt": "Around her neck, a delicate black lace collar added a touch of mystery and classical dramatic tension; In the foreground, varying shades of ink smoke surge, surging and rolling from both sides of her body and below, forming swirling, splashing, and thread-like dynamic textures. Some areas show splashing ink dots and transitions at the edges of smudging, creating a strong visual impact and spatial layering; The middle shot shows her exposed shoulder and neck lines and upper body contours, clearly highlighted by the gradient of black, white, and gray light and shadow. Under soft light, her skin shows subtle contrasts of light and shadow, highlighting curves and fragility; The background is a pure, pale gray-white tone, almost invisible, with only faint ink residues at the edges of the frame. This blank space technique enhances the subject's presence and lonely atmosphere; The composition uses a vertical long format, with the figure positioned slightly to the center left, and the head extending upward to the upper third of the frame, forming a visual guiding line. The direction of smoke flow creates a sense of movement, wrapping the subject from bottom to top and guiding the viewer's gaze naturally following the pose; The visual guide begins with dense smoke in the foreground, then transitions along the body's contours to the middle shot, and finally converges in the blank background, forming a narrative rhythm of \"from chaos to clarity\"; The lighting and shadow treatment is extremely meticulous, with overall high-profile soft lighting that comes from a slightly higher front of the figure, creating soft shadow transitions while creating a layered interplay of light and shadow within the smoke, enhancing three-dimensionality and transparency. In terms of atmosphere, the entire image exudes a surreal fusion of poetic melancholy reminiscent of Eastern ink painting and modern art photography, combining the solitary elegance of classical aesthetics with the ultimate expression of emotion and form in contemporary images; The color palette is monochrome black and white, with only a few abstract blocks of deep red or dark purple dotted in certain areas (such as the chest or hem edges), serving as emotional outbursts and visual anchors, breaking monotony while reinforcing the theme; The image texture combines the hazy brushwork of painting with the sharp edges of the camera lens, simulating professional-grade digital camera shooting effects, with slight noise and film graininess to enhance realism and immersion; The overall style leans toward a combination of conceptual art photography and digital painting. It is neither fully realistic nor purely abstract, but rather a dreamlike expression that lies somewhere in between, emphasizing emotional resonance rather than physical reality, creating a visual experience that is both tangible and elusive, allowing viewers to feel the characters' surging emotions and the vast flow of their spiritual worlds.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
