        {
          "id": "krea2-21adcafe28a37a3a79f44ed8",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙花园忧伤倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman is the absolute subject of the painting, wearing an elegant off-white off-shoulder long dress with a naturally draped hem, and the shoulders adorned with delicate white rose ornaments, adding softness and a romantic touch; It glows with a gentle glow under soft light; She clasps her hands in front of her, gently clutching a heart-shaped rattan handbag. The natural texture of the material is clearly visible, injecting a touch of simplicity and a sense of everyday life into the overall look; She leans slightly against the thick wooden column, her posture relaxed yet slightly lazy, gazing into the lens, exuding a serene, reserved, and slightly melancholic Eastern classical beauty. The foreground features the lower half of her body and the heart-shaped handbag in her hand. The handbag is located in the lower center of the frame, and its warm natural wood color forms a subtle contrast with the skirt, serving as one of the visual guiding lines, drawing the viewer's gaze downward and focusing on the overall contour of the figure. The middle frame features a Chinese wooden railing structure that appears from her waist up to her head, as well as behind her, with a geometric hollowed-out pattern with simple, rustic lines that create a sense of spatial depth and cultural atmosphere; The background is rendered into a shallow depth-blur effect, presenting dense green vegetation and interlaced tree trunks and branches. The leaves are rich in layers, light and shadow are mottled, and distant stone steps or waterfront outlines can be faintly seen, creating a tranquil and profound garden atmosphere; The entire composition uses the classic three-part layout, with the figure positioned near the golden ratio point of the composition, body slightly tilted, creating a dynamic and balanced aesthetic. In terms of lighting and atmosphere, the overall lighting is naturally scattered, soft and even, without strong direct shadows. The pleats of the skirt have a slight transition of light and shadow, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality; Light spots filtering through the background leaves fall like scattered gold, injecting lively energy into the scene. The color palette is mainly a blend of warm and cool green and off-white, accented with woody brown, creating an overall atmosphere that is fresh, elegant, and slightly nostalgic poetry. It combines the exquisite composition of modern photography with the tranquil atmosphere of traditional Eastern gardens, resembling a contemporary female portrait in an ink wash freehand painting, full of artistic appeal and the poetic beauty of everyday life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
