        {
          "id": "krea2-029e8230a1a14603649515e6",
          "alias": "单女礼服摄影棚困倦坐注视",
          "prompt": "An elegant Eastern woman sits upright on a classical rattan armchair, wearing a luxurious gown that transitions from top to bottom. Her upper body is made of dazzling white sequin fabric like a galaxy, while her lower body transitions into a deep blue-black gradient sequin skirt as deep as the night sky. On the right edge of the chair is a small bouquet of pale pink rose branches, with budding petals that add a touch of romance. In the background is an old-fashioned double-leaf window with green frames. The panes are distinct, and you can see the reddish-brown tiled roof outside. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the curtains into the room, creating a dramatic contrast of light and shadow between the walls and the figures. The curtains are thin, transparent white gauze curtains that gently flutter in the wind, creating delicate refractions and transmission of light and shadow on them; The entire composition uses the golden ratio ratio, with the main figure positioned slightly to the right, and the gaze naturally extends out the window, creating a tranquil and contemplative mood; Light mainly comes from the left window, creating a strong side backlight effect. The sequins on the skirt sparkle like stars under the light, creating a dreamy and poetic visual effect; The overall color palette is dominated by warm brown, dark brown, dark green, and silvery white, with sharp contrasts of cool and warm without conflict. The rich and delicate layers of light and shadow present an artistic atmosphere reminiscent of a high-end cinema or professional studio shoot. It combines the warmth of daily life with a sense of ritual and solitary beauty. It feels like at a dusk, she waits alone for someone or something to pause for a moment. The entire scene exudes a tranquil, elegant, and slightly melancholic artistic atmosphere, with extremely rich visual details. From the textures of clothing to the wood textures to the transitions of light and shadow, everything is handled with remarkable finesse and realism, like a carefully composed film still.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
