        {
          "id": "krea2-b8f4cd551860a9037590e55f",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙酒店回眸",
          "prompt": "A graceful Eastern woman exuded confidence and composure. She wore a boldly designed and highly modern black spaghetti strap dress made of smooth, delicate velvet or faux leather. The skirt was tailored to fit the curves, and the chest and waist were decorated with multiple golden metal rings forming a hollowed-out structure, which not only highlighted her body lines but also remained fashionable and avant-garde. Wear a multi-layered pearl necklace around her neck, paired with a necklace featuring a large pearl pendant and metal ring elements, and also wear a string of pearls on her wrist. The overall accessory cleverly blends vintage luxury with modern industrial style. Her right hand gently rested on the edge of a dark brown wooden round table, her fingertips slightly curled, her posture elegant and relaxed. The foreground features a blurred desktop edge with a light yellow woven texture, guiding the viewer to focus on the subject; The middle frame shows her posture from waist to legs, with a faintly hollowed-out design extending to the thighs at the hem, creating a layered transition with the background; The background is a warm golden pleated curtain, thick and soft fabric, with light and shadow flowing between the folds, creating a rich indoor atmosphere. The entire shot uses close-up composition, with the figure slightly turning to the side and looking back at the camera, with the head tilted at just the right angle, creating a strong visual focal point. Light comes from a soft, warm source on one side, creating a contrast of light and shadow that highlights three-dimensional silhouettes, while the metal rings on the black clothing reflect specks of light. The shadows are well handled, preserving details without disrupting the overall atmosphere. The entire scene is enveloped in a warm, private, and slightly lazy atmosphere, as if at dusk in a luxury hotel suite or private club. Light and shadow intertwine, with a unified warm golden tone that creates an artistic beauty that is sophisticated and sexy without being exaggerated. It combines cinematic narrative tension with the authentic texture of everyday photography, allowing viewers to feel the characters' inner tranquility and external luxury, full of storytelling and emotional depth.",
