        {
          "id": "krea2-08b8a5979d6a2f5e3ffabc01",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙酒店神秘站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman in an elegant white long dress takes a selfie in a luxury hotel room on the top floor of a high-rise building. Her phone camera reflects her reflection on the mirror, her left hand naturally resting on the dark wooden counter, her body slightly turning to reveal a long, flowing curve. The dress features a body-hugging spaghetti strap cut, with the upper chest adorned with dazzling diamonds or crystals, a cinched waist with pleats, and a hem made of lightweight, sheer fabric that naturally drapes down to the ankles like silk. As she stands, flowing wave pleats form and create a hazy layered light under the light. On her feet, she wore pointed high heels studded with rhinestones, with shoe details that sparkled and complemented the overall look. She wears a slender chain bracelet on her wrist, her nails neatly trimmed with light-colored nails, and her fingertips lightly touch the edge of her phone, her posture calm and confident yet slightly mysterious. In the foreground is a deep brown wooden floor with clearly visible grain, and a bouquet of pink wrapped flowers or cake decorations peeking out from the right edge, adding a cozy atmosphere. The middle view features wide floor-to-ceiling glass window frames with clean and modern lines. Outside the window is a dazzling city night view, with dense buildings brightly lit. In the distance, a landmark building is illuminated with a magnificent crown-shaped light fixture, becoming one of the visual focal points. The background is the interior space of the hotel rooms, with flat ceilings without unnecessary decoration. Recessed downlights provide even and soft lighting, and the walls use dark gray or black wood finishes to create a calm and sophisticated feel. On the left, another group of white floral arrangements can be faintly seen. The composition uses a vertically centered and right-side layout, with the main figure occupying about two-thirds of the frame's height and mirror reflections creating a dual visual effect, enhancing depth and visual interest. The visual guide naturally extends from the hand holding the phone to the city skyline outside the window. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by low-contrast warm tones. The indoor light source concentrates on the figure, creating soft contour light and local highlights that emphasize the texture of clothing materials and skin glow. Meanwhile, the cool-toned city lights outside the window create a contrast, enhancing the sense of tranquility and bustle in the nighttime city. The entire image presents a delicate, private, and modern urban romantic artistic photography style, as if capturing a tranquil moment before an important occasion. It combines the casual realism of daily life with a fusion of high-end fashion and artistic aesthetics. The image has moderate saturation, with colors leaning toward low-saturation cool platinum tones, creating a dreamlike immersive visual experience suitable for social media sharing or personal art archives.",
