        {
          "id": "krea2-7f4636acc920584aa8de49a2",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙城市忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the railing on a city rooftop terrace, wearing an off-shoulder dress with a deep blue base and white paisley pattern. The hem is layered, the cuffs are lantern-shaped and fluffy, and a thin black leather belt with a metal ring buckle accentuates the waistline; On her left shoulder, she slung a matte black suede tote bag crossbody over her left shoulder, with a slim strap and understated minimalist metal accessories. Her right hand elegantly holds a white porcelain coffee cup, its body decorated with blue geometric patterns, the rim trimmed with gold, while her left hand rests gently on a beige metal railing, her posture relaxed and natural, as if enjoying a moment of tranquility. In the foreground are the vertical lines and arched hollowed-out structures of terrace railings. The railing surface is a warm brown hue due to years or sunlight. Behind the railing is a densely arranged red terracotta tile roof, with clear tile patterns. Some ridges feature brick chimneys or decorative spires, and in the distance, the silhouette of modern buildings and a row of towering green silhouettes can be faintly seen. The sky is a gray-blue shade filled with overcast clouds, with soft and even lighting without strong shadows. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and slightly melancholic and poetic, like a snapshot of slow-paced urban life on a cloudy afternoon. The composition uses a medium portrait perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, slightly turned but facing the camera head, forming the visual focal point; The railing serves as a foreground guiding line extending from the lower left corner to the upper right, directing the viewer's gaze toward the main subject; The roof in the background is layered, creating a sense of spatial depth from near to far; The background is moderately blurred to enhance the subject's presence. The light and shadow processing is delicate, with diffused light from the zenith evenly covering the skin and folds of the fabric, highlighting the texture and sheen of the fabric, and giving the image a sense of depth and warmth. The entire photo presents a visual style that combines artistic photography texture with everyday realism. The color saturation is moderate, with a balance of warm and cool tones. The blue-and-white dress paired with the red-tiled roof forms a classic complementary color pairing, creating a nostalgic urban aesthetic atmosphere. It feels like a photo taken with amateur equipment yet full of professional aesthetic depth, featuring slight film grain and natural noise, preserving the authentic atmosphere of life while maintaining a sophisticated fashion feel.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
