        {
          "id": "krea2-30737bc39b6226ff3a461f9f",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙广场冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "She wore a light, flowing white slip dress paired with a light blue long-sleeved knit cardigan. The cardigan was casually draped over one shoulder, revealing one side of her collarbone and slender arms. The fabric was soft and draped down, gently swaying in the breeze. The layered hem was as light as clouds, creating a harmonious contrast with the cardigan in warm and cool tones. She slung a simple off-white square bag across her left shoulder, with metal fasteners shining warmly in the sunlight. Her right hand naturally hung down holding the strap, her nails neatly trimmed with light pink nails, and the overall style was fresh and sweet, balancing casual daily wear with a sense of fashion. In the foreground, low grass and a few slender wildflowers stand at her feet, dotted with pink and white flowers. The petals are slender and gently swaying in the wind, creating a romantic atmosphere close to nature without embellishment; On the left, you can see a gray stone pavement, its edges covered in grass, giving a rough yet authentic texture. In the middle is a winding reddish-brown plastic track, with a flat and slightly worn surface. The edge of the track is marked by a white cement divider, naturally separating the figure from the background. Behind the track, a wooden bench and a tree trunk with whitewashed base can be faintly seen. The dappled shadows cast on the grass, hinting at spatial depth. The background is a vast, boundless green lawn, with lush and bright grass leaves. Against the backlight, it presents a soft golden-green hue, while distant tree outlines blur, creating a blurred background effect that emphasizes the visual focus on the figure. The composition uses a medium-near portrait perspective, with the person positioned at the golden ratio point on the right side of the frame, body slightly tilted, head facing the camera creating asymmetrical dynamic balance, and ample blank space on the left side to allow the gaze to flow freely. Nature guides the image toward the center and extends into the distance, enhancing the narrative value of the image. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is like the \"magical moment\" of evening or early morning, with the sun at a lower angle, slanting from the right rear of the figure into the frame, creating a soft backlight contour light. The shadow transitions are delicate and gentle, without harsh contrasts. The overall color saturation is moderate, with blue, white, green, and pink as the main tones, creating a peaceful and healing visual experience. The image features a slight soft focus and a grainy film texture, simulating the realism of amateur phone or small camera shooting. The details are rich yet still hazy and poetic, conveying a carefree, leisurely lifestyle aesthetic. It seems to capture the gentlest moment of afternoon sunlight, combining the everyday atmosphere of an urban park with the unique dreaminess and innocence of youth.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
