        {
          "id": "krea2-118de63b3962f0b8fd47d04d",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤城市微笑坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at a wooden table in an industrial-style café, wearing a faint, almost imperceptible smile. Her nails are neatly trimmed and painted black, a simple silver bracelet on her left wrist, and a clean light blue short-sleeved T-shirt. The collar of her black-and-white polka-dot shirt is faintly visible, exuding a relaxed and elegant posture. In the foreground is the heavy wooden table where she sits, with clearly visible grain and a slightly lustrous surface that has been used for a warm sheen. On the table sits a simple white porcelain plate and a half-empty green glass cup. Water stains remain on the cup's walls, reflecting subtle iridescence in the warm light, forming one of the visual focal points. In the middle of the frame, she leans against the edge of a dark brown leather chair and the blurred outlines of other tables and chairs around her. On the right, another customer's arm and glass can be faintly seen, hinting at the social yet intimate atmosphere of the space. In the background is the café's open kitchen area, with white brick walls paired with exposed metal pipes and beam structures. The ceiling is adorned with several vintage black industrial chandeliers and long fluorescent tubes, with interlaced light streaming through. In the distance, you can see stainless steel countertops, coffee machines, hanging copper cookware, and a sliding door leading to the kitchen. Several decorative paintings or menu boards hang on the walls, creating a sense of depth that is both authentic and full of life. The composition uses a slightly upward-looking mid-to-close perspective, with the main figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame. Objects on the table in the foreground form visual guides, creating a warm and slightly hazy atmosphere of light and shadow, while shadows naturally converge below the neck and hairline. The overall color scheme leans toward warm gray and low-saturation brown, creating a lazy, quiet, and slightly nostalgic urban afternoon atmosphere. The entire photo presents a realistic texture reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment, rich in details yet artistically beautiful, capturing poetic moments in ordinary moments—not staged, but naturally expressing emotions and resonating with the environment, like a forgotten slice of life in a corner of an album full of storytelling.",
