        {
          "id": "krea2-fc2df3af11624fdee6b1968a",
          "alias": "单女湿身粉连衣裙城市自信坐注视",
          "prompt": "An elegant Eastern woman sits upright on a stone bridge bench surrounded by an antique iron railing. She wears a soft pink one-shoulder pleated dress as delicate as early spring cherry blossoms, the hem naturally draping to the knees. The fabric is light and smooth, forming smooth and sculpted pleated lines with her posture, highlighting her slender figure and supple curves. Her right hand rests lightly on the horizontal bar of a deep blue wooden bench, her fingertips long, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with light pink polish. Her left hand rests naturally beside her thigh, her overall posture relaxed and composed. In the foreground is a dark blue-lacquered wooden bench with a slightly weathered surface, and behind it stands a black wrought iron railing. The railing is wrapped with vintage scroll patterns, and the rust-stained areas reveal the texture of time, contrasting with the delicate and smooth skin of the figures. The middle ground depicts a quiet, winding canal surface, calm as a mirror, reflecting the outlines of the buildings on both banks and the faint glow of the sky. Some walls show fine signs of peeling and the textures of time. Small religious frames or decorative wall lamps hang on the walls, and in the distance, the silhouettes of pedestrians and bridge structures can be faintly seen, creating a rich historical and cultural atmosphere. The entire composition adopts a close-up perspective from medium to close-up, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the golden ratio point, the body slightly tilted, creating a subtle interaction between the gaze and the lens. Light and shadow come from the soft daylight in the upper left, creating a natural, three-dimensional transition of light and shadow, while casting clear and layered shadows on the skirt hem and railing; The color palette is mainly pink, blue, and gray. The pink dress contrasts warmly with the deep blue bench, while the off-white tones of the background buildings provide visual balance. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, gentle, and slightly nostalgic, like an oil painting gently soaked by time. It has cinematic narrative tension while preserving the authentic warmth of everyday photography, presenting an \"artistic everyday\" style—as if shooting with a high-end digital camera paired with a large-aperture prime lens on a sunny afternoon, with post-processing and softened colors applied. It enhances the emotional appeal and visual harmony of the image, rather than being completely realistic or overly dramatized in the style of a commercial blockbuster. Instead, it resembles a carefully curated urban street portrait creation, capturing the poetic moments and self-expression of urban women blooming in historic streets and alleys.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
