        {
          "id": "krea2-28e246d173640561c2512416",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣车内冷淡站立持手机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands inside a public transportation vehicle, wearing a simple yet refined white knit camisole paired with a high-waisted black pleated mini skirt, outlining an elegant and sharp silhouette. Her hands lightly gripped a black smartphone, her fingertips moving slightly, as if immersed in a world of information. Her body leaned forward slightly, showing a focused posture unique to daily commuting. The foreground focuses on the lines from below the waist to her legs. The pleats of the black mini skirt are distinct and layered, creating delicate transitions of light and shadow under the light, highlighting the harmonious blend of fabric texture and body curves; In the background, a row of blue upholstered seats and metal handrails inside the carriage are intertwined, with passengers' silhouettes blurred and natural light streaming in through the windows, creating a realistic yet slightly hazy public atmosphere. The composition is shot at a slightly upward angle, placing the main subject at the visual center, then extending to the details of the bag, creating a rhythmic visual path. The overall color scheme is dominated by cool whites and deep blacks, complemented by blue-gray tones of the seats, creating a clean, modern, and slightly urban atmosphere of detachment. The light and shadow come from the natural diffuse light on the side of the window, creating a subtle contrast of light and dark while avoiding strong shadow interference. The greenery outside the window and the blurred outlines of the buildings in the background enhance the presence of the main figures, while also hinting at moments of tranquility during a city journey. The overall visual atmosphere combines the realism of daily life with the refinement of artistic photography, as if captured by an ordinary digital camera in the moment the afternoon sunlight filters through a car window. Yet, thanks to precise control of light and shadow, color saturation, and detailed rendering, it presents a surrealist-like aesthetic texture. Like a carefully composed street portrait, it carries the everyday atmosphere of everyday life while embodying the independent confidence of urban women and the modern aesthetic of immersion in the digital world.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
