        {
          "id": "krea2-ac49964abe54875d99b56530",
          "alias": "单女白挂脖雪地冷淡站立持扇",
          "prompt": "An Eastern woman is the absolute focal point of the painting, wearing a delicate off-white sleeveless halter qipao-style dress with delicate wavy three-dimensional pleats. The waistline flows smoothly to fit the figure, with one side slit extending to mid-thigh, revealing smooth, slender leg skin. The fan has a black background, featuring the outline of Mount Fuji's snowy peaks and densely blooming pink cherry blossoms. The fan ribs are made of light-colored wood with hollowed-out carved edges, and a metal clasp detail faintly visible on the handle; Her left hand hangs naturally at her waist, fingertips neatly trimmed, nails painted with light-colored bare nail polish, her posture elegant and composed, body slightly turned at about a forty-five degree angle to the camera, shoulder and neck lines graceful, showcasing a serene, restrained, and distinctly Eastern temperament; In the foreground, the figure occupies the center-left area of the composition, forming a visual focus from knee to chest. The position of holding a folding fan cleverly balances the composition. In the middle shot, the torso and hem of the skirt extend to the bottom edge of the frame, with the folds and layers of light and shadow richly enhancing the depth of the composition. The background uses a dark-toned blurring treatment, faintly revealing geometric grid structures made of white or light gray, reminiscent of traditional Japanese paper sliding doors or modern architectural window lattice designs. Their blurred effect creates a hazy spatial atmosphere while avoiding interference with the subject; The entire composition adopts a classic central symmetry technique, with the figure standing in the center, and the slightly right-leaning body posture breaks perfect symmetry, adding dynamic beauty; The use of lighting is extremely meticulous, with the main light source coming from the upper left of the front of the figure, while naturally transitioning shadows are formed on the right side of the body to enhance the sense of depth; The background lighting is dim, casting only a faint outline light on the grille structure, further highlighting the main body; The overall atmosphere presents a tranquil, elegant, and slightly artistic retro Eastern aesthetic, combining the poetic romance of classical poetry with the refined texture of modern photography; The color palette is mainly warm white and off-white, accented with black and pink cherry blossoms on the folding fan, creating a warm and cool contrast that creates a serene yet vibrant artistic visual experience; The overall image style leans toward professional studio shooting, yet still retains the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment. The image features delicate graininess and subtle noise, simulating the performance of real camera sensors rather than excessive sharpening or perfect compositing; The images convey an artistic beauty of \"time frozen,\" as if freezing a quiet Eastern classical dream on a quiet night. The characters' expressions are gentle and picturesque, costume details are meticulously crafted, props are used perfectly, and the overall expression is highly expressive and emotionally profound.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
