        {
          "id": "krea2-a3b02b52ce10c95e296b3254",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤街道微笑站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands behind a light blue car, wearing a confident smile and showing a relaxed, cheerful yet slightly playful expression; Above his head, he cleverly supports a teal inflatable kayak or water sports equipment with his right hand, clearly printed with the black \"BOTE\" brand logo. Its shape is rounded and full, with vivid colors that create a visual focal point in the scene; She wore a simple, fitted black sleeveless short tank top that accentuated her slender waistline, paired with loose plaid casual pants with a loose plaid pattern, and a casual tie at the waistband added a laid-back, rebellious street vibe; A white wide shoulder strap is slung across the chest, printed with the classic black lettering \"Christian Dior PARIS,\" with black leather buckles at the end of the strap, creating a fashionable contrast with the overall outfit; Her left hand naturally hangs at her side, and she wears a delicate metal chain bracelet on her wrist, gleaming with a delicate sheen in the sunlight; The entire composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center-left position, the rear of a car serving as a solid backdrop, and the window glass reflecting a blurred street scene, creating a realistic urban atmosphere; The foreground features the contact points between the character's arm and the inflatable device, as well as some car taillights and body lines; the middle ground focuses on the upper body and clothing details; the background is a blurred city street environment, with faint outlines of pedestrians and buildings visible in the distance, emphasizing the main subject through shallow depth of field; Light and shadow are soft and even, forming natural transitions of light and shadow, while producing slight reflections on the vehicle surface; The overall color scheme is mainly cool blue-gray, accented with teal and black-and-white checkered patterns, creating a fresh, modern, and slightly adventurous urban travel atmosphere. It combines the sophistication of a fashion shoot with the authentic texture of everyday shooting. The images are full of youthful energy and a spirit of free exploration, as if preparing to set off for distant places, combining artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life, presenting a fleeting beauty captured unexpectedly.",
          "description": "",
