        {
          "id": "krea2-c771ef0c66202a063b7b8226",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙公园困倦站立展示",
          "prompt": "Standing in the center of a park-shaded path, she wore a light blue layered dress with a lightweight tulle short-sleeve top, with a delicate white lace trim and black ribbon bow decoration at the neckline. The pearl chain crossbody bag at the chest flowed naturally, adding elegant details to the overall look; The hem of the skirt is layered, gently swaying in the wind, showcasing a lively aura. Her hands are naturally open, with a plush white wristband on her left wrist and a green neon bracelet on her right, hinting at youthful energy and traces of everyday life. The foreground focuses on the whole body, with a medium close-up combined with depth perspective. She is positioned at the very center of the frame, becoming the absolute visual focal point; The background features lush trees and a path extending into the distance. The leaves glow in bright emerald shades under the sunlight, their shadows dappled across the asphalt, and in the distance, blurry pedestrian figures walk along the road, creating spatial depth and a sense of life. The light comes from above, soft and even, without strong shadows. The transition between light and shadow is natural and smooth, and the overall atmosphere is fresh, peaceful, and slightly dreamy, like the pleasant moment of a gentle breeze on a summer afternoon. The entire painting is dominated by fresh blue-green tones, creating a harmonious and pleasing visual balance. The composition emphasizes symmetry and blank space, enhancing the depth and storytelling of the composition. The image quality leans toward a realistic and natural phone shooting style, with slight noise and soft blurred edges, preserving the subtle warmth and realism of daily life, rather than overly retouched commercial photography. It is closer to the beautiful moments ordinary people casually capture while strolling in the park. The overall image conveys a youthful atmosphere of innocence, freedom, and carefree, as if time stands still at this moment, with only the breeze gently brushing over leaves and skirts, bringing fleeting peace and beautiful memories.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
