        {
          "id": "krea2-72331f56599c6c8f1c6710e6",
          "alias": "多人庭院冷淡倚靠手持物",
          "prompt": "A classical beauty dressed in elegant Hanfu leans sideways against a wooden corridor, holding a delicate pipa. The slightly tilted standing posture and the pipa's diagonal lines provide visual guidance, with light coming from the upper and side to create a contrast of light and shadow, emphasizing three-dimensionality and textured materials; The overall atmosphere is tranquil and far-reaching, infused with poetic Eastern aesthetics. The color palette is mainly light blue, off-white, and pale yellow, complemented by woody browns and mossy green, creating a warm and cool intertwining visual experience; The image texture is delicate and authentic, as if shooting with amateur equipment in the afternoon sunlight. There is slight noise and natural color transitions, enhancing the sense of realism and emotional resonance in everyday life. There are no signs of excessive retouching, preserving the flow of light and shadow and subtle changes in fabric folds, making viewers feel as if they are in a story-filled ancient-style courtyard, experiencing the fusion of music and beauty.",
