        {
          "id": "krea2-71c6c24f57221fcf42a8bfcb",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣街道忧伤站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways by the roadside at dusk, her movements natural and fluid, as if packing her gear or preparing for the start of a journey. In the air, dazzling camera halos and soft-focus bokeh illuminate her shoulder and neck lines and firm skin, injecting a sacred and serene atmosphere into the scene; She wore a simple, fitted light gray-white knit short-sleeve top made of delicate and soft material, hugging the figure and highlighting elegant curves. Below, she wore a pure black high-waisted skirt with a natural hem, creating a warm and cool contrast with the top to enhance the visual focus. On her left side leaned a folding chair with a metal frame, with a vintage-style silver handbag hanging from the back. The strap was slender and delicate, hinting that she might have just arrived or was about to set off; In the foreground is a damp gray tiled pavement, reflecting the sunset's afterglow and the surrounding buildings' reflections. The damp texture of the ground enhances the realism of the scene and the traces of time passing; The middle view is a straight-line asphalt road stretching into the distance, with clearly visible white lane markings. On both sides of the road are open, flat wilderness or farmland, with sparse vegetation or low hill outlines faintly visible on the distant horizon. On the left side of the background is a modern-style white column-style building, possibly a bus stop or a small bus shelter. Its simple geometric lines and the gentle curves of the figures create visual tension. To the right is the boundless sky, with thin clouds in a pale golden-orange hue. The sun is slowly sinking into the horizon, emitting a highly saturated warm yellow glow. The light shines strongly at a side and backlight angle onto the subject. The composition adopts a slightly upward-looking mid-to-near angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the painting in a third-quarter position. The blank space guides the gaze to the left to extend to the building and distant roads, creating a sense of depth and narrative; The visual guiding lines are formed by the direction of the characters' arms raised, the straight extension of the highway, and the diagonal lines formed by the building's edges. The lighting atmosphere presents a typical \"golden moment\" characteristic—soft and warm light without losing intensity, delicate shadow edges transitioning, moderate color saturation, and an overall tone that combines documentary and poetic romance. It preserves the simple authenticity of daily life while giving the visuals a cinematic texture and emotional depth through precise exposure control and post-production color grading. It resembles a travel diary photo taken with an old digital camera, with slight noise and color shifts, conveying a nostalgic, free, slightly lonely yet hopeful traveler's sentiment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
