        {
          "id": "krea2-2c409b09ee442083064552e8",
          "alias": "单女粉旗袍花园严肃坐持扇",
          "prompt": "An Eastern woman sits upright beside a classical garden stone railing, wearing a pale pink sleeveless qipao. The ribs are arranged in a warm golden radial pattern, with clearly visible edge details; In the foreground is the rough stone railing she leans on, its surface covered in mottled patterns marked by the passage of time, forming a material contrast with the figure's graceful posture; The middle shot focuses on the woman's upper body and the folding fan in her hand, composed in the golden ratio. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, with the right side of the blank space guiding the viewer to the background; The background is a blurred, dense greenery, sunlight filtering through the gaps in the leaves casting mottled light spots, creating a soft bokeh effect. The blurred tree shadows are rich in layers but do not overshadow the scene; The entire shot was shot in natural light, with light slanting from the upper right, gently outlining the figure's outline and the folds of the clothing. The shoulder and neck lines are softly blurred with soft light, creating a captivating and hazy effect; The color palette is mainly pink, green, and brown, with pink coats and shade forming a fresh and harmonious complementary relationship, while the dark green and golden accents of folding fans add elegant layers; The atmosphere is tranquil and lingering, carrying the \"blank space\" aesthetic of Eastern classical aesthetics, as if one can hear the gentle sound of wind brushing through leaf tips and the slow flow of time; Dynamic balance is formed by combining the curved edges of folding fans and straight lines of stone railings; The lens uses shallow depth of field technology to highlight the subject, blurring the background to enhance spatial depth. The entire composition resembles a meticulously crafted light color painting, combining the authentic texture of photography with the poetic expression of painting, full of the gentle and serene philosophical beauty of Eastern women living in harmony with nature. It is suitable for amateur DSLR or mobile phone shooting in the forest in the afternoon, aiming for a documentary and artistic blend of natural light and environment.",
