        {
          "id": "krea2-479e2689dd4217e3649a3659",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤卧室冷淡坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bedroom bed, staring directly at the camera. She wears a form-fitting blue knitted camisole that accentuates her slender waist and full bust curves, layered with a casually open white shirt whose hem naturally drapes over her thighs and jeans, creating a casual yet refined home atmosphere; On the bottom, she wore light blue slim-fit jeans that fit snugly to the hip line, with slightly washed and stitching details at the knees, and the legs naturally tapering above the ankles. The overall look was simple, fashionable, and full of youthful energy. Her posture is relaxed and natural, sitting cross-legged on a bed covered with white sheets, leaning slightly to the side, with her left arm naturally resting on the pillow or headboard behind her, and her right hand gently resting beside her knee or thigh, her movements smooth and relaxed, showing a comfortable and carefree lifestyle. In the foreground are her full hip curves, the pleated details of her jeans, and the partially hidden edges of her white shirt, with the visual focus on her waist and thighs, highlighting her body proportions and the texture of her clothing. The background is a simple and cozy bedroom environment—three decorative frames in different styles hang on the pure white walls: on the left is a black-framed abstract silhouette; on the middle right is a vintage wooden frame with a figure wearing a white coat holding a puppy; and on the right is a simple illustration on a pink background. These paintings enrich the visual layers without overshadowing the main theme. The headboard is made of dark solid wood with clean and modern lines, and behind it sits a beige fabric cushion, creating a warm and soft color contrast with the white bedding. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the main figure occupying the main position. The slightly right-leaning angle adds dynamism and spatial depth to the image. At the same time, the texture of the bedsheet and the geometry of the frame also serve as auxiliary guidance. The light is soft and even, creating subtle three-dimensional shadows, especially on areas like shoulders, neck, collarbones, and hips, which create natural contrasts between light and dark, enhancing the realism of skin texture and clothing folds. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, gentle, and healing, carrying a strong sense of everyday life and personal privacy. It feels like capturing the moment she has just gotten up or is about to rest as morning or afternoon sunlight streams into the room. The color palette is a blend of warm and cool blues and whites, accented with beige and wood tones, creating a fresh, comfortable, and artistically beautiful image, with the authentic texture and delicate emotional expression of everyday photography equipment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
