        {
          "id": "krea2-3db03593f79c6908dea3bd32",
          "alias": "单女红T恤街道害羞站立摆拍",
          "prompt": "A female character, dressed in a red-and-white striped camisole top and army green work shorts, stands against the blurred backdrop of a city street. The lenses reflect slightly in natural light, revealing a playful yet slightly shy expression. Her left hand hangs naturally at her waist, and she wears a slender silver bracelet on her wrist. Her fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with light pink nails, and she also wears a simple ring on her right middle finger. The overall design blends classic elements of anime characters with the vibrant energy of real youth. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the main figure occupying the center of the composition. The slightly tilted body posture and raised hand pose create a dynamic balance. The background is blurred by shallow depth of field to create a gray-blue city streetscape, with faint distant parked vehicle silhouettes and roadside greenery, creating a lively urban daily atmosphere with soft and even lighting. Natural sunlight from the upper front outlines the shoulders, necks, and clothing folds, with delicate shadow transitions. The overall color palette is dominated by red, white, and green. The image texture is close to professional camera shooting, as if capturing a moment of a sunny afternoon street encounter, full of everyday life and ACG aesthetics, while preserving the iconic features of anime characters. It also showcases the vivid expressions of real people blending with the natural environment, presenting a visual narrative style that is both profound and warm.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
