        {
          "id": "krea2-3fb876ed56f9381e1cb28440",
          "alias": "单女旗袍闺房冷淡站立持包",
          "prompt": "An elegant woman stands at the center of the interior, wearing a delicate qipao with a dark base adorned with three-dimensional peony patterns. The flowers blend warm pink and dark red, with delicate black lace or embroidered edges, highlighting the fusion of classical Eastern aesthetics with modern tailoring; Her makeup is delicate and natural, gently holding an off-white leather handbag with a crocodile pattern. The clasp has a golden metallic finish, her nails are painted light blue, and she wears a pair of high-heeled patent leather pointed shoes, which reflect a cool sheen. On the left side of the foreground is a uniquely shaped wooden round table, with a vintage black rotary dial phone and a pink ceramic vase placed on the tabletop. Inside the vase are several withered silver-white plant branches, with the table legs designed in a tapered gradient, and the base rests on a black-and-white geometric radial circular carpet; To the right of the central view is a classic wooden Windsor chair, with a back made of multiple vertical thin wooden strips. The armrests and seat are carved with traditional Chinese patterns, and the legs are fitted with black non-slip footrests. The chair is slightly tilted, suggesting the figure has just stood up or is about to sit down; The background wall is made of dark gray or black, decorated with decorative panels formed by white rectangular line frames. Above are three side by side arched windows, framed from dark brown wood, allowing bright and even natural light to flow in while casting clear shadows on the floor; The overall composition uses a central axis symmetrical layout but slightly tilted to break rigidity; the figures are positioned slightly to the right of the visual center, creating a sense of depth; For light and shadow treatment, side backlighting is used, with the light source coming from the upper left window, making the figure's silhouette clear and three-dimensional. The qipao fabric shows subtle glossy changes due to light refraction, while the shadowed areas retain enough detail to avoid overexposure; The ambiance blends vintage art with modern fashion, blending the reserved elegance of Republican-era boudoir women with the confidence and composure of contemporary urban women. The color scheme centers on black, brown, and off-white, accented with warm pink florals and metallic gold to create a sophisticated and tranquil visual layer; The image quality pursues a delicate and realistic style, similar to professional studio lighting effects, but simulates slight noise and real material textures from everyday amateur equipment, such as tiny scratches on wooden floors, rough carpet fibers, and subtle wrinkles on leather upholstery, enhancing the authenticity and sense of everyday life. The overall mood conveys a quiet sense of ritual and an elegant temperament that has accumulated over time, as if frozen in the living room of an old house bathed in slanting afternoon sunlight—both a tribute to traditional culture and a silent expression of personal taste and contemporary aesthetics.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
