        {
          "id": "krea2-03625952ff510634adb0921b",
          "alias": "单女街道俏皮站立",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in exquisite traditional Hanfu stands before a rustic blue brick wall. The fabric is light pink as the base, with intricate and delicate peony and auspicious cloud patterns embroidered on the chest, edged with gold thread. The collar and cuffs are trimmed with fluffy, pure white plush trim, soft as winter sunshine, adding a touch of playfulness and luxury. The colors are harmonious and layered, combining classical elegance with the relaxed and pleasant modern lifestyle; The atmosphere is tranquil and gentle, as if capturing a beautiful moment of a lazy afternoon street encounter. It combines the refined beauty of artistic photography with the authentic texture and warmth of everyday phone photography, allowing people to feel the unique charm of traditional culture blending with modern youth lifestyle.",
