        {
          "id": "krea2-fc20123b16d003c9de9da0c8",
          "alias": "单女透视连衣裙城市冷淡站立指向",
          "prompt": "The front center of the dress is adorned with a gorgeous vintage-style golden mirror embroidery, with the artistic words \"Life is the most beautiful\" engraved inside the mirror, highlighting the fusion of fashion and philosophical thought; She paired it with black sheer stockings and pointed high heels adorned with sparkling rhinestones. Her ankles were slender and long, and the overall look was simple yet luxurious. Her right hand is gently raised, fingertips slightly raised, as if displaying or pointing to the products on the display shelf beside her. Her left hand naturally hangs down, holding a brown leather chain bag with a metal chain design, adding a touch of urban modernity. In the foreground is where she stands and the gray geometric carpet beneath her feet, with the floor reflecting soft light and creating a sense of spatial layering; In the middle is the gold metal shelves on the left behind her, layered with white packaging boxes and silver bottled products. The shelves have clean and modern lines, and the golden frame looks even more luxurious against the cool white walls; The background shows a city street view visible through large floor-to-ceiling glass windows—a dark gray sedan parked by the roadside, its headlights faintly on, and a man in a gray suit walking past the shop in the distance. His figure is blurred yet real, with faint outlines of buildings visible outside the window, giving the scene a sense of depth in urban life. The composition uses a slightly elevated mid-shot angle, placing the person slightly to the right of the golden ratio point, creating a stable visual center of gravity and a tense effect; The main figure occupies about two-thirds of the height of the composition, while horizontal lines extending from the window create visual balance with the vertical structure of the shelves, enhancing the sense of spatial order. In terms of lighting and ambiance, the main indoor light source comes from the ceiling soft light, evenly casting on the figures, giving the skin a delicate and smooth texture, distinct layered folds on clothing, and soft and natural shadow transitions; Natural light from outside the window enters the room diagonally from the side, casting subtle contrasts of light and shadow on the floor and glass, enhancing the sense of depth and realism; The overall color palette is mainly off-white, light gold, and gray-black, complemented by warm lighting, creating a quiet, sophisticated, and slightly lazy afternoon atmosphere. It combines the professional texture of commercial photography with the authentic beauty captured unintentionally in daily life, as if casually captured with a regular phone during a shopping mall's precious moments—understated yet full of storytelling, unforced yet evoking lingering thoughts. The entire scene resembles a fashionable portrait of everyday life, combining the refined layout of a commercial scene. It also contains poetry and warmth found in ordinary daily life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
