        {
          "id": "krea2-c6da0b920f1cd67c11e5a2f1",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤竹林愤怒坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by a spacious, bright glass window in the indoor space, her right hand naturally resting on a huge wooden tabletop in front of her, her posture relaxed and full of life; She wore a black-and-white patchwork midriff camisole with silver rhinestone lettering on the chest, loose dark jeans, and black-and-white sneakers, with a white padded pad at her feet. Gray blankets and woven straw hats scattered around her created a comfortable and cozy home atmosphere; In the foreground is a rugged, heavy wooden tabletop, its surface covered in natural cracks and weathering marks, with clearly visible grain. In the lower right corner sits a black vintage camera, hinting at the photographer's identity or creative intent; The middle view depicts the position where the woman sits and the surrounding environment, including woven bamboo mats on the floor, wooden window frame structures, fluttering sheer curtains, and the country path extending beyond the window; The background is a wide and tranquil pastoral landscape. A winding dirt road winds through lush green grasslands and low shrubs, with faint outlines of field ridges and farmhouses visible in the distance. Sunlight streams through the windows into the room, creating soft and warm layers of light and shadow on the figures' skin, clothing folds, and wooden furniture. The shadows cast by the window frames add dimension and depth to the scene; The overall composition adopts a slightly top-down angle, placing the figure slightly to the left center of the frame. The window frame lines guide the gaze to focus on the subject, while the combination of solid and void enhances spatial layering; then extending to the scenery outside the window, forming a coherent narrative rhythm; The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and healing, featuring the unique warm yellow tones of afternoon sunlight. The light is soft and not glaring, giving the image a tranquil and peaceful mood, while retaining some natural noise and slight graininess to simulate the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment. The entire image exudes an artistic, fresh, and free-spirited urban pastoral style, combining artistic expression with closeness to everyday life, allowing viewers to experience moments of tranquility and inner relaxation.",
