        {
          "id": "krea2-0e43747159eed8397269cddb",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙城市严肃站立跳舞",
          "prompt": "At a wooden table in an outdoor café by the Thames in London, a woman in a lightweight white polka-dot dress is intently fiddling with a small camera, as if capturing the poetic scene of the city; On the wooden table beside her sat a latte with delicate milk foam, the rim stained with a few drops of coffee, and beside it sat a glimmering smartphone reflecting the mottled light and shadows of the branches above; In the foreground, a cluster of dense green maple leaves naturally hangs down from the upper left corner of the painting, partially obscuring the sky and distant buildings, forming a natural frame composition that injects vitality and layering into the painting; In the middle is where she stands, with low brick flower beds and neatly trimmed lawns behind her. The edges of the flowerbeds are scattered with irregular pebbles, and on the right side, you can see yellow metal chairs paired with gray cushions. On the table, a golden, crispy fried chicken nugget with salad remains, hinting at the leisurely dining time just ended; In the background is London's iconic tower bridge, majestic and majestic. Its Gothic tower and blue steel truss structure appear solemn and elegant under the cloudy sky. Spots of light cast between the leaves dance and flicker across the table and skirt, giving the scene a warm afternoon atmosphere; The warm yellow of the food and the bright yellow of the chairs create a harmonious yet vibrant color; The image presents a texture reminiscent of real amateur equipment shooting—slight noise, natural depth blur, and slightly warm-toned color temperature post-processing, making the image both documentary and full of everyday life. The atmosphere is tranquil and full of stories, combining the bustling backdrop of urban travel with the tranquil moments of solitude, as if time slows down at this moment, allowing one to feel the gentle intertwining of city scenery and personal emotions.",
