        {
          "id": "krea2-07c215db991a4da5a2cc9e73",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙公园困倦坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a park bench, wearing a light, flowing white spaghetti strap dress whose hem naturally drapes over the edge of the wooden chair. The fabric is delicate and soft, gently rising in the breeze, and the straps are adorned with delicate lace bow decorations, adding a touch of sweetness and elegance. On her wrist is a slender silver chain bracelet, delicate yet understated. She leans slightly forward, lowering her head to gaze at an open book or notebook in her hand, her expression focused and slightly contemplative, exuding a quiet, restrained, and story-filled emotional atmosphere. Her overall makeup is clean and natural, as if she doesn't wear heavy makeup yet looks even more genuine and captivating. The foreground focuses on her bare arms, skirt edges, and hand movements, with fingertips lightly touching the pages, her posture relaxed and natural, creating a strong visual layer. In the center is a reddish-brown wooden bench she leans on, with armrests made of black metal. The surface shows slight wear from years of use, and the surface texture is clearly visible, creating a textured contrast with the skin and clothing. The background is lush forests, with tall and upright branches intertwined, lush green leaves shining through, sunlight filtering through the leaves, casting mottled, soft light and shadow on the ground and figures, creating a natural filter effect of interplay of light and shadow. The entire composition adopts a slightly tilted perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the center on the right side and the body facing the lower left, creating a sense of spatial depth and narrative tension. The light comes from the soft, diffused light on the upper left, possibly natural light from cloudy days or under the shade of trees. The overall tone is a teal blend of warm and cool tones, with a slight film graininess and soft focus treatment, creating a dreamy, tranquil, and slightly melancholic atmosphere, like a summer afternoon portrait gently frozen by time. The visuals are full and restrained, combining the innocence and vitality of youth with exploration and contemplation of the inner world, presenting a sense of realism and aesthetics of \"everyday amateur equipment shooting\"—without excessive retouching or flawless perfection, instead retaining subtle noise and natural color saturation fading in light and shadow transitions, allowing viewers to feel the photographer's subtle tenderness and sincerity when capturing the moment. The entire image exudes a poetic sense of loneliness and serene beauty, like a silent prose poem that invites pause and gaze, immersing viewers in endless imagination about the inner world of the characters and the stories behind the scenes.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
