        {
          "id": "krea2-03ca18774fb9dfec5cd62756",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣酒吧忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the wooden bar in a window-side café, adding a lazy and carefree aesthetic; Her expression was calm and tinged with a hint of melancholy, as if she were lost in her own world of thoughts. She wore a light beige short-sleeved knit top adorned with delicate lace trim at the neckline, paired with a white camisole that was faintly visible. She paired it with light blue denim shorts and a delicate gold chain belt around her waist. The overall look was simple, gentle, and layered. On her wrist, she wears two exquisite gold bracelets: one is a fine bracelet, the other is set with a small, rounded orange gemstone. Around her neck hangs a slender pearl necklace, and although there are no obvious earrings, her temperament is elegant and refined. Her hands are folded on her knees or the edge of the table, her posture relaxed and natural, her body slightly leaning forward, revealing an unintentional sense of intimacy and approachability. In the foreground is the space occupied by her arms and legs, with a black smartphone, a paper cup of coffee, and scattered tissues or small items on the table. The presence of these everyday items enhances the realism and sense of life in the scene. The middle ground features the dark brown wooden bar counter she leans on, with a smooth and warm surface and clean and flowing edges, extending to the right to form a visual guiding line deep into the frame. In the background, large floor-to-ceiling glass windows frame the cityscape—outside the windows, lush trees and dense branches and leaves, sunlight filtering through the leaves casting dappled shadows, while distant streets blur with pedestrians and vehicles weaving by, creating a quiet corner amid the city's noise. On the upper left side of the interior hangs a warm yellow vintage lampshade chandelier, creating a contrast between light and shadow with the natural light outside the window, enhancing the sense of depth and authenticity. The composition is arranged slightly to the left centered on the figure, using window frames and bar counters to form a framed composition, enhancing the sense of structure and spatial depth of the image. Hinting at her inner thoughts or emotional projection points. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere presents a warm and soft afternoon sunshine tone. Light enters the room diagonally from the upper right, creating a quiet, healing, and slightly artistic ambiance. It is both close to daily life and infused with artistic beauty, like a snapshot casually captured with a regular phone under natural light, full of emotional tension. It has a strong sense of immersion and storytelling, inviting imagination of her inner story and state of mind at that moment.",
