        {
          "id": "krea2-b3c2718fca71c2afcd833fd3",
          "alias": "单女棕外套城市忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits alone on an outdoor concrete bench, wearing a soft, fluffy brown wool coat with a light-colored short skirt underneath. Behind it is a white brick wall covered with graffiti, scattered with irregular black and white letters and abstract symbols, some of which are blurred, presenting the ruggedness and casualness of urban street art; The ground is covered with a thick layer of withered yellow fallen leaves, with leaves of various shapes and rich color layers, ranging from golden yellow to dark brown. Some leaves are already broken and curled, hinting at the changing of seasons and the passage of time; A few fallen leaves in the foreground are deliberately blurred to create a depth effect, guiding the viewer to focus on the subject; The composition uses a centrally symmetrical vertical style, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame. The bench extends horizontally to form a stable visual baseline, and the vertical lines on the background wall enhance the sense of depth; Light comes from the upper side, soft and even, without strong shadows, creating a diffused light atmosphere on cloudy or evening days. Scarves and white socks stand out especially in gray-toned environments; The overall color scheme leans toward cool gray tones, mainly gray-white and brown, accented with bright yellow scarves for visual focus and warmth. The transitions of light and shadow are delicate, creating a quiet, lonely yet slightly artistic atmosphere, as if a brief undisturbed moment on an autumn afternoon. It combines the realism of daily life with the delicate emotions unique to youth and the poetic beauty of the urban edge. The images are rich in detail and textures are realistic, as if captured by a high-resolution phone or portable camera under natural light, preserving the grainy texture and authentic feel of everyday life.",
