        {
          "id": "krea2-5e366f4357e9c0167cb6fe50",
          "alias": "单女红浴袍竹林俏皮站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in exquisite and luxurious ancao-style attire occupies the main position in the composition, naturally draped over her shoulders. Looking toward the upper left of the frame, it seems as if gazing into the distance at a heart-stirring moment, revealing a subtle and serene joy. She wore a bright and striking red outer robe, with a fluffy, soft white plush trim around the neckline. The texture was delicate and the color contrast was strong, making a strong visual impact; A light pink satin bow is tied at the chest, with a light and flowing ribbon that adds a touch of softness and playfulness to the overall look; The lining is an off-white silk-textured dress with delicate subtle embroidery patterns, and the waist belt is also decorated with intricate traditional patterns. The overall garment is rich in layers and meticulously detailed, showcasing a strong Eastern classical aesthetic charm; The foreground focuses on the area from her neck to chest, with a white fur collar, pink bow, and part of a red robe forming the visual center. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure's head slightly tilted, creating a subtle visual flow; The background blur presents a hazy, deep green forest or bamboo grove, with interwoven branches and leaves and dappled light and shadow, creating a tranquil and profound atmosphere, suggesting the scene may be located deep within a mountain forest or a classical garden; The entire painting is lighted gently and evenly, with the main light source coming from the front and sides. The shadow transitions are natural, without harsh contrasts of light and dark, giving the painting a warm, jade-like texture; The color scheme uses red and white as the main tones, supplemented by light pink and off-white, creating a warm, bright yet elegant visual tone. The deep green background serves as a contrast, making the main subject stand out more; The overall atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, full of poetry and storytelling. It combines the beautiful mood of traditional costume dramas with the delicate texture of modern photography. It feels like a classic shot from a costume drama or photo album, or precious moments captured by professional photographers using high-end equipment in the natural environment. The image texture is delicate and authentic, offering a strong immersive viewing experience, evoking the pleasant moments of strolling through the forest under the warm winter sun, or a morning after rain, when the air is filled with the scent of moist soil and grass. The character's expression is gentle as water, and the entire scene exudes a classical romantic atmosphere that transcends time and space, making one imagine her upcoming journey or the transformation of her mindset—a visual masterpiece that combines artistic depth with the warmth of everyday life.",
