        {
          "id": "krea2-4631effa6157a203c3b6e346",
          "alias": "单女黑长裤家中害羞站立侧头",
          "prompt": "The straps were thin with slight pleats, and the left strap faintly showed the edge of a black strap, suggesting she might have paired it with other clothes or backpacks; She wears black pants on the bottom, revealing only her waist and part of her hip line, creating a classic contrast of black, white, gray, and off-white; On the left edge of the foreground, there is a splash of bright red flowers in detail; the petals are full and three-dimensional, with high color saturation, creating a strong visual impact with the figure's cool-toned clothing, becoming the only warm accent in the painting; The background is a minimalist indoor environment, with clean and crisp pure white walls, faint shadow transitions in the corners, and the right wall slightly blurred, creating a shallow depth of field effect; The composition uses a centrally symmetrical style, with the figure standing in the center and the head slightly tilted to the right, creating a strong visual focal point and emotional connection; The shooting angle is level with a slight elevation angle, enhancing the person's affinity and presence; The light and shadow treatment is extremely soft and even, with the main light source coming from the left side of the figure, creating subtle layers of light and shadow without obvious hard shadows, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere; The overall color scheme is mainly low-saturation, with off-white, black, and gray as the main tones, complemented by red flowers as visual anchors. The color combination is harmonious and artistically dynamic; The visual atmosphere is tranquil and gentle, carrying the warmth and realism of everyday life, yet retaining carefully arranged aesthetic details. It feels like a moment casually captured by a phone under natural light at home, yet presenting professional-level lighting and composition awareness; The visual guidance begins with a red flower in the foreground, immersing the audience in her expressions and emotions; The image texture is delicate and realistic, presenting a high-resolution authentic photography style, rather than overly rendered CG or illustration effects; The entire image conveys a youthful, pure, gentle, and slightly shy temperament, combining a casual sense of everyday life with a serene artistic beauty, as if capturing the most touching moment of an ordinary day.",
