        {
          "id": "krea2-bb5ecc90dbab15c9ebbdbfc9",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙森林困倦站立亲吻",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in elegant beige Hanfu stands deep in the forest, holding a plain white oil-paper umbrella. The umbrella's surface glows with a soft, warm white sheen against the backlight, and the handle is made of warm bamboo, naturally hanging between her slender fingers. Her posture is composed yet carries a hint of classical solitude. It was as if time had frozen at this moment, or perhaps the Wind God was whispering beside her. There was a hint of thoughtful tenderness, but not joy, but a serene peace like morning dew, as if gazing into some unspeakable secret far away. Hanfu has wide, flowing hems, layers of fabric stretching out in the wind like clouds, with light and shadow flowing on them, forming folds of interplay of light and shadow. Every inch of fabric carries the breath of wind and the kiss marks of sunlight, and the loose belt at the waist adds a touch of free-spirited, fairy-like charm. The hem of her dress waves outward to the lower left of the frame, guiding the visual toward the body's center of gravity and emotional flow; The background is a densely colored deep green forest, with dense branches and leaves. Light pours down through gaps in the canopy, creating large bokeh circular light spots behind the scenes, creating a dreamy out-of-focus blur effect that makes the main figure stand out more and gives the painting an atmosphere of escaping the hustle and bustle, reclusive in the mountains. The composition uses a slightly upward angle, making the figure appear noble and upright. The umbrella rim almost spans the entire upper part of the frame, forming a natural visual framework. The use of light and shadow is highly dramatic, with strong backlight penetrating from behind, outlining her outline edges like a silhouette, creating a subtle transition between light and shadow. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, combining the ethereal and Zen qualities of Eastern classical aesthetics with modern photography's ultimate pursuit of light and motion capture, like a perfect fusion of ink painting and film documentary art. The entire painting exudes a gentle, restrained yet powerful vitality; viewers seem to hear the rustling of wind passing through the treetops, smell the faint fragrance of grass and trees in the air, and feel that tranquil beauty that transcends time and space.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
