        {
          "id": "krea2-183ad62380dcc9cba8c0f032",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙坐伸手",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly on a neatly trimmed, lush green lawn. She wears a simple, fitted black slip dress that outlines a smooth and curvaceous silhouette. On her feet, she wears platform white sneakers paired with white mid-calf socks, creating a striking black-and-white visual contrast. Her left hand gently rests on a hardshell book with a pristine white cover beside her, while her right hand is raised high, palm slightly spread like wings. It's as if you're embracing sunlight or catching the flow of the wind, lifting slightly with your posture, exuding a lazy yet vibrant youthful vibe. In the foreground is the quiet white book at her feet and the grass trampled underfoot. The grass leaves are clearly visible, some shimmering with a sparkling sheen from the sunlight, echoing her pristine white sneakers; In the middle shot, her extended sitting posture and raised arm lines form the visual focal point of the composition, with her body slightly tilted, creating a dynamic and balanced aesthetic; In the background, rows of towering dark green conifers cast dappled shadows on the lawn, creating a soft blur effect in the distance. The sky is bright but not overly harsh, presenting a pure light blue tone, making the entire scene feel open and tranquil. The composition uses medium to low angles, placing the figure slightly to the left center of the frame, using diagonally extended grass to guide the gaze, while the outstretched arms form a strong diagonal line, enhancing spatial depth and dynamic rhythm in the composition; The gaze extends upward along her raised arm, then naturally transitions to the trees in the background, forming a complete visual loop. In terms of lighting and atmosphere, sunlight slants down from the upper left of the frame, casting clear and soft shadows on her shoulders, arms, and legs. The skin appears delicate and translucent under the light, and the black clothes and white shoes create a striking contrast between light and shadow. The overall tone leans toward a natural and fresh warm tone, with a slight film-like soft-focus effect, giving the scene a slightly nostalgic and artistic atmosphere. It seems like a snapshot of life aesthetics casually captured with amateur equipment, yet it contains professional photographic compositional awareness and emotional expression, conveying a poetic daily life seeking a moment of tranquility beyond the bustling city and immersing oneself in one's own world.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
