        {
          "id": "krea2-cdcca907116429aec9b80986",
          "alias": "单女黑丝袜酒店忧伤坐摆拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sat elegantly on a bed covered with pristine white pleated sheets. She wore a fitted black long-sleeve top paired with a pair of semi-transparent black stockings adorned with fine black polka dots. Her legs were naturally crossed, her posture lazy yet full of allure. Add a touch of softness and mystery. The entire pose was both relaxed and deliberately created a dramatic tension that was carefully staged. In the foreground is a pure white, soft yet wrinkled bedsheet, whose texture naturally undulates and changes in light and shadow depending on the figure's sitting posture, creating a strong black-and-white contrast with the polka-dot stockings on the legs; The middle shot shows her full upper body and legs. The black clothing and stockings present a delicate texture under dim lighting, especially the polka dots on the stockings, which are clearly visible under the light, becoming one of the visual focal points; The background is a simple yet somewhat dated indoor environment. On the left, you can see a white shelf housing a small glass-door refrigerator, inside which bottled beverages can be faintly seen; Behind the shelf is a folding wooden striped chair with clean backrest lines that harmonize with the overall spatial style; The right wall is a plain light gray, with a slender white wire or decorative cord hanging from it, its end naturally hanging down, adding a touch of everyday life and subtle details to the space. The composition uses a medium to near angle angle, with the subject positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, and the slanted bed surface creates a dynamic balance with the figure's posture. then extending to the ankle with the polka dot details of the stockings. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is crucial: the overall scene is set in a low-saturation cool-toned environment, with light sources from the front left of the frame, soft and focused, while other areas are immersed in deep shadows, creating a strong chiaroscuro effect that enhances the contours and three-dimensionality of the figures, while also creating a private, ambiguous, and slightly melancholic nighttime atmosphere. The background walls and furniture almost completely blend into the shadows, further highlighting the presence of the main figures. The colors are slightly dull and oppressive, with minimal noise and slightly blurred edges, as if captured casually in a hotel room with a phone or regular camera. Yet, through post-processing, it retains sufficient artistic beauty and emotional expression, evoking moments of loneliness, sensuality, and self-reflection in urban nightlife. The entire image exudes a sophisticated decadent aesthetic, serene and narrative like a movie still. It is neither purely commercial portrait nor random snapshot, but an artistic image rich in personal emotional projection that lies somewhere in between.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
