        {
          "id": "krea2-dd66c8ff30ff327693fb8922",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣商店困倦站立持灯",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the center of a bright and tidy supermarket snack shelf aisle, wearing a lightweight, breathable white long-sleeve knit sweater printed with exquisite and dreamy cartoon patterns—including flying white doves, little angels holding candles, floating clouds, four-leaf clover, and a swan tied with a bow. The colors are light blue, light pink, and gold, creating a sweet and healing style that perfectly complements her gentle, sweet smile; Pair it with khaki high-waisted shorts with a crisp cut and pocket design, highlighting youthful energy. With a hint of playfulness and confidence, she pointed her right index finger at the red label for \"Popular Products\" on the left shelf, her fingertips light and expressive, as if sharing shopping tips or guiding viewers' attention; Her nails are neatly trimmed, painted with light pink manicures, with exquisite details. The foreground features the midsection of her body and her outstretched arms, occupying the main visual focus and creating a warm and interactive atmosphere. In the middle frame, shelves are neatly arranged on both sides; on the left, transparent packaging bags of jerky, spicy snacks, and promotional labels for \"social network/popular products\" are displayed; on the right side are multi-layered wooden shelves, neatly displaying a large number of puffed snacks in cups or bags, such as fries and corn kernels. The packaging is simple and uniform, creating a regular, repetitive visual rhythm. The background is the spacious interior of a supermarket, with a ceiling covered with neat white metal pipes and embedded lighting strips. In the distance, you can see a \"Checkout Counter\" sign and a blurred clothing display rack. The overall environment is clean and modern, but the subtle blur treatment focuses the focus on the figures. The lighting atmosphere is uniform and soft commercial lighting, with light sources coming from the ceiling, evenly distributed without obvious shadows, creating a fresh and transparent everyday feel; However, due to equipment limitations (presumably mobile phones or regular cameras), the images have slight noise and slightly low color saturation, presenting a realistic and everyday feel rather than a professional studio effect; The overall color scheme is mainly warm white and beige, complemented by orange-red and dark brown packaging and pale accents of character clothing, creating a warm and comfortable everyday atmosphere. It combines the practical functionality of a supermarket environment with the lively and youthful atmosphere infused by the characters. The visuals are filled with a relaxed and joyful sense of consumption and a fashionable attitude of self-expression, allowing urban youth to feel the ease and beauty of everyday shopping.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
