        {
          "id": "krea2-4d4962f3c82f3614b512bef9",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣沙发害羞坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A close-up of a woman's half-body adds a touch of laziness and gentleness. Her makeup is elegant and natural, looking directly into the camera, revealing a calm yet slightly shy gentle smile. Her overall expression appears serene, confident, and approachable. She wore an off-white slim-fit knit long-sleeve top with a V-shaped neckline and three small matching buttons on the chest, forming an elegant decorative detail. The shirt hugged her figure, outlining soft curves. The material was delicate and textured, presenting a balance of comfort and style. Her left hand is gently raised, fingers naturally bent; this gesture is both casual and full of beauty, adding a sense of dynamism and everyday life to the scene. She sits on a dark-colored cushioned sofa, with fluffy, soft brown velvet visible at the edges, giving a thick and warm texture that creates a soft color contrast with the character's clothing. The background is a minimalist, modern interior environment. On the left side is a large window with clean frame lines, allowing bright, evenly lit natural light to flow in from the upper left, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The feature wall is light grayish-white, clean and free of clutter, with faint vertical lines of curtains or blinds visible on the right, further enhancing the sense of depth and the minimalist style of modern homes. The composition uses a slightly upward-looking close-up perspective, with the figure occupying most of the space, the head positioned slightly above the visual center, and the body slightly tilted to the right, creating a natural sense of balance. The center is the details of her arms and top, while the background is blurred to highlight the main figure. Then spread it out into the background space. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft and warm, with the overall color scheme mainly in off-white, light gray, and dark brown, presenting a low-saturation cozyness. It feels like afternoon sunlight filling the room, creating a peaceful, comfortable, everyday, yet artistically beautiful home atmosphere. It's like a selfie portrait shot with amateur equipment full of poetic life and genuine emotions, full of delicate emotional expression and visual layering.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
