        {
          "id": "krea2-6e4377c219d80b3e2b0bebaa",
          "alias": "单女黑挂脖城市俏皮站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands elegantly in front of a vintage red brick fireplace, wearing a delicate black sleeveless halter dress adorned with a striking gold floral embroidery. Layers of flowers and leaves shine with a warm and luxurious metallic sheen, presenting a delicate texture and subtle highlights under soft light. Add a touch of softness and an unintentional laziness; Wearing a pair of slim, transparent-framed glasses exudes a calm, confident, yet slightly detached aura. Her arms are crossed over her chest, and her right hand gently holds an unfolded white lace folding fan. The edges of the fan are decorated with delicate hollowed-out patterns, the ribs are slender, and the overall shape is light and elegant, as if ready to add a lively touch to this tranquil scene at any moment. Her posture is calm yet full of tension, with her body slightly turned and head slightly tilted, creating a natural dynamic balance—neither stiff nor casual, perfectly embodying the \"freedom of control\" in modern Eastern aesthetics. In the foreground is a mirror-smooth, black marble fireplace countertop, reflecting the outlines of her arm and fan, enhancing spatial depth and material contrast in the composition. The middle shot is her complete figure and costume details, as well as the edge of the fireplace counter she leans on, serving as a stable focal point for the visual focal point. The background features a fireplace structure made of reddish-brown brick walls. The bricks are neatly arranged but have rough textures. Some brick joints show a pale grayish-white tone due to age or signs of use. The uneven texture of the bricks creates rich layers of light and shadow under light and shadow. The fireplace's arched doorway is symmetrical, giving the painting a solemn sense of classical architecture. The entire composition uses medium to near shots, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right, leaving enough space to display the environment and creating visual tension that is both intimate and distant. Light softly streams down from the upper left, giving the skin a healthy, warm tone, while creating subtle shadow transitions between the hem and the brick wall, enhancing the sense of dimension. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and restrained, with a soft-focus effect like afternoon sunlight filtering through a window frame. The overall color palette is dominated by warm brown, deep black, and gilded tones, complemented by a white fan as a cool accent. The colors are harmonious yet not monotonous, exuding an elegant, retro, and modern fashion vibe. The entire image appears to have been shot with professional photography equipment, with clear and sharp visuals and rich details, possessing cinematic texture and a sense of everyday storytelling. It resembles a carefully arranged portrait of a life scene, capturing the subtle dialogue between the characters' inner emotions and the external environment, conveying a quiet, confident, and composed urban female charm.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
