        {
          "id": "krea2-2e3848e6692c8815dec73069",
          "alias": "单女短裙摄影棚冷淡侧头",
          "prompt": "The neckline is designed in a vintage lapel style, with three round gold buttons arranged vertically on the chest. A wide belt in matching color is tied at the waist. The belt buckle is a simple rectangular metallic design, the hem reaches the knees, and the side slits reveal slender leg lines. The sleeves are three-quarter sleeves that naturally fall above the wrists. The overall cut hugs the figure, highlighting the beauty of curves. The foreground focuses on the upper body and waist area, with natural hand postures: the right hand lightly gripping near the belt and the left hand resting lightly on the edge of one pocket on the skirt hem. The fingers are long, and the nails are neatly trimmed and unadorned. The middle view shows the skirt and lower legs, with clear hem texture and rich light and shadow layers, highlighting the fabric's texture. The background features a light beige or cream-colored draped curtain, with evenly folded curtains forming soft vertical lines from top to bottom. Faint natural light filters through from behind the curtain, creating a warm and tranquil indoor atmosphere. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical portrait style, with the figure positioned at the center of the frame, the head slightly tilted upward, and the gaze horizontally aligned with the viewer, creating a stable and visually striking composition. Enhances the sense of depth in the image. The lighting atmosphere is dominated by soft, diffused light, with the light source coming from the upper left front of the subject, creating a natural transition between light and shadow. The shadows are soft and not abrupt, with a warm and neutral overall tone with a slight cool tone, creating a refined atmosphere reminiscent of a high-end fashion studio. While preserving the authentic texture of everyday shooting, there is no excessive post-processing. The details are rich but not oversaturated, presenting a professional-grade commercial model style while still retaining a natural, everyday feel and genuine emotional expression.",
