        {
          "id": "krea2-11e556536f4737cf18e1bc6b",
          "alias": "单女竹林严肃倚靠",
          "prompt": "The sleeve rises slightly with movement, the fabric is thin and translucent, the folds naturally smooth, and sunlight filters through the tulle on the skin, creating soft and delicate layers of light and shadow; The foreground focuses on her slender fingers and the edges of her sleeves, with clearly visible details, delicate textures, and distinct threads; The middle ground features her complete upper body and scroll, with a full-bodied composition rich in the mood of blank space; The background is blurred, faintly revealing the lush green branches and shadows deep within the bamboo forest, interwoven with mottled light and shadow. Several tall, slender bamboo poles stretch diagonally, creating a deep and tranquil courtyard atmosphere. In the distance, gray-white walls or wooden corridor structures can be faintly seen, revealing the elegant contours of Eastern garden architecture amid the blur. The entire composition uses shallow depth of field, with the main figure occupying the visual center. Through the foreground sleeves, the middle ground, the figures and scrolls, and the background bamboo shadows, the layers progress, creating a sense of depth and spatial layering; Guiding emotional resonance; The light is softly scattered, possibly from cloudy days or diffuse reflections from shaded trees. The overall tone leans toward a cool grayish-white, complemented by the green of bamboo leaves and the pure white of the clothing, creating a fresh and elegant contrast, creating an ethereal, tranquil, and slightly Zen-inspired artistic atmosphere; The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a high-end digital camera or a professional mirrorless camera, featuring cinematic soft focus and film graininess. Color saturation is moderate, highlights are slightly softened, shadows retain subtle layers, presenting a visually appealing yet artistically captivating effect from everyday amateur equipment—like a classical lady painted in ink wash, it combines the gentle atmosphere of real life with the spiritual core of Eastern aesthetics, evoking images of scholars and refined scholars in Jiangnan or talented women living in secluded mountains, conveying a sense of tranquility and purity. A life aesthetic full of cultural poetry.",
