        {
          "id": "krea2-2dc471f518b13ed5abafce31",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫广场俏皮倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "Her makeup is subtle yet expressive. Her right hand rests naturally on the armrest, with her nails adorned with colorful manicures, adding a touch of playfulness and vitality. She wore a cleverly designed top made mainly of semi-transparent gray-purple lace, with layers of delicate floral embroidery subtly outlining the skin's lines. The cuffs featured a pure white short-sleeve design, creating a striking contrast. The collar was a classic lapel-collared white shirt style, clean and sharp; She wore a high-waisted white pencil skirt with a smooth, structured fabric, a slim fit, and the hem naturally draped down to her calves, highlighting her long, balanced leg lines. The foreground focuses on the details of her hands and the details of the sofa, especially a small silver metallic square box placed at the lower right, with horizontal stripes on the surface that reflects a subtle sheen, hinting at refined lifestyle taste. The middle view covers most of her body and the sofa's curved backrest and cushions. The sofa is made of fine fabric with clearly visible textures, presenting a soft matte finish. The background is the interior environment. On the left is a bright window with off-white draped curtains that naturally diffuse into soft natural light. On the right is a light gray custom cabinet with simple doors without unnecessary decoration, equipped only with a slender metal handle. The overall space tones are mainly gray, white, and beige, creating a peaceful, sophisticated, and slightly cool atmosphere. The composition uses a close-up perspective from medium to close-up, with the character positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaning slightly against the sofa to create dynamic balance; The visual guide line is formed by her gaze, hand posture, and the curve of the sofa. In terms of light and shadow, the main light source comes from natural light outside the left window, soft and even, while a slight shadow is formed on the right side to enhance the sense of depth; The overall atmosphere is tranquil, gentle, and artistically beautiful, like a carefully arranged portrait of fashionable lifestyle, combining the warmth of everyday life with the sophistication of professional photography. The images are full of delicate emotional expression and aesthetic tension, conveying a state of urban women showcasing their charm and confident composure in private spaces.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
