        {
          "id": "krea2-4fd7a0079182799485ee974d",
          "alias": "单女蓝礼服门沉思",
          "prompt": "An elegant woman wore a light blue strapless gown, covered in delicate pleats and a lightweight sheer fabric, glowing with a gentle glow under soft natural light. She leaned against the corner where the pristine white wall met the gray mailbox wall, her posture calm yet slightly contemplative. She gently held a white letter in her hand, her fingertips trembling as if waiting or reminiscing. The entire composition uses a medium shot, with the figure occupying the center right of the frame. On the left is a white wooden door with arched glass window grilles. The door frame lines are clean and sharp, and the outline of a staircase can be faintly seen inside. On the right is a neatly arranged gray-white mailbox wall, with some mailbox openings revealing a corner of white letterhead, creating a visual rhythm. The background wall is pure white, with the ceiling curve echoing the top lines of the door frame. The overall space evokes the atmosphere of a classical architectural corridor or entrance, with layered light and shadow effects. Natural light streaming in from the upper left outlines the transition between light and shadow on the shoulders, neck, arms, and skirt hem. At the same time, clear geometric shadows are cast on the mailbox wall, creating a tranquil, private, and slightly nostalgic mood. The colors are mainly cool blue-white, with an overall cool and elegant tone. The image feels delicate and authentic, as if shot with amateur equipment, yet full of cinematic and poetic feel. It captures inner monologue and emotional tension in a tranquil moment. The atmosphere is poetic and picturesque, combining the simplicity of daily life with the depth and beauty of artistic photography.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
