        {
          "id": "krea2-6474e2a9ba0bd84e4193584d",
          "alias": "单女礼服城市困倦倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully leans against ancient, rugged rocks, wearing a spaghetti strap gown adorned with fluffy white feathers and intricate pearl and diamond decorations. The hem is layered and flowing like clouds, with delicate and delicate shoulder and neck lines, fair and radiant skin, gently brushing her shoulders and collarbones in the breeze. Her hands gently rest on the rough stone surface, her posture composed and full of storytelling. Her makeup is exquisite yet understated, and her overall aura is both ethereal and wild, like a fairy stepping out of a fairy tale or dream. In the foreground is the lower half of her body and the rock she leans on, whose surface is covered with moss and weathered textures, ranging from deep gray to dark green, with a rough and heavy texture, creating a strong visual contrast and material contrast with her light white feather skirt; The middle ground features her complete silhouette and scattered natural stones of various sizes and shapes around her, dotted with scattered dead leaves and tiny wild grass, enhancing the scene's realism and natural atmosphere; The background is a dense forest bathed in sunlight, with layers of leaves and dappled light and shadow. In the distance, an ancient low wall or slope made of stacked stones can be faintly seen, with green vegetation growing in the cracks of the walls, creating a deep and tranquil forest retreat. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, while the right side is left to suggest the environment extends. The horizontal aspect ratio is slightly wider, preserving sufficient background depth. For lighting and shadow, natural light is used, with light from the upper left of the frame, soft and with a distinct transition between light and dark, while creating sharp, dark areas in the rock shadows to enhance three-dimensionality and dramatic tension; The overall atmosphere presents a poetic beauty of \"urban fantasy blending with primal nature,\" combining the refinement of modern fashion photography with the primal vitality of wild forests. The color palette mainly contrasts warm and cool tones. The white feather skirt stands out against the dark rocks and green plants, creating a cool, pure, dreamy, and slightly mysterious visual experience. It feels like a daily image casually captured with a phone camera under the shade of an afternoon tree, full of artistic appeal—both real and surreal. It evokes the heroine in an art film or the elf character in a nature documentary.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
