        {
          "id": "krea2-8480a683320ee9f73b35c440",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙窗边微笑站立侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a pure white sleeveless spaghetti strap dress with a light and flowing hem, naturally falling below the knees. The fabric is delicate and smooth, glistening softly under the sunlight, highlighting her slender figure and healthy, fair skin; Natural curls add a touch of liveliness and a sense of freedom; She wears a gentle and serene smile, looking directly into the camera, exuding a confident and approachable aura; Her left hand gently carries a delicate, petite white quilted handbag. The bag features a classic design, featuring metal clasps and a striking red Dior logo. The shoulder strap features decorative details like stars and hearts, adding a playful and fashionable touch to the overall look. On her right wrist, she wears a simple silver bracelet, with a delicate diamond necklace adorning her neck. These accessories are understated and luxurious, perfectly complementing the white dress; Her posture is natural and relaxed, her body slightly turned to the side, her head slightly tilted, and her hands lightly holding the handbag, as if displaying or sharing this beauty. The entire movement is full of the spirit of life and artistic beauty. In the foreground is a vast expanse of vibrant green lawns, with clearly visible grass leaves and delicate textures. Under sunlight, they display different layers of green tones, with slightly undulating ground, providing a solid and textured visual foundation for the figures; The middle ground area consists of several lush shrubs and low green plants, rich in color and with clear edges, cleverly connecting foreground and background as transitional elements and effectively guiding the gaze backward; In the background is a magnificent historic building, with brick and stone exterior walls in a warm beige hue and strong colonial style. The arched window openings are arranged in an orderly fashion, topped with white railings and spired towers. The facade is rich in detail, including carved decorations, window lines, and multiple flag hanging points; Several flagpoles stand in front of the building, displaying the Malaysian flag. The red, white, and blue stripes and crescent star emblem flutter in the breeze, adding a strong regional cultural atmosphere; In front of the building, several tourists or passersby can be faintly seen, dressed in casual clothes, strolling or taking photos. Their silhouettes are blurred, which not only emphasizes the public nature and realism of the scene, but also avoids distracting the audience from the main characters. The composition uses the classic rule of thirds, with the figure positioned near the golden ratio point on the right side of the frame, creating a dynamic balance; The overall composition features a mid-angle perspective with a slight overhead angle, making the figure stand out and giving a sense of spatial depth; In terms of light and shadow, the natural sunlight from the upper left is soft and even, with moderate intensity and no strong shadows. The high gloss reflections on the skirt hem and handbag enhance the three-dimensional effect; The shadowed parts of the background buildings naturally contrast with the exposed surfaces, enhancing the building's sense of volume and texture; The overall atmosphere presents a fresh, bright, tranquil, and vibrant summer afternoon vibe, combining the solemn elegance of historic architecture with the youthful energy and fashionable taste of modern women, creating a harmonious and pleasing visual experience; The color palette is mainly white, green, and beige, accented with the red and blue of the national flag. The color combination is fresh and natural, with moderate saturation, giving a comfortable, clean, and premium impression; The entire frame uses precise depth control, with a clear and sharp foreground and moderately blurred background, highlighting the subject's refined details and emotional expression, while preserving the realism and narrative quality of the environment. It presents a documentary style that combines artistic beauty with everyday life, as if taken by a high-quality digital camera on a clear afternoon. The image quality is delicate, details rich, colors authentic, with no signs of excessive post-processing, allowing viewers to feel the beautiful moments of the real world.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
