        {
          "id": "krea2-b83e77a3253eb34aff663e3f",
          "alias": "单女灰西装博物馆困倦倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "In a spacious and bright modern car showroom, a graceful female model leans elegantly beside a deep blue-green Audi A7L coupe. She wears a neatly tailored, finely textured light gray-white suit, with short trousers that accentuate her long legs, paired with black pointed-toe stiletto sandals. The laces are adorned with delicate white label decorations, giving the overall look a blend of business sharpness and avant-garde fashion; Her makeup is delicate and soft, her posture calm and full of tension. Her left hand rests lightly at her waist, her right hand lets her hand hang naturally, fingertips slightly curled, showcasing the body language and command of a professional car model; The Audi A7L she leans on has sculptural body lines, with a metallic paint surface reflecting a delicate luster under the showroom lighting. The taillights feature a through-type LED design, with red light bands blazing like flames. The wheels are multi-spoke black alloy with the Audi Four Rings emblem in the center. The rear of the vehicle clearly displays the \"A7L\" model badge, and the floor behind the car is a white reflective stand, reflecting the reflections of the vehicle and its people, enhancing the sense of spatial layering. In the background is a massive gray concrete wall, with the brand name \"SAIC Audi\" engraved in simple and powerful white lettering, and above it floats Audi's iconic four-ring logo—simple yet powerful; The upper structure of the exhibition hall faintly reveals glass curtain walls and hanging professional stage lighting equipment; some areas are enveloped in soft pink and blue gradient light and shadow, creating a dreamy technological atmosphere; The entire composition was shot from a medium to low angle, with the model positioned in the left third and the vehicle occupying the right two-thirds, creating visual balance and dynamic guidance. The gaze extends from the model's slender ankles upward to the head, then transitions to the rear of the vehicle and the brand wall. The lighting is meticulously used, with the main light source coming from the front right. The showroom's top spotlights create subtle contrasts of highlights and shadows on the car surface, enhancing the vehicle's three-dimensional sense and material expression. The overall atmosphere blends high-end automotive aesthetics, modern urban fashion, and the serene poetry of artistic photography. Cool tones are the main tone, complemented by warm lighting, creating a visual experience that is both rational and calm, full of warmth. It feels as if capturing the pinnacle moment of a futuristic car launch or top-tier auto show. Every detail is meticulously designed and scheduled, silently telling the perfect fusion of speed, elegance, and technology, presenting a visual work with strong commercial value and artistic appeal.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
