        {
          "id": "krea2-43f42110a08913e53ee329d8",
          "alias": "单女白T恤门俏皮站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beside the open door of a white sedan. She wears a lightweight, breathable white short-sleeved top with a black camisole underneath, and dark denim shorts, with the hems rolled up to reveal her slender, slender legs. Her hands are folded in front of her abdomen, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with elegant white nails, her fingertips slightly curved, her posture natural and captivating. The vehicle is a modern, minimalist white SUV or sedan. The doors are fully open, the door frames and body lines are smooth, the metal door handles and black rubber sealing strips are clearly visible, and the seats are made of dark leather. The interior is clean and textured, and the rearview mirror faintly reflects the streets and greenery. The background is the entrance of a modern urban building, with walls made of white bricks, complemented by wooden window frames and eave structures. Above hangs a blurry sign reading \"Get in,\" and on the adjacent wall is a blue house number \"132-7\" label. Through the glass window, one can see some open spaces inside and the outlines of trees in the distance. The entire composition uses a medium shot, with the figure occupying the center, slightly left, the car door forming a natural diagonal to guide the visual flow, the foreground showing partial parts of the vehicle body and door edges, the middle shot focusing on the person's entire body and the interior space, and the background blurred to highlight the subject. The light comes from the warm natural afternoon, slanting in from the right front of the figure, casting soft shadows on the edge of the door and the floor, creating a sense of depth and layering. The overall atmosphere is relaxed, stylish, and slightly laid-back with the urban lifestyle. The main color palettes are white, beige, and dark blue denim, complemented by wood tan and architectural gray-white. The tones are fresh and bright but not overly saturated, presenting a natural realism common in everyday photography while also featuring carefully composed artistic beauty. It feels like capturing a life moment with a high-resolution portable camera on the streets and alleys. It is both documentary and aesthetically expressive, harmoniously coexisting with the people and environment. It conveys the image of a modern woman who is youthful, energetic, independent, and confident.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
