        {
          "id": "krea2-351a1f17ab818d45381ce4a7",
          "alias": "单女粉毛衣洗手台专注坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits intently at the pottery workbench, gently and powerfully shaping the moist clay on the spinning wheel, her fingertips covered in fine white clay, glowing gently under soft natural light; It feels as if you are immersed in a tranquil world of creation; She wore a soft, fluffy light pink knit cardigan with slightly rolled cuffs revealing her slender wrists, layered over a white lace base layer, and a simple and exquisite gold ring necklace around her neck, complemented by a golden bracelet wrapped around her wrist for a harmonious metallic sheen; She wore a dark blue denim suspend dress over it, with the hem naturally falling to her knees. The overall look was both casual and full of artistic flair, perfectly blending with the ceramic art scene; Her hands wear transparent gloves covered with a thin layer of mud, her knuckles distinct, her movements skillful and rhythmic, carefully shaping a lump of moist clay into a round, full, cup-shaped vessel. The pottery wheel slowly rotates, causing changes in the clay's shape, and the edges of the sink are stained with splashed clay, creating a realistic and vivid creative atmosphere; In the foreground is a rotating pottery wheel and its surrounding yellow plastic water basin; the surface of the clay is smooth like a mirror, reflecting faint light. Water stains and mud marks can be seen on the inner walls of the basin, suggesting the ongoing production process; The middle frame depicts the woman's entire body and her workspace. Her body leans slightly forward, her posture natural and relaxed yet full of power. The background is a blurred indoor pottery studio space, with colorful ceramic works and tools placed on wooden cabinets and shelves. Faintly visible cups, paint bottles, and pottery tools in different colors create a warm and creative living scene; The composition uses a medium to close-up perspective, with the main figure positioned slightly to the left center of the image, and the dynamic lines of the rotating pottery wheel naturally lead to the item display area in the right background of the painting; The lighting effect is soft and even, with the main light source coming from the left or upper side of the frame, creating bright and warm diffused light, while light shadows are cast behind and to the right to enhance the sense of depth and layering; The overall atmosphere is tranquil and focused, filled with a strong sense of artistic creation and lifestyle aesthetics. It combines the rustic authenticity of handmade art with a gentle and healing feeling, as if time stretches out in this moment, leaving only the pure moment where fingertips blend with earth. The painting features warm pink, light blue, and natural wood tones, accented with golden jewelry, presenting a kind of beauty and poetry captured casually in daily life. It is like a real life art photograph taken with amateur equipment, rich in details without clutter. Full of emotional warmth and visual appeal.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
