        {
          "id": "krea2-313f7f9aa5e883c1e2d08e93",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫广场俏皮站立注视",
          "prompt": "A female student stands at the edge of a wide paved plaza on a university campus, wearing a neat, crisp white long-sleeved shirt paired with a deep blue school uniform pleated skirt and a blue-and-white diagonal striped tie. The tie naturally falls over her chest, with the collar slightly open to reveal the collar of her light-colored shirt underneath, with delicate button details at the cuffs. Her posture is natural and relaxed with a touch of playfulness and confidence. Her makeup is exquisite but not overly heavy, presenting an overall beauty where youthful energy and campus vibe intertwine. The foreground is the lower middle part of her body, including the skirt, waistline, and the gray stone curb and round stone ball decorations on the left side. These elements form the solid visual foundation of the scene. The ground is a smooth dark gray asphalt pavement marked with yellow traffic markings, and in the distance, a black sedan can be seen parked by the roadside. The middle ground is where she stands and the plaza area extending behind her. The ground is paved with neatly arranged gray bricks, dotted with several rounded gray-white stone balls, forming rhythmic spatial guiding lines. In the background are two red brick buildings: on the left is a multi-story modern-style teaching building with neatly arranged windows, and on the right is a curved red brick building with simple roof lines. The facade glows with a warm orange-red hue in the sunset, contrasting with the pale blue gradient of the sky. Between the buildings are several tall trees with sparse branches and leaves, suggesting the season may be early spring or late autumn, with their shadows stretched and cast on the ground. In composition, a slightly upward perspective is used, making the figure appear more upright and prominent, while the lines extending from the square guide the gaze to focus on the subject. The visual guidance is clear: from the stone spheres and ground lines in the foreground, to the postures and costume details in the middle ground, and then to the background buildings and the layers of the sky, creating a sense of depth from near to far, from solid to void. The lighting and shadow atmosphere presents the soft warm glow of the evening \"golden hour,\" with sunlight slanting in from the right rear of the figure, enhancing the sense of depth. Light filters through the gaps in the leaves, falling onto the ground and the figures, creating a mottled effect of light and shadow. The overall tone is warm with a slight film texture, moderate color saturation, and soft contrast between light and shadow, creating a peaceful, gentle, and slightly nostalgic campus atmosphere. It feels like freezing a lazy moment after school when sunlight floods the campus. It combines the everyday warmth of daily life with the purity and beauty unique to youth, with cinematic narrative and emotional tension.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
