        {
          "id": "krea2-7c0c5771ac728dacb8bbbd54",
          "alias": "单女绿连衣裙街道冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under the afternoon sunlight on a city street corner, wearing a light light green spaghetti strap long dress. On the left is a beige-colored old apartment building with neatly arranged windows, a hanging clothes rack and miscellaneous items hanging on the balcony, and a dark gray modern building wall decorated with geometric lines. The ground floor is an open-air café or restaurant, with a few tables and chairs faintly visible. Several customers sit in the shadows chatting, their silhouettes blurred to create a sense of spatial depth; The entire composition uses shallow depth of field, with the focus precisely on the woman, while the background elements are softly blurred, forming a visually layered spatial structure; The visual guide line is formed by a light and shadow strip formed by sunlight slanting, extending from the upper left corner to the lower right, cleverly directing the viewer's gaze toward the main figure; The light comes from the upper left of the painting, a tough yet warm daylight. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting dappled shadows, while casting heavy shadows on the sides of the body and the ground, creating a strong contrast between light and dark; The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, full of the leisurely vibe of urban life, yet also reveals a hint of restrained loneliness, as if time has frozen at this moment; The color palette mainly features warm and cool contrasts, with pale green dresses visually balanced with dark gray buildings. The warm yellow tones of sunlight intertwine with the cool blue tones of shadows, creating a retro texture reminiscent of a film film; The image quality leans toward a realistic photography style, simulating high-megapixel camera shooting effects. The details are rich, noise control is well-controlled, and it has a visual tension that is both everyday and artistically beautiful, allowing people to feel the tranquility and beauty of an ordinary city corner gently wrapped in sunlight.",
