        {
          "id": "krea2-1e8bf0ed470741d1793ccfe6",
          "alias": "单女围巾山野沉思站立泼洒",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways at the edge of the wooden boardwalk, slightly tilting her head to gaze into the distance, her expression calm and slightly contemplative. The rugged woven patterns are clearly visible, warm yet exotic. Her right hand gently rests on the edge of the shawl, her posture relaxed and elegant; In the foreground is a slightly rough-textured log boardwalk, with wooden board gaps and natural grain clearly distinguishable, adding a rustic and authentic feel to the scene; In the middle is a crystal-clear alpine lake, as clear as emerald. The water is calm and still, reflecting the rugged rocks along the shore and the distant mountain silhouettes. Several small waterfalls cascade down the lakeshore from the rock layers, their gentle currents shimmering in the sunlight; The background features majestic rolling mountain ranges, with nearby slopes covered in dense and verdant coniferous forests stretching upward. The mountain tops are covered in pure white snow, appearing in a hazy blue-gray tone under the mist. The sky is clear and slightly bright, with thin clouds, and light pouring from the upper left side gently outlines the figures and the mountain structure; The composition uses a medium shot close-up perspective, with the figure positioned in the right two-thirds of the frame, body facing left, forming a visual flow extending deep into the background; The overall composition was shot in natural light, with delicate transitions between light and shadow. The shawl's texture underwent subtle changes in light and shadow, and the water reflected the sky and mountain shadows, creating a cool and ethereal atmosphere. The colors are mainly cool tones, with the lake's green and the mountain's dark green complementing the snowy peaks' pure white. The warm blue and white tones of the characters' clothing serve as visual focal points, creating a contrast of cool and warm without feeling awkward; The image quality leans toward the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting, with rich details without excessive sharpening, retaining slight noise and natural color deviations. It feels like a moment captured on a plateau morning with a phone or small camera, infused with the breath of life and cultural warmth. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and distant, full of poetry and a longing to explore nature, conveying a small yet profound resonance between people and magnificent mountains and rivers.",
