        {
          "id": "krea2-77f60d6571b697d33ce6990e",
          "alias": "单女金礼服家中愤怒坐",
          "prompt": "A beautiful bride sits upright on the grand bed in the bridal chamber, covered with bright red silk sheets. She wears a gorgeous, gold-embroidered Chinese wedding dress. Both the top and long skirt feature golden phoenixes as the main motif, complemented by layers of auspicious clouds, peonies, and scroll motifs. The highly three-dimensional embroidery shines under the soft warm light, as if flowing molten gold and pearl luster intertwine. The fabric is as delicate and smooth as velvet, and every detail reveals the nobility and festivity of traditional craftsmanship. Sunlight filters through the window lattice, slanting through the folds of the sheets, creating interplay of light and shadow on the fabric surface. The soft and warm light creates a cozy and intimate atmosphere; The background is a minimalist, modern bedroom environment. Light brown wooden walls and white cabinets create a clean and clean backdrop. Red paper cuttings or floral decorations symbolize festivity hang on the walls. On the left, a corner of the nightstand and embedded light strips emit a warm yellow glow, while on the right is a half-open glass door or wardrobe door frame. The overall layout is spacious but does not overshadow the main focus, firmly focusing on the figure. The composition uses a close-up perspective from medium to close-up, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, the body slightly turned but the head facing the camera, forming the classic \"three-division\" composition, with a stable and dynamic visual focus; The use of lighting is extremely meticulous, with subtle shadows on the left side enhancing the sense of depth, while the background areas are slightly blurred to make the subject stand out; The overall color palette is a vibrant Chinese red as the main tone, paired with warm tones like gold, silver, and off-white. The colors are highly saturated but not glaring, creating a strong traditional wedding festive atmosphere. The contrast between the gentle and tranquil expressions of the characters and the modern minimalism of the environment gives the painting a sense of artistic beauty that is both classical and fashionable. The lighting effect is delicate and soft, without harsh light and dark boundaries. Instead, diffuse reflection creates a soft skin gloss and a metallic reflective texture of clothing, enhancing the realism and immersion of the image; The overall atmosphere presents a sense of \"grand joy in tranquility,\" combining the solemnity of a wedding ritual with the bride's personal tenderness and peace in everyday home environments, as if freezing the moments of contemplation and happiness before a crucial moment in life; The image style leans toward high-end portrait works shot in professional studios, with strong narrative and emotional resonance, like a meticulously painted meticulous figure painting blending modern photographic art. It is suitable for wedding album covers, fashion magazine features, or cultural promotional posters, perfectly interpreting the Eastern aesthetic philosophy of \"festive but not ostentatious, magnificent but not ostentatious.\"",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
