        {
          "id": "krea2-d0f2956155abe808c6a7837a",
          "alias": "单女蓝旗袍竹林冷淡站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman is the absolute subject of the painting, adding a touch of natural vitality; The overall makeup is clean and natural, without heavy contouring; She wore a light blue-gray graded printed stand-collar qipao-style top with an oriental charm. The fabric was light and flowing, with delicate textures that blended like an ink wash landscape. The frog button design on the chest was simple yet elegant; Her left hand gently holds a simple white oil-paper umbrella, with a handle in a warm natural wood color. The canopy surface is slightly tilted to block some light above, casting a soft shadow over her shoulder; Her right hand gently held up a slender green leaf branch, full and deep green, forming a subtle contrast with the cool tones of her clothes. Her fingertips were slender and fair, her nails neatly trimmed, and her movements were full of poetry and tranquility. Especially the carefully held green leaves and the grip of the umbrella handle create a strong visual center and emotional connection; The middle shot shows her complete upper body silhouette and clothing textures, with the pleats of the qipao, the buttons on the collar, and the curve of the cuffs all clearly displayed, and the fabric presenting a silky sheen and breathable texture; The background is completely blurred, with faint gray-green plant outlines and mottled light and shadow—possibly old trees or bamboo groves in the courtyard. This shallow depth of field reinforces the subject's status and gives the painting a sense of hazy, poetic spatial depth. The entire image uses a close-up composition, with the figure occupying most of the frame, the head slightly tilted to one side. The visual guide line extends diagonally upward from the lower left corner of the umbrella handle to the shoulder, while the green leaf at the fingertip of the right finger forms a natural visual guiding line. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and lingering, carrying a subtle artistic retro vibe and Eastern aesthetic conception. The colors are mainly low-saturation gray-blue, off-white, and olive green, creating a fresh and moist feeling like a clear rain or shrouded in mist. The light and shadow transitions are soft and delicate, without strong contrasts of light and shadow, highlighting the delicate texture of the characters' skin and the layered texture of the clothing materials; The overall visuals present a sense of realism reminiscent of 'everyday amateur equipment shooting'—not professional studio works, but moments captured by handheld cameras or mobile phones in a natural environment, with slight noise and soft caustic effects. It feels as if time is gently frozen in that moment, combining a sense of everyday intimacy with artistic beauty of blank space. It evokes the fleeting excitement at the entrance of Jiangnan's misty alleys, by the bluestone roadside, or in front of an ancient house. The mood is restrained yet full of vitality, making it a piece that combines classical charm with modern aesthetics. Portrait photography works full of narrative tension and emotional warmth.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
