        {
          "id": "krea2-8f98076b7b59de0fc71a23b6",
          "alias": "单女短裙室内害羞倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "The waist is cinched to outline graceful curves, the edge of the skirt reaches the knees with wavy lace trim, and a black satin bow tie around the neck. The center of the bow tie is set with a sparkling crystal, blending classical softness with modern fashion. With a slightly voluminous texture, the makeup is delicate and soft, revealing a confident yet slightly shy charm. She leans slightly against the hood of a streamlined light purple or pale pink metallic sports car, her left hand gently touching the edge of the roof, her right hand naturally with her hips, a posture both relaxed and powerful, perfectly showcasing the harmonious blend of human lines and mechanical aesthetics. In the foreground, the car's smooth, mirror-like surface reflects ambient light and the silhouettes of figures. The taillights have a transparent red plastic texture, with sharp lines and a sense of technology. The paint surface develops high-gloss reflective stripes under strong light, enhancing the three-dimensional layering of the image. The middle shot consists of the model's body and parts of the body, forming a visual focal point. The white lace dress stands out against a cool-toned background, creating a subtle contrast with the body color. The background is deeply blurred, presenting a blurred light spot and geometric outline of a blend of deep blue and dark purple, with faint outlines of other booths, lighting equipment, or audience silhouettes in the exhibition hall. This creates a professional atmosphere for a large auto show or high-end car launch, while the shallow depth of field effect firmly focuses the audience's attention on the foreground figures and vehicles. The composition uses a classic rule of thirds combined with center offset. The model is positioned near the golden ratio point on the right side of the image, with the body facing forward to the left and the head slightly tilted. The overall illumination uses warm, soft lighting, with the main light source coming from the upper front of the model, complemented by side contour light outlining the silhouette. The car body is illuminated by the top spotlight, creating bright highlights that contrast strongly with the shadowed areas and enhance the material's expressiveness. In terms of lighting and atmosphere, the entire photo is filled with a tranquil, dreamy, and futuristic high-end vibe. The colors are mainly cool blue-purple, accented with warm white and pink, creating a unique ambiguous hazy feeling in nighttime or indoor lighting environments. The overall image presents the effect of a professional studio or high-end auto show shooting, while retaining the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment—such as slight noise graininess, natural dynamic range control, and non-fully idealized light transitions. This gives the image a more everyday feel and authentic appeal rather than an overly polished commercial commercial style, giving the image a unique beauty that is both artistic depth and close to real life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
