        {
          "id": "krea2-acbacee9787a26ea74a00baf",
          "alias": "单女全裸红礼服室内愤怒站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a bright red one-shoulder bow gown stands gracefully on the steps inside a modern building. Her hands are folded over her chest, and her left hand gently holds a square clutch edged with silver sequins. On her wrist is a simple yet exquisite silver bracelet that reflects a delicate metallic texture in the light; Wearing a pair of nude high heels, the upper is smooth as a mirror, with sharp heel lines that create a harmonious visual extension with the overall look. The entire red dress was highly dramatic: one side of the wide fabric covered the shoulders like wings and tied into a huge three-dimensional bow, while the other side exposed skin, creating a strong visual contrast and asymmetrical beauty. The hem hugged the body's curves up to the mid-calf, with a delicate and smooth texture that presented a silky soft sheen. In natural light, it reflected slightly but was not glaring, outlining her graceful waist and hip lines. In the foreground is the stairway platform she stands on, made of light gray terrazzo or concrete texture with speckled texture. The surface is smooth and clean, with clear and powerful edges. Each step progresses backward, guiding the gaze to focus on the subject; The middle ground features layered stepped structures, where horizontal lines and vertical postures create geometric tension, while the stepped shadows are richly layered, enhancing the spatial depth of the composition; The background is a simple and spacious interior space, with large windows streaming in bright daylight. Outside, the hazy outlines of buildings or the sky can be faintly seen. The walls also use a simple light gray tone, with no unnecessary decorations, creating a minimalist aesthetic atmosphere and making the figures the absolute visual focal point. In terms of composition, a full-body portrait is used vertically, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. The diagonal lines formed by steps are used to enhance the dynamic and stable image, while leaving a large negative space on the right side to balance the image and reinforce the character's presence. The visual guide converges at the center of the composition, starting from the crossed posture of the characters' arms, the lines of the legs, and the upward trend of the steps. The handling of light and shadow is extremely meticulous, with natural soft light from the top and sides evenly casting out, highlighting the color saturation and three-dimensional fold details of the clothing, avoiding awkward shadow divisions; The overall atmosphere combines urban fashion with artistic expressiveness, combining the refined luxury of a haute couture fashion show with a subtle sense of restrained emotional tension. It seems she is waiting for an important moment or has just experienced a silent farewell. The painting is dominated by warm reds, with restrained yet sophisticated color combinations, conveying an image of an independent woman who is both confident and slightly detached. Although the entire scene appears ordinary, it is actually carefully arranged, with a strong cinematic feel and studio-level lighting. Like a narrative fashion blockbuster captured with a professional camera in a high-end indoor setting, every light and shadow and every texture silently tells the story and emotions behind the characters, leaving a lasting impression.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
