        {
          "id": "krea2-45a230ff3267d6a0e443ca16",
          "alias": "单女蓝制服教室愤怒坐注视",
          "prompt": "In a spacious classroom, sunlight streams in through the high windows, creating warm and soft beams that illuminate the entire space and create a peaceful and nostalgic atmosphere. The main figure is a girl dressed in a deep blue sailor uniform, sitting at a desk holding a book with a green cover in both hands, looking especially graceful. The collar of the sailor uniform is tied with a white bow, and the collar is embroidered with a delicate school emblem. The details are clearly visible, and the white stripe design on the cuffs adds layers to the uniform. The girl's posture is relaxed and natural, as if enjoying a moment of tranquility and freedom. In the foreground is a wooden desk, smooth and finely textured. On the desk sits a book with a deep blue cover, its pages slightly opened, and beside it sits a blue pencil. These items are all within focal points, with rich details. The composition uses a high-angle top-down shot, making the classroom's layout clearly visible. The desks and chairs extend in regular rows into the background, creating a strong perspective effect that guides the gaze toward the distance. The middle view is where the girl sits. The surrounding environment is relatively open, while the background gradually blurs other desks and chairs. The color shifts from bright yellow to dim shadows, enhancing the sense of depth in the space. In terms of lighting, warm yellow sunlight streams in from the left, casting long shadows on the floor and tabletop, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The light is soft but not glaring, with the overall color palette mainly warm yellow, brown, and deep blue. The color coordination is harmonious and unified, creating a warm, quiet, and slightly melancholic campus atmosphere. The images present a sense of realism reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment shooting, rich in details but not exaggerated, as if recording an ordinary yet beautiful moment, full of strong artistic atmosphere and emotional resonance. Every element in the frame is carefully arranged—from the expressions of the people to the changes in light and shadow, from the placement of objects to the layout of the space—together creating a scene full of poetry and memories, evoking memories of those simple and precious moments in youth. The entire scene is free of unnecessary decoration or distractions. Maintaining a minimalist aesthetic style, viewers can focus on the emotional expression of the characters and the tranquil beauty of the environment. The composition is stable and rhythmic, with visual guidance flowing naturally. Starting from books and pencils in the foreground, extending along the lines of the desk to the girl, and finally disappearing deep into the background, forming a complete visual pathway. This design not only enhances the three-dimensional effect of the painting but also deepens the viewer's immersive experience. The overall atmosphere is both real and dreamlike, with the texture of real life and an idealized romantic touch. It seemed to freeze an eternal memory of growth, dreams, and youth.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
