        {
          "id": "krea2-0e68a55ad6620225c4f65983",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫商店沉思坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a plastic chair in a convenience store, wearing a white shirt and a dark school uniform jacket, with a dark blue tie with golden stripes tied at the collar. She sits sideways, her expression thoughtful and playful, as if savoring candy or lost in some kind of daydream. Her left hand rests naturally on her lap, wearing a plaid mini skirt. In the foreground, the lower half of her body and the edge of the chair are visible, while the background is a blurred convenience store shelf displaying colorful snack packaging, with warm and soft lighting. It presents a typical indoor commercial lighting effect, with overall light coming from above and sides, creating a natural transition of light and shadow and creating a warm and intimate atmosphere. The composition uses low-angle downward shots to highlight the subject, using shallow depth of field to blur the background and enhance the visual focus on the subject. The shelves on the right and the glass door frame on the left form a diagonal to guide the view. The colors are mainly warm yellow, interspersed with colorful packaging accents on the shelves. The overall tone is harmonious and unified, with soft light and shadow and rich layering. It presents a tranquil moment captured in daily life, as if captured by an ordinary camera without any accidental capture. Without excessive embellishment, it preserves the authentic texture of life. The figures' postures are naturally relaxed, movements rich in detail, and the entire image is full of story and emotional warmth, like a photo capturing an ordinary afternoon memory, allowing people to feel the passage of time and inner peace",
