        {
          "id": "krea2-f66aacdee63f43979b84c2ef",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫忧伤倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "She tilts her head slightly, her expression calm and slightly contemplative, as if feeling the warmth of sunlight or immersed in some kind of thought, appearing light and dynamic. She wears a thick off-white turtleneck sweater or scarf, the soft fabric clearly visible in the light, with natural edges flowing and a gentle transition with the neck line. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the composition, with the head slightly tilted, creating an asymmetrical yet balanced visual beauty. The details are rich, with the middle being part of her shoulders and scarf, with distinct layering The background is completely blurred, presenting a blurry dark tone, with faint outlines of trees or buildings visible, creating a shallow depth of field effect that highlights the subject. The composition uses close-ups to emphasize the emotional expression and texture of the characters, extending upward along her line of sight, guiding viewers to the light source at the top of the frame. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is mainly warm tones, with strong backlight from diagonally above making the character's outline very clear, creating a distinct backlight effect that brings a dreamlike texture, with one side illuminated while the other side is shadowed. The strong contrast between light and shadow highlights the sense of depth. The overall lighting is soft and grainy, reminiscent of film photography. The tone leans toward yellow-brown, presenting a retro warm filter effect. The image also features slight noise and slight overexposure, enhancing realism and nostalgia. It feels like capturing the moment sunlight filters through the leaves on an autumn afternoon. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, gentle, and poetic, with a hint of melancholy and a delicate perception of life. For example, everyday moments captured with an old-fashioned film camera in natural light—without deliberate staging, yet full of the authenticity of life and the appeal of art",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
