        {
          "id": "krea2-cc52b00f944bf74d73c1f4ee",
          "alias": "单女红毛衣街道忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the steps at a city street corner, wearing a thick red knit sweater with clearly visible texture, presenting a warm and soft texture. The sleeves hang naturally, creating natural pleats and layers. She pairs dark pants with a simple yet everyday style, adding a touch of lazy and casual beauty. She leans slightly to the side, her right hand resting gently on her knee, her left hand resting on the black bag beside her, her posture relaxed and natural. There is a faint sense of melancholy and contemplation, as if gazing into some distant memory or future. The subject is positioned slightly to the right of the foreground, and the composition is shot at a low angle, making the figure stand out and create a strong visual impact. The background is a corner of a city street, with a gray asphalt pavement edged with yellow traffic markings. Next to it stands a green traffic cone with white reflective stripes on the cone, showing clear details. In the background is a yellow column-shaped object, possibly a signal control box or a public facility Behind is a light blue metal railing with a grid-like pattern with clean and regular lines. In the distance, you can faintly see the blurred outlines of buildings and the faint glow of the sky, creating a sense of spatial depth. The light comes from the upper left of the painting, soft natural daylight. Sunlight filters through the clouds, creating a bright and even illumination effect. The outline is clear and shadows soft. The sweater's surface creates a delicate transition of light and shadow under the light, enhancing the material's sense of realism. At the same time, a faint shadow is cast on the right side of the figure and on the ground. It further enhances the sense of three-dimensionality, with the overall color scheme dominated by warm tones. The red sweater becomes the visual focal point, forming a sharp contrast with the cool background. However, through harmonious color coordination, the overall balance of the image is maintained. The atmosphere is tranquil and slightly lonely, like an autumn afternoon with bright sunshine, few people, and time seemingly standing still. The entire scene exudes a poetic and gentle charm found in everyday life. The image is presented with a film photographic texture, with slight graininess and soft color saturation, and the tone slightly warmer. Moderate exposure, rich details, and meticulous composition, using the relationship between characters and background elements to create a narrative, guiding the viewer's gaze from the foreground figures to the background streets, forming a natural visual flow. The distribution of light and shadow is reasonable and layered, making the overall image both realistic and artistically appealing, like a moment captured with an old-fashioned film camera, full of life's authenticity and emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
