        {
          "id": "krea2-3c57f8c01b8ca7fa8165f66d",
          "alias": "单女白T恤持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a white crew-neck T-shirt with red diagonal stripes on the chest, layered with an off-white knit cardigan. The knit texture is clearly visible, with rich details on the sleeves and shoulders, presenting a warm and comfortable feel. The overall posture is relaxed and natural, as if immersed in the pleasant moments brought by sunlight and sea breeze. The foreground is the main subject. Occupying most of the composition, the composition uses close-ups. The background is a fine beach, with distinct grains of sand. The surface shows natural textures and unevenness formed by stepping or wind, presenting a gradient from light beige to pale yellow. Light and shadow shine down from the upper left, creating a soft contrast between light and dark. Highlights are bright and transparent, shadowed areas transition delicately, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, full of the relaxed and cozy summer seaside atmosphere. The colors are mainly warm tones, with white, beige, light yellow, and red accents creating a harmonious combination The image has a slight film texture, natural graininess, and a slightly retro filter tone, presenting a nostalgic atmosphere reminiscent of vintage camera shooting. The lens is a mid-focal length portrait lens with moderate depth control, soft background blur while retaining some detail, and the composition emphasizes emotional expression, forming a complete emotional loop. The overall style combines everyday documentary and artistic beauty, like capturing moments casually with a lightweight rangefinder camera—authentic and warm",
