        {
          "id": "krea2-ca3bb3bba1714bc429c4c41a",
          "alias": "单女黑制服窗边坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the floor of a traditional Japanese indoor space, dressed in a black sailor uniform with a white bow tie and cuff decorations clearly visible. She wears a white shirt underneath, a black short skirt, and semi-transparent black stockings. Her legs stretch out naturally, feet slightly crossed, her posture elegant and relaxed, naturally draped over her shoulders, looking directly at the camera. The overall aura is calm and full of storytelling. On the left side of the foreground is a low wooden table, on which sits a golden lotus-shaped incense burner or ornament, beside which is a rough stone or wooden block. On the right is a vintage black leather handbag, with metal fasteners and wear marks on the body, giving it a rustic and vintage feel. The center is the main subject, sitting slightly to the right of the center of the frame, leaning slightly forward, hands gently resting on the knees, fingers long, and clear details. The background is the interior of a Japanese building, with walls in light gray or off-white and traditional wooden lattice window frames. Soft natural light streams through, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The glass reflects a blurred external image, with faint outlines of trees or buildings. The spatial layout is simple yet Zen-like, with a composition combining central symmetry and the golden ratio. Light and shadow come from natural light sources on the sides, soft and directional, highlighting three-dimensionality and texture. At the same time, slight reflections on the floor and object surfaces enhance realism. The overall atmosphere is calm, restrained, and slightly nostalgic and artistic. The color palette is dominated by black, white, and gray, accented with gold and brown. The color combination is restrained yet sophisticated. The image has a grainy texture reminiscent of film photography and slight exposure control, as if shot with an old camera, preserving the warmth and realism of everyday life. The details are rich, from the texture of the stockings to the wear of the leather, all clearly visible. Overall, it presents a static portrait style that combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life, like a private moment captured by chance, full of emotional tension and narrative",
