        {
          "id": "krea2-91e02eb14bbe2bf21b3fbdf4",
          "alias": "单女礼服婚礼害羞坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a soft floor covered with white tulle, wearing a luxurious strapless voluminous wedding dress. Layers of light tulle skirts spread out like clouds, forming a massive hem that covers the foreground of the entire frame. The fabric is delicate and translucent, presenting natural folds and flow, as if gently brushed by a breeze. The tulle fabric reveals a semi-transparent texture in the light, with distinct layers, gradually unfolding from the waist to form an elegant A-line silhouette. The hem edges are slightly curled, adding dimension and dynamic beauty. The flowers were pure white and tender, the branches and leaves naturally unfolded, the bouquet was just the right size, resting perfectly on her knees, harmonizing with the overall look. She wore simple, slender earrings, adding a touch of refinement and contemplation, revealing a subtle contemplation and anticipation. She wore a shy smile, and her makeup was light and natural. The background is a blurred patch of green plants, reflected through the large floor-to-ceiling windows indoors. Outside, the trees are lush and the leaves are dense, and sunlight filters through the leaves, casting dappled shadows to create a soft natural lighting environment. The window frame is light beige with clean lines, enhancing the sense of depth in the space. The composition uses a center-to-right layout, with the figure positioned on the right side of the frame, leaving a large amount of blank space on the left to highlight the volume of the wedding dress and the sense of openness in the environment. The camera focuses on the upper body and the bouquet, with a background blur that makes the subject stand out even more. The light comes from the front left, warm natural daylight, with natural shadow transitions without harsh boundaries. The overall color scheme is mainly white and green, complemented by warm yellow halos, creating a pure, romantic, and dreamy atmosphere. The image has the texture of film photography, with low color saturation, rich details, and minimal noise, presenting a realistic feel reminiscent of everyday amateur camera shooting. The composition is balanced and artistic, forming a smooth visual path. The overall image is poetic and tranquil. It was as if she had captured a tranquil afternoon, allowing people to feel the purity and beauty of love",
