        {
          "id": "krea2-f7749ca822ffa25b62013eb4",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙微笑倚靠持花",
          "prompt": "A close-up of a woman's half-body looks warm and gentle. Wearing pale pink lipstick, she reveals a gentle smile. She wears a light blue puff-sleeve dress made of light and soft fabric, presenting a silky sheen. The sleeves are puffy, and the shoulder features pleated designs that add dimension. She holds a bouquet of blooming blue roses in her hands. The flowers are layered and the petals are full, with colors gradient from light blue to deep blue. The center is slightly white, with green leaves scattered throughout. The veins are clear, and the overall composition centers on the figure, occupying the right side of the composition. The head is slightly tilted, the body slightly tilted, forming a graceful diagonal pose. In the foreground is the bouquet of blue roses in her hand, with clearly visible flowers and rich details. The background is a blurred outdoor natural environment, with faint outlines of trees and shrubs. Soft green and brown tones are presented, using shallow depth of field shooting techniques to completely blur the background and highlight the main subject. Light comes from the upper right, representing a warm afternoon sun. The light is soft and directional, with delicate transitions of light and shadow, creating a dreamy, hazy atmosphere. The overall tone leans warm, accented with gold and green, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The composition uses the classic rule of thirds: the person is positioned on the right side of the frame, with the left side left blank, creating visual balance and a smooth visual flow. The overall composition presents a sense of tranquility, The gentle and romantic atmosphere feels like a sunny afternoon, accompanied by flowers, peaceful time, with a delicate texture and artistic vibe reminiscent of Japanese photography. The lens uses a mid-focus lens to simulate professional camera effects, producing clear image quality and rich details. Pores and minor imperfections are softened while preserving realism. Petal textures are clear, light and shadow layers are rich, and the overall atmosphere is both realistic and artistic, like a carefully composed film photograph, full of youth and poetry",
