        {
          "id": "krea2-ba986e46707d408df3f20c03",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙公寓俏皮坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the indoor floor, wearing a pink semi-transparent long-sleeved dress adorned with red heart-shaped patterns. The material is light and flowing, with a slight sheen. The neckline and cuffs are simple yet elegant. She sits cross-legged with bent knees, wearing white over-the-knee socks printed with orange heart-shaped patterns that echo the dress. The sock legs are deep green, creating a striking contrast. The overall look is sweet yet playful. Her posture is relaxed and natural, her body slightly leaning forward, presenting a lazy yet slightly contemplative state. The background is a warm indoor environment, with white walls and door frames on the left, smooth and flat surfaces. On the right is a row of wooden bookshelves, neatly arranged with several books. The spines vary in color but are mainly light tones. The wood grain on the shelves is clearly visible, giving a warm texture. The floor is covered with a light-colored carpet with fine texture, and light softly streams in from the upper left of the frame. A warm golden tone is formed, highlighting the character's silhouette and clothing details, creating a cozy, tranquil, and slightly retro atmosphere. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The head is slightly tilted, creating direct communication with the viewer, guiding the audience to focus on her expression and demeanor. The foreground is the figure's body and legs, the middle ground is her upper body and some background elements, and the background is a bookshelf and wall. The layers are distinct, blending solid and void, with the distant background slightly blurred. It enhances the prominence of the subject, with the overall color palette dominated by pink, orange, green, white, and brown. The color combinations are harmonious and unified, full of youthful energy. The images present a moment of beauty carefully captured from daily life, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retaining everyday details and realism. The light and shadow treatment is delicate, highlights are soft, shadows natural, and there is no excessive sharpness or exaggerated contrast, creating a warm, comfortable, and emotionally charged visual experience, like a private photo capturing beautiful moments, combining artistic flair with a sense of warmth, the overall atmosphere is tranquil and romantic, evoking a gentle strength",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
