        {
          "id": "krea2-44c875a712d4b10562ec13b8",
          "alias": "单女黑外套街道困倦蹲注视",
          "prompt": "As night falls, a quiet street is bathed in soft warm light. In the center of the frame is a woman squatting in front of a classic white sports car. She wears a black jacket and shorts, white sneakers, arms hugged over her knees, and gazes thoughtfully at the camera. Her posture is naturally relaxed yet full of storytelling, as if waiting for something or recalling something, forming the core visual focal point of the frame. In the foreground is this classic white Japanese sports car, with smooth and retro body lines. The headlights shine brightly, emitting a warm orange-yellow glow that illuminates the front and the lower half of the woman. The emblem is clearly visible, and the hood is slightly raised, showcasing a typical performance car design style. The wheels have a slight shadow where they touch the ground, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The window glass reflects the blurred light and shadow of the surrounding environment, with rich details. In the middle is a blooming cherry tree, its branches extending diagonally from the upper left of the frame. The dense clusters of pink-white flowers create a dreamy atmosphere in the night. The petals appear semi-transparent under the dim light, with some branches gently swaying in the wind, creating a dynamic beauty. The trunk is thick and vigorous, contrasting with the gentle flowers. In the background, several utility poles and crisscrossing wires can be faintly seen, extending into the distance, adding a touch of urban life to the scene. At the same time, it implies that this is a suburban or residential road; The distant view is a hazy night sky, dark gray with a faint mist. The distant outline of the city is faintly visible, dotted with scattered lights, forming blurred light spots that enhance the sense of spatial depth in the image. On the right side is a red traffic warning post, bright but not jarring, adding a splash of brightness to the otherwise cool tones. The composition uses low-angle shots to make the characters and vehicles more visually impactful. The figures are positioned near the center at the lower bottom of the frame, the sports car occupies the lower middle, and the cherry blossom tree runs diagonally down from the upper left corner, forming a diagonal guide that draws the gaze toward the main subject. At the same time, the halos of the headlights and cherry blossoms create a sense of layering. The lighting atmosphere is mainly warm tones, with the orange-yellow glow of the headlights complementing the pink and white of the cherry blossoms, creating a strong contrast with the cold gray night sky, creating a romantic yet slightly lonely urban nightscape atmosphere. The overall image presents the texture of film photography, with moderate color saturation, slight graininess, and shadow noise, simulating the real effect of amateur camera or mobile phone shooting. The lighting is soft and layered, creating delicate transitions between light and dark. Street lamps in the background and distant building lights serve as auxiliary light sources, enhancing the scene's realism and immersion. The entire image blends elements of youth, nostalgia, loneliness, and beauty, combining the casual feeling of daily life with the narrative tension of an art film. It was as if a quiet moment belonging to the night had been captured.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
