        {
          "id": "krea2-47235c357ed404b01dad9ae2",
          "alias": "单女黑短裙霓虹夜景媚态阅读",
          "prompt": "She wears a white tight short-sleeved top paired with a black short skirt and black over-the-knee stockings, layered with a light-colored long-sleeved cardigan. Her arms stretch out naturally, holding the steering wheel in her right hand and resting her left hand gently on her leg. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, carrying a touch of playfulness and confidence. The overall look blends cuteness and sensuality. It creates a youthful, energetic yet slightly cool atmosphere. In the foreground are red racing seats and steering wheels, with smooth seat materials and smooth edges, creating a strong visual impact. The center features a female subject, positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, her body slightly tilted, creating a dynamic balance. The background is a typical Japanese arcade setting, with flashing neon lights and vibrant colors. Various arcade cabinets are neatly arranged, including the \"BEMANI\" series of music game consoles. The screen displays colorful game scenes, with a yellow vertical sign next to it reading the four large characters \"Ryodai Machine.\" The font is striking and the colors are bright. The entire space is dimly lit, but illuminated by various lights, creating a strong contrast. The composition combines close-ups with people in the middle and the environment in the distance, using the curved lines of racing seats to guide the gaze toward the woman. The game console and signboard in the background provide rich detailed information, enhancing the realism of the scene. The visual guide starts from the red seats in the foreground, follows the contours of the women's bodies, and extends to the background of neon lights and text signs, forming a clear visual path. The lighting atmosphere is dominated by warm tones, with soft yellow light from the game console screen and ceiling fluorescent lights, accented with cool light in some areas, creating a blend of retro and modern urban nightlife. The overall scene strongly reflects Japanese street culture, as if capturing a moment of entertainment in an arcade on an ordinary night, with a delicate image texture With high color saturation and rich details, it combines the warmth of everyday life with an artistic aesthetic, presenting a visual experience that is both authentic and slightly dreamy",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
