        {
          "id": "krea2-effc9d19d191df0931d8776a",
          "alias": "单女女仆红女仆装椅上沉思坐",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a red-and-white maid outfit sits sideways on a wooden bench on the station platform. She wears a white beret, her expression slightly contemplative and gentle. Her red knit cardigan pairs with a white ruffled apron and a turtleneck shirt, with a blue bow adorning her chest. White over-the-knee socks wrap her long legs, and she wears shiny red Mary Jane shoes. Her hands rest naturally on her knees, her posture elegant and relaxed. The background is a blurred train station environment, with an electronic display showing red numbers, distant outlines of buildings and traffic signs. Sunlight streams in from the side, creating soft shadows on the ground and the figures. Pink petals drift in the air, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The overall composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned on the left third of the frame, facing right. The foreground features a clear bench and lower body, the middle ground shows the person's entire body and some platform facilities, while the background is completely blurred to highlight the main subject. Light comes from the front left, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The shadows fall on the right side of the ground and the figure's body, with the color scheme mainly red and white. Complemented by warm golden sunlight and soft pink petals, the overall atmosphere is tranquil and romantic, with a Japanese photo style. It seems to capture a tranquil moment before a train arrives on a spring afternoon. The details are rich, the texture authentic, like high-quality photos taken with a professional camera, offering strong visual appeal and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
