        {
          "id": "krea2-8af37a70fa3858e273fe0d37",
          "alias": "单女和服微笑注视",
          "prompt": "From a low-angle downward view, a woman wears a traditional kimono, a teal-green outer robe paired with a white lining. The fabric gently flutters in the breeze, showing natural folds and drapes. The kimono's sleeves are wide, with subtle textured details along the edges. The overall look is elegant and full of Eastern charm, with a radiant smile radiating pure joy and satisfaction, presenting a warm golden sheen. Her right hand gently cups two orange-red apples, with smooth, rounded fruit surfaces featuring natural peel texture and subtle reflection. The fingers are naturally bent, the posture relaxed and realistic. The background is a vast, boundless blue sky, showing gradients from deep blue to light blue. A few thin wisps of white clouds float like feathers, sunlight pours down from above the image, creating a soft backlighting effect. The figure's outline is outlined by bright light forming a golden edge. On the right side of the painting, a red and white pole is inserted diagonally, topped by a blue background with white characters, printed with a blurry \"M\" letter. The sign sways slightly in the wind, adding a sense of dynamism. The composition uses an asymmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the lower left of the frame. The viewer's gaze is directed toward the sky and sign in the upper right, creating visual extension and tension. The foreground features the character's head, arms, and apple; the middle features a kimono and body; the background features the sky and traffic signs. The spatial layers are distinct, with cool tones predominantly in color. Blue and teal create a tranquil and fresh atmosphere, while warm sunlight and apples add warmth and vitality, creating a soft light and shadow effect. With the grainy texture of film photography and a slight overexposure effect, it simulates the realism of everyday amateur camera shooting. The images are full of life and a sense of freedom, as if capturing a fleeting moment of happiness, conveying youth, nature, and simple beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
