        {
          "id": "krea2-98a384814e5681b97fdad556",
          "alias": "单女外套严肃倚靠躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman leans against a white wall, exuding a quiet and reserved emotion. She wears a plaid wool coat whose texture is clearly visible, presenting a vintage pattern of dark gray and light brown. A corner of the red garment peeks out from the collar and cuffs, creating a striking color contrast. A leopard-print strap is slung across her shoulder, with a beige base and black spots, soft and full of wildness. Her right hand gently grips the strap, her fingers long, and a simple silver ring on her ring finger. A section of red clothing is exposed at the wrist, with fine stitching along the edges. The overall posture is relaxed and natural, with the body slightly tilted and the head slightly tilted, presenting a casual yet elegant temperament. In the foreground, a bright circular halo spans the image, formed by lens flares forming a rainbow-colored halo that presents a gradient from blue-green to orange-red. The edges have soft scattered halos, creating a dreamlike visual effect. Inside the halo are subtle light spots and starry flashes, enhancing the optical beauty of the image. The middle ground is the main figure and the wall behind her. The wall is light gray, with subtle graininess and irregular light and shadow changes. Light shines from the right, casting soft shadows on the wall. The background is blurred, presenting a blurry outdoor scene. You can faintly see the outlines of trees and yellow and green leaves. In the distance, there are also building silhouettes and traces of streets, but all are out of focus, creating a beautiful bokeh effect. The composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space and positioned to the left. Leaving the right blank space to balance the visuals and using halos as guiding elements creates a warm backlit atmosphere. Sunlight shines from the upper right, outlining the figures' outlines with golden edges. The shadows transition naturally, with rich layers of light and shadow and warm tones, mainly yellow, orange, and brown, complemented by cool halos for contrast. The overall style combines everyday documentary feel with artistic beauty, as if shot with an old film camera, with slight graininess and the unique color tendencies of film. The images are full of life and emotional expression, conveying a tranquil, gentle, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
