        {
          "id": "krea2-08790594f18fb85f03060128",
          "alias": "单女棕内衣城市沉思站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a city rooftop at dusk, wearing a beige fitted long-sleeve top and dark brown low-rise underwear. Her body is angled sideways, arms raised above her head, right hand gently caressing the back of her head, left hand naturally letting down. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, showing off her long neck line and smooth body curves, presenting a natural brown color. The length reaches her shoulders, slightly curled, sunlight streams in from the upper right, creating a delicate transition of light and shadow. Her expression is calm and slightly thoughtful, as if savoring the freedom and relaxation of this moment. In the foreground is a blurred metal mesh fence with slight depth blurring at the edges. Behind the fence, several pots of green plants can be seen, their leaves appearing semi-transparent in the backlight. The middle ground shows a cluster of high-rise city buildings, with glass curtain walls reflecting the sunset's afterglow, presenting a warm orange-yellow hue. The building form is modern and dense, with some buildings featuring construction scaffolding, showcasing the city's dynamism and realism. The distant sky is a clear pale blue, gradually transitioning toward the horizon into a soft warm yellow. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward shot. The figure occupies about two-thirds of the left side of the frame, forming the visual focal point. The background buildings extend to the right, creating a sense of openness. Light comes from the right rear side, a typical golden moment backlit shot. The figure's outline is outlined with bright golden edges, with rich layers in the shadows. The overall atmosphere is warm, tranquil, and full of the poetic and free spirit of urban life. The main tones are warm yellow, off-white, and dark brown, complemented by the cool blue of the sky for contrast, enhancing the visual tension of the image. The image has a strong film-like texture. The slight graininess and slightly lower color saturation simulate vintage camera shooting. The lens is a 24-70mm zoom lens with an aperture of f/2.8, shutter speed of 1/125 sec, ISO 400. The composition emphasizes the interaction between character dynamics and the urban background, highlighting the harmonious coexistence of people and the environment. The visual guide extends from the characters' body language toward the sky and the distance, creating an upward, open visual flow that presents a fleeting beauty captured casually in daily life. It feels as if a photographer uses portable devices to accidentally capture real scenes on the street, full of vibrant life and artistic cinematic expression",
