        {
          "id": "krea2-de9b043cf31a4aebe8e17214",
          "alias": "单女毛衣街道沉思坐喝",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a warm corner of a café, wearing a dark coarse knit sweater, her expression calm and slightly contemplative. She holds a white ceramic coffee cup in both hands, her fingers painted with dark nail polish, and her ring finger wears a simple ring, gently sipping a hot beverage. The scene is full of the atmosphere of life and inner emotional tension. In the foreground, her body and the cup in her hand occupy the left central position of the composition. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure appearing above the chest. The background wall is covered with numerous black-and-white photographs, framed in a black frame The photos feature street scenes, portraits, and blurred moments of movement, creating a visual sense of layering and an artistic atmosphere. The wallpaper is in beige or light brown tones with subtle textures. On the right wall, a vintage wall lamp glows with warm yellow light, its gentle glow casting a gentle halo on the wall and the figure, creating a cozy yet slightly nostalgic atmosphere. In the distance, a round table covered with a white tablecloth can be seen. On the table is a black object, possibly a phone or wallet, with the edge slightly visible. The space layout is compact but not cramped. The overall composition leans toward a natural snapshot style. The lens is slightly tilted to simulate the slight shaking of everyday handheld shooting. Light comes from a wall lamp in the upper right and possible ambient sources, creating side lighting. The right side is illuminated by light, creating contrast between light and dark, highlighting contours and three-dimensionality. Shadows are soft and light transitions are natural. The color tones are mainly warm yellow, brown, and black, complemented by white cups as visual highlights. The overall image has a film-like texture, with slight graininess and low-saturation colors, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera. Emphasizing realism and the passage of time, the frames in the background are staggered and orderly. Some photos show slight perspective distortion depending on the angle, enhancing spatial depth. The figure's posture is relaxed, the body leans slightly forward, hand movements are natural, the details of the cup body and fingers are clearly visible, sweater textures are delicate, and clothing folds are natural. The entire scene resembles a quiet afternoon moment, capturing a moment of tranquility in urban life, with a strong documentary aesthetic and humanistic care. The images convey a sense of loneliness yet warmth. Alone yet filled with a contemplative atmosphere, as if one can hear the aroma of coffee and breathing in the silence. The composition is balanced and storyful, evoking viewers' associations with their inner world.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
