        {
          "id": "krea2-abbb3d55d6d44a8365a9bb8d",
          "alias": "单女白礼服婚礼忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a vintage-style white wedding dress sits on the steps of a dim stairwell. She wears a satin wedding dress with puffy puff sleeves and a deep V-neck design. The skirt is wide and layered, presenting an elegant A-line silhouette. Her left hand gently holds a simple bouquet of white flowers, while her right hand, wearing white gloves, gently lifts the hem of the skirt. Her posture is naturally relaxed, her body slightly tilted. Her head is slightly raised, exuding a dignified yet gentle temperament. In the foreground is the gray marble steps she sits on, with fine textures and wear marks on the surface. The metal handrails are dark gray, smooth and reflecting faint light. The middle is the stairwell where she stands, flanked by rough cement walls with obvious stains and traces of time. There are slight peeling at the corners, and the background features an upward staircase structure, forming strong geometric lines that guide the gaze upward toward the frame. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, making the character stand out more. The slanted lines on the stairs enhance depth and dynamism. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, creating a visual focal point. Light slants down from above, creating a soft backlight effect, while the lower body is in shadow, creating a dramatic light and shadow atmosphere with strong contrast between light and shadow. The overall tone leans toward warm yellow tones with a vintage film texture. There are slight vignetting and grainy noise at the edges, simulating the effect of vintage camera shooting. The entire scene exudes a nostalgic, tranquil, and slightly melancholic artistic atmosphere, as if capturing a forgotten moment. Like a classic scene from a film, it is rich in narrative and emotional tension. The details are rich, from the folds of the wedding dress to the transparency of the veil, to the texture of the floor and the mottled walls, all clearly visible. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, and the color saturation is moderate, presenting a realistic and warm visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
