        {
          "id": "krea2-44ceca1a8c09e3ab00e2b375",
          "alias": "单女白睡裙卧室害羞坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window, appearing casual and gentle, with a slight blush. Looking directly at the camera, she carries a hint of playfulness and laziness. The bread has distinct layers, a crispy surface with a slight oily sheen, and slightly golden edges, presenting a freshly baked, warm texture. She wears a white lace spaghetti strap nightgown with a delicate neckline and slender straps revealing her collarbone and part of her shoulders. She wears an off-white loose knit cardigan, with sleeves casually rolled up to her elbows, the knit texture clearly visible, and the threads naturally loose, showcasing a cozy home. She folds her hands in front of herself, arms relaxed, posture natural, body slightly leaning forward, close to the camera to create an intimate atmosphere. The background is a blurred indoor environment, with faint light blue cushions or sofas. The walls are pale white, and soft natural light streams through the window, creating a backlighting effect. Light streams in from the right, making the main figure stand out. The overall tone of the painting is warm, mainly white, beige, light gray, and light blue, creating a peaceful and cozy afternoon atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups. The middle shot is her upper body and clothing details, with background blur treatment highlighting the subject. Light and shadow are evenly distributed, shadows are soft, and transitions are natural. The overall image has the texture of film photography, with slight graininess, moderate color saturation, and slight overexposure and fading effects, as if captured with an old-fashioned camera, full of life and youthful vibes. The image conveys a sense of leisure, The sweet yet slightly shy mood is like morning sunlight shining into the bedroom. The girl enjoys a peaceful moment of breakfast. The entire scene is authentic and moving, with no signs of deliberate posing, like an unintentional snapshot capturing the most natural moments",
