        {
          "id": "krea2-59f5146e0b73364a29544aa6",
          "alias": "单女和服公寓沉思坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a wooden corridor of a traditional Japanese building, wearing a kimono with a white base printed with orange and yellow cherry blossom patterns and dark brown stripes. The fabric is delicate, with slight pleats and natural drapes. The sleeves are wide and elegant, and the collar is slightly open to reveal the lining, presenting an everyday yet refined style. Her expression is slightly lazy and contemplative, and her right hand gently holds a transparent glass bottle. The bottle is slender with a blue cap, filled with clear liquid. The left hand gently supports the bottle, posture natural and relaxed. Both feet are bare, toes are long, and the soles rest flat on the dark brown wooden floor. The floor grain is clearly visible, with fine gaps between the wooden boards. The surface looks slightly aged but well maintained. The background features traditional Japanese sliding doors and lattice windows. The wooden frame is dark brown, with clean and regular lines. The window panes let in soft natural light, which streams in diagonally from outside, creating a contrast of light and shadow on the figure, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. In the middle ground, you can see parts of a potted green plant's leaves. The leaves are broad and emerald green, adding a touch of vitality and a natural atmosphere. The composition uses a centered technique: the figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the composition, with a slightly tilted body and a slight tilt of the head, creating a strong visual guidance. The foreground features a wooden floor and the lower body of the figure, the middle is the subject and the bottle in his hand, and the background features sliding doors, windows, and some plants. The layers are distinct and the sense of space is strong. Light and shadow come from the left, serving as side backlighting, softly outlining the figure's outline, with delicate transitions in the shadows, and the overall tone is warm brown Off-white and orange-yellow are the main colors, accented with blue-green accents, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The image atmosphere is quiet, nostalgic, and full of everyday life, as if capturing a tranquil moment in a traditional Japanese residence on a summer afternoon. It has a strong sense of documentary realism and artistic beauty. It's like using a professional camera paired with a prime lens, combining natural and ambient light to present a high dynamic range effect. The details are rich, the texture is authentic, combining the elegance of traditional aesthetics with the casual and intimate nature of modern life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
