        {
          "id": "krea2-adc3a8e1048b35593696b472",
          "alias": "单女蓝制服沉思站立交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a blue and white school uniform stands outside the campus. She strikes a thoughtful or playful pose, arms crossed in front of her, looking elegant and relaxed. The uniform is a light blue short-sleeved polo shirt with dark blue stripes on the collar and sleeve edges. On the left chest is a red circular badge pattern. The fabric feels authentic, with natural folds. Sunlight streams through the leaves, and the background is a blurred campus environment, shaded by green trees and lush branches and leaves. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting tiny patches of light. In the distance, other students in similar uniforms walk and chat—some looking down at their phones, others walking side by side, presenting a daily campus atmosphere. The overall composition uses a shallow depth of field, with the focus on the girl in the foreground. The background is well blurred, highlighting the main figure. The composition is center-right, with the figure occupying the main spot, creating a warm and natural interaction. The light is soft natural light, coming from the upper and slightly tilted side. This creates a warm and even lighting effect. The shadows transition naturally without strong contrasts. The colors are mainly fresh blue-and-white, accented with green leaves and distant students' clothing. The overall tone is fresh and bright, carrying a hint of youthful energy. The image has a slight film texture and graininess, simulating everyday handheld camera shooting. Slight overexposure and color saturation adjustments make the image more realistic, as if casually captured on a sunny afternoon campus. It captures the purest and most beautiful side of student life, with rich image details, clear textures, and lively and natural expressions. The entire scene is full of youthful energy and a peaceful everyday feel, like an old photo treasured in an old album, carrying nostalgia and beautiful memories of campus days",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
