        {
          "id": "krea2-a4604dc7146b7ae542cb11b9",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙城市沉思倚靠持包",
          "prompt": "A woman elegantly leans against a modern-style light gray fabric sofa. She wears a light blue off-shoulder spaghetti strap dress with a knee-length hem, featuring loose pleated upper parts and puff sleeves. The tight cut on the lower half outlines her graceful silhouette. She crosses her arms over her chest, gently gripping a white woven handbag in her left hand, which features a metal chain and leather handle. She wears silver high heels, the smooth, reflective upper surfaces giving a metallic texture, and her makeup is exquisite. The overall posture is dignified yet sexy. The foreground shows a corner of the sofa and her standing legs and feet; the middle is her full-body image and the sofa's main body. The background features large floor-to-ceiling windows that let in soft natural light outside. The curtains are made of off-white tulle material that gently flutters in the wind, faintly revealing the outlines of distant trees and the hazy sky. The indoor lighting is bright and even, with the main light source coming from the right window, creating a soft side light effect that creates a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses a diagonal line slightly to the right center. The figure occupies the main position, extending along the body lines to the bag in hand and the high heels beneath the feet, then guiding the viewer to the background through the sofa's lines. The overall color palette is mainly light blue, gray-white, and beige, fresh and soft, full of the elegant atmosphere of modern urban life. It features professional studio-level light and shadow processing while preserving the natural and authentic texture of daily life, as if photographed with a high-end camera under the afternoon sun. The details are rich, the expressions lively, and the clothing textures clear The layered light and shadow are distinct, presenting an overall sense of tranquility, comfort, and luxury",
