          "id": "krea2-8350d81f0b2bc2682d6f5d03",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣城市冷淡站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a modern glass and metal overpass, her left hand naturally hanging down, her posture both relaxed and full of charm. She wears a light gray long-sleeved knit cardigan, delicate and soft. The cardigan is left open to reveal the collar and deep V design of the white shirt underneath. A few buttons are undone, revealing a graceful neck line and collarbones. Her figure is full and well-proportioned, with a full bust and a defined waistline. She pairs a black high-waisted pleated short skirt with a voluminous and stylish hem and cross-tie designs on the sides. Adding a touch of sexiness and fashion. Although her feet are not fully visible, you can imagine she is paired with simple shoes. She wears a slender gold necklace, simple yet refined. The background is a transparent modern architectural interior, composed of numerous silver metal frames and transparent glass forming intersecting geometric lines. In the distance, multi-story floors and blurred city outlines are visible. Light streams through glass from above and around, creating a bright, soft natural light environment. The sunlight reflects dappled shadows on the floor and glass. The entire scene presents a clean, open, and technologically advanced atmosphere. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, their bodies slightly turned and heads slightly tilted, creating a natural visual guide. The foreground features smooth metal floors and glass railings, the middle ground features the main figure and nearby architectural structures, while the background features extended corridors and distant architectural details. The layers are distinct, the perspective is strong, the light and shadow treatment is delicate, the contrast of light and shadow is moderate, and shadows are gently distributed over the body and surrounding structures. The overall color palette mainly uses cool gray, white, and black, creating a modern urban sense of fashion and youthful vitality. The image texture is realistic, as if shot with a professional camera, featuring slight film graininess and natural depth of field. The lens is chosen for standard portrait focal length, capturing the full figure and rich details of the subject, while preserving the openness of the background, clear visual focus, and a relaxed and pleasant atmosphere. It combines the warmth of everyday life with artistic beauty, making it suitable for expressing women's fashion looks or urban life themes",
