        {
          "id": "krea2-0f56a393544b5755ec682960",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙霓虹夜景冷淡倚靠展示",
          "prompt": "A female model wore a black lace strapless dress, elegantly leaning against the hood of a black sports car. The dress featured sheer lace designs that outlined her graceful figure, with layered hems and ruffled decorations. The overall look was fashionable and full of femininity. She wore a fine chain necklace and a gold bracelet, with details highlighting a sense of refinement. The black sports car beside it is smooth as a mirror, reflecting the light and shadow of the surroundings. The windows are adorned with blue neon light strips, emitting a psychedelic halo. The door handles and edges are smooth lines, showcasing a strong sense of modern technology. The background is an indoor showroom or stage environment, with clean gray walls. On the right, metal brackets and lighting equipment are visible, creating a professional studio atmosphere. The overall composition centers on the characters, using a medium perspective where the figures occupy the main position and their bodies slightly tilt. A graceful S-shaped curve is formed, with the sports car partially obscured as the foreground element, enhancing spatial layering. The light mainly comes from the left-slightly soft light at the front, supplemented by blue neon lights in the background for fill lighting and ambiance, creating a warm and cool contrast that highlights the contours of the figures. Shadows transition softly, rich in detail, and primarily black, creating a strong visual impact. The overall image presents a style that combines sophistication and fashion, as if a professional photographer is shooting with a full-frame camera paired with a large-aperture lens with an 85mm focal length, aperture f/1.8, ISO 200, shutter speed 1/125 sec, capturing a quiet and dynamic moment with cinematic texture and magazine cover-like visual effects. The image is delicate, noise control is excellent, color reproduction is true, details are clear, and light transitions are natural. The overall atmosphere is mysterious, elegant, and modern, as if you are at a high-end car launch or a fashion photography scene, giving a feeling that is both everyday and surreal, as if you could shoot professional-grade works with amateur equipment. Full of artistic atmosphere and a sense of everyday beauty",
