        {
          "id": "krea2-f8eb696f37028a07e315365f",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙户外害羞站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors in a natural setting, wearing a white spaghetti strap dress with an irregular high slit design. The fabric is smooth and slightly glossy, presenting a silky texture. The neckline is decorated with delicate lace lace, and on the chest is a red envelope pattern. The envelope is adorned with a heart and a pair of small wings, forming a cute cartoon-style pattern that drapes smoothly over her shoulders with distinct layers. She wears a delicate chain necklace with a small and simple pendant. On her left wrist, she wears a gold bracelet. The overall look is fresh and sweet. Her posture is natural and relaxed, gently lifting one side of her skirt to reveal her long leg lines. Her expression is slightly shy and serene. The background is a blurred green vegetation and a patch of white flowers or plants, creating a soft blur effect. Several green leaves hang down in the upper left corner, creating a foreground obstruction that enhances spatial and layered space. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, body slightly turned to the side, head facing the camera. This creates a visual relationship that is both intimate and elegant. The lighting is soft and even, coming from natural daylight, presenting warm tones like early morning or evening. The light and shadow are delicate, shadows are soft, without strong contrasts. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, romantic, and pure, as if capturing the moment of summer afternoon sunlight shining on the grass. The image has the realism of everyday photography while retaining artistic beauty, as if shooting outdoors with a lightweight camera, focusing on the subject and blurring the background naturally. Paired with a small amount of red accents, a vivid and harmonious visual contrast is formed, presenting an overall image of youthfulness, beauty, and hope, like a realistic film photograph with rich details, authentic texture, and a sense of life and emotional warmth",
