        {
          "id": "krea2-24b6acaccb1e0443922e2da3",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙小径冷淡倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a white lace lace long dress adorned with elegant blue floral patterns. The layered hem gives a light and flowing texture. She crosses her arms around her knees, leans slightly forward, and tilts her head gently to the camera, her posture elegant and relaxed. On her left wrist is a delicate bracelet, and beside her is a small white handbag embroidered with butterfly patterns. The wooden boardwalk is paved with light-colored planks, with clear wood grain. The surface shows slight weathering, showing natural traces of time. The boardwalk extends to the right side of the painting, forming a diagonal composition. On the left is a shimmering lake surface, with deep green tones. The breeze ripples fine on the water, sunlight pours down from the upper left, forming a dazzling band of light that reflects gold-like spots. Light penetrates the water, making the underwater part faintly visible. The overall light and shadow contrast is strong, with rich layers of light and shadow. The shadows fall beneath the boardwalk and the figure's body, creating a strong sense of three-dimensionality. The composition uses a high-angle overhead view, with the main subject positioned slightly to the lower right of the frame, forming the visual focal point. The background is blurred to highlight the main subject. The composition uses boardwalk lines to guide the viewer's gaze, while leaving ample space to showcase the lake and light and shadow. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, warm, and poetic, filled with the lazy feeling of summer afternoon sunshine. The color palette emphasizes warm and cool contrasts, with the lake's cool green intertwining with the warm yellow of sunlight. The white and blue clothing form a soft visual center, with delicate texture and rich details. It looks like a film-style photo taken with a professional camera, featuring a strong Japanese photographic aesthetic. There are no obvious artificial traces in the image; all elements naturally blend together, presenting a subtle beauty found in daily life. It seems to capture a quiet moment, authentic and full of storytelling. The overall light and shadow are soft, color saturation is moderate, preserving the original natural texture. Without excessive embellishment, it emphasizes realism and the sense of life. The reflections on the water surface in the background echo with the sky's reflections, enhancing the spatial depth of the image. The relationship between the characters and the environment is harmonious and unified; the entire scene resembles a tranquil painting, allowing one to feel the slow flow of time and inner peace",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
