        {
          "id": "krea2-1e93d99df0445d213743451e",
          "alias": "单女粉毛衣家中微笑回眸",
          "prompt": "She wears a light pink knit cardigan with clearly visible yarn texture, delicate ribbed designs on the neckline and cuffs, and the buttons in a warm natural wood color arranged neatly. The cardigan is soft and fluffy, with a slightly lazy feel. She slightly turns her head to look at the camera, the color is full and natural, wearing a gentle smile. In her right hand, she holds a white round puff with gentle and natural movements. In her left hand, she holds a transparent glass jar of skincare products, the jar smooth and rounded. The silver metal lid is highly reflective, and the product inside the jar is semi-transparent milky white, with a rich texture. The background is a pure, light gray-white wall with no decorations or clutter, making the space simple and clean. Light shines from the front slightly above, creating a uniform and soft lighting effect. The shadows are subtle and transitioning naturally. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with main tones of light pink, off-white, and warm gray, creating a comfortable and relaxed home atmosphere. The composition uses medium to close shots of portraits, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, head slightly tilted. The gaze interacts with the audience, with puffs and skincare products highlighted as visual focal points. The middle ground covers the upper body and clothing details, with the background completely blurred, retaining only basic color blocks. Then, following hand movements, the focus shifts to skincare products, finally lingering in the harmonious atmosphere of the entire scene. The overall style carries a sense of lifestyle aesthetics, as if captured with a regular home camera. The image texture is authentic and natural, without excessive embellishment, rich in details but not exaggerated, presenting a warm and straightforward everyday beauty. Filled with a gentle and healing atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
