        {
          "id": "krea2-09c3b3334b9302a7e4a9d4fe",
          "alias": "单女外套街道冷淡持手机",
          "prompt": "A woman squatted on the gray brick sidewalk of a city street, wearing a blue baseball cap with a white letter \"A\" logo. She was gently holding a small white dog with her head down. The puppy was fluffy, its tongue slightly sticking out, looking very cute. The woman wore a color-blocked lambswool jacket, mainly off-white, with light purple sleeves and shoulders. The jacket was soft and thick. She wore white sneakers with black laces, giving the overall look a casual and comfortable look. Her makeup was exquisite. In the background, a retro-style green electric motorcycle is parked by the roadside. The front has a round headlight, several small stickers on the body, and the rear of a white car with license plate number \"Min B·051JB\" is visible. In the distance, you can see the yellow road markings and the guardrails. The sky is a cloudy grayish-white tone, with soft and even lighting. The entire scene was shot in natural light without strong shadows, and the composition is shot at a low angle. The person is positioned slightly to the lower left of the frame, creating a friendly perspective. The foreground features a woman and a puppy, the middle features an electric bike and part of the road, and the background features vehicles and an extended road. Gradually moving down to the puppy, then backward to the vehicle and road in the background, it creates a warm atmosphere of everyday life. The color palette is mainly cool, with blue, green, and gray echoing each other to enhance the visual focus. Overall, it feels like a real street shot casually taken with a regular phone or amateur camera, full of life and realism. The details are rich, the lighting and shadow treatment natural, without excessive post-processing. presenting a simple yet warm everyday moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
