        {
          "id": "krea2-58441477d390f4d4db0c9717",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙街道站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on the gray asphalt road of a Japanese street, slightly tilting her head to look at the camera. She wears a blue-and-white plaid spaghetti strap dress with thin straps that outline her graceful collarbones. The loose, flowing hem presents natural pleats and a sense of movement. She gently carries a black cloth handbag in her right hand, inside which a transparent plastic bottle of drink is faintly visible. Her left hand hangs naturally, fingers long, and she wears a simple pair of black flat sandals. Her body slightly turns to the side, showing a natural S-shaped curve. The overall posture is relaxed and relaxed, yet full of warmth. The background is a typical Japanese street scene. On the left is a beige wooden wall, with two rustic ceramic jars placed in the corner. On the right is a dark wooden door and a white air conditioning outdoor unit. The floor is a slightly rough asphalt pavement, with cement steps and metal manhole covers along the roadside. The lighting is soft natural light, with soft and clear shadows. Objects in the background appear realistic under sunlight, with overall tones mainly gray, blue, and brown. The color saturation is moderate, with a slight film graininess, resembling everyday moments shot with an old-fashioned camera. The edges of the frame are slightly darkened to enhance the focus of the main subject. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, layered and rich, creating a quiet and cozy atmosphere, like a chance encounter on a summer afternoon street, full of life and youthful vitality. The details are exquisitely rendered, the background is moderately blurred, and the main subject is highlighted. Overall, it presents a natural, emotionally charged style of everyday photography, like capturing precious moments casually with an old portable camera. It retains the unique warmth and subtle noise of film, making the entire image both artistic and authentically lifelike",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
