        {
          "id": "krea2-8f97f34af1e0bed91127a10e",
          "alias": "单女制服草地困倦侧头",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman wearing a wide-brimmed woven straw hat with naturally curled brims, and the hat body handwoven from light beige natural fibers, presenting a dense and uniform grid-like hollowed-out structure that creates interwoven geometric patterns of light and shadow, adding a dreamy and poetic texture. She wears a white knitted cardigan, light and soft in texture, with clearly visible knit textures and fine stitching, presenting a warm cream tone, paired with a simple white camisole underneath The collar slightly reveals the collarbone line, giving the overall look a fresh and natural vibe, full of summer vibes. It has a faint sheen, slightly flared, and looking directly into the camera, its expression is calm with a hint of melancholy and contemplation, as if gazing into some distant memory or thought. The background is a blurred green plant, possibly dense woods or grasslands. With shallow depth of field, it presents a soft bokeh effect. The green layers are rich, transitioning from deep green to light green, creating a peaceful and vibrant atmosphere. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly above the center of the frame, head slightly tilted. The direction of sight creates a subtle interaction with the viewer, emphasizing the character's emotional expression and the beauty of details. Light comes from the upper left, belonging to natural light, soft and bright. Sunlight penetrates the gaps between leaves, forming dotted light spots and soft shadows, while natural shadows are cast below the straw hat and on the neck, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and spatial layering. The overall light and shadow contrast is moderate, preserving the details of the highlights without losing the layers of the shadows. The atmosphere is tranquil, gentle, and slightly artistic, with the graininess of film photography and a retro tone with low color saturation. The tones are mainly warm yellow and light green, creating a nostalgic and fresh summer afternoon feeling. The image texture is close to that of vintage film cameras, with slight noise and color overflow, enhancing realism and traces of time passing. The overall image conveys a sense of youth, freedom, tranquility, and introspection, like a silent poem about growth and memories",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
