        {
          "id": "krea2-bf6845d10aacacb673afd92e",
          "alias": "单女米外套窗边站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the window indoors, wearing a beige and light brown plaid wool coat, layered with a white turtleneck sweater and a light blue turtleneck base shirt. The collar drapes down naturally, and the cuffs are slightly cinched, showcasing a warm and comfortable winter outfit style that adds a touch of lazy and casual charm. She wears round metal-rimmed glasses, the lenses reflecting slightly, appearing friendly and intellectual. She holds a transparent glass cup filled with a pale yellow liquid—possibly hot tea or lemonade—with slender fingers. Her nails are neatly trimmed and painted with light-colored nail polish. The surface of the cup has fine droplets that show the temperature of the drink. She slung a small brown leather pouch diagonally over her shoulder. The strap is slender and delicate, compact and delicate. The overall shape is simple yet layered. The foreground is the main subject, occupying most of the space. The composition uses close-ups: the middle is the figure and some clothing, while the background is a window framed with gray borders. The light outside is soft, presenting a bright white tone. The interior walls are pure white, clean and simple. On the right wall, there is a white power switch that adds a sense of life. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered, light and shadow streaming in through the left window, creating a soft side light. The shadows transition naturally on the right side, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly warm tones, with beige, brown, light blue, and white harmoniously combined. The color saturation is moderate, with a slight retro filter effect. The image texture is delicate and has a slight film graininess, as if captured with a professional camera. The lens has a focal length close to 50mm, a shallow depth of field, and a slightly blurred background, highlighting the main subject. The overall image conveys a warm, healing, and quiet aesthetic of life, like a photo capturing ordinary and beautiful family life, full of authenticity and human warmth",
          "description": "",
