        {
          "id": "krea2-697c693819d129fe20a66c5d",
          "alias": "单女金毛衣小径站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an outdoor wooden floor, wearing a loose yellow knit sweater with an open-back design, light gray shorts and white sneakers, and a pair of sunglasses with red frames placed at an angle above her head. She turns sideways to look back at the camera, gently resting her left hand on a yellow electric scooter beside her. The bike is stamped with the brand logos \"NIU\" and \"niu.com.\" The taillights are red, and the body lines are smooth and modern, forming a sharp contrast with the retro-style vintage white Volkswagen Beetle. This classic car is parked on the right side of the frame, with the front facing left. The headlights are round and bright, chrome trim is clearly visible, the doors are tightly closed, and the overall look is elegant and nostalgic. The distance between the two is moderate, creating a dialogue between fashion and classic. The background is a dense bamboo forest, where the bamboo leaves in the sunlight create layers of emerald green and gold. The dappled light and shadows fall on the ground and vehicle, and in the distance, you can faintly see an orange-brown wooden fence and the outline of a beige sunshade. The sky is pale blue with a hint of thin clouds. The lighting is soft and warm, typical of afternoon sunlight. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned in the middle left of the frame, while the electric bike and car occupy the right half, creating visual balance. The foreground features textured details of the wooden floor, the middle ground highlights the interaction between the subject and the vehicle, and the background uses blur to highlight the subject, creating depth of field. The visual guide line naturally extends from the figure's posture to the electric bike and then to the car, forming a smooth visual path. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and bright, with yellow, white, and green as the main colors. Accented with red and orange, the overall tone is harmonious and unified, full of life and youthful energy. The image texture is delicate and authentic, as if shot with a high-resolution camera, with a slight film graininess, presenting a sense of authenticity and artistic beauty for everyday photography. It seems to capture a tranquil moment on a leisurely afternoon, between people and cars, tradition and modernity, nature and the city. The images are full of storytelling, evoking small joys in the city and longing for a better life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
