        {
          "id": "krea2-4116108d7508d669e2d86372",
          "alias": "单女窗边忧伤侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sat by the window, looking gentle and lazy. She lowered her head slightly, revealing a faint melancholy and contemplative mood. Her fingers were slender and long, her posture elegant and natural. She wore a loose white cotton top with slightly rolled cuffs, revealing fair arms. The fabric was soft and lightweight, with natural pleats, presenting the comfort of everyday home. She sat barefoot on a sofa covered in cream-colored lace fabric, her feet naturally crossed, toes slightly curled, and under the light and shadow, a soft sheen shimmered. Her legs were long and well-proportioned. From the side, the body is slightly leaned forward, knees bent, legs together, forming an inward-retracted triangle composition that focuses the visual focus on the figure. In the foreground is her foot and part of her calf, clearly visible and rich in detail. The texture of the soles and the curve of the ankle are clearly visible. The middle is her upper body and arms, with her body slightly angled to the lens, head slightly tilted, with a hint of rosy hues. The background is the indoor environment, with warm sunlight streaming through the window and dappled light through blinds or curtains, projected onto the walls and figures, with a light beige surface and delicate texture. On the right side, there is a wooden bookshelf or storage cabinet with blurred edges and a warm yellow tone, adding layers to the space. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, off-white, and light gray, creating a peaceful and cozy atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space, with a slightly lower perspective than level view, highlighting their softness and fragility. Visual guidance is guided by the characters' postures and gaze directions. At the same time, her hand movements and leg lines create a natural visual flow. Light and shadow come from the upper left side, representing natural light in the morning or evening, soft and warm, creating contrasts of light and shadow. The shadows transition naturally, creating a sense of depth and dimension. The entire scene presents a lifestyle photography style, as if shot with an old film camera, with slight graininess and warm tones, like a private moment captured by chance, full of story and emotional tension, with well-handled background blur It highlights the main characters while preserving the authenticity of the environment. The overall atmosphere is quiet, private, warm, and slightly melancholic, like an afternoon forgotten in a corner, inviting people to explore her inner story",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
