        {
          "id": "krea2-1e9fc5771a2000b268cc015a",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙街道忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands inside a phone booth on a rainy night, wearing a black spaghetti strap dress with pleated hems. The material is light and slightly transparent, faintly revealing the shoulder lines. Her right hand rests on the metal railing of the booth, fingers gently resting on the wooden handle. Her body slightly turns to the side, turning back to gaze at the camera, wearing red lipstick. In the distance, tall buildings stand everywhere, lights flicker, forming large circular light spots that create a beautiful bokeh effect. The damp street reflects the light. Yellow road markings are faintly visible, rainwater flowing down the glass windows, forming fine water marks. The metal frame of the phone booth is dark gray with slight wear on the edges. The overall tone of the image leans toward a cool tone, mainly blue-gray, with light coming from behind and sides creating a backlit effect. The layering of light and shadow is rich, creating a strong atmosphere. The composition uses the main figure slightly to the left center, using the vertical lines of the phone booth to guide the view, while leaving space on the right side to showcase the city nightscape. The visual focus is on the figure, with background blur treatment highlighting the subject. It creates a lonely, tranquil, and slightly melancholic urban nighttime atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, with the graininess and color saturation of film photography, as if captured with an old camera. It captures a quiet and storytelling moment on a rainy night street. The overall style blends cinematic and everyday feel, artistic yet realistic. The interplay of light and shadow reveals a faint sense of nostalgia, evoking youth, waiting, or longing. Every detail in the frame serves this emotional expression. From the postures of the figures to the blurring of the background, from the direction of lighting to the color coordination, they together construct a poetic urban nighttime scene",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
