        {
          "id": "krea2-dd0fd2a10a35362d2436a712",
          "alias": "单女金T恤俏皮躺注视",
          "prompt": "A woman lies sideways on a soft white sheet, appearing fluffy and layered. A pale yellow thin camisole is visible on the shoulder, faintly revealing the collarbone line. The background is a blurred white fabric and soft light spots. Light streams in diagonally from the left side of the frame, creating a warm and bright backlighting effect. Sunlight filters through the curtains or sheer screens, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space The head is slightly tilted, with the gaze facing the lens. The right side of the frame leaves ample negative space to enhance visual balance. The colors are mainly warm yellow and white, with soft and layered light and shadow, presenting a tranquil and cozy feeling like the morning sunlight shining down. It feels like capturing a lazy and beautiful moment. The image texture is delicate and realistic, with high-resolution detail expression, like shooting with a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens, while retaining the natural feel of handheld device shooting in daily life. The overall atmosphere is warm and healing. Full of the atmosphere of life, it conveys a relaxed and joyful mood. The composition is compact but not crowded, with evenly distributed light and shadow full of variety. The background blur is well handled, highlighting the subject's three-dimensionality and vividness. The entire scene conveys a tone of youthfulness, innocence, and romance, as if time has stood still at this moment, leaving only the purest and most beautiful memories",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
