        {
          "id": "krea2-e8f5bcbe8df2ea278fe65501",
          "alias": "单女绿浴袍窗边微笑坐持食物",
          "prompt": "A woman sits indoors, looking down at the peeled orange in her hand, a playful and satisfied smile appearing healthy and lively. She wears a loose light green linen robe, paired with a white camisole underneath and gray-white plaid loungewear. Her overall outfit is comfortable and casual, full of a homely vibe. She holds a fresh orange in her left hand and another in her right, her fingers long and natural. On her wrist are several simple metal bracelets and a thin string bracelet. The details are rich but not messy, and her posture is relaxed She sits cross-legged, leaning slightly forward, as if immersed in a tranquil moment of enjoying delicious food. In the foreground, she holds an orange and some clothing, clearly visible, with the focus focused here. The background is blurred, presenting a soft indoor environment. Faintly visible dark curtains, blurred furniture outlines, and warm yellow walls create a warm and intimate sense of space. The composition uses a centered technique, with the figure centered to form the visual center. At the same time, the shallow depth of field effect highlights the subject, blurring the background and enhancing the sense of layering in the image. Light comes from the front side, with soft natural light streaming through the window, creating a delicate transition of light and shadow. Shadows naturally fall on the sides of the body and background. The overall color scheme is mainly warm beige, light green, and gray-white, accented with bright orange oranges. The colors are harmoniously unified, creating a quiet, warm, and healing atmosphere. The image has a strong sense of daily life and life, as if captured with a regular camera at home, capturing the most touching moments of ordinary life. The camera feels authentic, It has a slight grainy texture of film, moderate color saturation, and soft contrast, presenting an artistic, fresh, and natural style that conveys a relaxed, joyful mood and a love for life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
