        {
          "id": "krea2-7aa4dbd21d51e31f5bc48ff2",
          "alias": "单女毛衣窗边忧伤坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window, wearing a coarse knit sweater woven from beige and light brown. The sweater's texture is clearly visible, giving off a warm and rustic feel. She leans slightly against the window frame, adding a touch of liveliness and spontaneity. Her expression is calm and slightly contemplative, revealing a subtle melancholy and gentleness. In her hand, she gently holds a book titled \"Jane Eyre\" with a dark cover. The golden lettering on the spine is faintly visible under the soft light. One of her hands rests gently on the windowsill, her posture relaxed and natural. As if immersed in reading or deep thoughts, the foreground features heavy, dark curtains, soft in texture and rich in folds, creating a strong contrast between light and shadow. The edges of the curtains are outlined by light with gentle contours, creating a sense of privacy and tranquility. The middle ground is the window itself, with wooden window frames that look slightly worn and show subtle wear on the surface, revealing the texture of time. The walls are a warm yellow hue, and the windows are neatly arranged. However, due to the shallow depth of field, they appear blurry and hazy, enhancing the sense of layering and depth in the painting. The sky is gray-blue, the clouds are thin, and the light is soft and diffuse. The overall atmosphere is quiet, nostalgic, and poetic. The composition is vertical, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the painting, forming the visual center. The right side has a large blank space, and curtains and window frames are used to guide the line of sight from the foreground to the middle and then to the background. This creates a natural visual flow. In terms of light and shadow, the main light source comes from the natural light outside the right window, which passes through the sheer curtain, creating a contrasting light and shadow effect. The large shadowed area on the left contrasts strongly with the bright area on the right, highlighting the main contour and creating a sense of depth. The overall color tone is mainly warm yellow, gray-blue, and dark brown, with low color saturation, presenting a retro texture reminiscent of film photography. The image has slight graininess and low contrast, simulating everyday amateur camera shooting and emphasizing realism and a sense of life The lens is a 50mm prime lens with an f/1.8 aperture, achieving a shallow depth of field effect, blurring the background and highlighting the subject. The overall atmosphere is quiet, restrained, and full of artistic flair, as if capturing an ordinary yet touching afternoon moment, allowing one to feel the slow flow of time and inner peace.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
