        {
          "id": "krea2-aaa589b8f1b3b42eed9ec1db",
          "alias": "单女白礼服婚礼困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "The flowers and green leaves intertwine and entwine, creating a poetic pastoral beauty. A slender black hairpin is placed in her bun, with floral earrings matching the accessories, swaying gently with the slight movement of her head. She wears a pure white spaghetti strap gown with slender straps, and the upper half of the dress is densely covered with tiny sequins or beads, shimmering faintly under the light. The overall look is full of romance and ceremony. The gaze looks downward, as if gazing at something, or immersed in its own thoughts. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure positioned on the right side of the painting, body slightly tilted, head slightly lowered, forming a graceful S-shaped curve. The background is a pure light beige or cream wall with subtle textures, unifying and soft tones without cluttered elements, making the subject stand out. Light softly shines from the front left side. It creates a natural side lighting effect, with smooth shadow transitions, creating a warm and layered texture of light and shadow. The overall atmosphere is quiet, gentle, and romantic, with the refinement of artistic photography and the natural beauty of everyday life. It feels like a portrait shot with a professional camera on a quiet afternoon. The background blur is handled perfectly, highlighting the subject's three-dimensionality and visual center. The color scheme is harmonious, dominated by warm tones, interwoven with yellow, orange, white, and brown, creating a cozy and dreamy visual experience. The overall composition presents an artistic beauty that is both real and transcendent, like a carefully crafted portrait or a beautiful moment casually captured in daily life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
