        {
          "id": "krea2-500b523523a3795540814383",
          "alias": "单女黑毛衣霓虹夜景自信倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman leans sideways against a metal railing, her head slightly tilted back, her expression revealing a calmness and reverie. She wears a simple black sleeveless knit top, with smooth shoulder lines and clearly visible garment patterns. At her collarbone, a slender silver necklace sparkles faintly in the light. Her arms are naturally bent, elbows resting lightly on the railing, fingers hanging relaxed, her posture elegant and relaxed. The foreground is a close-up of her body, occupying the left to central area of the frame, composed in a low-angle downward shot. Highlighting the outlines and expressions of the figures, the background is a blurry city street scene at night, with distant tall buildings standing high. Neon signs and car lights form large bokeh light spots, colorful with blue, green, white, and yellow circular halos. These spots vary in size and are distributed in a well-balanced manner, creating a strong sense of depth and contrast between reality and void. The overall composition uses shallow depth of field, with the background completely blurred, creating a dreamlike bokeh effect that extends along her line of sight into the distant world of light. It creates an upward sense of flow and a desire to explore. The light mainly comes from the red light source slightly above the right, possibly street lights or billboards, while soft transitional shadows form on the neck and shoulders, enhancing the sense of depth. The ambient light is composed of multicolored lighting in the background, adding rich color layers to the image. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and romantic, carrying a touch of urban loneliness and poetry, as if capturing a fleeting inner monologue. The image texture approaches that of high-sensitivity film photography. There is a slight graininess and natural noise, with a slightly warm tone and minimal exposure, but details are preserved, presenting a realistic and artistic effect of everyday amateur photography. The lens simulates an 85mm prime portrait lens, with an f/1.8 large aperture and slow shutter shooting. Slight handheld shake causes local motion blur, enhancing the sense of presence. Color saturation is moderate, emphasizing the contrast of red and blue to create strong emotional tension. The composition is asymmetrical, with the figure positioned in the left two-thirds of the frame. Leaving space on the right for background light spots creates visual balance. The overall style blends city nightscapes, portrait photography, and film aesthetics, conveying a modern urban youth seeking a moment of tranquility amid the noise",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
