        {
          "id": "krea2-ed096ed3dbce67cf77d2687f",
          "alias": "单女粉衬衫室内温柔坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by an indoor bookshelf, wearing a soft pink short-sleeved shirt. The fabric is light and breathable, presenting natural pleats and drapes. The cuffs are slightly rolled up, revealing slender wrists. The shirt collar is open, showing off the neckline. The overall look is simple yet comfortable, full of the vibe of everyday life. The shelves were neatly arranged with many comic books, spines in a variety of colors—red, blue, yellow, white, etc. Some spines bore Korean titles and patterns, indicating these were Korean comic works. The bookshelves themselves were made of dark wood, with a slightly aged surface showing signs of time. In the background, a window could be faintly seen, and outside light streamed through the curtains into the interior. Soft light spots are formed, with curtains featuring floral patterns hanging by the window, mainly pink and green. The patterns are blurry but layered, and the entire scene is bathed in warm natural light, with light streaming in from the left side, creating a tranquil and cozy atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center-left position, head slightly tilted, and the gaze meeting the viewer directly, creating a strong visual guidance. Bookshelves and books serve as foreground elements, enriching the composition's layers. It also hints at the characters' interests and lifestyles. The background blur highlights the subject while preserving environmental details, making the image more realistic. In terms of lighting and shadow, the main light source comes from the window on the left, creating a side lighting effect, while the left side is in shadow, creating a natural transition and three-dimensionality. The overall tone is warm, mainly pink, brown, and off-white, complemented by colorful accents on the spine, creating a retro film photography texture. The image has slight graininess and color shift, simulating the effect of vintage camera shooting. It heightens nostalgia, with moderate focal length, shallow depth, and a gradually blurred background, reinforcing the subject's presence. The overall atmosphere is quiet, intimate, and story-rich, as if capturing a brief rest after an afternoon of reading, full of poetic and gentle everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
