        {
          "id": "krea2-a4266911b1b8480afc085c2f",
          "alias": "单女制服车厢忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a Japanese high school girls' uniform, a white short-sleeved shirt paired with a dark plaid pleated skirt, with a red and white striped bow tie at the collar. Her expression was slightly melancholic and contemplative. In her left hand, she held a deep blue canvas handbag, with a white plush teddy bear hanging from it. Her posture was naturally relaxed but also tinged with a hint of loneliness. Standing near the window inside the subway carriage, sunlight slanted in from outside, creating a warm golden halo that created a soft silhouette glow. The interior of the carriage was dimly lit. The window glass reflects the afterglow of the setting sun, creating a hazy light and shadow effect. The entire scene is dominated by warm tones, with orange-yellow light streaming through the windows and filling the cabin, contrasting with the cool gray metallic texture inside. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned on the right side, while the left side leaves space to show the depth of the car. The vertical lines of the windows guide the gaze into the distance, with the foreground showing the main subject. The middle shot features blurry passengers and passenger seats, while the background is a window outside the window bathed in golden red sunlight. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm yet slightly melancholic, as if capturing a moment of returning home alone after school. The overall image has a strong cinematic and storytelling feel, with warm tones, moderate saturation, rich details, and delicate texture, resembling a real scene shot at dusk with a professional camera. There is a slight film graininess and natural lens distortion, presenting a daily aesthetic that is both realistic and dreamy, with a compact and layered composition. The use of lighting is skillful, emphasizing the fusion of the characters' emotions with the ambient atmosphere, creating a tranquil, nostalgic, and youthful visual style",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
