        {
          "id": "krea2-bc734dbfa85ad092e025e1c1",
          "alias": "单女沙发坐泼洒",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the edge of a deep green leather sofa, looking lazy and natural. She tilts her head slightly back, her right hand gently holding a slice of sliced grapefruit. The flesh is bright red and juicy, the grains clearly visible. Her hand posture is naturally relaxed, as if gazing at the fruit in her hand or lost in thought. The background is a warm wooden blind, sunlight pouring through the gaps, forming parallel beams of light. The light is soft and has a distinct graininess, creating a tranquil afternoon atmosphere. In the foreground, faint plant leaves can be faintly seen. It adds depth and a sense of life to the composition. The middle shot focuses on the people and grapefruits, with close-ups in composition. The figures occupy most of the space, slightly to the right, with the head slightly tilted, creating a sense of visual flow. The blinds in the background are mainly horizontal lines, contrasting with the curves of the figures and enhancing the rhythm of the composition. The overall tone is warm, mainly golden, orange-red, and deep green, with strong light and shadow contrasts. Highlights are bright and transparent, while shadow areas are deep and soft, creating delicate transitions between light and dark. The image presents a film-like texture with slight noise and slightly low color saturation, as if captured with an old-fashioned camera. The overall atmosphere is quiet, private, and poetic, carrying a nostalgic mood reminiscent of artistic youth. The image details are rich, with the grapefruit's juice and fiber structure clearly distinguishable. The entire scene resembles an afternoon corner forgotten by time, full of the authenticity of life and emotional depth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
