        {
          "id": "krea2-67b1429326455c164b8ea387",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙小巷微笑坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden bench in an old alley, wearing a bright red sleeveless dress with a naturally flowing hem, a black thin cord at the waist, and a cross-shaped embroidery pattern adorning the chest. The overall look is simple yet full of design, showing a gentle smile and looking directly at the camera, exuding a friendly yet slightly shy aura. Her body leans slightly forward, arms naturally resting on her knees, her posture relaxed and elegant. Her right hand rests gently on the edge of the bench, her left hand hangs naturally, fingers long, and nails neatly trimmed. A subtle transition of light and shadow forms as she leans against a red vending machine. The machine's surface is smooth, adorned with vintage-style stickers and buttons. Inside, various beverage bottles and cans are displayed, colorful and echoing the red dress she wears. The background is a narrow street, flanked by old buildings. The walls are mottled, with peeling paint and stains in some areas, showing the marks of time. On the left is a green cartoon elephant sculpture, adorably shaped, placed on a yellow plastic box. Nearby, several stacked yellow plastic boxes add a sense of life. In the distance, building windows emit warm yellow light, contrasting with the cool outdoor tones and creating a cozy atmosphere. The street floor is paved with gray stone slabs edged with red curbstones. The vending machine on the right side occupies a large visual space, its bright red color becoming the visual focal point of the entire composition. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the right, and the vending machine occupying most of the right side, creating a strong visual guidance. The left side leaves some negative space to balance the image without crowding. The background is blurred to highlight the main figure, while retaining environmental details to enhance the sense of space. The light comes from the left in the front, soft and even, like natural afternoon or dusk light. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the building, casting long shadows on the floor and walls. The interplay of light and shadow creates rich layers, creating an overall warm and nostalgic atmosphere, as if capturing an ordinary yet story-filled moment. The color palette is mainly red, gray, and green. The color scheme is harmonious, creating both visual impact and authenticity, presenting a subtle beauty found in everyday life, like a real scene shot with a regular camera, full of vibrant life and humanistic care",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
