        {
          "id": "krea2-d73473de09dcf44f051d8771",
          "alias": "单女棕制服街道忧伤过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a dark brown school uniform jacket with a white shirt and a red-blue striped tie. She carries a red backpack over her shoulder, with an overall relaxed yet slightly lazy posture, presenting a daily moment from a youthful campus life. The foreground features the main subject occupying the center to the right, with a medium to close-up shot, fully presenting the head and upper body. The background is a blurry city streetscape, and through the glass window, you can see vehicles, pedestrians, and distant buildings, creating blurred light spots and lines to create a shallow depth of field effect. Light enters the frame diagonally from the upper left, creating warm backlight and side backlight. Sunlight filters through the glass, creating a soft halo that produces distinct contour light and highlights. The layers of light and shadow are rich, with a warm yellowish tone, a grainy film texture, and a slight fading effect. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and nostalgic, as if capturing a tranquil dusk after school. The image is rich in documentary and everyday life, reminiscent of street candid shots taken with an old film camera. The lens is an 85mm prime portrait lens with an aperture f/ 1.8, shutter speed 1/200 second, ISO 400, presenting delicate out-of-focus blur and soft light and shadow transitions. The composition follows the rule of thirds, with glass reflections in the background and urban elements as environmental cues to enhance realism. The main tones are brown, off-white, dark red, and blue, with subtle contrasts of warm and cool tones, presenting an overall vintage film style with slight overexposure and shadow compression, simulating exposure control and dynamic range in real shooting, with slight vignetting at the edges. Enhancing the central focus effect, the overall atmosphere presents a quiet, contemplative, and slightly melancholic youthful atmosphere, reminiscent of the artistic scenes commonly seen in films like \"Love Letter\" or \"Quartet,\" full of storytelling and emotional tension, as if one can hear the wind and distant traffic noise, feeling the warmth and emotion of that particular moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
