        {
          "id": "krea2-75353559e07cd8d84ee877a8",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫高塔冷淡持花",
          "prompt": "She wears a black sleeveless turtleneck top paired with a loose long dress in light purple with colorful floral patterns. The dress has distinct layers, the material is light and flowing, swaying naturally with her movements, appearing elegant and vibrant. In her left hand, she holds a bouquet of fresh flowers wrapped in kraft paper, including orange-yellow roses, white baby's breath, and green leaves. The colors are fresh and natural, with flower branches poking out from the paper bag in an orderly fashion. In the right hand, she carries a white handbag. The body is simple and adorned with gold metal clasps. The strap is made of woven straw material, giving it a warm and smooth texture and presenting a Japanese artistic style. The background is a vast blue sky, dotted with several fluffy, pure white clouds. The clouds are naturally distributed with clear layers, and in the distance, the outlines of city buildings, including the silhouettes of skyscrapers, add spatial depth to the composition. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward view. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the painting, occupying the visual center and creating a strong upward extension. The sky occupies most of the upper part of the image, creating a spacious and bright atmosphere. Text information is overlaid in white font at the top and right of the image, including \"AIRI MATSUI,\" \"DAY 30,\" and Japanese descriptions. The font is simple and modern, harmonizing with the overall style. The light comes from the top slightly to the right, belonging to natural daylight, with soft and even sunlight creating a slight shadow transition that enhances the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color palette is mainly blue, white, and light purple, complemented by warm floral tones. The contrast of cool and warm is harmonious, creating a comfortable visual experience. The image is filled with fresh summer vibes and romantic emotions, conveying a relaxed, joyful, and free-spirited attitude toward life. It has a strong everyday photography aesthetic, resembling a magazine cover photo shot with a professional camera. It is realistic and delicate, with natural light and shadow, rich details, and outstanding texture, while retaining a sense of everyday warmth and authenticity. It is suitable for fashion styling, travel diaries, or emotional themes for visual expression. The overall scene presents a gentle, healing, and hopeful atmosphere, allowing people to feel the beautiful moments found in love, friendship, or self-companionship",
