        {
          "id": "krea2-ffee29eaa10db70dc7788967",
          "alias": "单女红毛衣秋叶微笑站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under an autumn maple tree, wearing a bright red knit sweater with clearly visible textures. The thick knit pattern creates a warm texture in the sunlight, with wide and voluminous sleeves naturally draped over her arms, presenting a relaxed and comfortable style that adds a touch of casualness and gentleness. She tilts her head slightly back, wearing a bright smile and showing white teeth. Her right hand gently raises her fingers, lightly touching the dense maple leaves above her head, as if suppressing the overflowing laughter, creating mottled light and shadow. Softly outlining her outline, the maple leaves are a vivid orange-red with slightly yellowish edges, unfolding like a palm, layered over the upper half of the painting, forming a natural arched frame that encloses the figures. The background is a blurred park scene, with faint green trees, metal railings, and benches visible. In the distance, faint light spots and color transitions create a shallow depth of field effect. The composition uses the figure positioned slightly to the right center, using the maple leaf in the foreground as visual guidance. It draws the attention to the figures, while the leaves block the view and allow light to penetrate, creating layers and spatial depth. The overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, full of autumn poetry and vitality. Sunlight pours in from the upper left, creating bright highlights and soft shadows. The contrast is strong but not glaring, with warm tones predominantly blending red, orange, and yellow echoing the characters' red sweaters. The green accents in the background bring a touch of freshness, and the entire scene feels like a film shot frozen in time, with a slight graininess and natural overexposure, presenting the authentic texture of everyday shooting. The background blur is well handled, highlighting the subject while preserving environmental information. The overall image conveys a relaxed and joyful feeling, immersed in the beauty of nature. You can almost hear the rustling of leaves and the cheerful laughter of women, allowing one to feel the unique romance and healing power of autumn",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
