        {
          "id": "krea2-923609abe08db194ff3db6c0",
          "alias": "单女内衣床冷淡坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bed by the window, her body slightly leaning forward, legs bent together, her knees covered by a soft white sheet. She wears an off-white hooded sweatshirt, the zipper half-open revealing the light-colored underwear. The sleeve of the sweatshirt features a simple circular logo, fingers naturally bent, and the other hand casually resting on her leg, her posture relaxed and natural. Light softly streams into the room from the left window, creating a bright natural light effect. The outlines of the window frame and curtains are clearly visible in the background but slightly blurred, creating a sense of depth. The overall color scheme of the room is mainly white and beige, with walls and furniture presenting a clean modern style. The composition uses medium shots and close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space and positioned slightly to the right of the visual center. Light and shadow shine from the upper left, highlighting the delicate texture of the skin and the folds of the clothing. The whole atmosphere is tranquil and warm, full of the cozy vibe of daily life, as if on a sunny morning or afternoon sunshine. Shot with professional photography equipment, it achieves cinematic-level color reproduction and delicate texture expression. The lens is an 85mm prime portrait lens with an f/1.8 aperture, creating an extremely shallow depth of field and a soft background blur. The lighting is soft and even, with no obvious hard shadows, emphasizing harmony between subject and environment. The images present a realistic and emotionally rich documentary aesthetic, like moments captured with a high-end camera. The film features a slight film grain texture and natural color gradients, enhancing the image's realism and artistic appeal. The overall tone leans toward cool white, creating a warm and cool contrast. This makes the composition both fresh and warm. The composition follows the golden ratio ratio, with the figure's head slightly tilted, forming a graceful line that forms a complete visual flow path. The window in the background becomes an important visual element, providing not only light but also hinting at the openness of the space and its connection to the outside world. The faintly visible green plants outside the window add a touch of vitality, but the focus is entirely on the figure. The background blur is handled well to avoid distracting the subject, presenting the entire scene with a sense of tranquility. The tranquil and slightly lazy atmosphere makes it seem as if time has stopped at this moment, evoking a pure and genuine beauty. It is suitable for expressing themes of youth, tenderness, everyday life, and self-healing. The images possess a high level of detail depiction, while preserving natural light and shadow changes and color gradation, demonstrating the photographer's deep understanding of light and emotion. The final image resembles a carefully crafted portrait work, combining artistic beauty with a sense of realism in life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
