        {
          "id": "krea2-3ee233d767f2a4f25b6274e3",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣街道冷淡站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under the sunlight of a city street, her head slightly raised, her expression calm and content, as if feeling the warm sunlight and fresh air. She wears a dark gray thick knit sweater with a red scarf revealing a corner of the collar, adorned with geometric patterns that add a touch of vintage warmth. A brown leather strap is slung across her shoulder, forming the main subject. The foreground is a blurred ground and part of the street edge, with visible stone pillars and shadows by the roadside, and the background is a typical urban street scene. There are bare trees, building facades, steps, and pedestrians walking in the distance. One person in a black jacket is walking down the steps, while another electric scooter rider passes by. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure positioned on the right side of the frame, leaving space on the left to show the street extension. Light comes from the upper left, and the intense sunlight casts clear shadows of trees and figures on the ground, creating a contrast of light and shadow, producing soft highlights and warm golden tones. The light and shadow atmosphere is filled with the warmth of late winter and early spring. The overall color tone leans toward cool but is tinged with a warm orange-yellow hue by sunlight. The image has a grainy texture reminiscent of film photography and a slight overexposure, presenting a casual feeling of daily life and a tranquil atmosphere reminiscent of an art film. The camera captures a real and natural moment, without forced staging, with relaxed postures and rich environmental details, creating a rare tranquility in the city. The background blur emphasizes the main subject, while retaining enough environmental information to enhance the realism of the scene. The entire image exudes nostalgia, Gentle yet poetic, like a scene from an independent film, it lets people feel the small joys of life and the appreciation of beautiful moments",
