          "id": "krea2-672465fcab88d2a3c0ada134",
          "alias": "单女紫衬衫沙发沉思躺泼洒",
          "prompt": "A woman is lying on her side on a light-colored soft sofa, her head resting on a crossed pale purple long-sleeved shirt. She wears a black ribbed knit top layered with a light purple long-sleeve base shirt, with distinct color layers and a soft visual effect. Her left hand gently rests on her right, fingers relaxed naturally, her posture relaxed and relaxed, with a touch of contemplation and tranquility. She wears a soft coral lipstick, which glows naturally under the light. The background is a bright indoor space, with light pouring in from the right window, creating a soft backlighting effect. The window frame features white geometric lines, with faint glimpses of the blurred blue floor or wall outside, creating a cool atmosphere reminiscent of a winter afternoon or early spring. Sunlight filters through the glass onto the figure and sofa, creating delicate shadow transitions and slight highlights. The overall color palette is mainly warm white, pale purple, and gray-blue, creating a harmonious contrast of cool and warm tones. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the left central position of the frame, the head slightly tilted, arms and body forming diagonal extensions to enhance the image's dynamism and tension. The foreground features a smooth off-white sofa surface with a slight reflect, highlighting the softness and warmth of the material. The middle shot is the main subject, rich in detail. The background is blurred to highlight the subject while preserving environmental information to make the sense of space more complete. The overall light and shadow distribution is even, with the main light source coming from the right rear. Soft contour light and local highlights enhance the sense of depth. The atmosphere is quiet, healing, gentle, and full of life, as if capturing an ordinary yet poetic moment. It's like a daily photo taken with a regular camera, featuring a film-like graininess and natural color saturation. The edges of the frame have slight noise and vignetting, simulating real camera imaging and conveying a quiet, private, and authentic personal moment. The overall style leans toward Japanese artistic style—simple yet detailed. The emotional expression is subtle yet profound, evoking inner peace and a gentle gaze toward life",
