        {
          "id": "krea2-de6a6204a4ec7314ad8ae82f",
          "alias": "单女橙毛衣沙发沉思躺泼洒",
          "prompt": "A woman lies sideways on a deep blue fabric sofa, wearing a bright orange-red sweater and black trousers. The pages are printed with blurred words, presenting a warm golden sheen, tinged with a touch of contemplation and tenderness, as if immersed in a tranquil world of reading. The background is dark gray curtains and a bright window, with natural light pouring in from the right, casting gentle shadows on the pages and creating a tranquil and cozy atmosphere. The sofa's texture is delicate, The fabric texture is clearly visible, the pillow softly rests against the back, and the overall composition uses close-ups. The figure is positioned in the lower right corner of the frame, occupying the visual center. The book serves as a foreground element, partially covering the legs to create a sense of layering. The upper left of the painting leaves a lot of blank space to highlight the subject. The composition is slightly slanted, enhancing the sense of dynamism and the sense of life. The colors mainly feature warm and cool contrasts, with deep blue and gray-black cool tones contrasting sharply with orange-red and warm yellow tones, yet harmoniously unified. The light and shadows are soft, and the light source comes from the window on the right. This creates a natural side backlighting effect, making the character's outline clear with a slight graininess, presenting an authentic and poetic moment from everyday life, as if shot with an old film camera, with slight noise and slight color cast. The lens focal length is moderate, depth of field is relatively shallow, the background is naturally blurred, and emotional expression is emphasized. The image has a strong sense of narrative and warmth, conveying a quiet, focused, and healing atmosphere, like an ordinary moment when afternoon sunlight fills the room, full of realism and artistic beauty",
