        {
          "id": "krea2-27f6a828118316bf33d6be74",
          "alias": "单女灰外套城市困倦站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beneath a blooming cherry blossom tree, wearing a dark gray coat with clean and sharp shoulder lines. The fabric is delicate and soft, presenting a calm and elegant urban feel. Looking to the left side of the frame, her expression is focused and reserved. She carries a black crossbody bag with a simple and practical design, harmonizing with the overall look. Her body turns slightly, her posture natural and relaxed, as if immersed in the breath of spring. In the foreground is a vast expanse of golden rapeseed flowers, densely blooming. The tiny petals glow warmly under the sunlight, the stems are upright, and green leaves dot the space, creating a striking color contrast. Some rapeseed flowers are scorched, creating a soft blur effect that enhances the sense of layering and depth in the composition. In the middle ground, the woman is the main subject, her outline clear, with natural transitions of light and shadow. The background is a tree full of pure white cherry blossoms, with petals layered and densely covering the branches, forming a sea of flowers like clouds and snow, with branches intertwining and crisscrossing. A complex geometric texture is formed, with some branches extending into the edges of the composition, adding dynamic to the composition. The distant cherry blossoms gradually blur, creating a soft bokeh and a dreamy visual atmosphere. The entire composition uses a low-angle downward view, making the figures appear taller and highlighting the grandeur and flourishing of the cherry trees. The composition uses the rule of thirds: the figure is positioned slightly to the right, leaving space on the left side to extend the view deep into the background cherry blossoms, creating visual guidance. Light pours down from above and sides. Bright and soft daytime natural light is presented, with sunlight filtering through the gaps and casting mottled shadows on the figures, creating a contrast of light and shadow that enhances the sense of depth. The overall color palette is dominated by white, yellow, and gray. White cherry blossoms are pure and bright, yellow rapeseed flowers warm and lively, and the gray coat is calm and understated. These three elements complement each other, creating a harmonious and layered color scheme. The overall atmosphere of the painting is tranquil and poetic, full of spring vitality and romance, carrying a subtle sense of nostalgia and artistic flair, as if capturing a fleeting moment of tender time The lens simulates professional photography equipment, using a large-aperture prime lens to achieve a shallow depth of field effect. The background blurs naturally, details are rich, and the image sharpness is moderate, preserving authentic texture and graininess, presenting a delicate texture with slight noise similar to film photography. The overall style leans toward Japanese photography, emphasizing natural lighting effects and emotional expression, with a strong sense of artistry and a sense of everyday life—like capturing beautiful moments casually on a spring afternoon with a lightweight camera—authentic and unpretentious",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
