        {
          "id": "krea2-ba5ed1b8ffb16778106a28f7",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道沉思站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman rides a vintage-style white scooter, wearing a classic white vintage helmet with black goggles and a metallic strap. The visor reflects faint colored spots. She wears a simple white long-sleeve shirt made of soft and slightly wrinkled fabric, hands folded on the handlebars, fingers long and neatly trimmed. On her wrist is a gold watch or bracelet, her expression focused and slightly contemplative. The front of the motorcycle is designed with a rounded design. In the center is a round vintage headlight with a transparent lampshade and fine scratches on the surface. On each side is an orange round turn signal. Below the front hangs a Japanese license plate reading \"Tsuchiura 35 お71-109\". There are slight wear marks around the plate. The body is matte white, with fine dust and signs of use. The background is a blurry city streetscape, with faint outlines of buildings and a blue sky. The overall composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the main figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame. The motorcycle occupies the main foreground, forming a visual focal point. The background is blurred to highlight the subject, and the camera angle slightly tilts upward, enhancing the character's uprightness. Light comes from the upper right, creating a soft side effect. The shadows transition delicately, creating a warm and bright daytime atmosphere. The colors are mainly white, light gray, blue, and orange, fresh and natural with a slight retro filter. The overall image presents a realistic and story-rich moment from everyday life. It feels as if capturing a quiet moment on an afternoon street, full of life and youthful energy. The photography style resembles a professional photographer using a full-frame camera paired with a prime lens, with a focal length of about 85mm, an aperture of f/2.8, moderate shutter speed, accurate exposure, clear details, and soft background bokeh. The overall image has a cinematic and film-like feel, presenting a quiet yet poetic urban cycling scene",
