        {
          "id": "krea2-ec5da10d52aeb2b0aa866dbe",
          "alias": "单女金衬衫城市忧伤坐持包",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a red-cushioned seat on a bus, wearing a yellow-green plaid shirt paired with an off-white knit vest, paired with matching plaid pants. The overall look is simple yet exudes a Japanese retro vibe, with a hint of detachment and contemplation. Her right hand rests naturally on her lap, while her left hand lightly grips a brown leather handbag, with the strap slung across her shoulder, presenting a realistic state from everyday travel. The figure is positioned on the right side of the frame, body slightly turned and head facing the camera, forming the visual center. The foreground features bright red seat edges and some leg contours; the middle features the main figure, window frames, and metal armrests and hanging rings inside the cabin. Through the window, the background reveals a blurred city streetscape, with faint outlines of trees, buildings, and flowing light and shadow, creating an atmosphere where dynamic and static elements intertwine. The composition combines close-ups with the environment, using the window as a natural frame to place the figure near the golden ratio point, creating a stable visual balance. Light streams in diagonally from the left window. This creates a strong contrast between light and dark, while creating deep shadow areas within the dark cabin. The interplay of light and shadow enhances the image's sense of depth and layering. The overall tone is warm, with a slight grainy film texture and a slightly low-saturation retro filter effect, simulating the realistic feel of amateur or vintage film cameras. The lens is chosen at a mid-focal length angle, slightly compressing space to highlight the subject. The background blur is well handled so that the focus is clearly on the subject. The car window reflects the profiles of the people and the external environment, adding depth and narrative quality to the image. The overall atmosphere is quiet and private, as if capturing fleeting moments during a city commute, full of life and artistic flair. It is like an ordinary yet moving moment captured by chance on a sunny afternoon. The images present a style that balances documentary and art, combining the realism of everyday photography with exquisite details of visual aesthetics. The tones mainly include warm yellow, orange-red, dark green, and gray-black. The color transitions are soft, the light and shadow delicate, the composition is refined but not forced, emphasizing atmosphere rather than mere visual impact. The overall composition conveys a tranquil, introspective, and slightly melancholic emotional tone, like a private diary fragment from the streets and alleys, evoking those overlooked yet cherished moments of urban life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
