        {
          "id": "krea2-b34cf7fc5b64d7e94ddf2ae8",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙困倦坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the white metal railing by the water, wearing a loose white pleated long dress. The fabric is light and flowing, naturally draping down to create soft folds and layers of light and shadow. She leans slightly to the side, gently holding a pot of blooming red tulips. She smiles faintly, exuding a calm and contented mood. Sunlight slants in from the upper left of the painting, creating shimmering waves on the water's surface and reflecting dazzling golden light spots. Some light passes through the gaps between the railings, forming interwoven stripes of light and shadow, creating a warm and dreamy atmosphere. The background is an open water surface with delicate ripples, where water and sky meet in the distance. The color tone is cool, presenting a gray-blue hue, contrasting with the warm foreground to enhance the visual layering. The composition uses a center-right position of the figure, using horizontal lines on the railing to guide the view, forming a framed composition that enhances the subject's presence. The figure's head and flowerpot form the visual focal point, and the red tulip becomes the strongest color accent in the composition The overall image has the texture of film photography, with slight graininess and natural exposure. The color saturation is moderate, preserving the original transitions and details of light and shadow. The lighting is soft and shadows are not abrupt, presenting the golden atmosphere of early morning or evening. The lens focal length is close, background blur is moderate, highlighting details of people and flowers. The overall style combines the casual feel of daily life with the delicacy of artistic imagery, like a private moment captured with an old-fashioned camera, capturing the beautiful moment where people and nature, tranquility and vitality intertwine",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
