        {
          "id": "krea2-897435a34a5b7f5d7a61dc77",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫椅上温柔坐持手机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits indoors, wearing a loose white shirt, her overall posture relaxed and casual. She holds a bottle of clear glass soda in each hand, with clearly visible labels and striking blue and red packaging. On her left wrist is a watch with a simple black strap, adding a touch of everyday detail. The background is a plain light beige wall. On the wall hangs a calendar, printed with the word \"CALENDAR\" and a striking orange number \"1.\" Below it are blurry Japanese text, with slightly yellowed edges revealing traces of time. On the right is a wooden shelf housing a retro-style white portable radio or audio equipment, equipped with two round speakers and a tape slot. Nearby are several thermoses, one blue and white with cartoon patterns, and another with a silver metallic finish. On the bookshelf below the shelves, several books are neatly arranged. The covers are mainly white and orange, with faintly visible spines. Next to it is a small potted lush green plant, lush and full of life. In the lower left corner of the painting, a section of dark green furniture frames and black metal armrests is visible, possibly part of a chair or sofa. The overall composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly below the center of the frame, heads slightly tilted and bodies slightly leaning forward, creating a warm and natural sense of closeness, with soft and even lighting. From the side of the interior, a slight shadow transition forms. The tone is warm and slightly retro-filtered, presenting a grainy texture and slight overexposure reminiscent of film photography. The color saturation is moderate, dominated by white, beige, green, blue, and orange, creating a harmonious and layered visual combination. The overall atmosphere is quiet, nostalgic, and full of life, as if capturing a peaceful moment at home in an ordinary afternoon. The image combines a strong sense of everyday life with artistic expression. For example, real scenes shot with amateur cameras or smartphones preserve imperfections and randomness from the real environment—such as subtle wall textures, imperfect placement of items, and natural changes in light and shadow, enhancing the realism and immersion. In composition, the beverage bottles in the foreground, the main figures in the middle ground, and the furnishings in the background create rich spatial layers, which extend to the decorations behind them to form a circular visual path, presenting an overall life aesthetic of tranquility, gentleness, and a touch of humor. Combining documentary and creative qualities, it is like an intimate image capturing the daily life of youth.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
