        {
          "id": "krea2-b68aa1fc2d86404a5bea1fa0",
          "alias": "单女白长裤山野俏皮坐持手机",
          "prompt": "From a low-angle downward view, a woman sits outdoors under a sunny blue sky. She wears a red short-sleeved top and loose white pants, wearing a light-colored baseball cap. Her expression is slightly lazy and playful, her overall posture relaxed and expressive. Her hands extend forward, her right hand exaggeratedly enlarged in the foreground, fingers making a \"V\" or grabbing gesture, while her left hand echoes below the frame, creating strong visual tension and spatial illusions. The background is a pure, cloudless deep blue sky. Only a few thin strands of white cloud threads dot the area, with distant mountain outlines and green vegetation faintly visible. The composition uses an extremely low angle to emphasize the contrast between the figure and the sky. The enlarged hand in the foreground becomes the visual focal point, then projected upward into the vast sky, creating a visual flow from near to far. Light comes from intense daylight directly above, making the folds of the clothing clearly visible. Shadows are concentrated below the body and hands, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The color saturation is high, and the red top and white pants create a striking contrast against the deep blue background. Highlighting the subject, the overall atmosphere is full of youthful energy, free-spiritedness, and a touch of summer, as if capturing an impromptu street moment. It carries the natural realism and everyday life of amateur photography. The lens presents a slight grainy film texture and soft color transitions, simulating everyday phone or portable camera shooting. The light and shadow layers are rich but not abrupt, with slightly dark corners at the edges to enhance center focus. The overall style combines artistry and documentary, like a precious moment casually pressed on a sunny afternoon. It conveys a relaxed, carefree, and distinctive urban youth vibe",
          "description": "",
