        {
          "id": "krea2-f86bb7c438961bb17e97f97b",
          "alias": "单女白礼服婚礼专注跪注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wore an elegant white strapless wedding dress. She sat at a rustic dark wooden table, turning sideways to gaze out the window. She was barefoot suspended in the air, one foot gently resting on the other. The hem of the dress naturally unfolded along her body's lines. The light tulle material appeared semi-transparent under the light, the edges of the skirt slightly curled, revealing the lines of her long legs. Her hands rested naturally on her knees, fingers slightly bent, her expression focused and calm. As if immersed in her own thoughts, the foreground is her sitting posture, occupying most of the left side of the image, fully visible from waist to feet. In the middle is a dark wooden table, wide and smooth, with slight wear on the edges. On the table sits a large bouquet of vibrant flowers, including pink, red, white, and pale purple roses and hydrangeas. The blossoms are lush and intertwined, with some petals scattered around the table, making the scene especially vivid under the light. In the background are two tall, classical-style wooden doors. The door panels feature exquisite embossed patterns, the frame is thick and warm light brown, and sunlight streams in diagonally from outside, creating a strong backlight effect. Light passes through the door crack, casting long bands of light on the floor. The halo is soft and bright, illuminating the entire space. The floor is a dark wooden floor with clear grain, reflecting some light and creating a warm atmosphere. The composition uses a three-part method, with the figure positioned on the left third of the frame, with the gaze turning to the right, creating a visual flow. At the same time, flowers and the table form a stable horizontal line, balancing the structure of the image. The use of light and shadow is extremely delicate. The main light source comes from the window on the right, creating a strong contrast of light and dark, while the shadowed areas retain detailed layering. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and off-white, creating a retro and romantic atmosphere. The image has a film-like texture, slight graininess, moderate color saturation, and emphasizes realism. The lens uses an 85mm portrait focal length to simulate professional camera shooting, with a shallow depth of field and slightly blurred background and foreground. It enhances the prominence of the main subject, and the overall atmosphere is quiet, gentle, and poetic, as if capturing a private and precious moment, like a classic scene from a movie, full of strong emotional tension and artistic appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
