        {
          "id": "krea2-fa965c8d44ad299ae84b8bd6",
          "alias": "单女制服街道忧伤拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a Japanese-style schoolgirl uniform is curled up on a stone pedestal outdoors. She wears a white short-sleeved shirt and a deep blue pleated skirt, with a white collar trimmed, white long socks, and black leather shoes. She hugs her knees with her arms hugged, her head lowered and resting on her arms, her expression slightly melancholic and tired, as if lost in thought or feeling lonely. Her posture conveys a quiet and reserved mood. The background is a dense green plant, with vines and leaves layered in layers, full of natural wildness and vitality. On the right side is a metal wire fence. Composed of thick steel cables and dense diamond-shaped barbed wire, it appears somewhat old and mottled. Behind the barbed wire, a bamboo pole can be faintly seen slanting into the ground, adding a touch of everyday detail. The overall composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left, creating an asymmetrical visual balance. The stone base surface is covered with moss, showing traces of time erosion, enhancing the scene's realism and sense of time. Light comes from the upper left side, with soft natural light filtering through the gaps in the leaves. The figures are adorned with mottled light and shadow, with delicate contrasts of light and shadow, highlighting the outlines and the texture of the clothing folds. The overall color scheme is mainly green and deep blue, accented with white and black, creating a fresh yet slightly oppressive atmosphere. The image has a strong sense of daily life and a documentary style, as if taken casually with a regular camera, without deliberate staging, yet full of genuine emotional tension. The background is moderately blurred, highlighting the subject while preserving environmental information. The composition uses barbed wire lines to guide the gaze toward the figures, while the growth direction of the plants forms a natural frame structure, enhancing the spatial layering of the composition. The light and shadow are handled delicately, with soft transitions in shadows. Highlights are clear but not glaring, and the overall atmosphere is tranquil and slightly melancholic, like a forgotten moment of youth in a corner. It evokes a faint sense of loneliness and confusion in growing up. The texture is close to film photography, with slight graininess and low color saturation, adding a touch of nostalgia and authenticity Distant green leaves gently sway in the breeze, bringing a sense of dynamic breathing and filling the entire static scene with vitality. The hems of the characters' clothes and trouser legs hang naturally, rich in detail—including fabric textures, sock creases, and wear marks on shoes. These details together create a scene full of storytelling, as if you can hear the wind rustling through leaves and the faint birdsong in the distance. The whole scene feels both like a realistic street photography piece and a frozen youthful memory. The emotional intensity is extremely high, prompting reflection on the story behind it.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
