        {
          "id": "krea2-c5f89beae1f9f4f9d53bdee0",
          "alias": "单女门困倦站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways indoors, wearing a lightweight white semi-transparent cover-up over dark undergarments. The cover-up casually slides over her shoulders, revealing one shoulder and back line, adding a touch of laziness and naturalness. Her right hand is gently raised, her posture elegant yet slightly contemplative, as if lost in some tranquil thought. The overall composition centers on the figure, using medium shots to capture the upper body and part of the body's contours. The background is a bright window framed in light wood, with soft light streaming in from outside. This creates a warm backlighting effect, casting a faint halo around the edges of the figure's silhouette, creating a hazy and dreamy atmosphere. On the right side of the frame, you can see part of a wooden door with a simple round door handle on the door panel. The wall is off-white, with a delicate texture and a slightly grainy texture. The overall environment is clean and cozy, presenting a feeling of a private home space. The use of light and shadow is very meticulous, with the main light source coming from the window at the back, a typical backlit style that casts the subject in relatively soft shadows. However, the outlines are clearly and layered by sunlight, with a slight sheen. The wrinkles and textures of clothing naturally appear in the light, enhancing the realism and three-dimensionality of the image. The foreground occupies most of the composition, with the composition leaning to the right, leaving space on the left to highlight windows and light in the background, creating visual balance and guidance, creating a visual flow that moves toward the light. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and off-white, with low saturation, presenting a vintage film-like texture. The slightly yellowish white balance enhances the atmosphere of early morning or dusk, with rich image details while retaining some noise and slight overexposure, simulating natural traces from real camera shots and enhancing the image's realism and artistry. The overall style blends Japanese photography, lifestyle aesthetics, and intimate emotional expression, combining the warmth of everyday life with the refinement and subtlety of professional photography, making it suitable for themes that express women's inner worlds, self-reflection, or quiet moments",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
