        {
          "id": "krea2-7eef77e49dced7270de7856f",
          "alias": "单女蓝西装教室冷淡站立侧头",
          "prompt": "Her right hand gently gripped a transparent plastic bottle. The bottle was rounded and filled with a colorless liquid. She wore a dark blue suit jacket with a lapel design, gold buttons embedded on the chest, and a school emblem embroidered with gold patterns and letters on the left sleeve Underneath, she wears a white stand-collar shirt with a slightly open neckline revealing her collarbone. She wears a blue-black plaid bow tie, which is exquisitely tied with distinct pleats. She wears the same blue-black plaid pleated skirt below, with distinct layers and sharp edges. Paired with black over-the-knee stockings, her leg lines are graceful. Her right leg is slightly bent, with the elastic texture of the stockings visible at the knee. The overall composition centers on the figure, using medium to close shots. The figure occupies most of the main area of the frame, with the head slightly tilted to the right, creating a strong visual direction. The background is an indoor environment. Behind is a row of white bookshelves with multiple blue glass bottles printed with white patterns neatly arranged. The colors echo the characters' costumes, creating a fresh and clean atmosphere. Light enters diagonally from the left, simulating natural window illumination. The light source is soft and even, creating contrasts of light and shadow, natural transitions of shadows, enhancing three-dimensionality. The background bookshelves are bokefold to present a shallow depth of field effect, highlighting the main subject. The overall color palette is mainly cool blue and gray-white, creating a warm contrast with rich light and shadow layers, creating a quiet and cozy atmosphere. It is as if afternoon sunlight pours into a classroom or study, capturing a youthful everyday scene. The image texture is delicate, details are realistic, and it offers professional studio-level lighting and imaging effects, while preserving the natural feel and lifestyle of everyday shooting. The composition is balanced, the focus precise, and colors harmoniously unified, presenting a tranquil and beautiful campus image",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
