        {
          "id": "krea2-765710bfbc40e42543e07f16",
          "alias": "单女黑毛衣室内持相机",
          "prompt": "A half-length portrait of a woman wearing a thick black knit sweater adorned with green and red geometric patterns, presenting a classic Nordic style. The collar is a wide red plush hood made of fluffy and soft material with a warm texture. The hood edges hang naturally, forming soft pleats. Several dark round buttons are accented below the hood, connecting two slender red drawstrings. The drawstrings hang from both sides of the hood, echoing the patterned lines on the sweater, adding a touch of casual and lazy charm, with a hint of red. It appears moist and full. Looking directly into the camera, the background is a simple off-white wall with a flat surface without any decoration. The lighting is soft and even, shining down from the front slightly above, creating a warm and quiet atmosphere. The overall composition centers on the person, using close-ups. The colors are mainly black, red, and green, with sharp contrasts and harmonious unity. The light and shadow transitions naturally and shadows are soft, without strong contrasts of light and shadow, emphasizing the texture and realism of everyday life. It feels like a moment captured with an amateur camera in an ordinary indoor setting, capturing the most authentic and natural state of the person. The entire scene is filled with tranquil poetry and a gentle narrative feel, like a carefully preserved old photograph capturing an ordinary yet moving moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
