        {
          "id": "krea2-51be35a54705c252b14bd2c3",
          "alias": "单女半褪灰毛衣窗边愤怒倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman is presented in a half-body close-up, with a faint healthy pink hue. Her right shoulder is exposed, and she wears a dark gray ribbed knit short-sleeved top. The shirt is gently pulled down below her collarbone, creating natural folds and shadow layers. Her right hand lightly grips the hem, fingers are long, nails neatly trimmed, arms are smooth, and her body leans slightly, presenting an unintentionally lazy and sexy vibe. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space and the head positioned slightly to the left at the top of the frame. The gaze falls directly on the viewer, creating a strong sense of emotional connection. The background is a blurred indoor environment, with walls in light beige or gray-white tones with a slight texture. On the right side, you can faintly see the edges of wooden furniture. The overall background is very softly rendered, creating a strong depth of field. Light comes from the upper left side, which is soft natural light, possibly diffused light filtering through the window. The highlights are bright but not glaring, while the shadows transition softly, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. At the same time, subtle light and shadow changes occur in the folds of the clothing, with mainly neutral tones. The warm background walls and cool-toned clothing create a harmonious visual balance. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and private, carrying a sense of realism captured in daily life. It feels like a casual moment taken at home with an amateur camera or phone, without any deliberate staging, yet full of storytelling and emotional tension. Using a large aperture lens, the focal length is about 85mm, with a moderate shutter speed and low ISO. This ensures the purity and detail of the image, presenting a film-like texture with slight graininess and a warm color tendency, as if recording a gentle yet slightly melancholic afternoon. The interplay of light and shadow reveals youthful fragility and strength. The composition is simple yet impactful, extending along her shoulder line and arms to the edges of the frame, forming a dynamic visual loop that immerses viewers in this quiet yet profound gaze",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
