        {
          "id": "krea2-7de56793967dca72dcd4cf5c",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙公园站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on the tree-lined path of the autumn park, wearing a deep blue long-sleeved knitted dress with a laced hem featuring geometric patterns, presenting an elegant yet slightly vintage style. Her hands are gently folded in front of her, her right hand lightly grasping the sleeve of her left arm, her posture natural and relaxed, as if enjoying a peaceful afternoon. Her figure stands out clearly in the foreground, with the composition centered on the figure and a medium perspective. Placing the figures on the right side of the frame creates visual balance and a sense of dynamism. The background is a brilliant golden ginkgo forest, with leaves shining warmly and richly in the sunlight, layered to create a soft bokeh effect. In the blurred background, several pedestrians can be faintly seen slowly passing by, their silhouettes blurred, adding a sense of life and spatial depth to the scene. The entire scene is bathed in soft warm sunlight, with light streaming through the canopy forming mottled shadows, casting delicate light dots on the ground and the figures. It creates a warm, tranquil, and poetic atmosphere. The composition uses a shallow depth of field effect to clearly separate the subject from the background, enhancing the visual focus. At the same time, through color contrast, the deep blue clothing and the golden background form a strong and harmonious complementary relationship, enhancing the artistic expression of the image. The overall light and shadow are soft and even, without harsh shadows, presenting a natural, realistic, and textured shooting effect, as if taking high-resolution photos with a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens on a clear autumn day. It has a strong film texture and cinematic visual layering, with rich details. From the texture of clothing to the veins of leaves, everything is clearly visible. The overall atmosphere is both warm and romantic, filled with the unexpectedly beautiful moments of daily life, giving a sense of immersion, like a precious image recording the gentle memories of autumn.",
