        {
          "id": "krea2-054ad6cd7d5ff1c80d5d7205",
          "alias": "单女橙毛衣烟火冷淡站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at the edge of a city rooftop under the night sky, wearing a loose orange-red chunky knit sweater. The ribbed hem at the neckline and cuffs fits perfectly, giving the overall look a relaxed yet comfortable vibe. She leans slightly to the side, her head lightly raised, adding a sense of movement and authenticity. Her right arm is raised high, palm open as if touching the sky, while her left arm is stretched to one side. Her body posture is relaxed and expressive, forming a dynamic arc full of vitality. The background is a deep night sky, dotted with blooming white fireworks. The trails of the fireworks streak across the sky like silver meteors, leaving long streaks of light. Some fireworks have already faded, leaving only faint smoke drifting in the air. In the distance, city lights are hazy, and the silhouettes of skyscrapers appear faintly in the night. The lights intertwine in warm yellow and cool white, creating an atmosphere where bustling and tranquil city nights coexist. In the foreground is the rough edge of a concrete platform, with fine cracks and mottled marks, a grayish-white color that feels authentic. In stark contrast to the warm sweater of the figure, the composition uses a low-angle downward angle, placing the figure slightly lower in the center of the frame to highlight their central position. At the same time, the sense of space between the sky and fireworks is elongated, extending along the outstretched arm to the highest point where the fireworks bloom, forming a smooth S-shaped visual flow. In terms of light and shadow, the main light source comes from the explosive glow of the fireworks, which is brief yet intense, producing soft contour light that sharpens the character's outline and creates a subtle transition of light and shadow on the sweater. City lights serve as auxiliary light sources, providing ambient light in the background and enhancing spatial layers. The overall atmosphere blends holiday celebration, youthful freedom, and urban tranquility. It combines the refinement of artistic photography with the casualness and realism of everyday smartphone shooting. The tones are mainly deep blue, orange-red, and white, with strong contrasts of warm and cool tones. The image texture is delicate, with a slight graininess and film filter effect, as if capturing a fleeting beautiful moment, with strong narrative and emotional resonance. Like a precious fragment of life captured with an amateur camera, full of story and warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
