        {
          "id": "krea2-2e1c8ea3c8eda1a4ec8e1aad",
          "alias": "单女白短裤舞台冷淡站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman stands with a sideways glance back under the dim stage lights, presenting a smooth dynamic trajectory. Under cool-toned lighting, she appears crystal clear, painted with pale pink lipstick, and her overall expression conveys confidence and vitality. She wears a green backless top with wide sleeves with slight pleats, made of soft material that fits her figure. Her back is largely exposed, showing off a graceful spine and shoulder blade lines. On the right arm of the top, white lettering or graphic details are faintly visible. The lower body is paired with high-waisted white shorts. The fabric is crisp and well-shaped, with clear pant lines. The back pocket design is simple, accentuating the hip curve. On the feet, he wears classic white canvas shoes with clean and tidy uppers, laces tied into a standard bow, and black stripes on the sole edge. The figure's posture is full of movement: one leg bent and raised, knee slightly bent, the sole of the foot firmly on the ground, and the other leg supporting the body, creating a natural center of gravity tilt. The body leans slightly forward, and the head is twisted backward. This creates a strong visual appeal. The foreground focuses on the entire figure, fully visible from the ankles to the top of the head. The middle ground features a dark background behind the figure, possibly a stage curtain or wall. The surface is smooth and has no obvious texture, with some blurry outlines of equipment such as speakers or lighting racks, but not clear. The background is composed of strong color contrasts. In the upper left is a bright blue spotlight, radiating and spreading light to create soft halos and starbursts, surrounded by scattered purple and deep red light and shadow spots. It creates a typical nightclub or performance scene atmosphere, with a center-shifted layout. The figure is positioned on the right side of the frame, with an overall proportion close to vertical portrait photography, emphasizing body lines and clothing details. The movement then extends downward along the body curve to leg movements and shoes, forming a complete circular visual path. The use of light and shadow is highly dramatic, with the main light source coming from a blue spotlight in the upper left, creating strong side backlighting. At the same time, there is a clear transition of light and shadow on the back of the body and in shadowed areas, creating a sense of three-dimensionality and layering. The ambient light is relatively weak, but auxiliary light with purple tones penetrates the image, enhancing the overall warm and cool contrast. The atmosphere is strong, combining modern urban fashion with the dynamic tension of stage performance. The overall color palette mainly features blue, purple, green, and white, dominated by cool tones. The image texture is delicate, featuring professional studio-level lighting control and color reproduction, while retaining a certain realism typical of everyday amateur shooting. It feels like capturing a moment with a high-resolution camera in low-light conditions. The image quality is sharp yet soft, with rich details. Overall, it presents a visual style that combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
