        {
          "id": "krea2-3813e0017ec581bbd11ea521",
          "alias": "单女白T恤城市沉思倚靠喝",
          "prompt": "She wears a white short-sleeved T-shirt paired with blue denim overalls, with neatly draped straps over her shoulders. The overall look is casual yet refined. She holds a transparent plastic cup of iced beverage with the McDonald's logo and the word \"McCafé\" printed on the glass. The drink is light brown with an orange-red liquid at the bottom, possibly caramel or jam. She is sipping lightly with a white straw. With a slight reflective effect, it appears gentle and focused. The fingers are long, and the nails are painted in light pink with fine glitter decorations. The background is a gray concrete wall, with several vertical warm yellow LED light strips emitting soft light. The wall is also painted with abstract patterns formed by white lines, resembling the outline of McDonald's fries. On the left, a black tablet can be faintly seen on a wooden tabletop. The tabletop is made of light natural wood with clear and natural grain, and the entire scene is set indoors. The spatial layout is compact, with the composition centered on the figure, using close-up shots. The figure occupies most of the composition, with the head slightly tilted to the right and the body slightly leaning forward, forming a natural visual guide line that creates a friendly, everyday, and slightly artistic atmosphere. The light comes from the left front, simulating the combination of natural light and indoor lighting. The overall color tone is warm and soft, mainly off-white, light brown, and blue-gray. The transitions between light and shadow are delicate, shadows are subtle but clear, and the background blur is moderately applied to make the subject stand out. The image has a slight grainy film texture, moderate color saturation, neither exaggerated nor dim, presenting a casual shooting style reminiscent of real life, as if captured by a high-resolution phone or portable camera in the afternoon sunlight. The composition is balanced and layered, with hands and drinks in the foreground and walls and lamps in the background. The three elements create a clear sense of spatial depth, creating an overall quiet and comfortable atmosphere, full of youthful energy and the leisurely vibe of urban life. Suitable for expressing women's everyday aesthetics or for brand collaboration promotional scenarios",
