        {
          "id": "krea2-bb2aa5426e3139fa79f985e2",
          "alias": "单女黑西装街道忧伤坐持手机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a city street at night, slightly turned to the side, holding a black smartphone in her right hand. White wired earphones hang, connected to the phone. She wears a loose black suit jacket with a white camisole underneath, exposing one shoulder. Her posture is casual yet elegant, her expression calm and profound. The background is a blurry city nightscape, with distant neon lights forming soft circular light spots that display warm yellow and white tones. The street lights of vehicles blur to form flowing light bands. It creates a hazy urban nighttime atmosphere. The overall shot uses a low angle, with the person positioned slightly to the right of the frame, body slightly tilted, forming a natural S-shaped curve. The composition uses blurred light and shadow in the foreground and bokeh effects in the background to create a strong sense of depth and spatial layering. The light mainly comes from the right streetlights and distant car headlights, creating soft side backlighting that produces bright contour light and enhances the sense of three-dimensionality. The warm-toned lighting in the background contrasts with the cool-toned clothing of the foreground characters, highlighting the main subject. On the left side of the image, there is a green halo, possibly from a traffic light or reflective object, adding a cool touch to the overall warm tone. The overall atmosphere is quiet, lonely, and full of urban modernity, like a weary city dweller seeking a moment of peace amid the noise. The image has the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment, with slight graininess and motion blur, simulating real camera imaging effects. The lens is a large-aperture prime lens, f/1.8 aperture, 85mm focal length, and shutter speed 1/. 60 seconds, ISO 800. The slight shake from handheld shooting gives the image a more lifelike feel. The color saturation is moderate, not overly vibrant, preserving realistic light and shadow transitions. Highlights slightly overflow, dark areas are rich, and the overall film style is cinematic, similar to the color performance of Kodak 5207 film. The composition follows the rule of thirds, with visual guiding lines formed by background light strips and the characters' postures, creating a strong emotional resonance. The entire scene is full of storytelling. As if telling a moment about urban loneliness, self-reflection, and inner world, the images capture those unintentionally tender moments in modern life, combining fashion with genuine warmth",
