        {
          "id": "krea2-110047bf40e18c81fcac2911",
          "alias": "单女粉毛衣广场冷淡坐注视",
          "prompt": "Her phone case is printed with a cute cartoon pattern. She holds her phone in her right hand and gently rests her left hand at her side. She wears a simple silver bracelet on her wrist and a pink quilted knit cardigan with a white square-collar cropped top underneath. She pairs it with a black high-waisted short skirt, crosses her legs and wears black stockings. Her feet are relaxed, presenting a relaxed yet elegant sitting posture. Her posture leans slightly forward, her body slightly tilted to the right. It showcases natural body curves and a sense of movement. In the foreground, on the left side is a brightly colored striped insulated box. The box mainly features warm tones such as orange, pink, and yellow, with deep pink edges. The lid is half-open, revealing items inside. Next to the incubator is a packet of snacks in blue packaging, with yellow patterns and text. Next to it is a black portable Marshall speaker with brand logos and detailed textures on the speaker surface. The overall design is vintage and modern, with a tranquil riverside landscape in the background. The river water is crystal clear, flowing slowly. The riverbank is made of light sand, with sparse yellow weeds and a few clumps of green plants growing along the bank. In the distance, rolling hillsides have brownish-yellow vegetation, with bare branches showing the characteristics of early spring or early winter. Scattered low buildings and metal railings are scattered along the slopes. The sky is clear, the light bright and soft. Sunlight streams down from the upper right, creating natural transitions of light and shadow on the figures. The shadows are clear but not harsh, with subtle shadow changes in the folds of clothing. The overall composition uses a mid-shot perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the center on the right side of the frame, occupying the main visual focus. The picnic supplies in the lower left and the foreground elements provide balance, guiding the gaze toward the center. The river and distant mountains in the background create a distinct sense of spatial depth, creating an open and tranquil atmosphere. The color palette is mainly warm pink, red, and orange, contrasting with the cool-toned river and earth, enhancing visual impact. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and comfortable, full of life and youthful vitality. It carries a slight everyday shooting feel, as if captured with a regular camera or phone, capturing real moments. The lighting is natural, details rich, the composition full but not crowded, and the colors harmonious and unified, presenting a documentary style that is both realistic and slightly artistic, emphasizing the fusion of natural environment with the person's state and highlighting the tranquility and beauty of outdoor leisure moments",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
