        {
          "id": "krea2-ee5b37ce23755851240f90a9",
          "alias": "单女白礼服婚礼困倦过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a white lace wedding dress, wearing a garland made of orange and white flowers. Her hands are gently clasped together in front of her chest, as if praying or indulging in a beautiful moment, naturally scattered over her shoulders. The background is blurred green plants and blooming white and yellow flowers, forming a hazy and dreamy garden scene. In the foreground, several blurred green leaves and petals create a sense of depth and layering. The composition uses close-ups. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, with the gaze directed to the upper left, creating a visual guide. Light comes from the upper left, presenting a warm golden tone. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating a mottled light and shadow effect, producing distinct backlit outlines and soft-focus halos. The overall atmosphere is romantic and poetic, full of hope and gentle emotions. The main tones are white, pale yellow, and light green, with soft and unified colors, rich details yet not cluttered, possessing a strong artistic sense and cinematic texture, as if it were a carefully composed wedding photography masterpiece. At the same time, it carries the realism of everyday amateur equipment. The camera captures the breathing of nature and fleeting emotions, authentic and moving. The flowers and leaves in the background appear as circular light spots under shallow depth, enhancing the dreamlike feel. The overall image presents a tranquil, pure, and beautiful artistic conception, as if time has frozen in this moment, recording the most precious moments of happiness",
