        {
          "id": "krea2-60bd753bd9e4b477edd8c8fb",
          "alias": "单女棕外套街道沉思站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at a city street corner, looking gentle and natural. She wears a loose dark brown coat paired with a light blue shirt underneath. The neckline is slightly open, revealing her delicate collarbones and a simple silver necklace. The overall look is elegant and layered, her posture natural and relaxed, with a subtle contemplation and composure in her expression. The background is a typical urban street scene, with a white electric scooter parked on the left side adorned with simple decorations and signage. Next to it is a white flowerpot filled with lush greenery, adding a touch of vitality to the cold and harsh urban environment. In the distance stands an old residential building, its exterior walls weathered, iron railings and clothes hanging on the balcony. The windows let in faint light, showing the breath of life. On the right is a sturdy tree trunk, with clearly visible bark grain and lush branches and leaves. Some leaves are illuminated by sunlight, creating a soft effect of light and shadow. The ground is paved with gray bricks, and the edges of the road are marked with yellow traffic markings. The entire scene is set at dusk. The sun approaches the horizon, emitting a warm orange-yellow glow. Light slants down from the upper left of the image, creating a strong contrast of light and dark. This side backlight not only outlines the figures' outlines, but also creates deep silhouettes of buildings and trees in the background, enhancing the sense of space and depth in the composition. The composition uses the main figure positioned slightly to the right of the center, following the golden ratio principle. The background elements are reasonably distributed, enriching the content without overshadowing the main focus, making the foreground figures clear and sharp. The electric bike and flowerpot in the middle of the frame are slightly blurred, while the buildings and trees in the background are further blurred, creating a natural transition in depth of field. Through the extension of light and shadow and the flow of lines, attention is drawn deep into the background. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and warm, rich in life and cinematic texture, as if capturing an ordinary yet poetic moment. The colors are mainly warm tones, with golden sunlight contrasting sharply with dark clothing, creating a warm yet slightly nostalgic mood. The details in the composition are rich. From the makeup of the figures to the folds of the clothing, to the textures and changes in light and shadow in the background, everything is handled with delicacy and realism, presenting an artistic beauty that unintentionally reveals in daily life. It's like a frame casually taken on the streets at dusk with an old film camera, preserving natural graininess and slight exposure deviation, adding a touch of authenticity and warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
