        {
          "id": "krea2-4c0dc56ae53e49523159505a",
          "alias": "单女黑西装酒吧微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a warm café, wearing a tailored black blazer paired with a white shirt, looking sharp and elegant. She leans relaxed against the wooden bar, her right hand gently holding a pale yellow drink from a transparent glass, with a small decorative straw inserted in the cup. On her finger is a simple silver ring and a pearl bracelet, with a pair of delicate gold earrings hanging, accompanied by a subtle smile. Her overall aura is gentle and approachable. And the gently swaying drink in her hand. The surface of the bar counter shows a natural wood grain texture, with slightly rough edges, adding a touch of rustic charm. On the counter sits a woven basket with a bundle of beige paper straws neatly inserted. Next to it are several transparent glass jars filled with small items like sugar packets and stirring sticks. In the background is a black professional coffee machine, above which is a transparent grinder container filled with dark brown coffee beans. The grains are plump, and some light passes through the container, creating a faint reflection. Next to the coffee machine is a vintage-style black speaker with gold brand lettering on the surface. On the wall hang several hand-painted small paintings related to coffee culture. Below is a white sheet of paper printed with neatly arranged patterns. On the left side is a sturdy wooden pillar with clear grain and a weathered surface marked by time. Behind it is a potted green plant with slender leaves, adding a touch of vitality to the scene. The entire scene is bathed in warm yellow lighting. The light comes from hidden light strips or chandeliers on the ceiling, gently casting light on the people and objects to create a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The composition combines close-ups with environmental details. The figures are positioned slightly on the left side of the frame, with their gaze slightly shifting to the right, creating a subtle visual guidance. The bar extends diagonally from the lower right corner to the center, forming a strong diagonal that enhances the sense of depth in the space. Elements like the coffee machine and speakers in the background are arranged vertically, enriching the image's layers. The background is slightly blurred, but key details remain discernible. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, brown, and black, accented with white and green. The colors are harmonious and unified, full of life and artistic flair, as if shot with an old-fashioned film camera, with slight graininess and the unique color tendencies of film. The lens focal length is about 50mm, and the aperture f/1.8 creates a shallow depth of field effect, presenting an image that captures the documentary beauty of everyday life, combining the texture of professional photography with the authentic warmth of natural authenticity, like capturing a quiet and beautiful moment on an ordinary afternoon",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
