        {
          "id": "krea2-e8964fba28903274e3b7973a",
          "alias": "单女灰外套街道忧伤站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by a quiet street, wearing a loose light gray long hooded coat. The fabric is soft and puffy, presenting a delicate woolen texture. The cuffs feature natural rolled edges, giving off a relaxed yet warm vibe that adds a touch of casualness and authenticity. She casually drapes a colorful plaid scarf around her neck. Her expression is natural and unpretentious. As if just captured from a moment of everyday life, she slightly turns her body, one hand naturally hanging down, the other gently holding the sleeve of her coat, her posture relaxed and genuine. The foreground occupies the main position of the frame, located slightly to the center on the left side, creating a dynamic balance in the composition. The background is a tall wooden fence made of vertically arranged wooden planks. The surface of the boards is slightly worn, bearing the marks of time, and the color is reddish-brown. Sunlight filters through the leaves onto the fence, creating mottled light and shadows that sway with the tree shadows. Fine shadow lines cast onto the wooden boards enhance the sense of space and layering in the composition. Behind the fence, some greenery and building silhouettes can be faintly seen. In the distance, faint tree branches and leaves and some building walls appear in the distance. The color tone is cool, contrasting with the warm light in the foreground. Below the frame is a neatly paved asphalt pavement, with low green shrubs growing along the roadside. The leaves are dense and naturally formed. The overall composition uses a medium perspective, with the figures occupying the main subject, but ample background space is left to create an ambient atmosphere. The composition is close to the golden ratio, with the figure's head slightly above the center line. The vertical lines of the fence enhance the sense of depth and structure. Light comes from the upper right, the afternoon sunlight slanting. The warm golden beam pierces through the gaps in the leaves, creating soft highlights and subtle transitions of light and shadow on the coat's surface. The edges of light and shadow are clear but not harsh, while the shadowed areas in the background display a cool blue-purple hue, creating a sharp contrast with the warm light and creating a cool atmosphere of winter or early spring. The overall light and shadow atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, preserving the authenticity of daily life while possessing the delicate texture of artistic photography. The main color palettes are warm brown, gray-white, and blue-green, harmoniously unified with warmth and layers. The details are rich and texture prominent, presenting a tranquil, gentle, and slightly artistic everyday scene, resembling a film-style photo taken with a professional camera, with strong narrative and emotional resonance. The overall image presents a documentary beauty of a \"chance encounter.\" Like a moment of real life captured by a photographer on the street, the image texture is delicate, rich in detail, with moderate color saturation and no signs of over-processing, maintaining a natural visual impression. It presents an artistic style reminiscent of amateur equipment shooting, with strong Japanese photographic aesthetics. There are no unnecessary decorations or distractions in the frame; all elements serve the theme and atmosphere creation. The composition is simple yet expressive, with visual guidance flowing naturally and smoothly. Ultimately returning to the overall tranquil atmosphere, the entire scene exudes a quiet, restrained, gentle, and slightly lonely everyday poetic atmosphere.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
