          "id": "krea2-c5257348c8e7fa6601379350",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙街道专注坐吃",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at an orange round table in front of a street food stall. She wears an off-white lace long dress, with delicate cutout patterns that glimmer faintly under soft light. The hem naturally falls to the floor, and her black high heels reveal her ankles. The overall look is elegant and contrasts sharply with the surroundings. She is holding food with chopsticks and putting it into her mouth, her expression focused yet slightly lazy, revealing her enjoyment of the food. Her left hand rests naturally on the table, fingers long, and her nails painted a light pink nail polish. On the table sits a transparent glass cup holding dark drinks. Next to it is a pink insulated container with several straws stuck in the mouth of the bottle, and a small glass jar holding red sauce. On the other side are a white lunch box and a stack of tissues. The edges of the orange tabletop show slight wear marks, showing the texture of everyday use. Under the table is a metal frame structure with clean and practical lines. Three pink plastic stools are casually placed by the tableside, one slightly tilted with fine scratches and signs of use. The floor is paved with gray cement bricks. There are some dust and stains in the gaps, giving a realistic and everyday feel. In the background is a typical Hong Kong-style cha chaan teng or snack stall. Above hangs a sign filled with traditional Chinese characters, with white characters on a red background and white characters. The words include \"salad bread,\" \"sandwich,\" \"scallion egg,\" \"hot rice milk,\" \"peanut soup,\" and more. The font sizes vary densely, full of a street vibe. Below the sign is a semi-open kitchen workspace, with a stainless steel countertop reflecting faint light. A person wearing a blue mask, A staff member wearing a white apron was busy with their back to the camera, their figures blurred but their movements clear. On the workbench were some containers and tools, with a handwritten price list posted next to it with words like \"Takeout Black Tea\" and \"Fried Chicken Cutlet.\" On the left was a refrigerated display cabinet, with glass doors displaying various packaged foods and bottled beverages. The cabinet's surface had some moisture and reflection, and the interior lighting was dim yellow, illuminating some products. The wall behind was covered with blue-green tiles, with some peeling and stains, adding a sense of the passage of time. The entire scene uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center. The dining table occupies the main foreground area, with distinct background layers. From nearby tables and chairs to the stalls in the middle and then to the distant workspace, the sense of depth is strong. The visual guide extends from the edge of the table backward, pointing toward the kitchen and staff, creating a natural flow of sight. Light enters diagonally from the right, like afternoon sunlight streaming through the street, creating a soft side light, while the other side is in shadow, creating a clear contrast between light and dark. At the same time, the desk and floor cast long shadows, enhancing the spatial sense of three-dimensionality. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and slightly nostalgic, with mainly orange, pink, off-white, and gray-blue tones. The color saturation is moderate, with a slight film graininess and retro filter effects, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera. The images are rich in detail, combining the everyday life of urban life with an artistic tranquil beauty, creating a surreal yet authentic everyday moment that lets people feel the poetry and warmth of ordinary life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
