        {
          "id": "krea2-88ac11fe6b620b60ce774e7b",
          "alias": "单女透视黑毛衣酒店媚态倚靠手持物",
          "prompt": "She wears a pair of black thin-rimmed glasses, her makeup exquisite, exuding an elegant and sexy aura. Her right hand gently tugs at the collar of her black knit cardigan, revealing the blue lace underneath. The lace edges are delicate and delicate, giving a semi-transparent texture that contrasts sharply with the black jacket. Her left hand lightly grips a slender black whip, her fingers long, nails painted bright red nail polish. Adding a touch of brightness, she wore a black high-waisted short dress paired with sheer stockings. Her legs were smooth and graceful, and she wore a slender gold necklace around her neck. The pendant was small and exquisite, and she wore sparkling earrings. The overall look blended intellect, sensuality, and mystery. The background was a deep blue wall with subtle textures, and light streaming from the upper left created soft shadows, creating a warm and intimate atmosphere. In the front was an orange-red leather seat with curved backrests and armrests, smooth and glossy. The middle shot depicts the woman's posture and clothing details. The composition uses close-ups, with the main figure occupying the main position and the angle slightly tilted. Through contrast of light and shadow, the delicate texture of the skin and the material details of the clothing are emphasized. The lighting and shadow atmosphere leans toward warm tones, but the overall environment is cold, creating a contrast of warm and cool that enhances the dramatic tension and artistic appeal of the image. The entire scene looks as if shot in a high-end hotel room or private club, using professional photography lighting to simulate natural shadow transitions and highlight reflections. It presents an effect similar to high-quality commercial portrait photography, while retaining the texture of everyday amateur equipment shooting, such as slight noise and soft depth blur, making the images more realistic and lifelike",
