        {
          "id": "krea2-329fcc721b17eceabbb6d05d",
          "alias": "单女棕毛衣摄影棚严肃躺展示",
          "prompt": "A woman lies on her side in a relaxed posture against a pure white background, her body slightly curled up, head resting on her arm. She wears a dark brown ribbed knit sweater, with a colorful plaid scarf revealing a corner of the collar and shoulders. She pairs beige shorts and gray long socks, and black leather shoes. The composition is taken at a low angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the lower right of the frame, creating a visually asymmetrical balance. Leaving plenty of blank space creates a minimalist modern feel. The foreground features the subject and the camera in their hands, with clear details, including the metallic texture of the camera surface and reflections at the lens edges. The middle ground features the contours of the body and the folds of clothing, showcasing soft materials and natural transitions of light and shadow. The background is pure white with no distractions, highlighting the subject's solitude and focus. Light from the upper left gently and evenly casts shadows on the figure, creating subtle shadows and enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is quiet. Introspective and full of artistic flair, featuring the minimalist aesthetics unique to Japanese photography. The color palette mainly features warm brown, off-white, and gray-black, with harmonious unity to present poetic moments of everyday life. It feels like real life fragments captured with professional equipment in an empty studio. The images have a slight graininess and film texture, simulating the image quality of vintage cameras, enhancing nostalgia and realism while retaining the clarity and delicate layers of digital photography. The entire image conveys a sense of tranquility, Contemplation and a passion for visual creation are like a gentle monologue about self-expression",
