        {
          "id": "krea2-a94e3f9a001c0278d59965db",
          "alias": "单女棕外套庭院忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the courtyard of an ancient building under the warm winter sun. She wears a dark brown wool coat with a slightly open neckline, revealing a white turtleneck sweater underneath. Around her neck is an off-white knitted scarf, with delicate tassels and hollowed-out patterns along the edges, naturally draped over her chest, gently fluttering in the wind. Her expression is calm yet slightly melancholic. Her hands are in her coat pockets, her posture relaxed yet somewhat detached. Her body is slightly turned to the left side of the frame, her head facing the camera, creating a visual tension that is both intimate and distant. In the foreground, the figure occupies the center of the painting slightly to the left, with a close-up composition. The background features the dark wooden doors and stone steps of traditional Chinese architecture, decorated with intricate geometric patterns. The edges of the door frames bear traces of time. On the right, a sturdy old tree trunk extends diagonally from the upper right corner of the painting. The bark texture is rough, branches interwoven, and leaves are sparse, casting mottled shadows in the sunlight. The ground is a path paved with blue-gray stone slabs, with some areas illuminated by sunlight showing a warm yellow tone, while the rest remain in shadow. This creates a contrast between light and dark. The overall light comes from the upper right, representing the warm afternoon sun. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating a sense of depth and layering. The main color palettes are warm brown, off-white, and dark brown, complemented by cool gray and dark green backgrounds. The color combinations are harmonious and warm, with natural light and shadow transitions, creating a quiet and slightly nostalgic atmosphere, as if capturing a tranquil moment. The entire scene looks like it was shot with an old-fashioned film camera, with slight graininess and slight overexposure. The blurred outside focus rendering of the lens blurs the background. It highlights the main subject, with balanced composition, blending characters and environment into one, combining the atmosphere of life with artistic beauty. The overall style resembles the nostalgic tones of the film \"In the Mood for Love,\" full of storytelling and emotional tension. The visuals are delicate and detailed, with clear visibility from clothing textures to light and shadow changes, conveying a sense of contemplation and tenderness during solitary winter afternoons, with strong narrative and emotional appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
