        {
          "id": "krea2-9af710923fa1e75cc92952fd",
          "alias": "单女白T恤卧室躺侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman lies on her side on soft white bedding, slightly tilting her head up, presenting a quiet and relaxed state. She wears a loose white T-shirt, her arms naturally bent, her hands gently resting on the bedding in front of her. Her fingers are long, her posture natural and comfortable. Her whole body is wrapped in a pure white quilt, which is rich in pleats, soft and fluffy. Light and shadow create interplay of light and shadow patterns on the fabric, creating a warm and authentic feel. In the foreground, the nearby white quilt and her arms occupy the lower half of the scene. This forms a visual guiding line. The middle ground is her head, shoulders, and upper body, positioned slightly to the right center of the frame. The background is a blurred headboard, with faint dark headboards or walls visible, contrasting with the bright white bedding, highlighting the subject's clarity and layering. Light comes from the upper left of the painting, like soft morning sunlight streaming through the curtains, with golden beams piercing through the air. At the same time, a natural shadow transition is formed on the right side, with clear lighting and direction, enhancing three-dimensionality and spatial depth. The overall color scheme is mainly warm white, mixed with golden tones from sunlight. The atmosphere is peaceful and serene, full of the gentle warmth of everyday life, as if capturing a lazy morning. The subjects' expressions are natural and natural, without any deliberate posing, resembling a quiet moment in real life. The image has the texture of film photography, with slight graininess and low color saturation, simulating the effect of vintage camera shooting. The edges have slight vignetting, enhancing the retro nostalgia atmosphere. The composition is asymmetrical but balanced, with the main subject slightly to the right, leaving ample negative space on the left side, giving the image a breathable sense and guiding viewers to feel her inner calm and peace. The overall style combines artistry with everyday life, combining the documentary feel of photography with aesthetic refinement and delicacy. Like casually capturing precious moments in the morning bedroom with an old film camera, light and color together create a warm, private, and poetic visual experience",
