        {
          "id": "krea2-c56169043ca0bbc3311e1398",
          "alias": "单女困倦躺",
          "prompt": "A woman lies sideways on a clearing covered with golden fallen leaves. The low-angle angle makes viewers feel as if they are right beside her, experiencing this tranquility up close. In the foreground are layers of withered yellow leaves, each with different shapes, some fully stretched out. Some edges are broken, showing varying shades of brownish-yellow and orange. Some leaves still retain tiny droplets of water or dew, shimmering in the sunlight. Scattered grass stems and dead branches on the ground add realism and depth to the scene. In the middle is the outline of a woman's body, slightly tilted back, with soft and smooth neck lines. The shoulders are outlined by warm light, leaving delicate shadows. The texture of the clothing is clearly visible, and the knitted yarn details appear especially gentle under the light. The background is a dense ginkgo grove. The trunk is straight and upright, dark brown. Under the autumn sun, the leaves glow bright and rich golden yellow, forming a hazy and dreamy golden halo. The sky is faintly visible through the gaps in the leaves, appearing pale blue. A few wisps of white clouds drift like ribbons, and the background is perfectly blurred, creating a strong depth of field effect. The composition uses a golden ratio point slightly to the center, with the figure positioned in the lower middle part of the composition, heads facing upper-left, forming a natural visual flow, while fallen leaves in the foreground serve as a framing element, enhancing the spatial depth of the painting. In terms of light and shadow, sunlight shines diagonally from the upper right of the image, creating soft backlight and side lighting effects, enveloping its silhouette in a warm halo. The transition of light and shadow is natural, with a moderate contrast between light and shadow, highlighting the main subject while preserving details. The overall atmosphere is warm and healing, full of autumn's unique poetry and romance. The color palette is dominated by warm yellow, complemented by brown, off-white, and light blue, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme that evokes a sense of tranquility and tranquility, as if time has frozen in this moment. The image texture is delicate, with slight film graininess and natural lens distortion, simulating the realism of everyday amateur camera shooting, like a chance autumn moment captured, full of life and emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
