        {
          "id": "krea2-59d90b132488a1c49612ae46",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫摄影棚站立叉腰",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by a bright window indoors, wearing a soft, fluffy white turtleneck sweater and dark blue skinny jeans. She leans slightly to the side, leans forward, and gently rests her hands on her hips. Her posture is relaxed and natural, looking directly into the camera, exuding a friendly and easygoing aura, adding a touch of life and authenticity. The overall look is simple and comfortable, presenting a casual style for everyday home. The main focus is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, with the figure occupying most of the space. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot. This makes the figure appear more upright and elegant. The background is a simple white wall and a large window. Soft natural light streams in from the right side, creating a contrast of light and shadow on the figure and creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The window frame lines are clear and form a geometric structure with the wall. On the left side, a corner of the wooden headboard is faintly visible, adding a touch of life to the scene. The overall color palette is mainly white and light wood, paired with dark blue jeans. The color contrast is vivid yet harmonious, with delicate light and shadow effects. Sunlight creates soft highlights on the character's sweater, casting gentle shadows on the floor and walls, enhancing the sense of depth in the space. It follows the curves of the body to hand movements, and finally lands on the background window and bedside details, creating a natural and smooth flow of sight. The overall atmosphere is warm, healing, and full of life, as if capturing a tranquil moment when afternoon sunlight fills the room. The image quality is close to professional studio shooting, but retains natural, realistic light and shadow changes and a slight graininess. Like shooting with a medium format camera or high-end DSLR in natural light, it presents an imaging style that is both artistic and retains everyday warmth",
          "description": "",
