        {
          "id": "krea2-cb3090b6bef79ab6f58ac4e3",
          "alias": "单女灰外套窗边忧伤倚靠出神",
          "prompt": "A woman leans sideways against an old wooden window frame, her head slightly lowered, her expression calm and slightly melancholic, as if lost in thought or reminiscing about something. She wears a light gray woolen coat with a white shirt underneath with a slightly exposed collar. The texture and wrinkles of the fabric are clearly visible under the light. Her reflection is on the glass window covered in water stains and scratches, blurred and hazy, creating a visual effect of intertwining reality and illusion with her real-life self. The glass surface shows obvious water droplets and stains. Some areas still bear faded blue graffiti marks, which enhance the realism of the scene and the traces of time. The composition uses close-ups to highlight the emotional expression of the characters. The middle ground features glass windows with cracks and water stains, along with rough window frames. The background is a blurred outdoor scene, with faint outlines of distant buildings and gloomy skies. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, brown, and gray-black, creating a nostalgic and cozy atmosphere. Light streams in from outside, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. At the same time, soft reflections and scattering are created on the glass, with rich layers of light and shadow that enhance the image's sense of depth and emotional tension. The composition uses window frames as natural borders, guiding the gaze to focus on the figure and her reflection, creating a sense of closed yet open space. The entire composition is filled with poetic tranquility and solitude, as if frozen in a quiet dusk moment, capturing an ordinary yet moving moment, presenting a grainy texture reminiscent of film photography and slight color shifts. Simulating the effects of everyday amateur camera shooting, the lens is slightly tilted to bring a sense of everyday realism. Natural vignetting at the edges of the frame enhances the focus of the central subject. The overall atmosphere is both gentle and slightly melancholic, like an old photo taken by chance, capturing a quiet moment in youth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
