        {
          "id": "krea2-2b6ce2f1e29cae2f096999de",
          "alias": "单女橙毛衣街道困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a brick sidewalk on a city street, wearing a loose orange-red chunky knit sweater whose texture is clearly visible, presenting a warm and rustic feel. She pairs a deep blue A-line skirt on the bottom, the hem naturally draping down, creating a striking color contrast with the sweater. On her feet, she wears gray mid-calf socks and a pair of black platform loafers. She leans slightly forward, The right hand grips the metal mesh fence, the left hand stretches out naturally, the right leg raised, and the toes lightly tap the fence. The posture is elegant and full of movement, as if capturing a fleeting balance and tension, revealing a relaxed and carefree attitude toward life. In the foreground is a sidewalk paved with reddish-brown bricks, neatly arranged with fine weeds growing in the gaps. A white curb stone separates the sidewalk from the roadside dirt. The fence is made of fine metal mesh, reflecting soft light, appearing solid and modern. The middle view is an extension of the street, where a dark-colored small car is parked by the roadside, with several orange traffic cones hanging from the tail. In the distance, a blurry pedestrian figure is walking. In the background is a row of low buildings, with facades of light gray and white, neatly arranged windows, utility poles and interlaced wires between the buildings. The sky appears a bright pale blue, with sunlight streaming down from the upper right of the frame, creating a soft backlighting effect. The light passes through the fine dust in the air, creating a hazy and dreamy atmosphere. The overall tone of the painting is warm, mainly orange-red, deep blue, and gray-white. The contrast of light and shadow is strong, and sunlight casts long shadows on the figures, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and spatial depth. The composition uses diagonal lines, with the lines of the figures contrasting with the vertical lines of the fence, guiding the gaze from the lower left corner to the upper right. The visual focus is on the dynamic postures of the figures, while the architectural and street lines in the background also serve as supporting guidance. Overall, the painting presents a poetic beauty of everyday life. It seems to capture an ordinary yet warm moment, with a strong film film texture, fine graininess, moderate color saturation, rich details, natural light and shadow transitions, creating a peaceful, warm, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The entire scene is filled with the breath of life and cultural emotion, making you want to pause and appreciate this beautiful moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
