        {
          "id": "krea2-afc5cd2430d50abc4dbead72",
          "alias": "单女白礼服婚礼忧伤侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a pure white wedding dress wears a light, flowing multi-layered sheer veil. The veil naturally falls from above, creating soft layers of light and shadow. Looking directly into the camera, her expression carries a faint melancholy and contemplation. Under the black-and-white tones, a strong contrast between highlights and shadows is presented. She wears a strapless wedding dress that reveals her slender neck and shoulders. Her right hand wears white lace gloves, her fingers slender, gently holding a blooming white rose. The flower rests above her left shoulder, with full petals, naturally curved, and clearly visible leaves. The overall posture is elegant yet slightly fragile, as if silently telling a quiet story. The background is pure black with no unnecessary elements, highlighting the main figure and creating a strong visual focus. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned in the center of the frame, head slightly tilted, creating direct visual communication with the viewer. Light comes from the front slightly left, soft and focused, creating a delicate transition of light and shadow. The folds of the veil and wedding dress reveal rich texture layers under the light. The shadowed areas deepen the depth and drama of the image. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, solemn, and poetic, with the texture of classical photography. It feels as if an old photo has been revived, conveying an emotional tension that is both sacred and lonely. The image features high-resolution detail, with rich layers of black, white, and gray tones. The transition from bright white to deep black creates a strong visual impact, while retaining delicate midtones to give the image a breathable feel. Like vintage portraits shot with professional film cameras, it carries a strong artistic atmosphere and emotional depth. The image contains no unnecessary decorations or distractions; only figures, veils, flowers, and gloves form the core visual elements. It emphasizes the unity of formal beauty and emotional expression, with a compact but not crowded composition and just the right amount of blank space, enhancing the tranquility and ritual of the image. The light and shadow treatment is exquisite, highlighting the main contour and texture, creating an eternal beauty that transcends time. The overall style blends romanticism with modern minimalist aesthetics. It carries both the sanctity of a wedding and the complex emotions of the individual's inner world, like a frozen moment of an important moment, inviting long-lasting gaze and endless afterthought",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
