        {
          "id": "krea2-89692be8f40a10b159d85688",
          "alias": "单女黑短裙城市冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "Under a black pleated skirt, her long legs were revealed. Her left hand rested gently on her knee, her right hand naturally hanging down, and a dark gray coat beside her. The whole scene presented a serene beauty of daily commuting. In the foreground, a girl sits on a plastic seat with cartoon patterns on a blue background, with metal armrests on the seat edges. In the middle is her full-body posture. The background shows the interior of the train, including the windows, silver metal pillars, warning signs and stickers by the doors. Outside the window, you can see the blurred outlines of city buildings. Sunlight streams in diagonally from the left window, creating a warm and bright overall light, presenting the texture of morning or afternoon sunlight streaming through the glass into the carriage. The composition uses a slightly tilted perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame. The large space on the left side is left to depict the scene outside the window, then down to the posture of the body, creating a balance between dynamic and static elements. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and nostalgic, with a contrast of cool and warm tones. Blue seats and uniforms bring a sense of calm, while sunlight gives the image a warm atmosphere. The overall style is similar to film photography, with slight graininess and low color saturation, presenting a true texture reminiscent of a vintage film camera, as if captured with an old 35mm film camera during a city commute. The details are rich but not chaotic, and the expressions of the figures are natural and authentic, without any signs of deliberate staging, conveying a rare moment of tranquility and self-immersion in urban life. The background blur is well handled, highlighting the main subject while retaining environmental information. The overall composition is full but not crowded, and the color scheme is harmonious and unified, giving a sense of quietness, healing, and storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
