        {
          "id": "krea2-876240e1e9b58d9f2ee540f5",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙室内倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a pure white sleeveless spaghetti strap dress, made of light and soft fabric, with delicate lace texture and tiny sequin accents. Under the light, the dress features a ruffled design layered and a sense of depth. The waist is cinched, outlining a slender waist, making the overall look elegant and romantic. Full of breath, she gently held a string of transparent balloons in her left hand. The balloons floated gently in the air, reflecting soft light on the surface and giving a semi-transparent texture. The string of the balloons was slender, extending from her hand, gently swaying with each movement, creating a light, floating dynamic feel. Her right hand held a small white cake, its surface covered with delicate cream, edged with neat vertical stripes, and a tiny decorative stick stuck at the top, looking like it was prepared to celebrate a special occasion. She wears a simple silver bracelet on her wrist, and a slender necklace around her neck. These accessories appear faintly under the light, enhancing the overall refinement of the look. The background is a pure light beige tone, and the walls are adorned with multiple strings of silver star ornaments. The stars vary in size, connected by fine threads, arranged in an orderly manner throughout the frame. Some stars reflect different light effects depending on the angle—some bright like mirrors, others slightly dim, creating rich light and shadow variations. These stars serve not only as decorative elements, It also serves to guide the viewer's gaze, giving the image a greater sense of space and festive atmosphere. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the characters positioned slightly to the left of the center, their bodies slightly turned and heads facing the camera, creating a strong visual focal point. Balloons and cakes in the foreground form the main visual guiding elements, naturally drawing the viewer's attention to the figures and adding interest and storytelling to the scene. The middle shot centers on the characters, whose postures, expressions, and costume details are clearly visible. The star decorations in the background are in a hazy state, enriching the layers of the image while avoiding overshadowing the main focus. The light and shadow treatment is extremely delicate, with the light source coming from the upper front, a soft, diffused light without harsh shadows, presenting a natural sense of transparency. Sequins and star decorations on clothing create dotted highlights under the light, enhancing the sparkling and dreamlike feel. The overall lighting is warm and soft, with tones mainly of white, off-white, and silver-gray, creating a clean, cozy, and slightly fairy-tale atmosphere. The overall image presents a dynamic beauty within staticism, combining the warmth of everyday life with the refinement and romance of artistic photography. It seems to capture a private and beautiful moment, like shooting indoors with an entry-level full-frame camera, using a standard prime lens paired with softbox fill light, accurate exposure, true color reproduction, good noise control, and a slight film grain texture. The overall style leans toward fresh Japanese photography, carrying a strong sense of youthful nostalgia. It evokes a sense of happiness surrounded by love; the images are rich in detail, layered, and emotionally subtle, profound, evoking resonance and memories of beautiful times in viewers",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
