        {
          "id": "krea2-6f335e14d290f9cfb96812cf",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣商店俏皮蹲侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman squats in front of a supermarket shelf, her expression slightly playful and calm, presenting a soft pink tone. Her overall makeup is exquisite but not exaggerated, preserving a sense of everyday life and authenticity. She wears a light beige tight short-sleeved top made of lightweight and somewhat translucent material, subtly revealing skin texture and body contours. The V-neck design highlights the neck and bust curves, with slight pleats at the cuffs. She pairs it with gray high-waisted knit pants that fit her body perfectly. She shows off her smooth leg lines, wearing a pair of white flat slippers with a clean upper, featuring the brand logo. On her wrist, she wears a multi-layered fine metal bracelet and a white woven wrist strap, adding a touch of everyday life. Her right hand reaches for the yellow packaging bag on the shelf, while her left hand holds a bag of honey butter-flavored chips printed with the Korean words \"허니버터チップ\" (ハ니버터チップ). The bag is also printed with golden chip patterns and sunflower decorations. The background is a typical supermarket snack shelf, with various brands of puffed snacks displayed above. This includes the green-packaged \"Frito Lay\" series chips, the red-packaged \"Leshi\" chips, and other Japanese-Korean-style snack packaging. The shelves are light wood, with price tags showing the weight of \"480g.\" Some labels are marked in Chinese and Korean. The ambient lighting is bright and even, with commercial lighting from the ceiling, making the entire scene clearly visible. The color saturation is moderate, with no overexposure or shadows. The composition uses close-ups, with people positioned slightly to the right center. The pose is in a half-squatting posture, with the body slightly leaning forward and the head slightly tilted, creating a sense of dynamic balance. The prominent potato chip packaging in the foreground and the characters' hand movements enhance interactivity. The middle ground features the main figure and some shelves, while the background is made up of other stacked products in a blurry setting. Using shallow depth of field effects to focus on the figure, it creates a well-defined sense of space. Light and shadow shine from the front above, creating a soft transition of shadows. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and everyday, full of life. It feels as if you've captured a real-life shopping moment. The image quality is close to high-resolution smartphone shooting, with rich detail, good noise control, and true-to-life color reproduction. There's a slight film graininess that enhances visual warmth and realism, presenting a modern urban lifestyle image that combines artistic beauty with a documentary style",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
