        {
          "id": "krea2-69a0db72fcd42369c1da0151",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙沙发冷淡倚靠阅读",
          "prompt": "She wore a white strapless dress with puff sleeves and lace trim at the hem. The overall look was sweet and slightly sexy. In her left hand, she held a slice of chocolate cake, with distinct layers, and the inner layer was bright red strawberry jam and cream. The top was garnished with fresh strawberries and green mint leaves, with a small label reading \"85%.\" In her right hand, she held a small metal spoon, her nails painted with shiny silver nail art and adorned with tiny diamonds. Her fingers were slender and slender. She sat on a light gray fabric sofa, her body slightly leaning to the side, legs crossed, wearing white stockings with smooth leg lines. The background was a home scene full of everyday life. Behind her was a white washing machine, above which sat an old-fashioned camera, beside it was a dark blinds, and on the left was a black shelf displaying several plant-themed decorative paintings and photo frames. One of them features a monstera leaf pattern, while the other is a blurry portrait photo. The entire space is lighted in soft, cool tones, with the main light source coming from the front, creating a natural shadow transition. The background is slightly dim, creating a private, everyday, and slightly ambiguous atmosphere. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure occupying most of the space, head slightly tilted, and the gaze meeting the viewer directly, creating strong visual guidance. The camera's angle is slightly lower than the level view, enhancing the person's affinity and presence. The light and shadow distribution is evenly distributed but with clear contrast, highlighting the main contours and details. The overall style blends the realism of daily life with artistic aesthetic expression, presenting a texture similar to mobile phone photography. It features slight noise and natural color shifts, as if capturing private moments late at night, conveying a lazy, sweet, and slightly mysterious mood. The main color palette is black, white, and gray, accented with the red of the cake and the vitality of green leaves, forming a visual focal point. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of storytelling. Like a scene from a youth movie, it makes one imagine her feelings and the story behind it",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
