        {
          "id": "krea2-56a5c7632cc9ae64bbab511d",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤沙发困倦坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a sofa by the window indoors, wearing a light blue sleeveless tank top with vertical stripes. The neckline and shoulder straps are decorated with delicate white lace trim, and the chest is adorned with three small white heart embroidery. She pairs loose shorts with blue and white plaid patterns, and the same plaid fabric is casually tied around the waist, creating natural pleats and drapes. The overall look presents a lazy yet gentle home-style style. Her hands are gently raised, her posture relaxed and natural, looking directly at the camera. It reveals a subtle hint of shyness and innocence, shimmering with a soft sheen. The background is the indoor environment, with light slanting in from the left window, creating a warm side glow that creates a soft three-dimensional effect. Sunlight streams through the curtains, enhancing the dreamy atmosphere of the scene. The sofa is made of deep blue fabric with subtle fabric textures. The backrest features blue and white checkered patterns, with clear lines and distinct layers. In the distance, you can see a corner of wooden furniture and a light-colored wall. The color palette leans toward warmth, the spatial layout is simple, and the composition centers on the figure, using close-ups with the figure occupying most of the composition. The head is slightly tilted, the body slightly leaned back, and both arms raised above the head, forming a smooth S-shaped curve. The visual guide extends from her arms upward to the top of her head. At the same time, the contrast of light and shadow is used to highlight the main subject's contours and texture. The background blur treatment makes the foreground figure stand out even more. The overall color scheme is mainly blue and white, complemented by warm yellow light, creating a harmonious contrast of cool and warm tones to create a tranquil, The comfortable and cozy afternoon atmosphere and rich details present authentic and artistic everyday moments, as if shot with a professional camera under natural light, capturing a private moment full of life and emotional warmth, with strong visual appeal and emotional appeal",
