        {
          "id": "krea2-8d6e8be7679824e82dc186e7",
          "alias": "单女室内俏皮坐持手机",
          "prompt": "She wears a pink off-shoulder top paired with a black lace spaghetti strap, looking both sweet and distinctive. She holds a ceramic plate decorated with blue and white stripes in both hands, holding a golden tempting omelet rice and a few French fries. The surface is garnished with chopped scallions, giving it a rich and enticing color. On her left ring finger, she wears a simple ring. In the foreground is a warm wooden dining table with clear grain. On the table sits a transparent glass cup filled with ice and dark drinks, with vertical ridges on the cup. Next to it is a smartphone with a lit screen displaying blurry images. Next to the phone is a used tissue and an empty plate, with traces of food left. On the right side is a semi-transparent glass water bottle, clean and simple, with a white lid, On the table, several pairs of metal chopsticks and spoons are scattered, along with a small piece of wrapping paper printed with red text. The middle frame is the surrounding environment. Behind her is a light gray modern-style chair with smooth backrest lines. The background wall is made of warm-toned wood trim, with two brightly colored abstract art paintings hanging on it: one depicts a white dog pattern on a red background surrounded by yellow noodle elements, the other is a portrait of a figure against an orange-yellow gradient background, with a gentle expression. The frame is white, and above hang three warm spherical chandeliers. Soft light illuminates the entire space. In the distance, a curved glass partition is visible, with greenery inside, adding a natural touch. In the corner, a white electric fan and some storage cabinets can be faintly seen. The overall layout is compact and full of life. The composition uses a close-up perspective, with the subject positioned slightly to the right center, leaning slightly forward, creating a strong visual guidance. Using a large aperture lens creates a shallow depth of field effect, the background blur is well handled, highlighting the subject, and the lighting and shadow atmosphere are warm and soft. Using warm yellow indoor lighting as the main light source, it creates a comfortable and relaxed dining atmosphere. Light shines from above and sides, with natural shadow transitions. The food surface reflects a faint sheen, enhancing realism. The overall color tone leans warm, blending pink, yellow, brown, and other warm colors, presenting a relaxed and joyful moment in daily life. It feels like capturing a friendly gathering or a leisurely time enjoying food alone. It carries a strong sense of life and artistic beauty, like a real-life scene casually captured with a regular phone or entry-level camera. It retains slight noise and natural color distortions, making it more realistic and approachable",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
