        {
          "id": "krea2-0605732e805dc03bee53f937",
          "alias": "单女白T恤街道冷淡倚靠过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman squatted by the roadside of a city street, dressed simply and freshly, wearing a white lace camisole underneath and a light blue loose knit cardigan. The cardigan was casually draped over her shoulders, sleeves sliding down to her elbows, revealing slender arms and collarbones. Around her neck was a delicate silver necklace, a small and delicate pendant. She held a bouquet of daisies wrapped in yellow kraft paper, with pure white and delicate flowers, golden centers, and long green stems. She wore pink striped flat slippers with graceful ankle lines. The overall posture is natural and relaxed, with the body slightly leaning forward and knees bent, presenting a friendly yet casual squatting posture. The foreground features blurred green plant leaves, creating a natural depth blur effect. The middle ground features a female subject holding a bouquet of flowers. The background is a somewhat blurred city street, with gray asphalt roads featuring white traffic markings. In the distance, there are blurred architectural outlines and green vegetation. The composition uses a low-angle shot, with the figure positioned on the right side occupying the visual center, while the left side leaves space to highlight the relationship between the subject and the environment. Light comes from the sides, with soft natural light streaming down from the upper left, while subtle shadow transitions appear on the right side of the body, creating a sense of depth and layering. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with tones mainly featuring warm and cool contrasts. Light blue, white, pale yellow, and gray-green intertwine to create a fresh visual effect. The background blur is well handled, guiding the viewer's attention to the subject. The overall image presents a beautiful moment from everyday life, as if captured with a portable camera or phone. It has a strong sense of documentary and everyday life, while still retaining artistic beauty. The color saturation is moderate, details are rich, and textures are clear. The entire composition is full of youthful energy and gentle poetry, conveying a simple and pure sense of happiness and a love for life",
