        {
          "id": "krea2-d27dd1d426cea7d6dc9bd81e",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙摄影棚沉思坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits indoors, wearing a red silk-textured spaghetti strap dress embroidered with a white lotus pattern on the chest. The skirt is wide and flowing, edged with traditional deep red and gold motifs. The overall look blends modern fashion with classical Eastern aesthetics. Looking directly at the camera, she exudes a gentle and confident expression. She gently holds a golden ring in both hands, its surface smooth and reflective, showing a metallic sheen. Her fingers are slender, Wearing a simple silver bracelet and ring, her wrists are gracefully shaped, her legs are together, her posture dignified and elegant. Her body leans slightly forward, and her head is slightly tilted, creating a friendly and slightly playful atmosphere. The background is an indoor scene: on the left is a white carved stair railing, decorated with gold patterns. On the right is a light beige carved wooden door with circular relief decorations. The wall is made of warm brown vertical striped wallpaper with fine textures, and light softly streams in from the upper left of the painting, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. The light source is warm with a yellowish tint, simulating dusk or indoor lighting effects. The shadows are soft and emphasize three-dimensionality. Light and shadow create delicate highlights and shadows in the folds of clothing, enhancing the texture of the silk fabric. In the foreground, a golden ring occupies the lower visual center, guiding the gaze toward the figure. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered, and the left and right elements balanced with clear layers. The middle is the main figure and seat, the front is the ring and part of the skirt, and the background is stairs and doors. The sense of spatial depth is strong, with red as the main color. Paired with gold, white, beige, and warm brown, a harmonious and unified palette system is formed. Red symbolizes passion and celebration, gold adds a sense of luxury, and white and beige bring freshness and tranquility. The overall atmosphere is warm and romantic, full of unique beauty that blends Eastern charm with modern aesthetics. The details are rich, the fabric textures are clearly visible, the silk sheen shimmers under the light, the makeup is exquisitely detailed, and the transitions of light and shadow are natural, as if shot in a professional studio, yet still retaining a sense of everyday intimacy. Like portraits taken at home with a high-end camera, they have a strong visual impact and artistic appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
