        {
          "id": "krea2-66c748edd61d1464673ccd2e",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤广场微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden chair, looking straight at the camera with a gentle smile. She wears a black-and-white striped short-sleeved T-shirt with clear and even stripes, a fitted fit that highlights her figure. She pairs it with black high-waisted shorts with delicate lace trim at the hem. On her feet are a pair of thick-soled yellow Martin boots, which are simple and fashionable in design, with smooth and glossy uppers and zippered side decorations. The boot shaft is high, revealing white mid-calf socks. The sock cuff fits perfectly to the calf. Her left hand gently grips the shoulder strap of a pink crossbody bag, which is a soft pale pink color. Made of fine leather, the surface is smooth with a slight reflective finish. The bag is square and rounded, featuring gold metal fasteners and adjustable shoulder straps. The overall look is fresh and sweet yet distinctive. Her posture is naturally relaxed, with legs together slightly to one side, right hand gently resting on her knee, body slightly leaning forward, creating a friendly and approachable atmosphere. The foreground shows a close-up of her lower body and feet, highlighting the details of her yellow platform boots and white socks. The center frame shows her full-body sitting posture, fully presented from head to toe. The background is a vibrant wall of greenery. Large monstera leaves are broad and spreading, with clearly visible veins. Other tropical plants such as Fiddle Ficus and Oracinthrum are scattered throughout, creating rich green layers. On the right side is a small table made of deep brown solid wood, with a vintage desk lamp with a beige lampshade. The lamp base is made of brass, emitting a warm yellow glow. Next to it is a beautifully framed old photo showing a man wearing blue jeans. In the corner, there is a small glass jar and a decorative clock. Several woven straw hats hang on the wall, adding a pastoral charm. The entire scene is lighted softly and warmly, mainly from a combination of desk lamps and ambient light. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, with soft shadows that are soft and not awkward. The background green plants illuminate different layers of light and shadow, creating a cozy and cozy home atmosphere. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, but the extension of legs and boots guides the gaze downward. At the same time, the lines of greenery and furniture also serve a balanced effect. The overall color palette is green, brown, Mainly white, accented with yellow and pink, the color combination is harmonious and unified, full of life and artistic beauty. The image texture is delicate and authentic, as if shot with a professional camera, rich in detail, precise light and shadow performance, and strong visual appeal and emotional resonance",
