        {
          "id": "krea2-2648afb8d6c783880fe09dd1",
          "alias": "单女透视米风衣街道自信坐展示",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the roadside of a city street, wearing a long beige trench coat printed with striking red capital letters \"BURBERRY,\" paired with a black tight tank top and black shiny shorts. She wears black pointed high heels, her legs long and straight on the ground, wearing sheer stockings. Her legs are smooth and graceful, her makeup exquisite, her right hand gently touching the collar of the trench coat, her posture elegant and confident. Her left hand rests on her knee, and beside her is a black quilted chain bag. The background features a modern-style architectural complex, with light-colored stone exterior walls featuring decorative colonnades and balconies. Sunlight pours in from the upper right, casting clear shadows on the building's surface, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. The light is warm and soft, presenting a golden tone at dusk. The sky is a clear blue, the rear of a black car can be seen in the distance, the street is clean and tidy, and the ground reflects the shadows of people and buildings. The composition uses a low-angle shot to highlight the main subject, with the foreground showing the legs and the ground. The middle shot features the full body of the figure and part of the building facade, with the background being an extended group of buildings and the sky, extending along the curve of the body to the legs, finally landing on distant buildings and sky. The overall atmosphere blends urban fashion with the casual vibe of everyday life. The image has a strong visual impact and artistic beauty, as if it were a street photography work taken with a professional camera, while preserving authentic moments captured casually from daily life. The color palette is mainly warm yellow, beige, and black, accented with red lettering. It creates a fashionable atmosphere that is both sophisticated and down-to-earth, with rich details, clear layering, and natural light and shadow transitions, showcasing an independent and confident lifestyle attitude of modern urban women",
