        {
          "id": "krea2-afe6f88f0fdd105fdb02f07a",
          "alias": "单女酒廊俏皮站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors under a sunny green tree, exuding a natural and fresh aura. Her hands are gently raised behind her head, fingers slightly bent, her posture elegant and relaxed. She wears a loose off-white long-sleeve top, made of light and soft material with natural pleats and drape. The right waist has a drawstring design, forming an asymmetrical side slit that reveals part of the waistline. She pairs it with light gray-pink high-waisted tight sweatpants that fit her figure. The surface is smooth and delicate, presenting a soft sheen. Her overall style is simple, comfortable, yet stylish. She wears a slender gold necklace around her neck, with a small and delicate pendant that adds a highlight to the look. The background is blurred green plants and white architectural structures, with leaves casting mottled shadows under the sunlight, casting a warm and soft glow on her body and clothes. In the distance, the blue water at the edge of the pool and several white lounge chairs can be faintly seen. The entire scene is set in a tranquil courtyard or resort area. The ground is paved with gray stone pavements, surrounded by neatly trimmed lawns. The composition uses a centered technique, with figures centered and clear focal points. The background is blurred, and the shallow depth of field effect emphasizes the subject. The light extends along the body contours to hand movements and clothing details. Light comes from above, representing soft natural daylight, presenting warm tones in the early morning or evening. The transitions between light and shadow are natural, shadows are soft, and the overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, full of life's vitality. The texture of the image is delicate and authentic. It feels like real outdoor photos taken with a professional camera, offering a high degree of realism and artistic beauty. The colors are mainly white, beige, and light gray-pink, accented with green and blue. The tones are harmonious and unified, with rich layers, giving an overall impression of freshness, naturalness, comfort, and ease. It resembles beautiful moments captured in daily life, while also featuring studio-level lighting control and image texture, presenting a visual experience that is both lively and refined",
