        {
          "id": "krea2-b569fd6903f181bd14cd2417",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣窗边微笑坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window inside, gazing at the camera with a gentle smile, presenting a serene yet slightly shy demeanor. She wears a white spaghetti strap underneath, casually draped over a dark gray knit cardigan. The sleeves hang naturally, revealing slender arms. Beneath her lies a piece of white fabric with a light green floral pattern, possibly a bedsheet or blanket. In the background, you can see a window with blinds. Sunlight streams in from outside, creating a soft beam of light in the air and creating a warm backlight effect. On the windowsill sits a retro-style black vintage TV, with the screen turned off. Next to it, a pot of green plant leaves stretches into the left side of the screen, adding a touch of vitality. In the distance, books and some daily necessities are neatly arranged on the bookshelf. An old-fashioned twin-speaker radio sits on the shelf, with a few magazines or art books nearby. The overall environment feels warm and nostalgic. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center-right position, head slightly tilted, and the gaze interacting with the viewer. The greenery and headphones in the foreground serve as visual guiding elements, with light coming from the upper left, creating a distinct side backlight. The figure's outline is surrounded by a soft halo, with delicate transitions in the shadows. The color scheme is mainly warm yellow, accented with white, gray, and green, creating a peaceful and comfortable home atmosphere. The overall texture is delicate, with rich layers of light and shadow. It has a grainy texture reminiscent of film photography and natural color saturation, as if shot with an old camera. The edges of the frame have slight vignetting, enhancing the retro feel, presenting a beautiful moment from everyday life that is full of vitality and vitality",
