        {
          "id": "krea2-28a366dfc987822be9dd504c",
          "alias": "单女黑毛衣地牢忧伤坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the driver's seat of a white modified sports car, wearing a black knit hat and a green striped short-sleeve T-shirt. Her arms rest naturally on the edge of the open car window, her head slightly turned toward the window, looking to the right of the frame. Her expression reveals a trace of fatigue and contemplation. Her left arm has several small tattoo patterns, and her right arm has a red scratch or scar. Her overall posture is relaxed and casual, as if she has just finished a long drive or is waiting for something. On the side of the car is a black Japanese print reading \"Thailand Tofu House.\" The word \"tofu\" inside parentheses is bold and powerful, with a black decorative stripe below. The door handles are black, the window frames have a blue metallic roll cage structure, and inside the car, you can see orange-red racing seats. The seat material appears to be leather or faux leather, with textured details. The window glass is transparent but reflects blurred images of the surrounding environment. The background is blurred, presenting a scene of a city street or parking lot. In the distance, there are blurred architectural silhouettes, neon signs, and pedestrian silhouettes. The sky is grayish-white, with soft and even lighting. On cloudy or evening days, sunlight shines from above, creating faint shadows and highlights on the car body. The light and shadow layers are delicate, with slight reflections and wear marks on the car's surface, creating a realistic sense of life. The entire composition uses close-up shots, with the figure occupying the center-left position, the window edges forming a natural frame, and the camera angles slightly tilted to enhance the sense of dynamism and presence. The colors are mainly white, black, and green. Complemented by orange-red and gray, the contrast is sharp yet harmonious. The overall atmosphere is quiet, lonely, and tinged with a hint of urban fatigue. The texture is close to film photography, with obvious graininess, low color saturation, and cool tones, giving a retro filter effect. It feels like street candid shots taken with an old-fashioned camera, giving the feeling of real, unintentionally captured moments in daily life. The images have no obvious movements but are full of storytelling, conveying a sense of confusion for modern people in the fast-paced city life. The emotional state of emptiness and self-healing is tightly composed, with clear focus and moderate background blur, highlighting the main figure while preserving environmental information. The overall visual language is concise yet expressive, like a narrative street photography work with strong immersion and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
