        {
          "id": "krea2-dcb73ab27a033a19eb95cb72",
          "alias": "单女红外套摄影棚困倦站立过肩",
          "prompt": "Her left hand gently holds a bouquet of bright red balloons, which glow under soft light. Several thin white strings hang gently in the wind, while her right hand hangs naturally, holding a red jacket draped over her shoulder. She wears a white base with red floral patterns, a navel camisole top with red floral patterns, and a matching short skirt. The collar and cuffs of the top are decorated with red bows, the skirt features multi-layered ruffles, and a red ribbon is tied around the waist. On her feet, she wears white lace-trimmed short socks, the cuff tied with a red ribbon in a bow. She stands on a beautifully carved dark wooden chair, with the backrest carved with intricate Baroque patterns. The seat is covered in white lace fabric, with an off-white curtain in the background printed with elegant floral patterns. The curtain folds naturally, and on the right hangs a vintage brass wall lamp. The lampshade is made of milky white glass, emitting a warm yellow glow. The light casts a soft highlight on the figure. On the left side is a table covered with a white lace tablecloth, on which are a teapot with red and white polka dots, a small cake, a box decorated with pink ribbons, and a few pale yellow tulips. In the distance, you can see the outline of a wine cabinet. In the right rear corner, you can faintly see the green branches of a Christmas tree and red decorative spheres. In the foreground is another dining table covered with a white tablecloth, scattered with a few red cherry tomatoes and white utensils. The composition centers on the figure, shot in the middle shot, with the figure occupying the main part of the frame. The balloon is positioned at the upper left to form a visual guide, with light slanting in from the upper right, creating a warm and bright light and shadow effect. The overall atmosphere is warm and romantic, with a sense of festivity and heart. The color scheme is mainly warm yellow, paired with red and white for a striking contrast. The image is delicate and detailed, as if shot in a carefully arranged studio with professional photography equipment. It has a strong sense of artistry and cinema, while still retaining the warmth and authenticity of daily life, presenting a dreamy and authentic dual beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
