        {
          "id": "krea2-3e5aace9b6e15e40f05a57d0",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙公寓忧伤坐比耶",
          "prompt": "She wore a blue floral dress with a knee-length hem, made of light and flowing material. The neckline was V-shaped and the sleeves were short-sleeved, giving the overall style a fresh and natural look. She looked down at her phone, holding a cigarette in her right hand as the smoke curled up. Her left hand held the phone, fingers long and her nails neatly trimmed. Her calm expression revealed a faint sense of melancholy and detachment. She wore a pair of brown flat Mary Jane shoes, smooth uppers and low heels, giving off a comfortable and casual look. Her right leg was crossed over her left, her posture relaxed yet elegant. Next to it sits a brown leather shoulder bag, with a delicate texture and delicate metal fasteners. Next to it is a red soda can printed with white lettering. The bench is made of wood, with light brown wood panels with clearly visible grain. The surface shows slight wear and slight peeling along the edges, showing signs of long-term use. Behind the bench is a white Coca-Cola vending machine with a striking red \"Coca-Cola\" logo and colorful promotional labels on top. Inside, multiple rows of bottled drinks are displayed The colors are rich, including orange, green, yellow, etc, clearly visible through the transparent glass door. The vending machine has ventilation and coin slots at the bottom, with realistic details. The background is a dense forest with thick trunks and rough bark, and dense green leaves, forming a deep green canopy. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting mottled shadows on the ground and figures. The light spots are round or oval, varying in size, with interlaced light and shadow, creating a warm and gentle atmosphere. Light streams diagonally from the right side of the frame, creating a side backlighting effect. The outlines of the figures glow slightly, casting long shadows on the bench and ground to enhance the sense of spatial depth. The foreground features soil and scattered fallen leaves on the ground, with obvious graininess and rough texture. Some areas are illuminated by sunlight and appear in a yellowish tone, while other areas are in shadow with darker tones. The composition uses the rule of thirds: the figure is positioned on the right third of the frame, with the gaze facing left, creating visual guidance and enhancing the narrative of the scene. The middle shot centers on the figure and bench, with trees and vending machines in the background, creating clear layers. The depth of field is relatively shallow, the background is blurred, and the main subject is highlighted. The leaves and vending machines in the background create a blurred bokeh effect, forming soft light spots. The visual guidance is composed of the character's phone in hand and the upward-drifting smoke. The smoke is fine threads, slowly rising, gradually merging into the air, attracting the viewer's attention to move upward. The contrast of light and shadow is strong, with shadows distributed along the sides of the body and under the bench. The overall color palette is mainly green and blue, supplemented by warm yellow sunlight and red brand elements, creating a harmonious and layered color. The atmosphere is tranquil yet slightly lonely, as if capturing a brief pause in urban life. It has a realistic feel of everyday life and an artistic photographic aesthetic. The image texture is delicate, with rich details, presenting high-definition image quality similar to professional cameras. There is slight film graininess and natural noise. The lens focal length is about 50mm, aperture f/1.8, shutter speed is moderate, exposure is accurate, image stability is stable with no noticeable shake, overall composition is balanced, emotional expression is subtle and restrained, conveying a sense of tranquility, Fragments of distant yet slightly poetic urban life seem to come from real moments captured by a photographer using amateur equipment, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
