        {
          "id": "krea2-3c5a813ef8d1f99f031fff27",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣窗边忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways by the window, wearing a beige plush hooded knit cardigan, the hat naturally draped over her head. Her expression is calm yet tinged with a hint of melancholy, as if lost in her own thoughts. Her posture is slightly tilted, her body close to the window. The background is a blurred indoor environment, and warm natural light streams in from the right side. The curtain is made of white tulle material, lightly hanging by the window, gently swaying in the breeze, creating a hazy and dreamy atmosphere. Her reflection is faintly reflected on the glass glass. Present a semi-transparent silhouette, adding layers and depth to the image. The composition uses close-ups, with the main position of the subject, the head and shoulders clearly prominent. The background is blurred, and the shallow depth of field effect enhances the subject's visual impact. Light comes from the side slightly behind, a typical side backlight shoot, outlining the character's outline with a soft halo. The clothing texture appears especially soft and fluffy under the light. The overall color palette is warm yellow and off-white, with a slight vintage film texture and moderate color saturation With rich details and distinct light and shadow layers, the image presents a quiet, gentle, and slightly nostalgic everyday feel, as if casually captured with an old-fashioned film camera in the early morning or evening. The lens has a focal length of about 85mm, an aperture of f/1.8, exposure compensation of +0.3, simulating film graininess and slight vignetting. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, like a private photo recording youthful memories, full of emotional tension and artistic flair",
