        {
          "id": "krea2-ca3a117fab819a558f1d62b4",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道自信坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a white short-sleeved shirt and a black high-waisted skirt, paired with black stockings, sitting elegantly on a gray fabric sofa. Her right hand gently grips one end of a light blue silk scarf, which naturally drapes over her shoulders, forming a gentle curve. Her left hand rests naturally on the armrest of the sofa, her posture calm and confident, her body slightly turned to reveal her long legs and graceful figure. In the background are wooden windows with vintage wrought iron window lattice, from which the outlines of buildings and blurred street views can be faintly seen. Sunlight streams through the glass into the room. A warm light and shadow effect is created, with light slanting in from the right side, creating a bright and cozy atmosphere. The overall composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame, occupying the visual center. The sofa occupies the lower half of the frame, forming a stable triangular structure. The window frame forms a natural frame, guiding the gaze to focus on the subject. The colors are mainly white, black, and gray, accented with light blue silk scarves and wood brown, harmoniously unified. The image feels delicate and richly detailed, with the scarf material light and flowing. The surface of the stockings has a subtle sheen, the sofa fabric texture is clearly visible, the transition of light and shadow is natural, and the layers are distinct, presenting a slightly professional and intimate scene from daily life. It feels like being shot in a quiet afternoon café or home living room, captured with a professional camera and standard prime lens, giving it a realistic texture and a sense of life. The overall atmosphere of the image is warm, tranquil, elegant, and slightly lazy, making it suitable for depicting the daily life of modern urban women or the leisure moments of working women. The composition is carefully crafted, The use of light and shadow is well-balanced, color coordination is coordinated, and visual guidance is clear, highlighting the main subjects while also considering the ambiance, creating a story-rich artistic conception",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
