        {
          "id": "krea2-5442cb93070750fee110917a",
          "alias": "单女蓝内衣窗边专注站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways indoors, wearing a light blue spaghetti-strap bra and matching underwear. Her body leans back slightly, her head turning back to gaze at the camera, presenting a natural, unrefined beauty. Her overall posture exudes an elegant and relaxed state. Her right hand gently rests behind her waist, fingers naturally bent, and her left hand hangs naturally, making her hand movements natural and casual. It feels as if you've just stepped out of a private moment. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left, with the body slightly tilted, forming a dynamic S-shaped curve. The foreground is a close-up of the person's entire body, fully presented from ankle to head. The background is a simple indoor environment, with walls in off-white or light gray, smooth and delicate texture. On the left wall is a white light switch panel and a thermostat or access control system with a digital display. These details add realism and a sense of life to the scene. On the right is a plain wall without unnecessary decoration. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure occupying most of the space but leaving some negative space to highlight the subject. The overall proportions of the painting are close to vertical portrait photography, with visual guidance formed by the subject's gaze and body orientation. The lighting atmosphere is soft and warm. The light source comes from the left side of the image, possibly window or indoor lighting, evenly spreading light onto the subject, creating a natural transition between light and dark. The shadows are soft and not abrupt, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality, while the background is light-absorbed. This creates a slight backlight effect, making the subject stand out more. The color scheme is harmonious and unified, creating a quiet, private, and slightly ambiguous atmosphere. The image texture is similar to professional camera shooting, yet retains the casualness and realism of everyday life. It's like a photographer capturing a moment in a home with a Canon 5D Mark IV or Sony A7R series full-frame camera. The lens is a 50mm prime lens with an aperture of about f/2.8, providing a moderate background blur. The focus is fully focused on the subject, while retaining enough detail and clarity. The overall style leans toward Japanese photoshoots or lifestyle aesthetic photography, emphasizing naturalness, authenticity, and emotional expression. The images are not overly embellished, presenting a simple yet moving beauty",
