        {
          "id": "krea2-c819776189b176d72e9fb179",
          "alias": "单女灰牛仔街道微笑站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a city street corner, wearing a light gray denim jacket with a white T-shirt underneath, gray shorts, and a leopard-print shoulder bag slung over her shoulder. She wears a gentle smile and holds up a silver retro-style portable digital camera in her right hand. The lens is pointed directly at her, as if recording the moment. Her left hand naturally stretches out, her posture relaxed and relaxed, her body slightly tilted, creating a dynamic sense of balance. Her figure occupies the left center of the frame, forming a visual focal point. The background is a typical old city street in a Chinese city, flanked by residential buildings with beige exterior walls. Windows are fitted with metal security screens, and some balconies are drying clothes, giving the scene a strong sense of daily life. On the right side of the street, there is a utility pole and some messy wires, adding authentic urban details. In the distance, a blue electric bike can be seen parked by the roadside, with pedestrians passing by. One person wears a black shirt, while another sits under a green umbrella, seemingly resting or running a stall. These elements add layers to the scene. The ground is a dark gray asphalt pavement, edged with white traffic markings and yellow-black road posts. Sunlight pours in from the upper right, creating a soft backlight effect. The light penetrates the air, outlining a golden halo on the figure's outline, casting long shadows on the ground. The contrast is sharp but not too strong, creating a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward view, enhancing the subject's sense of subjectivity and spatial depth. The foreground is clear and prominent, while the middle ground features the figure and nearby buildings. The background gradually blurs, widening the front and back distances. The visual guide extends upward from the camera, forming a smooth visual loop. The colors are mainly warm tones, with soft tones like off-white, light gray, and pale yellow as the main tones. Brown spots on the leopard print bag and blue from the electric bike add a delicate texture, with a slight film graininess and natural overexposure, as if captured casually with an old camera, full of youthful energy and everyday poetry, with natural light and shadow transitions. The details are rich, capturing both the hustle and bustle of urban life and the quiet expression of personal emotions, presenting a unique aesthetic style that lies between artistic photography and life documentation",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
