        {
          "id": "krea2-15a5af9e6cc3bcab368408aa",
          "alias": "单女黑和服雪地冷淡站立展示",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a snowy winter landscape, dressed in a black kimono adorned with tiny white snowflakes. The collar reveals a pale yellow lining, and a wide white belt is tied around the waist. The belt is decorated with traditional golden patterns, fastened with thick cords, showcasing the delicate details of traditional Japanese attire. The background is a pure white snowfield, covered by snow covering the entire ground, creating a soft white background and a pure and ethereal atmosphere. Fine snowflakes continuously fall from the sky. Some snowflakes are clearly visible in front of the camera, adding dynamism and realism to the image. The composition uses a centered composition, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame, highlighting the main subject. The shallow depth of field effect blurs the background and enhances the visual focus on the character. The middle ground features the waist and hand movements of the kimono, while the background features vast snowfields and falling snowflakes. The overall color scheme is primarily black and white, creating a tranquil, cool yet warm winter atmosphere, with naturally diffused light. The diffused light from cloudy days creates soft and even light and shadows, with no obvious shadows. The atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, as if time has frozen in this moment, capturing a fleeting moment of innocence and beauty. It has a strong artistic appeal, like a classic scene from an art film, with a strong Japanese aesthetic style. The image quality is close to high-resolution camera shooting, but retains slight graininess and natural noise, simulating the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting. The cool tone enhances the layering and visual appeal of the image. Overall, it presents a style that is both beautiful and close to everyday life, as if recording an ordinary yet precious winter moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
