        {
          "id": "krea2-887d6d97750a80276b5d317d",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣室内俏皮坐躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a corner of the room, looking healthy and lively. She wears a gray chunky knit sweater with wide, puffy sleeves, thick and warm material, showcasing handwoven texture details. Beneath the sweater, a corner of the black inner layer peeks out, creating a color contrast. Her legs are bent and close, knees raised high, hands naturally resting on their knees, fingers relaxed, white socks with blue patterns at the cuffs, a small section exposed at the ankle, light-colored sneakers tied in a bow pattern, The upper is accented with orange-yellow, giving the overall posture a natural and relaxed look, as if enjoying a quiet afternoon. The foreground shows her raised legs and hands, occupying the lower half of the frame and forming a clear and prominent visual guide. The background is a dark wall or curtain with rough fabric textures, a dark gray color that is slightly blurred, creating a contrast between solid and void. Light enters diagonally from the left, creating a soft side light. The shadows transition naturally, with rich layers of light and shadow. The overall tone is cool, mainly gray, black, and white. It brings a touch of warmth. The image has a distinct film texture, obvious graininess, low color saturation, and a retro nostalgic atmosphere. The background is well blurred, the depth of field is shallow, and the composition is shot at a low angle, with a slightly upward perspective making the character appear more approachable and charming. The upper center of the frame is the person's head, with legs and hands forming a symmetrical composition that guides the gaze toward the center. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and warm, carrying a sense of casualness and realism from everyday life, as if captured with an old camera, full of the breath of life and emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
