        {
          "id": "krea2-fbc0c87b7f4275edc124f11a",
          "alias": "单女棕毛衣沙发坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits half-squatting on the indoor wooden floor, wearing a brown sweater paired with a dark blue plaid pleated mini skirt and white over-the-knee stockings. The overall look presents a cute animal-like campus style, holding a brown-and-white plush dog plushie. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of center of the frame, using a combination of close-up and middle shots. The figure occupies about two-thirds of the composition. In the foreground are her legs and feet, where the texture of the stockings and the shine of the shoes are clearly visible. The background is a soft indoor environment. On the right side are a beige sofa and an orange-yellow pumpkin-shaped throw pillow, on the left are cushions with floral patterns, and behind are translucent white curtains and bright windows. Natural light streams in from outside, creating a soft, diffused glow that illuminates the entire scene. The light and shadow are evenly distributed, with delicate and soft shadows, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall color palette is warm brown, Off-white and light wood tones are the main colors, accented with blue and orange-yellow, creating clear visual layers. The focus is on the subject, and depth of field control blurs the background slightly, highlighting the subject. The composition is balanced and full of life, resembling a cozy home photo taken with a daily camera, with a slight film texture and realistic lighting and shadow details, presenting a cute yet natural everyday feel. There are no unnecessary decorations or distractions in the frame; all elements serve to shape the character's image, creating a relaxed and pleasant overall atmosphere. Full of youthful energy and a sense of healing",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
