        {
          "id": "krea2-8e76883fd83c079280f3e5ec",
          "alias": "单女新娘白礼服婚礼坐持花",
          "prompt": "A bride sits in the back seat of a car, wearing a delicate white strapless wedding dress adorned with three-dimensional floral embroidery and lace details. The shoulders and chest are designed to elegantly fit the figure, with the skirt flowing naturally and puffy. She wears a light, transparent long veil topped with a bow decoration. In her left hand, she gently holds a bouquet of pale yellow roses and baby's breath. The bouquet is full and rounded, with distinct layers of petals and green leaves scattered throughout, creating a soft and warm overall tone. The car window reflects the blurry woods and stone wall scenery outside. Sunlight streams into the cabin from the side, creating soft side lighting that creates a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The interior is made of black leather, with clearly visible seat contours. The roof lining is light gray, and details of the door handles and control panel are faintly visible. The composition uses a medium perspective: the bride occupies the center to the right, her body slightly turned to the side, her head facing the camera, forming a focal point. In the foreground is the bouquet in the bride's hands and part of her skirt, while in the middle is the bride's whole body and the car seat. The background features outdoor scenes seen through the car window, including neatly arranged stone walls and trees. Distant scenes appear slightly blurred, highlighting the main subject. The overall image presents a texture reminiscent of everyday life, as if captured with an amateur camera. The lighting is natural, colors are faithfully restored, and it has a strong documentary feel and emotional warmth. The composition is balanced and stable, the figures' postures are natural and relaxed, expressions are sincere and moving, and the veil gently sways with the car, adding dynamic details. The whole scene is filled with warmth and anticipation on the wedding day. The main color palette is white, beige, and light gray, complemented by black interior accents and green plants, creating a harmonious visual contrast. The atmosphere is tranquil and romantic, as if a private memory is frozen in time",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
