        {
          "id": "krea2-5eda808bf8fe642627a38745",
          "alias": "单女制服家中忧伤侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a dark school uniform jacket over a white shirt with a red and blue striped tie, a round school emblem on her left chest, holding a white captain's hat above her head in her right hand, and gently stroking the back of her head with her left hand. Sunlight streams in from the left side of the frame, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow, creating a retro film-like visual effect. The background features a blurred glass curtain wall of city buildings, presenting a sharp contrast between the cool blue tones and the warm tones in the foreground. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure occupying the main position and the head slightly tilted. The overall image has a strong cinematic feel and storytelling, with moderate color saturation, slight graininess, and vignetting effects, as if captured with an old-fashioned film camera. Light shines from the side, creating bright edge light on the contours of the figures. The background blur emphasizes the subject, while distant building lines extend diagonally, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is quiet and slightly melancholic, conveying the unique confusion and contemplation of youth. The image is full of life atmosphere yet still artistically beautiful. Like a precious photo capturing an ordinary afternoon, the camera captures a quiet and emotionally charged moment. The figure's posture is naturally relaxed, as if just finished a day of study or work, ready to set off on the journey home. The entire scene exudes a unique charm interwoven with nostalgia and tenderness",
