        {
          "id": "krea2-c477969d314e8cdbd47bddf9",
          "alias": "单女米长裤街道忧伤站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the warm evening sunlight, wearing a black long-sleeve top and beige cargo pants, with a brown belt tied around her waist. The overall look is simple yet street-style, naturally draped down, adding a touch of laziness and spontaneity. She leans slightly to the side, raises her left arm against the wall, leans her body slightly, and her expression carries a hint of stubbornness and confidence, as if telling an inner story. The foreground is a close-up of her upper body, occupying the main part of the frame. The composition is taken in close-up, with the figure appearing from above the waist. The background is a rough concrete wall, with mottled light and shadow projections on the wall, presenting shadows of leaves or grilles. These shadows form geometric shapes of interwoven light and shadow as the light changes, enhancing the layering and visual interest of the image. The light comes from the upper right side, a typical afternoon sunset. The sunlight is soft and warm, presenting a golden hue, while clear shadows are cast on the wall. The contrast is strong but not too harsh, creating a peaceful and cozy atmosphere. The entire scene resembles an old alley or abandoned building, with some blurred white graffiti or text marks scattered on the ground, adding a sense of realism and everyday life to the environment. The composition centers on the characters, using diagonal light and shadows to guide the view, then extending along body lines to the background, creating a natural visual flow. The colors are mainly warm tones, with black clothing contrasting sharply with beige pants and harmonizing with the brownish-yellow wall in the background. The overall atmosphere combines the rustic feel of everyday life. It also carries the refined beauty of artistic photography, as if casually capturing a shot with an old film camera, preserving slight graininess and natural exposure deviation. The edges of the frame have slightly dark corners, enhancing the texture of the vintage film. The transitions of light and shadow are soft, the details rich, presenting an overall gentle yet slightly melancholic poetic atmosphere, as if capturing a forgotten moment, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
