        {
          "id": "krea2-02349bf3e2e866536c793a32",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫教室站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A Japanese female student wearing a white short-sleeved shirt and a dark plaid pleated skirt stands slightly sideways in the classroom, her expression natural and genuine, with a slight blush. Her overall posture is relaxed yet dignified, her hands naturally hanging in front of her, fingers slightly bent, elbows slightly bent, and body leaning forward, presenting a natural state from everyday interactions. Her white shirt collar is open, revealing her collarbone and part of her chest, with the collar hanging naturally, creating natural folds and shadows, highlighting the texture of the garment and the curves of the body The shirt is made of cotton, with fine textures and slight wrinkles on the surface. Sunlight streams through the classroom windows, creating a soft and warm light transition that creates a natural transition between light and dark. The background is a typical Japanese-style classroom environment, with wooden desks and chairs neatly arranged. On the table sits a bottle of transparent plastic bottled mineral water, with water droplets condensing and reflecting faint light spots. Other students stand vaguely behind them, wearing similar uniforms—some carrying backpacks, others chatting, creating a real campus atmosphere. The middle shot shows the classroom desk and students, while the foreground shows the female protagonist's body and part of the tabletop. The composition uses a medium shot close-up, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, slightly looking upward to highlight the main subject while preserving details of the surrounding environment. The background is blurred to make the subject stand out. Light and shadow come from outside the left window, creating a natural side lighting effect that enhances the sense of depth. The background light is relatively dark, creating a contrast with the subject. The composition is narrative, as if capturing a real moment during a classroom break. The overall atmosphere is calm and everyday. Full of youthful energy, the color tones are mainly white, blue, and wood, with moderate color saturation to faithfully reproduce real scenes. The image texture resembles amateur camera shooting, with slight noise and motion blur, simulating the graininess and shallow depth of field effect of real photography. The lens focal length is about 50mm, aperture f/2.8, shutter speed 1/125 sec, ISO 400, presenting a documentary-style snapshot feel. The subject's expressions are natural and natural, movements are smooth and continuous, without forced posing, as if captured by a photographer by chance The entire scene exudes a lifelike warmth and youthful tranquility, allowing people to feel the most authentic and unintentionally beautiful moments of campus life",
