        {
          "id": "krea2-e8769356deb7fc0eb2c5f07a",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套街道忧伤站立（2）",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beside the metal railing of a city overpass, wearing a blue-gray plaid wool coat over a white knit sweater. Her right hand rests gently on the railing, while her left hand stretches forward, fingers slightly spread, as if touching the air or trying to grasp something. Her posture is naturally relaxed and poetic. The main subject is this woman, positioned slightly in the center of the left, her body slightly leaning forward, head resting on her arm, forming a gentle arc In the foreground, a clear metal railing structure consists of thick beams and vertical columns, with slight wear marks and rivet details on the surface. The railing edges have obvious shadows, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and realism. The middle is a blurred city street, with several cars driving in the distance. One dark sedan and one red car have clear outlines but details are blurred, road markings are faintly visible, and the background is an open sky and distant architectural silhouettes. The light is bright and warm, presenting the soft sunlight of early morning or evening. Sunlight pours in from the upper right, with bright highlights and rich layers of shadows. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow and cool gray, creating a tranquil, cozy, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The composition is shot at an angle, giving the image more dynamic and visual impact. The figures occupy the main position, guiding the viewer toward the distance, while the railing lines extend deeper into the frame, creating a strong perspective effect. Visual guidance guides the viewer naturally through the posture of the person and the direction of the railing. From foreground to middle ground and then background, the lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, with a film-like texture. Color saturation is moderate, contrast is low, presenting a realistic feel similar to everyday amateur camera shooting. The image details are rich, textures are clear, clothing wrinkles look natural, and the metal railing reflects realistically. The overall style combines a sense of everyday life with artistic beauty, as if capturing a moment of emotion in a street photography photo, with a strong Japanese portrait style. The image is full of youthful energy. The intertwining of loneliness and hope evokes a quiet yet profound emotional flow",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
