        {
          "id": "krea2-df1425ebcf3bc03561932978",
          "alias": "单女困倦站立侧头（3）",
          "prompt": "A woman is presented in a close-up portrait, adding a touch of laziness and casualness. Her texture is as delicate as porcelain. Her nails are painted light pink, her fingers long and slender, and her posture is elegant yet restrained. She wears a pair of silver earrings, simple and modern in design, perfectly complementing her overall look. She wears a pink plush garment made of the same material, with faint views on her shoulders and chest, echoing the hairpiece. The overall color tone is harmonious and unified. The background is a pure blue, showing a smooth gradient from light blue to deep blue. The color saturation is moderate, without cluttered textures or distracting elements, making the main figure stand out. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered, the head slightly tilted, and the gaze directed toward the lower left. The overall image has a strong visual focus, with extremely delicate light and shadow treatment. The main light source comes from the front right, creating a natural transition between highlights and shadows, enhancing the sense of space and texture. This creates a clear separation between the subject and background, creating a quiet and emotionally charged atmosphere. The overall color palette is dominated by pink and blue, with a striking yet harmonious contrast of warm and cool tones, creating a dreamy feeling that is both sweet and slightly serene. The image details are rich, as if shot with a professional-grade camera in high resolution, featuring cinematic color grading and post-processing. It presents a refined yet authentic artistic aesthetic. The overall composition conveys a gentle, introspective, and slightly lonely atmosphere, evoking thoughts of youth, dreams, and inner worlds. It is like a tranquil moment eternally frozen in time, full of poetry and emotional tension, suitable for creative scenes expressing emotions, fashion, or personal story themes",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
