        {
          "id": "krea2-10fcbcd632cbf3e4f0dc8cbc",
          "alias": "多人忧伤站立持相机",
          "prompt": "Under soft light and shadow, natural luster and texture appear, creating a dreamlike visual effect. The outlines of the flowers are clearly visible, petal edges slightly curled, and the center is a pale yellow stamen. These flowers are distributed in the foreground and middle of the painting, some clear, some blurred, creating a rich sense of spatial depth. The background is a deep dark tone, almost completely covered by shadow, making the main figure stand out even more. The composition uses a very close-up perspective. This compact composition enhances intimacy and emotional tension. Visual guidance is mainly achieved through the distribution of light and shadow, while the sides gradually transition into darker areas, forming a natural focal point. Light comes from the upper sides, presenting a warm pink tone mixed with faint cyan-green cool light. The two colors blend together, creating an atmosphere that is both romantic and slightly melancholic. The contrast of light and shadow is strong but not abrupt, and the transitions between light and shadow are smooth. Like watercolor grading, the overall image is full of poetry and artistic feel, as if taken at dusk with an old film camera. The lens has slight bokeh and graininess, and the image quality is slightly rough, as if hand-developed. It retains the film's unique texture and temperature, with a warm tone and moderate saturation, but subtle separation between colors, creating a retro and captivating visual experience. The overall style blends Japanese aesthetics with modern digital art, retaining the texture of authentic photography. It also carries a surreal and fantasy tone, as if capturing a fleeting moment, a tranquil moment shrouded in flower shadows, allowing one to feel the stillness of time and inner peace.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
