        {
          "id": "krea2-ccea130cab4d1a6d4cddafe1",
          "alias": "单女毛衣门温柔倚靠持相机",
          "prompt": "Her right hand gently holds a white matte perfume bottle, decorated with exquisite gold embossed patterns featuring classical floral and scroll motifs. The cap features a metallic golden spiral design, while her left hand holds the cap to her chest, striking an elegant and natural posture. She wears an off-shoulder off-shoulder knit top. The material is soft and fits the body's curves, with a diagonal neckline exposing one shoulder and collarbone. The sleeves are long-sleeved with slightly pleats, creating a comfortable and relaxed feeling. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the middle foreground, with the figure occupying about two-thirds of the space. The composition uses a slightly slanted three-quarters side view to enhance dynamic beauty and intimate atmosphere. The background is an indoor environment, with warm white and light beige tones as the main tones. The walls are simple and free of unnecessary decoration. In the blurred area on the right, the outline of a green plant can be seen, with slender leaves naturally scattered. The plant blur creates a depth effect. On the left, you can faintly see the edges of furniture or door frames, but the details are diminished. The overall background remains minimalist and clean, highlighting the main subject. Light comes from the front left, creating a subtle transition of light and shadow through natural daylight filtering through the curtains. The shadows are delicate and soft, without strong contrast, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The direction of light and shadow is consistent, enhancing three-dimensionality without disrupting the overall soft tone. The overall color palette leans toward creamy tones, blending off-white, light gold, Light brown and mint green and other low-saturation colors create harmonious unity, creating a comfortable and cozy visual experience. The lens uses a mid-focal length for well-controlled depth of field, with background and distant objects gradually blurring, creating a \"focal imaging\" effect similar to portrait photography, enhancing the subject's prominence. The composition uses the subject's head and perfume bottle to form a visual guiding line, extending from the lower left corner to the upper right, naturally following the movement trajectory. At the same time, the neck lines and arm curves form a gentle curved guide, giving the image an intrinsic rhythm. The overall atmosphere conveys a private, gentle, romantic, and slightly luxurious everyday aesthetic, like a fashionable photo shoot with a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens, or like moments casually captured in daily life. Full of realism and artistic atmosphere, the image texture is delicate, the reflections from clothing fibers and perfume bottle surfaces are real and believable, details are rich but not cluttered, presenting a balance between sophistication and everyday life, making it suitable for beauty commercials or lifestyle content creation",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
