        {
          "id": "krea2-41e472128dc2f670ae274f9c",
          "alias": "单女湿身蓝T恤冷淡吃",
          "prompt": "Her right hand holds a pair of black chopsticks, picking up a slender bundle of noodles from a bowl. The noodles curve slightly in the air, showing a golden hue, with an oily sheen on the surface, looking very tempting. Her left hand holds a black spoon, ready to assist with eating. On her wrist is a metal watch with a strap and a gold ring, with clear details. She was looking down at the food in her bowl, her expression focused and engaged, as if completely immersed in the delicious taste. In the foreground was a white ceramic ramen bowl, with an orange-red round tray at the bottom. The bowl was filled with rich broth, amber-colored, with a few thinly sliced char siu floating on top, sprinkled with fresh scallions and chopped green cilantro, and half a dark brown soft-boiled egg. The yolk was slightly exposed, presenting an enticing flowing texture. Several strands of noodles soaked in the soup, some lifted high, forming a natural arc The background is a typical Japanese ramen shop interior. The walls are beige, with a row of vertically arranged Japanese menu signs in neat font, mainly red and white. Several stainless steel beer kegs are placed along the walls. In the distance, you can see wooden partitions and counter structures. Multiple spotlights are installed on the ceiling, providing warm and soft lighting that illuminates the entire space and creates a cozy and comfortable dining atmosphere. The composition uses a close-up perspective, with the characters positioned slightly to the right center, and the ramen bowl occupying the center of the frame. The visual guide line starts with noodles lifted by chopsticks, extending upward and ultimately focusing on the bowl of richly colored, layered ramen. The light and shadows come from warm yellow lighting above, with soft shadows. The overall atmosphere is authentic and natural, carrying the warmth and warmth of daily life and the warmth of everyday life, as if captured with a regular camera or phone. The lens's edges are slightly out of focus, the background slightly blurred, highlighting the subject. The image tones are warm, mainly orange, yellow, and brown, paired with the light blue of the character's T-shirt to create a cool and warm contrast, enhancing visual appeal and rich details. All showcase a sense of artistic beauty rooted in everyday life, presenting an ordinary yet happy everyday scene that brings satisfaction and comfort to a bowl of ramen",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
