        {
          "id": "krea2-4337468c69f80a24e2fa3534",
          "alias": "单女白礼服婚礼忧伤倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a pristine white strapless wedding dress with a high-waisted design. The layered skirt presented a fluffy A-line silhouette, with delicate pleats and a slight sheen on the fabric, as if glowing softly under dim light. She wore a lightweight sheer veil that hung from the top of her head to her shoulders, with slightly curled edges draped over her shoulders. She held a small white bouquet composed of white roses and green leaves, the flowers full and delicate, Her posture gracefully leans against the yellow-and-black railing, her left hand gently resting on it, her right hand naturally hanging down to hold a bouquet, her body slightly turned to the side, head slightly tilted, expression slightly melancholic and contemplative. The overall atmosphere is filled with a sense of tranquility and solitude. The foreground is the main figure, occupying most of the space. In the middle is a metal railing with yellow and black stripes running across the right side of the frame. The railing surface shows signs of wear, while the background is city streets at night, dimly lit, with faint streetlights and vehicle lights visible in the distance, forming warm yellow light spots The sky is pitch black, with faint raindrops or water droplets reflecting faint light spots. The composition uses a center-left main figure placement, with the figure positioned near the golden ratio point of the composition. The visual guide line is guided by the figure's posture and gaze direction to the viewer. Light and shadow mainly come from the warm yellow light source in the background, creating a backlighting effect that softly outlines the figure's outline. At the same time, subtle transitions of highlight and shadow appear on the wedding dress, creating a strong contrast of light and dark. The overall color palette is mainly cool blue and warm yellow, creating a warm and cool contrast. It enhances the layering and emotional tension of the image. The image has a film-like texture, obvious graininess, low color saturation, and slightly faded and smudged edges, presenting a retro nostalgic atmosphere. It feels like a street snapshot taken with an old-fashioned camera, with strong realism, rich details, delicate light and shadow handling, natural human expressions, and a believable scene. The overall style combines artistic and everyday feel, like moments amateur photographers accidentally capture at night, full of storytelling and emotional depth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
