        {
          "id": "krea2-23491c072bcd3af5dbf8ee78",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙椅上沉思坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden chair, turning sideways to look out the window, her expression calm and slightly contemplative. She wears a white geometric hairpin and a loose long-sleeved floral dress adorned with small pink, blue, and yellow floral accents. Beside her rests a white classical guitar, with smooth lines and a long neck, the head slightly tilted, resting on a low wooden coffee table. The tea table surface is smooth with clear texture, and on top sits a white porcelain bowl filled with orange-red snacks, like nuts or dried fruits. The woman sits on a dark brown rattan chair with a curved backrest and a soft cushion. The cushion is light beige, with curved legs that give off a vintage feel. In the background is a cozy indoor space. On the left is a row of wooden shelves with several books in various spine colors—red, blue, and white. Next to it is a transparent glass bottle with a few dried flowers inside. Behind is a white door with a metal handle that reflects a faint sheen. Next to the door hangs a mirror framed in dark wood, reflecting parts of the room. In the distance, an old black CRT TV hangs on the wall. The screen is closed, the body is heavy, and next to it is a window that lets in soft natural light. The light streams in from the right side, creating a warm backlight effect. The floor is covered with a vintage patterned carpet with intricate patterns, mainly reddish-brown and beige, with ethnic flair. The overall tone of the scene is warm. The saturation is moderate, presenting a nostalgic film texture. The shot uses a medium shot composition, with the person positioned slightly to the left center of the frame. The viewer's gaze is directed toward the window at the upper right, creating a quiet, artistic, and lively atmosphere. The overall style resembles everyday amateur photography, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera. The image quality is slightly grainy and slightly noisy, with rich color layers but not overly sharpened. The light and shadow are soft, details are realistic, and the image conveys a sense of gentleness, introspection, and everyday poetry. It was as if I had captured a quiet afternoon, with time slowly flowing",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
