        {
          "id": "krea2-08e3ad746b97411eaaf5a20c",
          "alias": "单女商店忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of an aquarium, faintly glowing with a delicate sheen, as if silently telling something. Her expression carries a hint of melancholy yet a faint tranquility. She wears a light-colored top with vintage patterns, with delicate lace trim at the neckline. The shoulder lines are smooth, the fabric is light, and with each breath, she gazes into the camera as if detached from reality and exploring her inner self. In the foreground are several brightly colored tropical fish, one of which occupies the left side of the frame. Its body is full and rounded, its scales reflecting a warm glow in the light. Another pink fish swims past from the upper right, its tail fin extended gracefully. Another large orange fish is on the right side of the painting, dark and deep. These fish swim slowly in the water, their blurred outlines contrasting with the clear subject, enhancing the sense of layering in the painting. In the middle is a transparent glass aquarium filled with blue lighting, creating a mysterious underwater atmosphere. Inside the aquarium are white coral decorations. Each has its own unique form and is arranged in a well-balanced manner. Under blue light, they appear crystal clear, adding a natural beauty to the scene. The background is a blurred indoor environment, with faint outlines of furniture and soft, warm-toned lighting, suggesting a cozy home space or a small pet shop. The composition uses close-ups, placing the figures slightly back in the center of the frame. Through the fish in the foreground, they act as a visual barrier, creating a sense of voyeurism and privacy. The depth of field effect makes the subject clear while the foreground and background gradually blur Visual guidance is mainly achieved through color contrast. The warm tones of fish in the foreground contrast strongly with the cool blue tones of the background, serving as a visual balance point. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by warm and cool contrasts, with the blue cool light in the background intertwining with the orange-red warm light in the foreground, creating a dreamy visual effect. Light radiates from inside the aquarium, penetrating the water body and forming soft scattered light, enveloping the entire scene in a hazy halo. This lighting and shadow treatment not only enhances the three-dimensional effect of the image but also gives the image a surreal artistic temperament. The overall style combines the warmth of everyday life with the refinement of artistic photography, as if it were a chance moment of shooting. Using a regular camera or mobile phone to capture a real scene, the carefully arranged colors and composition give it a cinematic texture. The rich image details together create a moment full of emotional tension and visual appeal, prompting reflection on the relationship between humans and nature, reality and fantasy.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
