        {
          "id": "krea2-a106a569ebb765af8fa3acf8",
          "alias": "单女白袜子户外微笑坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a lush green football field, wearing a white Real Madrid jersey with the gold \"Fly Emirates\" sponsor logo and club badge printed on her chest. The cuffs feature the La Liga logo, the jersey features a delicate breathable mesh texture, and gold stripes on the shoulders. The overall design exudes a sporty and professional vibe. She sits cross-legged with legs naturally bent, wearing slightly worn white sneakers with loosely tied laces and three white stripes on her black long socks. Echoing the style of the jersey, she raised both hands above her head, steadily supporting a white soccer ball adorned with blue and yellow decorations. The surface clearly showed stitching and brand logos. The woman wore a bright smile, looking directly at the camera. On her left wrist, she wore a delicate silver bracelet, adding a touch of refinement. The background was a vast green artificial turf with dense and even grass leaves. In the distance, a faint white court line was faintly visible, presenting a soft shallow depth of field. The foreground was sharp and clear, while the middle ground gradually blurred. The background becomes more blurred, creating a strong sense of layering. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figures centered, and the visual focus focused on the woman and the football, creating a stable visual balance. The lighting is soft natural light from above, with gentle shadows and no strong contrast. The overall atmosphere is relaxed, cheerful, youthful, full of vitality and approachability. The color palette is mainly fresh and bright green, accented with white and gold, making the scene clean and tidy and dynamic, as if capturing a leisurely afternoon football moment. The image texture is delicate and realistic, like a high-quality portrait shot outdoors with a professional camera, while preserving the intimacy of everyday life. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, color saturation is moderate, and details are rich. From the folds of the jersey to the texture of the grass, everything is clearly visible. Overall, it presents an artistic aesthetic that is both professional and retains a sense of life, with strong visual appeal and emotional appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
