        {
          "id": "krea2-acea6a80a0f3067a4070954c",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫竹林坐书写",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the wooden bar in a Japanese izakaya, wearing a simple white short-sleeved shirt and a vintage-style shoulder bag made of brown leather and khaki canvas slung over her shoulder. She slightly turns to look at the camera, holding an amber beer with fine droplets on the glass. The background is the typical interior of a Japanese tavern. The bar is made of warm natural wood, with a smooth surface and natural wood grain texture. Above the bar hangs a black chalk menu board. On them, colorful chalk hand-wrote prices and names for various Japanese dishes and drinks, such as \"Sashimi 680\" and \"Grilled Chicken Skewers 350,\" with crooked handwriting style. Next to them are several white paper price lists with \"Chuka Soba 130\" and \"Edamame 380.\" On the right is a row of neatly stacked wooden chopstick holders, holding bundles of unopened bamboo chopsticks. Further inside is the kitchen operation area, where you can see stainless steel utensils and some cooking equipment. The walls are made of light-colored wooden wainscoting, presenting a warm beige tone. The overall lighting is soft and even, with warm yellow light from above casting on the figures and the bar counter, creating delicate transitions of shadows and highlights to create a cozy and comfortable atmosphere. The composition uses the classic three-part method, with the figures positioned slightly to the lower left of the frame, gazing to the right. The text is mainly in vertical Japanese, including the magazine title \"mina\" and the subtitle \"Minna no Hajido Sake.\" \"As well as multiple news and fashion section headlines, these text and images are cleverly blended to create a visual rhythm. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, brown, and off-white, with moderate color saturation and a natural, authentic texture, as if captured with an old-fashioned film camera. The lens captures the small beauties of life, with soft and layered light and shadow, creating a nostalgic yet welcoming atmosphere. The whole scene is full of everyday life and warmth, evoking the pleasant moments of enjoying a drink after work on a summer evening. The details in the painting are rich, from the folds of the characters' clothing to the reflections of beer mugs, to the rough texture of wood grain and chalk writing, all clearly visible, presenting a high degree of realism and artistry. The composition is balanced yet dynamic, the visual guidance is smooth and natural, the lighting and shadow are delicate, and the atmosphere is tranquil and warm, as if one can smell the aroma of wine and food in the air. This is a photographic work that combines the atmosphere of life with aesthetic value",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
