        {
          "id": "krea2-9a698ebb4b36e44ec147420d",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window on the bus, wearing a white puff-sleeve shirt made of thin and transparent fabric, her expression calm and slightly contemplative. Her right hand rests gently on her leg, fingers naturally relaxed. Her entire posture exudes an unintentional laziness and ease. The foreground shows details inside the bus, including the dark plastic seat edges, metal armrests, and window frames. The window glass reflects the interior environment and the silhouettes of the people, while the vehicles on the street outside appear in a dynamic, blurred form. A white sedan and a blue car sped past, creating a strong sense of sportiness and a visual hint of the passage of time. The background is the real scene of a city street, with blurred architectural outlines and red signs in the distance, but the focus is entirely on the figures. The composition combines close-up shots with side angles, with the figures occupying about two-thirds of the right side, while the left side leaves a large negative space to showcase the flowing scenery outside the window, creating visual balance and contrast. The light comes from the right front, slanting sunlight at dusk or dawn. Golden warm light pours in through the car window, creating a striking contrast between light and dark, while the shadowed areas transition softly, creating a warm and layered atmosphere of light and shadow. The overall tone leans toward warmth, mainly gold, off-white, and light gray, complemented by the cool tones of the street outside the window for contrast, enhancing the emotional tension of the image. The image has a strong sense of daily life and life, as if taken casually with a regular phone. The lens has slight noise and natural exposure deviation, simulating real camera imaging effects. Without excessive sharpening or filter marks, it preserves the film-like graininess and natural color gradients. The composition does not pursue perfect symmetry but adds movement and realism through slanted angles and irregular lines, forming an inward-to-outside visual path that guides viewers to contemplate the connection between the characters' inner worlds and the external world. The entire image conveys a tranquil, lonely, yet hopeful mood, like a brief yet profound moment in urban life, capturing the softness of modern hearts and their longing for freedom. With a strong artistic atmosphere and poetic beauty, it is suitable for expressing themes such as youth, growth, wandering, and longing. The composition contains no unnecessary decorations or distractions; everything serves the characters' emotions and the construction of the scene's atmosphere, ultimately presenting a documentary image that is both realistic and artistically appealing",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
