        {
          "id": "krea2-7f5e9ea31045037a717b6cb1",
          "alias": "单女躺摆拍",
          "prompt": "The fabric feels soft and natural, with clear and layered plaid lines. The sleeves are slightly rolled up to reveal slender wrists, the left hand naturally raised at her side, fingers slightly spread in a relaxed pose. Her nails are neatly trimmed, and the overall movement appears casual yet authentic. The grass she lies on is yellow-green, with densely woven leaves. Some areas glow golden under sunlight, while the shadows transition between deep green and brown. The grass tips sway gently in the wind, rich in detail and lifelike texture. The composition uses a high-angle overhead shot, with the figure positioned in the lower left of the frame, the body extending diagonally, and a large grassy area in the upper right area, creating visual balance and a sense of breathing. The background features a blurred lawn and faintly visible tree shadows in the distance. The blur effect enhances the subject's prominence, creating a shallow depth of field style that fully focuses on the subject. The light comes from above, simulating the warm natural glow of an afternoon. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating soft contrast between light and dark. The highlights are bright but not harsh, while the shadows transition delicately. The overall tone is warm, with a slight film graininess and retro filter effect. The color saturation is moderate, slightly faded, presenting a nostalgic and cozy atmosphere. The edges of the frame have slight vignetting to enhance the sense of center focus, while preserving a certain original image texture. It feels as if shot with an old-fashioned camera, evoking the simplicity and realism of everyday amateur equipment. The overall atmosphere is quiet, gentle, and full of life, conveying a tranquil summer afternoon that lets people feel the innocence and freedom of youth, as if time has frozen at this moment, leaving only the most genuine dialogue between humans and nature",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
