        {
          "id": "krea2-ce4dc9ed88d16931eecc3f68",
          "alias": "单女白内衣厨房沉思坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the edge of a stainless steel sink in the kitchen, her body slightly leaned back, legs naturally extended, one foot resting on the edge and the other dangling in the air, her posture relaxed and lazy. She wore a loose white long-sleeved top with the hem cascading casually, revealing one shoulder and part of her waist, while white underwear on the bottom. The overall outfit was simple yet slightly sexy, her expression calm yet tinged with a thoughtful detachment. In the foreground was her body and arms, gently resting near her abdomen, fingers naturally bent, nails neatly trimmed. The background is a corner of the kitchen, with dark cabinets above the window and vintage-style round metal handles on the doors. On the windowsill are several bottles of clear glass alcoholic beverages—one with a blue label, another green—along with several bottles of skincare or drinks in white packaging. Soft natural light streams in from outside, creating dappled shadows through the white lace curtains. The light is cool in tone, contrasting with the warm yellow lighting inside. The middle frame shows her body and surroundings, including the sink, countertop, and power outlets on the wall, The composition uses a low-angle shot, with the subject occupying most of the space on the right side of the frame, while the left side leaves a windowsill and background area to create visual balance. The subject's head is slightly tilted, extending to the background details. The lighting atmosphere is warm and slightly nostalgic. The indoor lighting is yellowish, creating a private and quiet home feel. At the same time, the cool window light brings a touch of coolness and distance. The overall image has the texture of film photography, with obvious graininess, moderate color saturation, and a vintage tone, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera. There is slight overexposure and loss of shadow details, enhancing realism and a sense of life. The images present the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting, not aiming for perfection but capturing a natural, casual moment, conveying a tranquil moment often overlooked in urban life. The overall atmosphere is both private and open, both everyday and full of artistic flair",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
