        {
          "id": "krea2-69490c94fcd3bb0c84ad4e97",
          "alias": "单女白袜子家中沉思交叠",
          "prompt": "Her right hand rests gently on the sofa backrest, her body slightly tilted, legs crossed—right leg on top and left leg below—wearing white over-the-knee socks and white high-heeled sandals. Her ankles are decorated with thin straps, giving her legs a smooth, slender line. She wears a short-sleeved jumpsuit made of light purple tweed fabric, with white woven trim at the collar and cuffs. There are two flap pockets on the chest with white buttons. The overall style is vintage and refined. Full of French romantic atmosphere, the background is a pure light gray wall with uniform and soft tones without unnecessary decoration. The floor is a light gray matte floor, forming a clean spatial layer with the wall. The composition uses a medium portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, occupying the main visual space and creating a vertical visual flow. Light comes from the front slightly left, with delicate and natural shadows. The overall atmosphere is quiet, gentle, with a hint of laziness and contemplation. The color palette is mainly light purple, off-white, and light gray, with harmonious and unified colors. It presents a sophisticated yet understated fashion aesthetic. The visuals have the texture of professional studio photography while preserving authentic and natural details from daily life, as if captured in a simple and modern home environment. The transitions of light and shadow are smooth, the texture rich, combining the refinement of a fashion blockbuster with a sense of everyday warmth. The image details are clear, the characters' expressions natural, the clothing materials authentic and tangible, the overall composition balanced, and the visual focus clear, conveying a tranquil, elegant, and story-rich artistic atmosphere",
