        {
          "id": "krea2-1c94030b2c40f13dd092931e",
          "alias": "单女和服摄影棚严肃侧头",
          "prompt": "Her fingers are long, her nails painted with light pink polish, her posture elegant yet slightly lazy. The kimono has a deep blue base and is embroidered with vibrant floral patterns, including pink, white, and yellow peonies and cherry blossoms, as well as golden geometric patterns. The cuffs reveal a white brocade lining inside, also embroidered with gold patterns, layered and richly textured. A white haori is draped over it, also decorated with gold embroidery patterns and fine piping edges. The overall design is elegant and luxurious, with close-up shots. The figure occupies most of the scene, with the head slightly tilted and the body slightly turned, forming a natural S-shaped curve. The foreground is clear and sharp, the middle scene transitions naturally, the background is simple and clean, with no distractions. Light comes from the front left, soft and even. It creates a warm and bright atmosphere, with subtle shadows that highlight the outlines of the figures and the texture of the clothing. The rich layers of light and shadow give the image a strong sense of depth, with a harmonious and unified overall color tone, infused with the delicacy and tranquility of Japanese aesthetics. It resembles a serene portrait, combining artistic flair with a sense of everyday life. It is like shooting in a studio with a professional camera, capturing the perfect fusion of traditional attire and modern aesthetics, presenting a solemn yet gentle Eastern charm",
