        {
          "id": "krea2-4df286f86cba010168a01862",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣花园困倦坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the stone steps of an outdoor garden, wearing a gray knit sweater with a white shirt that slightly shows the cuffs underneath. She wears a dark short skirt below, her posture natural and relaxed. Her right hand rests gently on a table covered with white lace tablecloth, her expression slightly contemplative and gentle. The overall temperament is fresh and artistic. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, with the figure occupying the primary visual focus. The composition uses close-ups, with the head and upper body fully presented, the body slightly tilted, forming a natural S-shaped curve. The background is dense green plants, with various potted plants neatly arranged on the stone steps. There are clay pots, white ceramic pots, and gray cement pots. The plant species is diverse, including monstera, pothos, ivy, rose, and more. The leaves vary in shape—some broad and spreading, others delicate and delicate. The interplay of light and shadow creates a rich sense of layering. Sunlight streams in from the upper right of the painting, creating a soft backlight effect. The light penetrates through the gaps in the leaves, creating a warm and dreamy atmosphere. The halo fills the air. It creates a slight lens halo and bokeh effect, enhancing the cinematic texture of the image. The background blur is well handled, making the subject stand out while preserving environmental details. The colors are mainly green and gray, complemented by golden yellow tones of sunlight. The overall tone is warm and harmonious, and the image is full of life and poetic beauty, as if capturing a quiet afternoon moment. Like images shot with an old film camera, there is a slight graininess and the unique color tendencies of film, with slight vignetting at the edges of the frame, enhancing the retro feel. The composition is balanced and breathable, creating a tranquil, healing, and romantic atmosphere, as if time has frozen in this moment, allowing people to feel the beauty of life and inner peace",
