        {
          "id": "krea2-771bea584bf0017acdd17bdb",
          "alias": "单女白风衣码头忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on the concrete embankment of the harbor, wearing an off-white long trench coat. The fabric is slightly rough, with natural wrinkles and slight wear marks, presenting a practical everyday feel. The buttons of the trench coat are dark brown wood or imitation wood, harmonizing with the overall color scheme. The hem of the trench coat is slightly open, revealing the dark undergarment, with faint plaid or subtle patterns adding a touch of vintage charm. Around her neck is a thick brown scarf with soft fabric and tassel decorations. Some tassels hang down the front of the coat, giving a warm and casual look. Her hands gently rest on the rusty metal railing, her fingers long, nails neatly trimmed, veins clearly visible on the backs of her hands. The railing surface is covered with rust and peeling paint, showing a mottled texture of gray-green and reddish-brown intertwined, showing traces of long-term exposure to the damp sea breeze. She slightly tilts her head to the sky, as if feeling the gentle stroke of the sea breeze, with a faint natural sheen. The background is a vast sea surface, with a gray-blue hue. The waves sparkled, and in the distance sat a large cargo ship. The lower half of the hull was red, the upper half blue-green. The hull had some stains and fading, the chimneys towering, and white smoke or steam slowly rising from the top. The hull structure was complex, with various equipment and pipelines on deck, but due to the distance, they appeared somewhat blurry. The sky was pale gray or pale yellow, with thin clouds and soft light, like low-angle sunlight at dawn or dusk. The entire scene was enveloped in a warm golden halo, with light slanting down from the upper right. A clear contrast of light and shadow is formed, with natural transitions of light and shadow, creating a tranquil yet slightly melancholic atmosphere. The composition uses the rule of third: the figure is positioned on the left third of the frame, with the body slightly tilted and head facing right, the line of sight extending beyond the frame. The railing extends from the lower left corner to the upper right, forming a diagonal composition that enhances the depth and stability of the composition. The foreground features a rough concrete embankment and rusty railing, the middle ground features a female subject, and the background features the sea and cargo ships, creating distinct layers and a shallow depth of field. This makes the characters stand out clearly, the background blurred, and the visual focus is enhanced. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, off-white, and brown, paired with the cool blue sea and gray-white sky, creating a contrast of warm and cool colors. The visual balance is rich in emotional tension. The image style resembles film photography, with slight graininess and color shift, simulating the effects of vintage cameras. The lens may have used an 85mm prime lens with an aperture of about f/2.8, capturing delicate details and soft bokeh. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, contemplative, and nostalgic. It seems to capture an ordinary yet poetic moment, conveying a tranquility within solitude and contemplation of the future. The visuals contain no unnecessary decorations; all elements serve emotional expression. The composition is simple yet powerful, with soft and realistic light and shadow, like a still frame in an art film, allowing people to feel the slow flow of time and inner peace.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
