        {
          "id": "krea2-977244fccd13726f5d28e3b0",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤街道沉思站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman holding a vintage black film camera, focused on shooting through the viewfinder, her expression focused and slightly contemplative. She wore a simple black camisole with smooth arm lines. On her left wrist was a finely designed metal watch strap and several stackable thin bracelets. Her right hand held a camera, with a black woven strap tied to her wrist. The camera body clearly displayed the brand logo and round lens, presenting an overall posture that combined casual and professional style with everyday street photography. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right center of the composition, using medium to close shots with the characters occupying the main visual space. The background is a blurred urban building cluster, with red brick exterior walls and glass windows arranged in a staggered pattern. Warm yellow light filters through the windows, creating blurred light spots. In the distance, the light trails left by vehicles can be faintly seen, creating a hazy urban nighttime atmosphere. In the foreground is a blue-gray metal railing with clear edges and a slight reflection, adding depth and authenticity to the image. The middle ground features a woman and a camera. The background is completely blurred, with a shallow depth of field effect highlighting the subject. The composition presents an asymmetrical layout: the figure stands slightly at an angle, facing the left side of the frame, but the gaze is directed directly at the camera, creating strong visual guidance. The light comes from above, simulating natural light at dusk or dusk, soft and tinged with a cool blue tone. The warm yellow lighting in the background provides contrast, enhancing the layering of light and shadow. The overall color scheme is mainly cool blue and warm yellow, creating a striking contrast that creates a tranquil yet story-filled urban nightscape atmosphere. The image texture is similar to high-ISO film photography, with slight graininess and color shifts, as if an amateur is casually capturing an old camera on a city street, capturing an unintentional moment and conveying nostalgia, freedom, and poetic worldview. The images are rich in life atmosphere and artistic expression, as if freezing an ordinary yet moving city moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
