        {
          "id": "krea2-2f9f5394901b675ba28baeab",
          "alias": "单女空姐蓝制服机场温柔注视",
          "prompt": "A female flight attendant dressed in a deep blue aviation uniform sat on a red suede high chair in the airport VIP lounge. Her uniform was tailored perfectly, with a collar and cuffs adorned with striking red trim. On her chest was a badge printed with her name and company logo. Her white shirt had a neat collar and a red, white, and blue silk scarf tied to it. On her wrist was a silver metal watch strap and a pearl bracelet. Her posture was calm and approachable, her legs naturally crossed. Wearing black stockings, her legs are smooth and graceful. In the background is a huge floor-to-ceiling window, with clear blue skies and white clouds outside. A passenger plane is flying in the distance, with the runway and apron clearly visible. The interior is luxuriously decorated, with the edges of the golden metal bar table shining like a mirror. Behind the bar is a black wine cabinet displaying multiple bottles of alcoholic beverages. The floor in front of the bar is covered with a dark carpet featuring golden curved patterns. The ceiling recessed spotlights emit a warm yellow glow, contrasting with the natural light outside the window. The overall composition adopts a medium perspective. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, with a slightly turned body, and the gaze meets the viewer's. The finger guides the visual line to the sky outside the window, forming a strong visual guiding line. Light and shadow come from natural daylight outside the left window, while indoor lighting on the right casts gentle warm shadows on the bar counter and walls, creating a bright, transparent, yet intimate atmosphere. The main colors are deep blue, red, and gold, paired with white and gray, creating rich and harmonious layers, presenting an overall blend of high-end business and everyday professional life. It feels as if you've captured a real and heartwarming moment, with a strong sense of presence and the atmosphere of everyday life—like real scenes shot with a professional camera in natural light, with delicate texture, rich details, and full of storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
