        {
          "id": "krea2-2dda49bd1f59e72c9e18841f",
          "alias": "单女白外套街道沉思倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "She wore a loose off-white long-sleeved jacket over a light pink ruffled dress, khaki sports shorts, white over-the-knee socks, and a pair of platform white sneakers with red accents. She lowered her head slightly, her left hand naturally resting on her knee, with a thin red string tied around her wrist. Her posture was relaxed and slightly contemplative, her body leaning forward slightly, legs curled in front of her, ankles crossed, exuding a quiet and introspective state. In the foreground were rough gray cement curbs and asphalt pavement. The edges of the curbstones show obvious wear marks and irregular seams. Sunlight slants down from the upper left of the painting, casting long shadows on the ground and curbs, forming interwoven geometric patterns of light and shadow. The middle is the area where the girl is, squatting by the roadside. Behind her is a dense cluster of green shrubs, lush and layered, dotted with a few pale pink flowers. The flowers are naturally shaped, with light petals—some are budding, others fully bloomed. On the right side, a white metal rod stands vertically on the ground. The surface is smooth, reflecting faint light. The background is blurred green vegetation and a faintly visible street scene in the distance. Light filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting mottled shadows on and around the girl. The overall composition is shot at a low angle, with the angle close to the ground, enhancing the intimacy and realism of the image. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right, while the left side leaves a larger space to show the changes in environment and light. The visual guide extends from the curb lines and the shadows on the ground into the depths of the frame, ultimately converging at the figures. This creates a strong sense of perspective, while the plant's growth direction naturally guides the gaze toward the center. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with golden sunlight softly enveloping the entire scene, creating the unique laziness and tranquility of a summer afternoon. The colors are mainly warm yellow tones, complemented by green and white, creating a striking and harmonious contrast. The image has a slight film-like texture, with a subtle graininess and natural exposure transitions, as if captured with an old-fashioned camera on a clear day. The lens presents a slight shallow depth of field effect. The focus is clearly on the girl and the flower in her hand, the background gradually blurring, enhancing the prominence of the subject. The overall composition is full of life's vitality, combining the ordinary beauty of daily life with a touch of poetic loneliness and tenderness, like a moment frozen by time, recording the most subtle interaction between humans and nature.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
