        {
          "id": "krea2-f46e4d53393965c0a9f0ef6d",
          "alias": "单女樱花困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman gazes upward, as if gently inhaling the fragrance of cherry blossoms in the air. Her soft silhouette reveals a youthful purity and tranquility. She stands beneath a blooming cherry tree, with pink petals densely clustered on the branches. The flowers are tender and dripping—some budding, others fully in full bloom. The layers of pink and white petals glow in the sunlight, and the slender branches intertwine and extend, forming a natural arched flower corridor. Some branches stretch diagonally from the left side of the painting to the upper right of the painting. Others are lifted upward from below, creating rich layers and spatial depth. In the foreground are several clearly visible cherry blossom branches, covered with blooming flowers. One thicker branch slants diagonally through the lower left corner, guiding the viewer to the center of the scene. The background is a blurred cherry blossom forest, layers of pink flower seas. Distant flowers gradually blur into a hazy pink mist, and the sky appears pale blue, mixed with some white clouds. Light filters through the gaps, creating a mottled effect of light and shadow. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward angle, placing the figure slightly to the lower right of the frame to form a visual focal point. At the same time, the branches and flowers in the foreground are framed to enhance the sense of depth and envelopment, creating a smooth viewing path. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft and warm, with sunlight streaming down from above and sides, creating soft halos around the petal edges. The shadow transitions naturally, with the overall color palette mainly pink, white, and blue, featuring fresh and elegant color combinations that create a dreamy spring atmosphere with delicate texture. With a slight grainy film texture and retro filter effect, it feels like an image taken with an old-fashioned camera. The lens focal length is moderate, depth of field is well controlled, details in the near are sharp and clear, while the background in the distance is naturally blurred, presenting a soft bokeh effect. The entire scene is full of poetry and romance, conveying the peaceful beauty of harmonious coexistence between humans and nature. Like a flowing spring poetic painting, it evokes the gentleness and hope of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
