        {
          "id": "krea2-4212668afae9a54c1a1c4312",
          "alias": "单女粉外套街道冷淡站立出神",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of an outdoor wall, appearing casual and lazy, as if gazing into the distance or immersed in her own thoughts. Her overall aura is gentle and cool. She wears a light pink down jacket with a fluffy and soft jacket featuring full quilted textures. There is a small \"LA\" logo on the chest, and she wears a white hooded sweatshirt with red capital letters printed on it, arranged in a well-arranged manner to create a street-style trendy vibe. Her left hand is raised, her posture naturally relaxed. It presents an effortless sense of fashion. The background is a rough beige cement wall, with fine grainy textures and irregular textures, adding a rough urban feel. On the right side, there is a dark door frame edge, with clean lines contrasting with the wall. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space, heads slightly tilted, bodies positioned three-quarters of the side facing the camera, creating an intimate and private atmosphere. The slightly lower viewing angle enhances the visual presence of the characters, with soft and even lighting, from natural daylight, illuminated from the left front, with natural shadow transitions that highlight the contours. The folds of the garment create rich layers of light and shadow. The soft pink down jacket displays delicate gradient colors under the light, with the overall tone mainly soft pink, white, and beige, creating a striking contrast that creates a warm yet calm visual impression. The image shows no obvious artificial lighting traces, resembling a real scene shot with a daily phone, with slight noise and a low-saturation texture, enhancing realism and a sense of everyday life. The composition is stable and full of tension, with a moderate background blur that makes the subject stand out. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, gentle, and full of the lifestyle of modern urban youth, like a casual yet aesthetically pleasing everyday street photo, conveying an effortless beauty and a sense of youthful freedom",
