        {
          "id": "krea2-14b470c88cb069190f69d6c7",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫沙发俏皮坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the edge of a deep green velvet sofa, leaning slightly back with her head resting on her left arm. She wears a loose white long-sleeved shirt with a slightly open collar and naturally draped sleeves. She pairs the lower half with a brightly colored plaid pleated mini skirt, woven from red, blue, yellow, and black. The hem unfolds naturally, creating a soft curve. Her legs are pressed together, wearing a pair of pure white over-the-knee socks that fit tightly to the top of her thighs. The lines are smooth and natural, draping over her shoulders and adding a playful touch. The overall posture is relaxed and approachable, as if just waking from a relaxing afternoon nap. The background is dark wooden walls and partially blurred sofa backs, creating a private and cozy indoor atmosphere. Light streams in from the left side of the frame, creating a soft side lighting effect, while light shadows are cast on the right side, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and layering. The light and shadow transition is natural, with moderate contrast between light and shadow, highlighting the main subject. The composition uses close-ups, placing the person slightly to the right of the center of the frame. Using a shallow depth of field effect to blur the background, highlighting the main subject and creating a quiet, warm, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly white, green, and checkered, paired with soft warm lighting, presenting a beautiful moment from everyday life that is unintentional. Like images taken with an old film camera, it has a slight graininess and vintage texture. The edges of the frame are slightly darkened to enhance the nostalgic atmosphere, with rich details. From the pleats of the shirt to the texture of the plaid skirt to the soft texture of the socks, everything is clearly visible. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and authentic, as if you can hear soft breathing and distant music, immersing you in this tranquil moment",
