        {
          "id": "krea2-6c0b23d55555dcbd45dabec0",
          "alias": "单女黑和服公寓忧伤倚靠持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a black kimono with bright floral patterns, embroidered with red, orange, and yellow flowers and green leaves. The colors are rich and layered, with white lace revealing the cuffs and collar, adding a touch of softness and refinement. She wears a dark jacket with slightly drooping shoulders, forming natural pleats, appearing lazy and casual. Her fingers lightly touch her temples, her expression revealing a trace of fatigue and a faint melancholy. Her body leans against a bright red Japan Post mailbox. The mailbox has a smooth surface and a flat top, with a side marked with the phrase \"No graffiti allowed, No!\" The warning sign \"Graffiti\" also includes Japanese explanations and English translations, with clear font. The background shows the everyday scenes of Shibuya, Tokyo, with tall modern buildings lining the streets. Glass curtain walls reflect sunlight, and the facades display neutral tones such as beige and gray. Above the street hang pink and white banners printed with \"TOKYO 2020,\" indicating scenes from the Olympic Games. In the distance, blurred pedestrian figures can be seen—some walking, some talking. Streetlights are also scattered along the streets, traffic signs, and billboards. One circular blue sign features a white pattern, presenting the overall vibrancy and bustle of urban life. However, the focus is on the foreground, with a low-angle downward shot. The figure is positioned slightly in the center on the left side of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The mailbox serves as a foreground element to enhance the sense of depth. The middle ground is the interactive relationship between the figure and the mailbox, while the background is blurred through shallow depth of field, highlighting the main subject. Light comes from the upper right. It belongs to the warm afternoon sun, with sunlight filtering through the gaps between buildings, creating contrasts of light and dark. At the same time, a slight reflection appears on the mailbox surface, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly red, black, and pink, paired with neutral architectural tones, creating a strong visual impact yet maintaining harmony. The image has a strong sense of realism and artistry, resembling a street photo taken with an amateur camera, carrying a sense of everyday life and the beauty of a moment captured by chance. The details are rich, the layers distinct, and the transition of light and shadow is natural. Filled with storytelling and emotional tension, it presents a unique atmosphere where tradition and fashion blend in a modern city",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
