        {
          "id": "krea2-0971407de38ef8b5d14192ab",
          "alias": "单女白长裤广场俏皮坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits indoors, her expression naturally relaxed and approachable. Her overall aura is fresh, sweet, and tinged with a playful touch. She wears a bright red short-sleeved fitted short top with a fine texture and a slight sheen. The square neckline accentuates her long neckline, and the chest has obvious pleats, enhancing the garment's three-dimensional and fitted fit. She pairs off-white high-waisted pants with a flat and crisp fabric, and a black leather belt at the waist. The belt buckle is made of gold metal with a round ring design, featuring exquisite details and a vintage vibe. She wears an orange silk scarf on her head, soft and smooth in texture, its color contrasting sharply with the red top, harmoniously unified. After tying a knot at the top of her head, the scarf falls behind her head, adding a touch of movement and color layering. The background is a soft indoor space. On the left side stands a tall green palm plant, with broad, spreading leaves and slightly naturally curled edges, clearly visible veins, and the plant's green contrasts with the red of the figure. The orange color creates a strong visual contrast, creating a vibrant atmosphere. On the right is a light gray curtain, made of lightweight and transparent fabric with natural vertical folds. Light streams through the curtains into the interior, creating a soft light and shadow effect. The texture and texture of the curtains appear delicate and realistic under the light. Behind the figure is a beige sofa or chair with a slight fabric texture and natural shadows, adding spatial depth to the image. The entire composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the person positioned slightly to the left center of the frame. The head is slightly tilted, the body slightly tilted to the camera, the posture is natural and comfortable, and the gaze communicates directly with the viewer, forming a strong emotional connection. The foreground is the upper body and part of the arm, with clear details. The middle ground includes her full body outline and surrounding plants and furniture, while the background features curtains and a blurred indoor environment. The layers are distinct, the blend of solid and void, and the composition is balanced and stable. The line of sight extends along her line of sight to the plants and curtains in the background, creating a smooth visual flow. Light and shadow come from the upper right of the frame, belonging to soft natural light creating delicate transitions between light and dark, with soft shadows that are soft and unobtrusive. The folds on the clothing also show subtle light and shadow changes, creating an overall warm and tranquil atmosphere full of life. The color tones are warm and bright, with the warm red and orange tones contrasting with the cool green tones, enhancing the visual impact of the image while maintaining overall harmony. The image style combines fashion with a sense of everyday warmth, as if you were casually shooting a real scene at home with a mid-range digital camera, with slight noise and authentic color reproduction. Without excessive embellishment, it preserves the original texture and warmth, presenting a natural, authentic, and emotionally rich visual style",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
