        {
          "id": "krea2-fd2a2335acc3dabcde5e1de1",
          "alias": "单女黑毛衣霓虹夜景俏皮坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits indoors, slightly tilting her head toward the camera, her expression natural and relaxed, with a touch of laziness and playfulness. Her movements are smooth and full of life. She wears a black low-neck inner top and a loose black cardigan, adorned with a small metallic badge decoration. The lower half is paired with a light-colored plaid short skirt. The overall look is simple, fashionable, yet sexy. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the center, with a slightly tilted body forming a natural S-shaped curve. The composition uses a medium shot close-up. The background is a typical home or studio environment. On the left is a dark plaid fabric chair, on the right is a computer case, with transparent side panels surrounded by blue LED rings that emit a cool-toned halo. Behind are blurred bookshelves, monitors, and various electronic devices, creating a space where technology and lifestyle blend together. The light mainly comes from the front and side soft lights, creating a uniform and soft illumination. The neon lights and screen reflections in the background add rich layers of color to the image. The overall lighting and shadows mainly use warm and cool contrasts. The foreground figures are outlined by warm frontal lighting, while the background is dominated by blue-purple tones, forming a distinct visual distinction. The color tone is cool yet warm, with a quiet and intimate atmosphere, as if capturing an unintentional moment in daily life. The composition emphasizes symmetry and balance, with natural postures and well-handled background elements, enriching the scene information without overpowering the main focus. Overall, it presents a visual style that combines artistic and realistic feel. High-quality portraits shot with professional cameras have strong visual appeal and emotional resonance. The image texture is delicate, color saturation is moderate, details are clear, and light and shadow transitions are natural, providing an immersive viewing experience. It feels as if you can feel the air flowing in the room and the faint hum of electrical appliances. The entire scene exudes the lifestyle of modern urban youth, combining the chill of technology with the warmth of personal life. The composition is compact but not crowded, with just the right amount of blank space, highlighting the character's presence and emotional expression The overall atmosphere is quiet and full of storytelling, like a prep moment before a live stream or a relaxing moment after work coming home, full of the authenticity of life and youthful energy. The footage shows no obvious post-production traces, preserving the original shooting texture, like documentary-style photos taken with a high-resolution camera under indoor lighting, emphasizing realism and natural beauty. The characters' postures are relaxed, expressions are lively, body language is rich, and it conveys a confident and composed emotional state. The electronic devices and lighting design in the background suggest that this is a typical living space in the digital age, blending both work and leisure attributes. The overall visual language is simple and powerful, with harmonious color combinations and skillful use of light and shadow, creating an atmosphere that is both modern and inviting. It makes one want to explore the story behind this space. The details are rich, and the gradients and reflections of lighting in the background are handled with great precision, presenting a visual effect that combines sophistication and approachability. The composition is stable, and the viewing angle is slightly low This enhances the intimacy and immersion of the characters. The layers of light and shadow are distinct, the foreground is bright, and the background is dark, creating a strong contrast that highlights the main figure. The colors are mainly black, white, and gray, accented with blue, purple, and red light sources, creating a visual rhythm of intertwined warmth and coolness. The overall composition is clean and crisp, with no unnecessary distractions. Every detail serves the theme, presenting a pursuit of a minimalist yet sophisticated aesthetic. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of tension, combining static beauty with dynamic hints, leaving a lasting impression",
