        {
          "id": "krea2-48e211647908f37a0dec6580",
          "alias": "单女女仆黑女仆装酒廊坐演奏",
          "prompt": "A silver-haired woman dressed in a black-and-white maid outfit sits on a lounge chair by the white pool. She wears a black bikini top, layered with a white maid apron decorated with ruffles. The collar and cuffs of the apron are delicately pleated, a thin black belt is tied at the waist, black tight stockings below, and on her feet are blue high-heeled sandals with high heels and metal buckles on the uppers. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, her legs crossed. One hand rested naturally on her leg, while the other held a black toy gun. The gun body was modernly designed with red decorative lines. She sat on a white plastic lounge chair, which had a smooth surface and rounded edges. The background was a blurred green tree and blue sky, with sunlight filtering through the leaves casting dappled shadows, creating a warm and tranquil summer atmosphere. In the distance, you could see the pool's tiled wall, made of small black and white blocks joined together to form geometric patterns. Next to it was a red pole and some white pipe fittings. The entire composition centers on the person, shot in medium shots, with a slightly lower angle highlighting the figure's posture and clothing details. The light comes from the upper left, soft and bright, making the silhouette clear and shadows natural. The overall color tone is fresh and vibrant, full of youthful energy, as if capturing a leisurely and carefree time on a clear afternoon. The image has strong visual guidance, then follows the lines of her body to the toy gun in her hand, and finally spreads to the surrounding environment. The composition is balanced and layered The foreground features people and lounge chairs, the middle is the facilities by the pool and part of the water, and the background is dense woods and sky. The color contrasts are striking, and the black-and-white costumes create a strong contrast with the bright surroundings, enhancing the visual impact. The lighting and shadow effects are delicate, with natural transitions between highlights and shadows in sunlight, creating a realistic and vivid texture. The entire image presents a beautiful moment from everyday life, combining the fantasy flair of anime-style role-playing with the realism of real scenes. Like precious images casually taken with an amateur camera, they are full of the spirit of life and artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
