        {
          "id": "krea2-6f0e07be1e05da18df57df2f",
          "alias": "单女武士蓝和服森林冷淡站立比耶",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a deep blue traditional kimono stands on an outdoor forest path, raising both hands above her head to grip a Japanese samurai sword. The hilt is made of dark wood, the blade reflecting a cold metallic sheen in the sunlight. She slightly lowers her head and gazes ahead, exuding a restrained sense of strength and elegant temperament. The kimono is made of thick cotton-linen fabric with delicate textures, showing subtle folds and shadow changes under the light. A wide belt in the same color family is tied around the waist, tied into a delicate knot to highlight a slender waistline. The composition uses a mid-field perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, body slightly turned to the side, arms raised to form a symmetrical and powerful V-shaped structure, guiding the gaze upward to the blade, creating strong visual tension. The background is a blurry green forest, leaves gently swaying in the breeze, sunlight filtering through the branches and leaves, creating a mottled and dazzling effect of light and shadow. The ground is covered with fallen leaves and soil. It presents a natural brownish-yellow tone, creating an overall environment that is tranquil and Zen-like. Light comes from above, simulating the soft afternoon sunlight. At the same time, natural transitions of light and shadow are created in the kimono folds, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The foreground is blurred to highlight the main figure, while the background uses a shallow depth of field to present bokeh effects, focusing entirely on the interaction between the figure and the knife. The painting uses blue, green, and brown as the main colors, paired with warm golden halos, creating a visual atmosphere that is both classical and modern. The overall style combines realism and artistry, resembling a high-quality portrait shot with professional photography equipment, featuring a slight film texture and grainy details. The lens is an 85mm prime portrait lens with an f/1.8 aperture, capturing excellent background blur and character clarity. The composition is rigorous, layered and harmonious, conveying a power in tranquility and an aesthetic fusion of tradition and modernity. The image is filled with symbolic meanings of Eastern Zen and samurai spirit. It also preserves the warmth and authenticity of everyday life. Like an amateur accidentally capturing a moment in the park with a phone or entry-level camera, it unexpectedly captures a beauty beyond the ordinary. The entire scene exudes a gentle yet determined aura, evoking inner peace and control over the outside world. The images are rich in detail, from the woven texture of the kimono to the subtle reflections on blades, and even the halo outlines at the edges of leaves, all carefully depicted to present a highly realistic visual experience. The overall atmosphere is quiet and solemn, with a touch of poetry and philosophical reflection, as if telling a story about cultivation, self-awareness, and inner growth. This atmosphere comes not only from the combination of visual elements, but also from the spiritual state conveyed by the characters' postures. She is not displaying martial prowess, but expressing a belief and way of being. Every element in the painting—knives, clothing, light, shadows, trees, and ground—collectively constructs a complete emotional world, ultimately forming a visual work that is both profound and warm",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
