        {
          "id": "krea2-9c2ac47f97c853de95b73e7b",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣厨房沉思坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a white kitchen countertop, wearing a loose gray chunky knit sweater. The twisted knit pattern is clearly visible, with natural pleats and drapes on the sleeves and body. The sweater length reaches her thighs, revealing legs clad in black stockings. The surface of the stockings is smooth and slightly reflective, and the leg lines are smooth and natural. She sits cross-legged, toes slightly raised, her posture relaxed and elegant, facing the camera with a hint of laziness and contemplation. Her right hand is raised, On his ring finger is a small ring, and on his wrist is a slender silver necklace. The overall design is simple yet textured, with a white square tile wall with even black gaps between the tiles forming a neat grid pattern. On the left countertop are two bottles of seasonings: one with a green label of olive oil and the other in a transparent glass bottle of syrup. The label on the bottle is clearly visible, and on the right is a metal storage tube containing scissors, a whisk, and other kitchen tools. The countertop is clean and tidy, with soft and even lighting, illuminated from the upper front, creating a natural transition of shadows. The texture details of sweaters and the sheen of stockings are clearly presented. The overall composition is centered and symmetrical, with the figure positioned in the center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The foreground is the figure's body and countertop, the middle ground is the objects and parts of the walls on both sides, and the background is a complete tiled wall. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, carrying the atmosphere of everyday life, as if captured in a real moment shot in an ordinary family kitchen. The image has a strong sense of everyday life and intimacy. It retains the delicate texture of artistic photography, with gray and white as the main color scheme, accented by the dark black stockings and the bright green bottle body. The contrast is sharp yet not jarring, and the overall image is clean and crisp, full of lifestyle aesthetics. It's like high-quality photos taken with a professional camera in natural light, or like casual snapshots of real life. It's both fashionable and simple, creating a comfortable, relaxed, and slightly private atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
