        {
          "id": "krea2-ea4ac4bd1399978775362cdc",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙公园害羞坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman sits inside the cabin of a nighttime amusement park on the Ferris wheel, wearing a gentle yet slightly shy smile, presenting a serene and charming demeanor. She wears a light pink spaghetti strap dress made of light and soft material, with a sheer texture and delicate ruffle decorations. The cuffs and neckline are decorated with fine pleats, giving the overall look fresh and sweet. Her right hand gently rests on the metal railing inside the cabin, while her left hand hangs naturally, her posture elegant and relaxed. Her body turns slightly, showing off graceful shoulder and neck lines and soft contours. In the foreground is the metal structure frame of the Ferris wheel, made of silver stainless steel, with a smooth and reflective surface. Several vertical and diagonal support rods form geometric lines, with a thick pillar extending from the right side to the top, forming a visual guiding line. The left side also has similar structural elements. These metal components reflect a soft sheen under the light, adding depth and modernity to the image. The middle view is a blurred view of the other cabins and visitors of the Ferris wheel, with the towering Ferris wheel tower visible in the distance. Rows of warm yellow and pink LED strings are arranged above, forming vertical light strips that intertwine with blue, purple, and white neon lights scattered across the sky, creating a dreamy light spot effect. Some lights appear as circular or oval blurred halos due to shallow depth of field, creating a strong sense of depth and atmosphere. The entire scene is set at night, with the sky a deep dark blue illuminated by colorful lights, interlacing light and shadow, with warm and rich colors. The main light source is the surrounding artificial lighting. This includes the lights on the Ferris wheel, streetlights in the background, and neon signs on buildings. The light is soft and directional, making the contours clear and enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color scheme is mainly pink, warm yellow, and light purple, complemented by cool blues for contrast, creating a romantic, warm, and slightly mysterious night strolling atmosphere. The composition uses a layered layout combining close-ups with medium and long shots. The metal frame in the foreground serves as a frame. Drawing the viewer's gaze to the people while using lines to guide the visual depth into the frame, the background bokeh highlights not only enrich the details but also enhance the sense of space and dreaminess. The overall photography style resembles professional portrait shooting, but retains the natural texture of everyday equipment, as if captured with a phone or portable camera. The image has slight graininess and realistic lens distortion, giving the image a sense of life and authenticity. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and beautiful, filled with youthful romance and the warmth of memories. Like an ordinary yet precious night fragment frozen in time.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
