        {
          "id": "krea2-a6463c8eda946f3ff42d4c75",
          "alias": "单女黑短裙公寓忧伤坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the edge of the windowsill, her body slightly turned to the camera, her legs crossed and naturally hanging down, her posture elegant and relaxed. She wears a semi-transparent leopard-print long-sleeve top made of light and flowing fabric, with natural pleats. The shoulder design features ruffled decorations to add soft details. She pairs a black high-waisted short skirt with a smooth and slightly sheen material, creating a textured contrast with dark stockings. The stockings cling tightly to the leg line, combining fashion and intimate atmosphere, with a subtle expression of contemplation and detachment. Light pours in from the left window, creating a soft side illumination, while subtle shadows are cast on the right side of the body, enhancing the sense of depth. The background is a large window, with the outlines of green plants faintly visible outside. Sunlight filters through the glass, creating a slight scattered glow effect. The window frame is simple and white, and the windowsill is also white, with a clean and flat surface. Below, there is a black grille for ventilation. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure occupying the center to the right. Diagonal lines guide the view, extending from the feet to the head. This creates a sense of visual flow. The foreground highlights the details of the figure's legs and hands, the middle shot focuses on the torso and upper body, and the background is blurred to create spatial layering. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, carrying the tranquility of morning or afternoon sunlight. The main tones are beige, gray-black, and white, harmoniously unified and delicate, with a delicate and realistic image texture, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retaining the natural atmosphere of daily life. It is like capturing a moment with a portable camera, full of a sense of life and artistic beauty, with rich image details. All these elements together create a tranquil, gentle, and slightly melancholic atmosphere, allowing people to feel the pause of time and the accumulation of emotions",
