        {
          "id": "krea2-807cbf85116bf8988e3e6b36",
          "alias": "单女红浴袍沙发严肃坐摆拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a dark wooden armchair, wearing a red floral short-sleeved robe. The fabric is light and soft, featuring delicate white floral patterns. The collar is slightly open, revealing the collarbone. Her legs are crossed and let them hang naturally—right leg on top and left below. She rests barefoot on the chair seat, toes relaxed naturally. Her right hand rests gently on her right knee, while her left hand rests naturally on her left calf. Her posture is elegant and casual, her expression gentle with a hint of laziness. Her overall aura is gentle, intellectual, yet approachable. She sits by the window inside. The background is a bright white curtain, with sunlight streaming through the semi-transparent sheer curtain from the left, creating a soft, diffused light that creates a warm and tranquil atmosphere. On the right, you can see a corner of the dark heavy curtain, contrasting with the brightness on the left side and enhancing the sense of spatial layering. The chairs are retro in style, with a deep brown wooden frame and clean, smooth lines. The seat surface is covered with black-and-white plaid fabric cushions with clear texture and authentic texture. The floor is a dark gray carpet, thick with slightly curled edges. The composition uses a mid-field perspective. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, leaving a large amount of blank space on the left to highlight the light source and atmosphere, creating a natural flow of sight. The direction of light and shadow is clear, with the main light coming from the front left, soft and even. The shadows are subtle but present, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall color palette is mainly warm red, off-white, and dark brown, with harmonious unity, presenting a realistic moment captured in daily life. It feels like an improvised portrait taken with an old film camera, with slight graininess and natural color shift, and a moderate lens focal length. The depth of field is well controlled, the foreground is clear, the background slightly blurred, highlighting the main subject. The entire composition is filled with a sense of life and privacy, conveying a quiet, comfortable, and relaxing home atmosphere, like the truest self in the afternoon sunlight. There are no signs of deliberate posing, only natural emotions and warmth. The image details are rich, and even the refraction of light on the curtains is clearly visible, creating a highly infectious visual experience",
