        {
          "id": "krea2-cff1ae416ed63828b84b65c2",
          "alias": "单女制服户外忧伤坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a Japanese-style high school girls' uniform sits on the outdoor asphalt road. She wears a dark gray knit cardigan, a white collared shirt, and a red-and-white striped tie. She wears a gray pleated short skirt paired with black tights and black leather shoes. Her legs are naturally crossed, right hand resting lightly on her knee, left hand hanging beside her, body slightly turned to the camera, head slightly tilted, looking straight ahead. Her posture is relaxed and natural, as if she has just finished a day of study or paused briefly on the way home. The foreground features clear road textures and the lower body outline of the character; the middle ground shows the main subject and part of the road extension; the background features blurred green shrubs and distant blurred building silhouettes; the sky is dyed a warm golden hue by the sunset. Sunlight slants down from the upper right of the frame, casting long shadows on the ground and creating a clear contrast of light and shadow. The light is soft and layered. The overall composition is shot at a low angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the lower left of the frame, leaving a large space on the right to highlight the environment and atmosphere. It creates a tranquil, lonely atmosphere with a touch of youthful melancholy. The color palette is mainly warm yellow and orange, blended with cool tones like deep gray and black for sharp contrast. The image has a film-like texture, with slight graininess and natural overexposure, reminiscent of a real moment captured by an old camera at dusk. The lens is an 85mm prime portrait lens with an f/1.8 aperture for a shallow depth of field, making the subject clear and the background completely blurred, filling the overall image with a sense of story and poetic beauty. Like a quiet scene in a movie, it records an ordinary yet unforgettable moment in youth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
