        {
          "id": "krea2-db364c006431e4dca2eff7cc",
          "alias": "单女红和服街道害羞坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits sideways on a metal railing beside a city street, wearing a red-and-white kimono-style yukata printed with flowing geometric patterns, presenting the texture and design of traditional Japanese fabrics. A deep red wide belt is tied around her waist, outlining a slender waistline. The hem hangs naturally, revealing a section of white over-the-knee socks and ankles. The overall look combines Eastern aesthetics with a modern fresh vibe. Her expression is calm yet slightly shy, as if lost in her own thoughts. Her right hand gently rests on the silver-gray metal railing, her fingers long and her posture elegant, while her left hand hangs naturally at one side of her body, the whole body slightly tilted, creating a dynamic sense of balance. In the foreground is a clear metal railing with slight reflections and wear marks on its surface, presenting the authentic details of urban life. The middle ground is the main figure, occupying the main position in the composition. The composition uses a side view, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame. The left side is reserved to display the background environment. The background is a blurred city streetscape, where you can see blurred trees, buildings, traffic signs, and distant billboards. One of the trees is covered with pink and white cherry blossoms, creating a spring atmosphere. The sky displays a soft grayish-white tone, with evenly and bright light, characteristic of cloudy or early morning diffuse light. The overall light and shadow are soft without strong shadows, with warm and harmonious tones. The overall composition presents a peaceful, gentle, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. It seems to capture an ordinary yet poetic moment. The camera uses a large aperture to create a distinct bokeh effect in the background, highlighting the main subject while preserving the authenticity of the environment. The composition is simple yet layered, with visual guidance starting from the foreground railing and finally stopping on the cherry blossom trees faintly visible in the background, creating a natural visual flow. The overall style combines realism and artistry, like a casual photo taken with a regular camera on the street, but due to just the right composition, The light and shadow and emotional expression make the scene especially captivating. The colors are mainly red, white, and gray, complemented by soft pink and green, creating a unified and rich overall palette that creates a visual experience that is both everyday and dreamy",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
