        {
          "id": "krea2-e798d6b3f6251c8240f6666b",
          "alias": "单女透视衬衫城市微笑坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor metal grille platform, naturally draped over her shoulders, wearing a gentle and serene smile, looking directly at the camera. Her right hand rests naturally on her knee, her body slightly leaning to the side, her posture elegant and relaxed. She wears a long-sleeved shirt with a beige silk texture, the neckline slightly open, revealing a light-colored lace camisole underneath. The hem of the shirt is casually tucked into a black high-waisted short skirt, the skirt fits her body with smooth lines, her legs long and straight, wearing black sheer stockings. Her ankles are slender, her feet are bare, and her toes naturally stretch out. Next to it is a pair of black pointed high heels with moderate heel height and brand logos on the upper. The overall design is simple and stylish, full of the intellect and charm of urban women. The background is a dense green plant wall, with layers of leaves and varying shades of color, presenting a rich sense of layering. In front of the plant wall is a black metal railing made of thick columns and beams forming geometric lines that echo the metal grille on the floor. The grid is grid-like, slightly rough on the surface, reflecting a faint sheen and providing soft and even light. From the front slightly above, it resembles diffused light on a cloudy day or early morning, with no obvious shadows. The wrinkles of the clothing are clearly visible, the sheer texture of the stockings and the delicate lines of the legs are delicately presented. The overall atmosphere is fresh and tranquil, with a subtle artistic vibe. The composition uses a central shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. The foreground highlights the main figure and shoes, the middle ground features a metal platform and railing, and the background is a wall of greenery. The layers are distinct, extending along the body lines to the legs and shoes, then returning to the background greenery, forming a complete visual loop. The color tones are mainly beige, black, and green, harmoniously and unified. The overall image is clean and crisp, rich in detail, and has the feel of professional photography. It feels as if shooting with a full-frame camera paired with a large-aperture prime lens. The depth of field is precisely controlled, the background is naturally blurred, and the focus is on the subject, while preserving the readability of environmental elements. The overall image presents a subtle beauty from everyday life, both artistic and realistic, like capturing a moment in a city park or rooftop garden. The lighting is warm and soft, creating a relaxed and pleasant atmosphere that lets people feel the beauty of youth and the comfort of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
