          "id": "krea2-5e18e5e19fdf68609fd8d53f",
          "alias": "单女衬衫家中自信蹲持花",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed exquisitely and fashionably squats gracefully on a light-colored wooden floor, wearing fine-framed glasses that reflect soft light, adding a touch of intellect and mystery. Her makeup is refined and natural, presenting a calm yet slightly alluring aura. She wears a gray, sheer-textured long-sleeved shirt with ruffled pleats at the collar and cuffs. The fabric is thin and has a slight sheer effect, subtly revealing the outline of the inner garment. She pairs a high-waisted black leather mini skirt on the bottom. The skirt is smooth and glossy, clinging to the body's curves to outline the perfect hip line. The hem is slightly raised, highlighting her long legs. She wears black stockings, made of fine and even fabric, giving a natural semi-transparent texture. Her legs are crossed and bent, with the right leg in front and left leg behind. She wears black high heels, with long, straight heels and a clasp design on the upper. The overall look exudes a sexy and capable urban feminine vibe. She folds her hands in front of herself, and in her right hand, she holds a gold-handled item. On her wrist, she wears a white pearl bracelet, with pale pink nail polish on her fingers. The details are exquisitely detailed, with the main subject positioned slightly to the center, composed from a medium perspective, with the figure occupying the main part of the frame. The background is a simple and bright indoor space, the walls are pure white, decorated with simple square grooves. On the left is a white fireplace stand, on which sits a table lamp with an off-white lampshade and several potted green plants. Beside it, a bouquet of small white flowers is placed in a transparent glass bottle. On the right, a corner of a pink upholstered chair is faintly visible. The floor is covered with light wood grain flooring, with clear and natural texture. The entire scene is well-lit and soft, with the light source coming from the left side of the painting, simulating the diffuse effects of natural or indoor lighting, creating a warm and bright atmosphere. Light and shadow cast from the left side of the figure, with soft and unobtrusive shadows, especially on the sides and legs of her body, creating a subtle sense of three-dimensionality. Objects in the background, such as the desk lamp, plants, and fireplace stand, are moderately blurred, highlighting the main figure while maintaining the realism of the environment. Forming the visual center, the color scheme is dominated by gray, black, and white, accented with soft shades like brown, pink, and green, creating a sophisticated and harmonious visual experience. The overall atmosphere blends modern urban fashion, feminine elegance, and a touch of intimate ambiguity, as if captured from a carefully planned daily shoot, like real moments recorded by a professional camera in a home environment. The images are rich in detail, realistic in texture, and with clear light and shadow layers, presenting a realistic style that combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life",
