        {
          "id": "krea2-2bd79e26f2fbd4427ccc9c82",
          "alias": "单女上衣椅上专注坐喝",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an orange folding chair, wearing a loose long-sleeved dark green top and matching pants. Her legs are curled up in front, her bare feet naturally resting on the edge of the chair, her posture relaxed and casual, gently sipping with focused and peaceful expression. The dog's fur glows warmly in the light, forming a close interaction with its owner. In the foreground is a lush green plant. The leaves are slender and sword-shaped, extending upward from the lower left corner of the painting. Some leaves cover the legs and the edges of the chair, adding depth and visual guidance. The green of the plants contrasts with the orange chairs and white walls in the background, echoing the women's green clothing. The center features the main images of the woman and the dog, as well as their indoor environment, including a red folding chair, a green calendar on the wall, hanging cartoon character posters, and another anime-style movie poster. The calendar features clear date arrangements and colorful patterns. Next to it hangs a small spider plant with slender leaves hanging from a black woven hanging pouch, adding a touch of life. On the right is a desk with a white monitor on it. The screen is off, with a black microphone stand and a silver microphone in front of it. On the table are blue packaging boxes, tissue boxes, and other miscellaneous items. Wires hang messily, connecting various devices. The background is a light beige wall, and the overall tone is soft. The spatial layout is compact but not crowded. The composition uses close-up perspectives, with the figure occupying the center-left position, the body slightly tilted, forming a natural diagonal line composition that enhances dynamism. The distinct spatial layers are formed between the plants in the foreground and the figures in the center. Visual guidance is guided from the leaves of the green plants in the background to the figures in the middle of the background, then extends to the details of the wall and tabletop. Light and shadow come from the upper right of the frame, possibly natural light streaming through the window. The light is soft and even, without strong shadows, making the entire scene bright and cozy. The colors are mainly green, orange, and white, accented with black and brown, creating a comfortable atmosphere for everyday life. The overall feeling is like real-life moments captured with a regular camera or phone, with a strong sense of documentary authenticity and intimacy. The images are full of life's atmosphere, conveying a relaxed, relaxed, and warm mood of spending time with pets. You can almost hear gentle breathing and subtle sounds from afar, allowing people to feel the beauty and tranquility of ordinary days",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
