        {
          "id": "krea2-06f1700c36728c8a3e2c888e",
          "alias": "单女白礼服摄影棚困倦站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways, slightly tilting her head toward the upper right of the frame. Her skin is fair and delicate, radiating a healthy glow. She wears a beautifully designed white backless gown, with lightweight sheer gauze pleats on the shoulders and back, forming an elegant ruffled shape. The straps are as thin as silk threads, extending from the back to the chest, creating a romantic and flowing feel. Her right hand gently holds a bouquet of pure white flowers, mainly white lisquamos, dotted with small daisies and green leaves. The petals are layered and fresh, elegant. The bouquet is gently held in the hand, fingers slender and long, nails neatly trimmed to a natural pale pink. is a white three-dimensional floral earring echoing the bouquet. The petals are layered and the center is adorned with gold, adding a touch of refinement. The background is a light blue blurred setting with delicate textures and light gradients, resembling watercolor gradients or silk textures, creating a dreamy, hazy atmosphere. Light softly falls from the front left of the painting, creating warm highlights that enhance the three-dimensional effect. The overall composition uses a medium shot close-up, with the figure occupying about two-thirds of the left side of the frame. The head is slightly tilted, and the gaze guides the viewer to look outward, creating a visual extension. The foreground clearly highlights the main details, while the middle shot shows bouquets and some clothing. The background is blurred to focus on the figure, accented with a touch of green. The overall tone is fresh and pure, full of poetry and romance. The painting presents a serene and elegant beauty, as if capturing a moment of tranquility, with natural and soft light and shadow transitions. Without harsh contrasts, it creates a warm and dreamy atmosphere, like a professional studio using softboxes and reflectors for careful lighting. The lens is a large-aperture prime lens for a shallow depth of field effect, making the subject stand out, the background blurred, and the image texture delicate, presenting a premium visual experience. It also retains slight film graininess and natural color shift, simulating the realistic texture of everyday amateur equipment. The overall style blends the characteristics of wedding portraits and artistic portraits, combining a sense of ceremony with a sense of everyday life. It conveys an emotional tone of gentleness, innocence, and anticipation",
