        {
          "id": "krea2-84e54016a6bf3f4de880db54",
          "alias": "单女橙T恤桌边俏皮坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at a wooden dining table, appearing both casual and refined, looking directly at the camera with a playful and innocent look. She holds a golden pancake in her mouth. The surface of the muffin is slightly caramelized, with crispy edges and a soft, porous interior, presenting an enticing texture. She wears an orange-red knitted camisole with thin straps outlining her graceful collarbones. The pleats on her chest are clearly visible, and the material is soft and elastic. Her right hand holds a silver metal fork, its tip gently touching the pile of muffins on the plate. Her left hand rested naturally on the table, fingers long, nails neatly trimmed. The plate was round with orange-red trims echoing the color of her top. On the plate was a thick stack of muffins, layer upon layer, smooth on the surface, golden in color, emitting a warm luster. The background was a cozy family kitchen. In the blurred background, an old TV could be seen, its screen turned gray, and next to it was a vase holding several bright yellow tulips, with plump petals and bright colors. Adding a touch of vitality to the scene: the kitchen walls are light brown, with faint cabinets and countertops visible. The overall tone is warm, creating a comfortable and welcoming atmosphere. Light softly enters from the left, creating a natural side lighting effect. The shadow transitions are smooth and three-dimensional, highlighting the texture and contours of the skin. The foreground features muffins and tableware, and the center is the main subject. The background blur treatment focuses the focus on the people and food, attracting viewers' attention. The entire scene is full of life, as if capturing a beautiful everyday moment, as if shot with an old film camera. The image quality is slightly grainy, color saturation is moderate, and the tone is warm, evoking a retro nostalgia. The image is rich in detail and layered, giving a sense of authenticity, warmth, and warmth. It is as if you can smell the aroma of muffins and enjoy that leisurely morning time",
