        {
          "id": "krea2-6dc984b4db762b17da2cd371",
          "alias": "单女米外套街道微笑倚靠持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman rides a red Kawasaki Z650 motorcycle, wearing a beige jacket and blue pleated skirt, carrying a black backpack, and a white retro-style motorcycle helmet adorned with red and blue stripes. She wears a bright smile, grips the handlebars steadily, leans slightly forward, and looks relaxed and confident, exuding youthful dynamism and a sense of freedom. The motorcycle is designed as a classic vintage street bike, with the red fuel tank printed with the \"KAWASAKI\" brand logo and white striped decorations. The front round headlights are bright and clear, dotted with orange turn signals, the silver front fork and engine components are exquisitely detailed, the exhaust pipe and rear suspension system are clearly visible, and the body lines are smooth, presenting a strong Japanese motorcycle cultural atmosphere. The scene is set beside a wide city road with smooth surfaces, white traffic markings clearly marking lane boundaries, a blurred white guardrail and distant city building silhouettes in the background, a pale blue sky with soft and even lighting, creating a warm and bright afternoon atmosphere. The composition uses a medium shot. The main figure and motorcycle occupy the center-left position, forming a visual focal point. The foreground highlights the front details of the motorcycle and the character's posture, while the middle ground shows the full body and parts of the vehicle. The background blur enhances spatial layering, and light and shadow come from the upper right. Sunlight falls on the figure and the car, creating natural transitions between highlights and shadows. The overall color scheme is mainly warm tones. The red motorcycle contrasts sharply with the beige jacket and blue skirt, creating a harmonious and pleasing color scheme, giving the image a strong sense of everyday documentary. It feels like a professional camera capturing real moments of life. The lens captures cyclists parked on the street, with balanced and story-rich compositions, extending to the distant, open background, creating a leisurely, hopeful travel atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and lifelike, with rich details. From helmet reflections to shoelace textures, everything is clearly visible, presenting a high-level photographic effect, like a carefully composed work of art—combining the refined beauty of commercial advertising with the authentic warmth of everyday life",
          "description": "",
