        {
          "id": "krea2-1930ee1574c9bed6e9a72ffd",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣展示",
          "prompt": "A Japanese female student wearing a white knit cardigan and a deep blue pleated skirt bent over to adjust her shoes under the spring sunshine, gently grasping the heel with her right hand and naturally extending her left hand at her side, striking an elegant and relaxed posture. The navy collar edges of the cardigan were trimmed with blue-green trim, with delicate fabric textures visible. The skirt swayed gently in the breeze, with a background of blooming pink cherry trees. Petals drifted like clouds in the air, distant blurred branches interlaced into soft blurred light spots, and the sky was a bright pale blue, with sunlight streaming down from the upper right. Warm highlights and soft shadows are created on the figure's body. The overall composition uses shallow depth of field photography, focusing on the upper body and movement details. A few slender blades of grass gently sway in the foreground, adding a touch of nature. The composition is arranged slightly to the left center, leaving a large space on the right to express the openness of the background. The visual guide naturally extends from the character's downward head movement to the shoes on the ground, creating a quiet and restrained atmosphere. The lighting is soft and even, and the tones are fresh and bright. Overall, it presents a sense of everyday beauty from youthful campus life, as if capturing real moments casually with a portable camera or phone. It has a slight film texture and natural noise, moderate color saturation with a slight warm tone, natural light and shadow transitions, and rich visual layers. It combines the casual feeling of real life with artistic beauty, showcasing a quiet and beautiful spring afternoon",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
