        {
          "id": "krea2-d8e7702d1ddcc09b1f13eb0d",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙广场忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an escalator, wearing a black short-sleeved dress with a knee-length hem that is simple yet elegant. Her shoulders are smooth, her arms hang naturally, her left hand gently gripping the handrail, and her right hand hanging naturally. She wears a silver chain strap on her wrist. The body is visible, with fine texture and reflective effects on the surface, presenting a metallic texture that looks slightly puffy. Her expression is calm and focused, her body slightly turned to the side, her back turned to the direction of the escalator's ascent, facing the camera, her posture natural and relaxed. The overall composition centers on the figure. Located slightly to the left of the painting, occupying the center of the scene, the escalator extends diagonally upward from the lower right corner to the upper left, forming a strong visual guiding line. The steps are dark gray, with fine textures and wear marks on the surface. The edges have white safety warning strips, and the handrails are made of black metal, smooth on the surface that reflects surrounding light. The background is the interior space of the subway station. The ceiling is made of multiple square metal panels joined together with horizontal stripes, and the light is evenly distributed from above, emitting warm yellow light that illuminates the entire space. The walls are made of light beige stone or tiles, with a fine grainy texture. On the right wall, there is an electronic display showing words like \"12\" and \"Exit.\" The font is white, the background is black, and there are other signs nearby. The content is blurred, with more escalators and passageways visible in the distance, but the details are blurred to create a sense of depth. The overall atmosphere feels quiet and slightly lonely, with strong light and shadow contrast, creating soft highlights and shadows. There are obvious shadows beneath the legs and skirts, and faint light spots reflect from the ground. The color palette leans toward coolness, mainly gray, black, and brown, with a slight film graininess and retro filter effect. The image presents a sense of a moment captured spontaneously in daily life, as if taken with an old camera on the street, full of vibrant life and artistic beauty. The composition uses a low-angle upward view to enhance the visual presence of the subject. The diagonal lines of the escalator guide the gaze to the subject, highlighting the subject. The background blur treatment focuses the focus on the person and their actions, making the overall composition full of storytelling. It feels like telling a segment about urban life, waiting, or the journey home. The lighting is soft but not harsh, the color saturation is low, presenting a low-key aesthetic. The environmental details are rich, such as reflections on the escalator, wall textures, and distant signs, all clearly visible, enhancing realism. The overall style combines documentary photography with fashionable portraits, combining casual street style with carefully designed beauty, giving a feeling both ordinary and special, as if encountering a scene at a subway station on an ordinary night. It makes people pause and gaze, pondering the story behind it",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
