        {
          "id": "krea2-249434d6b619a85ee3c2a15a",
          "alias": "单女窗边温柔持镜",
          "prompt": "Under the warm, soft dusk light, a woman and her silver cat interact indoors, creating a peaceful and cozy atmosphere. The main focus is the intimate moment between the woman and the cat, her expression peaceful and content. Her hands gently support the cat's front paws, which is a fluffy silver cat with a silver gradient shorthair. The entire body is covered with delicate, soft grayish-white fuzz, which glows softly under the warm yellow light. It raises a front paw and gently rests it on the woman's hand, as if responding to her caress. Yet its overall posture is relaxed, showing trust in its owner. In the foreground is a lit glass candlestick, its flame flickering in the transparent glass, casting flickering light and shadow. The candlelight becomes the main light source throughout the scene, forming a warm golden halo and leaving mottled reflections on the tabletop, enhancing the sense of layering in the space The middle shot is the interaction area between the woman and the cat. They are positioned near the center on the right side of the image, their bodies slightly tilted, forming a natural visual focal point. The background is relatively blurred, presenting a blurred indoor environment. The outline of a window or mirror can be faintly seen, along with silhouettes of some dark furniture, creating a private and quiet family atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups focusing on people and animals, using shallow depth of field to highlight the subject, blurring the background and enhancing the depth and emotional focus of the composition. The visual guide begins with the candlelight in the foreground and finally converges at the touching hands of the two, forming a natural emotional path. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is extremely warm and romantic, with golden tones dominating the entire image. Light shines from the front left, creating soft shadow transitions that highlight the texture of the subject's skin and the layers of cat fur. The overall tone is warm, with a slight retro filter effect, simulating the graininess and color saturation of film photography, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera, evoking a nostalgic everyday feel. The images are full of life, capturing the most authentic and touching moments between people and pets, presenting a serene, healing, and poetic aesthetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
