        {
          "id": "krea2-e7efb1d8d62b2fe0d510246d",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣公寓忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a vintage rattan armchair, leaning slightly forward, her right leg bent and raised, her left leg naturally hanging down. She wears thick gray knee-high knit socks at her ankles, which extend from her ankles down to below her knees, featuring delicate ribbed textures and a soft matte finish. Her right hand rests gently on the armrest, while her left hand rests naturally on her right knee, fingers slightly curled, as if adjusting her socks or just casually arranging them, giving off a lazy and effortless look. She wears a beige turtleneck knit sweater, The material is soft and fitted, with slightly rolled-up cuffs revealing slender wrists. The lower half is paired with dark shorts, creating a soft color contrast with the sweater. The overall look is simple yet warm, with a subtle melancholy and contemplation in its expression, as if immersed in its own world. The chair is made of wood with a dark brown frame. The backrest and cushion are woven with rattan designs, presenting natural textures and hollowed-out patterns. On the right side of the chair hangs a beige thick knit scarf, thick and clear in texture, naturally draping down. Echoing the sweater's material, the background is a simple, light off-white wall with a flat and undecorated surface, creating a clean and quiet spatial feel. The floor is light brown wood with fine wood grain reflecting a slight sheen, presenting an overall minimalist indoor atmosphere. The composition centers on the figure, using medium shots that occupy most of the space, from above the waist to below the knees. The head is positioned slightly to the upper left of the frame, with the gaze slightly directed to the lower right, creating a dynamic visual balance. The chair is slightly tilted, adding movement and layering to the image. The foreground features the woman's legs and socks, rich in detail and highlighting the texture of the material and the changes in light and shadow. The middle is the woman's body and chair, forming the main visual focal point. The background is the pure wall and floor, serving to highlight the main subject. The visual guide extends through the figure's posture and line of sight, extending to the chair and scarf, forming a smooth visual path. Light and shadow come from the left side of the painting, soft and even, with light shining from the front side. Shadows are concentrated on the right side of the body and behind the chair, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. At the same time, a soft shadow is cast on the floor, creating a calm, warm, and slightly nostalgic lighting atmosphere. The tones are mainly earthy tones, including beige, gray-green, dark brown, and light brown. The color saturation is low, presenting a soft, low-contrast texture. The overall image has a strong artistic and everyday vibe, resembling a fashionable photo shot with professional photography or a real, unintentional moment captured in daily life. The grainy texture and slight exposure deviations of film photography create a vintage, tranquil, and emotionally charged atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
