        {
          "id": "krea2-d753da5a7209fbdf4476ed2e",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙阳台困倦站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a wooden balcony in traditional Japanese architecture, wearing a loose white striped cotton-linen dress with ruffled hems, wide sleeves slightly rolled up, and two dark thin strings on the chest as decoration. The overall look is simple yet layered. The dress is lightweight and breathable, with sunlight filtering through the fabric to create a semi-transparent texture, subtly revealing the silhouette of the body and creating a hazy yet gentle visual effect. Her hands are gently raised, her posture elegant and relaxed, head slightly lowered, The expression is calm and slightly contemplative, as if immersed in one's own world, displaying a serene and reserved temperament. The background is a typical Japanese wooden structure, with wooden beams and lattice window lattices clearly visible. The walls are a warm light brown, windows emit soft light, and the distant architectural outlines are slightly blurred, creating a natural depth effect. In the foreground, the wooden balconies on the balcony are visible, with simple yet powerful lines contrasting with the figures. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figures positioned at the center of the composition, occupying the main visual space Through clear layers of foreground, mid-range, and distant shots, the main subject is highlighted while preserving the ambient atmosphere. The camera shoots from a slightly upward angle, making the figure appear more elongated and enhancing the sense of spatial depth. Light comes from the sides and back, creating a backlighting effect. Sunlight passes through the dress, casting a soft halo on the figure, with golden glow along the edges. The transition of light and shadow is natural, with a moderate contrast of light and shadow, creating a warm and dreamy atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and off-white, complemented by woody brown tones, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The image is filled with the lazy and comfortable atmosphere of a summer afternoon, with exquisite detail handling while preserving slight film graininess and natural overexposure, simulating the authentic texture of everyday amateur camera shooting. Overall, it presents a style that blends life-oriented, documentary, and artistic beauty. It combines the refined feel of portrait photography with a natural, casual everyday vibe, like capturing a moment of genuine beauty on a quiet afternoon",
          "description": "",
