        {
          "id": "krea2-b4d05e788ea4e5a7ee317ce6",
          "alias": "单女寺庙站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman is presented from a low-angle upward perspective, creating a lazy yet refined aesthetic. She wears frameless transparent glasses made of slim metal, with a simple and modern temple design. The lenses reflect slightly, reflecting the blurred outlines of the surroundings. The details of the glasses are clearly visible, showcasing a fashionable and intellectual temperament, revealing a touch of gentleness and curiosity. When slightly open, it shows a natural curve. Her nails are neatly trimmed and painted with light nail polish. Her hands are elegant and relaxed, as if lost in thought or waiting for something. The main figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, with her head slightly tilted, creating a dynamic visual balance that occupies most of the space. In the middle shot, you can see her exposed shoulder and collarbone lines. Her skin is smooth and delicate, the shoulder contours are soft, and the background is a pure white wall or set with no cluttered elements. The minimalist background makes the subject stand out even more, and the composition uses close-ups. The lighting and shadow atmosphere are soft and even, with the light source coming from the front slightly above, warm and bright like morning sunlight, without strong shadows, enhancing the sense of depth and creating a sharp contrast, creating a clean, pure, and slightly artistic atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, delivering professional studio-level imaging effects. At the same time, it preserves the authentic and natural moments of daily life, as if captured on a quiet afternoon with a high-quality camera. The entire scene is filled with tranquility, gentleness, and poetry, conveying a subtle yet captivating personal charm",
