        {
          "id": "krea2-9cf34546208f29be99afaf94",
          "alias": "单女白T恤桌边冷淡坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at a wooden dining table, wearing a loose white short-sleeved T-shirt and light blue jeans. Under the backlight, it appears especially transparent, while the shadowed areas are deep and layered, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, occupying the visual center, with the composition using a diagonal angle. From a slightly overhead angle, it captures the relationship between the figure and the environment, highlighting their emotional expression and sense of spatial depth. In the foreground is a brown solid wood dining table with clear wood grain patterns. The texture of the tabletop is realistic, with rounded edges. In the lower right corner is a metal mesh-like placemat with a finely arranged geometric pattern. Above sits a transparent glass container with a small airborne pineapple plant, its roots covered with white granular media. The plant's form is slender and elegant, with clear details. The background is the indoor home environment. On the left is a white metal-framed chair with a clean and modern backrest. Behind, you can faintly see the outlines of kitchen cabinets or storage cabinets. The surface is light gray or white, featuring minimalist handle designs. The background is blended to create a soft bokeh effect, making the subject stand out. Light comes from the window or source on the right, representing warm afternoon sunlight. The light is reflected in a side backlight, creating a clear contrast of light and dark. At the same time, long shadows are cast on the tabletop, creating rich layers of interplay between light and shadow. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, off-white, and brown, paired with a touch of cool metallic gray and blue-green. The colors are harmonious and unified, full of a sense of life. The composition uses the figure's posture and gaze to guide viewers to focus on her expressions and hand movements, while the blurring of foreground objects and background enhances spatial depth, forming a natural observation path. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is quiet and warm, as if capturing an ordinary yet precious moment, like a real scene shot with a regular household camera or phone. It carries a simple sense of documentary and intimacy, with no deliberate staged photos in the images, instead capturing the most natural state. The overall style leans toward Japanese-style photo shoots or lifestyle photography, emphasizing emotional expression and environmental integration, presenting a simple, pure, and healing beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
