        {
          "id": "krea2-7d3172b5ed7a264e89dec5d0",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙桥忧伤站立持花",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on the grass at the edge of the city, her expression slightly contemplative and gentle, appearing three-dimensional and layered. She wears a light blue dress over an off-white knit cardigan, adorned with red floral patterns. The sleeves are slightly rolled up, revealing slender wrists. In her right hand, she holds a bouquet of small orange-red flowers, clustered densely, with slender stems and bright colors that sharply contrast with the surrounding environment. In the foreground is a dense grassland. The grass leaves appear in the sunlight with intertwined golden and emerald hues. Some blades are slightly tilted by the wind, adding to the dynamic effect of the scene. The middle ground is a wide grassy area stretching into the distance, with slight undulations on the ground. Scattered withered yellow grass leaves show the transition of seasons. In the background is an elevated bridge spanning the scene. The bridge structure is clearly visible, supported by concrete pillars. On the deck, there are faint traces of vehicles moving, and the distant city skyline is faintly visible. High-rise buildings appear faintly in the mist. The sky shows a gradient from pale blue to light orange, the sun nears the horizon, and the light is soft and warm. The entire shot is shot at a low angle, with the figure occupying the left center of the frame. The composition is balanced and deep, then turns to distant bridges and the city, forming a natural path of sight. The atmosphere of light and shadow is warm and tranquil. The golden sunset rays fall on the figures, creating soft outline light, casting long shadows on the grass. The overall tone leans toward a vintage film style. With slight graininess and color shifts, it creates a nostalgic, poetic, and slightly lonely everyday feel, as if capturing an ordinary yet emotionally charged moment. Shot with an amateur or film camera, the image is slightly overexposed but retains details, with moderate color saturation, presenting a realistic yet rustic texture",
          "description": "",
