        {
          "id": "krea2-2335bc702204b130e3890157",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫教室忧伤坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the edge of a classroom desk, wearing a white short-sleeved shirt and a gray pleated skirt, paired with black long socks. Her legs hang naturally, her toes lightly touch the ground, her body slightly leaned back, hands resting on the desk, head gently tilted to one side, her expression calm yet slightly melancholic, as if lost in her own thoughts. Sunlight streams in diagonally through the left window, filtering through the translucent gray curtains into the room, creating a soft effect of light and shadow that creates a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The geometric lines of the window frame contrast with the folds of the curtains. This enhances the sense of layering in the composition. The background features simple white walls and several neat rows of wooden desks and chairs. In the distance, a wooden blind can be faintly seen. The floor is made of light-colored tiles reflecting faint light. The overall color scheme is mainly white, gray, and beige, accented with dark black stockings. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned on the right side of the frame, occupying the main visual space, while the left side leaves a large window and shadow area to create visual balance. The camera is shot from a slightly lower angle, highlighting the figure's posture and leg lines. At the same time, the spatial sense of the environment is preserved. The foreground features a clear desk and some chairs, the middle is the main figure and surrounding desks, and the background features walls, windows, and furniture in the distance. The visual guide is formed by the light outside the window and the figure's posture. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, carrying a subtle sense of nostalgia and youth, as if capturing a moment of being alone in the classroom after school. The entire scene presents a quiet, authentic, and story-filled everyday beauty. For example, natural scenes shot with a regular camera or phone are not overly embellished, preserving the authentic texture of life. The lighting is natural, color accuracy is high, and details are rich. It is both artistic and refreshingly familiar with everyday life. The composition is steady yet lively, the figures' postures are natural and relaxed, and the emotions are subtle and restrained. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and far-reaching, allowing people to feel the passage of time and the tranquility of youth. It is as if you can hear the rustling of leaves outside the window and the distant faint voices of people, yet all of this feels so distant. On this quiet afternoon that belonged only to her, the sunlight was just right, the breeze was gentle, and she just sat there, as if time itself had stopped at that moment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
