        {
          "id": "krea2-9da77781419012403fb54eaf",
          "alias": "男女白毛衣机场沉思站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a bright indoor space, dressed in a layered outfit full of academic and everyday vibes. The main figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, presenting a natural half-body portrait composition. Her expression is calm and slightly contemplative, with slightly curled hat edges, showing a soft texture and warm tones with a subtle reddish glow, giving a gentle yet somewhat reserved impression. She wears an off-white thick knit sleeveless sweater vest with deep red fine trim decorations on the neckline and hem. The sweater's surface texture is rough and layered, with natural faux edges on the shoulders, giving it a casual yet refined look. Underneath, she wears a brown-yellow plaid shirt with a plaid pattern woven from light yellow, dark brown, and white. The collar is tied with a matching plaid silk scarf, tied into a loose bow, adding a touch of vintage and playful charm. The shirt sleeves are folded to reveal wrists, with well-crafted details. In her left hand, she holds a boarding pass or ID with a blue cover, printed with the words \"China Southern Airlines\" and a QR code. In her right hand, she was holding a gray little elephant doll. On her shoulder slung a red leather chain bag made of gold metal. The bag was small and delicate, with red decorative clasps on the black leather parts. The overall color scheme was harmonious yet highlighted. The background was a spacious, bright, modern indoor space, possibly an airport lobby or a transportation hub. The background was clearly blurred, and in the distance, blurred figures could be seen. One person wore a blue blazer, A man wearing a dark blue sweater is pushing a luggage cart as he walks. His figure appears hazy and distant in the halo. The building's structure mainly features glass curtain walls and metal frames, letting in natural light. The floor is made of light gray tiles, reflecting a soft sheen. Sunlight pours in from above and the sides, creating a strong backlight effect, outlining the figure's outline in a bright halo. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and transparent, with the overall color palette dominated by warm yellow and beige, accented with red, brown, and blue. It creates a realistic and warm sense of everyday life. The composition adopts a centrally focused layout, with the characters as the dominant visual focal points. The foreground features rich hand movements and detailed objects, while the middle shots have distinct postures and layered clothing. The background environmental elements are blurry but provide clear spatial information. The body lines and background structure then spread outward, enhancing the depth and storytelling of the image. The overall style combines a sense of everyday life with artistic beauty, as if it were a documentary photograph taken with a professional camera, yet it carries a slight film texture and soft graininess, presenting a realistic, natural, intimate, and slightly artistic visual atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
