        {
          "id": "krea2-d65aceee0355ad5950462f21",
          "alias": "单女白礼服婚礼媚态倚靠比耶",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in an exquisite white lace wedding dress leans elegantly against a pure white wall. Her left hand softly holds a large bouquet of baby's breath, with countless small white flowers twinkling like stars, slender and upright green stems, occupying most of the space on the right side of the painting. Creating a harmonious visual balance with the figure, her right hand gently raised, fingers slender and long, fingertips slightly curved. The sleeves of the wedding dress are made of semi-transparent tulle fabric, embroidered with exquisite lace patterns. The layered pleats create a soft texture under the light, and the neckline is designed in a V-shape, revealing her delicate collarbones and some shoulder lines, adding a touch of sensuality and elegance. The background is a simple white wall, smooth and flat, without any unnecessary decorations. Light streams in diagonally from the upper left of the frame. A strong contrast of light and shadow is formed, with these shadows taking different shapes depending on the angle of light—some resembling petals, others like leaves—creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The composition of the entire composition uses the classic three-part method: the figure is positioned slightly toward the center on the left, the bouquet occupies the right, creating a symmetrical yet imperfect visual effect. The background is slightly blurred, enhancing the subject's prominence. The color palette is mainly white, supplemented by pale pink and green, creating an overall soft and pure tone. It gives a fresh and elegant feeling. The use of light and shadow is very clever, utilizing side and backlight effects to make the character's outline more three-dimensional, highlighting the delicate texture of the skin. The atmosphere is tranquil and warm, like a moment of early morning, with sunlight streaming through the window into the room as the girl quietly enjoys this beautiful moment of her own. The entire scene is filled with poetry and romance, evoking a sense of pure happiness and tranquility",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
