        {
          "id": "krea2-69ea3310e3e02db2cda829bb",
          "alias": "单女白T恤小巷俏皮坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the wooden steps of a bowling alley, wearing a white fitted short T-shirt with small black patterns and text on the chest, paired with dark denim shorts that reveal a slender waistline. Her makeup is exquisite, she wears a thin chain necklace and earrings, lightly holding a red bowling ball in her left hand, her right hand naturally hanging down, fingernails painted black, her posture relaxed and confident, her body slightly turned to the side, full of youthful energy. In the background is a bowling machine. The brand is Brunswick. The machine is off-white, with a black control panel and round buttons. The surface shows slight wear, with the edge of the bowling lane visible nearby. The wooden floor has a clear texture, and warm yellow lighting casts from above, creating soft shadows that create a warm yet slightly retro atmosphere. The overall composition uses a medium angle of view, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, occupying the main visual space. The background blur highlights the subject, with clear light and shadow layers, and the color tones are mainly warm yellow, off-white, and dark brown. Accented with red spheres and white clothing, creating a striking contrast, extending along body lines to the bowling ball in hand, then returning to the background equipment, creating a looping viewing path. The image texture is close to everyday amateur camera shooting, with slight noise and realism, moderate color saturation, rich details, presenting a casual yet carefully arranged street fashion style. It seems to capture a moment of nighttime leisure and entertainment, combining the atmosphere of everyday life with artistic beauty. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and joyful, full of the personality expression of modern urban youth.",
