        {
          "id": "krea2-1cb35eb8116153ea3c53bb14",
          "alias": "牛仔街道倚靠阅读",
          "prompt": "A man leans against the trunk of a white Honda Civic, wearing sunglasses, a black long-sleeve top, and loose jeans. The overall look carries a street-style vibe. The rear of the car is decorated with a blue sticker reading \"KYOBOK,\" and the license plate is a British plate \"H932 GLH\" with black letters on a yellow background. The body is clean and tidy but shows some signs of wear. The taillights are orange, and the rear design is simple and retro. The car stopped on a quiet city street, with a dark gray asphalt surface with clearly visible grain. On both sides of the street were typical English-style townhouses. The exterior walls were off-white, windows were neatly arranged, and the frames were dark color. Some windows were draped with curtains, and the roof's lines were distinct. The decorative details were rich, such as balcony railings, pilasters, and carved decorations. The trees were tall and lush, with dense branches and leaves, lush and green. The shadows of the trees scattered mottled across the ground and buildings, and sunlight streamed down from the upper left of the painting, creating a soft side light. The layers of light and shadow are distinct, with warm yellowish lighting, presenting a tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The sky is clear with a slight bluish tint, and in the distance, you can faintly see other vehicles and pedestrians, but it's not noisy. The overall composition uses a low-angle shot, with the rear of the car occupying the lower half of the frame, the person positioned in the center-right position, forming the visual focus. The foreground highlights the vehicle and the character, while the middle view shows streets and buildings. The background extends to the distant cluster of houses, creating a sense of depth. The tone of the image is warm, with a slight film texture and graininess, and the color saturation is moderate. With low contrast, it presents a nostalgic retro filter effect. The image feels as realistic as shooting with everyday amateur equipment, as if from a short life documentary. The composition is balanced, visuals guide nature, leading from the rear of the car to the characters, then extending to the background buildings and sky. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, leisurely, and full of urban life poetry, as if capturing an ordinary yet touching moment, allowing people to feel the slow flow of time and the individual's inner world.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
