        {
          "id": "krea2-dd0df1c8e669c1e134c63792",
          "alias": "单女全裸白礼服婚礼困倦跪注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a pure white strapless wedding dress sat elegantly on a light-colored sofa by the window. Her body leaned slightly forward, hands folded on her knees, head lowered to gaze at her own hands. Her expression was gentle and serene, as if immersed in some deep thought, adding a touch of softness and laziness. The upper half of the dress was decorated with exquisite lace lace, with three-dimensional floral decorations on the chest. The skirt was made of multiple layers of lightweight tulle, layered across the floor and sofa, forming a full and voluminous silhouette. Light streams in diagonally from the left window, creating a soft backlight effect that outlines the figure's outline in a bright halo, creating a dreamy and sacred atmosphere. In the foreground, the hem of the wedding dress occupies most of the space, its flowing texture and transparency appearing especially light under the light. The middle frame shows the woman's body and posture, with smooth shoulder lines, naturally bent arms, delicate hand movements, long fingers, neatly trimmed nails painted with elegant nude nail polish, and a background of blurred green plants Through the glass window, you can see the outdoor trees and branches, creating a soft bokeh effect that makes the subject stand out more. The composition uses the classic three-part method: the figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving space on the right side for the light and background to extend. The visual guide is formed by the direction of the light source and the character's line of sight. The overall light and shadow are mainly warm white tones, with the golden glow of sunlight contrasting with the cool tones in the shadows, enhancing the layering and three-dimensionality of the image. The atmosphere is peaceful, romantic, and slightly melancholic. It feels like a morning or afternoon, with the bride enjoying a moment of quiet alone before the wedding. The entire scene is like a classic shot from an art film, with strong artistic appeal and emotional tension. Filmed with professional-grade equipment, it features high resolution, ultra-fine detail, realistic light and shadow simulation, film texture, slight graininess, natural depth of field, clear focus, accurate color reproduction, and clean images free of cluttered elements, presenting a beauty that is both everyday and extraordinary",
