        {
          "id": "krea2-c7540cdb01488e99e39f5944",
          "alias": "单女花园困倦站立",
          "prompt": "A half-length portrait of a woman, her expression calm and slightly contemplative. Her head is slightly tilted back, forming a natural pattern of interwoven light and shadow, creating a warm and dreamy atmosphere. She wears a white high-neck, long-sleeved top with a red heart-shaped pattern on the chest and delicate embroidered edges. The fabric looks soft and comfortable, with slight pleats that add authenticity. She wears delicate gold earrings, with delicate details. In the foreground are many blooming white flowers, with fine petals and some flowers accented with pale pink Branches and leaves intertwine to form a natural frame structure, framing the figure within. Some flowers are out of focus, creating a blurred blur effect that enhances depth of field. The middle ground is the main subject, positioned slightly to the left of the frame, with a slightly tilted body and a naturally relaxed posture. The background is dense white flower clusters that gradually extend into the distance and blur, creating a soft bokeh. Light in the background penetrates the leaves from above, creating light spots and shadows. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the main space in the composition. The flower clusters serve as foreground and backdrop, creating a sense of envelopment and a smooth visual path. Light comes from diagonally above, serving as side backlighting. Sunlight penetrates the leaves, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow but a soft transition, presenting a warm golden tone. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, gentle, and full of springtime vibes, as if you are in a morning garden. The image texture is delicate, with the graininess and color saturation of film photography. The tones are mainly white, light green, and warm yellow, accented with red hearts, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The image style blends the refinement of fashion magazines with the realism of everyday shooting. It's like capturing a moment outdoors under natural light with an old film camera. The slight camera shake instead enhances authenticity and artistry, conveying a sense of youth, innocence, poetry, and freedom, as if time stands still in this moment, leaving only light and floral fragrance in the air",
