        {
          "id": "krea2-3ee6d4f3bfeed7f29be5541a",
          "alias": "单女外套室内坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits slightly to the right center of a black leather sofa, her body slightly tilted to the left, arms crossed over her chest, her posture elegant and relaxed. The jacket features a white lapel and gold buttons, revealing the sleeves of a white shirt. She pairs the lower half with white stockings adorned with delicate white butterfly patterns. Her legs are naturally crossed, one foot slightly stretched forward, with the toes pointing upward, creating an unintentionally relaxed vibe. On her left hand, she wears a simple silver earring, with delicate tassel earrings hanging. The overall look is both vintage and fashionable. In the foreground is a black leather sofa surface with distinct diamond-shaped stitching texture, thick and glossy. On the left side of the sofa is a gray fabric cushion contrasting with the black leather. The middle frame is the main figure and part of the sofa's structure. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the visual center, occupying the main area. On the left side of the background is a white vase with a bouquet of pure white flowers inside. It may be a hydrangea or similar variety, with plump petals and distinct layers. Behind the vase is a decorative frame with a metal frame, shaped like geometric lines, in gold or brass colors. On the right side of the background is a dark curtain, thick and heavy, with a noticeable drape, appearing in a deep gray or charcoal black. The curtain edges have slight wrinkles, adding depth to the space. The lighting throughout the scene is soft and even, illuminated by the soft light from the left front, with natural shadow transitions without strong contrasts. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and comfortable, carrying the feeling of home life. The composition uses the classic three-part layout, with the figure positioned on the right one-third of the time, with the line of sight naturally guided to form a stable visual flow. The overall color scheme is mainly black, white, and gray, accented with pink, white, and gold, creating an atmosphere that blends sophistication and warmth. The image has a strong realistic style, rich in detail, and a realistic texture, as if taken by a professional camera in an indoor environment. The lens focus is precise, depth of field is moderate, the background slightly blurred to highlight the subject, while retaining environmental information. The overall image presents a sense of tranquility and elegance, A visual experience that is both everyday and artistically beautiful",
