        {
          "id": "krea2-201628b7d4b7d2c6dd9d348b",
          "alias": "单女绿外套室内微笑坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits indoors in a well-lit environment, showing slight waves. She shows a gentle smile, her overall expression warm and friendly. She wears a loose dark green coat made of soft wool or thick cotton, with a white stripe decoration at the neckline. Underneath, she wears a pale yellow crew-neck top with delicate stitching along the collar edge, and the front of the jacket is decorated with a white knot. She adds a touch of Japanese or artistic details: her right hand rests naturally on her knee, her hand relaxed, while her left hand gently grips the sleeve of her coat. Her arm is bent to form a natural curve. In front of her, she wears a brown leather strap diagonally. The strap is moderately wide and smooth, slung from shoulder to chest, adding depth and a sense of everyday life to the scene. She wears off-white loose pants, with comfortable legs and light material, subtle texture, and natural pleats. As the body posture subtly changes, the background is a simple white wall with a flat surface featuring subtle vertical textures, possibly wood or gypsum board. The wall has a clear light and shadow effect, sunlight streaming in diagonally from the left, creating a clear shadow area on the wall. The shadow edges are soft, creating a contrast between light and shadow with the light section, enhancing the spatial sense of three-dimensionality. The entire composition centers on the figure, shot in a medium shot, with the figure occupying the main part of the frame, the head slightly tilted, and the gaze facing the camera. It creates an intimate and natural atmosphere. The light mainly comes from the left front, serving as side lighting, while the other side forms soft shadows. The colors are warm, presenting golden tones reminiscent of early morning or evening, adding a cozy and tranquil atmosphere to the entire scene. The color scheme is mainly green, off-white, and brown, harmoniously unified. The green coat contrasts sharply with the off-white pants, complementing each other, while the brown straps add a touch, enriching the visual layers. The overall image presents a vivid and beautiful moment from everyday life, as if it were a natural portrait casually captured with a regular camera. Without excessive embellishment or staged photos, it gives a sense of intimacy, authenticity, and warmth. The image is rich in detail, possessing strong artistic appeal and a sense of everyday life, as if one can feel the tranquility and beauty of that moment",
