        {
          "id": "krea2-bcf8eefb13e22a31b7452ffd",
          "alias": "单女米和服庭院忧伤侧头",
          "prompt": "Wearing a light beige kimono with delicate linen texture and a soft sheen, wide and naturally draped cuffs, the collar revealing a pale green lining inside, a wide matching color belt tied around her waist, hands gently clasped in front of her, posture elegant yet reserved. She stood slightly to the side, head slightly tilted, her calm expression tinged with a hint of melancholy and tranquility. Her figure was reflected on the glass beside the wooden window frame behind her, forming a blurred mirror reflection, in which the kimono pattern was faintly visible. This creates a contrast between reality and void with the real subject. The foreground is the main figure, occupying the left to central position of the frame. The composition uses the classic rule of thirds: the figure is near the left three-quarter line, with the body facing right but the head turned toward the camera, creating a dynamic visual balance. The background is the interior of a traditional Japanese building, with dark wooden walls and floor textures clearly defined. Light streams through the right window, while outside the window are blurred green plants. The leaves in the sunlight create soft layers of light and shadow, creating a tranquil and Zen-rich atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly warm gray, off-white, dark brown, and emerald green, with harmonious and unified colors and soft light and shadow. The light source comes from the right rear, creating a backlighting effect that gently outlines the character's outline. At the same time, subtle transitions between highlights and shadows appear on the kimono surface, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and texture. The image has a slight film graininess and natural depth blur, simulating the realism of professional camera shooting. The composition emphasizes spatial layering, with clear and sharp figures in the foreground, hazy glass reflections in the middle ground, and background plants blurring to create a sense of depth. Then, through the lines of the body and reflections extending out the window, the natural scenery extends outward, creating an overall atmosphere that is quiet, restrained, and poetic, as if capturing a tranquil moment in an afternoon courtyard. It is rich in Japanese aesthetic style, combining the solemnity of traditional attire with the delicate observation of modern life's details. The images present an unintentional beauty in daily life, like precious memories casually captured with an old camera, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
