          "id": "krea2-bdfd4562bcbaed6eb245eddb",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫街道困倦坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a street at night, looking slightly tired. She wears a light blue velvet shirt with vertical stripes, the collar slightly open, revealing a white top and black camisole underneath. She wears loose light gray jeans, legs bent, knees close to chest, body slightly leaning forward, posture relaxed and natural. Her left hand rests on the knee, right hand hangs naturally, fingers gently touching the ground, presenting a casual and realistic feeling of everyday life. In the foreground, you can see the folds and material details of her clothing. Light shines from the right side, casting faint shadows on the other side. The background features a dark wooden door frame and glass windows, with two silver metal handles on the door frame. The glass reflects a blurred street scene and lights, and above the window hangs a string of decorative lights, made up of several small yellow bulbs shaped like yellow lemon slices. These bulbs emit a warm yellow glow, adding a splash of brightness to the entire scene. On the right wall, there is a red digital clock display. 18:40\" The text is clear but slightly blurred, hinting at the time point in the evening. In the distance, faint glimmers of vehicle taillights and streetlights can be seen, creating a bokeh effect. The composition uses a centered technique, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the painting, head slightly tilted, and the gaze directly communicating with the viewer, creating an intimate and tranquil atmosphere. The overall tone of the painting is cool, mainly blue-gray, but accented by warm yellow lighting, creating a contrast between cool and warm tones. The layers of light and shadow are rich, and the bright areas brought by the light source are also present There are also shadow transitions in the dark, with slight vignetting effects at the edges of the frame, simulating the natural attenuation of film cameras, while preserving graininess and slight noise to enhance the retro feel. The color saturation is moderate, not overly vibrant, but maintains a low-key realist style. Extending to the background lighting and time information, the entire scene seems to capture a brief pause by an ordinary person after work or before a date, full of life and a sense of story. Like a photo casually taken with an old film camera, not staged but containing delicate emotional expression, the image details are exquisitely handled, preserving the authenticity of photography while incorporating artistic aesthetic pursuits. The overall atmosphere is quiet, contemplative, and slightly melancholic, like a silent poem recording an ordinary yet special moment in the city's night",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
