        {
          "id": "krea2-ed9742444e783ff988eb7879",
          "alias": "单女霓虹夜景忧伤倚靠",
          "prompt": "A half-length portrait of a woman, partially obscured from view, creating a lazy yet slightly melancholic atmosphere, slightly open as if whispering or contemplating. The foreground is the figure's head and shoulders, occupying the main position. The background is a blurred city nightscape, composed of countless scattered light spots. These spots come in white, blue, orange, and green, varying in size and rounded shape, resembling distant streetlights. The car headlights and neon lights create out-of-focus imaging in front of the lens, with light shining from above and behind, creating a strong backlighting effect. The figure's outline is surrounded by a golden halo, with light passing through particles in the air, producing distinct beams and mist, enhancing the depth and dreamlike feel of the image. The background light spots are evenly distributed, enriching the image's layers without distracting attention. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and nostalgic, with golden yellow as the main tone, mixed with cool-toned blue-green light spots, creating a warm and slightly lonely urban nightscape atmosphere. The entire frame has a film texture, obvious graininess, moderate color saturation, and warm tones, presenting a retro cinematic feel. The lens uses a large-aperture prime lens with a focal length of about 50mm and an aperture of f/1.8. When shooting at close range, the background is completely blurred, highlighting the subject. The image has slight lens distortion and vignetting. Simulating real camera shooting effects, the overall style leans toward film photography and cinematic aesthetics, capturing a fleeting intimate emotion, like a gentle silhouette in the city night, full of storytelling and artistic atmosphere",
