        {
          "id": "krea2-9b36544c9addc7111fe565fe",
          "alias": "单女制服高塔害羞坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a Japanese-style school uniform sits on the wooden floor by the indoor window. She wears a white short-sleeved shirt over a green knit vest with a red bow tied at the neckline, a brown-yellow plaid pleated skirt paired with black stockings, legs slightly bent, knees together, hands naturally resting on her legs, right hand gently raised, expression slightly shy and thoughtful, overall elegant and relaxed, with large floor-to-ceiling windows in the background, outside a cluster of modern urban skyscrapers, the glass reflecting soft skylight. The building's outline is clear but slightly blurred, creating a sense of spatial depth. The interior lighting is bright and soft, with natural light streaming in from the left side, creating a uniform transition of light and shadow on the figures. The floor has a light wood texture with a delicate texture, and the window sill edges have slight shadows. In the lower left corner of the painting, a book with a white cover lies quietly on the floor. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, slightly tilted, and the gaze communicates directly with the viewer, creating a strong visual guidance. The foreground features clear floors and books, the middle ground is the main subjects, and the background is a blurred cityscape with distinct layers. The colors are mainly green, white, and brown, accented with red bow ties. The tones are fresh and natural, the lighting atmosphere is warm and tranquil, carrying the atmosphere of daily life, as if capturing the moment when afternoon sunlight fills the room. The overall style is realistic and full of life, rich in details and authentic texture, presenting a tranquil campus beauty, similar to the real scene taken with an amateur camera. It retains slight noise and natural exposure transitions, enhancing the image's realism and approachability",
