        {
          "id": "krea2-5c129f410f888305cac64836",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤沙发冷淡跪侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman kneels on an indoor carpet, wearing a black camisole and light blue ripped denim shorts, layered with a loose light gray knit cardigan. The cardigan naturally reveals a slender waistline, and she wears a simple silver necklace. Her overall posture is relaxed and natural, full of youthful energy and approachability. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the center, forming a half-body composition. The figure occupies about two-thirds of the frame's height, with the head slightly tilted and the body slightly turned, forming a graceful S-shaped curve. In the foreground is a soft carpet with blue and white geometric patterns, with delicate and clear texture. The middle features the female subject, while the background is a modern home environment. On the right is an off-white fabric sofa with brown cushions and light-patterned throw pillows. Behind is a bright floor-to-ceiling window with white sheer curtains that let in soft natural light. The light outside evenly enters the interior, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The entire scene layout is simple and orderly, with distinct spatial layers. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical style, with visual guidance extending from the characters' hands upward to the top of their heads. It creates a strong visual focal point, with delicate light and shadow processing. The main light source comes from the left window, creating a soft backlight effect, giving the edges of the figure's silhouette a faint halo and natural shadow transitions. The overall color tone mainly uses warm and cool contrasts, giving the image a realistic texture and rich details, giving it the realism of shooting with a professional camera or high-end phone in daily life. It feels like capturing a moment of life on a quiet afternoon, presenting a fresh, natural, warm, and comfortable lifestyle aesthetic. At the same time, it retains the artistic feel of photography and portraits, creating a relaxed and pleasant home atmosphere",
