        {
          "id": "krea2-f6c63a0062849da31eb98632",
          "alias": "单女透视黑睡裙城市俏皮坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden floor covered with vintage Persian carpets, wearing a black silk spaghetti strap nightgown with lace details and black sheer stockings, creating a lazy yet sexy homely atmosphere. She leans slightly, her right hand gently stroking her left arm, her left hand naturally letting loose, her expression tinged with playfulness and seduction. The background is a nostalgic indoor space, with an old cathode ray tube TV on the left side displaying a blurry image. Next to the TV are stacked several old books and an old camera, and beside it is a tall green plant with wide leaves, adding a touch of vitality to the scene. On the right is a brown leather sofa with a soft fabric cushion with blue and white patterns. In front of the sofa, a piece of white lace fabric is scattered on the floor, hinting at a sense of casualness and authenticity in life. The lighting throughout the scene is soft, with warm yellow light from the sides creating a warm and intimate atmosphere. The light and shadow on the skin of the figures The silk garments and carpet textures create delicate transitions of light and dark, highlighting the texture of the materials. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, body slightly tilted, creating a dynamic visual balance. The foreground features a richly colored Persian carpet with intricate patterns, mainly red, blue, and beige, accented with tassel decorations that guide the viewer's gaze toward the figure. The middle ground features the main figure with furniture such as sofas and televisions, while the background features walls and plants, with clear layers. The movement then moves upward to the TV and plants. This creates a natural visual flow, presenting an overall aesthetic that evokes the subtle beauty of everyday life, as if taken with an old camera. The film photo features a slight graininess and low-saturation tone, creating a retro nostalgia yet modern atmosphere. The tones are warm yellow, brown, black, and blue, harmoniously unified with moderate light and shadow contrast, including both bright and shadowed areas, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall style blends retro, sexy, everyday, and artistic elements, like a quiet moment in an independent film. It captures the real state of urban youth in their private spaces, with rich details—from the folds of clothing to the carpet texture to the faint glow of a TV screen, all filled with storytelling. It seems as if you can hear distant music and the city's noise outside the window, yet are surrounded by the tranquility of this tiny space",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
