        {
          "id": "krea2-8e04fe5cd931511b4d035167",
          "alias": "单女外套车厢冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands inside a subway carriage, slightly turned to the side, her expression calm and profound, displaying a soft sheen. She wears a dark coat with a slightly open collar, appearing casual yet textured. The background is a blurred interior of the subway carriage. The reflections from metal handrails and windows create a strong interplay of light and shadow in the blurred air, with light streaming diagonally through the window, creating a dramatic visual effect. In the foreground, a slanted metal handrail runs across the frame, dividing the figure in two halves and enhancing the tension and layering of the composition. The middle shot features a female subject, positioned slightly to the left center of the frame. Her head and shoulders occupy the main visual space, while the background shows details inside the carriage, including seats, billboards, and blurred passenger silhouettes, all deeply blurred to emphasize the subject's presence. The overall composition uses an asymmetrical layout, using diagonal lines to guide the gaze, then flowing down to the body and armrests, forming a natural visual path. The colors are mainly cool, interwoven with gray-blue and black, accented by warm golden sunlight, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. The highlights are bright and transparent, the shadow areas are deep and rich, the atmosphere is tranquil and full of storytelling, as if capturing a fleeting inner monologue. The overall style combines the detachment of modern urban life with a poetic romantic atmosphere, featuring magazine cover-level artistic texture, simulating professional photography effects. Using an 85mm prime lens with a small f/2.8 aperture, low saturation tone, slight graininess, simulating film texture while preserving real details, presenting a fleeting beauty captured unintentionally in daily life. It feels like a casual shot from a street photographer, carrying a dual charm of documentary and aesthetic coexistence",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
