        {
          "id": "krea2-78b5ee5c4995b035d2cb8723",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙水边坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a clear stream, wearing a wide-brimmed off-white straw hat adorned with a matching bow on the brim. The hat's woven pattern is clearly visible, creating a soft and layered light spot. She wears a white spaghetti strap dress, the lightweight fabric slightly translucent in the water, hugging her body curves and showcasing a natural beauty with a moist texture. She leans sideways against a moss-covered rock, her hands gently resting on the surface, fingers long and nails neatly trimmed The fingertips are slightly bent, as if feeling the coolness of the water and the roughness of the stones, presenting an unintentional natural state. The overall posture is relaxed and elegant, as if immersed in a tranquil natural environment. In the foreground, the rocks and water surface in the stream are covered with green moss, with rough and detailed textures. The water is crystal clear, revealing pebbles and fine sand underwater. The ripples gently ripple, forming ripples and refracting light and shadow. The middle view shows the woman's body from waist to head. Light passes through the water, creating flowing shadows on her skin and creating a dreamlike visual effect. The background is a blurred forest environment, with faint trees and shrubs visible. The colors are mainly deep green and brown, and the blur treatment makes the subject stand out. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame, leaving space on the left to express the extended view and ambient atmosphere. The perspective is slightly overlooked, enhancing intimacy and immersion. Extending further into the natural background, the lighting and shadow atmosphere are dominated by warm golden tones Sunlight shines down from above and from the sides, creating contrasts of light and shadow. Highlights are bright and soft, shadows transition delicately, and the overall light distribution is even, without strong glare, creating a peaceful, warm, and slightly romantic summer afternoon atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, color saturation is moderate, and the tones are harmoniously unified. It has a retro feel like film photography and the realism of everyday amateur equipment, as if captured by chance, full of life and artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
