        {
          "id": "krea2-c90ee6112a8a9e36afd26185",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道俏皮阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman, as the subject of the image, appears both playful and gentle, looking directly into the camera as if she is about to whisper a secret. Under the warm yellow light, she appears almost transparent. She wears a white shirt with a crisp neckline and wide, pleated sleeves. The front of the dress is decorated with two symmetrical lace trims, the lace patterns delicate and intricate, with slightly curled edges that contrast with the smooth silk fabric. Her hands are folded over her chest, and on her left ring finger is a simple silver ring. The right index finger also wears a matching ring. The finger is long and graceful, as if tidying clothes or gently touching something. The foreground is a close-up of the upper body of the person, occupying most of the space. The composition uses a close-up portrait, with the middle being a partial part of the body, from the chest to the waist, showcasing the overall tailoring and layering of the clothing. The background is a single light gray wall, simple and clean, without unnecessary elements, creating a minimalist sense of space. On the left side of the painting, a strong light source shines from the side and back, creating a distinct backlighting effect. Light passes through the fine dust in the air, creating a warm halo and soft beams. The transition of light and shadow is natural, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow, blending off-white, light gray, and gold, creating a harmonious and unified color. Through focusing light and guiding composition, the light moves along the path to her hand and ring, finally returning to the shape of the entire body. In the lower right corner of the frame, there is a phrase reading \"Our Street Style Moment.\" The font is fine, the colors are light, and do not interfere with the subject. The overall atmosphere is quiet and gentle. It carries a slight nostalgic feel, like an afternoon sunlight streaming through a window into a room, full of poetry and storytelling, as if recording a forgotten beautiful moment. It has the texture of professional studio shooting, yet retains the natural feel of everyday life occasionally. Using high-quality cameras and large aperture lenses, the depth of field is well controlled, the background blur is soft, the subject is clear and sharp, and the lighting is handled delicately, presenting a cinematic visual style. The composition is balanced, with the subject centered slightly to the left, leaving a moderate amount of negative space. It enhances the breathability and artistry of the composition, presenting an elegant, restrained, and emotionally charged visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
