        {
          "id": "krea2-371d688ba0e93de027b72561",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣椅上严肃坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden folding chair, wearing an off-white knit cardigan and a matching short skirt, with a white bodysuit underneath. She wears white lace knee-high stockings, her legs crossed, her posture relaxed and natural. She wears delicate earrings. The overall look is sweet and cute, full of youthful energy. The foreground is the main figure, occupying the left central position of the composition. The composition uses a medium perspective, presenting the figure fully from above the waist, with the body slightly tilted and the head slightly turned to the side, forming a graceful S-shaped curve. The background is a warm indoor environment. On the right is a wooden cabinet furnished with plush teddy bears, glass jars of cookies, and woven baskets, creating a cozy home atmosphere. On the left are wooden walls and a folding chair, with light-colored wood flooring. Light softly streams in through the left window, creating a warm backlighting effect. Sunlight filters through the window lattice, casting mottled shadows on the figures, creating bright outline light. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and off-white, harmonious and unified, with rich layers of light and shadow. It presents a lazy and comfortable afternoon atmosphere, forming a subtle visual loop. The composition emphasizes blank space and balance, with characters occupying the main space but not oppressive. Background elements are just rightly decorated, creating a peaceful and warm atmosphere, as if capturing an ordinary yet poetic everyday moment. Using a large aperture lens, the background blur is well handled to highlight the subject, resulting in a delicate image texture and clear details. It also retains a certain graininess of film and slight overexposure, creating a vintage film photography texture. The lighting is soft and directional, emphasizing three-dimensionality and layering. The overall style combines characteristics of Japanese photography with lifestyle aesthetics, conveying a quiet, healing, and beautiful mood",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
