        {
          "id": "krea2-bd64f4a4f91087fbcc8fed54",
          "alias": "单女和服咖啡厅坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a brightly colored kimono sits inside a Japanese restaurant. The kimono is white as the base color, printed with large red floral patterns. The petal edges feature a delicate gradient effect, accented with green leaves and pink flowers. The overall pattern is full and layered. A wide deep blue obi belt hangs at her waist, its end naturally falling into elegant pleats. She is sitting sideways at a wooden table. The right hand gently holds a pink straw, while the left hand holds a transparent glass cup. The glass holds a golden, chilled drink, with the ice cubes clearly visible. The drink's surface glows faintly, while the background is a blurred Japanese restaurant interior. Warm yellow light streams through the window into the room, creating a cozy and gentle atmosphere. Outside the window, traditional lanterns and signs can be faintly seen. The interior furnishings include wooden tabletops, seasoning bottles, tissue boxes, and other daily necessities. The composition uses close-up shots, with the figure positioned on the right side of the frame, head slightly tilted, and light and shadow slanting in from the left. A natural transition of light and shadow is formed, with delicate and soft shadows, background blur treatment making the subject stand out, and the overall color tone is warm and harmonious, full of life and artistic beauty, as if capturing a quiet and beautiful moment. It has strong visual guidance, rich and authentic details, presenting an elegant and beautiful touch in everyday life",
