        {
          "id": "krea2-508d853da804c21db3fd2693",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫卧室困倦坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sat on the bedroom bed, adding a touch of laziness and gentleness. She wore a loose white shirt with slightly rolled cuffs, underneath a light green dress that spread lightly over her legs, revealing a small tattoo with intricate patterns. Her hands were folded over her chest, her fingers slender and long, and a simple ring on her ring finger, as if lost in her own thoughts. Her body leaned forward slightly, her posture relaxed yet elegant. Behind her was a wooden nightstand. On top sits a vintage-style film camera, next to a book with a red cover and a white flowerpot. Inside the pot is a vibrant green plant, full of life. Above the bedside table hangs a round wooden-framed mirror, reflecting part of the room. Light streams in diagonally through the right window, forming a bright beam that illuminates the entire space. On the windowsill is a potted greenery, its leaves shining especially bright in the sunlight. The room's walls are light-colored, giving a warm and comfortable feeling. The floor is dark wood, contrasting with the light-colored walls. The sheets are white, soft in texture, and naturally wrinkled. By the bed is a metal-framed headlamp with a simple and modern design. The composition uses a high-angle overhead shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right, while furniture and objects in the background are distributed to the left and back, creating a visual balance. The foreground features details of the figure's body and hands, the middle is the bed, nightstand, and parts of the wall, while the background features windows, plants, and furniture in the distance. The lighting effect is very prominent. Sunlight streams in diagonally through the window, creating distinct halos and light spots in the air, creating a warm and dreamy atmosphere. At the same time, delicate transitions are left in the shadows. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow, with soft orange and brown tones, giving a nostalgic and cozy feeling. The image is full of life and artistic beauty, as if capturing a quiet and intimate moment, like a daily scene shot with an old-fashioned camera. The lens is slightly out of focus, with natural vignetting and noise at the edges. The color saturation is moderate, presenting a unique texture of film photography. The image is rich in details and distinct layers, featuring both a clear outline of the subject and a blurred background, enhancing visual depth and three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, evoking a subtle sense of loneliness and beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
