        {
          "id": "krea2-898a3a153773d1bdd79dda51",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors on the red brick steps, wearing a white puff-sleeve short-sleeve shirt paired with a pink spaghetti strap long dress. She wears casual canvas shoes with pink and white patchwork, with black capital letters \"R\" and \"V\" printed on the upper. The toe is decorated with tassels, giving the overall look fresh and sweet, full of youthful energy, appearing casual and cute. She leans slightly to the side, leans forward, hands naturally resting on her knees, fingers gently interlaced, her posture relaxed and elegant. Looking directly at the camera, she conveys a warm and natural appeal. It exudes a pure and innocent temperament. In the foreground is a step paved with red square bricks, neatly arranged with slightly worn edges. The ground has fine dust and stains, showing traces of daily life. Below the steps is a gray asphalt pavement with a white traffic marking, clear lines but slightly worn down. The background is a simple light gray cement wall, smooth but with slight texture and mottling. In the corner is a potted green plant with slender, feather-like leaves, and beside it is a red spherical ornament, possibly part of a sculpture or flowerpot, adding a splash of color to the scene. The lighting throughout the scene is soft and even, like natural light on a cloudy day or early morning, without strong shadows, creating a peaceful and comfortable atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame, body slightly tilted, creating a dynamic visual balance. The head is slightly tilted back, with the gaze facing the camera. The slanted lines of the steps and the floor lines serve as visual guides, enhancing the sense of space and depth in the image. The colors are soft pink, White and gray are the main tones, accented with green and red, forming a harmonious color scheme that presents a sense of everyday life and everyday beauty. It looks like a real photo casually taken on the street with a regular camera, full of a strong sense of life and a documentary style. The light and shadow processing is delicate, with soft shadows that are soft and unobtrusive, creating a warm and authentic atmosphere. The image texture is close to film photography, with slight graininess and low color saturation, enhancing the retro and nostalgic feel. The overall composition is stable and the layers are distinct, rich in details, combining artistic beauty with a sense of realism in life, conveying a relaxed, pleasant, and warm emotional experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
