        {
          "id": "krea2-e42c0f433ad6eebfa1759c7a",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙城市冷淡坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the dim indoor floor, wearing a loose white slip dress. She slightly lowers her head and gazes ahead, her right hand gently touching an orange plate on the floor. A faint flame burns inside, creating a warm layer of light and shadow. In the foreground are scattered white pills and several medicine bottles. One bottle leans down, pills scattered, and the edges of the orange plate gleam with metallic sheen The flame inside the plate flickers continuously, emitting a faint warm yellow glow that illuminates a small surrounding area. The background is an ordinary family kitchen, with a faint outline of a refrigerator faintly visible. The door frame and walls appear in a cool gray tone, forming a strong contrast with the warm light in the foreground. The composition uses a low-angle shot, with the figure occupying the lower right corner of the frame. The overall scene presents a sense of oppression, loneliness, and a strong sense of storytelling. The light mainly comes from the flames on the plate, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow, with the shadowed areas deep and heavy. It highlights the complex emotions within the characters, with a predominantly cool gray color scheme accented by warm yellow halos, creating a hazy beauty where reality and fantasy intertwine. The camera captures a quiet and tense moment, as if time has stopped at this moment. The entire scene resembles a real-life clip shot with amateur equipment, with slight noise and film texture, enhancing the image's realism and documentary quality. The environmental details are rich but not overly rendered, preserving the roughness of everyday life. The interplay of light and shadow conveys a silent cry and struggle. The visual focus is on the interaction between the characters and the flames. The flames are not only a source of light but also symbolize hope, destruction, or the release of some unspeakable emotion. The overall atmosphere is both intimate and highly dramatic, presenting a psychological dilemma of modern urban youth under pressure. The visuals are minimally adorned, relying solely on simple objects and the characters' states to convey profound emotions. The composition is compact but not crowded, with just the right amount of blank space, creating a memorable narrative space. The color scheme is restrained yet expressive, with warm and cool contrasts that intensify psychological conflict. The overall style is close to the high-contrast, low-saturation treatment found in cinematography, with a clear artistic tendency. At the same time, it maintains the raw realism of everyday scenes, as if recording the most authentic state of mind of an ordinary person alone late at night. Every element in the frame serves the theme, from the expressions of the figures to the placement of objects and the use of light and shadow, together constructing a contemporary life picture full of metaphor and poetry",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
