        {
          "id": "krea2-16f04e2174f9331b57286f71",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙厨房俏皮坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a white tiled kitchen countertop, wearing a delicate floral embroidered spaghetti strap dress over a loose blue-and-white plaid long coat. The coat is casually draped over her shoulders, revealing the gorgeous details of the inner layer, naturally draped over her shoulders. The overall look blends vintage and modern elements, full of artistic flair. She sits in the kitchen, with a light beige square tiled wall as the background. In the corner of the wall are metal pipes and the edge of the range hood. On the left countertop sits a green cast iron kettle, next to a black gas stove. Sunlight streams in diagonally from the right side of the image, casting clear shadows on the wall and creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. The light is warm and soft, presenting a golden afternoon atmosphere. The entire scene is enveloped in a tranquil and lazy atmosphere. The composition uses medium shots and close-ups, with the figure occupying the left central position, body slightly tilted, legs crossed, one foot on the edge of the countertop. The other foot dangling in the air, relaxed and elegant, extends to the overall outfit and environmental details. The colors are mainly warm yellow, accented with blue, pink, green, and other rich hues, creating a cozy, retro, and lively scene. It looks like a fashion magazine shot with a professional camera, or a moment casually captured in daily life, with a strong cinematic feel and storytelling. The details are rich, from clothing textures to light and shadow changes clearly visible. Overall, it presents an artistic style that blends sophistication with a sense of everyday life",
