        {
          "id": "krea2-cfbcd9e6ee1668e2109bbbfb",
          "alias": "单女绿衬衫城市俏皮站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of an outdoor laundry room, her expression natural and relaxed, as if engaged in a silent conversation with the viewer, appearing healthy and lively. She wears a green and white plaid shirt with soft fabric and wide cuffs, presenting a vintage and comfortable style. Over it, she wears white overalls, which are thick with slight wrinkles and signs of use, showcasing the texture of everyday life. Her hands are naturally placed at her sides, her body slightly tilted, and her posture relaxed and relaxed. The background is a somewhat messy but lively laundry room. You can see an old washing machine with a metal shell that is somewhat worn, surrounded by various miscellaneous items including plastic bottles, cleaning supplies, and some tools. Several black pipes hang on the wall, and a beam hangs from the ceiling. The entire scene presents a daily atmosphere of an old urban community. The composition uses medium shots, with the person positioned slightly to the left center, head slightly tilted, and gaze directly on the camera, creating a strong visual direction. The foreground clearly shows the main subject with rich details. The middle ground is the laundry area behind the figure. Although slightly blurred, the main objects are still recognizable. The background features distant architectural structures and some blurred objects. The shallow depth of field effect focuses the focus on the figures, with soft and even light and shadow, like natural light on cloudy or evening days. The light shines from above and enhances the sense of depth. The overall tone is warm with a slight film texture, and the color saturation is moderate. The green plaid shirt contrasts sharply with the white overalls, yet harmoniously united. The edges of the frame are slightly darkened, creating a nostalgic atmosphere, as if taken with an old-fashioned camera, full of a strong sense of life and art. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and warm, evoking a beautiful moment in ordinary life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
