        {
          "id": "krea2-5835364c32cc92e5411c55ea",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套沉思站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beneath a blooming cherry tree, wearing a dark blue quilted jacket with a white shirt and a plaid long skirt. She wears a light-colored beret and round metallic fine-framed glasses. Her left hand gently rests on the frame, her right hand rests on the white railing, and she carries a dark canvas bag on her shoulder. The overall look exudes a youthful Japanese collegiate style. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of center in the frame, composed using a medium shot. The figure occupies about two-thirds of the height of the frame, with a background of large blooming white cherry blossoms with dense and lush petals. The intertwined branches create soft blurred light spots, sunlight streaming through the gaps in the flowers, creating a warm backlight effect and a dreamlike light and shadow atmosphere. The foreground features a clear white wooden railing, sharply contrasting with the blurred background and highlighting the main figures. The middle ground is the transitional area between the figures and cherry trees, while the background is a soft-focus cherry blossom forest. In the distance, faint green leaves and some purple flower clusters can be seen, with rich color layers, ranging from pure white in the foreground to deep blue, white, and brown in the middle to pinkish and pale purple in the background. Soft green forms a harmonious gradient tone. Light comes from the upper left, creating a soft side backlight, outlining the figure's outline with a golden halo. The expression is slightly contemplative, and the overall scene presents a tranquil and beautiful spring afternoon atmosphere, with the grainy texture and slight overexposure characteristic of film photography. It feels like a moment shot with an old-fashioned camera. The color saturation is moderate, the tone is warm, with a retro filter effect. The image details are rich, from the quilted texture of the jacket to the fabric pleats of the plaid skirt, all clearly visible. The delicate texture of cherry blossom petals and the tiny traces of insects flying can be faintly discerned. The entire scene is full of poetry and romance, as if capturing the gentlest moments of youth. The composition follows a golden ratio, with figures naturally relaxed and gazing slightly upward, creating an atmosphere of gazing up at spring. Light and shadow transition naturally, progressing from bright highlights to soft shadows, enhancing the three-dimensionality and spatial depth of the composition. The overall visual guide leads from the foreground railing to the figures, then extends to the background cherry blossom forest. It forms a smooth visual flow and creates a tranquil and far-reaching atmosphere, like a silent poem telling stories about spring, youth, and dreams",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
