        {
          "id": "krea2-464f18fc4969e4a3a58e178f",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣森林忧伤奔跑侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman holds a transparent umbrella in the rain, looking up at the sky with a calm and imaginative expression. She wears a white knitted sweater with a soft knit texture clearly visible, jet black and smooth. Her right hand is raised, fingers lightly touching the umbrella surface, as if feeling the coolness of the raindrops. Her left hand firmly grips the handle, her posture elegant and natural. The transparent umbrella is covered with fine water droplets, which rainwater slides down the surface, forming crystal-clear water marks. The umbrella ribs are clearly visible, the metal frame reflects a faint light, and the canopy surface curves gently, showing a gentle curve. The background is dense green leaves, layered and varying shades of green, creating a rich forest atmosphere. The leaves appear especially moist in the rain, with water droplets shimmering in the faint light. Some leaf edges are slightly blurred, enhancing the sense of depth. She tilts her head slightly upward, as if whispering softly or breathing in the fresh air after the rain. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure occupying the lower left of the frame, the head and arms forming a diagonal extension that guides the gaze upward. The transparent umbrella runs diagonally through the upper right corner of the image, forming a diagonal composition that enhances visual tension. The edges overlap with leaves, creating a sense of layering and space. The light and shadow are soft, with an overall cool tone, dominated by green and white. Green comes from the vitality and moisture of leaves, while white comes from the purity of sweaters and umbrellas. Light streams from above through the gaps in the leaves, creating a mottled effect of light and shadow. There are slight backlights in some areas, softening the figure's outlines. Raindrops on the umbrella surface create highlights like scattered pearls. This adds to the dynamics of the image. The entire scene is enveloped in a tranquil, poetic, and slightly melancholic atmosphere, as if time has stopped at this moment. The air is filled with the fresh scent of soil and plants after the rain. The image has a strong cinematic and artistic atmosphere, rich in detail and authentic texture, as if shot with professional photography equipment, yet retaining the beauty of moments occasionally captured in daily life. Color saturation is moderate. The contrast is soft, presenting an overall gentle, delicate, and emotionally rich visual language, allowing one to feel the unique romance and tranquility of rainy days. There are no unnecessary decorations in the image; all elements serve to express emotion. The composition is simple yet layered, the light and shadow changes are subtle, and the details are meticulously handled, conveying a restrained yet profound emotional experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
