        {
          "id": "krea2-a756b6900d9fe7e5410b224c",
          "alias": "单女女仆女仆装室内忧伤坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a classic maid outfit sits on a pure white floor, wearing a pure white pleated maid headpiece on her head. The edges of the headpiece rise and fall slightly, presenting a soft wavy silhouette that contrasts sharply with her fair skin. It carries a subtle melancholy and contemplation, radiating a healthy glow. Her overall aura is both pure and a touch of mystery. She wears a black-and-white maid uniform, with a white stand-collar shirt featuring wide ruffled cuffs, which are puffy and layered. The neckline is adorned with a few delicate black buttons, and the chest is decorated with delicate white lace trim. The hem is black and soft, with delicate white lace patterns embroidered along the edges. The hem naturally spreads across the floor, forming an elegant curve. She wears a pair of high-top black stockings, with smooth and slightly reflective surfaces that outline the graceful lines of her legs. At the ankles, you can faintly see black camisole details. She sits cross-legged, her right leg pressing against her left, her posture dignified yet graceful. Her left hand gently rests on the hem of her skirt, fingers long, painted bright red nail polish, creating a strong visual contrast with the black stockings. In the background is a light gray fabric sofa with a simple and flat backrest, a light wood frame, smooth lines, and delicate materials. Part of the wooden structure is exposed underneath, adding a sense of realism to the space. The entire scene is set in a bright indoor environment, with pure white walls and white floors. Light pours evenly from the left side of the frame, creating a soft, diffused lighting effect. The transition of light and shadow is natural, with slight shadows on the right side of the figure and the floor enhancing the sense of depth. The composition uses a mid-field perspective, with the figure positioned slightly below the center of the frame, arranged diagonally. The crossed legs form a diagonal line that guides the gaze toward the center. The horizontal lines of the sofa contrast with the figure's vertical posture, balancing the visual focus of the image. The foreground features the lower body and crossed legs, which stand out clearly; the middle ground features the upper body and part of the skirt; the background is the sofa and wall, creating a clear layered structure. The visual guide extends from the character's head down to the crossed legs, then toward the ground, forming a complete visual loop. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, pure, and slightly classical romantic. The colors are mainly black, white, and gray, accented with a touch of red. The tones are harmonious and unified, with soft and delicate light and shadow, as if from a professional studio, yet retaining the natural texture of daily life. It is like a high-quality portrait shot with a regular camera, possessing strong artistic expression and emotional appeal, with clean and crisp images. With no unnecessary elements to distract the audience, the focus is on the emotional expression of the characters themselves and the presentation of clothing details, conveying a serene, restrained, yet story-rich aesthetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
