        {
          "id": "krea2-cedee6149a482de5f99bd660",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫森林忧伤坐戏水",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a clear stream, wearing a white short-sleeved shirt and a black plaid skirt. The shirt collar is tied with a black bow tie, and the sleeves are rolled up to the elbows, presenting a style that lies between formal and casual. Her expression reveals a hint of calm and detachment. Her body leans slightly forward, her right arm supporting the rocks beside her, while her left hand gently touches the water's surface, creating subtle ripples. Her legs are half-submerged, knees bent, and below the ankles are completely submerged in the shallow water, with the water gently lapping against her calves. The water surface reflects the outline of her lower body and the surrounding light and shadow. In the foreground is flowing stream, shimmering on the water's surface, reflecting the pale blue of the sky and the emerald green of the surrounding vegetation. The water is highly transparent, allowing you to clearly see pebbles and fine sand at the bottom. A few fallen leaves and tiny plant remains float on the water, adding a sense of naturalness. In the middle frame, the female subject is positioned slightly to the left of the frame. Shot at a low angle, the figure stands out even more. The background features moss-covered rocks and dense green vegetation. The rock surface is moist, and the moss displays different layers of green, ranging from bright green to deep green, with a delicate texture. Some rocky edges show traces of water erosion. deep in the background, there is a small waterfall where water cascades down from above, creating white splashes and mist, enhancing the sense of depth in the space. Distant trees and shrubs blend into a soft green tone. The composition uses a three-part layout: the figure occupies the left third and the right side leaves ample space to showcase the natural landscape. At the same time, the lines of the stream guide the gaze deeper into the painting, creating a dynamic visual balance. The overall color palette is mainly cool green and white, creating a fresh, tranquil, and slightly cool atmosphere. The light is naturally scattered, coming from the upper left with no strong shadows. The water surface reflects a soft sheen, and the waterfall area in the background produces slight bright spots due to light refraction. The transition of light and shadow is natural, creating a tranquil and poetic atmosphere, as if capturing a moment forgotten deep within the forest. The images have a high degree of realism and delicate texture, as if taken with professional photography equipment in the early morning or evening. They have a film-like grainy texture and color saturation, while preserving the authenticity of occasional records from daily life. The images contain no artificial decorations, emphasizing the integration of the natural environment and the people, conveying a sense of harmonious coexistence between humans and nature yet somewhat lonely",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
