        {
          "id": "krea2-8d49ad0e38bfa0b50b9dc8e2",
          "alias": "单女床愤怒躺自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman lies sideways on a soft dark brown plush blanket, her body slightly leaned back, legs naturally stretched upward, barefoot suspended in the air, toes relaxed and stretched, presenting a lazy and casual posture that adds a touch of mystery and privacy. She tightly grips a black Canon vintage film camera, with the lens facing forward, as if shooting or about to press the shutter. The \"Canon\" logo on the camera body is clearly visible, with a slight reflection at the lens edge, showing a metallic texture and vintage design. Her fingers are slender Her nails are painted light-colored, her movements focused and composed. The foreground features her hands holding the camera and the camera subject, occupying the visual center. The composition uses low-angle downward shots to make the figure appear more approachable and immersive, while highlighting the camera as the core element. The middle ground is the lower half of her body and parts of the bed. The blanket has delicate textures and natural folds, with light creating a soft transition of light and dark on the fabric surface. The background is a simple interior wall in light gray-white tones, with subtle textures and a vertical shadow line It may be the outline of a door frame or cabinet. On the left side, a corner of a blue curtain can be faintly seen, injecting a touch of warmth into the overall cool tone. The entire scene is enveloped by warm side backlighting, with the light source coming from the upper left of the image. Sunlight passes through the window and pours into the room, casting long shadows on the background and floor. The contrast of light and shadow is strong but not glaring, creating a quiet and layered atmosphere. The overall tone of the painting leans toward warm yellow, with obvious film graininess and slight overexposure. It simulates the authentic texture of vintage film cameras, with moderate color saturation and a slight faded effect, enhancing the mood of nostalgia and the passage of time. The composition uses an asymmetrical layout, with the character and camera positioned at the lower right of the frame, leaving plenty of negative space to guide the gaze to the upper left, creating a sense of breath and storytelling. The visual direction starts with the camera in the foreground, follows the lines of the characters' arms and bodies, gradually extending to the legs and walls in the background, and finally settles on the slanting light and the fluttering curtains. This forms a subtle dynamic path, with an overall atmosphere that is peaceful, private, and full of life. It resembles a real moment under the afternoon sun, capturing the natural state of photography enthusiasts taking selfies at home. It is both artistic and retains the warmth of everyday life, like a precious memory recorded with an old camera, possessing strong narrative and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
