        {
          "id": "krea2-28cef2e140731041effaacf7",
          "alias": "单女黑外套公园忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways in an autumn park, as if gazing at the sky or something beautiful in the distance. Her expression carries a hint of contemplation and longing. Her head is slightly tilted back, her neck lines graceful and smooth. She wears a black-and-white plaid tweed coat with thick texture and clearly visible patterns. The plaid pattern is woven from black and off-white, presenting a classic Scottish style. The coat has a wide neckline and naturally draped lapels, with vintage round buttons and a light-colored knit sweater underneath. The neckline and shoulder lines are faintly revealed, creating an overall simple yet layered look. The figure is positioned in the lower right of the frame, occupying about one-third of the composition, forming the visual focal point. The background is a large patch of blurred golden leaves, which glow warmly golden under sunlight. Some leaves emit a soft halo, creating a beautiful bokeh effect. The trunk's outline is faintly visible, branches intertwine and extend, and the sky reveals a pale blue through the leaves. Light falls from the upper left, creating a soft backlight effect and a distinct outline light. This separates the subject from the background, highlights the subject, and the transition of light and shadow is natural, with moderate contrast between light and shadow, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle downward view to enhance the character's elegant temperament and sense of spatial depth. The foreground is blurred, the background shows obvious out-of-focus imaging, and the depth of field is relatively shallow, emphasizing the subject. The composition uses the rule of thirds: the figure is positioned to the right, leaving ample space on the left side for the background color and light. The visual guide line is directed from the character's line of sight toward the upper left of the frame. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, off-white, and black, accented with a pale blue sky. The colors are harmonious and unified, full of autumn's unique warmth and poetry. The image texture is delicate and rich, with both natural light and shadow from real photography and a soft atmosphere of artistic treatment, presenting a beautiful moment captured unintentionally in daily life. Like street photography with a medium format film camera, the lens slightly out of focus brings a hazy beauty, noise is natural, and color saturation is moderate. The overall style leans toward a blend of realism and romanticism, conveying a quiet, warm, and slightly melancholic autumn mood",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
