        {
          "id": "krea2-aa134539a256aa22c9489db1",
          "alias": "单女蓝和服门坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a tatami mat in a traditional Japanese room, wearing a blue-and-white striped kimono yukata. The yukata's collar is wide open, revealing one shoulder and collarbone. Around her waist is a wide deep blue sash, the ends naturally hanging down, forming elegant pleats and curves. Her body leans slightly back, her head resting on the edge of a wooden cabinet, her expression gentle yet slightly lazy. Her overall posture is relaxed and expressive. One arm hangs naturally, the other hand gently supports her side, legs slightly bent, knees raised, The calves stretch naturally, sunlight streams in diagonally through the shoji door on the right, casting soft shadows on the floor and the figures. The light is warm and bright, presenting a golden tone at dusk. The room is simply furnished, with traditional Japanese sliding doors and wooden lattice structures in the background. The shoji doors are made of white, semi-transparent paper, with dark brown frames and clearly visible grain. The floor is covered with light yellow tatami mats with woven textures, giving a realistic texture. The composition uses a high-angle overhead view, with the figure as the center. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, with a large space left at the lower right to form a visual guiding line. Light enters from the upper right, creating a clear contrast between light and dark. However, the edges of clothing and shadows transition naturally, with rich layers of light and shadow. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, warm, and full of Eastern aesthetic charm. The color tones are mainly warm yellow, off-white, dark brown, and blue-white, with harmonious and unified colors. The image has a slight film graininess and a low-saturation retro texture, as if captured with an old-fashioned camera. The lens is slightly out of focus and the background is slightly blurred. Highlighting the main subject, the overall scene presents a private, tranquil, and life-filled Japanese-style interior, like an ordinary moment when afternoon sunlight fills the room, quietly containing gentle emotional expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
