        {
          "id": "krea2-1178a8acc232dd32a9441ace",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣室内沉思倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sat sideways in a warm indoor setting, appearing both casual and refined. She wore a red, black, and white plaid knit jacket with a black leather neckline, adding a touch of coolness and layering. The jacket's texture was clearly visible, presenting a delicate woven texture. Her posture was relaxed and elegant, her body slightly leaning forward, head turned to one side, her expression focused and slightly contemplative, as if pondering something. She wore tiny gold earrings that sparkled softly under soft light. Adding delicate details to the overall design, the foreground features the backrest of a wooden chair with a smooth surface and natural wood grain. The backrest curves smoothly, forming an intimate spatial relationship with the figure. The middle section is a blurred indoor environment, where a warm yellow desk lamp emits soft light, creating a cozy and comfortable atmosphere. In the background, some blurred furniture outlines and decorations can be faintly seen, such as red cups and white tissue boxes on the table. These elements, though not clear, enrich the scene's sense of realism. The composition combines close-ups with mid-shot blur, focusing on the subject, using shallow depth of field effects to highlight the subject while retaining some environmental information to enhance spatial sense. Visual guidance naturally leads the right side of the frame through the character's gaze and posture, forming a dynamic viewing path. In terms of light and shadow, the main light source comes from the left-side desk lamp, creating a delicate transition between light and shadow. The shadowed parts naturally blend into the background, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color tone leans toward warmth, mainly orange-yellow and brown. It creates a quiet, private, and story-rich atmosphere. The visuals have a strong cinematic and everyday atmosphere, as if capturing a daily moment. It resembles a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens, while preserving the authentic and natural texture of amateur equipment shooting. The image details are rich, from clothing textures to light and shadow changes handled perfectly, presenting an overall visual experience that combines artistic beauty with the warmth of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
