        {
          "id": "krea2-b279669a2d2e8f6335a35833",
          "alias": "单女白礼服婚礼困倦躺",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a flawless white strapless wedding dress lies gracefully in a dreamy space made of multiple layers of lightweight tulle fabric, adding a touch of laziness and gentleness. She wears a subtle yet warm smile, revealing feelings of happiness and contentment. Her hands fold under her head, her posture relaxed and relaxed, as if immersed in a peaceful and beautiful dream. The upper body of the dress is designed simply to fit the figure, highlighting the graceful lines of her shoulders and neck. The hem of the dress is made from countless layers of white tulle as thin as cicada wings, layered together. This forms a fluffy, full A-shaped silhouette, with each layer of gauze radiating a soft sheen. Under the light, it presents delicate textures and layers. The sheer fabric is light and flowing, gently swaying in the wind, creating a cloud-like soft visual effect. The entire composition is dominated by pure white and light gray tones, pure and unified in color. The background is a large area of white sheer drape, layered like clouds blown by the wind, forming a flowing, wave-like structure. The foreground features a spread-out wedding dress that occupies most of the image, creating a strong visual impact. The middle ground is the main subject, clear and prominent, while the background features hazy gauze drapes and faintly visible gray walls. The contrast between solid and void is obvious, enhancing the sense of layering in the image. Light comes from the upper left of the image, providing soft, diffused light. The light and shadow are evenly spread across the figure and the wedding dress, with no harsh shadows, only subtle transitions of light and shadow. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is tranquil, romantic, and poetic. The image presents a surreal and pure beauty, as if capturing the most private and authentic moments before the wedding. It features professional studio lighting and high-resolution detail rendering, while preserving the casual naturalness and realism found in everyday shooting. The lens simulates a large-format camera paired with a standard prime lens, with precise depth control and soft background blur. The edges of the frame have slight film graininess and color shifts, enhancing a retro yet cozy visual texture. The entire image combines the artistic flair of a high-end fashion blockbuster with a warm, everyday atmosphere, conveying a profound emotional resonance about love, dreams, and beautiful moments",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
