        {
          "id": "krea2-c792e2d0abe88fbc78ceaaae",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙摄影棚站立持花",
          "prompt": "A woman stands between two thick tree trunks, her body slightly tilted against the left trunk. Her right hand hangs naturally, while her left hand raises a bouquet of pale pink and white flowers high. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, her expression revealing serenity and contentment. She wears a light blue lace dress adorned with delicate floral embroidery, light and bright in texture. Underneath, she wears a light pink long-sleeved shirt with slightly rolled sleeves revealing slender arms. On her feet are a pair of silver high-heeled sandals, with laces wrapped around her ankles. Paired with white socks printed with letters, the overall look is both retro and romantic. In the foreground are two sturdy tree trunks, with clearly visible bark grain. The dark brown bark is covered with crisscrossing cracks and uneven grooves, giving a heavy yet realistic feel. The trunk extends upward from the bottom of the painting, forming a natural frame structure that frames the figure in the center. The middle is where the woman stands and a small patch of grass around her, with sparse green grass and withered fallen leaves covering the ground, sunlight streaming onto it. This creates mottled light and shadow. The background is an open woodland environment, with rows of trees in the distance and straight trunks. The colors are mainly gray-white and light brown, with lush branches and leaves showing different layers of green. The sky is faintly visible, with bright and soft tones. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame. At the same time, the vertical lines of the trunks enhance the image's stability and depth. The light comes from the upper right. Sunlight filters through the leaves, creating a soft transition of light and shadow on the figures. The wrinkles and lace textures of the clothing are clearly visible under the light, while the shadowed areas are soft and layered. The overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, carrying a strong spring vibe. The colors are mainly light blue, pale pink, off-white, olive green, and brown, with fresh and elegant tones that create a poetic pastoral beauty. The texture of the images is close to professional studio outdoor shoots, while retaining the authenticity of natural outdoor lighting. It feels like a film-style photo taken with a high-resolution camera, with a slightly blurred background that highlights the subject while maintaining the integrity of the environmental information. The entire scene is filled with a tranquil romantic mood, as if time has frozen at this moment, capturing a gentle and beautiful moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
