        {
          "id": "krea2-c0557cb43b14d6a8d9322b1e",
          "alias": "单女黑泳装海滩忧伤跪",
          "prompt": "A woman sat on the beach, wearing a black bikini with a black thin ribbon design on the upper half and a bow on the back. The lower half was black high-waisted swim trunks with pleated details at the waist. The panties underneath were tie-dyeed pink and purple, creating a soft gradient effect that looked slightly damp. She turned sideways to look back at the camera, her expression calm yet tinged with tenderness and contemplation. Her body leaned slightly forward, hands resting lightly on her knees, ankles and soles covered in fine sand, toes naturally stretched out, glowing with a faint sheen. The main subject of the composition is positioned slightly to the right of the composition, using a medium perspective. The figures occupy about two-thirds of the frame, with a wide beach in the background. The sand is light brown, with fine grains and scattered shell fragments on the surface. In the distance, the gray-blue sea surface gently laps the shore, forming white foam. The sky displays a uniform gray-white tone, thick clouds, soft and diffuse light, with no obvious shadows. The overall atmosphere is calm and slightly melancholic, with cool tones predominantly highlighting the figures' presence. The composition adopts a slightly tilted perspective. It enhances the dynamic and realistic feel of the image, creating a profound sense of space. The camera uses a mid-focus lens to simulate the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment, with slight noise and natural color reproduction. The light and shadow processing is delicate, emphasizing even distribution of ambient light to avoid overexposure or missing dark areas. Overall, it presents a private, authentic, and lifelike imaging style, as if captured by chance on an ordinary summer evening, with a strong sense of realism and emotional resonance. The edges of the frame have slight vignetting, It enhances the central focus effect while preserving natural depth variations: grains of sand in the foreground are clearly visible, figures in the middle are sharply defined, backgrounds gradually blur, layers are rich, and the overall color tone is warm and restrained, neither exaggerated nor cold, conveying a quiet beauty and a cherishing of everyday moments",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
