        {
          "id": "krea2-860cf4b58c6981c2d266713a",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫教室沉思坐摆拍",
          "prompt": "She wears a white long-sleeved shirt with a slightly open neckline, wearing a light gray thin tie. She pairs a brown plaid pleated short skirt with a brown plaid pleated skirt that drapes down naturally, revealing her long legs clad in black pantyhose. On her feet are black patent leather loafers with smooth, reflective uppers, giving the overall look a youthful, lively, yet elegant look. She lifts one leg and straddles the edge of an old wooden desk. The body is in a dynamically balanced posture: left leg bent and raised, toes touching the ground, right arm raised and fist placed in front of chest, striking a pose full of strength and confidence. Left hand lightly rests on the desk to maintain balance, movements smooth and natural, as if expressing some declaration or inner strength. In the foreground, the desk surface shows slight wear, with clear wood grain. On the desk sits an open notebook and a pen, and beside it, a dark brown canvas backpack casually rests on the floor. The zipper is slightly open, revealing the outline of items inside. The background is a blurred indoor space, possibly a school corridor or classroom, with huge white columns. In the distance, neatly arranged windows stream in the wall, letting in warm golden sunlight and creating a soft backlight effect. Light enters diagonally from the right, creating distinct contour light and shadow layers on and around the figure, creating a warm, bright, and vibrant atmosphere. The composition uses a three-part layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the center on the left side of the frame, their bodies extending diagonally, enhancing visual dynamism. The background blur highlights the subject, The shallow depth of field gives both foreground and background a soft and blurred feel. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and off-white, contrasted with brown and black. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, with strong but not awkward contrasts. The image texture is delicate and detailed, giving it the realism of everyday amateur equipment. It's like capturing a moment in the afternoon sunlight with an old-fashioned film camera, full of youthful energy and storytelling. The overall atmosphere feels like a carefully curated photo work, or like a moments of life captured casually, conveying a positive, hopeful emotional tone",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
