        {
          "id": "krea2-a96e6c1f03ab69a54b337f4c",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫桥忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a city pedestrian bridge at night, wearing a loose white long-sleeved shirt with a naturally draped hem revealing her waistline, paired with dark jeans. The overall look is simple yet casual, adding a touch of laziness and gentleness. She leans relaxedly against a wooden railing, her left hand gently resting on the edge, her right hand naturally lowered, her expression slightly thoughtful and calm, presenting a quiet and reserved temperament. The main subject is positioned in the central foreground, slightly tilted to the left of the frame, her body slightly turned to the side. The head turns toward the camera, creating a subtle visual tension. The background is a blurred city nightscape, while distant streetlights and car headlights appear soft under long exposure, creating a beautiful bokeh. The warm yellow light intertwines with the cool-toned night sky, creating a warm yet slightly melancholic atmosphere. The outline of the elevated bridge is faintly visible, and the bridge structure appears geometric lines in the blur, enhancing spatial layering. The wooden railing in the foreground is detailed and natural, bearing traces of time. The vertical lines of the railing contrast with the figures' diagonal postures. The composition uses a center-offset three-part layout, with the characters occupying the main visual focus. The background light spots are evenly distributed, creating a rich visual rhythm. The light comes from surrounding streetlights and traffic, forming a mixed light source. The main light shines from the front left, with natural shadow transitions. Meanwhile, the warm yellow halo in the background injects a nostalgic feel into the entire image. The light and shadow create delicate light and shadow changes on the characters' clothing, highlighting the fabric texture. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and dark brown. Supplemented by a touch of cool gray tones, it creates the unique vintage texture of film photography. The image has slight graininess and color shifts, simulating the effects of vintage camera shots. It feels like a casual snapshot taken with amateur equipment, capturing the tranquility of a city night. The composition is highly narrative, evoking feelings of loneliness, contemplation, or waiting. The viewpoint is close to level and slightly tilted, making the characters appear both real and story-rich. The overall atmosphere is quiet, private, and full of poetry. Like a gentle moment frozen on an ordinary night, the images present a lifelike aesthetic, combining everyday realism with artistic appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
