        {
          "id": "krea2-8f6f931fa4170260c4f440eb",
          "alias": "单女黑丝袜沙发忧伤躺侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman lies relaxed on a soft white sofa, leaning slightly back, legs crossed and raised. Her feet clad in black stockings create a natural visual extension in the scene. She wears a loose white shirt with sleeves naturally hanging down, the collar slightly open, revealing collarbones and part of the neckline. The overall look is simple yet full of everyday charm, adding a touch of dynamic beauty, carrying a thoughtful gentleness and a subtle melancholy, appearing delicate and genuine. Her right hand gently holds her left wrist, fingers naturally bent. On her ring finger is a simple silver ring, with delicate details and a sense of everyday life. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying a slightly lower center position, the head slightly tilted, creating an intimate and natural perspective. The background is a blurred indoor environment, with faint outlines of bookshelves and books, creating a cozy homely atmosphere. Light comes from the front and side, creating a natural shadow transition. The layers of light and shadow are rich, with mainly white and light gray tones, creating a striking yet harmonious unity for the overall atmosphere. It feels as if capturing a quiet moment when afternoon sunlight pours into the room. The image has a strong sense of everyday life and realism, like a natural portrait taken with a regular camera or phone. Without excessive embellishment, it preserves the original texture of life. The color saturation is moderate and slightly warm, enhancing the warm and comfortable visual feeling. The composition is simple yet detailed, the foreground is clear, and the background blur is well handled, forming a visual focal point. Overall, it presents a youthful, innocent, and slightly lazy aesthetic style, combining artistry with a sense of everyday life. It evokes a sense of tranquil and authentic beautiful moments",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
