        {
          "id": "krea2-d09abaa4ee4739fc465fe103",
          "alias": "单女白制服屋顶忧伤倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman squatted on a wooden platform atop a city rooftop, wearing a white short-sleeved school uniform shirt and a gray plaid pleated skirt, with a blue and white striped bow tie around her neckline. Her hands were locked with silver metal handcuffs and held a thick chain, with a white wristband on her wrist. She wore red thin-rimmed glasses, her expression calm yet tinged with stubbornness and detachment. Her body leaned slightly forward, knees bent, feet firmly planted on the ground. The background was a gloomy modern urban complex, with towering buildings in the distance and glass curtain walls reflecting the gray sky. Nearby details include the edges of the cement platform, metal railings, and rattan seats. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figures occupying a slightly lower central position, creating strong visual guidance that highlights the subject. The background blur treatment makes the foreground clearer. The lighting is natural light on a cloudy day, soft and even, with no obvious shadows. The overall tone leans toward coolness, mainly gray, white, and blue, creating a quiet yet slightly oppressive atmosphere with a slight film texture and graininess, reminiscent of everyday scenes shot with an old-fashioned camera. The lens focal length is about 50mm, with a shallow depth of field, emphasizing detail expression. The composition is balanced, the postures of the characters are natural and authentic, and the background elements are rich but not chaotic, presenting a narrative that intertwines urban youth and constraints. The cinematic light and shadow treatment and color coordination retain the authenticity and everyday atmosphere of amateur photography. The overall atmosphere feels like a carefully planned photo shoot or a moment captured by chance on an ordinary afternoon, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
