        {
          "id": "krea2-d89f93898333dde350709711",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣雪地冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a soft, fluffy light blue plush knit jacket with wide and comfortable sleeves, a faint glimpse of white underneath. Around her neck is a thick, soft pink scarf that wraps the neck and chest in layers, presenting a soft gradient of colors. Her hands naturally rest on the snow, fingers slightly bent, as if about to touch or scoop up the snowflakes. The foreground of the scene is covered with pure white, delicate Untrampled snow reflects slightly in the light, presenting a crystal-clear texture and dotted white marks. Through the glass, you can see warm indoor lighting. Next to the door stands a vintage black wall lamp with an off-white wall. On the left is a decorative artificial cedar tree with a thin layer of artificial snow covering its branches and leaves. The overall composition is shot from a low angle, with the person positioned slightly to the left of the frame, slightly leaning forward. The head is slightly tilted, gently gazing at the lens, forming a natural visual guideline. The right side of the frame leaves a large space to highlight the main subject while creating an open winter atmosphere. The light and shadows come from diffused light from cloudy days, soft and even, without strong shadows, casting faint shadows on the snow. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, cozy, romantic, and slightly fairy-tale-like, with a realistic feel like everyday amateur camera photography. It's like capturing a moment with a regular digital camera on a cold morning, with slight noise in the image quality. The color saturation is moderate, preserving the details and warmth of real scenes. The lens has a slight shallow depth of field effect, and the background is slightly blurred, focusing on the subject. The entire image presents a style that blends lifelike, documentary, and artistic beauty, allowing people to feel the purest joy and beauty of winter",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
