        {
          "id": "krea2-d1435b8877822d23f8efa609",
          "alias": "单女湿身白衬衫沉思侧头",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman, tinged with a hint of laziness and gentleness, her expression relaxed and slightly contemplative. She wears a white cotton shirt with fine orange-red vertical stripes, the collar slightly open, and the sleeves puffy and pleated, appearing light and comfortable. Her hands are raised above her head, holding a transparent glass cup filled with clear water. Several bright red strawberries are soaked in it, some floating on the surface, others sinking underwater. Tiny droplets cling to the rim of the cup, and light refracts and distorts through the cup's body. A dreamlike light and shadow effect is created. Sunlight streams in diagonally from the upper left of the image, shifting with the curved surface of the glass, creating a flowing texture. The background is a blurry outdoor environment, with faint green plants and blue tones of the sky, but the blurred effect highlights the main figure. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space, the head slightly tilted, gazing directly at the camera, creating intimacy and interactivity. The foreground features the glass cup and hands, with clear details, while the background is completely blurred. A strong depth of field contrast is created, and the entire image is filled with the fresh atmosphere of summer. The colors are mainly white, orange-red, pale pink, and teal, with warm and soft tones and rich layers of light and shadow. It has the grainy texture and slight overexposure effect of film photography, as if capturing a tranquil moment under the afternoon sun with an old camera. The overall atmosphere is romantic, healing, and poetic, with a Japanese artistic style. The details are exquisite and emotionally rich, conveying a simple yet beautiful aesthetic for living",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
