        {
          "id": "krea2-1030dd788f50cca967cb5688",
          "alias": "单女制服教室媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A figure wearing a Japanese high school sailor uniform sits with her back to the camera at a wooden desk in the classroom, presenting a delicate texture and dynamic feel. A white short-sleeved shirt paired with a deep blue pleated skirt is clearly visible, with the classic sailor suit design clearly visible at the neckline. The black-and-blue bow tie and white striped decorations add a touch of refinement to the uniform. Her figure is slender, with smooth back lines and a small piece of skin exposed at the waist, showcasing youthful energy and a subtle touch of sensuality. She sits on a wooden chair with a metal frame, the chair's backrest somewhat worn. The edges show slight wear, showing signs of daily use. In front is a typical Japanese classroom desk, with a light wood surface and straight edges. In the drawer below, several neatly stacked books can be faintly seen. In the background is a wide window framed with silver-gray metal, transparent glass reflecting outdoor light. Outside, the blurred outlines of buildings and the sky flow in, and the natural light streaming in is soft and bright, creating a warm backlighting effect. Light pours in from behind, outlining a golden silhouette. It presents a semi-transparent texture, casting faint shadows in front of her body and on the table, enhancing spatial layering. The entire composition uses a mid-field perspective, with the subject positioned slightly to the right of the center, slightly turned to the side, and gazing out the window, creating a tranquil and contemplative atmosphere. The foreground is a partial part of the desk and chair, the middle ground is the full-body posture and movement details, and the background is the window and distant blurred outdoor scene, forming a clear front-back depth relationship. The visual guide begins with golden outlines in the backlight. Then it returns to her back and sitting posture, finally resting on the desk and books, forming a natural visual closed loop. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, dominated by warm yellow tones. Light comes from the right rear side, representing low-angle sunlight in the early morning or afternoon, creating a quiet, nostalgic, and slightly melancholic campus daily atmosphere. The tones are fresh and elegant, with moderate color saturation and low contrast, highlighting realism and a sense of life, as if captured with a regular digital camera or phone. It features a slight grainy film texture and natural noise, with slight vigned corners at the edges, enhancing the texture of retro photography. Overall, it presents a poetic beauty of youth passing and tranquil time, capturing the most ordinary yet precious moments of student life, full of emotional tension and artistic appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
