        {
          "id": "krea2-baa531028dae30dd1669f5f7",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫商店微笑站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a rustic stone bridge, wearing a loose light blue shirt with a white crew-neck top underneath, and a black-and-white plaid short skirt with delicate white lace trim and brown embroidery at the hem. She wears white over-the-knee socks and silver flats, a gray knitted headband on her head, and a gentle smile. Her left hand gently holds a small black chain bag, her posture elegant and natural, her body slightly leaning to the side, and her right hand hanging naturally. The overall look is fresh, sweet, and stylish. In the foreground is a pristine stone bridge railing, carved with delicate patterns The texture is warm and smooth. In the middle is a shimmering river surface, the deep blue water shimmering with scattered light and shadow. Across the riverbank is a typical traditional Chinese architectural complex: white walls and gray tiles, flying eaves, upturned corners, arranged in a harmonious manner. Several withered willow trees with interlaced branches have yet to bud in late winter and early spring, their sparse branches forming beautiful silhouettes against the blue sky. In the distance, you can see low-rise modern buildings and shop signs, among which the red \"eat\" sign is faintly visible, adding a sense of life. The sky is a clear blue and the sun shines brightly. Light slanted down from the upper right, creating a soft transition between light and shadow. Shadows fall on the left side of the body and the bridge railing, creating a strong sense of depth. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned slightly to the left, leaving space on the right side to display the river and distant views. The angle is slightly lower than the head-on, enhancing the beauty of proportion. Following the line of sight, it extends to the bag in hand, then toward the distant riverbank and buildings, creating a richly layered sense of space. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and bright, full of the lazy and pleasant atmosphere of a spring afternoon. The overall color palette mainly features a contrast of warm and cool tones. Blue and white form a fresh main tone, accented with neutral colors like black, gray, and brown, highlighting the subject while harmonizing the image. The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if shot with a high-resolution phone or portable camera, with slight lens distortion and natural noise, presenting beautiful moments captured unintentionally in daily life. It exudes a strong sense of life and artistic beauty. The details are rich, from clothing folds to stone railings and ripples on the water surface, all clearly visible. The color saturation is moderate and does not appear overly retouched. It creates a realistic yet slightly idealized youthful style",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
