        {
          "id": "krea2-01cae973aaa6065962adbd71",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫城市沉思坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor wooden step, wearing a black turtleneck sweater that fits her body snugly, accentuating her slender figure. She pairs black mesh stockings and black high heels, with a hint of skin showing at her ankles. The overall look is simple yet elegant. Her posture is relaxed, legs crossed, one hand gently resting on her knee, the other behind her back supporting her body, her head slightly turned to the side, appearing gentle and spirited. She wears a small earring and a thin chain necklace, adding a touch of refinement. The background is a corner of a city street. On the left are gray stone walls and metal railings; on the right, wooden steps extend into the distance. Faint pedestrians and building silhouettes are faintly visible in the distance, and sunlight pours down from the upper right of the image, creating a soft light and shadow effect that creates a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The stone wall texture in the foreground is clear, and the stripes and gaps on the wooden steps are also visible, enhancing the realism of the composition. The composition uses a mid-field perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left, leaving space on the right to convey a sense of depth in the environment. The visual guide line extends from the steps into the distance drawing the viewer's gaze toward the background, with clear light and shadow contrasts. The shadowed areas are gently distributed on the sides of the body and steps. The overall color scheme is dominated by black, gray, and brown, accented with warm yellow tones of sunlight, presenting a subtle beauty found in everyday life. It's like a moment captured on an afternoon street with a regular camera—authentic, natural, and full of artistic flair. The details are rich, from the mesh texture of stockings to the reflective material of shoes, all clearly visible. The interaction between the character and the environment is harmonious and unified. It showcases a quiet and elegant moment in urban life",
