        {
          "id": "krea2-ef759df6e85faa6d464a2012",
          "alias": "单女米外套椅上坐指向",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors on a blue plastic chair, wearing a beige long coat over a white pleated dress, black platform boots, and light yellow ankle socks. Her body leans slightly, right leg bent and raised, toes pointing downward, left leg naturally extended. This forms a dynamic asymmetrical composition. In the foreground is a rough gray cement floor scattered with a few dead leaves and small debris. A distinct shadow appears on the ground, suggesting the light source comes from the side and rear. In the middle is the blue plastic chair where the woman sits, its bright colors sharply contrasting with the surrounding environment. Behind the seat is a row of low green shrubs, lush but somewhat messy, with some vines climbing over metal railings. In the background is a tall white tiled wall with slight stains and mottled marks. Above the wall ceiling are barbed wire and rusted pipes. In the distance, green corrugated metal panels and a corner of the red eaves can be seen, giving the overall environment an old-fashioned yet everyday feel. The composition uses a mid-ground portrait perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame, leaving space on the left to showcase background details. The perspective of near and far is used to enhance the sense of spatial depth. Meanwhile, the blue seats serve as color focal points to attract attention. In terms of light and shadow, the light is soft and directional, coming from a diagonal top and forming natural shadows at the folds of the coat. The ground casts clear but not harsh shadows, creating an overall atmosphere that is tranquil and authentic, with a touch of everyday texture and a touch of nostalgia. The color tones are mainly warm gray, off-white, and blue-green, with moderate saturation, creating a warm yet calm visual feel. The image presents a realistic texture reminiscent of amateur camera or mobile phone photography. Slight noise and soft depth of field enhance the documentary feel, as if capturing an ordinary yet story-rich moment. The overall image has distinct layers. From the ground in the foreground to the figures and seats in the middle ground, then to the buildings and vegetation in the background, the story unfolds step by step, forming a rich visual narrative.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
