        {
          "id": "krea2-ff366c651ac114272db0b459",
          "alias": "单女毛衣户外站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors under a tree, wearing a dark diamond-patterned plaid sweater with a black base color. White and brown lines outline a classic diamond pattern, with striped decorations on the collar and cuffs. She wears a white turtleneck underneath and a brown beret, looking naturally relaxed. Her left hand gently holds a light-colored handbag, her posture elegant and casual. The overall look is full of artistic flair. The main focus is slightly to the right of the middle shot, with several lush green leaves in the foreground, their edges tinted golden by sunlight. Some leaves slightly block the light above, creating a natural framing effect. The background features blurred woods and a warm golden halo. Sunlight slanting in from the upper left corner creates a strong backlight effect, producing obvious camera halos and bokeh spots. In the background, faint red walls and distant blurred figures are faintly visible, creating a realistic sense of everyday life. The composition uses low-angle downward shots to highlight the figure's upright posture and the layered surrounding environment, then guides downward to the body contours, creating a natural flow of sight and a warm and soft lighting atmosphere The tones are mainly golden, orange-red, and brown, presenting the warm tones unique to autumn afternoons. The light creates bright contour light over the figures' contours, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall image has the texture of film photography, with moderate color saturation, rich details, and clear layers, as if captured with a regular digital camera or phone. The moments are real, with slight graininess and natural exposure transitions, creating a nostalgic and cozy everyday atmosphere. The overall image presents a serene poetic beauty. It makes you feel the gentle flow of time",
