        {
          "id": "krea2-2e44ecec55fe43a37c07ddd0",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣秋叶忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beneath a huge ginkgo tree, wearing an off-white loose knit cardigan with a light-colored dress underneath. Around her neck is a brown-and-white gradient plush scarf, black loafers paired with white ankle socks, gently holding a bouquet of pure white roses. She slightly lowers her head to look at the camera, her expression gentle and serene. Her body leans forward slightly, her posture elegant and relaxed, as if immersed in the tranquility of autumn. In the foreground lies a thick layer of golden ginkgo leaves covering the ground, layer upon layer, delicate and soft. Like a carpet, the bottom of the entire painting is covered, with leaf edges clearly visible. Some leaves gently curl in the wind, presenting rich texture and layering. The middle ground features a thick ginkgo trunk, with a rough and deep bark texture covered in the marks of time. The trunk stands straight and upright, with branches extending outward, forming a natural arched frame. Golden leaves hang from the branches, vibrant and dazzling, shimmering with warm luster in soft light. The background is a blurred forest and distant architectural silhouettes. Faintly visible reddish-brown maple leaves intertwined with evergreen trees, creating a rich color layer for late autumn. A small wooden cabin with a blue roof appears faintly, adding a touch of pastoral poetry. The sky is grayish-white, clouds thin, and the light is evenly soft. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and warm. The composition uses a low-angle upward shot to highlight the tall and majestic ginkgo trees and the graceful figures of the figures. The figure is positioned slightly lower to the right of the painting, visually balancing with the massive tree trunk on the left, with a guiding line extending from fallen leaves on the ground to the figure's feet. This creates a natural visual flow. Light and shadow come from scattered light on cloudy days, soft and even, without strong shadows. However, the light spots shining through the gaps in the leaves create subtle light and shadow changes on the ground and figures, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, supplemented by off-white, light brown, light green, and a touch of red. The colors are harmonious and unified, full of the unique warmth and poetry of autumn. The image has the texture of film photography, with slight graininess and natural exposure, simulating everyday amateur camera shooting effects, rich in detail, and delicate emotion. It conveys a quiet, romantic, and slightly melancholic autumn mood",
