        {
          "id": "krea2-8973a68f2eaf1ab34b7ced6e",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙雪地坐",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a red velvet Christmas dress, with thick white plush trim along the hem. The neckline and cuffs were also adorned with soft white fur. The short design revealed her long legs. She knelt on the floor covered with a white velvet carpet, gracefully turning to look back at the camera. Her makeup was fresh and natural. Her left hand lightly touched the ground, fingers long, her ring finger wearing a delicate ring. Her right leg was stretched forward, her left leg bent, wearing black stockings, her feet slightly raised, toes pointing outward. At the heel, you can see the black non-slip sole. Beside her are several red-and-white plush balls, and beside it sits a white gift box tied with a golden ribbon. In the background is a tall silver-gray Christmas tree, its trunk covered in a snow-like effect. Golden bells, red balls, stars, and deer-shaped ornaments hang from the branches and leaves. The tree's top is decorated with golden stars, and beneath the tree are several beautifully packaged gift boxes—some tied with gold ribbons, some in red gift bags. On the left window is a Christmas stocking with red and white stripes. The window frame is white blinds, allowing soft light to enter from outside. The wall is light grayish-white, with a string of paper art decorations made of a green Christmas tree and brown deer. The overall composition centers on the figure, using a medium perspective. The figure is positioned slightly in the center on the right side, while the Christmas tree forms a visual balance on the left. The foreground features the figure's legs and scattered plush balls and gift boxes. The middle ground shows the main figure along with some Christmas trees and gifts. The background features a complete Christmas tree, wall decorations, and windows, with light and shadow coming from the left window direction. Soft natural lighting is created, with subtle and natural transitions, creating a warm and peaceful holiday atmosphere. The colors are mainly red, white, and silver-gray, accented with gold and green. The warm and harmonious tones present a home Christmas scene that combines festive festivity with private tranquility. It feels like a high-quality photo taken with a professional camera, featuring delicate texture and authentic spatial layering. The images are rich in detail, full of life atmosphere and artistic beauty",
