        {
          "id": "krea2-18c9db4fda7b61a46b37ca8e",
          "alias": "单女白围裙厨房忧伤站立喝",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a white apron and headscarf, standing sideways in the kitchen. Her right hand is raised to adjust her headscarf, her posture natural relaxed and showing a quiet, contemplative expression. Her overall temperament is gentle and reserved. The white apron she wears is made of soft fabric with lace trim, loose cuffs, and pockets on the chest. The details showcase a sense of everyday life. The background is a typical family kitchen environment, with walls paved with small blue-green grid tiles. Above the cabinet are metal shelves with pots and dishes, and hanging stainless steel spatulas, Spoons and other kitchen utensils are neatly arranged, and soft natural light streams in from the right side. Light streams in from the right, creating a contrast of light and shadow on the figure. The edges of the window frame are slightly blurred, creating a shallow depth of field effect. On the kitchen counter sits a transparent glass bottle of liquid, possibly drinking water or condiments. Next to it is a vase with small white flowers, adding a touch of everyday life. The sink is made of stainless steel, with obvious reflections on the edges. The overall color tone is cool, mainly bluish-gray, evoking a tranquil yet slightly melancholic atmosphere. The composition uses medium shots, with the figure positioned on the left side of the frame, body slightly tilted, and gaze directed toward the lower right, guiding viewers to focus on her expressions and movements. The foreground highlights the main subject, the background is blurred to emphasize spatial layering, and the use of light and shadow is delicate. The main light source comes from the right window, creating soft side lighting that enhances the sense of depth. Meanwhile, light in the background reflects faint highlights through the glass, enriching the visual details and presenting a tranquil moment of everyday life. It seems to capture the poetic beauty of an ordinary moment. The image texture is close to professional photography style, yet retains the realism of amateur camera shooting. The camera feels strong, with slight film graininess and color shifts, simulating real camera imaging effects. The focal length is moderate, depth of field is well controlled, and the background gradually blurs, emphasizing the subject's presence. The tone is warm yet calm, with subtle contrasts of warmth and coolness, creating an emotional tension that is both intimate and distant. The overall atmosphere is quiet, intimate, and full of storytelling. It was as if she could hear the faint sounds in the kitchen and feel the faint fragrance in the air—a moment filled with the warmth of life, frozen in the cracks of time, making one imagine her mood and thoughts at that moment",
