        {
          "id": "krea2-6556b5c6469ba388b6fbc29e",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔窗边愤怒坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a warm wooden floor, wearing a fluffy, soft white plush long-sleeved top, light blue denim shorts, and semi-transparent flesh-colored stockings. She curls up barefoot naturally on the ground, hands folded gently on her knees, fingers long and slender, and on her wrist wears a delicate gold bracelet. Against the background is a white wall hanging a reproduction of Van Gogh's painting in the style of \"The Olive Tree of Arles.\" The painting depicts golden wheat fields, blue skies and white clouds, and a tall cypress tree. The frame is light wood, and above the painting is a window. On the windowsill are several blurred decorations, including a beige pottery jar and some miscellaneous items. The overall lighting is soft and bright, with natural light evenly streaming on the left side of the painting onto the figure, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The wood grain on the floor is clearly visible, showing a pattern of dark and light brown intertwined. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the painting, body slightly tilted. The head is slightly tilted, gazing directly at the camera. The paintings in the background serve as visual elements, adding an artistic touch. The overall color palette is mainly warm white, beige, light blue, and brown, creating a cozy, tranquil, and lively home scene. The image texture is delicate and authentic, as if taken with a casual camera, with a slight film graininess and natural color saturation. The lighting is soft and not glaring, with rich but not overly intense shadows. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and natural, with a slight sense of nostalgia and artistic vibes, like a private photo recording moments of life, full of warmth and emotion.",
