        {
          "id": "krea2-812b0a3087703ff3cd3fb0d1",
          "alias": "单女灰高领衫沙发冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a gorgeous black carved armchair, wearing a gray turtleneck tight knit sweater paired with dark stockings and gray ankle boots. The overall look is simple yet sophisticated. The background is the indoor environment, with walls in a light gray-white color featuring wooden structures and window frames. On the left, white sheer curtains let in soft natural light, which slanted in from outside. The contrast between light and shadow between the floor and the figures creates a tranquil and slightly vintage atmosphere. The floor is made of dark wood, with wear marks and mottled textures on the surface, adding a sense of authenticity and age to the space. The chairs are intricately designed and exquisitely carved, featuring Baroque-style decorative details such as curved armrests, intricate patterns, and heavy backrests, presenting a classical aristocratic atmosphere. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the composition, using a mid-angle perspective to highlight the relationship between the subject and the environment. The foreground features the legs and feet of the figures. It occupies a large area at the bottom of the frame. The middle shot features the upper body and chair, while the background is walls and windows. Light and shadow mainly come from the side light of the left window, while the other side is in shadow, creating a soft transition and three-dimensional effect. The overall color tone is mainly gray, black, and brown, with low saturation, creating a calm, cool, and textured visual effect. The image presents a fleeting beauty casually captured in daily life, as if it were a real scene shot at home with a regular camera. It retains slight noise and natural light and shadow changes, enhancing realism and a sense of everyday life, while maintaining artistic composition and atmosphere. The entire scene is full of storytelling and emotional tension, allowing viewers to feel a power and elegance in tranquility",
