        {
          "id": "krea2-ee80f5e1c83d78d0ae7f4d19",
          "alias": "单女衬衫医院冷淡坐注视",
          "prompt": "The overall vibe is fresh and modern. The background is a simple white wall with an embedded windowsill on which sits a potted green plant with broad, heart-shaped leaves and yellow stripes along the edges. The flowerpot is bright green, creating a striking contrast with the surrounding environment. Behind the windowsill is a portion of another room, where you can see the refrigerator, cabinets, and some miscellaneous items. The space layout is open and transparent, with light streaming in from the right window, creating soft natural light. The entire scene is illuminated by evenly diffused light, with clear layers of light and shadow. The main figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, composed using the classic three-part method. The figure occupies the main visual center, with a blue bench extending from the lower left corner to the middle right, forming a strong visual guide that draws the viewer's gaze toward the figure. The wooden floor has a warm brown tone. The texture is clear and natural, creating a warm contrast with the cool-toned blue seats and white walls, creating a harmonious and layered sense of space. The foreground shows the lower half of the figure and the bench, the middle is the full body of the figure and the bench, and the background is the windowsill and distant rooms. The layers are distinct and visually rich. The overall atmosphere is quiet, simple, and modern, carrying the breath of everyday life, as if capturing an ordinary yet emotionally charged moment. The image texture is authentic and delicate, with exquisite detail handling. It presents a high-resolution effect similar to professional camera shooting, while retaining slight film graininess and natural color transitions, enhancing realism and artistry. Light and shadow are soft and not harsh, with blurred and natural shadow edges, showcasing high-quality lighting techniques. The overall color palette is mainly blue, white, and green, with harmonious and unified color combinations, creating a fresh, comfortable, and slightly artistic visual experience. The composition is stable and balanced, the figures' poses are relaxed and natural, without any forced posing, presenting an effortless aesthetic. The entire scene feels like a café, clinic, or waiting area, creating a strong sense of immersion in everyday life. The visual style blends realistic photography with fashionable portraits, making it both realistic and artistically expressive, presenting a tranquil and elegant everyday aesthetic. The light source is clear, simulating the natural effect of afternoon sunlight streaming through windows into the interior, with strong three-dimensionality. Shadows cast on the floor and chairs enhance the spatial realism, and the wrinkles and material details of the clothing are clearly visible. The contrast between the soft texture of the shirt and the rough texture of the denim skirt enhances the tactile experience of the image. The overall atmosphere is quiet and restrained, suitable for expressing youth, reflection, waiting, or those subtle yet precious moments in daily life. The background is a white wall and windowsill, with a pot of green plants on the windowsill with broad leaves. The flowerpots are bright green, and in the distant room, you can see the refrigerator and furniture. Natural light enters through the right window, providing soft and even light. The diffuse light creates distinct layers, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center. The blue bench extends from the lower left corner to the middle right, forming a visual guiding line. The wooden floor is a warm brown with clear texture. The composition uses a three-part method: the foreground shows the figure and the lower half of the bench, the middle ground shows the full body of the figure and the bench, and the background is the windowsill and distant room. The layers are distinct, the visual depth is rich, and the overall atmosphere is peaceful, simple, and modern. Strong everyday atmosphere, realistic and delicate texture, high resolution, slight film graininess, natural color transitions, soft light and shadow, blurred and natural shadow edges, excellent lighting techniques, mainly blue, white, and green, harmonious and unified, fresh and comfortable, with a slight artistic touch, stable and balanced composition, relaxed and natural postures, no deliberate posing, strong immersion in life, realistic photography combined with fashionable portraits, tranquil elegance, everyday aesthetics, afternoon sunlight, even lighting, strong three-dimensionality, clear clothing folds and material details. The shirt is soft, the denim skirt is rough, the tactile experience is rich, quiet and restrained, youthful, thoughtful, waiting, subtle precious moments, professional camera shooting effects, strong realism, strong artistic expression, complete image, rich details, clear layering, natural light and shadow, immersive atmosphere, delicate emotion, precise composition, clear visual guidance, strong sense of space, harmonious colors, prominent texture, unique style, and high aesthetic value.",
