          "id": "krea2-01b789cf3cf9307beb67e0a2",
          "alias": "单女棕高领衫床沉思躺注视",
          "prompt": "A woman lies on a bed covered with gray geometric patterned sheets, dressed in a dark brown turtleneck knit sweater. The fabric is delicate and soft, presenting a warm velvet with natural pleated details. Long sleeves naturally drape down the sides of the body, slightly cinched to outline the arm lines. The lower half is paired with a black-and-white plaid short skirt, with a voluminous and layered hem. The fabric features fine woven textures and a slight reflective texture, showcasing exquisite craftsmanship. Her legs are crossed and layered, wearing black stockings. The surface of the stockings is smooth and has a moderate sheen. The leg curve appears soft and fluid under the light, the feet slightly raised, toes lightly touching the bed, posture natural and relaxed. The head rests sideways on a yellow fabric pillow made of coarse cotton-linen with clear texture, warm and soft colors contrasting with the overall tone. Looking directly into the camera, the expression is calm yet tinged with tenderness and contemplation. The background is a simple indoor environment, with light slanting in from the upper left of the frame, creating a soft natural lighting effect. The light source is warm, It creates a quiet and comfortable atmosphere, with natural transitions in shadows highlighting the subject. The composition uses a center-shifted layout, with the character positioned slightly to the right of the frame, leaving space on the left to enhance visual balance. The camera shoots from a high angle to bring the shot closer, making the subject occupy the main part of the frame while preserving the surrounding environmental details. The foreground shows the bedsheet and pillow area, the middle ground shows the subject's entire body and clothing details, and the background is the blurred bedside area, creating a clear depth of field. The gaze gradually extends to body posture and clothing details, finally settling on the overall ambiance. The light and shadow are evenly distributed, dominated by warm tones, creating a cozy, private, and slightly lazy home feel. The image texture is realistic, as if shot with a professional camera under natural indoor light, with rich details and harmonious colors, exuding strong artistic appeal and a sense of everyday life",
