        {
          "id": "krea2-fbfff4df37b42ce87561a896",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙小巷害羞蹲躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman squats in the middle of a quiet country alley, wearing a pure white high-neck, long-sleeved dress with a natural hem draped over the gray asphalt pavement, creating soft pleats and flow. The edge of her light-colored panties peeks out beneath the skirt, adding a touch of casual everyday charm. Her hands are folded on her knees, her posture dignified yet slightly shy, her expression calm with a hint of melancholy and contemplation. She wears a pair of white thick-soled sandals made of transparent plastic, with off-white square heels. It appears both modern and minimalist. The background is a narrow stone road stretching into the distance, clean and tidy, flanked by mottled stone walls and dense green vegetation. The stone wall on the right is made of irregular gray-brown stone blocks, covered in moss, showing traces of time. On the left are low shrubs and distant blurred architectural silhouettes. The sky is a bright pale blue, with thin clouds and soft and even lighting. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and slightly nostalgic, with a centrally symmetrical layout. The figure is positioned slightly below the center of the frame, occupying the visual focal point. The road extends backward, forming a strong perspective guide line that draws the gaze into the distance. The foreground highlights the subject, the middle view reveals the details of the alley environment, and the background is blurred to enhance spatial layering. Light and shadow come from natural daylight, which shines diagonally from above, creating subtle shadows on the ground and clothing. The transition between light and dark is natural, with colors dominated by white, gray, green, and the gray-brown of the stone walls. The tone is fresh and elegant, presenting an overall documentary photography style. It feels like a moment captured with a regular digital camera or phone, with a slight graininess and authentic texture, without excessive embellishment, preserving the original image details and creating a quiet, pure, and story-rich everyday scene—like a chance encounter on a country road on a summer afternoon, evoking the slow passage of time and inner peace",
