        {
          "id": "krea2-faf3c65f8b4187bd59b6c48f",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫机场温柔坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the off-white leather seat of a luxury private jet. She wears a pure white long-sleeved shirt with a deep blue silk scarf featuring pink and white geometric patterns tied at the collar, paired with a high-waisted black short skirt. The overall look exudes the elegant temperament of a professional flight attendant. Her makeup is exquisite, looking directly at the camera. She wears a gold bracelet on her left wrist, her right hand resting gently on her knee, fingers long, nails neatly trimmed. She leans slightly forward, legs crossed, right leg on top and left leg below. The posture is dignified yet sexy. The background is the luxurious interior decorations of the airplane, with wood panels showing a warm brown texture, creating a soft contrast with the off-white seats and light green cushions. The cushion surface has delicate fabric texture with dark edges. The seat's leather is smooth and glossy, showcasing high-end material details. On the left side of the frame, a corner of a silver-gray laptop can be faintly seen, suggesting she may be working or handling affairs. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure occupying the center to the right. The head is slightly tilted, creating a natural visual guide and creating an intimate and professional atmosphere. Light comes from the upper left of the image, softly illuminating the subject evenly. The shadows transition naturally, without harsh contrasts of light and shadow, enhancing three-dimensionality and realism. The overall color palette is mainly white, black, beige, and brown, accented with blue and pink scarves. The color combination is harmonious and sophisticated, and the background blur treatment focuses on the figure, highlighting their image. The spatial layers are distinct, with the foreground showing the figure's body and some legs. The middle shot features seats and cushions, with wooden walls and a blurred cabin structure in the background. Following the line of sight, it extends to her posture and surroundings, creating a quiet, private, and story-filled atmosphere. The entire scene seems to capture a brief break amid busy work, combining professional rigor with personal charm and composure. The images present a cinematic texture, rich in detail, with delicate light and shadow, as if taken with professional photography. At the same time, it preserves the natural feel of everyday life.",
