          "id": "krea2-fc3a2f01efe9c614b3abbf37",
          "alias": "单女黑短裤街道俏皮坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor stone step, her body slightly tilted against a thick tree trunk. Her expression is relaxed and slightly playful. She wears a semi-transparent black short-sleeved top with striped shorts, a gray blazer casually draped over it, and brown lace-up sneakers with white numeric patterns and orange decorative rings on the uppers. Her posture is relaxed and natural, legs crossed, knees slightly bent. It presents a casual yet refined sense of everyday life. In the foreground is a dark gray asphalt paved with fallen leaves, scattered with a few withered yellow leaves and tiny branches. In the middle is rough gray cement steps with slightly weathered edges, covered with pebbles of various sizes, mainly gray-white with some brown spots. The background features blurred building facades and metal railings, made of black columns and horizontal bars, dotted with orange reflective markings. In the distance, the outlines of green plants can be faintly seen. The composition uses low-angle shooting, with the subject positioned slightly to the right of the frame, forming the visual focal point. The left side leaves a large negative space, enhancing the sense of breath and storytelling in the image. A large aperture blurs the background to highlight the subject and create a soft depth of field. Light comes from the front left, naturally diffused, with a cool overall tone, mainly gray, black, and brown. The light and shadow layers are delicate, shadows are soft, and the transitions between light and dark are natural. The atmosphere is tranquil and artistic, like an afternoon moment on a city street, full of the vitality of life and the tenderness of youth. With a slight film texture and graininess, it simulates the style of professional photography equipment, emphasizing realism and detail while retaining the casual and intimate nature of daily documentation. The overall image presents a tranquil, comfortable, and emotionally charged urban life segment",
