        {
          "id": "krea2-6cc69efe3ba803c556de197a",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫沙发俏皮坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a light gray fabric single sofa, wearing a light blue ruffled long-sleeved shirt with a white turtleneck base layer, a black short skirt, and a pair of black platform Mary Jane shoes. The overall look exudes a retro collegiate fashion vibe, appearing playful and elegant. She leans sideways against the sofa armrest, her right hand naturally resting on the edge of the sofa, creating a lazy and charming atmosphere. Her posture is relaxed and expressive, her body slightly leaned, legs naturally extended. One foot is firmly planted on the floor, while the other gently rests on the sofa cushion, showing off the lines of slender legs. The background is a minimalist, modern interior space, with dark gray walls and a light gray carpet on the floor. The light is soft and even, projected from the left side of the image, creating delicate transitions of light and shadow on the figures and furniture, creating a quiet and warm atmosphere. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure occupying the center slightly left. The sofa's contour lines are clear, echoing the figure's posture. At the same time, her hand movements and leg extensions enhance the dynamic feel of the image. The light and shadow are handled with delicate detail, with the light source coming from the left front, creating a soft contrast between light and dark. The overall color scheme is mainly gray, white, blue, and black, with harmonious and unified color combinations that carry a subtle nostalgic vibe. It feels like everyday moments captured with an old-fashioned film camera, full of everyday artistic beauty. The image details are rich, from the ruffled texture of the shirt to the metal fasteners of the shoes, all clearly visible, with the material rendered authentically. The entire scene resembles a quiet afternoon, with the characters immersed in their own worlds, creating a narrative space that is both intimate and open. There are no unnecessary decorations in the scene, and the minimalist environment makes the subject stand out, emphasizing the characters' own charm and emotional expression. This blend of realism and art creates a serene and profound aesthetic experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
