        {
          "id": "krea2-03ea8f22d0fe8a835e27d847",
          "alias": "单女米连衣裙烟火忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "As night falls, the deep indigo sky spreads out like ink, creating a tranquil and mysterious atmosphere. The main figure is a woman standing sideways, slightly tilting her head back to gaze at the firework stick in her hand. She wears a beige floral spaghetti strap dress adorned with fine dark red patterns. The layered hem has a vintage pastoral style, and a matching thin cord is tied around the waist, outlining a slender waistline. Underneath, she wears a white vest. The overall look is fresh and natural, full of summer romance. Her right hand was raised high, holding a burning firework stick. Bright sparks burst from the tip of the stick, golden sparks flying everywhere like falling stars. Accompanied by curling white smoke, it traced a graceful arc in the air. The smoke slowly spread in the darkness, presenting a hazy texture that sharply contrasted with the deep blue background. In the foreground, the flames and flying sparks of the firework stick became the visual focal points, standing out in the darkness and radiating a warm golden glow. At the same time, Some sparks and light spots are scattered throughout the frame, forming a dot-like halo effect that adds dynamism and dreamlike feel. The middle ground shows the woman's body outline and the changing light and shadow around her. Her posture is elegant, her body slightly leaning back, as if in a silent dialogue with the fireworks. Light radiates from the fireworks stick outward, creating a clear layer of light and shadow. The background is a deep blue space completely blending into the night, with no unnecessary elements that make the subject stand out. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot. Placing the figure slightly to the right of the frame, leaving a large stretch of sky on the left as a visual extension, enhances the sense of space and depth in the image. At the same time, the slanting upward direction of the fireworks stick guides the viewer's gaze from below to upward, ultimately focusing on the woman's gaze upward. The visual guidance is clear and smooth, with the lighting and shadow atmosphere centered on warm and cool contrasts. The deep blue background tones bring tranquility and steadiness, while the warm yellow glow of the fireworks infuses vitality and hope. The two colors collide yet coexist harmoniously. It creates an emotional tone that is both romantic and slightly melancholic. The entire scene is filled with poetic beauty, as if a moment is frozen in eternity, as if shot with an old film camera. The slight noise from the lens, soft out-of-focus blur, and natural exposure transitions give the entire photo a sense of authenticity and nostalgia, as if recording a private memory of youth, dreams, and fireworks. The air is filled with a faint scent of everyday life, and time seems to stand still in that moment. Only that faint glow blooms in the night sky, illuminating the softest dreams in our hearts.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
