        {
          "id": "krea2-ce702e9a2327f133b25ffc07",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫商店沉思坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an orange plastic chair, wearing a black turtleneck knit top and a pink multi-layered ruffled tulle dress, with a black belt with a gold double-G metal buckle tied around her waist. Her expression is slightly lazy and contemplative, her head slightly tilted, her posture naturally relaxed, her body slightly leaning forward, her left hand naturally resting on her leg, fingers long. The background is an indoor wall, on which are white warning signs reading \"No Entry\" and several handwritten notes are pasted. The notes read \"Innocent\" and \"Qie Qie Qie\" (Pure Feelings) and \"Qie Qie Qie\" (Cut Chop Qie). In the corner hangs a black little doll ornament. On the right is an orange cartoon figurine wearing a baseball cap. Below is a white cylindrical container printed with the words \"Q.cutians,\" and beside it is a shiny silver foil sheet. The overall environment resembles a corner of a small shop or studio, compact and full of life. The composition uses medium shots and close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, occupying the main visual focus. The background elements are rich but not cluttered, forming a clear layered front and back relationship. The foreground features the figure and an orange chair. The middle shot features the lower body and part of the background, while the background is the wall and various decorations. The light comes from the left, soft and even, creating a warm and bright atmosphere that emphasizes three-dimensionality. The color scheme mainly features black, pink, and orange, creating a striking contrast yet harmonious unity. Overall, it presents a casual sense of fashion in daily life, with a slight film texture and vintage tones, reminiscent of a real scene shot with an amateur camera. The details are rich and full of storytelling, with slight vignetting at the edges to enhance the focal point. The overall atmosphere is warm and slightly artistic, as if capturing an ordinary yet special moment",
