        {
          "id": "krea2-e18a759a6160749e85df7012",
          "alias": "单女背心公园害羞注视",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman slightly tilted her head gazing at the camera, presenting a gentle yet slightly shy expression. Her fingers are slender and long, her nails neatly trimmed, wearing a sleeveless top with a blue-green plaid pattern, with faintly visible shoulder straps. The overall posture is elegant and natural. The foreground features blurred green plant leaves and a few blurred blue flowers, creating a natural depth effect. The edges of the leaves are illuminated by sunlight, presenting a semi-transparent texture. The composition centers on the figure. The background is softly blurred green vegetation, with light filtering through the leaves from above and the sides, creating mottled shadows that evoke a soft natural light in the morning or afternoon. The overall tone is fresh and bright, dominated by green and blue, accented with warm skin tones. The layers of light and shadow are rich, highlights are bright and transparent, shadows transition naturally, the atmosphere is peaceful and serene, filled with the laziness and poetry of a summer afternoon, as if capturing a tranquil moment. It allows one to feel the beauty of youth and the harmony of nature. The image has a strong film texture and slight graininess, simulating the realism of amateur camera shooting. The lens focal length is short, resulting in slight distortion and soft edge blur, enhancing the image's affinity and realism. The composition uses a three-part method, with the subject positioned near the golden ratio point, maintaining a stable visual center of gravity. At the same time, the foreground obstruction creates a peepy sense of privacy. The color saturation is moderate, preserving authentic details and subtle color differences. Overall, it presents a fresh, artistic, gentle, and tranquil style, as if a photographer accidentally captured beautiful moments in the park with an old-fashioned camera, full of the atmosphere of life and artistic beauty",
