        {
          "id": "krea2-447bcabe6c7f8659561676ef",
          "alias": "单女白旗袍花园温柔倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman leans sideways, wearing a light off-white Chinese qipao with delicate subtle patterns. The collar and cuffs are trimmed with deep gray-blue, and her chest is adorned with matching frog buttons adorned with a string of delicate white pearls. She slightly lowers her head and gazes at an open book or notebook in her hand, exuding a calm and reserved temperament. The main subject is on the right side of the painting, with her body slightly leaning forward, forming an elegant S-shaped curve. In the foreground, a blurred green wooden frame and red traditional building beams and columns create an atmosphere of a classical garden. The background features soft, diffused natural greenery and mottled light and shadow. Sunlight filters through the leaves, creating a warm backlighting effect. Light enters the frame diagonally from the upper right, intertwining warm yellow and pale teal green, presenting a vintage film texture. The image uses a shallow depth of field shooting technique, with the background completely blurred. The composition uses the rule of thirds to place the figure on the right, leaving plenty of negative space on the left side to enhance visual breath and poetic beauty. The lens uses an 85mm prime portrait lens to simulate real camera photography. The slight graininess and natural color shifts bring a sense of realism, with rich layers of light and shadow. Highlights are bright and transparent, shadows transition smoothly, and the overall atmosphere is tranquil and far-reaching, full of Eastern aesthetics. It feels as if capturing the most intimate and touching moment in an afternoon courtyard. The visuals have a strong cinematic feel and storytelling, as if taken from a classic shot in an art film. Shot with a casual camera, it preserves the warmth and texture of the film era while maintaining the simplicity and refinement of modern aesthetics",
