        {
          "id": "krea2-16a2ed941c2125cc9e0323d6",
          "alias": "单女透视连衣裙室内困倦坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a soft indoor setting, looking directly at the camera. She wears a light, flowing turquoise sheer dress made of layered transparent fabric, presenting a semi-transparent texture. The wide hem naturally drapes down with the posture, creating rich pleats and light and shadow variations. The sleeves are fitted with fine textures, contrasting with the loose skirt. The overall clothing style is romantic and layered. The background is a simple pure white or off-white wall and floor, with slight wrinkles and shadows on the surface, creating a clean and ethereal sense of space. Light softly enters from the left side of the painting, creating a warm side glow, while natural shadow transitions are created on the other side. The layers of light and shadow are rich. The overall composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame, head slightly tilted, creating direct communication with the viewer. The composition is balanced and visually guided, with the foreground showing the upper body and hand movements, with clear details The middle shot depicts the lower half of the dress and the body's posture, while the background is completely blurred, highlighting the subject. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, gentle, and dreamy, as if capturing a private moment in the early morning or dusk. The color palette is mainly cool teal, paired with warm yellow lighting, creating a contrast of cool and warm tones that enhances the artistic sense and emotional expression of the image. The image texture is delicate, reminiscent of professional studio shooting, yet retains the casualness and realism of daily life, as if taken with amateur equipment at home. With a slight grainy film texture and soft color transitions, the overall experience presents a serene, beautiful, and poetic visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
