        {
          "id": "krea2-bab312ac634e4fc267b20d07",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫室内专注站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in an elegant vintage indoor setting, wearing an off-white turtleneck knit top paired with a brown plaid mini skirt and gray stockings, layered with a beige and brown knit cardigan and brown square-toe chunky-heeled leather shoes. The overall look presents the refined and graceful British collegiate style. Golden stamped text is visible on the spine. She gently holds the book in her right hand while her left hand hangs naturally, appearing calm and quiet. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the center, slightly tilted toward the camera, head slightly tilted. It presents a focused expression of quiet reading. In the foreground is a classical-style carved sofa with exquisitely carved wooden frames, featuring curled patterns and metal decorative details. The seat cushion is made of light beige velvet fabric with round cushions along the edges. Intricate craftsmanship can be seen at the armrests. The middle scene features a combination of a female figure and a sofa. The background features a wide floor-to-ceiling window framed with white wood frames, allowing soft natural light to let in. Outside the window, blurred outlines of green plants can be faintly seen. The curtains have a beige base with light gray floral patterns. The texture is thick and drapes, with curtains gently drawn open on both sides to form a symmetrical visual frame. The floor is covered with a light beige woven carpet, edges decorated with simple geometric patterns. The walls are in a pale yellow tone with clean line decorations. The entire composition adopts a vertical rectangular proportion, with figures occupying the main part of the composition. The gaze is guided from the foreground sofa to the middle of the scene, then extends to the background window and curtains, creating a clear sense of spatial layering. Light and shadow slanting in from the left window creates a warm and soft morning atmosphere. Light casts dappled shadows on the curtains, enhancing the space's sense of realism and depth. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, off-white, and brown, accented with deep blue and gray-green. The colors are harmoniously unified and full of nostalgic and tranquil artistic atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains the natural authenticity of daily life, like a moment captured in a quiet corner of the home. It carries a strong literary and artistic atmosphere while also showcasing the refined beauty of fashionable photography",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
