        {
          "id": "krea2-f09b7f573be9bf774f5bae4e",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫摄影棚俏皮站立手持物",
          "prompt": "In the black-and-white video, a woman stands sideways, elegant yet reserved. She wears a delicately designed white shirt, with layers of ruffled pleats at the collar and cuffs. The light, flowing sheer fabric creates a soft layering under the light. The texture and pleat details of the fabric are clearly visible, showcasing the garment's three-dimensional structure and exquisite craftsmanship, adding a touch of softness and spontaneity. Her right hand gently grips her left arm, her movements natural and relaxed. A simple silver ring is worn on her ring finger, serving as a subtle accent in the frame. The expression is calm and profound, as if immersed in one's own thoughts. The overall composition uses a medium close-up, with the figure occupying most of the space on the right side of the painting, the body slightly leaning forward, the head turning to the left, forming a smooth diagonal line. The background is a pure light gray gradient wall, simple and clean, with no distractions, creating a minimalist atmosphere. Light softly shines from the left, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The highlights emphasize the texture and three-dimensionality of the clothing, while the shadows outline the character's contours and volume. The transitions between light and shadow are natural and delicate, enhancing the layering and depth of the image. The overall color palette is dominated by black, white, and gray, with varying levels of gray to create a rich visual texture. The upper left and lower right corners of the image are printed with \"CHLOÉ by BODA\" and \"2017-2018 boda Confident· Happy· Light· Optimistic· Textual messages such as \"Effortless\" are simple and modern, harmonizing with the overall style. The composition emphasizes blank space, using negative space to enhance the subject's presence, creating a quiet, sophisticated, and artistically rich visual experience. The overall atmosphere is calm and restrained yet gentle, like a fashionable portrait shot in a professional studio, with the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment, capturing the most natural state of the person and conveying an emotional tone that coexists with confidence, composure, and elegance. The painting carries a strong sense of narrative and emotional tension, as if freezing a moment of contemplation and self-dialogue. The flow of light and shadow and the presentation of details together construct a visual world full of poetry and aesthetics",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
