        {
          "id": "krea2-92fe2f6a265316423b604588",
          "alias": "单女全裸蓝牛仔厨房俏皮坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a high stool, her left hand gently touching the lace top on her chest, her right hand naturally resting on her knee, her posture elegant and composed. She wears a white lace long-sleeve top with a wavy hem, a white tight base layer underneath, light blue denim shorts, long and well-proportioned legs, and nude stockings. Her feet are naturally crossed, one foot resting on the stool pedal, the other dangling in the air. The overall look is fresh, sweet, and yet still sexy. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the middle shot, and the composition uses a three-part method. The figure occupies about two-thirds of the frame, set in a cozy indoor kitchen setting. Wooden cabinets and walls display warm natural wood tones, with fresh fruits like apples, oranges, and leafy greens placed on the cabinets. Next to them are cleaning spray bottles and spice jars. Several handwritten notes and photos are pasted on the wall. On the right wall hangs an artistic poster reading \"VAN GOGH EN PROVENCE,\" adding an artistic touch. A glass wine glass and a bottle of red wine are placed on a wooden box, with cotton decorative branches nearby. Creating a lively atmosphere, the foreground features a high stool with a metal frame made of wood, featuring a simple and modern structure. The floor is covered with a beige woven carpet, and the light and shadows come from soft natural light on the left. The light is evenly bright and even, without strong shadows, creating a warm and comfortable home atmosphere. The entire scene is mainly in warm yellow and off-white, accented with green plants, red fruits, and dark wine bottles for visual contrast. The tones are harmonious and unified, with rich details and a strong sense of realism, as if captured with a casual amateur camera, with a slight film texture and natural noise, a slightly blurred background that enhances spatial layering, creating an overall relaxed and pleasant atmosphere full of life and youthful vitality, presenting a realistic, natural, and effortless beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
