        {
          "id": "krea2-46432bc5fbbfaf2cde39afdb",
          "alias": "单女蓝泳装公寓害羞脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a light blue high-waisted one-piece swimsuit featuring fine vertical stripes, a V-neck cut with ruffled decorations on the chest, and slender shoulder straps. The overall look was elegant and full of feminine charm. She leaned against a white wall, her left hand naturally hanging down, her body slightly turned to the side, showing off graceful curves and a healthy, full figure. Looking directly at the camera, her expression was calm and slightly shy. The lighting was soft and even, creating a fresh and clean atmosphere, with a simple indoor setting against the background. The wall is made of white and beige tiles joined together, presenting a geometric layered arrangement. On the right wall, several beige tiles and white tiles intersect, creating a visual rhythm. The left wall is pure white, with a smooth and flat surface. The overall composition centers on the figure, using medium shots that occupy the main position, fully visible from head to knee. The composition is balanced and stable, the posture is naturally relaxed, and the raised arm adds movement and tension to the image, culminating in the ruffled details at the waist. This creates a smooth visual path, with delicate light and shadow processing. The light source comes from the front left, with soft natural light evenly illuminating the figure without obvious shadows, highlighting the texture of the skin and the delicate texture of the swimsuit material. The overall color palette is mainly light blue, white, and beige, harmoniously unified to create a peaceful, fresh, and healing summer atmosphere. The image feels as realistic as shooting with everyday amateur equipment, as if captured with a regular camera in natural indoor light, preserving slight noise and authentic texture. This enhances the image's affinity and sense of life, while still maintaining artistic beauty. The composition is simple and not monotonous, with rich and thought-provoking details, conveying a gentle, tranquil, and vibrant visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
