        {
          "id": "krea2-65ba0603dd2dd398aaa415cc",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤室内忧伤坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits sideways in a dimly lit indoor setting, radiating a warm golden-brown sheen that adds an unintentional sense of laziness. It seems she is gazing into some distant place, appearing especially soft under the warm yellow light, revealing a subtle contemplation. She wears a black camisole top with thin straps, which outlines a graceful shoulder line. Her body leans slightly forward, her posture relaxed yet tinged with restrained elegance. In the foreground, a transparent glass bottle holds a small white flower, with a slender stem and budding flower The bottle reflects the surrounding light and shadow, with faint ripples appearing on the water's surface. The bottom of the bottle is placed on a circular wooden tray with circular patterns on the surface and slightly worn edges, revealing traces of time. The background is a blurred indoor space with dark tones, faintly revealing the outlines of walls and furniture, creating a private and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the left side of the painting, head slightly tilted, and the gaze directly communicates with the viewer. The glass bottle on the right serves as a visual balance point, forming a diagonal relationship with the figure, enhancing the dynamic feel of the image. Further into the background, it creates a natural visual path. The use of light and shadow is extremely skillful, with the main light source coming from the right rear, creating a strong backlighting effect. The figure's outline is wrapped in a golden halo, creating a clear contrast between highlights and shadows. One side is bright, the other darker, highlighting the sense of depth. The background light also casts soft light spots scattered across the walls and tabletops, creating a hazy atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow. Dark brown and black shadows are interwoven, with moderate color saturation that emphasizes the layering of light and shadow. The image presents a cinematic film style, with slight graininess and a retro filter effect, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera. The lens focal length is 85mm prime lens, with an aperture of f/1.8 to achieve a shallow depth of field. This makes the subject clear and the background blurred, highlighting the people and foreground objects. The overall atmosphere is quiet, gentle, and slightly melancholic, like a frozen memory, full of storytelling. The composition is compact yet well-spaced, expressing both emotion and artistic beauty, suitable for themes such as youth, loneliness, longing, or inner monologue. The images are rich in detail while retaining the authentic texture unique to photography, without excessive embellishment, giving the impression of a beautiful moment accidentally captured in daily life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
