        {
          "id": "krea2-f59c53b9ef3a09a55584aab6",
          "alias": "单女白T恤室内困倦坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits indoors, her hands gently resting on her head, fingers naturally bent and fingertips slightly apart. Her makeup is exquisite, wearing a white crew-neck T-shirt over a black camisole with thin straps creating a striking color contrast. She wears small silver earrings that sparkle softly, and her overall posture is relaxed and expressive, presenting a blend of youth and tranquility. The foreground is a close-up of her body, from above her chest to her head, with her hands positioned above her head. This forms a soft arc-shaped composition, with a light green wall as the background. The wall has a slightly textured surface that presents a warm matte texture. In the upper right corner, there is a blurred circular light source composed of multiple glass sphere-shaped bulbs, emitting a soft warm yellow glow. Light refracts and scatters through the glass spheres, creating a dreamy light spot and shadow effect, creating a hazy and romantic atmosphere. On the right side of the painting, distinct shadows are cast onto the wall, enhancing the spatial sense of three-dimensionality and layering. The composition uses close-ups. The figures occupy the main position in the composition, with a slightly tilted perspective that enhances visual dynamism and creates a strong visual center. The use of light and shadow is clever, with the main light source coming from the warm yellow light in the upper right, creating soft highlights and delicate shadow transitions. On the background wall, a gradient of light and shadow changes is formed, with natural and smooth transitions from light to dark. The overall color palette is dominated by warm yellow and light green, creating a warm, nostalgic, and slightly retro atmosphere. The color coordination is harmonious and unified, with a sharp contrast between warm and cool without feeling awkward. There are also faint orange light spots in the image, possibly reflections from objects in the foreground or extensions of ambient light, adding more layers and artistic flair to the image. The entire image presents a fleeting beauty captured casually in daily life, as if taken on a quiet afternoon with an old film camera. The slight graininess and natural exposure shift fill the image with realism and warmth. This amateur equipment texture makes the light and shadows softer and the details richer. It offers a warm and intimate visual experience; the overall atmosphere of the painting is both modern and nostalgic, combining fashion with a sense of everyday life, as if recording an ordinary yet poetic moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
