        {
          "id": "krea2-2ea1ca88b46cf317c042ea2b",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙小径困倦蹲侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman in a light blue long dress squats gracefully by the water, holding a transparent umbrella. Under the umbrella, she slightly tilts her head back, gently inhaling a blooming hydrangea. Her expression is focused and gentle, displaying natural curves and luster. Her posture reveals a quiet contemplation and immersion in the beauty of nature. The skirt hangs naturally, fitting the curves of the body, revealing soft folds and changes in light and shadow. The overall figure is positioned slightly to the right of the composition, forming a visual focal point. In the foreground is a mirror-like water surface, reflecting the character, The images of flowers and the sky are slightly distorted and rippled, presenting a dreamlike sense of fragmentation and layering. Gentle ripples spread along the edge of the water, enhancing dynamism and realism. The middle ground features a vast dense field of hydrangeas, with flowers blooming densely and in rich colors. From pale purple and deep blue to pink and white, they weave together a dazzling sea of flowers. Green leaves dot the space, creating a striking contrast. The clusters of flowers are clustered and full of vitality, with a hazy sky and distant blurred plant outlines, creating a profound sense of space. The sky is gray-blue, as if a fine rain is about to arrive or has just stopped. The air is filled with a moist atmosphere. The entire scene is enveloped in soft, diffused light, with uniform and delicate lighting without strong shadows, highlighting the saturation and layering of colors. The painting is also dotted with tiny spots of light and floating particles, like raindrops or dust, flickering under the light, adding a poetic and dreamy atmosphere. The composition uses a figure slightly to the right of the center and a large floral wall on the left to create visual balance, with reflections on the water extending the spatial layout. It enhances symmetry and resonance. The visual guide line leads from the character's gaze toward the flowers overhead, then extends to the distant flower clusters, forming a natural flowing path. At the same time, reflections on the water lead the viewer downward to explore, adding depth to the image. The lighting atmosphere is tranquil and romantic, with cool tones predominantly blending blue, purple, and green, creating a cool, fresh, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The overall style combines realism and artistic treatment, resembling an Impressionist oil painting while retaining the authentic texture of photography, with rich details and clear layers, full of storytelling and emotional tension, it is suitable for themes of harmonious coexistence between humans and nature, tranquil moments, and inner monologue, with strong visual appeal and emotional impact",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
