        {
          "id": "krea2-48143d263fbccc7ca7eaa057",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫摄影棚站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands before a pure white background, wearing an off-white turtleneck shirt with delicate pleats at the collar and cuffs. The sleeves are decorated with lace patchwork that creates a semi-transparent mesh pattern, with ruffled details at the cuffs. The light is warm and even, without strong shadows. The background is a pure light gray wall with no debris or patterns, highlighting the main subject. The composition uses a mid-angle portrait shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, head slightly tilted, body forming an S-shaped curve. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and emotionally charged, as if capturing a quiet moment of thought. The main color tones are white, off-white, and pale pink, creating a striking contrast. This enhances visual layering. The camera shoots at a level angle, with well-handled background blur, highlighting the subject while preserving a sense of space. The entire photo features professional studio lighting effects while retaining a natural, everyday beauty. Like a portrait shot with a high-end DSLR under indoor lighting, the details are rich, texture is delicate, and light and shadow are harmonious, presenting a gentle yet restrained artistic temperament",
