        {
          "id": "krea2-01a3dde072f0ccf645745139",
          "alias": "单女黑西装街道忧伤站立吸烟",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a dim street corner alley, dressed in a black suit jacket. Her posture is relaxed yet slightly detached, holding a lit cigarette in her hand. Her left hand hangs naturally at her side, her nails painted dark polish, creating a subtle contrast with the overall tone, as if gazing at some distant presence or immersed in her own thoughts. The background is a wall covered in graffiti, with bold and powerful black graffiti lines. The patterns are complex and full of street art vibes. On the walls, several faded posters and labels are pasted, some of which are blurred. Next to them are several thick metal pipes, their surfaces rusted and giving an industrial feel. The pipes are wrapped with wires and tape, rich and realistic in detail. The entire scene is enveloped in a rich orange-yellow hue, with light sources coming from streetlights or neon lights outside the frame. The light shines diagonally from the upper right, gently extending shadows onto the walls and floor, creating a strong sense of three-dimensionality and spatial layering. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving enough space to showcase environmental details. At the same time, diagonal light and shadow and architectural structures guide the viewer deeper into the frame. The layering of smoke, light and shadow, and color enhances emotional expression. The overall atmosphere is calm and melancholic, with a strong urban nightlife vibe and a sense of loneliness, as if capturing a forgotten moment. The image has a strong cinematic and film-like feel, with moderate color saturation but on the warm side and minimal noise. It simulates the realistic effect of shooting in low-light environments, using a 50mm prime lens with a shallow depth of field, clear foreground, and slightly blurred background, highlighting the subject while preserving environmental information. The overall style blends Japanese photoshoot, street photography, and vintage film aesthetics, conveying a sense of urban loneliness that is both everyday and poetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
