        {
          "id": "krea2-dd46320b46880df76863dae4",
          "alias": "单女俏皮喝",
          "prompt": "She slightly tilts her head toward the camera, holding a clear glass bottle of milky white beverage in her right hand. The bottle has an orange label and a circular pattern, with a transparent straw inserted into the mouth of the bottle. She is gently sipping the drink with the straw, her left hand naturally resting on her knee, her posture relaxed and natural. The background is a messy but lively bookshelf filled with stacks of books. The books come in various colors, including white, blue, and red. Light softly pours in from the left, creating a warm backlighting effect. The layers of light and shadow are rich, and shadows naturally transition onto the clothes and background. The overall tone is cool but balanced by the warm light, presenting a fresh and artistic atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center-left position. The viewer's gaze guides viewers to focus on her expressions and the drink in her hand. The background blur emphasizes the subject while preserving some environmental details. The lens uses an 85mm portrait focal length to simulate professional camera shooting, with delicate image quality and realistic color reproduction, featuring a film texture and slight graininess, as if shot with an old-fashioned film camera. It adds nostalgia and a sense of documentary authenticity. The overall atmosphere is warm and healing, capturing a quiet and beautiful moment in youthful daily life, conveying a relaxed and joyful mood",
