        {
          "id": "krea2-18d189fa8d161974398555d4",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣小巷坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a narrow stone-paved alley, wearing an off-white coarse knit sweater. The sweater's texture is clearly visible, presenting a warm and soft texture. The weaving details at the cuffs and neckline are delicate and natural, and the varying thickness of the yarn adds rich visual layers. She gently grasps the hem of the sweater, her fingers slightly bent, her hand movements natural and relaxed, as if tidying clothes or hiding shyness. She was holding a white plastic bag with slight wrinkles on the surface. The material was thin and transparent, faintly revealing the outlines of the items inside. The bag was stamped with green stripes, adding a touch of everyday life. The background was a typical Japanese street, flanked by low concrete walls and old buildings. The walls were mottled and marked by the passage of time. Some areas were covered with moss, the floor was paved with irregular stone slabs, and fine gravel and fallen leaves were mixed between the cracks. On the left was a section of white metal railing, slightly worn on the surface. The lines are simple and extend deep into the frame. The distant alley gradually narrows, with interlacing light and shadow creating a strong perspective effect. Light enters diagonally from the alley entrance, creating a contrast of light and shadow that illuminates the foreground and the people. At the same time, long shadows are cast on the ground and walls, creating a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The overall tone leans toward warmth, mainly yellow-brown and off-white, with a vintage film texture. The color saturation is moderate and slightly grainy, simulating the effect of vintage camera shooting. The composition uses close-ups. The figure occupies the left central position of the frame, with her head slightly tilted, creating direct communication with the viewer and guiding viewers to focus on her expressions and demeanor. The background is blurred to highlight the subject, while retaining some environmental information to enhance spatial sense. The direction of light and shadow is clear, with the main light source coming from the upper right, creating a soft side light. The transition of shadows is natural, and the overall atmosphere is warm, nostalgic, and authentic, as if capturing an ordinary yet emotionally charged moment, like casually capturing moments of life with an old film camera. Filled with the warmth and poetry of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
