        {
          "id": "krea2-763df8185261a81e176e7591",
          "alias": "单女城市忧伤持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman is propping herself up in a transparent plastic raincoat in the rain, draped in a cheap disposable raincoat made of yellow and blue. The yellow part covers her left shoulder and head, while the blue part wraps around her right side, creating a strong color contrast. The surface of the raincoat glistens with a damp sheen, with wrinkles and droplets clearly visible. The semi-transparent texture of the material allows the inner layer to faintly see. She lowers her head slightly, her expression tinged with melancholy and contemplation. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space. The yellow raincoat edges extending diagonally from the upper left corner form a strong visual guideline. The background is a blurry gray-blue sky and a hazy outdoor environment. The blur emphasizes the subject, creating a lonely, tranquil, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The lighting is natural on cloudy days, with an overall cool tone dominated by blue-purple. The yellow raincoat is the only warm accent, with soft light and shadow but sharp contrast. Highlights are concentrated on the raincoat's folds and damp surface, giving the image a grainy texture reminiscent of film photography, as if capturing everyday moments with an old camera. Rich in details and delicate emotion, it conveys an unintentional vulnerability and poetry in urban life, full of storytelling and artistic appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
