        {
          "id": "krea2-a7a66b4d7ca69eacebc1be1a",
          "alias": "单女白背心公寓忧伤坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors on a green lawn, wearing a light blue headscarf, a white sleeveless top and loose blue jeans, white canvas shoes, and carrying a red canvas bag. Her posture is natural and relaxed, her body slightly leaning back, hands propped on the grass, head tilted to one side, expression calm yet slightly melancholic, presenting an overall lazy, casual, and slightly artistic everyday state. In the foreground is a dense green grassland, with clear grass leaves and slender leaves glowing softly in the sunlight. The breeze gently swayed, scattered on the grass were a few dead leaves and tiny wildflowers. The nearby grass was blurred, creating a natural transition of depth of field. In the middle is a seated female subject, positioned slightly to the right of the frame. The composition uses a third-division method, with the figure occupying the right third of the frame, leaving space on the left to enhance visual balance. Her body is slightly tilted, legs bent, one foot flat on the ground, the other raised, the sole facing the camera, forming a dynamic visual guideline. The red canvas bag is slung diagonally over the shoulder. The bright colors contrast with the surrounding cool-toned environment, attracting attention. In the background is a lush green park landscape. In the distance, there are metal structures climbing vines, dense vines, dark green leaves, and intertwined branches that create natural textures and layers. Behind the trellises, the outlines of city buildings can be faintly seen, including high-rise residential buildings and some low walls. The sky is pale blue, the clouds thin, and the light is bright yet soft, belonging to natural afternoon or early morning light, with sunlight shining down from the upper right of the frame. Light shadows are cast on the figures and grass, with clear direction. The light source is natural daylight, moderately intense, not glaring, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly green, accented with white, blue, and red. The tone is fresh and natural, giving it a film shooting feel. The image has a slight graininess and retro filter effect, simulating the look of vintage camera shooting. The background gradually blurs to highlight the subject, the depth of field is shallow, the composition is stable and story-rich, and the overall atmosphere is quiet and healing. Full of the breath of life, it seems to capture an ordinary yet moving moment, like a snapshot of real life casually taken with a regular camera. The details are rich and layered, combining everyday realism with artistic aesthetic expression. The light and shadow are soft, color saturation is moderate, and the edges of the frame have slight vignetting to enhance focus. Overall, it presents a gentle, tranquil, and slightly nostalgic urban pastoral style, suitable for expressing themes of youth, freedom, reflection, or relaxation",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
