        {
          "id": "krea2-3b585b6de7bacde7b44ad9ff",
          "alias": "单女城市坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at a wooden dining table, wearing an off-white hooded sweatshirt with a light gray crew-neck top underneath. Her posture is relaxed and natural, her body leaning slightly forward, as if enjoying a lazy morning time. On the foreground tabletop sits a white ceramic mug with a deep brown rim. The cup body is simple and clean, and beside it is a transparent glass bowl filled with green vegetables and a small amount of broth, with a black plate peeking out from the edge. There seem to be traces of food left on top. The background is a bright white curtain made of lightweight, translucent material. Sunlight streams in from outside, creating soft layers of light and shadow. The light filtering through the curtain becomes diffuse and warm, creating a gentle morning atmosphere. The entire composition centers on the person, shot in a medium shot, with the figure occupying the lower half of the frame. The head is near the visual golden ratio, creating a subtle sense of interaction with the viewer. The overall layout is balanced and full of everyday life. On the left is the magazine cover text. It includes the brand logos of \"COVER GIRL Suzu Hirose\" and \"mina,\" as well as multi-line Japanese titles and column names. On the right side, there is handwritten Japanese calligraphy reading \"Natsu, Timin, and Breakfast.\" The font is elegant and smooth, with natural strokes. In the lower right corner, there is a circular label that reads \"Indulge ♥ Korea Cosme.\" The overall color scheme is mainly warm white, beige, and light gray, with harmonious and unified colors. The light and shadow are delicate, with the light source coming from the front left, simulating natural light effects. The shadows are soft, the background blur is well handled, highlighting the subject. The image texture is realistic, evoking the warmth of everyday life while also featuring the artistic beauty of a fashion magazine cover. The details are rich and the layers are distinct, presenting a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The slightly artistic morning scene, like real photos taken with a professional camera in natural indoor light, features slight film graininess and real noise, enhancing realism, stable composition, and a slightly low viewpoint, creating an immersive viewing experience. The overall atmosphere is quiet, warm, and healing, full of poetic life and the calm temperament of modern urban women",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
