        {
          "id": "krea2-f630bf206a196fdc4f8a7ae3",
          "alias": "单女制服街道俏皮坐吃",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bench on a city street, wearing a dark school uniform jacket and a white shirt, her collar slightly open. She is looking down, biting into a slice of toast, looking natural and authentic. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot to highlight the main figure. The background is a street extending into the distance, flanked by closed shop shutters and weathered walls, with the floor paved with red and yellow checkered tiles. Sunlight streams in from the right side, casting long shadows on the ground, creating a contrasting effect of light and shadow. Distant buildings gradually blur, creating a strong sense of depth. The sky appears a faint blue, with a few strands of clouds illuminated by sunlight. The overall tone is warm with a vintage film texture, moderate color saturation, rich details but not too sharp, and the light soft and directional, creating a peaceful, nostalgic, and lively atmosphere. In the upper right of the frame, there is a circular traffic sign, with slightly blurred edges. It adds a touch of everyday realism. The entire scene resembles street documentary photos taken with an old-fashioned camera, full of the beauty of a moment captured by chance. It extends deeper along the street, forming a natural visual path, emphasizing spatial depth. The composition is balanced yet dynamic, with figures occupying about one-third of the left side of the frame, leaving plenty of blank space to depict the environment and atmosphere. Overall, it presents a simple, authentic, and story-rich everyday aesthetic, like a quiet scene in a youth film. It allows people to feel the passage of time and the simple beauty of life",
