        {
          "id": "krea2-62c7c227921dec31e891226a",
          "alias": "单女白T恤商店冷淡坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a corner of a thrift store piled with records and music books. She wears a white camisole paired with blue jeans, her elbows resting on her knees, fingers long, painted with light pink nail polish. Her left hand hangs naturally by her leg, and a black crossbody bag hangs casually over her shoulder. Her posture is relaxed and effortless, as if waiting for something or immersed in her own thoughts. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, occupying the main visual space, with dense record racks in the background. The cover is filled with various music album covers, including classical, jazz, pop, and other styles. Among them are album covers by \"JAY CHOU\" and some albums with English and Chinese titles. Some covers look somewhat worn, with worn edges. A metal ring decoration hangs above the shelves, adding a touch of retro charm. The middle frame shows the record racks and stacked books behind the characters, creating rich layering. The text on the spines is blurred, creating a strong cultural atmosphere. The background features farther shelves and walls, dimly lit but illuminated by several warm yellow lights, creating a soft transition of light and shadow. The composition combines close-ups with medium environments, with the subjects at a slight tilt to create an informal, everyday documentary feel. The view extends along her line of sight to the album cover in the background, then back to her lowered arms and body lines, forming a cyclical visual path. Light and shadow come from the warm light source in the upper right, possibly spotlights or neon lights inside the store. At the same time, a noticeable shadow contrast is created in the background, creating an overall warm and nostalgic atmosphere. It has a grainy texture and slight fading effect typical of film photography. The tones are mainly warm yellow and brown, mixed with cool blue-green accents, simulating the effects of vintage camera shooting. The image has a strong artistic vibe and the everyday feel of urban streets, as if recording an ordinary yet story-filled moment. The texture of amateur equipment includes slight noise, low color saturation, moderate contrast, and slight vignetting at the edges of the lens. Simulating real camera imaging features, the overall image presents a realistic and emotionally rich visual style",
