        {
          "id": "krea2-1fe5d0c26231e63cdb7eb0f6",
          "alias": "单女灰短裙樱花害羞站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under a cherry blossom tree in spring, wearing a white short-sleeved top and a light gray pleated short skirt, paired with beige high heels. Her expression is slightly shy and serene. She stands slightly sideways, gently lifting the hem of her skirt with her left hand and letting her right hand hang naturally at her side. Her posture is elegant and dynamic, as if she is spinning lightly or just stopping in her tracks. Her figure is long and well-proportioned, her legs smooth, and her overall look fresh and refined, full of youthful energy. In the foreground is a concrete path covered with flower petals, with a slightly undulating surface. At the edges, green vegetation and scattered yellow wildflowers can be seen. In the middle of the scene, the female subject is positioned slightly toward the center on the right side of the composition, her body forming an S-shaped curve, her head slightly turned, and the background is a blooming cherry tree. The flowers are dense like clouds, alternating pink and white, with thick and powerful branches that intertwine and extend, forming a dreamlike sea of flowers. In the distance, faintly visible green trees and gray fences create a profound sense of space. The composition uses the classic three-part method: the main body is on the right, the left side is blank, and the branches above span the frame, forming a natural frame structure. Guiding the gaze to focus on the figure, while using the shallow depth of field effect to blur the background into soft light spots, highlighting the subject. The visual guide extends from the small path in the foreground to the figure in the center, then converges upward to the cherry blossoms in the background, forming a smooth visual path. The lighting atmosphere is bright and soft. In the morning or afternoon, warm sunlight filters through the flower branches, creating mottled light and shadows. The figure has clear outline light, casting slender shadows on the ground. The overall color palette is mainly white, light gray, and pale pink, accented with green and beige. The colors are harmoniously unified, creating a tranquil, romantic, and poetic spring atmosphere. The image is delicate and richly detailed, as if shot with a professional camera, with a sophisticated cinematography and artistic atmosphere. It features slight film graininess and natural color transitions, presenting a realistic and beautiful everyday aesthetic style, as if capturing the most touching moments of life on an ordinary yet beautiful afternoon",
