        {
          "id": "krea2-3748c82afcffd5d4bd50ccf2",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙小径坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a sunflower field, wearing a beige woven straw hat with natural faux edges at the brim. She wears a yellow and white plaid spaghetti strap dress with delicate lace trim, giving the whole style a fresh and sweet look. She leans slightly to the side, her fingers long and her nails neatly trimmed, gazing toward the upper right of the frame, her expression gentle yet slightly longing, as if gazing at something beautiful in the distance. Her posture is naturally relaxed, her body leaning slightly forward, creating a sense of warmth and a hint of shyness. In the foreground is a cluster of blooming sunflowers, with plump and rounded golden petals. The center is a dark brown head, with green stems and leaves that are thick and strong, broad with slightly serrated edges. Some leaves are hidden in the lower left corner of the painting, forming a natural visual framework. In the middle is a female subject, positioned slightly in the center on the right side of the painting, echoing the sunflowers on the left and right. The background is a blurred garden environment, with faint green plants and scattered red flowers. The ground is light brown soil, and in the distance, a row of low wooden stake fences is visible. A soft bokeh layer is formed. The entire composition uses a three-part layout, with the figure occupying the right half of the frame. The sunflower serves as the foreground element to guide the viewer's gaze into the frame. The visual guide starts from the foreground sunflower, and through the characters' hand movements, a smooth visual path is formed. Light comes from the front left of the painting, representing the warm afternoon sunlight, creating delicate transitions of light and shadow. The shadowed areas form soft shadows around the neck and shoulders, with the overall color tone mainly warm yellow, accented by green and red. It creates a tranquil summer afternoon atmosphere, presenting a realistic image reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment shooting. Camera specs are close to Canon EOS R5 or Sony A7R IV, using an 85mm prime lens with an aperture of f/1.8, shutter speed of 1/200 sec, ISO 100, exposure compensation +0.3, white balance set to daylight mode, true and natural color reproduction, rich detail, good noise control, clear image quality, while retaining a slight film grain texture to enhance the retro vibe. The overall atmosphere is warm and healing, full of youthful energy and pastoral poetry, as if capturing a moment kissed by sunlight, allowing people to feel the beauty and purity of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
