        {
          "id": "krea2-f4f64442cfb5e81c11b6e9a4",
          "alias": "单女白短裙窗边忧伤坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window, wearing a light gray long-sleeved ballet top and a fluffy white tulle skirt. Her feet wear matching stockings, hands folded on her knees, her posture elegant and relaxed. She slightly tilts her head to gaze into the camera, presenting a serene beauty. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the composition, occupying the main visual space. In the foreground are her body silhouette and clothing details, with clearly visible folds, silky textures, and the light layers of the tulle skirt. In the middle is the semi-transparent white curtain behind her. Softly filtering natural light, creating a hazy effect of light and shadow. The background is the blurred outlines of city buildings outside the window, faintly visible through the curtains. Distant high-rises glow in the sunlight with a pale blue hue. The entire scene is illuminated by the warm afternoon sunlight. Light streams in from the left, casting long shadows on the floor and creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. The composition uses a vertical rectangle proportion, with the figure positioned slightly to the center. The lines of the window edges and curtains guide the gaze to the subject, while also creating a sense of depth. Visual guidance is achieved through the direction of light and the posture of the characters, creating a smooth viewing path. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is bright and soft, carrying a subtle sense of nostalgia, as if capturing a quiet everyday moment. The tones are mainly cool whites and light grays, accented with warm sunlight and gold, creating a fresh, pure, and slightly melancholic artistic atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, featuring professional photography resolution and natural film graininess, as if shooting with an old-fashioned film camera. The retro style, with slight noise and low color saturation, presents an aesthetic that is both dreamy and authentic, as if time stands still at this moment, recording a gentle memory of youth and dreams",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
