        {
          "id": "krea2-947d18cceb94f984200c1abf",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙街道微笑站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the wall of a beige building, wearing a light blue dress paired with black platform boots, a dark backpack slung across her shoulder, smiling as she leans sideways to the wall, her head slightly tilted, as if interacting with the huge silhouette of a black cat on the wall. Her posture is naturally relaxed, her body slightly leaning forward, her hands hanging naturally—her left hand gently gripping the backpack strap, and her right hand hanging naturally, creating a friendly and playful atmosphere. The background is a slightly mottled beige wall. On the wall is a huge silhouette of a black cat, walking in a simple and powerful pose with smooth lines. Above the silhouette is the blue handwritten words \"CAT Public Office,\" elegant and stylish. Above the wall is a dark gray window frame embedded with dark blinds. The edge of the frame shows slight wear marks, reflecting the building's historical character. A white surveillance camera is installed in the upper left corner, facing the street, hinting that this is a public space. In the lower right corner of the image, the artist's signature \"Zhang Yiwen Painting\" is displayed. The overall composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with figures on the left side and cat silhouettes occupying most of the right space, creating visual balance. The foreground is a smooth gray cement floor with slight reflections, the middle ground features figures and walls, and the background is the building facade and sky. Light comes from the upper right, with soft and even sunlight casting soft shadows, with a beige tone Blue-gray and black are the main colors, harmoniously unified in color, presenting a peaceful and warm everyday atmosphere. The overall composition has a strong visual guidance, then follows her gaze toward the huge cat silhouette, and finally notices the text and details on the wall. The composition is stable and layered, with delicate light and shadow treatment and just the right contrast between light and shadow, preserving details while enhancing three-dimensionality. The entire image is full of life and artistic interest, as if taken with an old-fashioned film camera on a street scene, with a slightly grainy texture. The color saturation is moderate, with a cool tone, creating a retro yet fresh urban aesthetic. Slight vignetting effects at the edges of the frame enhances the photo's realism and storytelling. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and joyful, full of creativity and imagination, like a carefully conceived urban street art photograph capturing the subtle connections between people and animals, reality and imagination",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
