        {
          "id": "krea2-65d5728b5fb588b4e46fa307",
          "alias": "单女棕外套公园困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a park path, wearing a long dark brown coat over a black turtleneck sweater, light purple glossy wide-leg pants, black ankle boots, thin-rimmed glasses, and slightly lowered head to look at the ground. Her expression is calm and contemplative, her left hand naturally resting at her side, her posture elegant and relaxed. Her figure is illuminated by sunlight from behind, forming a soft outline. The light passes through the treetops, casting light onto her body and the ground, creating a warm and dreamy atmosphere. The path is covered with golden yellow and brown fallen leaves. Leaves are layered and partially deformed by stepping, presenting natural textures and textures. The background is a tranquil forest, with pines and other trees interlaced, dappled light and shadow filtering through the branches and leaves. Distant trees appear slightly blurred, creating a natural depth effect. The sky is bright but not glaring, with sunlight slanting down from the upper left of the frame, creating a clear backlighting effect that sharpens the figure's outlines. At the same time, long shadows cast on the ground move slightly with her steps, enhancing the dynamic feel of the composition. The composition uses the three-part method The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the painting, with the gaze facing the lower right. The foreground features scattered leaves and details on the ground, the middle ground features the main figure and nearby trees, and the background features gradually blurred forests and open grasslands. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, brown, and gray, accented by purple pants for visual highlights. The colors are harmonious and unified, with rich layers of light and shadow, transitioning naturally from strong light to shadow. The scene is filled with the unique tranquility and poetry of autumn, as if capturing a moment when genuine emotions are revealed unintentionally. Using the Canon 5D Mark IV camera paired with an 85mm f/1.2 lens, it simulates the natural light environment found in portrait photography, retaining slight film graininess and color gradients, presenting a texture reminiscent of professional studio outdoor scenes. It delivers the realism and everyday atmosphere of amateur equipment shooting, while also combining art film-like light and shadow treatment and emotional expression, making the entire frame both realistic and poetically beautiful",
