        {
          "id": "krea2-568dfbdaff82ff942adecfc0",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套室内神秘站立持书",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman adds a touch of casualness and laziness, carrying a hint of curiosity and inquiry, as if peering into some secret, or silently communicating with the viewer. Her expression reveals a subtle tension and anticipation. She wears a light blue jacket, made of smooth material with a slight sheen, possibly nylon or polyester. White buttons at the cuffs reveal clear details. She uses her right hand to pull up the collar of the jacket, a gesture that seems like hiding. It also feels like self-protection, creating a mysterious and evocative atmosphere. The left hand gently rests on the right arm, fingers naturally bent, the posture relaxed yet elegant. The coat's lining is deep blue, edged with pink and white stripes adding color layering. The background is pure white, with no debris or distractions, making the subject stand out. The composition uses close-ups, using a shallow depth of field effect to blur the background, further emphasizing the subject's presence. The lighting is soft and even. Coming from the upper front, there is no strong shadow, making the overall image clean and bright. The transition of light and shadow is natural, with cool tones dominated. Light blue and white create a fresh and tranquil feeling, while pink accents add warmth and vitality, sparking curiosity about hidden parts. The whole image is full of storytelling and emotional tension, as if capturing a fleeting inner monologue. It has strong artistic appeal and photographic beauty, presenting the refined feel of a professional fashion magazine shoot. It also preserves unintentional, authentic moments from daily life, like high-quality portraits taken with a high-resolution phone in natural indoor light—authentic and expressive",
