        {
          "id": "krea2-62ed6fb79208ebd47a213e1e",
          "alias": "单女湿身蓝连衣裙海滩忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a beach covered with damp pebbles, wearing a deep blue sleeveless long dress. The fabric is light and flowing, gently swaying in the breeze. The hem naturally spreads over the damp rocks, creating soft folds and light and shadow variations, adding a touch of laziness and spontaneity. She sits sideways, legs bent, one arm embracing the violin, the other gently gripping the bow. The violin rests on her lap, the wood body has a warm and lustrous sheen, showing a natural brown grain, the strings are clearly visible, and the headstock is exquisitely carved. The overall design is elegant and artistic, with a slight blush that looks both pure and tinged with a hint of melancholy. The background is a vast coastline, covered with gray and white pebbles of various sizes and shapes. The stones are rough, some soaked by seawater, reflecting a faint sheen. In the distance, waves can faintly lap the shore. The sky is bright, sunlight pours down from above, warm and soft, casting faint shadows on the ground and objects, creating a peaceful yet slightly lonely atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-shot perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, forming the visual focal point. The violin, as an important element, is placed in the foreground to guide the viewer's gaze. At the same time, the character's posture and head direction are used to direct the viewer's gaze toward the camera, enhancing interaction. The pebbles in the background and the distant sea surface are distinctly layered, creating a contrast of depth of field before and behind and making the scene more three-dimensional. The light and shadow are handled delicately, with dark areas distributed beneath the body and in rock crevices. The colors are mainly blue, brown, and gray-white, with a striking contrast of warm and cool tones. The blue long dress and brown violin form a harmonious complementary color relationship, with a unified and textured overall tone. The image presents a serene, artistic, and slightly melancholic poetic beauty, as if recording a private moment about music, solitude, and nature. It is like a real scene shot with an old film camera, featuring slight graininess and natural exposure transitions, rich in detail, emotionally rich, and possessing strong narrative and artistic appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
