        {
          "id": "krea2-7e1bfbb39c0ec4a9401df119",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫窗边微笑坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window indoors, her fingers naturally bent into a half-clenched fist, creating a playful and subtle atmosphere. She wears a white turtleneck knit sweater underneath, topped with a sleeveless dress in off-white with delicate green and light purple plaid patterns. The dress design is simple and elegant, with natural pleats at the waist, presenting a soft A-line silhouette. The overall look is fresh, artistic, and layered. The background is a white horizontal blind, with light streaming evenly through the blinds from outside. Parallel light and shadow stripes are formed, with light and shadow interwoven on the figure and background, adding rich visual texture and spatial depth to the composition. The composition uses medium to near shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, body slightly turned and head facing the camera, creating a stable visual focal point. The middle ground shows her upper body and clothing details, while the background is a blurred shutter structure. The shallow depth of field effect highlights the subject, ultimately resting on her warm smile. The overall light and shadow atmosphere is bright and soft. With cool white as the main color, light comes from the sides, creating a natural shadow transition that enhances three-dimensionality and realism. Overall, it presents a warm and tranquil moment in daily life, as if taken spontaneously with a regular phone or portable camera. It has a slight graininess and realistic exposure texture, without excessive retouching, preserving a sense of life and intimacy. The image style leans toward Japanese artistic style, with clean and transparent tones, simple composition without losing detail, and the figure's posture is natural and relaxed. The emotional expression is sincere, as if recording a quiet and beautiful moment on a sunny afternoon. There are no unnecessary decorations or distractions in the painting; all attention is focused on the figure and their interaction with the environment. This minimalist approach makes the theme stand out while maintaining artistic beauty. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, warm, and healing, allowing people to feel a poetic beauty in ordinary life",
          "description": "",
