        {
          "id": "krea2-373aa994eb41d6d3d54253bd",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫公园站立出神",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a horizontal bar in an outdoor park, holding a slightly worn green metal bar with both hands. Her body leans slightly back, arms stretched straight to support her upper body, her posture natural and relaxed, showing youthful energy and a relaxed joy. She wears a light blue plaid shirt with a white T-shirt underneath, dark blue jeans, and the hem of the shirt casually drapes down to her waist, appearing casual and comfortable. Looking toward the upper right of the frame, As if gazing into the distance or immersed in some beautiful thought, the overall composition centers on the figure, using medium shots where the figure occupies the main position. The background is blurred green trees and dappled sunlight, creating a soft bokeh effect. Light streams through the gaps in the leaves, presenting a warm golden tone that creates a peaceful and cozy evening atmosphere. The foreground features a clear horizontal bar and the upper body of the person, the middle ground is the figure and part of the background, and the background is a blurred forest and sky, with distinct layers. Visual guidance naturally leads the subject's gaze and hand movements to the right side of the frame. The light and shadow are soft, combining backlight and side lighting, gently outlining the character's outline. The overall tone is warm, with a slight retro filter effect. The image texture is close to everyday amateur photography, such as Canon or Sony cameras recording authentically under natural light, evoking a sense of life and documentary while retaining the beauty of artistic photography. The lens uses an 85mm prime lens with an f/2.8 aperture, capturing a shallow depth of field effect and natural background blur. The main subject stands out, with moderate color saturation that is not overly bright to maintain a sense of realism. The edges of the frame have slight vignetting to enhance focus, creating an overall atmosphere that is peaceful, warm, and full of youthful energy, like a girl enjoying a moment of leisure and beauty in an ordinary park bathed in afternoon sunlight",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
