        {
          "id": "krea2-369ac78654aad94922459cc6",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套雪地忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the snow, wearing a light blue wool coat over a white knit sweater and beige scarf, light blue jeans, black Martin boots, and yellow socks. Her body leans slightly, her left leg raised, right arm raised, palm spread wide, as if embracing the sky. Her posture is light and full of vitality. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left, with the figure occupying about two-thirds of the frame. The composition uses medium shots, presenting the figure fully from above the knees. The background is a vast snowy field with distant blurred lakes and mountain outlines. The sky shows a pale blue-white gradient, with soft and even lighting. The overall color palette is mainly cool tones, with soft blue and white accents, creating a tranquil and cool winter atmosphere. The foreground is fine snow with faint footprints and textures; the middle is the dynamic figures of the figures; the background is the hazy lake and distant mountains, forming a clear sense of layering. The visual guide naturally leads the distant scenery from the figures' postures, with light and shadow coming from diffused skylight without obvious shadows Overall, it presents a sense of clean, pure, warm, and slightly melancholic beauty, like a winter portrait shot with a professional camera. The image has a cinematic texture, rich in detail, and harmonious colors, as if capturing a real and touching moment. The whole image is full of youthful energy and poetic life, like a gentle poem about winter, allowing people to feel the warmth and hope of the winter days",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
