        {
          "id": "krea2-c91ef4b55f24a1b73cf111e5",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣街道忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by a metal railing on a city street, wearing a light blue plush knit cardigan with a fluffy and soft fabric, presenting delicate knit textures and natural pleats. Underneath, she wears a white shirt with smooth shoulder lines, giving the overall look a relaxed and casual vibe. The texture is smooth, looking directly at the camera with slight freckles, adding authenticity and approachability. She wore a string of pearl necklaces, the beads lustrous and rounded, hanging from the neckline, adding a touch of vintage elegance. The background was a mottled cement wall, covered with traces of time, peeling paint, stains, and rust. The wall was adorned with blue-green graffiti letters \"CH\" and some blurred patterns. The color layers were rich, ranging from faded gray-white to vivid blue-green contrasts, creating a decadent yet artistic urban atmosphere. The floor was rough cement, slightly damp, reflecting faint light. The railing is made of dark gray metal, with wear and rust on the surface. The structure is simple yet industrial-oriented. The composition uses a mid-shot close-up, with the figure positioned on the right side of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The head is slightly tilted, creating direct communication with the viewer. The background is blurred to highlight the main subject, while retaining enough environmental information to enhance the realism of the scene. Light and shadow come from the front left, creating a subtle transition between light and dark. The shadows are soft and not stiff, giving the figure a stronger sense of depth. The overall color tone is warm, mainly off-white, light blue, and gray-brown. Dotted with blue graffiti and pink plastic bags, the color scheme is harmonious and layered, creating a tranquil yet slightly melancholic atmosphere, as if capturing a moment on an afternoon street corner. Full of storytelling and life, it feels like shooting with an old film camera, with slight graininess and low saturation, simulating everyday amateur equipment shooting. The lens focal length is moderate, depth of field is well controlled, and the background is moderately blurred, enhancing spatial depth. The overall image presents a gentle, tranquil, and slightly nostalgic urban youth aesthetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
