        {
          "id": "krea2-8b8e2e4721ee87682e393160",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden floor, leaning against a light gray wall, wearing a loose blue vertical striped knit sweater. The sweater is finely textured, with clearly visible patterns, and the sleeves hang naturally, creating soft pleats. She slightly turns to look back at the camera, looking radiant and captivating. Her legs are together, knees bent, and her posture relaxed and natural, as if enjoying a moment of tranquility. In the foreground is a warm wooden floor with clear wood grain and a gentle hue. Sunlight streams in diagonally from the right, casting mottled shadows on the floor and walls, forming parallel bands of light and shadow with strong contrasts of light and shadow. The middle ground features the female subject, positioned slightly to the right of the frame, her body slightly tilted, head turned toward the camera, creating a subtle visual guidance. The composition uses a three-part method, with the subject on the right side, leaving a large shadow space on the left to create a balanced and dynamic visual structure. The background is a simple light gray wall with a slightly grainy texture. There is no unnecessary decoration, highlighting the relationship between the figure and the light and shadow. In the corners of the walls, there are wooden baseboards with a deeper color, echoing the floor and enhancing the sense of layering in the space. Light comes from the upper right, natural light in the early morning or evening, warm and soft, with a distinct color temperature tendency, presenting a golden tone. The beam passes through the gaps in the curtains, forming sharp geometric shapes that illuminate parts of the wall and floor, while casting soft shadows on the figures. The transition of light and shadow is natural, the details rich, and the overall atmosphere is peaceful and warm. Intimate and full of everyday life, like everyday moments shot with an old film camera. The image has slight graininess and color shifts, with a slightly retro tone, as if recording an ordinary yet touching afternoon. The background is slightly blurred, highlighting the subject while preserving environmental information. The overall composition has a cinematic feel, emphasizing the combination of light, shadow, and emotion, conveying a serene, gentle, and slightly melancholic poetic beauty. There are no unnecessary elements distracting the frame, and every detail serves the theme. It creates a realistic and infectious everyday aesthetic experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
