        {
          "id": "krea2-4feaacda2c4127ac7c99d694",
          "alias": "单女短裙室内摆拍",
          "prompt": "She wears an off-white high-neck knitted long-sleeve top and a light-colored, semi-transparent short skirt. The garment lightly covers her body, creating soft folds and light and shadow effects. Her hands are crossed behind her head, fingers slightly bent, a natural and slightly casual pose adding a touch of softness and privacy. It exudes a subtle gentleness and tranquility. The background features a deep brown old-fashioned carpet with intricate floral patterns, mainly dark red, gold, and green, with delicate and vintage textures. The carpet edges are slightly curled, showing signs of use. The floor is made of wood or hard materials but is completely covered by the carpet. The overall composition uses a high-angle overhead shot, with the figure occupying the main position in the frame, extending from the lower left to the upper right, forming a strong visual guiding line. Light comes from the upper right of the frame, soft and warm. It's like afternoon sunlight streaming through the curtains into the room, creating a natural side lighting effect. The transition between light and shadow is smooth, creating a quiet, warm, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The colors are mainly warm tones, with off-white, light brown, deep red, and golden intertwined, creating harmonious and unified tones with rich layers. The overall image has a film-like texture, with slight graininess and low saturation treatment enhancing realism and artistry, as if capturing everyday moments taken with an old camera, capturing peaceful moments in life. There are no unnecessary decorations or distractions in the painting, focusing on the relationship between the figures and the environment, emphasizing spatial sense and emotional expression. The composition is balanced yet dynamic, and through the contrast between the figures' postures and background textures, the softness of the subject and the weight of the environment are emphasized. The visual guidance is clear, extending along the body lines to the feet, ultimately returning to the complex patterns in the background, forming a complete visual loop. The overall atmosphere is quiet, private, and warm, full of poetry and the spirit of life, like a frozen memory. It lets you feel the slow flow of time and inner peace",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
