        {
          "id": "krea2-9f36db7902470dee3a1f268a",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫室内媚态持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a white long-sleeved shirt and a black pleated short skirt. The hem of the shirt was tied in a knot, revealing her waist, paired with a black tie that casually draped down. Her expression revealed a blend of laziness and sensuality. Her posture leaned slightly forward, hands folded in front of her, and body slightly turned to the side, creating a natural curves. The overall look presented a typical Japanese campus style, with bright white curtains in the background. Sunlight filtered through the sheer fabric from one side, creating a soft light and shadow effect, with the light creating delicate transitions of light and shadow on the figures. The shadowed areas present warm golden tones, composed with a mid-shot portrait position, with the figure occupying the main spot slightly to the right, leaving space on the left to enhance visual balance. The shallow depth of field highlights the subject, and the curtain texture in the background is blurred to create a soft blurred background. The direction of light flow also enhances this direction, creating a bright and warm light atmosphere, with the soft texture of morning or afternoon sunlight. White and black are the main colors, creating a striking contrast and harmonious visual effect. The overall image presents an atmosphere that is both everyday and artistic, as if shot with a professional camera in natural indoor light. The moment captured with a wide-aperture lens has the texture and depth of real photography. The details are rich, from the folds of clothing and the sheen of fabrics to the delicate textures of human skin, all are clearly distinguishable. The composition is meticulous, and the use of light and shadow is skillful, creating a tranquil, gentle, and highly attractive visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
