        {
          "id": "krea2-8b9ef7d782f7e8c3c9496527",
          "alias": "单女白外套公园愤怒站立泼洒",
          "prompt": "She wears a fluffy, soft white plush jacket with delicate texture, as if you can feel its warm touch. Underneath, she wears a white lace-trimmed short skirt, layered and displaying a gentle and elegant temperament. Her right hand is gently raised, pinching an orange-red maple leaf between her fingertips. The edges of the leaf curl slightly, veins clearly visible. Her overall posture is relaxed and natural, full of poetry and romance. In the foreground, the main figure occupies about two-thirds of the right side of the frame, with a slightly tilted body forming graceful curves. The raised arm gesture guides the gaze upward to the maple leaf in her hand. The composition adopts an oblique perspective to enhance dynamism and visual tension. The middle ground features a blurred background of golden and orange leaves, presenting a large aperture bokeh effect, forming beautiful bokeh light spots, with high saturation but not glaring, dominated by warm yellow tones, accented with deep red and ochre, creating a rich autumn atmosphere. The background features the outline of a distant forest, gradually transitioning into dark orange and deep brown, with rich layers and a blend of solid and void, making the subject stand out. Light and shadow shine diagonally from the upper right of the frame, creating a soft backlighting effect that outlines the figure's outline and gives the edges a golden edge. The shadowed areas transition naturally, with warm and bright light, like afternoon sunlight pouring down. It brings a sense of tranquility and healing. The overall color palette mainly features warm yellow, orange-red, and off-white, with a harmonious contrast of cool and warm tones, creating a warm, nostalgic, and slightly melancholic autumn atmosphere. The image has a strong film texture, fine grain, and slightly fading colors, simulating the retro atmosphere of vintage camera shooting. The lens is a 50mm prime portrait lens with an f/1.8 aperture, achieving an extremely shallow depth of field, completely blurred backgrounds, clear visual guidance, balanced yet varied composition, and the overall image exudes an artistic, tranquil atmosphere. The poetic everyday beauty is like a real moment captured by an amateur photographer in a park or courtyard with a mobile phone or entry-level camera, full of the spirit of life and emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
