        {
          "id": "krea2-5e754b36dfb7d166ccd594b6",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫广场忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor stone steps, wearing a dark blue polo shirt with a green crocodile emblem on her chest, light blue denim shorts, and off-white high-top canvas shoes. Her ankles show gray socks, her expression calm and thoughtful. Her hands rest on her knees, her posture relaxed but revealing a hint of restraint and detachment. The stone steps she sits on are made of gray bricks, with a smooth surface with fine textures. The edges of the steps are clear, and below them is a path paved with square stone slabs, with neat gaps between them, and the ground looking somewhat worn. A few dead leaves and scattered weeds are scattered, with a blurred woodland background. The trunks stand straight and upright, the canopy is dense, and in the distance, you can see slopes and sparse vegetation. The overall environment appears peaceful and slightly desolate, with grayish-white skies and soft and even lighting, no obvious shadows, presenting a diffused light effect on cloudy or dusk days. The foreground features a clear stone slab floor and the lower body of the figure, the middle ground features the main body and some steps, while the background is blurred to highlight the subject while creating spatial layering. The background gradually loses focus, producing a soft bokeh effect. The colors are mainly cool tones, interwoven with blue, gray, and brown. The overall atmosphere is quiet, artistic, and slightly melancholic, as if recording an ordinary afternoon moment, with a film photography texture. The tones are warm but not oversaturated, with slight graininess and natural light and shadow transitions. The painting blends the atmosphere of life with artistic beauty, like youth portraits taken with an old camera—authentic and delicate, capturing the unintentional emotions and loneliness of daily life. The overall composition is balanced, with characters and environments harmoniously coexisting, conveying a quiet, introspective, gentle, and slightly confused emotional tone",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
