        {
          "id": "krea2-4034abac913829c3e95053fe",
          "alias": "单女白礼服婚礼忧伤持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman wore an elegant white strapless wedding dress. She turned slightly to look back at the camera, her expression calm yet tinged with a hint of melancholy. Her right hand gently held a bouquet of large pink and beige peonies. The petals layered softly with gradient colors, the stems long and naturally drooping, partially covering one side of her body, creating a visual semi-concealed effect. The dress was strapless, with a large bow decoration at the waist. The skirt was voluminous and wide, made from layers of sheer fabric and satin fabric, with delicate and smooth pleats, presenting an elegant drape. The overall composition centers on the character, using a medium close-up perspective where the figure occupies most of the image. The background is a pure light beige wall, with soft light streaming in from the right, creating a natural transition between light and shadow and creating a warm and dreamy atmosphere. The overall color palette mainly consists of white, off-white, and pale pink, harmoniously unified and delicate. The image texture is delicate, featuring a high-end fashion photography style with the refined feel of professional studio shooting, while retaining a slight everyday shooting feel. It feels like a moment captured with an amateur camera, with slightly defocused edges of the lens, delivering a realistic and emotionally rich image effect. The composition is balanced and layered, with the foreground showing the main figure and bouquet, and the middle ground showing the waist and hem details of the wedding dress. The background is simple and clean, with soft and even lighting without strong shadows. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, romantic, gentle, and poetic, making it suitable for wedding art photos or high-end fashion photo shoots",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
