        {
          "id": "krea2-01c8dcdea7e544d197b8c3cd",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣屋顶微笑站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the metal railing on a city rooftop, wearing a soft, fluffy light blue sweater with clearly visible knit texture, presenting a warm and comfortable feel. She tilts her head slightly back, wearing a bright smile and showing white teeth, her expression radiating pure joy and love for life. Her left hand rests casually on the railing, fingers relaxed, body leaning slightly back The posture is natural and spontaneous, as if immersed in this moment of tranquility and beauty. In the foreground is a gray metal railing, with simple and modern lines. Its cold metallic texture contrasts with the figure's warm sweater, while guiding the gaze from the foreground to the main figure in the middle of the scene. The center is a woman, positioned at the lower right of the painting, her body slightly tilted, head tilted upward to the left, forming a spacious, diagonal composition. This composition not only enhances the dynamic effect of the painting but also highlights the subject's status. The background is a hazy city skyline, with towering buildings in the distance. One pointed building stands out with a clear outline, while other buildings appear faintly in the mist, presenting a soft gray-white tone. The sky occupies the upper part of the composition, with a few light white clouds floating in the pale blue sky. The layers of clouds are distinct, and light filters through them, creating a bright and gentle atmosphere. The entire scene is filled with natural light, which shines from the upper right and creates delicate shadows in the folds of the sweater. This enhances the sense of three-dimensionality, with the lighting tones warm, yet the overall tone still maintains a fresh cool tone. This contrast makes the composition both cozy and retains the calm of the city. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, making the characters stand out more and elongating the city's outline in the background, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The visual guide starts from the foreground railing, extending upward along the curves of the figure's body and line of sight, forming a smooth visual path. The entire scene is filled with the atmosphere of everyday life. It feels like a photo taken casually with an old film camera, with slight graininess and color shift, simulating the texture of real film. The color saturation is moderate, with a slight retro filter effect, giving the image a gentle and nostalgic atmosphere. The overall style blends youth, freedom, urbanism, and lifestyle aesthetics, combining the refinement of artistic photography with the authenticity and warmth of amateur shooting, conveying a simple yet profound sense of happiness.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
