        {
          "id": "krea2-2ac912019f6cd2d92c673170",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫小径困倦站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a white short-sleeved shirt and a deep blue pleated skirt in her school uniform, her black bow tie neatly tied at her chest, and a black backpack slung over her shoulder. She stands on a sunlit tree-lined path outdoors. A gentle breeze blows, and she stands slightly to the side, her fingers long, showing white teeth. Sunlight pours down from the upper left of the frame, creating a soft backlight effect. Light filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting dappled shadows on the ground and figures, creating a warm and dreamy atmosphere. The background is a blurry green forest and a winding path. The blurred depth of field makes the subject stand out. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned on the left side of the frame, leaving space on the right side for the gaze to extend into the distance. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and green, blending natural light and soft focus effects, presenting a fresh, artistic, and slightly nostalgic visual style. It feels like a youthful memory shot with an old film camera. The image has a slight grainy texture and color shift, enhancing realism and a sense of era. The backpack strap and shirt folds are clearly visible in the foreground, rich in detail. The middle ground shows the complete figures and postures of the figures, while the background completely blurs into a hazy greenery. The layers of light and shadow are distinct, highlights are bright and transparent, while shadows transition softly. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of vitality, like a fleeting moment frozen on a summer afternoon campus, allowing one to feel the beauty and innocence of youth. The image presents a genuine beauty captured casually in daily life, as if one can hear the rustling of leaves in the wind and the faint chirping of birds in the distance. The entire scene radiates a subtle warmth and hope. Like a silent poem, it records the most ordinary yet precious moments",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
