        {
          "id": "krea2-7709fdbe0abec3a9f8198730",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣摄影棚害羞坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in front of a pure white background, wearing a bright yellow bucket hat adorned with a pair of cute beige antlers. She wears a white long-sleeved knit sweater layered with a light pink V-neck knit vest. The vest is soft and puffy with delicate textures, and she wears a dark gray pleated short skirt. She sits cross-legged, with her right leg folded over her left, her feet naturally relaxed, toes slightly bent, presenting an effortless, lazy posture. Her left hand rests gently on her knee, while her right hand rests naturally at her side. She wears a delicate silver bracelet on her wrist, adding a touch of refinement. Her body leans slightly forward, her overall demeanor gentle yet slightly shy, as if immersed in a quiet moment. Behind her is a blue square cushion, which subtly contrasts with the overall composition, injecting a calm color into the pure visual space. The entire scene is centered around the figure, using a medium perspective where the figure occupies the main position. The body is slightly tilted, forming a natural S-shaped curve that guides the gaze from the head to the legs, creating an elegant dynamic beauty with rich details. The middle ground features her body contours and sitting posture, as well as parts of the blue cushions. The background is a large pure white curtain with slight wrinkles and light and shadow variations, enhancing the sense of depth in the space. Light comes from the front left, soft and even, a typical studio setup. The main light source is bright but not glaring, with natural shadow transitions without strong contrast between light and dark. At the same time, soft backlighting is applied on the right and rear sides, making the character's profile more three-dimensional. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, gentle, and fresh, carrying a youthful innocence. The color tones are mainly white, yellow, pink, and blue, harmonious and soft, creating a visually warm yet clean and refreshing look. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains the warmth of daily life. It presents a unique style that lies between commercial portraits and personal life records, like a carefully planned home selfie. Or natural moments captured in minimalist studios, the overall image is strongly narrative, evoking a quiet afternoon with sunlight streaming through the window lattice, sipping into the corner of the room. A girl wearing her favorite outfit and a cute little hat sits quietly, enjoying her own moment of peace.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
