        {
          "id": "krea2-8d88942fb1e1b2651a01c35c",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫窗边微笑坐（2）",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a warm wooden floor, wearing a loose off-white turtleneck knit sweater. The sweater is delicate in texture, with clearly visible texture, presenting a soft warm tone. The sleeves hang naturally, giving off a relaxed and comfortable vibe. She wears black stockings, her legs smooth and graceful, the surface of the stockings reflecting a subtle sheen, forming a sharp contrast with the sweater. Her hands are raised above her head, fingers interlaced, her posture relaxed and natural, as if stretching or just waking up. She wears round metal-framed glasses with transparent lenses. Reflecting a faint reflection, she looks directly into the camera with a gentle smile, adding a playful touch. She wears delicate gold earrings, with exquisite details that add a lot to the overall look. She sits by the window, behind which are white blinds. Sunlight streams through the gaps into the room, creating a dappled and comfortable atmosphere. On the left is a light-colored wood-grain wall and a white metal clothes rack with several clothes hanging on it. This includes a blue-green top and a light-colored fabric with small patterns. On the right is a potted green plant with slender leaves naturally drooping, planted in gray geometric pots. The rough material contrasts with the vitality of the plants. There is also a white velvet carpet on the floor, edged with orange stitching, adding a touch of life. The entire composition is shot from a low angle, with a view looking up from below, making the figure stand out more and bringing the viewer closer. The visual guide starts from the foreground's foot. A clear visual pathway is formed, with delicate light and shadow processing. Natural light streams in diagonally through the window, casting soft shadows on the floor, walls, and figures, enhancing the space's three-dimensionality and layering. The overall atmosphere is warm, everyday, and authentic, as if capturing a tranquil moment when afternoon sunlight fills the room, full of life atmosphere and artistic beauty, like a private moment casually captured with a regular home camera, full of warmth and storytelling",
