        {
          "id": "krea2-d7a3229ee3d6178f1598d20b",
          "alias": "单女灰西装摄影棚沉思倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a gray pinstripe double-breasted blazer with a deep brown sheen appears in the center. She slightly lowers her head, her expression contemplative and cool. Her right hand gently holds a black round clutch, with a smooth surface and metallic decorative patterns. The bag chain is connected by a fine metal ring, and she wears a simple ring on her wrist. Her fingers are long, and her nails are painted dark polish, contrasting with the overall look. Her legs are clad in semi-transparent gray stockings, which are lightweight and lightweight. You can faintly see the lines of the legs. On her feet are black pointed high heels, with slim heels that showcase an elegant stance. The body leans slightly forward, naturally relaxed yet stylish. The foreground shows the full body of the person, fully presented from head to feet. The background is a pure black screen or wall without any unnecessary decoration, creating a minimalist yet focused visual effect. The middle section depicts the spatial relationship between the figure and the background, with light shining slightly from the front above, creating soft lighting that highlights the character's silhouette and clothing details. At the same time, light shadows are cast on the ground and background to enhance the sense of three-dimensionality. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure standing in the center with a slightly downward gaze. The composition is close to a vertical proportion, emphasizing a sense of vertical extension. The visual guide line starts from the character's head, follows the body's direction to the feet, and then draws attention through details like the handbag and stockings. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is mainly cool tones, with soft and even overall lighting but with slight contrast between light and dark, creating a sophisticated, calm, and slightly mysterious atmosphere. The ambient lighting comes from professional studio lighting, providing clear directionality and clear character outlines. The overall image presents an urban fashion style, blending the formality of professional attire with the casual feel of everyday wear. It feels like a real-life moment captured backstage at a high-end fashion show or media interview, capturing the elegance and confidence of the person in their natural state. The colors are mainly gray, black, and white, accented with a touch of metallic sheen and dark nail polish. The overall color scheme is unified and harmonious, with strong visual impact and rich details. The delicate texture conveys an image of a modern woman who is independent, capable, fashionable, and full of charm",
