        {
          "id": "krea2-a1fd575ab9e17f5b061e9220",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫城市忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the windowsill, wearing a white short-sleeved shirt paired with a green knit vest and brown plaid pleated skirt, tied with a red bow tie. Black stockings wrap her long legs, gracefully leaning sideways against the window frame, her expression tinged with contemplation and longing, radiating youthful freshness and tenderness. In the foreground, she is a close-up of her body sitting on the windowsill, with smooth leg lines, slightly bent ankles, and hands gently resting on the windowsill. In the middle is her full sitting posture and part of the interior environment, including the wooden floor and white windowsill. The background is the city's skyscrapers seen through large windows. The architectural outlines are clear but slightly blurred, creating a sense of spatial depth. The composition uses a diagonal perspective, with the figures positioned slightly to the lower right of the frame, creating an asymmetrical visual balance. The geometric lines of the window extend from the upper left to the lower right, guiding the gaze through the figures and focusing on the distant cityscape. Light softly streams in from outside, presenting warm tones of morning or evening, while the shadowed parts naturally blend into the overall image, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The entire scene resembles everyday moments captured with a professional camera, with a slight film texture and realistic noise. The lens is an 85mm prime portrait lens with an aperture of f/1.8, simulating a shallow depth of field effect, making the subject stand out while the background blurs. The colors are mainly green, white, brown, and black, accented with a red bow tie as a visual focal point. The overall image has a strong Japanese photo style, full of life and artistic ambiance, as if capturing a beautiful moment of a quiet afternoon girl gazing alone at the city. The images are rich in detail and have clear textures. From the fabric textures of clothing to the reflections of glass windows, everything is rendered extremely realistic, while preserving the naturalness and imperfections of photography, such as slight overexposure and color adjustments, which enhance the texture of the authentic shot. The composition uses window frames as natural frames, reinforcing the subject's presence. The layers of light and shadow are distinct, and the contrast between highlights and shadows is just right, highlighting the contours of the subjects while maintaining a soft overall feel. The whole scene exudes a quiet, gentle, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. It lets people feel the innocence of youth and the hope for the future",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
