        {
          "id": "krea2-a5180b77dcf6ec228aecb780",
          "alias": "单女毛衣忧伤蹲持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman squats on the steps in front of a red brick wall, wearing a brown beret, her expression slightly contemplative and melancholic, exuding a quiet and reserved aura. She wears a loose diamond-patterned knit sweater with geometric patterns in deep purple, off-white, and orange lines, cuffs decorated with colorful stripes, a white turtleneck underneath, shorts or skirts exposing her legs, brown lace-up Martin boots, holding a brown leather wallet or small clutch in both hands, fingers long and nails neatly trimmed, Her posture was relaxed but somewhat reserved, her body slightly leaning forward, knees together, presenting a quiet and intimate state. In the foreground was the red brick wall where she stood, with clear texture and warm red color, with slight weathering on the surface. On the wall was a silver-gray metal distribution box with the Korean marking \"DF단자함\" (DF단자함). Next to it were several vertical stainless steel railings reflecting the surrounding light and shadow. In the middle was where she sat. The floor was a concrete step with slight wear on the edges, and sunlight slanted in from the right. Long shadows are cast on the ground and figures, with warm and soft lighting tinged with distinct golden tones. The background features more red brick walls and some green plants. The plants are lush with branches and leaves, which appear bright yellow-green under sunlight. Some leaves are outlined by backlight, creating a halo effect. In the distance, blurred architectural structures and windows can be seen. The overall composition uses the figure to be centered slightly to the left, using diagonal light and lines to guide the view, creating a sense of depth and spatial layering. The camera angle is slightly overlooked. Capturing the full posture of the figures and the details of the surrounding environment, the painting mainly uses warm tones: the red of the red bricks, the golden yellow of sunlight, and the purple, white, and orange hues of sweaters intertwine, creating a harmonious visual effect. The contrast of light and shadow is strong, with bright highlights and transparent highlights, while the shadows are deeper, emphasizing three-dimensionality and texture. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, warm, and nostalgic, like an autumn afternoon with just the right sunlight and still time, giving a sense of everyday life and the poetic beauty of an art film. The images have the grainy texture of film photography and a soft blur effect outside focus, like real moments captured with an amateur camera. The story is full of storytelling and emotional tension. The plant and architectural details in the background are rich yet not cluttered, enhancing the scene's realism and immersion. The composition is balanced, the subject is prominent, the use of light and shadow is skillful, and the tones are consistent, conveying a subtle feeling of loneliness and tenderness, as if freezing a moment of ordinary yet touching life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
