        {
          "id": "krea2-79d43d8bbfd1078af58d1013",
          "alias": "单女白T恤窗边沉思坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window, shooting from a low angle in a low-angle view. She leans slightly to the side, her head lightly resting on the deep green window frame, as if gazing out at the sky or the distance. Her expression is calm and slightly contemplative, with a soft glow that radiates a warm golden glow. She wears a white lace camisole top, with a blue knit cardigan draped over her shoulders, revealing her slender collarbones and arm lines. Her right hand holds a transparent glass filled with clear blue-green liquid, with water droplets condensing on the rim and slender fingers. Nails neatly trimmed, hands naturally relaxed, left hand gently resting on the rim of the cup, body slightly leaning forward, near the windowsill. The background is a deep green heavy curtain, rough in texture, with wrinkles and shadows. Behind the curtain, the wooden window frame is faintly visible, dark green and slightly worn, with wear marks on the edge. On the right, part of the white wall is visible, with some peeling and mottled texture. In the foreground is a cluster of blooming yellow flowers, with petals small and petal, slender stems and leaves, and branches naturally extended. Some flowers are out of focus, creating a soft blur effect that creates a sense of layering with the figures. The overall tone of the painting leans toward a cool tone, mainly green and blue. Light enters diagonally from the upper right, creating a contrast of light and shadow and a warm backlight effect. There is a clear shadow area on the left side of the painting to enhance the three-dimensional effect. The composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space but leaving enough breathing room to extend beyond the window into the imaginative space. The overall atmosphere is quiet, gentle, and full of poetry. It features the graininess and vintage tones of film photography, simulating the realistic texture of amateur camera shooting. The edges of the frame are slightly vignetted to enhance nostalgia, with moderate color saturation, rich details, and natural transitions of light and shadow, presenting an unintentional beauty in daily life, like capturing a lazy afternoon moment. The image has slight noise and lens distortion, mimicking real camera imaging effects. The overall style leans toward a fresh and artistic style, combining the atmosphere of everyday life with artistic beauty",
