        {
          "id": "krea2-92a15c2e7ec17dd42d5e59f6",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫街道站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors in front of barbed wire, looking directly at the camera as if in a silent conversation with the viewer. Her right hand is gently raised, fingers slightly bent, index and middle fingers together, and a simple silver ring on her ring finger. Her hand is elegant and natural, creating a subtle intimacy. She wears an off-white turtleneck sweater adorned with geometric patterns of dark green, black, and brown, presenting a Nordic-style knit texture. The sweater is soft and voluminous, with rich details. The cuffs feature prominent ribbed designs, adding visual layering. She slung a black backpack across her shoulder, with a simple outline. The material appears to be durable canvas or nylon, adding a touch of casual and practical flair to the overall look. In the foreground is a teal-green chain-style barbed wire mesh, with clear grids and interlaced lines forming a regular diamond pattern. Some mesh is filtered by sunlight, casting fine shadows and creating a strong contrast of light and shadow, creating a hazy and poetic atmosphere. The middle ground is a blurred outdoor setting. Faintly visible are some trees and shrubs, with leaves showing faint yellow and green hues, hinting that the season may be early autumn or late spring. In the distance, a yellow pillar and some blurred building outlines are visible. Although the background is blurred, it preserves enough information to provide spatial and environmental clues. The barbed wire extends from the left side to the upper right, forming a diagonal guiding line. At the same time, it creates a sense of barrier in the painting, symbolizing the distance between people and the outside world. The lines of shadow intertwine to form a complex visual texture. Light comes from the right, soft natural light, possibly the afternoon or early morning sunset. Sunlight passes through the barbed wire, alternating between light and shadow, creating rich layers of light and shadow. The warm-toned lighting fills the entire scene with a sense of warmth and nostalgia. The colors are mainly off-white, dark green, and black, complemented by teal barbed wire and yellow-green plants in the background, creating a harmonious and unified overall palette. With a slight retro filter, it looks like a photo taken with an old film camera, with slight graininess and faded texture. The image captures an unintentional moment from daily life, like a casual street shot, without any deliberate staged shots, yet full of genuine emotion and storytelling. The entire image is both artistic and retains a sense of everyday life, evoking a sense of tranquility, gentleness, and a hint of loneliness in youthful life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
