        {
          "id": "krea2-e4743375f7b94c27daa380f8",
          "alias": "单女灰西装摄影棚冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a black metal lift-up stool, her body slightly leaning forward. Her right leg is bent and raised to rest on the chair, while her left leg hangs naturally, toes touching the ground. Her posture is elegant yet slightly lazy. She wears a loose dark gray fine-striped blazer, the hem naturally hanging down, revealing black stockings underneath and her long legs. In the foreground is a black vintage liftable high stool with wear marks on its surface. The metal stand has a spiral adjustment structure, giving it a solid texture. The center is the main subject, and on the left side of the background is a white photography softbox, with light projected from the upper left, creating a soft transition between light and shadow. On the right, a wooden easel can be faintly seen, topped with a whiteboard with blurred blue handwriting. Next to it is a wooden ladder placed against the wall, with a beige jacket hanging from it. The entire scene is set in a dim indoor space. The floor is a dark gray carpet, the walls are pure black, and the composition uses figures positioned slightly to the center, with the figures occupying the main position and forming a visual focal point. Light shines from the softbox on the left, creating deep shadows on the right side of the body and in the background, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere leans toward cinematic and dramatic feel, with black, gray, and white as the main color schemes, accented with red lipstick and nail polish as visual highlights. The scene presents a serene, cool, and dynamic artistic style. It feels like a fashionable portrait shot in a professional studio, with a strong black-and-white cinematic feel and a high-end fashion vibe, while retaining the realism of everyday amateur equipment shoots, such as slight noise, uneven lighting transitions, and authentic material details, enhancing the credibility and lifelike feel of the image. Overall, it presents a dual beauty that blends artistic creation with daily documentation, allowing viewers to feel the character's inner confidence and composure, as well as the narrative power inherent in photography",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
