        {
          "id": "krea2-4c96493b2d519714ef007097",
          "alias": "单女衬衫站立持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a light-colored plaid shirt and denim shorts, white sneakers, and holds a leafy green plant in her hand, interacting closely with the deer. The deer's body is slightly turned to the camera, its head turned to one side, covered in clear white spots, its fur glowing softly under the sunlight. The background is a blurred forest and grassland, with leaves showing autumn-like yellow-green tones. Sunlight filters through the canopy, casting dappled light and shadows, creating a warm and bright atmosphere The composition centers on the figure and deer, positioned slightly to the left of the center to form a visual focal point. The foreground is a clear close-up of the woman and deer, the middle ground and some vegetation, and the background is a blurred forest and sky. The overall approach uses shallow depth of field to highlight the subject and enhance spatial layering. Light comes from above, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. Shadows are gently cast on the ground and the sides of the body. The tones are warm and gentle, mainly off-white, light brown, and light green, with a slight film texture and graininess. It feels as if a real scene shot with a regular camera, filled with a warm and harmonious pastoral atmosphere, conveying beautiful moments of coexistence between humans and nature. The slightly downward perspective makes viewers feel as if they are standing right in front of them, experiencing tranquility and joy. The entire scene is like a precious photo recording daily life—authentic yet artistically beautiful",
