        {
          "id": "krea2-5fe22aa41b8d9c8b67c7acbc",
          "alias": "单女制服街道俏皮站立泼洒",
          "prompt": "A figure dressed in a typical Japanese sailor uniform stands in the middle of a quiet Japanese town street, her overall posture naturally relaxed yet slightly playful. Her left hand gently grips the backpack strap, her body slightly turned to the side, and her right leg steps forward, her toes lightly touching the ground, as if she's just stopping or preparing to move forward, showcasing youthful energy and the fleeting beauty of everyday life. She wears a white short-sleeved top with a deep blue collar and trim, adorned with two white stripes at the neckline. She wears a deep blue pleated skirt that gently sways in the wind. Black long socks wrap her slender legs, paired with brown platform loafers and a gray canvas backpack with wide and comfortable straps. The overall look is neat and campus-like. The foreground is an asphalt paved with fine stones, with sunlight casting clear shadows on the pavement, creating interwoven geometric patterns of light and shadow. The middle is the main focus, positioned slightly to the left of the frame. Her slightly tilted body and dynamic posture give the scene a dynamic feel. The background is a typical Japanese street scene, flanked by low residential buildings and shops. The exterior walls are mainly light-colored, featuring Japanese-style doors, windows, and signboards. In the distance, rolling green hills can be faintly seen. The sky is a deep blue and clear, with a few strands of white clouds drifting leisurely. The entire scene is bright and soft, with sunlight pouring down from the upper right, forming a warm golden halo. At the same time, long shadows cast on the ground and buildings, creating a striking contrast that creates a peaceful and tranquil atmosphere in the morning or afternoon. The composition uses the classic three-part method: the figure occupies the left side of the frame, leaving space on the right side to extend the gaze into the distance. Using street lines to guide the visual convergence into depth, enhancing the sense of depth, while using a shallow depth of field effect to blur the background and highlight the main subject. The buildings and distant mountains in the background gradually blur, forming a clear visual structure. The colors mainly feature warm and cool contrasts, with blue skies, dark clothing, and gray roads forming a cool tone, while the warm yellow tones of sunlight inject vitality and warmth into the scene, presenting an overall fresh, natural, and lifelike Japanese photo style. It's as if a regular camera is occasionally capturing a youthful moment on the street. The image texture is authentic and delicate, with rich details. It combines the sophistication of artistic photography with the simplicity and warmth of everyday shooting, conveying a quiet, gentle, and slightly nostalgic emotional atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
