        {
          "id": "krea2-fbd51760f7e5c03625775ba4",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫沙发沉思坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the corner of a pure white sofa, wearing a well-fitted white long-sleeve shirt and a gray high-waisted mini skirt, paired with black stockings. Her legs are elegantly crossed, right leg in front and left behind, toes naturally hanging down, her posture relaxed yet slightly lazy. Her right hand rests naturally on a silver laptop on her lap. The screen is closed, the body reflective and delicate, the brand logo clearly visible, and the overall composition centers on the figure, forming a visual focal point. The left side of the painting has a large area of blank space, while the right side features a window with horizontal blinds. Light from outside filters through the blinds into the room, creating alternating light and shadow strips that fall on the walls, sofa, and figures, creating a soft and layered natural lighting effect. The background is simple, with white as the main tone to highlight the main subject. The sofa is soft and fluffy, with a delicate texture and full cushions. The proportions of figures and furniture are harmonious, creating a comfortable sense of space. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with figures occupying about two-thirds of the frame. From above the waist down to below the knees, the leg lines are smooth, the posture natural, extending along the line of sight to hand movements, then down to the computer and legs, forming a stable triangular structure. The direction of light and shadow comes from the right, with natural light as the main source. The lighting is soft and shadows transition naturally, without strong contrasts. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, fresh, modern, and full of life. The tones are mainly white, gray, and black, with clean and unified colors and rich details, including the wrinkles of the shirt and the sheen of the stockings. The metallic texture of the computer casing and the texture of the blinds present an involuntary beauty in daily life, as if shot with a professional camera on a bright afternoon. It has a slight film texture and natural noise, with clear details and distinct layers, offering strong immersion and artistic expression",
