        {
          "id": "krea2-524b87cd61c6777a0545c8a1",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙床沉思坐回眸",
          "prompt": "A woman sits half-squatting on a bed covered with white sheets, her body slightly turned to the side, her head looking back at the camera. She wears a uniquely designed white off-shoulder dress with puffy puff sleeves, and the waist and back are tied with cross-tied thin ribbons, showcasing exquisite tailoring and sexy lines. The dress is smooth and delicate with a slight reflective texture, highlighting the garment's sophistication. She pairs the lower half with red stockings. In stark contrast to the white top, the color layers are rich and harmonious. Her posture is elegant and full of tension, with one hand resting lightly on her knee and the other naturally hanging down. The overall composition presents a dynamic balance. In the foreground, the main figure occupies the left central position of the frame, highlighting her silhouette and clothing details. The middle is the bed and curtains in the background. The bedsheet texture is clearly visible and the folds are natural, creating a realistic sense of everyday life. The background consists of two layers of hanging curtains: the outer layer is orange-pink and the inner layer is light gray. The color transitions are soft, creating a warm and hazy visual atmosphere. The vertical lines of the curtains guide the gaze upward, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The overall composition adopts a slightly tilted perspective, making the image more dynamic and approachable. It passes through the neck, shoulders, and arms, and finally lands on the legs and stockings, forming a smooth visual path. Light and shadow come from the left side of the image, soft and concentrated, creating a warm golden tone that illuminates the profiles and body curves, casting gradient shadows on the background and bed. It creates a quiet indoor atmosphere at dusk, while the dark areas naturally blend into the background, with distinct layers. The tones are warm orange and off-white, accented with red. The overall atmosphere is cozy, private, and slightly romantic, as if capturing a lazy moment of afternoon sunlight streaming into the room. The image quality is close to the realism of everyday amateur photography. Camera specs are simulated as Canon EOS R5, ISO 400, shutter speed 1/60 sec, aperture f/2.8, focal length 85mm. Handheld shooting features slight shaking that naturally blurs edges and faint noise to enhance realism. The lens shows slight aberration and sharpness reduction, and obvious background blur but retains some texture details. The overall style blends the refined aesthetics of portrait photography with a casual lifestyle vibe, presenting an image expression that is both artistic and close to everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
