        {
          "id": "krea2-27a24e71ad29308160cf6f7a",
          "alias": "单女窗边沉思站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the window inside, wearing a pink pleated short-sleeved top with a bow tied around her neckline. Her fingers are slightly apart, palms facing the light source, forming a silhouette. Sunlight streams in diagonally from outside, passing through the gaps in the blinds, casting clear strips of light and shadow on her body and the background wall. In the beams of light, fine dust particles can be seen, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow and a sense of three-dimensionality. The overall scene presents warm golden tones with soft pink gradients. The left background is a blurred bookshelf topped with books and a green glass bottle. The right wall features a mirror reflecting the character's profile and parts of the environment. The composition uses close-up shots, with the figure occupying the center to the right, head slightly tilted, body slightly tilted back, creating dynamic balance. The foreground features bright lighting and hand movements, the middle ground is the main subject, and the background is a blurred indoor space. The layers are distinct, and the lighting atmosphere is full of film-like texture, similar to vintage camera shots. The tone is warm and nostalgic, with a Japanese artistic style. Natural vignetting at the edges enhances focus Overall, it presents a quiet, private, and slightly detached everyday moment, as if capturing a contemplative afternoon moment of solitude. It is authentic and storyful, possessing strong emotional tension and artistic beauty, like an impromptu snapshot taken with a 35mm film camera under low-light conditions. It preserves original exposure errors and color reproduction, with rich details, delicate texture, immersive atmosphere, and poetic and philosophical depth",
