        {
          "id": "krea2-a979275b0e7a128188be71d5",
          "alias": "单女黑和服沉思站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a traditional black kimono with a delicate silk texture, shimmering softly in the sunlight. Her right hand gently held an unfolded red oil-paper umbrella. Her left hand hung naturally at her side, and a simple white bracelet was worn on her wrist. The overall posture is elegant and reserved, with the body slightly turned to the camera and the head slightly tilted, creating a thoughtful atmosphere. On the left side of the foreground is a huge red oil-paper umbrella, its surface occupying the left half of the frame. Its edge details are clear, ribs are well-structured, and the fabric folds naturally, presenting a three-dimensional effect. The middle is the main figure of the woman, positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame. The background features a traditional Japanese bamboo fence, with neatly arranged bamboo strips and a surface featuring natural textures and mottled light and shadow. Behind her hangs a dark blue cloth curtain, with white wave patterns painted above, as if symbolizing the ocean or flowing clouds. The curtain gently sways in the wind, adding dynamism to the composition. The composition uses a three-part method: the main figure is positioned on the right one-third, while the left side leaves ample space to accommodate the red oil-paper umbrella, creating visual balance. At the same time, it guides the viewer's gaze from the umbrella surface to the figure, then extends to the background, creating a natural visual path. Light comes from the upper left of the painting, with strong and bright sunlight, creating a striking contrast between light and shadow. The back of the kimono and parts of the body are in shadow, with rich layers of light and shadow that emphasize three-dimensionality. The highlights are delicate, and the shadows transition smoothly. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, with a strong Japanese aesthetic style. The color palette is mainly black, red, and white, complemented by bamboo yellow and blue-gray. The color combinations are harmonious, full of Eastern charm, presenting a realistic everyday shooting feel, as if captured with a mid-range camera on a sunny afternoon. The lens has slight noise, precise focusing, and moderate background blur. It creates a shallow depth of field effect, making the subject stand out. The overall image is both artistic and retains a sense of life, like a quiet moment frozen in time, allowing people to feel the beauty of tradition and modernity intertwined",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
