        {
          "id": "krea2-1a8b1f3fd06dc0e3f9c4989a",
          "alias": "单女白T恤街道站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an outdoor staircase, her expression conveying pure joy and a sense of freedom. Her body leans slightly forward, her right leg lifted with her knee bent, toes pointing down, wearing a pair of white platform sneakers with bright orange-red soles. Her left leg supports her body, her posture relaxed and dynamic. Her right hand holds a black phone, her arm hangs naturally, and her left hand extends to the side for balance. She wears a loose white crew-neck T-shirt with clean and warm lines, paired with dark gray high-waisted casual pants. The material looks soft and comfortable, and the overall style is simple and casual yet stylish. The background is an old outdoor staircase with green surfaces showing mottled marks and weathered patterns, showing the accumulation of time. On both sides of the stairs are walls; the left wall is painted a warm orange-yellow with fine peeling and stains. The right side is a light gray cement wall that looks somewhat rough. Above, some architectural structures and metal railings are visible, made of silver stainless steel that reflects faint light. Several green plants are also dotted beside the stairs Leaves hang down from above, adding a touch of vitality. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, forming a visual focal point. The staircase's diagonal line extends from the lower left corner to the upper right, guiding the gaze upward and enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The middle ground contrasts the colors of the stairs and walls, while the background features architectural details and a corner of the sky in the distance. The light and shadows come from natural daylight, with soft and even lighting without strong shadows. The overall atmosphere is bright and warm, with tones mainly orange, yellow, green, white, and gray. It creates a sense of authenticity and warmth in everyday life, as if capturing the moment of an ordinary afternoon girl casually jumping around the street, full of youthful energy and life's interest. The image has a slight film graininess and vintage tones, simulating amateur camera shooting. The details are rich but not overly sharp, presenting a realistic texture reminiscent of home videos or street photos. The composition is natural and unforced, emphasizing emotional expression rather than perfect styling. The entire scene feels like a video clip capturing the beautiful moments of everyday life. It allows people to feel the joy and freedom of a simple life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
