        {
          "id": "krea2-73383f5125300c6e77e711da",
          "alias": "单女城市忧伤坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the trunk lid of a silver-gray Nissan Silvia S14 sports car. Her posture is lazy and calm, her body slightly leaning forward, legs crossed and pressed together with her right leg pressed over her left, presenting a casual yet somewhat detached urban youth vibe. Her expression is calm yet tinged with a hint of fatigue and contemplation, as if savoring something alone in the night. The background is a city street corner at dusk or dawn, the sky is grayish-purple, the light soft and dim. In the distance is a mottled white brick wall, with obvious signs of weathering and peeling paint. Behind the wall is a metal chain fence, inside which you can vaguely see miscellaneous items and abandoned vehicles. On the right is a dark green vintage streetlight pole, its surface marked by rust and wear from the years. The ground is rough asphalt, scattered with some fallen leaves and debris. The overall tone of the scene is cold. With a slight film graininess and a low-saturation retro filter effect, it creates a nostalgic, lonely, and slightly poetic atmosphere. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, and the car occupying most of the left side of the image, creating visual balance. The taillights are lit, and the red halo stands out in a dark environment. The license plate is clearly visible, with the words \"MUMEI\" and \"IT'S OKAY\" written on it, adding personal and storytelling details. Light and shadow come from faint ambient light sources and reflections from car headlights, creating soft shadow transitions that highlight the main contour. The background blur treatment focuses the focus on the people and the car. It is full of youthful confusion and a sense of freedom. The colors are mainly gray, brown, purple, and black, accented by red car lights to create contrast and enhance visual impact, resulting in a delicate image texture. The details are rich, combining the rough realism of everyday life with the refined beauty of artistic photography, presenting a unique atmosphere that lies between reality and dreams, evoking classic scenes from independent films, full of narrative tension and emotional resonance",
