        {
          "id": "krea2-3346bc6b43b95fc9e903eb19",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫窗边微笑坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a white short-sleeved shirt and a plaid pleated skirt sits by a Japanese-style indoor window. She wears a white beret, a gentle smile, her expression calm and slightly hopeful, holding an open book in both hands, seemingly immersed in reading. Her legs are crossed, wearing white over-the-knee socks with slightly exposed ankles, her posture elegant and natural. On the left windowsill sits a green bottle of beverage with a yellow cap, and nearby is a magazine with a strawberry cake design printed on the cover. On the ground to the right is a transparent bowl filled with yellow food, with a small wooden bookshelf in the background. On top are several books, a photo frame, a vintage-style mini alarm clock, two green glass bottled drinks, and a small electronic keyboard. Below the bookshelf are some miscellaneous items and a gray plush toy, filling the space with a lively atmosphere. The windows are framed in dark brown wood, clearly visible, and soft natural light streams in from the upper left. Delicate transitions of light and shadow are created on the floor and figures. The floor is covered with beige tatami mats with blue striped edges, and the curtains are thin white gauze curtains that gently flutter in the breeze, creating a tranquil and warm atmosphere. The composition centers on the figures, with a slightly tilted perspective enhancing realism. The foreground features the figures and some ground objects, the middle is a windowsill and bookshelves, the background is a blurry courtyard outside the window, and returning to the book in hand creates a cyclical visual path. Light and shadow are soft and layered. Sunlight casts gentle shadows on walls and objects, with warm yellow and off-white tones dominated by green and gray, presenting an overall warm, healing, and artistic Japanese daily scene, as if captured with a regular camera—rich in detail, natural texture, and full of vibrant life and youthful beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
