        {
          "id": "krea2-8f07352caafa24bcf2b44c6d",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫车内沉思坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the back seat of a yellow van, wearing a black turtleneck knit top and loose black pants. She crosses her legs and curls up on the seat, barefoot on the backrest of the seat in front. Her posture is lazy and relaxed, with a hint of contemplation and detachment. The overall atmosphere is quiet and reserved. The main subject is the woman, positioned slightly in the center on the left side of the frame, occupying the main visual space. In the foreground is a dark gray fabric seat with a plaid texture, with a subtle woven texture on the seat surface, and the seatbelt buckle clearly visible. The red plastic parts create a subtle contrast in the dark tones. The middle ground shows the contours and posture of the woman's body, her body slightly turned to the side, arms naturally resting on her knees. The folds of her clothing create soft light and shadow changes with movement. The background is the car window glass, covered with fine water droplets or rain marks, creating a hazy frosty effect. Outside the window, the blurred green vegetation and faint architectural outlines create a soft bokeh under the sunlight. The yellow body frame frames the windows, creating a striking color contrast with the cool-toned blue-gray seats inside. The composition uses a slightly tilted perspective to create a sense of realism and dynamic balance. The figure occupies the left half of the frame, leaving space on the right side to show the door, the other seat, and the view outside the window. This creates a visual guide line extending from the upper right corner to the lower left corner. Light comes from the right window, representing a low-angle slanted sunset or early morning sunlight. The golden warm light penetrates the raindrop-mottled glass, creating a contrasting light and shadow inside the car. The shadowed areas display a deep blue-green tone, creating a strong contrast between warm and cool tones with the warm yellow in the bright areas. The overall lighting atmosphere is filled with the grainy texture and vintage tones characteristic of film photography. The color saturation is relatively low, but the details are rich, with slightly faded edges, as if captured with an old-fashioned film camera. The frame is surrounded by black borders, simulating the visual effect of traditional film photography, evoking strong nostalgia and a sense of everyday life. The entire scene resembles a frozen daily moment, capturing moments of tranquility and loneliness during travel. The images present a style that strikes between artistic photography and amateur documentary. It features both delicate portrait portrayals and deep environmental narrative, conveying a quiet, introspective, and poetic emotional tone",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
