        {
          "id": "krea2-bba1750aca6e5691fa6533cf",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙广场困倦侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman is presented in a low-angle low-angle upward view, slightly tilting her head and applying warm orange-red lipstick, adding a touch of laziness and casualness. She wears a colorful floral dress with a blue base accented with pink, red, and white flowers. The sleeves feature a pink patchwork design, and the neckline is a teal square collar with pleated details. The overall style is both retro and full of summer vibes. Her right hand holds a transparent glass cup filled with golden liquid, possibly lemon tea or juice. The cup wall reflects bright spots of light, forming a dazzling light source. Light passes through the rear of the cup, creating a strong backlight effect. At the same time, a clear green blind stripe shadow is cast in the background. The background is a blurred teal-green wall, and the vertical lines of the blinds alternate in a regular pattern of light and shadow under the light, creating a tranquil and rhythmic visual layer. In the background is a close-up of a transparent glass cup, whose edges produce soft halos and slight distortions due to light refraction, enhancing the image's sense of depth and perspective The middle shot is the main subject, occupying most of the composition's space. The posture is relaxed and natural, as if enjoying a leisurely afternoon. The background is blurred to highlight the visual focal point between the figure and the foreground object. Using a glass cup as a foreground cover creates a playful \"through\" perspective, forming a unique visual path. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is mainly warm yellow, with the strong light source from the liquid in the cup creating dramatic highlights and shadow contrasts. This fills the image with vitality and warmth. The cool green tones in the background contrast sharply with the warm yellow in the foreground, enhancing color tension. The overall atmosphere is both cozy and slightly dreamy, as if capturing a poetic moment. It features a strong Japanese film photography style, with delicate texture and slight graininess and color shifts, simulating real camera shooting effects. The tone is slightly overexposed, highlighting light and transparency, presenting an image language that is lifelike, everyday, and full of artistic beauty. Like a beautiful memory casually captured on a sunny afternoon with an old-fashioned film camera, rich in detail and full of emotion, it lets you feel the intertwining of youth, freedom, and comfort",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
