        {
          "id": "krea2-ba056a70f5f50879cab4defa",
          "alias": "单女棕外套公园微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by a tree in the park, wearing black round glasses and a gentle smile. Her fingers are naturally curved, her nails neatly trimmed, and she wears a deep brown coat with black underneath. The coat is soft and thick, with a slightly open neckline revealing her neckline. She leans against a rough tree trunk, with the bark grain clearly visible. The tree trunks show varying shades of brown and gray, with natural cracks and bumps on the trunk surface. The background is a blurry autumn park scene, with leaves showing a gradient of gold, orange, and brown. In the distance, several figures walk but their outlines are blurred, creating a blurred background. The ground is covered with fallen leaves, mainly brownish-yellow, with interlaced light and shadow. The entire shot uses a shallow depth of field, with the background completely blurred, creating a beautiful bokeh effect. In composition, the figure is positioned on the right side, leaving plenty of space on the left. This creates an asymmetrical balance, drawing the viewer's gaze. The lighting is soft and warm, with a warm tone dominated by orange, yellow, and brown. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and cozy, as if capturing the most beautiful moment of an autumn afternoon. The image presents the realism of everyday amateur equipment. The camera ISO is set to 400, shutter speed is 1/125 sec, aperture f/2.8, and it uses a standard prime lens. The slight vignetting and slight noise enhance the quality and realism of the photos. The overall image quality is slightly grainy but retains rich details and layers. The color saturation is moderate, contrast is soft, and there is no excessive sharpening, giving a warm and natural feeling. It's like casually capturing everyday moments outdoors with an entry-level mirrorless camera, full of life atmosphere and cultural warmth",
