        {
          "id": "krea2-78b9d28bdf201bbed2b66e75",
          "alias": "单女白T恤门忧伤倚靠躲藏",
          "prompt": "She wears a loose white T-shirt with natural wrinkles, smooth shoulder lines, and slightly rolled-up cuffs, presenting a casual and relaxed posture. Her head is slightly turned to one side, peeking out from gaps in the door frame or wall, with most of her body covered. The composition cleverly uses spatial occlusion. It creates an atmosphere of peeping and privacy. It is placed in the lower right corner of the frame, slightly tilted, adding a sense of dynamism. The middle ground is the female subject, positioned slightly to the left of the center, with part of her body partially hidden by the dark wall or door frame on the right, creating a semi-hidden, semi-visible effect. This composition not only enhances the sense of layering in the painting but also gives the figures a sense of mystery and restraint. The background is a simple white tiled wall, neatly arranged with fine gaps, smooth surfaces with slight texture, reflecting soft light. The overall tone leans toward coolness, mainly gray-white and deep green, creating a calm and restrained atmosphere. Light streams in from the left or upper windows or openings, forming a bright band of light and shadow with natural transitions and strong contrasts. It emphasizes the three-dimensionality and emotional expression of the characters. The overall shot uses a low angle, with a slightly upward perspective to enhance the visual presence of the characters. The entire scene presents a fleeting beauty captured in everyday life, as if it were a real image taken with amateur equipment, with slight noise and film texture, and low color saturation. It retains the original graininess and realism, with delicate light and shadow treatment emphasizing the tranquility and loneliness of a cool atmosphere. The overall composition is full of artistic flair yet retains a sense of life, conveying a quiet, introspective, and slightly melancholic emotional state",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
