        {
          "id": "krea2-f24f29e166e8a4a2bd36518b",
          "alias": "单女白制服卧室害羞坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the bedroom carpet, wearing an off-white sailor uniform top with a dark brown bow at the collar and dark blue striped cuffs. She pairs a dark blue short skirt and black stockings below, sitting cross-legged in an elegant and natural posture. Her left hand gently rests on her knee, while her right hand is raised near her head in a gentle waving gesture. The overall look exudes a youthful Japanese campus vibe. In the foreground is a retro carpet covered with patterns, with delicate floral and geometric designs along the edges, and colors in off-white, Light brown and pale pink are the main colors, with a delicate texture. The center is a female figure, sitting at the edge of the bed, her body slightly leaning forward and her head slightly tilted, presenting a friendly yet slightly shy posture. In the background is a large bed with white bedding, with pure white sheets and pillows featuring soft pleats and tassel details. Behind the headboard is a semi-transparent white curtain that lets in soft natural light, creating a bright and cozy indoor atmosphere. On the left side of the bed is a white ceramic desk lamp, with a conical lampshade, simple and elegant. Several books are stacked beneath the lamp, with words like \"GLOWIENKA\" and \"KINFOLK\" on the spines, adding a sense of life and artistry. The entire scene is illuminated by natural light from outside the window, soft and even, with no obvious shadows, presenting a warm diffused light effect in the morning or afternoon. The tones are mainly white, beige, light blue, and black, creating a fresh and tranquil visual contrast. The composition uses a center-left position of the figure, using slanted carpet lines and postures to guide the view. The carpet texture in the foreground extends to the figures in the middle of the background, then transitions to the bed and curtains in the background, creating a natural sense of spatial layering that highlights the main subject. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is bright and soft, full of the warmth and comfort of everyday life. The overall image has a high-resolution photographic quality, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains the authenticity of the home environment. The details are rich and colors harmonious, presenting a quiet yet story-rich everyday moment, suitable for expressing themes such as youth, campus, and the aesthetics of life. There are no unnecessary elements in the frame, focusing on the harmonious relationship between the figure and the environment, creating a quiet, warm, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere, like a carefully arranged home portrait capturing a moment of beauty in ordinary life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
