        {
          "id": "krea2-62aa2ea7b5139d648ccf9f6f",
          "alias": "单女白T恤室内俏皮坐持包",
          "prompt": "A woman sits indoors, her expression naturally playful and focused. Her left hand gently holds a bag of green Karsien chips, clearly displaying \"Net content: 120g\" and nutrition facts. She wears a loose white T-shirt with a cartoon pattern outlined in black lines and the words \"HURRY, POPEYE\" on the chest. She wears a dark green skirt with white vertical stripes, the fabric of the skirt with a slight sheen. The overall design is casual and youthful. The figure is positioned slightly to the center on the left side of the frame, with a slightly turned body and a slight tilt of the head, forming a soft diagonal composition. The background is a blurred indoor environment, presenting warm yellow-brown tones. The outline of dark wooden furniture and metal railings can be faintly seen, creating a vintage and cozy home atmosphere. Light comes from the front left, creating a natural shadow transition that gives the figure a strong sense of depth and texture. The overall light and shadow layers are rich, with a warm tone. The retro filter, with a slight film graininess and slightly reduced color saturation, resembles everyday moments taken with an old camera. The foreground is clear, the background is noticeably blurred, and the shallow depth of field enhances the subject, extending to the details of the chip packaging in her hand. The composition is simple yet storytelling, presenting an overall style that is lifelike, authentic, and slightly artistic—like a private photo capturing ordinary daily life yet full of warmth, full of nostalgia and delicate emotional expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
