        {
          "id": "krea2-4b3406a5a5e5034c4b78e631",
          "alias": "单女女仆黑女仆装理发店害羞坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a classic black-and-white maid outfit sits on an orange leather swivel chair in a vintage barbershop. She wears a white apron with a black collar and cuffs, the edges of the apron decorated with delicate ruffled pleats, paired with white knee-high socks and black platform Mary Jane shoes. She wears a white maid headpiece, fine-framed glasses, hands folded on her knees, her posture dignified yet slightly shy. The background is a typical Japanese barbershop interior, with off-white walls and round mirrors framed by wooden frames. Her silhouette and part of the interior are reflected in the mirror. Above the mirror hangs a decorative sign reading \"The Barber Shop,\" alongside two white bottled personal care products. The floor is paved with black-and-white hexagonal tiles. The overall spatial layout is compact and cozy, with a central composition. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of center of the frame, with a chair and figure forming a stable visual focal point. The foreground shows details of the lower body and feet, the middle ground shows the person's entire body and seat, and the background includes the mirror, The wall decorations and some shelves provide soft and even lighting, blending indoor ceiling lights and natural light outside the windows to create a warm and bright atmosphere. The colors are mainly black and white, accented with orange seats and green curtains. The overall tone is harmonious and unified, with a slight film texture and graininess, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera, presenting a nostalgic yet everyday life atmosphere. The images have a strong sense of narrative and immersive scenes, as if freezing a quiet afternoon in a barbershop, with calm and focused expressions. The entire scene is filled with youthful innocence and elegance, while also revealing a touch of formality brought by professional attire. The composition is balanced and layered, gradually extending to body lines and environmental details, forming a complete visual closed loop. The overall atmosphere is quiet and warm, as if you can hear soft music and the occasional sound of scissors, giving a feeling that is both real and dreamy",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
