        {
          "id": "krea2-12cad938f99186f8c7b98fa1",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤酒店俏皮坐躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a blue fabric armchair in a hotel room, slightly turned toward the camera, her left hand naturally resting on her knee, legs crossed and curled up on the chair, barefoot naturally hanging down, toes slightly bent, presenting a relaxed and playful posture. Her expression is lazy yet a bit cute, wearing a loose light blue T-shirt with sleeves casually rolled up to reveal slender arms, light-colored jeans with slightly rolled-up legs. The overall look is casual and effortless, with most of her body in the foreground. Occupying the left and center of the painting, the center features a blue fabric armchair with diamond-patterned patterns where she sits. The backrest and cushion are clearly visible. On the right side near the foreground is a round glass coffee table with a black metal frame. The glass surface shows slight reflection and stains. The background is a beige wall with fine vertical stripes, hanging on a minimalist black-and-white framed painting. In the upper left corner of the painting, a small portion of wooden furniture edges peeks out. The composition adopts a slightly overhead perspective, with the figure positioned to the right, creating an asymmetrical visual balance. Using diagonal lines formed by chairs, figures, and coffee tables to guide the gaze toward the center, light comes from the front left of the frame, with soft natural light evenly illuminating the figures, creating a warm and bright atmosphere. Shadows are delicate and transitions naturally. The overall color scheme is mainly blue, gray, and beige, with harmonious unity and rich layering of light and shadow. The image texture is delicate, as if shot indoors with a high-megapixel camera, carrying the atmosphere of daily life and privacy, with rich image details. From the texture of the striped carpet floors to the reflections on the glass tabletops, everything is clearly visible. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and comfortable, full of youthful energy and a sense of everyday life—like a real-life photo casually taken with professional equipment in a hotel room, capturing the most natural and relaxed moments of the person",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
