        {
          "id": "krea2-dced87bc87bf253f5fbe8dd6",
          "alias": "单女蓝和服花园愤怒站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under an outdoor pavilion, her look faintly radiating a healthy glow. She wears a loose deep blue kimono-style jacket made of denim-like material, with light gray patchwork designs on the cuffs and neckline. Underneath, she wears a short-sleeved shirt with a white base and blue floral patterns, the hem slightly exposed. The overall look is casual yet retains Japanese style. In her right hand, she carries a pink woven handbag. The body is rectangular, with metal fasteners and thin shoulder straps, giving the bag a delicate texture and rich layers. The left hand gently rests on the side of the body, posture natural and relaxed. The body is slightly turned to the camera, head slightly tilted, presenting a casual yet elegant posture. The background is dense green plants, with huge leaves spreading like palms, colors graded from tender green to deep green. The leaf edges are clearly visible, some leaves appear semi-transparent under the light, and in the distance, the blurred outlines of bamboo groves or trees can be faintly seen, creating a deep sense of space. Above is the pavilion's black wooden structure, with simple and powerful beams and columns. A geometric framework is formed, contrasting with the natural environment. The lower left of the painting features several stone steps, rough and bearing traces of time. Scattered nearby are dead leaves and rubble, and the ground is slightly mottled. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned at the very center of the painting with a clear visual focal point. The foreground features broad green leaves nearby, the middle ground the main subject, and the background layers of vegetation and pavilion structures, creating rich spatial layers. The light is soft and even, and diffuse light from above and on the sides makes the entire scene bright but not glaring. Shadows are slight, light transitions are natural, and the tone is mainly blue-green, with a harmonious contrast of warm and cool tones. The pink handbag becomes a visual highlight in the image, with just the right color accents. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and fresh, full of the poetry and artistic atmosphere of a summer afternoon garden. It feels like a professional camera film photo, with slight graininess and vintage tones. The lens focal length is moderate, depth of field is well controlled, background blur is soft, details are rich, and the image texture is delicate, presenting a beautiful moment casually captured in daily life. Like an improvisational photo taken by a photographer in natural light, it is authentic and full of storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
          "_classification": {
            "binding": "487774573edc623fe910f4156dc1d7f7c9df9d02ba13c44b1abc670d2895b078",
