        {
          "id": "krea2-80d81f1c0fdea1c004dc756f",
          "alias": "单女红外套车厢冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "Inside a moving Japanese subway carriage, a woman stands in the center of the foreground, her expression calm yet tinged with a hint of detachment, as if lost in her own thoughts. This echoes the bright red wool coat she wears. Her scarf is a thick red and blue plaid pattern, naturally draped over her chest and shoulders, adding a touch of winter warmth and a sense of life. She holds a bottle of drink in both hands, the bottle transparent with a pale yellow liquid, and the label bears blurred Japanese text, her hand movements relaxed naturally. It looks like she has just gotten up from her seat or is about to get off, with her backpack strap draped across her shoulder. The black body is visible, hinting at everyday commuting scenes. The interior of the carriage is authentic and simple, with a uniquely shaped white circular handrail hanging from the top. Next to it is an orange pull-tab handrail with a metallic texture that reflects slightly in the dim yellow light. The seats inside the carriage are made of blue fabric with wear on the edges, showing signs of daily public transportation. In the background, you can see other passengers sitting in their seats. Their poses vary, but all are blurred, creating a shallow depth of field effect that makes the main figure stand out. The windows reflect the blurry street scene and light outside, and Japanese advertising posters are posted on the glass with words like \"decorative characterまいdecorative characterし\" (to explore your home). The font is clear and legible, with rich details. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figures centered, guiding the gaze directly to the viewer. The cabin's depth structure forms perspective lines, with light coming from the right window. It is the slanting sunlight at dusk, presenting warm golden tones, soft shadows, and distinct layers. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of storytelling, like a real life moment captured with a film camera, with slight graininess and color shifts, simulating the texture of vintage photography equipment. The tones are mainly warm yellow and orange-red, complemented by blue seats and the white carriage structure to create a warm and cool contrast, enhancing visual tension. On the left edge of the frame is a vertical date watermark \"20 1 19\" in orange-yellow color, giving it a retro style. This further enhances the sense of realism, with the entire image filled with the warmth and poetry of everyday life, capturing both the hurried pace of the city and moments of inner tranquility, presenting a hazy beauty that lies between reality and memory.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
