        {
          "id": "krea2-86dbd0d8799ac6d0cdb12eda",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫室内自信坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the indoor floor, leaning slightly back against the beige wall. Her makeup is exquisite but not exaggerated, presenting a fresh and natural beauty. She wears a loose blue and white striped shirt, the collar slightly open, sleeves casually rolled up to the elbows, revealing slender wrists. The shirt's hem cascades over her thighs, paired with black shorts. She sits cross-legged, left leg in front, right leg behind, and a thin black bracelet around her ankle Her hands are folded on her knees, her posture elegant and relaxed. Her legs are long and well-proportioned, presenting a healthy and authentic texture. Beneath her feet is a carpet with a brown base and white geometric patterns, composed of repeated diamonds and checks, with simple border decorations along the edges. The floor is a light-colored wooden floor with clearly visible textures, and the background is a simple beige wall without unnecessary decoration. Light softly streams in from the left side of the painting, creating a natural transition of light and shadow, while the right side is in slight shadow. It creates a sense of depth and layering, with the overall lighting and shadow effect warm and soft, mainly warm yellow and beige tones, creating a peaceful, comfortable, and slightly intimate atmosphere. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, occupying the main visual space. The foreground shows the character's body and carpet, the middle ground is her upper body and some legs, and the background is simple walls and floors. The spatial layers are distinct, and the overall image presents a sense of tranquility in everyday life. It feels like a casual moment taken at home, capturing a genuine sense of life and artistic beauty. The style is similar to professional portrait photography, using a large-aperture lens with moderate background blur to highlight the subject while preserving environmental details. Color saturation is moderate, contrast is soft, and the overall atmosphere is warm and emotional. The image texture is delicate and detailed, giving a sense of warmth and authenticity, as if you can sense the tranquility and tranquility of that moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
