        {
          "id": "krea2-b0146e21593e2a1a3a4d0d6f",
          "alias": "单女蓝制服沙发俏皮坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a rattan armchair, wearing a short blue school uniform-style blazer and pleated skirt, paired with white long socks underneath. White headphone cables extend, immersed in the world of music, her expression relaxed and joyful. The background is a warm indoor environment, the walls are covered with brown and beige checkered wallpaper, and a blue-green globe hangs on the wall. Next to it is a dark leather briefcase and a white vintage alarm clock. On the wooden bookshelf below are several books and a woven basket. The curtains are beige with blue floral patterns. Sunlight streams through the window, creating a warm golden beam that illuminates the entire room. The light gently outlines the figures with light and shadow, creating a peaceful, nostalgic, and lively atmosphere. The composition centers on the figure, using medium shots to highlight their postures and expressions, while the foreground features a checkered blanket covering the chair In the middle frame, the figure and the rattan chair she sits on, with bookshelves, globes, curtains, and other arrangements in the background. The light and shadow present warm tones of early morning or evening. The overall image has a film-like texture, moderate color saturation, rich details, and distinct layering, with a slight graininess and natural depth effect, as if shot with a professional camera, filled with youth, memories, and peaceful moments",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
