        {
          "id": "krea2-04b6bb0e5ede621dc96091fb",
          "alias": "单女米连衣裙窗边侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sat by the window, her head slightly tilted. Her right hand gently held a golden croissant, her fingers long, nails painted with light purple polish. She wore a beige pleated dress with fine pleats at the neckline, wide sleeves, and a light and flowing material. Around her neck is a string of pearl necklaces and a slender gold chain. The necklace hangs over her chest, harmonizing with the color of her clothes. The background is a blurred view outside the window, and through the wooden frame, you can see green trees and mottled light and shadow. Leaves gently sway in the breeze, creating a soft bokeh effect. Light streams in diagonally from outside, creating a warm side glow that creates a peaceful and cozy atmosphere. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned on the right side of the frame, head slightly tilted, gazing upward, leaving ample space on the left, highlighting the subject's dynamic sense and emotional expression, with background blur treatment to emphasize foreground details. Light and shadow are soft, with warm tones, mainly beige, brown, and light green. The color combinations are naturally harmonious, giving a film-like texture. The image has a slight graininess and retro filter effect, as if captured with an old-fashioned camera, capturing the small joys of life. The overall atmosphere is quiet, healing, and full of life's atmosphere, like a private photo capturing ordinary beautiful moments, without any signs of deliberate posing. Yet it is filled with genuine emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
