        {
          "id": "krea2-b1b2520622f9681c00e0b1fe",
          "alias": "单女绿外套街道站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a city street at night, exuding a youthful yet slightly lazy beauty. She wears a heavy, high-quality olive green leather jacket with natural pleats and glossy reflections. The collar is slightly open, revealing a colorful floral shirt underneath. The shirt is dark blue, covered with red, yellow, white, and green floral and leaf patterns, paired with blue jeans. The overall look is vintage and fashionable, with a yellow square film camera slung over her left shoulder. The camera has a black lens and metal parts. Her right hand rests gently on the wooden railing beside her, her posture relaxed and natural. The background is a blurry city nightscape, and you can see a white taxi parked by the roadside. On the body is a red advertising sticker reading \"590\". In the distance, the silhouette of a double-decker bus shines with warm yellow light from the headlights and windows. Above the street hangs decorative golden light strings, creating a soft halo. The entire shot uses a shallow depth of field technique, with a clear foreground and a blurred background. The composition uses a center-right main subject, with the person occupying the main position, and the gaze slightly shifting to the left side of the lens, creating a natural visual guide. Light comes from surrounding streetlights and architectural neon, presenting a warm yellow-orange hue, creating a unique cozy atmosphere of the city at night. The layers of light and shadow are rich, the leather jacket surface has delicate highlights, the folds of clothing create natural shadows, and the camera case reflects ambient light. The lighting in the background creates a bokeh effect. The overall image has a strong film texture, with moderate color saturation, low contrast, slight graininess, and warm tone shifts, as if shot with an old-fashioned film camera. The lens focal length is about 35mm, with a slightly low angle of view that creates a close-up feel. There are slight vignetting effects at the edges of the frame, enhancing the retro atmosphere. The overall style blends the realism of everyday street photography with the aesthetic of artistic photography, capturing a moment full of life yet still elegant. It was as if recording a gentle moment on an ordinary night",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
