        {
          "id": "krea2-6d2264defd107b796510313e",
          "alias": "单女黑西装樱花微笑坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a white three-wheeled electric bike, wearing a black helmet and a gentle smile at the camera. She wears a loose black blazer paired with a light floral lace mini skirt, black knee-high boots, hands naturally folded over her knees, and a white mask in her hands. Her overall posture is relaxed and elegant. The main focus is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, with the tricycle occupying most of the middle frame. The body is a white and black combination, with a black metal basket at the front, and black armrests and backrests in the rear seats. The wheels feature a silver multi-spoke design, with smooth, modern body lines. The background is a tranquil lake and distant, rolling hills. The sky is clear blue and cloudless, and the sun is shining. On the upper left, cherry blossom branches extend into the frame, with pink-white flowers standing out against the blue sky. On the right is a sturdy tree trunk with clearly visible bark grain. The overall composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered slightly to the left. The electric bike extends horizontally to form a stable frame, then returns to the front vehicle, creating a circular flow of sight. Light and shadow come from the right above, with strong yet soft sunlight. Figures and vehicles cast clear shadows, the water reflects the sky with a blue sheen, and the cherry blossoms reveal mottled light and shadow among the branches and leaves. The colors are mainly blue, white, pink, and black, with sharp contrasts of warm and cool tones, creating a fresh and bright spring afternoon atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and authentic, as if shot with a high-megapixel camera. The details are rich and layered, evoking a sense of documentary life and artistic beauty, presenting an overall relaxed and vibrant outdoor leisure scene. It carries a subtle artistic vibe and youthful energy",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
