        {
          "id": "krea2-9c5a04f8fa6bc3ae578738e9",
          "alias": "单女粉毛衣室内忧伤坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a corner of the room, her expression slightly melancholic and contemplative. Her overall demeanor is quiet and reserved. She wears a loose pink knit sweater with clearly visible textures. The thick knit texture appears warm and soft under the light. The sleeves slide down slightly, revealing an arm. She wears gray knit shorts or a skirt, creating a soft color contrast with the top. As if lost in thought while alone, the foreground is a close-up of her body, occupying most of the space. The composition uses a medium-close perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame, head slightly tilted. The background is a simple indoor environment. The walls are light beige, with a deep blue vertical strip or curtain edge on the right side, adding a touch of cool contrast. Light softly pours in from the left, creating a warm side lighting effect. The shadowed areas transition naturally, creating a sense of depth and rich layering of light and shadow. The warm yellow lighting gives the entire frame a cozy and nostalgic atmosphere, reminiscent of vintage film cameras. It has a slight graininess and fading effect, with a warm tone and moderate saturation. Overall, it presents a real moment captured in daily life, like a private life photo taken with amateur equipment, full of story and emotional tension. The composition is compact, the focus clear, the background blur well-handled, highlighting the subject's emotional expression, making one want to explore her inner world. The overall atmosphere of the painting is tranquil and slightly lonely, yet gentle and authentic, like an old photo forgotten in a drawer, carrying an ordinary yet profound moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
