        {
          "id": "krea2-5737f99288d34a799002281f",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫酒廊忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a white folding lounge chair, wearing a loose white short-sleeved shirt with a white T-shirt underneath. She wears bright red shorts, white high-top sports socks printed with \"New Balance,\" and a pair of classic white vintage sneakers. The shoes are decorated with black and blue details, her left hand resting gently on her knee, her posture relaxed and slightly contemplative. Her expression is gentle yet tinged with a hint of melancholy and contemplation. Her overall aura is fresh and natural, with a close-up of her lower body and feet in the foreground. The details of the sneakers and socks are clearly shown. In the center, the outline of her sitting posture and the structure of the white lounge chair are resting on the backrest of the lounge chair. A colorful striped towel rests on the backrest, with vertical stripes in orange, red, purple, green, and yellow on the towel, giving it a soft and fluffy texture. The background is a warm and gentle indoor environment. The walls are light beige or pale pink, with decorative paintings bordered by gold frames hanging on the walls. The floor is paved with vintage patterned tiles, mainly in purple, brown, and beige, presenting a classical style where geometry and flowers intertwine, a pink balloon appears in the lower right corner of the image, adding a touch of childlike fun and a sense of everyday life. The composition uses a mid-field perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, creating a sense of visual balance. Lines guide the viewer from the figure to the decorative elements in the background. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft and warm, with light coming from the left side of the painting simulating natural or indoor lighting to create delicate shadow transitions. The overall color palette is mainly warm tones, with bright colors like white, red, pink, and orange harmonizing with the soft background tones. It creates a warm, comfortable, and slightly nostalgic everyday atmosphere, like a fashionable portrait shot with a professional camera, while retaining a sense of everyday authenticity. It has strong artistic appeal and emotional expression, with delicate texture, rich details, and clear layering, presenting a tranquil yet story-rich moment, like a beautiful moment captured by a movie lens, full of youthful energy and personal charm",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
