        {
          "id": "krea2-ebc933ac4582ea1b2d45de81",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫城市忧伤站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a white shirt and a dark blue suit stands in a modern, minimalist indoor setting. She casually drapes her blazer over her shoulders, revealing the sleeves of the white shirt she wears underneath, slightly rolled up, appearing both formal and casual, adding a touch of softness and laziness. She stands barefoot on the light wooden floor, one foot gently lifted, toes touching the ground, her posture elegant and relaxed. Her left hand gently strokes her neck, while her right hand carries a translucent plastic bag, inside which a green-packaged beverage can be faintly seen. The overall look presents the daily state of an urban white-collar worker after work. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the composition, with the figure slightly tilted to the camera and head slightly turned toward the viewer, carrying a thoughtful expression. The foreground shows a clear full-body image with rich details, from the folds of the shirt to the texture of the black stockings. The middle is a light gray cement-textured wall behind the figure, featuring an irregular circular hollowed-out design with a faint warm yellow glow inside. Injecting a touch of warmth into the cool space, the right side features an arched doorway leading deeper into a blurred space. The background is layered, combining the geometric beauty of architectural structure with the depth brought by light and shadow changes. The composition uses a vertical frame, with figures occupying most of the space. However, by leaving blank space and guiding background elements, it avoids crowding. The visual guide naturally extends from the figure's posture to the leg-raising movements and gaze direction on the ground, forming a smooth S-shaped curve. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft and layered. The main light source comes from the left side of the image, simulating natural window or indoor lighting. The light evenly spreads over the subject, creating subtle shadow transitions. The delicate contrast between light and shadow enhances the sense of depth. The warm light from the circular hollowed-out background contrasts with the overall cool tones, creating a quiet and slightly lonely urban afternoon atmosphere. The entire image presents a sense of casual moments captured from daily life, as if taken with a regular camera, with slight film graininess and a slightly lower color saturation texture, without excessive embellishment, retaining authentic light and detail. The overall color palette is mainly gray-blue, white, and wood, accented with green and orange on plastic bags and drink cans, giving the painting a sense of life in a calm atmosphere. The composition is balanced and storytelling, as if telling a brief break after work—quiet, authentic, and full of emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
