        {
          "id": "krea2-904300fab99030d67c78f684",
          "alias": "烟火困倦持相机",
          "prompt": "One sparks brightly at the lower right of the image, while the other is held high in the upper left, sparks flying, forming a dynamic light trail that naturally floats. The overall composition centers on the figure, occupying the main position. The background is a pure deep blue night sky, showing a gradient tone from top to bottom, with no clouds in the sky. It creates a sense of tranquil and open space. The middle scene showcases the posture of the body and the details of clothing folds, while the background completely blurs into a tranquil blues-toned space. Visually, the spark in the lower right extends to the upper left, forming a diagonal composition that enhances the dynamic and tension of the image. The light mainly comes from the warm yellow glow of the fireworks themselves, creating a contrast of cool and warm. The cool blue ambient light intertwines with the warm yellow fireworks, creating a dreamy and romantic atmosphere. The layers of light and shadow are rich, shadows are delicate, and smoke and sparks drift in the air. A subtle halo effect is formed, adding a hazy beauty to the image. The overall color scheme is mainly deep blue, complemented by orange-yellow and purple transitions, creating a harmonious and unified color. The image has a strong visual impact and emotional expression, as if capturing a poetic moment, full of youthful spirit and romantic fantasy. It resembles a real outdoor scene shot at night with a regular camera, with slight graininess and natural noise, presenting a lifelike artistic aesthetic. The characters' expressions are naturally relaxed, revealing pure joy and satisfaction. The entire scene is cinematic yet retains a sense of everyday realism, as if capturing an extraordinary moment on an ordinary night",
