        {
          "id": "krea2-a5df98d8862696609244215e",
          "alias": "单女忧伤站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands before a traditional Korean building, wearing a deep green velvet cloak with a heavy and lustrous texture, edged with delicate subtle embroidery patterns, presenting an elegant Eastern charm. Her makeup is exquisite, carrying a hint of gentleness and calm. She slightly turns to glance back, her expression revealing a faint melancholy and contemplation. The background is a typical Korean traditional building, with layers of blue-gray tiled roofs and slightly upturned eaves. The wooden structure is simple yet dignified, with columns and beams clearly visible, and the building's silhouette is sharply defined against the backlight. Interwoven light and shadow create a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The foreground is the main subject, occupying the center-right position of the composition. The composition uses the rule of thirds, with the figure positioned near the golden ratio point, forming a visual focal point. The background is blurred to make the subject stand out. Light shines diagonally from the right, creating a soft side light and dark light and shadow transition. The shadowed areas naturally blend into the environment, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and dark green, with a sharp contrast of warm and cool tones, creating a beauty that blends classical and modern elements. The scene is full of poetry and storytelling, as if frozen in a quiet afternoon. In the distance, sparse tree branches, fallen leaves cover the ground, and the ground is a stone pavement with clear texture. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and distant, like a carefully composed film photograph, rich in artistic and cinematic feel, capturing fleeting emotional expression. The composition is balanced and harmonious, with clear layers, exquisite use of light and shadow, moderate color saturation, rich details, elegant and natural postures, and cloaks gently fluttering in the wind, adding a sense of movement. The entire scene exudes a retro and romantic atmosphere, as if coming from a forgotten ancient story. The visuals are delicate and realistic, as if shot with a professional camera, yet still retaining the rustic feel of everyday amateur equipment. It preserves real light and shadow changes and slight noise, enhancing realism and the sense of life. Overall, it presents a visual experience that combines artistry and everyday life, allowing people to feel the passage of time and the accumulation of emotions",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
