        {
          "id": "krea2-b2307572aadb772e4da40724",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙家中沉思坐",
          "prompt": "She wears a black-and-white plaid short-sleeve dress made of tweed with clear and visible texture, featuring a delicate woven texture. The collar features a white lapel, adorned with a black bow decoration, with a small metal clasp accented in the center of the bow, adding a touch of vintage elegance. The short-sleeve section features a slight puff sleeve design, giving the overall look a sweeter feel. She sits cross-legged with her legs together, wearing a pair of light purple thin stockings on her feet. The fabric is thin and translucent, subtly revealing the leg lines. The ankles are slightly curved, toes naturally raised, hands folded on the knees, and on her left wrist is a pearl bracelet. The beads are round and white, neatly arranged, and the wrist relaxes naturally. Her fingers are long and slender, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with light pink nail polish. The carpet is laid on a light gray floor, and on the left side of the background is a white door with a flat panel, topped by horizontal louver designs that let in soft natural light. To the right is a deep brown classical glass display cabinet with exquisitely carved cabinets, curved legs, and Baroque-style decorative details. Inside the cabinet are various bottles of alcoholic beverages, including whisky and brandy, each with a different shape and clearly visible labels Some bottles reflect light. Inside the cabinet is a round decorative plate painted with vintage character scenes, rich in color and vivid content. The glass surface of the display cabinet is smooth and reflective, reflecting blurred images of the surrounding environment. The entire space is bright and soft, with the light source coming from the front left, simulating natural daylight to create uniform diffused light. The shadows are soft, not stiff, with a moderate sense of three-dimensionality. There is a clear depth of field relationship between the background and foreground, with clear and prominent figures in the foreground and slightly blurred background, creating a visual focal point. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly lower in the center of the frame, facing the viewer to create direct emotional exchange. The display cabinet and door frame in the background form vertical lines, contrasting with the horizontal stripes on the carpet, enhancing the stability of the image. The direction of light and shadow is consistent, with warm tones as the main focus, creating a warm and comfortable home atmosphere. The overall texture is delicate, with harmonious colors that convey both the warmth of daily life and artistic aesthetic expression, presenting a sense of tranquility. An elegant and lifelike visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
