        {
          "id": "krea2-20491259c8a0731938967886",
          "alias": "单女透视黑毛衣室内媚态坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a modern-style indoor setting, wearing a black long-sleeve knit dress with a short hem revealing smooth, delicate legs. Her legs are clad in sheer stockings, and on her feet are black pointed high heels with gold metal decorative buckles. The design is exquisite and fashionable. She wears black thin-rimmed glasses, the lenses reflecting the blurred outlines of her surroundings, slightly curled. Her makeup is refined, and the overall look exudes a blend of intellect and sensuality. In the foreground, her legs and feet occupy a prominent spot at the bottom of the frame. The texture of her stockings and the details of her high heels are clearly visible. Next to her is an open magazine with a fashion portrait and the word \"ELLE\" printed on the cover. Next to it is a white folder or notebook with black borders, hinting at work or reading scenes. The middle is a female subject, fully presented from chest to knee, with a slightly tilted body leaning against a blue textured wall. The wall is made of deep blue fabric with subtle fabric textures, rich in texture. On the right side, a golden metal frame is used as decoration, adding depth to the space. The background is a solid blue wall, simple yet modern, without unnecessary decoration, highlighting the subject. The composition uses the classic rule of thirds, with the figure positioned slightly toward the center on the left side of the frame, with the gaze facing the viewer, creating a strong visual direction. Light comes from the front slightly left, soft and even, while natural highlight reflections appear on stockings and high heels, creating a delicate transition of light and shadow. The shadows are well handled to enhance the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is calm, elegant, professional, and slightly private. The color tones are mainly black, white, and blue, harmoniously unified and high-end, giving a sense of sophistication. The images present an effect similar to professional studio shooting, yet retaining real details that may exist in daily life. It feels as if a high-end camera and a standard lens were used to shoot under well-controlled indoor lighting, emphasizing the character's expression and clothing details, conveying an image of urban women who are independent, confident, and intellectual. The overall image is clean and crisp, with rigorous composition, delicate light and shadow, and a strong atmosphere, possessing strong artistic expression and visual impact",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
