          "id": "krea2-190b7e976253cf7b2a88a2ed",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫户外沉思坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors beside a metal mesh fence, wearing a white long-sleeve shirt and a deep blue pleated skirt in her school uniform. A blue-and-white striped bow tie is tied around the neckline, sleeves slightly rolled up, revealing slender arms. She wears black stockings and black leather shoes, her legs crossed, one foot lightly stepping on the other, her posture naturally relaxed. Her left hand gently supports the railing, and on her wrist is a string of colorful beaded bracelets. The overall design presents a typical Japanese schoolgirl style, with a background of blurred architectural structures and a white metal grid fence. Light shines from above, creating interplay of light and shadow on the ground and the figures. Sunlight casts regular geometric shadows through the grid, creating a warm and gentle afternoon atmosphere. The composition uses shallow depth of field, with a clear foreground highlighting the subject, background blurred, and the composition arranged slightly to the right center, using diagonal fence lines to guide the viewer's gaze and enhance the depth and dynamic feel of the image. Paired with warm yellow sunlight, it presents a fresh yet slightly artistic visual effect. The image is delicate and detailed, with a sense of realism and life that feels like everyday photography is captured in a real environment. It captures the tranquil moments of youth sitting quietly in a corner outside the campus. The layers of light and shadow are sharp, with strong contrasts and gentle transitions, creating an atmosphere that is both everyday and artistically beautiful. The characters' subtle expressions reveal a subtle sense of loneliness and contemplation. The entire scene is full of storytelling, inviting one to imagine her current state of mind and the story behind it. The visuals have no obvious decorations or unnecessary elements; they are simple and focused, highlighting the emotional expression of the characters and the integration of the environment. The composition cleverly uses slanted lines and frame structures to enhance the visual impact and spatial sense of the image. The precise use of lighting not only shapes three-dimensional character contours but also sets a warm and slightly nostalgic emotional tone, presenting an overall visual style that combines realism and poetry. Like a quiet scene in a movie, it records the tenderness and vulnerability revealed inadvertently during the youthful years",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
