        {
          "id": "krea2-40ec214c753afc469a57d0c3",
          "alias": "单女黑西装桥微笑站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an outdoor bridge, wearing a black suit jacket and a plaid pleated skirt, paired with a white and gray plaid scarf. The edges of the scarf are decorated with tassels, giving a warm and fashionable look with a gentle smile. Her overall posture is relaxed and natural, her body slightly turned to one side, and her hands hang down or gently clasp in front of her, creating a daily yet slightly artistic atmosphere. In the foreground is a white metal railing with simple and clear lines extending from the lower left corner to the center of the painting, forming a visual element that guides the viewer. The middle ground features a female subject, occupying the center-right position of the composition. The composition uses the classic three-part method to highlight its role as a visual focal point. The background is a blurry warm yellow architectural wall with subtle textures and light and shadow variations. Above, the orange-red roof outline can be faintly seen. The background blur is very soft, making the subject stand out more while preserving the warmth and spatial layering of the environment. Light comes from the rear diagonally, presenting a typical afternoon sunshine effect, creating soft highlights and delicate shadow transitions. It enhances the sense of depth and warmth. The entire scene is bathed in warm backlighting, creating a tranquil, healing, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The colors are mainly warm yellow, orange-red, off-white, and deep black, harmoniously unified and unified, giving it a strong Japanese photo style. The image texture is delicate and detailed, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains a natural, everyday feel. The lens uses a large-aperture prime lens to simulate real photography, with precise depth control and creamy background blur. At the same time, necessary environmental information is preserved, the overall composition is stable and full of tension, with natural and smooth visual guidance. From the foreground railing to the central figures and then to the background buildings, a complete visual chain is formed. Light and shadow are evenly distributed, with moderate contrast between light and shadow, without overexposure or dead black areas. The images are full of storytelling, as if capturing an ordinary yet touching moment. It is suitable for video creation that expresses themes of youth, campus, daily life, or emotions. The overall atmosphere is quiet and beautiful, like a silent poem. It lets people feel the gentleness of time and the warmth of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
