        {
          "id": "krea2-bcbb43645ff7b65847fc460d",
          "alias": "单女棕短裙庭院温柔坐侧头",
          "prompt": "Her overall aura is elegant and slightly artistic. She wears a white ruffled off-shoulder top, made of light and flowing material, with layered pleats creating a romantic visual effect. The sleeves are wide and voluminous, giving a semi-transparent texture. She wears a light brown high-waisted short skirt with a clean and sharp cut, smooth lines that hug the figure, accentuating her long legs. She wears black stockings. The stockings are smooth and tight, perfectly outlining the curves of her legs. On her feet are black pointed-toe stiletto shoes, the upper surfaces shiny like mirrors, accented with metal clasps, adding a touch of refinement. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, legs crossed, one hand gently resting on the knee, the other naturally letting go, her body slightly tilted, head slightly tilted, showcasing an effortless beauty. The background is a wall made of white wooden planks, whose surface is slightly rough, preserving the natural grain and slight wear marks of the wood. The walls are covered with numerous green ivy leaves, each with different shapes and sizes—some heart-shaped, others palmate-shaped. The colors transition from tender green to deep green, with some leaf edges yellowing or spotted, giving a natural and authentic appearance. The vines wind and twist, forming a dense green vegetation wall that contrasts sharply with the white wooden boards. In the foreground, the wooden box is made of unpolished wooden boards, with obvious wood grain and nail holes on the surface, and slightly rough edges. The woman seated above is the central subject, with the composition positioned slightly to the right of the center The figure occupies the main space in the frame, naturally guiding the gaze to the subject. The middle shot features a woman and a wooden box, while the background is a wall covered with vines. The layers are distinct, with a strong sense of depth. The lighting is soft and even, coming from a slightly left front position, simulating natural light or indoor soft lighting. The transition is natural, without harsh shadows, highlighting the texture of the material. The overall atmosphere is quiet and elegant, with a touch of vintage artistic flair, as if shooting in a quiet courtyard corner or indoor garden, giving it the realism of everyday amateur equipment. Accented with black shoes, the colors are harmonious and unified, the details rich, full of life and artistic beauty. The image is clear and moderately resolved, presenting a texture similar to camera photography rather than overly retouched digital painting. The subject's expressions are natural, movements are unpretentious, the environment is simple yet design-oriented, the overall composition is stable, the visual focus is clear, conveying a gentle, tranquil, and slightly nostalgic mood. It is suitable for fashion portraits or lifestyle photography, with no unnecessary decorations in the frame. It highlights the integration of characters and natural elements, creating an artistic conception of harmonious coexistence between people and the environment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
