        {
          "id": "krea2-7ff2e3605c06e5694dbc95b9",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫沙发愤怒坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a beige fabric single sofa chair, wearing a loose white long-sleeved shirt with the hem naturally falling to mid-thigh. The neckline is slightly open, revealing the neck line. Her left hand rests naturally on her right arm, legs crossed, one foot lightly touches the ground. The leg lines are smooth and graceful, and the overall design is simple yet modern. The sofa chair is designed in a retro style, with wooden armrests and legs in deep brown, a smooth surface with a warm texture, and a full-padded body. The cushions are thick and comfortable, with a light beige wall in the background. The wall is decorated with vertical wooden strips and decorative panels with clear and natural texture. On the right side, there is a window with a lattice window frame, light brown with soft light from the glass. The curtains are made of white, semi-transparent material that gently flutters in the wind. The floor is covered with white tiles that reflect evenly. The overall color palette is mainly off-white, light brown, and white, creating a warm and tranquil indoor atmosphere. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, and the body slightly angled to the side. The foreground features the sofa and the lower body of the figure, the middle ground features the upper body and sofa details, and the background features walls and windows. The layers are distinct and the space feels strong. Light and shadow come from the right window, creating soft side lighting, while the other side creates natural shadows. The transition is delicate and three-dimensional, and the overall lighting is bright but not glaring, presenting a clean and fresh everyday feel, as if shot with a regular home camera. It carries a sense of artistic life and harmonious colors. The saturation is moderate, contrast is gentle, details are rich, texture is authentic, and the subject's expression is calm and restrained, revealing a touch of contemplation and tenderness. The entire scene is filled with a serene beauty, combining fashion with a sense of approachability, like a carefully arranged home portrait capturing the most natural and beautiful moments of everyday life",
