        {
          "id": "krea2-8f9ce3d36d53ac7b04330cac",
          "alias": "单女白礼服室内困倦站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a warm and dreamy indoor lighting setting, wearing an elegant white off-shoulder gown with delicate lace texture and pleated designs. The sleeves are puffy puff sleeves, presenting a light and flowing texture. The neckline softly fits the curve of the neck, exuding a noble and romantic aura that adds a touch of playfulness and liveliness. Her smile is sweet and confident, looking directly at the camera conveying gentle and friendly emotions. She wears a pair of long tassel earrings. Composed of multiple layers of transparent crystal and metal elements, it reflects fine fragments of light under the light. A slender bracelet is worn on the wrist, with a simple ring accentuated between the fingers. The overall design is rich in details but not overly complex. In the foreground, a semi-transparent pink acrylic panel is placed diagonally, with smooth and rounded edges. The surface reflects the colors of the surrounding environment, creating a soft layer of light and shadow. Behind the acrylic panel, a faint purple object outline can be seen, possibly as a decorative prop or lighting installation, enhancing the spatial depth of the composition. The middle shot centers on the figure, with a background featuring blurry warm tones of light and shadow, mainly composed of orange-red and golden-yellow intertwining, creating an atmosphere reminiscent of a dinner or party scene. In the background, some blurred light spots can be seen, creating a beautiful bokeh effect. Circular light spots and strip light sources are interlaced, hinting at distant neon lights or decorative light strips, mixed with some green plant outlines, adding vitality and realism to the scene. The composition uses a centered technique, with the figure positioned at the center of the frame with the head slightly raised. The body is slightly tilted, with a clear visual focus. The foreground acrylic panel serves as a visual guiding element, guiding the viewer from the lower left corner to the main subject through its tilt angle and color transitions, enhancing dynamic balance in the composition. Light mainly comes from the right front of the figure, providing soft frontal fill lighting, with natural shadow transitions. There are slight highlights on the shoulders and arms, highlighting the three-dimensional structure of the clothing. Warm lighting in the background is projected from behind and sides, forming backlit contours that outline the figure's silhouette. This enhances the prominence of the subject, creating an overall lighting and shadow atmosphere that is warm, romantic, and dramatic. The color palette is dominated by white, pink, orange-red, and gold, accented with a touch of purple and green, creating a warm and cool contrast. This not only maintains visual harmony but also enhances the layering and artistic appeal of the image. The image texture is close to that of professional portrait photography, featuring high-end skin texture and delicate material rendering, while retaining the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting, such as slight noise, Soft transitions outside focus and natural color shifts give the overall image both artistic beauty and a sense of everyday life. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and warm, as if capturing a private and precious moment, evoking an elegant and composed temperament and inner joy",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
