        {
          "id": "krea2-6f48bf9a29543818942e5cd5",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙街道忧伤坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a concrete curb by the outdoor roadside, leaning slightly forward, lowering her head to gaze at her own hands. Her expression is slightly contemplative and melancholic, adding a touch of softness and laziness. Under soft natural light, it glows with a gentle sheen. Her gaze falls on her hands folded over her knees, her hand posture relaxed and relaxed, fingers gently intertwined, as if lost in thought. She wears a light blue spaghetti strap dress made of light and flowing fabric, adorned with elegant off-white floral patterns evenly distributed. It creates a fresh and artistic visual effect. The camisole design is minimalist, revealing the long collarbones and shoulder lines. The skirt hem is loose and comfortable, naturally extending over the legs to form soft pleats. She sits beside a gray asphalt road, which is slightly rough with fine cracks and wear marks. Next to it is a cement curbstone, with clearly visible edges. The background is a lush shrub with dense leaves, varying in color and rich layers. Some leaves glow softly under the light, making the overall environment feel peaceful and natural. The composition uses medium shots, with the subject occupying the right side of the main subject, the head slightly tilted to the left, and the body forming an S-shaped curve. The pose is elegant and dynamic. The camera is shot from a slightly higher angle, with a view close to the natural feel of everyday handheld camera photography. The background is moderately blurred, highlighting the subject's three-dimensionality and detailed texture. The light and shadow come from naturally diffused light, possibly soft daylight from cloudy days or shaded trees, evenly illuminating the figure without strong shadows. The colors are mainly cool tones, with blue-green tones running throughout the body. It harmoniously echoes the green plants in the background, creating a subtle contrast of warmth and coolness. The overall atmosphere is quiet, private, with a hint of loneliness and introspection, like a tranquil moment encountered on the street in an afternoon. It carries a strong sense of realism and a sense of life, as if captured casually with a regular phone or entry-level camera. The image retains slight noise and natural motion blur, enhancing realism and documentary quality. The composition is simple yet layered, extending further to the background greenery and roads. It creates an immersive viewing experience, with the overall image conveying a gentle, serene, and slightly melancholic everyday aesthetic, combining artistic sensibility with a sense of authenticity in life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
