        {
          "id": "krea2-93dfb1af1d273dd61a7f2068",
          "alias": "单女灰高领衫城市温柔站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of an indoor mirror for a selfie, exuding a natural and approachable aura. Her left hand holds a silver smartphone, with three cameras arranged in a triangle on the back of the phone, facing the mirror for the shot. Her right hand hangs naturally, fingers are long, nails neatly trimmed, and she wears a gray turtleneck ribbed knit sweater. The sweater is delicately textured, with clearly visible texture, and the fitted design highlights her slender figure. She pairs the lower half with a black high-waisted mini skirt that is neatly tailored with side slits that reveal her leg lines. On her feet, she wears black stockings, which have a smooth texture with a slight reflect, presenting a natural sheen. The overall look is simple yet elegant, full of the fashion vibe of modern urban women. The background is a warm and comfortable home environment. The walls are pure white, clean and simple. The floor is a light gray cement-textured floor with a smooth surface with a slight graininess, reflecting soft light. In the center is a beige fabric sofa, with a soft-padded design for the backrest and seat cushions, with stitched edges that look refined and comfortable. On the sofa are two square cushions in the same color family. The surface of the cushions is smooth and soft, blending seamlessly with the sofa. Underneath the sofa are wooden legs supporting the surface, light brown in color, with a stable structure. Next to it is a low wooden coffee table. The tabletop is natural wood with clear grain, and the legs are also wooden. The overall design is simple and modern with smooth lines. Behind is a window with a lightweight, wrinkled curtain hanging naturally, letting in soft natural light. It illuminates the entire space, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical style, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, body slightly tilted to the camera, posture naturally relaxed. An arm raised to form a guiding line with a phone. The sofa, coffee table, and curtains in the background form a distinctly layered spatial layout. The foreground features the main subject, the middle ground is furniture, and the background is windows and curtains, creating a clear visual layer. In terms of light and shadow, the main light source comes from natural light outside the window, soft and even, shining in from the left, creating a natural transition of light and shadow on the subject. The sweater's texture and the sheen of the stockings appear more three-dimensional under the light. The shadows are delicate and soft, without strong contrasts. The overall atmosphere is quiet, warm, and everyday, as if capturing an ordinary yet beautiful moment of life. The image presents a realistic and natural everyday photography texture, like intimate life photos taken with a regular phone, preserving original details and warmth. The tones are mainly gray, off-white, and black, with harmonious and unified color combinations. It creates a minimalist yet stylish visual effect, with no unnecessary decorations in the frame; all elements serve the expression of the main characters and the atmosphere of the scene. The overall composition is stable, visual guidance is clear, and the light and shadow treatment is delicate, creating a strong sense of atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
