        {
          "id": "krea2-2e7ec7a9b0ee459235687847",
          "alias": "单女粉衬衫桌边俏皮坐喝",
          "prompt": "A woman sits inside a café, wearing a pale pink cotton shirt with a slightly open collar and naturally rolled-up cuffs, appearing casual and comfortable. Her right hand gently holds a transparent glass cup, filled with clear water. She lowers her head and takes a gentle sip, as crystal-clear droplets slide down the rim, forming fine water marks. The curve of the glass matches the lines of her hand, creating a playful touch. The cup reflects a soft light, giving a warm texture. Her left hand rests on the table, fingers naturally relaxed. A slender wrist is revealed. In the foreground, she holds a glass cup and part of her arm. The cup occupies the lower left corner of the frame, and the body of the cup is slightly deformed due to tilting. The edges are clearly defined, and the bottom of the cup has fine engravings. Ripples ripple on the water surface, reflecting blurred light and shadow. The background is the blurred interior of the café. Warm yellow lights pour down from the ceiling, creating soft patches of light. Several round chandeliers appear faintly in the distance, and the walls are light beige with subtle textures. You can faintly see the outlines of decorative paintings or posters on the wall, but the details are blurry. In the right background, there is a dark-colored chair and a wooden table. On the table sits another glass with a drink, with a straw stuck in the cup. In the background, there are also blurry silhouettes of other customers, dressed casually, chatting or using their phones, creating a sense of authentic life. The entire scene uses shallow depth of field, with the background gradually blurring, creating a natural out-of-focus bokeh effect. The composition uses a center-to-right third-division layout. The subject's head is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, with the gaze facing the lens, creating a strong visual direction. The light mainly comes from a soft light source slightly to the left in front, possibly a mix of natural light from windows and indoor lighting. The shadows transition naturally, and the overall color palette is dominated by warm yellow, pale pink, and white, creating a warm, tranquil, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The image has a slight film graininess and a low-saturation color texture, resembling everyday moments shot with an old-fashioned camera. The layers of light and shadow are rich, including bright highlight areas. There are also soft transitions in shadow, as if enjoying a moment of solitude. The entire scene is filled with the atmosphere of life and emotional warmth, giving a warm, authentic, and slightly artistic visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
