        {
          "id": "krea2-aa759c88868d17fc2ede974e",
          "alias": "单女绿毛衣广场愤怒站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the bright indoor window, wearing a dark green vertically striped knit cardigan over a black square-neck top underneath, a black A-line short skirt, smooth white tights on her legs, and simple black flats. Her hands are folded in front of her, her posture natural relaxed, her body slightly leaning to the side, leaning against a light beige glass door frame. The door frame is clearly structured and the lines are clean. In the distance, you can see multi-story buildings with beige exterior walls. The windows are neatly arranged, some buildings feature classical decorative lines, and pedestrians walk faintly along the street—some wearing red jackets, others carrying backpacks—forming a dynamic background element. Sunlight streams in from the right, casting soft shadows on the floor. The light is bright but not glaring, creating a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The composition centers on the figures, using a medium perspective. The figure occupies the main position, with the head slightly above the center line, creating a subtle interaction between the line of sight and the viewer. The foreground features the figure and nearby door frames, the middle ground shows the figure's body and the street outside the window, and the background features farther buildings and pedestrians. The layers are distinct, extending along the body lines to the legs and feet, then through the door frame and glass reflections, it leads to the distant street, creating a natural visual flow. The light and shadow are handled with delicate detail, with the main light source coming from the right front, and soft shadows on the left side enhancing the sense of depth. Reflections on the floor and door frames further enrich the layers of light and shadow. The overall color scheme is mainly green, black, and white, paired with beige and gray backgrounds. The colors are harmoniously unified, and the image texture is close to that of a high-resolution camera. The details are sharp, the clothing folds are realistic, and the glass reflections are lifelike, creating a strong sense of realism and artistic atmosphere. It feels like a professional photographer took a lifelike portrait in a Parisian street café, capturing a quiet and poetic moment in urban life. The image presents an aesthetic found in everyday life. It is both documentary and artistic, as if you can hear the soft noise of the distant street and the faint sound of wind brushing through glass. The entire scene is full of storytelling, making one imagine the girl just returning from the street, preparing to head out or just ending a day's itinerary, or perhaps looking forward to the future or reminiscing about the past. This subtle emotional expression gives the image greater depth and emotional impact. The precise control of light and color gives the image a cinematic texture—both real and dreamlike. Like a carefully composed film photograph, it captures this ordinary yet moving moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
