        {
          "id": "krea2-ab12abfa1d7853ff462c6aec",
          "alias": "单女黑礼服镜前叛逆站立指向",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a winding country road, wearing a black spaghetti strap gown whose hem flutters lightly in the wind. The shoulder design is simple yet elegant, and the skirt's lines are smooth and hug the figure. The material appears soft and slightly drapes, presenting natural folds and light and shadow effects, adding a touch of movement and rebelliousness. She slightly turns to look back, carrying a touch of playfulness and gentleness, as if inviting the viewer to enter this moment together. Her left hand is raised high, fingers extended, forming a free, unbound pose, while her right hand extends forward. The palm is open, fingers naturally apart, fingertips pointing toward the camera as if trying to touch or grasp something. The movements are full of expressiveness and emotional tension, shining with a healthy glow under the sunlight. The muscles on the arms are soft, showing youthful vitality and strength. The background is a vast green meadow with dense leaves gently swaying in the wind. In the distance, rolling low hills with sparse vegetation show layers of pale yellow and green. Further away is the vast ocean, calm as a mirror, reflecting the pale blue skylight A few wisps of thin clouds drift leisurely, with the overall lighting being bright daylight. The sun is positioned in the upper left of the frame, creating a strong backlighting effect. This creates a soft halo around the outline edges of the figures, casting clear but not overly harsh shadows on the ground and body. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle to emphasize the figures' upright postures and spatial depth. The main subject occupies the right third of the frame, leaving a large amount of negative space on the left side, guiding the gaze from the foreground to the center and then to the natural scenery in the background, creating visual flow. The foreground prominent outstretched hand serves as a visual guide, attracting viewers' attention and enhancing interaction. The middle shot focuses on the overall form and expression of the characters, while the background is blurred to create depth of field, making the subject stand out even more. The overall atmosphere is relaxed, free, and full of vitality, carrying the warm and tranquil mood of a summer afternoon. The colors are mainly black, white, blue, and green, with sharp contrast yet harmonious unity. The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if shot with a professional camera, with graininess and color saturation reminiscent of film photography. Rich in details and natural transitions of light and shadow, presenting a style that is both everyday and artistically beautiful. The composition is balanced yet dynamic, and the emotions are sincere and moving, as if capturing a moment of poetry and beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
          "_classification": {
            "binding": "a2c7d3058938b1bd959266b75a7b9a3f00124c22bc6ed06ea4eec6cb4c0aa00b",
            "disposition": "classified",
