        {
          "id": "krea2-65cc5370fad2c68677977ad7",
          "alias": "单女黑丝袜沙发微笑坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a modernly designed white plush armchair, wearing a faint, almost imperceptible smile. Her overall posture is elegant and relaxed, her body slightly tilted, legs crossed, one foot gently resting on the other. Black stockings wrap her long leg lines, with a smooth and natural curve from knee to ankle. Her right hand gently embraces a thick red and white knit blanket, thick and clearly visible, with red stripes alternating with a white background, presenting a warm and rustic sense of handcraft. The blanket is casually draped over her shoulders and arms, creating natural folds and layers. She wears a black tight dress or leggings underneath, creating a sharp contrast with the outer blanket. The chair is made of white plush material, with a soft and fluffy surface, full cushions, rounded armrests, and black metal crossed legs that radiate support, stable and stylish. The background is a minimalist light gray-white wall with no decoration, and the floor is a smooth material in the same color. The overall space is clean and pure, with light coming from the left side of the frame. Soft natural light streams through the window, forming a slanting bright light band, casting soft shadows on the right wall and floor. The transition of light and shadow is natural, creating a peaceful, warm, and slightly intimate atmosphere. The composition uses a medium shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, occupying the main visual focus. The angle is slightly upward, highlighting the character's elegant temperament. The foreground is the main body of the figure and chair, the middle ground is the blanket and leg details, and the background is the clean wall and floor. The visual guide draws attention from the strong light on the left, extending to the blanket's texture and leg lines. The atmosphere of light and shadow is warm and soft, with white and gray tones as the main tones, accented by a red blanket for visual highlights. Overall, it presents a tranquil moment full of artistic flair in daily life, as if on a quiet afternoon with sunlight streaming through the window into the room. She sits quietly, dressed in comfortable clothes wrapped in a blanket, enjoying her own tranquil moment. The image is delicate and the colors harmonious. It has strong visual appeal and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
