        {
          "id": "krea2-9d128e46de29571ca68b64ed",
          "alias": "单女连体衣城市冷淡坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on dark wooden furniture, her legs crossed in an elegant S-shape, her body slightly leaning forward, hands naturally resting at her ankles. Her fingers are long, fair, and her nails are neatly trimmed. She wears a form-fitting gray high-neck, long-sleeve bodysuit, made of smooth and delicate material that presents a soft matte texture. The dress fits her body perfectly, outlining smooth shoulder and neck lines and a slender waistline. She pairs the lower half with sheer black stockings, clearly showing her leg lines. The surface of the stockings has a slight reflect, creating a subtle sheen and a delicate sheen. Her makeup is exquisite contrasting with the overall cool tones, the expression is calm and slightly mysterious. The background is the indoor environment, the walls are light beige, and the walls are decorated with clean lines. There are recessed downlights on the ceiling, casting light from above to create soft shadows. In the space, faint furniture outlines can be faintly seen, such as chair backs and distant door frames. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned at the center of the frame, occupying the main visual focus. The foreground is a close-up of the lower body and hands, rich in detail, while the background is blurred, highlighting the main subject, the overall composition is stable and layered, forming a continuous flow of movement. The lighting and shadow atmosphere leans toward a cool tone, with gray, black, and off-white as the main tones. Light comes from above, creating a soft toplight effect. Shadows are concentrated below the figure and behind the body, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is quiet and private, conveying the calmness and restraint of modern urban life. The images have the texture of professional studio photography while retaining the natural atmosphere of daily life, as if taken casually at home, authentic and artistic, rich in details, harmonious and unified colors, and the visuals are full of tension and beauty",
