        {
          "id": "krea2-e43b4ca3ad45b529ef69d849",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙户外严肃站立持相机",
          "prompt": "From a low-angle downward view, a woman stands in a vast outdoor space. She wears an off-white, loose sleeveless dress with a cotton-linen texture, paired with a brown-white plaid long-sleeve shirt underneath. The sleeves naturally fall to the elbows, and the neckline is slightly open, presenting a casual yet elegant everyday feel. Her hands gently hold up a light beige woven straw hat, with slightly fluffy edges and wide brims. The fine material reveals a clear woven texture. She places the hat above her head, as if feeling the warmth of the sunlight. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the composition, with the figure occupying about two-thirds of the height. The background is a pure, cloudless blue sky with moderate color saturation, presenting the freshness and vastness unique to a clear summer sky. The sky gradually shifts from deep blue at the top to light blue at the bottom, with clear layers without any cluttered elements obstructing the view, creating an open, tranquil, and hopeful atmosphere. The foreground centers on the figures. Highlighting the details of movement and expression, the middle shot extends from the figure's body to the sky, forming a simple yet dynamic spatial structure. The background is completely occupied by the sky, reinforcing the theme of loneliness and freedom. The composition uses the classic \"blank space\" technique, with extensive use of negative space to focus the visual focus on the figure, while giving the painting a sense of breath and poetic beauty. The light and shadow come from natural daylight slightly above to the right, soft and even, without strong shadows, with clear but not harsh contours. A slight shadow is cast beneath the straw hat. Enhances three-dimensionality, with subtle light and shadow changes in the folds of clothing, reflecting the realism of the material. The overall color scheme is dominated by cool blue and warm off-white, creating a harmonious contrast of cool and warm tones for visual balance and comfort. The image has a film texture with slight graininess and slightly faded colors, simulating vintage camera shooting effects. It features a nostalgic, gentle filter style. The lens is a 50mm standard prime lens, with a shallow depth of field, natural background blur, sharp and clear subjects, and smooth edge transitions. The entire image conveys a sense of tranquility and far-reaching commitment, a love for life, and enjoyment of solitude in everyday aesthetics, as if capturing an ordinary yet touching moment, evoking inner peace and anticipation for the future",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
