        {
          "id": "krea2-98a1fa95727968286c973c0e",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙窗边俏皮坐注视",
          "prompt": "She sits cross-legged, her body slightly turned toward the window, showing some teeth, appearing relaxed and cheerful. She wears small earrings, relaxes her posture, rests her hands on her knees, and immerses herself in a tranquil atmosphere. The bed is covered with a white quilt, a bit messy and naturally wrinkled. Near the window at the head of the bed lies an open book or magazine with a blurred colorful pattern, and by the bedside is a black geometric desk lamp. The lampshade is made of transparent glass, with the bulb clearly visible. The walls are beige with a soft texture. The ceiling is made of dark brown wood. The windows are sliding glass doors with dark wood frames, and the edges of the frames reflect lightly. The curtains are made of white tulle, half-unfolded, gently fluttering in the wind. Through the glass door, you can see the balcony outside. On the balcony hangs a clothes rack hanging several pieces of clothing, including a black dress and a white underwear, which gently sway in the breeze. In the background, you can see the rooftops and greenery of nearby houses, distant trees and utility poles, and the sky is a bright gray-white. Light streams in diagonally from the window, creating a soft backlight effect. Sunlight filters through the curtains and glass, casting mottled shadows inside the room, making its outline clearly visible. At the same time, a soft halo forms on the sheets and walls. The overall tone of the painting leans toward warmth, mainly beige, white, and blue, with a touch of vintage film feel. The color saturation is low, and contrast is moderate. The image has a slightly grainy texture and slight vignetting, creating a nostalgic, tranquil, and warm family atmosphere. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned on the right side, leaving ample space on the left to showcase the view outside the window. The visual guide line follows the character's gaze toward the window, enhancing depth in the image. The camera angle slightly looks downward, capturing the complete relationship between the bed, the figure, and the environment outside the window. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and peaceful, full of the poetry and warmth of daily life, as if recording an ordinary yet beautiful morning moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
