        {
          "id": "krea2-ad697540d49c0af32b9d453e",
          "alias": "单女紫连衣裙户外冷淡坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor paved pavement, wearing a light purple loose long dress with a skirt that naturally drapes to the ground. The material is light and flowing, with delicate pleats and textures, presenting a soft cotton-linen texture. The sleeves are puff sleeves, with smooth and elegant lines. She leans slightly to the side beside a large cluster of hydrangeas, tilting her head back, her expression calm and serene. She wears delicate gold hoop earrings, her overall posture relaxed and natural, as if enjoying the sunshine and breeze. Her legs are crossed, On his feet are brown thin-strap sandals, with slender ankles. His right hand rests naturally on his left, with elegant hand lines and neatly trimmed nails. Beside him sits a white woven straw hat on the ground, with a wide brim and hollowed-out patterns on top. The material is natural grass, with clear details. The background is dense hydrangea shrubs, with lush flowers and rich color layers, ranging from deep blue and purple to pinkish and pale purple. The flower clusters are full, petals layered, and green leaves set off in the middle. The leaves are broad, with distinct veins full of vitality. In the distant right side, more flowers and greenery can be faintly seen, creating a blurred background and creating a depth of field effect. The composition uses a medium-angle shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the lower right of the frame, occupying about one-third of the space. The large area of hydrangeas on the left occupies the main visual area, creating a strong color contrast and visual impact. The figure and the flower cluster form a harmonious interaction. Light and shadow come from the upper right, creating warm highlights, while light casts light shadows on the ground and below the flower beds. Light penetrates the gaps between the flowers and leaves, creating a mottled light and shadow effect. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, with a dominant contrast of warm and cool tones. Cool tones like purple and blue balance with the characters' light-colored clothing and the warmth under the sunlight. The image is filled with the feeling of a summer afternoon, with the texture of film photography. The color saturation is moderate, with a slight retro filter effect. The graininess is slight, details are rich, edges are soft, and the background gradually blurs, guiding the viewer's gaze from the figures to the flower sea, creating a tranquil, romantic, and healing atmosphere. The overall style is close to Japanese photo shoots or art film scenes. It carries the warmth of everyday life and artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
