        {
          "id": "krea2-6c9a0d008dfbe740905479f5",
          "alias": "单女米风衣站立",
          "prompt": "She wears a beige trench coat with a black turtleneck inner layer at the collar. The fabric of the coat features delicate textures and soft pleats, smooth shoulder lines, and clearly visible button details. The overall look is simple yet elegant, with tiny pearl earrings adding a touch of refinement. The composition uses close-ups, with the main subject positioned slightly to the center on the left side of the frame The head occupies the main visual space, with background blur treatment presenting a blurred architectural structure. Traditional Chinese architectural elements of red walls and gray tiles can be faintly seen. The colors are warm brown, dark red, and gray, creating a retro and cozy atmosphere. The overall tone of the image is warm, with a slight film texture, slight graininess, and color shifts, simulating the shooting effect of vintage cameras. The lens is a large-aperture prime lens with an extremely shallow depth of field The foreground is clear, the background completely unfocused, forming bokeh light spots that highlight the main subject, creating a poetic atmosphere of time standing still and flowing emotions. The overall style combines documentary and artistic qualities, as if captured by an old film camera at dusk, full of storytelling and emotional tension. There are no obvious artificial traces in the frame, and natural light blends perfectly with the environment, conveying a sense of tranquility, freedom, and immersion in the present life aesthetic",
