        {
          "id": "krea2-9277299f9e3c4817cc2cf68f",
          "alias": "单女灰外套车内困倦坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits inside the car, carrying a hint of gentleness and calm, slightly tilting her head toward the camera, radiating a healthy glow. She wears a light gray wool coat, thick and warm, decorated with dark brown round buttons and wooden horn buttons. The collar is slightly open, revealing the outline of the inner garment. Around her neck is an off-white thick knitted scarf, thick and soft, with clearly visible texture, layered around the neck, adding warmth and comfort. In the light, the light flickers slightly. The background features the windows and interior structures. Outside the window is a blurry outdoor scene, with sunlight slanting in from the left, creating a soft backlighting effect. Light passes through the window glass, creating a warm and dreamy atmosphere. The foreground is the main subject, occupying most of the space. The composition uses close-ups, with the middle showing the seats and some door trim inside. The tones are darker to create contrast, and the background is blurred, presenting a hazy layering of light and shadow. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is mainly warm yellow. The lighting is soft and layered, presenting a tranquil, warm, and slightly artistic everyday scene, as if capturing a winter afternoon nap in the car or a moment of travel. It carries both the atmosphere of life and emotional warmth, with a delicate and realistic texture, as if shot with a professional camera, while retaining slight film grain and natural color transitions, presenting an aesthetic style that is both refined and approachable",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
