        {
          "id": "krea2-8045f94d6ee3baecf1ab5409",
          "alias": "单女灰长裤街道冷淡注视",
          "prompt": "A woman holding a long sword, her posture elegant and full of strength. She wears a gray cropped top and loose printed trousers, draped in a black plush jacket. Her overall look blends modern street style with traditional samurai elements. Looking directly into the camera, it seems as if she is gazing at the viewer. In her hand is a Japanese tachi, long with a black handle. The blade reflects a cold metallic sheen in the sunlight, with the tip pointing diagonally upward, forming a strong visual guide extending from the lower left corner to the upper right corner, forming a diagonal composition. This enhances the dynamics and tension of the composition. In the foreground, the woman's arms and blades occupy the main positions. The light and shadow on the arms are mottled like leaf shadows, presenting a warm golden tone that sharply contrasts with the bright white light spots in the background. The middle frame shows the woman's body outline, slightly tilted, with smooth and natural body lines. The waist and abdomen are partially exposed, presenting a healthy and powerful posture. The background is composed of blurred leaves and mottled light and shadow filtering through the branches, creating a soft bokeh effect and a dreamlike atmosphere. Light enters from above and behind, creating a backlighting effect that creates a golden edge on the edges of the figure's outline. Light and shadow intertwine for rich layering. The entire composition uses high-contrast color processing, mainly black, white, and gray, accented with warm yellow tones. The colors are calm yet restrained, creating a strong visual impact. The composition is compact, with the focus on the people and tools. The shallow depth of field highlights the subject, the background blurs naturally, and the image texture is delicate, with slight film graininess and slight overexposure, simulating the realism of amateur camera shooting. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and mysterious, combining the artistic conception of Eastern aesthetics with the cold temperament of modern art. Like a carefully composed movie still, full of storytelling and imaginative space, it possesses strong visual appeal and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
