        {
          "id": "krea2-aee406707da314456e21d032",
          "alias": "单女棕高领衫室内害羞坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden tray, her body slightly leaning forward, tightly embracing a huge brown plush teddy bear with her arms resting lightly on the bear's belly, presenting an intimate cuddling posture that reveals a gentle yet slightly shy emotion. She wears a loose brown turtleneck sweater and a gray-white plaid short skirt, paired with white ankle socks and brown loafers. A small white bag with a golden chain slung over her shoulder, the overall look is casual and sweet. The teddy bear is large and almost occupies the left half of the frame. The overall image is cute and cozy. The background is a warm, light-colored wooden wall and floor with clearly visible grain. On the right side is a simple white shelf with some blurred items. The lighting is soft, presenting a warm yellow tone. The light source comes from the upper right of the frame, creating a peaceful and comfortable indoor atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure and teddy bear positioned slightly to the left of the center of the image, forming a visual focal point. The foreground features the legs and feet of the woman. The lines are smooth and the details rich. The middle ground shows the main interaction between the figure and the teddy bear, while the background is dominated by simple wooden elements with clear layers, extending along the curves of arms and body to the teddy bear's massive body, then returning to the legs and shoes, forming a complete visual loop. The light and shadow are evenly distributed, with soft shadows mainly concentrated below and behind the figures and the teddy bear, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and spatial depth. The overall atmosphere is warm, healing, full of childlike fun and security, as if capturing a quiet and intimate moment It offers the realism of everyday photography with a mobile phone or regular camera, rich in detail, harmonious colors, natural and unforced images, full of life and emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
