        {
          "id": "krea2-5611fdb840173e23fe080c16",
          "alias": "单女绿外套客厅忧伤躺摆拍",
          "prompt": "She wears a loose army green corduroy jacket with wide sleeves and pleated details, a white T-shirt underneath, black shorts, and classic white canvas shoes with loosely tied laces paired with dark green socks. The overall look is casual and casual, with heavy deep red vertical pleated curtains in the background, the curtain material slightly reflective. A soft transition of light and shadow is formed, with light streaming in diagonally from the left, creating a warm and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The main color tones are red, brown, and green, with moderate saturation and a slight film texture and graininess. The shot uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right, leaving space on the left for visual guidance. The foreground features the leather texture of the sofa and the legs and shoes; the middle shot is the main subject; the background is a red curtain. The composition is distinct, with light and shadow coming from the left to create a soft side lighting effect. This makes the character's outline clear while preserving details in the shadows. The overall atmosphere is quiet, private, and full of storytelling, as if capturing a moment of solitude on an afternoon. It has the realism and life atmosphere of everyday amateur equipment shooting. The image presents a texture similar to film cameras, with slight noise and color cast, and a slightly warm tone, highlighting a lazy, artistic, and slightly melancholic mood. The image does not focus strongly but uses a shallow depth of field to blur the background slightly, enhancing the subject's prominence. The overall style lies between fashionable photography and personal portraits, combining artistry and everyday life. It is suitable for expressing themes of youth, loneliness, reflection, or inner worlds. The composition is stable but not rigid, and the figures' poses are natural and relaxed, without any forced posing. It gives a sense of authenticity, warmth, and a touch of detachment. The red curtains in the background not only provide strong color contrast but also enhance the dramatic quality of the image, while the old leather texture of the sofa adds traces of time and warmth, making the whole scene feel like a private space. For example, vintage living rooms or studio corners are filled with nostalgia and privacy, with soft lighting without harsh highlights, delicate shadows, and an overall quiet, contemplative aesthetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
