        {
          "id": "krea2-131a1ae58c364ac9d6e2aa37",
          "alias": "单女白T恤桌边俏皮吃",
          "prompt": "She wore a simple white short-sleeve T-shirt over dark denim overalls, with metal buckle details on the shoulder straps. Her makeup was delicate and natural, and she smiled at the camera, holding a slice of pizza in her right hand and another in her left. Both slices were topped with Italian spicy sausage and melted cheese, with cheese strands stretching from the pizza in her right hand to the pizza in her left. forming an enticing arc as she was about to bite into one slice of pizza, her expression joyful and content. On the table lay a whole plate of sliced pizza, also topped with spicy sausage and cheese. Next to it was a glass drink cup filled with ice, orange liquid, and mint leaves, with two transparent straws inserted in the cup, and a black-handled knife and fork resting on a white porcelain plate. The background was gray-blue wallpaper with vintage patterns, and a light blue lace curtain hung on the window, letting sunlight stream through the room. Soft light and shadow effects are created. The window frame is made of dark brown wood, with the overall composition centered on the person, using close-up shots. The person is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, where the gaze meets the camera to create a friendly and natural interaction. The foreground highlights the details of the food and the characters' movements, the middle ground shows the posture and dining table environment, and the background provides spatial and atmospheric enhancement. Light comes from outside the right window, creating side lighting. The shadows are soft, and the overall color scheme is warm, mainly orange-yellow, off-white, and dark brown. Accented with blue and green, extending to the food and drinks on the table, it creates a relaxed and pleasant dining atmosphere. The images present a sense of documentary daily life, as if casually captured with a regular camera or phone in a real environment, full of life atmosphere and artistic beauty. The overall image is rich in layers, colors harmonious, and full of warmth and satisfaction",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
