        {
          "id": "krea2-7606a0e1462dc4d46ac26117",
          "alias": "单女和服神社站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in traditional kimono stands sideways beneath the wooden structure of a Japanese shrine or courtyard. She slightly tilts her head up to gaze at the colorful glass wind chimes hanging above. Her right hand gently holds a softly colored paper lantern, with a faint gradient of green, pink, and white on its surface, giving it a light yet warm feel. She wears a yukata with a white base adorned with blue geometric lines and floral patterns, with abstract orange and deep blue patterns accented at the cuffs and collar, and a wide light blue belt tied around her waist. The overall costume style is fresh and elegant, full of the atmosphere of summer festivals, forming a visual focal point. The center features layers of wooden beams and slanted frames, with numerous transparent and semi-transparent glass wind chimes hanging above. The wind chimes come in a rich variety of colors, including light blue, sky blue, orange-red, milky white, and teal, varying in size and rounded and full. Some wind chimes even have wooden plaques inscribed with Japanese prayer text, engraved with words like \"Kawagoe Hikawa Shrine,\" in neat and clear handwriting. The background features blurred wooden structures and soft natural light spots. Light filters through the gaps, creating a hazy halo and bokeh effect, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle upward shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the center on the left side of the frame, gazing upward to the right, forming a strong visual guiding line. The entire scene presents a shallow depth of field, with the subject clearly standing out and the background gradually blurring, enhancing spatial layering. In terms of light and shadow, natural light pours in from above and the sides, soft and bright. At the same time, subtle reflections and highlights are created on the wooden structure and wind chimes. The overall color scheme is mainly warm tones, blending soft shades such as light blue, off-white, light yellow, and orange-red, creating a warm, tranquil, and slightly poetic summer afternoon atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, as if shot by a vintage film camera, with slight graininess and soft color transitions. The lens has a focal length of about 50mm, an aperture of f/1.8, moderate exposure, and a slightly warm tone, presenting a realistic and lifelike feeling of everyday amateur photography. The overall composition conveys an emotional atmosphere where tranquility, devotion, and beautiful wishes intertwine",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
