        {
          "id": "krea2-d0d46062c039e5da94d4fb10",
          "alias": "单女白礼服沙发困倦坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a fabric sofa with deep brown woven patterns, her body slightly turned to the right side of the frame, her head gently turned toward the camera. She wears a white strapless gown with a soft, fluffy skirt, made of multiple layers of lightweight tulle or chiffon, presenting richly layered pleats and a flowing texture. Light softly streams in from the left. This creates a warm and bright highlight area, casting delicate shadows on the right side of the body and the sofa surface, creating a three-dimensional transition of light and shadow that looks casual yet elegant. She wears a pair of uniquely designed silver earrings, composed of multiple geometric shapes, including circular and intersecting lines, inlaid with sparkling crystals or rhinestones that reflect tinks of light in the light. Her makeup is delicate and natural, with a background of hazy light gray or white curtains of light texture with subtle vertical stripes. Through the curtains, soft diffused light can be seen, creating a peaceful and warm atmosphere throughout the scene. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space, the head positioned slightly to the right of the center, creating direct communication with the viewer. The foreground features the character's shoulders, arms, and part of the skirt, rich in detail. The overall color palette is mainly white, beige, light gray, and dark brown. The color coordination is harmonious and unified, with delicate use of light and shadow, creating a tranquil, romantic, and slightly dreamy atmosphere. It feels like a quiet afternoon, with sunlight streaming through the window into the room, capturing the tenderness and beauty of the moment. The image carries a strong artistic sense and emotional expression, like a carefully photographed portrait showcasing a woman's elegant temperament and inner charm",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
