          "id": "krea2-9540901d115cca24a0cf3b29",
          "alias": "单女学生蓝制服街道沉思站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a deep blue Japanese high school girl uniform stands on a steep stone staircase, slightly sideways, gently holding her backpack strap with her left hand and her right hand naturally hanging down, her posture elegant and relaxed. Her uniform jacket features a classic double-breasted design, paired with a white shirt and bow tie underneath, a matching pleated short skirt, black leather shoes and black long socks, and a deep blue backpack with reflective stripes. The overall look is youthful and full of everyday vibes. In the foreground is a staircase paved with yellow paved pavements, with metal handrails extending along both sides. A strong line of lines is formed. The middle view is this winding street extending downward, flanked by typical Japanese-style residential areas. The roofs are mostly gray tiles or corrugated metal panels, walls are mainly off-white and light gray, some houses are dotted with green plants or vines, clear lane markings in the middle of the road, faint pedestrian silhouettes in the distance, and layers upon layers of residential buildings of varying heights, with intricate utility poles and cables interwoven in the air, creating a realistic urban lifestyle. The sky displays a soft gray-white hue. The lighting is uniform and diffuse, with no obvious shadows, suggesting cloudy or cloudy weather. The overall light and shadow are delicate and soft, with a cool yet warm tone. The composition uses a high-angle top-down shot, with the subject positioned slightly to the left below the frame, forming the visual focal point. A long staircase extends from the foreground all the way into the distance, creating a strong sense of depth and perspective, guiding the gaze toward the distant streets and buildings. On the left side of the frame stands a lush green tree, while on the right is a wall covered with yellow-green shrubs. Color layers and spatial contrasts are added, creating an overall atmosphere that is tranquil and slightly nostalgic, as if capturing an ordinary moment after school. It combines the freshness of campus life with the everyday texture of urban living, featuring a strong documentary style and humanistic atmosphere. It feels like casually capturing photos with an old film camera, preserving slight graininess and natural color transitions, presenting a real, simple, and poetic everyday aesthetic",
