        {
          "id": "krea2-7ce3de53307098ae3540a341",
          "alias": "单女蓝高领衫樱花站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beneath a blooming cherry blossom tree, wearing a light blue striped turtleneck knit sweater with delicate ruffled sleeves, paired with an off-white high-waisted short skirt, and a beige beret. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, hands tucked into the skirt pockets, her body slightly turned to reveal soft curves. The overall look is simple yet full of spring vibes, with lush pink cherry blossom branches extending from both sides toward the center of the frame, with flowers blooming densely. The petals are layered, with some branches passing over the figure's head, forming a natural frame structure that creates a dreamlike visual effect. The middle scene depicts the female protagonist's interaction with the cherry tree, positioned slightly to the center of the painting, harmoniously echoing the blooming cherry blossoms in color. The background shows a hazy outline of distant mountains and a pale yellow sky, with wooden fences and withered grass faintly visible in the distance. Light pours down from the upper left, creating a warm golden backlight. Sunlight penetrates the petals, creating a soft halo and bokeh effect. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, blended with soft colors like pink, blue, and white, presenting a nostalgic film texture reminiscent of vintage camera footage, with slight graininess and slight overexposure. The composition uses a classic three-part layout, with the main figures occupying the main position, cherry blossom branches guiding the gaze toward the subject, background blur to highlight the subject, while retaining enough environmental information to enhance the sense of space. The overall atmosphere is warm and romantic, full of spring poetry. Like a beautiful moment in a quiet afternoon among cherry blossoms, it features a strong Japanese photo style, with rich details, rich light and shadow layers, and natural color transitions, conveying a serene and far-reaching life aesthetic of tranquility and tranquil years",
