          "id": "krea2-eadcd0817c145a21782ad9b9",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫街道自信坐展示",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a white metal railing by the city street, wearing a black turtleneck knit top and a gray pencil skirt. Her legs are crossed, one foot resting on the edge of the rusty concrete railing below, the other resting on the crossbar above. Her overall posture is relaxed and natural, showcasing the competence and composure of a city woman. Her legs are smooth and graceful, and she wears black pointed-toe stiletto shoes with subtle textures on the upper. The background is a modern urban architectural complex. The beige exterior walls paired with large glass windows reflect the pale blue tones of the sky. The building's outlines are clear but slightly blurred, creating a shallow depth effect. Green trees dot the area, lush branches and leaves, sunlight filters through the leaves casting mottled shadows. The ground is a gray cement pavement, and the guardrails are made of white metal pipes, with slight wear and rust on the surface. The concrete structure at the bottom shows traces of moss and rust. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly toward the center on the right side of the frame, body in a diagonal posture. A visual guide line is formed, extending from the lower left corner to the upper right. The foreground features rusty concrete railings and some metal railings, the middle ground features the main subject and nearby guardrail structures, the background is blurred buildings and trees, and the light comes from the front left, soft and bright, creating a natural transition of shadows. The overall atmosphere is fresh and full of life, with mainly black, gray, and white tones, accented with green and warm yellow sunlight, presenting the authentic texture of everyday street photography. The images have the graininess and color gradation of film photography, simulating amateur camera shooting Slight noise and color shifts enhance realism, with slight dark corners at the edges of the image highlighting the central subject. The overall composition is balanced and full of tension, conveying a quiet, confident, and independent urban feminine temperament. The details are rich, the lighting and shadows are delicate, and the atmosphere is full of storytelling and artistic atmosphere",
