        {
          "id": "krea2-1b09c4d1155e8e48860de2c4",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫废墟困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a deep path surrounded by dense vegetation. She wears a loose white long-sleeved shirt, black shorts and patterned dark socks, and white sneakers. The overall look is simple yet modern. Her posture is naturally relaxed, standing slightly to the side, her expression slightly contemplative and distant, as if gazing into some invisible distance, adding a touch of movement and vitality. In the foreground, blurred green plant leaves create a soft bokeh effect. These leaves occupy the lower left corner and some edges of the painting, forming a natural frame structure that guides the viewer's gaze to the center. The center is the main subject, positioned slightly to the right, beneath a wooden corridor. The beams and columns of the corridor are dark gray, with surface marks of age, giving a texture reminiscent of abandoned or aged buildings. Light streams through the gaps and above the corridor, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. A few beams of golden sunlight pass through the leaves, spilling onto her body and the ground. It creates a warm and dreamy light spot effect, with the background being a distant forest and shrubs, rich in layers. The colors are mainly dark green and dark green, interspersed with some purple flowers, adding visual color variation. The entire scene presents a tranquil, mysterious, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The composition uses low-angle shots to make the figures appear more upright and present, while also enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The visual guide line is formed by the plant lines in the foreground and the path's direction. The gaze naturally shifts toward the figures and the depths of light and shadow in the distance. The lighting atmosphere centers on warm and cool contrasts. The foreground and background shadows show blue-green tones, while the illuminated areas are bright warm yellow. This alternating mix of warm and cool tones not only enhances the sense of three-dimensionality but also gives the visuals a cinematic narrative quality. The overall style blends everyday documentary photography with artistic expression, as if captured with an old-fashioned film camera at dusk. The camera's slight graininess and natural exposure transitions give the image a sense of realism and warmth. The overall image conveys a sense of loneliness, tranquility, and self-exploration, like a poetic fragment about growth and emptiness, filled with youthful confusion and longing for the future. The tone is restrained yet sophisticated, with rich details. Every light and color serves emotional expression, making one pause and gaze, immersed in this corner forgotten by time.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
