        {
          "id": "krea2-2e2765cf275ad150e7b56474",
          "alias": "单女米连衣裙户外沉思站立比耶",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors in a natural setting, calm and thoughtful. She wears a beige sleeveless dress made of suede or suede, soft in texture. The neckline and waist are adorned with numerous sparkling crystals or rhinestones, forming a V-shape and horizontal belt pattern. These decorations reflect dazzling light in the sunlight. In the foreground, faint dry grass and green plants are visible, with leaf edges outlined by backlight. The middle shot features a female subject, occupying the main position. Her body is slightly turned to the side, her head turned to the side, her posture naturally relaxed. The background is a blurred lake and distant mountains, with the lake hued blue-gray. The distant hillside is covered with dense green vegetation, and a towering tower-shaped building can be faintly seen, possibly a transmission tower or communication tower. The entire shot uses shallow depth of field, with the background completely blurred. In the composition, the figure is positioned slightly to the left, leaving space on the right side to enhance visual guidance and breathability. Light comes from the upper right. It is soft natural light, like the slanting sunlight of evening or early morning, creating a distinct side light effect. The other side is in shadow, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow, highlighting the contours of the figures. The transition of light and shadow is natural, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall color tone leans toward warmth, mainly yellow, brown, and green, with a retro film texture. The color saturation is moderate, details are rich, and the image has a cinematic and artistic feel, as if shot on a professional outdoor scene. Using large-aperture lenses such as f/1.8 or f/ 2.0, capturing delicate skin textures and clothing details while maintaining background blur. Camera specs are close to full-frame mirrorless or medium format cameras, with low ISO and moderate shutter speeds to ensure clean and noise-free images. Overall, it presents an imaging style that is both everyday and artistically beautiful, as if captured in natural light with high-end amateur equipment—real and captivating",
