        {
          "id": "krea2-161408f09e57475c13e1d3bf",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣椅上困倦倚靠阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sat on a vintage wooden chair, leaning slightly forward, intently reading an open book. She wore a loose off-white knit sweater decorated with brown and orange geometric patterns. The sleeves were wide and soft and puffy, with intricate weaves at the neckline and shoulders. Her expression was calm and serene, gently holding the book with both hands, her fingers slender, nails neatly trimmed. She crossed her legs, draped her right leg over her left, bent knees, and naturally drooped calves. Her legs were graceful, and she wore no shoes or socks at her ankles. She presents a natural bare state, sitting relaxed, her back slightly leaned back, leaning against the chair backrest. The chair is a classical-style wooden high-back chair with smooth curves and rounded armrests. The seat is made of dark brown leather with slight wear on the surface, edges decorated with metal studs, and the legs are supported at four corners with simple carvings. The chair rests on a carpet with floral patterns, with a beige base and printed with pink, red, and green flowers and vines, creating a vintage and layered design. In the background is an old-fashioned wooden desk. The surface is smooth and dark brown, with fine scratches and signs of use. Several heavy books are placed on the table, with spines of various colors—deep red, brown, and dark yellow. Next to it is an old film camera with a black body, clearly visible through the lens. Next to it is a black leather bag or backpack. The wall above the desk is light white, with a blurry painting or photo hanging on it. The content is unclear, and the overall lighting is soft and warm. Natural light from the left window pours into the room, creating a bright backlighting effect. Sunlight filters through the curtains, casting a faint halo on the floor and figures, creating a hazy, dreamy atmosphere that enhances three-dimensionality and realism. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, occupying the main visual space. Background elements such as desks, books, and cameras are distributed on the left and back, creating spatial layering. The foreground features the figures and books, the middle ground features chairs and carpets, and the background features desks and walls. The colors in the image are mainly warm tones, including off-white, brown, orange-yellow, and pale pink. The overall tone is harmonious and unified. Moving upward to the bookshelf and camera in the background, a natural visual path is formed. The entire scene is full of artistic atmosphere and nostalgic mood, as if capturing a quiet afternoon. The image texture is delicate and rich, combining the warmth of daily life with a refined and elegant artistic photography feel. Like a film piece shot with a professional camera, it carries a strong cinematic feel and storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
