          "id": "krea2-4368454bcd668b56afa191db",
          "alias": "单女粉短裙庭院愤怒站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at the entrance of a rustic Chinese courtyard, her expression slightly thoughtful. Her overall aura is gentle yet slightly artistic, wearing a light pink long-sleeved top made of light, smooth material with a subtle sheen. She pairs a high-waisted pink semi-transparent tulle skirt with a light and flowing hem, subtly revealing her leg lines, appearing both elegant and sophisticated. Her right hand hangs naturally, while her left hand gently holds a small light blue handbag. The bag is simple and rounded, made of smooth material, with metal fasteners and slender handles. The strap is a wide black shoulder strap with white circular decorations, slung diagonally over the shoulder, creating a visual contrast and balance. She wears a thin silver chain bracelet on her wrist, and a simple ring on her finger. The details highlight a sense of refinement. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, her body slightly turned to the side, her head facing the camera, and her posture is naturally relaxed, as if she has just stopped, gazing or waiting for something. On the left side of the foreground is a blurry red umbrella-shaped object with irregular edges. For example, traditional architectural parasols or decorations are brightly colored but blurred, adding a splash of brightness and layering to the scene. Some yellow objects are also visible, possibly lanterns or other decorations, further enhancing the cultural atmosphere. The middle features gray brick walls and a dark brown wooden door. The door frame is heavy, with textures and mottled marks left by time. Inside, the lighting is dim, creating a strong contrast of light and dark. Next to the door is a finely carved stone pedestal with faint traditional patterns. This adds a sense of history and cultural depth. The floor is a gray-white stone slab step with a rough texture and slight wear on the edges, showing signs of long-term use. The background features continuous brick walls and architectural structures, with gray and brown tones as the main tones, creating a calm and elegant atmosphere. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure as the absolute subject placed in the visual focal point. The shallow depth of field effect blurs the background and foreground, highlighting the character's image. At the same time, through color contrast—the collision between pink clothing and the gray background and red foreground elements— Enhancing the visual appeal of the image, the light and shadow come from natural light, with the light source shining from the front left to increase the sense of three-dimensionality. At the same time, soft shadows are cast on the floor and walls. The overall lighting is bright but not glaring, presenting a warm afternoon sunshine atmosphere. The atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, combining the fashion vibe of modern urban women with the charm of traditional Eastern culture. The overall color tone is soft, mainly pink, gray, and brown, accented with red and blue. The color combination is harmonious and unified, resulting in a delicate texture in the image. With the graininess of film photography and slight overexposure, it simulates the effect of real camera shooting, like shooting with an old film camera on a clear daytime, capturing a moment in daily life with the authenticity and artistic beauty of everyday recording",
