          "id": "krea2-8a2553a46ff14b572b190996",
          "alias": "单女蓝和服竹林忧伤站立展示",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a blue-and-white kimono printed with radiating blue patterns, showcasing the beauty of traditional Japanese dyeing and weaving craftsmanship. She stands slightly to the side, her expression slightly contemplative and melancholic. Her makeup is exquisite, and her overall posture is elegant and restrained. The foreground features the main subject occupying most of the space, from above the chest, with medium to close shots in the composition. The figure is positioned near the center on the right side of the painting, with a large left space to create visual balance The background is a dim indoor environment, with faint bamboo screens or partitions. Sunlight streams in from the left, casting mottled light and shadow on the walls and figures, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. Light shines from the upper left, while the left half is in shadow, creating a strong sense of three-dimensionality and dramatic atmosphere. The light and shadow form irregular light spots and stripes on the kimono, enhancing the layering and dynamic feel of the image. The background is blurred to highlight the main figure, while retaining some environmental details to enhance the realism of the scene. The overall color scheme is mainly cool, with blue and white as the main tones, contrasting with the warm golden sunlight, creating a tranquil, gentle, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The image has the texture of film photography, with slight graininess and moderate color saturation, resembling everyday moments shot with an old-fashioned camera. The composition emphasizes asymmetry aesthetics, filling the entire scene with Eastern aesthetics, combining the elegance of traditional clothing with modern emotional expression, presenting a tranquil, introspective, and poetic atmosphere. It was as if capturing a tranquil moment as the afternoon sunlight poured down, allowing one to feel the slow flow of time and inner peace",
