        {
          "id": "krea2-71a51922d64ccc67cb477c9b",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣街道俏皮倚靠摆拍",
          "prompt": "On a city street as night falls, a woman leans against a metal railing in a half-squatting pose, becoming the absolute focal point of the scene. She wears an off-white thick cable knit sweater with clearly visible fabric textures, naturally draped cuffs, and a light and flowing black lace-trimmed skirt underneath. She pairs knee-high beige striped stockings with brown leather loafers, with soft ankle lines, and the overall look combines collegiate style with urban flair. Her left hand gently touches the edge of the frame, while her right hand rests naturally on the railing. Her body leans slightly to the side for dynamic balance, showing an effortless laziness and playfulness. The foreground focuses on the skin at her knee bends and the details of the folds in her socks. The ground is a dark gray stone pavement, with faint reflections of surrounding lights. The right railing has a cool gray metallic texture with clean and sharp lines. The middle frame extends to the blurred outlines of streets and buildings behind her, with tall buildings rising in the distance. Warm yellow light and cool white neon glow intertwine through windows to create dreamlike light spots, while the background completely blurs into bokeh halos, creating a shallow depth of field effect. The composition is shot at a slightly upward angle, with the figure occupying two-thirds of the frame. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and hazy, with artificial light sources from the front and upper sides illuminating the subject, creating a transition between soft highlights and natural shadows. The sweater folds contrast sharply with the skin on the legs, while the city lights in the background use soft focus to evoke the romantic mood of a romantic urban night. The overall color scheme leans toward warm yellow tones, with moderate saturation and a slight film graininess, presenting a style reminiscent of Japanese street or cinematic portraits. It is both lively and artistically dynamic, as if capturing a poetic and surprising moment on an ordinary night, allowing viewers to feel the gentleness and vitality within urban loneliness. The visuals are rich in layers, progressing from clothing textures and skin gloss to background light spots, creating an immersive visual experience that is both realistic and imaginative, as if one can hear the subtle sounds intertwining the city's noise with inner tranquility.",
