        {
          "id": "krea2-d092729ea78b47454ea27b98",
          "alias": "单女米长裤水边沉思站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by a tranquil lakeside, sunlight filtering through the leaves and falling on her, creating a soft and warm natural glow. She wore a long-sleeved V-neck top with an off-white base and deep blue rose floral pattern. The chest tie design cleverly cinched her waist, and the fabric was light and flowing, gently swaying in the breeze, subtly revealing her slender waistline. Paired with a simple cream-colored high-waisted wide-leg pants, the overall style is gentle and vintage yet modern. As if silently telling or contemplating, it conveys a quiet yet storytelling atmosphere. The foreground focuses on her upper body, while the background is blurred to present a hazy lush greenery—in the distance is the outline of dense forests, up close are shimmering water surfaces, with scattered lotus leaves or reeds floating on the water, and the interplay of light and shadow creates a dreamlike depth effect. The composition uses a medium close-up perspective, with the character positioned slightly to the left, body slightly turned but head facing the camera, with the gaze reaching straight into the viewer's heart, forming a progressive visual narrative path. The overall color palette of the painting is mainly warm yellow and blue-green, with light coming from the upper side. The soft backlighting outlines the golden halo at the edges of her silhouette, enhancing the sense of depth. The lighting and shadow atmosphere combines the laziness and poetic romance of a summer afternoon. The air seems filled with the scent of grass and flowers, and the entire scene resembles a slow-motion clip from a film film, full of nostalgic filter texture, with slight grainy noise and soft-focus effects. It feels like shooting with an old digital camera at dusk, capturing the most casual yet touching moments in life. There are no obvious props distracting the painting, only natural elements surrounding the scene, reinforcing the theme of harmonious coexistence between humans and the environment. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, healing, and emotionally powerful, evoking youth, memories, and unfinished stories, quietly blooming with artistic momentary beauty in the ordinary corners of daily life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
