        {
          "id": "krea2-96153a764bb6d7b1c265362e",
          "alias": "单女灰连衣裙城市困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the center of a modern industrial-style underground passage or bridge structure, wearing a simple and elegant light gray long dress adorned with black trim at the collar and cuffs, a black crossbody bag on her shoulder, and dark boots—the overall look combines urban flair with artistic flair. It carries a slightly messy aesthetic, creating subtle contrasts in a cool-toned environment; Her body turns slightly, her right hand naturally hanging at her side, her left hand lightly resting on her waist, her posture relaxed yet full of tension, as if she is briefly pausing and gazing amidst the noise; The background is a hazy yet layered warm orange dusk halo, like the sunset's afterglow filtering through the cracks in the metal structure, creating a hazy, dreamy atmosphere; The foreground features a deep black wooden floor texture that clearly extends to the bottom of the frame, forming a visual anchor point with the figure's legs; The middle ground features symmetrically arranged metal railings and supporting structures on both sides, with sharp lines bearing slight rust or wear marks, hinting at the marks of use and the passage of time; The distant view is at the end of the soft-focused corridor, with faint orange warning conical barrels and white reflective strips adding details to the scene; The entire composition uses a low-angle downward angle, making the figures appear upright and imposing, while the sense of depth in the passage enhances the spatial dimension of the image; The light mainly comes from the side backlight at the upper and rear sides, outlining the figure's outline and giving it a sense of depth, while the front of the body retains moderate shadows to enhance drama; The overall contrast of light and shadow is strong, with delicate transitions between light and shadow, creating a poetic urban atmosphere that is both lonely and tranquil, both realistic and transcendent; The color palette is mainly gray-black, complemented by a warm orange background as the visual focal point, creating a visual tension of a clash of cool and warm tones; The image quality closely resembles that of professional photography equipment, but with slight film graininess and color shifts, simulating the true performance of amateur cameras in specific environments. This presents a unique aesthetic style that lies between artistic creation and everyday documentation, emphasizing emotional expression rather than pure realism, allowing viewers to feel the characters' complex inner feelings and the passage of time in the space.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
