        {
          "id": "krea2-43bce6f8ee39a1840708a9d8",
          "alias": "单女女仆女仆装花园躺展示",
          "prompt": "A female character, dressed in an exquisite maid outfit, lies gracefully pronely on a lush green lawn evenly bathed in sunlight. She tied a delicate white bow on her chest, layered with a white lace lingerie, and a pale purple satin bow waistband at her waist. She wore matching lace gloves on her wrists, with blue-gray nail polish applied to her fingertips. Her hands were folded on the grass in front of her chest, making her look both delicate and dignified. Her legs stretched back, wearing black knee-high boots, the heels of the boots clearly visible, creating a striking contrast with the ground and adding a visual extension to the scene; In the foreground is a grass shining especially brightly under the sunlight, with every blade clearly visible, showcasing the vitality of nature; The middle shot is the space occupied by this female subject, whose body curves and clothing details are fully displayed under light and shadow, becoming the visual focal point of the entire composition; The background is a blurred outdoor environment, with a faint white pole-like object and the outline of a dark fence or wall in the distance. The light comes from the front above, creating bright daylight illumination. The shadows are soft yet three-dimensional, and the overall atmosphere is warm and fresh, full of the lazy and pleasant mood of a summer afternoon. At the same time, the clothing style and character expressions exude a touch of sweetness and dreaminess, as if immersed in a fairy-tale garden. The entire scene looks as if a high-end digital camera was shot under natural light. The image quality is delicate and sharp, with moderate color saturation, preserving real-world light and shadow transitions and textured textures, presenting a visual experience that combines artistic beauty with everyday photography texture.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
