        {
          "id": "krea2-42e6be6ed4aecc831d07e059",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道忧伤倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman leans against a thick, weathered old tree trunk, her body slightly turned and her head naturally tilted, adding a touch of casualness and authenticity; She wore an off-white loose shirt with a loose base featuring delicate pale yellow floral patterns. The collar was slightly open and the cuffs naturally draped down, paired with dark blue high-waisted jeans. The overall outfit was simple and comfortable, presenting an effortless elegance in everyday life; The foreground is the tree trunk occupying about one-third of the left side of the painting, with rough and cracked bark and traces of time, a strong texture and tactile feel, forming a natural contrast with the figure's skin; In the middle shot, the figure is the main subject; she stands relaxed, her body pressed close to the tree trunk, arms naturally hanging down or lightly resting at her waist, creating an intimate yet slightly distant spatial relationship; The background features a blurred modern architectural wall and window outline. The window frame lines are clear but blurred due to shallow depth of field, creating cold-toned geometric shadows and interlaced light spots. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves and falls on the wall, creating rich layers of light and shadow and delicate transitions that enhance the sense of three-dimensionality and atmosphere. The composition uses vertical shots, with the figure positioned on the right side and tree trunks serving as visual guides extending from the lower left corner to the upper center, forming a stable and dynamic triangular structure. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, healing, and nostalgic, with the characteristic grainy noise and slight fading characteristic of film photography. The color saturation is relatively low, while the background buildings appear in blue-gray tones, creating a tranquil moment as afternoon sunlight filters through the shaded trees. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm yet slightly melancholic, with light slanting from the upper right to enhance the texture of the skin and the realistic fabric folds; The entire image is full of life and artistic flair, as if capturing a chance encounter on an ordinary afternoon street and alley. It combines cinematic narrative rhythm with the authentic grains and slightly defocused edges of amateur equipment, offering a warm, soft, and unadorned emotional resonance. The details are exquisite yet unadorned, conveying a poetic mood of \"seeking a moment of peace in the bustling city.\"",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
