        {
          "id": "krea2-ac61c5ea7e23f440995e9213",
          "alias": "单女蓝旗袍俏皮坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright beside an antique red wooden railing, wearing a fresh and elegant light blue modified qipao-style dress. The neckline and cuffs are trimmed with dark green, the chest adorned with three delicate dark green four-leaf clover-shaped buttons, and the slit on one side of the dress is also tied with a matching tie knot, blending modern simplicity with Eastern classical charm. Her left hand rests naturally on the stone steps behind her, her posture calm and tinged with a hint of lazy playfulness. She tilted her head slightly to gaze at the camera, a pair of uniquely designed green tassel earrings hanging, shimmering with delicate luster in the sunlight. In the foreground, she leans on gray stone steps and the bright, striking vermilion railing. The railing lines are simple and powerful, forming a striking color contrast that serves as a visual guide guiding the viewer's attention to the main figure. The middle ground features the full figure of the figure and the blurred architectural structure behind it, with faint glimpses of traditional Chinese flying eaves and dougong brackets, along with lush green trees in the distance, creating a rich sense of spatial depth. The background is further blurred, presenting soft light spots and hazy tree shadows, enhancing the focal point of the scene while imparting a poetic atmosphere. The entire composition uses medium to near shots, with the figure positioned near the golden ratio point slightly to the right, leaving just the right amount of blank space. The light comes from the front left, soft and bright, typical of daytime natural light, creating delicate transitions and a sense of three-dimensionality. The light and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with a mottled feeling created by afternoon sunlight filtering through the leaves. The overall color palette is mainly blue, red, gray, and green, harmonious yet impactful, creating a tranquil beauty that is both retro and elegant, full of youthful vitality. The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if shot by a professional-grade digital camera under natural light. The details are clear, presenting a high level of artistic expression that everyday hobbyist equipment cannot match, yet still retaining a sense of familiarity and authenticity in everyday life, as if capturing a beautiful moment blooming unexpectedly in an ordinary afternoon.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
