        {
          "id": "krea2-c3db836c45c2be67bff6e5d7",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫温柔坐注视",
          "prompt": "A female character wears a white short-sleeved shirt and black tie in a Japanese campus style, paired with dark sports shorts. She sits on the wooden floor, looking naturally relaxed, with legs slightly curled. Her right hand gently pulls the edge of white knee-high stockings, her left hand supports her ankle, and her bare foot reveals toes painted with deep blue nail polish. She wears a simple metal collar around her neck, giving her an overall look that balances innocence and maturity. The foreground focuses on the white stockings she is wearing, her bare feet, and the texture of the wooden floor. The floor has a warm brown tone, with the wood grain clearly visible, and the surface softly reflecting under light. On the left edge is a blue backpack and a pair of brown leather shoes, hinting at everyday campus life. In the middle is her full figure sitting cross-legged, slightly leaning forward, her gaze directly on the camera, creating an intimate and interactive atmosphere. After blurring the background, a blooming pink cherry tree can be faintly seen, its petals fluttering in the wind, its branches strong and powerful. The tree shadow on the right casts dappled light on the ground, and in the distance, traditional Japanese garden elements such as stone lantern outlines and blurred architectural structures can be faintly seen, creating distinct spatial layers; The composition uses a low-angle downward perspective to highlight the subject's position, with the central left position concentrating the core movements of the characters, forming a stable and dynamic visual guideline; The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, with the main light source coming from the upper right. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, falling onto her skin and clothing, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow and three-dimensionality. At the same time, delicate shadow transitions are created between the wooden floor and the figure's legs. The overall color palette is mainly warm brown, pinkish white, and deep black, creating a tranquil and cozy campus atmosphere on a spring afternoon. The image texture is delicate and authentic, with slight film graininess and natural noise, as if shot with amateur equipment yet full of artistic beauty. The details are rich yet retaining the vitality of life, conveying youthful and Innocence, naturalness, and a slightly lazy everyday mood.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
