        {
          "id": "krea2-1fa161b43879e4f486aee43f",
          "alias": "单女礼服婚礼站立回眸",
          "prompt": "A bride dressed in a delicate lace embroidered wedding dress stands sideways by the bright window, her back to the camera and slightly turning her head to look back. She tightly holds a bouquet of plump, blooming pink peonies, with layers of petals softly and full, green leaves adding vitality and layers; The wedding dress was in light champagne or off-white, made of lightweight tulle material. The hollowed-out back design was inlaid with intricate gold thread embroidery and three-dimensional floral patterns. The skirt was voluminous and elegant, naturally draping down to the floor, with light and shadow outlining delicate textures and flowing folds; The foreground focuses on the skirt hem and bouquet below the bride's waist, with petal details clearly visible and edges softly blended into a hazy transition; The middle frame shows the bride's slender waist, shoulder contours, and part of the back curve, with embroidery patterns faintly visible against the backlight; The background features large areas of pure white curtains or floor-to-ceiling windows, with light slanting in from the right to create soft, diffused glow.",
