        {
          "id": "krea2-061cbe50a41d863c88c89281",
          "alias": "单女棕上衣椅上俏皮坐",
          "prompt": "The guitar's wood grain is delicate and smooth, with a deep brown rim and pale yellow top forming a soft contrast. The frets on the neck are clearly visible, and the overall design is classic and vintage, exuding a warm handmade feel. In the foreground, her bare legs naturally overlap on the chair, her toes lightly touching the ground, barefoot on the smooth wooden floor. Her skin is fair and delicate, her legs long and soft, adding a touch of casual laziness and authenticity; In the middle of the scene, she sits on a wooden chair with simple and stable legs, the backrest faintly visible, and a huge off-white plush teddy bear leaning beside it. Its fluffy texture forms a soft visual contrast with the figure; In the background is a large window, outside where lush trees sway gently in the wind. Soft natural light filters through the translucent pale yellow curtains, creating bright and even indoor lighting. A small pot of green plants is placed along the windowsill, its pot in terracotta color, its leaves vibrant and vibrant; Below the window is a wooden bookshelf neatly arranged with colorful books, each spine of different colors, adding a touch of everyday life; On the top shelf are several adorable cartoon dolls, including a yellow bear, blue Doraemon, and other small characters. Their bright colors and adorable designs create a playful and cozy atmosphere; The entire composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. The shallow depth of field effect slightly blurs the background to highlight the subject; Light and shadow come from the left window direction, with soft side light outlining the figure's outline and the folds of clothing. The guitar's surface reflects a delicate sheen, while the floor casts a gentle shadow, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, off-white, and light pink, accented with green plants, creating a quiet, healing, and youthful, artistic afternoon atmosphere. It feels as if time has frozen at this moment, music is about to start or just end, and the visuals are filled with the poetry and artistic beauty of everyday life. It's like shooting with amateur equipment yet possessing professional-level soft texture and emotional expression, allowing people to feel pure beauty and inner peace.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
