        {
          "id": "krea2-45268a9a8a5afc5957dbc58f",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫厨房冷淡坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly on a white kitchen countertop, her body slightly turned, as if lost in thought or gazing at the morning light outside the window. Her right hand gently holds a black ceramic mug. The body is simple, the rim slightly tilted, hinting at whether she has just taken a sip or is about to taste a hot drink. Her left hand rests naturally on her waist, slender fingers lightly touching the fabric, presenting a lazy and relaxed posture that adds softness and spontaneity. She wears an off-white turtleneck knit crop top that hugs her figure and outlines smooth curves. She pairs a red and black plaid pleated mini skirt with delicate white lace trim along the hem, creating a striking color contrast and a retro collegiate vibe. On her feet, she wears a pair of simple white cotton socks that reveal her long calf lines. In the black, white, and gray tones, she appears especially pure and soft. The foreground focuses on the details of her legs and feet, especially the left leg bent and raised, while the right leg hangs naturally for a dynamic balance. The middle frame shows the waist-to-knee area, where the folds and skin transitions naturally. Light and shadow fall softly on the waist and abdomen, highlighting a healthy posture. The background is a neat and orderly modern kitchen space. Above is a large white cabinet panel with a smooth, seamless surface. Hidden LED light strips faintly shine through cabinet gaps, emitting a uniform cool white light. Below are dark matte cabinet doors that reflect faint light reflections from the environment. The walls are paved with light gray marble tiles, which are delicate and layered. On the right countertop are a natural wood cutting board, a black metal faucet, and a bottle of white cleaner. Though there are few items, they are full of everyday life. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot to enhance the subject's presence and visual impact. At the same time, the tabletop is used as a horizontal dividing line, naturally dividing the scene into upper and lower parts. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, forming a stable visual center and creating a sense of depth and space. The light mainly comes from a hidden light strip at the top left and a mixed source of natural light outside the window, softly and evenly casting light and shadow on the figure, creating a subtle transition between light and dark, especially on her arm, Delicate highlights and shadows are created along the legs and hem edges, enhancing the three-dimensional effect. The overall atmosphere is calm, warm, and slightly intimate, blending the everyday life atmosphere with the refined beauty of artistic photography. The image conveys a leisurely state of morning or afternoon leisure, as if time stands still at this moment, with only the aroma of coffee and inner thoughts flowing silently. The entire image presents a highly realistic and everyday feel, as if taken by a regular phone camera under natural indoor light, with slight noise and color deviation, yet rich in details and exquisite composition, full of storytelling and emotional warmth, perfectly blending modern home aesthetics with personal life aesthetics.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
