        {
          "id": "krea2-86230855f04b7c78ffaa4ec0",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣床温柔蹲注视",
          "prompt": "A tranquil indoor scene full of life and gentle ambiance, captured from a high angle of a woman squatting on a green carpet. She wears a fluffy, thick off-white knit cardigan adorned with small orange and green floral embroidery patterns. The cuffs and collar are decorated with three-dimensional pom-poms, paired with dark blue slightly flared jeans and black casual shoes, head slightly lowered. Her right hand gently strokes a black-and-white cat beside her, curled up at the edge of the carpet, looking relaxed. The focus is on the intimate moments of interaction between the characters and their pets; In the foreground, the woman's bent knees, naturally hanging arms, and the cat's back being petted, are arranged with slanted diagonal lines to naturally guide the gaze to the main movement area; In the middle is a dark green carpet covered with zebra patterns, with clear textures. The carpet edges reveal a corner of the wooden floor, while the background is a dim corner of the room. Colorful fabric decorations on the bed or sofa can be faintly seen, including red polka dot elements and geometric patterns, creating an overall sense of space that feels somewhat cramped but cozy. The lighting and shadow treatment has a cinematic feel, with the main light source coming from the upper left of the frame. The soft and warm yellow tone illuminates women's sweaters, arms, and cat fur, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow contour lighting, while casting heavy shadows on carpets and walls to create a private late-night home atmosphere; The overall tone leans toward a warm brownish-yellow with a slight film grain texture, moderate color saturation, highlighting the soft texture of knitwear and the delicate texture of cat fur; The visual guide extends from the woman's hand gestures petting the cat to the cat's body, then forms a visual extension through the zebra pattern on the carpet. The atmosphere is quiet, healing, everyday, and full of emotional warmth, as if time has frozen at this moment, conveying a sense of solitude away from the noise. It carries a strong aesthetic of life and vintage film photography style. The details are rich yet not cluttered, and every element serves to create a genuine and tangible emotional space, evoking the warm moments spent late at night with beloved pets. The entire scene exudes a lazy, comfortable, and secure home atmosphere.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
