        {
          "id": "krea2-4538e92b7bee304b7005a1b1",
          "alias": "单女制服广场忧伤坐出神",
          "prompt": "A person dressed in a classic Japanese school uniform sits quietly on a wooden bench in the school corridor, head slightly lowered, as if lost in thought. Beside her sits a black canvas travel bag, her hands naturally resting on her knees, legs gently crossed, wearing white socks and black leather shoes. Sunlight streams in from the right window, casting soft, warm light on her body and the floor, illuminating the bright red bow tie at the collar of her white shirt and the pleated details of the deep blue vest skirt. In the background is a bulletin board covered with colorful promotional posters and notices, featuring Japanese titles and images like \"GOOD JOGI,\" creating an authentic campus atmosphere. Above the bulletin board is a light-colored wall, below is a brown upholstered wall skirt, and on the left extends another empty wooden bench. The floor is made of gray-and-white square tiles, with window frames in dark green. The overall composition adopts a slightly tilted perspective, giving the image a sense of dynamism and spatial depth. Light pours from the upper right to create a contrast of light and shadow. Highlighting the figure's outline and the materiality of clothing, the colors are mainly the blue and white of school uniforms, accented with red bow ties and warm yellow sunlight streaming through the window, creating a tranquil, nostalgic, and slightly youthful melancholy atmosphere. The entire image presents a natural realism reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment, with slight film grain and soft focus effects, as if capturing an unnoticed moment after school or between classes, full of life and delicate emotional expression.",
