        {
          "id": "krea2-500d0c50ff8fce5207a98eac",
          "alias": "单女牛仔海滩倚靠",
          "prompt": "The surface shows fine cracks and mottled marks, creating a three-dimensional shadow transitioning between light and dark under strong light; The middle ground shows her complete silhouette, fully presented from ankles to the top of her head. Her legs are long and straight, knees slightly bent for a dynamic look, and the lines of her legs are smooth and tight. The background is a vast, boundless blue sky—pure, clear, and cloudless. The horizon faintly reveals the calm and profound color of the ocean, blending naturally with the tones of the sea and sky. In the distance, faint silhouettes of city buildings or ships appear on the horizon. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, placing the figure slightly above the center of the frame. The wide-angle lens stretches spatial sense to enhance visual impact, while the foreground embankment guides the viewer to focus on the main subject; The visual guide line extends from the edge of the embankment to the figures' legs, then converges upward to the heads and arm movements, creating a strong sense of depth and rhythm of movement; The lighting atmosphere presents a strong daytime outdoor natural light effect. The sun is positioned diagonally above the figure, brightly and evenly spreading throughout, while the shadowed areas transition smoothly without stiffness. The overall image is highly saturated and contrasting, with colors mainly the sky's deep blue, the sea's emerald green, warm white clothing, and denim blue as the main tones, creating a fresh, bright, and free-spirited summer seaside vacation atmosphere; The image quality leans toward a professional-grade photography style, with detailed detailing that retains natural realism rather than excessive post-processing, presenting an aesthetic that is both artistically expressive and close to everyday amateur equipment.",
