        {
          "id": "krea2-a129f0da8fc83744ad6701d8",
          "alias": "单女灰T恤客厅困倦坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the living room carpet, legs crossed, a softly colored geometric pillow resting on her knees. She wears a loose gray-white collegiate T-shirt with the word \"COLLEGE\" printed on the chest and a vintage badge pattern. The sleeves hang naturally, revealing slender arms and wrists; Her right hand gripped an old-fashioned gray game controller, with the controller cable hanging naturally at her side, while her left hand was raised high, making a victorious fist clench. The sofa is covered with various styles, including a plush pad with red and white stripes, a geometric pattern mat with blue-green gradients, and a glowing five-pointed star. The light emits a soft glow of pink, purple, and blue, adding a dreamy atmosphere to the entire scene. The feature wall is gently enveloped by warm orange-pink gradient lighting, while the wall panels display a light green vertical strip texture, creating a striking contrast and harmonious unity with the sofa; The floor is covered with a geometric carpet featuring red and white lines, with faint off-white edges visible, visually extending the bare ankles beneath the characters' feet; The entire composition centers on the character, using a slightly overhead medium to close-up perspective, allowing viewers to clearly see her expressions and movement details while preserving the rich layers of the surrounding environment; Visual guidance begins with the character's raised arm, the gaze naturally transitions to the game controller in her hand, and finally is drawn by the colorful light and shadow flowing in the background, forming an emotional progression from the inside out; The lighting atmosphere is warm and dynamic, with clear contours. The neon light strips and string lights in the background create a dreamy alternating effect of warm and cool light effects, creating an immersive home entertainment scene; The overall color palette is mainly warm orange and pink, paired with the sofa's red and the green of the background wall, creating a strong color collision and visual tension, while achieving emotional balance through soft lighting transitions and the characters' warm expressions; The image quality is delicate and realistic, as if shot with amateur equipment, featuring slight noise and natural motion blur, simulating the intimacy of real life moments rather than overly polished commercial blockbusters; The atmosphere is relaxed and pleasant, full of modern youth's love for gaming and self-expression. It combines the casual feeling of daily life with artistic composition and emotional rendering, evoking a free, joyful, and unconventional attitude toward life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
