        {
          "id": "krea2-9b72848932cf9025bb29b5b2",
          "alias": "单女米外套雪地害羞站立注视",
          "prompt": "On a vast snowy plain, a woman turns her back to the camera and glances back. Her figure becomes the focal point of the scene. She wears a fluffy, soft beige shearling hooded short jacket paired with matching shorts, creating a warm and playful look. The body is compact and delicate, adorned with several strings of sparkling icicle decorations that glow with a cool sheen in the glow; She wears black knee-high boots with white plush knee pads above the shaft, tied with a black bow, creating a contrasting yet harmonious look with the overall warm tone; Her right hand gently holds a small gray-white plaid glove, her fingertips curled slightly, as if just taken out of a pocket or about to be put on. This gesture gives the scene a dynamic, everyday detail; Her expression is calm yet slightly shy, conveying the gentle and reserved emotions unique to winter. In the foreground is the snow-covered ground where she stands, with a smooth and fine surface with slight dents and footprint marks in some areas. On the right side, a white wooden fence stretches across the edge of the frame, its clean lines guiding the gaze into the distance; In the middle is a vast, continuous snowy hill and sparse trees, with snow-covered canopies and branches outlining clear silhouettes in cool tones. In the distance, a few low buildings or farmhouse rooftops can be faintly seen, adding a touch of everyday life to this empty space; The background features rolling distant mountains, the ridge lines faintly visible through the mist, the mountaintops covered in pure white snow, and the sky is covered with vast gray-blue clouds, with faint daylight filtering through the gaps, creating an open yet slightly lonely atmosphere; The entire composition adopts a medium to long-range perspective, with the figure positioned about one-third to the right of the frame, following the rule of thirds to reserve ample space to depict the environment and achieve a \"unity\" visual balance; Nature naturally guides the viewer's gaze from the main subject to distant mountains and the sky; In terms of light and shadow, the overall lighting is soft and even, scattered light on cloudy days without strong shadows, but the back and shoulders show subtle transitions of light and shadow depending on the light source. The folds of clothing have delicate reflections, and the snow surface reflects a cold silvery sheen; The atmosphere blends the tranquility of winter, the grandeur of nature, and the gentle charm of the characters. It combines the meticulously arranged fashion feel of a studio with the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment. The color palette mainly features warm and cool contrasts, with beige, white, and black as the main tones, accented with a touch of green vegetation and deep blue sky. The color saturation is moderate, not glaring but full of layers. The entire image exudes a healing winter romantic vibe, like a snapshot capturing travel moments, yet carefully composed and polished in post-processing. Presenting cinematic narrative beauty and poetic life, it makes one imagine the freedom and tranquility she feels as she walks through the snow, as well as the warmth and comfort this winter outfit brings.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
