        {
          "id": "krea2-a78e3d7e00712faace828857",
          "alias": "单女绿衬衫城市微笑坐持杯",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a cozy vintage-style café, wearing a pair of delicate, compact round metal glasses, looking cheerful and relaxed. Her right hand gently holds a deep brown mug with a coarse ceramic texture. The rim of the rim glows with a natural glaze sheen, the body features irregular hand-fired patterns, and the handle has a delicate matte texture; Her left hand rests casually on the wooden tabletop, and on her wrist is a brown leather woven bracelet—simple yet full of everyday life. She wore a loose olive green cotton shirt with sleeves rolled up to the elbows, layered with a gray crew-neck knit top. The fabric was soft and comfortable, with naturally draped pleats. The overall look was understated yet layered, exuding the everyday vibe of an artistic youth. In the foreground is a dark brown wooden tabletop, smooth and warm, with faint wood grain visible. On the table sits a transparent glass coffee pot decorated with amber wooden clasps, with a small amount of coffee left inside, a small white tissue nearby, and faint coffee stains, hinting at the enjoyment of just finished coffee. In the center is the green diamond-patterned soft-padded sofa chair she sits on. The back is made of deep olive green suede, with a clear and three-dimensional diamond-quilted texture that feels soft and thick to the touch. The backrest lines are smooth and elegant, creating a visual harmony with the figure. Above the background is a pale gray-white wall, with a simply mounted painting framed in natural wood. The text faintly shows the German word \"GERHARD RICHTER\" in neat and elegant handwriting, with a few lines of blurry text below, creating an artistic atmosphere without overshadowing the main focus. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, naturally guiding the viewer to focus on her radiant smile and the cup in her hand, creating a strong visual focal point. The camera takes a slightly overhead shot, making the footage more intimate and immersive. The light comes from a soft, diffused light source on the left front, enhancing the sense of depth; The feature wall and sofa are in slightly darker shaded areas, highlighting the main figure through contrast of light and shadow, creating a warm and comfortable indoor atmosphere. The overall color palette is dominated by low-saturation olive green, beige gray, and dark brown, complemented by warm yellow tones for light and shadow transitions, presenting a cinematic-quality film texture. It features slight grainy noise and soft-focus effects, rich in color layers without being glaring, full of Japanese artistic aesthetics and a sense of everyday ritual. The atmosphere in the images is peaceful, healing, and lazy, as if time is gently stretched out in this moment, allowing people to feel the purest moments of happiness in ordinary life—a hot drink, a smile, a sofa, an artistic signature on the wall, together forming a poetic slice of slow-paced urban life, rich in emotional resonance and visual appeal. Suitable for shooting with amateur equipment such as phones or small cameras, it pursues authenticity and naturalness rather than overly polished imagery, capturing emotions rather than staged poses. It is a life aesthetic moment that moves hearts without words.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
