        {
          "id": "krea2-5239acf8c357370787acf8b1",
          "alias": "单女白袜子室内困倦坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits behind a round wooden table covered with a light pink pleated tablecloth. She wears a loose, comfortable light blue long-sleeve sweatshirt, paired with white knee-high socks and a pair of white sneakers with cartoon patterns. The word \"EMENTS\" shows at her ankles, giving the whole look a lazy, everyday vibe. On the table sat a vintage red dial telephone, round and full, with the receiver placed on the tabletop, and a slender white wire hanging down to the floor. Behind her was a dark brown wooden chair, with an orange plaid cloth bag draped over its back. The metal fasteners of the bag shimmered faintly under the light. The background features large areas of pink draped curtains, made of soft and heavy fabric, creating a warm yet slightly hazy visual barrier. The entire scene is lighted softly and evenly, coming from the front and above, creating a cozy indoor afternoon atmosphere, with subtle soft-focus transitions at the edges of figure silhouettes, tablecloth folds, and floor shadows. The composition uses a medium shot, slightly overhead, placing the figure slightly to the left of the center. The foreground highlights the delicate folds of the tablecloth and the bright red contrast of the telephone. The middle ground shows the figure's posture and clothing details, while the background uses a unified color tone to enhance spatial depth. The overall lighting and shadows present a film-like warm filter, with moderate color saturation leaning toward pink-orange tones, giving the image a nostalgic yet slightly dreamy mood. The visual guidance starts with a telephone in the background and extends to the gentle enveloping effect created by the background curtains. The atmosphere is tranquil, intimate, and narrative, as if capturing a moment waiting for a call or falling into memories. It is both lively and refined, like shooting with an old digital camera under soft indoor lighting, preserving natural noise and slight exposure deviations to present a realistic and gentle image quality.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
