        {
          "id": "krea2-53de9534e1b0ec993d197420",
          "alias": "单女绿西装摄影棚沉思站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a solid-colored warm brown background, wearing a neatly tailored dark green short blazer. The jacket reaches the upper thigh, with a slightly flared A-shaped hem. The smooth, reflective tops and high, high-toed heels highlight her leg lines; The entire composition uses a full-body vertical portrait style, with the figure standing slightly centered to the right, body slightly tilted, head slightly tilted, creating a subtle asymmetrical beauty. The lighting and shadow atmosphere are warm and slightly dramatic, while a slight shadow on the right side enhances the three-dimensional effect. Both the ground and background are in light brown tones, with no distractions distracting the visual focus, creating a minimalist sense of sophistication; The overall image has the feel of a professional studio shoot, but still carries the real graininess and slight noise typical of everyday amateur equipment. The color saturation is moderately low, presenting a calm and restrained cinematic aesthetic. It feels like a moment taken from a retro-style urban fashion blockbuster, full of storytelling and emotional tension. It not only showcases the independent and capable temperament of modern women but also subtly conveys an unspoken emotional repression or self-protective posture. The entire image exudes a calm, restrained yet vibrant artistic atmosphere.",
