        {
          "id": "krea2-7e33cf34fb2740d44307204e",
          "alias": "摄影棚困倦倚靠",
          "prompt": "Large areas of blank space highlight the main figure, while slight shadow edges hint at the direction of the light source, adding depth to the space; The composition uses a slightly tilted close-up angle, placing the figure in the left side of the frame, leaving blank space on the right side to create a sense of visual breathing, and the head and hand postures form a dynamic balance; The light and shadow treatment is soft and even, with the main light source coming from the left front of the subject, avoiding harsh contrasts; The overall atmosphere combines sweetness with a retro artistic vibe, with pale purple and red as the finishing touches, creating a dreamy, tranquil yet slightly rebellious youthful mood; The image style presents the feel of professional studio shooting, but deliberately mimics the shooting effect of everyday amateur equipment (such as mobile phones or small cameras), retaining slight noise and natural color temperature deviations to enhance the authentic feel and familiarity of real life; The overall tone of the painting leans toward warmth, with moderate saturation, presenting a gentle and hazy \"Japanese film style,\" as if frozen in a quiet moment bathed in slanting afternoon sunlight—full of artistic expression yet retaining the delicate warmth of everyday life.",
