        {
          "id": "krea2-562c1dd010b91dade438c3c1",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣衣帽间沉思坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits gracefully on a soft bed covered with pristine white sheets, dressed in a gentle beige knit suit paired with a quilted short-sleeved cardigan, paired with a matching slim slip dress in the same color as the inner layer. The hem naturally falls to mid-thigh, outlining a soft yet layered silhouette. Add a touch of laziness and authenticity. Her posture is calm and thoughtful, as if immersed in a quiet private moment, or silently engaged in a gentle conversation with the viewer. She wore a pair of small, rounded pearl earrings that glowed gently under soft light, complementing the overall color scheme and becoming one of the visual focal points. The background features a simple and elegant light gray wall, with the texture and lines of the wooden wardrobe door panels visible on the left, presenting warm natural wood tones that gently contrast with the white bedding. The headboard features an off-white upholstered design with delicate vertical stripes on the surface, supported by several fluffy, plump white pillows with natural folds, creating a cozy and cozy bedroom atmosphere. The entire composition uses a close-up shot, with the figure occupying most of the space. The camera is slightly angled down, making viewers feel as if they are right by the bed, gazing at her up close. It strengthens the emotional expression and appeal of the characters. The light comes from the upper left of the image, a softly diffused indoor light source with clear contours without harsh shadows, giving the skin a naturally radiant texture; The texture of the garments appears delicate and three-dimensional under the light, and the folds of the bedding gain layering through the changes in light and shadow. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, private, and healing, featuring the \"wabi-sabi\" style of Japanese home aesthetics—understated yet warm, not noisy yet reassuring. The tones are mainly off-white, cream, light brown, and gray-white, with low saturation and harmonious colors, creating a beautiful moment captured unintentionally in daily life. It combines professional-level exquisite composition and attention to detail while retaining the natural, casual, and unrefined realism of ordinary phone shooting. It feels like a snapshot of her life casually shot in her room at dawn or dusk, full of artistic flair and close to the warmth and breath of real life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
