        {
          "id": "krea2-403b9fdd3325423174df00cf",
          "alias": "单女白T恤高塔忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of the railing on an open-air balcony of a city skyscraper, leaning slightly forward, her hands naturally resting on the metal railing, her posture relaxed yet slightly contemplative, adding a sense of haziness and mystery; She wore a loose white crew-neck T-shirt embroidered with a striking red and blue letter \"B\" pattern on the chest, simple yet stylish. She paired it with high-waisted black pants, creating a striking color contrast that highlighted her urban casual style; Wearing a slender silver necklace around her neck, the pendant is small and delicate, faintly visible in soft light; On the wrist, a simple bracelet or woven cord can be faintly seen, with details revealing a sense of everyday life; Her gaze is lowered, her expression focused and reserved, as if immersed in her own thoughts, forming a peaceful dialogue with the bustling city; In the foreground is a metal balcony railing with clean and sharp lines, giving it an industrial feel. Below the railing, you can faintly see the taillights of vehicles driving on the distant street, and red dots dotting the gray-blue dusk background like sparks, infusing the scene with a touch of dynamism and warmth. The middle is a cluster of city buildings. On the left, an off-white high-rise residential building dominates the main part. Its neatly arranged windows appear peaceful and orderly in the twilight. On the right are some old-fashioned buildings in warm tones of brick-red or brown, arranged in a staggered manner, with roof contours outlining the city's texture. The background is a vast and profound sky, with thick and layered clouds transitioning from pale gray-blue to deep indigo. The clouds stretch out like cotton, their edges dyed faintly golden or orange by the sunset's afterglow. The sky occupies about two-thirds of the composition, creating a visual sense of expansive expanse; The composition uses a vertical long panel, with the figure positioned in the middle and lower parts of the frame, leaving a large area of blank space above for the sky, creating strong visual guidance and spatial tension. The figure's body is slightly tilted, breaking the symmetry of the composition and enhancing the dynamic and realistic feel of the composition; Her gaze naturally extends down to her hands and railing, creating a spatial depth that moves from near to far, from solid to void; The lighting atmosphere presents the \"blues moment\" at dusk or dusk, with soft and slightly cool tones, clear contours but details softened, subtle transitions between light and dark in clothing folds, and clouds in the sky showing delicate gradients under the sunset. The overall color palette is mainly cool blue, gray-white, and deep black, complemented by red and blue accents on T-shirts and warm light spots from car headlights, creating a visual balance of warm and cool intertwine; The texture leans toward realistic photography rather than painting, with slight graininess and film texture, and moderately low color saturation, creating a nostalgic, artistic, and slightly melancholic urban atmosphere. It seems to capture an ordinary yet poetic moment, combining the casualness and authenticity of daily life with deep reflections on the city, freedom, loneliness, or inner world. The overall image conveys a modern youthful temperament that is tranquil, independent, and slightly detached, reminiscent of a solitary traveler in the city. Seeking inner peace and self-expression amid the noise.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
