        {
          "id": "krea2-1c01b11a8dc5908b7f0e8208",
          "alias": "单女毛衣卧室冷淡躺侧头",
          "prompt": "The lace cutout details at the collar were subtly visible under the light, showcasing a gentle and sweet everyday style; The foreground focuses on the lines of her shoulders and neck and the layering of her chest garments; the loose cuffs of the knit cardigan hang naturally, and the three-dimensional pleats of the lace edges create subtle shadow transitions in the light, enhancing the material contrast and visual focal point; The middle shot is a slightly blurred corner of the bedroom behind her. On the left, a bed covered with blue-and-white plaid sheets can be vaguely seen. On the bed are a smooth pink throw pillow and a fluffy brown teddy bear. On the right is a white dressing table neatly arranged with silver spray bottles, transparent water bottles, black cosmetic jars, and some scattered papers. Next to it lies a small blue cartoon-shaped plush doll. The background wall is in a light gray-white tone, simple and clean, without excessive decoration. In the corners of the ceiling, air conditioner vents and electrical wiring are visible, suggesting this is a real and unintentionally arranged private space. The overall environment creates a private, relaxed, and life-rich home atmosphere; The composition uses a slightly tilted half-body close-up perspective, with the figure's head slightly tilted to the right, creating an intimate yet slightly distant sense of interaction; Then, through objects on the right dressing table, the natural transition into the background guides the viewer's gaze from the main subject to gradually explore environmental details; The light and shadow treatment is extremely soft and natural, with the light source coming from the left front of the character, creating a soft transition between light and dark without strong shadows, highlighting the delicate texture of the skin; Slightly weaker background light creates a slight depth of field blur, making the main subject stand out more; The overall atmosphere is tranquil and peaceful, with a dominant blend of warm and cool blue-white, accented by a touch of pink and wood warmth, creating a fresh, healing, and slightly artistic visual mood. It's as if capturing the moment when afternoon sunlight streams through the window lattice, and the girl sits alone at her dressing table, either trying to organize her mood or prepare to go out. The image is filled with a gentle, authentic, and unadorned aesthetic of everyday life—combining the delicate texture of professional photography with the unique natural breath and warmth of amateur photography.",
