        {
          "id": "krea2-fde63283b7897a7f45d26dfd",
          "alias": "单女女仆女仆装寺庙害羞拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a delicate Japanese maid outfit sat on a warm, vintage wooden floor, wearing a fluffy, white ruffled maid headpiece on her head. Her left hand gently brushed one side of her temple, while her right hand naturally rested at her knee, her posture elegant yet slightly shy. Her outfit is a classic black-and-white maid outfit, with layers of ruffled pleats at the collar and cuffs of a white shirt. A black satin vest hugs her figure, and a wide, flowing white pleated skirt with black lace trim along the hem. The skirt spreads out and covers the wooden floor, revealing legs clad in thin white tights. On her feet are platform brown leather loafers with black rubber soles, adding a touch of modernity and comfort. The space she is in is an interior full of classical atmosphere. In the background is a carved wooden low cabinet, topped with an old-fashioned wooden gramophone and a black metal desk lamp. To the right of the cabinet is a luxurious red and gold patterned fabric sofa. The armrests and backrest have smooth lines, and the legs are made of dark brown solid wood. The foreground focuses on her cross-legged posture and clothing details, while the middle extends to her legs, feet, and floor textures, with furniture in the background moderately blurred to highlight the main figure. The composition uses a low-angle, slightly upward shot to make the figure appear more three-dimensional and full. The composition is diagonal, with the figure's body extending from the upper left to the lower right forming a visual guide line with the floor. Light and shadow come from soft natural light or studio softboxes on the left side of the image, evenly casting light on the figure while casting delicate shadows on the floor, enhancing the sense of spatial layering. The overall atmosphere is warm, tranquil, nostalgic, and full of storytelling. It feels as if time has frozen in this moment, and the characters are immersed in a moment of rest and self-expression. The entire scene exudes a delicate, gentle, and slightly artistic aesthetic, suitable for amateur photography with realistic style, emphasizing real lighting and everyday prop arrangements. Avoid excessive post-processing, and pursue a natural and delicate visual experience.",
