        {
          "id": "krea2-473d30b57c0ecf1cf3596ff4",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙微笑站立持相机",
          "prompt": "Under the bright afternoon sunlight, a woman stands sideways in a clearing in the woods bathed in natural light spots, as if immersed in a tranquil moment where floral fragrance and light intertwine. She wore a delicate red spaghetti strap dress with delicate pleats at the neckline. The fabric glowed with a warm sheen and layering under the sunlight, and the shoulder and collarbone lines appeared even softer through the interplay of light and shadow. Her fingers were slender and slender, gently holding a blooming white flower branch. The blossoms were dense and delicate, with petals as thin as cicada wings, casting a translucent, soft white in the backlight, with green leaves scattered throughout, full of vitality. Echoing the colors of her dress, she carries a hint of a serene smile. The foreground focuses on her hand holding the flower and the details of the flowers, while the background is completely blurred into a hazy green patch of light. The bokeh effect created by leaves and sunlight filtering through the canopy creates a dreamlike sense of spatial depth. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, with sharp contrasts of light and shadow that are not glaring. The soft focus and graininess reminiscent of film film are dominated by warm orange, bright red, and fresh grass green, complemented by pure white flowers for accents, creating a lazy, romantic, and poetic spring afternoon atmosphere. The image conveys a tranquil state of mind away from the noise and returning to nature, as if time stands still at this moment, with only the fragrance of flowers and sunlight gently flowing through the air. The entire scene resembles a carefully composed portrait photographic work, with a slight retro filter color tendency, simulating the delicate image quality and realistic transitions of professional camera shots, while preserving the authenticity and warmth of beautiful moments captured unintentionally in daily life, immersing viewers in this simple yet profound aesthetic experience.",
