        {
          "id": "krea2-09cd83fe8d3d0b9f6b9032a5",
          "alias": "单女白连体衣广场愤怒跪展示",
          "prompt": "A woman kneels in an outdoor public space in a modern city, dressed in a delicate white bunny girl cosplay outfit, her overall look full of drama and visual impact. The main outfit is a fitted white bodysuit tailored to the body, with a wide stand collar and a black bow accented on the chest, highlighting a style that blends classical and sexy elements; The shoulders feature white sleeve-style decorations, and the wrists are also styled with matching sleeves, with clean and sharp lines; She wears beige fishnet socks with fine and even texture, outlining a hazy layer of light and shadow along the leg curve. She wears a pair of pure white pointed high heels, with slender heels and smooth uppers, creating a unified tone with the overall white outfit. She kneels on gray granular tiles or artificial turf, her body slightly turned to the side, hips slightly arched back, knees bent into an elegant kneeling posture, showcasing flexible body lines and dynamic beauty. The foreground focuses on her upper body and hand movements, while the background is a blurred urban architectural complex. The glass curtain walls reflect the sunlight, with neat, cold lines that sharply contrast with the figure's warm and gentle atmosphere. In the middle ground, metal railings and blurred figures can be seen, suggesting that this is a city square or station corridor bustling with people, but this is weakened by shallow depth of field treatment, serving only as a backdrop for the environment. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, making the character appear taller and more upright, while also enhancing the spatial depth of the image; The subject is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, with the body facing forward to the left, looking directly at the lens, creating a strong visual focus and sense of interaction. The light comes from natural daylight slightly to the left above and below, soft and bright without glaring, creating a delicate three-dimensional silhouette; Shadows transition smoothly without harsh cuts, especially on the arms, shoulders, neck, and legs, creating subtle contrasts of light and shadow, enhancing skin texture and clothing fold details. The overall atmosphere blends dreaminess with realism, retaining the fun and cuteness of cosplay characters, while blending sophisticated costume textures, precise pose control, and environmental integration to create an almost cinematic-level fashion blockbuster feel, as if it were a real-life moment from an anime convention or studio outdoor shoot. The gray-blue cool background further highlights the character's vibrancy and brightness, creating a fresh, sweet yet mature visual tone. The overall composition conveys vitality in tranquility and confidence in innocence, like a modern era emerging from a fairy tale world, quietly blooming amid the bustling city, leaving a lasting impression.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
