        {
          "id": "krea2-21828eeca2fe2e89cfcd52f6",
          "alias": "单女毛衣摄影棚冷淡吃",
          "prompt": "The tip is fluffy and naturally raises like a cloud, and the tail stripes clearly display a ring-like pattern of black, brown, and white, elegantly curving from the back of the waist toward the upper right of the painting for dynamic balance; She held a golden fish-shaped cookie in both hands, gently biting the edge, its soft glow evenly covering her skin, enhancing her contours; The middle ground features her upper body and sweater texture, with the knitted texture and plush texture creating a subtle contrast under light and shadow. The background is vertically divided by the cold gray wall on the left and the pure white wall on the right. The floor is a low-saturation blue-gray, and a warm orange plane cuts diagonally into the lower right corner, creating a dialogue between calm, rational and lively passion; The composition uses a slightly downward tilted perspective, with the figure's body extending diagonally, the tail curve guiding the gaze upward, and the head and cookie serving as visual anchors. The overall layout is full of asymmetrical tension characteristic of modern minimalist aesthetics; The lighting atmosphere combines the precise control of a professional studio with the warmth of everyday scenes.",
