        {
          "id": "krea2-577ad323d00352b1d8a94fa7",
          "alias": "单女和服城市沉思坐持镜",
          "prompt": "She held a burning firework stick in each hand, sparks flying like meteors, tracing bright yet brief trails in the darkness. Orange-yellow light flickered at her fingertips, illuminating her fair skin and delicate earrings, and also illuminating the delicate patterns on the kimono—light blue polka dots and red koi fish patterns intertwined, the flowing hem swaying gently in the wind, the hem naturally falling to the ground, forming soft curves. The rock she sits on is rough and covered with traces of time, forming a stark contrast to her graceful posture. Beneath her feet are damp soil and scattered dry grass, adding a sense of charm and authenticity. In the middle shot, the lake surface is like a mirror, reflecting the blurred city lights in the distance. These spots of light transform into warm circular halos in the virtual focus, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The background is a deep night, with faint outlines of trees and buildings on the shore. The lighting outlines a hazy line, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center, body in an oblique posture, legs naturally extended, extending to the earth beneath and the distant lake. In terms of lighting and shadow, the main subject is illuminated by the warm yellow light source emitted by the sparkler, creating a strong contrast between light and dark, while the background is in a completely dark tone, relying solely on distant city light spots to provide ambient illumination. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and romantic, carrying a hint of festive joy and the contemplative feeling of solitude. It is filled with the poetic charm of Eastern aesthetics while revealing the lively atmosphere of modern urban nightlife. The images present a highly artistic photographic style, with rich details, moderate color saturation, a slight grainy texture, and soft focus effects. It feels as if a high-end digital camera was used to shoot at night, with fine color grading in post-processing, presenting a professional-grade image texture. It combines cinematic narrative with the authentic warmth and life of everyday shooting, allowing viewers to feel the tranquility, beauty, and fleeting precious moments of that moment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
