        {
          "id": "krea2-be68f54ef8c87810e720cf06",
          "alias": "单女棕外套街道坐展示",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright against a warm, rich crimson background, wearing a loose, draping brown vertically striped corduroy jacket with a faintly visible blue shirt collar underneath. Her posture is lazy yet full of tension, as if silently telling an inner story; Her legs are naturally bent and crossed, with slightly exposed knees, wearing thick white knitted knee-high socks and a pair of intricately designed blue-and-white color-blocked sneakers. The upper features delicate gray-white geometric patterns and striking red rubber soles, with laces loosely and casually tied, showcasing a unique style that blends street style with retro style; On the left side of the foreground is a smooth-textured white leather handbag. The body lines are simple and elegant, and the gold metal clasps glow softly under soft light, creating a visual balance with the few red fruits scattered at her feet; The middle section features branches wrapped between her calves and knees, slender yet resilient, covered with plump, rounded orange-red fruits. The leaves are gray-green or light silver, faintly showing a metallic texture under light and shadow. The fruits and leaves intertwine and intertwine, resembling both nature's gift and carefully arranged art installations, infusing the painting with vitality and layers; The background is a pure deep red wall, saturated and heavy, with no decorations to obstruct the view, making the main figure stand out even more; The floor is covered with a colorful and intricately textured Persian carpet, interwoven with warm blue, red, and gold patterns, echoing the overall red tone and adding spatial depth to the composition; The composition uses a slightly overhead mid-to-close perspective, with the figure centered slightly to the left. Light comes from a soft left light source in front, while subtle shadows on shoulders, arms, and legs enhance the sense of depth. The contrast between the feature wall and carpet creates a strong contrast of light and shadow, highlighting the main subject; The overall atmosphere blends autumn tranquility, fashionable modernity, and artistic poetry. It combines the casual realism of daily life with exquisite composition and emotional expression reminiscent of artistic photography, presenting a unique aesthetic experience between urban trends and natural aesthetics. It resembles a carefully curated fashion shoot while preserving the genuine warmth and life atmosphere inadvertently captured during amateur equipment shoots.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
