        {
          "id": "krea2-d6b9a96f71673e14354b5fd5",
          "alias": "单女衬衫公寓冷淡坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits gracefully on a light blue wooden bench, leaning slightly back into a right-angled corner formed by two pure white walls. Her posture is relaxed and full of tension, legs naturally crossed, her left hand gently resting on her knee, and a simple ring on her ring finger, adding a touch of laziness and authenticity. She wore an off-white, semi-transparent lace-collared shirt with a light and flowing fabric, revealing delicate textures under the light. The delicate lace trim and lining at the cuffs were faintly visible, paired with loose wide-leg pants in matching colors. The pant legs naturally rolled up to reveal slender ankles, giving the overall look a gentle, intellectual, and slightly vintage fashion vibe. She wears a pair of gray-white sneakers with classic vintage running shoes on the upper. The prominent \"N\" logo and red triangle accents on the side create a visual focal point. The laces are neatly and tight, the sole is thick and stylish, and the heel features small black details, cleverly blending casual and refined styles. This not only breaks the constraints of traditional outfits but also maintains overall harmony. In the foreground is a light blue bench beneath her feet, with clearly visible wooden edges, a smooth and flat surface, and colors forming a subtle contrast between warm and cool with the wall, creating a tranquil spatial layer; The center is the contour of her cross-legged body and legs, along with her striking sneakers, forming the core narrative area of the scene; The background is a geometric space formed by the intersection of two simple pure white walls, with no unnecessary decoration or distractions. The pure blank space enhances the subject's presence and imparts a minimalist aesthetic tone to the painting. The entire composition uses a low-angle downward angle, slightly tilted upward to capture the full figure of the figure. Light comes from the upper left of the frame, with soft, evenly diffused light shining on her, outlining gentle shadow transitions. The atmosphere of light and shadow is cool and tranquil, with a slight blues filter effect, enveloping the entire scene in a dreamlike urban morning or afternoon, as if you are in a quiet indoor studio or a corner of a modern apartment, full of artistic atmosphere and a sense of everyday realism. Visual guidance starts with her sneakers, extends the gaze upward along her legs to her waist and shoulders, and finally focuses on her slightly contemplative expressions and hand movements, forming a smooth and emotionally charged visual path. The overall color scheme is dominated by cool white, light blue, and off-white, creating visual balance and emotional focus. The image texture is delicate and lifelike, reaching the level of professional commercial photography or high-end fashion portraits, yet retaining the authentic warmth of everyday moments captured by everyday photography equipment. It feels as if a beautiful moment is accidentally captured on an ordinary afternoon, combining artistic compositional depth and atmosphere without straying from the breathing rhythm and authentic texture of everyday life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
