        {
          "id": "krea2-ce939ae108120f4a79151ae2",
          "alias": "单女困倦回眸",
          "prompt": "A woman is the absolute subject of the painting, wearing a necklace with a thin black-and-white stripe around her neck to accentuate the overall look. She wore a tight off-shoulder long-sleeve top featuring a black and brown zebra pattern. The fabric was noticeably elastic and hugged her curves, and the cinched cuffs highlighted her slender wrists; The bottom is paired with high-waisted tie-dye sweatpants, featuring a spiral gradient of pink, purple, and white as the main visual focus. The colors are soft and dreamy, perfectly outlining the waistline to accentuate the full hip contour. Her posture is angled sideways and looking back, with her left hand gently raised to her chest forming an elegant arc, her right hand naturally resting on her waist, legs slightly bent to create a dynamic balance, and the whole pose is full of fashion expression and a sense of everyday life.",
          "description": "",
