        {
          "id": "krea2-13366a847ad2e15ff7937c3c",
          "alias": "多人城市沉思坐",
          "prompt": "In the front is a simple, modern light wood tabletop with a smooth, reflective surface. On the table sits a white paper napkin box, neatly folded inside the box, revealing a corner of the wooden tray, hinting at a casual dining space. The left side of the desktop extends to the edge, while the right side is obscured by the figure's legs, forming a solid visual foundation. The center of the ground is dominated by figures, with blue-gray walls and a row of golden metal hangers behind them. The hangers are designed in a semicircular arc suspended, with several blank white hangers reflecting the light from above to create a contrast of warmth and coolness. Below the hanger is a deep green suede sofa chair, with clearly visible vertical pleats on the backrest. The cushion is full and textured, and the color complements the blue wall to enhance the visual layer. The background wall is a highly saturated royal blue, and a large urban nightscape artwork hangs on it. The scene presents the architectural outlines and flowing light effects illuminated by neon lights, with a purple-red-orange color tone that creates a bustling urban atmosphere. Three round modern chandeliers hang from the ceiling, with orange or cyan decorative rings along the lampshade edges, emitting soft, even warm white light downward to create a multi-layered lighting structure.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
