        {
          "id": "krea2-de2d1bfad43d4beaceffd42a",
          "alias": "城市愤怒持相机",
          "prompt": "The composition uses a close-up perspective of medium to close-up portraits, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, following the rule of thirds to ensure a stable visual center of gravity. The camera angles slightly downward to enhance the figure's slender proportions and aura, while elements like hangers, sofas, and tabletops are used to build deep spatial relationships. The visual guide lines are composed of the direction of the character's arm lift, the curved lines of the hanger, the vertical lines of the sofa backrest, and the arrangement of the chandelier. The light and shadow are handled with delicate detail, with the main light source coming from the overhead chandelier, while light shadow transitions are created on the back and waist to enhance the sense of depth. Ambient light is complemented by wall reflections and internal luminous elements, making the overall contrast between light and dark balanced and not glaring. The atmosphere blends the simplicity and refinement of modern interior design with the vibrant boldness of streetwear fashion. The interplay of pink, purple, blue, and gold creates a calm and rational vibe while remaining passionate and exuberant, presenting an artistic expression of the urban youth lifestyle. The entire image is delicately textured, as if shot with a professional camera in a well-lit, carefully decorated café or boutique. The details are rich yet not cluttered, conveying a relaxed, joyful, fashionable, and free lifestyle attitude.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
