        {
          "id": "krea2-5de9852bad9c915c536381ff",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫书店俏皮坐注视",
          "prompt": "A female student sits in a somewhat messy corner of a used bookstore or library, wearing a classic blue-and-white short-sleeved shirt and dark blue sports shorts, with three clear dark blue stripes on the collar and cuffs, creating a simple yet youthful look; With a hint of laziness and curiosity, she stares straight at the camera, her expression relaxed yet a bit playful; She sits cross-legged on a low stool, her right hand naturally holding a transparent glass bottle. The bottle is slender with a vintage curve, with an orange circular label encircling the center. The bottle is filled with milky white liquid, creating a soft dynamic effect; The background is blurred, with towering, messy books and cardboard boxes stacked on both sides. The spines are colorful yet blurry, creating a strong campus or nostalgic atmosphere; The composition adopts a slightly tilted mid-to-near perspective, with the figure occupying the left central position, the body naturally turning sideways, forming a visual flow path; The light and shadow come from the soft, diffused light on the left, while light shadows are cast on the right shoulder and arm to enhance the sense of depth; The overall color scheme leans toward a soft-focus style with a warm and cool balance, mainly gray-blue and off-white, accented with orange labels for visual focus. The atmosphere is tranquil yet tinged with a touch of youthful artistry, as if captured in the moment of sunlight streaming through the window on an afternoon after school. The realistic daily shooting effect with a film camera texture is not deliberately pursued for perfect symmetry, but rather presents a casual, realistic feel. The bookshelves and miscellaneous items in the background hint at the accumulation of knowledge and growth, while the drink in your hand symbolizes a brief moment of youthful rest and carefree life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
