        {
          "id": "krea2-c4cab7706600362c4ca27450",
          "alias": "单女制服桌边俏皮坐",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in exquisite Japanese school uniform style sits at the center of a wide, textured deep green suede sofa. Her right hand gently adjusts the red and black striped tie at the neckline, while her left hand hangs naturally at her thigh, legs elegantly crossed. Her left knee leans slightly forward, while her right leg extends long to the bottom of the frame. At her ankles, she wears black over-the-knee socks, the cuff clinging to her skin, revealing her slender calf lines. The white shirt she wore featured plaid cuffs and a beige knit vest, paired with a classic plaid mini skirt that perfectly outlined a youthful and energetic silhouette; The sofa she sits on is made of deep green, high-density velvet fabric, with regular button-like raised surfaces that display delicate textures and a warm sheen under soft light. The sofa's edges are smooth, harmoniously proportioned to the figures; In the foreground is a low, transparent glass coffee table, its smooth mirror surface clearly reflecting the lower body and legs of the figure, reflecting a blurred yet realistic layer of light and shadow that enhances the sense of spatial depth; The background features a city night view unfolding through floor-to-ceiling windows, with lights outside twinkling like stars. In the distance, the silhouettes of high-rise buildings are faintly visible, and the window frames have a dark metallic texture, contrasting with the warm tones of the interior. The interior uses cool white lighting, with light sources from the ceiling or hidden fixtures on the side walls, creating a quiet yet slightly dramatic atmosphere. The shadow transitions naturally avoid harsh cuts; In composition, a centrally symmetrical layout is used, with figures positioned near the golden ratio point of the composition, while the reflection on the coffee table and the night scene outside the window form a visual extension axis; The color palette is mainly dark green, off-white, and black, accented with red ties and warm yellow light spots outside the window, creating a visual tension that blends calmness and warmth; The overall image presents an artistic atmosphere in a private urban nighttime, combining the casual feeling of daily life with studio-level precise lighting and artistic composition. It feels as if shooting with amateur equipment yet possessing professional-level light and shadow control. The atmosphere is quiet, restrained, and full of storytelling, like a student just finishing evening class alone at home. Both authentic and cinematic, it naturally evokes the imagination of her mood and story at that moment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
