        {
          "id": "krea2-9435fd782e288b4fce4e35c8",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套街道忧伤坐躲藏",
          "prompt": "On a city street corner as night falls, a woman sits upright on a dark wooden bench, becoming the absolute visual focal point of the scene. She wears a fluffy, soft light blue wool coat, with the collar and cuffs trimmed with dense, pure white faux fur, gently wrapping her slender figure like the warm winter sun. The coat is adorned with several exquisite gold buttons, glowing with understated luxury under the city's neon lights; gazing into the lens, as if enjoying a moment of peace alone on a quiet night; Her right hand gently holds a white coffee cup with a simple pattern, the lid black, her nails neatly trimmed with elegant silver-gray nail art, while her left hand rests naturally on her knee, exposing her long, fair legs. The corner of a beige ankle boot peeks out from her ankle, adding a casual yet refined urban vibe; Next to her is a pink-toned handbag, made of delicate leather, adorned with a metal chain and a luxurious silk scarf bow. The soft and layered colors complement the overall look; In the foreground is the clear grain of a dark brown wooden bench, with distinct backrest strips and armrests. The seat surface reflects slightly from the humid night air, creating a realistic tactile feel; In the middle ground, you can see a stone-paved sidewalk extending into the distance. In the distance, the silhouettes of pedestrians blur into flowing silhouettes—some strolling in groups, others hurrying along. In the background, towering modern buildings rise into the clouds. Glass curtain walls reflect dazzling lights, billboards flash continuously, and cars weave through the streets, leaving trailing light trails. On the left, a lush tree can be faintly seen, its silhouette outlining a soft green silhouette in the night, injecting a touch of natural vitality into the cold city. The entire composition adopts a slightly overhead central view, with the figure centered to the right, and a bench running across the lower third forming a stable baseline. The lighting and shadow atmosphere presents a typical nighttime urban feel, with the main subject illuminated by soft warm yellow artificial light sources. Light projects from the front side, while the cool-toned lighting of the background buildings creates a contrasting visual tension that blends warmth and detachment. The overall color scheme is dominated by cool blue and warm pinks, accented with dark brown, dark green, and metallic gold, creating a harmonious and layered color; The visuals have a strong cinematic and everyday feel, as if captured by a high-resolution phone on a street at night. The details are rich yet not cluttered, and the background blur is just right, preserving the realism of the urban environment while highlighting the emotional expression of the subjects. The entire image is filled with a quiet, stylish, and slightly lonely urban night strolling atmosphere, like a silent nocturne quietly telling its own gentle story amid the noise.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
