        {
          "id": "krea2-224609474fd874c61e6636be",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙卧室困倦坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bedroom bed, wearing a delicate red lace spaghetti strap dress with white wavy lace and vintage embroidery along the hem. The fabric has a silky smooth sheen and delicate pleats, with delicate pearl strings adorning the straps that glow softly under the warm light. She gently embraced a fluffy white rabbit plush toy with both hands. The overall look was cute and playful, tightly held by her chest, as if symbolizing emotional support. The foreground focuses on the doll in her arms and part of her skirt, with a medium to close-up shot. The figure occupies the center slightly to the left, with her head slightly tilted, gaze directed downward to the frame, fingers long, nails neatly trimmed and painted with light nail polish. The background is blurred, with faint glimpses of the dark gray carved wooden headboard. The rear wall has a warm creamy yellow tone, a blurred blue star-shaped decoration hangs in the corner, and a corner of pink fabric is faintly visible on the right, creating a private and cozy indoor atmosphere. The overall use of light and shadow is soft and natural, with the light source coming from the right front of the figure, creating a subtle contrast of light and shadow that enhances the sense of depth and texture. The color palette is mainly warm red and cream yellow, paired with white dolls and dark furniture to create visual balance. The color saturation is moderate, creating a nostalgic, dreamy, and slightly artistic atmosphere. It combines the warmth of daily life with the delicate emotional expression of artistic photography, as if capturing an emotional moment of quiet afternoon or late night alone, full of storytelling and immersive viewing experience.",
