        {
          "id": "krea2-64fb452c9a7920e807fbcc73",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙卧室困倦坐泼洒",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright on a soft, fluffy pink velvet single sofa, wearing a light, flowing light pink pleated slip dress, topped with a fluffy, fuzzy light gray-blue knit cardigan. Her hands are gently clasped on her knees, her left wrist wears a simple pearl bracelet, her knuckles slender and long, and her ring finger adorned with a small ring—details that reveal the refinement and restraint of everyday life; The foreground focuses on her leg lines and hand postures from knee to ankle, with light and shadow outlining soft transitions of light and shadow on the skin. The background features off-white wallpaper with elegant pale yellow floral patterns. The wall texture is delicate, and above hangs a slender white string strung with several small and cute decorations—a white deer plush doll, a plush bear head, and a transparent glass bead—creating a fairy-tale-like warm atmosphere; The composition adopts a close-up perspective from medium to close-up, with the characters positioned slightly below the center, leaving ample ceiling space to create a visual sense of breath, emphasizing the main subjects while preserving environmental narrative clues; The overall composition is a vertical strip, with visual guides naturally extending from the direction of the person's gaze to the top of the frame, then using background decorations to guide the gaze horizontally, creating a stable and rhythmic visual rhythm; Light comes from the front slightly left, with soft, evenly diffused light filling the entire scene, avoiding strong shadows. It only creates slight highlights on the folds of clothing and the edges of body contours, creating a creamy, warm transparency; The color palette is mainly pink, white, and light gray, complemented by deep purple nail polish as a contrast between warm and cool tones. The overall tone is soft and unified, presenting a tranquil, healing, and slightly heartfelt dreamy atmosphere. It feels like afternoon sunlight pouring into the bedroom, stretching the time and calming the mood. The entire photo radiates beautiful moments carefully captured from daily life, combining the exquisite composition and color control of artistic photography with the unique naturalness and life atmosphere of amateur equipment shooting. Like a gentle recording completed with a phone or small camera under natural indoor light, without any deliberate embellishment, yet full of emotional resonance and aesthetic tension.",
