          "alias": "单女制服户外害羞站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A high school girl stands outdoors on a sunny, lush green lawn, wearing a classic Japanese school uniform: a white short-sleeved shirt paired with a dark gray pleated skirt, with a bright burgundy scarf tied around the neckline, looking especially fresh and charming under the natural light; Her posture is natural yet slightly shy, with a hint of youthful innocence and calm in her expression; She carried a simple black backpack, with straps naturally draped over her shoulders, the hem and skirt fluttering in the breeze, creating a soft dynamic effect; In the foreground is dense emerald green grass, with leaves shining in the sunlight, some blades slightly tilted, creating an immersive visual layer close to the ground; The middle frame features her slender body and school uniform details, with light and shadow outlining delicate transitions of light and shadow on her skin, highlighting a healthy and soft texture; The background features blurred trees and sky, with leaves turning into dreamy circular light spots against the backlight, presenting a soft out-of-focus blur effect. In the distance, a corner of a wooden bench can be faintly seen, adding a touch of everyday campus life to the scene; The composition adopts a slightly upward-looking perspective, placing the figure slightly to the left center of the frame. Using shallow depth of field technology to enhance the subject's prominence, the lighting and shadow atmosphere are warm and bright. It seems to capture the moment of strolling through the campus on a sunny afternoon after school. It carries a cinematic aesthetic while preserving the casual naturalness and life atmosphere of amateur equipment shooting. The visuals are full of storytelling and emotional tension, allowing people to feel the pure and flawless beauty of youthful years.",
