        {
          "id": "krea2-97f2dd2467c8b2f8567d9d3e",
          "alias": "单女困倦坐泼洒",
          "prompt": "A woman sits deep in a golden wheat field, sunlight pouring down from above her head. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and dreamy, with sunlight piercing through the clouds forming dappled beams of light that create a cinematic soft light texture; The overall color palette leans toward warmth, mainly golden and sky blue, accented by white clothing. The color saturation is moderate, avoiding overly bright colors and presenting a film texture with a slightly nostalgic filter. The visuals have a strong Japanese artistic style and pastoral poetry, capturing both authentic and natural details with slight traces of artistic processing. For example, when shot in the afternoon with an amateur DSLR camera, the subtle motion blur caused by slight camera movement enhances the sense of presence and emotional tension; The entire image exudes an atmosphere of tranquility, freedom, romance, and youthful excitement, as if time has frozen in this moment, with only the sound of wind blowing through the wheat and the impending guitar melody echoing in the air.",
          "description": "",
