        {
          "id": "krea2-b38fd5265134682282019f2c",
          "alias": "单女粉毛衣温柔躺手持物",
          "prompt": "A woman is comfortably reclining on the soft, lush green grass, showing her neat, white teeth. She wears a soft light pink crew-neck knit sweater with delicate textures that appear soft matte under the light. On her chest is a white handwritten Korean word \"리틀 フォーレ스트\" (리틀 포レ스트), with casual and artistic brushstrokes. Below is a detailed list of production teams and the date \"2018.02.\" These textual elements are cleverly integrated into the image, creating a natural tone that enhances the narrative atmosphere. The composition uses a slightly top-down close-up angle, while blurring the background to make the subject stand out more. In the middle are her bare shoulders and part of her collar, surrounded by scattered tender leaves and branches. The edges of the leaves shimmer with a crystal-clear sheen under the light; some leaves display a fresh tender green, while others carry deep layers of dark green, creating rich color contrasts. The background consists of dense and well-layered shrubs with a variety of plant species, including tiny white flowers dotted like stars and dense pinnate compound leaves forming a visual barrier. The overall color scheme is dominated by green with varying saturations, creating a natural soft-focus filter effect that enhances the dreamlike and immersive feel. For lighting and shadow, natural daylight is used, with light slanting down from above to enhance the sense of depth; The leaves in the background also display a mottled effect of interplay of light and shadow depending on the angle of light, creating a lazy and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The composition is stable yet dynamic, exuding a healing artistic atmosphere, like a breeze on a summer afternoon, carrying the fragrance of grass and flowers, evoking a sense of poetry and simple beauty in life. Whether professional photography or amateur equipment shooting, one can capture this natural genuine emotion without excessive embellishment—just savor the vitality woven from sunlight, greenery, and smiles.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
