        {
          "id": "krea2-09317d75371a56f989caa95b",
          "alias": "单女粉T恤厨房倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully leans against the edge of a wooden dining table, leaning slightly forward, her posture natural and full of confidence. She wears a delicate pink lace camisole top with a lace design at the chest, paired with light blue slim-fit jeans on the bottom. The pant legs are naturally rolled up, standing barefoot, her left leg bent and lightly resting on the table, her right hand gently pressing the edge of the jeans at her waist, while her left hand steadily supports the tabletop. The overall look combines everyday comfort with a sense of fashion. In the foreground is a warm natural wood dining table and legs with clearly visible grain. On the right side, there is a matching small stool. The floor is light-colored wood, reflecting soft light and creating a cozy home atmosphere. The center view is the kitchen countertop area, with clean white cabinets and a natural wood countertop. On top are stainless steel faucets, black oven doors, and some kitchen tools. In the right corner, a silver kettle sits quietly on the stove. The background features pristine white tiled walls designed with horizontally arranged rectangular bricks. Above the wall hangs a black metal hook rack, neatly displaying kitchen utensils like spatulas and egg beaters. On the white shelf at the upper left, daily items such as glass bottles and jars, wooden cutting boards, spice bottles, and coffee pots are displayed, adding a sense of authentic living. The entire composition uses a slightly low-angle shot, placing the figure at the visual center, using the dining table as the foreground frame to guide the viewer to focus on their posture and expressions. Light and shadow come from soft natural light or indoor ceiling lights, evenly casting over the figures to outline soft contours. Delicate transitions between light and shadow appear in the folds of clothing, and the background wall appears slightly bright due to reflections but is not overexposed, maintaining a sense of depth in the image. The overall atmosphere is warm, tranquil, and full of life. It combines the cleanliness and tidiness of modern home living, while conveying a relaxed and carefree everyday beauty through the natural state of the subjects. It feels like capturing a beautiful moment in an ordinary afternoon kitchen, offering a strong sense of realism and immersion. It is like shooting with amateur equipment such as a phone or a small camera in natural light. The image quality has slight noise and true color deviation, enhancing the image's warmth and intimacy, rather than the flawless perfection of professional studio shoots. A more authentic aesthetic expression in everyday life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
