        {
          "id": "krea2-07e05d0e42f865f64175513d",
          "alias": "单女内衣家中困倦自拍",
          "prompt": "The heel gleamed with a metallic sheen, reflecting a warm golden glow under the light; She wears a simple black-and-white striped necklace around her neck, with a faint white wristband or watch decoration on her wrist, delicate yet understated; On the left side of the foreground is a beige patterned paper box containing a soft coral pink garment, possibly underwear or pajamas, adding a sense of life and privacy to the scene; The right background features a vanity mirror frame with a warm bulb, which emits a soft, circular glow that creates a cozy and dreamy atmosphere; The entire scene background consists of a dark gray vertical textured curtain on the left and a pure white wall on the right, creating a strong contrast of light and dark and visual segmentation, highlighting the main figures; The composition uses a slightly upward-looking mid-to-near angle, with the figure occupying the center to the right. In terms of lighting, the main light source comes from the right side of the makeup mirror, while deep shadows are formed at the left curtain, enhancing the sense of depth and layering. The overall color palette is mainly warm pink, golden brown, and gray-white, with harmonious and modern tones. The atmosphere is relaxed and pleasant, full of the fun of daily outfit sharing and the texture of fashion bloggers' selfies. The images are delicate and authentic, resembling high-quality lifestyle photos taken at home with a regular phone or portable camera. The details are rich yet natural, combining the refined composition of artistic photography with the authentic warmth and lifestyle of amateur equipment shots.",
