        {
          "id": "krea2-8bd4758d260ea59035e5700d",
          "alias": "单女红毛衣广场俏皮摆拍",
          "prompt": "A woman lounged lazily on a beige fabric sofa, her body slightly reclined, legs naturally curled, presenting a relaxed yet slightly playful pose; adding a touch of casualness and gentleness; She wore a bright red knit cardigan with soft and fluffy fabric, naturally draped cuffs, a light gray crew-neck T-shirt underneath, and loose, comfortable dark blue sweatpants. The legs of the pant tucked up to the knees, revealing classic blue-and-white striped platform socks, with the white stripes clearly visible at the edges, creating a striking contrast with the overall color scheme. Her right hand gently rests on the back of her head, while her left hand naturally rests on the sofa armrest or is hidden by clothing, her expression both innocent and full of storytelling; In the foreground, a corner of her red cardigan casually spreads out on the sofa cushion, forming a visual focal point and creating a sense of everyday detail layering; The middle shot is the main space occupied by her body, forming the core structure from shoulder to knee, with the folds of the sofa, the outline of the pillow, and the texture of the clothing all clearly visible; The background is a minimalist indoor environment, with soft warm white walls, clean lines of the sofa backrest, and an off-white square cushion on the right side with fine quilted texture to enhance the texture; The entire composition is shot at a slightly overhead angle, making the figures appear closer to the viewer while maintaining a sense of spatial depth; Light comes from the upper right of the painting, a gentle afternoon sunlight streaming through the window. The transition between light and shadow is natural and delicate, with soft yet layered contrasts, and the shadows are not harsh but have a strong sense of depth. The color scheme is mainly warm tones, with a red cardigan and blue pants creating a cool contrast, while beige sofas and white walls create a tranquil atmosphere. The overall color scheme is cozy and comfortable, with a strong Japanese home aesthetic style. The atmosphere is tranquil, healing, and full of the warmth and poetry of everyday life, as if capturing a real moment from a lazy weekend afternoon. It combines the compositional beauty of artistic photography with the casualness and warmth of real life; At the same time, the color extension of the red cardigan enhances visual appeal; The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and hazy, with a slight film grain texture that simulates the soft focus effect under natural light, enhancing the emotional expression and immersive viewing experience of the visuals; The entire image conveys a free-spirited, relaxed, and relaxed attitude toward life, allowing people to feel the power of youth, warmth, and inner peace.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
