        {
          "id": "krea2-fadf4b3f3ee9d47a28e3e826",
          "alias": "单女蓝短裤客厅坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a soft beige fabric sofa in the living room, leaning slightly forward, legs naturally crossed on a brown plush carpet, wearing a loose, comfortable white zip-up hooded sweatshirt and dark blue shorts, paired with pure white mid-calf socks. The overall look is simple yet everyday yet full of youthful energy. Looking directly into the camera, it feels as if she is engaging in a silent emotional exchange with the audience. Sunlight slants into the room through the left window of the painting, creating a soft, warm backlight silhouette on her body, while illuminating her bare legs, presenting a delicate and translucent sheen. In the background, you can see the sofa back, wooden side table, and a blue-gray ceramic cup, with unified tones that create a warm and tranquil home atmosphere; In the distance, faintly visible light-colored curtains and wall decorations further enhance the space's sense of authenticity and the sense of everyday life. The middle frame shows her lower body interacting with the sofa and carpet, while the background is moderately blurred to highlight the main figure. The composition uses a slightly overhead angle to make the image more approachable and immersive, while natural light creates contrasts of light and shadow to enhance three-dimensional layering. The gaze naturally shifts toward the audience, creating emotional resonance points. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, with the golden tones unique to afternoon sunlight. The overall image exudes a lazy, relaxed, and healing sense of everyday life. It resembles a carefully arranged photo work in a professional studio, or precious moments casually captured at home with a regular home camera or phone. It combines artistic beauty with the warmth of real life, allowing people to feel a sense of unrestrained freedom and pure beauty.",
