        {
          "id": "krea2-ff1a759cbec2960760f35017",
          "alias": "单女白礼服室内困倦倚靠持镜",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully leans beside a lavishly decorated white Christmas tree, dressed in a light, flowing white wedding dress and wearing a wide, fluffy white sheer headpiece adorned with delicate red ribbon bows. Her right hand gently holds a sparkling, warm red glass Christmas ball, its surface smooth as a mirror, reflecting the soft warm light and blurred silhouettes of the figure, as if carrying holiday blessings and tender secrets; Her left hand hangs naturally at her side, her posture relaxed and expressive. Her skin was delicate and fair, and under soft indoor lighting, it appeared to have a gentle sheen, as if wrapped in a layer of soft veil. In the foreground, the red Christmas ball gently held by her palm and the heavy red ribbon wrapped around silver-white branches form one of the visual focal points. In the middle are the lines of her slender neck, shoulders, and arms. The garment feels light and soft, with faint white lace or embroidered edges, adding a touch of vintage and refinement. Although the background is slightly blurred, you can still make out more silver-white Christmas tree branches and hanging red decorative balls, creating a strong festive atmosphere. In the distance, warm-toned walls or curtains can be faintly seen, hinting at a cozy and cozy indoor environment. The composition uses the classic rule of thirds: the main figure is positioned slightly toward the center on the right side of the painting, while the left side leaves ample negative space to showcase the decorative details of the Christmas tree, creating visual balance and rhythm; The slightly tilted angle gives the photo a dynamic and everyday feel, avoiding the overly rigid frontal view. At the same time, the white sheer sheer fabric above the head stretches upward to the right like a cloud, adding spatial layers and a sense of flow to the composition. In terms of lighting and shadow, the overall light source comes from a soft light box or window slightly to the left in front of the figure, with scattered light that is uniform and soft without harsh shadows. The Christmas sphere's surface is strongly reflected, creating bright spots that enhance the image's three-dimensional effect and festive colors; The background area intentionally retains slight shadow transitions to highlight the foreground figure. The atmosphere is warm, romantic, dreamy, and slightly fairy-tale-like, blending the unique joy and reunion of Christmas, while the characters' expressions and postures reveal the innocence and liveliness of youth. The overall style leans toward Japanese art photography or the \"atmosphere\" style popular on Xiaohongshu, suitable for shooting with a phone or regular camera, emphasizing artistic expression in real-life scenes rather than professional studio-level production. It offers a strong sense of immersion and emotional resonance, evoking the laughter and sweet memories of home and family gatherings on winter nights.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
