        {
          "id": "krea2-8c5277fb5f2de356194c9495",
          "alias": "单女泳装浴室媚态坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly at the edge of a white-tiled bathtub in a modern, minimalist bathroom, her body slightly leaning forward, her posture naturally relaxed yet full of tension, showing flexible lines and a confident expression; She wore a highly designed semi-transparent tight-fitting swimsuit, made mainly of pale pink or milky white tulle fabric, which hugged the skin and outlined graceful curves. The neckline and waist were adorned with deep blue sporty zipper details, with the blue zipper extending from the collarbone to the waist, glistening with moisture under the flowing water, highlighting the fusion of fashion and sensuality. Soft natural light streams in outside, intertwining with the indoor warm-tuning lighting to make the space bright and airy; The composition adopts a slightly upward angle, placing the figure slightly to the right of the golden ratio point. The left side is blank to emphasize spatial depth, while the right window forms a visual guiding line. The visual guide path naturally extends from the shower water flow, the curve of the character's arms, and the posture of the legs. In terms of light and shadow, the main light source comes from the upper right, with soft, diffused light evenly illuminating the figure's contours, supplemented by ambient light on the left to create subtle shadows to enhance the sense of depth. The atmosphere combines privacy and openness, with mist misting like a dream. The overall color palette is mainly cool white and gray-blue, creating a tranquil, clean, and slightly ambiguous artistic beauty. It feels like capturing a moment after a daily bath, yet with the refined texture of a professional studio. It combines the casual realism of everyday life with the meticulous craftsmanship of artistic imagery, presenting a visual experience of \"amateur equipment shooting with a professional-grade atmosphere\"—not overly saturated filters, but preserving authentic textures and transitions of light and shadow. Viewers can feel the sensation of water droplets sliding down the skin, the cold reflection of tiles, and the gentle aura emanating from the characters' breathing. The entire painting is like a silent poem, telling a narrative of the flowing body, water, light, and time within a minimalist space.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
