        {
          "id": "krea2-6144ded7765b36f95b1c2808",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔街道倚靠指向",
          "prompt": "A woman lounges lazily on the steps of a pure white spiral staircase, wearing a lightweight, soft light blue denim short-sleeved dress with a skirt that naturally falls below her knees, paired with light purple hollow-out sandals and light-colored mesh socks. Her toes are slightly curled, one leg elegantly raised above her head, toes pointing toward the ceiling, while the other casually rests on the steps below, creating a dynamic and dynamic body language. She turned sideways to look back at the camera, her expression calm and full of storytelling, as if immersed in her own world, yet the camera captured a fleeting emotional fluctuation. The entire scene is set in a minimalist interior space, with the surrounding walls, floors, and stairs all in pure white, with no decorations or clutter, creating an extremely clean and pure sense of space. Sunlight slanted in from the upper left of the painting, casting sharp geometric shadows on the white wall of stair railings and steps. The interplay of light and shadow creates a strong visual rhythm of light and shadow, soft yet three-dimensional, illuminating the delicate textures of the skin and clothing folds. The composition adopts a slightly top-down angle, placing the figure slightly to the right of the frame. The staircase structure guides the gaze upward, while slanted lines enhance dynamic balance and visual impact. In the foreground is her raised leg and sandals, rich in detail and decorative; The middle ground is the powerful support structure formed by her body leaning against the stair handrail; The background is layered stairs and walls, gradually fading into the blur, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and dramatic, blending the fresh elegance of Japanese art photography with the carefree freedom of street fashion blockbusters. Light and color echo each other, creating a surreal beauty that lies between dream and reality. The image texture leans toward realistic film shooting, with slight grain noise and natural color shifts. It simulates the slight exposure transitions and color temperature deviations that ordinary digital cameras may encounter in bright environments, giving the images a friendly, everyday yet artistic depth. It's like a precious moment captured unintentionally when afternoon sunlight streams through the blinds into the room. It neither deliberately pursues perfect composition nor avoids subtle emotional expressions in daily life, presenting a sense of authenticity and freedom. A vibrant visual aesthetic.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
