        {
          "id": "krea2-336a38e2ff67ef4c884b81e8",
          "alias": "单女棕短裙街道俏皮坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a vintage-style bar high stool, wearing a gray-and-white striped long-sleeved top paired with a brown A-line skirt, and thick plush socks with blue trim and intricate patterns, creating an overall look that combines a relaxed vibe with Japanese street style. In his right hand, he held a clear glass filled with bright red smoothies or juices, with a pink straw in the cup; his left hand casually rested on the edge of the sleek wooden bar, and on his wrist, he wore a minimalist metal watch. Her body leans slightly, her posture relaxed yet full of storytelling, as if she has just ended a casual chat or is waiting for the next moment. In the foreground is a glossy dark brown wooden bar counter railing, whose curved lines extend diagonally from the lower left corner of the painting to form a visual guideline. The bar surface reflects soft warm light and blurred shadows, adding a sense of authenticity. The medium shots focus on the woman's entire body and surrounding environment, including the metal stand high stool she sits on, the black-and-white geometric floor tiles beneath her feet, and everyday items such as spice bottles, seasoning jars, and tissue boxes faintly visible behind the bar, creating a realistic, everyday scene. The background is a slightly dim yet richly detailed bar interior, with vintage dart boards, posters, neon signs, and various decorations hanging on the walls. On the right side, another empty metal high stool and wooden tables and chairs can be seen. In the distance, bottled drinks and small items are displayed on the shelves, creating an overall atmosphere of a Japanese izakaya or an American vintage bar with a slightly nostalgic vibe. The composition uses a slightly slanted, low-angle perspective to give the subject a stronger sense of pressure and presence, while the frame structure formed by the foreground armrest enhances the depth of the image; The subject is positioned near the golden ratio point of the composition, occupying the visual center but not fully centered, leaving room for breathing. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by warm yellow tones, creating delicate transitions between light and shadow and local highlights. The shadows tend to be softer and blurred, avoiding harsh cuts. The overall lighting creates a lazy, cozy, and slightly hazy mood in the afternoon or evening. In terms of color, the gray-white striped top contrasts with the brown skirt in a classic color scheme, while the blue and yellow patterns on the sock sleeves add a lively and lively feel, interwoven with the warm brown, wood, and black-and-white blocks in the background to create a harmonious and layered image. The entire image exudes a strong sense of life and cinematic feel, as if shot in low-light conditions on an old film camera or a modern smartphone. The noise is minimal, color saturation is moderate, and dynamic range is rich. It preserves the clutter and warmth of the real world while using soft focus and light and shadow to give the image poetic narrative tension, evoking an ordinary yet emotionally charged afternoon.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
