        {
          "id": "krea2-97e22d6293fe5a91ad338155",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙摄影棚忧伤坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly on a modern, minimalist white curved windowsill, wearing a fitted black high-neck long-sleeve dress with a hem that naturally falls above the knees, paired with semi-transparent black stockings. Her toes are slightly exposed, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with a subtle white polish. Her makeup is delicate and soft, her right hand naturally resting on her knee, her body slightly turned to the side, her posture relaxed yet full of tension. The background features bright vertical striped curtains composed of light blue, off-white, and pale yellow gradients. Light passes through the curtains to form soft vertical beams, creating a hazy layered light behind and around the figures. The curtain folds are delicate and three-dimensional. The foreground features a smooth white window sill, whose clean geometric lines contrast with the figure's curves, enhancing the sense of spatial depth in the composition. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, head slightly tilted, gazing directly at the camera. The light and shadow are delicate and soft, with the main light source coming from the front left of the subject. At the same time, subtle transitions of light and shadow are created on the folds of clothing, leg skin, and curtain textures, creating a warm yet slightly cool atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly black, white, and light gray, visually clean and crisp yet still sexy, with a strong sense of fashion photography and artistic expression. It feels as if shot in a professional studio, yet carries the tranquil beauty casually captured in daily life. The images are tranquil and storytelling, conveying an independent, confident, and slightly melancholic temperament.",
