        {
          "id": "krea2-ce69167c66f567ee28a357d0",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙城市俏皮站立演奏",
          "prompt": "She wears a simple yet youthful black-and-white patchwork dress, paired with a pure white short-sleeved shirt paired with a black spaghetti strap skirt. A bright red ribbon bow is tied at the chest as the finishing touch. The asymmetrical hem lifts slightly with her body movements, revealing long, fair legs. She wears classic black loafers paired with over-the-knee white socks, presenting a Japanese-style campus idol or a light anime role-playing style, full of sweetness and vitality. In the foreground, the ground where she stands is paved with fine white gravel, with a delicate texture that glows softly under the sunlight. On the left edge is a professional portable LED photography fill light device, with a black body and colored power cords scattered on the ground, suggesting this is a carefully arranged outdoor portrait shoot; In the middle ground, behind her is a modern building facade with light-colored exterior walls. On the right side is a large window with a dark brown wooden frame. The glass reflects a blurred image of the sky and surroundings, and a vintage copper wall lamp hangs on the wall. On the left side, in the distance, is an abstract art installation sculpture framed by white metal, stretching upward like tree branches, creating a dreamlike urban street atmosphere. The entire composition uses a slightly top-down medium to close-up shot. The figure is positioned in the right half of the frame, with the body slightly turned toward the camera. The left hand gently lifts a corner of the skirt, while the right hand naturally hangs down at the waist, creating a lively and dynamic pose; At the same time, the direction in which the skirt is raised forms an upward, dynamic line that guides the viewer's gaze to follow the curves of her body; Light comes from the upper left, representing the soft daylight of morning or afternoon, outlining clear and soft silhouettes. The hem and legs create slight highlighted edges due to backlighting, and the gravel on the ground reflects delicate layers of light and shadow; The overall color palette mainly features a warm and cool contrast. The main clothing features a calm and clean black-and-white tone, while the background buildings and vegetation display low-saturation cool tones like blue, gray, and green, together creating a fresh and tranquil yet lively visual atmosphere. The footage exudes a sense of \"everyday amateur equipment shooting\" — not a flawless professional studio shoot, but a realistic aesthetic style with slight natural noise, slight edge defocus transitions, and soft shadow transitions, as if on a sunny afternoon. Youthful moments casually captured with a phone or small camera are then post-processed with color grading to enhance color contrast and emotional impact, making the entire scene both lively and full of cinematic narrative beauty and artistic expression.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
