        {
          "id": "krea2-3712b8045480228d83bf3826",
          "alias": "单女全裸黑西装城市自信倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully leans on an orange leather sofa, dressed in a sharply tailored black suit with her jacket exposed to reveal the collar of a white shirt underneath. She wears short trousers paired with sheer, nude-colored stockings, barefoot between the armrest and cushion, exuding both the sharpness of a modern urban woman and a hint of lazy sexiness; Under soft light, it glows with a healthy glow, slightly tilting its head to gaze into the lens, as if silently communicating with the viewer; In the foreground, she gently grips the armrest of the sofa with one hand, her fingertips painted with elegant white nail polish, while her other leg is naturally bent and raised, her toes lightly touching the ground. The lines of her legs are long and smooth, and her skin appears delicate and subtly warm under the light and shadow; In the middle ground, an orange sofa occupies the lower half of the frame, with clear leather texture, neat stitching, and a full, elastic cushion. On the left edge, a corner of a light-colored small table and the outline of a tablet can be faintly seen, suggesting this is a modern, minimalist home or office leisure space; The background is a smooth, white wall, with a dense artificial green wall hanging above. The leaves are layered, with deep and light green intertwined, dotted with a few small clusters of yellow flowers, injecting vitality and a natural atmosphere into the entire scene, while creating a visual sense of vertical extension. The composition uses a slightly upward angle, giving the figure a stronger sense of presence and approachability. The body is arranged diagonally along a diagonal line, extending from the lower left corner to the upper right. The visual guide path runs from the foreground sofa armrest to the figure's waist, creating a soft and warm light and shadow atmosphere. The main light source comes from the front left of the frame, creating a natural, three-dimensional contrast of light and shadow. The shadowed areas transition softly without feeling awkward; The background green wall is slightly shadowed by side light, enhancing the sense of spatial depth; The overall color scheme is dominated by orange, black, and green, creating a visual balance of warmth, vitality, and serene elegance. It exudes a refined and relaxed atmosphere typical of daily life, as if sunlight streaming through the window frame on an afternoon brings her pause and a casual snapshot of her life. Yet, thanks to precise composition and delicate emotional expression, it possesses the texture of artistic photography. Without excessive staged shots, it exudes genuine natural beauty and a confident, composed aura throughout.",
