        {
          "id": "krea2-372b154323aa2da019868b06",
          "alias": "单女黑礼服海报愤怒侧头",
          "prompt": "She wore a delicate black spaghetti strap gown with a tailored upper body that outlined her graceful shoulder and neck lines. The chest area was adorned with densely and evenly colored round beads or rhinestones, reflecting a faint glow under soft light without glaring, highlighting understated luxury and exquisite craftsmanship. Around her neck is a slender silver chain necklace woven from multiple layers of fine chains, with a small, delicate teardrop-shaped transparent crystal pendant at the end hanging gently, gently swaying along the curve of her neck. The earrings are hollowed out and inlaid with sparkling crystals, creating a simple modern yet highly detailed aesthetic. The entire composition uses the classic rule of thirds and a central offset. The main figure is positioned slightly to the left of the canvas, with the head slightly tilted and the body facing right, creating spatial depth and visual flow. The background is a large, pure gray-white wall with no decorations or cluttered elements. The minimalist approach emphasizes the subject's presence, while a slight depth of field blurs the background into soft, transitional color blocks, avoiding overshadowing the main focus. The use of light and shadow is extremely meticulous, with the light source coming from the upper left front of the character, a soft, diffuse lighting pattern that enhances skin texture and the layering of bone structure; Natural soft light transitions appear at the edges of the neck and shoulders, while the folds and beaded surfaces of the garments appear glossy and realistic due to high-gloss reflections. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, restrained, and full of artistic flair, with black, white, and gray as the main color palettes, presenting a \"still life\" aesthetic in high-end fashion photography. It resembles a movie still or magazine cover shoot, yet still carries the authentic graininess and slight noise typical of everyday amateur equipment, preserving the breathing and warmth of life. The cinematography is restrained yet expressive, allowing viewers not only to see her external beauty but also to feel her inner emotional tension and personal charm. It is a visual work that combines commercial texture with deep humanistic emotion.",
          "description": "",
