        {
          "id": "krea2-a6e01f7e9264110cf648272f",
          "alias": "单女透视连衣裙博物馆忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright in the center of a modern, minimalist indoor space, wearing an olive green spaghetti-strap spaghetti strap dress with the hem naturally falling to mid-thigh, paired with black sheer stockings and black Mary Jane high heels, with the ankle straps adding a retro and refined touch; Her makeup is delicate and soft, with her right hand lightly resting on her left knee, her left hand naturally resting on her thigh, her nails neatly trimmed with light pink nail art, and her fingertips slightly raised; She sits in a blue, suede-shaped round modern chair with slender metal legs, ergonomically curved backrests that create a striking color contrast with the surrounding environment; On the left side of the foreground is a black glass round table, with clear reflections on the tabletop. On it are a used white paper cup, a black smartphone, and another blank paper cup. The edges of the cups bear coffee stains, hinting at a leisurely moment just ended; The center area is the visual focal point of the main figure and chairs. The background wall is pure white, adorned with multiple mounting art posters, including black-and-white photographic works and printed exhibition information such as \"Louisiana Museum for Modern Art\" and \"In a Love Gregory.\" The poster borders are uniformly black, creating a cultural atmosphere reminiscent of an art museum or independent gallery. The window on the right side reveals the outdoor street view, revealing gray pavement, low residential buildings, and withered vegetation. The dim lighting outside the window contrasts with the warm indoor lighting; The overall composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure occupying about two-thirds of the frame, and the body slightly tilted to the right to create dynamic balance; Light and shadow come from the ceiling soft lights combined with window side lights, creating natural leg shadows; The atmosphere blends urban art with a sense of privacy and leisure, presenting a tranquil, stylish, and slightly lonely contemporary youth aesthetic—like a brief break in a late-night café or private studio, combining everyday authenticity with the refined layout and emotional expression of artistic photography.",
          "description": "",
