        {
          "id": "krea2-ba1e66b39b3ae3c31fcca32f",
          "alias": "单女米外套商店困倦站立持包",
          "prompt": "On the streets of London at night, a woman became the absolute focal point of the scene. She wore a fluffy, soft cream-colored plush cropped jacket paired with gold thin-strap high-waisted shorts, accentuating her long, well-proportioned legs. A slender silver chain necklace around her neck adds a subtle accent. Her left hand gently holds a white quilted handbag, whose metal fasteners reflect a warm glow under the light. The overall look is both luxurious and youthful; In the foreground is the asphalt pavement where she stands, with a clear grainy texture. The ground is transitioned between light and shadow by streetlights and shop lights. Her posture is slightly tilted, her right leg leans forward, her left arm hangs naturally, and the plush jacket follows her body's curves, presenting a soft, three-dimensional shape that creates a dynamic beauty; In the middle frame, bustling streets stretch into the distance, with pedestrians weaving through in small groups, their varied figures blurred into flowing silhouettes in the background, adding a sense of authentic urban life to the scene; In the background is the grand and elegant facade of the Chanel flagship store, with beige walls paired with black wrought iron balcony railings. The warm yellow lighting inside the window sets off the displayed products, with several customers coming and going at the entrance; Above the building hangs a massive blue crystal chandelier installation, woven with dense LED beads to form the brand's signature double C pattern, dazzling like a galaxy of stars and illuminating the entire street; On the right, in the distance, the windows of a multi-story office building are lit up with warm yellow lights, and a white flag printed with the word \"CHANEL\" flutters gently in the wind, creating spatial layers with the building on the left; The composition adopts a medium-near portrait perspective, with the main subject positioned slightly to the left of the frame, while retaining ample background information to present the ambiance; The visual guide line extends from the foreground road to the middle of the crowd and then to the background buildings, creating a sense of depth. The backward glances of characters and the light trajectories together form the visual flow; In terms of light and shadow, the main light sources come from decorative light arrays on the rooftops of buildings and warm light from shop windows, creating a contrast of cool and warm temperatures. The shadows transition delicately, and the plush coat surfaces show subtle gradients due to reflections; The atmosphere is filled with luxury, fashion, and the romance and bustle of urban nightlife. It combines the sophistication of a high-end luxury brand with a relaxed and composed attitude toward women living in a bustling city. The overall color tone leans toward warmth, with a slight film-like filter effect, as if taken by a professional camera in low-light conditions, capturing fleeting elegance and dynamism, presenting a dreamy yet realistic visual aesthetic.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
