        {
          "id": "krea2-ea461df60a4feca591c1b9d1",
          "alias": "单女和服椅上微笑跪展示",
          "prompt": "She gently raises her right hand and places a small, adorable fox mask on top of her head. The ambiguous smile creates a quiet yet storytelling atmosphere. Her kneeling posture is natural and elegant, with legs together and bare feet pressed against the floor, showcasing the tranquility and humility of a Japanese-style interior space. In the foreground, her body occupies the main position, with the kimono's folds and subtle light and shadow variations. The fabric feels soft and flowing, and the cuffs are slightly raised, as if moving lightly with each breath. In the middle of the frame, she sits on a red cushion or low stool, with the words \"CKS*JAPAN\" printed on the edges, glowing with a warm glow and forming a striking contrast with the background. The background features large Japanese-style paper sliding doors (shoji), divided by fine wooden frames into neat squares, allowing soft, even natural light to pass through. The light diffuses from behind, forming a hazy halo around the figure's outline, while subtly casting light and shadow transitions on the kimono fabric. The composition adopts a slightly overhead angle, making the figures appear friendly and focused. The kimono cuffs in the foreground and vertical lines in the background form visual guidance, creating a warm and soft lighting atmosphere, reflecting the diffuse effect of afternoon sunlight filtering through paper windows. The entire composition presents a highly harmonious visual balance, combining the simplicity of everyday life with artistic detailing, like a carefully composed film photograph capturing moments of tranquility and inner imagination, evoking the Japanese legend of the divine fox and the beautiful scenes of spring gardens intertwined with inner thoughts.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
