        {
          "id": "krea2-840533d6c71598fbef3da3e5",
          "alias": "单女绿衬衫街道害羞站立出神",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways in front of a traditional outdoor building, her head slightly lowered and gazing into the distance, showing a gentle yet slightly shy expression; Under the sunlight, she wears delicate geometric pendant earrings on her earlobes, reflecting a sparkling glow; She wore a light mint green cotton polo shirt, with deep green fine-trimmed stripes on the collar and cuffs. In the center of her back, a three-dimensional, full-bodied pink rose pattern was embroidered. The petals were layered and finely outlined, accented by two dark green leaves, making her a visual focal point. Her hands naturally folded behind her waist, her posture relaxed yet full of effortless elegance; In the foreground is her clearly visible silhouette and the texture details of her clothing; in the middle is the open ground and blurred wooden railings where she stands; in the background are two massive traditional vermilion columns, their mottled and peeling surfaces showing signs of age, and the columns under strong light create sharp contrasts of light and shadow and warm tones; The composition uses a slightly slanted side view, placing the figure in the right third of the frame, using red columns as a symmetrical frame to guide the viewer's focus on the back and floral embroidery; The visual guide line extends from the direction of the character's head to the distant blurred background space, creating a sense of depth and storytelling; The light is bright and direct sunlight, slanting down from the upper left, casting clear and soft shadows on the shoulders, arms, and clothing, while creating a highlighted contrast at the rose embroidery on the back, enhancing the sense of depth; The overall atmosphere is warm, tranquil, nostalgic, yet youthful and energetic. The main colors are light blue, deep green, pink, and vermilion, creating a fresh and lively visual impact. It carries a strong Japanese street photography style, as if capturing a lazy afternoon stroll. It expresses both the atmosphere of life and artistic beauty, presenting a realistic, natural, and emotionally charged visual texture, reminiscent of real portraits taken with an amateur camera on a sunny summer afternoon, with minimal noise and chromatic transitions. It strengthens non-professional yet heartfelt visual storytelling.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
