        {
          "id": "krea2-6fa1add360a83feec95d0ebc",
          "alias": "单女和服雪地注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in traditional Japanese kimono poses a profile with a strong Eastern aesthetic against a pure black background. Her right hand is raised above her shoulder, fingers lightly extended like blooming lotuses, fingertips painted with white nail polish, outlining slender and smooth lines in the backlight. Her left hand hangs naturally at her side, sleeves fluttering in the breeze, the fabric delicate and soft. It displays a silky luster and layered folds; The kimono's main color is pure snow white, with delicate red cherry blossom embroidery patterns on the collar, cuffs, and hem. Slender red tassels hang at the ends that gently sway in the breeze, while a few stray strands are illuminated by the backlight, drifting into semi-transparent threads of light in the air, adding vitality and poetry; The composition uses a classic rule of thirds and diagonal guidance. The main figure is positioned on the right side of the canvas, with the body extending diagonally to the upper left. The direction of the gaze and the arm lift trajectory together create an upward visual flow. The black background completely strips away all distractions, allowing the viewer's attention to focus entirely on the figure's form and the interaction of light and shadow.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
