        {
          "id": "krea2-185b91218803e20a14c1d1f2",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙摄影棚冷淡坐比耶",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly on a modern, minimalist black chair with crossed metal frames and warm wooden legs. She wears a form-fitting black long-sleeve dress with a deep V-shaped neckline adorned with delicate ruffles, and the tie details on the chest add a touch of mystery; Paired with black sheer over-the-knee socks and high-heeled thick-soled transparent patent leather sandals, lace trim at the ankles, nails painted with light purple polish, fingertips lightly touching the chair, legs naturally crossed, posture calm and confident. It exudes a temperament that is both mature and pure. The foreground features a light-colored wooden floor with clear and soft grain. In the left corner, a large pot of lush indoor plants is placed in the left corner, with broad, deep green leaves that contrast sharply with the background, adding vitality and a natural atmosphere. The middle shot focuses on the visual center formed by the main figure and the chair; the chair's structural lines are simple and powerful, supporting the center of gravity of the entire composition. The background features an artistically crafted pink gradient wall, with smooth, winding wave patterns carved on the surface. Each curved edge is embedded with fine, pearl-like dots, with light and shadow flowing softly across the surface. The right area is bathed in warm red lighting, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The entire image is shot slightly from above, making the figure appear more upright and noble, with a stable and balanced composition. The figure is centered slightly to the right, then spreads out into the wavy patterns of the background, creating a sense of visual depth from near to far, from solid to void. The lighting is delicate and soft, with the main light source coming from the front left, while subtle shadows are cast on the background wall to enhance the sense of depth; Slight reflections under the floor and chairs suggest ample ambient light and smooth materials. The overall color palette is dominated by black, pink, and wood, with strong but non-jarring contrasts. Black and pink create a classic warm and cool collision, while the wood-colored floor provides a warm base. The transition of light and shadow is natural, creating an atmosphere that combines high-end fashion with a private, romantic vibe. It feels as if you are in a carefully arranged modern art studio or private space, featuring exquisite lighting and props from a professional studio while retaining the authentic texture and lifestyle of everyday shooting, creating a quiet, understated, yet powerful aesthetic expression.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
