        {
          "id": "krea2-ee165f07105af811c7c6ae02",
          "alias": "单女白外套车厢微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a vintage tram platform, wearing a fluffy, lightweight off-white down jacket lined with soft light gray plush material. The hem is tied with a drawstring design, the cuffs hang naturally, and she pairs it with a light purple sheer long skirt that flutters gently in the wind, giving the overall look a gentle yet energetic look; With a warm and sincere smile, showing her white, neat teeth, she glances back at the camera; In the foreground, the rails and platform edges are clearly visible, the ground is paved with gray-brown bricks with delicate texture, and on the right side, dark metal columns extend vertically to the edge of the image, forming a visual guiding line; The middle shot is a blurred platform passage, where a passerby in a brown jacket with his back to the camera can be faintly seen walking, his figure blurred to create a sense of spatial depth; In the background is a classic yellow-green two-tone retro tram, with smooth body lines, window glass reflecting soft light, round front headlights faintly glowing, door frames and window details clearly visible, and distant architectural silhouettes faintly visible, presenting a unique tranquil atmosphere of a Japanese street scene; The entire composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure positioned in the left two-thirds of the frame. The right column serves as a guiding line to direct the viewer's gaze toward the main subject, while depth control creates a distinctly layered spatial structure between the background tram and the pedestrian in the middle shot; In terms of lighting and shadow, natural light pours in from the upper left, with delicate highlight reflections in the coat's pleats, and faint shadows cast along the hem edges. The overall tone is warm with a slight film graininess, creating a nostalgic, cozy, and slightly artistic atmosphere; The overall image presents the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting, with moderate color saturation and rich details yet a hazy beauty, as if frozen on a city street on an autumn afternoon or early winter morning, full of life and youthful vitality. It combines the noise of the city with the gentle moments of tranquility, evoking a sense of unexpected encounter.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
