        {
          "id": "krea2-d3d7f2a4ada39e411cd69840",
          "alias": "单女全裸粉连衣裙摄影棚困倦坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits gracefully on the steps of an indoor wooden staircase, wearing a soft pink sleeveless dress paired with semi-transparent nude stockings and a pair of minimalist yet visually striking pink pointed high heels. The upper is adorned with striking black geometric lines, and the ankle and calf lines appear soft and elongated in the light. Her makeup is exquisite, gentle yet mysterious. The foreground focuses on her long legs and high heels, extending diagonally from the bottom of the frame to the lower right corner, forming a strong visual guiding line. The center is her complete sitting posture, forming a stable compositional foundation together with the stair handrails and steps. In the background is a simple indoor staircase, with wooden steps contrasting with the white walls in warm and clean tones. At the end of the stairs, a door or partition with hollowed-out carved decorations can be faintly seen, creating a sense of spatial depth. The overall composition is a medium to close-up shot, shot from a slightly upward angle to make the main subject stand out, while the horizontal lines of the stairs create a sense of rhythm and layering. Light comes from soft natural light or indoor lighting on the left, evenly illuminating the figure, while the shadowed areas are concentrated at the staircase edges and beneath the figure's body to enhance the sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, private, and artistic, blending the casual feel of daily life with the carefully arranged traces of a studio, presenting a subtle balance between real life and artistic creation. It resembles footage shot with amateur equipment but post-processed with color grading. The color saturation is moderate, leaning toward warm tones, emphasizing the gentle texture of pink clothing and skin, creating a hazy, dreamy visual experience with a touch of nostalgia, allowing one to feel a quiet sense of solitude and a delicate expression of feminine charm.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
