        {
          "id": "krea2-0115d57be5f11d4d847d830a",
          "alias": "单女外套车厢俏皮持相机",
          "prompt": "The collar was slightly raised, with clear zipper details. The cuffs and shoulders formed soft pleats due to the garment's padding formed soft pleats. Her hands were naturally crossed over her chest or lightly draped in front of her, looking relaxed and natural; The texture and light and shadow transitions of the down jacket are delicate and realistic, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality; In the middle shot, you can faintly see the blurred outline of a vintage tram behind her. The upper half has a warm creamy yellow tone, while the lower half is painted a steady dark green. The window glass reflects the phantom of the street scene, creating a richly layered background blur effect; The distant view is completely softened, preserving only the blurred outlines of city streets and distant architectural silhouettes, creating a strong sense of depth and spatial depth; The composition uses the classic center-right thirds method, with the figure's head positioned near the golden ratio point and the line of sight slightly extending to the upper left, creating a soft dynamic balance; Light comes from natural daylight, with smooth and natural shadow transitions without a stiff cutting feel, while creating a delicate contrast of light and dark on the jacket surface to enhance texture; The overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, yet retains the everyday life vibe of urban life. The color palette is mainly warm white, light gray, cream yellow, and dark green, forming a harmonious gradient color palette. The color saturation is moderate, creating a sense of intimacy and lifestyle aesthetics reminiscent of everyday street encounters. The images present the authentic texture of professional photography equipment, with rich and layered details, featuring cinematic-level soft out-of-focus blur and film graininess, as if captured by a high-end digital camera in the afternoon sunlight. This preserves the authenticity of the image while embodying artistic narrative emotion, conveying a free, joyful, and warm humanistic emotional tone.",
