        {
          "id": "krea2-0c092ec4e355b3f273c2721a",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙海滩严肃站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the Riviera Coast, wearing a light, flowing white strapless dress. Her right hand gently lifted a corner of her skirt, while her left hand naturally rested at her waist, her posture relaxed and relaxed, as if enjoying the breeze and sunshine by the seaside; The foreground focuses on the lower and middle part of her body, with the skirt covering about one-third of the lower part of the frame, forming a visual anchor point; The middle ground is the transition from her waist to her head, with the background being a completely blurred ocean and sky, presenting gradient blocks from light blue to deep blue. In the distance, faint silhouettes of ships or reef silhouettes can be seen, creating a sense of spatial depth; The composition uses a classic three-part layout, with the main figure positioned slightly toward the center on the right side of the painting, the left side blank to create a sense of breathability, and the overall diagonal dynamic extension; In terms of light and shadow, the light comes from the upper left of the front, softly and evenly onto her skin and clothing, creating natural highlights and subtle shadow transitions. There is no strong contrast or harsh shadows, highlighting the delicate texture of the skin and the transparency of the fabric; The atmosphere is filled with the freshness and freedom of a summer beach. The blue tone dominates the visuals, delivering a tranquil, pure, and healing emotional experience. The overall color saturation is moderate, with slight film graininess and soft focus effects, giving the images a warm, nostalgic artistic film feel. The setting is a clear, cloudless tropical island afternoon, with the sea shimmering but blurred to emphasize the main subject; The entire image presents a style that is artistically expressive while shooting with everyday amateur equipment—a non-professional studio setting, capturing moments with handheld cameras or phones under natural light, preserving authentic human movements and environmental interaction details, avoiding excessive post-processing, emphasizing the fusion of natural beauty and lifestyle aesthetics, conveying a positive feeling of youthful carefree and love for life, suitable for social media sharing or personal photo book covers.",
