        {
          "id": "krea2-2f32759da0323e1baf1c8cff",
          "alias": "单女黑短裙海滩忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "On a winter seaside shrouded in cold and silence, she drapes a heavy and luxurious black plush cloak, with warm brown fur trimmed at the collar and cuffs, like a gentle flame quietly blooming in winter, radiating a lonely yet elegant aura in the cold air; She wears a fluffy, soft black wool hat on her head, as if gazing at the distant white lighthouse standing at the edge of the frozen sea—the distant and unreachable shore in her heart; Slightly raised, it forms a soft dynamic contrast with the plush edges of the cloak, infusing the scene with a lifelike rhythm; She wears a black fitted mini skirt and black stockings, with a leather belt with silver metal buckles at her waist. Simple yet refined, it outlines a slender yet powerful silhouette, becoming a visual focal point amid the cool tones of black, white, and gray; She sat on an old wooden chair, its surface mottled and cracked, with wood grain of varying depths interwoven, as if recording countless stormy memories. A thin layer of snow settled where the chair's legs touched the floor, adding a touch of desolation and realism; The composition uses a slightly upward angle, making the figure appear tall and commanding, while guiding the gaze naturally to the middle ground—behind her lie scattered rocks and gravel beaches, covered with a thin layer of frost that reflects the faint light from the sky, presenting a cold yet hard texture; In the background is the vast, frozen sea and the distant white lighthouse. The red lampshade atop the lighthouse stands out in the pale blue sky, standing alone at the edge of the coastline like a silent watchman, witnessing the changing of seasons and the joys and sorrows of life; The entire scene is dominated by cool tones, with the sky showing a gradient of pale blue and gray-white. Sunlight filters through gaps in the clouds, soft yet slightly cool, creating delicate and warm highlights that create a tranquil, ethereal yet slightly melancholic atmosphere. On the right side of the painting, there is a slight backlighting effect, giving her silhouette a soft halo and enhancing the sense of depth and dreaminess; The overall composition is balanced and full of tension, with the main figure occupying the center-left position, while the lighthouse is cleverly placed at the rear right, creating a visual sense of symmetry and extension. It extends downward to the waist and leg lines, then spreads to the rocks and sea in the background, finally converging at the distant lighthouse, progressing layer by layer to build spatial depth and emotional depth; The entire image presents an almost cinematic narrative atmosphere, combining the authentic texture of everyday photography with the poetic expression of surrealism. It feels like a scene taken from a winter art film about loneliness, waiting, and hope—both cold and gentle, both realistic and dreamlike, inviting endless imagination about distant places and inner worlds.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
