        {
          "id": "krea2-c5b6dd8fa1a6dbcb720712e7",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道困倦站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by a metal railing on a city street. From a low-angle downward angle, she blends into the sky. She wears a loose, flowing white long-sleeved shirt, the hem fluttering in the wind. Her left hand holds a bundle of transparent balloons held high, filled with rose gold foil and colored confetti, reflecting a dreamy glow in the sunlight. Some balloons flutter slightly, with ribbons wrapped around her wrists forming a natural arc. The background is a modern urban skyscraper. The glass curtain wall reflects the blue sky and white clouds. In the distance, the \"TSUT\" logo can be seen atop the building. The sky is a deep blue, washed with fluffy white clouds. Light pours in from above, casting soft shadows on the shoulders and legs of the figures. The overall composition uses a warm-toned daylight filter to create a fresh yet slightly nostalgic film texture. The composition centers on the figure slightly to the left, with the balloon cluster extending from the upper left corner to the middle right forming a visual guiding line. The foreground railing appears as a black curve running across the bottom of the image, adding spatial layering. In the middle shot, figures and balloons become focal points. The background buildings are blurred to enhance the main focus, with sharp light and shadow contrasts and natural transitions between light and shadow. The atmosphere is both childlike and free, yet also tinged with loneliness and contemplation. It feels like searching for a moment of tranquility in the bustling city. The entire image presents a blend of poetry and reality in everyday life, like street portraits taken with an amateur camera, with slight noise and color aberration effects to enhance realism and documentary. The color saturation is moderate yet emotionally expressive, with ample blank space in the frame. It gives people endless room for imagination.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
