        {
          "id": "krea2-41d7880317a0f20db8ec1460",
          "alias": "单女和服烟火俏皮注视",
          "prompt": "Night falls, and the deep black sky is torn apart by dazzling fireworks into a dreamlike painting. The main figure is a woman, dressed in a traditional kimono printed with pink peonies and green leaf patterns. The fabric glows with a soft silky texture in the faint light, with faint crimson fabric trim visible at the cuffs. Her fingers curl slightly, her posture somewhat restrained and fragile, as if seeking a moment of peace amid the bustling celebration, creating a quiet yet story-filled atmosphere. The foreground focuses on her shoulders, neck, and hand movements, while the background is a blurry yet dazzling fireworks spectacle. On the right, a huge blue firework blooms like a nebula, with bright white light dots intertwining with golden rays at the center. On the left is a cluster of scorching orange-red fireworks, dotted below with dense warm yellow light spots like scattered stars. The entire background appears dynamic blurred and light blur, intensifying the lively yet fleeting festive atmosphere. The composition uses a slightly upward-looking mid-to-near perspective, placing the figures slightly lower and center-centered to form a visual focal point, while leaving a wide space above for the fireworks display, creating a contrast tension between the figures and the grand celebration. The visual guide extends from the direction of the characters' upward gaze to the core area of the fireworks, creating a strong emotional resonance. The lighting and shadow are highly dramatic, with the overall shadow being dark, highlighting the emotional state of loneliness or contemplation. The background fireworks are presented with high saturation and brightness, interwoven with warm and cool tones—blue-purple tones evoke mystery and calm, while orange-red tones convey passion and celebration, forming a striking color contrast. The overall atmosphere is permeated with a contradictory aesthetic of \"loneliness amid prosperity\" and \"tranquility amid the noise.\" It combines the passionate exuberance of a festival with personal tenderness and introspection. It feels like shooting with a film camera at night, with slight grain noise and color cast, presenting a retro cinematic feel. The edges of the frame have a slight blending effect, enhancing the hazy poetry and emotional depth, as if recording a moment of youth, tradition, festivals, and inner monologue—both everyday and surreal, both real and full of artistic imagination. It draws people into reflection on the subtle balance between beauty and transience, liveliness and loneliness.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
