        {
          "id": "krea2-372e8937f450d329ad54cc68",
          "alias": "单女白T恤酒廊冷淡倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully leans on a vintage deep red velvet lounge chair, dressed in a simple white camisole top and short skirt, draped over a black casual jacket and pure white mid-calf socks. Her posture is relaxed yet exudes refinement, gently holding a black smartphone in both hands, as if immersed in a moment of tranquility in the digital world; The makeup looks natural and translucent, appearing even more delicate under warm light; The foreground focuses on her long legs and leg lines, with her right leg naturally bent over her left, white socks outlining her calf curve, creating a strong color contrast with the deep red seat, while also suggesting a private, home-like casual atmosphere; In the middle is a classical curved armchair, with a carved wooden frame and full cushion forming a visual focal point. The slight tilt of the seat back extends to the right side of the frame, guiding the gaze toward the space behind; In the background is a wall of deep brown solid wood wine cabinets, with countless tall glasses and wine sets neatly hanging inside the glass doors. Under the recessed spotlights at the top, they reflect a crystal-clear cold light, subtly balancing the warm tones in the foreground. The metal handles below the cabinet and the brass trim along the bar edge add luxurious details; The entire composition uses a slightly overhead angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, their bodies stretched diagonally, creating a dynamic and balanced aesthetic. The camera captures close-ups of their half-body and legs from the side, creating an intimate yet distant sense of observation; Then, the phone screen guides the viewer's focus, while the multiple reflections created by the wine cabinet glass add layers and mystery to the space; The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by warm yellow tones, with soft indirect light from the ceiling and above the bar illuminating the skin and folds of clothing, creating delicate transitions between light and shadow, while the background wine cabinet area retains moderate shadows to enhance depth; The overall atmosphere blends the leisurely modern urban life with the elegance of a retro bar. It is neither fully realistic nor purely artistic, but features the natural noise, slight defocus edges, and reflections typical of everyday photography devices (such as iPhones or small cameras), presenting a \"life slices\" style of documentary aesthetics—like private moments casually recorded during a late-night nap, combining cinematic narrative rhythm with the breath of real life and unvarnished human warmth. Reminiscent of old Paris taverns, Tokyo jazz clubs, or tranquil moments in old Shanghai vintage houses, every detail silently tells of loneliness, waiting, or fleeting respiteful moments in virtual socializing.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
