        {
          "id": "krea2-00559d0b90b182afdecf571a",
          "alias": "单女韩服摄影棚忧伤倚靠阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in exquisite hanbok leans elegantly against the edge of an ancient stone wall, barefoot lightly resting on the gray stone steps, her posture relaxed yet full of classical charm. Her deep blue top is embroidered with delicate floral patterns, while the light purple skirt is adorned with intricate lace trim and soft embroidery. The flowing hems reveal the silk's smooth texture and the refined temperament of Eastern aesthetics; Her makeup is exquisite yet restrained, gazing into the camera or distant distance, as if silently conversing between history and modernity; In the foreground, her legs are long and graceful, her toes slender, and her exposed skin appears warm and gentle under soft lighting, forming a striking contrast with the rugged stone wall behind her; The middle ground features the heavy stone wall structure she leans on, with clearly visible brick and stone textures. The gray-white tones and the blue-purple of the figures' clothing create a visual tension that intertwines warm and cool; In the background, the rolling castle walls are faintly visible under the mist. In the distance, you can faintly see the upturned eaves of traditional Korean architecture and a fluttering flag. Behind the wall is a vast yellow-brown grassland and sparse vegetation. The sky is a mix of pale blue and gray-white clouds, with soft and even light without strong shadows, creating a tranquil and distant historical atmosphere. The composition uses a slightly upward, low-angle shot, allowing the main subject to occupy the golden ratio area of the composition. The stone wall serves as a strong vertical guide line extending from the upper right to the lower left, enhancing the sense of spatial depth; Visual guidance starts with the barefoot foreground and then spreads to the background of the castle and sky, forming a natural reading path; The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere leans toward a soft, diffused daytime scene. Light pours from the side and above, casting delicate transitions of light and shadow on the folds of the characters' clothes and stone walls. This preserves detailed layers while avoiding harsh contrasts, giving the image a poetic, nostalgic, and slightly melancholic cinematic feel. It resembles a film image gently touched by time, with the meticulous craftsmanship of a professional studio and the authentic temperature captured by everyday amateur equipment. The color saturation is moderate, with a balanced mix of cool and warm tones, blending the overall atmosphere with a sense of historical weight. Eastern aesthetics combined with the independent and gentle temperament of modern women draw people into this serene and story-rich scene.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
