        {
          "id": "krea2-4e20f29c7212909f5ebe6c67",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙城市俏皮坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sat elegantly on a high stool in a modern-style bar, wearing a delicate burgundy corduroy spaghetti strap dress with several metal buttons arranged at the front. The straps cleverly slid down to one shoulder, revealing a delicate shoulder and neck line. Her hands were gently folded over her chest, fingertips lightly touching the fabric edge, her posture naturally relaxed with a touch of playfulness. It was as if she was silently communicating with the audience, her expressions revealing confidence, joy, and a gentle aura tinged with shyness. The high stool she sits on features a minimalist industrial design, with a black metal frame paired with a round wooden seat, sturdy and modern; Behind it is a dark wooden bar counter. Behind the bar, you can faintly see colorful bottled drinks neatly displayed in refrigerated cabinets, creating a dreamlike halo effect under the cold light strip. The feature wall is made of black and white geometric tiles joined together, with patterns that are orderly and rhythmic. On the right wall hang several vintage books arranged vertically, each with different spine colors, adding a touch of cultural atmosphere and warmth to life. The spatial layout of the entire scene is clearly layered: the foreground features the lower half of the woman's body and the partial details of the high stool; the middle shot focuses on her upper body, clothing textures, and hand movements; the background features a blurred bar counter, refrigerated cabinets, and wall decorations, creating a strong sense of depth and visual focus through shallow depth. The composition uses a classic centrally symmetrical portrait style, with the figure centered to the right, the composition proportioned harmoniously, and the blank space just right. The lighting atmosphere presents a warm and soft indoor lighting effect, with the main light source coming from the front slightly left, while subtle shadow transitions between the skirt hem and the arms enhance the sense of depth; It creates a quiet, comfortable, and slightly private atmosphere for nighttime social spaces. The overall color saturation is moderate, mainly burgundy, black-gray, and off-white, accented with a few colorful bottles and book covers, creating a visually unified and varied look. The image quality is delicate and realistic, as if shot with a regular digital camera or phone in a low-noise environment, preserving slight natural graininess and realistic light and shadow transitions, without excessive post-processing, presenting a friendly, down-to-earth yet artistically rich authentic style that evokes the laziness and romance of urban nightlife, as well as the characters' inner ease and ease.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
