        {
          "id": "krea2-eb1f3035f6738343bd7b40e8",
          "alias": "单女短裙海滩困倦站立",
          "prompt": "On a vast, boundless, tranquil seaside beach, a woman stands gracefully in a sideways posture slightly to the left of the center of the painting. The cuffs naturally cinched to the elbows, the hem flared in a fluffy A-shape, and the skirt swayed lightly in the wind, soft and flowing like clouds, presenting a semi-transparent, dreamy texture under the light. The foreground is a fine, soft white sandy beach, with sand particles glimmering faintly under the sunlight. Faint footprints or water stains can be seen near the feet, while the foreground has a slight blurred effect, as if the camera deliberately focuses on the main subject while preserving a hazy spatial layered beauty; The middle ground shows the edge of the waves where seawater meets the beach, gently lapping the shore, forming layers of white foam and shimmering waves. The water reflects intense sunlight, creating large bright and dazzling highlight areas, and the distant sea and sky gradually transition into soft blue-white tones; The background is a vast, clear sky, pure as if washed, with almost no clouds, only a few thin threads of cloud faintly visible in the sky. Sunlight pours down from the upper right of the frame, forming a soft and warm backlit outline that outlines the figure with exceptional clarity, while a faint halo and soft focus effect are cast behind her; The composition uses the classic rule of thirds and the golden ratio, with the figure positioned on the left third of the canvas, and the line of sight naturally extends to the right to the distant horizon, creating a sense of expansive spatial depth; The visual guidance path starts from the foreground beach, extends upward along the lines of the figure's body to their upward posture, and finally converges at the distant horizon, creating a strong emotional pull and spatial extensibility; The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere presents a strong soft glow and a high-profile feel. Sunlight filters through sheer clothing and dust in the air, creating a diffused light effect, making the entire scene transparent and bright without being glaring. The color saturation is low, mainly cool tones accented with warm light spots, creating a fresh, ethereal, and slightly melancholic poetic atmosphere; The entire image has a distinct film texture, with fine and soft grain and natural and smooth color transitions, possessing cinematic narrative tension and emotional appeal. It feels like a quiet scene taken from an artistic youth film, filled with complex emotions of freedom, healing, romance, and loneliness, making one wonder what she is thinking at this moment—is it nostalgia? Or is it just dreaming of the future? Or simply enjoy the peaceful moment of undisturbed moments? This atmosphere is suitable not only for art photo book covers but also as a visual memory point for mobile wallpapers or social media sharing, offering strong emotional resonance and aesthetic value.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
