        {
          "id": "krea2-feaf421f1949df5036567602",
          "alias": "单女衬衫室内忧伤注视",
          "prompt": "She lowered her head slightly, her expression calm and tinged with melancholy. She wore a dark loose shirt and light blue jeans, the fabric wrinkled naturally, arms relaxed and hanging down, her posture slightly curled up, as if silently bearing some emotional weight; The foreground shows her shoulder and arm, with clearly visible clothing textures and subtle light transitions at the cuffs; The expression is restrained, with the background showing the inside of an open refrigerator. Several white plastic beverage bottles are neatly arranged on metal shelves. The label on the bottle is blurry but recognizable as Korean or Japanese brand logos. The bottle cap has a light brown wood texture, reflecting cool white light, creating a hazy blur effect under the deep blue color palette. The inner walls of the refrigerator have fine textured heat dissipation holes, and the overall space is dominated by cool tones, creating an atmosphere of solitude, tranquility, and even a touch of distance. The composition uses a compact diagonal side, with the figure occupying two-thirds of the right side, the left blank space extended from inside the refrigerator to create visual balance, and the camera slightly tilted to enhance the dynamic and psychological tension of the image; The viewer's gaze is then drawn into that cold, orderly, yet metaphorically rich space; In terms of lighting and shadow, the main light source comes from the cold light source inside the refrigerator, creating a high-contrast division of light and dark, while the other side sinks into deep shadows, emphasizing emotional layers and spatial depth. The lighting inside the refrigerator is evenly distributed, creating soft reflections on the bottle body and creating a sense of calm and isolation in the environment; The overall atmosphere is filled with the fatigue, loneliness, and complex intertwining of urban life and inner worlds. The colors are dominated by gray-blue, cool white, and ink black, with low saturation, creating a retro texture reminiscent of film film. The image texture is delicate and authentic, as if shot with an old digital camera or phone in low-light indoor environments, with slight noise and vignetting at the edges, presenting emotional moments captured unintentionally in daily life. It combines the refined composition and emotional expression of artistic photography. It also preserves the true temperatures and imperfect details of amateur equipment shooting, allowing viewers to feel a silent aesthetic wrapped in time and space.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
