        {
          "id": "krea2-94d501d3db1bb211555c8e70",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫城市困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A female photographer stands under the shade of trees by the lake, wearing a blue and white plaid shirt, her expression gentle yet focused as she gazes up at the sky, as if immersed in the poetic beauty of natural light and distant scenery; She steadily holds a professional-grade digital camera with both hands, featuring a Sony G series large-aperture prime lens. The body design is simple and modern, with a black body and silver mount creating a delicate texture contrast. The camera strap hangs over the shoulder strap, paired with a brown plush backpack. On the wrist, she wears a black sports watch, with details that are both authentic and full of everyday life. In the foreground is a large canopy layer with lush branches and leaves, where leaves glow with a translucent green glow in the gentle sunlight. Some branches span the top of the painting to form natural frames, while leaf edges create a hazy blur effect due to shallow depth of field, creating a richly layered visual depth; The middle ground is a calm lake surface like a mirror, reflecting the distant, undulating green hills. The gentle ripples create a subtle sense of movement, and the edges of the lakeshore faintly show the texture of grass and soil; The background is a distant mountain forest shrouded in mist, with tones transitioning from bright green to soft gray-green from near to far. The outlines of trees gradually blur and blend into the skyline, with bright, soft white highlights suggesting a scattered light environment of clear afternoon or light obscured by thin clouds; The composition uses a slightly upward-looking angle to shoot the subject, with the person positioned slightly to the center on the right side of the frame, the body facing upward to the left, creating a strong visual pull; The overall composition features a diagonal layout, with branches, human arms, and camera lines forming a diagonal guiding structure, enhancing the sense of spatial extension; The lighting atmosphere is dominated by soft natural light, with light shining diagonally from the upper right of the subject. The camera lens has clear but not harsh reflections; The background blur treatment cleverly preserves the shape of the scenery without interfering with the main subject, creating a \"shallow depth, dreamy\" atmosphere; The color palette leans toward cool natural tones, with the blue plaid shirt harmoniously complementing the green vegetation. The overall image conveys a tranquil, far-reaching artistic youth who loves photography and nature exploration. It combines the realism brought by professional equipment with soft light, contrast between reality and blur, and emotional expression to present a highly artistic visual style, like a city travel diary captured with amateur equipment, full of the warmth of daily life and poetic imagination.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
