        {
          "id": "krea2-61475a666bcfc742d4396b60",
          "alias": "单女棕毛衣庭院坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a Japanese-style wooden floor, her body slightly turned to the camera, head slightly tilted. Her overall posture is natural and relaxed, sitting cross-legged, her right hand resting lightly on her knee, her left hand gently caressing the skin of her calf. Her slender fingers are adorned with several delicate rings. She wears a dark brown off-shoulder long-sleeve tight knit top that outlines her soft silhouette, paired with a brown and black plaid mini skirt. The hem of the skirt casually falls by the knees, creating a soft contrast with the dark clothing. In the background is a huge traditional Japanese wood-framed glass window. Outside, you can faintly see lush green trees and a blurry courtyard scene. Sunlight streams through the window lattice, casting warm light and shadow stripes on the wooden floor. In the corner by the window sits a rustic wooden chair with smooth backrest and sturdy, sturdy legs. In the distance, blurred wooden partitions and cabinets create a tranquil Japanese living atmosphere. The entire composition uses a medium shot. The figure is positioned on the right side of the canvas, occupying the visual focal point. The foreground clearly shows the wooden floor texture and the outline of the legs, while the middle features the main body and some furniture. The background is blurred to highlight the subject, with light streaming diagonally from the upper right to create a soft backlighting effect. At the same time, a natural transition of light and shadow between the floor and the character's sides is created. The overall tone leans toward warm brown, creating a warm, nostalgic, and slightly artistic atmosphere. The texture of the painting is delicate and authentic. It looks as if a high-resolution professional camera was shot under natural light, with rich details but never overpowering the scene. The layers of light and shadow are distinct, the emotional expression is subtle yet storytelling, evoking the feeling of a beautiful moment encountered in a quiet afternoon.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
