        {
          "id": "krea2-51eaf2422249125d2cec4880",
          "alias": "单女摄影棚冷淡注视",
          "prompt": "A female character serves as the main subject, dressed in a white sportswear that blends modern casual and retro collegiate styles. Her sleeves and pant legs are decorated with black stripes and tassel knots, and she wears a delicate white lace headband with a bow at the end. She pairs her glasses with thin rims, gently supporting the frames with her right hand, exuding a relaxed yet confident demeanor. The legs are simple white metal structures, partially covering the lower left corner of the screen to create a sense of spatial layering; The middle shot is a close-up of the chair and legs of the female lead. The chair is avant-garde in shape, with a bright blue plastic backrest, white seat and armrests, metal bracket support, and a plush carpet with alternating orange and white geometric patterns. The carpet edges transition smoothly to the gray floor; On the right side of the background is an old-fashioned CRT monitor computer with a silver-gray shell and teal sides. The screen is closed, the keyboard rests on a transparent glass tabletop, with wires naturally hanging down. Behind it is a large window with white vertical louvered curtains that let in soft natural light, and the outline of the city's buildings can be faintly seen outside. The entire composition uses shallow depth of field, with background elements such as computers and windows moderately blurred, creating a visual depth of front and back; Light comes from the upper right window, softly and evenly casting on the figure, while creating delicate shadows on the floor and surfaces to enhance the sense of depth; The color palette is mainly cool tones, dominated by white, blue, and gray, accented by a warm contrast between a yellow tablecloth and an orange carpet, creating a fresh, tranquil, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere; The visual guide lines naturally extend from the subject's gaze, arm movements, and the edge of the foreground tablecloth into the depths of the frame. The overall atmosphere combines the casual nature of daily life with the refinement of artistic photography, as if shooting in a private studio or home study full of technological and retro vibes. Through light and shadow control, color coordination, and prop arrangement, it conveys a tranquil, healing, and distinctive lifestyle aesthetic. The image texture is delicate and authentic, like shooting with a high-resolution camera under natural light. It preserves rich texture details and subtle emotional expression.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
