        {
          "id": "krea2-fd417548ccf50dd978dd74f3",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙城市冷淡站立注视（2）",
          "prompt": "A woman with outstanding temperament stands in a modern, minimalist interior space, exuding confidence and composure; She wore a fitted black sequin bodycon dress that fit her figure, with the hem cutting to mid-thigh, outlining graceful curves. Over it was a stylish long black leather coat, with fluffy, soft white fur adorning the collar and cuffs, creating a strong black-and-white visual contrast. The open posture of the coat was both casual and noble, and a delicate heart-shaped pendant necklace faintly visible on the chest shimmered softly around her neck. Her legs are long and straight, she wears semi-transparent black stockings, and on her feet are a pair of gold-wrapped high-heeled sandals adorned with fine rhinestones. The heels are slender, and the metallic sheen on the upper sparkles under the lights; Her right hand gently strokes the collar of her coat, while her left hand hangs naturally at her side. Her body turns slightly, her head slightly turned toward the camera, her posture elegant and full of tension; The front ground features a light beige marble texture floor, smooth and clean that reflects soft light. At the front left edge, a small gray carpet can be seen, adding layers to the space; In the middle is where she stands, and to the left of the background is a row of dark brown wooden bookshelves, embedded with warm-toned LED light strips that illuminate the neatly arranged books and magazines, creating a warm and intellectual atmosphere; On the right side is a large off-white wall divided into geometric modules with dark metal lines, clean and neat, with a black smart panel switch embedded in the wall; The overall composition uses a full perspective in the middle shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, using perspective to guide the gaze toward the subject; Light and shadow come from a soft light source in the upper left, casting clear but subtle shadows on the floor and walls, enhancing the sense of depth; The visual atmosphere combines urban fashion with artistic photography quality. The black-and-white main color scheme paired with gold accents creates a sophisticated, cool, and mysterious luxurious visual tone. It combines the realism of everyday shooting with the delicate emotional expression of professional portrait photography. The overall image is clean and crisp, with restrained yet impactful colors, as if capturing a moment of modern urban woman showcasing her charm in her private space, full of storytelling and aesthetic tension.",
