        {
          "id": "krea2-f4a1b4385b92a581ad047227",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔楼梯愤怒站立泼洒",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on the middle steps of a spiral metal staircase, wearing a loose light blue denim jacket paired with a light pink crew-neck T-shirt and a matching denim skirt, paired with brown woven sandals that glow softly in the sunlight. Her body twisted slightly, tracing a light arc through the air. The water droplets shimmered under the strong light, as if time had been frozen in that instant. Her left hand naturally rests at her side, while her right hand firmly grips the handle of the teapot, her posture composed and ceremonial. The spiral staircase has an off-white or light gray cement texture, with simple and powerful railings and steps extending from the lower right corner to the upper left, forming a strong visual guide that draws the viewer's attention to the main figure and cleverly divides the spatial layers between sky and ground. The background is a vast, boundless pure blue sky, without a single cloud. The colors are highly saturated but not glaring, creating a tranquil, open, and slightly lonely atmosphere. The light comes from the upper right, typical of tough daylight, making the figure's outline clear, with delicate contrasts of light and shadow and textured details on the folds of clothing and metal railings. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, enhancing the character's uprightness and spatial depth, while allowing the sky to occupy most of the composition, reinforcing the theme of upward growth and hope symbolized by the \"watering\" action. The foreground section consists of stair handrails and scattered water droplets, with the droplet trails extending from the pot mouth to the lower left of the painting, creating a dynamic visual focal point; The middle shot focuses on the entire body of the figure and the movement of holding a watering can; The distant view is an infinitely stretching blue sky. The overall color scheme is mainly a cool blue-gray tone, with the strong contrast of the yellow watering can creating a visual focal point, creating a striking contrast yet harmonious artistic effect. The light and shadow treatment is delicate to avoid overexposure, while the metal railings create sharp shadows from direct light, enhancing the sense of depth. The atmosphere combines the rustic realism of everyday life with the poetic imagination of surrealism—a seemingly ordinary act (watering) is placed against a grand and open backdrop, giving it metaphorical meaning: perhaps to nurture inner desires, or to breathe life into abstract concepts. The entire scene is filled with tranquil, gentle, and slightly philosophical emotional tension, like a silent poem or a visual prose composed with light, shadow, and color, suitable for those who pursue ultimate compositional beauty and emotional expression when shooting with amateur equipment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
