        {
          "id": "krea2-881298e5bd963437a5402104",
          "alias": "单女全裸白连衣裙椅上严肃坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sat elegantly on a vintage-style dark brown wooden chair with a beige suede cushion trimmed with delicate metal rivets. She wore a pure white short-sleeved dress with a fluffy bow at the collar. The skirt flowed lightly down to mid-thigh, her posture relaxed and full of tension. Her left leg naturally bent over her right, her right hand gently touching her knee, while her left hand held a blue-and-white plaid short skirt, as if she had just transitioned from a school uniform or everyday outfit. Sheer nude stockings were worn at her ankles. Her bare feet were slightly raised, and a pair of pristine white pointed high heels were casually placed on the wooden floor, creating a subtle contrast and tension with her posture. Looking directly at the camera, wearing small, delicate pearl earrings that glow gently under soft light. In the foreground is a dark brown wood grain floor, with clearly visible grain and scattered with a few tiny dust or debris, enhancing the image's realism and sense of life, while guiding the viewer to focus on the subject. The middle shot shows the chair the woman is sitting on and the extension of her leg lines; the chair's structure, cushion texture, and leg posture together form the visual focal point of the painting. The background is a pristine white wall adorned with various decorative frames, including abstract floral patterns with gold borders, Big Ben's black-and-white photos framed with silver borders, blue-and-white porcelain-style circular patterns with green borders, and a gray-and-white geometric collage on the left. These artworks are arranged at different sizes and angles, creating rich layers and cultural atmosphere while avoiding monotonous backgrounds. The composition uses a slightly overhead angle, making the leg lines appear more elongated. The diagonal lines formed by the chair and floor enhance the sense of spatial depth. The overall composition is diagonally balanced, with the figure positioned slightly to the right, leaving more blank space on the left side but filled by the frame, creating a visual effect that balances stability and movement. The lighting and shadow atmosphere presents a soft, even indoor diffuse light effect. The light source seems to come from the upper left of the image, with natural transitions in the shadows, without harsh contrasts of light and dark, creating a peaceful, warm, and slightly nostalgic indoor atmosphere. The overall color palette mainly features white, beige, and light wood, accented with blue plaid and gold frames. The color combination is harmonious and unified, giving a fresh and pure feeling while maintaining an elegant and refined artistic temperament. It resembles a carefully arranged life scene photograph, with slight film graininess and natural noise, like capturing it with an entry-level digital camera as afternoon sunlight filters through the window, full of the warmth and beauty of everyday life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
