        {
          "id": "krea2-f9600615e6f543b9e20a3848",
          "alias": "单女白旗袍茶室俏皮坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright at a table by an ancient wooden window, dressed in a light, translucent white modified Chinese qipao. The collar is embroidered with delicate and elegant pink floral patterns, with soft lines at the cuffs and collar. Her expression is calm and gentle, and on her left wrist is a bright red wrist strap, adding a touch of brightness. She was gently stirring the orange-yellow smoothie in her cup with a slender wooden spoon, garnished with a slice of fresh lemon. The ice sparkled under the sunlight, the liquid gleaming enticingly. In the foreground is a thick, warm wooden desktop with clearly visible grain. On the left side of the table sits a vintage black film camera, its lens shining silver and paired with a reddish-brown leather strap. Next to the camera is a transparent glass filled with ice water; On the right side, a traditional oil-paper umbrella painted with ink landscape and figure patterns is placed. The umbrella's surface alternates blue and white, with the ink outlining the classical atmosphere of travelers holding an umbrella. The background is blurred, with faint wooden columns, climbing green vines, and warm yellow indoor lighting. Distant blurred figures hint at a lively yet intimate space—possibly a teahouse or café full of Eastern charm. The composition uses a close-up perspective, with the main figure positioned slightly to the right center, tabletop objects creating visual balance, and the window frame edge in the upper left serving as a natural frame guiding the viewer to focus on the figure and the drink. The use of light and shadow is highly layered, with bright natural light streaming in diagonally from the left side, casting deep shadows on the desk and behind the back, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow and a sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and far-reaching, carrying a touch of artistic flair and poetic life. It feels as if time slows down at this moment, with dappled light and shadow like poetry. The painting's tones are warm and soft, mainly warm yellow and wood tones, complemented by plain white clothing, orange-yellow drinks, and blue-black umbrellas, creating a harmonious and unified color without losing rich layers. The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if taken by a professional camera in the afternoon sunlight, with slight film graininess and soft focus effects. The details are rich but not noisy, conveying a sense of leisure and aesthetic enjoyment far from the hustle and bustle, immersed in one's own small world. It combines the subtle elegance of Eastern classical style with the daily leisure of modern life. The images are full of storytelling and emotional tension, inviting reflection on her current state of mind and past experiences.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
