        {
          "id": "krea2-2223463dcb75a313970bbec3",
          "alias": "单女空姐紫制服城市持包",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a delicate purple flight attendant uniform sat gracefully on a modern orange-yellow curved metal frame seat. Her makeup was natural and refined, her hands lightly folded over her chest, carefully adjusting the white badge and blue lanyard hanging around her neck. On her wrist, she wore a simple and stylish watch, adding a touch of urban elite flair to her overall look. She wore a black pencil mini skirt paired with semi-transparent black stockings and brown suede high heels. Her legs were long and well-proportioned, naturally extending along the edge of the chair, presenting a posture that was both professional and graceful; On her left side is a black leather handbag and a suitcase with a purple trolley, suggesting scenes of travel or work; The background is the spacious and bright interior space of the airport terminal, where large glass curtain walls reflect the sky and architectural silhouettes, while in the distance, green lawns and modern architectural structures can be seen, creating a transparent, open, and futuristic visual environment; The geometric lines formed by the metal bracket of the foreground and the floor tiles guide the viewer to focus on the subject, while also enhancing the spatial layering of the composition; The composition uses a slightly upward-looking mid-angle perspective, placing the figure slightly to the right center. The curve of the chair and the body's curve forms a soft visual guideline. Light from outside the window blends soft indoor illumination, evenly casting on the figure to create a warm and bright atmosphere. At the same time, clear and soft shadows are cast on the floor and under the seat, enhancing the sense of depth and authenticity. The overall image presents a daily atmosphere that combines professional aesthetics with a sense of everyday life. The color palette is mainly purple, orange, and black, creating a striking yet harmonious contrast, creating a refined feel of artistic photography while retaining the authentic and delicate texture of amateur equipment, as if capturing a brief yet precious moment of airport waiting, full of storytelling and humanistic warmth.",
