        {
          "id": "krea2-f0d466f03f25a03770544ae8",
          "alias": "单女黑女仆装椅上害羞坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright on a white wooden bench, dressed in a delicate and elegant black-and-white maid outfit. Her top features a white short-sleeve top with black puff sleeves, a wide white ruffle at the neckline, a full, three-dimensional black satin bow tied at the chest, and black buttons at the waist. The skirt is layered with alternating white and black tulle fabrics, and the hem of the skirt reveals semi-transparent pink fishnet stockings with lace patterns. The overall clothing is rich in details and distinct layers. It showcases a visual beauty where vintage and sweetness intertwine. Her hands gently intertwined over her chest, fingertips lightly touching, her posture elegant yet slightly shy, as if silently communicating with the viewer in front of the camera. The background is a weathered, aged white wooden wall, with dark wood grain visible where the paint has peeled, adding a sense of nostalgia and the accumulation of time; On the right side of the wall is a decorative wrought iron window lattice, featuring symmetrical swirl patterns. The metal surface emits a gray-blue hue due to oxidation, and soft natural light streaming through the window creates a contrasting effect of light and shadow, enhancing the sense of spatial depth in the painting. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the main subject positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, with a slightly upward gaze. The foreground uses parts of the chair backrest and skirt edges to create natural occlusion, enhancing the layering and realism of the image. Light mainly comes from the side and rear windows, softly and evenly illuminating the silhouettes and details of the clothing, while creating subtle shadows on the walls and garment folds, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and textured materials. The overall atmosphere is gentle and tranquil, with a strong Japanese retro aesthetic. The colors are mainly black and white, accented with a touch of pink and gray-blue, creating a clean, pure, and slightly melancholic visual mood. The entire image presents the delicate texture and artistic appeal unique to professional studios or high-end amateur equipment, full of narrative and emotional resonance. It makes one imagine the story behind her and her inner world.",
