        {
          "id": "krea2-0f565c3851c8b0648c0b6dc3",
          "alias": "单女衬衫街道沉思站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beside a tree at a city street corner, wearing a light-colored floral shirt. Her left hand gently touches the rough trunk, her body slightly turned to the side, her expression calm yet tinged with contemplation and gentleness, as if pausing briefly in the sunlight to enjoy a moment of peace. It was as if silently telling the story of her heart. In the foreground, her hands pressed tightly against the trunk and part of her sleeves, with the bark grain clearly visible, reinforcing the intimacy between humans and nature. The middle ground is the transitional area between her half-body posture and the background buildings. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting mottled shadows on her shoulders and fabrics, creating delicate light spots and soft gradients that create a dreamlike atmosphere. The background is a somewhat blurred city streetscape, with white residential floors stacked in layers, windows and balconies faintly visible, parked cars and road signs in the distance, but the overall effect is softened by strong backlighting and bokeh effects, presenting a poetic urban atmosphere where reality and illusion intertwine. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, giving the subject a stronger sense of presence and height. The tree trunk slants in from the left side of the frame, forming a visual guiding line. Light comes from the upper right of the frame, with intense sunlight penetrating the leaves to create dazzling flares and radiating halos. Some areas are overexposed to create a soft focus effect. Especially in the second photo, the light almost completely covers her head, creating a sacred or dreamlike atmosphere. The colors are mainly cool tones, with the sky and buildings showing pale blue and gray-white. The figures' costumes are light beige paired with floral patterns, harmoniously blending with the background. However, the warm yellow tones brought by sunlight inject a touch of warm vitality into the composition. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, nostalgic, and slightly artistic, combining the casual feeling of daily life with profound emotional expression. It resembles a film image casually captured on an afternoon street with an amateur camera, with slight noise and film graininess, slight defocus and glow at the edges, enhancing realism and cinematic quality. The images are full of emotional tension—neither a perfectly staged composition nor a pure record, but rather capturing a fleeting flow of thoughts and emotions, allowing people to feel the gentleness of time standing still and the resonance of loneliness.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
