        {
          "id": "krea2-83122601fe4862a0479419b7",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣小径冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a light blue tiled floor, wearing a soft, fluffy white knit sweater. The sleeves and shoulders are adorned with several wide, glossy dark brown ribbons. These ribbons wind from her shoulders to her legs, wrapping around her knees, calves, and ankles, creating a visual effect that is both restrictive and artistic. The ribbon's ends hang naturally to the ground, with some wrapped around her toes, painted with orange-red nail polish, making them stand out in a cool-toned setting. It adds a touch of laziness and softness. The background is a simple light blue square tiled wall, with clear gaps between tiles. The overall space is clean and tidy, with no unnecessary decorations, enhancing the presence of the main figure. In the foreground are her bare feet wrapped in ribbons, toes slightly curled, nail polish brightly colored, contrasting with the tiled floor; The center features her torso and legs, with ribbon-wrapped lines forming the visual focal point, and the background featuring pure tiled walls, creating a closed and intimate atmosphere. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the main figures occupying the main positions. The slightly tilted shooting angle enhances the dynamic and emotional tension of the image, while retaining details of the legs and feet, creating a vertical echo. The visual guide is formed by the ribbon winding path, extending from the shoulder down to the ankle, finally converging at the toes, firmly locking the viewer's attention. In terms of light and shadow, soft natural light from the front and sides evenly illuminates the figures, creating delicate transitions between light and dark, while the shadowed areas are concentrated behind the body and at the edges of the ground, enhancing the sense of depth and spatial layering; The overall atmosphere presents a calm, introspective, and slightly dramatic aesthetic style, combining the simplicity and realism of daily life, like a carefully crafted concept photography, yet retaining the natural texture and lifestyle of amateur equipment shooting, allowing people to feel tension in tranquility and strength in gentleness.",
