        {
          "id": "krea2-9cf810e596a5ba34b144231c",
          "alias": "单女米外套城市严肃站立泼洒",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the white metal railing atop an old city stairwell. She wears a loose beige workwear jacket with a naturally flowing hem, sleeves slightly rolled up to reveal her wrists, her posture lazy yet confident. Her left hand rests on the railing, her body slightly turned to the side, wearing delicate gold geometric earrings that glow in the sunlight. Around her neck, a slender brown leather necklace faintly peeks out. The overall look is simple and casual yet full of urban artistic vibe. In the foreground is the white metal railing she leans on, its surface slightly rusted, mottled, and peeling. The steps below are covered with withered yellow leaves, edges marked by a mix of rust and stains, hinting at the passage of time and the sense of wear and down in the city's corners; In the middle is the cement floor where she stands, cut into sharply contrasting geometric shadows by intense sunlight. On the right is a row of rusty orange-red metal scaffolding or scaffolding structures, with lines extending diagonally to create a strong perspective guide. On the left is a spatial frame composed of white iron railings and steps, together creating a sense of depth and three-dimensional layering; The background features a distant blurred city street outline, including low buildings, cement walls, and scattered potted greenery. Sunlight filters through the clouds and casts sharp trapezoidal and linear shadow patterns on the ground. The strong contrast of light and shadow and the distinct contrast between light and shadow highlight the three-dimensional spatial effect on a clear afternoon day. The composition uses a high-angle overhead view, tilting downward from above to capture the subject, creating a sense of visual pressure and dynamic tension. The blank area in the lower right corner of the frame enhances the sense of spatial extension. Visual guidance mainly draws the viewer's attention naturally to her expression and atmosphere through the movement of the figure raising her hand to shield herself, gaze toward the camera, and the contrast of strength and shadows. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is presented as bright and warm sunlight streaming down, pouring down from the upper left while creating deep shadows in the background and ground, creating a strong sense of depth and authenticity. The color tones are mainly warm gray, off-white, rusty red, and deep brown, with moderate saturation yet rich layering, presenting a daily yet cinematic visual texture. It combines the rough realism of urban life with the softness and poetry within the characters, as if capturing a brief and precious moment of an ordinary afternoon. The entire painting exudes an atmosphere of gentleness, laziness, nostalgia, and freedom, like a photo casually taken by an amateur camera yet surprisingly rich in artistic depth, filled with the genuine warmth of life and subtle aesthetic expressions.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
