        {
          "id": "krea2-ac96467bc1cf4b45c5ef498d",
          "alias": "单女蓝旗袍竹林沉思坐喝",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright on the café terrace set by a simple wooden window frame, dressed in a refined light blue qipao-style long gown. She is sipping an amber-colored iced drink through a straw, her expression calm yet tinged with curiosity and contemplation; In front of her was a rough wooden table with clear textures, a vintage film camera with a deep black body and silver rim lens. A red leather strap casually draped over the edge of the table, and beside it lay a traditional Vietnamese bamboo hat painted with blue and white porcelain. The black-and-white landscape figures were delicate and vivid, with slightly raised edges, as if just put down; In the foreground are thick, mottled black wooden door frames and window lattices. Vines and green plants hang above the frame, swaying like curtains, their leaves shining glossy in the sunlight. A small sticker of the Vietnamese flag is stuck to the left door panel, while dry branches hang naturally by the right window edge, forming a natural visual guideline. In the middle frame, the wooden chair and tabletop form a solid visual focal point for the woman, with the café's warm yellow lighting and blurred bar outline in the background. Several red flags hang on the walls—one featuring the five-pointed star of the Vietnamese national flag, the other a sickle and hammer symbol. The interplay of light and shadow creates a hazy yet story-rich sense of depth; The composition adopts a classic framed style, with windows as natural frames firmly framing the main subject, while the foreground door frame and vines create layering and depth of perspective; This extends to the drink in her hand and the camera on the table, finally converging into the warm light and flags deep in the background, forming a smooth narrative flow; The lighting and shadow create a strong contrast between light and shadow. Outside the window, sunlight pierces through the tree shadows, casting mottled light onto the woman's shoulder and desk. Inside, soft and warm diffused light fills the air, creating a lazy and cozy afternoon atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and dark brown, accented with green plants and porcelain blue-white, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The texture of the image combines the everyday life atmosphere with the refinement of artistic photography, as if peering through this window into a slow-paced, cultural symbol, and life detail in an exotic corner. With the grainy texture of the film and slight noise, the film feels even more authentic and emotionally warm. The entire scene is tranquil and full of storytelling, evoking the imagination of her current state of mind and past experiences.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
