        {
          "id": "krea2-9e5c6cd75ff399af1786f69a",
          "alias": "单女绿毛衣街道坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly by the window of a bright café on a Parisian street corner, sitting at a white table and chair. She wears a thick dark green chunky knit cardigan paired with a black spaghetti strap dress and light-colored stockings, with a slender silver chain necklace around her neck. Next to it is a small plate of colorful macarons—pink, mint green, and vanilla yellow—carefully arranged on a pure white round plate to create a visual focal point; In the middle frame, her long legs are elegantly crossed under the table, with graceful leg lines that form a stable visual support alongside the desk and chairs; Through large floor-to-ceiling windows in the background, classic Parisian street scenes are presented. The beige classical building facades are clearly visible, with arched porches, multi-layered windows, and balcony railings arranged in layers. Distant pedestrians are blurred like flowing silhouettes, creating a sense of real spatial depth; The composition is shot at a slightly top-down diagonal angle, with the person positioned in the right third-section position, naturally directed toward the window, while tabletop objects and the person's posture are balanced; The visual guide line extends from the edge of the table to the movements of the figure's hands, creating a soft, diffused lighting atmosphere. Natural light from outside the window on cloudy days or early morning/evening is evenly filtered, creating warm and delicate indoor lighting. The outlines of buildings outside the window appear slightly gray, creating a contrast between light and dark. The overall color scheme is dominated by low-saturation warm gray, accented with vibrant green cardigans and macarons, creating a tranquil, leisurely, and slightly nostalgic French afternoon atmosphere, as if time has quietly stood still, full of poetry and lifestyle aesthetics.",
