        {
          "id": "krea2-db78c3d50b43e963bdbdc7de",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道冷淡站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a city street at night, looking directly at the camera, her expression calm yet tinged with a faint sense of detachment. She wore a loose white short-sleeved shirt with a soft and wrinkled fabric. The neckline was slightly open, and the hem was casually tucked into a pair of washed-out blue-toned utility jeans. The side pockets of the pants were clearly visible, and a white drawstring was tied around the waist. The overall outfit presented a relaxed, lazy yet refined Japanese street style. Her hands were naturally tucked into her pants pockets, her body slightly turned to the side, but her head was facing the camera, her posture relaxed yet focused. In the foreground is her clear upper body and part of her legs, with delicate textures and layers of light and shadow clearly distinguishable; In the middle is a blurry outline of a vehicle behind her, with words like \"Karen Hotel,\" \"400-88,\" and \"6 people\" printed on the body. The lettering is simple, with gray-white contrasts that appear faintly against a dim background, hinting at a real city nighttime scene; The background is a deep night, almost entirely black, with only faint glimpses of reflections or neon lights visible on the top left corner, enhancing the sense of spatial depth and solitude. The composition uses a vertical shot slightly to the right center, with the figure occupying about two-thirds of the height of the frame. The slightly tilted standing posture gives the scene a sense of dynamism; In terms of lighting and shadow, the light source comes from a soft warm light slightly to the left front, which could be a streetlight or a phone flash, creating subtle transitions between light and dark, while creating natural shadows in the folds of the clothes to enhance the sense of depth; The background is completely in low light, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow that makes the subject stand out from the environment. The overall atmosphere is filled with the tranquility and loneliness of urban nights, with tones blending cool blue-gray and warm whites, featuring a slight film grain texture and vintage filter effects. It's like capturing a moment on a street late at night with an old-fashioned digital camera. It carries both a sense of everyday life and poetry and emotional tension. The images are full of narrative and artistic appeal, like a carefully crafted street portrait photography piece.",
