        {
          "id": "krea2-bb85d59177276a6b46cc0148",
          "alias": "单女绿毛衣害羞站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under a blooming cherry tree, wearing a thick dark green chunky knit knit sweater with two white stripes at the cuffs, paired with a white shirt collar, a gray pleated mini skirt, and black tights. The overall look combines preppy style with a spring-casual vibe. Her head tilted slightly, revealing a sweet, innocent yet slightly shy expression. In the foreground, several cherry blossom branches stretch diagonally down from the upper left, their blossoms pure white tinged with a pale pink, petals layered in layers, some almost touching the shoulders of the figures, forming a soft visual framework; The middle shot shows the girl herself, occupying the center right of the frame, her body slightly tilted, her posture naturally relaxed; The background features vast fields of golden rapeseed flowers, rich and vibrant, with a blurred effect forming warm and bright color blocks, which, together with the pale pink cherry blossoms above, form a brilliant spring backdrop. In terms of composition, medium to close-up portrait photography is used, with the main subject clearly prominent. Cherry blossom branches in the foreground guide the viewer's gaze, while the rapeseed fields in the background are moderately blurred to enhance spatial depth. The light and shadow come from soft, naturally scattered light, possibly on cloudy days or early morning or evening, evenly illuminating the figure without strong shadows, with the sweater's texture clearly visible, while giving the entire composition a warm and serene atmosphere. The overall color palette is dominated by green, white, and yellow, creating a fresh and bright spring color scheme. The green sweater contrasts sharply with the yellow sea of flowers yet harmoniously coexists, while the pink and white of cherry blossoms serves as a soft transitional color. The visual atmosphere is full of youthful vitality, romantic poetry, and natural vitality, combining the warmth of everyday life with a subtle cinematic or artistic photography style, as if capturing a brief and beautiful moment on a spring afternoon. The details are rich: the sweater's knit is clearly visible, cuff labels faintly visible, skirt edges naturally hanging, pantyings at the ankles smooth and delicate, and every small flower in the background rapeseed fields has a unique shape. The cherry blossom branches are strong and strong, petals curling slightly in the wind, presenting a visual experience that is both realistic and artistically beautiful, as if carefully photographed by a high-resolution professional camera or high-quality phone under natural light. Post-production color grading with a slight film graininess and well-controlled color saturation creates a visual experience that is both realistic and dreamy.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
