        {
          "id": "krea2-21753fde285e58f6a758e5e1",
          "alias": "单女白外套街道忧伤坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright on the railing of an old wooden boardwalk, wearing an off-white fluffy lambswool jacket paired with a matching soft scarf, black short skirt, and black stockings, paired with platform sneakers. The overall look combines autumn warmth with a casual street vibe; She leaned slightly to the side, her expression gentle yet tinged with a hint of detachment; In the foreground is a dark brown wooden boardwalk with mottled light and shadows, with a few dead leaves scattered on top, the wood grain clearly visible, and sunlight filtering through the branches and leaves along the edges, casting tiny light spots; In the middle frame, the railing and leg lines of her sit are delicate, with delicate fabric textures and a soft transition between light and shadow between skin and clothing; The background features overlapping and interlaced maple branches, with leaves dyed in autumn tones such as golden orange, ochre, and dark brown. Some branches are exposed and vigorous, with clear outlines in the backlight. In the distance, moss-covered rocks and hazy forest shadows can be faintly seen; The composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. A diagonal railing guides the visual extension to the right, and the background is blurred to create a sense of spatial depth; Light shines diagonally from the upper right, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow in the side lighting, while the shadowed areas retain detail and texture; The atmosphere is tranquil and lingering, carrying the poetic and lonely feeling unique to autumn in a Japanese courtyard. The colors are mainly warm brown, off-white, and ink black, accented with orange-red leaves for a warm yet restrained overall tone; The image presents a slightly nostalgic film texture, with rich layers of light and shadow, combining authentic outdoor lighting with soft focus and graininess from manual post-processing. It feels as if a professional camera was shooting in the afternoon sunlight, yet it retains the authentic warmth and vitality of everyday photography. The entire image conveys personal emotions and the subtle beauty of seasonal changes in the quiet autumn day.",
