        {
          "id": "krea2-6611ebc583e1d98e4a65767f",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙窗边温柔站立",
          "prompt": "In a wooden study full of life, sunlight pours in obliquely through the right window, creating a warm and soft beam-cutting space. The geometric light and shadow of light and shadow interplay on the floor and desk surface creates a quiet and lazy afternoon atmosphere. She wore a red, blue, and white plaid spaghetti strap dress over a light gray knit cardigan, white ankle socks, her skin glistening softly against the backlight, and her legs naturally extended to the foreground. On the carpet to her right front are two small transparent glass bowls: one filled with sparkling green grapes, the other filled with plump, bright red strawberries. The fruit reflects sunlight, creating a striking color contrast that becomes one of the visual focal points. The background features a natural wood desk and bookshelf combination. The tabletop is tidy, with glass cups, a few open books, and a pot of lush snake plant plants. On the wall behind the desk hangs a 2021 paper calendar, beside which stands a vintage yellow desk lamp. The curtains are off-white with deep blue floral patterns gently swaying in the breeze, adding a cozy touch to the home. The composition uses a low-angle shot, making the figures appear more intimate and occupying the center of the frame. The fruit bowl in the foreground forms a guiding line with the figure's legs, while the middle shot's body and desk form a stable structure; The background is highlighted through blurring to highlight the subject. The use of lighting is highly dramatic, with strong side backlighting creating contour light and highlight areas, while the shadows retain delicate layering. The overall tone leans toward warm yellow with a film-like texture, as if shot by an old digital camera or phone under natural light. The details are rich but never overshadowed, presenting a beautiful moment casually captured in daily life, combining youthful energy with artistic nostalgia, allowing one to feel the pure and healing tranquility when sunlight pours into the room.",
