        {
          "id": "krea2-69d7003b3a9ae8f78750ade3",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫椅上微笑坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly on a light-wood chair in the center of a Japanese-style room, dressed in a simple white shirt and black skirt, paired with semi-transparent black stockings. She steps barefoot lightly on the warm tatami, legs naturally crossed, her posture relaxed and confident; With a gentle and serene smile, she gently lifts a cup of green-wrapped drink in front of her chest, as if displaying or sharing a small everyday happiness; The background features a classic Japanese-style sliding paper door, with neat wooden grille lines that emit soft, evenly diffused light, creating a tranquil and Zen-inspired atmosphere; On the left, you can see a corner of a wooden desk made of the same material, scattered with several magazines and small items, hinting at a private corner that blends work and life; The entire composition uses a medium shot, with the figure at the visual center, naturally focusing on the lush green drink in her hand. The light comes from the front side, soft yet layered, skillfully outlining the folds of the clothing, the texture of the skin, and the delicate texture of the stockings, with gentle shadow transitions that are never awkward; The overall atmosphere is warm and refreshing, like a spring afternoon, combining the restrained elegance of Eastern aesthetics with the relaxed ease of modern living. The color palette mainly features deep natural wood brown, off-white, and black silk, accented with a touch of fresh green packaging, creating visual balance and resonance; The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if captured by a high-resolution digital camera under natural light. The details are rich yet minimalist, and every element serves to create a moment filled with the warmth of life and artistic beauty—it is both the protagonist of the scene and the most moving scenery in this tranquil space.",
