        {
          "id": "krea2-9c03aea125b88b8d7a51a71b",
          "alias": "单女衬衫厨房愤怒跪展示",
          "prompt": "A woman kneels on the kitchen floor in a modern, minimalist style, wearing a bright rose-pink tight one-piece sportswear. The back of the shirt features boldly hollowed-out cross-straps, perfectly outlining her long spine and graceful back lines, while highlighting the full, rounded curves of her hips. Light evenly casts soft shadows on it, enhancing the three-dimensional effect of the figures; In the middle of the ground, a simple geometric composition of white cabinet countertops and black ovens is formed, with metal spice bottles, stainless steel electric kettles, and other everyday kitchen utensils neatly arranged on the countertop, reflecting a cool glossy finish; The background features marble walls with natural gray veins, smooth and cloud-like texture, creating a minimalist and sophisticated look with the white cabinets. Above, you can faintly see a black stove and storage racks; The entire shot was shot from a slightly top-down angle, with the composition arranged diagonally around the subject. The lighting and shadows come from natural indoor light or soft lighting, creating a smooth, non-glaring effect, while creating subtle contrasts between the back and legs to enhance the sense of volume. The atmosphere blends the warmth of everyday home life with the sophistication of fashionable photography, combining relaxed everyday life with precise composition and color contrast to create strong visual impact and artistic beauty, as if capturing a private and beautiful moment, showcasing the strength of the female body while conveying a comfortable and carefree lifestyle.",
