        {
          "id": "krea2-4e12748149621677a2de95c6",
          "alias": "单女金睡裙床微笑躺跳舞",
          "prompt": "A woman lounges lazily on a soft, pristine bed, wearing a lightweight, flowing pale yellow polka-dot spaghetti strap nightdress. The thin straps outline the graceful lines of her shoulders and neck, with the hem naturally draping to the sides. The semi-transparent fabric reveals a gentle glow through her skin, and the collar is adorned with warm orange-yellow woven cords, harmonizing with the overall color scheme. Add a touch of casualness and playfulness; She stretches her arms out, fingertips slightly curled, as if unintentionally parting light and shadow, while the other arm naturally extends to the edge of the frame, her posture relaxed and rhythmic; It feels as if you are immersed in the gentle embrace of the afternoon sun, revealing a peaceful and serene smile, blending seamlessly with the overall warm atmosphere; In the foreground, an open vintage hand-drawn photo album lies quietly on her chest. The cover is mainly pink, blue, and off-white, depicting intricate floral patterns and classical figure silhouettes. The pages are yellowed and the edges slightly rolled, revealing the gentle aura of time; The middle shot shows her bare neck, collarbones, and slender arm lines, softly and three-dimensionally outlined under sunlight, with interplay of light and shadow creating a contrast of light and shadow that highlights the delicate texture of her skin; In the background is a simple bedside pillow printed with classical floral patterns interwoven in pale gold and off-white. The shadowed areas transition delicately and richly, giving the painting a strong sense of three-dimensionality and airiness; The overall atmosphere is peaceful, warm, and healing, filled with the lazy and pleasant mood of a summer afternoon. It feels as if time quietly stands still, with only sunlight dancing on the skin and wind whispering between the curtains, creating a poetic everyday aesthetic. It features a slight film graininess and soft color temperature shifts, presenting an artistic effect reminiscent of amateur equipment shooting. The color palette centers on cream white, pale yellow, light pink, and light gold, with moderate saturation and natural color transitions, as gentle and captivating as a carefully painted watercolor illustration.",
