        {
          "id": "krea2-2e976bd853a52f422dcb8a5b",
          "alias": "室内站立跳舞",
          "prompt": "In the background is a corner of a classical brown upright piano, with the keys faintly visible in black and white. The main figure occupies the center-right position, while the left side leaves space for the piano and floor to create visual balance; The lighting atmosphere is dominated by soft natural light, which enters the room diagonally from the upper left, casting soft shadows on the floor and furniture, creating a warm, tranquil, and slightly nostalgic afternoon atmosphere; The color tone leans toward a harmonious blend of warm brown and cream white. Wooden elements contrast strongly with the white dance costume to create a unified visual tone. The overall color saturation is moderate, presenting a film texture rich in cinematic feel, as if shot with an old digital camera or phone under natural light. The details are rich yet soft, combining professional photography compositional beauty with the genuine graininess and slight noise of everyday amateur equipment, giving the entire image artistic depth and emotional resonance. It retains the warmth and authenticity of everyday life, perfectly capturing the tranquility and poetry of a ballerina's moments during a break.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
