        {
          "id": "krea2-bdb030dde62a6f877e27eaa6",
          "alias": "单女全裸白衬衫沙发自信坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly in a classic-style brown leather armchair, featuring intricate wood carvings and a full, button-back design, exuding a strong vintage luxury atmosphere; She wore a pristine white long-sleeved shirt with delicate lace trim at the collar, paired with a black short skirt and nude tights. In the corner sits an old-fashioned wooden radio with metal knobs and a display screen. On top are several books with blurred covers, and on the right side, a corner of a dark wooden cabinet can be faintly seen. The foreground focuses on the lower body and seat details, with the middle ground showing the upper body and armchair as the main structure, while the background is blurred to soften the sense of spatial depth. The overall composition uses a medium and close-up perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, where the lighting is soft and warm. The main light source comes from the upper front of the figure, while the leather seat surface creates delicate reflections, creating a warm and comfortable indoor atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly warm brown, off-white, and dark wood, accented with black. The colors are harmonious and unified, with rich and delicate light and shadow layers, presenting an artistic photography style full of life and nostalgia. It feels like a daily portrait shot with amateur equipment but carefully composed, possessing strong visual appeal and emotional resonance, allowing people to experience beautiful moments in the tranquility of time.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
