        {
          "id": "krea2-29e2aead1a3f177eb710eba5",
          "alias": "单女黑短裤街道困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "She was standing sideways, slightly turning back to look at the camera, revealing neat, white teeth, full of youthful energy and gentle charm. She wore a loose, comfortable pure white hooded sweatshirt with two parallel black pinstripes on the sleeves. A vintage-style black tassel key pendant hung from the collar, adding a touch of mystery and personality. She paired it with black shorts or a skirt, revealing only her slender legs. On her feet, she wore white knee-high socks or boots, with black stripes accented at the cuffs, presenting a clever blend of Japanese style and street casual vibes. Her posture is natural and relaxed: her right hand gently raises and drapes it over the edge of the curtain behind her, her left hand hangs down, fingers slightly bent, and her body leans slightly, creating a dynamic and balanced beauty. In the foreground, her lower body outline from waist to knee is visible, while the background is a large, soft, hazy white gauze curtain. The curtain is thin and translucent, with faintly evenly distributed geometric hollowed-out patterns visible. Under natural light, delicate layers of light and shadow are formed. Light streams in diagonally through the left window, casting soft transitions of light and shadow on her body and clothing, outlining a smooth sense of three-dimensionality. In the middle is the light blue wall where she stands. The wall has a smooth texture and fresh, tranquil colors, creating a warm contrast with the white main building. In the corner, there is a simple white power outlet that adds a touch of everyday life. The entire composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure positioned in the right two-thirds of the frame, leaving a large amount of blank space on the left side, naturally drawing the viewer's attention to the center. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft and dreamy, with pure white as the main color scheme, complemented by fresh light blue walls and warm golden tones from natural light, creating a cozy, tranquil, healing, and slightly artistic home scene. It feels as if afternoon sunlight pours into the room, and the girl is enjoying a moment of leisure. The images are full of the poetry and authenticity of everyday life, featuring exquisite professional composition and delicate lighting, while retaining the natural, intimate, and casual beauty of amateur equipment shooting. Every detail is carefully designed yet not deliberately polished, conveying a pure, bright, and hopeful vitality.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
