        {
          "id": "krea2-9c95c948010392e44fcbebfd",
          "alias": "单女黑西装摄影棚沉思蹲自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman squats on the indoor wooden floor, taking a selfie in a mirror. She wears a black sequin blazer paired with a dark tight knit inner layer and sheer black stockings. Her barefoot posture is naturally relaxed, her right leg bent to support her body, her left knee kneeling on the ground, and her hips slightly leaning back to create elegant curves. Her left hand is gently raised in a \"V\" gesture, and she wears fine-rimmed glasses to enhance her intellectual aura. The reflection in the mirror clearly reflects her focused expression. The foreground focuses on the lines of her legs and the reflection details of her phone screen. In the middle of the frame, the floor texture extends to the bottom of the frame. On the right stands a large softbox bracket, with white softlight half-hanging to block part of the light source. Behind the transparent glass door in the left background, you can faintly see outdoor greenery and window frames. The interior walls are in light gray-white tones, ceiling-mounted downlights provide even lighting, and in the distant corners, camera equipment such as camera bags, tripods, and storage racks are stacked. The floor is covered with gray carpet edges, creating a mix of professional studio and home atmosphere. The composition uses a mirror-reflective perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the center, the body dynamically extending diagonally. The softbox's diagonal cut enhances depth, with soft and natural light and shadow without strong shadow contrast. Light diffuses from the side and top, black stockings reveal skin texture and leg muscles, and the sequins on the suit jacket shimmer with tiny particles, creating an atmosphere of understated luxury and casual everyday style. The color palette is mainly black, white, and gray, complemented by a purple phone case and white matte fabric to create a warm and cool contrast. The overall image exudes a lazy artistic vibe of urban youth expressing themselves in private spaces. It features the rigorous layout of professional photography equipment while retaining the spontaneity and genuine emotions unique to phone selfies, as if capturing a moment of inspiration during an ordinary afternoon when setting up a shooting area at home, offering an immersive visual experience full of the blend of everyday life and creative passion.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
