        {
          "id": "krea2-116e573b7c799537e17f4861",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤街道严肃坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits cross-legged on a wooden balcony floor, her legs crossed, barefoot on the ground, hands naturally folded in front of her knees, her posture relaxed yet full of life, her overall expression full of youthful energy and innocence. She wore a loose black short-sleeved T-shirt with the hem naturally falling to her thighs, the sleeves slightly rolled up to reveal slender arms, with blue \"SECONDS\" lettering and black-and-white vintage character prints on the chest. She paired it with matching shorts or simply wore the T-shirt hem. The overall look was simple and casual, blending street fashion with Japanese casual style. In the foreground is a close-up of her bare legs and crossed hands. Her legs are smooth and slender, her skin glows softly under the sunlight, the details of her hands are clearly visible, her nails are neatly trimmed, and her fingertips are slightly curled, conveying an effortless, natural beauty. The center features her complete body outline and the light brown wooden railing behind her. The horizontal bars of the railing are clearly structured, with a warm wood grain texture that serves as a visual dividing line to guide the viewer to focus on the main subject. The background features a blurred green plant landscape visible through the glass window, lush foliage and dappled light and shadow, creating a sense of depth and tranquility through the blur effect. Soft scattered light outside creates a natural halo effect. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical style, with the figure positioned slightly above and center, the head slightly raised, forming a visual center of gravity. The composition has ample blank space but not hollowness, with breathing space on both sides, and the ground at the bottom extending to the edges enhances stability. At the same time, the horizontal line formed by the greenery and railing outside the window guides the horizontal flow of view. In terms of lighting ambiance, the main light source comes from the natural backlight from the window at the upper left, creating warm and bright highlights, while casting soft shadows on the right side and back of the body to create a sense of depth and layering; The overall color tone leans toward warm yellow tones with moderate saturation, presenting a lazy and comfortable afternoon atmosphere. The image texture is as delicate as film photography, with slight graininess and soft focus effects, reminiscent of everyday moments taken with an old-fashioned digital camera or phone. It captures the most natural state of real life, without excessive embellishment, yet full of artistic appeal and emotional resonance, conveying a quiet, carefree, and carefree youthful mood.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
