        {
          "id": "krea2-697a0155ae8ab83eed3d79a4",
          "alias": "单女白制服瀑布微笑跳跃指向",
          "prompt": "A youthful and energetic Japanese woman leaps through the city streets. She wears a classic white sailor-collar school uniform shirt, adorned with three deep blue white stripes on the cuffs and collar. She wears a bright red bow tie at the chest, paired with a deep navy pleated mini skirt that lifts naturally with the skirt flowing upward. She wears black leather shoes paired with dark socks, creating a clean and crisp look full of campus vibe. Her right hand holds a black microphone high, as if singing passionately or greeting the audience, while her left hand rests lightly on the edge of her skirt to maintain balance, her body in a floating posture, legs bent, knees slightly bent, showcasing dynamic leaping moments. Scattering and fluttering in the air like a waterfall, adding a sense of dynamism and playfulness; She wore a radiant, carefree smile, showing her neat, white teeth, and looked directly at the camera conveying pure joy and confidence. In the foreground, her feet are suspended in midair, while below is a paved paved walkway with clearly visible brick textures, providing a solid visual foundation for the entire scene. In the background is a large glass curtain wall building, through which the indoor gym environment is faintly visible. The blurred silhouettes of people and equipment hint at the daily rhythm of urban life. The glass surface reflects the light and shadows of the sky and surroundings, creating a soft blur effect that enriches the spatial layers while preventing the background from overshadowing the main focus. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical, low-angle downward shot, placing the shot near the golden ratio point to make it an absolute visual focal point, while using its airborne posture to create an upward-extending visual tension. Light comes from natural daylight, softly and evenly spreading over the main body. The details of the clothing are clearly visible, the shadow transitions are delicate, and there is no strong contrast, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The overall color saturation is moderate, with the white, blue, and red of school uniforms as the main tones, harmoniously contrasting with the warm gray brick tones of the ground and the cool tones of the glass background, highlighting the main subjects while adding rich visual layers to the scene. The overall atmosphere is filled with carefree youthful energy, uninhibited self-expression, and the casual beauty of urban streets. It combines the precise control of professional photography with the unique natural vitality and vitality of amateur equipment shooting, presenting a real, vivid, and artistically expressive narrative that lets people feel the joy and strength of life being freely released within urban spaces.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
