        {
          "id": "krea2-a3c5fb4c3a76e627d1f2c73d",
          "alias": "单女白礼服婚礼倚靠交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a delicate white wedding dress with a light hem draped to the floor, lace trim and sheer veils fluttering gently in the breeze. She leans lazily and gracefully against the mottled concrete wall covered in graffiti and stickers. The cracks on the wall reveal the marks of time, densely covered with various street stickers, faded advertisements, and black spray-painted graffiti, creating a strong visual contrast and urban texture; She sat curled up with her legs crossed on the dark asphalt pavement, wearing white high heels, her slender fingers gently caressing the hem of her skirt or letting them fall naturally. In the distance, a blurred city street scene is seen, with pedestrians hurrying by, dressed casually with backpacks, faintly visible shop signs and architectural silhouettes, while the background is blurred, preserving only the general shape of the building structure and scattered light spots, creating a sense of spatial depth through shallow depth of field; The composition uses low-angle shooting, placing the person on the right side of the frame to create an asymmetrical yet harmonious visual balance; Light comes from the upper side, with soft daylight filtering through the alley, and the shadowed areas deepen the emotional intensity of the scene; The overall atmosphere is full of contradictory tension—the pure wedding attire forms a stark contrast with the rough street environment, conveying a kind of \"discordant beauty,\" combining urban loneliness with poetic youthful rebellion and self-expression; The main colors of the painting are black, white, and gray, accented with a small amount of blue and gold jewelry to enhance the visual focus; The photographic style features film graininess and a slight soft focus effect, simulating the natural noise and realistic transitions of light and shadow from amateur equipment, presenting a unique aesthetic between professional artistic photography and casual daily recording, allowing viewers to feel the genuine emotional flow that is neither deliberately staged nor fully documentary.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
