        {
          "id": "krea2-83b4358d915b5bca6e5a1d93",
          "alias": "单女全裸白外套微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "In a poetic and gentle evening portrait, a woman sits gracefully on a huge, rough rock, her figure becoming the absolute visual centerpiece of the image. She wore a fluffy, soft, cloud-like white long plush coat. The plush details at the neckline and cuffs shimmered softly under the dim light. She wore a simple white turtleneck knit sweater underneath, paired with light-colored shorts that fit her body and semi-transparent nude stockings. She wore classic retro-style white Mary Jane chunky heels. The delicate round buttons on the upper contrasted sharply with the thick heels, preserving both the feel and a touch of maturity. In the backlight, she casts a faint golden tint, with a gentle, thoughtful smile as if gazing directly at the camera, as if engaging in a silent dialogue with the viewer in the tranquil twilight. The foreground focuses on her long, straight legs, with smooth and graceful lines from knees to ankles. The skin shows a delicate texture under the interplay of light and shadow, and the white shoes create a contrast between light and shadow on the rocky ground, guiding the gaze naturally downward; In the middle setting, her cross-legged posture contrasts with the layering of her plush jacket; the folds of her clothing echo the texture of the rock's surface, creating a tension that blends softness and ruggedness; The background features silhouettes of mountains and forests dyed in twilight, with dense branches and leaves that reveal deep black outlines due to insufficient light. Only in the upper left sky does a fading pink-orange sunset glimmer, like a gentle edge of a canvas, injecting a warm and dreamy color tone into the entire composition. The composition combines classic three-point ratio with low-angle shooting. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, with a slightly tilted body for dynamic balance. The left blank space perfectly accommodates the sky and vegetation, avoiding crowding. And naturally move down along the legs to the foot details. The handling of light and shadow is extremely meticulous, with clear and soft contours, while the lower body and background are immersed in natural shadows, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow, highlighting the subject while intensifying the mysterious atmosphere of dusk. The overall color scheme is dominated by a mix of warm and cool tones—white clothing and shoes are pure and bright cool tones, while the dark vegetation in the background clashes dramatically with the warm orange glow of the sky, creating a contrasting beauty that is both cold and lonely, yet warm and romantic. The scene is filled with a quiet, contemplative yet slightly melancholic artistic atmosphere, as if frozen on a summer evening about to end, with a girl sitting alone in the undisturbed mountains, enjoying a moment of solitude and freedom. The entire scene exudes a cinematic texture and the real graininess captured by a handmade camera, like a precious moment casually captured at dusk with an old DSLR or phone. It combines the rigorous composition of professional photography with the casual warmth of everyday imagery. It perfectly blends the depth of artistic creation with the warmth of everyday life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
