        {
          "id": "krea2-c4e931c91a73db837fdf19e6",
          "alias": "单女白旗袍俏皮站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on the wide stone steps in front of a magnificent ancient building, dressed in a modern, modernized white qipao with deep green trim on the collar and cuffs, delicate green frog buttons adorning the slit of the skirt, and a pair of thick-soled black Martin boots, creating a striking visual contrast between tradition and modernity, softness and strength. Slightly curled, with simple silver geometric earrings hanging from her earlobes, her hands gently folded over her chest, her body slightly turned to the side, exuding a calm yet playful Eastern feminine temperament. In the foreground are layers of gray stone steps, rough and bearing the marks of time. Sunlight casts clear shadow lines on the steps, enhancing the sense of spatial depth in the painting; The middle feature stone railings symmetrically arranged on both sides, with the column heads carved with smooth cloud patterns or lotus shapes, guiding the gaze upward to focus on the main figure; In the background is a traditional Chinese pavilion with multi-tiered flying eaves and dougong brackets. The vermilion columns and dark brown eaves complement each other charmingly. However, with moderate blurring, the main figure stands out even more. The entire composition adopts a central composition, with the figures positioned near the golden ratio point. The stone steps form a strong guiding line that draws the viewer's gaze toward the figure, naturally extending to the top of the building; The visual guidance begins with the textured details of the foreground stone steps, then converges on the complex structure of the background buildings, creating a strong sense of narrative and layering. The light comes from a high angle directly to the right, representing a strong afternoon glow. Sunlight penetrates the air to create a soft scattered effect, the edges of the figures are outlined with bright highlights, the folds of clothing show delicate transitions of light and shadow, and the stone steps reflect mottled light and shadow. The overall atmosphere is bright and transparent, filled with the warm and tranquil atmosphere of a summer afternoon. At the same time, the architectural solemnity and the youthful vitality of the figures create tension, conveying a cultural atmosphere of \"blending ancient and modern.\" The image texture leans toward a realistic and delicate photographic style rather than painting or digital rendering, as if shot with a professional camera on a clear day. There is slight motion blur and natural noise, preserving real-world texture details and light and shadow layers. Color saturation is moderate, white balance is accurate, presenting an image aesthetic that is both artistic and close to everyday life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
