        {
          "id": "krea2-065129d1ae993bd5d78ba9d6",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道俏皮站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under the shade of a city street corner, sunlight streaming through the dense green leaves on her, creating a dappled, soft light effect. She wears an off-white floral long-sleeved shirt paired with dark blue denim shorts, with a bright orange-red strap slung across her shoulder, creating a striking visual contrast with the overall understated color scheme. The look is slightly curled, her expression gentle yet playful, her left hand naturally resting at her side, her posture relaxed and full of life, with a typical residential building in the background. The white exterior walls are paired with black metal railings and air conditioning units. The windows are neatly arranged, some window sills are planted with potted greenery, and in the distance, a white SUV is parked with clearly visible taillights. In the left foreground, there is a flowerbed made of bricks filled with tall green plants. At the lower left edge of the frame, there is a slight lens halo effect, creating the unique soft-focus texture of film cameras. The entire composition is shot from a slightly upward angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, and tree branches extending from the top to the center. A natural frame structure is formed, enhancing the visual focus. Light comes from the upper left, warm and bright, casting clear shadow lines that enhance three-dimensionality and spatial layering. The overall atmosphere is filled with the lazy and cozy mood of a summer afternoon. The granular noise and slightly overexposed edges of vintage film photography present a realistic, natural, and unedited lifestyle aesthetic, as if casually captured with an old digital or film camera. The color saturation is moderate yet emotionally expressive, with the sky partially obscured by leaves. With only a small glimpse of blue sky visible, the overall scene is tranquil yet vibrant, conveying a poetic sense of youth, freedom, and everyday life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
