        {
          "id": "krea2-d5f7c26b672a76892b40af1e",
          "alias": "单女灰背心户外忧伤坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the edge of the back of an old white pickup truck, wearing a simple gray sleeveless vest and light-colored shorts, paired with platform white sandals. Her legs are naturally crossed, and her expression reveals a hint of laziness, contemplation, or a faint melancholy, as if she is lost in her own world. Her posture is relaxed and full of life, her body leaning slightly forward, knees bent, and her calves clearly visible, exuding youthful energy and an effortless sensuality. The pickup truck's body is marked by time, with a black metal badge on the rear reading \"4WD DIELOCK,\" and a red and white warning stripe below. The taillights are rectangular with a slightly muted color, and the surface shows fine scratches and stains from long-term use, conveying a genuine and rugged everyday feel. The vehicle was parked in a somewhat messy yet lively-filled outdoor environment, with a subtle visual boundary forming between the edge of the truck bed and the ground. In the foreground are metal panels at the edge of the truck bed and rough gravel floor, scattered with fine stones and dead leaves, adding a rustic natural feel; The middle shot depicts the girl's body and the rear of the vehicle, forming the core visual focal point of the composition; In the background, a blurred residential scene is visible: houses with corrugated roofs, weathered walls, wooden railings entwined with vines, and faintly visible greenery and trees in the distance. These elements together create a tranquil, slightly nostalgic atmosphere of Japanese countryside or suburbs. The composition uses a slightly top-down angle, while leaving enough space to showcase the vehicle's details and surroundings, creating a composition that feels both intimate and spatial depth. The visual guide naturally extends from the girl's arms and legs, then uses the metal lines at the rear of the car and the gravel on the ground to guide the gaze outward to the buildings and vegetation in the background. In terms of lighting and shadow, the overall effect is soft natural light, with light coming from the upper left of the frame, creating a delicate transition between light and dark. At the same time, light shadows are cast on the car's surface, enhancing the sense of depth and the realism of the materials. The background part appears hazy and blurred due to the shallow depth of field, making the main figure stand out even more. The overall atmosphere is filled with a quiet, gentle, and slightly nostalgic mood. The colors mainly use low-saturation tones such as gray-white, beige, and olive green, creating a fresh, natural, understated yet highly infectious visual style. It seems to capture a moment of sunlight filtering through leaves on a summer afternoon at a street corner, full of poetic and artistic charm of everyday life. It feels like a casual work taken with a regular digital camera under non-professional conditions, possessing a strong sense of realism and emotional resonance, evoking youth, Growth and those ordinary moments gently wrapped by time.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
