        {
          "id": "krea2-c6f195b8700cfa478feeada1",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙城市忧伤坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly on a wooden bench atop a modern industrial-style bridge, wearing a simple yet stylish white polo collar dress with a knee-length hem trimmed in black, black ankle boots, and a black woven crossbody bag on her shoulder. The overall look presents the leisure and sophistication of an urban traveler amid light and shadow. Her posture is naturally relaxed, her body slightly turned to the camera, her left hand lightly resting on the edge of the bench, her right hand resting beside her knee, head slightly tilted, her expression calm yet tinged with contemplation, as if immersed in a moment of tranquility on a journey. It adds an unintentional sense of vividness. The background is the interior space of the bridge with dark metal trusses, with geometric lines interlacing and extending into the distance, creating a strong sense of perspective and depth; The high window on the right is made of layered wooden veneers, with sunlight filtering through the gaps, casting warm, soft, alternating light and shadow spots and stripes on the floor and figures, creating dramatic layers of light and shadow. In the foreground is the dark wooden bench where she sits, with clear wood grain on its surface, and faintly scattered papers or small objects underneath, hinting at the true traces of the journey. The middle ground features a wooden floor extending into the distance, gradually blurring as the view lengthens, enhancing the depth and sense of solitude in the space. The entire composition uses classic third-division and guide line design. The diagonal support structure of the bridge and the parallel lines of the wooden planks on the ground converge deep within the frame, directing the viewer's gaze toward the main figure. At the same time, a high contrast of light creates a strong contrast of light and shadow, with the subject surrounded by soft light while the surrounding environment is cast in darker shadows, highlighting their presence. The light mainly comes from the right window direction, while delicate contour light forms on her legs and the edges of her clothes, enhancing the sense of depth. The atmosphere combines cinematic feel with documentary aesthetics, combining the cold rationality of modern architecture with the gentle emotion brought by natural light. The overall color scheme intertwines cool gray and warm gold, presenting a quiet, introspective, and slightly melancholic poetic atmosphere. It feels like a slow-motion frame amid the city's noise, capturing that moment forgotten by time during the journey. The image texture is delicate and detailed, like a professional film shot at dusk, possessing high artistic expression and emotional appeal.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
