        {
          "id": "krea2-4320736f9d95c7e6b720c44e",
          "alias": "单女粉衬衫户外站立摆拍",
          "prompt": "This is an outdoor portrait photography piece full of youthful energy and dreamlike atmosphere. The subject is a woman, captured from an upward angle, showing a posture of upward growth and a longing for light. It feels as if you are searching for some secret in the sky or feeling the warmth of the sunlight, exuding a pure and tranquil joy. She wore a light pink pleated shirt with a delicate bow at the neckline. The fabric was light and layered, showing delicate pleats under the sunlight; The lower body is paired with a black high-waisted dress with a wide black leather belt at the waist. This pose gives the painting a strong sense of dynamism and poetic expression. The foreground is dominated by her upper body, especially the raised arms and hands where details are clearly visible, serving as the starting point for visual guidance; In the middle shot, the torso and skirt edges transition to her body, with the folds of her clothing naturally extending along the curves of her body; The background is a pure and bright sky, almost entirely covered by overexposed white. Only in the lower right corner can a few clusters of dense deep green tree crowns faintly appear, serving as accents rather than distractions to the environment, creating a sense of expansive and boundless space. The composition uses a low-angle upward angle, enhancing the character's upright and sacred feel. The overall composition is diagonally balanced, with the figure's body extending diagonally to the upper left, creating visual tension with the green tree shadow on the right. The lighting and shadow handling is extremely meticulous, with the light source coming from the upper right side, creating a soft, uniform diffused light with delicate shadow transitions. The large overexposure of the background creates a \"white sky\" atmosphere, contrasting warmly with the characters' pink clothing, while the black belt serves as a visual anchor, stabilizing the image's center of gravity in bright environments. The entire image exudes a fresh, gentle, and slightly fairy-tale artistic atmosphere, combining the warmth of everyday life with surreal imagination—as if taken from a comic or movie still, full of vitality and infinite possibilities, allowing one to feel the purest beautiful moments of youth, like sunlight piercing the clouds and shining over a carefree soul. The texture is close to film-style images taken with high-resolution digital cameras on a sunny afternoon, with moderate color saturation and a subtle graininess. It offers a visual experience that is both authentic and artistically refined.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
