        {
          "id": "krea2-eb4f7af78d08f8723a7e7f87",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣庭院站立侧头",
          "prompt": "She tilts her head slightly to gaze into the camera, exuding a subtle artistic temperament and youthful energy; She wore a loose, comfortable off-white chunky knit sweater. The fabric was fluffy and soft, with clearly visible textures, presenting a warm and healing visual sensation. A slender gold necklace faintly visible at the neckline appeared faintly in the light and shadow; The foreground is occupied by several bright orange cosmos or autumn flowers, with full and spreading petals and slender, upright stems forming a natural visual framework. The edges of the flowers are slightly blurred due to depth of field, creating a hazy and gentle atmosphere; The middle shot features dense green plant branches and leaves behind the girl, with rich layers and vibrant colors that contrast sharply with the orange flowers, serving as a transitional point and guiding the viewer's gaze from the foreground to the deeper background; The background is an architectural environment with Japanese or Chinese courtyard styles, featuring blurred wooden structures, eaves outlines, and traditional pottery jars. The walls have a distinctly mottled texture, with mainly warm brown and gray-white tones, and the hollow treatment creates a tranquil and rustic atmosphere; The entire composition uses the classic central composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, body slightly tilted, head naturally turned toward the frame, creating dynamic balance; Create a strong sense of interaction; The light comes from the upper left of the painting, a gentle afternoon slanting sun, filtering through the leaves and enhancing the sense of depth; The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with a subtle nostalgic filter effect. The tones lean toward warm yellow and cream white, with moderate saturation, creating a \"cinematic\" tranquil poetic atmosphere; The image quality pursues high realism but carries a slight film graininess, as if shot at dusk with an old digital camera or phone. The details are rich yet retain the soft-focus beauty, highlighting a sense of \"amateur equipment shooting\" authenticity and lifestyle aesthetics. The entire scene is filled with the lazy feeling of late spring and early summer, as if captured on a quiet afternoon with a beautiful moment. It combines the exquisite composition of artistic photography with the genuine warmth of everyday life.",
          "description": "",
