        {
          "id": "krea2-5f58fce6de5090898660665c",
          "alias": "单女黑袜子害羞坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a soft, fluffy white sheet, leaning slightly forward, sitting cross-legged with her legs crossed, her posture naturally relaxed yet full of playfulness. She wears a pure white tracksuit, with two parallel black stripes on the sleeves and pant legs. Her chest is adorned with delicate black Chinese knot tassels. On her feet, she pairs black sneakers with white knee-high socks with clearly visible black brand letters. Revealing a radiant yet shy smile, as if gently interacting with the audience. The background is a soft pink wall, on which hangs a softly colored floral art canvas. In the painting, blooming daisies or small wildflowers are mainly in orange petals and green leaves. On the right edge of the painting, a faint red vase with a few orange-yellow flowers is faintly visible, creating a warm and lively atmosphere. In the foreground is the bed she sits on, with white pleated sheets with delicate textures, and the light and shadow create a soft transition of light and shadow. The entire composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the left of the frame. The shallow depth of field effect slightly blurs the painting and vase in the background, enhancing the subject's presence. Light comes slightly from the front above, soft and even, without strong shadows. The overall color palette is mainly pink, white, and black, accented with orange, creating a sweet, dreamy, yet lively visual experience. The atmosphere is relaxed and joyful, carrying a youthful innocence and cuteness, as if capturing a sweet moment in everyday life. The photography style leans toward the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment, with images featuring slight noise and natural color saturation, preserving the warmth and intimacy of real-life scenes rather than overly polished artworks. Overall, it presents a blend of fashion and homeiness, evoking a sense of comfort, ease, and joyful emotional resonance.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
