        {
          "id": "krea2-7f2bb192ad9399d70defe601",
          "alias": "单女高跟鞋城市冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "The overall outfit was simple yet sexy and layered; Her sitting posture is relaxed and graceful, with legs naturally crossed and toes slightly straightened. The curved backrest and armrest lines smoothly wrap around her waist and hips, creating a visually stable support; In the foreground is her long legs and high heels, the ground has a cool gray cement texture, and the left edge faintly reveals the outline of a black circular object, possibly a low table or a sound system; In the middle is a brown leather single sofa chair, with a surface featuring delicate stitching and a metal bracket structure, reflecting a warm sheen under soft light. The right side of the chair extends to the edge of the frame; In the background is a wooden wall panel engraved with scribbled graffiti, hand-drawn patterns, and the words \"NO STACKING.\" Above it sits an old-fashioned wooden shell radio or amplifier, with a silver-gray panel with white knobs and buttons, and the top covered with beige fabric mesh covers; Several framed paintings hang on the walls; one faintly shows the profiles of the figures, while another features English poetry and text, creating a strong artistic atmosphere and a sense of privacy; The entire composition uses a medium-near angle, shooting at a slightly lower angle to make the main subject stand out. In terms of lighting, the main light source comes from the upper left front of the subject, enhancing the sense of depth. The background area is darker, creating a contrast of light and dark to highlight the main subject; The overall atmosphere presents a lifestyle aesthetic of urban artistic youth—combining the nostalgic charm of vintage items with the refined touch of modern fashion and interior design. The color palette is earth brown, dark green, and pure black, accented by warm white lighting, creating a tranquil, private, and slightly emotional visual experience. It feels as if you are in a story-filled independent music studio or private collection. The entire image exudes a unique charm where understated luxury and artistic temperament intertwine. Like a snapshot captured by an amateur camera in a confined space, it achieves a professional-grade image quality thanks to precise composition and emotional expression.",
