        {
          "id": "krea2-14e5ec937c8caeee046aff60",
          "alias": "单女毛衣公园坐阅读",
          "prompt": "On an autumn afternoon, the gentle sunlight pours down as a woman sits quietly on a wooden platform in the park. She wears a soft knit sweater in a gray-white color accented with black geometric patterns, paired with a light, flowing beige long skirt that lifts gently in the breeze, creating a charming contrast with the surrounding golden fallen leaves. The pages are slightly flipped, as if immersed in the world of words. Beside her stands a sturdy, rustic ginkgo tree, its deep brown veins clearly visible, its branches covered in brilliant golden leaves that shine in the sunlight, creating a warm and rich background tone. In the foreground is a platform paved with dark brown wooden planks, scattered with a few wind-blown maple or ginkgo leaves. At the edges, metal railings are visible, with clean and modern lines that contrast with the natural scenery. The middle ground features the woman herself, the trail extending behind her, and the blurred white awning or sculptural outline in the distance, with faint green shrubs scattered throughout. The distant view features more layered autumn forests, with colors gradually shifting from near to far from golden to orange-red and dark green, creating a sense of depth and seasonal atmosphere. The entire photo uses a medium to close-up composition, with the subject positioned slightly to the left center, naturally directing the viewer's gaze to form a strong emotional connection. Light comes from the upper right, casting warm light spots on the pages to enhance the layering of the image. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, artistic, and healing, with a slight film texture and the realistic graininess of everyday phone photography. The color saturation is moderate, and warm tones dominate, conveying a lazy and poetic feeling of immersing yourself in reading and enjoying autumn time. The visual guide line of the painting is vertically divided by metal railings, then progressively through fallen leaves, books, and trees, enhancing spatial depth. The transition of light and shadow is natural and soft, without strong shadows, creating a warm and comfortable mood, as if time has stood still at this moment, leaving only the quiet moments of autumn and the fragrance of books.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
