        {
          "id": "krea2-b231349c5bdefb33489ebd8d",
          "alias": "单女制服教室冷淡坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A cosplayer dressed in an exquisite Japanese sailor uniform sits on the edge of a wooden desk in a spacious classroom, legs elegantly crossed and raised. Black stockings and shiny leather shoes glow with a delicate sheen under soft light. In his hand, he gently holds a book with a red cover, its pages slightly flipped, as if he has just stopped reading or is about to continue immersing himself in the world of knowledge. Her blue school uniform jacket features gold buttons and white stripes on the cuffs, and a bright red bow tie at the neckline, making it a visual focal point against a cool-toned background. The fabric is delicate and the pleats are natural, showcasing highly realistic details of the character's costume. The foreground focuses on her slender leg lines and the posture of her toes dangling in the air, creating a dynamic balance; The middle shot features the contours of her seated body and the red book in her hands, forming the core narrative elements of the composition; The background is a blurred classroom environment—light green blackboards, neatly arranged but empty wooden desks and chairs, faintly visible air conditioning vents and ceiling pipes in corners, creating a forgotten afternoon classroom atmosphere. The composition uses a slightly overhead perspective, making viewers feel as if they are glimpsing the scene from the back of the classroom. At the same time, a large aperture creates a shallow depth of field effect, making the main figure stand out clearly and the background gradually blurs out, enhancing the sense of \"solitude.\" Natural light comes from the high window on the left, creating subtle transitions of light and shadow; shadows are subtle yet layered, casting delicate projections onto the desk and legs. The overall color scheme is mainly blue, white, and black, accented with a striking touch of red, creating a calm and restrained yet youthful and energetic visual atmosphere. The atmosphere of light and shadow is both tranquil and tense: the halo filtering through the window hints at the passage of time, and the room is so quiet that only breathing remains, as if the whole world has paused at this moment, with only her alone in the empty classroom thinking, waiting, or reminiscing. The visuals exude a realistic aesthetic reminiscent of Japanese anime, combining the ordinary feeling of everyday campus life with dramatic and artistic depth due to the expressions and postures of the role players. It is like a precious moment accidentally captured by amateur equipment—the natural realism brought by slight camera shake, combined with perfectly saturated color grading in post-production, makes the entire image both professional photographic compositional awareness and retains a casual, everyday emotional warmth, making one wonder about her current state of mind: is it solitary contemplation? Is it a brief breath after the exam? Or is it an unfinished chapter of the story? All of this is frozen in this frame, waiting for viewers to interpret that silent youthful monologue.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
