        {
          "id": "krea2-8436e28d5554bd21ee290a2a",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙海滩愤怒倚靠过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman leans against the rugged black volcanic cliffs, wearing a layered, light, flowing white long dress with layers of sheer fabric and ruffles, gently lifted in the sea breeze. A fluffy, soft white plush shawl drapes over her shoulders, creating a gentle yet striking visual contrast with the cold rocks; The expression is serene yet full of storytelling; The foreground features rough, uneven, distinct dark volcanic rock, occupying most of the right side of the painting. Its hard texture contrasts sharply with the gentle posture of the figures; In the middle of the scene, her slender figure and skirt stretch to the gravel beach by the sea, where the water crashes against the reefs and stirs up white waves, and in the distance, the undulating silhouettes of gray rock hills can be seen; The background is a vast, boundless sky, deep blue as if washed, dotted with a few light clouds. Sunlight pours in from the upper left, creating interplay of light and shadow on the rock surface; The composition uses a slanted diagonal layout, with the figure positioned about one-third to the right of the frame, body facing left, while gaze turns toward the camera, creating a dynamic balance and psychological tension; The lighting and shadow atmosphere presents the soft sunlight effect of morning or afternoon, warm but not glaring, injecting a dreamlike poetic atmosphere into the entire scene. It seems as if she is the only gentle presence on this pristine coastline. The entire scene resembles a carefully composed movie still, with a film texture and slight grainy noise. It presents the realism and humanistic warmth of amateur equipment shooting.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
