        {
          "id": "krea2-95ae33d1b80ea486a68ce584",
          "alias": "单女毛衣街道戏谑倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman, about sixteen or seventeen years old, wears an innocent yet slightly sly smile, as if capturing a moment or engaging in a silent dialogue with the viewer; In the backlight, it glows with a soft, bright warm golden sheen, appearing casual yet full of vitality; She steadily held a classic Nikon dual-reflex film camera with both hands. The body was in black and white, with a silver metal frame contrasting sharply with black leather texture. The lens was rounded and heavy, with the \"Nikon\" logo clearly visible on the rim. The movements were natural and smooth, full of the photographer's confidence and passion; She wore a deep burgundy chunky knit sweater with thick and soft cuffs, revealing a corner of a white shirt underneath at the neckline. The fabric had delicate textures, and light and shadow flowed between the folds, creating a warm and nostalgic feel. The composition uses a slightly upward-looking close-up, placing the figure slightly to the right of the center of the frame, with the camera occupying the visual center. In the middle shot, details of her shoulders and sweater can be faintly seen, while the background is blurred into a blurred outline of city streets and alleys. The brick walls and iron railings are faintly visible, with tones leaning toward gray-brown and cool blue, creating a subtle contrast with the warm colors in the foreground to emphasize the subject's prominence. It is as if you can hear the snapping of film and feel the heartbeat and anticipation at the moment the shutter is pressed. It combines the calm focus of a professional photographer with the unique agility and unruliness of an amateur. It is a work that combines everyday realism with cinematic aesthetic depth, evoking the romance and persistence of street photographers in the 1970s and 1980s.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
