        {
          "id": "krea2-36e27875a09aad48d8813a9e",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道微笑倚靠",
          "prompt": "A youthful figure, dressed in a neat white short-sleeved school shirt, paired with a classic plaid pleated skirt and matching bow tie, stepped into a pair of clean white sneakers, leaning against a bright orange-red shared bicycle, looking naturally relaxed. In the foreground is a close-up of the bicycle—black leather cushion, metal handlebars, and a white helmet quietly placed inside a silver wire basket. The rim of the basket reflects clearly, and the bicycle's orange-red body prominently illuminates the image. The colors are saturated and warm, forming a striking contrast yet harmonious unity with the clothing. The middle view is a dynamic composition of her full figure and bicycle, her legs faintly visible, her knees showing natural curves in a plaid mini skirt, and the gray brick texture of the ground at her feet faintly suggests, suggesting this is a city street or a campus path. In the background is a gray-white public facility pillar with a blurry notice posted on it. In the distance, green trees are blurred and the extended road stretches out. The lush trees and leaves present a soft green tone in the shallow depth, creating a tranquil and distant sense of space. The entire shot is shot at a low angle, slightly looking upward, emphasizing its youthful vitality and central role; Then, the smile naturally spreads into the background space, forming a visual flow pathway. Light comes from the upper left, soft natural daylight, evenly illuminating the surfaces of people and objects without strong shadows, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is fresh and bright, full of life's vibe, with a touch of artistic campus film quality. The tone leans toward warm white with a slight film graininess, simulating real noise and slight color differences from everyday phone or entry-level cameras, capturing poetic moments in ordinary daily life—a sunny afternoon, a perfect mood, and a world just right, smiling like a flower, a bicycle waiting quietly, and the gentleness of a city corner frozen in eternity.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
