        {
          "id": "krea2-91719d1042f3e357870183a2",
          "alias": "单女黑衬衫室内沉思坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright on a modern minimalist gray fabric sofa. She wears a black short-sleeved polo shirt with a pure white collar, faintly revealing the print and cartoon print of \"THINK\" on the chest. She pairs matching shorts with long, straight legs, her toes naturally falling to the wooden floor, creating an elegant leg line. Her fingers are slender, her wrist wears a delicate gold fine chain bracelet, and her right hand rests naturally on her knee or sofa armrest, with a relaxed yet expressive pose. Looking directly into the camera, she exudes a gentle yet slightly contemplative aura. The front focuses on the texture of her exposed ankles, calves, and knees, the delicate sheen of her stockings, and the visual lines formed by her crossed legs. The center features the sofa's curved backrest and soft, fluffy gray throw pillows; the sofa's fabric texture is clearly visible, creating a warm and cool contrast with the figure's black clothing. The background is a simple white wall, with three black-and-white artworks mounted in fine black frames hanging on the wall. The composition is symmetrical and leaves ample blank space, enhancing the tranquility of the space. The entire composition uses medium to near shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. The sofa's edges and leg lines guide the viewer's gaze from top to bottom, creating a stable and layered spatial structure. Light comes from soft natural light or softbox illumination from the front side, avoiding hard shadows. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, comfortable, artistic, and slightly private. The main color palettes are black, white, and gray, accented by warm brown on wooden floors and soft white in stockings, creating a clean, cool, yet warm visual experience. The images are highly realistic and richly detailed, as if shot by a professional-grade camera in an indoor natural light environment. They combine the intimacy of everyday life with the refinement of artistic photography. The light and shadow treatment is delicate, color saturation is moderate, emphasizing the gentle charm of the subject and the harmonious unity of the environment, conveying a quiet, introspective, and slightly youthful aesthetic concept.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
