        {
          "id": "krea2-3bfa45c15b2b1adc570087dd",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣森林困倦坐手持物",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright on a soft white knit blanket, wearing a voluminous, thick dark green turtleneck sweater. The sleeves drape naturally, outlining a relaxed yet warm silhouette. She pairs her lower body with white ankle socks and brown lace-up ankle boots. The leather uppers have delicate texture, and the metal clasps glow softly under soft light. She crossed her legs, steadily holding a small artificial pine branch on her knees. The branches and leaves were lush and green, covered with bright red berries, and the base was wrapped in coarse linen, as if embracing a small winter forest. On the right side of the painting is a beautifully decorated white Christmas tree, its branches frost-white as if covered in frost, adorned with a golden sphere and a bright red sphere, faintly visible in the blurred focus. The background is pure white, with a festive ribbon made of red, green, and off-white yarn balls hanging above, its graceful posture frozen as a serene decorative element. On the left side of the foreground is a large fluffy off-white woven blanket, with textures soft and undulating like clouds, forming a visual buffer zone near the figure's feet. The overall composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, and the Christmas tree and colorful chains on the right forming a diagonal balance, creating a stable and breathable spatial layout. Light comes from the front left, creating subtle shadows to enhance three-dimensionality while avoiding strong contrast. Light spots and colorful chains on the background wall reflect warm, soft glows, giving the scene a cozy and healing atmosphere. The color scheme is dominated by green, accented with white, brown, red, and gold, forming a classic Christmas color scheme, but modern life is infused with the makeup and costume details. The entire image presents a daily texture reminiscent of home photography, yet through careful arrangement and the expressions of the characters, it conveys a strong sense of holiday ritual and a fairy-tale-like dreamy atmosphere. It feels like a snapshot of life full of love and imagination captured on a winter afternoon when sunlight streams through the window lattice. The composition combines exquisite artistic creation with the relaxation and warmth of real life scenes, allowing people to feel the quiet joy of the holiday and the inner tranquility.",
