        {
          "id": "krea2-7a7d730e0e3db1e0e3846784",
          "alias": "单女透视白毛衣城市忧伤坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits gracefully on the stone steps of a city building at night, looking directly into the camera and conveying a calm yet story-filled atmosphere; She wore a lightweight pink lace spaghetti strap pajama paired with an off-white knit cardigan. The material was soft and finely textured, glowing softly under the light, contrasting sharply with the dark sheer stockings; Her legs are long and straight, she wears a pair of pointed black high heels, with faint metal trims visible at her ankles. She sits gracefully crossed atop the stone steps, her right hand gently resting on her knee, her left hand naturally hanging down to touch the ground, her nails neatly trimmed and adorned with elegant manicures; In the background is a gray stone building facade with a sense of history, its walls covered in traces of time and mottled stains. The stepped structure above is clearly layered, and on the left side, a faint dark window frame can be seen. The overall tone leans toward a cool gray-yellow, creating a lonely and retro atmosphere of urban nights; In the foreground is the rough stone floor where she sits; each brick has a clear texture, with slightly worn edges, creating a tactile contrast with the smooth skin and clothing of the figures; The middle shot is the main visual space formed by her body outline and the wall behind her. The composition is shot at a slightly upward angle, giving the figure a stronger sense of presence and power, while retaining enough negative space to help the viewer focus on the subject. The center left of the painting is the visual center, with the figure's head slightly tilted to the right. Light and shadow come from a soft artificial light source on the right, casting a warm yellow halo over the stone wall and floor, creating a three-dimensional effect of light and shadow, while the shadows deepen the emotional intensity of the image. The overall atmosphere combines the coldness of urban nightscapes with the softness of character designs, presenting a contradictory aesthetic of \"modernity colliding with classical architecture.\" It features meticulous composition and color control reminiscent of artistic photography, as well as authentic graininess and slight noise from amateur equipment casually shot. It feels like a moment of chance encounter on the street is frozen in time—both sexy and restrained, dreamy yet realistic, inviting imagination about the story behind it and the warmth of this city's night.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
