        {
          "id": "krea2-cc6215cac1dbc0a107551192",
          "alias": "单女上衣咖啡厅忧伤坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits alone in a dark leather sofa booth by the window in a vintage-style café or restaurant, turning sideways toward the window, her expression calm yet tinged with a faint melancholy and imagination, as if immersed in her own world of thoughts; She wore a loose, comfortable off-white knit top paired with blue jeans, her outfit simple and natural, and her overall look exuded a sense of laziness and authenticity from everyday life; In the foreground is a dark leather sofa and the edge of a wooden tabletop, with an open book or magazine on the tabletop, its pages slightly curled, suggesting she might have just read or would soon continue reading; The middle ground is the complete outline of her sitting posture, along with the table and chair in front of her, forming the core visual anchor of the composition; In the background are large expanses of bright floor-to-ceiling glass windows. Outside the window frames are blurry city streets, with a white car driving by, and the outlines of buildings in the distance faintly visible. Through the window, you can see colorful checkered decorative stickers pasted on the glass—yellow, green, and gray alternate, creating a lively yet slightly playful visual element. The window glass is handwritten in black ink in Japanese: \"あ、あ、あのdecorative characterにdecorative characterてと\" in casual and free-spirited style, adding a personal diary-like narrative feel. At the same time, soft shadows are cast on the left side and on the floor, with just the right contrast of light and shadow, highlighting the main subject while preserving the authentic texture of the scene; The overall color tone is warm, with a slight grainy film texture and soft-focus effect, presenting a cinematic atmosphere of Japanese literary aesthetics. It combines the everyday life of everyday life with poetic solitude and introspection; The color saturation in the painting is moderate, with yellow and green stickers breaking the monotony, creating a subtle balance with the cool tones of the characters' clothing, creating a visual tension that is both warm and slightly distant; This atmosphere is like the quiet moment when afternoon sunlight fills an empty café, or the sudden emotional impact on an ordinary day—full of storytelling and emotional resonance, as if you can hear her silent inner monologue, making people pause and gaze into endless fantasies about youth, memories, or an unknown future.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
