        {
          "id": "krea2-c19139785231ae4283ae6414",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙乡村愤怒持手机",
          "prompt": "Under a pure and flawless blue sky, a woman becomes the absolute visual focal point of the scene. She wears a light, flowing white floral dress adorned with soft floral patterns woven from pink, light blue, and tender green. Layers of ruffles and fluffy short-sleeved sleeves glow softly in the sunlight, like clouds gently stirred by the wind. She wears a wide-brimmed woven straw hat on her head, with natural golden-brown grass outlining hollowed-out geometric patterns. The brim edges are scattered with tiny light and shadow, sunlight filtering through the gaps of the hat, like scattered gold on a summer afternoon. adding a touch of vitality and naturalness. Like rose petals in the early summer dawn. The entire composition adopts a minimalist style, with the figure occupying a slightly higher center position, the background a clear sky without any impurities, creating a strong color contrast—the deep blue sky and white dress complement each other, creating a calm yet vibrant visual tone. Light comes from the upper, slightly forward direction, which is typical of hard daylight conditions, but through post-processing or shooting techniques, the shadow edges are cleverly softened, while natural transitions of light and shadow are created in the folds of the clothing. The foreground is almost entirely occupied by people, with no extra objects obstructing the view; The middle shots are limited to the area from the neck down to the waist, with clothing details rich but not overshadowing; The background is a pure sky, with no buildings, trees, or other elements involved, reinforcing the theme of \"humans and nature.\" Heading down to the bow decoration on the chest, finally falling on the edge of the skirt, the overall atmosphere is filled with youthful, free, and carefree summer vibes. It combines the romantic poetry of French countryside with the gentle tranquility unique to the East, as if capturing a moment of imminent vacation or the most beautiful memory of a lazy afternoon. The entire image presents a highly idealized everyday aesthetic, like a high-quality work accidentally captured outdoors under natural light with an ordinary phone. The color saturation is moderate, saturated but not glaring, with strong light and shadow contrasts yet still softness. Every detail is meticulously crafted yet naturally harmonious, conveying a life philosophy of \"ordinary days can also have extraordinary beauty.\"",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
