        {
          "id": "krea2-ecf4b54ce197e3346e47274f",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫雪地忧伤倚靠",
          "prompt": "On the vast snowy Alps stretching endlessly, a graceful woman becomes the absolute visual focal point of the scene, glowing softly in the sunlight, her expression confident yet tinged with a hint of lazy allure, as if silently declaring her presence. She wore a fitted, modern black turtleneck bodysuit, made of satin smoothness that perfectly outlined her graceful and graceful body curves. The bold slit on the chest highlighted her sexiness without sacrificing elegance; Wearing a pair of fluffy, thick white plush snow boots contrasts sharply with the black outfit, providing both warmth and a fashionable flair. The fine plush texture on the boot shaft is clearly visible under sunlight. She leans against a gray concrete wall covered in thick snow, her hands resting lightly on the edge of the wall, her body slightly leaning forward, her posture composed and expressive, legs naturally crossed, displaying a dynamic balance that combines strength and softness. The foreground features nearby soft snowdrifts that have been trampled and weathered. The snowflakes are densely packed and reflect a crystal-clear texture under strong light. The ground is scattered with footprints and skiboard scratches, suggesting that this was once a place of activity; In the middle is a rolling snowy slope, with clear traces of ski slopes winding into the distance. A few solitary fir trees dot the landscape, their branches upright yet giving a particularly lonely feel. On the right, a simple fence made of log stakes runs across the scene, adding a touch of artificial traces and wild charm. The distant view is the expansive summit of the snowy mountains, with a sky as clear as a washed blue, a few fluffy, pure white clouds floating like cotton on the ridge, and in the distance, several ski lift frames can be faintly seen atop the slope, casting slender shadows under the clear sky. The entire background is rich in layers, and the sense of spatial depth is strong. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, with slightly tilted shots that make the main characters appear taller and more upright, while concrete walls serve as foreground guides, reinforcing the central role of the characters; The overall composition features a diagonal layout, forming a visual flow from the snow pile in the lower left to the clouds in the upper right, giving the image both stability and dynamism. In terms of light and shadow, intense top light shines directly from above, with subtle highlights on the black clothing surface due to reflections, while white snow boots present a warm, soft glow texture. The shade on the snow is well-balanced, enhancing the sense of depth and realism; The entire image has a cold and pure atmosphere. The blue sky and white snow create an ultimate sense of tranquility and emptiness. Yet the presence of the figures breaks this pure natural landscape, giving the image intense dramatic tension and emotional warmth. Like a carefully staged fashion shoot, yet retaining an unintentional sense of realism, like a precious moment casually captured on a winter afternoon with a regular phone or small camera—that amateur equipment style with slight noise, slightly soft edges, and perfectly saturated colors. This makes the visuals both cinematic artistic and retaining a warm, everyday atmosphere, like a visual poem dedicated to winter, radiating human longing and aesthetic brilliance in the cold.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
