        {
          "id": "krea2-d90a578609dbdd41956799e6",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣雪地困倦坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a soft, fluffy white plush carpet, with a sofa covered in thick white fur in the background. The entire space is bathed in warm, soft yellow lighting, creating a cozy and cozy indoor festive atmosphere. She wore a loose, laid-back off-white knit sweater with a single-shoulder, off-shoulder neckline, naturally draped cuffs, and clearly visible texture, giving her a three-dimensional and handcrafted feel. She paired the bottom with a gray pleated short skirt, the skirt light and flowing, revealing her slender legs. Add a sweet and playful touch. She slightly tilted her head toward the camera, her makeup exquisite but not exaggerated, highlighting the natural and clear texture of her skin. Her right hand gently lifts a shiny orange-red Christmas ball ornament, her fingertips lightly touching the surface of the sphere, as if admiring or preparing to hang it, a gentle yet ceremonial gesture. On the left side of the painting is a small Christmas tree, its branches and leaves covered in snow-white frost, adorned with orange-red and silver round ornaments and large red ribbon bows. Next to the tree base is a yellow gift box tied with bright red ribbons, with a fluffy yellow teddy bear snuggled beside it, adding a playful and festive atmosphere. On the right edge of the image, a gift wrapper with alternating green and orange plaid patterns is visible, printed with snowflake patterns, hinting at the presence of more surprise gifts. The floor is covered with a richly colored vintage patterned carpet, mainly red in tone, with intricate and luxurious golden scroll patterns that faintly appear in the white cotton-like plush carpet, creating visual layers. The composition uses a medium to near angle angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, while the Christmas tree on the left and the gift bag on the right create a visual balance. Light softly falls from above to the right, creating a sense of depth, while the shadowed areas are softened by warm light to avoid harsh contrast. The overall color palette is mainly warm white, cream yellow, deep gray-blue, bright red, and dark green. The color saturation is moderate, creating a dreamy yet lifelike artistic photography style. It feels as if a professional camera is shooting under soft natural light, with a slight film grain texture. The image is rich in details and distinct layers, filled with a fairy-tale-like romantic atmosphere of winter and Christmas, allowing people to feel the joy of the holiday, the warmth of home, and the innocence of youth.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
