        {
          "id": "krea2-667e52d2332c89460c83d0da",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙窗边困倦倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully leans against the side window of a vintage car, gently pressed against her neck and shoulder, as if immersed in a quiet and beautiful afternoon; She wore a simple white slip dress, her skin showing a delicate and warm texture under soft lighting. Her hands were gently folded over her chest, her fingertips lightly touching a pale yellow flower, her posture lazy yet full of poetry; In the background is a large number of blooming flowers, mainly blue-purple hydrangeas, interspersed with pure white daisies and a few bright yellow sunflowers. The petals are layered and green leaves dot the space. Some of the flowers appear hazy and dreamy due to the blurred depth of field, creating a romantic atmosphere surrounded by a sea of flowers; The middle view features a geometric frame formed by window glass and metal frames, with window edges showing a cool-toned metallic sheen, subtly contrasting with the warm interior light. The door handles and window sealing strips are clearly visible, with exquisite details; The background is a blurred patch of green plants and scattered flowers, with rich color layers but blurred effects that make the main figure stand out even more; The entire photo uses a low-angle downward angle, cleverly placing the figure in the center through the window frame composition, extending into the hazy green background; The use of light and shadow is extremely meticulous: natural light enters the interior diagonally from outside while preserving the layering of shadows, creating a three-dimensional yet gentle visual effect; The overall color tone leans warm, with a slight film graininess and soft focus effect, creating a dreamy, slightly nostalgic artistic atmosphere; The visual style blends Japanese portraiture with cinematic cinematography, featuring strong narrative and emotional resonance, as if capturing a moment of tranquility and beauty, evoking the romantic encounters of youth, freedom, and blooming flowers; Although it appears to be an everyday scene, through careful lighting, prop selection, and compositional design, the images are endowed with high artistic value and visual impact.",
