        {
          "id": "krea2-954c5727df6b98eeb5d9788f",
          "alias": "单女黑衬衫城市坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a modern minimalist armchair with a beige woven texture. She wears a loose and comfortable gray hooded sweatshirt paired with a black-and-white polka-dot shirt, paired with pink lace-up sneakers paired with white socks. The overall look is relaxed and casual yet stylish; Wearing a delicate little ring on her finger, her posture relaxed yet full of expressiveness; The foreground focuses on her crossed legs, pink sneakers on her feet, and the fabric texture on the edge of the chair, forming a visual focal point; The middle is the full silhouette of her sitting posture, the loose folds of her sweatshirt, and the subtle shadows cast by the chair's metal legs on the floor; The background is a pure, flawless pale gray-white wall with no decorations or clutter, creating a minimalist sense of space; The composition adopts a close-up perspective from medium to close-up, with the figure occupying the left central position of the frame, and the chair structure forms a natural frame to enhance the sense of depth in the painting; The light is soft and evenly from the front sides, while slight highlights form on the shoulders and arms, leaving soft transitional shadows along the floor and chair edges. The overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with a touch of artistic flair, as if afternoon sunlight streaming through the window lattice. The color scheme is mainly low-saturation gray-white, accented with pink shoes and polka dot elements to create visual focal points; The photography style presents a professional-grade portrait texture, but with the realism and slight noise typical of everyday amateur equipment. The lens features slight blurred edges to emphasize subject clarity while preserving environmental details. The visuals convey a sense of comfort and ease for urban youth, a fusion of self-expression and lifestyle aesthetics, combining the refinement of magazine covers with the relaxed feel of home life, evoking a quiet and vibrant lifestyle.",
