        {
          "id": "krea2-c2fec953bbc5b625e6489960",
          "alias": "单女全裸制服商店冷淡坐持手机",
          "prompt": "She wore a light purple short-sleeved top made of light and breathable fabric, with delicate hollow-out embroidery patterns on the surface, presenting a vintage elegance. The sleeves were slightly rolled up, adding a touch of casual and lazy charm. Her right hand gently holds a transparent plastic cup filled with iced milk tea. The lid is round and clear, fitted with a black straw. The milk tea inside is smooth like amber, with ice cubes faintly visible inside, and the glass walls reflecting slightly from the cold; Her left hand rested elegantly on the table, her fingertips lightly touching a straw, her nails neatly trimmed, painted with a subtle nude pink nail, and a simple gold ring faintly visible on her wrist. She leaned forward slightly, her posture relaxed and natural, as if enjoying a moment of peaceful rest. In the foreground is a deep brown wooden desktop with fine grain patterns, its surface smooth and reflecting soft ambient light. On the table sits a silver-edged smartphone, the screen facing down, with the metal frame faintly glowing in the light. The medium shot focuses on the main figure and the drink, occupying the left central position. The composition uses close-up shots, with a blurred background inside the café. You can see deep green upholstered sofas, dark wooden tables and chairs, and wall decorations illuminated by warm yellow lighting. In the distance, faint outlines of other customers or shop signs can be faintly seen, creating an atmosphere reminiscent of real life. The entire shot uses a shallow depth of field technique, with the background softened into hazy blocks of color, keeping the visual focus firmly on the subject. The light comes from diffused light sources at the indoor ceiling, uniform and soft, without strong shadows, while creating subtle highlight reflections on the cup body and tabletop. The visual atmosphere is relaxed and pleasant, full of the warmth and healing power of everyday life. It combines the delicate texture of professional photography with the authentic natural atmosphere of amateur equipment shooting—natural transitions of light and shadow, moderate color saturation, slight noise and defocus at the edges, simulating the texture of a mobile camera shot. It feels like an ordinary girl relaxing in a café—no forced posing, yet full of storytelling and emotional warmth.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
