        {
          "id": "krea2-d6cf412ea94827be54d0d8bb",
          "alias": "单女城市愤怒倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "The fabric was soft and finely textured, and the buttons were white round designs that reflected a warm glow under soft light. In the foreground is a vintage-style stainless steel coffee pot firmly held in her right hand. The body features vertical ridge patterns, mirror-like reflections of surrounding light and shadow, and the lid is topped with a small wooden handle, exquisitely detailed and full of lifestyle aesthetics; In the lower right corner of the image, a cup of iced Americano can be vaguely seen in a transparent glass. Water droplets condense on the rim, the coffee liquid is distinctly layered, and the milk coffee on top blends to form fine foam, hinting at the freshly completed hand-brewing process; The middle ground is the area from her chest to waist, where the folds of her clothes hang naturally, with soft transitions of light and shadow, creating a contrast between solid and void with the background; The background is blurred: the left side is a light gray wall, while the blurred area on the right reveals the outline of an abstract painting in warm red tones. The colors are saturated but not glaring, creating a cozy indoor artistic atmosphere; The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure occupying the main visual focus. The coffee pot acts as a visual guide extending from upper left to lower right, guiding the viewer's gaze to follow her movements; The camera angles slightly from above, making the figure's posture appear calm and reserved, while highlighting the three-dimensional lines and metallic texture of the coffee pot; The overall lighting is naturally scattered, softly streaming in from the front left, creating subtle contrasts of light and shadow, with soft shadows that are not jarring; The atmosphere is tranquil and far-reaching, full of the poetry and healing of everyday life, as if time is stretched in this moment, each frame radiating a slow-paced aesthetic of life; The main color palette is earth tones—olive green, gray-brown, silver white, and off-white, accented with a touch of warm red. The overall tone leans toward cool tones but still maintains warmth, presenting a low-key and sophisticated visual language; Image texture simulates professional camera shooting effects, with fine noise and slight motion blur, enhancing realism and film-like grainy textures, avoiding excessive sharpening or plasticity, preserving the warmth and traces of handmade craftsmanship; The layers of light and shadow are rich; the highlights of the coffee pot are dazzling but not overly dazzling, and the background transitions naturally create a sense of depth and space; The entire image conveys a philosophy of \"slow living\"—seeking ritual and self-satisfaction in ordinary daily life. Through the small act of handmade coffee making, it reflects the pursuit of quality living and inner peace. Like a carefully composed film photograph, it embodies the independent temperament of urban youth while also embodying the \"wabi-sabi\" charm of Eastern aesthetics, inviting pause and a moment of peace that belongs to oneself.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
