        {
          "id": "krea2-e417645114493de367bd74a0",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙海滩困倦站立侧头",
          "prompt": "She wore a blue-and-white floral spaghetti strap dress made of lightweight, breathable fabric, with pleats and ruffles design. The neckline was tied with a matching fabric tie, tied in an elegant knot around the neck. The white floral pattern on the dress looked fresh and lively on the blue background, full of summer vacation vibe. Behind her flows a thin white lace veil or shawl, as thin as cicada wings, light and transparent, with delicate wavy pleats along the edges, softly shimmering in the sunlight, adding a dreamy and romantic atmosphere to the scene. The background is a pure, flawless blue sky, with saturated and bright tones, with no clouds or other distractions, making the main figure stand out. The entire composition uses a central composition, with the head slightly tilted to one side to create a natural dynamic balance. Details are clear and sharp, while the background becomes blurred and soft through shallow depth of field, creating a strong sense of layering and spatial depth. Guide the audience's gaze to flow naturally. The light and shadow come from strong daylight from the side and above, bright but not glaring, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is bright, fresh, and tranquil, carrying a fairy-tale-like dreamy feeling and the cozy feeling of a summer seaside. The colors are mainly blue and white, presenting a fresh and clean visual effect, while retaining a slight film graininess and slight overexposure edge gradation, giving the image a retro cinematic feel or a sense of realism shot with amateur equipment. It feels like a youthful portrait taken with an old film camera on a sunny afternoon, full of story and emotional warmth.",
