        {
          "id": "krea2-bcf08f009a356de9cb14834c",
          "alias": "单女绿连帽衫街道俏皮倚靠戏水",
          "prompt": "A girl rides a vintage-style bicycle parked on a sun-dappled street. She wears a loose, comfortable green and off-white plush hooded hoodie, paired with shorts, white socks with teal patterns, and white sneakers. Her hands grip the handlebars steadily, her body leans slightly forward, and her feet lightly hover above the pedals, as if she's just stopped or is about to set off, presenting a dynamic moment full of energy and a touch of playfulness. The bike features a classic city bike style, with smooth silver metal handlebars and a finely woven rattan basket at the fork. The body features a warm light brown or off-white tone, thick tires, clearly visible wheel details, and natural wear marks on the rim edges, adding a touch of everyday life. In the background, sunlight cuts the concrete sidewalk into interplay of light and shadow, scattered with a few dead leaves and fine dust fragments. The layers of light and shadow are rich, casting blurred shadows of trees and building silhouettes, giving the floor a truly delicate texture. The middle shot is the focal point of the composition between the girl and the bicycle. Her posture is relaxed and natural, the clothing fabric is fluffy and soft, with clearly visible textures. The green patches on the clothing appear gently gradient in the sunlight, creating a sharp contrast with the background. The background consists of a row of shop facades on the left with a modern industrial design style. The walls are mainly in red-brown and gray-white tones, with window glass reflecting the sky and surroundings. To the right stands a sturdy old tree, its trunk covered with rough cracks left by time and mottled white paint peeling marks. The lush branches and leaves form a natural green frame at the top of the frame, with bright daylight filtering through the gaps between the leaves. In the distance, the silhouettes of high-rise buildings can be faintly seen, hinting that this is a quiet corner within an urban block. The composition adopts a slightly upward-looking perspective, placing the girl slightly to the left center of the frame. The large tree on the right serves as a visual guide line naturally extending deep into the frame, while the vertical lines of the shop on the left and the diagonal lines of the tree trunks on the right create a subtle balance, creating a stable and dynamic spatial structure. The visual guidance path begins with mottled light and shadow in the foreground, then draws the viewer's gaze into the distance through the depth of buildings and trees in the background, creating a natural visual flow. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and bright, with intense daylight slanting down from the upper right of the image, creating soft highlights and natural transitional shadows on the figures. Meanwhile, the shadowed areas in the background appear hazy and blurred, enhancing the depth and spatial layers of the composition. The entire scene exudes a youthful, relaxed, and comfortable lifestyle atmosphere. The color scheme is fresh and natural, interwoven with green, off-white, brown, and gray, blending the everyday life of urban life with an artistic and romantic style. It seems to capture a beautiful moment of lazy afternoon sunlight bathing the streets, full of storytelling and emotional resonance. The texture is delicate and authentic, like precious moments captured with high-resolution everyday photography equipment, combining artistic expression with a sense of realism in everyday life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
