        {
          "id": "krea2-80bb773b1a67160f133c4ca2",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙街道俏皮坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly on a gray textured fabric bed, leaning slightly forward, legs crossed, her posture relaxed yet confident. She wears a simple white sleeveless dress with a classic shirt lapel design, paired with a wide black tie casually tied around her neck, creating a strong black-and-white visual focal point. She wears sheer black stockings on the bottom, outlining her long, well-proportioned legs. On her feet are a pair of uniquely styled platform sneakers, with a pure white and black upper featuring laces woven in bright orange and yellow; The other is mainly black and white, with laces wrapped in a mix of green, red, and black colors, presenting a street-style artistic vibe. The edge of the sole faintly reveals handwritten signature graffiti details. Her left hand rests gently on the edge of the bed, her right hand naturally rests beside her knee, and she wears a delicate silver chain bracelet on her wrist. Her nails are neatly trimmed and painted with deep red or burgundy nail polish, with slightly curved fingertips adding a playful touch. In the foreground is a delicate woven carpet on the bed, with subtle metallic reflective particles in the gray tones, enhancing the texture and layering of the image; The middle shot features her slender figure from waist to knees, the beauty of her crossed legs, and the sense of spatial depth created by close-ups of her shoes; The background features two sets of vertical curtains—dark gray vertical striped curtains on the left, and light and flowing off-white draped sheer curtains on the right. Under soft lighting, they create transitions between light and shadow and contrasts of solid and void, creating an intimate atmosphere. The composition uses a slightly overhead mid-to-close perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the center-right, creating visual balance and tension. The overall lighting uses soft, even indoor diffused light, with the main light source coming from the left side of the figure, giving the skin a delicate and translucent texture, while the sides and legs retain moderate shadow transitions to enhance three-dimensionality and volume. The background curtains create subtle folds and highlight reflections as light penetrates, enhancing the depth of the space. The entire painting uses black, white, and gray as the main color palette, accented with high-saturation elements such as orange, green, and red, creating a dramatic collision between calm restraint and lively boldness. The atmosphere combines urban fashion with home intimacy, conveying a slightly rebellious youthful vibe while retaining a restrained and gentle emotional tone. It seems to capture a moment of quiet and self-expression alone as the afternoon sunlight streams through the curtains, creating a strong narrative and emotional resonance. Suitable for shooting real life with slight noise and natural distortion using amateur equipment such as phones or small cameras, rather than the over-retouched commercial blockbuster style.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
