        {
          "id": "krea2-73842cf031190a25228a3875",
          "alias": "多人竹林",
          "prompt": "The foreground is dominated by numerous hanging green vines, with lush and soft branches and leaves naturally hanging from above and on both sides of the frame. Some leaves are bright emerald green when illuminated by sunlight, while others are shaded by contrasts of light and shadow. These vines are like curtains, half-concealing the scene, adding layers and creating a private and romantic atmosphere. Several small red Vietnamese flags are interwoven among the vines, with golden stars shining brilliantly in the sunlight, forming a striking contrast with the white paper lanterns. Two white paper lanterns hang above the window frame, with bamboo joint patterns printed on the surface and elegant white tassels hanging below, adding an Eastern classical charm to the scene.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
