        {
          "id": "krea2-1669d6f7caccb8f5ef92f02a",
          "alias": "单女广场俏皮站立",
          "prompt": "The middle shot focuses on the windowsill area where the woman stands. The window frame is made of dark old-fashioned wooden doors, with the edges of the door panels slightly rough due to age. Metal hinge details can be seen on the door hinges, and a small red square badge is affixed to the left door panel, echoing the flag's color. On the windowsill, besides the woman, drinks, bamboo hat, and camera, there was also a transparent glass cup filled with clear water, reflecting the surrounding environment. The background is the café's interior space, with dimly lit lighting. Through blur processing, you can make out more red flags hanging on the back wall, along with some greenery as decorations. The outlines of customers and furniture inside the store are faintly visible, creating a lively but not noisy daily scene. At the same time, blur highlights the importance of the foreground figures.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
