        {
          "id": "krea2-d281085a0a5c5ced7f06a932",
          "alias": "窗边",
          "prompt": "The composition uses a classic centrally symmetrical frame structure, with window frames serving as natural frames that firmly frame the figures at the visual center. The \"curtain\" effect formed by the vines in the foreground enhances the sense of depth in the composition, while the use of light and shadow partitioning creates a rich visual rhythm. The visual guiding lines mainly come from the vines and flags hanging above, which diagonally extend from the top to the edge of the windowsill. Additionally, the horizontal lines along the windowsill edges and the vertical door frame together create a sense of stability, leaving room for imagination.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
