        {
          "id": "krea2-d9615964862c6fe333a36497",
          "alias": "单女街道（3）",
          "prompt": "In terms of lighting and shadow, the entire scene is bathed in bright, soft sunlight, with light coming from the upper left of the frame, while delicate shadows are cast behind her and below the windowsill, enhancing the sense of depth. The highlights and shadows on the vine leaves interspersed, creating a strong contrast of texture. The interior of the background café is relatively dim, creating a strong contrast with the bright foreground area and highlighting the main focus. The color atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with warm yellow as the main tone, complemented by the vitality of green plants, the purity of white lanterns, and the vibrant embellishment of red flags. The overall color scheme is harmonious and unified, combining the rich exotic colors with the simplicity and tranquility of daily life. The entire scene resembles a carefully arranged life painting, exuding poetry and leisure accumulated over time. It features both the exquisite composition of professional photography and the authentic, natural, and effortless beauty of amateur equipment shooting, allowing visitors to feel the unique slow-paced pace and cultural charm of Vietnamese street cafés.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
