        {
          "id": "krea2-fb587ba81b24ed7ed9e154bb",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫公寓困倦坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright on an outdoor lawn, wearing a finely designed white chiffon shirt with a collar decorated with layered, cloud-like ruffles, light and flowing. The sleeves hang naturally, and the fabric flutters gently in the breeze, creating a soft echo with the translucent white gauze drape hanging behind her. She pairs her bottom with neat black shorts that outline her long legs. Her legs are paired with delicate white over-the-knee socks with a flat, fitted cuff, and simple black shoes. The overall look blends preppy style with romantic elements, presenting a fresh yet slightly dramatic visual tension under natural light. She leans on a simple wooden high chair, with four legs firmly rooted on the lush grass. Scattered leaves and tiny wildflowers dot the grass, sunlight streaming through the canopy, casting mottled light and shadows on the floor, adding vivid texture layers to the scene. Her posture is lazy yet expressive—her body slightly leaned back, head slightly tilted to one side, as if immersed in her own world of thoughts. Her expression is neither completely relaxed nor deliberately staged, but carries a naturally expressed emotional state, creating a strong narrative and emotional resonance. The background is a dense and verdant forest, with lush branches and greenery. The outlines of distant trees appear faintly blurred out of soft focus, enhancing the sense of spatial depth in the composition; The foreground features a clearly visible grassy area and the base of a wooden chair, guiding the viewer to focus on the subject. The entire composition uses a medium-angle perspective, with the figure occupying the center-left area, and the blank space on the right side occupied by a white sheer draper, creating visual balance; The camera is shot from a slightly low angle, making the characters' postures more narrative while highlighting environmental details. The light comes from natural daylight, which is a gentle afternoon side backlight, filtering through the gauze curtain from the right rear of the figure, enhancing the sense of depth; The background trees appear bright green under strong light, creating a warm and cool contrast with the shadowy grass in the foreground. The overall color palette is dominated by white, green, and black, with moderate color saturation. The atmosphere is tranquil, cool, and slightly dreamy, like an oil painting bathed in sunlight. It combines the realism of everyday photography with poetic artistic expression. The image conveys a sense of youth, innocence, introspection, and fleeting beauty, inviting readers to imagine the story fragments of her inner thoughts at that moment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
