        {
          "id": "krea2-0edb852e43d340c69b4a0075",
          "alias": "多人窗边困倦倚靠持手机",
          "prompt": "The light source comes from the upper right window, creating subtle transitions between highlights and shadows, giving the skin a gentle glow, while casting soft shadows on the plush blanket and dolls to enhance the three-dimensional effect; The overall atmosphere is tranquil, healing, and full of heart and life. The main color palettes are warm pink, cream white, and light blue, complemented by colorful polka dots and floral elements, creating a warm and dreamy home scene; The style leans toward realistic everyday photography yet carries a refined artistic tone; the details are rich yet not cluttered, like a fleeting moment of tender time captured in the afternoon sunlight with a phone or small camera, and the floating dust and halos in the air, giving the entire image a serene, far-reaching, and comforting aesthetic experience.",
