        {
          "id": "krea2-5fa564b753884caa7f421580",
          "alias": "单女透视黑短裙商店微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands elegantly on the gray concrete steps in front of a café called \"Lost Land,\" wearing a simple yet layered white strapless top paired with a black leather mini skirt. A slender black belt tied around her waist outlines a perfect waistline, while she wears dark sheer stockings and chunky black patent leather loafers. Her slightly raised ankles exude confidence and playfulness. Her right hand hangs naturally, while her left hand gently carries a fluffy, soft white plush jacket, as if she has just stepped out of or is about to enter. The jacket gently flutters in her hand, adding a touch of lazy dynamic beauty. She glanced back with a smile, showing her white, neat teeth, her expression full of warmth and style. The background features a simple off-white wall with a vintage wooden sign engraved with \"LOST LAND,\" topped by a cute black kitten design, giving it a playful and adorable look. On the right is a dark brown wooden sliding door, with glass embedded along the edges of the door frame. Through the glass, you can faintly see the warm lighting and blurred outlines of tables and chairs inside the store, with the word \"PUSH\" clearly marked on the door. In the left corner of the wall, two white disposable coffee cups with black lids are placed, suggesting this is a casual everyday scene. The entire composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, forming a visual focal point. The steps extend from the lower left to the upper right, naturally guiding the viewer's gaze toward the character. In the foreground is a rough-textured cement step, whose dark tones contrast with the figure's bright clothing, enhancing visual layering. The middle ground shows the person's entire body and surrounding environment, while the background is the storefront and the blurred outline of the interior. The light comes from a mix of natural sources and indoor warmth, creating a soft and cozy atmosphere with delicate shadows, creating a relaxed and cozy feeling on an urban street. The light and shadow treatment is delicate, with the garment's texture clearly visible, especially the fluffy texture of the plush jacket contrasting sharply with the smooth surface of the leather mini skirt. The entire photo features a strong Japanese street style that combines artistry with a sense of everyday life, as if capturing an ordinary yet charming moment, allowing people to feel the beautiful pursuit of refinement and freedom in everyday life by urban youth.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
