        {
          "id": "krea2-f757579e8057fbfd9ed21c0c",
          "alias": "单女蓝泳装海滩俏皮站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on the beach, wearing a dark blue bikini swimsuit. Her top is a strapless strapless top, and her bottom is high-waisted briefs, with light blue stripes accenting the waist. The overall cut, hugging her figure, accentuates her curves. The ends are slightly fluffy, adding a touch of lazy and casual charm. She turned sideways to look back at the camera, her expression natural and unpretentious, revealing a calm and reserved aura. She gently holds a transparent plastic bottle of drinking water in her right hand. The cap is sky blue, the bottle reflects soft light, and the mouth is slightly tilted, as if she has just taken water from the beach or is about to drink. Her movements are natural and relaxed, her arms smooth and well-defined, showcasing a healthy and energetic posture. The foreground focuses on the details of the figure's torso and the water bottle held. The skin appears delicate under natural light, with soft transitions between light and shadow. The middle ground features a pure, white beach, with fine grains extending beneath the feet, contrasting with the figure's legs and enhancing the three-dimensional outline of the body. The background is blurred, with a blurred coastline meeting the pale blue sky in the distance. The sky clouds are thin, presenting a gradient from gray-white to light blue, with faint outlines of distant buildings or breakwater structures visible, but these are softened by soft focus, keeping the audience's attention fully focused on the main figure. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the person positioned slightly to the right of center of the frame, body rotated at a 45-degree angle, and the head slightly turned toward the lens, creating a visual dynamic balance and tension. The camera angle is slightly upward, enhancing the character's upright and presence, while the horizontal line of the ground guides the gaze upward. It then follows the curve of the body downward to the hips and legs, finally landing on the beach floor, creating a natural top-to-bottom flow. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is diffused light in the early morning or evening, with uniform and soft lighting without strong shadows, creating a fresh, tranquil, and slightly cool seaside atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly cool, with a deep blue swimsuit echoing the light blue bottle cap. The white beach and gray-blue sky form a clean and simple background color palette. The image has the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment, with slight noise and moderate color saturation, making the image feel more lifelike rather than an overly refined commercial photography style. It feels like a casual photo recording an afternoon by the sea, infused with genuine emotion and humanistic warmth, maintaining artistic beauty while retaining a natural, casual lifestyle atmosphere.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
