        {
          "id": "krea2-ac71f407b8cd069f8c89b074",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道冷淡招手",
          "prompt": "In a street photo full of everyday life and artistic atmosphere, the subject is a woman wearing an off-white loose shirt paired with dark blue denim shorts, light brown flat shoes, and pure white long socks. The overall look is simple yet full of youthful energy. An orange-red silk scarf is tied around her neck, becoming the warmest and most striking color accent in the painting. In the sunlight, it looks like a dancing flame, forming a strong contrast with the surrounding cool-toned city background. Her postures vary—sometimes she turns to look up at the sky, her expression serene and serene; Sometimes she turns to look back, sometimes she gently waves her silk scarf with both hands, as if dancing with the wind, displaying a rebellious yet gentle temperament. Her movements are full of rhythm, capturing her momentary movement and emotional expression, as if writing her own poetic chapter on an ordinary street.",
