        {
          "id": "krea2-e965a353214428e9170ac954",
          "alias": "多人街道行走",
          "prompt": "The medium shots focus on the interaction between the characters and the street environment. The window reflects mottled tree shadows, hinting at the hurried pace of city life. In the distance, several blurred figures of pedestrians can be seen, some walking, some pausing, forming a dynamic contrast with the protagonist, further highlighting the everyday urban atmosphere. The tall phoenix trees on both sides of the street have canopies like green umbrellas, shading part of the sky. Their thick and powerful branches and intersecting lines form a natural frame structure, blocking direct sunlight while casting large patches of mottled light and shadow on the ground, creating a visual rhythm of interplay of light and shadow.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
