        {
          "id": "krea2-ad9877ee280c63585cf42d4b",
          "alias": "自然语言提示词（4）",
          "prompt": "The background is a typical residential building complex, with walls mainly white, neatly arranged windows, and some balconies hanging clothes or potted plants, exuding a strong sense of daily life. The building's facade appears somewhat aged, with subtle peeling marks visible in the corners. This \"sense of time\" subtly contrasts with the youthful vitality of the characters, giving the painting a narrative depth where nostalgia and reality intertwine. Although the sky is not fully visible, the light filtering through the leaves is soft and bright, creating a warm and sunny afternoon atmosphere.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
