        {
          "id": "krea2-796bc77ea1191e7c5c1c70f8",
          "alias": "单女街道倚靠",
          "prompt": "In terms of lighting and atmosphere, the entire series is bathed in intense natural sunlight, with sunlight filtering through the dense canopy casting delicate, textured shadows on the ground and figures, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow as a \"light spot\" effect. The character outlines are clearly and sharply outlined, but the shadow transitions are soft, avoiding a stiff and fragmented feeling. The overall tone leans toward warm yellow, with slight film grain texture and slight overexposed edges, simulating the soft focus and color shift effects of vintage camera film, giving the image a vintage cinematic hazy beauty. There is a faint sense of dust floating in the air, combined with soft diffused light, creating a tranquil atmosphere of a \"lazy afternoon,\" as if time has frozen at this moment, with only the wind whispering among the leaves and only the girl breathing freely on the street.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
