        {
          "id": "krea2-9b3e1fc142d7e375e1d8a0e0",
          "alias": "单女灰旗袍雪地冷淡站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the center of a modern black metal arched tunnel. She wears an elegant light gray-blue modified qipao, with delicate black piping on the collar and cuffs. The chest is adorned with several vintage-style black frog buttons. One side of the skirt slits down to mid-thigh, revealing her long legs. She wears simple black knee-high boots and a small black bag draped over her shoulder, giving off a slightly messy look. Her posture is upright and relaxed, her hands naturally hanging at her sides, while her left hand gently grips the end of the strap, blending traditional Eastern charm with modern fashion flair. In the foreground is the wooden floor where she stands, with clear dark brown wood grain extending into the depths of the painting to form a visual passage guiding the viewer. On the right edge, a neatly laid wooden bench or steps can be faintly seen, with scattered white debris or snow marks below, suggesting the environment may be in winter or cold weather. The middle section depicts the tunnel's internal structure, with black steel frames arranged in a radial interlaced pattern, creating a space frame full of tension and depth. Several warm yellow circular spotlights are embedded at the top, casting soft light spots in dim environments. Light reflects off the metal surface to create delicate high-gloss textures, enhancing the spatial dimension. The background is completely enveloped by the tunnel structure, with distant areas gradually blurring and creating a beautiful out-of-focus effect. Warm light and shadow faintly appear outside or on the other side, possibly from dusk or indoor lights filtering through gaps, creating a mysterious, profound, and warm atmosphere. The entire composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figures positioned at the very center of the composition. The ground guide lines in the foreground and structural lines in the background form multiple visual guidances, enhancing the depth and spatial narrative value of the composition. The lighting and shadow handling is extremely meticulous: the main light source comes from the upper front of the figure, while moderate shadows are retained to enhance the sense of depth. Warm light spots in the background serve as auxiliary light sources, enriching color layers and giving the scene a warm and romantic emotional tone. The overall atmosphere blends classical Eastern aesthetics with elements of futuristic industrial design, offering both a tranquil and steady poetic beauty and the cold and stern texture of urban nightlife, presenting a unique charm of a \"new Chinese style\"—traditional clothing is revitalized in the context of modern architecture, and the figures are as serene and elegant as figures in a painting, as if stepping out of a historical scroll or immersed in a contemporary art installation. At this wonderful moment, time and space converge, with delicate and authentic texture. As if shot by professional photography during prime time, it delivers powerful visual impact and emotional resonance. Every detail is meticulously crafted, together creating a visual work full of narrative depth and artistic tension.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
