        {
          "id": "krea2-e9016c3aae63a647e461197c",
          "alias": "单女白T恤庭院忧伤站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under the shade of a tree in an outdoor courtyard or alley, looking directly at the camera, as if silently expressing some inner emotion. The petals curl slightly, carrying a natural softness and a hint of stubbornness. The stems are slender, with green leaves scattered throughout, hinting that she is holding a bouquet of equally blooming roses. The flowers extend naturally in the lower left corner of the painting, forming a soft visual guiding line. She wore a loose, minimalist white T-shirt, with the fabric showing delicate pleats and layers of light and shadow under the sunlight, while the lines of her shoulders and neck were outlined softly and three-dimensionally by the sunlight. Above the head, dense deep green leaves and leaves, their edges filtered by sunlight, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow, creating a dreamlike \"light painting\" effect. The background is blurred, with faint gray-blue tones of walls or fences, possibly old buildings or courtyard fences. The blurred outlines and foreground figures create a sense of spatial depth while reinforcing the subject's focus. The entire composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with a slight tilt giving the image a sense of dynamism and emotional tension. The figures occupy the right side of the frame, while the left side is blank for flowers and light to extend into the scene, creating a balanced and breathable visual layout. Light comes from the upper side, representing the soft natural afternoon light, filtering through the gaps in the leaves while retaining large areas of shadow to enhance the sense of depth and drama. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, poetic, and slightly nostalgic, like an old-fashioned photo taken with a film camera, featuring slight grainy noise, faded edges, and natural color shifts, presenting a gentle yet slightly melancholic youthful aesthetic. The tones are a blend of warm and cool tones, with the figures' skin naturally warm, while the background and leaves lean toward a cool blue-green tone, creating a visually harmonious contrast. The details in the painting are rich, with every detail brimming with a sense of life and artistic quality. The entire image exudes an everyday yet deeply artistic aura, like a moment captured on a summer afternoon with an old digital camera or film reel. It combines the warmth of real life with cinematic narrative beauty and emotional depth, evoking youth, loneliness, romance, and unspoken thoughts.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
