        {
          "id": "krea2-8612a5685ea3ec66f36dfbe1",
          "alias": "多人白制服婚礼忧伤倚靠",
          "prompt": "This is a campus promotional poster image full of youthful energy and philosophical depth. The main subjects are two figures dressed in matching white school uniforms and wearing dark gray striped bow ties. The gray-white color scheme is simple and dignified, enhancing the sense of ceremony and order of the campus uniforms; The background is a pure, boundless pale blue sky, with clouds thin like veil. Several pale golden rays of light slant from the upper right corner into the painting, penetrating the air to create a soft-focus halo effect, dotted with floating circular light spots and flying dust particles, giving the painting a light, ethereal dynamic beauty. The composition uses a vertically symmetrical double-layered structure, with the heads of the upper and lower figures centered to form a stable visual center of gravity and a layered visual framework. The blank area in the middle cleverly incorporates the Japanese slogan \"だけじゃないチカラ.\" The text features a simple and modern font design, with white text clearly legible against a blue background, and the green school name \"Shizuoka Gakuen High School\" at the bottom serves as a visual anchor to stabilize the bottom of the image. The visual guidance path flows naturally from top to bottom, ultimately culminating in the school name at the bottom, achieving dual functions of emotional progression and information transmission. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere leans toward soft, diffused daylight, with the main light source coming from the upper right, creating a contrast between light and dark without being awkward. The shadow transitions naturally, creating a fresh, transparent, and slightly melancholic poetic youthful ambiance; The color palette is dominated by cool sky blue, creating a visual balance of warm and cool interweaving, reflecting both the calm temperament of rational scholarship while maintaining the warmth of life and humanistic care. Combined with the text, the emphasis is on social practice skills that go beyond mere knowledge on paper, conveying an educational philosophy that is explosively powerful in tranquility and warmth in rationality. The image texture is delicate and authentic, featuring traces of professional studio lighting and post-production color grading, while retaining natural light and shadow and slight noise, presenting a grainy texture and lifestyle aesthetic close to everyday amateur equipment, avoiding the artificial feeling caused by excessive perfect retouching, allowing viewers to experience immersive resonance and emotional projection.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
