        {
          "id": "krea2-7fb685be9d9099a603659be2",
          "alias": "单女白T恤窗边沉思坐展示",
          "prompt": "A woman sits alone at the edge of the windowsill, her body slightly tilted against the warm wooden wall, legs naturally bent and crossed, barefoot touching the windowsill, her posture relaxed yet full of life. She wears a simple pure white short-sleeve T-shirt and a pair of fitted mid-blue jeans. The fabric is authentic and delicate, with clearly visible stitching and folds, showcasing comfort and casual beauty in everyday wear. Her expression was either contemplative or thoughtful, as if immersed in her own inner world. In the foreground are her bare feet and ankle lines, toes naturally spreading, sunlight streaming through the left window, creating soft high-light transitions on the instep and calf, with distinct layers of light and shadow. The medium focuses on her upper body and leg contours. The white T-shirt creates subtle folds due to body curves, jeans wrap her long legs, and the knees have a natural curve. The overall composition centers on the person, shot from a slightly upward perspective, giving the figure a greater sense of warmth and spatial depth. The background consists of a modern-style black window frame on the left and a warm natural wood wall on the right. The window frame lines are clean and strong, and the blurred outdoor light visible through the glass creates a visual separation between the interior and outdoors. The wooden wall on the right has clear textures, presenting a warm yellow tone reminiscent of years of accumulation. The surface features natural scratches and uneven color variations, enhancing the realism and warmth of the scene. The composition is compact and full, with the main figure occupying about two-thirds of the image. The diagonally extended window frames and vertical walls form a geometric framework, naturally guiding the viewer's attention to the expressions and postures of the figures. In terms of lighting and ambiance, the main light source comes from natural daylight outside the left window, which is soft and directional. At the same time, a gentle shadow transition is formed between the right wall and the back of the body, creating a sense of depth and layering. The overall color tone leans toward warmth, complemented by a white T-shirt as a bright accent, creating a quiet, cozy, and slightly artistic atmosphere for a home afternoon. The image quality pursues realism and delicacy, reminiscent of natural candid shots with amateur equipment, preserving slight noise and color transitions for a natural feel, avoiding excessive sharpening or post-processing retouching, conveying an unrefined aesthetic of life and emotional tension, allowing people to experience moments of tranquility and the beauty of solitude.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
