        {
          "id": "krea2-4f754ef4a0f34dbd1b1c8ff8",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣卧室害羞坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman quietly sits on a bed covered with soft floral patterned sheets. She wears softly colored loungewear: a blue-and-white-pink striped knit cardigan on top, and light-colored pajama pants printed with small cherry blossoms and daisies, creating a relaxed yet comfortable home atmosphere; She held a small hardcover book with a delicate cover pattern. The pages slightly flipped, seemingly immersed in reading, but she gently lifted it to look directly at the camera, her expression calm and slightly shy, adding a touch of liveliness and authenticity; On the left side of the foreground is a white circular electric fan, with some blades blurred, exposing only the outline and partial blade structure, adding a sense of life and spatial layers to the image, while cleverly guiding the viewer to focus on the subject; The middle is the area where she sits on her bed. The sheets are delicate and soft, adorned with small floral patterns in pink, yellow, and blue. The colors are bright but not glaring, harmonizing with the character's clothing tones. Next to the bed is a pure white ruffled pillow with naturally folded edges, further enhancing the warmth of the bedroom scene; In the background is a large window with a wooden window frame divided into multiple squares. Light outside filters through the glass into the room, creating a bright and soft diffused glow. The lines of the window frame are clearly visible, and the right window handle is made of dark brown metal, glowing with a warm luster in the sunlight. Outside, faint outlines of green plants can be faintly seen, hinting at the presence of an outdoor courtyard or balcony, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The entire image uses a close-up composition, with the figure occupying the left central position, the body slightly turned to the side, and the head slightly tilted, forming a natural visual focal point; The visual guide line of the image begins from the curved edge of the foreground fan, allowing the viewer's gaze to naturally follow and linger on the details of the character's expression; In terms of lighting and shadows, the main light source comes from the upper right window, which is a natural soft glow that creates soft highlights and transitional shadows. There are no harsh projections or overexposed areas, creating a warm and peaceful atmosphere full of healing like afternoon sunshine. The color palette is dominated by low-saturation pastels, complemented by warm wood brown and white as neutral tones, creating a fresh, tranquil, and slightly nostalgic Japanese style. The image texture is as delicate as film photography, with slight graininess and soft focus effects, as if shot with a regular digital camera under natural light, presenting beautiful moments captured unintentionally in daily life—both artistically expressive and warm.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
