        {
          "id": "krea2-f4177b6193d1e509fd90269c",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣城市冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits gracefully on the edge of a bright white windowsill, her body slightly turned and her head slightly raised, as if drawn to a moment outside the window, her expression serene and full of storytelling. adding a touch of laziness and authenticity. Her makeup is delicate yet understated, creating a subtle contrast with her fair skin. She wore a minimalist white short-sleeved knit sweater, with flared cuffs that flared out naturally. The fabric was delicate and textured, presenting a soft matte finish under the light; Layered with a deep navy blue slip dress, the hem hugs the figure, outlining smooth curves. The slender straps create a warm and cool visual balance with the white top. She wears thin black tights on her legs, and at her ankles reveals a pair of uniquely designed light blue suede wedge sandals, with laces tied at the ankles, giving the whole look a blend of professional vibe and casual flair. Her posture is relaxed and relaxed, her left hand lightly resting on the bend of her right arm, her right hand naturally hanging by her knee, her fingers long and her nails neatly trimmed, presenting a relaxed beauty in everyday life. The foreground focuses on the lines and details of her legs. The shallow depth of field blurs the background into a hazy patch of light and shadow. Outside the window, you can faintly see the outlines of green plants and the white architectural structure. Through the large glass windows, soft, even natural light pours in, streaming diagonally from the left, creating a three-dimensional yet unobtrusive layering of light and shadow. The entire composition uses the classic rule of thirds, with the figure positioned on the right third of the frame, while the slanted window frame lines and the curves of the figure's body enhance the dynamic image. The white window frame in the background forms a clean geometric framework with the wall, enhancing the sense of spatial depth, while the blurred scenery outside the window gives the painting a sense of breath and ambiance. The color combination is harmonious and unified, creating a clean, tranquil, and slightly artistic visual atmosphere. The lighting and shadow processing in the images are delicate, avoiding strong contrasts. The overall style leans toward Japanese portraiture or urban lifestyle aesthetic photography, featuring a slight soft-focus effect and low-noise texture, simulating the realism and emotional warmth of amateur equipment shooting rather than overly commercialized perfect filters, conveying an authentic and life-close artistic aesthetic.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
