        {
          "id": "krea2-b737fec254adf23c06f6b9a6",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣沙发困倦坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly on the edge of a white sofa, leaning slightly forward, her left hand gently pulling aside the pink metal tassel curtains hanging on both sides, while her right hand rests naturally on her knee, her posture relaxed and full of movement; She wore an off-white long-sleeved knit top with a classic navy-style black-and-white striped bow at the collar. She paired it with a black high-waisted short skirt that sat at mid-thigh, revealing long, well-proportioned legs. She wore light-colored semi-transparent socks on her feet, barefoot lightly touching the sofa armrest; Her expression is gentle yet full of storytelling; In the foreground, her bare leg lines contrast with the soft white leather texture of the sofa; in the middle are her arms pulling the curtain, the folds of her blouse, and the metal button details on the edge of her short skirt; the background features a white wall half-covered by pink tassel curtains and a window that lets in soft natural light. A layer of sheer lace curtains can be faintly seen by the window, and a pink star-shaped balloon hangs in the right corner, adding a dreamy atmosphere to the scene. The overall composition adopts a medium-near perspective, with the figure occupying the center-left position, tasseled curtains forming a visual guiding line that extends to the direction of the light outside the window; The light and shadows are soft and even, with natural light streaming through the curtains from the front side, creating delicate transitions of light and dark on her skin, clothes, and sofa surface, with soft shadows that are soft and not awkward; The atmosphere is fresh and sweet, evoking the warmth of a festive or birthday party. The color scheme is mainly white, complemented by pink tassels that contrast sharply with black clothing, creating a clean, bright, yet lively visual layer; The image quality is delicate and realistic, as if shot with amateur equipment but with professional post-production color grading, preserving a natural, everyday feel and slight noise particles, making the entire scene feel more intimate and lively rather than overly refined; The overall mood is warm and healing, full of youthful energy and casual romance, like capturing a girl at home preparing to celebrate a special moment—both everyday and full of ritual, artistic beauty and close to real life experiences.",
