        {
          "id": "krea2-55fac704ce88de2b5edc08c1",
          "alias": "单女白和服竹林坐",
          "prompt": "An Eastern woman sits upright in a traditional Japanese-style room, dressed in a simple off-white kimono with light fabric like clouds, naturally draped cuffs and hems, and the collar embroidered with delicate orange maple leaves and light green bamboo leaf patterns. The colors are warm and soft, forming a delicate contrast with the overall simple and clean tone; Slightly turning his head to look back at the camera, his posture elegant yet restrained, hands lightly resting on his knees, fingertips long, nails painted a pale pink nail polish. Next to his right hand, a faint red satin wrap can be seen, possibly a kimono obi or accessory, with subtle patterns on it, adding a touch of classical elegance; In the foreground is a semi-transparent wooden sliding door frame structure, with clear and warm wood grain and blurred edges, skillfully forming a visual framework that guides viewers to focus on the main figure; The middle features a tatami floor with finely visible woven patterns, laid with a light brown mat. The figures sit upright, forming a stable compositional foundation with the floor; The background features a traditional Japanese shoji door, with clean and orderly grille lines that let in hazy daylight. Behind it, a round white paper lantern can be faintly seen hanging in the corner of the wall, soft light and shadow casting softly, creating a tranquil and Zen-like atmosphere. The entire composition uses a low-angle, slightly upward-looking composition to make the figures more approachable and present, while the door frame forms a natural framed composition to enhance depth; Light comes from softly scattered light sources on the front side, with warm golden sunlight evenly filtering through the shoji door gaps, creating subtle transitions between light and dark. The shadows are soft but not stiff, enhancing the three-dimensional contours; The overall atmosphere is peaceful, gentle, with a touch of nostalgia and poetry, as if time has frozen in an afternoon, filled with Eastern aesthetics and the leisurely feeling of daily life. The color palette mainly features off-white, wood brown, and light gray, accented with small areas of red and orange, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if shot with a high-resolution camera, featuring slight film graininess and natural noise, presenting a visual effect with amateur equipment yet rich in artistic depth. The details are rich yet never overshadowed, and every element serves emotional expression and spatial storytelling, conveying vitality and inner emotional tension in tranquility.",
