          "id": "krea2-48adc8db7d7c7af2043ede08",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫广场困倦坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window in front of a grid iron railing, sunlight streaming in from the tall window, casting clear geometric stripes of light and shadow on her body and background, creating a warm yet slightly lazy afternoon atmosphere. She wore a pristine loose white shirt with a deep blue striped bow tie at the collar, paired with a dark blue short skirt and tight pants. The overall school uniform style was simple and clean yet full of youthful energy. adding a touch of playfulness and naturalness; A delicate white floral hairpin is pinned to her bun, making her one of the visual focal points of the scene. She turned slightly, her left hand naturally resting on her knee, and wore a delicate silver bracelet on her wrist, which shimmered with a soft metallic sheen under the light. Her gaze shifted slightly to one side, as if immersed in her own world. Contrasting with the white shirt, it exudes a gentle aura reminiscent of a Japanese idol. The foreground is a close-up of her legs and clothing, with dark blue pants outlined by sunlight creating three-dimensional folds and layers of light and shadow, creating a contrast with the bright background behind. The medium focuses on her upper body and posture, with the shirt cuffs slightly rolled, and the fabric revealed a delicate texture and flow under the light. The background features large glass window frames, divided by white metal frames into neat square areas. The daylight streaming in from outside is pale blue-white, making the entire space appear transparent, bright, and modern. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the subject positioned slightly to the right of the frame, leaving a larger space on the left to showcase pane structures and light and shadow effects, creating an asymmetrical yet balanced visual layout. The visual guide lines are composed of vertical and horizontal lines on the windows, creating a warm and soft light and shadow atmosphere. Strong backlighting forms a bright halo along the edges of the figures' silhouettes, highlighting their graceful figures; The indoor lighting is more even, avoiding overexposure or heavy shadows. The overall color palette mainly uses white, light blue, and deep blue, creating a fresh, tranquil, and slightly dreamy visual tone. The image style leans toward the realism of everyday amateur equipment, rich yet natural, with moderate color saturation, slight film graininess, and soft motion blur. It simulates the moment of a person captured by a phone or regular camera in natural light, combining life feel with artistic expression and evoking a quiet, gentle, and slightly nostalgic youthful mood.",
