        {
          "id": "krea2-b4aed7a0f0063d445b0975bc",
          "alias": "单女灰T恤窗边愤怒站立指向",
          "prompt": "Standing sideways by the bright window, she wears a loose light gray cotton T-shirt, her shoulders naturally draped down, the fabric softly shimmering in the light. Her right hand gently holds a dark green thick terracotta mug, the rim facing upward, her posture relaxed yet contemplative, as if immersed in the warmth of a hot drink and the tranquility of the world outside the window; Her silhouette is outlined in the backlight, outlining a soft silhouette, with a few strands scattered behind her neck, presenting a warm orange-red hue, which complements the diffused light streaming in from outside the window; The windowsill runs across the central scene, with several transparent glass bottles and a deep amber vintage wine bottle scattered across it. The bottle is crystal clear, reflecting a faint highlight in the light. Inside a slender-necked bottle is a withered dark brown flower, its petals curled like a sigh, making it the only still life in the painting with traces of human intervention. The view outside is blurred by a layer of misty curtains or raindrops, forming a hazy gray-white background. The outlines of distant greenery and the pale blue sky can be faintly seen, creating an atmosphere of isolation from the hustle and bustle, tranquil and far-reaching reach; The composition uses the classic rule of thirds: the figure occupies about one-third of the left side of the painting, while the right side is left blank to create space for the window view and extended view. The window frame, as a natural frame, enhances the sense of depth. The visual guiding line naturally extends from the arm, holding the cup, passing through the horizontal line of the windowsill, ultimately pointing to the blurred distant view outside the window, forming a stable visual flow. The overall use of light and shadow is delicate and warm. Natural light from outside the window passes through behind the figure, creating a strong backlighting effect without harsh shadows. Instead, the edges of the figure are blended into soft-focus halos, and there are slight transitions between light and dark below the window, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The mood is set for a lazy home moment in the early morning or afternoon, carrying a subtle nostalgia and introspective temperament. The tones lean toward warm yellow and gray-green, with moderate saturation and rich color layers that are not glaring, creating a poetic moment gently wrapped by time in everyday life. Like images taken with an old film camera indoors on cloudy days, the graininess and slightly overexposed edges give the image a genuine texture and emotional warmth, as if time has frozen at this moment, with only breathing and the lingering warmth of the rim gently echoing in the air.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
