        {
          "id": "krea2-6fbd422bb7e7c283833daf78",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫桥严肃蹲持手机",
          "prompt": "A female character squats on the concrete floor at the edge of a city overpass or rooftop, dressed in Japanese-style campus-style clothing: a white long-sleeved shirt paired with a gray knit cardigan casually tied at the waist, revealing a plaid mini skirt and thick white socks underneath, paired with black loafers. The overall look exudes youthful energy with a touch of lazy casualness; In her right hand, she holds a black smartphone. Beside her lies a dark blue backpack with a gray-white fabric strap, and nearby is a black tactical style replica firearm prop with the muzzle pointing downward, with exquisite and realistic details suggesting the character might play a specific role or scene; In the background, metallic vertical railings stretch into the distance, with blurred urban architectural outlines visible behind. The sky is bright and pale, with soft and even light, creating an overall atmosphere that is tranquil with a slight sense of urban detachment; The foreground focuses on the characters' legs, feet, and ground props; the middle ground features the upper body and mobile interactions; the background is a blurred city skyline that creates depth; The composition is shot from a slightly top-down angle, with the figure occupying two-thirds of the left side of the frame, and the blank space on the right side housing props and background elements, creating visual balance; Light and shadow come from natural sources on the upper side, with delicate shadow transitions that create a warm and clear daytime atmosphere; The color palette leans toward cool tones of blue, gray, and white, enhancing the sense of layering in the image; then extends down to ground props, creating a smooth sight path; The overall visuals present a realistic texture reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment. Slight noise and natural color temperature deviations enhance the everyday narrative atmosphere, while costumes, props, and environmental details cleverly blend character settings with real-life scenes, creating a visual style that is both artistic and close to real life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
