        {
          "id": "krea2-1136069d528c72ebd1752954",
          "alias": "单女白T恤公园微笑站立持食物",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a natural setting in an outdoor park or riverside, holding a huge green traffic cone on her head, gently holding the edge of the cone with both hands, as if maintaining balance or interacting with it; The overall posture is full of vitality and humor; She wore a white camisole top paired with light blue denim overalls, with dark brown leather straps and metal fasteners in the details. The style was casual yet refined; The traffic cone is a standard conical shape, with a matte green plastic surface and two white reflective stripes wrapped in the middle. One stripe faintly shows the handwritten number \"21\", and the bottom edge of the cone slightly deforms under stress, highlighting its authentic texture. In the middle shot, she raises both arms to support the cone, with soft and smooth arm lines that glow with a healthy glow under natural light; The background is dense green trees with rich layers of leaves. The depth of field creates a soft bokeh blur, sunlight filters through the branches and leaves, casting dappled shadows. In the distance, a calm water surface or embankment can be faintly seen, with mainly blue-green tones, creating a tranquil and leisurely summer afternoon atmosphere; The composition adopts a close-up perspective from medium to close-up, with the figure positioned slightly above the center of the frame. The traffic cone vertically runs along the longitudinal axis of the image, creating a strong visual guidance and engaging contrast. At the same time, shallow depth of field compresses the sense of spatial depth to highlight the main subject; The lighting atmosphere presents soft, diffused light, with an overall warm vintage film texture with slight grainy noise and color bias. The color saturation is moderate yet layered, with green vegetation contrasting fresh against white clothing, and subtle shadows from the upper side enhance the sense of depth. The overall visuals convey a relaxed, childlike, and slightly absurd artistic feel, reminiscent of street photography or movie stills in narrative scenes. They are both lively and creatively expressive, as if capturing a wonderful moment in an ordinary day, making viewers smile knowingly and sparking endless imagination.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
