        {
          "id": "krea2-3df27ce035f9d39ff5438d7e",
          "alias": "单女短裙雪地困倦倚靠",
          "prompt": "The pendant was made of transparent material, inlaid with fine sequins that reflected a dreamy glow under soft light. Below, two plump white pom-poms hung down, visually echoing the plush elements of the cloak; Her left hand naturally hangs down, fingertips lightly touch the hem of the skirt, which lifts slightly with movement, showing a lively posture; On the left side of the foreground is a small imitation Christmas tree, its branches and leaves covered in delicate white \"snow frost.\" Some branches are blurred to enhance spatial layering, and a faint warm yellow string decoration can be seen at the base of the trunk, injecting a touch of warmth into the cool-toned background; The middle shot is the main subject, occupying most of the visual focus, and the composition uses a slightly downward angle to make the characters appear more approachable and charming; The background features a pure and simple light gray wall, with slightly irregular light and shadow mottling, possibly natural projections created by softly scattered light on the wall, creating a clean and tidy space that retains a sense of life; The overall composition uses shallow depth of field, with moderate blurring between background and foreground to emphasize the prominence of the subject; Light comes from the upper front, avoiding strong shadows, while subtly reflecting highlights on the velvet fabric of the cloak, highlighting the texture of the material; The colors are centered on classic red and white, complemented by gray background tones and green accents from Christmas trees, creating a striking contrast yet harmonious and unified visual system; The lighting atmosphere is warm, dreamy, full of childlike fun and festive atmosphere, as if immersed in a tranquil and joyful winter fairy tale world. The visual style leans toward the realistic texture of everyday amateur equipment, with slight noise and natural halo effects, rather than the flawless professional studio experience. It is closer to the beautiful moments of real life, conveying a relaxed, happy, and overflowing emotional resonance.",
