        {
          "id": "krea2-c75998ad7293a75d443a45fa",
          "alias": "单女绿衬衫山野微笑持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman rides a brightly colored bicycle wearing an off-white woven bucket hat with the clear \"ANN TEANO\" black brand label printed on it. She wears a pair of retro-style orange round sunglasses with deep lenses and soft frame lines, revealing her bright and radiant smile through the lenses, adding a touch of vitality. Her outfit exudes a strong summer vibe, layered over a loose, flowing mint green short-sleeved shirt. The fabric is thin and breathable, the hem flutters gently in the breeze, and she underneath a pure white long-sleeve base shirt, creating a refreshing layered look. A black plush charm hangs at the shirt collar, adding a playful detail to the overall look. She also slung a black vintage film camera diagonally around her neck, with the camera naturally hanging over her chest through a black strap, the lens pointing downward, as if ready to capture the highlights of her journey. She rides a mountain bike with a blue-green gradient paint scheme. The frame lines are smooth, the front fork and handlebars are sky blue, the rear transitions to teal, and the metallic finish glows softly in the sunlight. The seat is a classic black design accented with orange stripes. One hand was held on the handlebar, her nails neatly trimmed, while the other hand hung naturally beside the frame. Hanging below the frame is a bottle of transparent plastic bottled beverage, with an orange-yellow label and a white cap, hinting at a relaxed and pleasant outdoor cycling journey. The entire composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right, the bicycle extending diagonally from the lower left corner to the center, forming a visual guiding line. The background is blurred, presenting blurred grass, sand, and faintly visible orange object outlines in the distance (possibly abandoned playground equipment or wooden structures), creating a shallow depth of field effect that highlights the main figure. Light comes from the upper left of the painting, a gentle afternoon sunshine that creates natural transitions of light and shadow and delicate shadows, especially under the brim, shoulders, and bicycle frame, creating subtle contrasts of light and shadow. The overall atmosphere is full of youthful energy, freedom, and summer casual vibes. The color palette is mainly fresh and natural mint green, sky blue, and earth brown, accented with orange, creating a harmonious and visually striking color scheme. The images have a strong sense of realism and a sense of everyday life, as if shot by a regular phone or entry-level digital camera under natural light. It retains slight noise and true color saturation, avoiding excessive sharpening or post-processing, conveying an unpolished, pure aesthetic and poetic everyday life. It allows riders to feel their inner joy and closeness to the natural environment. The entire image is filled with sunshine, freedom, and carefree youthful energy, like a flowing summer memory scroll.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
