        {
          "id": "krea2-28195934b521086146c3011d",
          "alias": "单女透视白毛衣沙发媚态坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly on the edge of an off-white suede sofa, leaning slightly forward, legs naturally crossed, presenting a relaxed yet confident posture. She wears a simple white cropped knit top that reveals a slender waistline and part of her abdomen. She pairs a classic red and black plaid skirt with black sheer stockings, the red sock hem clearly visible at the ankle, and a pair of black high heels casually placed on the light-colored wooden floor, their heels delicate and upright. Her right hand gently supports an open book. The pages are pure white, the handwriting clearly visible, as if she has just stopped reading. In the foreground, the soft texture of the sofa and the delicate lines of her long legs are presented. In the middle frame, the focus is on her upper body posture and the interaction between the book in her hands. The background features a simple, light-colored wall and a flowing white gauze curtain on the right. Behind the curtain, a string of warm string lights faintly shines through, emitting a hazy golden glow that creates a private and cozy home atmosphere. The entire scene uses a slightly overhead view, giving viewers an intimate sense of insight and creating a smooth visual flow. Light comes from the front side, soft and layered, illuminating the texture of her skin and clothing, while casting delicate shadows on the sofa and walls, enhancing the sense of depth and dimension. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and slightly provocative, blending the casual feel of daily life with a subtle artistic touch of carefully arranged art. The interplay of light and shadow presents a balance between \"home\" and \"self\"—neither a fully realistic life scene nor a staged still, but a real and exquisite moment between the two. It feels as if time has frozen in this moment, leaving only her with books, sofas, and lights forming a gentle yet tension-filled image, making one imagine she is immersed in a world of a story.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
