        {
          "id": "krea2-610dba4f3d5dd058f79fd431",
          "alias": "单女商店坐持相机",
          "prompt": "In a scene full of exotic charm and serene poetry, a woman dressed in traditional white Audai sits upright on a rustic wooden windowsill. Her sleeves are light and semi-transparent, gently fluttering in the breeze. A bright red bracelet on her wrist adds a touch of vitality to her simple clothes. On the wooden table beside him sat a vintage film camera, a cup of clear water, and a blue-and-white ceramic conical hat painted with landscape figures. The hat leaned against the tabletop, as if carrying a long-standing story. Outside the window is a mottled yellow wall, sunlight filtering through the vines and leaves, creating a texture of light and shadow. In the corner, a small sticker of the Vietnamese flag can be faintly seen. The window frame is a heavy black wooden door, open to the door. Inside, warm and dim yellow lights glow softly, faintly visible with a \"Coffee\" wooden sign and more red flags scattered throughout. In the background, blurred figures hint at the daily bustle and liveliness of the shop. In the foreground, hanging green vines form natural curtains, cascading layer upon layer from the eaves, with slender and flexible branches and vibrant green leaves, interwoven with two white paper lanterns hanging above the lintel, their surfaces printed with elegant bamboo leaf patterns. At the top hangs a small red triangular flag, gently fluttering in the wind. The entire composition centers on the window, forming a natural visual guiding line, while the foreground vines and the background interior space create a sense of depth and depth. Light comes from the upper left of the painting, with intense sunlight piercing through the gaps in the leaves, casting sharp shadows on the shoulders, tables, and walls, creating a high-contrast atmosphere of light and shadow, giving the painting a sense of depth and dramatic tension. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow, complemented by dark brown wood, dark green vines, pure white clothing, and red and yellow flags as accents, creating a harmonious color that carries an Eastern aesthetic charm. The image texture is delicate and realistic, featuring professional-level precise composition and light control, while also featuring a soft graininess and slight noise characteristic of amateur equipment shooting. It seems to capture a moment of lazy afternoon time, conveying a tranquil, far-reaching atmosphere of peaceful and peaceful life, making one pause and immerse in the poetic and cultural depth contained within this small space.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
