        {
          "id": "krea2-67bb68a41e32e266e42cd025",
          "alias": "单女白外套城市忧伤倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman leans sideways against the window, her expression tinged with a hint of laziness and mystery; Her shoulders are exposed, faintly revealing the geometric patterns of the inner garment. Her right hand gently rolls around a fluffy, thick white faux fur coat. The fur is dense and soft, with every strand clearly visible, shimmering with a delicate sheen under the light. The coat naturally drapes down, covering most of her body, creating a warm yet slightly lonely visual focal point; In the foreground is the thick, full plush edges of the fur coat, occupying about one-third of the lower space. The tips of the fur show layers of light and shadow with the changing light and shadow, creating a strong tactile and volumetric feel; The middle is the woman's upper body and the main part of the fur coat, with her head slightly tilted, forming the core point of emotional communication; The background is a simple indoor environment. On the left, dense parallel lines formed by vertical blinds allow sunlight to stream through the gaps, casting fine strip-like shadows on the walls and figures. On the right is a plain, light gray wall, creating a clean space with no unnecessary decoration, enhancing the visual tension between the figure and the fur. At the same time, the straight line structure of the blinds contrasts with the curves of the fur, enhancing the sense of rhythm in the composition. Extending further to the orderly background of the blinds, the light and shadow atmosphere creates a natural indoor light effect where warm and cool intertwine, while subtle shadows form behind the blinds. The overall color scheme is mainly gray and white, creating a tranquil, private, and slightly fashionable artistic spatial mood. It seems to capture a moment of daily life full of dramatic tension. This amateur-style work is suitable for shooting with a mobile phone or small camera, preserving authentic texture and the atmosphere of life, avoiding excessive embellishment, presenting a modern urban woman's independence and Elegance and reserved temperament.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
