        {
          "id": "krea2-50bba302167e76119ea26072",
          "alias": "单女白T恤竹林微笑坐泼洒",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a floor covered with light green bamboo mats, draped in a soft, wrinkled orange blanket, her legs naturally crossed on a matching square pillow. She wears an off-white knitted camisole paired with loose cotton-linen pants, slightly tilting her head and smiling as she bites into a juicy bright red watermelon. Her right hand holds another piece of watermelon, but on a small white porcelain plate before her are two sliced watermelons, their translucent flesh contrasting sharply with the deep green rind. On the left side of the foreground is a retro electric fan with a silver-gray metal mesh cover. The blades are stationary, and the body lines are clean, occupying the visual focus in the lower right corner of the frame, creating a sense of everyday life. The middle is the area where the woman sits, including the blanket, pillow, and watermelon she is holding beneath her. These elements together create a comfortable and pleasant living scene; On the left side of the background is a tall wooden bookshelf stacked with books of various colored covers, ranging from dark brown to light blue to pure white, arranged in a harmonious manner. In the center of the shelf stands a pot of lush green plants placed in a blue-glazed ceramic basin, its leaves spreading densely and vibrantly injecting the interior; On the right is a dark brown wooden door and window frame, with a small gardening shovel hanging beside the door, and a small pot of ferns placed on a small round wooden stump nearby. The terracotta pot is simple and natural; In the distance, several stacked colorful paperback books can be seen scattered along the edge of the wooden floor, creating a reading atmosphere; The entire composition is shot at a slightly overhead angle, with the main figure positioned slightly to the left center. The viewer's gaze naturally guides the audience to focus on her expressions and movements, while the foreground fan, the middle ground features a watermelon and watermelon, and the background bookshelf and plants create a distinct sense of spatial depth; Light comes from the window at the upper right of the painting, with soft natural light pouring into the room, while the shadows transition delicately. The overall contrast of light and shadow is soft but not glaring, presenting a tranquil atmosphere as afternoon sunlight streaming through the glass windows. The color palette mainly features warm orange, off-white, and natural wood tones, complemented by the bright red of watermelon and the vibrant green of greenery, creating a warm and vibrant visual effect; The overall image exudes a healing feeling of home life and a lazy summer afternoon atmosphere, with a slight grainy film texture and natural color temperature deviation. It feels like a real moment casually captured by a regular phone or small camera under natural light, without excessive post-processing, preserving texture details and subtle imperfections from real life, conveying an ordinary yet poetic everyday aesthetic.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
