        {
          "id": "krea2-48b1c8388fe825cd3cf98c0e",
          "alias": "单女毛衣庭院愤怒蹲",
          "prompt": "A woman squats at the edge of an outdoor concrete step, wearing a dark knit cardigan paired with loose white pants, a black beret, and a black-dotted canvas bag with an off-white background and polka dots on her shoulder. Her hands are folded and resting lightly on her knees, her expression slightly calm and reserved, as if captured in an unintentional moment on an afternoon. The overall makeup is minimalist, adding a touch of everyday life. She was in a somewhat old-fashioned corner of a Japanese courtyard, with mottled white walls and rusty metal fences behind her. Behind the fence, you could vaguely see brick walls, iron gates, and a few withered branches or budding shrubs. In the distance, building windows were fitted with white guardrails, giving off a sense of everyday urban residential life. In the foreground is a slanting and extended cement floor, with sunlight streaming in from the upper left, casting clear and layered shadow streaks on the floor. The interplay of light and shadow creates a strong visual rhythm of light and shadow, while highlighting subtle cracks and wear marks on the floor, giving the painting a realistic tactile feel and the depth of time. The composition uses a slightly overhead perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame, leaving a large space on the left to enhance the light and shadow narrative and spatial depth. Background elements are used to reduce distractions through blurring, keeping the focus firmly fixed on the character. The visual guide line consists of slanted light and shadow on the ground and vertical lines on the fence, creating an overall atmosphere filled with the characteristic grainy noise and slight fading of film photography, presenting a warm, soft yellow tone. The light is bright but not glaring, creating a lazy, nostalgic, tranquil, and slightly artistic afternoon atmosphere. The texture of the images combines the casualness of everyday life with artistic delicacy, as if captured by accidental shutter from an old-fashioned film camera at a street corner or alley. It is full of storytelling and emotional tension, blending the everyday life of urban life with the delicate tenderness of inner thoughts. Light and color intertwine to form a poetic and blank portrait of everyday life.",
          "description": "",
