        {
          "id": "krea2-10e64bf37763ecf10e92fd7c",
          "alias": "单女紫毛衣城市困倦坐比耶",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright on a simple metal mesh chair, her posture elegant yet slightly lazy. She wears a puffy, soft deep purple long-sleeved sweater with a deep V-shaped neckline that cleverly reveals her collarbones and neckline. She wears a black short skirt with a clean and crisp hem, contrasting sharply with the soft and warm tones of her upper body. Her legs are long, and she wears a pair of translucent light purple sheer tights, with delicate lace patterns faintly visible at the edges. Her toes are naturally exposed, presenting a visual tension that is both sexy and pure. Harmonizes with the overall color tone of the clothing. Exuding a calm and confident aura. The foreground focuses on her body contours and leg lines; the chair's metal frame and grid structure are clearly visible, the floor is gray-white tiles, somewhat aged but clean and tidy, with a few fallen leaves or debris scattered in the corners, hinting at a daily public space. The center is the chair she sits on, along with parts of her legs and skirt, forming the main visual support of the composition. The background is a slightly mottled off-white wall, with faint abstract geometric patterns or faded decorative motifs on the wall. The soft lines create a nostalgic yet modern urban atmosphere. The entire composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure occupying the center-left position. The diagonal line formed by the crossing of the slanted chair and legs guides the gaze, while the movement of the figure raising their hand creates a visual flow that traces back to the background wall. The light comes from the upper front, soft and even, belonging to natural light or simulated daylight environments, with natural shadow transitions without strong contrast, creating a warm, tranquil, and slightly dreamy atmosphere. The overall color scheme is dominated by purple, paired with neutral colors like black, white, and gray, creating a visual balance of warm and cool interweaving. The color saturation is moderate, neither abrupt nor dull, giving the composition a gentle artistic feel. The image style leans toward realistic everyday shooting, featuring a slight soft focus effect and delicate detail processing. It is like shooting a high-resolution phone or entry-level DSLR in natural indoor light, featuring authentic human textures, fabric folds, and environmental textures, rather than fully idealized or overly rendered CGI works. Overall, it conveys a youthful, fashionable, and slightly artistic everyday aesthetic.",
          "description": "",
