        {
          "id": "krea2-aca3d7e0c129abc35964743e",
          "alias": "单女礼服婚礼困倦注视",
          "prompt": "A bride turns to glance back, revealing her white, neat teeth, as if immersed in the most beautiful moment of the wedding day; A light white veil hangs down, gently swaying in the breeze, adding a dreamy feel; She wore a delicate strapless lace wedding dress, with delicate embroidery patterns faintly visible in the sunlight, highlighting the soft glow of her skin; Her right hand gently cups a blooming white rose, with layers of petals with slightly naturally curled edges, and stems bearing a few deep green leaves, as if softly inhaling their fragrance, her posture natural yet full of ritual; The foreground focuses on her hand holding the flower and the details of the flower—the lines of her hands are graceful, her nails are neatly trimmed, and her fingers gently grasp the stem, showing a gentle sense of control; The middle shot shows her curves from shoulders to waist, with the lace texture of the wedding dress clearly visible, highlighting her body contours; The background is blurred outdoor greenery and architectural structures, with light streaming through windows or porches creating numerous circular bokeh spots behind, presenting warm yellow-green tones that create a hazy and romantic atmosphere; The composition uses the classic rule of thirds: the figure is on the right side of the painting, leaving space on the left to guide the flow of the gaze, and the overall diagonal composition enhances dynamism; In terms of lighting and shadow, the backlight from the upper right is strong and soft, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere full of love and hope. It has the refined texture of a professional studio while carrying the natural realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting—color saturation is moderately warm, with slight film graininess enhancing emotional intensity. The overall color palette is mainly cream white, light beige, and pale gold, accented with a touch of olive green, creating a fairy-tale-like dreamy yet lifelike poetic scene; The visuals are full of narrative, as if capturing a casual, sweet moment before or between the wedding, with tranquility filled with boundless vitality and beautiful wishes.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
