        {
          "id": "krea2-4b8af60b27f5be160cfaa22e",
          "alias": "单女白T恤街道困倦持相机",
          "prompt": "Her expression is calm and tinged with a hint of contemplation or reverie, as if she is immersed in a gentle moment. She wore a pure white camisole underneath topped with light blue washed denim overalls. The strap was made of vintage brown leather with metal studs and adjustment clasp details, giving off a casual yet artistic vibe; The strap drapes across her shoulders, forming an elegant curve with her slender arm lines. Her left hand hangs naturally, while her right hand is gently held at her waist, her posture relaxed and natural, her body slightly tilted, revealing an effortless dynamic beauty. The background features a wall made of gray cement bricks, with clear joints and slightly weathered walls, adding traces of time and a sense of authenticity; Above the wall, a cluster of dense green maple leaf branches extended, with sharply serrated edges that glowed with a bright green sheen in the sunlight. Some leaves covered the top of the figure's head, forming a natural green frame; The wall is adorned with a small yellow butterfly graffiti decoration, and on the right side, a faintly visible pink floral pattern—the color contrast is both striking and harmonious. In the foreground, scattered several blurred green leaves and pink petal-like objects, possibly plant decorations on the ground or in corners, add layers and a sense of life to the composition. The composition uses the classic three-part layout, with the figure positioned slightly toward the center on the right side of the frame, leaving space on the left to accommodate background elements and visual breathability; The camera angle tilts slightly upward, making the character appear taller and more approachable. Light comes from the upper left, soft natural daylight, creating a warm transition between light and dark; The shadows are soft, without harsh cuts, highlighting the texture of the skin and the texture of the garment. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, fresh, and healing, carrying the lazy mood of a summer afternoon. It combines youthful vitality with a touch of artistic bourgeoisie; The image features warm tones and moderate saturation, presenting a grainy texture and slight fading reminiscent of film cameras, creating a hazy, dreamy, nostalgic aesthetic. It resembles a carefully composed everyday street portrait, combining artistic depth with everyday warmth.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
