        {
          "id": "krea2-bc75a88ec11927c2c6f074d0",
          "alias": "单女毛衣街道微笑坐阅读",
          "prompt": "She wore a gentle, sweet smile, looking directly at the camera, as if sharing a peaceful and pleasant afternoon with the viewer. She gently held a bag of green vegetable crisps labeled \"VEGGIE STICKS\" in both hands, her long fingers and gentle movements creating a lazy and cute vibe of everyday life; In the foreground is her exposed ankle and calf lines, naturally warm in soft light, creating a striking contrast with the dark background; In the center is the black cabinet countertop where she sits, on which are a bottle of dark glass bottle of hand soap, a silver metal faucet, a transparent glass cup, a white ceramic bowl, and several scattered books or magazines. On the right side, a wooden vase with dried plant branches adds a touch of artistic flair; The background is a pristine white wall adorned with a warmly colored city street poster depicting the outdoor café's outdoor seating area. The sign faintly reads \"L'APART,\" with the French phrase \"An alley in Annecy\" below, creating an exotic atmosphere; On the black shelf at the upper left, three beige ceramic cups are neatly arranged. One cup's mouth is slightly slanted, giving it a casual yet refined look; The overall composition adopts a slightly upward angle to make the main subject stand out more, while the tabletop serves as a support point to create a stable visual balance; The lighting in the painting is soft and even, creating a subtle transition between light and dark; the shadows are soft and not abrupt, highlighting the velvet feel of the sweater and the layers of the tulle skirt; The color scheme is mainly low-saturation, with black, gray, and blue forming a calm tone, accented by green packaging bags and warm orange buildings in wallpaper, creating a fresh yet slightly retro home atmosphere; guiding viewers to delve deeper and deeper, allowing them to feel the spatial extension inside and outside the frame; The entire scene exudes a gentle, healing, and authentic aesthetic of living, combining the fashion of urban youth with the warmth and relaxation of home living. It's like everyday moments captured indoors under natural light with a regular phone or small camera. The details are rich but not deliberately polished, full of quality and emotional warmth.",
