        {
          "id": "krea2-ff572469f1e9d1b000da5866",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤卧室愤怒",
          "prompt": "She wore a light blue striped camisole underneath, draped over a light purple semi-transparent shirt. The collar was open, sleeves rolled up or hanging freely, and the light pleats of the fabric naturally relaxed with her posture. She paired it with matching light gray striped shorts, stepping barefoot on a fluffy white quilt, with bent knees, and long, graceful ankle and calf lines, creating a warm and smooth texture under soft light. The foreground focuses on her bare legs and feet, with the texture and folds of the sheets clearly visible, and the layered fabric creating a soft and comfortable visual touch. The middle frame depicts her torso and upper body, where the flowing shirt contrasts with the simplicity of the inner layer, and the sheer texture of the fabric's material is precisely captured, with sheer transparency and fine striped textures captured precisely. The background is a bright and open indoor space, with a large window on the left side. Outside, you can faintly see the blurred outlines of greenery and scattered natural light spots. The right wall is in a pure light blue tone, creating a clean and tidy environment with no unnecessary decorations to obstruct the view, enhancing the tranquil atmosphere of the scene. The composition uses a slightly tilted perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving a large negative space on the right to enhance breathability. At the same time, natural light from the window enters from the upper left, outlining the three-dimensional contours of her body and creating a soft transition between light and shadow. Light comes from natural daylight outside the window, warm but not glaring, evenly spreading over the subject's skin and clothing surface, creating subtle layers of highlights and shadows, especially on her neck, collarbones, arms, and knees, creating delicate transitions of light and shadow, giving the image a truly three-dimensional texture. The entire image exudes a gentle and tranquil atmosphere like morning sunlight filling the bedroom, full of youthful energy and the spirit of life. The main tones are pink-purple, light blue, and milky white. The colors are low saturation but rich in layers, creating a fresh, healing, and slightly dreamy artistic feel. It seems to capture a carefree morning moment, combining the exquisite composition of professional photography with the unintentional beauty of daily life. The mood is full yet restrained, extending to her slender waist and smooth leg lines. Ultimately, it rests on the gentle details of barefoot touching the sheets, conveying a state of innocence, freedom, and relaxation.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
