        {
          "id": "krea2-3a321700212bece59e1083ee",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫椅上坐伸展",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright on a light-colored wooden bench outdoors, wearing a delicate white lace-collared shirt with elegant green plant embroidery on the sleeves, a large bow tied at the neckline, and a brown-yellow plaid short skirt with a black lining at the hem, giving the whole look a gentle yet expressive feel. She held a paper ticket or flyer printed with Korean characters and blue sky and white cloud patterns in both hands. Her fingers were long, her nails painted light blue, and a simple silver ring on her ring finger added a bright touch. The foreground focuses on the ticket in her hand and the details of her hands; the text on the ticket is clear and legible but not the main focus, mainly conveying a sense of ritual about to set off or participate in an event. The middle frame shows her sitting posture, stretching out the contours of her body and the folds of her clothing, with light and shadow creating a soft transition on the fabric, emphasizing the softness and layering of the material. The background features simple beige walls with uniform textures and a slightly warm tone. Above, horizontal metal or wooden structural lines can be faintly seen, creating a spacious and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the character positioned slightly to the right center, while leaving enough negative space for visual breathing. The image was shot in natural light, with light slanting from the front left, creating subtle contrast between light and dark to enhance the sense of depth; The shadowed areas are soft and not stiff, creating an overall warm and bright atmosphere with a touch of quiet waiting. The color palette is mainly creamy white, beige, light blue, and dark green, harmoniously unified to present a fresh and sweet Japanese style, while preserving the authentic texture and lifestyle of everyday shoots. The entire composition constructs a youthful narrative full of storytelling through delicate costume details, soft light and shadow transitions, a quiet scene atmosphere, and subtle changes in the characters' expressions—as if on an ordinary afternoon, she is preparing to embark on an unknown journey or immersed in the quiet waiting for an important moment. The image combines the exquisite beauty of artistic photography with the warmth and emotional tension of real life, prompting imagination of the stories and emotional fluctuations behind it.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
