        {
          "id": "krea2-28b103390500771df226670f",
          "alias": "单女短裙街道愤怒持相机",
          "prompt": "Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting soft light spots, creating warm highlights on the shoulders and skirts, creating a rich autumn atmosphere; The entire composition adopts a mid-shot portrait perspective, with the figure positioned in the right two-thirds of the frame. The blank space on the left enhances breathability and narrative tension. The railing lines extend diagonally from the lower left to the upper right, creating a diagonal guiding line. The light and shadow atmosphere is warm yet slightly hazy. Backlighting or side backlighting creates a soft glow around the edges of the figure's contours. The warm tones are mainly gold, beige, and cream white, complemented by black railings to create a warm and cool contrast that enhances visual layering. The overall image is filled with the poetry and lazy comfort of youthful campus life, as if frozen on an ordinary yet warm autumn afternoon. It combines the everyday life atmosphere with the refined composition and emotional expression reminiscent of artistic photography. The color saturation is moderate and not glaring, the texture delicate and authentic, with slight film graininess and natural depth blur effects, presenting a visual language that is both close to life and rich in aesthetic depth. Like street photography taken with an amateur camera, it possesses professional-level emotional control and environmental storytelling ability.",
