        {
          "id": "krea2-342cc196facd5bb44633c878",
          "alias": "单女公园困倦站立戏水",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the lush greenery of an outdoor park, wearing a loose, comfortable light pink off-shoulder sweatshirt with slightly rolled cuffs to reveal slender wrists. The overall look combines youthful energy with a gentle, sweet aura; Naturally draped over her shoulder, she wears delicate silver earrings and a minimalist necklace, with a black lanyard ID card holder on her chest printed with \"Strawberry\" and a pastel blue pattern, adding a playful and cute touch; She leans slightly to the side of a sturdy concrete pillar, whose surface is marked by cracks marked by age and its mottled texture contrasts sharply. Some branches and leaves naturally extend from both sides of the frame, creating a sense of envelopment and vibrant life. In the middle of the frame, a black metal fence can be seen, behind which a red-and-green sports field can faintly appear, possibly a basketball court or tennis court. In the distance, several tall palm plants are scattered throughout, adding depth and a sense of life to the scene; The background is made up of dense tree canopies, with layers of branches and leaves forming a natural green barrier. Sunlight filters through the gaps, casting mottled light spots, bathing the entire scene in warm, gentle sunlight; The composition adopts a medium to near perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. Cement columns are used as vertical lines to guide the visual focal point, while natural vegetation in the foreground creates spatial layering; The lighting effects are delicate and soft, with sunlight slanting in from the upper right of the figure, casting clear and rhythmic shadows on the ground and vegetation, enhancing the sense of depth and realism; The overall atmosphere is tranquil and filled with the lazy and cozy vibe of a summer afternoon. It combines the everyday feel of urban campus life with the fresh vitality of natural ecology. The color scheme is mainly soft and pastel, complemented by a rich green base, creating a gentle, dreamy, slightly vintage film-like visual experience. It's like capturing a real moment on a sunny afternoon with an entry-level digital camera, with slight noise and natural color deviations, enhancing the image's authenticity and emotional resonance.",
