        {
          "id": "krea2-dc1d013d9375ef579b9d3c94",
          "alias": "单女白浴袍雪地忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "Amidst a pure and flawless snowy landscape, a woman dressed in elegant Hanfu becomes the absolute focal point of the scene. She stands beneath swirling snowflakes, adorned with fine, sparkling snowflakes, as if time has frozen in this moment. She wears a wide-sleeved white robe made of light and flowing fabric, with fluffy, soft white fur trims at the collar and cuffs. Against a cool-toned background, she resembles a pure white flower blooming in the depths of winter. The collar is slightly open, revealing the elegant weave inside. The delicate tie is tied at the chest, with smooth and natural lines, showcasing the unique rhythmic beauty of traditional attire. Her right hand tightly grips the bamboo handle of an ancient oil-paper umbrella. The ribs are made of dark brown wood, covered with natural textures and fine cracks left by time. The edges are decorated with traditional woven patterns of red and off-white. The ribs are clearly visible, both practical and artistic, with the tips slightly tilted, creating a quiet yet story-filled posture. In the foreground, the woman's robe and umbrella handle occupy the lower half of the composition. The folds and plush texture of the fabric create rich layers under soft lighting, and the overlapping light and shadow highlight the authentic tactile feel of the material; The middle shot focuses on the woman's upper body and umbrella, with a slightly upward angle to make the figure appear more noble and elegant. At the same time, shallow depth of field blurs distant environments to enhance the subject's presence; The background is a hazy snowfield or forest outline, with grayish-white skies and heavy clouds, faintly visible silhouettes of distant mountains, creating an ethereal and lonely atmosphere. Light comes from the upper side, soft and even, without strong shadows. The overall transition between light and shadow is natural, with subtle contrasts of light and shadow, enhancing the image's three-dimensionality and emotional depth. The color palette is mainly cool, with large areas of white, gray, and black forming the main theme, creating a striking contrast that is not jarring. The composition uses a central composition, with figures positioned slightly above the center, and the gaze directly facing the viewer, creating a strong sense of interaction and emotional resonance; At the same time, the rule of thirds is applied to enhance visual balance and guidance. The entire scene is filled with an atmosphere of tranquility and far-reaching, solitary beauty yet vitality. It carries the artistic conception of classical poetry described as \"A lone boat with a straw raincoat and bamboo hat, fishing alone in the snowy river,\" while also blending modern photography's ultimate pursuit of detail, texture, and emotional expression. It is not just a portrait but a silent poem—a visual metaphor about waiting, watching, and inner resilience. Amidst the cold and white, it is both part of the landscape and its soul, making one imagine her figure walking alone in the snow. And the unspoken secrets and distant stories behind it. This image perfectly showcases the artistic heights that everyday amateur equipment can achieve—no expensive equipment needed, just capturing the harmonious blend of emotional warmth and natural surroundings to create a moving and unforgettable classic image.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
