        {
          "id": "krea2-e5aa399eceafc06f044eaaa0",
          "alias": "单女白T恤霓虹夜景微笑躺侧头",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman full of emotional tension and visual impact, with a woman slightly tilting her head to gaze at the camera, as if lost in thought or immersed in some emotion, revealing a faint, almost imperceptible smile. The overall posture is naturally relaxed yet contains inner strength. Under light and shadow, it presents rich layers, like flowing shadows. Pores are almost invisible, presenting a highly ideal skin texture; She wore a simple white thin-strap tank top with thin straps and lightweight, breathable material. The delicate curves of her neck and collarbone were faintly visible, and the edges of the garment were softly lighted, without obvious wrinkles or shadows distracting the visual focus. The middle shot extends to her shoulders, collarbones, and parts of her chest, while transitioning into the deep darkness of the background, creating a sense of spatial depth. The background is pure black, with no decorative or environmental elements, fully serving the prominence and emotional expression of the main characters. This minimalist treatment enhances the drama and mysterious atmosphere of the painting. The composition uses a vertical long format, with the figure's head slightly offset from the centerline, creating an asymmetrical aesthetic. The top of the frame leaves an appropriate blank space, creating a stable and breathable composition. In terms of atmosphere, the entire image is filled with a dual temperament of tranquility, melancholy, and vibrant energy—like a moment illuminated by neon lights alone on a city street late at night, or a boundary moment where dreams and reality intertwine. It carries the innocence of youth and the alienation of urban loners. The use of color is highly artistic, creating visual conflict and psychological tension. Through high saturation and low noise processing, the image presents an extremely sharp and transparent feeling reminiscent of professional studio lighting or high-end smartphone night mode, but the overall tone is closer to capturing real-life emotions rather than fully commercialized perfect portraits. The image texture is delicate and lifelike yet not rough, presenting a \"hyper-realistic\" aesthetic that lies between digital rendering and real photography. It looks as if shot with a top-tier camera in extremely dark conditions, with slight noise and dynamic blur marks, suggesting this was a real snapshot full of chance and improvisation, rather than a carefully staged shot. Overall, this image is not just a portrait, but a visual poem about emotion, color, light and shadow, and state of existence. It invites viewers into a space full of metaphor and imagination, where human beauty is no longer merely a display of appearance but becomes a life imprint woven from emotion and the light and shadow of the times.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
