        {
          "id": "krea2-5d589a1a296c6ed22110e2c8",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙门站立戏水",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a traditional Chinese building, wearing an off-white slip dress adorned with soft pink-orange floral and leafy patterns. The hem drapes naturally with layered pleats, the fabric light and radiating a delicate sheen, softly glowing in the sunlight; Draped over her shoulders, her right hand naturally hanging down, holding a matching printed fabric tote bag. On her wrist, she wears a slender metal bracelet and a delicate necklace. Her makeup is fresh and natural, and her expression is calm with a hint of laziness and confidence; In the foreground are her long legs and the hem of her skirt, with the outline of black high heels faintly visible at her ankles. Beneath her feet is a ground paved with grayish stone slabs, with fine dust and light interwoven between the cracks; The middle is the transitional area between her complete figure and the background buildings. On the left is a dark brown wooden door frame with glass windows, above which is a vertical white promotional banner; on the right is another dark wooden door, with upturned eaves, layered tiles, and a vertical plaque with black characters on a red background hanging beneath the eaves, faintly revealing the character \"Welcome\"; The background features typical Jiangnan ancient town architecture: white walls and gray tiles, slightly weathered walls, black carved decorations under the eaves, and faint alleys and architectural outlines visible in the distance; The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, slightly turned to the side but facing the camera head, creating a stable and dynamic visual focus; The camera angle is slightly down, making the character stand out and give a sense of spatial layering; Light comes from the right front of the figure, with warm and bright sunlight filtering through the eaves gap, casting soft shadows on her. The edges of her skirt are illuminated, creating a contrast of light and shadow, and the stone slab on the floor reflects clear light and shadow textures; The overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of life, combining the weight of classical architecture with the fresh vitality of modernity. The light and shadow are soft and natural, and the color saturation is moderate, presenting a visual effect that combines the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment with artistic beauty. The main color palettes are warm yellow, off-white, and dark brown, creating a warm nostalgic mood like afternoon sunlight bathing the ancient alleys. The details are rich yet not chaotic, with every element serving the emotional expression of the main characters and the creation of the scene atmosphere.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
