        {
          "id": "krea2-640c89140a303ecd0b5a3aba",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙花园专注持相机",
          "prompt": "The railing is simple yet decorative, with black contrasting sharply against the green background; The middle shot shows her complete upper body and dress details, with fabric showing a soft sheen and delicate pleats under the light; The background is a dense and layered wall of green plants, with dense and bright leaves in pale yellow and emerald green tones. Under the sunlight, it glows with a warm halo, creating a fresh summer garden-like atmosphere; The entire composition uses medium to near near shots, with the figure positioned slightly above the center of the frame, extending further to the background greenery, creating a natural sense of spatial depth; Light comes from above, slightly left, gently and evenly casting on the figures, with graceful shoulder and neck lines, and water droplets on the clothes reflecting tinks of light; The shadowed areas are concentrated below the neck and at the pleats of the skirt, enhancing the three-dimensional effect; The overall atmosphere is tranquil, fresh, and healing, full of the poetic laziness of a summer afternoon. The colors are mainly blue, white, and green, harmonious and full of vitality. The image texture is delicate and realistic, featuring cinematic light and shadow expression and studio-like character portrayal, as if shot by a professional photographer using a high-end digital camera. The details are precisely handled, presenting a visual experience that is both everyday and artistically beautiful.",
