        {
          "id": "krea2-cb672241be801c8bd67e7a9a",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣自信",
          "prompt": "Add a sense of softness; Earlobes are adorned with delicate silver studs, and a thin four-leaf clover pendant necklace hangs around her neck—simple and elegant. She wore a white short-sleeved knit cover-up with delicate vertical pleated textures, giving a soft sheen in the sunlight. The collar was slightly open, revealing a royal blue bikini top underneath, creating a striking color contrast. Her waistline was slim, and her body proportions were excellent. The foreground focuses on the upper body of the figure, clearly capturing the chest to waist, with the right arm naturally hanging down, the left hand either unvisible or obscured, only part of the wrist line visible. In the middle of the scene, the sea surges behind her, with waves crashing against the beach forming white foam at the edges. The rippling water reflects the daylight, while the distant sea level and sky merge with a hint of gray-blue, hinting at a broad view on clear days. The background features a vast ocean and a pale blue sky, with the sea and sky line slightly tilted, creating a sense of spatial depth. In the distance, there are no obvious land or architectural silhouettes, enhancing the tranquility and freedom of a pure seaside scene. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the main visual center, the head slightly shifted to the left, and the body's center of gravity slightly tilted to the right, creating a subtle dynamic balance; At the same time, hand movements are used to create visual interest. It then naturally extends to the necklace, shoulder garment texture, arm lines, and finally lands where the waist curve interacts with the waves, forming a smooth visual flow from top to bottom. Light comes from the upper left, simulating strong lighting at noon or afternoon to enhance the sense of depth; The overall contrast of light and dark is moderate, avoiding overexposure. The atmosphere is warm and bright, full of summer vacation vibes. It combines the fresh and natural seaside vibe, while exquisite makeup, costume coordination, and professional shooting techniques exude a touch of fashionable artistry. It resembles a carefully composed travel photo shoot, yet retains the authenticity and intimacy of everyday shooting. The color palette mainly features warm white, deep blue, and sand gold, with moderate saturation, presenting a soft yet layered visual experience, conveying a blend of youthful vitality, carefree care, and natural beauty. You can feel the sunlight shining on your skin and the soothing sea breeze.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
