        {
          "id": "krea2-bc2663497e484da00b5a0d63",
          "alias": "单女街道蹲",
          "prompt": "A woman squats on the asphalt pavement of a city street, sunlight slanting through behind her, forming a soft and warm backlit silhouette that outlines her slender arms and knees; She wore a delicately textured, slightly pleated pure white long-sleeve top with faint black thin shoulder straps on her shoulders, and light-colored sneakers with simple designs showing signs of wear. The lighting and shadow atmosphere presents the warm golden tones unique to dusk, creating mottled, soft highlights and shadow contrasts, giving the painting a strong sense of depth and warmth; The entire image is filled with a blend of tranquility, nostalgia, and poetry, as if capturing the gentlest moment before an ordinary afternoon ends. It combines the realistic texture of urban life with the delicate emotional expression of artistic photography. The color saturation is moderate, the color layers are rich but do not overshadow the main focus, and even after blurring background elements, a certain sense of realism is retained, enhancing the artistic effect of a \"casual shot\" yet rich in depth.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
