        {
          "id": "krea2-2ece0b0865753111258c3a44",
          "alias": "单女白外套户外愤怒注视",
          "prompt": "On a baseball field gently bathed in warm sunlight, a woman becomes the absolute visual focal point of the scene. She wears a distinctly designed white short baseball jacket, with the prominent \"Bear\" logo on the chest outlined in vintage red and black lines, highlighting a strong sense of sportiness and youthful energy. Three dark stripes on the cuffs extend like a racetrack, with the \"T Station\" logo on the left chest and \"DOOS\" on the right shoulder. The lettering hints at a certain team or brand affiliation; the fabric is light and fits the figure, with a natural sheen under the sunlight. She pairs her pants with high-waisted washed jeans, with a delicate metal buckle at the waistband and a plush bear charm hanging down, adding a playful and cute detail to the overall tough style. Gently drifting in the breeze, as if immersed in an impromptu baseball game. Her hands were raised above her head, her left hand steadily supporting a cute pink baseball glove, while her right hand cleverly placed a white baseball in the center of the glove. The stitching on the glove edge was clearly visible, and the pink leather material showed delicate textures and soft reflections under the sunlight. The entire pose was full of movement and anticipation, as if she was about to throw her arm at any moment. The entire image is illuminated with bright, natural daylight, with light streaming from above creating soft contrasts of light and shadow on her shoulders, neck, arms, and the folds of her clothing, while giving the image a warm twilight tone, creating a relaxed, relaxed, and lazy summer afternoon atmosphere. The layers of light and shadow are rich yet not glaring; the composition centers the subject slightly to the right, leaving some negative space to guide the gaze and spark imagination about the next moment. The overall image exudes a sense of both professional photography texture and the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting—moderate color saturation, slight noise and motion blur, simulating the realistic image of a mobile phone camera under strong outdoor light, rather than overly sharpened or flawless commercial retouching. This subtle realism actually enhances the everyday atmosphere and emotional resonance of the image, making viewers feel as if they are right at the edge of a real baseball field, feeling the vibe of youth, sports, and freedom.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
