        {
          "id": "krea2-675f5ea56b207453eecd691c",
          "alias": "单女摄影棚忧伤倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "The cuffs and collar lines were smooth, the colors highly saturated, and under the warm light, they shimmered like silk; Her right hand gently holds a bundle of slender hay or reeds, her fingertips soft and her posture serene, as if quietly waiting for flowers to bloom in the breeze; In the foreground are several slender dry grass stems and leaves, partially obscuring the lower right corner of the frame. The middle ground shows the woman's shoulders, neck, collar, and hands, with natural folds of clothing and soft transitions of light and shadow; The background is blurred, presenting a warm and hazy dusk tone, with faint outlines of distant trees and soft light spots, creating a dreamlike sense of spatial depth; The composition uses a slightly tilted close-up angle, with the figure's head positioned slightly to the upper left of the frame, and the blank space on the right side enhancing the sense of breath in the image; guiding the audience's gaze deeper and deeper; The light comes from the upper left of the painting, creating a soft sunset backlight, creating bright halos and starlight effects around the figure's outline, highlighting the sense of depth; The overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, full of poetry and classical Eastern aesthetics, like a fairy stepping out of an ink painting, carrying a hint of melancholy and tenderness, with restrained emotions and rich storytelling; The painting features warm orange-red as the main tone, complemented by white, gold, and light brown, creating a harmonious and layered visual rhythm; The layers of light and shadow are rich and delicate, with bright and transparent highlights and soft transitions in shadows, without harsh cuts, presenting the texture of professional studio or outdoor prime time shooting; The image style leans toward realistic and delicate realism, featuring slight film graininess and soft focus effects, simulating the delicate expressiveness of high-end cameras capturing moments under natural light, while imparting a dreamy softness to the images. It is suitable for artistic portraits or emotional narrative visual creations; The entire scene is full of narrative tension and emotional depth, evoking beautiful moods such as spring afternoons, strolling through ancient gardens, and youthful glances, offering a strong immersive visual experience and emotional appeal.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
