        {
          "id": "krea2-1574e53321307e5e3dd557bf",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣沙发微笑坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly on a dark brown leather sofa, leaning slightly forward, legs naturally crossed, her right foot lightly resting on the edge of a vintage wooden cabinet in front of her, while her left foot firmly rests on the wooden floor, her posture lazy yet full of life. She wore a loose, comfortable light gray crew-neck knit sweater, with the hem casually draped down, revealing the edge of her white shorts underneath, creating a soft contrast with her pure white over-the-knee socks. The cuff hugged the calf line, highlighting her legs. Add a touch of liveliness and gentleness; She wears a serene smile, exuding an unintentional confidence and approachability, as if engaging in a silent exchange with the viewer. Her hands are slender and soft, fingertips gracefully folded over her chest, and her left ring finger wears a simple and exquisite gold ring that glows gently under the warm light. In the foreground, a corner of the sofa she sits on forms a solid visual foundation with the wooden floor beneath her feet. Scattered across the floor is a book with a blurred cover, its edges slightly curled, hinting at a freshly flipped page and adding a touch of real life to the image. The middle section shows her legs extending to the low cabinet, which has a clear wood grain texture. The cabinet door handle is a round metal pull tab, and a faint storage space is visible beneath the cabinet. On the right side of the cabinet is a classic black film camera, with a silver nameplate and the lens focused forward, as if capturing a beautiful moment. The background is a soft and warm indoor environment, with off-white walls. On the right, a large window is blocked by a semi-transparent sheer curtain, allowing bright natural light to stream through, evenly casting on figures and furniture, creating a soft transition of light and shadow. Above the window hangs a vintage-style wall lamp, simple and elegant in design, with a lampshade in warm yellow tones that complement the overall atmosphere. The entire composition uses a low-angle downward shot, cleverly using the sofa and low cabinet to form visual guides while enhancing the sense of extension of the leg lines. The light and shadow treatment is delicate and soft, with the main light source coming from the window at the upper right, creating a natural side backlight effect. The figure's outline is slightly outlined, and the shadow transitions are smooth, creating a warm, tranquil, and healing home atmosphere. The overall color palette mainly consists of off-white, light gray, and natural wood tones, with moderate saturation, presenting a Japanese artistic or Nordic minimalist visual aesthetic. It combines the lively atmosphere of daily life with the refinement of artistic photography. The details are rich but not cluttered, and each object serves the overall emotional expression, conveying a quiet, comfortable, and free attitude toward life, making one feel as if they are on a sunny afternoon, feeling pure gentleness and beauty.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
