        {
          "id": "krea2-d4321d49cfeba96448ca5229",
          "alias": "单女短裤公寓坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bed covered with white, soft sheets. She wears a loose, comfortable white long-sleeve top with thin straps underneath, shorts with dark edging, and light-colored socks. The overall look is simple and relaxed, exuding the warmth of everyday home. It adds a touch of youthful energy. Her left hand gently rested on the open page of a book, which lay flat in front of her knees. The pages had a soft texture, hinting that she might have just started reading or was about to continue, creating an atmosphere of tranquility and far-reaching vision. The composition has clear layers and a distinct main subject.",
