        {
          "id": "krea2-308890cc28031f9ce9294e0c",
          "alias": "单女床坐",
          "prompt": "The middle ground is the bed she sits on, with the pure white fluffy quilt and the sheets folded delicately, presenting a soft texture. Sunlight filters through the curtains onto the sheets, creating a gentle transition of light and shadow. In the background is a plain, light gray wall, with a natural wood folk guitar placed in the corner. The body is elegantly curved and rests on a plaid fabric sofa, which is neatly stacked with white cushions and a blanket. Next to it is a modern, minimalist white desk lamp, its rounded and smooth lampshade emitting a warm, soft glow. On the right, a black light pole with a tall floor lamp can be faintly seen, adding dimension and a sense of life to the entire space. The entire scene is arranged simply yet warmly, with furniture arranged in a low-key and comfortable manner. The main color palettes are white, off-white, light gray, and natural wood tones, creating a clean, bright, and healing visual experience.",
