        {
          "id": "krea2-cc3f916e8b0aba293fe647f9",
          "alias": "窗边冷淡持乐器",
          "prompt": "The composition uses a left-centered third-division method, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. The light mainly comes from the natural light from the left window, softly and evenly illuminating the figure, creating a natural transition between light and shadow contours. Indoor lighting is supplemented as supplementary lighting, giving the skin a delicate and translucent texture. The shadows are soft, with almost no harsh contrasts, and the overall atmosphere is warm and peaceful, with a touch of lazy afternoon time. The color scheme mainly combines warm and cool tones, with white clothing paired with a light background to create a pure tone, while the guitar's wood texture and sofa plaid pattern add texture details to the image. The overall visuals present a sense of realism reminiscent of \"everyday amateur equipment shooting,\" but through careful composition and light control, it imparts an artistic beauty reminiscent of a cinematic image. It resembles a tranquil portrait of life, recording gentle moments in ordinary days, evoking a sense of quiet happiness and poetic life.",
