        {
          "id": "krea2-e6a21ce77dd8a3b02ca3aa41",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙高塔冷淡站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A graceful woman stands by a floor-to-ceiling window, wearing a highly designed white long dress. The upper part features an asymmetrical off-shoulder waist-revealing cut, with wide, flowing cuffs that drape like clouds. The hem is a high-slit mermaid gown, the lightweight and sheer fabric hugging the figure and outlining smooth curves. The hem rises slightly with her movements, as if gently stirred by the breeze. She wore a pair of silver stiletto sandals, with metal straps wrapped around her ankles, reflecting a cold sheen. She wore exquisite earrings and a necklace. The earrings were streamlined crystal pendants, simple and petite, adorning her collarbone. Her posture is full of tension: her body slightly leaned, her right hand gently caressing her waist, her left hand gracefully resting on her right elbow, her head slightly turned to the side, and her makeup is delicate and natural. In the foreground are her slender ankles and the tips of her high heels, while the floor is a smooth light gray marble floor, reflecting finely and reflecting the reflection of her legs and skirt. The center frame shows her complete silhouette, clearly captured from shoulders and neck to ankles, with the pleats and layers of light and shadow at the skirt's hem richly expressed. In the background are massive floor-to-ceiling glass windows. Outside the windows is a blurry cluster of city skyscrapers, with the building lines forming a grid pattern. The glass surfaces create subtle blue tones and hazy effects due to light refraction and reflection, while the distant outlines of buildings are blurred, creating a sense of deep space. The composition uses a center-left vertical shot, with the main subject positioned slightly to the right of the center, and the vertical lines of the window guiding the viewer's focus on the figure. The lighting atmosphere presents a cool-toned indoor effect of urban dusk or early morning. The main light source comes from natural light outside the window, evenly filtering through the glass to create a soft and layered contrast of light and dark. The back and skirt edges feature natural transitional shadows, creating a quiet, sophisticated, and modern artistic atmosphere, like a fashionable urban portrait. It combines the realism of everyday shooting with the refined texture of a professional studio.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
