        {
          "id": "krea2-8d9440d03825dde6616aa4bf",
          "alias": "单女白西装樱花俏皮倚靠持花",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully leans against the ancient stone steps, wearing a pure white blazer paired with a light gray plaid pleated skirt and pure white socks, paired with dark brown loafers. The overall look is simple yet full of youthful collegiate vibe; As if immersed in the poetry of spring; In the foreground is a rough-textured stone staircase, each brick bearing the marks of time. Sunlight filters through the dense cherry blossom branches, casting mottled, lively shadows on her long legs and the stone steps, like flowing petal patterns, adding a dreamlike layer to the scene; In the middle of the frame, her posture is fully expressed: her left leg rests lightly on the edge of the steps, her right leg hangs naturally, both hands lightly supporting the stone wall, creating a dynamic balance. At the same time, she holds a small bouquet of freshly picked cherry blossoms, with delicate and soft petals that harmonize with the color tones of her clothing; The background is a blurred urban streetscape, with faintly visible parked vehicles, iron chain fences, and blurred building outlines, but covered by numerous blooming cherry trees. Layers of pink and white flowers spread like clouds, creating a hazy and gentle atmosphere; The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, cleverly placing the figure slightly to the left center of the frame, creating visual tension; For lighting, natural daylight is used, with soft and even lighting with a slight warm tone, enhancing the contrast between cherry blossom pink and stone steps gray-brown, while the shadow areas retain detailed textures to avoid overexposure; The overall atmosphere is tranquil and gentle, with a touch of nostalgic artistry. It combines the lively atmosphere of real life with a romantic and beautiful artistic imagination. It's like a moment casually captured by a regular digital camera in the afternoon sunlight, yet thanks to the exquisite combination of light, shadow, and composition, it feels cinematic and emotionally moving, conveying youth, beauty, and fleeting philosophical reflections on time.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
