        {
          "id": "krea2-90560e8b02d530e826dc24f8",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙街道坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor asphalt pavement, wearing a light, flowing white floral long dress adorned with delicate lace patterns. The fabric casts a semi-transparent texture under soft light, with naturally draped cuffs. The overall color scheme is mainly pale pink and pure white, creating a gentle and serene visual tone. With a natural, healthy soft pink hue, it presents an unadorned yet vibrant youthful beauty. She held a vintage-style silver Canon camera in both hands, with a classic brushed metal finish and black rubber grip. The lens was slightly tilted, as if ready to press record to capture a moment. Her fingers were long, her nails neatly trimmed and painted a subtle light pink polish, and on her wrist was a warm off-white pearl bracelet that reflected fine shimmer in the sunlight. On her left shoulder is a simple and practical black backpack, with the strap naturally hanging down her back, adding a touch of casual everyday life to the scene. In the foreground, a bouquet of colorful flowers is placed beside her lap or leaning on her backpack. The bouquet consists of numerous pure white daisies, several plump pale pink peonies, blue forget-me-nots, and green buds and leaves. The flowers are layered, with fresh and soft colors, exuding a strong pastoral romantic atmosphere that cleverly echoes the figures' costumes. The middle shot focuses on the main subject and the camera in hand, with the composition shot from a slightly top-down angle, naturally guiding the viewer's gaze downward to the point where the bouquet meets the ground, enhancing the spatial depth of the image. The background is a blurred dark gray asphalt pavement, with fine grain textures visible and faint yellow markings in the distance. The shallow depth blur technique effectively highlights the subject, while also hinting that this is a scene from a city street or park path. The entire composition uses warm-toned daylight lighting, with the light source coming from the upper right of the figure, creating delicate high-light reflections on the folds of the dress and petals, while casting a slight shadow on the left side of the body to enhance the sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, combining the artistic temperament of a camera to document life while revealing a cherishing and longing for beautiful moments. The light and shadow layers are distinct, color saturation is moderate yet emotionally moving, presenting a film-like soft-focus texture and hazy beauty, as if captured by an old-fashioned film camera in the afternoon sunlight. It combines the exquisite composition of artistic photography with the authentic warmth of everyday images, allowing one to feel the gentle power within the quiet flow of time.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
