        {
          "id": "krea2-ff35485af154ce151247fa03",
          "alias": "单女红礼服舞台神秘站立叉腰",
          "prompt": "An elegant Eastern woman stands between two thick deep red textured walls. She wears an extremely luxurious red strapless gown, with a three-dimensional waist cinched top adorned with intricate rhinestones, perfectly outlining her slender waistline and full bust. The skirt is made of high-slit satin fabric that flows smoothly to the floor, and she wears simple red strappy high-heeled sandals that highlight her long legs. A ring was lightly worn on her fingertips. The overall accessories and gown tones were highly unified, exuding a rich sense of nobility blending vintage palace with modern fashion. Her left hand gently rests on the right wall, her right hand naturally hands on her hips, head slightly tilted, her expression confident yet tinged with mystery, creating a strong visual resonance with the clothing. In the foreground was the deep black ground beneath her feet, almost completely hidden in shadow, with only a faint red glow glimmering along the edge of her skirt; The middle shot shows the contours of her entire body and the dynamic hem of her skirt, forming a strong visual framework at the angle of the walls on both sides; The background features two rough-textured, deep-toned reddish-brown walls, covered with hand-painted texture marks. The left wall is illuminated by a warm orange spotlight, with the light gradually dimming from bottom to top, creating a strong contrast between light and shadow. The right wall remains in a darker area, emphasizing spatial depth and the subject's role. The composition uses the classic rule of thirds, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the painting, the left and right walls forming a naturally symmetrical frame, and the lines of the skirt extending to the bottom of the frame create visual balance. The visual guidance path starts from a bright light source, naturally transitions through the shoulders, waist, and legs to the shadow area beneath the feet, forming a visual flow from light to dark. The lighting atmosphere is extremely dramatic, with the main light source coming from the low left side, precisely shaping the figure's body contours and the fold details of the clothing. The highlights shine brilliantly, while the shadows are deep and intense, creating a strong cinematic feel and a stage play-like noble atmosphere. The entire composition is highly saturated, dominated by red tones, complemented by warm tones such as dark brown, black, and orange, presenting a passionate, passionate, mysterious, and powerful artistic tension. It feels as if you are behind the scenes of a grand banquet or high-end fashion show, combining the refined texture of a professional studio with the natural emotional expression pursued by everyday amateur equipment. The images are delicate and authentic, with every light and shadow shift carrying storytelling and emotional depth, delivering strong visual impact and aesthetic appeal.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
