        {
          "id": "krea2-bf4993c879d91b4a8086d18e",
          "alias": "单女棕外套城市自信站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of an outdoor brick-walled building, her makeup fresh and elegant, slightly tilting her head toward the camera. Her right hand gently raises in a cute heart gesture. Her nails are neatly trimmed with light pink polish, and her left hand hangs naturally at her side. Her overall posture is relaxed, confident, and full of youthful energy. She wore a highly designed brown cargo jacket with a thick and matte finish. The collar and zipper were made of black suede patchwork for a striking contrast. The chest and cuffs were decorated with a large amount of three-dimensional silver and black floral embroidery or beadwork, shimmering with a delicate metallic sheen under natural light and creating a glamorous yet understated visual collision with the calm brown base tone. Underneath, she wears a simple pure white V-neck base shirt that reveals her collarbones, adding a touch of clean and sharp fashion. In the foreground, her hand movements and clothing details are clearly visible, especially the floral decorations on her jacket, which reflect subtle highlights under the light, drawing the viewer's attention to the main figure. The middle ground is the ground where she stands, paved with neatly arranged gray bricks and stones with clear textures, and faint outlines of other event panels or crowds at the edges, suggesting this is a public event or campus scene. The background is a slightly mottled reddish-brown brick wall, with a rough texture that contrasts sharply with the figures' delicate shapes. On the right is a white column extending vertically, while on the left is a green promotional poster stand printed with words like \"PEL College Esports\" and game element patterns. The colors are vivid but blurred, avoiding overshadowing and instead enhancing the authentic atmosphere of the scene. In terms of composition, the center is centered to the right, with the subject occupying the main visual space. The head is slightly tilted to create a sense of dynamic balance, and the shooting angle is horizontal, slightly upright, making the subject appear more upright and approachable. Extending to the decorative details of the clothing, the lighting and shadows present natural daylight illumination, with light softly streaming from the front left, creating a warm transition between light and dark. The shadows are concentrated on the right side of the body and the background wall, enhancing the sense of depth without losing softness. The overall atmosphere combines the casual vibe of urban streets with the sophistication of fashionable trends. It combines the intimate authenticity of everyday life with a sophisticated quality reminiscent of artistic photography thanks to carefully crafted costume details and makeup. It resembles a perfect moment casually captured at an event with a regular phone camera, full of youthful energy, confident attitude, and lifestyle aesthetics, evoking a relaxed yet stylish modern youth image.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
