        {
          "id": "krea2-3bcfb62cebad7c2aeca7d7ff",
          "alias": "单女湿身灰毛衣城市俏皮坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly on the wooden floor of a vintage-style café, her body slightly turned to the camera, her makeup fresh and natural. Her right hand gently holds an amber-colored drink, its crystal-clear body reflecting the warm glow of the liquid. Her left hand rests naturally at the knee, her slender, fair fingers long, her nails neatly trimmed and painted in light pink. She wears a fluffy, soft light gray V-neck knit cardigan, with several small shiny metal decorative buttons on the collar, paired with a white lace-trimmed collar underneath. She wore a sweet pink high-waisted mini skirt with a hem that hugged her figure and outlined her smooth curves. Around her neck was a string of pearls, and the pendant was a simple gold floral design, adding a touch of refinement. Next to her sat a light gray quilted mini handbag, with a clearly visible brand logo. The strap hung naturally, and a cute plush rabbit charm was scattered beside it. The color scheme was light purple and white, creating a playful and cozy atmosphere. The foreground features a deep brown wood floor with delicate and clear texture. At the edge of the floor, some tables, chairs, and tableware are visible. In the lower left corner, a corner of a ceramic bowl and wooden spoon is faintly visible. Through a wide glass window in the background, the café's interior scene is revealed. The window frame is made of vintage carved wood, with window panes inlaid with warm yellow and orange-red frosted glass blocks. Outside the window, cream-colored sheer curtains flutter gently in the breeze. The interior is classical and elegant, with dark solid wood tables and chairs scattered throughout. In the distance, you can faintly see other customers' silhouettes and green plant decorations. The overall composition uses a medium to near perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center. The background blur enhances the subject's prominence, and the color palette is mainly warm brown, light gray, and soft pink, creating a tranquil atmosphere for a lazy afternoon. The entire image exudes an artistic retro atmosphere and the refined lifestyle aesthetics of urban women, like a film image soaked in sunlight—rich in details without being overly noisy, conveying a sense of gentleness. The calm and slightly detached emotional tone seems to capture the most casual yet touching moment in an afternoon café.",
