        {
          "id": "krea2-c57a29dcaaeec1ba5edb42d4",
          "alias": "单女背心摄影棚冷淡倚靠",
          "prompt": "She wears a light blue, fluffy sleeveless top that accentuates her slender waist and long arms. Her left hand rests elegantly on a silver-gray laptop keyboard, her fingertips lightly touching the keys, seemingly immersed in work or creation. The laptop is an Apple brand, with a clean and modern body, and the screen reflecting slightly reveals her focused profile. The foreground is a close-up of a laptop, with keyboard keys clearly visible. The metal shell gleams with a warm sheen under cool-toned lighting, serving as a key visual guide. The middle frame shows her posture and clothing details. The texture of the plush top is soft and fluffy, presenting rich layers under light and shadow. The black pants or skirt hem is partially hidden in shadow, creating a contrast between color and material. The background is a pure white wall, and on the right side is a window fitted with black horizontal blinds. The blades are neatly arranged, forming interplay geometric lines of light and shadow as light penetrates, adding structure and spatial depth to the painting. The composition adopts a slightly top-down perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, forming a stable and dynamic visual focus; The laptop enters the screen diagonally from the lower left corner, forming a diagonal guide line that enhances the sense of spatial extension in the image. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere leans toward a cool blue-purple tone, with the light source coming from the front of the figure slightly to the left, enhancing the sense of depth; The feature wall is hollowed out, making the main subject stand out more; The shadows cast by the blinds intertwine with the warm indoor light, creating a quiet, private, and slightly artistic atmosphere, as if the afternoon sunlight streaming through the curtains onto a desk in a tranquil moment. The overall image presents a highly realistic style with subtle artistic modifications, similar to professional studio shots, yet retaining the intimacy of real everyday scenes. The details are rich yet not overly complicated, providing a comfortable, focused, and immersive viewing experience, conveying a modern urban woman's relaxed lifestyle aesthetic in the digital world.",
