        {
          "id": "krea2-d1c2f84c9a262b8f29ae82bc",
          "alias": "单女粉毛衣床困倦坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright on a bed covered with pure white soft sheets, wearing a lightweight, breathable pink hollowed knit short-sleeve top paired with a matching puffy mini skirt. Her legs are long and crossed, wearing white lace hollow-out stockings that go above the knees. The petals are plump and delicate, with soft colors that harmonize with the overall tone; The middle shot presents her body completely, from her slender wrists to her long legs, clearly visible, forming a visually stable center of gravity; In the background is a wide glass window, with faint glimpses of green plants and a white fence outside. The edges of the window frames are bathed in warm white tones by soft sunlight, and the window screen is a semi-transparent pink-orange polka dot tulle that gently sways in the wind, creating a hazy, dreamy atmosphere; The entire composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame. The visual guide extends from the foreground garland to the character's ankle, creating a smooth and layered spatial narrative; Light comes from the window at the front left, naturally soft and evenly casts on the skin and clothing surfaces, creating a delicate transition between light and dark. The overall light and shadow treatment is extremely delicate, avoiding harsh contrasts and enhancing the warm texture of the image; The atmosphere presents a tranquil, sweet, and slightly nostalgic mood, combining the warmth and authenticity of daily life with an artistically beautiful and romantic temperament. It seems to freeze in a lazy afternoon sunshine, with the air filled with the sweet and creamy scent of cotton candy and the scent of youthful excitement. The entire scene exudes a healing aesthetic, like a silent lyrical poem that draws pause, immersing one in this pure and flawless beauty.",
