        {
          "id": "krea2-7b28cd6ef4508b2054836338",
          "alias": "单女沙发严肃坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits sideways on a soft, comfortable white sofa, slightly lowering her head as she reads a book with vintage illustrations and gold-embossed text on the cover. Her exposed shoulders and neck are graceful, her skin appears delicate and warm under soft light. She is draped in a fluffy, thick light brown plush blanket, its soft fiber texture clearly visible, cascading from her shoulders and back down to her knees, creating a lazy yet warm embrace. Beside her leans a plaid pillow woven with off-white and deep brown, the delicate fabric texture complementing the overall warm tones. In the lower left corner of the painting, a minimalist warm yellow desk lamp stands quietly. The lampshade is elegantly folded in the shape of a cone, emitting a soft, even warm light. The light falls softly like silk onto her arms, book pages, and blanket, creating a delicate transition of light and shadow, giving her a serene and immersive expression. The background is a clean and simple indoor environment. Behind the sofa, you can faintly see the white wall and diffused natural light filtering through the blinds. The light is filtered into strips by the curtains, interwoven with the artificial light source of the desk lamp, creating a richly layered sense of light in the space. The foreground is visually guided by a desk lamp and a woman's arm, with the classic three-part composition: the main figure is on the right side of the painting, while the left blank area is occupied by the desk lamp, creating visual balance; The camera angles slightly downward, enhancing the intimacy and narrative quality of the scene, as if capturing a quiet moment in real life. The overall atmosphere is warm, quiet, and healing, full of the poetry and privacy of home life. The colors are mainly earthy tones—cream white, light brown, caramel, beige—harmoniously unified with soft and hazy light and shadow, without harsh contrasts, presenting a delicate and gentle texture reminiscent of film reel. The visuals are rich in detail yet not cluttered, silently telling a story about reading, relaxation, and inner solitude. The entire image exudes the artistic atmosphere of everyday life, as if taken with amateur equipment, yet thanks to exquisite composition and proper lighting use, it possesses professional-level visual depth and emotional resonance, allowing one to feel the beauty of time being gently frozen in this moment.",
