        {
          "id": "krea2-40b6aa445dd5872be1682e11",
          "alias": "单女制服教室坐指向",
          "prompt": "A female student wore a classic Japanese school uniform: a white short-sleeved shirt paired with a deep red bow tie and black pleated skirt, black stockings, and shiny leather shoes. She sat on the edge of a wooden desk in the classroom, legs elegantly crossed, left hand gently stroking the collar, her overall posture natural and relaxed yet full of youthful energy. In the foreground is the desk and chair she sits on, with several textbooks and a pair of glasses placed on the tabletop. The chair has a metal frame with a yellow wooden seat, and the floor is light-colored wood, with clear grain and visible texture, creating a realistic sense of everyday campus life; The medium shots present her body completely, with delicate attention from shoulders to ankles. Her makeup is exquisite, her skin fair and radiant, and under soft light, she appears gentle and moist; The background is a typical classroom space. On the right wall hangs a dark green blackboard, beneath which is a podium; on the left, semi-transparent sheer curtains let in diffused natural light. In the distance, you can faintly see storage cabinets and neatly arranged empty desks and chairs. The sense of spatial depth is enhanced through blurring, making the main characters stand out more. The composition uses a medium to near angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, body slightly tilted to create dynamic balance, leg lines extending to the lower right corner to guide the view, and desks and chairs as visual support points to enhance the sense of structure; The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by bright and even indoor natural light. Light streams in from the left window, casting delicate shadows on the skirt hem and desks and chairs to create a three-dimensional layer. The visual guide lines are formed by the characters' legs extending along the edges of the desks, and the arrangement of desks and chairs in the background, creating a quiet yet story-filled campus afternoon atmosphere. It combines the warmth of daily life with the exquisite composition and emotional expression of artistic photography, as if time has frozen in this moment, capturing the purest and most beautiful moments of youth. The entire scene looks like it was shot with amateur equipment, yet boasts professional-level lighting control and emotional rendering, delicately conveying a campus aesthetic that is both nostalgic and modern.",
