        {
          "id": "krea2-8120b180b9e7db790de94768",
          "alias": "单女白外套雪地忧伤站立（2）",
          "prompt": "A woman stands amidst a snowy plain, wearing a soft, fluffy off-white wool coat. The wide lapel and matching scarf naturally drape down, the scarf softly wraps around her neck, creating soft layering. The fabric has delicate textures, like warm clouds under winter sunlight. It cascades over the shoulders like a waterfall, forming a striking contrast with the snowy background. Looking directly into the lens, it forms a subtle balance with the overall cool white tones, conveying a restrained gentle strength. The foreground focuses on the details of her clothing from chest to shoulders, with the folds of the coat, the layers of the scarf, and the stitching at the collar all clearly visible, highlighting the authentic texture of the material. The middle ground is from below the neck to the waist, where the flowing curve of the scarf and the natural drape of the collar create a visual transition. The background is a forest of withered branches covered in snow, with branches crisscrossing in a distant yet rhythmic form. Some branches are blurred, creating a sense of spatial depth and hazy poetry. The entire composition uses shallow depth of field, with the main figure clear and sharp, the background softly blurred, reinforcing the emotional central role of the character. Light comes from the soft upper side, possibly scattered light from cloudy days or early mornings, outlining soft contours while creating subtle shadows among fabric folds, enhancing dimension without losing warmth. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, lonely, yet poetic, as if time has frozen in the snow, with the characters serving as the warmest footnotes in this winter painting. The colors are dominated by large areas of cool white and gray-blue, creating a warm and cool contrast without feeling abrupt, creating an artistic tension of \"warmth hidden beneath the ice.\" Ultimately, it returns to the emptiness and silence of the background. The layers of light and shadow are rich, combining bright and pure highlights with low saturation transitions in shadows, giving images a cinematic feel while preserving the authentic texture of everyday shooting. The overall style leans toward artistic photography, with a slight grainy film texture, simulating the natural noise and soft focus effects of amateur equipment (such as phones or small cameras) in low-light environments. Instead of excessive sharpening, it emphasizes emotional expression and immersive atmosphere, making viewers feel as if they are on a forgotten winter afternoon, sharing a moment of tranquility and solitude with this woman.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
