        {
          "id": "krea2-0ed2ef06613fa6d059497c58",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙花园害羞倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "Her right hand rests lightly on the edge of a dark wooden table, wearing a delicate, shiny silver bracelet on her wrist. She wears a simple pure white slip dress that reveals her long, well-proportioned arm lines. Her overall temperament is gentle and serene, yet retains youthful vitality. In the foreground is the dark brown solid wood table she leans on, with a smooth surface and distinct, natural wood grain texture, occupying a stable visual base at the bottom of the frame. On the right side of the table sits a tall, transparent glass vase filled with fresh green carnations or similar flowers, with upright stems clearly visible. Slightly to the left of the vase is another shorter glass vase holding pale yellow or cream-colored flowers, together forming a layered foreground element. The medium shot mainly consists of the woman's body and the tabletop. Her body leans slightly forward against the edge of the table, her gaze naturally lowering shyly toward the camera, creating an intimate yet subtle interaction. The background is a large-scale indoor environment with blurred effects. The walls are faintly shaded in light gray-white, with faint outlines of green plants in the corners. Above the ceiling hangs a bunch of slender vines adorned with tender green leaves and tiny white flowers, slanting from the upper right corner to the middle right of the painting, resembling a naturally growing green curtain, enriching the spatial layers and adding a poetic atmosphere. The entire composition uses the classic rule of thirds, with the figure's head located in the upper left third of the frame, the body extending to the lower center, and the vase on the right side creating visual balance. For lighting and shadowing, soft and evenly diffused natural light is used, with the light source coming from the upper right side of the frame, giving the skin a delicate and gentle three-dimensional effect. The shadow transitions are smooth and unobtrusive, with restrained contrast between light and shadow to avoid strong drama. The atmosphere is peaceful, fresh, and healing, with a romantic vibe reminiscent of a spring garden. The background walls and plants lean toward cool blue-green tones, creating a visually harmonious contrast that creates a private and cozy scene as if you are in a modern urban balcony garden or private study. The entire image has a delicate and realistic texture, with moderate yet layered colors, evoking the refined feel of professional studios or high-end home environments. It also preserves the relaxed and relaxed beauty of daily life. The details are rich yet not chaotic, and every element serves the overall emotional expression and aesthetic unity, conveying a poetic life philosophy about youth, nature, beauty, and self-reflection.",
          "description": "",
