        {
          "id": "krea2-9381fef228e0b003b41dea6d",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣街道专注坐喝",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a green metal chair on an outdoor terrace, her expression gentle yet slightly lazy focused. She gently holds a transparent glass of deep red beverage in her right hand, with a fresh lemon slice floating in the glass. A slender white straw is inserted diagonally from the rim, as if about to take a sip. Her left hand rests naturally on the chair's backrest, and a simple silver ring is worn on her ring finger, adding a touch of casual elegance. She wore a fluffy, soft, and fluffy off-white knit cardigan. The plush at the cuffs and hem was dense and layered, glowing warmly in the sunlight. Underneath, she wore a fitted black lace-trimmed dress that outlined her slender and elongated figure. The black lace details at the hem were subtly visible under the light, creating a visual contrast with the outer sweater. In the foreground was the cup of richly colored drink in her hand and the edge of the green round table partially exposed. On the tabletop, faint water stains could be seen, indicating it had just been used; On the right side, several pots of blooming flowers are displayed. The pink and orange blossoms stand out vividly against the green leaves. Next to one pot stands a small black handwritten wooden sign, written in white characters in blurry Chinese characters, adding a touch of everyday life and artistic flair to the scene. In the middle is the green wrought iron chair she sits on, with clean and smooth backrest lines that blend harmoniously with the surroundings; On the left side are lush green vines climbing on white railings, their leaves layered and full of vitality; on the right is a row of neatly arranged clay pots filled with flowers of various shapes, rich and full of color. The background is a winding, tranquil river channel, with banks built of light gray stone bricks, dotted with moss and wild grass between the cracks. In the distance, lush, neatly trimmed shrubs and tall trees stand tall, with dense canopies and interwoven branches forming a natural green barrier. Further away, a bridge with white railings can be faintly seen crossing the water, with blurred figures slowly walking on it, adding spatial depth and a sense of realism to the scene. The entire composition uses a slightly overhead medium to close-up shot, with the main figure positioned slightly to the left center, extending outward to the surrounding flowers, grass, and environment. Light comes from the upper left of the frame, representing soft daytime natural light, creating delicate transitions between light and dark, without strong shadows or harsh highlights; The surface of the drink reflects a faint sheen, and the dewdrops on the petals and leaves become crystal clear due to light refraction. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and cozy, carrying the leisurely and artistic vibe of a city afternoon café. It combines the freshness of a summer breeze with a touch of lazy and carefree lifestyle aesthetics. The colors are dominated by natural green, warm off-white, and calm blacks, accented with pink and orange flowers. The color combinations are harmonious yet vibrant, creating a gentle, healing, and life-close artistic atmosphere, as if capturing a fleeting moment of beauty in daily life with a regular phone or small camera. With a strong sense of realism and emotional resonance, it makes people imagine her mood and story at that moment.",
