        {
          "id": "krea2-f8a34abf956d61ea9c0c36d7",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙城市困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a wine cabinet, wearing a black spaghetti strap dress with a scarf woven with leopard and zebra prints tied at the collar, adding a wild and elegant aura. The label on the bottle is clearly visible, and her posture is natural and relaxed, yet tinged with a hint of lazy confidence. Her expression was slightly contemplative or dreamy, as if immersed in some intimate nighttime atmosphere. The foreground focuses on the transparent texture and liquid color of the wine bottle in her hand, as well as the red bead bracelet she wears on her arm, which slightly reflects under warm light, creating a visual focal point. In the middle are layered, orderly wine racks, each layer displaying bottles of different brands and colors, such as green LUXARDO, brown GRAPETE, white MALIBU, dark AMARO MONTEBENI, and more. The bottle labels are rich in detail, and some bottles refract and reflect at different angles, creating a rich sense of layering. In the background, a dark wooden wine cabinet structure and soft yellow backlight strips shine from behind the wine racks, outlining the outlines of the bottles and casting a warm halo. On the right side, a glass cup display area is faintly visible, reflecting a hazy golden glow that enhances the depth of the space. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, the wine rack occupying the left and rear sides, forming a stable triangular support structure while leaving some negative space to enhance breathability. It naturally guides the viewer's gaze toward the main subject and extends deeper into the background. The lighting atmosphere is dominated by warm yellow tones, with light coming from behind and from the sides and above, while retaining shadow transitions to give the characters a strong sense of depth and drama; The overall atmosphere is filled with the ambiguous, refined, and sensual aspects of urban nightlife. It hints at the noise of bars while conveying tranquility and introspective emotional tension through the expressions of the characters. The visuals are delicate in texture, with moderate color saturation, possessing cinematic narrative and artistic photography aesthetics, as if capturing intimate moments of modern women in social settings. The story is full of storytelling and emotional resonance, presenting an artistic style that combines everyday authenticity with meticulously composed images.",
