        {
          "id": "krea2-d09f8f2e9c5c2512c88ff426",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙花园冷淡坐持花",
          "prompt": "Underneath, she wore a colorful floral dress with a hem of purple, green, and yellow as the main colors, presenting abstract floral patterns with rich layers of pleats that naturally stretched out with her posture; She gently supports a finely woven straw flower basket with both hands, filled with fresh and elegant white flowers and leafy plants, including several blooming white lilies, fluffy spherical inflorescences, and tiny silver-leaf chrysanthemums. The bouquet is naturally and effortlessly shaped yet full of vitality; In the foreground is the lush lawn where she sits, the grass leaves glow with a bright green glow in the soft light, and some grass tips are gently touched or pressed by her hands, creating subtle interactive details; The middle shot focuses on the combination of figures and flower baskets, with a slightly upward perspective that makes the figures appear taller and more approachable. The center of the composition is slightly right, with a neatly trimmed garden in the background. The most striking feature is a large, rounded, and plump shrub ball in the background, with dense deep green branches and leaves. Together with the distant blurred white wall buildings and several sparse trees, it creates a richly layered sense of spatial depth; The entire frame uses shallow depth of field techniques, with delicate background blur treatment to highlight the clarity and three-dimensionality of the main figure and flower basket, while preserving the ambient atmosphere; The light and shadow come from soft, evenly scattered natural light, which may be diffused light from cloudy days or under tree shade. There is a slight transition between light and dark in the folds of the clothing, enhancing realism; The overall color palette leans toward the cool and soft Morandi palette, dominated by cream yellow, mint green, and light purple-gray, creating a tranquil and healing visual atmosphere that feels like being in a poetic afternoon garden; The composition is stable and breathable, with figures relaxed and natural, harmonizing with their surroundings to form a smooth visual narrative; The atmosphere is filled with the poetry and romance of everyday life, combining the refinement of professional photography with the authentic warmth of nature. Like a gentle moment captured by amateur equipment in the afternoon sunlight, it carries delicate expression and emotional resonance with the aesthetics of life, allowing people to feel the beauty of slowing down time and inner peace and tranquility.",
