        {
          "id": "krea2-c7a920fc9b3d77555e2b190f",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙公园冷淡蹲持包",
          "prompt": "A woman squats on a light-colored rock with natural patterns in the park, wearing a blue and white plaid puff-sleeve dress with loose and flowing cuts, the hem gently draping over the edge of the rock, paired with clean and sharp white sneakers featuring a black brand logo on the sides, and a slender gold ring accented at the ankle. She slung an off-white chain bag across her left shoulder, with the gold chain reflecting gently in the sunlight. Her earlobes were adorned with delicate gold pendant earrings, blending artistic flair with everyday casualness. She slightly turns her body, bends her right leg for support, naturally rests her left leg on her right knee, and folds her hands gently near her knees, exuding a relaxed and natural posture full of dynamic beauty that feels like everyday life. In the foreground is the rock surface where she sits, rough yet textured, edges surrounded by green grass; In the middle of the scene, behind her is a neatly trimmed green lawn and several sturdy trees, their shadows swaying, some branches extending to the top of the frame, forming a natural green arched frame; The background is a dense forest with a blurred effect, where layers of green leaves create rich light and shadow and color transitions under soft diffused light. In the distance, faint stone walls or architectural outlines can be faintly seen, adding spatial depth to the scene. The entire composition uses a low-angle downward angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, and large leaves hanging above like a canopy, cleverly covering part of the sky and creating a visual atmosphere of \"light and shadow under the trees.\" Light comes from the upper left, representing the soft daylight of early morning or afternoon, outlining delicate contours and shadows to enhance depth. The overall tone of the painting is fresh and natural, dominated by different layers of green, complemented by blue-and-white plaid patterns and white shoes to create a warm and cool contrast, with gold accessories serving as the finishing touch to enhance the refinement. The light and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, carrying the poetic laziness and comfort of a spring afternoon, as if time has frozen at this moment, with characters merging with the natural environment, conveying a life aesthetic far from the noise and inner peace. The image texture is delicate and realistic, with rich but not cluttered details, featuring professional studio-level post-production color grading, while preserving the authentic texture and breathing of natural scenes. It's like shooting with a high-end digital camera on a clear summer afternoon, offering cinematic quality and immersive visual experiences, allowing urban women to feel the ease and freedom embraced by nature.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
