        {
          "id": "krea2-e1fb362aa2999b54d6dca527",
          "alias": "单女银浴袍竹林忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a luxurious silver-gray ancient-style robe stands deep within a bamboo forest. The shoulders of her robe are adorned with fluffy, snow-white fur collars, and the hem is embroidered with intricate silver floral and bird patterns, which glow gently in the glow. She tilts her head slightly to look back at the camera, her posture graceful and relaxed, her right hand gently caressing her collar, her left hand naturally letting down, creating a serene and story-filled atmosphere. In the foreground, several lush bamboo leaves slanted in from the upper left of the frame, their edges clear and sharp, forming a subtle visual layer with the figures. The middle ground shows the woman's full upper body outline, with delicate and realistic folds in the fabric. Light and shadow flow between her skin and fabric, highlighting three-dimensionality and texture. The background features a dense bamboo grove with a blurred effect, layered green tones creating a hazy and profound sense of space. The composition uses classic third-division techniques combined with center offset, with the figure positioned near the golden ratio point of the composition. At the same time, slanted bamboo leaves and sleeve lines extend the visual flow, creating dynamic balance. The overall light and shadows are soft and even, resembling natural diffused light from cloudy days or shaded trees. The main light source comes from the front left, with delicate and unobtrusive shadow transitions. The color palette is mainly cool tones, with silver-gray, dark green, and snow white forming a harmonious and unified visual language, creating a cool, ethereal, and slightly melancholic Eastern classical aesthetic. The atmosphere is tranquil and far-reaching, as elegant and enduring as ink painting, yet subtly refines the precision and subtlety of modern photography. It resembles a photographic work captured by professional equipment in a natural environment, with a cinematic texture, combining artistic depth with a sense of everyday life. It evokes images of ancient imperial consorts or peerless beauties secluded in the mountains, combining historical weight with contemporary aesthetic expression.",
          "description": "",
