        {
          "id": "krea2-03a68cd2e32e1395b5b6514e",
          "alias": "单女白T恤茶室自信坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman occupies the center of the frame, gazing at the camera with a slightly tilted head, exuding a quiet, reserved yet youthful energy. She wore a pure white short-sleeved T-shirt with subtle vertical pleats, creating a soft transition of light and shadow under the light, highlighting the fabric's soft texture; Pair it with light blue washed jeans on the bottom, with clearly visible fabric texture, presenting a comfortable, casual everyday style. Her right hand is naturally bent and resting on her knee or thigh, her arm lines smooth and graceful, and her whole posture relaxed and natural, as if she has just stepped up from a cozy indoor space or is about to sit down, presenting a real, undeniably staged everyday moment. Extending from the upper left corner to the center of the frame, her arm spans the lower part of the frame, forming a stable compositional support point that keeps the center of gravity firm. The middle shot is the main area where her torso and clothing are presented. The soft contrast between the white T-shirt and light blue jeans highlights the main figure while harmonizing with the background. The background environment is decorated with a strong traditional Japanese or Chinese atmosphere. On the left wall hang three traditional calligraphy or seal carving artworks framed in wooden frames, mainly featuring red background with white characters or black-and-white ink wash paintings, with faint auspicious characters like \"fortune\" and \"longevity\" visible. The wooden frame's warm and rustic colors complement the warm yellow tones of the walls; On the right side is a semi-transparent white drape or paper curtain, on which abstract calligraphy is written with a black brush. The brushstrokes are graceful and free, creating an elegant and tranquil atmosphere; A circular spotlight on the ceiling emits warm spotlight, with starbursts spreading out and creating a clear highlight on the ceiling. The entire image is composed in close-up shots, using a shallow depth of field effect to blur background elements, enhancing the subject's presence and visual impact; The overall tone of the image is warm, with beige, cream white, light blue, and dark brown as the main color schemes, creating a cozy, comfortable, tranquil, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The layers of light and shadow are rich and delicate, with soft diffused light from above. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and peaceful, full of life and cultural warmth, as if capturing a real moment on an ordinary afternoon or night in a Japanese teahouse or cultural shop. It has a strong sense of realism and emotional resonance, with a delicate and authentic texture, like shooting indoors with a high-end digital camera. It retains natural noise and slight color deviations, presenting an unadorned sense of sophistication and lifestyle aesthetics, allowing viewers to feel a gentleness and beauty close to everyday life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
