        {
          "id": "krea2-833e8044dc6796b08308ff46",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤公园忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits alone on a metal bench in an outdoor park, dressed in a simple yet fashionable everyday outfit—a hugging dark blue camisole over a white long-sleeve shirt, high-waisted dark blue denim shorts, clean white platform sneakers paired with white mid-calf socks, and a low-key black baseball cap. The overall look exudes a casual yet refined street casual vibe. Her posture was naturally relaxed, sitting cross-legged, her left hand gently holding a beige, coarse linen woven handbag, her right hand casually resting on the chair, her body leaning forward slightly, as if immersed in a moment of tranquility or contemplation. In the foreground is the floor paved with dark gray square tiles beneath her feet, with a few withered yellow leaves and scattered grass scattered between the gaps, adding a touch of autumn or early winter to the natural atmosphere; In the middle is a slightly aged silver-gray metal bench, with slight wear on its surface. The structure is simple but the lines are distinct, and on the right side is another empty bench, hinting at a corner of a public space for relaxation; The background is a huge, rough dark gray cement wall, covered with irregular grained textures and mottled marks, resembling industrial styles or art installations polished by time. The top edges are surrounded by dense green branches and tree trunks, with sunlight filtering through the gaps to cast dappled light and shadow, creating a visual layer of light and shadow. The entire composition is shot from a slightly top-down angle, centered on the person, using the horizontal lines of the bench to create a geometric contrast with the vertical surfaces of the wall, creating a stable and dynamic sense of space. The visual guide line extends from the characters' legs to fallen leaves on the ground, then upward to the background wall and the greenery above, guiding the viewer's gaze to flow naturally. The lighting is soft daylight, possibly on cloudy days or under shaded trees. The shadows are light and transitions are smooth, the wrinkles of the garment are clearly visible, and the material details are rich; The atmosphere is tranquil yet slightly lonely, combining the everyday vibe of urban life with a fresh and refined natural element effect. The overall color palette mainly features cool gray, deep blue, and off-white, accented with a touch of green, presenting an aesthetic style that is calm and restrained yet full of warmth of life. It resembles a real moment captured by a regular camera, with real-world grain noise and slight motion blur, rather than flawless commercial photography, conveying a poetic life and inner emotions that unintentionally reveal life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
