        {
          "id": "krea2-0c2e13186fa4db1cca1b3a1c",
          "alias": "单女黑毛衣雪地困倦蹲注视",
          "prompt": "A woman squats gracefully in front of a massive white Chanel perfume bottle art installation, dressed in a classic black-and-white Chanel-style knit suit. The white body is accented with black piping and gold buttons, outlining a refined and sharp silhouette. Black over-the-knee high-heeled boots add a sense of mystery and strength, showcasing a calm and confident temperament. In the foreground are her long legs and slightly raised knees, along with her black suede high heels, the floor covered in a snow-white imitation material, creating a soft transition with the light gray ground beneath her feet; The middle is the main part of her body, including her upper body, arm posture, and the dynamic pleats of her skirt. The large white perfume bottle behind her is simple and modern in structure, with \"GABRIELLE CHANEL PARIS\" clearly engraved on the side of the bottle, shimmering with delicate luster in soft light. The bottle cap is square and three-dimensional, creating a strong visual focal point; The background consists of several pine trees covered with thick artificial frost, lush and dense in foliage, presenting a cool, pure blue-white tone. The canopy is richly layered, with some branches extending to the edges, adding natural elements and a winter atmosphere to the scene; The overall composition is shot from a slightly upward angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame. The perfume bottle installation occupies the right and rear spaces, forming a stable triangular support structure. The trees in the foreground and background are symmetrically distributed on both sides, creating a sense of depth and envelopment; Then, the vertical lines of the perfume bottle guide the viewer's gaze upward, ultimately focusing on the brand logo's text, forming a narrative flow path; The lighting and shadow atmosphere is presented as soft and even daytime natural light, with the light source coming from the upper left of the frame, highlighting skin texture and fabric texture. Shadows are soft but not harsh, with the overall color scheme dominated by cool whites, accented with black and gold details, creating a luxurious, elegant, tranquil, and dreamy high-end fashion show atmosphere. It feels as if you are at the Chanel winter exhibition booth in Paris, combining fashionable artistry with the authentic texture of everyday photography. The details are rich and full, full of storytelling and emotional tension.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
