        {
          "id": "krea2-907c9f64c2f8b4d4463365d2",
          "alias": "多人制服广场冷淡持包",
          "prompt": "The soft lighting inside the refrigerator compartment illuminated several neatly arranged bottles of blue glass water and a can of blue-purple beverage. The inside of the refrigerator door was decorated with a white square grid pattern, and above the refrigerator was a bright yellow cabinet with silver metal handles; On the left side of the painting are stacked two natural wood-colored cardboard boxes printed with the words \"Mas La Plana.\" On the top layer of the box is a large white cylindrical packaging bag labeled \"Patatas Fritas Bonilla a la vista\" and a sailing ship pattern, with a white plastic bowl beside it; The lighting throughout the scene is uniform and soft, with the main light source intertwining cold light from inside the refrigerator and warm ambient light, creating a cozy yet slightly mysterious atmosphere; The composition is shot at a medium to low angle, with the figure occupying the center to the right, leg lines extending from the foreground to the center. Elements in the background—such as yellow cabinets, wooden boxes, and refrigerators—form a distinctly layered spatial structure. The wood floor texture in the foreground is clearly visible, enhancing the realism and sense of everyday life in the image. The color scheme is mainly warm yellow, with a red striped top contrasting sharply with blue shorts. The cool tones inside the refrigerator create a visual contrast, presenting a serene beauty with a dramatic touch in daily life, as if capturing a cute moment that happened unexpectedly. It combines the refined composition of artistic photography with the natural realism of amateur equipment. The light and shadow transitions are delicate, details rich but not cluttered, conveying a relaxed, pleasant yet slightly playful mood.",
