        {
          "id": "krea2-72b8c06b81583791bc8be0ff",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣愤怒站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beside a classic-style stone railing, wearing a fluffy, soft white plush knit cardigan. The fabric is as delicate and light as clouds, glowing softly under the autumn sun. Her sleeves are slightly rolled up, revealing slender wrists and exquisite manicures. Her right hand rests gently on the railing, fingertips holding a golden fallen leaf, her posture natural and relaxed yet full of elegance. Draping over the shoulders, it seems to share a moment of tranquility with viewers on a tranquil autumn afternoon. In the foreground is the white carved stone pillar she leans on, topped with a lotus shape, featuring smooth, antique lines. The column body is carved with delicate lotus petal patterns, with faint traces of time and mottled light and shadow. A few withered yellow fallen leaves cling to the pillar's edge, adding a sense of season and everyday life. The middle ground is the main contour of her body and the structure of the railing. The railing is made of grayish-white stone, with regular horizontal and vertical lines. Some areas show slight wear, showing historical depth. Through the gaps in the railing, one can see the distant calm water, with gentle ripples reflecting the sky and shadows of trees, adding layers and depth to the composition. The background is a vibrant, full autumn canopy, with layers of golden ginkgo leaves layered and strong, the branches vigorous and powerful. The deep brown branches crisscross, forming a natural framing composition, cleverly framing the figure slightly to the center. Soft daylight filters through the gaps between the leaves, creating a warm, bright, and slightly hazy atmosphere; The entire composition uses close-up shots, with the figure occupying the visual center, and the camera slightly tilted downward, enhancing the character's softness and noble temperament. At the same time, tree branches are used as natural frames, with light coming from the upper and side areas, representing soft daytime natural light that outlines a soft, three-dimensional contour. The shadows transition naturally without glaring; The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow, paired with a white sweater and gray-white railings for a cool contrast, enhancing visual impact and harmonious beauty. The atmosphere is serene, gentle, and poetic, carrying a strong autumn romance and artistic vibe. It resembles a carefully composed film still or a fashionable portrait shot by a professional photographer, yet retains the authenticity and warmth of everyday snapshots. Without excessive retouching, it looks even more authentic and moving. It allows people to feel the beautiful moments of the changing seasons and the inner peace and joy.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
