        {
          "id": "krea2-a8c730865aaea54321860207",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙城市冷淡倚靠",
          "prompt": "Around her neck is a slender white lace necklace paired with a simple silver necklace, complementing the scene. Her left wrist is wrapped with multiple layers of black beaded bracelets, giving the wrist a smooth and natural line; Her outfit is a tailored black strapless dress that fits her figure. The upper body features three-dimensional pleated designs, with a deep blue ribbon bow and metal zipper details on the chest. The cinched waist outlines a graceful curve, and the layered black sheer ruffles on the hem are light and flowing. The dress length and thigh length are paired with over-the-knee black stockings with black cross-strap straps. The socks are smooth and reveal the skin's luster. She wears shiny patent Mary Jane shoes with rounded toes and small heels, blending dark tones into the overall look. The multiple elements of maid style and sensibility; The foreground focuses on her long legs and shoes, with legs stretched out—one foot lightly touches the ground, the other hangs naturally, and the knees are slightly bent to create visual focus. The floor is covered with light gray marble-patterned tiles, with soft light illuminating certain areas and reflecting delicate textures and layers of light and shadow. In the center is a large, heavy black leather sofa, with silver metal trims on the armrests. The cushions are full and feature classic button embossing. The woman's left hand rests lightly on the sofa backrest, her body leaning forward slightly, her posture relaxed yet full of control; The background features a pure, deep black wall with a finely grained texture, with no decorations to obstruct the view, enhancing the minimalist aesthetic and sense of spatial depth; The composition uses a slightly top-down full-body mirrored view, with the figure standing slightly to the center, tracing back to the details and accessories of the clothing, creating a smooth visual flow; The handling of light and shadow is extremely meticulous, with the main light source coming from the upper left side of the frame, casting soft transitions of light and shadow on the shoulders, collarbones, and leg sides, while creating subtle shadows in the gaps between the sofa edges and the floor, enhancing the sense of depth and drama; The overall atmosphere is both cool and soft, with a dark black tone that exudes a hint of sweetness, like a black rose quietly blooming in a corner of a late-night café—both sexy and restrained, combining modern urban fashion with the romantic charm of vintage Lolita. The painting exudes a serene yet story-filled artistic vibe, as if someone might burst in and break the frozen moments of time.",
