        {
          "id": "krea2-7d4c903bbc694c709deba6b2",
          "alias": "单女天使蓝毛衣门困倦站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands inside a vintage white wooden door frame, her body slightly turned toward the camera. Her left hand rests gently on the edge of the doorframe, while her right hand hangs naturally at her side, her posture elegant and relaxed. She wears a light blue striped knit off-shoulder top made of lightweight and sheer material, with matching ribbons draping naturally at the waist. She pairs it with classic blue jeans, creating a simple, fresh, yet fashionable overall look. The background is a carefully arranged outdoor courtyard scene, with clear textures on the white wooden wall. The walls are adorned with hanging green vines and a few delicate blue butterflies. Above, a classic-style glass chandelier hangs that emits a soft, warm yellow glow. Behind her to the right is a small table covered with a white lace tablecloth, featuring white angel statues, candlesticks, and colorful bouquets, creating a dreamy and romantic atmosphere. In the foreground is a mottled, moist mossy floor, adding a touch of natural rustic charm and contrast to the image. The entire composition uses a medium shot angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center The door frame forms a natural visual framework, while the blank spaces on both sides of the door frame enhance the sense of spatial depth. The light and shadow treatment is delicate and soft, with the main light sources coming from overhead chandeliers and natural diffused light. The layering of clothing folds and shadows is distinct, and the background blur is well handled to make the main subject stand out. The overall color scheme is mainly cool blue-white, complemented by warm yellow lighting and green plants, creating a peaceful, gentle, and slightly fairy-tale atmosphere. The image has a slight film-grained texture. It's as if you casually capture these real moments in the afternoon sunlight with a regular digital camera or phone, full of the spirit of life and artistic beauty. The entire image exudes a unique charm where youthful energy and poetic romance intertwine.",
