        {
          "id": "krea2-5f960f51b405dfeb577ea20f",
          "alias": "单女短裙庭院站立注视",
          "prompt": "A beautiful classical Eastern beauty, dressed in exquisite Hanfu, stands by a wooden table in the courtyard. Her fabric is as light as cloud-gauze, with soft off-white and pale teal as the main colors. Her skirt is embroidered with delicate lotus patterns, edged with pearl ornaments. Her belt is elegantly fastened, with wide, flowing cuffs. In the foreground is a dark brown wooden tabletop, with a surface slightly reflecting water droplets or dew. On the left side is a woven bamboo basket-style ceramic jar, with a blooming pink peony inside. The petals are full and vibrant, and the leaves are lush and green; On the right side is a small celadon porcelain bowl filled with crystal-clear blue-green grapes. The fruit is plump and round, some with an orange-red sheen, and beside it lies a pair of black lacquered chopsticks, each with light green tassels attached. The medium shots focus on the upper body of the character and tabletop objects, with close-up shots occupying the left central position, gazing gently at the camera to form a natural emotional connection. The background is a blurred Jiangnan garden scene, with dense lotus leaves and lush green branches spreading out in soft focus. In the distance, the outlines of rustic architectural eaves can be faintly seen, creating a hazy, poetic sense of space. The overall light and shadow are soft and warm, like the afternoon sun piercing through thin mist, with natural shadow transitions that highlight the skin's delicacy and the texture of the fabric; The background blur treatment enhances the prominence of the subject while giving the painting depth and layers. The atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, full of classical Eastern aesthetics. It combines the everyday feel of everyday life with the delicate texture of artistic photography, like a meticulously painted courtyard lady, carrying moist air, fresh fruity aromas, and subtle floral notes, calming the mind and immersing one in this gentle tapestry of time.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
