        {
          "id": "krea2-461123dbab1df7a697b1c7fb",
          "alias": "单女窗边沉思持相机",
          "prompt": "The overall style blended sweet collegiate style with a touch of sexiness; In the foreground are her long, well-proportioned legs, with delicate and smooth skin. At her ankles, a faint blue gradient base and a small decorative light emitting a warm red glow at the bottom cast a hazy glow on the floor, creating a visual contrast with the carpet pattern; The middle ground features a modern minimalist style of dark wood-colored tables and chairs. The tabletop is clean and tidy, with a white cardboard box or small storage box placed on top. On the right side, some black objects (possibly photography equipment or furniture) block a corner of the frame, adding depth to the space; The background is a bright and transparent indoor environment. On the left is pure white walls and window outlines, on the right is a half-open light gray curtain. Soft light filters in from outside, and in the distance, a corner of white classical-style chairs can be faintly seen. The floor is covered with a blue carpet featuring abstract waves and swirling textures, with subtle reflective particles on the carpet surface, creating a premium texture. The entire composition uses a slightly upward, medium-close perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, while the leg lines extend downward, creating visual balance; The light and shadow treatment is delicate and soft, with the main light source coming from the window on the right side of the frame, creating a natural side backlight effect while preserving slight shadow transitions to enhance the sense of depth; The atmosphere is tranquil and warm with a touch of dreaminess, with the overall palette mainly cool blue and white, accented with bright red bows and lighting, creating a visual focal point and emotional contrast; The image texture is delicate and lifelike, as if shot with a high-end professional camera, featuring cinematic compositional aesthetics and the realism of everyday scenes. It is neither exaggerated nor forced, presenting beautiful moments captured unintentionally in daily life, full of youthful energy and gentle poetry, allowing viewers to feel a tranquil and joyful emotional resonance.",
