        {
          "id": "krea2-0f39325a6cb1626a33c078c3",
          "alias": "单女白外套街道站立",
          "prompt": "She wears a classic white sports school jacket with a deep blue collar and striped cuffs. The left chest is embroidered with a round school emblem, paired with a white cropped polo shirt underneath and dark blue sweatpants. The overall look is simple, stylish, and full of student vibes. In the distance, blurred green trees, building outlines, and street elements can be seen, creating an authentic urban living atmosphere; The foreground mainly consists of the main figure, while the middle ground is the transitional area between the ground where the figure stands and the surrounding environment. Although somewhat blurred, spatial layers can still be perceived; The background features trees and city buildings heavily blurred, presenting warm, hazy light spots and color gradients; Light comes from the side and above, the soft natural afternoon glow, creating subtle contrasts of light and shadow and a sense of depth, casting soft shadows on her shoulders and fabric; The light and shadow atmosphere is warm and healing, with a romantic Japanese youth campus vibe. The overall color scheme leans toward warmth, mainly white and blue, accented with golden sunlight and green plants, creating a fresh, tranquil, and vibrant visual experience; The visuals have a strong cinematic feel and artistic cinematic quality, like real-life moments captured with a high-end camera on a sunny afternoon. The details are rich and delicate, color saturation is moderate, preserving natural and authentic light and shadow transitions and material expression, conveying a carefree and free youthful daily state.",
