        {
          "id": "krea2-77d717953dd62d3918a61000",
          "alias": "单女短裤室内媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly in a vintage-style indoor setting, wearing a light, flowing white polka-dot cropped top with a delicate bow at the neckline, paired with matching high-waisted shorts. The overall look is simple yet layered, showcasing a blend of softness and sensuality. adding a touch of laziness and authenticity. She slept gracefully, raising her right arm above her head, her slender fingers lightly pinching a plump bright red strawberry, as if unintentionally sharing this sweetness with the viewer; Her left arm rests on the table, her body leaning slightly forward, forming a smooth and dynamic curve that highlights her long, well-proportioned legs and graceful waist-to-hip proportions. Looking directly into the camera, with a half-smile, creating an atmosphere that is both intimate and slightly mysterious. In the foreground, a wooden tabletop sits with a small white plate filled with strawberries and a martini glass with a few strawberries. The red fruit contrasts sharply with the white tableware, becoming one of the visual focal points and hinting at the theme—sweet, romantic, or leisurely afternoon time. In the middle is the deep purple leather sofa she leans on, adorned with classical carved decorations. The texture is heavy, contrasting with the lightness of the figure and enhancing the sense of spatial layering. The background presents hazy warm-toned light and shadow, with vintage furniture silhouettes, golden decorations, and a blurred arched porch structure, creating an intimate, cozy, and story-filled interior space. Light casts from behind or from the side above, creating soft light spots and bokeh effects in the background, enhancing the sense of spatial depth in the composition. The composition adopts a slightly top-down perspective, with the subject positioned slightly to the left center of the frame. The tilted body posture guides the natural flow of the gaze, while the fruit plate and wine glass in the foreground serve as visual anchors, enhancing the stability and interest of the composition. The light and shadow treatment is delicate and soft, with the main light source coming from the upper front of the figure, while subtle shadows are created on the back and arms to emphasize three-dimensionality; The background uses a low-saturation cool blue mixed with warm yellow light, creating a dreamy atmosphere of dusk or dusk, giving the painting a sense of serene, gentle, and slightly melancholic artistic beauty. The overall atmosphere combines the casual nature of daily life with the refinement of artistic photography. The colors are mainly white, light blue, and deep purple, accented with bright red strawberries. The visual impact is strong yet not flashy, conveying a lazy and sweet lifestyle aesthetic. The image texture is delicate, the clothing wrinkles naturally, and the transitions of light and shadow are soft, as if shot with professional equipment, yet preserving the natural atmosphere of real life. It combines the refinement of a high-end photo shoot with the warmth of everyday photography.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
