        {
          "id": "krea2-d238f11b5fc77ec4d3557778",
          "alias": "单女礼服瀑布困倦注视",
          "prompt": "She gazes into the camera as if silently telling some secret story. Her gown was the visual focal point, featuring a tight strapless top covered with dense, sparkling crystals and sequins, reflecting star-like brilliance under the lights and perfectly outlining her graceful waist and hip curves; The hem of the skirt blooms layer upon layer from the waist downward like blooming waves or clouds, made of lightweight, translucent tulle, edged with fine sequins and metallic threads, flowing and shimmering in light and shadow, creating intricate and luxurious layers. The ends of the skirt are scattered across dark marble steps, forming a flowing waterfall of light. Her right hand rests gently on the black wrought iron carved armrest, while her left hand naturally rests at her side. Her posture is composed yet sculptural, her body slightly turned, showcasing the perfect fusion of the gown and the body's lines. In the foreground is the gorgeous skirt hem and some stairways spread beneath her feet; the pleats and reflective details of the skirt are clearly visible, creating a strong sense of visual depth; In the middle frame, her tall figure and the handrail form vertical lines. The railing is made of black wrought iron, decorated with vintage scroll patterns and geometric hollow-out patterns, creating a strong contrast with her pale skin and light-colored gown, enhancing the structural sense of the composition; The background extends the interior space: on the left, you can faintly see beige walls and the warm light outlines of classical window lattices or wall lamps; on the right, the staircase corner leading to the second floor and the white walls, creating an elegant and intimate environment. Light softly pours in from the sides and above, while delicate shadows cast on the skirt hem and railing, enhancing the sense of depth. The composition uses a slightly elevated, slightly overhead perspective, making the figure appear noble and solid. The diagonal line formed by the handrail guides the gaze to focus on the subject, while the upward trend of the stairs suggests the expansiveness of the space. Then, following the curve of the skirt and the lines of the armrest, the natural flow descended, ultimately captivated by the luxurious details scattered along the skirt. The lighting and shadow atmosphere presents a blend of cool sophistication and warmth and restraint in the atmosphere. The main light source comes from the front right of the figure, while the warm lighting in the background serves as a supplementary light, creating a subtle contrast between cool and warm. The overall color scheme is mainly silver-white, light blue, and dark brown-black, accented with warm yellow accents, creating an atmosphere that is both dreamy and solemn. It feels like stepping into a tranquil moment before a grand banquet, with cinematic dramatic tension and the refined texture of artistic photography. The entire scene is full of narrative and emotional depth. Like a meticulously composed fashion blockbuster, yet preserving the authentic tactile feel of real-world light and texture.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
