        {
          "id": "krea2-fa1626ad27d023516f8f8ec3",
          "alias": "单女红衬衫小巷冷淡站立躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a somewhat worn-out city alley, turning to glance back, as if silently communicating with the audience outside the camera. Under natural light, it has a faint, healthy dark brown sheen, adding a touch of laid-back and casual beauty. She wore a classic blue, gray, and red plaid shirt, with the hem casually rolled up to her forearms, revealing a white crew-neck T-shirt underneath. The cuffs faintly showed the texture of denim fabric, giving the overall look a comfortable and youthful vibe reminiscent of Japanese street collegiate style. She pairs it with dark blue slim-fit jeans, with the gold badge clearly visible on the pocket, outlining a slim waistline and long legs. She carries a high-end black backpack made of matte leather, with delicate pleats and stitching details. The metal zipper and adjustment strap reflect a subtle sheen under the light, and the bag's shape is simple and practical yet stylish. Her right hand hangs naturally at her side, gently holding a white hardcover notebook or tablet. Her nails are neatly trimmed, painted with a pale pink polish, and her fingertips are slightly curved, revealing an effortlessly elegant pose. In the foreground is the mottled concrete road where she stands, with fine stones and dust scattered on the ground. At the edges, a few tenacious grass stalks peek out from the gaps. On the right side of the road, an old bamboo broom leans diagonally, and beside it is a bulging red plastic garbage bag. These everyday items form a visual anchor full of the atmosphere of everyday life. The middle view is the weathered wall behind her, with large areas of paint peeling off, revealing the gray-white concrete base underneath. The corners of the walls are covered with moss and vines, with green leaves gently swaying in the breeze, adding vitality and traces of time to the cold building. On the wall stood a brown, wrought iron gate with a rusty lock, and a few withered yellow leaves hung on the door, adding a touch of nostalgia. The distant view shows a partial view of an old residential building, with grayish-white walls, an air conditioning unit installed above the window, and several green plants placed along the windowsill, lush and foliage, creating a visual layer with the nearby wall. The entire composition uses a slightly tilted golden ratio perspective. The main figure is positioned about one-third on the left side of the frame, with the body facing forward to the right but the head turned toward the camera, forming a classic dynamic \"looking back\" dynamic composition. The lighting is soft and even, naturally illuminated on cloudy days or afternoon diffused light, without strong shadow contrast. The colors are mainly cool tones, dominated by blue-gray tones, which unify with the black backpack and dark jeans. The walls are mottled gray-white, the vines emerald green, The brown broom and the red plastic bag create subtle color accents, giving the image layers without appearing cluttered. The overall atmosphere presents a tranquil, artistic, and lifelike Japanese street style full of everyday life. It combines the lively and realistic atmosphere of urban alleys, while the exquisite makeup and costumes convey youthful vitality and artistic beauty. It seems to capture an ordinary yet story-filled afternoon moment, allowing people to feel the untouched beauty and tranquility in the city's corners. The image quality strives for a high level of realism and detail, much like photos taken with a professional digital camera, with rich and full details that provide a strong immersive viewing experience.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
