        {
          "id": "krea2-0858899e7a239c9340fcf45e",
          "alias": "单女短裙镜前俏皮倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman elegantly leans against the hood of a bright blue Xiaomi SU7, her right hand naturally resting on the smooth, mirror-like body reflecting the showroom lights. Her nails are painted a light nail polish, giving her a posture that is both casual and stylish. She wore an off-white loose long-sleeve outer layer, paired with a form-fitting short skirt underneath. The dress was covered with vintage stamp motifs, rich but not chaotic, mainly in soft tones like pink, green, blue, and brown. The patterns included cartoon bears, bows, and landscape paintings, creating a visual effect that blended childlike fun with refinement. The waistline was perfectly narrowed, highlighting her slender figure. Around her neck, she wears a simple silver thin chain necklace that glimmers softly under soft light, adding a touch of sophistication. The main body of the car is the Xiaomi SU7, with a vibrant lake-blue metallic paint finish. Under the bright and uniform ceiling lighting in the showroom, the surface displays a delicate and intense sheen. The small \"mi\" brand logo is embedded in the center of the front end, with a white license plate clearly printed in black lettering \"XIAOMI SU7\" below. The edges of the plate are neat and uniform, consistent with the vehicle's design language. The headlights have a highly futuristic design, while the grille area is clean and elegant, combining a sense of technology with aesthetic tension. In the background is a spacious and bright automotive showroom interior, with walls in pure light beige or gray-white tones. The ceiling is equipped with a hidden lighting system, providing soft and evenly distributed light. In the center of the rear wall, a large white three-dimensional \"XIAOMI\" brand logo is prominently hung, with letters edged with a slight glowing effect, creating an immersive visual atmosphere for the brand. The foreground focuses on the details of the figures and the front of the car, with background blurring to make the subject stand out more. The composition uses a slightly low-angle perspective to make the people and vehicles appear more imposing, while the car's hood serves as a natural support platform to form a stable visual foundation. The visual guide line extends from the direction of the character's finger to the car logo, then upward to the background brand logo, forming a natural visual flow path. In terms of light and shadow, the main light source comes from the upper front, creating soft highlights and natural transitional shadows, without harsh contrasts of light and dark, highlighting the texture of the material and the three-dimensional contours. The overall atmosphere is fresh, modern, full of vitality and a sense of technology. At the same time, the playful patterns and gentle expressions of the characters' clothing infuse a touch of relaxed and joyful lifestyle, as if capturing a beautiful moment in daily life that is unintentional yet full of ritual. It has a strong commercial photography texture and artistic expression, like shooting with a professional-grade camera paired with high-quality lenses. After careful color grading and local sharpening in post-production, it presents a moderately saturated and harmonious color effect, combining professionalism with product presentation. Yet the humanistic warmth of portrait photography is not lost.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
