        {
          "id": "krea2-dd1101bcd3480a812ff46833",
          "alias": "单女白挂脖室内俏皮坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly in front of a red velvet sofa indoors, leaning back slightly and raising her head slightly, as if immersed in some silent thought or dream, adding a lazy yet lively sense of life; She wore an off-white pleated halter camisole top, made of light, soft fabric with distinct pleats. Under soft lighting, it presented a delicate texture, paired with high-waisted blue denim shorts. The simple and sharp cut outlined her long, well-proportioned legs, with no shoes visible at the ankle. The overall style was both casual and refined, highlighting the casual and fashionable taste of urban women. Her left hand rests naturally on her knee, fingers slender and long, her nails painted with deep black glossy polish, reflecting a subtle sheen under cool lighting and creating a striking color contrast with her light-colored clothing; The foreground focuses on her exposed skin and posture, especially the curves of her legs and arms, with low-angle shots enhancing the visual sense of extension and graceful curves; The mid-range is the full, thick, and richly colored red velvet sofa, with a classic button-embossed design. The material feels heavy and tactile, serving as a warm and powerful visual anchor in a cool-toned environment; The background is a simple, modern interior space, with walls in a plain light gray-white, ceiling lines clearly visible, and in the distance, a dark brown wooden door and parts of the wall structure faintly visible. The overall layout is spacious but somewhat blurred, creating a sense of depth and ambiance; The composition uses a slightly upward-tilted angle, placing the figure slightly to the left center of the frame, using the edge of the sofa to form a natural guiding line, then transitioning into the background space to create a smooth visual path; The lighting and shadow handling is extremely meticulous, with the main light source coming from the front left of the figure. It is soft yet directional, precisely outlining the three-dimensional contours of her neck, collarbones, shoulder blades, and arms, enhancing the sense of three-dimensional volume; The overall atmosphere is filled with a quiet, private, and slightly artistic home aesthetic. The color palette is dominated by cool blue and warm red, creating visual tension and harmonious balance. The light and shadow layers are rich and delicate, with local highlights and shadows created by hard lighting, creating a texture that is both realistic and artistically filtered. It feels like a photo taken with a high-end digital camera or professional phone in a carefully arranged indoor environment. The details are rich, color saturation is moderate, and noise control is well controlled. It presents a highly realistic yet cinematic visual experience, conveying a restrained emotional tension and a poetic beauty that feels like everyday life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
