        {
          "id": "krea2-7c3b7c703f72ccf60880786b",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣街道俏皮站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the middle of a city's shaded street, wearing a soft light blue loose knit cardigan paired with a pure white fitted slip dress underneath. The hem fits her figure and naturally falls to her ankles, creating a simple yet layered look. She stands slightly to the side, lightly carrying a brown leather shoulder bag in her left hand. The strap drapes across her shoulder, small and delicate, adorned with a cute plush duckling, adding a touch of playful energy to the overall understated tone; Her right hand is gently raised, her posture elegant and lazy, as if immersed in some beautiful memory or longing for the future. She wears a delicate silver necklace around her neck, and her earlobe is adorned with a tiny pearl stud that reflects a gentle glow in the sunlight. The background is a typical urban tree-lined avenue, flanked by tall, dense green trees forming natural arcades. The branches and leaves are lush, sunlight filters through the layers of leaves, casting dappled light and shadow. The brick and stone pavement is cut into interplay light patterns. On the left, you can see an off-white classical wall, with several bicycles parked beside it, their wheels and frames faintly visible in a blurred haze. In the distance, the street stretches to the edge of the view, with faint silhouettes of cars passing and blurry human silhouettes visible, creating a sense of depth in real life scenes. The entire composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the visual center. The light is bright and soft natural daylight, coming from the upper left of the painting and evenly illuminating the figure, creating a delicate transition between light and dark. The color palette is mainly fresh green, pure white, and elegant gray-blue, accented by a brown bag as a warm accent. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, fresh, and healing, filled with the leisurely feeling of a spring afternoon stroll and the poetic beauty of urban life. The image quality leans toward professional photography level, but the realistic graininess and slight noise typical of everyday equipment make the images feel more alive and warm rather than over-retouched commercial blockbusters. It presents an artistic aesthetic reminiscent of \"daily life kissed by sunlight,\" combining the narrative tension of cinematography with the breath and authentic warmth of ordinary street life, making viewers pause and gaze at the tranquility and beauty within.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
