        {
          "id": "krea2-0743c89476602945455d97ed",
          "alias": "单女窗边微笑持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman occupies the center of the painting, wearing round glasses with slim metal frames. The lenses clearly reflect soft indoor light, revealing a calm yet slightly contemplative gentle expression. Her right hand was gently raised, her posture elegant and natural, as if she had inadvertently captured a quiet moment. She wore a beautifully designed off-white high-neck long-sleeve top made of smooth, delicate fabric with a silky sheen. The collar and cuffs were decorated with exquisite embroidery patterns, outlining classic floral and vine patterns with elegant pink and gold lines, accented by several small, rounded pearl buttons. The cuffs were embedded with a layer of sheer lace and mesh fabric, adding a touch of retro artistic flair. The color is naturally soft, with a subtle smile. In the middle of the frame, you can see the texture and folds of her clothing. The background is a curtain or wallpaper printed with cartoon patterns, with a light gray-blue base color. The surface is dotted with fine horizontal grid lines, dotted with pink round polka dot decorations. Below, several white bear silhouettes in a simple sketch style are printed. The design is cute and minimalist, creating a warm and playful yet fresh and elegant spatial atmosphere. The composition uses a slightly tilted vertical perspective, creating a visual tension that is both intimate and somewhat distant. The overall composition uses warm-toned lighting, with the light source coming from the upper front of the figure, creating a natural transition of light and shadow and a sense of three-dimensionality, enhancing the layering of the image. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is gentle and serene, blending Japanese style with French retro aesthetics. The entire image presents a peaceful and beautiful everyday scene, like afternoon sunlight filtering through the window lattice, like a desk in the afternoon. It feels as if shot with an old film camera or phone under natural light, preserving subtle noise and slight color differences from real life, giving the image a rustic sense of everyday life and artistic beauty.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
