        {
          "id": "krea2-6faa15e18cac7746a51a86c1",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙庭院俏皮站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a spacious courtyard of a modern building, wearing a delicate black-and-white patchwork dress. The upper body features an off-white lace strapless top, adorned with a cute little bunny decoration on the chest. The lower half is a black short skirt with a naturally draped hem, paired with pure white over-the-knee socks. The overall look is both sweet and playful; Her makeup is exquisite, her hands spread outward, palms facing outward, making two \"V\" gestures, nails painted with red nail polish, her posture lively and confident; She stands on a floor paved with large gray tiles, whose texture is clear and reflect soft light, creating subtle layers of light and shadow; Behind her on the left is a sturdy concrete column, beside which is an open entrance with warm orange lighting, faintly visible wooden walls and a potted tree; On the right side is a vast landscape of dense greenery, with bamboo groves intertwined with broadleaf trees, their leaves shining bright yellow-green in the sunlight. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, fresh, and full of the relaxed feel of modern urban life. The image has a slight soft-focus effect, moderate color saturation, and a mix of cool gray and warm green, presenting a realistic texture reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment. The details are rich but never overpower, conveying a relaxed, joyful, and free lifestyle attitude.",
