        {
          "id": "krea2-fb1e096219f3fb3b93ea1153",
          "alias": "单女粉女仆装厨房俏皮坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly at a bright and cozy wooden kitchen counter, dressed in a delicate and cute pink polka dot and plaid maid outfit. The skirt is layered with ruffles, paired with a beret in the same color and a white lace lining, creating an overall look that is both sweet and playful; Her makeup is delicate and natural: her left hand gently holds a freshly baked, soft bread, while her right hand holds a soft pink plastic spoon, as if ready to enjoy a delicious meal; She wore semi-transparent white mesh fishnet stockings, barefoot hanging from the table below, her legs long and smooth, showing delicate skin texture under soft light; The composition uses a slightly overhead perspective to make the main subject occupy the visual center of the frame, while cleverly using kitchen elements to create a sense of layering—in the foreground is her legs extended from her seated posture and hanging toes; in the middle is her plump torso, arms, and props; in the background are neatly arranged white tiled walls and high shelves, with numerous transparent goblets and ceramic ware on the shelves. In the right corner, a vintage green oven and wooden horse-shaped ornaments can be seen, while on the left are wooden steamers and metal stands, creating a spatial atmosphere that blends authentic life with Japanese home aesthetics; For lighting and shadowing, it uses soft, even diffused light that enters the room diagonally from the upper left, while creating a natural transition of light shadows between the edge of the console and the legs, enhancing the sense of depth; The color palette is mainly pink and white, accented with natural wood tones and light gray tiles. The overall color scheme is fresh and bright yet warm, creating a tranquil, healing, and heartfelt everyday atmosphere; Drawing viewers' attention to the characters' expressions and movement details, while guiding the gaze backward through background depth layouts to enhance spatial depth; The entire scene exudes a strong Japanese sweet-cool aesthetic and a home-style healing style, combining exquisite composition with the authentic texture of amateur equipment. The details are rich and full, full of life and emotional warmth, evoking a gentle and sweet moment in a lazy afternoon.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
