        {
          "id": "krea2-79f461fc26481075612d8d44",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔公寓站立",
          "prompt": "A woman lounged lazily on a white, soft bed, faintly glowing in the gentle light; Her makeup is natural and fresh. She wears a simple and comfortable white strapless cropped top that outlines a slender and balanced waistline. She pairs it with washed blue jeans, the waistband casually lifted to reveal a flat belly and navel. Her right hand gently caresses her abdomen, looking relaxed yet full of charm. Around her neck wears a delicate and petite gold necklace, with a unique pendant shape that adds a touch of sophistication to the overall look; The background is a warm and tranquil bedroom environment, with light-colored curtains half-drawn, letting in soft natural light. In the right corner stands a simple, modern white floor lamp that emits a warm yellow glow. The foreground focuses on her upper body and hand movements, with a slightly top-down angle placing the figure slightly above the center of the frame, forming the visual center. The middle scene consists of pristine white fluffy sheets and jeans, with material contrast enhancing layers; The distant view uses blurred walls and curtains to create spatial depth; The light and shadow effect is soft and even, with the main light source coming from the left front window and artificial light from the right rear floor lamp, creating a subtle transition between light and dark. The shadows are soft and not abrupt, and the folds of clothing show natural light and shadow changes; The overall atmosphere presents a private, tranquil, and slightly youthful home aesthetic, with a sense of realism and the sense of everyday life from casual shooting. The color palette is mainly white, light gray, and light blue, accented with gold accessories and floral ornaments, creating a clean, fresh, and healing visual experience. The visuals have strong narrative and emotional resonance, as if capturing the most relaxed and natural moment of a girl as afternoon sunlight fills the room. It combines the compositional beauty of artistic photography with the natural texture and genuine emotional expression of a phone or regular camera.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
