        {
          "id": "krea2-f6e119a816dffea99eaf320b",
          "alias": "单女粉浴袍庭院严肃站立",
          "prompt": "A beautiful Eastern woman, dressed in exquisite and elegant Hanfu, stands before the gate of a traditional courtyard full of antique charm. Sunlight pours in from behind, outlining a soft, warm halo on her translucent pink robe and pale blue lining. Her robes flutter like clouds, and the hem is embroidered with intricate floral patterns—pale and green, rich in layers. Around her waist is a bright red ribbon and pearl tassels, and around her neck is a multi-layered pearl chain necklace. Her skin glows with a healthy glow, her makeup is refined and natural, and the overall look combines classical charm with modern youthful energy. The foreground focuses on her upper body and clothing details, while the middle frame features dark carved wooden doors and openwork window lattices behind her, with interlaced light and shadow. The background is blurred, and the green plants and stone steps deep in the courtyard can be faintly seen, creating a sense of depth and spatial layering. The composition uses medium to near shots and close-ups. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, leaving breathing space on the right side, which extends to the architectural structure behind the scenes, forming a visual flow. The use of light and shadow is highly dramatic. Backlighting creates a soft halo around the edges, while the shadowed areas perfectly enhance the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, full of poetry and storytelling, like a work blending classical meticulous brushwork with modern photographic aesthetics. The color palette is mainly powder blue, complemented by golden sunlight and a dark wooden background. The colors are harmonious and layered, and the image feels delicate and authentic. It feels as if a professional camera is used to shoot under natural light, featuring cinematic cinematic language and a sense of sophistication. It preserves the solemn beauty of traditional clothing culture while conveying modern dynamism and confidence through the expressions and postures of the characters. The entire scene exudes a sense of romance and nostalgia that transcends time and space, making one imagine the era and story she lived in—a visual feast blending Eastern aesthetics, fashion elements, and humanistic emotions.",
