        {
          "id": "krea2-4ce557ef4d3c04fe0025a9d8",
          "alias": "多人摄影棚媚态手持物",
          "prompt": "Light casts delicate transitions of light and shadow on it, enhancing the sense of spatial depth in the painting; The lighting and shadow treatment is extremely meticulous, with the main light source coming from the upper left front, creating a distinct shadow contour that gives the body structure a more three-dimensional feel; The overall atmosphere is filled with a quiet and oppressive beauty, carrying both Gothic mystery and sensuality, yet a hint of vulnerability and unease, as if on the edge of a dream or on the eve of an emotional storm; The color palette is mainly cool black and gray, creating strong color contrasts; The image texture is delicate and lifelike, like high-resolution images shot in a professional studio, yet contains AI-generated soft transitions and surreal details.",
