        {
          "id": "krea2-1220017fb6f439cdf815205a",
          "alias": "单女白T恤图书馆微笑奔跑注视",
          "prompt": "A woman, with a gentle and serene smile, gazes into the camera through a pair of round glasses framed with slender metal frames, adding a touch of laziness and intellectual charm; She wore a lightweight, soft off-white camisole with subtle wrinkles and a semi-transparent texture, glowing in the light. The cuffs featured delicate ruffled designs, revealing her long, fair arms and slender collarbones. Her right hand rested gently on the edge of a wooden bookshelf, her fingers long, nails neatly trimmed and painted with light pink polish, fingertips slightly curved, her posture elegant and natural; The composition cleverly uses bookshelves as foreground and background frames, with the main subject centered slightly to the right, and the slightly tilted head creating a friendly and interactive atmosphere with the line of sight; In the foreground are books neatly arranged on the bookshelf, with spines mainly in warm brown and off-white. Some book covers faintly show text or patterns, and the edges of the pages reflect soft light from light. The wood grain on the shelves is clear and natural, with warm and steady tones; The middle ground marks the junction between the figure's body and the bookshelves, with rich layers of light and shadow, soft shadows, and soft but not stiff; The background is blurred, presenting a blurred indoor environment, with natural light spots and wall contours faintly visible through the windows, creating a sense of spatial depth and a quiet atmosphere; The overall approach uses shallow depth of field photography, with both background and foreground moderately blurred to highlight the subject's presence; Light comes from soft sources on the front side, simulating natural window lighting. Warm golden tones run throughout the image, creating delicate highlights and transitional shadows. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is tranquil and warm, full of scholarly and artistic atmosphere, as if you are in a private study or a university library corner, with tranquil air and only the gentle touch of sunlight brushing the pages and skin. The overall color palette mainly features warm brown, off-white, and cream tones, with moderate saturation to avoid excessive brightness, creating a retro film texture or cinematic aesthetic. The images feature slight grainy noise and soft focus effects to enhance realism and artistic appeal, while preserving the authentic texture and lifestyle feel of everyday amateur equipment. The details are refined and delicate, conveying a restrained intelligence, gentleness, and slightly shy image of a youthful woman, allowing viewers to feel the fusion of knowledge and beauty.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
