        {
          "id": "krea2-650ff220f4b0dbbcdd141147",
          "alias": "单女灰T恤船上困倦",
          "prompt": "She wore a fitted high-neck, sleeveless gray fitted tank top, made of smooth and soft material that accentuated her graceful shoulder and neck lines and body curves. She paired it with loose black shorts or a short skirt, with the waist and upper garments gently lifted to reveal leg skin, hands naturally tucked into her pockets, looking relaxed yet confident. In the foreground is a moist beach and gentle waves crashing against the shore, the sea glistening faintly, with fine, white foam and clearly visible ripples, with water stains and damp sand intertwined at your feet. The middle ground shows a calm, open sea, with a white luxury yacht moored in the distance. The hull lines are smooth, several people are blurred on the deck, and farther away, two small boats are scattered across the horizon. The background is a magnificent sunset sky, with the sun positioned at the lower left edge of the horizon, emitting a warm orange-yellow glow that dyes the clouds in richly layered purple-gray, pale gold, and pinkish orange tones. The clouds are fluffy and heavy, their edges outlined by sunlight forming soft golden outlines, while the upper part of the sky gradually turns a cool blue-gray. The cloud layers are arranged in a well-balanced manner, creating a dramatic contrast of light and shadow. The composition uses a vertical long format, with the figure positioned slightly above the center, occupying the main visual focus. The sea-sky boundary divides the painting into upper and lower visual zones, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The light and shadow atmosphere presents a unique blend of warmth and coolness at dusk, with the back and arms cast faint shadows by the sunset, enhancing the sense of depth; The seawater reflects the colors of the sky, shimmering with waves, and the overall tone transitions between cool gray and warm yellow, creating a tranquil, dreamy, and slightly melancholic artistic atmosphere. The visuals are delicate and authentic, with rich details, as if professional photography equipment was shooting at the golden hour. It offers cinematic texture and emotional tension, blending the independent elegance of modern urban women with the poetic blend of natural surroundings, evoking the quiet solitude of a sunset by the sea or the beginning of an untold story.",
