        {
          "id": "krea2-c236f81b9989f76505a92357",
          "alias": "单女灰短裙花园微笑倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully leans against the stone railing of a classical garden, wearing a delicate black lace off-shoulder top with delicate and intricate lace textures. Ruffled designs on the cuffs and neckline add soft layers, paired with a gray-black plaid high-waisted short skirt that outlines a long, well-proportioned figure, combining vintage charm with modern fashion sense; Her makeup is clear and soft, revealing a calm and confident smile; Her right hand is lightly clenched into a fist over her chest, her left hand naturally resting at her waist, her posture relaxed and graceful. On the left stone platform of the painting sits a celadon wine bottle painted with red floral ink. The bottle is simple and elegant, creating a subtle contrast with the figure's modern attire; In the foreground are mottled wooden tables and chairs paired with rough-textured cement stone railings, with clear wood grain and carved stone railings faintly revealing the classical atmosphere of Chinese gardens; The middle view is a broad and calm lake surface, where the water mirrors the lush trees along the shore and the outline of the distant arched bridge, with gentle ripples forming the water; The background is a dense, lush green forest, with layers of branches and leaves that display different layers of emerald green under soft light. In the distance, a white arch bridge can be faintly seen spanning the water, with faint pedestrian figures and white umbrellas below, hinting that this is a public garden space frequented by tourists; The entire composition uses shallow depth of field, with the background blurred to create a hazy, dreamlike atmosphere. The realistic materials of the foreground wooden table and stone railings enhance spatial depth; The visual guide line is formed by the direction of the character's gaze, the lines of the arms, and the railing extending to the right. The light and shadow are soft and even, resembling the mottled halo formed by afternoon sunlight filtering through the leaves. The shadows transition naturally without strong contrast, creating a tranquil and warm atmosphere; The color palette is mainly fresh green, complemented by black and gray in the characters' clothing to create a warm and cool contrast. The overall color scheme is harmonious and unified, with a subtle Japanese photo style. The images are full of life and artistic beauty, like a carefully composed everyday photography masterpiece—both authentic and poetic, conveying a beautiful atmosphere where youth, freedom, and nature blend together.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
