        {
          "id": "krea2-4e1ec2e222271fbc60e3d8ee",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙公园站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on the edge of the green lawn in a city riverside park, wearing a light purple lightweight spaghetti strap long dress adorned with delicate butterfly prints. The waist is adorned with an elegant bow decoration, featuring irregular ruffled hems and side slits. The fabric gently flutters in the breeze, and the semi-transparent material reveals the contours of the skin. Delicate bracelets are placed at the cuffs, and her posture is natural and relaxed. One hand gently caresses her arm, the other hangs down slightly at her fingertips, creating a fresh and natural makeup that presents a natural, everyday bare-faced look. In the foreground is the gray stone pathway stretching beneath her feet and the boundary between the lush green lawn, where the grass leaves are clearly visible and the gently undulating floor texture enhances the spatial layers; In the middle is a wide, flat waterfront plaza, with several passersby scattered vaguely—some sitting reading, others strolling slowly. They are blurred to highlight the main figures. The plaza is neat and clean, with several sets of leisure seats and trash bins visible in the distance; The background features a wide water surface reflecting the sky and the modern urban skyline across the river. High-rise buildings stand out in a staggered manner, with one building featuring a uniquely streamlined dome structure standing out. The sky displays a soft grayish-white tone, clouds are thin and even, and the light is diffused from the afternoon, enveloping the entire scene in a tranquil and gentle atmosphere. The composition uses a medium-near portrait perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, body slightly turned toward the camera, creating a stable visual center; Using shallow depth of field, the background crowd and city architecture are appropriately blurred, enhancing the clarity and presence of the main figures; The visual guide lines are formed by the extension of the character's arms, the edge of the lawn, and the ripples on the distant water surface. The light and shadow are soft and even, without strong shadows. Sunlight pours in from the sides, creating subtle highlights on the shoulders and skirt hem, highlighting the three-dimensional silhouette and fabric texture. The overall color palette is mainly light purple, teal-green, and gray-white, creating a quiet, romantic yet urban atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and realistic, simulating amateur equipment shooting while retaining slight noise and slightly lower color saturation. It also possesses the compositional aesthetics and emotional expression of artistic photography, conveying a youthful, free, and urban-integrated attitude toward life.",
