        {
          "id": "krea2-07af69e01c40802df1ea0394",
          "alias": "单女粉毛衣乡村困倦站立持包",
          "prompt": "She wore a light pink knit cardigan with a soft and voluminous texture, natural pleats and frayed details at the cuffs and neckline, layered underneath by an olive green pleated slip dress with a slight ruffle at the neckline, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme that presents a gentle vintage everyday style. On the left edge of the foreground, part of a beige round bamboo handbag can be faintly seen. The handle curves smoothly, and the metal rivets glow with a warm luster under the light, hinting that she is holding or shouldering the item, adding a sense of everyday life and realism to the scene. The middle shot is the transition area from her neck to her shoulders, where light streams from the side and above, creating soft layers of light and shadow on the folds of the garment. The transition of light and shadow is natural, highlighting the texture of the fabric. In the background, lush green plants are lush and full, with clear veins. Sunlight filters through the leaves, creating mottled light spots. Some branches are covered with clusters of small orange-red fruits, round and plump like cherries, standing out vividly against the green leaves, creating a rich summer countryside atmosphere. The entire composition uses a close-up perspective with a slight downward tilt. The leaves and fruits in the foreground serve as natural frames, partially obscuring the right side of the subject's head, creating a visual sense of \"peeping\" and layered depth. At the same time, blurring is used to create a dreamy soft-focus effect on the background, emphasizing the prominence of the subject. For lighting and shadowing, natural daylight lighting is used, with the light source coming from the upper right corner of the frame, avoiding hard shadows and enhancing depth and transparency. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and healing, full of youthful energy and natural poetry. It's as if you catch the moment when an afternoon sunlight passes through the shade of trees and you unintentionally look up. It combines cinematic aesthetics with the authentic warmth and breathing of everyday shoots. The color saturation is moderate, with green as the main tone accented by warm orange, creating a fresh, gentle, and slightly nostalgic mood that allows viewers to feel a sense of peace and beauty wrapped in nature.",
