        {
          "id": "krea2-737280a46650cdbc470fb633",
          "alias": "单女制服书店害羞站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman stands between the bookshelves of a modern bookstore, dressed in a classic Japanese sailor uniform. Her white short-sleeved top is paired with a deep blue collar and cuffs, with a bright red velvet bow tied around her chest. She wears a matching pleated short skirt and white long socks, making her look youthful and neat. Her natural cascade falls over her shoulders, wearing a gentle yet slightly shy smile as she looks straight at the camera, her expression relaxed and natural, as if she's just found a moment of peace in the sea of books. Her left hand gently holds a book with a light-colored cover printed in red text, while her right hand carries a small black shoulder bag. Her posture is calm and elegant, her body slightly tilted, and her left leg slightly leaned forward, creating a natural sense of dynamic balance. In the foreground is the edge of the wooden bookshelf where she stands, where neatly arranged books are stacked. Some spines are clearly visible, with faint words like \"Upward Social\" and \"Read a Forgotten Person Every Day.\" At the bottom of the shelf are engraved gold letters \"SISYP,\" hinting at the bookstore's brand or regional identity. The middle ground features layered dark metal framed bookshelves filled with various books, with a rich and diverse range of colors—from warm orange to cool blue to pure white—creating visual layers; Above the bookshelf hang several green and black signs, such as \"Psychology & Soul Good Book Recommendations\" and \"When the Stars of Humanity Shine,\" with simple and modern fonts that add a sense of knowledge to the scene. The background is the book wall deeper inside the bookstore, with soft and even lighting that creates a quiet and steady atmosphere. Embedded lighting and surveillance cameras can be seen on the ceiling, suggesting that this is a truly operational commercial space rather than a purely artistic setting. The composition adopts a medium-near portrait perspective, with the main figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, creating a strong visual focal point. The layout uses a symmetrical layout, with bookshelves extending backward to form visual guiding lines. The light and shadow treatment is delicate and soft, with the main light sources coming from warm white LED lights above and on the upper sides, while light shadows are cast on the bookshelves and the floor to enhance the sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, full of the fragrance of books and youthful energy. It combines the innocence and cuteness of campus with the artistic flair of an urban reading space. The light and shadow are warm but not glaring, with warm wood tones, cool tones of books, and the red, blue, and white uniforms creating a harmonious contrast, creating a beautiful moment of casual encounters in daily life. The visuals present a high-precision digital rendering texture, with rich and realistic details, resembling high-definition photos taken by professional cameras under soft indoor lighting. It combines realist authenticity with artistic aesthetic expression, conveying the thematic ambiance of knowledge, growth, and youth.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
