        {
          "id": "krea2-e64a5dbe236328f0d8c6d55b",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙庭院俏皮站立出神",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in flowing Hanfu stands beneath the spring willow shade, as if gazing into the distance or immersed in the natural poetry of the moment. She gently held a simple oil-paper umbrella in her right hand. The umbrella surface was a pale blue-green, with ribs in a gentle natural wood color. Delicate white patterns could be faintly visible on the canopy. Under the dappled light filtering through the willow leaves, the umbrella seemed to be coated with a hazy glow, harmonizing beautifully with her dress. Her Hanfu uses a gradient gradient design, transitioning from pink-purple at the waist to light green and milky white hems. The lightweight, transparent tulle fabric stretches and flutters like clouds in the breeze. The sash flutters, outlining smooth and rhythmic curves. The hem edges glow with a soft warm light, subtly revealing the color layers of the lining. The overall outfit is both elegant and lively, full of the romantic atmosphere of Eastern classical aesthetics. In the foreground is a moist, lush green meadow, with leaves showing a bright green under the light. Some leaf edges glow slightly due to light refraction, and the ground has a slightly dewdrop-like moist texture, hinting at the recent light rain or lingering morning dew. The middle set features a series of ancient and heavy stone stacked stones, with rough and uneven surfaces, covered with textures and moss traces eroded by time. The colors range from gray-brown, beige to deep ochre, creating a strong visual contrast with the woman's light, flowing dress, enhancing the spatial depth and historical depth of the painting. The background is a dense and lush willow forest, with willow branches hanging like curtains, leaves slender and flexible gently swaying in the wind, forming a natural framed composition. Distant trees blur into a soft green blurred area, creating a tranquil and distant atmosphere. The entire composition adopts a centrally symmetrical right-leaning composition, with the main figure positioned near the golden ratio point, and the oil-paper umbrella cleverly extends to the left, creating visual balance; The tree trunk on the right serves as a vertical line to stabilize the composition, while the flowing skirt hem extends downward to the right, guiding the viewer's gaze to flow naturally. Light comes from the upper left of the canvas, casting soft, bright scattered light through the gaps in willow leaves, creating a beam effect reminiscent of the \"Tyndall effect,\" while leaving a slight shadow behind the skirt to enhance the sense of depth; The background presents a natural backlit blur, making the subject stand out even more. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and far-reaching, ethereal and beautiful, carrying a strong Eastern ink painting mood and a poetic beauty reminiscent of classical poetry. It resembles a freehand work that fuses Song Dynasty courtyard style meticulous painting with modern photographic techniques. The color palette is mainly blue-green, complemented by soft pink-purple, off-white, and earth tones. The colors are harmonious yet not monotonous, with rich and delicate light and shadow layers. It combines a genuine and natural texture with artistic softness and dreamlike charm, conveying a peaceful state of mind far from the hustle and bustle and immersed in the embrace of nature. It evokes the beautiful moments of time standing still, possessing high aesthetic value and emotional resonance.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
