        {
          "id": "krea2-6a9b5747294d1d448963799d",
          "alias": "单女全裸丝袜桌边自信站立",
          "prompt": "She wears a black stethoscope on her chest, with both ends lightly draped over her wrists. Her overall posture is elegant and confident, her legs long and straight, wearing nude-colored pantyhose. She stands barefoot, with the main focus on her entire body. In the foreground is a white marble-patterned kitchen counter she stands on, with a smooth and clean surface. On the left, an embedded lightbox emits a soft warm light. In the middle shot, her body and the countertop form the visual focal point. The background is a minimalist, modern kitchen space. On the right is a silver-gray refrigerator with light beige three-dimensional brick patterns on the wall. Light gray curtains hang by the left window to let in natural light. The floor is covered with off-white imitation marble tiles. The overall composition uses a full-body shot in the middle shot, with the figure centered slightly to the left, facing the camera for direct emotional exchange. The visual guide line extends from the curve of the stethoscope, arm lines, and legs to the bottom of the frame. It creates a stable and harmonious sense of space, with a bright and soft lighting atmosphere. Natural light streams diagonally from the left window, casting soft shadows on the edge of the countertop and the floor. The overall color scheme is primarily white, accented with beige, light gray, and metallic silver, creating a clean, warm, tranquil, and slightly professional aesthetic atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and authentic, as if taken by a high-end digital camera in indoor natural light, combining the realism of everyday scenes with the refined aesthetics of artistic photography.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
