        {
          "id": "krea2-4b28d1a529cdc8a2ea939f8b",
          "alias": "单女浴袍桥严肃坐注视",
          "prompt": "An Eastern woman sits upright at the edge of a simple wooden bridge, dressed in an off-white Hanfu-style outfit that blends classical charm with modern minimalist design. She drapes a light, cloud-like wide-sleeved robe over it, paired with a delicate short-length camisole top underneath. A matching silk ribbon naturally drapes down the skirt. In the foreground is the rough wooden bridge she sits on, with clear grain. The natural cracks and mottled marks of the wood grain contrast sharply with the softness of her dress, enhancing the layering of the scene; The middle set focuses on her dress from waist to knee, with the hem naturally draping and pleats unfolding with her posture. The fabric creates subtle transitions of light and shadow under light and shadow, creating a three-dimensional and flowing visual effect; The background features a hazy gray-green water surface and the blurred outlines of distant rocks. The gentle ripples and the distant blurring are handled just right, making the main figure stand out and creating a tranquil, distant, and ethereal atmosphere; The composition uses a classic centrally symmetrical portrait style, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame, gazing directly at the viewer, creating a strong emotional connection. At the same time, shallow depth of field technology blurs the background, enhancing the subject's presence; then spread to both sides, forming a smooth and rhythmic visual path; For lighting and ambiance, soft diffused light is used, with the light source coming from the front left of the figure to enhance the sense of depth; The folds of the clothing also show rich layers of light and shadow due to the changing light and shadow. The water in the background reflects a faint daylight, with the overall color scheme mainly off-white, gray-green, and light brown, creating a calm, elegant, and slightly ink-wash Eastern aesthetic atmosphere. It resembles a classical meticulous painting captured with a camera, combining delicate texture with poetic blank space. The entire composition exudes a serene, far-reaching artistic aura, gentle as jade, like a beauty stepping out of ancient poetry, carrying a touch of modern aesthetic freshness and freedom. It makes one stop and gaze, immersed in this tranquil beauty.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
