        {
          "id": "krea2-7ca8142535db5222275db91a",
          "alias": "单女竹林冷淡倚靠持灯",
          "prompt": "The straps were adorned with tiny sequins that shimmered with understated luxury under the lights. The fabric hugged her figure, showcasing elegant curves; In the foreground on the left side of the painting, a handwoven bamboo lantern occupies a prominent visual space. Its geometric diamond-shaped hollow structure emits bright, even warm yellow light, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow and a sense of layering; The background is blurred, with rough textures of brick or stone walls faintly visible. The tone leans toward dark brown, creating a warm and cool contrast with the warm light in the foreground, creating an intimate indoor atmosphere; The composition uses the classic three-part method, with the figure's head in the upper right and the lantern in the lower left, creating visual balance and guidance; Finally, the focus is on the soft halo emanating from the warm light source inside the lantern; The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is cinematic and emotionally dynamic. The main light source comes from the left lantern direction, creating a side backlighting effect, while rich details are preserved in the shadowed areas to create an intimate \"warm light wrap\" atmosphere; The color palette is mainly warm orange and amber yellow, complemented by the purple-pink-gray of the figures' clothing and a dark brownish background, creating a harmonious and layered color scheme; The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if shot with professional-grade photography equipment, featuring high resolution and cinematic post-production color grading, conveying a tranquil, gentle, and slightly nostalgic Eastern aesthetic atmosphere. It's like a late-night study or a corner of a courtyard, where a woman sits alone under the lamp, immersed in a moment of tranquility and beauty in her own world.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
