        {
          "id": "krea2-a919f5182ede3fe1ec924552",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道忧伤站立摆拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands behind the balustrade of a vintage red brick building, wearing a white shirt paired with a burgundy plaid pleated skirt. The collar is tied with a matching thin spaghetti strap, the cuffs naturally rolled up to reveal her slender wrist. On her left wrist, she wears a silver metal bracelet with a delicate heart-shaped pendant hanging from it. Her expression is gentle yet tinged with a hint of contemplation and melancholy. In the foreground is a dark wrought iron railing decorated with golden curling patterns. The railing runs across the lower part of the frame, forming a visual dividing line that covers the lower body of the figure. The middle ground is the main part of her body, including her shirt, skirt, and hand poses, with clearly visible details. The background features warm-toned red brick walls, neatly arranged with delicate texture. On the wall is a black vintage street lamp and a modern-style surveillance camera, creating a contrast between a sense of era and technology. The door frame is made of dark wood or metal, letting in a faint warm light from the interior. The composition uses medium to near shots in close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly above the center of the frame, and railings serving as the foreground frame structure, enhancing spatial layering and visual guidance. The light comes from soft natural light from the front side, with soft transitions of shadows. The overall atmosphere is warm and slightly nostalgic, with a cinematic texture. It feels like evening or afternoon sunlight slanting, with interplay of light and shadow creating a tranquil, artistic, and slightly story-driven ambiance. The color saturation is moderate, with warm brown red bricks, pure white shirts, and deep red plaid skirts accented with gold accents creating a harmonious contrast. Overall, it presents a style that is both artistic and emotionally charged with everyday amateur equipment shooting. It feels as if frozen in a quiet campus corner or a moment in front of an old building, full of youthful energy and delicate emotions.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
