        {
          "id": "krea2-66a208d09428466165e501a7",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙摄影棚微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright on a light gray fabric sofa, wearing a delicate white lace spaghetti strap dress with a light and flowing hem, and the straps adorned with delicate lace decorations. The overall look is simple yet full of softness. Smoothly draped down to the shoulder, adding a touch of laziness and charm. She leans slightly to the side, her left hand naturally resting beside her knee, her posture relaxed and relaxed, gazing directly at the camera with a gentle smile, as if silently expressing inner peace and joy. Her makeup is fresh and natural, without heavy embellishments, highlighting youthful energy and pure charm. The foreground focuses on her long legs and slender arm lines. Under the light, the skin on her legs appears soft and warm, with her right leg elegantly draped over her left, and a faint off-white cutout lace stocking visible at the ankle—delicate details that harmonize with the overall fashion style. In the center is the sofa she sits on, with clearly visible fabric textures and smooth, rounded edges. The armrests curve gracefully, and the background is a simple, modern interior space. On the left is a white curved shelf neatly stacked with several books with white covers, and at the top is a beautifully framed black-and-white photo frame. The image is blurry but the outline of a figure is faintly visible; On the right side are large floor-to-ceiling windows, with curtains half-drawn to let in warm, soft daylight. Dappled light and shadow fall on the sofa and figures, creating a visual layer of interplay of light and shadow. The entire scene is dominated by light tones, with walls, furniture, and clothing in white or off-white tones, creating a clean, bright, warm, and slightly dreamy atmosphere. The composition adopts a medium to near perspective, with the subject positioned slightly to the center, while the foreground legs and mid-ground furniture create a sense of depth to enhance spatial three-dimensionality. Light comes from the right window direction, which is a natural soft glow. The light source is soft and even, without strong shadows, creating subtle highlight transitions only on the shoulders, arms, and legs, enhancing skin transparency and texture expression. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and peaceful, filled with the comfort and sweet scent of home life. It combines the refined control of a professional studio with the authentic warmth of everyday shooting, as if capturing the most unintentionally beautiful moment when the afternoon sunlight fills the room, evoking a gentle, pure, and vibrant artistic aesthetic expression.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
