        {
          "id": "krea2-d64badb02a2dcd57a3b11b52",
          "alias": "单女灰连衣裙城市害羞站立演奏",
          "prompt": "A woman sat elegantly in front of a black upright piano, wearing a fitted gray spaghetti strap dress over a lightweight, breathable white long-sleeved knit cardigan. The fabric glowed softly under the light, and the naturally draped pleats at the cuffs complemented her slender wrist. She looks back at the camera with a gentle yet slightly shy smile, as if she has just finished playing a melody or is about to start singing. Her hands rest naturally on the piano keys, her fingertips lightly touching the black-and-white keys. Her left hand is slightly bent, while her right hand hovers above, seemingly playing or about to begin. Her fingers are long and delicate, her nails neatly trimmed, creating a focused and serene atmosphere. In the foreground is a close-up of the piano, its smooth black body reflecting the light and shadow of the surroundings. A sheet of sheet music is spread out on the music stand, with slightly rolled edges and clear staff notation marks, hinting at the flow of music and emotional expression. The middle shot focuses on the woman's upper body combined with the piano; her body is slightly turned sideways, her back lines smooth, creating a harmonious visual balance with the piano. The background is a modern, minimalist interior space. On the left is a cabinet door or wall with dark wood texture; on the right, through a large glass window, one can see lush greenery and blurred urban architectural outlines. By the window sits a vase filled with colorful flowers, whose soft colors add a touch of natural vitality to the entire scene. In the distance, a wine cabinet or storage cabinet can be faintly seen, with neatly arranged bottles or decorative items inside, appearing understated luxury under warm lighting. Ceiling-mounted downlights emit soft, even light, casting gentle shadows on the piano surface and floor tiles, creating a warm, tranquil, and layered spatial atmosphere. The overall composition adopts a slightly tilted perspective, extending to the natural scenery outside the window, forming a visual guide path from near to far, from solid to virtual. The entire image exudes a warm, artistic, and slightly intimate atmosphere, as if capturing a quiet afternoon or dusk when the owner is alone immersed in the world of music. It is both full of life and artistic beauty, like everyday scenes taken with an ordinary smartphone under natural indoor light, yet the demeanor and compositional skillfully arranged make them especially moving. They combine the authentic texture of amateur equipment with professional-level aesthetic depth and emotional appeal.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
