        {
          "id": "krea2-5fcd389b059d7c5748cca1be",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔公寓俏皮持手机",
          "prompt": "A woman is the absolute subject of the painting, with a gentle and serene expression tinged with a hint of casual laziness. Her overall temperament is fresh, sweet, and full of youthful energy. Her fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed with light-colored nail polish, and she wears a simple silver bracelet on her right wrist that reflects gently in soft light. In the center, she wears a short V-neck puff-sleeve top with a beige base and printed with small orange roses and green leaf patterns. The fabric is lightweight and flowing, with pleats on the chest and a small flat belly at the waist. She pairs it with light blue washed denim shorts, with a clear waistline and natural wear marks at the edges, highlighting a casual everyday style. After the background blur, the interior environment is faintly revealed. On the left is a natural wood rattan chair with elegant structural lines; on the right, natural light streams through bright windows. The window frame is white and simple, with light slanting in from the upper right to create soft diffuse reflections, while subtle shadows on the left shoulder and back enhance the sense of depth. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and bright, with the overall color scheme mainly warm yellow, cream white, and light blue, accented by orange flowers and wood brown. The colors are harmonious and unified, with soft, even lighting without strong contrast, creating a peaceful and comfortable feeling like afternoon sunlight streaming into the room. It is both lively and full of artistic beauty, like a casual photo taken with a phone yet full of texture. The details are rich yet not cluttered, the mood is full yet understated, conveying a gentle, free, and youthful vibe.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
