        {
          "id": "krea2-f8ce22effbb9b0b667a9388a",
          "alias": "单女黑西装茶室冷淡坐展示",
          "prompt": "An elegant and charming Eastern woman sits at a refined tea table, radiating a warm glow in the soft light, exuding a serene, restrained, and confident aura; She wore a luxurious black sequin blazer, covered with fine silver shimmering patterns that shimmered like a flowing galaxy under the light. The V-neck design outlined a graceful collarbone line, and the cuffs and collar details were carefully detailed, fully showcasing a sense of high-end fashion. Her left hand is gently raised, fingertips long, wearing a ring set with dazzling diamonds, her posture composed as if she is about to touch or have just set down her teacup; In the foreground is a carefully arranged Chinese tea scene. A rustic and warm Yixing clay teapot sits quietly in the center of a wooden tea tray. The body is rounded and full, with a deep brown color that is steady. Next to it is a set of jade-white gaiwan tea sets, with wooden tea cups and tea cans placed along the edges. On the right, a lush green potted plant with unfurled leaves can be faintly seen, injecting vitality into the scene. The background is a blurry blue-toned environment, possibly a modern glass curtain wall building or a city window at night. Blurred circular light spots scatter above the frame like dreamlike stars, creating a hazy yet sophisticated spatial atmosphere; The composition adopts a classic close-up perspective in medium and close-up shots, with the characters occupying the main visual focus and forming a natural visual flow; The painting uses a soft, warm main light source from the front left, while the background uses cool blue tones for contrast rendering, enhancing the subject's prominent effect; The overall light and shadow layers are rich and delicate, with natural transitions between light and shadow. It preserves a realistic texture while featuring an artistic filter-like soft focus effect. The atmosphere is tranquil, elegant, and rich in Eastern Zen aesthetics, as if you are in a high-end private tea room or a hidden corner of a city nightscape. It conveys a calm attitude toward life and refined taste. It combines professional studio-level refined composition with the authentic light and shadow texture and life atmosphere of everyday amateur equipment. The image is gentle and introspective, full of storytelling and immersive beauty.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
