        {
          "id": "krea2-4711aa67ab77459952773243",
          "alias": "单女黑外套舞台困倦站立指向",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the center of a dreamy pink interior space, her makeup exquisite, dressed in a visually striking black fashion outfit: a sheer sheer jacket with lace trim and sparkling crystal embellishments, topped with a black sequin corset that reveals a slender waistline and abdominal curve; The lower half is high-waisted lace-up leather shorts that hug the leg lines, paired with over-the-knee pointed-toe high-heeled boots. The boots are smooth like a mirror, and the heels are slim, elongating the legs. The overall look is sexy, avant-garde, and full of strength. Her left hand naturally rests on her hip, while her right hand elegantly carries a small, vintage-style black patent leather handbag. The clasp features a gold metal ring design, reflecting a delicate sheen under the light. The figure's posture is calm and confident, with the body slightly turned to the side and head facing the camera, creating a dynamic and balanced visual focal point. In the foreground, her feet and boots occupy the visual focal point at the bottom of the frame. The ground is a uniform, soft pink that matches the wall tones, with no cluttered elements obstructing the view. The middle shot shows her complete silhouette, from waist to knees, accentuated by the gorgeous background decorations, making her even more three-dimensional and striking. On the left side of the background is a pale pink wall, with several hexagonal mirrored decorations of varying sizes hanging above, reflecting colorful light and shadow; On the right side hangs a pink-purple tassel curtain hanging down to the ground, gently swaying in the breeze with a subtle sense of movement. Above, several sparkling spherical lights and star-shaped pendants are dotted, creating a dazzling atmosphere reminiscent of a party or stage. The entire composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned near the golden ratio point of the composition. The symmetrical background enhances visual stability, with light coming from a soft studio slightly above the front to avoid shadow obstruction, while the background curtain and mirror surface reflect local highlights, adding layering. The overall atmosphere is sweet, dreamy, fashionable, and slightly reminiscent of nightclub party, with pink as the main color tone and black as a strong contrast, creating intense visual tension and emotional resonance. The image texture pursues professional-level photography-level delicacy, with realistic and noticeable garment folds and leather reflections. The metal and glass background decorations are rich in detail, making you feel as if you are at a carefully planned fashion-themed party. It combines artistic expression with the realism of everyday photography. The image saturation is moderate, the tone is warm and bright, conveying a youthful, confident, and bold charm of modern urban women.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
