        {
          "id": "krea2-a05132c28ec0d271dc50ca41",
          "alias": "摄影棚冷淡",
          "prompt": "Soft orange-red flames shine from inside the fireplace, creating a cozy and intimate atmosphere. On the right, the outline of a light gray ceramic vessel can be faintly seen; The entire composition uses a low-angle downward shot, using the sofa armrest as a natural foreground frame. The use of light and shadow is highly layered, casting soft shadows on the sofa and floor. The warm light from the background fireplace injects a warm tone into the image, creating a subtle contrast with the cool-toned sofa and environment. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of storytelling, as if capturing a private moment in an afternoon or night. It features exquisite lighting and color control like a high-end studio, while also retaining the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment—rich yet simple in detail, moderate color saturation, and minimal noise, presenting an artistic portrait style that combines cinematic feel with a sense of everyday life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
