        {
          "id": "krea2-f0a0e38afa24131925d78fc8",
          "alias": "单女紫和服竹林坐回眸",
          "prompt": "An Eastern woman wears a light purple striped kimono adorned with delicate floral embroidery patterns. She sits elegantly on a low stool with traditional patterned cushions, her body slightly turned to the side, her head gently looking back at the camera, her right hand lightly holding a wooden folding fan. The fan surface is half-open, revealing pink gradient decorations inside. Her makeup is soft, and her overall posture is serene and full of classical charm. In the foreground is a blurred wooden pillar or door frame structure in warm brown tones, extending diagonally from the right side of the painting, partially obscuring the main figure, forming a strong framing composition and visual guidance, naturally focusing the viewer's gaze on the woman. In the middle is a low table and stools where she sits, with a simple set of Japanese tea sets, including a white ceramic cup, teapot, and matching bamboo tea tray. Next to it is a dark fabric cushion printed with black and white vine patterns, adding a touch of everyday life. The background is the interior of a typical traditional Japanese room, featuring wooden sliding doors (shoji doors) with simple lines. Behind the door, faint greenery and light from outside the window can be glimpsed. Soft natural light streams through the window lattice, casting mottled shadows on the walls and floor, creating a sense of tranquil and deep space. The entire photo is shot using shallow depth of field, with the background and foreground moderately blurred, highlighting the subject while preserving the ambient atmosphere. Light comes from the upper side, soft and warm, presenting the effect of diffused indoor light at dusk or afternoon. Shadows transition naturally, color saturation is low, and the overall tone leans toward a vintage film texture, with slight grainy noise and soft focus effects, giving the image a hazy, poetic atmosphere. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, gentle, and nostalgic, infused with strong Japanese aesthetics and Eastern Zen charm. It resembles a carefully arranged traditional interior portrait, showcasing the delicate beauty of daily life while embodying artistic narrative depth. It is suitable for shooting with amateur equipment such as a phone or a small digital camera in natural indoor light, pursuing a realistic and simple imaging style rather than an overly embellished commercial blockbuster effect.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
