        {
          "id": "krea2-832b57d6d5995e36976f9601",
          "alias": "单女金礼服桌边温柔倚靠跳舞",
          "prompt": "A woman leans elegantly against a dark wooden long table, wearing a delicate amber-gold strapless gown with a skirt made of multiple layers of tulle, glowing softly under candlelight and adorned with delicate beads. The corset outlines her graceful figure, the skirt naturally draping to the floor and draped lightly over a white drape. The candlelight flickers and dances, emitting a warm, soft light that illuminates the woman's hands and part of her dress, creating a quiet and romantic atmosphere; The middle shot focuses on the woman's upper body and the details of her dress, with a beige wall adorned with vintage carved decorations in the background. In the right corner is a mirror inlaid with a gold-edged carved frame, below which is a white marble fireplace. Above hangs a crystal chandelier, its crystal-clear glass hanging and sparkling faintly, adding a touch of luxury to the scene. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the main subject positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, while candlelight, layered light and shadow, and spatial depth create a strong visual focal point; The overall use of light and shadow is soft and dramatic, with the main light sources coming from the front and side candles, creating a warm yellow tone. The flickering candlelight exudes a retro romantic atmosphere, combining the refinement and depth of artistic photography with the authentic texture and lifestyle of everyday amateur equipment. The colors are mainly warm brown, golden yellow, and cream white, complemented by wood tones and metallic gray, together creating a noble and elegant yet warm and intimate visual experience.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
