        {
          "id": "krea2-27d5299c73ab8029dbc76cb2",
          "alias": "单女短裙酒廊困倦坐注视",
          "prompt": "Her upper body features a strapless design, adorned with a three-dimensional artificial rose decoration on the chest, while the lower body is a light, flowing sheer wrap skirt adorned with matching rose knots. The overall color scheme is mainly pink, white, and light green, dreamy and soft like clouds. The fabric appears semi-transparent and subtly folded under the sunlight. She sits elegantly on a modern, minimalist white outdoor lounge chair, leaning slightly forward, legs naturally crossed, her left hand lightly resting on the edge of the chair back, while her right hand hangs naturally at her knee, her posture relaxed and full of artistic tension. A thick, fluffy blue towel is laid on the lounge chair, its texture clearly visible, creating a warm and cool contrast with the figure's skin. The foreground focuses on her leg lines, waist curves, and the flowing details of her swimsuit, emphasizing the graceful curve of her body. The middle view features a crystal-clear infinity pool surface, shimmering with ripples and delicate ripples, as if seamlessly connecting with the distant skyline, creating a sense of expansive visual extension. The background features a hazy city skyline and distant mountain outlines. The buildings are colorful but blurred, preserving only vague geometric shapes to highlight the clarity and tranquility of the main subject. The composition uses classic third-division and diagonal guidance; the figure is positioned slightly to the left of the painting, naturally directing the gaze toward the upper right and far away, while the diagonal lines of the lounge chair enhance the depth of the composition. The light comes from a bright, soft daytime natural light from the front and above, avoiding strong shadows while creating slight reflections on the pool surface and towel edges to enhance texture. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, lazy, romantic, and full of vacation vibes, like a carefully composed fashion portrait or movie still. The color scheme blends fresh cool blue with gentle pastels, offering a visual experience that is both realistic and transcendent. It feels as if you are in a private and luxurious seaside vacation paradise, with every detail meticulously crafted, combining the comfort and authenticity of daily life with the artistic refinement of a professional studio, allowing visitors to feel the tranquility and beauty under the summer sun.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
