        {
          "id": "krea2-3c3e2235218c2ed7f785db1f",
          "alias": "单女透视短裙窗边困倦跪过肩",
          "prompt": "A graceful woman naturally drapes over her shoulders and back, kneeling in a lazy yet elegant posture on the floor paved with warm-toned herringbone bricks. Her legs are long, slender, and intertwined, her bare feet lightly touching the ground. Between her toes and the hem of her skirt are scattered numerous pink and white rose petals, like gentle poems quietly falling in spring; She wore a light champagne or pale pink halter sheer dress made of lightweight and sheer fabric, outlining delicate silhouettes with her figure. The neckline was decorated with layered ruffles, adding a touch of romantic vintage charm. Around her neck hung a string of sparkling pearls, delicate tassel earrings hung from her earlobes that shimmered in the light, and her wrists were adorned with a simple silver bracelet. Some petals are intact, some broken, with colors gradient from pure white to light pink, creating a visual contrast with the warm brown tiles on the floor. Some petals are illuminated by sunlight, appearing semi-transparent; The middle ground is the windowsill area she leans on. The white carved window frame is bordered with gold, with intricate and ornate lines. On the windowsill are two plump, vibrant deep pink roses that echo the light petals on the ground. Below the windowsill is a wooden baseboard trimmed with gold trim, showing exquisite detail; The background is the outdoor garden view seen through the wide windows, with lush shrubs and a few plants blooming with purple flowers faintly blurred in and out of the window. The light outside is bright but softened, creating a dreamy, hazy effect; The entire composition uses a low-angle downward shot, placing the figure slightly to the left center, with large blank spaces and extended floors guiding the viewer's focus on the subject; In terms of light and shadow, the main light source comes from natural light slanting through the high window on the right, creating a soft and warm side backlight, while the other side is subtly shadowed, enhancing three-dimensionality and layering. At the same time, mottled tree shadows and petal outlines are cast on the ground, adding a poetic atmosphere to the scene. The color palette is mainly cream white, warm brown, light pink, and gold, creating a cozy, romantic, tranquil, and slightly classical aristocratic atmosphere. The overall image is filled with soft-focus textures and cinematic color grading, resembling a carefully arranged indoor portrait with strong artistic expression and emotional resonance, evoking a sense of serene beauty and a sense of ritual in life, like a silent floral monologue under the afternoon sun.",
