        {
          "id": "krea2-80ea23578e17ab12d0ca5d94",
          "alias": "单女白礼服窗边困倦",
          "prompt": "A beautiful Eastern woman wore a high-quality pure white satin strapless gown, with a naturally draped hem adorned with delicate pleats and lace trim. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, with her body slightly turned to the side, forming a graceful S-shaped curve; On the left side of the foreground is a simple wooden small round table with three classic-shaped white candles placed on it. Next to it is a vintage desk lamp with an off-white lampshade, made of dark copper metal base, providing soft and warm lighting; The middle frame shows the figure's entire body and part of the background environment. To the right is a huge French floor-to-ceiling window framed with a white solid wood frame and finely carved gilded brass handles. Above the window hangs a translucent beige curtain, sunlight streaming through the glass into the room, casting soft light spots on the floor and the figures; The background features pure white walls and ceilings, with partial silhouettes of crystal chandeliers faintly visible on the walls, their crystal-clear beads stringed at the top forming elegant curves; The overall composition uses shallow depth of field, with background blur treatment to highlight the subject; The visual guide lines are formed by the curve formed by the curve of the character's arm, the direction of the line of sight, and the path of light slanting through the window. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft and bright, with the main light source coming from the natural daylight from the right window. The light is evenly soft and even, creating a dreamy sense of transparency. Warm indoor lighting is added as supplementary lighting, making the details of the skin and clothing textures clearly visible, with natural shadow transitions; The overall color scheme is primarily pure white, accented with beige, light gold, and wood tones, presenting a fresh, noble, tranquil, and romantic artistic photography style. The images are rich in cinematic texture and sophisticated fashion, combining the realistic delicacy of everyday amateur equipment with the refined aesthetics of professional photography, allowing viewers to experience a pure, gentle, and ceremonial aesthetic.",
