        {
          "id": "krea2-73bf8dd8c54ba8d84b0e2d70",
          "alias": "单女白礼服室内忧伤注视",
          "prompt": "A woman, as the absolute subject of the painting, seems to be telling an unfinished story; She displays a temperament that is both sweet and slightly melancholic. She wore a light, flowing white feather gown, with semi-transparent fabric and delicate, soft white feather decorations along the edges. Under the light, it presented a dreamy, hazy texture. The neckline was bold and elegant, subtly revealing the collarbone line. Her hands gently held a necklace strung from lustrous pearls, her fingers long and fair, her left wrist adorned with a silver bracelet set with tiny diamonds, and a simple ring on her right ring finger. The overall accessories were understated, luxurious, and understated. She tilted her head slightly to gaze at the camera, her posture dignified yet revealing a hint of laziness and composure. In the foreground, she holds a pearl necklace in her hand and a burning candle on the right. The flame flickers with orange-yellow light, infusing the painting with warm vitality and creating highlights with strong contrast of light and shadow, while also creating blurred bokeh in the background, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The medium focuses on her upper body and clothing details, including feather decorations, the posture of the pearl necklace, and the jewelry on her arm, all of which together form the visual focal point. The background completely blurs into a deep dark tone, with only a few scattered warm halos on the left as accents, creating an atmosphere of a private indoor night. It might be a elegantly arranged banquet hall or a private study corner, hinting at a moment full of ritual and romance. The composition uses a classic center composition, with the figure centered slightly to the right. The use of light and shadow is extremely meticulous, with the main light source coming from the front right side, simulating the combination of candlelight and ambient lighting, creating a scene where soft-focus contour light intertwines with localized strong light, enhancing the delicate texture of the skin. It combines the heavy texture of classical oil painting with the clarity and realism of modern photography. The air seems to be filled with the scent of incense and candle tears, enchanting the soul. The entire image exudes a quiet, restrained, yet story-rich beauty, like a beautiful moment captured from a silent film. It is suitable not only for art photo collections but also as a design reference for high-end fashion magazine covers or brand promotional posters. The visual style pursues ultimate realism, delicacy, and emotional expression, avoiding the sense of artificiality caused by excessive post-processing. It strives to present a natural, vivid yet professional visual effect reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment shooting, capturing the indescribable tenderness and lonely emotional tension deep within the characters.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
