        {
          "id": "krea2-7c94f331b6333705e0da9768",
          "alias": "单女粉挂脖庭院困倦坐躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman sat elegantly on the red brick floor of an outdoor courtyard, wearing a light, flowing pale pink halter gown. The hem naturally hung and fluttered in the wind, revealing long, fair legs and bare feet, with delicate gold nail art adorning her toes. adding a touch of laziness and liveliness. She turned slightly, her left hand gently touching the dazzling diamond necklace around her neck, her right hand naturally resting on the brick floor beside her, wearing a simple silver bracelet on her wrist, exuding a serene and confident expression. In the foreground are the lower half of her body and pink rose petals scattered across the red brick floor, the petal edges outlined by sunlight creating a soft halo, forming delicate visual layers with the pleats of the skirt. The center is her complete sitting posture, with clear red brick floor textures, some moss and gravel peeking through the cracks, and a small exposed yellow gravel path nearby, forming a sharp contrast with the green lawn. In the background is a low wall made of irregular yellow stones, behind which is a neatly trimmed lush green lawn. The edge of the lawn is planted with large patches of silver-leaf plants and various wildflowers. In the distance, trees and a winding path can be faintly seen. To the right is an off-white vintage wooden door with a simple frame, a copper handle, and a hazy white curtain light shining through the door. The composition adopts a slightly tilted perspective, placing the figure on the right half of the canvas and leaving ample space on the left to display the depth of the environment, creating a spacious and story-rich composition. The visual guide line naturally extends from the characters' fingers, necklaces, and gaze toward the garden path deep into the frame. Light comes from the upper left, providing bright, soft natural daylight evenly on the skin and clothing, creating subtle transitions of light and shadow and a sense of depth; The shadowed areas are light gray, not harsh but enough to emphasize the contours. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, romantic, and full of French pastoral poetry. The colors are mainly pink, green, brown, and white, with moderate saturation, presenting a warm, jade-like yet slightly dreamy artistic texture. It resembles a carefully composed film still or a high-end fashion magazine cover, while preserving the authentic details and slight noise from everyday amateur equipment, making the images both refined and lifelike, conveying the lazy and relaxed atmosphere of a spring afternoon and the gentle and reserved power of femininity.",
