          "id": "krea2-5ffe2e31e198b35b878336c0",
          "alias": "单女蓝风衣海滩困倦站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a sunny beach, wearing black sunglasses on her head, her left hand naturally folded in front of her, and a loose, flowing light blue long trench coat. The fabric is delicate and soft, with exquisite cuffs and neckline designs, and a white lace-collared shirt faintly visible underneath, giving the overall look a balance of casual and fashionable flair. Her posture is relaxed and natural, her body slightly turned but her head facing the camera, creating a visual tension that is both intimate and slightly distant. On the left edge of the foreground, a cluster of withered brownish-yellow plant branches slants into the frame, forming a natural compositional guide and adding depth to the composition; In the middle is the fine, soft golden sand where she stands, with clear grain grains that glow warmly under the sunlight, with scattered traces of fine sand blown by the wind at her feet; The background consists of several beige canvas awnings and thatched roofs, arranged in a staggered and orderly manner. Behind them are lush green vegetation and blurry tree shadows, with clusters of round warm white light bulbs hanging above. Under the sunlight, they create soft light spots and a dreamy atmosphere. In the distance, reflections from the water surface or pool can be faintly seen, filling the entire scene with a vacation atmosphere. The composition uses a center composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the golden ratio point, making the subject prominent and balanced, forming a clear visual flow. In terms of lighting and shadowing, it uses strong natural daylight, with light slanting into the frame from the upper right and casting soft shadows on the left side of the body to enhance depth and realism; The overall color scheme is mainly blue-white and warm yellow, with a striking contrast of cool and warm without conflict, creating a fresh, tranquil, yet lively summer afternoon atmosphere. The image presents a cinematic-quality film texture, with moderate color saturation, rich and delicate details, and a slight soft-focus effect. It feels like an amateur equipment piece shot with a high-end digital camera paired with a large-aperture lens, combining a sense of realism with everyday life and artistic aesthetic expression, conveying a leisurely, youthful, and slightly mysterious vacation mood.",
