        {
          "id": "krea2-042325ec02ceaeb2411450ba",
          "alias": "单女制服摄影棚困倦",
          "prompt": "She wears a classic Japanese school uniform: a white short-sleeved shirt paired with a deep blue bow tie and collar trim. The chest pocket is embroidered with a delicate school emblem, and the black pleated skirt is tailored to outline her long, well-proportioned figure. A delicate brown leather backpack is slung over her right shoulder. The backpack strap naturally hangs down at one side of the body, with a simple yet detailed overall design, full of the everyday atmosphere of campus life. On the left edge of the foreground, several clusters of blooming white flowers appear faintly, their petals light and soft, creating a gentle visual transition with the skirt hem. The middle section features lush flower clusters blurred, with orange, yellow, and pale pink wildflowers scattered across the lush green lawn, creating a warm and bright spring atmosphere. The background features deep, hazy forests or shrubs with dense and interwoven branches and leaves, Present a soft blue-green tone, cleverly separating the subject from the environment through shallow depth of field. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical portrait close-up, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame with the head slightly raised, creating a strong visual focal point. Flowers in the foreground serve as guiding lines, with extremely delicate light and shadow application. Soft natural light pours down from the upper left, while the folds of clothing have natural shadow transitions, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and realism. The overall color scheme is mainly fresh and bright, with a white shirt paired with a dark skirt forming a classic color scheme The warm sea of flowers in the background and the cool-toned shade complement each other, creating a tranquil, cozy, and slightly dreamy campus afternoon atmosphere. The image exudes a clean and pure artistic beauty, as if capturing the most beautiful moments of youth. It features exquisite lighting and post-production quality like a professional studio, while retaining the natural breathing and life atmosphere unique to amateur equipment shooting. Viewers feel as if they can smell the intertwined scent of grass and flowers. The entire image exudes a healing gentle power that inevitably brings back carefree student days, full of hope and infinite possibilities.",
