        {
          "id": "krea2-fbd05f209a17c4634b4ecdc2",
          "alias": "单女红浴袍竹林忧伤倚靠吃",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a bright red wide-sleeved ancient-style robe turns sideways and gazes back at the camera. Her right hand gently grips a black longsword or bamboo staff leaning against her waist, her robe fluttering in the breeze. The fabric is delicate and soft, with naturally smooth pleats, presenting a silky sheen and flowing feel. She stood on a vast, pristine snowy plain, with the ground beneath her feet covered in thick snow. The snow surface was smooth and seamless, with occasional small footprints or branch shadows scattered throughout. In the middle of the scene, several withered trees with twisted, leafless branches stand silently in the cold wind, their shadows casting blurred yet profound silhouettes on the snow, creating a layered spatial depth. The background features even more hazy silhouettes of woods, with layers of trees stretching into the distance. Due to the blurring of depth of field, a soft gray-blue tone is presented, creating an ethereal and lonely winter forest atmosphere. The composition uses the classic rule of thirds and diagonal guidance, with the figure positioned on the right third of the canvas, body facing to the left front, creating a strong visual focus and emotional connection; At the same time, the black long object she holds extends diagonally upward from the lower right corner, enhancing the dynamic balance of the composition. The foreground portion features nearby snowy terrain and the edges of the lower body hem of the figure's clothing, slightly blurred through a shallow depth of field effect, which not only strengthens the subject's position but also increases the spatial sense of the composition. The overall use of light and shadow is soft yet dramatic, with diffused light from the upper side evenly scattered, outlining the figure's outline and the shadows of clothing folds, highlighting a sense of depth; The background is enveloped in a layer of misty, cool-toned soft light, with a blue-white hue that contrasts sharply with the vivid red of the figures, highlighting their presence and emotional tension. The overall atmosphere of the painting combines classical martial arts conception with modern cinematic aesthetics, combining the lonely and solemn atmosphere of a biting winter with the heroic and restrained beauty of the heroic woman in red, creating a poetic sense of conflict like \"a flame in a snowy world.\" In terms of color, large areas of pure white and cool gray tones serve as the base, with the fiery orange-red of the characters' costumes becoming the absolute visual center, making the composition both calm and full of vitality. The shooting style simulates professional-grade portrait studio outdoor shooting quality, with clear and sharp details, realistic and tangible clothing folds, and natural background blur, delivering cinematic visual texture and emotional immersion. It feels like a key frame from a costume martial arts drama or ink-wash artistic blockbuster, allowing viewers to feel the story and emotional weight behind the characters. It retains the natural lighting and slight noise characteristic of everyday amateur equipment shooting, avoiding false perfection caused by excessive post-processing, and pursuing an organic fusion of genuine emotion and artistic expression.",
